// Lista oficial HSK 3.0 — nivel 7–9: [id, hanzi, pinyin, categoría, en, es, fr]. Fuente: ivankra/hsk30 (MIT) + complete-hsk-vocabulary (MIT, datos CC-CEDICT CC BY-SA 4.0); glosas es/fr redactadas para la app.
window.HSK_OFFICIAL = window.HSK_OFFICIAL || {};
window.HSK_OFFICIAL[7] = [["L7-0001","阿拉伯语","Ālābóyǔ","N","Arabic (language)","árabe (idioma)","arabe (langue)","她为了研究当地历史，开始认真学习阿拉伯语。","tā wèi le yán jiū dāng dì lì shǐ kāi shǐ rèn zhēn xué xí ā lā bó yǔ","She began studying Arabic seriously in order to research the region's history.","Empezó a estudiar árabe en serio para investigar la historia de la región.","Elle s'est mise à étudier sérieusement l'arabe pour faire des recherches sur l'histoire locale."],["L7-0002","哎","āi","Intj","hey!; oh!","¡oye!; ¡ay!","hé !; eh !","哎，前面的箱子还没关好，搬的时候小心一点。","āi qián miàn de xiāng zi hái méi guān hǎo bān de shí hou xiǎo xīn yì diǎn","Hey, the box in front has not been closed properly, so be careful when moving it.","Oye, la caja de adelante todavía no está bien cerrada; ten cuidado al moverla.","Eh, la caisse de devant n'est pas encore bien fermée, fais attention en la déplaçant."],["L7-0003","哎呀","āiyā","Intj","oh my!; goodness!","¡caramba!; ¡ay!","oh là là ! ; mince !","哎呀，钥匙忘在屋里了，看来得请邻居帮忙。","āi yā yào shi wàng zài wū lǐ le kàn lái děi qǐng lín jū bāng máng","Oh dear, I left the keys inside; it looks as though I will need the neighbor's help.","¡Ay, olvidé las llaves adentro! Parece que tendremos que pedirle ayuda al vecino.","Oh là là, j'ai oublié les clés à l'intérieur ; il va falloir demander de l'aide au voisin."],["L7-0004","哀求","āiqiú","V","to beg; to implore","suplicar; implorar","supplier; implorer","孩子拉着父亲的手哀求，希望他能再留一天。","hái zi lā zhe fù qīn de shǒu āi qiú xī wàng tā néng zài liú yì tiān","The child held his father's hand and pleaded with him to stay another day.","El niño tomó la mano de su padre y le suplicó que se quedara un día más.","L'enfant a pris la main de son père et l'a supplié de rester un jour de plus."],["L7-0005","挨家挨户","āijiā-āihù","","door to door","de casa en casa","de porte en porte","志愿者挨家挨户走访，耐心倾听独居老人的诉求。","zhì yuàn zhě āi jiā āi hù zǒu fǎng nài xīn qīng tīng dú jū lǎo rén de sù qiú","The volunteers visited homes one by one and patiently listened to the needs of older people living alone.","Los voluntarios visitaron casa por casa y escucharon con paciencia las necesidades de los ancianos que viven solos.","Les bénévoles sont allés de porte en porte et ont écouté avec patience les besoins des personnes âgées vivant seules."],["L7-0006","癌","ái","N","cancer","cáncer","cancer","医生正在讨论这种癌的特点，家属在一旁认真听。","yī shēng zhèng zài tǎo lùn zhè zhǒng ái de tè diǎn jiā shǔ zài yì páng rèn zhēn tīng","The doctors were discussing the characteristics of this cancer while the family listened carefully nearby.","Los médicos discutían las características de este cáncer mientras los familiares escuchaban con atención a un lado.","Les médecins discutaient des caractéristiques de ce cancer, tandis que la famille écoutait attentivement à côté."],["L7-0007","癌症","áizhèng","N","cancer","cáncer","cancer","得知父亲患上癌症后，她决定陪他一起面对。","dé zhī fù qīn huàn shàng ái zhèng hòu tā jué dìng péi tā yì qǐ miàn duì","After learning that her father had cancer, she decided to face it alongside him.","Al enterarse de que su padre tenía cáncer, decidió enfrentarlo junto a él.","En apprenant que son père avait un cancer, elle a décidé d'affronter l'épreuve à ses côtés."],["L7-0008","艾滋病","àizībìng","N","AIDS","sida","sida","志愿者走进社区，向居民介绍艾滋病的预防知识。","zhì yuàn zhě zǒu jìn shè qū xiàng jū mín jiè shào ài zī bìng de yù fáng zhī shi","Volunteers visited the community to share information about preventing AIDS.","Los voluntarios fueron a la comunidad para informar a los vecinos sobre la prevención del sida.","Les bénévoles se sont rendus dans le quartier pour informer les habitants sur la prévention du sida."],["L7-0009","唉","ài","Intj","sigh; (interjection)","suspiro; (interjección)","soupir; (interjection)","唉，等了整整一个下午，还是没有收到他的回信。","āi děng le zhěng zhěng yí ge xià wǔ hái shi méi yǒu shōu dào tā de huí xìn","Oh well, after waiting the whole afternoon, I still have not received his reply.","Ay, esperé toda la tarde y todavía no he recibido su respuesta.","Hélas, après avoir attendu tout l'après-midi, je n'ai toujours pas reçu sa réponse."],["L7-0010","爱不释手","àibùshìshǒu","","to love too much to put down","no querer soltar algo","ne pouvoir se séparer de","这本画册印得很精美，弟弟拿到后爱不释手。","zhè běn huà cè yìn de hěn jīng měi dì di ná dào hòu ài bú shì shǒu","The art book was beautifully printed, and my younger brother could hardly put it down after receiving it.","Este álbum está impreso con mucho esmero, y mi hermano menor, al recibirlo, no podía soltarlo.","Cet album est magnifiquement imprimé ; mon petit frère ne pouvait plus le lâcher dès qu'il l'a eu entre les mains."],["L7-0011","爱理不理","àilǐ-bùlǐ","","aloof; indifferent","distante; indiferente","distant; indifférent","我主动和他打招呼，他却始终爱理不理的。","wǒ zhǔ dòng hé tā dǎ zhāo hu tā què shǐ zhōng ài lǐ bù lǐ de","I took the initiative to greet him, but he remained barely responsive.","Yo lo saludé primero, pero él siguió mostrándose indiferente.","Je l'ai salué le premier, mais il est resté constamment indifférent."],["L7-0012","爱面子","ài miànzi","","to care about saving face","preocuparse por las apariencias","tenir à sauver la face","他虽然爱面子，发现算错账后还是当众认了错。","tā suī rán ài miàn zi fā xiàn suàn cuò zhàng hòu hái shi dāng zhòng rèn le cuò","Although he cared greatly about saving face, he admitted his mistake publicly after finding an error in the accounts.","Aunque le importaba mucho guardar las apariencias, cuando descubrió que había calculado mal las cuentas, lo admitió delante de todos.","Bien qu'il tienne beaucoup à sauver la face, il a reconnu son erreur devant tout le monde après avoir découvert qu'il s'était trompé dans les comptes."],["L7-0013","爱惜","àixī","V","to cherish; to treasure","apreciar; valorar","chérir; ménager","这套工具陪了师傅多年，他一直非常爱惜。","zhè tào gōng jù péi le shī fu duō nián tā yì zhí fēi cháng ài xī","The master craftsman had used these tools for years and always took great care of them.","Este juego de herramientas acompañó al maestro durante muchos años, y siempre las cuidó muchísimo.","Ce jeu d'outils accompagnait le maître depuis de nombreuses années, et il y a toujours tenu énormément."],["L7-0014","碍事","àishì","","to be in the way","estorbar; ser un obstáculo","gêner; faire obstacle","这张桌子放在门口太碍事，我们把它移到窗边吧。","zhè zhāng zhuō zi fàng zài mén kǒu tài ài shì wǒ men bǎ tā yí dào chuāng biān ba","This table is too much in the way by the door; let us move it beside the window.","Esta mesa estorba demasiado en la entrada; movámosla junto a la ventana.","Cette table gêne trop près de la porte ; déplaçons-la près de la fenêtre."],["L7-0015","安定","āndìng","Adj/V","stable; to stabilize","estable; estabilizar","stable; stabiliser","搬进新家以后，一家人的生活终于安定下来。","bān jìn xīn jiā yǐ hòu yì jiā rén de shēng huó zhōng yú ān dìng xià lái","After moving into their new home, the family's life finally became settled.","Después de mudarse a la casa nueva, la vida de la familia por fin se estabilizó.","Après le déménagement dans leur nouvelle maison, la vie de la famille s'est enfin stabilisée."],["L7-0016","安抚","ānfǔ","V","to soothe; to pacify","tranquilizar; apaciguar","apaiser; pacifier","母亲轻声安抚受惊的孩子，直到他慢慢停止哭泣。","mǔ qīn qīng shēng ān fǔ shòu jīng de hái zi zhí dào tā màn màn tíng zhǐ kū qì","The mother softly soothed her frightened child until he gradually stopped crying.","La madre calmó con suavidad al niño asustado hasta que poco a poco dejó de llorar.","La mère a rassuré doucement son enfant effrayé jusqu'à ce qu'il cesse peu à peu de pleurer."],["L7-0017","安眠药","ānmiányào","N","sleeping pill","somnífero","somnifère","问诊时，她主动向医生说明自己服过安眠药。","wèn zhěn shí tā zhǔ dòng xiàng yī shēng shuō míng zì jǐ fú guo ān mián yào","During the consultation, she volunteered the information that she had taken sleeping pills.","Durante la consulta, ella le dijo al médico por iniciativa propia que había tomado pastillas para dormir.","Pendant la consultation, elle a spontanément dit au médecin qu'elle avait pris des somnifères."],["L7-0018","安宁","ānníng","Adj","peaceful; tranquil","tranquilo; apacible","paisible; tranquille","窗外细雨绵绵，屋里茶香弥漫，使这个平常的午后显得格外安宁。","chuāng wài xì yǔ mián mián wū lǐ chá xiāng mí màn shǐ zhè ge píng cháng de wǔ hòu xiǎn de gé wài ān níng","A fine rain fell steadily outside while the scent of tea filled the room, making this ordinary afternoon feel especially peaceful.","Afuera caía una llovizna fina y dentro de la casa flotaba el aroma del té, lo que hacía que esa tarde común resultara especialmente tranquila.","Dehors, une fine pluie tombait sans cesse et l'odeur du thé flottait dans la pièce, ce qui donnait à cet après-midi ordinaire une paix toute particulière."],["L7-0019","安稳","ānwěn","Adj","stable; calm","estable; sereno","stable; serein","搬到安静的小院后，他终于睡了一个安稳觉。","bān dào ān jìng de xiǎo yuàn hòu tā zhōng yú shuì le yí ge ān wěn jiào","After moving to a quiet courtyard home, he finally enjoyed an undisturbed night's sleep.","Después de mudarse a una casita tranquila con patio, por fin pudo dormir de un tirón.","Après avoir emménagé dans une petite maison tranquille avec cour, il a enfin passé une nuit paisible."],["L7-0020","安心","ānxīn","Adj","to be at ease; to feel relieved","estar tranquilo; sentir alivio","être tranquille; se rassurer","听说迷路的老人已经平安回家，大家才安心。","tīng shuō mí lù de lǎo rén yǐ jīng píng ān huí jiā dà jiā cái ān xīn","Everyone felt reassured only after hearing that the older man who had lost his way was safely home.","Todos se tranquilizaron solo cuando supieron que el anciano que se había perdido ya había llegado sano y salvo a casa.","Tout le monde n'a été rassuré qu'en apprenant que le vieil homme égaré était rentré chez lui sain et sauf."],["L7-0021","安逸","ānyì","Adj","easy and comfortable","cómodo y holgado","aisé et confortable","他不愿一直过安逸的生活，决定到外地闯一闯。","tā bú yuàn yì zhí guò ān yì de shēng huó jué dìng dào wài dì chuǎng yi chuǎng","Unwilling to keep living an easy life, he decided to try making his way elsewhere.","No quería seguir llevando una vida cómoda y decidió probar suerte en otro lugar.","Il ne voulait pas continuer à mener une vie facile et a décidé de tenter sa chance ailleurs."],["L7-0022","按键","ànjiàn","N","button; key","botón; tecla","bouton; touche","这个按键已经失灵，轻轻按下去也没有任何反应。","zhè ge àn jiàn yǐ jīng shī líng qīng qīng àn xià qù yě méi yǒu rèn hé fǎn yìng","This button no longer works; even a gentle press produces no response.","Este botón ya no funciona; aunque lo presiones con suavidad, no responde en absoluto.","Ce bouton ne fonctionne plus ; même en appuyant doucement dessus, il n'y a aucune réaction."],["L7-0023","按理说","ànlǐ shuō","","in principle; normally","en principio; lo lógico sería","en principe; normalement","按理说他早该到了，怎么到现在还没有消息？","àn lǐ shuō tā zǎo gāi dào le zěn me dào xiàn zài hái méi yǒu xiāo xi","By rights he should have arrived long ago; why have we still heard nothing from him?","En principio ya debería haber llegado hace rato; ¿cómo es que todavía no sabemos nada de él?","Normalement, il aurait dû arriver depuis longtemps ; pourquoi n'a-t-on toujours aucune nouvelle de lui ?"],["L7-0024","按说","ànshuō","Adv","normally; in principle","normalmente; en principio","normalement; en principe","按说这个时间他早该到了，怎么还不见人影？","àn shuō zhè ge shí jiān tā zǎo gāi dào le zěn me hái bú jiàn rén yǐng","He should have arrived long ago by now; why is there still no sign of him?","A estas horas ya debería haber llegado; ¿cómo es que todavía no se le ve?","À cette heure-ci, il aurait dû arriver depuis longtemps ; pourquoi n'y a-t-il toujours aucune trace de lui ?"],["L7-0025","案件","ànjiàn","N","case","caso","affaire; cas","这起案件将于下个月公开审判。","zhè qǐ àn jiàn jiāng yú xià ge yuè gōng kāi shěn pàn","This case will be tried publicly next month.","Este caso se juzgará públicamente el próximo mes.","Cette affaire sera jugée publiquement le mois prochain."],["L7-0026","暗地里","àndìlǐ","N","secretly; on the sly","en secreto; a escondidas","secrètement; en cachette","两个人都不服输，暗地里一直在较劲。","liǎng gè rén dōu bù fú shū àn dì lǐ yì zhí zài jiào jìn","Neither of them will admit defeat, and they've been quietly competing all along.","Ninguno de los dos quiere darse por vencido y han estado compitiendo en secreto todo este tiempo.","Aucun des deux ne veut s'avouer vaincu, et ils se livrent une lutte sourde depuis le début."],["L7-0027","暗杀","ànshā","V","to assassinate","asesinar","assassiner","小说中的将军逃过了暗杀，却从此不敢独自出门。","xiǎo shuō zhōng de jiāng jūn táo guò le àn shā què cóng cǐ bù gǎn dú zì chū mén","The general in the novel survived an assassination attempt but never dared go out alone afterward.","El general de la novela escapó de un atentado, pero desde entonces no se atreve a salir solo.","Le général du roman a échappé à un attentat, mais depuis il n'ose plus sortir seul."],["L7-0028","暗中","ànzhōng","N","in secret; secretly","en secreto; a escondidas","en secret; discrètement","黑暗中传来一个微弱的声音。","hēi àn zhōng chuán lái yí ge wēi ruò de shēng yīn","A faint sound came out of the darkness.","De la oscuridad llegó un sonido débil.","Un son faible est venu de l'obscurité."],["L7-0029","昂贵","ángguì","Adj","expensive; costly","caro; costoso","cher; coûteux","这套设备虽然昂贵，却能为工厂节省不少能源。","zhè tào shè bèi suī rán áng guì què néng wèi gōng chǎng jié shěng bù shǎo néng yuán","Although this equipment is expensive, it can save the factory a considerable amount of energy.","Aunque este equipo es caro, le permite a la fábrica ahorrar bastante energía.","Bien que cet équipement soit coûteux, il permet à l'usine d'économiser beaucoup d'énergie."],["L7-0030","凹","āo","Adj","concave; sunken","cóncavo; hundido","concave; creux","箱盖中间凹了一块，里面的物品倒没有受损。","xiāng gài zhōng jiān āo le yí kuài lǐ miàn de wù pǐn dào méi yǒu shòu sǔn","The middle of the lid was dented inward, but the items inside were undamaged.","La tapa de la caja estaba hundida en el centro, pero lo que había dentro no sufrió daños.","Le couvercle de la boîte était enfoncé en son milieu, mais les objets à l'intérieur n'étaient pas abîmés."],["L7-0031","熬","áo","V","to simmer; to endure","hervir a fuego lento; soportar","mijoter; endurer","这锅粥熬得太稠了，再加点水吧。","zhè guō zhōu áo de tài chóu le zài jiā diǎn shuǐ ba","This pot of porridge has been cooked too thick, so add some more water.","Esta olla de congee quedó demasiado espesa; agrégale un poco más de agua.","Cette marmite de bouillie de riz est trop épaisse ; ajoute un peu d'eau."],["L7-0032","熬夜","áoyè","","to stay up late","trasnochar","veiller tard","长期熬夜会削弱身体的免疫力。","cháng qī áo yè huì xuē ruò shēn tǐ de miǎn yì lì","Staying up late for a long time weakens the body's immunity.","Trasnochar durante mucho tiempo debilita las defensas del cuerpo.","Veiller tard de façon prolongée affaiblit les défenses immunitaires de l'organisme."],["L7-0033","傲","ào","Adj","proud; arrogant","orgulloso; arrogante","fier; arrogant","他性子有些傲，却从不轻视认真向他请教的人。","tā xìng zi yǒu xiē ào què cóng bù qīng shì rèn zhēn xiàng tā qǐng jiào de rén","He is rather proud by nature, but never looks down on people who sincerely ask him for advice.","Es algo orgulloso por naturaleza, pero nunca menosprecia a quien le pide consejo con sinceridad.","Il est plutôt fier de nature, mais ne méprise jamais ceux qui lui demandent conseil avec sincérité."],["L7-0034","傲慢","àomàn","Adj","arrogant; haughty","arrogante; altivo","arrogant; hautain","他傲慢的态度让客人十分不快，合作也没谈成。","tā ào màn de tài dù ràng kè rén shí fēn bú kuài hé zuò yě méi tán chéng","His arrogant attitude greatly displeased the guests, and the proposed partnership fell through.","Su actitud arrogante molestó mucho a los invitados y la colaboración no se concretó.","Son attitude arrogante a profondément déplu aux invités, et le partenariat n'a pas abouti."],["L7-0035","奥秘","àomì","N","secret; mystery","secreto; misterio","secret; mystère","科学家们一直在探求生命起源的奥秘。","kē xué jiā men yì zhí zài tàn qiú shēng mìng qǐ yuán de ào mì","Scientists have long been seeking the secrets of the origin of life.","Los científicos llevan mucho tiempo buscando los secretos del origen de la vida.","Les scientifiques cherchent depuis longtemps à percer les mystères de l'origine de la vie."],["L7-0036","奥运会","Àoyùnhuì","N","Olympic Games","Juegos Olímpicos","Jeux olympiques","因为受伤，他与这次奥运会无缘了。","yīn wèi shòu shāng tā yǔ zhè cì ào yùn huì wú yuán le","Because of his injury, he missed his chance at this Olympics.","Por su lesión, se quedó sin la oportunidad de participar en estos Juegos Olímpicos.","À cause de sa blessure, il a dû renoncer à ces Jeux olympiques."],["L7-0037","八卦","bāguà","N","gossip; trigrams","chisme; trigramas","ragots; trigrammes","他不喜欢打听别人的八卦，聊天时总会换个话题。","tā bù xǐ huan dǎ ting bié rén de bā guà liáo tiān shí zǒng huì huàn gè huà tí","He dislikes prying into other people's gossip and always changes the subject when it comes up.","No le gusta enterarse de los chismes ajenos y, al conversar, siempre cambia de tema.","Il n'aime pas se mêler des potins des autres et change toujours de sujet quand on en parle."],["L7-0038","巴不得","bābudé","V","to be eager to","morirse de ganas de","avoir hâte de","孩子们巴不得天天放假，可以在家玩游戏。","hái zi men bā bu dé tiān tiān fàng jià kě yǐ zài jiā wán yóu xì","The children wish they could be on holiday every day and play games at home.","Los niños desearían que todos los días fueran vacaciones para jugar en casa.","Les enfants voudraient être en vacances tous les jours pour jouer à des jeux à la maison."],["L7-0039","扒","bā","V","to peel; to cling to","pelar; aferrarse a","éplucher; s'accrocher à","他把墙上松动的旧海报扒了下来，准备重新粉刷。","tā bǎ qiáng shàng sōng dòng de jiù hǎi bào bā le xià lái zhǔn bèi chóng xīn fěn shuā","He stripped the loose old poster from the wall in preparation for repainting it.","Despegó de la pared el viejo póster que estaba flojo, para volver a pintar.","Il a décollé de la paroi le vieux poster qui se détachait, afin de repeindre."],["L7-0040","芭蕾","bālěi","N","ballet","ballet","ballet","看完那场芭蕾演出后，她第一次有了学舞的念头。","kàn wán nà chǎng bā lěi yǎn chū hòu tā dì yī cì yǒu le xué wǔ de niàn tou","After watching that ballet performance, she thought about learning to dance for the first time.","Después de ver esa función de ballet, por primera vez pensó en aprender a bailar.","Après avoir vu ce spectacle de ballet, elle a pour la première fois eu l'idée d'apprendre à danser."],["L7-0041","把柄","bǎbǐng","N","handle; (fig.) leverage","asa; punto débil usado en contra","poignée; prise (fig.)","他担心留下把柄，连私下的谈话也格外谨慎。","tā dān xīn liú xià bǎ bǐng lián sī xià de tán huà yě gé wài jǐn shèn","Worried about giving others something to use against him, he was especially cautious even in private conversations.","Temía dar pie a que usaran algo en su contra, así que era especialmente cuidadoso hasta en las conversaciones privadas.","Craignant de donner prise à ses adversaires, il restait particulièrement prudent même dans les conversations privées."],["L7-0042","把关","bǎguān","","to check; to guard a pass","controlar; filtrar","contrôler; filtrer","每一批产品出厂前，都由经验丰富的师傅把关。","měi yì pī chǎn pǐn chū chǎng qián dōu yóu jīng yàn fēng fù de shī fu bǎ guān","An experienced craftsman checks every batch of products before it leaves the factory.","Antes de salir de la fábrica, cada lote de productos es revisado por un maestro con mucha experiencia.","Avant de quitter l'usine, chaque lot de produits est contrôlé par un maître expérimenté."],["L7-0043","把手","bǎshou","N","handle; grip","asa; manija","poignée; manche","出门太匆忙，我把手机忘在了家里。","chū mén tài cōng máng wǒ bǎ shǒu jī wàng zài le jiā lǐ","I left the house in such a rush that I forgot my phone at home.","Salí tan apurado de casa que olvidé el celular.","J'étais tellement pressé en sortant que j'ai oublié mon téléphone à la maison."],["L7-0044","靶子","bǎzi","N","target","blanco; diana","cible","训练结束时，他终于把箭射到了靶子的中心。","xùn liàn jié shù shí tā zhōng yú bǎ jiàn shè dào le bǎ zi de zhōng xīn","By the end of the training session, he finally managed to shoot an arrow into the center of the target.","Al terminar el entrenamiento, por fin logró clavar la flecha en el centro de la diana.","À la fin de l'entraînement, il a enfin réussi à planter sa flèche au centre de la cible."],["L7-0045","坝","bà","N","dam","presa; dique","barrage; digue","河上的坝建成以后，附近农田有了稳定的水源。","hé shàng de bà jiàn chéng yǐ hòu fù jìn nóng tián yǒu le wěn dìng de shuǐ yuán","After the dam across the river was completed, the nearby farmland gained a reliable water supply.","Una vez construida la presa del río, las tierras de cultivo cercanas contaron con una fuente de agua estable.","Après la construction du barrage sur la rivière, les terres agricoles voisines ont disposé d'une source d'eau régulière."],["L7-0046","罢免","bàmiǎn","V","to dismiss from office","destituir","destituer; révoquer","成员们对负责人失去信任，提出了罢免他的要求。","chéng yuán men duì fù zé rén shī qù xìn rèn tí chū le bà miǎn tā de yāo qiú","Having lost trust in the person in charge, the members called for his removal from office.","Los miembros perdieron la confianza en el responsable y pidieron su destitución.","Les membres ont perdu confiance dans le responsable et ont exigé sa destitution."],["L7-0047","罢休","bàxiū","V","to give up; to let it go","renunciar; dejarlo pasar","abandonner; laisser tomber","事情还没有查清楚，她不会就这样轻易罢休。","shì qing hái méi yǒu chá qīng chu tā bú huì jiù zhè yàng qīng yì bà xiū","She will not simply let the matter drop before the facts have been established.","Mientras no se aclare el asunto, ella no lo dejará pasar así como así.","Tant que l'affaire ne sera pas tirée au clair, elle ne laissera pas tomber aussi facilement."],["L7-0048","霸占","bàzhàn","V","to seize; to occupy by force","apoderarse; ocupar por la fuerza","s'emparer de; occuper de force","这辆车长期霸占公共车位，引起了附近居民的不满。","zhè liàng chē cháng qī bà zhàn gōng gòng chē wèi yǐn qǐ le fù jìn jū mín de bù mǎn","The car's prolonged occupation of a public parking space has upset nearby residents.","Este auto ocupa desde hace tiempo un estacionamiento público, lo que ha molestado a los vecinos de la zona.","Cette voiture occupe depuis longtemps une place de stationnement publique, ce qui a mécontenté les habitants des environs."],["L7-0049","掰","bāi","V","to break off with the hands","partir con las manos","casser avec les mains","她把热饼掰成两半，一半留给还没回家的弟弟。","tā bǎ rè bǐng bāi chéng liǎng bàn yí bàn liú gěi hái méi huí jiā de dì di","She broke the hot flatbread in half and kept one half for her younger brother, who was not home yet.","Partió la torta caliente en dos y guardó una mitad para su hermano menor, que todavía no había llegado a casa.","Elle a rompu la galette chaude en deux et gardé une moitié pour son petit frère, qui n'était pas encore rentré."],["L7-0050","白白","báibái","Adv","in vain; for nothing","en vano; gratis","en vain; pour rien","早上起来，地上铺了一层白白的霜。","zǎo shang qǐ lái dì shang pū le yì céng bái bái de shuāng","When I got up in the morning, the ground was covered with a layer of white frost.","Al levantarme por la mañana, el suelo estaba cubierto por una capa de escarcha blanca.","Au lever, le sol était recouvert d'une couche de givre blanc."],["L7-0051","百分比","bǎifēnbǐ","N","percentage","porcentaje","pourcentage","报告不仅列出了人数，还用百分比说明各组的差别。","bào gào bù jǐn liè chū le rén shù hái yòng bǎi fēn bǐ shuō míng gè zǔ de chā bié","The report lists not only the numbers of people but also percentages showing the differences between groups.","El informe no solo enumera el número de personas, sino que además usa porcentajes para explicar las diferencias entre los grupos.","Le rapport ne se contente pas d'indiquer le nombre de personnes ; il utilise aussi des pourcentages pour expliquer les différences entre les groupes."],["L7-0052","百合","bǎihé","N","lily","lirio; azucena","lys","窗边的百合刚刚开花，淡淡的香气飘满了房间。","chuāng biān de bǎi hé gāng gāng kāi huā dàn dàn de xiāng qì piāo mǎn le fáng jiān","The lilies by the window have just bloomed, filling the room with a delicate scent.","Los lirios junto a la ventana acaban de florecer y un aroma suave llena la habitación.","Les lis près de la fenêtre viennent d'éclore et un léger parfum embaume la pièce."],["L7-0053","百科全书","bǎikē quánshū","","encyclopedia","enciclopedia","encyclopédie","遇到不熟悉的动物，爷爷就陪我翻查百科全书。","yù dào bù shú xī de dòng wù yé ye jiù péi wǒ fān chá bǎi kē quán shū","Whenever I encountered an unfamiliar animal, my grandfather would help me look it up in an encyclopedia.","Cuando me encontraba con un animal que no conocía, mi abuelo me acompañaba a buscarlo en la enciclopedia.","Quand je rencontrais un animal que je ne connaissais pas, mon grand-père m'aidait à le chercher dans l'encyclopédie."],["L7-0054","柏树","bǎishù","N","cypress","ciprés","cyprès","院里的柏树四季常青，冬天也给小屋添了生气。","yuàn lǐ de bǎi shù sì jì cháng qīng dōng tiān yě gěi xiǎo wū tiān le shēng qì","The cypress in the courtyard stays green throughout the year and brings life to the little house even in winter.","Los cipreses del patio se mantienen verdes todo el año y le dan vida a la casita incluso en invierno.","Les cyprès de la cour restent verts toute l'année et donnent de la vie à la petite maison même en hiver."],["L7-0055","摆放","bǎifàng","V","to arrange; to set out","colocar; disponer","disposer; arranger","图书馆的书按照类别摆放，很容易找到。","tú shū guǎn de shū àn zhào lèi bié bǎi fàng hěn róng yì zhǎo dào","The library's books are arranged by category, so they're easy to find.","Los libros de la biblioteca están ordenados por categorías, así que es fácil encontrarlos.","Les livres de la bibliothèque sont rangés par catégorie, ils sont donc faciles à trouver."],["L7-0056","摆平","bǎipíng","","to settle (a matter)","resolver (un asunto)","régler (une affaire)","他出面把两家的争执摆平，大家才重新坐下来谈。","tā chū miàn bǎ liǎng jiā de zhēng zhí bǎi píng dà jiā cái chóng xīn zuò xia lái tán","He stepped in to settle the dispute between the two families, allowing them to sit down and talk again.","Él intervino para resolver la disputa entre las dos familias, y solo entonces volvieron a sentarse a conversar.","Il est intervenu pour régler le différend entre les deux familles, et ce n'est qu'alors qu'elles se sont rassises pour discuter."],["L7-0057","摆设","bǎishe","N","ornament; decoration","adorno; decoración","objet décoratif; décor","这些旧摆设虽然不值钱，却保留着祖母生活的痕迹。","zhè xiē jiù bǎi she suī rán bù zhí qián què bǎo liú zhe zǔ mǔ shēng huó de hén jì","Although these old ornaments are not worth much, they preserve traces of my grandmother's life.","Aunque estos viejos adornos no valen mucho, conservan las huellas de la vida de mi abuela.","Même si ces vieux bibelots n'ont pas beaucoup de valeur, ils gardent les traces de la vie de ma grand-mère."],["L7-0058","拜会","bàihuì","V","to pay an official visit","hacer una visita oficial","rendre une visite officielle","代表团到达后，先去拜会了当地负责文化交流的官员。","dài biǎo tuán dào dá hòu xiān qù bài huì le dāng dì fù zé wén huà jiāo liú de guān yuán","After arriving, the delegation first visited the local official responsible for cultural exchanges.","Al llegar, la delegación visitó primero al funcionario local encargado del intercambio cultural.","À son arrivée, la délégation a d'abord rendu visite au responsable local des échanges culturels."],["L7-0059","拜见","bàijiàn","V","to pay a respectful visit","visitar con respeto","rendre visite par déférence","他特地带着新作，前去拜见多年未见的老师。","tā tè dì dài zhe xīn zuò qián qù bài jiàn duō nián wèi jiàn de lǎo shī","He made a special visit to his teacher, whom he had not seen for years, bringing his latest work.","Fue expresamente a visitar a su maestro, a quien no veía desde hacía años, llevándole su nueva obra.","Il est allé tout exprès rendre visite à son maître, qu'il n'avait pas vu depuis des années, en apportant sa dernière œuvre."],["L7-0060","拜年","bàinián","","to pay a New Year call","hacer visitas de Año Nuevo","présenter ses vœux de Nouvel An","过年的时候，我们要去好几家亲戚家拜年。","guò nián de shí hou wǒ men yào qù hǎo jǐ jiā qīn qi jiā bài nián","At New Year, we visit several relatives' homes to pay our respects.","En Año Nuevo, vamos a visitar a varios parientes para felicitarlos.","Au Nouvel An, nous allons présenter nos vœux dans plusieurs familles de parents."],["L7-0061","拜托","bàituō","V","to ask a favor; please","pedir un favor; por favor","prier; s'il vous plaît","我临时有事要出门，只好拜托邻居照看一下小狗。","wǒ lín shí yǒu shì yào chū mén zhǐ hǎo bài tuō lín jū zhào kàn yí xià xiǎo gǒu","Something came up and I had to go out, so I asked my neighbor to look after the puppy for a while.","Me surgió algo y tuve que salir, así que le pedí al vecino que cuidara al perrito un rato.","Un imprévu m'obligeait à sortir, alors j'ai demandé au voisin de surveiller le chiot un moment."],["L7-0062","扳","bān","V","to pull; to turn around","jalar; dar la vuelta","tirer; renverser","他试着扳了一下生锈的开关，发现它还是纹丝不动。","tā shì zhe bān le yí xià shēng xiù de kāi guān fā xiàn tā hái shi wén sī bú dòng","He tried pulling the rusty lever, but it still would not move at all.","Intentó mover el interruptor oxidado, pero siguió sin moverse en absoluto.","Il a essayé d'actionner l'interrupteur rouillé, mais il restait complètement immobile."],["L7-0063","颁布","bānbù","V","to promulgate; to issue","promulgar; emitir","promulguer; publier","新规定颁布以后，相关部门开始向居民解释具体内容。","xīn guī dìng bān bù yǐ hòu xiāng guān bù mén kāi shǐ xiàng jū mín jiě shì jù tǐ nèi róng","After the new regulations were issued, the relevant departments began explaining their details to residents.","Tras la promulgación de la nueva norma, los departamentos correspondientes empezaron a explicarles su contenido a los residentes.","Après la publication du nouveau règlement, les services concernés ont commencé à en expliquer le contenu aux habitants."],["L7-0064","颁发","bānfā","V","to issue; to award","emitir; otorgar","décerner; délivrer","学校向完成培训的学员颁发了证书，并合影留念。","xué xiào xiàng wán chéng péi xùn de xué yuán bān fā le zhèng shū bìng hé yǐng liú niàn","The school awarded certificates to those who completed the training, and they posed for a commemorative photograph.","La escuela entregó certificados a los alumnos que terminaron la capacitación y se tomaron una foto de recuerdo.","L'école a remis des certificats aux stagiaires ayant terminé la formation, puis ils ont posé pour une photo souvenir."],["L7-0065","颁奖","bānjiǎng","","to present an award","entregar un premio","remettre un prix","比赛结束后，教练受邀为取得优异成绩的队员颁奖。","bǐ sài jié shù hòu jiào liàn shòu yāo wèi qǔ dé yōu yì chéng jì de duì yuán bān jiǎng","After the competition, the coach was invited to present awards to the outstanding players.","Al terminar la competencia, el entrenador fue invitado a entregar los premios a los jugadores con resultados sobresalientes.","Après la compétition, l'entraîneur a été invité à remettre les prix aux joueurs aux excellents résultats."],["L7-0066","斑点","bāndiǎn","N","spot; stain","mancha; mota","tache; moucheture","这只小鸟胸前有几处白色斑点，远远就能认出来。","zhè zhī xiǎo niǎo xiōng qián yǒu jǐ chù bái sè bān diǎn yuǎn yuǎn jiù néng rèn chū lái","This small bird has several white spots on its chest and can be recognized from a distance.","Este pajarito tiene varias manchas blancas en el pecho y se reconoce desde lejos.","Ce petit oiseau a plusieurs taches blanches sur la poitrine et se reconnaît de loin."],["L7-0067","搬迁","bānqiān","V","to relocate; to move","mudarse; reubicarse","déménager; relocaliser","搬迁之后，一家人虽然暂时有些不适应，却也开始憧憬新的生活。","bān qiān zhī hòu yì jiā rén suī rán zàn shí yǒu xiē bú shì yìng què yě kāi shǐ chōng jǐng xīn de shēng huó","After moving, the family felt unsettled for a while but also began looking forward to a new life.","Después de la mudanza, la familia tardó un poco en adaptarse, pero también empezó a soñar con una vida nueva.","Après le déménagement, la famille a eu un peu de mal à s'adapter au début, mais elle a aussi commencé à rêver d'une nouvelle vie."],["L7-0068","板块","bǎnkuài","N","slab; tectonic plate; sector","losa; placa tectónica; sector","dalle; plaque tectonique; secteur","这份周报分成几个板块，分别介绍市场、生产和销售。","zhè fèn zhōu bào fēn chéng jǐ ge bǎn kuài fēn bié jiè shào shì chǎng shēng chǎn hé xiāo shòu","This weekly report is divided into sections covering the market, production, and sales.","Este informe semanal se divide en varias secciones que presentan el mercado, la producción y las ventas.","Ce rapport hebdomadaire est divisé en plusieurs rubriques présentant le marché, la production et les ventes."],["L7-0069","办不到","bàn bu dào","","impossible; can't be done","imposible; no se puede hacer","impossible; irréalisable","只靠两个人一天搬完这些货，恐怕实在办不到。","zhǐ kào liǎng gè rén yì tiān bān wán zhè xiē huò kǒng pà shí zài bàn bu dào","It is probably impossible for just two people to move all these goods in one day.","Me temo que es realmente imposible que solo dos personas muevan toda esta mercancía en un día.","Je crains qu'il soit vraiment impossible que deux personnes seulement déplacent toute cette marchandise en une journée."],["L7-0070","半边天","bànbiāntiān","N","women (half the sky)","las mujeres (mitad del cielo)","les femmes (moitié du ciel)","当地女性在农业生产中撑起了半边天，收入也不断提高。","dāng dì nǚ xìng zài nóng yè shēng chǎn zhōng chēng qǐ le bàn biān tiān shōu rù yě bú duàn tí gāo","Local women play a vital role in agricultural production, and their incomes continue to rise.","Las mujeres de la zona desempeñan un papel fundamental en la producción agrícola, y sus ingresos siguen aumentando.","Les femmes de la région jouent un rôle essentiel dans la production agricole, et leurs revenus ne cessent d'augmenter."],["L7-0071","半场","bànchǎng","N","half (of a game)","mitad (de un partido)","mi-temps","比赛才踢了半场，队员们的体力就明显下降了。","bǐ sài cái tī le bàn chǎng duì yuán men de tǐ lì jiù míng xiǎn xià jiàng le","After only half a game, the players' stamina had already dropped noticeably.","Apenas había pasado medio partido y la condición física de los jugadores ya había bajado notablemente.","Le match n'en était qu'à la mi-temps que l'endurance des joueurs avait déjà nettement baissé."],["L7-0072","半岛","bàndǎo","N","peninsula","península","péninsule","这座城市位于半岛南端，三面都能看到大海。","zhè zuò chéng shì wèi yú bàn dǎo nán duān sān miàn dōu néng kàn dào dà hǎi","The city lies at the southern tip of a peninsula, with views of the sea on three sides.","Esta ciudad está en el extremo sur de una península y desde ella se ve el mar por tres lados.","Cette ville est située à l'extrémité sud d'une péninsule, avec la mer visible sur trois côtés."],["L7-0073","半路","bànlù","N","halfway; midway","a medio camino","à mi-chemin","走到半路，他猛然想起忘了锁门。","zǒu dào bàn lù tā měng rán xiǎng qǐ wàng le suǒ mén","Halfway there, he suddenly remembered that he had forgotten to lock the door.","A mitad de camino, de pronto se acordó de que había olvidado cerrar la puerta con llave.","À mi-chemin, il s'est soudain rappelé qu'il avait oublié de fermer la porte à clé."],["L7-0074","半数","bànshù","N","half the number","la mitad","la moitié","这次调查中，超过半数的居民赞成延长公交运营时间。","zhè cì diào chá zhōng chāo guò bàn shù de jū mín zàn chéng yán cháng gōng jiāo yùn yíng shí jiān","In this survey, more than half of the residents supported extending bus service hours.","En esta encuesta, más de la mitad de los residentes estuvo a favor de ampliar el horario del transporte público.","Dans cette enquête, plus de la moitié des habitants étaient favorables à l'allongement des horaires des bus."],["L7-0075","半途而废","bàntú'érfèi","","to give up halfway","abandonar a medias","abandonner à mi-chemin","这项研究已经做了三年，我们不能因为暂时困难就半途而废。","zhè xiàng yán jiū yǐ jīng zuò le sān nián wǒ men bù néng yīn wèi zàn shí kùn nan jiù bàn tú ér fèi","We have worked on this research for three years and cannot abandon it halfway because of temporary difficulties.","Llevamos tres años con esta investigación y no podemos abandonarla a medias por dificultades temporales.","Nous travaillons sur cette recherche depuis trois ans et nous ne pouvons pas l'abandonner en cours de route à cause de difficultés passagères."],["L7-0076","半信半疑","bànxìn-bànyí","","half doubting; skeptical","dudoso; escéptico","dubitatif; sceptique","他说能独自修好这台机器，我听后仍然半信半疑。","tā shuō néng dú zì xiū hǎo zhè tái jī qì wǒ tīng hòu réng rán bàn xìn bàn yí","He said he could repair the machine by himself, but I was still only half convinced.","Dijo que podía arreglar la máquina él solo, pero yo, al oírlo, seguí sin estar del todo convencido.","Il a dit qu'il pouvait réparer seul cette machine, mais en l'entendant je restais à moitié sceptique."],["L7-0077","半真半假","bànzhēn-bànjiǎ","","half true, half false","mitad verdad, mitad mentira","moitié vrai, moitié faux","他把这段经历讲得半真半假，朋友们听着直发笑。","tā bǎ zhè duàn jīng lì jiǎng de bàn zhēn bàn jiǎ péng you men tīng zhe zhí fā xiào","He told a partly true, partly invented version of the experience, making his friends laugh.","Contó esa experiencia mezclando verdad y mentira, y sus amigos no paraban de reír al escucharlo.","Il a raconté cette expérience mi-vraie, mi-inventée, et ses amis ne cessaient de rire en l'écoutant."],["L7-0078","扮","bàn","V","to dress up as; to play (a role)","disfrazarse de; interpretar (un papel)","se déguiser en; jouer (un rôle)","学校演出时，他扮的是一位老人，走路也故意放慢。","xué xiào yǎn chū shí tā bàn de shì yí wèi lǎo rén zǒu lù yě gù yì fàng màn","In the school performance, he played an old man and deliberately slowed his walk.","En la obra de la escuela, él hizo de anciano y caminaba despacio a propósito.","Dans le spectacle de l'école, il jouait un vieillard et ralentissait volontairement sa démarche."],["L7-0079","伴","bàn","V/N","companion; to accompany","compañero; acompañar","compagnon; accompagner","她搬进姐姐家，既能相互照顾，也能有个伴。","tā bān jìn jiě jie jiā jì néng xiāng hù zhào gù yě néng yǒu gè bàn","She moved in with her sister so they could care for each other and have company.","Se mudó a casa de su hermana mayor para cuidarse mutuamente y también para tener compañía.","Elle a emménagé chez sa sœur pour pouvoir s'occuper l'une de l'autre et avoir de la compagnie."],["L7-0080","伴侣","bànlǚ","N","companion; partner","compañero; pareja","compagnon; partenaire","他们既是生活中的伴侣，也是一起经营小店的搭档。","tā men jì shì shēng huó zhōng de bàn lǚ yě shì yì qǐ jīng yíng xiǎo diàn de dā dàng","They are partners in life as well as in running their small shop.","Son compañeros de vida y también socios que llevan juntos una tiendita.","Ils sont à la fois partenaires dans la vie et associés dans la gestion de leur petite boutique."],["L7-0081","伴随","bànsuí","V","to accompany; to go with","acompañar; ir acompañado de","accompagner; s'accompagner de","新技术的推广往往伴随着新的问题，需要不断改进。","xīn jì shù de tuī guǎng wǎng wǎng bàn suí zhe xīn de wèn tí xū yào bú duàn gǎi jìn","The spread of new technology is often accompanied by new problems that require continued improvement.","La difusión de una nueva tecnología suele ir acompañada de nuevos problemas que exigen mejoras constantes.","La diffusion d'une nouvelle technologie s'accompagne souvent de nouveaux problèmes qui exigent des améliorations continues."],["L7-0082","伴奏","bànzòu","V","to accompany (musically)","acompañar (musicalmente)","accompagner (musicalement)","妹妹在台上唱歌，哥哥坐在钢琴前为她伴奏。","mèi mei zài tái shàng chàng gē gē ge zuò zài gāng qín qián wèi tā bàn zòu","The younger sister sang on stage while her brother accompanied her on the piano.","La hermana menor cantaba en el escenario y su hermano, sentado al piano, la acompañaba.","La petite sœur chantait sur scène tandis que son frère, assis au piano, l'accompagnait."],["L7-0083","拌","bàn","V","to mix; to toss","mezclar; aliñar","mélanger; assaisonner","拌凉菜的时候放几滴香油会更香。","bàn liáng cài de shí hou fàng jǐ dī xiāng yóu huì gèng xiāng","Adding a few drops of sesame oil makes cold dishes more fragrant.","Al aliñar ensaladas frías, unas gotas de aceite de sésamo les dan más aroma.","Quelques gouttes d'huile de sésame dans les plats froids les rendent plus parfumés."],["L7-0084","帮手","bāngshou","N","helper; assistant","ayudante; asistente","aide; assistant","小店最近生意越来越忙，老板决定再找一个帮手。","xiǎo diàn zuì jìn shēng yi yuè lái yuè máng lǎo bǎn jué dìng zài zhǎo yí ge bāng shou","The shop has become increasingly busy lately, so the owner decided to find another helper.","Últimamente la tiendita tiene cada vez más trabajo, así que el dueño decidió buscar otro ayudante.","Ces derniers temps, la petite boutique a de plus en plus de travail, et le patron a décidé de chercher un autre assistant."],["L7-0085","绑","bǎng","V","to tie; to bind","atar","attacher; ligoter","出发之前，请把车上的箱子绑牢，免得路上滑下来。","chū fā zhī qián qǐng bǎ chē shàng de xiāng zi bǎng láo miǎn de lù shang huá xià lái","Before setting off, please secure the boxes on the vehicle so they do not slip off on the way.","Antes de salir, amarra bien las cajas del vehículo para que no se resbalen en el camino.","Avant de partir, veuillez bien attacher les caisses du véhicule pour qu'elles ne glissent pas en route."],["L7-0086","绑架","bǎngjià","V","to kidnap; to abduct","secuestrar","kidnapper; enlever","警方收到线索后，连夜解救了被绑架的孩子。","jǐng fāng shōu dào xiàn suǒ hòu lián yè jiě jiù le bèi bǎng jià de hái zi","After receiving a lead, the police worked through the night to rescue the kidnapped child.","Tras recibir una pista, la policía rescató durante la noche al niño secuestrado.","Après avoir reçu un indice, la police a secouru dans la nuit l'enfant enlevé."],["L7-0087","榜样","bǎngyàng","N","example; role model","ejemplo; modelo","exemple; modèle","父母要给孩子树立一个好榜样。","fù mǔ yào gěi hái zi shù lì yí ge hǎo bǎng yàng","Parents should set a good example for their children.","Los padres deben darles un buen ejemplo a sus hijos.","Les parents doivent donner le bon exemple à leurs enfants."],["L7-0088","棒球","bàngqiú","N","baseball","béisbol","baseball","他原来不懂棒球，陪朋友看了几场比赛才渐渐入迷。","tā yuán lái bù dǒng bàng qiú péi péng you kàn le jǐ chǎng bǐ sài cái jiàn jiàn rù mí","He originally knew nothing about baseball, but gradually became fascinated after watching a few games with friends.","Antes no entendía nada de béisbol, pero después de ver unos cuantos partidos con sus amigos, poco a poco se aficionó.","Au départ, il ne connaissait rien au baseball, mais après avoir regardé quelques matchs avec des amis, il s'est peu à peu passionné."],["L7-0089","磅","bàng","M/N","pound (weight); scale; to weigh","libra (peso); báscula; pesar","livre (poids); balance; peser","这批货物重两百磅，搬运时需要使用专门的设备。","zhè pī huò wù zhòng liǎng bǎi bàng bān yùn shí xū yào shǐ yòng zhuān mén de shè bèi","These goods weigh two hundred pounds and require special equipment to move.","Este cargamento pesa doscientas libras y requiere equipo especial para transportarlo.","Cette cargaison pèse deux cents livres et nécessite un équipement spécial pour être déplacée."],["L7-0090","包袱","bāofu","N","burden; bundle","carga; fardo; bulto","fardeau; balluchon","放下过去失败的包袱以后，他终于敢再次尝试。","fàng xià guò qù shī bài de bāo fu yǐ hòu tā zhōng yú gǎn zài cì cháng shì","After letting go of the burden of his past failure, he finally dared to try again.","Después de dejar atrás la carga de sus fracasos pasados, por fin se atrevió a intentarlo otra vez.","Une fois libéré du fardeau de ses échecs passés, il a enfin osé réessayer."],["L7-0091","包容","bāoróng","V","to tolerate; to forgive; to contain","tolerar; perdonar; contener","tolérer; pardonner; contenir","这段经历让他明白，包容不同意见，并不等于对所有做法都表示赞同。","zhè duàn jīng lì ràng tā míng bai bāo róng bù tóng yì jiàn bìng bù děng yú duì suǒ yǒu zuò fǎ dōu biǎo shì zàn tóng","The experience taught him that accepting differing opinions does not mean endorsing every action.","Esta experiencia le hizo entender que tolerar opiniones distintas no equivale a aprobar todas las formas de actuar.","Cette expérience lui a fait comprendre que tolérer des opinions différentes ne signifie pas approuver toutes les façons d'agir."],["L7-0092","包扎","bāozā","V","to bandage; to dress a wound","vendar; curar una herida","bander; panser une plaie","护士替受伤的队员包扎好伤口，随后扶他坐下休息。","hù shi tì shòu shāng de duì yuán bāo zā hǎo shāng kǒu suí hòu fú tā zuò xia xiū xi","The nurse dressed the injured player's wound and then helped him sit down to rest.","La enfermera le vendó la herida al jugador lesionado y luego lo ayudó a sentarse a descansar.","L'infirmière a pansé la blessure du joueur blessé, puis l'a aidé à s'asseoir pour se reposer."],["L7-0093","剥","bāo","V","to peel; to shell","pelar; descascarar","éplucher; écaler","她坐在窗边剥橘子，孩子在一旁听她讲故事。","tā zuò zài chuāng biān bāo jú zi hái zi zài yì páng tīng tā jiǎng gù shi","She sat by the window peeling oranges while the child listened to her tell a story.","Ella pelaba mandarinas junto a la ventana mientras el niño la escuchaba contar un cuento.","Assise près de la fenêtre, elle épluchait des mandarines pendant que l'enfant l'écoutait raconter une histoire."],["L7-0094","煲","bāo","N/V","to stew; pot","cocer a fuego lento; olla","mijoter; marmite","祖母一早就开始煲汤，厨房里渐渐飘出了香味。","zǔ mǔ yì zǎo jiù kāi shǐ bāo tāng chú fáng lǐ jiàn jiàn piāo chū le xiāng wèi","Grandmother began simmering soup early in the morning, and a delicious smell gradually filled the kitchen.","La abuela empezó a hacer sopa desde temprano y poco a poco el aroma fue llenando la cocina.","Dès le matin, grand-mère a mis une soupe à mijoter, et peu à peu une bonne odeur s'est répandue dans la cuisine."],["L7-0095","饱和","bǎohé","V","saturated; at full capacity","saturado; lleno a su capacidad","saturé; plein à capacité","这座小城的餐饮市场已接近饱和，新店竞争十分激烈。","zhè zuò xiǎo chéng de cān yǐn shì chǎng yǐ jiē jìn bǎo hé xīn diàn jìng zhēng shí fēn jī liè","The restaurant market in this small city is nearly saturated, and competition among new establishments is intense.","El mercado de la restauración de esta pequeña ciudad está casi saturado y la competencia entre los locales nuevos es muy intensa.","Le marché de la restauration de cette petite ville est presque saturé, et la concurrence entre les nouveaux établissements est très vive."],["L7-0096","饱满","bǎomǎn","Adj","full; plump","lleno; rollizo","plein; dodu","今年雨水充足，地里的麦穗比往年更加饱满。","jīn nián yǔ shuǐ chōng zú dì lǐ de mài suì bǐ wǎng nián gèng jiā bǎo mǎn","With ample rainfall this year, the ears of wheat in the fields are fuller than in previous years.","Este año llovió lo suficiente y las espigas de trigo en el campo están más llenas que en años anteriores.","Cette année, les pluies ont été abondantes, et les épis de blé dans les champs sont plus fournis que les années précédentes."],["L7-0097","宝库","bǎokù","N","treasure house; treasury","tesoro; repositorio de tesoros","trésor; mine de trésors","这座图书馆收藏丰富，是研究地方历史的宝库。","zhè zuò tú shū guǎn shōu cáng fēng fù shì yán jiū dì fāng lì shǐ de bǎo kù","This library has a rich collection and is a treasure house for research into local history.","Esta biblioteca tiene una colección riquísima y es un tesoro para investigar la historia local.","Cette bibliothèque possède de riches collections et constitue un véritable trésor pour la recherche sur l'histoire locale."],["L7-0098","宝藏","bǎozàng","N","hidden treasure; precious deposits","tesoro oculto; riqueza","trésor caché; richesses","这部电影讲的是一群海盗寻找宝藏的故事。","zhè bù diàn yǐng jiǎng de shì yì qún hǎi dào xún zhǎo bǎo zàng de gù shi","This film tells the story of a band of pirates searching for treasure.","Esta película cuenta la historia de un grupo de piratas que buscan un tesoro.","Ce film raconte l'histoire d'une bande de pirates à la recherche d'un trésor."],["L7-0099","保管","bǎoguǎn","V/N","to keep safe; to guarantee","custodiar; garantizar","garder; garantir","调查人员应当妥善保管证物，确保证据在移交过程中不被篡改。","diào chá rén yuán yīng dāng tuǒ shàn bǎo guǎn zhèng wù què bǎo zhèng jù zài yí jiāo guò chéng zhōng bú bèi cuàn gǎi","Investigators should safeguard the exhibits to ensure that evidence is not tampered with during transfer.","Los investigadores deben custodiar adecuadamente las pruebas para garantizar que no se alteren durante el traspaso.","Les enquêteurs doivent conserver correctement les pièces à conviction afin de garantir que les preuves ne soient pas falsifiées pendant leur transfert."],["L7-0100","保姆","bǎomǔ","N","nanny; housekeeper","niñera; ama de llaves","nounou; gouvernante","他们雇了一位保姆来照顾家里的老人。","tā men gù le yí wèi bǎo mǔ lái zhào gù jiā lǐ de lǎo rén","They hired a caregiver to look after the elderly person at home.","Contrataron a una niñera para cuidar a la persona mayor de la casa.","Ils ont engagé une aide à domicile pour s'occuper de la personne âgée de la maison."],["L7-0101","保暖","bǎonuǎn","","to keep warm","abrigar; mantener el calor","garder au chaud","这件外套轻便又保暖，很适合早晚温差大的地方。","zhè jiàn wài tào qīng biàn yòu bǎo nuǎn hěn shì hé zǎo wǎn wēn chā dà de dì fang","This coat is both lightweight and warm, making it suitable for places with large temperature differences between morning and evening.","Esta chaqueta es ligera y abrigada, muy adecuada para lugares con gran diferencia de temperatura entre la mañana y la noche.","Ce manteau est à la fois léger et chaud, idéal pour les endroits où l'écart de température est grand entre le matin et le soir."],["L7-0102","保鲜","bǎoxiān","V","to keep fresh","conservar fresco","conserver frais","运输公司换用了保鲜设备，水果送到时仍然很新鲜。","yùn shū gōng sī huàn yòng le bǎo xiān shè bèi shuǐ guǒ sòng dào shí réng rán hěn xīn xiān","The transport company adopted equipment to preserve freshness, so the fruit still arrived fresh.","La empresa de transporte cambió a equipos de conservación en frío, así que la fruta sigue llegando fresca.","L'entreprise de transport est passée à un équipement de conservation de la fraîcheur, si bien que les fruits arrivent toujours frais."],["L7-0103","保修","bǎoxiū","V","warranty; to guarantee repairs","garantía; reparación garantizada","garantie; réparation garantie","商家承诺免费保修，却在维修时另收费用，这种做法理应受到质疑。","shāng jiā chéng nuò miǎn fèi bǎo xiū què zài wéi xiū shí lìng shōu fèi yòng zhè zhǒng zuò fǎ lǐ yīng shòu dào zhì yí","The seller promised free warranty repairs but charged extra during servicing; this practice deserves to be questioned.","El comerciante prometió una garantía gratuita, pero cobró un cargo adicional en la reparación; esta práctica merece ser cuestionada.","Le commerçant avait promis une garantie gratuite, mais a facturé des frais supplémentaires lors de la réparation ; cette pratique mérite d'être remise en question."],["L7-0104","保佑","bǎoyòu","V","to bless and protect","bendecir y proteger","bénir et protéger","出海以前，渔民们照例祈求神灵保佑家人平安。","chū hǎi yǐ qián yú mín men zhào lì qí qiú shén líng bǎo yòu jiā rén píng ān","Before setting out to sea, the fishermen customarily prayed for divine protection for their families.","Antes de salir al mar, los pescadores, como de costumbre, pedían a los dioses que protegieran a sus familias.","Avant de prendre la mer, les pêcheurs imploraient comme d'habitude la protection des dieux pour la sécurité de leurs familles."],["L7-0105","保障","bǎozhàng","V/N","to guarantee; to safeguard","garantizar; salvaguardar","garantir; sauvegarder","司法公正是社会公平的重要保障。","sī fǎ gōng zhèng shì shè huì gōng píng de zhòng yào bǎo zhàng","Judicial fairness is an important guarantee of social justice.","La justicia judicial es una garantía importante de la equidad social.","L'équité de la justice est une garantie importante de l'égalité sociale."],["L7-0106","保质期","bǎozhìqī","N","shelf life; expiry date","fecha de caducidad","durée de conservation; date de péremption","这批食品的标签标示不清，消费者很难辨认其保质期。","zhè pī shí pǐn de biāo qiān biāo shì bù qīng xiāo fèi zhě hěn nán biàn rèn qí bǎo zhì qī","The labeling on this batch of food is unclear, making it difficult for consumers to identify its shelf life.","Las etiquetas de este lote de alimentos no son claras y a los consumidores les cuesta identificar su fecha de caducidad.","L'étiquetage de ce lot de produits alimentaires n'est pas clair, et les consommateurs ont du mal à repérer la date limite de consommation."],["L7-0107","保重","bǎozhòng","V","to take care of oneself","cuidarse","prendre soin de soi","临别时，老人握着他的手，一再嘱咐他多多保重。","lín bié shí lǎo rén wò zhe tā de shǒu yí zài zhǔ fù tā duō duō bǎo zhòng","At their parting, the older man held his hand and repeatedly urged him to take good care of himself.","Al despedirse, el anciano le tomó la mano y le recomendó una y otra vez que se cuidara mucho.","Au moment de se quitter, le vieil homme lui a pris la main et lui a recommandé à plusieurs reprises de bien prendre soin de lui."],["L7-0108","堡垒","bǎolěi","N","fortress; bastion","fortaleza; bastión","forteresse; bastion","山顶那座古老的堡垒，至今仍保留着厚厚的石墙。","shān dǐng nà zuò gǔ lǎo de bǎo lěi zhì jīn réng bǎo liú zhe hòu hòu de shí qiáng","The ancient fortress on the mountaintop still retains its thick stone walls.","La antigua fortaleza en la cima de la montaña todavía conserva sus gruesos muros de piedra.","L'ancienne forteresse au sommet de la montagne a conservé jusqu'à aujourd'hui ses épais murs de pierre."],["L7-0109","报","bào","V","to report; newspaper; to repay","informar; periódico; recompensar","annoncer; journal; rendre","那个人打电话恐吓她，她马上报了警。","nà ge rén dǎ diàn huà kǒng hè tā tā mǎ shàng bào le jǐng","That person called to threaten her, and she immediately reported it to the police.","Esa persona la amenazó por teléfono y ella llamó de inmediato a la policía.","Cette personne l'a menacée par téléphone, et elle a immédiatement appelé la police."],["L7-0110","报仇","bàochóu","","to take revenge","vengarse","se venger","他不愿让下一代继续报仇，决定结束两家的争斗。","tā bú yuàn ràng xià yí dài jì xù bào chóu jué dìng jié shù liǎng jiā de zhēng dòu","Unwilling to let the next generation continue seeking revenge, he decided to end the feud between the two families.","No quería que la siguiente generación continuara con la venganza y decidió poner fin a la enemistad entre las dos familias.","Refusant que la génération suivante continue à se venger, il a décidé de mettre fin à la querelle entre les deux familles."],["L7-0111","报酬","bàochou","N","payment; remuneration","remuneración; paga","rémunération; paiement","这份工作报酬不高，却能让他学到真正有用的技术。","zhè fèn gōng zuò bào chou bù gāo què néng ràng tā xué dào zhēn zhèng yǒu yòng de jì shù","The job does not pay much, but it allows him to learn genuinely useful skills.","Este trabajo no paga mucho, pero le permite aprender técnicas realmente útiles.","Ce travail n'est pas très bien payé, mais il lui permet d'acquérir des compétences vraiment utiles."],["L7-0112","报废","bàofèi","","to scrap; to discard","desechar; dar de baja","mettre au rebut","这台旧机器的零件已经买不到了，只能报废。","zhè tái jiù jī qì de líng jiàn yǐ jīng mǎi bu dào le zhǐ néng bào fèi","Parts for this old machine are no longer available, so it can only be scrapped.","Ya no se consiguen repuestos para esta vieja máquina, así que solo queda desecharla.","On ne trouve plus de pièces pour cette vieille machine, il ne reste qu'à la mettre au rebut."],["L7-0113","报复","bàofù","V","to retaliate; revenge","tomar represalias; venganza","se venger; représailles","他担心说出实情会遭到报复，所以一直保持沉默。","tā dān xīn shuō chū shí qíng huì zāo dào bào fù suǒ yǐ yì zhí bǎo chí chén mò","He feared retaliation if he told the truth, so he remained silent.","Temía sufrir represalias si decía la verdad, así que siempre guardó silencio.","Il craignait des représailles s'il disait la vérité, alors il est toujours resté silencieux."],["L7-0114","报社","bàoshè","N","newspaper office","redacción de periódico","rédaction de journal","大学毕业后，她进入一家地方报社，负责采访普通市民。","dà xué bì yè hòu tā jìn rù yì jiā dì fāng bào shè fù zé cǎi fǎng pǔ tōng shì mín","After graduating from university, she joined a local newspaper and interviewed ordinary residents.","Después de graduarse de la universidad, entró en un periódico local, donde se encargaba de entrevistar a ciudadanos comunes.","Après avoir obtenu son diplôme universitaire, elle est entrée dans un journal local, où elle était chargée d'interviewer des citoyens ordinaires."],["L7-0115","报亭","bàotíng","N","newsstand; kiosk","quiosco de prensa","kiosque à journaux","车站旁的报亭还开着，老板正替顾客找当天的晚报。","chē zhàn páng de bào tíng hái kāi zhe lǎo bǎn zhèng tì gù kè zhǎo dàng tiān de wǎn bào","The newsstand beside the station was still open, and the owner was finding that day's evening paper for a customer.","El quiosco de periódicos junto a la estación todavía estaba abierto y el dueño buscaba el periódico vespertino del día para un cliente.","Le kiosque à journaux près de la gare était encore ouvert, et le patron cherchait à un client le journal du soir du jour."],["L7-0116","报销","bàoxiāo","V","to claim reimbursement; to write off","solicitar reembolso; dar de baja","se faire rembourser; passer en pertes","出差回来后，请把车票交给财务人员办理报销。","chū chāi huí lái hòu qǐng bǎ chē piào jiāo gěi cái wù rén yuán bàn lǐ bào xiāo","After returning from the business trip, please give your tickets to the finance staff to claim reimbursement.","Al regresar del viaje de trabajo, entregue los boletos al personal de finanzas para tramitar el reembolso.","À votre retour de déplacement professionnel, veuillez remettre vos billets au personnel de la comptabilité pour vous faire rembourser."],["L7-0117","抱负","bàofù","N","aspiration; ambition","aspiración; ambición","aspiration; ambition","他怀着改变家乡面貌的抱负，毕业后回到了小县城。","tā huái zhe gǎi biàn jiā xiāng miàn mào de bào fù bì yè hòu huí dào le xiǎo xiàn chéng","With the ambition of transforming his hometown, he returned to the small county town after graduation.","Con la ambición de transformar su pueblo natal, regresó a la pequeña ciudad tras graduarse.","Animé de l'ambition de transformer sa région natale, il est retourné dans la petite ville du comté après ses études."],["L7-0118","豹","bào","N","leopard; panther","leopardo; pantera","léopard; panthère","林间那只豹忽然停下脚步，警惕地望着远处。","lín jiān nà zhī bào hū rán tíng xià jiǎo bù jǐng tì de wàng zhe yuǎn chù","The leopard in the woods suddenly stopped and looked warily into the distance.","El leopardo del bosque se detuvo de pronto y miró alerta a lo lejos.","Le léopard dans les bois s'est soudain arrêté et a regardé au loin d'un air méfiant."],["L7-0119","暴风骤雨","bàofēng-zhòuyǔ","","violent storm; tempest","tormenta violenta; tempestad","tempête violente; tourmente","暴风骤雨过后，村民一起清理了挡在路上的树枝。","bào fēng zhòu yǔ guò hòu cūn mín yì qǐ qīng lǐ le dǎng zài lù shang de shù zhī","After the violent storm, the villagers worked together to clear the branches blocking the road.","Pasada la violenta tormenta, los aldeanos limpiaron juntos las ramas que bloqueaban el camino.","Après la violente tempête, les villageois ont dégagé ensemble les branches qui barraient la route."],["L7-0120","暴利","bàolì","N","huge profits","beneficios enormes","profits exorbitants","如果只顾眼前的暴利，企业最终可能失去多年积累的信誉。","rú guǒ zhǐ gù yǎn qián de bào lì qǐ yè zuì zhōng kě néng shī qù duō nián jī lěi de xìn yù","If a company pursues only immediate windfall profits, it may eventually lose the reputation built up over many years.","Si solo se piensa en las ganancias desorbitadas del momento, la empresa podría acabar perdiendo la credibilidad acumulada durante años.","Si l'entreprise ne songe qu'aux profits exorbitants à court terme, elle risque de perdre finalement la réputation bâtie pendant des années."],["L7-0121","暴躁","bàozào","Adj","irritable; short-tempered","irascible; malhumorado","irascible; colérique","最近工作不顺，他变得有些暴躁，常为小事发火。","zuì jìn gōng zuò bú shùn tā biàn de yǒu xiē bào zào cháng wèi xiǎo shì fā huǒ","Work has not been going well lately, and he has become irritable, often losing his temper over small matters.","Últimamente le va mal en el trabajo y se ha vuelto algo irritable; a menudo se enoja por cosas sin importancia.","Ces derniers temps, le travail ne va pas bien et il est devenu un peu irritable ; il s'emporte souvent pour des broutilles."],["L7-0122","曝光","bàoguāng","","to expose; exposure","exponer; exposición; sacar a la luz","exposer; exposition; dévoiler","这起财务丑闻曝光后，公司的股价一路下跌。","zhè qǐ cái wù chǒu wén bào guāng hòu gōng sī de gǔ jià yí lù xià diē","After the financial scandal came to light, the company's share price kept falling.","Después de que salió a la luz este escándalo financiero, las acciones de la empresa cayeron sin parar.","Après la révélation de ce scandale financier, le cours de l'action de l'entreprise n'a cessé de chuter."],["L7-0123","爆冷门","bào lěngmén","","upset; surprise result","sorpresa; resultado inesperado","surprise; résultat inattendu","这支年轻队伍首次参加比赛就爆冷门，打败了上届冠军。","zhè zhī nián qīng duì wǔ shǒu cì cān jiā bǐ sài jiù bào lěng mén dǎ bài le shàng jiè guàn jūn","The young team caused an upset in its first appearance, defeating the defending champion.","Este joven equipo dio la sorpresa en su primera participación y derrotó al campeón anterior.","Cette jeune équipe a créé la surprise dès sa première participation en battant le champion en titre."],["L7-0124","爆满","bàomǎn","V","packed; full to capacity","abarrotado; lleno a rebosar","bondé; plein à craquer","周末的剧场场场爆满，连临时加演的票也卖完了。","zhōu mò de jù chǎng chǎng chǎng bào mǎn lián lín shí jiā yǎn de piào yě mài wán le","Every weekend performance at the theater was packed, and even tickets for the added shows sold out.","Los fines de semana el teatro se llenaba en todas las funciones, y hasta las entradas de las funciones adicionales se agotaron.","Tous les week-ends, le théâtre affichait complet à chaque représentation, et même les billets des séances supplémentaires ont été vendus."],["L7-0125","爆竹","bàozhú","N","firecracker","petardo","pétard","为了安全，市区里禁止燃放烟花爆竹。","wèi le ān quán shì qū lǐ jìn zhǐ rán fàng yān huā bào zhú","For safety reasons, setting off fireworks and firecrackers is banned in the city.","Por seguridad, está prohibido lanzar fuegos artificiales y petardos en el casco urbano.","Pour des raisons de sécurité, il est interdit de tirer des feux d'artifice et des pétards en ville."],["L7-0126","卑鄙","bēibǐ","Adj","base; despicable","ruin; despreciable","vil; méprisable","利用朋友的信任骗走钱财，这种手段实在卑鄙。","lì yòng péng you de xìn rèn piàn zǒu qián cái zhè zhǒng shǒu duàn shí zài bēi bǐ","Using a friend's trust to swindle money is a truly despicable tactic.","Aprovecharse de la confianza de un amigo para estafarlo es un recurso realmente despreciable.","Profiter de la confiance d'un ami pour lui escroquer son argent est un procédé vraiment ignoble."],["L7-0127","悲哀","bēi'āi","Adj","sorrowful; grieved","afligido; apenado","affligé; peiné","最让人悲哀的，不是失败本身，而是失去了再试的勇气。","zuì ràng rén bēi āi de bú shì shī bài běn shēn ér shì shī qù le zài shì de yǒng qì","The saddest thing is not failure itself, but losing the courage to try again.","Lo más triste no es el fracaso en sí, sino perder el valor para volver a intentarlo.","Le plus triste n'est pas l'échec lui-même, mais d'avoir perdu le courage de réessayer."],["L7-0128","悲观","bēiguān","Adj","pessimistic","pesimista","pessimiste","情况虽然暂时不利，我们也不必对未来过分悲观。","qíng kuàng suī rán zàn shí bú lì wǒ men yě bú bì duì wèi lái guò fèn bēi guān","Although the situation is unfavorable for now, we need not be excessively pessimistic about the future.","Aunque la situación es desfavorable por ahora, no hace falta ser demasiado pesimistas sobre el futuro.","Même si la situation est pour le moment défavorable, il n'y a pas lieu d'être trop pessimiste quant à l'avenir."],["L7-0129","悲欢离合","bēihuān-líhé","","ups and downs of life","alegrías y penas de la vida","joies et peines de la vie","这部电影通过一家人的悲欢离合，展现了时代的变化。","zhè bù diàn yǐng tōng guò yì jiā rén de bēi huān lí hé zhǎn xiàn le shí dài de biàn huà","Through one family's joys, sorrows, partings, and reunions, the film depicts the changes of an era.","Esta película muestra los cambios de una época a través de las alegrías y penas, los encuentros y despedidas de una familia.","À travers les joies et les peines, les séparations et les retrouvailles d'une famille, ce film montre les changements d'une époque."],["L7-0130","悲痛","bēitòng","Adj","grief-stricken; sorrowful","afligido; desconsolado","affligé; accablé de douleur","听到老师去世的消息，学生们悲痛得久久说不出话。","tīng dào lǎo shī qù shì de xiāo xi xué shēng men bēi tòng de jiǔ jiǔ shuō bu chū huà","On hearing of their teacher's death, the students were too grief-stricken to speak for a long time.","Al enterarse de la muerte de su maestro, los alumnos quedaron tan afligidos que durante un buen rato no pudieron hablar.","En apprenant la mort de leur professeur, les élèves ont été si accablés de chagrin qu'ils sont restés longtemps sans pouvoir parler."],["L7-0131","碑","bēi","N","stele; stone tablet","estela; lápida","stèle; monument de pierre","村口那块碑上，清楚地刻着修桥人的姓名。","cūn kǒu nà kuài bēi shàng qīng chu de kè zhe xiū qiáo rén de xìng míng","The names of those who built the bridge are clearly engraved on the stone tablet at the village entrance.","En la estela a la entrada del pueblo están grabados con claridad los nombres de quienes construyeron el puente.","Sur la stèle à l'entrée du village sont clairement gravés les noms de ceux qui ont construit le pont."],["L7-0132","贝壳","bèiké","N","shell; seashell","concha; caparazón","coquille; coquillage","退潮以后，孩子们沿着海边寻找形状特别的贝壳。","tuì cháo yǐ hòu hái zi men yán zhe hǎi biān xún zhǎo xíng zhuàng tè bié de bèi ké","After the tide went out, the children searched along the shore for unusually shaped seashells.","Cuando bajó la marea, los niños recorrieron la orilla buscando conchas de formas especiales.","Après le reflux de la marée, les enfants ont longé le rivage à la recherche de coquillages aux formes particulières."],["L7-0133","备课","bèikè","","to prepare lessons","preparar las clases","préparer ses cours","为了讲清这个难点，她备课时特意设计了一个实验。","wèi le jiǎng qīng zhè ge nán diǎn tā bèi kè shí tè yì shè jì le yí ge shí yàn","To explain this difficult point clearly, she deliberately designed an experiment while preparing her lesson.","Para explicar con claridad este punto difícil, ella diseñó un experimento a propósito al preparar su clase.","Pour bien expliquer ce point difficile, elle a spécialement conçu une expérience en préparant son cours."],["L7-0134","备受","bèishòu","V","to receive abundantly; to enjoy fully","recibir en abundancia; gozar de","recevoir pleinement; jouir de","这部反映乡村生活的新作一出版，就备受读者关注。","zhè bù fǎn yìng xiāng cūn shēng huó de xīn zuò yì chū bǎn jiù bèi shòu dú zhě guān zhù","As soon as this new work depicting rural life was published, it attracted considerable attention from readers.","Apenas se publicó esta nueva obra que refleja la vida rural, atrajo mucho la atención de los lectores.","Dès sa parution, ce nouvel ouvrage reflétant la vie rurale a suscité un vif intérêt chez les lecteurs."],["L7-0135","备用","bèiyòng","V","spare; backup","de reserva; de repuesto","de rechange; de secours","停电的时候，医院会马上启动备用发电机。","tíng diàn de shí hou yī yuàn huì mǎ shàng qǐ dòng bèi yòng fā diàn jī","When there is a power cut, the hospital immediately starts its backup generator.","Cuando se va la luz, el hospital pone en marcha de inmediato el generador de reserva.","Lorsqu'il y a une coupure de courant, l'hôpital met aussitôt en marche le groupe électrogène de secours."],["L7-0136","背面","bèimiàn","N","back; reverse side","reverso; parte trasera","verso; face arrière","照片的背面写着拍摄日期，还有一行已经褪色的小字。","zhào piàn de bèi miàn xiě zhe pāi shè rì qī hái yǒu yì háng yǐ jīng tuì sè de xiǎo zì","The back of the photograph bears the date it was taken and a line of faded writing.","En el reverso de la foto está escrita la fecha en que se tomó, además de una línea de letra pequeña ya desvaída.","Au dos de la photo figurent la date de la prise de vue et une petite ligne d'écriture déjà effacée."],["L7-0137","背叛","bèipàn","V","to betray","traicionar","trahir","他最难接受的，是自己信任的人竟然背叛了他。","tā zuì nán jiē shòu de shì zì jǐ xìn rèn de rén jìng rán bèi pàn le tā","What he found hardest to accept was that someone he trusted had betrayed him.","Lo que más le costó aceptar fue que alguien en quien confiaba lo hubiera traicionado.","Ce qu'il avait le plus de mal à accepter, c'était d'avoir été trahi par quelqu'un en qui il avait confiance."],["L7-0138","背诵","bèisòng","V","to recite from memory","recitar de memoria","réciter par cœur","她不仅能流利背诵这首诗，还能解释其中的意思。","tā bù jǐn néng liú lì bèi sòng zhè shǒu shī hái néng jiě shì qí zhōng de yì si","She can not only recite the poem fluently from memory but also explain its meaning.","No solo puede recitar este poema de memoria con fluidez, sino que también puede explicar su significado.","Non seulement elle sait réciter ce poème par cœur avec aisance, mais elle peut aussi en expliquer le sens."],["L7-0139","被捕","bèibǔ","V","to be arrested","ser arrestado","être arrêté","嫌疑人被捕以后，调查人员继续寻找尚未发现的证据。","xián yí rén bèi bǔ yǐ hòu diào chá rén yuán jì xù xún zhǎo shàng wèi fā xiàn de zhèng jù","After the suspect was arrested, investigators continued searching for evidence that had not yet been found.","Tras la detención del sospechoso, los investigadores siguieron buscando pruebas que aún no habían encontrado.","Après l'arrestation du suspect, les enquêteurs ont continué à chercher des preuves encore non découvertes."],["L7-0140","奔波","bēnbō","V","to rush about","ir de un lado a otro","courir de tous côtés","这家医院为偏远乡村提供远程会诊，减少了患者长途奔波的负担。","zhè jiā yī yuàn wèi piān yuǎn xiāng cūn tí gōng yuǎn chéng huì zhěn jiǎn shǎo le huàn zhě cháng tú bēn bō de fù dān","This hospital offers remote consultations to isolated villages, reducing the burden of long journeys for patients.","Este hospital ofrece consultas a distancia a pueblos remotos, lo que alivia a los pacientes de largos desplazamientos.","Cet hôpital propose des téléconsultations aux villages isolés, ce qui évite aux patients de longs déplacements."],["L7-0141","奔赴","bēnfù","V","to rush to; to hurry to","dirigirse apresuradamente a","se précipiter vers","接到通知后，救援人员立即奔赴受灾最严重的地区。","jiē dào tōng zhī hòu jiù yuán rén yuán lì jí bēn fù shòu zāi zuì yán zhòng de dì qū","After receiving the notice, rescue workers immediately headed for the areas hardest hit by the disaster.","Al recibir el aviso, los rescatistas se dirigieron de inmediato a las zonas más afectadas por el desastre.","Dès réception de l'avis, les secouristes se sont immédiatement rendus dans les zones les plus touchées par la catastrophe."],["L7-0142","本分","běnfèn","N/Adj","one's duty; dutiful","deber; cumplidor","devoir; consciencieux","他认真照顾年老的母亲，觉得这是自己应尽的本分。","tā rèn zhēn zhào gù nián lǎo de mǔ qīn jué de zhè shì zì jǐ yīng jìn de běn fèn","He diligently cares for his elderly mother, considering it his proper responsibility.","Cuida con esmero a su anciana madre, pues considera que es su deber.","Il s'occupe avec soin de sa vieille mère, estimant que c'est son devoir."],["L7-0143","本能","běnnéng","N","instinct","instinto","instinct","听见孩子哭，她本能地伸手把他抱了起来。","tīng jiàn hái zi kū tā běn néng de shēn shǒu bǎ tā bào le qǐ lái","On hearing the child cry, she instinctively reached out and picked him up.","Al oír llorar al niño, ella, por instinto, extendió la mano y lo levantó en brazos.","En entendant l'enfant pleurer, elle a tendu instinctivement la main et l'a pris dans ses bras."],["L7-0144","本钱","běnqián","N","capital; asset; advantage","capital; ventaja","capital; atout","为了开这家修理铺，他把多年积攒的钱都当作本钱。","wèi le kāi zhè jiā xiū lǐ pù tā bǎ duō nián jī zǎn de qián dōu dàng zuò běn qián","To open this repair shop, he put all the money he had saved over the years into the initial capital.","Para abrir este taller de reparaciones, utilizó como capital todo el dinero que había ahorrado durante años.","Pour ouvrir cet atelier de réparation, il a investi comme capital tout l'argent économisé au fil des ans."],["L7-0145","本色","běnsè","N","true colors; natural character","carácter natural; esencia","nature véritable; caractère","无论获得多少荣誉，他都没有改变朴实的本色。","wú lùn huò dé duō shao róng yù tā dōu méi yǒu gǎi biàn pǔ shí de běn sè","No matter how many honors he received, he never lost his unpretentious character.","Por muchos honores que recibiera, nunca cambió su carácter sencillo.","Quels que soient les honneurs reçus, il n'a jamais changé son caractère simple."],["L7-0146","本性","běnxìng","N","nature; inherent character","naturaleza; carácter innato","nature; caractère inné","这个故事讽刺了商人贪婪的本性。","zhè ge gù shi fěng cì le shāng rén tān lán de běn xìng","This story satirizes the merchant's greedy nature.","Este cuento satiriza la codicia innata de los comerciantes.","Cette histoire tourne en dérision la cupidité naturelle des marchands."],["L7-0147","本意","běnyì","N","original intention","intención original","intention première","我提出这个建议的本意，是减轻大家的负担，并非推卸责任。","wǒ tí chū zhè ge jiàn yì de běn yì shì jiǎn qīng dà jiā de fù dān bìng fēi tuī xiè zé rèn","My original intention in making this suggestion was to reduce everyone's burden, not to evade responsibility.","Mi intención original al hacer esta propuesta era aliviar la carga de todos, no eludir mi responsabilidad.","En faisant cette proposition, mon intention première était d'alléger la charge de tous, et non de me défausser de mes responsabilités."],["L7-0148","本着","běnzhe","Prep","based on; in line with","con base en; conforme a","conformément à; en se fondant sur","双方本着相互尊重的原则，重新讨论了合作的条件。","shuāng fāng běn zhe xiāng hù zūn zhòng de yuán zé chóng xīn tǎo lùn le hé zuò de tiáo jiàn","In a spirit of mutual respect, the two sides discussed the terms of cooperation again.","Ambas partes, guiadas por el principio de respeto mutuo, volvieron a discutir las condiciones de la cooperación.","Les deux parties, selon le principe du respect mutuel, ont de nouveau discuté des conditions de la coopération."],["L7-0149","奔","bèn","V","to hurry; to rush; to elope","apresurarse; correr; fugarse","se hâter; courir; s'enfuir","他一下火车就奔医院去了，连家也没有回。","tā yí xià huǒ chē jiù bèn yī yuàn qù le lián jiā yě méi yǒu huí","As soon as he got off the train, he headed straight for the hospital without even going home.","En cuanto bajó del tren se fue directo al hospital, sin pasar siquiera por su casa.","Dès qu'il est descendu du train, il s'est rendu directement à l'hôpital, sans même passer chez lui."],["L7-0150","笨蛋","bèndàn","N","fool; idiot","tonto; idiota","imbécile; idiot","她笑着叫他笨蛋，随即替他扣好了扣错的衣扣。","tā xiào zhe jiào tā bèn dàn suí jí tì tā kòu hǎo le kòu cuò de yī kòu","She laughingly called him a silly fellow and then fixed the buttons he had fastened incorrectly.","Ella, sonriendo, lo llamó tonto y enseguida le abrochó los botones que se había abotonado mal.","Elle l'a traité d'idiot en riant, puis lui a reboutonné les boutons qu'il avait mal attachés."],["L7-0151","笨重","bènzhòng","Adj","heavy; cumbersome","pesado; voluminoso","lourd; encombrant","这套家具外观朴素，做工却很精细，放在小客厅里也不显笨重。","zhè tào jiā jù wài guān pǔ sù zuò gōng què hěn jīng xì fàng zài xiǎo kè tīng lǐ yě bù xiǎn bèn zhòng","This set of furniture looks plain but is finely made and does not appear bulky even in a small living room.","Este juego de muebles tiene un aspecto sencillo pero está muy bien hecho, y no se ve pesado ni siquiera en una sala pequeña.","Ce mobilier a un aspect sobre mais est très finement fabriqué, et il ne paraît pas lourd même dans un petit salon."],["L7-0152","崩溃","bēngkuì","V","to collapse; to break down","derrumbarse; venirse abajo","s'effondrer; craquer","连续几次失败以后，他几乎崩溃，幸好朋友一直陪着他。","lián xù jǐ cì shī bài yǐ hòu tā jī hū bēng kuì xìng hǎo péng you yì zhí péi zhe tā","After several failures in succession, he nearly broke down, but fortunately his friends stayed by his side.","Después de varios fracasos seguidos, casi se derrumbó, pero por suerte sus amigos lo acompañaron todo el tiempo.","Après plusieurs échecs consécutifs, il a failli s'effondrer, mais heureusement ses amis sont restés à ses côtés."],["L7-0153","绷","bēng","V","to stretch tight; to bind","tensar; atar","tendre; serrer","她把绳子绷得很紧，晾上去的被单也没有碰地。","tā bǎ shéng zi bēng de hěn jǐn liàng shàng qù de bèi dān yě méi yǒu pèng dì","She stretched the line very tight so that the sheet hung on it did not touch the ground.","Tensó la cuerda con fuerza para que la sábana tendida no tocara el suelo.","Elle a bien tendu la corde pour que le drap étendu dessus ne touche pas le sol."],["L7-0154","绷带","bēngdài","N","bandage","venda","bandage","护士取来干净的绷带，仔细替病人处理受伤的手臂。","hù shi qǔ lái gān jìng de bēng dài zǐ xì tì bìng rén chǔ lǐ shòu shāng de shǒu bì","The nurse fetched a clean bandage and carefully tended the patient's injured arm.","La enfermera trajo una venda limpia y le curó con cuidado el brazo herido al paciente.","L'infirmière a apporté un bandage propre et a soigneusement soigné le bras blessé du patient."],["L7-0155","蹦","bèng","V","to jump; to bounce","saltar; brincar","sauter; bondir","听到获奖的消息，孩子高兴得在院子里直蹦。","tīng dào huò jiǎng de xiāo xi hái zi gāo xìng de zài yuàn zi lǐ zhí bèng","On hearing the news of the award, the child jumped up and down with delight in the courtyard.","Al oír que había ganado un premio, el niño saltaba de alegría en el patio.","En apprenant la nouvelle de son prix, l'enfant sautait de joie dans la cour."],["L7-0156","逼近","bījìn","V","to approach; to close in on","acercarse; aproximarse","s'approcher; se rapprocher","乌云从海面迅速逼近，岸边的游客纷纷往回走。","wū yún cóng hǎi miàn xùn sù bī jìn àn biān de yóu kè fēn fēn wǎng huí zǒu","Dark clouds quickly approached from the sea, and the tourists on the shore began heading back.","Unas nubes negras se acercaron rápidamente desde el mar y los turistas de la orilla empezaron a regresar.","De sombres nuages se sont rapidement approchés depuis la mer, et les touristes sur le rivage ont commencé à rebrousser chemin."],["L7-0157","逼迫","bīpò","V","to force; to coerce","obligar; coaccionar","forcer; contraindre","父母不想逼迫孩子作决定，只希望他认真考虑后果。","fù mǔ bù xiǎng bī pò hái zi zuò jué dìng zhǐ xī wàng tā rèn zhēn kǎo lǜ hòu guǒ","The parents did not want to force their child into a decision; they only hoped he would consider the consequences carefully.","Los padres no querían presionar a su hijo para que tomara una decisión; solo esperaban que considerara con seriedad las consecuencias.","Les parents ne voulaient pas forcer leur enfant à prendre une décision ; ils espéraient seulement qu'il réfléchisse sérieusement aux conséquences."],["L7-0158","逼真","bīzhēn","Adj","lifelike; vivid","realista; vívido","réaliste; criant de vérité","画中的老人神情十分逼真，仿佛随时会开口说话。","huà zhōng de lǎo rén shén qíng shí fēn bī zhēn fǎng fú suí shí huì kāi kǒu shuō huà","The old man's expression in the painting is so lifelike that he seems about to speak.","La expresión del anciano en el cuadro es tan real que parece que fuera a hablar en cualquier momento.","L'expression du vieil homme dans le tableau est si vraie qu'on dirait qu'il va se mettre à parler d'un instant à l'autre."],["L7-0159","鼻涕","bítì","N","snot; nasal mucus","moco","morve","孩子感冒后不停地流鼻涕，连说话的声音也变了。","hái zi gǎn mào hòu bù tíng de liú bí tì lián shuō huà de shēng yīn yě biàn le","The child had a constantly runny nose after catching a cold, and even his voice sounded different.","Después de resfriarse, el niño no paraba de moquear y hasta le cambió la voz.","Après avoir pris froid, l'enfant avait le nez qui coulait sans cesse, et même sa voix avait changé."],["L7-0160","比比皆是","bǐbǐ-jiēshì","","to be found everywhere","abundar por todas partes","se trouver partout","在这片老城区，仍在使用的传统手工作坊比比皆是。","zài zhè piàn lǎo chéng qū réng zài shǐ yòng de chuán tǒng shǒu gōng zuō fang bǐ bǐ jiē shì","Traditional craft workshops still in use can be found throughout this old part of the city.","En este barrio antiguo abundan los talleres artesanales tradicionales que todavía siguen en uso.","Dans ce vieux quartier, les ateliers artisanaux traditionnels encore en activité sont très nombreux."],["L7-0161","比不上","bǐ bu shàng","","can't compare with","no poder compararse con","ne pas valoir; ne pas égaler","论实际操作经验，他承认自己还比不上那位年轻同事。","lùn shí jì cāo zuò jīng yàn tā chéng rèn zì jǐ hái bǐ bu shàng nà wèi nián qīng tóng shì","When it comes to practical experience, he admits that he still falls short of that young colleague.","En cuanto a experiencia práctica, reconoce que todavía no se compara con aquel joven colega.","En matière d'expérience pratique, il reconnaît ne pas encore égaler ce jeune collègue."],["L7-0162","比起","bǐqǐ","","compared with","en comparación con","comparé à","比起坐飞机，我更喜欢坐火车欣赏沿途的风景。","bǐ qǐ zuò fēi jī wǒ gèng xǐ huan zuò huǒ chē xīn shǎng yán tú de fēng jǐng","Compared with flying, I prefer taking the train to enjoy the scenery along the way.","Prefiero viajar en tren que en avión, para disfrutar del paisaje del camino.","Plutôt que de prendre l'avion, je préfère voyager en train pour admirer les paysages en chemin."],["L7-0163","比试","bǐshi","V","to compete; to gesture","competir; hacer gestos","se mesurer; mimer","两位象棋选手约好周末再比试一场，看看谁进步更大。","liǎng wèi xiàng qí xuǎn shǒu yuē hǎo zhōu mò zài bǐ shi yì chǎng kàn kan shéi jìn bù gèng dà","The two Chinese chess players agreed to play another match at the weekend to see who had improved more.","Los dos jugadores de ajedrez chino acordaron jugar otra partida el fin de semana para ver quién había progresado más.","Les deux joueurs d'échecs chinois sont convenus de disputer une autre partie le week-end pour voir lequel avait le plus progressé."],["L7-0164","比喻","bǐyù","N/V","metaphor; to liken to","metáfora; comparar","métaphore; comparer","老师用一个生活中的比喻，帮助学生理解抽象的概念。","lǎo shī yòng yí ge shēng huó zhōng de bǐ yù bāng zhù xué shēng lǐ jiě chōu xiàng de gài niàn","The teacher used a metaphor drawn from everyday life to help the students understand an abstract concept.","El maestro usó una metáfora de la vida cotidiana para ayudar a los alumnos a entender un concepto abstracto.","Le professeur a employé une métaphore tirée de la vie quotidienne pour aider les élèves à comprendre un concept abstrait."],["L7-0165","鄙视","bǐshì","V","to despise; to disdain","despreciar; desdeñar","mépriser; dédaigner","他从不因为别人收入低就鄙视对方，更看重人的品格。","tā cóng bù yīn wèi bié rén shōu rù dī jiù bǐ shì duì fāng gèng kàn zhòng rén de pǐn gé","He never looks down on someone for having a low income; he values personal character more.","Nunca desprecia a alguien por tener bajos ingresos; valora más el carácter de las personas.","Il ne méprise jamais quelqu'un parce que ses revenus sont faibles ; il accorde plus d'importance au caractère des gens."],["L7-0166","必不可少","bìbùkěshǎo","","indispensable; essential","imprescindible; esencial","indispensable; essentiel","如果考核只看短期业绩，员工就可能忽视那些见效缓慢却必不可少的工作。","rú guǒ kǎo hé zhǐ kàn duǎn qī yè jì yuán gōng jiù kě néng hū shì nà xiē jiàn xiào huǎn màn què bì bù kě shǎo de gōng zuò","If performance reviews focus only on short-term results, employees may neglect work that is slow to produce results but essential.","Si la evaluación solo considera los resultados a corto plazo, los empleados podrían descuidar tareas que tardan en dar frutos pero son indispensables.","Si l'évaluation ne regarde que les résultats à court terme, les employés risquent de négliger les tâches qui portent leurs fruits lentement mais qui sont indispensables."],["L7-0167","必定","bìdìng","Adv","bound to; certainly","sin duda; seguramente","à coup sûr; forcément","他答应过要来，若不是遇到急事，必定不会失约。","tā dā ying guo yào lái ruò bú shì yù dào jí shì bì dìng bú huì shī yuē","He promised to come and would certainly not break his word unless something urgent arose.","Prometió que vendría, y de no ser por un asunto urgente, seguramente no habría faltado a su palabra.","Il avait promis de venir ; s'il n'avait pas eu une urgence, il n'aurait certainement pas manqué à sa parole."],["L7-0168","碧绿","bìlǜ","Adj","dark green; emerald","verde oscuro; esmeralda","vert foncé; émeraude","雨后的山坡一片碧绿，几只白羊正在远处吃草。","yǔ hòu de shān pō yí piàn bì lǜ jǐ zhī bái yáng zhèng zài yuǎn chù chī cǎo","After the rain, the hillside was vividly green, with a few white sheep grazing in the distance.","Después de la lluvia, la ladera estaba de un verde intenso y unas ovejas blancas pastaban a lo lejos.","Après la pluie, le versant était d'un vert éclatant, et quelques moutons blancs broutaient au loin."],["L7-0169","弊病","bìbìng","N","drawback; malpractice","defecto; mala práctica","défaut; abus","只重结果而忽视过程，是这套考核办法的一大弊病。","zhǐ zhòng jié guǒ ér hū shì guò chéng shì zhè tào kǎo hé bàn fǎ de yí dà bì bìng","Valuing results alone while ignoring the process is a major flaw in this assessment system.","Dar importancia solo al resultado e ignorar el proceso es un gran defecto de este sistema de evaluación.","Ne valoriser que le résultat en négligeant le processus est un grand défaut de ce système d'évaluation."],["L7-0170","弊端","bìduān","N","systemic problem; abuse","problema sistémico; abuso","vice; dérive","新方案虽然提高了效率，也逐渐暴露出管理上的弊端。","xīn fāng àn suī rán tí gāo le xiào lǜ yě zhú jiàn bào lù chū guǎn lǐ shàng de bì duān","Although the new plan improved efficiency, it gradually revealed flaws in management as well.","Aunque el nuevo plan mejoró la eficiencia, también fue dejando al descubierto fallas en la gestión.","Bien que le nouveau plan ait amélioré l'efficacité, il a aussi peu à peu révélé des défauts de gestion."],["L7-0171","壁画","bìhuà","N","mural; fresco","mural; fresco","peinture murale; fresque","书架上摆着一本介绍敦煌壁画的画册。","shū jià shàng bǎi zhe yì běn jiè shào dūn huáng bì huà de huà cè","On the bookshelf is a picture album introducing the Dunhuang murals.","En el estante hay un álbum que presenta los murales de Dunhuang.","Sur l'étagère se trouve un album qui présente les peintures murales de Dunhuang."],["L7-0172","避难","bìnàn","","to take refuge; asylum","refugiarse; asilo","se réfugier; asile","洪水冲进村庄后，居民们转移到地势较高的学校避难。","hóng shuǐ chōng jìn cūn zhuāng hòu jū mín men zhuǎn yí dào dì shì jiào gāo de xué xiào bì nàn","After floodwater entered the village, the residents moved to a school on higher ground for refuge.","Cuando la inundación entró en el pueblo, los habitantes se trasladaron a refugiarse en una escuela situada en terreno más alto.","Une fois l'inondation entrée dans le village, les habitants se sont réfugiés dans une école située en hauteur."],["L7-0173","避暑","bìshǔ","","to escape summer heat","huir del calor estival","fuir la chaleur estivale","每到盛夏，一些市民就带着家人到山里的村庄避暑。","měi dào shèng xià yì xiē shì mín jiù dài zhe jiā rén dào shān lǐ de cūn zhuāng bì shǔ","Every midsummer, some city residents take their families to mountain villages to escape the heat.","Cada vez que llega el pleno verano, algunos ciudadanos llevan a su familia a un pueblo de montaña para escapar del calor.","Chaque année en pleine été, certains citadins emmènent leur famille dans un village de montagne pour fuir la chaleur."],["L7-0174","边疆","biānjiāng","N","border area; frontier","zona fronteriza; frontera","région frontalière; frontière","这个年轻人怀着一腔热血，来到边疆当了老师。","zhè ge nián qīng rén huái zhe yì qiāng rè xuè lái dào biān jiāng dāng le lǎo shī","Full of youthful passion, this young man came to the border region to become a teacher.","Este joven, lleno de entusiasmo, llegó a la frontera para ser maestro.","Plein d'ardeur, ce jeune homme est venu dans la région frontalière pour devenir enseignant."],["L7-0175","边界","biānjiè","N","boundary; border","frontera; límite","frontière; limite","两国通过谈判解决了边界争端。","liǎng guó tōng guò tán pàn jiě jué le biān jiè zhēng duān","The two countries resolved their border dispute through negotiations.","Los dos países resolvieron la disputa fronteriza mediante negociaciones.","Les deux pays ont réglé leur différend frontalier par la négociation."],["L7-0176","边远","biānyuǎn","Adj","remote; outlying","remoto; apartado","reculé; éloigné","这支医疗队常年到边远村庄，为出行困难的老人看病。","zhè zhī yī liáo duì cháng nián dào biān yuǎn cūn zhuāng wèi chū xíng kùn nan de lǎo rén kàn bìng","This medical team visits remote villages year-round to treat older people who have difficulty traveling.","Este equipo médico visita todo el año aldeas remotas para atender a ancianos con dificultades para desplazarse.","Cette équipe médicale se rend toute l'année dans des villages reculés pour soigner les personnes âgées qui ont du mal à se déplacer."],["L7-0177","编号","biānhào","N","to number; serial number","numerar; número de serie","numéroter; numéro de série","请先给每份材料编号，再按收到的时间整理入档。","qǐng xiān gěi měi fèn cái liào biān hào zài àn shōu dào de shí jiān zhěng lǐ rù dàng","Please number each document first, then file them in the order in which they were received.","Primero numere cada documento y luego archívelos según el orden en que se recibieron.","Veuillez d'abord numéroter chaque document, puis les classer selon leur ordre de réception."],["L7-0178","编剧","biānjù","N","screenwriter; to write a script","guionista; escribir un guion","scénariste; écrire un scénario","这位编剧走访了许多家庭，才写出如此真实的故事。","zhè wèi biān jù zǒu fǎng le xǔ duō jiā tíng cái xiě chū rú cǐ zhēn shí de gù shi","The screenwriter visited many families before writing such a realistic story.","Este guionista visitó muchas familias antes de escribir una historia tan real.","Ce scénariste a rendu visite à de nombreuses familles avant d'écrire une histoire aussi vraie."],["L7-0179","编排","biānpái","V","to arrange; to lay out","disponer; organizar","agencer; mettre en forme","编辑重新编排了文章的顺序，使整本书的结构更加清楚。","biān jí chóng xīn biān pái le wén zhāng de shùn xù shǐ zhěng běn shū de jié gòu gèng jiā qīng chu","The editor rearranged the articles to make the structure of the book clearer.","El editor reorganizó el orden de los artículos para que la estructura del libro quedara más clara.","L'éditeur a réorganisé l'ordre des articles pour rendre la structure de l'ensemble du livre plus claire."],["L7-0180","编写","biānxiě","V","to compile; to write","redactar; compilar","rédiger; compiler","这本教科书是由几位资深教师共同编写的。","zhè běn jiào kē shū shì yóu jǐ wèi zī shēn jiào shī gòng tóng biān xiě de","This textbook was jointly written by several senior teachers.","Este libro de texto fue escrito conjuntamente por varios profesores con mucha experiencia.","Ce manuel a été rédigé conjointement par plusieurs enseignants chevronnés."],["L7-0181","编造","biānzào","V","to fabricate; to concoct","inventar; fabricar","inventer; fabriquer","他不愿承认迟到的真正原因，临时编造了一个借口。","tā bú yuàn chéng rèn chí dào de zhēn zhèng yuán yīn lín shí biān zào le yí ge jiè kǒu","Unwilling to admit the real reason for being late, he invented an excuse on the spot.","No quería admitir el verdadero motivo de su retraso y se inventó una excusa en el momento.","Refusant d'avouer la vraie raison de son retard, il a inventé une excuse sur le moment."],["L7-0182","鞭策","biāncè","V","to spur on; to urge on","estimular; animar","aiguillonner; stimuler","老师严格的要求一直鞭策着他，使他不敢轻易松懈。","lǎo shī yán gé de yāo qiú yì zhí biān cè zhe tā shǐ tā bù gǎn qīng yì sōng xiè","The teacher's demanding expectations kept spurring him on, preventing him from easily relaxing his efforts.","Las exigencias estrictas del maestro lo han impulsado siempre y no le permiten relajarse con facilidad.","Les exigences strictes du professeur l'ont toujours stimulé et l'empêchent de se relâcher facilement."],["L7-0183","鞭炮","biānpào","N","firecrackers","petardos","pétards","婚礼当天，门外响起鞭炮声，院子里顿时热闹起来。","hūn lǐ dàng tiān mén wài xiǎng qǐ biān pào shēng yuàn zi lǐ dùn shí rè nao qǐ lái","On the wedding day, firecrackers sounded outside the gate, and the courtyard immediately became lively.","El día de la boda, afuera sonaron petardos y el patio se animó de inmediato.","Le jour du mariage, des pétards ont retenti devant la porte et la cour s'est aussitôt animée."],["L7-0184","贬值","biǎnzhí","V","to depreciate; to devalue","depreciarse; devaluar","se déprécier; dévaluer","这辆车买来没几年就明显贬值，卖掉也收不回原价。","zhè liàng chē mǎi lái méi jǐ nián jiù míng xiǎn biǎn zhí mài diào yě shōu bù huí yuán jià","The car lost considerable value within a few years of purchase and could no longer be sold for its original price.","Este auto se depreció notablemente a los pocos años de comprarlo, y ni vendiéndolo se recupera el precio original.","Cette voiture s'est nettement dépréciée en quelques années, et même en la vendant on ne récupérerait pas son prix d'origine."],["L7-0185","变革","biàngé","V","to transform; to change","transformar; cambiar","transformer; changer","倘若忽略历史语境，就很难对这场变革作出恰当的诠释。","tǎng ruò hū lüè lì shǐ yǔ jìng jiù hěn nán duì zhè chǎng biàn gé zuò chū qià dàng de quán shì","Without considering the historical context, it would be difficult to interpret this transformation appropriately.","Si se ignora el contexto histórico, es muy difícil hacer una interpretación adecuada de este cambio.","Si l'on néglige le contexte historique, il est très difficile de proposer une interprétation juste de ce bouleversement."],["L7-0186","变幻莫测","biànhuàn-mòcè","","unpredictably changing","cambiante e impredecible","changeant; imprévisible","海上的天气变幻莫测，船长不敢轻易决定出发。","hǎi shàng de tiān qì biàn huàn mò cè chuán zhǎng bù gǎn qīng yì jué dìng chū fā","The weather at sea changes unpredictably, so the captain is reluctant to decide to set out.","El clima en el mar cambia de forma impredecible, así que el capitán no se atreve a decidir la salida a la ligera.","Le temps en mer est imprévisible, si bien que le capitaine n'ose pas décider à la légère de partir."],["L7-0187","变迁","biànqiān","V/N","changes; vicissitudes","cambios; vicisitudes","changements; vicissitudes","这部小说通过主人公的遭遇，折射出一个时代的动荡与变迁。","zhè bù xiǎo shuō tōng guò zhǔ rén gōng de zāo yù zhé shè chū yí ge shí dài de dòng dàng yǔ biàn qiān","Through its protagonist's experiences, this novel reflects the upheavals and changes of an era.","A través de las vivencias del protagonista, esta novela refleja las turbulencias y transformaciones de una época.","À travers le parcours de son héros, ce roman reflète les troubles et les mutations d'une époque."],["L7-0188","变异","biànyì","V","variation; mutation","variación; mutación","variation; mutation","研究人员发现，这种植物在不同环境下出现了变异。","yán jiū rén yuán fā xiàn zhè zhǒng zhí wù zài bù tóng huán jìng xià chū xiàn le biàn yì","The researchers found variations in this plant under different environmental conditions.","Los investigadores descubrieron que esta planta presenta variaciones en distintos entornos.","Les chercheurs ont découvert que cette plante présentait des variations selon les environnements."],["L7-0189","变质","biànzhì","","to deteriorate; to go bad","deteriorarse; echarse a perder","se détériorer; s'avarier","牛奶在高温下放了一整天，打开时已经变质了。","niú nǎi zài gāo wēn xià fàng le yì zhěng tiān dǎ kāi shí yǐ jīng biàn zhì le","The milk had been left in the heat all day and had spoiled by the time it was opened.","La leche estuvo todo el día a alta temperatura y, al abrirla, ya se había echado a perder.","Le lait était resté toute la journée à la chaleur, et il était déjà tourné quand on l'a ouvert."],["L7-0190","便道","biàndào","N","sidewalk; makeshift road","acera; camino improvisado","trottoir; chemin de fortune","主路正在施工，村民暂时沿河边新修的便道通行。","zhǔ lù zhèng zài shī gōng cūn mín zàn shí yán hé biān xīn xiū de biàn dào tōng xíng","With the main road under construction, the villagers temporarily used a newly built access path beside the river.","Como la carretera principal está en obras, los aldeanos pasan por ahora por un camino provisional recién construido a la orilla del río.","La route principale étant en travaux, les villageois passent provisoirement par un chemin nouvellement aménagé le long de la rivière."],["L7-0191","便饭","biànfàn","N","simple meal","comida sencilla","repas simple","既然已经到家门口了，就进来一起吃顿便饭吧。","jì rán yǐ jīng dào jiā mén kǒu le jiù jìn lái yì qǐ chī dùn biàn fàn ba","Since you are already at our doorstep, come in and join us for a simple meal.","Ya que llegaste a la puerta de la casa, pasa y comamos algo sencillo juntos.","Puisque vous êtes déjà à notre porte, entrez donc partager un repas simple avec nous."],["L7-0192","便捷","biànjié","Adj","convenient and fast","cómodo y rápido","pratique et rapide","社区为残障居民增设了无障碍通道，使他们出行更加便捷。","shè qū wèi cán zhàng jū mín zēng shè le wú zhàng ài tōng dào shǐ tā men chū xíng gèng jiā biàn jié","The community added accessible passages for residents with disabilities, making it easier for them to get around.","La comunidad instaló accesos sin barreras para los residentes con discapacidad, de modo que se desplacen con más facilidad.","Le quartier a aménagé des passages accessibles pour les résidents handicapés, ce qui facilite leurs déplacements."],["L7-0193","便利店","biànlìdiàn","N","convenience store","tienda de conveniencia","supérette; magasin de proximité","坐公交车前，我先在便利店换了些零钱。","zuò gōng jiāo chē qián wǒ xiān zài biàn lì diàn huàn le xiē líng qián","Before taking the bus, I got some change at the convenience store.","Antes de subir al autobús, cambié un poco de monedas en la tienda de conveniencia.","Avant de prendre le bus, j'ai fait de la monnaie à la supérette."],["L7-0194","遍布","biànbù","V","to be found throughout","estar por todas partes","couvrir; être répandu partout","这家企业的服务网点已经遍布全国，维修方便多了。","zhè jiā qǐ yè de fú wù wǎng diǎn yǐ jīng biàn bù quán guó wéi xiū fāng biàn duō le","The company's service centers now cover the whole country, making repairs much more convenient.","Los puntos de servicio de esta empresa ya cubren todo el país, así que reparar es mucho más cómodo.","Les centres de service de cette entreprise couvrent désormais tout le pays, ce qui rend les réparations bien plus pratiques."],["L7-0195","辨别","biànbié","V","to distinguish; to discern","distinguir; discernir","distinguer; discerner","光看包装很难辨别真假，还需要核对商品的来源。","guāng kàn bāo zhuāng hěn nán biàn bié zhēn jiǎ hái xū yào hé duì shāng pǐn de lái yuán","It is difficult to tell genuine products from fakes by their packaging alone; their source also needs to be checked.","Solo con ver el empaque es difícil distinguir lo auténtico de lo falso; también hay que verificar el origen del producto.","Il est difficile de distinguer le vrai du faux rien qu'à l'emballage ; il faut aussi vérifier l'origine du produit."],["L7-0196","辨认","biànrèn","V","to recognize; to identify","reconocer; identificar","reconnaître; identifier","这批食品的标签标示不清，消费者很难辨认其保质期。","zhè pī shí pǐn de biāo qiān biāo shì bù qīng xiāo fèi zhě hěn nán biàn rèn qí bǎo zhì qī","The labeling on this batch of food is unclear, making it difficult for consumers to identify its shelf life.","Las etiquetas de este lote de alimentos no son claras y a los consumidores les cuesta identificar su fecha de caducidad.","L'étiquetage de ce lot de produits alimentaires n'est pas clair, et les consommateurs ont du mal à repérer la date limite de consommation."],["L7-0197","辩","biàn","V","to debate; to argue","debatir; argumentar","débattre; argumenter","双方意见相反，越辩越激动，谁也不肯让步。","shuāng fāng yì jiàn xiāng fǎn yuè biàn yuè jī dòng shéi yě bù kěn ràng bù","The two sides held opposing views and grew more agitated as they argued, with neither willing to yield.","Las dos partes tenían opiniones opuestas y, cuanto más discutían, más se exaltaban, sin que ninguna quisiera ceder.","Les deux parties avaient des avis opposés et s'échauffaient de plus en plus en discutant, sans que personne ne veuille céder."],["L7-0198","辩护","biànhù","V","to defend; to plead","defender; abogar","défendre; plaider","律师查阅了全部材料，准备为被告作出有力的辩护。","lǜ shī chá yuè le quán bù cái liào zhǔn bèi wèi bèi gào zuò chū yǒu lì de biàn hù","The lawyer reviewed all the materials and prepared a strong defense for the accused.","El abogado revisó todo el material y se preparó para ofrecer una defensa sólida del acusado.","L'avocat a examiné tous les documents et s'est préparé à présenter une solide défense de l'accusé."],["L7-0199","辩解","biànjiě","V","to justify; to explain","justificar; explicar","justifier; expliquer","面对清楚的事实，他没有再辩解，而是承认了错误。","miàn duì qīng chu de shì shí tā méi yǒu zài biàn jiě ér shì chéng rèn le cuò wù","Confronted with the clear facts, he stopped trying to justify himself and admitted his mistake.","Ante los hechos evidentes, ya no se justificó y reconoció su error.","Face à des faits évidents, il n'a plus cherché à se justifier et a reconnu son erreur."],["L7-0200","辫子","biànzi","N","braid; pigtail; weak point","trenza; punto débil","natte; point faible","她把长发编成两条辫子，方便在田里干活。","tā bǎ cháng fà biān chéng liǎng tiáo biàn zi fāng biàn zài tián lǐ gàn huó","She braided her long hair into two plaits to make working in the fields easier.","Se trenzó el pelo largo en dos trenzas para trabajar más cómodamente en el campo.","Elle a tressé ses longs cheveux en deux nattes pour travailler plus facilement dans les champs."],["L7-0201","标","biāo","V","to mark; to label","marcar; etiquetar","marquer; étiqueter","车站增设了醒目的标识，引导首次到访的旅客顺利换乘。","chē zhàn zēng shè le xǐng mù de biāo shí yǐn dǎo shǒu cì dào fǎng de lǚ kè shùn lì huàn chéng","The station added conspicuous signs to help first-time visitors transfer smoothly.","La estación instaló señalización llamativa para guiar a los viajeros que llegan por primera vez a hacer sus transbordos sin problemas.","La gare a installé une signalisation bien visible pour guider sans encombre les voyageurs qui viennent pour la première fois lors de leurs correspondances."],["L7-0202","标榜","biāobǎng","V","to flaunt; to tout","alardear; promocionar","se vanter de; afficher","这家店标榜价格最低，实际收费却比附近几家都高。","zhè jiā diàn biāo bǎng jià gé zuì dī shí jì shōu fèi què bǐ fù jìn jǐ jiā dōu gāo","This shop claims to have the lowest prices, yet actually charges more than several nearby shops.","Esta tienda presume de tener los precios más bajos, pero en realidad cobra más que varias de las cercanas.","Ce magasin se targue d'avoir les prix les plus bas, mais facture en réalité plus cher que plusieurs commerces voisins."],["L7-0203","标本","biāoběn","N","specimen; sample","espécimen; muestra","spécimen; échantillon","这个博物馆收藏了上千种昆虫标本。","zhè ge bó wù guǎn shōu cáng le shàng qiān zhǒng kūn chóng biāo běn","This museum holds specimens of over a thousand species of insects.","Este museo conserva especímenes de más de mil especies de insectos.","Ce musée possède des spécimens de plus d'un millier d'espèces d'insectes."],["L7-0204","标签","biāoqiān","N","label; tag","etiqueta","étiquette","购买水果时，你可以看看标签上写的产地。","gòu mǎi shuǐ guǒ shí nǐ kě yǐ kàn kan biāo qiān shàng xiě de chǎn dì","When buying fruit, you can check the place of origin written on the label.","Al comprar fruta, puedes mirar el lugar de origen que indica la etiqueta.","Quand tu achètes des fruits, tu peux regarder l'origine indiquée sur l'étiquette."],["L7-0205","标示","biāoshì","V","to indicate; to mark","indicar; señalar","indiquer; marquer","这批食品的标签标示不清，消费者很难辨认其保质期。","zhè pī shí pǐn de biāo qiān biāo shì bù qīng xiāo fèi zhě hěn nán biàn rèn qí bǎo zhì qī","The labeling on this batch of food is unclear, making it difficult for consumers to identify its shelf life.","Las etiquetas de este lote de alimentos no son claras y a los consumidores les cuesta identificar su fecha de caducidad.","L'étiquetage de ce lot de produits alimentaires n'est pas clair, et les consommateurs ont du mal à repérer la date limite de consommation."],["L7-0206","标语","biāoyǔ","N","slogan; placard","eslogan; pancarta","slogan; pancarte","校门口挂起了新的安全标语，提醒学生注意来往车辆。","xiào mén kǒu guà qǐ le xīn de ān quán biāo yǔ tí xǐng xué shēng zhù yì lái wǎng chē liàng","A new safety slogan was displayed at the school gate to remind students to watch for passing vehicles.","En la puerta de la escuela se colgó un nuevo lema de seguridad para recordarles a los alumnos que se fijen en los vehículos que pasan.","Un nouveau slogan de sécurité a été accroché à la porte de l'école pour rappeler aux élèves de faire attention aux véhicules qui passent."],["L7-0207","标致","biāozhì","Adj","Peugeot; pretty","Peugeot; atractivo","Peugeot; joli","这姑娘长得很标致，穿一件普通衬衫也十分精神。","zhè gū niang zhǎng de hěn biāo zhì chuān yí jiàn pǔ tōng chèn shān yě shí fēn jīng shen","The young woman is very pretty and looks smart even in an ordinary shirt.","Esta muchacha es muy bonita y se ve arreglada incluso con una camisa común.","Cette jeune fille est très jolie, et elle a belle allure même dans une simple chemise."],["L7-0208","飙升","biāoshēng","V","to soar; to skyrocket","dispararse; subir rápidamente","grimper en flèche","连续几天大雨影响运输，市场上的蔬菜价格迅速飙升。","lián xù jǐ tiān dà yǔ yǐng xiǎng yùn shū shì chǎng shàng de shū cài jià gé xùn sù biāo shēng","Several days of heavy rain disrupted transport, causing vegetable prices at the market to soar.","Varios días seguidos de lluvia intensa afectaron el transporte y los precios de las verduras en el mercado se dispararon enseguida.","Plusieurs jours de fortes pluies ont perturbé les transports, et le prix des légumes au marché a rapidement flambé."],["L7-0209","表白","biǎobái","V","to confess feelings; to explain oneself","declararse; explicarse","se déclarer; s'expliquer","他鼓起勇气向她表白，却没有要求她立刻给出答复。","tā gǔ qǐ yǒng qì xiàng tā biǎo bái què méi yǒu yāo qiú tā lì kè gěi chū dá fù","He summoned the courage to declare his feelings to her without demanding an immediate answer.","Armándose de valor, le declaró sus sentimientos, pero no le exigió que respondiera de inmediato.","Il a pris son courage à deux mains pour lui déclarer ses sentiments, sans exiger de réponse immédiate."],["L7-0210","表决","biǎojué","V","to vote; to decide by vote","votar; decidir por votación","voter; décider par vote","讨论结束以后，委员们举手表决，决定是否通过这项提案。","tǎo lùn jié shù yǐ hòu wěi yuán men jǔ shǒu biǎo jué jué dìng shì fǒu tōng guò zhè xiàng tí àn","After the discussion, the committee members voted by a show of hands on whether to pass the proposal.","Al terminar la discusión, los miembros del comité votaron a mano alzada para decidir si aprobaban la propuesta.","Après la discussion, les membres du comité ont voté à main levée pour décider d'adopter ou non la proposition."],["L7-0211","表述","biǎoshù","V","to state; to formulate","exponer; formular","exposer; formuler","这份报告的结论表述得不够准确，容易让读者产生误解。","zhè fèn bào gào de jié lùn biǎo shù de bú gòu zhǔn què róng yì ràng dú zhě chǎn shēng wù jiě","The conclusion of this report is not worded accurately enough, which can easily mislead readers.","La conclusión de este informe no está formulada con suficiente precisión y puede inducir a los lectores a malentendidos.","La conclusion de ce rapport n'est pas formulée avec assez de précision et risque d'induire les lecteurs en erreur."],["L7-0212","表率","biǎoshuài","N","role model; example","ejemplo; modelo","exemple; modèle","作为部门经理，他每天最早到公司，为年轻员工做出了表率。","zuò wéi bù mén jīng lǐ tā měi tiān zuì zǎo dào gōng sī wèi nián qīng yuán gōng zuò chū le biǎo shuài","As the department manager, he is the first to arrive at the office every day, setting an example for the younger staff.","Como gerente del departamento, es el primero en llegar a la empresa cada día y da ejemplo a los empleados jóvenes.","En tant que directeur de service, il est chaque jour le premier à arriver à l'entreprise et montre l'exemple aux jeunes employés."],["L7-0213","表态","biǎotài","","to declare one's position","manifestar su postura","prendre position","对于是否延长合同，对方代表在会上始终没有明确表态。","duì yú shì fǒu yán cháng hé tóng duì fāng dài biǎo zài huì shàng shǐ zhōng méi yǒu míng què biǎo tài","At the meeting, the other side's representative never made clear where they stood on whether to extend the contract.","Sobre si se prorrogaría el contrato, el representante de la otra parte nunca fijó una posición clara en la reunión.","Quant à savoir s'il fallait prolonger le contrat, le représentant de l'autre partie n'a jamais pris position clairement pendant la réunion."],["L7-0214","表彰","biǎozhāng","V","to commend; to honor","elogiar; condecorar","féliciter; honorer","他在抗洪救灾中立功，受到了上级的表彰。","tā zài kàng hóng jiù zāi zhōng lì gōng shòu dào le shàng jí de biǎo zhāng","He distinguished himself in the flood relief effort and was commended by his superiors.","Se destacó en las labores de rescate durante las inundaciones y recibió el reconocimiento de sus superiores.","Il s'est distingué lors des opérations de lutte contre les inondations et a été félicité par ses supérieurs."],["L7-0215","憋","biē","V/Adj","to hold back; to stifle","contener; sofocar","retenir; étouffer","他憋了一肚子话，见到老朋友才痛痛快快地说了出来。","tā biē le yí dù zi huà jiàn dào lǎo péng you cái tòng tòng kuài kuài de shuō le chū lái","He had been holding so much in, and only when he saw his old friend did he finally let it all out.","Se había guardado un montón de cosas y solo al ver a su viejo amigo las soltó por fin con total libertad.","Il avait tant de choses sur le cœur qu'il n'a pu enfin les dire librement qu'en retrouvant son vieil ami."],["L7-0216","别具匠心","biéjù-jiàngxīn","","ingenious; original","ingenioso; original","ingénieux; original","这家书店把旧仓库改造成阅读空间，设计别具匠心。","zhè jiā shū diàn bǎ jiù cāng kù gǎi zào chéng yuè dú kōng jiān shè jì bié jù jiàng xīn","This bookstore turned an old warehouse into a reading space, and the design is remarkably ingenious.","Esta librería convirtió un antiguo almacén en un espacio de lectura, y el diseño es muy ingenioso.","Cette librairie a transformé un ancien entrepôt en espace de lecture, avec un design d'une grande ingéniosité."],["L7-0217","别看","biékàn","Conj","don't be fooled by","no te dejes engañar por","ne vous fiez pas à","别看他年纪小，做起菜来比很多大人都熟练。","bié kàn tā nián jì xiǎo zuò qǐ cài lái bǐ hěn duō dà ren dōu shú liàn","He may be young, but when it comes to cooking he is more skilled than many adults.","Aunque es pequeño, cocina con más destreza que muchos adultos.","Même s'il est jeune, il cuisine avec plus d'habileté que bien des adultes."],["L7-0218","别墅","biéshù","N","villa","chalet; villa","villa","他们退休后搬到郊区的一栋别墅里，每天在院子里种花。","tā men tuì xiū hòu bān dào jiāo qū de yí dòng bié shù lǐ měi tiān zài yuàn zi lǐ zhòng huā","After retiring, they moved into a villa in the suburbs and now tend flowers in the yard every day.","Después de jubilarse, se mudaron a una villa en las afueras y todos los días plantan flores en el jardín.","Après leur retraite, ils ont emménagé dans une villa en banlieue et plantent des fleurs dans le jardin tous les jours."],["L7-0219","别说","biéshuō","Conj","let alone; not to mention","y no digamos; mucho menos","sans parler de; encore moins","别说废话了，赶紧说重点吧。","bié shuō fèi huà le gǎn jǐn shuō zhòng diǎn ba","Stop talking nonsense and get to the point.","¡Déjate de tonterías y ve al grano!","Arrête de dire des bêtises et va droit au but."],["L7-0220","别提了","biétí le","","don't mention it","ni lo menciones","n'en parlons pas","别提了，我这次考试又没及格。","bié tí le wǒ zhè cì kǎo shì yòu méi jí gé","Don't even mention it; I failed the exam again this time.","Ni me lo menciones, volví a reprobar este examen.","N'en parle même pas, j'ai encore raté cet examen."],["L7-0221","别致","biézhì","Adj","unique; unusual","original; peculiar","original; singulier","她送我的那个茶杯造型别致，我一直舍不得用。","tā sòng wǒ de nà ge chá bēi zào xíng bié zhì wǒ yì zhí shě bu de yòng","The teacup she gave me has such an unusual, elegant shape that I have never had the heart to use it.","La taza de té que ella me regaló tiene una forma tan original y elegante que nunca me atrevo a usarla.","La tasse à thé qu'elle m'a offerte a une forme si originale et élégante que je n'ai jamais eu le cœur de m'en servir."],["L7-0222","别扭","bièniu","Adj","awkward; uncomfortable","incómodo; torpe","gênant; mal à l'aise","两个人吵架以后，见面说话总觉得有点儿别扭。","liǎng gè rén chǎo jià yǐ hòu jiàn miàn shuō huà zǒng jué de yǒu diǎnr biè niu","Ever since their quarrel, the two of them have felt a bit awkward whenever they meet and talk.","Después de pelearse, a los dos siempre les resulta un poco incómodo hablar cuando se ven.","Depuis leur dispute, les deux se sentent toujours un peu mal à l'aise quand ils se voient et se parlent."],["L7-0223","彬彬有礼","bīnbīn-yǒulǐ","","refined and courteous","cortés y refinado","poli et raffiné","那位服务员对每位客人都彬彬有礼，给我们留下了很好的印象。","nà wèi fú wù yuán duì měi wèi kè rén dōu bīn bīn yǒu lǐ gěi wǒ men liú xià le hěn hǎo de yìn xiàng","That waiter was courteous to every guest and left a very good impression on us.","Ese mesero fue muy cortés con todos los clientes y nos dejó una muy buena impresión.","Ce serveur s'est montré très courtois envers tous les clients et nous a fait très bonne impression."],["L7-0224","滨海","bīn hǎi","","Binhai (place name)","Binhai (topónimo)","Binhai (toponyme)","这座滨海城市气候宜人，每年夏天都吸引大量游客前来度假。","zhè zuò bīn hǎi chéng shì qì hòu yí rén měi nián xià tiān dōu xī yǐn dà liàng yóu kè qián lái dù jià","This coastal city has a pleasant climate and attracts large numbers of vacationers every summer.","Esta ciudad costera tiene un clima agradable y cada verano atrae a muchos turistas que vienen a pasar sus vacaciones.","Cette ville côtière jouit d'un climat agréable et attire chaque été de nombreux touristes venus y passer leurs vacances."],["L7-0225","缤纷","bīnfēn","Adj","colorful; diverse","colorido; variado","coloré; varié","秋天的山坡上色彩缤纷，红叶和黄叶交织在一起。","qiū tiān de shān pō shàng sè cǎi bīn fēn hóng yè hé huáng yè jiāo zhī zài yì qǐ","In autumn the hillside is a riot of color, with red and yellow leaves mingling together.","En otoño, las laderas se llenan de colores, con hojas rojas y amarillas entrelazadas.","En automne, les pentes sont multicolores, les feuilles rouges et jaunes s'entremêlant."],["L7-0226","冰棍儿","bīnggùnr","N","ice lolly","polo de hielo","glace à l'eau","小时候，夏天放学后买一根冰棍儿是我最开心的事。","xiǎo shí hou xià tiān fàng xué hòu mǎi yì gēn bīng gùnr shì wǒ zuì kāi xīn de shì","When I was a child, buying a popsicle after school in summer was what made me happiest.","De niño, comprarme una paleta helada al salir de la escuela en verano era lo que más me alegraba.","Quand j'étais petit, acheter une glace à l'eau en sortant de l'école en été était ce qui me rendait le plus heureux."],["L7-0227","冰山","bīngshān","N","iceberg","iceberg","iceberg","科学家发现，这座漂浮的冰山正在以惊人的速度融化。","kē xué jiā fā xiàn zhè zuò piāo fú de bīng shān zhèng zài yǐ jīng rén de sù dù róng huà","Scientists have found that this floating iceberg is melting at an astonishing rate.","Los científicos descubrieron que este iceberg flotante se está derritiendo a una velocidad asombrosa.","Les scientifiques ont constaté que cet iceberg flottant fond à une vitesse stupéfiante."],["L7-0228","丙","bǐng","N","third (heavenly stem)","tercero (tronco celestial)","troisième (tronc céleste)","合同规定，甲、乙、丙三方必须在月底以前完成签字。","hé tóng guī dìng jiǎ yǐ bǐng sān fāng bì xū zài yuè dǐ yǐ qián wán chéng qiān zì","The contract stipulates that Parties A, B, and C must all sign before the end of the month.","El contrato estipula que las partes A, B y C deben firmar antes de fin de mes.","Le contrat stipule que les parties A, B et C doivent signer avant la fin du mois."],["L7-0229","秉承","bǐngchéng","V","to inherit; to carry on","heredar; continuar","hériter de; perpétuer","这家老字号秉承诚信经营的传统，赢得了几代顾客的信任。","zhè jiā lǎo zì hào bǐng chéng chéng xìn jīng yíng de chuán tǒng yíng dé le jǐ dài gù kè de xìn rèn","This time-honored shop upholds its tradition of honest business and has won the trust of generations of customers.","Este negocio con larga trayectoria mantiene la tradición de gestionar con honradez y ha ganado la confianza de varias generaciones de clientes.","Cette maison ancienne, fidèle à la tradition d'une gestion honnête, a gagné la confiance de plusieurs générations de clients."],["L7-0230","并非","bìngfēi","V","really isn't; it is not that","en realidad no es","n'est en réalité pas","我提出这个建议的本意，是减轻大家的负担，并非推卸责任。","wǒ tí chū zhè ge jiàn yì de běn yì shì jiǎn qīng dà jiā de fù dān bìng fēi tuī xiè zé rèn","My original intention in making this suggestion was to reduce everyone's burden, not to evade responsibility.","Mi intención original al hacer esta propuesta era aliviar la carga de todos, no eludir mi responsabilidad.","En faisant cette proposition, mon intention première était d'alléger la charge de tous, et non de me défausser de mes responsabilités."],["L7-0231","并购","bìnggòu","V","merger and acquisition","fusión y adquisición","fusion-acquisition","这家公司通过并购两家小型企业，迅速扩大了市场份额。","zhè jiā gōng sī tōng guò bìng gòu liǎng jiā xiǎo xíng qǐ yè xùn sù kuò dà le shì chǎng fèn é","By acquiring two small firms, the company quickly expanded its market share.","Esta empresa amplió rápidamente su cuota de mercado al adquirir dos pequeñas empresas.","En rachetant deux petites entreprises, cette société a rapidement augmenté sa part de marché."],["L7-0232","并列","bìngliè","V","to be side by side; parallel","estar en paralelo; situar al mismo nivel","être côte à côte; au même rang","展览把不同时期的作品并列呈现，使风格的演变一目了然。","zhǎn lǎn bǎ bù tóng shí qī de zuò pǐn bìng liè chéng xiàn shǐ fēng gé de yǎn biàn yí mù liǎo rán","The exhibition presents works from different periods side by side, making the evolution of the style clear at a glance.","La exposición presenta obras de distintas épocas una al lado de la otra, de modo que la evolución del estilo se aprecia de un vistazo.","L'exposition présente côte à côte des œuvres de différentes époques, ce qui rend l'évolution du style évidente au premier coup d'œil."],["L7-0233","并行","bìngxíng","V","to run in parallel","avanzar en paralelo","aller de pair; en parallèle","这家公司坚持网上销售和实体门店并行，两条渠道互相补充。","zhè jiā gōng sī jiān chí wǎng shàng xiāo shòu hé shí tǐ mén diàn bìng xíng liǎng tiáo qú dào hù xiāng bǔ chōng","The company keeps online sales and physical stores running in parallel, with the two channels complementing each other.","Esta empresa mantiene en paralelo las ventas en línea y las tiendas físicas, y ambos canales se complementan.","Cette entreprise maintient en parallèle la vente en ligne et les boutiques physiques, les deux canaux se complétant mutuellement."],["L7-0234","病床","bìngchuáng","N","hospital bed","cama de hospital","lit d'hôpital","医生在病床边守候了一整夜。","yī shēng zài bìng chuáng biān shǒu hòu le yì zhěng yè","The doctor kept watch at the bedside all night long.","El médico veló toda la noche junto a la cama del enfermo.","Le médecin a veillé toute la nuit au chevet du malade."],["L7-0235","病症","bìngzhèng","N","illness; disease","enfermedad; dolencia","maladie; affection","医生说这种病症早期不易察觉，建议中老年人定期体检。","yī shēng shuō zhè zhǒng bìng zhèng zǎo qī bú yì chá jué jiàn yì zhōng lǎo nián rén dìng qī tǐ jiǎn","The doctor said this illness is hard to detect in its early stages and advised middle-aged and elderly people to get regular check-ups.","El médico dijo que esta enfermedad es difícil de detectar en sus primeras etapas y recomendó que las personas de mediana edad y mayores se hagan chequeos periódicos.","Le médecin a dit que cette maladie est difficile à déceler à un stade précoce et recommande aux personnes d'âge mûr et âgées de faire régulièrement un bilan de santé."],["L7-0236","拨","bō","V","to dial; to push aside; to allocate","marcar; apartar; asignar","composer; écarter; allouer","他用筷子把菜里的辣椒一个个拨到盘子边上。","tā yòng kuài zi bǎ cài lǐ de là jiāo yí gè gè bō dào pán zi biān shàng","He used his chopsticks to push the chili peppers in the dish to the edge of the plate one by one.","Con los palillos fue apartando uno por uno los chiles del plato hacia el borde.","Avec ses baguettes, il a écarté un par un les piments du plat vers le bord de l'assiette."],["L7-0237","拨款","bōkuǎn","N","to allocate funds; appropriation","asignar fondos; dotación","allouer des fonds; crédit","市政府决定拨款修缮这座有三百年历史的古桥。","shì zhèng fǔ jué dìng bō kuǎn xiū shàn zhè zuò yǒu sān bǎi nián lì shǐ de gǔ qiáo","The city government decided to allocate funds to restore this three-hundred-year-old bridge.","El gobierno municipal decidió asignar fondos para restaurar este antiguo puente de trescientos años.","La municipalité a décidé d'allouer des fonds pour restaurer ce vieux pont vieux de trois cents ans."],["L7-0238","拨通","bōtōng","","to get through by phone","lograr comunicar por teléfono","obtenir la communication","她犹豫了很久，终于拨通了多年没联系的老同学的电话。","tā yóu yù le hěn jiǔ zhōng yú bō tōng le duō nián méi lián xì de lǎo tóng xué de diàn huà","After hesitating for a long time, she finally got through on the phone to an old classmate she hadn't contacted in years.","Dudó mucho tiempo y por fin llamó por teléfono a una vieja compañera de clase con quien llevaba años sin hablar.","Après avoir longuement hésité, elle a fini par appeler une ancienne camarade de classe avec qui elle n'avait plus de contact depuis des années."],["L7-0239","波及","bōjí","V","to spread to; to affect","extenderse a; afectar","se propager à; toucher","这场金融危机迅速波及全球，许多中小企业被迫关门。","zhè chǎng jīn róng wēi jī xùn sù bō jí quán qiú xǔ duō zhōng xiǎo qǐ yè bèi pò guān mén","The financial crisis quickly spread across the globe, forcing many small and medium-sized businesses to close.","Esta crisis financiera se extendió rápidamente por todo el mundo y muchas pequeñas y medianas empresas se vieron obligadas a cerrar.","Cette crise financière s'est rapidement propagée au monde entier, et de nombreuses petites et moyennes entreprises ont dû fermer."],["L7-0240","波澜","bōlán","N","billows; great waves","oleaje; grandes olas","vagues; remous","听到这个消息，他表面上很平静，内心却掀起了波澜。","tīng dào zhè ge xiāo xi tā biǎo miàn shang hěn píng jìng nèi xīn què xiān qǐ le bō lán","On hearing the news, he looked calm on the surface, but inside he was thrown into turmoil.","Al oír la noticia, por fuera parecía tranquilo, pero por dentro se desató una tormenta.","En apprenant la nouvelle, il paraissait calme en apparence, mais intérieurement il était bouleversé."],["L7-0241","波涛","bōtāo","N","great waves; billows","olas grandes; oleaje","grandes vagues; flots","渔船在汹涌的波涛中艰难前行，船员们都紧紧抓着栏杆。","yú chuán zài xiōng yǒng de bō tāo zhōng jiān nán qián xíng chuán yuán men dōu jǐn jǐn zhuā zhe lán gān","The fishing boat struggled forward through the surging waves, and the crew all held on tightly to the railing.","El barco pesquero avanzaba con dificultad entre las olas embravecidas y los tripulantes se aferraban con fuerza a la barandilla.","Le bateau de pêche avançait péniblement au milieu des vagues déchaînées, et tout l'équipage s'agrippait fermement à la rambarde."],["L7-0242","波折","bōzhé","N","twists and turns","vicisitudes; contratiempos","péripéties; revers","这部电影的拍摄经历了不少波折，上映时间推迟了整整两年。","zhè bù diàn yǐng de pāi shè jīng lì le bù shǎo bō zhé shàng yìng shí jiān tuī chí le zhěng zhěng liǎng nián","The shooting of this film went through quite a few setbacks, and its release was delayed by a full two years.","El rodaje de esta película pasó por bastantes altibajos y su estreno se retrasó dos años completos.","Le tournage de ce film a connu bien des vicissitudes, et sa sortie a été retardée de deux ans entiers."],["L7-0243","剥夺","bōduó","V","to deprive; to strip of","privar; despojar","priver; déposséder","任何人都不能以任何借口剥夺孩子接受教育的权利。","rèn hé rén dōu bù néng yǐ rèn hé jiè kǒu bō duó hái zi jiē shòu jiào yù de quán lì","No one may deprive a child of the right to an education under any pretext.","Nadie puede privar a un niño de su derecho a recibir educación, bajo ningún pretexto.","Nul ne peut priver un enfant de son droit à l'éducation, sous aucun prétexte."],["L7-0244","剥削","bōxuē","V/N","to exploit; exploitation","explotar; explotación","exploiter; exploitation","那家工厂长期剥削工人，加班从来不给加班费，最终被媒体曝光。","nà jiā gōng chǎng cháng qī bō xuē gōng rén jiā bān cóng lái bù gěi jiā bān fèi zuì zhōng bèi méi tǐ bào guāng","That factory had long exploited its workers, never paying them for overtime, and was eventually exposed by the media.","Esa fábrica explotaba a los trabajadores desde hacía tiempo y nunca pagaba las horas extra, hasta que los medios la expusieron.","Cette usine exploitait ses ouvriers depuis longtemps sans jamais payer les heures supplémentaires, jusqu'à ce que les médias la dénoncent."],["L7-0245","伯伯","bóbo","N","uncle (father's elder brother)","tío (hermano mayor del padre)","oncle (frère aîné du père)","小时候，伯伯常常骑自行车带我去河边钓鱼。","xiǎo shí hou bó bo cháng cháng qí zì xíng chē dài wǒ qù hé biān diào yú","When I was little, my uncle often took me fishing by the river on his bicycle.","Cuando era pequeño, mi tío solía llevarme en bicicleta a pescar al río.","Quand j'étais petit, mon oncle m'emmenait souvent pêcher à la rivière à vélo."],["L7-0246","伯父","bófù","N","uncle (father's elder brother)","tío paterno mayor","oncle paternel aîné","伯父退休以后搬回了老家，每年春节我们都去看望他。","bó fù tuì xiū yǐ hòu bān huí le lǎo jiā měi nián chūn jié wǒ men dōu qù kàn wàng tā","After retiring, my uncle moved back to our hometown, and we visit him every Spring Festival.","Mi tío se mudó de vuelta a su pueblo natal después de jubilarse, y cada Fiesta de la Primavera vamos a visitarlo.","Mon oncle est retourné dans son village natal après sa retraite, et nous allons lui rendre visite chaque année à la fête du Printemps."],["L7-0247","伯母","bómǔ","N","aunt (wife of father's elder brother)","tía (esposa del tío paterno mayor)","tante (épouse de l'oncle aîné)","伯母做的红烧鱼特别香，每次去她家我都要多吃一碗饭。","bó mǔ zuò de hóng shāo yú tè bié xiāng měi cì qù tā jiā wǒ dōu yào duō chī yì wǎn fàn","My aunt's braised fish is so delicious that I eat an extra bowl of rice every time I go to her home.","El pescado estofado que prepara mi tía es tan delicioso que cada vez que voy a su casa me como otro plato de arroz.","Le poisson braisé de ma tante est si délicieux que chaque fois que je vais chez elle, je reprends un bol de riz."],["L7-0248","驳回","bóhuí","V","to reject; to overrule","rechazar; denegar","rejeter; débouter","法院驳回了这项请求，但当事人仍可依法提出上诉。","fǎ yuàn bó huí le zhè xiàng qǐng qiú dàn dāng shì rén réng kě yī fǎ tí chū shàng sù","The court rejected the request, but the party concerned may still appeal in accordance with the law.","El tribunal rechazó esta solicitud, pero la parte interesada aún puede apelar conforme a la ley.","Le tribunal a rejeté cette demande, mais la partie concernée peut encore faire appel conformément à la loi."],["L7-0249","脖子","bózi","N","neck","cuello","cou","她用围巾遮盖住了脖子上的伤疤。","tā yòng wéi jīn zhē gài zhù le bó zi shàng de shāng bā","She covered the scar on her neck with a scarf.","Se cubrió con una bufanda la cicatriz del cuello.","Elle a caché avec une écharpe la cicatrice qu'elle avait au cou."],["L7-0250","搏斗","bódòu","V","to fight; to struggle","luchar; pelear","lutter; se battre","那位保安与持刀歹徒搏斗时手臂受了伤，但保护了顾客的安全。","nà wèi bǎo ān yǔ chí dāo dǎi tú bó dòu shí shǒu bì shòu le shāng dàn bǎo hù le gù kè de ān quán","The security guard injured his arm while fighting a knife-wielding attacker, but he kept the customers safe.","Aquel guardia de seguridad se hirió el brazo al forcejear con un delincuente armado con un cuchillo, pero protegió a los clientes.","Ce vigile s'est blessé au bras en luttant contre un malfaiteur armé d'un couteau, mais il a protégé les clients."],["L7-0251","不定","bùdìng","Adj/Adv","uncertain; indefinite","indeterminado; incierto","incertain; indéfini","最近天气阴晴不定，出门最好带上一把伞。","zuì jìn tiān qì yīn qíng bú dìng chū mén zuì hǎo dài shàng yì bǎ sǎn","The weather has been unpredictable lately, so you'd better take an umbrella when you go out.","Últimamente el clima está muy cambiante; es mejor llevar un paraguas al salir.","Ces derniers temps, le temps est instable ; mieux vaut prendre un parapluie en sortant."],["L7-0252","不见得","bùjiàndé","Adv","not necessarily","no necesariamente","pas forcément","价钱贵的东西不见得质量就好，买之前还是要多比较。","jià qián guì de dōng xi bú jiàn dé zhì liàng jiù hǎo mǎi zhī qián hái shi yào duō bǐ jiào","Expensive things are not necessarily of good quality, so you should still compare carefully before buying.","Lo caro no siempre es de buena calidad, así que conviene comparar bien antes de comprar.","Ce qui coûte cher n'est pas forcément de bonne qualité ; il vaut donc mieux comparer avant d'acheter."],["L7-0253","不利于","bùlì yú","","harmful to; unfavorable to","perjudicial para; desfavorable a","nuisible à; défavorable à","很多专家认为，让孩子过早接触手机不利于成长。","hěn duō zhuān jiā rèn wéi ràng hái zi guò zǎo jiē chù shǒu jī bú lì yú chéng zhǎng","Many experts believe letting children use phones too early is bad for their development.","Muchos expertos creen que exponer a los niños al celular demasiado pronto no es bueno para su desarrollo.","De nombreux experts estiment qu'exposer trop tôt les enfants au téléphone portable nuit à leur développement."],["L7-0254","不慎","bùshèn","Adj","careless; inadvertent","descuidado; imprudente","imprudent; par inadvertance","他下楼梯时不慎踩空，扭伤了右脚，只好请假在家休息。","tā xià lóu tī shí bú shèn cǎi kōng niǔ shāng le yòu jiǎo zhǐ hǎo qǐng jià zài jiā xiū xi","He carelessly missed a step while going downstairs, sprained his right foot, and had to take leave to rest at home.","Al bajar las escaleras, pisó en falso sin darse cuenta, se torció el pie derecho y tuvo que pedir permiso para descansar en casa.","En descendant l'escalier, il a eu un faux pas, s'est foulé le pied droit et a dû prendre congé pour se reposer chez lui."],["L7-0255","不适","bùshì","Adj","unwell; indisposed","indispuesto; molesto","indisposé; mal à l'aise","这间地下室又阴暗又潮湿，不适合住人。","zhè jiān dì xià shì yòu yīn àn yòu cháo shī bú shì hé zhù rén","This basement is dark and damp and not fit to live in.","Este sótano es oscuro y húmedo, y no es apto para vivir.","Ce sous-sol est sombre et humide, impropre à l'habitation."],["L7-0256","不算","bù suàn","","to not count; to not be considered","no contar; no considerarse","ne pas compter; ne pas être considéré comme","一次失败不算什么，千万不要灰心。","yí cì shī bài bú suàn shén me qiān wàn bú yào huī xīn","One failure is nothing — whatever you do, don't lose heart.","Un fracaso no es nada; por favor, no te desanimes.","Un échec, ce n'est rien ; surtout, ne te décourage pas."],["L7-0257","不像话","bùxiànghuà","Adj","outrageous; unreasonable","inaceptable; escandaloso","inadmissible; scandaleux","他把垃圾直接扔在邻居门口，实在太不像话了。","tā bǎ lā jī zhí jiē rēng zài lín jū mén kǒu shí zài tài bú xiàng huà le","He dumped his garbage right at his neighbor's door, which is simply outrageous.","Tiró la basura directamente frente a la puerta del vecino; es realmente intolerable.","Il a jeté ses ordures directement devant la porte de son voisin, c'est vraiment inadmissible."],["L7-0258","不屑","bùxiè","V","to disdain; to think beneath oneself","desdeñar; considerar indigno","dédaigner; juger indigne","面对网上那些毫无根据的谣言，他根本不屑解释。","miàn duì wǎng shàng nà xiē háo wú gēn jù de yáo yán tā gēn běn bú xiè jiě shì","Faced with those groundless rumors online, he simply considered it beneath him to explain.","Ante esos rumores sin fundamento en internet, ni siquiera se molestó en dar explicaciones.","Face à ces rumeurs sans fondement sur internet, il dédaigne tout simplement de s'expliquer."],["L7-0259","不懈","bùxiè","Adj","untiring; persistent","incansable; constante","inlassable; persévérant","经过科研团队多年的不懈努力，这种新药终于通过了临床试验。","jīng guò kē yán tuán duì duō nián de bú xiè nǔ lì zhè zhǒng xīn yào zhōng yú tōng guò le lín chuáng shì yàn","After years of unremitting effort by the research team, this new drug finally passed its clinical trials.","Tras años de incansables esfuerzos del equipo de investigación, este nuevo medicamento por fin superó los ensayos clínicos.","Après des années d'efforts inlassables de l'équipe de recherche, ce nouveau médicament a enfin passé les essais cliniques."],["L7-0260","不亚于","bùyàyú","V","no less than; on a par with","no inferior a; a la altura de","pas inférieur à; égal à","这位业余歌手的唱功不亚于专业演员，观众都听得入了迷。","zhè wèi yè yú gē shǒu de chàng gōng bú yà yú zhuān yè yǎn yuán guān zhòng dōu tīng de rù le mí","This amateur singer's vocal skill is no less impressive than a professional performer's, and the audience was completely captivated.","La destreza vocal de este cantante aficionado no tiene nada que envidiarle a la de un artista profesional, y el público lo escuchó fascinado.","Le talent vocal de ce chanteur amateur n'a rien à envier à celui d'un artiste professionnel, et le public l'a écouté, fasciné."],["L7-0261","不亦乐乎","bùyìlèhū","","extremely; to the utmost","muchísimo; a más no poder","à l'extrême; follement","春节前，全家人在厨房里包饺子、炸丸子，忙得不亦乐乎。","chūn jié qián quán jiā rén zài chú fáng lǐ bāo jiǎo zi zhá wán zi máng de bú yì lè hū","Before the Spring Festival, the whole family was happily bustling about in the kitchen, making dumplings and frying meatballs.","Antes del Año Nuevo Lunar, toda la familia estaba en la cocina haciendo empanadillas y friendo albóndigas, muy atareados y contentos.","Avant la fête du Printemps, toute la famille s'affairait joyeusement dans la cuisine à préparer des raviolis et à frire des boulettes."],["L7-0262","不翼而飞","bùyì'érfēi","","to vanish without trace","desaparecer sin dejar rastro","disparaître sans laisser de trace","他去洗手间才几分钟，放在桌上的手机就不翼而飞了。","tā qù xǐ shǒu jiān cái jǐ fēn zhōng fàng zài zhuō shàng de shǒu jī jiù bú yì ér fēi le","He had been in the restroom for only a few minutes when the phone he had left on the table vanished without a trace.","Había ido al baño solo unos minutos y el celular que dejó sobre la mesa desapareció sin dejar rastro.","Il n'était allé aux toilettes que quelques minutes, et le téléphone qu'il avait laissé sur la table avait disparu sans laisser de trace."],["L7-0263","不用说","bùyòngshuō","","needless to say","ni que decir tiene","inutile de dire; cela va de soi","连专家都解释不清楚，更不用说我们这些外行了。","lián zhuān jiā dōu jiě shì bù qīng chu gèng bú yòng shuō wǒ men zhè xiē wài háng le","Even the experts can't explain it clearly, let alone laymen like us.","Ni siquiera los expertos pueden explicarlo con claridad, y mucho menos los profanos como nosotros.","Même les experts n'arrivent pas à l'expliquer clairement, sans parler de profanes comme nous."],["L7-0264","不正之风","bùzhèngzhīfēng","","unhealthy practices","malas prácticas; mal hábito social","mauvaises pratiques; pratiques malsaines","公司决定严肃整治请客送礼的不正之风，违规者将受到处分。","gōng sī jué dìng yán sù zhěng zhì qǐng kè sòng lǐ de bú zhèng zhī fēng wéi guī zhě jiāng shòu dào chǔ fèn","The company has decided to crack down on the unhealthy practice of wining, dining, and gift-giving, and violators will be disciplined.","La empresa decidió combatir con firmeza la mala práctica de invitar a comer y hacer regalos, y quienes la infrinjan serán sancionados.","L'entreprise a décidé de réprimer sévèrement la mauvaise pratique des repas offerts et des cadeaux, et les contrevenants seront sanctionnés."],["L7-0265","补给","bǔjǐ","V/N","supplies; to replenish","suministros; reabastecer","ravitaillement; ravitailler","暴雪封路后，山上营地的补给只能靠直升机运送。","bào xuě fēng lù hòu shān shàng yíng dì de bǔ jǐ zhǐ néng kào zhí shēng jī yùn sòng","After the blizzard blocked the roads, supplies for the mountain camp could only be delivered by helicopter.","Tras el bloqueo de los caminos por la tormenta de nieve, los suministros al campamento de la montaña solo podían llegar en helicóptero.","Après que la tempête de neige a bloqué les routes, le ravitaillement du camp de montagne n'a pu être acheminé que par hélicoptère."],["L7-0266","补救","bǔjiù","V","to remedy; to make up for","remediar; subsanar","remédier à; réparer","等到真正出了问题再补救，恐怕就悔之晚矣。","děng dào zhēn zhèng chū le wèn tí zài bǔ jiù kǒng pà jiù huǐ zhī wǎn yǐ","If you wait until problems actually appear to fix them, I'm afraid it will be too late for regrets.","Si esperas a que realmente surja el problema para remediarlo, me temo que arrepentirse será demasiado tarde.","Si l'on attend que le problème survienne vraiment pour y remédier, je crains qu'il ne soit trop tard pour avoir des regrets."],["L7-0267","捕捉","bǔzhuō","V","to catch; to capture","capturar; atrapar","capturer; attraper","母鸟每天往返几十次捕捉昆虫，哺育巢中的幼鸟。","mǔ niǎo měi tiān wǎng fǎn jǐ shí cì bǔ zhuō kūn chóng bǔ yù cháo zhōng de yòu niǎo","The mother bird makes dozens of trips every day to catch insects and feed the chicks in her nest.","La madre ave va y viene decenas de veces al día para atrapar insectos y alimentar a los polluelos del nido.","La mère oiseau fait des dizaines d'allers-retours par jour pour attraper des insectes et nourrir les oisillons du nid."],["L7-0268","哺育","bǔyù","V","to nurture; to feed","criar; alimentar","nourrir; élever","母鸟每天往返几十次捕捉昆虫，哺育巢中的幼鸟。","mǔ niǎo měi tiān wǎng fǎn jǐ shí cì bǔ zhuō kūn chóng bǔ yù cháo zhōng de yòu niǎo","The mother bird makes dozens of trips every day to catch insects and feed the chicks in her nest.","La madre ave va y viene decenas de veces al día para atrapar insectos y alimentar a los polluelos del nido.","La mère oiseau fait des dizaines d'allers-retours par jour pour attraper des insectes et nourrir les oisillons du nid."],["L7-0269","不耻下问","bùchǐ-xiàwèn","","not ashamed to ask inferiors","no avergonzarse de preguntar a inferiores","ne pas avoir honte d'interroger ses inférieurs","王教授虽然是知名专家，遇到不熟悉的软件，仍然不耻下问，向学生请教。","wáng jiào shòu suī rán shì zhī míng zhuān jiā yù dào bù shú xī de ruǎn jiàn réng rán bù chǐ xià wèn xiàng xué shēng qǐng jiào","Although Professor Wang is a well-known expert, when he comes across unfamiliar software he is still not ashamed to ask his students for help.","Aunque el profesor Wang es un experto reconocido, cuando se topa con un programa que no conoce no tiene reparo en preguntarles a sus alumnos.","Bien que le professeur Wang soit un expert reconnu, face à un logiciel qu'il ne connaît pas, il n'hésite pas à demander conseil à ses étudiants."],["L7-0270","不辞而别","bùcí'érbié","","to leave without saying goodbye","irse sin despedirse","partir sans dire au revoir","他没有留下任何解释就不辞而别，朋友们都为他担心。","tā méi yǒu liú xià rèn hé jiě shì jiù bù cí ér bié péng you men dōu wèi tā dān xīn","He left without saying goodbye or giving any explanation, and his friends were all worried about him.","Se fue sin despedirse y sin dejar ninguna explicación, y sus amigos están preocupados por él.","Il est parti sans dire au revoir ni laisser la moindre explication, et ses amis s'inquiètent tous pour lui."],["L7-0271","不得而知","bùdé'érzhī","","unknown; impossible to find out","desconocido; imposible de saber","inconnu; impossible à savoir","这座古墓的主人究竟是谁，由于缺少文字记载，至今不得而知。","zhè zuò gǔ mù de zhǔ rén jiū jìng shì shéi yóu yú quē shǎo wén zì jì zǎi zhì jīn bù dé ér zhī","Because of the lack of written records, who exactly was buried in this ancient tomb remains unknown to this day.","Por falta de registros escritos, hasta hoy no se sabe quién era realmente el dueño de esta antigua tumba.","Faute de documents écrits, on ignore encore aujourd'hui à qui appartenait réellement cette ancienne tombe."],["L7-0272","不得已","bùdéyǐ","Adj","to have no alternative; reluctantly","no tener más remedio; a la fuerza","n'avoir pas le choix; à contrecœur","航班临时取消，她不得已改乘高铁，连夜赶往上海。","háng bān lín shí qǔ xiāo tā bù dé yǐ gǎi chéng gāo tiě lián yè gǎn wǎng shàng hǎi","Her flight was canceled at the last minute, so she had no choice but to take the high-speed train and rush to Shanghai overnight.","Como cancelaron su vuelo de improviso, no tuvo más remedio que tomar el tren de alta velocidad y viajar de noche a Shanghái.","Son vol ayant été annulé à la dernière minute, elle n'a pas eu d'autre choix que de prendre le train à grande vitesse et de filer toute la nuit vers Shanghai."],["L7-0273","不妨","bùfáng","Adv","might as well; no harm in","bien se puede; no hay inconveniente en","autant; rien n'empêche de","你要是拿不定主意，不妨听听父母的意见。","nǐ yào shi ná bú dìng zhǔ yi bù fáng tīng tīng fù mǔ de yì jiàn","If you can't make up your mind, you might as well listen to your parents' opinion.","Si no logras decidirte, bien podrías escuchar la opinión de tus padres.","Si tu n'arrives pas à te décider, tu pourrais écouter l'avis de tes parents."],["L7-0274","不服","bùfú","V","to refuse to accept; to disobey","no aceptar; no someterse","refuser d'accepter; ne pas se soumettre","两个人都不服输，暗地里一直在较劲。","liǎng gè rén dōu bù fú shū àn dì lǐ yì zhí zài jiào jìn","Neither of them will admit defeat, and they've been quietly competing all along.","Ninguno de los dos quiere darse por vencido y han estado compitiendo en secreto todo este tiempo.","Aucun des deux ne veut s'avouer vaincu, et ils se livrent une lutte sourde depuis le début."],["L7-0275","不服气","bù fúqì","","unconvinced; indignant","no resignarse; indignado","refuser de s'avouer vaincu; indigné","他嘴上恭维老板，心里却很不服气。","tā zuǐ shàng gōng wéi lǎo bǎn xīn lǐ què hěn bù fú qì","He flatters his boss, but inwardly he is unwilling to concede that the boss is better than he is.","De palabra elogia al jefe, pero por dentro no se resigna a reconocer que sea mejor que él.","Il flatte son patron de bouche, mais au fond il refuse d'admettre qu'il lui est supérieur."],["L7-0276","不假思索","bùjiǎ-sīsuǒ","","without thinking; instantly","sin pensarlo; de inmediato","sans réfléchir; instantanément","记者问他最想感谢谁，他不假思索地说是自己的母亲。","jì zhě wèn tā zuì xiǎng gǎn xiè shéi tā bù jiǎ sī suǒ de shuō shì zì jǐ de mǔ qīn","When the reporter asked whom he most wanted to thank, he said without hesitation that it was his mother.","Cuando el periodista le preguntó a quién quería agradecerle más, dijo sin pensarlo que a su madre.","Quand le journaliste lui a demandé qui il voulait remercier le plus, il a répondu sans hésiter que c'était sa mère."],["L7-0277","不解","bùjiě","V","not to understand; puzzled","no entender; desconcertado","ne pas comprendre; perplexe","他明明成绩优秀却突然退学，这让老师和同学都十分不解。","tā míng míng chéng jì yōu xiù què tū rán tuì xué zhè ràng lǎo shī hé tóng xué dōu shí fēn bù jiě","He was clearly an excellent student, yet he suddenly dropped out, which left his teachers and classmates very puzzled.","Era claramente un excelente estudiante y, sin embargo, abandonó los estudios de repente, algo que desconcertó mucho a los maestros y compañeros.","Alors qu'il avait manifestement d'excellents résultats, il a soudain abandonné ses études, ce qui a beaucoup déconcerté ses professeurs et ses camarades."],["L7-0278","不经意","bùjīngyì","V","carelessly; inadvertently","sin darse cuenta; por descuido","par inadvertance; négligemment","她不经意地提到自己下个月要搬家，大家才知道这个消息。","tā bù jīng yì de tí dào zì jǐ xià ge yuè yào bān jiā dà jiā cái zhī dào zhè ge xiāo xi","She casually mentioned that she was moving next month, and only then did everyone learn the news.","Mencionó sin darle importancia que se mudaría el mes próximo, y fue así como todos se enteraron.","Elle a mentionné incidemment qu'elle déménageait le mois prochain, et c'est ainsi que tout le monde l'a appris."],["L7-0279","不景气","bùjǐngqì","Adj","sluggish; in a slump","deprimido; en recesión","en berne; en récession","经济不景气，今年的失业率有所上升。","jīng jì bù jǐng qì jīn nián de shī yè lǜ yǒu suǒ shàng shēng","With the economy in a slump, the unemployment rate has risen somewhat this year.","Con la economía en recesión, la tasa de desempleo ha subido un poco este año.","L'économie étant en berne, le taux de chômage a un peu augmenté cette année."],["L7-0280","不堪","bùkān","V/Adj","unable to bear; extremely","no poder soportar; sumamente","incapable de supporter; extrêmement","连续加了一个月的班，他已经疲惫不堪，只想好好睡上一觉。","lián xù jiā le yí ge yuè de bān tā yǐ jīng pí bèi bù kān zhǐ xiǎng hǎo hǎo shuì shàng yí jiào","After working overtime for a month straight, he was utterly exhausted and just wanted a good sleep.","Tras trabajar horas extra durante un mes seguido, estaba agotadísimo y solo quería dormir bien.","Après un mois entier d'heures supplémentaires, il était épuisé et ne voulait qu'une bonne nuit de sommeil."],["L7-0281","不可避免","bùkě-bìmiǎn","","unavoidable","inevitable","inévitable","随着城市人口快速增加，交通拥堵几乎成了不可避免的问题。","suí zhe chéng shì rén kǒu kuài sù zēng jiā jiāo tōng yōng dǔ jī hū chéng le bù kě bì miǎn de wèn tí","As the urban population grows rapidly, traffic congestion has become an almost unavoidable problem.","Con el rápido aumento de la población urbana, los atascos se han vuelto un problema casi inevitable.","Avec la croissance rapide de la population urbaine, les embouteillages sont devenus un problème presque inévitable."],["L7-0282","不可思议","bùkě-sīyì","","inconceivable; unimaginable","inconcebible; increíble","inconcevable; inimaginable","他只用了半年就能用中文流利地演讲，真让人觉得不可思议。","tā zhǐ yòng le bàn nián jiù néng yòng zhōng wén liú lì de yǎn jiǎng zhēn ràng rén jué de bù kě sī yì","He was able to give fluent speeches in Chinese after only half a year, which is truly unbelievable.","En solo seis meses ya podía dar discursos con fluidez en chino, algo realmente increíble.","En seulement six mois, il a pu faire des discours en chinois avec aisance, ce qui est vraiment incroyable."],["L7-0283","不肯","bù kěn","","to refuse; to be unwilling","negarse; no querer","refuser; ne pas vouloir","任你怎么劝，他也不肯改变主意。","rèn nǐ zěn me quàn tā yě bù kěn gǎi biàn zhǔ yi","No matter how you try to persuade him, he won't change his mind.","Por más que le aconsejes, no querrá cambiar de opinión.","Quoi que tu lui dises pour le convaincre, il ne veut pas changer d'avis."],["L7-0284","不理","bù lǐ","","to ignore; to pay no attention","ignorar; no hacer caso","ignorer; ne pas prêter attention","小两口吵架以后冷战了三天，谁也不理谁。","xiǎo liǎng kǒu chǎo jià yǐ hòu lěng zhàn le sān tiān shéi yě bù lǐ shéi","After the argument, the young couple gave each other the silent treatment for three days.","Después de la discusión, la joven pareja estuvo tres días en guerra fría sin dirigirse la palabra.","Après leur dispute, le jeune couple s'est boudé pendant trois jours sans s'adresser la parole."],["L7-0285","不了了之","bùliǎo-liǎozhī","","to let a matter drop unresolved","dejar un asunto sin resolver","laisser une affaire sans suite","居民多次投诉噪音问题，可是没有人负责，最后只能不了了之。","jū mín duō cì tóu sù zào yīn wèn tí kě shì méi yǒu rén fù zé zuì hòu zhǐ néng bù liǎo liǎo zhī","The residents complained about the noise many times, but no one took responsibility, and in the end the matter was simply left unresolved.","Los vecinos se quejaron varias veces del ruido, pero nadie se hizo responsable y al final el asunto quedó en nada.","Les habitants se sont plaints plusieurs fois du bruit, mais personne n'a pris la responsabilité de l'affaire, qui a fini par être classée sans suite."],["L7-0286","不难","bù nán","","not difficult; easy to","no difícil; fácil de","pas difficile; facile à","只要仔细比较这两份报告，就不难发现其中的数据前后矛盾。","zhǐ yào zǐ xì bǐ jiào zhè liǎng fèn bào gào jiù bù nán fā xiàn qí zhōng de shù jù qián hòu máo dùn","If you compare the two reports carefully, it is not hard to see that the data in them are inconsistent.","Si se comparan con cuidado los dos informes, no es difícil notar que los datos se contradicen.","Si l'on compare attentivement ces deux rapports, il n'est pas difficile de constater que les données se contredisent."],["L7-0287","不平","bùpíng","Adj/N","injustice; unfair; uneven","injusticia; agravio; desigual","injustice; grief; inégal","看到老员工被无故辞退，同事们都为他感到不平。","kàn dào lǎo yuán gōng bèi wú gù cí tuì tóng shì men dōu wèi tā gǎn dào bù píng","Seeing the veteran employee dismissed for no reason, his colleagues all felt indignant on his behalf.","Al ver que despedían sin motivo a un empleado veterano, sus compañeros sintieron indignación por él.","En voyant un employé de longue date licencié sans raison, ses collègues se sont tous indignés pour lui."],["L7-0288","不起眼","bùqǐyǎn","","unremarkable","poco llamativo; insignificante","peu remarquable; insignifiant","巷子里那家不起眼的小店，做的牛肉面却是全城最有名的。","xiàng zi lǐ nà jiā bù qǐ yǎn de xiǎo diàn zuò de niú ròu miàn què shì quán chéng zuì yǒu míng de","That unremarkable little shop in the alley makes the most famous beef noodles in the whole city.","Esa discreta tiendita del callejón prepara los fideos con carne de res más famosos de toda la ciudad.","Cette petite boutique sans prétention de la ruelle prépare les nouilles au bœuf les plus célèbres de toute la ville."],["L7-0289","不容","bùróng","V","to not allow; cannot tolerate","no permitir; no tolerar","ne pas permettre; ne pas tolérer","市场份额虽然有所增长，但高额的运营成本仍然不容忽视。","shì chǎng fèn é suī rán yǒu suǒ zēng zhǎng dàn gāo é de yùn yíng chéng běn réng rán bù róng hū shì","Although market share has increased, the high operating costs still cannot be overlooked.","Aunque la cuota de mercado ha crecido, no se pueden ignorar los altos costos operativos.","Même si la part de marché a progressé, on ne peut pas négliger les coûts d'exploitation élevés."],["L7-0290","不如说","bùrú shuō","","rather; better to say","más bien; mejor dicho","plutôt; il vaudrait mieux dire","与其说他缺乏能力，不如说他一直没有得到合适的机会。","yǔ qí shuō tā quē fá néng lì bù rú shuō tā yì zhí méi yǒu dé dào hé shì de jī huì","Rather than saying he lacks ability, it would be more accurate to say he has never been given the right opportunity.","Más que decir que le falta capacidad, habría que decir que nunca ha tenido la oportunidad adecuada.","Plutôt que de dire qu'il manque de capacités, il vaudrait mieux dire qu'il n'a jamais eu l'occasion qui convenait."],["L7-0291","不同寻常","bùtóng-xúncháng","","unusual; extraordinary","fuera de lo común; extraordinario","hors du commun; inhabituel","今年冬天暖和得不同寻常，公园里的梅花提前一个月就开了。","jīn nián dōng tiān nuǎn huo de bù tóng xún cháng gōng yuán lǐ de méi huā tí qián yí ge yuè jiù kāi le","This winter has been unusually warm, and the plum blossoms in the park bloomed a month early.","Este invierno ha sido inusualmente templado y los ciruelos del parque florecieron un mes antes.","Cet hiver est exceptionnellement doux, et les pruniers du parc ont fleuri un mois plus tôt."],["L7-0292","不为人知","bùwéirénzhī","","unknown to others; secret","desconocido; secreto","inconnu du public; secret","这位著名作家在成名之前，有过一段不为人知的艰苦岁月。","zhè wèi zhù míng zuò jiā zài chéng míng zhī qián yǒu guo yí duàn bù wéi rén zhī de jiān kǔ suì yuè","Before becoming famous, this well-known writer went through a period of hardship that few people know about.","Antes de hacerse famoso, este célebre escritor pasó por una etapa de dificultades que pocos conocen.","Avant de devenir célèbre, cet écrivain renommé a traversé une période de dures épreuves que peu de gens connaissent."],["L7-0293","不惜","bùxī","V","to not hesitate; at any cost","no escatimar; no dudar en","ne pas hésiter à; ne pas ménager","为了按时完成订单，工厂不惜花高价从国外紧急购买原料。","wèi le àn shí wán chéng dìng dān gōng chǎng bù xī huā gāo jià cóng guó wài jǐn jí gòu mǎi yuán liào","To fill the order on time, the factory did not hesitate to pay high prices for urgent purchases of raw materials from abroad.","Para entregar el pedido a tiempo, la fábrica no dudó en pagar precios altos por comprar materia prima de emergencia en el extranjero.","Pour livrer la commande à temps, l'usine n'a pas hésité à payer le prix fort pour acheter en urgence des matières premières à l'étranger."],["L7-0294","不相上下","bùxiāng-shàngxià","","about equal; evenly matched","casi igual; parejo","à peu près égal; de force égale","比赛进入决胜阶段，双方比分不相上下，观众也屏住了呼吸。","bǐ sài jìn rù jué shèng jiē duàn shuāng fāng bǐ fēn bù xiāng shàng xià guān zhòng yě bǐng zhù le hū xī","As the match entered its decisive stage, the scores were neck and neck and the spectators held their breath.","El partido entró en su fase decisiva, el marcador estaba muy parejo y los espectadores contenían la respiración.","Le match est entré dans sa phase décisive, le score était serré et les spectateurs retenaient leur souffle."],["L7-0295","不宜","bùyí","V","inadvisable; unsuitable","no conveniente; desaconsejable","déconseillé; inapproprié","此药刺激性较强，故不宜空腹服用。","cǐ yào cì jī xìng jiào qiáng gù bù yí kōng fù fú yòng","This medicine is quite irritating, so it should not be taken on an empty stomach.","Este medicamento es bastante irritante, por lo que no conviene tomarlo con el estómago vacío.","Ce médicament est assez irritant ; il est donc déconseillé de le prendre à jeun."],["L7-0296","不已","bùyǐ","V","endlessly; incessantly","sin cesar; sin parar","sans cesse; sans fin","他一时冲动说了伤人的话，事后懊悔不已，却又不知如何开口道歉。","tā yì shí chōng dòng shuō le shāng rén de huà shì hòu ào huǐ bù yǐ què yòu bù zhī rú hé kāi kǒu dào qiàn","In a moment of impulse, he said something hurtful; afterward he was deeply remorseful but did not know how to apologize.","En un impulso dijo algo hiriente y luego se arrepintió muchísimo, pero no sabía cómo empezar a disculparse.","Sur un coup de tête, il a prononcé des paroles blessantes, puis l'a amèrement regretté, sans savoir comment présenter ses excuses."],["L7-0297","不以为然","bùyǐwéirán","","to disapprove; to object","no estar de acuerdo; desaprobar","désapprouver; ne pas être d'accord","大家都称赞这个方案很有创意，经理却不以为然，认为成本太高。","dà jiā dōu chēng zàn zhè ge fāng àn hěn yǒu chuàng yì jīng lǐ què bù yǐ wéi rán rèn wéi chéng běn tài gāo","Everyone praised the plan as very creative, but the manager disagreed, believing the cost was too high.","Todos elogiaron el plan por ser muy creativo, pero el gerente no estuvo de acuerdo y pensó que el costo era demasiado alto.","Tout le monde a félicité ce projet pour sa créativité, mais le directeur n'était pas d'accord et trouvait le coût trop élevé."],["L7-0298","不由得","bùyóude","V/Adv","can't help but","no poder evitar","ne pas pouvoir s'empêcher de","看到孩子们开心的笑脸，老师不由得笑了起来。","kàn dào hái zi men kāi xīn de xiào liǎn lǎo shī bù yóu de xiào le qǐ lái","Seeing the children's happy faces, the teacher couldn't help smiling.","Al ver las caras felices de los niños, la maestra no pudo evitar sonreír.","En voyant les visages joyeux des enfants, la maîtresse n'a pas pu s'empêcher de sourire."],["L7-0299","不由自主","bùyóuzìzhǔ","","involuntarily; can't help it","involuntariamente","involontairement; malgré soi","广场上的音乐一响起来，路过的孩子们就不由自主地跟着跳起舞来。","guǎng chǎng shàng de yīn yuè yì xiǎng qǐ lái lù guò de hái zi men jiù bù yóu zì zhǔ de gēn zhe tiào qǐ wǔ lái","As soon as the music started in the square, the children passing by involuntarily began dancing along.","En cuanto empezó a sonar la música en la plaza, los niños que pasaban se pusieron a bailar sin poder evitarlo.","Dès que la musique a retenti sur la place, les enfants qui passaient se sont mis à danser malgré eux."],["L7-0300","不予","bù yǔ","","to withhold; to refuse to give","no conceder; denegar","refuser d'accorder; ne pas accorder","由于申请材料不齐全，签证中心决定对他的申请不予受理。","yóu yú shēn qǐng cái liào bù qí quán qiān zhèng zhōng xīn jué dìng duì tā de shēn qǐng bù yǔ shòu lǐ","Because his application materials were incomplete, the visa center decided not to accept his application for processing.","Como los documentos de la solicitud estaban incompletos, el centro de visados decidió no tramitar su solicitud.","Les pièces de sa demande étant incomplètes, le centre de visas a décidé de ne pas la traiter."],["L7-0301","不约而同","bùyuē'értóng","","to do the same independently","coincidir sin ponerse de acuerdo","agir de concert sans s'être consultés","听到门外传来的巨响，办公室里的人不约而同地抬起了头。","tīng dào mén wài chuán lái de jù xiǎng bàn gōng shì lǐ de rén bù yuē ér tóng de tái qǐ le tóu","Hearing a loud bang from outside the door, everyone in the office looked up at the same moment, as if by agreement.","Al oír el fuerte estruendo fuera de la puerta, todos en la oficina levantaron la cabeza al mismo tiempo.","En entendant un grand bruit derrière la porte, tout le monde dans le bureau a levé la tête au même instant."],["L7-0302","不知","bùzhī","V","not to know; unaware","no saber; ignorar","ne pas savoir; ignorer","不知谁的恶作剧，把门口的花盆都摆歪了。","bù zhī shéi de è zuò jù bǎ mén kǒu de huā pén dōu bǎi wāi le","Someone's prank, who knows whose, has left all the flowerpots at the door crooked.","Quién sabe de quién fue la travesura que dejó torcidas todas las macetas de la entrada.","Je ne sais quel farceur a fait que tous les pots de fleurs devant la porte sont de travers."],["L7-0303","不知不觉","bùzhī-bùjué","","unconsciously; unawares","sin darse cuenta","sans s'en rendre compte","他说话太直，不知不觉就得罪了不少人。","tā shuō huà tài zhí bù zhī bù jué jiù dé zuì le bù shǎo rén","He's so blunt that he has offended quite a few people without realizing it.","Habla con demasiada franqueza y, sin darse cuenta, se ha ganado la enemistad de bastante gente.","Il parle trop franchement et s'est, sans s'en rendre compte, mis à dos pas mal de gens."],["L7-0304","不准","bù zhǔn","","to forbid; to prohibit","prohibir; no permitir","interdire; ne pas permettre","公司规定员工不准泄密。","gōng sī guī dìng yuán gōng bù zhǔn xiè mì","Company rules forbid employees from leaking secrets.","El reglamento de la empresa prohíbe que los empleados divulguen secretos.","Le règlement de l'entreprise interdit aux employés de divulguer des secrets."],["L7-0305","布局","bùjú","N/V","layout; arrangement","disposición; distribución","agencement; disposition","这套房子面积不大，但布局合理，客厅和卧室都很明亮。","zhè tào fáng zi miàn jī bú dà dàn bù jú hé lǐ kè tīng hé wò shì dōu hěn míng liàng","This apartment is not large, but its layout is sensible, and both the living room and the bedrooms are bright.","Este departamento no es grande, pero la distribución es adecuada y tanto la sala como los dormitorios son muy luminosos.","Cet appartement n'est pas grand, mais son agencement est judicieux, et le salon comme les chambres sont lumineux."],["L7-0306","步伐","bùfá","N","pace; step","paso; ritmo","pas; allure","为了赶上最后一班地铁，她不得不加快步伐。","wèi le gǎn shàng zuì hòu yì bān dì tiě tā bù dé bù jiā kuài bù fá","To catch the last subway train, she had no choice but to quicken her pace.","Para alcanzar el último metro, tuvo que acelerar el paso.","Pour attraper le dernier métro, elle a dû presser le pas."],["L7-0307","步入","bùrù","V","to step into; to enter","entrar en; adentrarse en","entrer dans; pénétrer","步入中年以后，他开始更加注意饮食和睡眠。","bù rù zhōng nián yǐ hòu tā kāi shǐ gèng jiā zhù yì yǐn shí hé shuì mián","After entering middle age, he began to pay more attention to his diet and sleep.","Al entrar en la mediana edad, empezó a cuidar más su alimentación y su sueño.","En entrant dans la quarantaine, il a commencé à faire plus attention à son alimentation et à son sommeil."],["L7-0308","步骤","bùzhòu","N","step; procedure","paso; procedimiento","étape; procédure","学生们聚精会神地听老师讲解实验步骤。","xué shēng men jù jīng huì shén de tīng lǎo shī jiǎng jiě shí yàn bù zhòu","The students listened with rapt attention as the teacher explained the experiment's steps.","Los alumnos escuchaban concentrados al profesor explicar los pasos del experimento.","Les élèves écoutaient avec une grande concentration le professeur expliquer les étapes de l'expérience."],["L7-0309","部件","bùjiàn","N","part; component","pieza; componente","pièce; composant","这台洗衣机的一个关键部件坏了，师傅说要等几天才能换。","zhè tái xǐ yī jī de yí ge guān jiàn bù jiàn huài le shī fu shuō yào děng jǐ tiān cái néng huàn","A key component of this washing machine has broken, and the repairman says it will be a few days before it can be replaced.","Se averió una pieza clave de esta lavadora y el técnico dice que habrá que esperar unos días para cambiarla.","Une pièce essentielle de ce lave-linge est cassée, et le réparateur dit qu'il faudra attendre quelques jours pour la remplacer."],["L7-0310","部署","bùshǔ","V","to deploy; deployment","desplegar; despliegue","déployer; déploiement","台风登陆前，市政府连夜部署了沿海居民的转移工作。","tái fēng dēng lù qián shì zhèng fǔ lián yè bù shǔ le yán hǎi jū mín de zhuǎn yí gōng zuò","Before the typhoon made landfall, the city government worked through the night to arrange the evacuation of coastal residents.","Antes de que el tifón tocara tierra, el gobierno municipal organizó durante la noche el traslado de los habitantes de la costa.","Avant que le typhon ne touche terre, la municipalité a organisé dans la nuit l'évacuation des habitants du littoral."],["L7-0311","猜谜","cāimí","","to guess a riddle","adivinar un acertijo","deviner une devinette","元宵节晚上，孩子们围在灯笼下猜谜，猜对了还能领到小礼物。","yuán xiāo jié wǎn shang hái zi men wéi zài dēng long xià cāi mí cāi duì le hái néng lǐng dào xiǎo lǐ wù","On the evening of the Lantern Festival, the children gathered under the lanterns to guess riddles, and they could also receive small gifts if they guessed correctly.","La noche de la Fiesta de los Faroles, los niños se reunían bajo los farolillos a adivinar acertijos y, si acertaban, recibían un pequeño regalo.","Le soir de la fête des Lanternes, les enfants se rassemblaient sous les lampions pour deviner des énigmes, et ceux qui trouvaient recevaient un petit cadeau."],["L7-0312","猜想","cāixiǎng","V","to guess; to suppose","suponer; conjeturar","supposer; conjecturer","实验结果印证了他的猜想。","shí yàn jié guǒ yìn zhèng le tā de cāi xiǎng","The experimental results confirmed his hypothesis.","Los resultados del experimento confirmaron su conjetura.","Les résultats de l'expérience ont confirmé son hypothèse."],["L7-0313","才华","cáihuá","N","talent","talento","talent","这位年轻的钢琴家展现出了非凡的才华。","zhè wèi nián qīng de gāng qín jiā zhǎn xiàn chū le fēi fán de cái huá","This young pianist has shown extraordinary talent.","Este joven pianista ha demostrado un talento extraordinario.","Ce jeune pianiste a fait preuve d'un talent extraordinaire."],["L7-0314","财经","cáijīng","N","finance and economics","finanzas y economía","finance et économie","他每天早上都会浏览财经新闻，了解股市的最新变化。","tā měi tiān zǎo shang dōu huì liú lǎn cái jīng xīn wén liǎo jiě gǔ shì de zuì xīn biàn huà","Every morning he browses the financial news to keep up with the latest changes in the stock market.","Todas las mañanas echa un vistazo a las noticias financieras para enterarse de los últimos cambios en la bolsa.","Chaque matin, il parcourt l'actualité financière pour se tenir au courant des dernières évolutions de la Bourse."],["L7-0315","财力","cáilì","N","financial resources","recursos financieros","ressources financières","这家小公司财力有限，暂时无法在海外设立分公司。","zhè jiā xiǎo gōng sī cái lì yǒu xiàn zàn shí wú fǎ zài hǎi wài shè lì fēn gōng sī","This small company has limited financial resources and cannot set up an overseas branch for the time being.","Esta pequeña empresa tiene recursos financieros limitados y por ahora no puede abrir una filial en el extranjero.","Cette petite entreprise dispose de moyens financiers limités et ne peut pour le moment pas ouvrir de filiale à l'étranger."],["L7-0316","财务","cáiwù","N","financial affairs","asuntos financieros; finanzas","affaires financières; finances","这家公司因为财务造假被调查了。","zhè jiā gōng sī yīn wèi cái wù zào jiǎ bèi diào chá le","This company was investigated for falsifying its accounts.","Investigaron a esta empresa por falsificar sus cuentas.","Cette entreprise a fait l'objet d'une enquête pour falsification de ses comptes."],["L7-0317","财物","cáiwù","N","property; belongings","bienes; pertenencias","biens; effets","乘客下车时请带好随身财物，以免遗失在车上。","chéng kè xià chē shí qǐng dài hǎo suí shēn cái wù yǐ miǎn yí shī zài chē shàng","Passengers, please take your personal belongings with you when getting off, so that nothing is left behind on the vehicle.","Al bajar, los pasajeros deben llevarse sus pertenencias personales para que no se queden olvidadas en el vehículo.","Les passagers sont priés d'emporter leurs effets personnels en descendant, afin de ne rien oublier dans le véhicule."],["L7-0318","财政","cáizhèng","N","public finance; fiscal","finanzas públicas; fiscal","finances publiques; fiscal","由于收入减少，这个城市的财政连续两年出现赤字。","yóu yú shōu rù jiǎn shǎo zhè ge chéng shì de cái zhèng lián xù liǎng nián chū xiàn chì zì","Because of falling revenue, the city's finances have run a deficit for two years in a row.","Debido a la caída de los ingresos, las finanzas de esta ciudad han registrado déficit durante dos años seguidos.","En raison de la baisse des recettes, les finances de cette ville sont déficitaires depuis deux ans."],["L7-0319","裁","cái","V","to cut; to trim; to reduce","cortar; recortar; reducir","couper; tailler; réduire","奶奶把旧床单裁成几块，给孙女缝了一个布娃娃。","nǎi nai bǎ jiù chuáng dān cái chéng jǐ kuài gěi sūn nǚ féng le yí ge bù wá wa","Grandma cut an old bedsheet into several pieces and sewed a rag doll for her granddaughter.","La abuela cortó una sábana vieja en varios pedazos y le cosió una muñeca de trapo a su nieta.","Grand-mère a découpé un vieux drap en plusieurs morceaux et a cousu une poupée de chiffon pour sa petite-fille."],["L7-0320","裁定","cáidìng","V","ruling; to rule","fallo; dictaminar","décision; statuer","协议应明确违约责任，以免日后各执一词，难以裁定。","xié yì yīng míng què wéi yuē zé rèn yǐ miǎn rì hòu gè zhí yì cí nán yǐ cái dìng","The agreement should specify liability for a breach to avoid conflicting accounts that are difficult to adjudicate later.","El acuerdo debe precisar la responsabilidad por incumplimiento, para evitar que luego cada parte sostenga una versión distinta y sea difícil resolver.","L'accord doit préciser la responsabilité en cas de rupture, afin d'éviter que chaque partie ne s'en tienne plus tard à sa version et qu'il soit difficile de trancher."],["L7-0321","裁决","cáijué","V","ruling; to adjudicate","resolución; dictaminar","arbitrage; trancher","法院最终作出裁决，要求那家工厂赔偿村民的全部损失。","fǎ yuàn zuì zhōng zuò chū cái jué yāo qiú nà jiā gōng chǎng péi cháng cūn mín de quán bù sǔn shī","The court finally issued a ruling requiring the factory to compensate the villagers for all their losses.","El tribunal dictó por fin su fallo y exigió a la fábrica que indemnizara a los aldeanos por todas sus pérdidas.","Le tribunal a finalement rendu sa décision, exigeant que l'usine indemnise les villageois de toutes leurs pertes."],["L7-0322","采","cǎi","V","to pick; to gather; to select","recoger; recolectar; elegir","cueillir; récolter; choisir","这种蜜是从深山里的野花上采来的，特别香甜。","zhè zhǒng mì shì cóng shēn shān lǐ de yě huā shàng cǎi lái de tè bié xiāng tián","This honey comes from wildflowers deep in the mountains and is especially fragrant and sweet.","Esta miel se recolecta de flores silvestres de las montañas profundas y es especialmente aromática y dulce.","Ce miel est récolté sur des fleurs sauvages au fond des montagnes ; il est particulièrement parfumé et doux."],["L7-0323","采集","cǎijí","V","to gather; to collect","recolectar; recopilar","recueillir; collecter","研究人员在湖边采集了水样，准备带回实验室化验。","yán jiū rén yuán zài hú biān cǎi jí le shuǐ yàng zhǔn bèi dài huí shí yàn shì huà yàn","The researchers collected water samples by the lake and planned to take them back to the lab for testing.","Los investigadores recogieron muestras de agua junto al lago y se prepararon para llevarlas al laboratorio para su análisis.","Les chercheurs ont prélevé des échantillons d'eau au bord du lac et comptaient les rapporter au laboratoire pour analyse."],["L7-0324","采矿","cǎikuàng","","mining","minería; extraer minerales","exploitation minière","这个小镇过去靠采矿为生，矿井关闭后开始发展旅游业。","zhè ge xiǎo zhèn guò qù kào cǎi kuàng wéi shēng kuàng jǐng guān bì hòu kāi shǐ fā zhǎn lǚ yóu yè","This small town used to live off mining, and after the mines closed it began developing tourism.","Este pueblo antes vivía de la minería y, tras el cierre de las minas, comenzó a desarrollar el turismo.","Cette petite ville vivait autrefois de l'exploitation minière ; après la fermeture des mines, elle a commencé à développer le tourisme."],["L7-0325","彩电","cǎidiàn","N","color TV","televisor a color","télévision couleur","八十年代，谁家要是买了一台彩电，邻居们都会跑来看热闹。","bā shí nián dài shéi jiā yào shi mǎi le yì tái cǎi diàn lín jū men dōu huì pǎo lái kàn rè nao","In the eighties, if a family bought a color TV, all the neighbors would come over to have a look.","En los años ochenta, si una familia compraba un televisor a color, los vecinos acudían a ver el espectáculo.","Dans les années quatre-vingt, quand une famille achetait un téléviseur couleur, tous les voisins accouraient pour voir."],["L7-0326","彩虹","cǎihóng","N","rainbow","arcoíris","arc-en-ciel","雨刚停，山谷上空就出现了一道弯弯的彩虹。","yǔ gāng tíng shān gǔ shàng kōng jiù chū xiàn le yí dào wān wān de cǎi hóng","As soon as the rain stopped, a curved rainbow appeared over the valley.","Apenas paró la lluvia, apareció un arcoíris curvo sobre el valle.","À peine la pluie avait-elle cessé qu'un arc-en-ciel courbe est apparu au-dessus de la vallée."],["L7-0327","彩霞","cǎixiá","N","colorful sunset clouds","nubes coloreadas del atardecer","nuages colorés du crépuscule","傍晚时分，西边的天空布满彩霞，把湖面也映红了。","bàng wǎn shí fēn xī bian de tiān kōng bù mǎn cǎi xiá bǎ hú miàn yě yìng hóng le","At dusk, the western sky was filled with rosy clouds that turned the lake red as well.","Al atardecer, el cielo del oeste se llenó de nubes teñidas de rosa y dorado, y también enrojecieron la superficie del lago.","Au crépuscule, le ciel à l'ouest s'est couvert de nuages colorés qui ont aussi rougi la surface du lac."],["L7-0328","菜市场","càishìchǎng","N","food market","mercado de alimentos","marché alimentaire","菜市场门口放着一杆公平秤，顾客可以自己复称。","cài shì chǎng mén kǒu fàng zhe yì gān gōng píng chèng gù kè kě yǐ zì jǐ fù chēng","There is a public scale at the entrance to the market so customers can weigh their purchases again themselves.","A la entrada del mercado hay una balanza pública, y los clientes pueden volver a pesar lo que compraron.","À l'entrée du marché se trouve une balance publique, et les clients peuvent peser de nouveau eux-mêmes leurs achats."],["L7-0329","参见","cānjiàn","V","see also; to refer to","véase también; consultar","voir aussi; se référer à","关于论文引用格式的具体要求，请参见本书附录中的详细说明。","guān yú lùn wén yǐn yòng gé shì de jù tǐ yāo qiú qǐng cān jiàn běn shū fù lù zhōng de xiáng xì shuō míng","For the specific requirements on citation format in papers, please see the detailed explanation in the appendix of this book.","Para los requisitos específicos sobre el formato de las citas en los trabajos, consulte la explicación detallada en el apéndice de este libro.","Pour les exigences précises concernant le format des citations dans les travaux, veuillez consulter les explications détaillées en annexe de ce livre."],["L7-0330","参军","cānjūn","","to join the army","alistarse en el ejército","s'engager dans l'armée","哥哥高中毕业后就参军了，在部队里锻炼了整整五年。","gē ge gāo zhōng bì yè hòu jiù cān jūn le zài bù duì lǐ duàn liàn le zhěng zhěng wǔ nián","My older brother joined the army right after high school and spent a full five years toughening up in the military.","Mi hermano mayor se alistó en el ejército al terminar la preparatoria y se fogueó durante cinco años completos en las filas.","Mon frère aîné s'est engagé dans l'armée après le lycée et s'est endurci pendant cinq années entières sous les drapeaux."],["L7-0331","参谋","cānmóu","V/N","staff officer; to advise","oficial de estado mayor; asesorar","officier d'état-major; conseiller","买房是件大事，你最好请懂行的朋友帮你参谋一下。","mǎi fáng shì jiàn dà shì nǐ zuì hǎo qǐng dǒng háng de péng you bāng nǐ cān móu yí xià","Buying a home is a big deal, so you'd better ask a friend who knows the field to give you some advice.","Comprar casa es un asunto importante; lo mejor es que le pidas consejo a un amigo que entienda del tema.","Acheter un logement est une affaire importante ; mieux vaut demander conseil à un ami qui s'y connaît."],["L7-0332","参照","cānzhào","V","to refer to; to consult","tomar como referencia; consultar","se référer à; consulter","新员工可以参照这份手册上的流程办理入职手续。","xīn yuán gōng kě yǐ cān zhào zhè fèn shǒu cè shàng de liú chéng bàn lǐ rù zhí shǒu xù","New employees can refer to the procedures in this handbook to complete their onboarding formalities.","Los empleados nuevos pueden consultar el procedimiento de este manual para completar los trámites de incorporación.","Les nouveaux employés peuvent se référer aux procédures de ce guide pour accomplir leurs formalités d'embauche."],["L7-0333","餐桌","cānzhuō","N","dining table","mesa de comedor","table à manger","一家人围坐在餐桌旁，边吃年夜饭边聊这一年的变化。","yì jiā rén wéi zuò zài cān zhuō páng biān chī nián yè fàn biān liáo zhè yì nián de biàn huà","The whole family sat around the dining table, eating New Year's Eve dinner and chatting about the changes of the past year.","La familia se sentó alrededor de la mesa y cenó la cena de Nochevieja mientras conversaba sobre los cambios del año.","Toute la famille, assise autour de la table, mangeait le repas du réveillon en parlant des changements de l'année."],["L7-0334","残","cán","V","incomplete; cruel; to damage","incompleto; cruel; dañar","incomplet; cruel; abîmer","这部纪录片展示了狼凶残的一面。","zhè bù jì lù piàn zhǎn shì le láng xiōng cán de yí miàn","This documentary shows the savage side of wolves.","Este documental muestra el lado feroz de los lobos.","Ce documentaire montre le côté féroce des loups."],["L7-0335","残留","cánliú","V","to remain; residual","permanecer; residual; residuo","subsister; résiduel; résidu","检测结果显示，这批蔬菜的农药残留严重超标。","jiǎn cè jié guǒ xiǎn shì zhè pī shū cài de nóng yào cán liú yán zhòng chāo biāo","Test results show that pesticide residues in this batch of vegetables far exceed the permitted limit.","Los resultados de las pruebas muestran que los residuos de pesticidas de este lote de verduras superan gravemente el límite.","Les résultats des analyses montrent que les résidus de pesticides de ce lot de légumes dépassent largement la limite autorisée."],["L7-0336","残缺","cánquē","V","incomplete; damaged","incompleto; deteriorado","incomplet; endommagé","由于保存不当，这份手稿残缺得很厉害，许多段落已无法辨认。","yóu yú bǎo cún bú dàng zhè fèn shǒu gǎo cán quē de hěn lì hai xǔ duō duàn luò yǐ wú fǎ biàn rèn","Because it was poorly preserved, this manuscript is badly incomplete, and many passages can no longer be made out.","Por haber sido mal conservado, este manuscrito está muy incompleto y muchos pasajes ya no se pueden descifrar.","Ayant été mal conservé, ce manuscrit est très lacunaire et beaucoup de passages sont désormais illisibles."],["L7-0337","残忍","cánrěn","Adj","cruel; ruthless","cruel; despiadado","cruel; impitoyable","为了取象牙而杀死大象，这种做法实在太残忍了。","wèi le qǔ xiàng yá ér shā sǐ dà xiàng zhè zhǒng zuò fǎ shí zài tài cán rěn le","Killing elephants just to take their ivory is truly too cruel.","Matar elefantes para quitarles el marfil es realmente demasiado cruel.","Tuer des éléphants pour leur prendre l'ivoire est vraiment trop cruel."],["L7-0338","惭愧","cánkuì","Adj","ashamed","avergonzado","honteux","想到自己很久没回家看望父母，他心里十分惭愧。","xiǎng dào zì jǐ hěn jiǔ méi huí jiā kàn wàng fù mǔ tā xīn lǐ shí fēn cán kuì","Thinking about how long it had been since he went home to see his parents, he felt deeply ashamed.","Al pensar que hacía mucho que no volvía a casa a ver a sus padres, sintió mucha vergüenza.","En pensant qu'il y avait longtemps qu'il n'était pas rentré voir ses parents, il a éprouvé une grande honte."],["L7-0339","惨白","cǎnbái","Adj","deathly pale","pálido como un muerto","livide","听到这个坏消息，她的脸色一下子变得惨白，半天说不出话来。","tīng dào zhè ge huài xiāo xi tā de liǎn sè yí xià zi biàn de cǎn bái bàn tiān shuō bu chū huà lái","On hearing the bad news, her face suddenly turned deathly pale, and she couldn't speak for a long while.","Al oír la mala noticia, su rostro se puso de pronto pálido y estuvo un buen rato sin poder hablar.","En entendant cette mauvaise nouvelle, son visage est soudain devenu livide, et elle est restée longtemps sans pouvoir parler."],["L7-0340","惨痛","cǎntòng","Adj","painful; bitter","doloroso; amargo","douloureux; cuisant","那次火灾给了工厂负责人一个惨痛的教训，此后他对安全检查再也不敢马虎。","nà cì huǒ zāi gěi le gōng chǎng fù zé rén yí ge cǎn tòng de jiào xùn cǐ hòu tā duì ān quán jiǎn chá zài yě bù gǎn mǎ hu","That fire taught the factory manager a painful lesson, and since then he has never dared to be careless about safety inspections.","Aquel incendio le dio al responsable de la fábrica una lección dolorosa, y desde entonces no se atrevió a descuidar las inspecciones de seguridad.","Cet incendie a donné au responsable de l'usine une leçon douloureuse, et depuis il n'ose plus négliger les contrôles de sécurité."],["L7-0341","惨重","cǎnzhòng","Adj","heavy; disastrous","grave; desastroso","lourd; désastreux","股市连续下跌，很多股民损失惨重。","gǔ shì lián xù xià diē hěn duō gǔ mín sǔn shī cǎn zhòng","The stock market kept falling, and many retail investors suffered heavy losses.","La bolsa siguió cayendo y muchos inversionistas sufrieron grandes pérdidas.","La Bourse a continué de chuter, et de nombreux petits porteurs ont subi de lourdes pertes."],["L7-0342","灿烂","cànlàn","Adj","brilliant; splendid","resplandeciente; espléndido","éclatant; splendide","中国有着悠久的历史和灿烂的文化。","zhōng guó yǒu zhe yōu jiǔ de lì shǐ hé càn làn de wén huà","China has a long history and a splendid culture.","China tiene una larga historia y una cultura esplendorosa.","La Chine possède une longue histoire et une culture brillante."],["L7-0343","苍蝇","cāngying","N","housefly","mosca","mouche","厨房里飞进来一只苍蝇，奶奶拿着扇子把它轰了出去。","chú fáng lǐ fēi jìn lái yì zhī cāng ying nǎi nai ná zhe shàn zi bǎ tā hōng le chū qù","A fly got into the kitchen, and Grandma shooed it out with a fan.","Entró una mosca volando a la cocina y la abuela la espantó con un abanico.","Une mouche est entrée dans la cuisine, et grand-mère l'a chassée avec un éventail."],["L7-0344","沧桑","cāngsāng","N","great changes; vicissitudes","grandes cambios; vicisitudes","grands bouleversements; vicissitudes","老人脸上的皱纹记录了他一生经历的沧桑。","lǎo rén liǎn shàng de zhòu wén jì lù le tā yì shēng jīng lì de cāng sāng","The wrinkles on the old man's face record the hardships and changes he went through in his life.","Las arrugas en el rostro del anciano registran las vicisitudes que vivió a lo largo de su vida.","Les rides sur le visage du vieil homme racontent les vicissitudes qu'il a vécues tout au long de sa vie."],["L7-0345","舱","cāng","N","cabin; hold","cabina; bodega","cabine; soute","船身突然剧烈摇晃，乘客们纷纷回到舱里坐好。","chuán shēn tū rán jù liè yáo huàng chéng kè men fēn fēn huí dào cāng lǐ zuò hǎo","The ship suddenly rocked violently, and the passengers hurried back to their seats in the cabin.","De repente el barco se sacudió con violencia y los pasajeros volvieron enseguida a sentarse en la cabina.","Le navire s'est soudain mis à tanguer violemment, et les passagers sont vite retournés s'asseoir dans la cabine."],["L7-0346","藏匿","cángnì","V","to conceal; to hide","ocultar; esconderse","cacher; se cacher","警方在一间废弃仓库里找到了嫌疑人藏匿的赃款。","jǐng fāng zài yì jiān fèi qì cāng kù lǐ zhǎo dào le xián yí rén cáng nì de zāng kuǎn","Police found the stolen money the suspect had hidden in an abandoned warehouse.","La policía encontró en un almacén abandonado el dinero robado que el sospechoso había escondido.","La police a retrouvé dans un entrepôt abandonné l'argent volé que le suspect avait caché."],["L7-0347","藏品","cángpǐn","N","collection item; collectible","pieza de colección","pièce de collection","这家博物馆的大部分藏品都来自私人捐赠。","zhè jiā bó wù guǎn de dà bù fen cáng pǐn dōu lái zì sī rén juān zèng","Most of the items in this museum's collection came from private donations.","La mayor parte de las piezas de la colección de este museo proviene de donaciones privadas.","La plupart des pièces de la collection de ce musée proviennent de dons de particuliers."],["L7-0348","藏身","cángshēn","V","to hide; to take refuge","esconderse; refugiarse","se cacher; se réfugier","暴雨来得太突然，我们只好在桥下找了个地方藏身。","bào yǔ lái de tài tū rán wǒ men zhǐ hǎo zài qiáo xià zhǎo le gè dì fang cáng shēn","The rainstorm came so suddenly that we had to find a spot under the bridge to take shelter.","La tormenta llegó tan de repente que no tuvimos más remedio que buscar dónde resguardarnos debajo del puente.","L'orage est arrivé si brusquement que nous avons dû chercher un abri sous le pont."],["L7-0349","操控","cāokòng","V","to control; to manipulate","controlar; manipular","contrôler; manipuler","这款无人机可以直接用手机操控，新手也很容易上手。","zhè kuǎn wú rén jī kě yǐ zhí jiē yòng shǒu jī cāo kòng xīn shǒu yě hěn róng yì shàng shǒu","This drone can be controlled directly with a phone, so even beginners can pick it up easily.","Este dron se puede controlar directamente con el celular, así que incluso los principiantes lo manejan con facilidad.","Ce drone se pilote directement avec un téléphone, si bien que même les débutants le prennent en main facilement."],["L7-0350","操劳","cāoláo","V","to work hard; to take care of","trabajar duro; ocuparse de","se donner du mal; s'occuper de","母亲为了这个家操劳了一辈子，从来没抱怨过。","mǔ qīn wèi le zhè ge jiā cāo láo le yí bèi zi cóng lái méi bào yuàn guo","Mother toiled her whole life for this family and never once complained.","Mi madre se sacrificó toda la vida por esta familia y nunca se quejó.","Ma mère s'est dévouée toute sa vie pour cette famille sans jamais se plaindre."],["L7-0351","操心","cāoxīn","","to worry about","preocuparse por","se soucier de; s'inquiéter","这孩子特别乖，从来不让父母操心。","zhè hái zi tè bié guāi cóng lái bú ràng fù mǔ cāo xīn","This child is very well-behaved and never gives her parents any trouble.","Este niño es muy bueno y nunca les da preocupaciones a sus padres.","Cet enfant est très sage et ne cause jamais de soucis à ses parents."],["L7-0352","槽","cáo","N","trough; groove","abrevadero; ranura","auge; rainure","农民把切好的草倒进槽里，几头牛马上围了过来。","nóng mín bǎ qiē hǎo de cǎo dào jìn cáo lǐ jǐ tóu niú mǎ shàng wéi le guò lái","The farmer poured the chopped grass into the trough, and several cows gathered around right away.","El campesino vació la hierba cortada en el comedero y varias vacas se acercaron de inmediato.","Le paysan a versé l'herbe coupée dans l'auge, et plusieurs vaches se sont aussitôt rassemblées autour."],["L7-0353","草案","cǎo'àn","N","draft","borrador; proyecto","projet; avant-projet","草案公布后，居民可以通过多种渠道提出意见，相关部门也应及时回应质疑。","cǎo àn gōng bù hòu jū mín kě yǐ tōng guò duō zhǒng qú dào tí chū yì jiàn xiāng guān bù mén yě yīng jí shí huí yìng zhì yí","After the draft is published, residents can submit comments through several channels, and the relevant departments should respond promptly to questions.","Una vez publicado el borrador, los vecinos pueden presentar sus opiniones por distintos canales, y los departamentos correspondientes deben responder a tiempo a las dudas.","Une fois le projet publié, les habitants peuvent formuler leurs observations par divers canaux, et les services concernés doivent répondre sans tarder aux objections."],["L7-0354","草坪","cǎopíng","N","lawn","césped","pelouse","公园的草坪刚刚浇过水，请大家暂时不要踩踏。","gōng yuán de cǎo píng gāng gāng jiāo guo shuǐ qǐng dà jiā zàn shí bú yào cǎi tà","The park lawn has just been watered, so please don't walk on it for now.","El césped del parque acaba de regarse; por favor, no lo pisen por ahora.","La pelouse du parc vient d'être arrosée ; veuillez ne pas la piétiner pour le moment."],["L7-0355","侧面","cèmiàn","N","side; aspect","lado; faceta","côté; aspect","记者从侧面了解到，这家公司的经营状况并不乐观。","jì zhě cóng cè miàn liǎo jiě dào zhè jiā gōng sī de jīng yíng zhuàng kuàng bìng bú lè guān","The reporter learned through indirect channels that the company's business was not doing well.","El periodista supo indirectamente que la situación del negocio de esta empresa no es nada optimista.","Le journaliste a appris de façon indirecte que la situation de cette entreprise n'est guère optimiste."],["L7-0356","侧重","cèzhòng","V","to emphasize; to focus on","hacer hincapié en; centrarse en","mettre l'accent sur; privilégier","这门课程侧重培养学生的口语表达能力。","zhè mén kè chéng cè zhòng péi yǎng xué shēng de kǒu yǔ biǎo dá néng lì","This course focuses on developing students' spoken expression skills.","Este curso se centra en desarrollar la expresión oral de los alumnos.","Ce cours met l'accent sur le développement de l'expression orale des étudiants."],["L7-0357","测算","cèsuàn","V","to measure and calculate","medir y calcular","mesurer et calculer","专家测算，新机场建成后每年可以创造数万个就业岗位。","zhuān jiā cè suàn xīn jī chǎng jiàn chéng hòu měi nián kě yǐ chuàng zào shù wàn gè jiù yè gǎng wèi","Experts estimate that once the new airport is built, it will generate tens of thousands of jobs each year.","Los expertos calculan que, cuando se construya el nuevo aeropuerto, se podrán crear decenas de miles de puestos de trabajo cada año.","Les experts estiment qu'une fois le nouvel aéroport construit, il pourra créer chaque année plusieurs dizaines de milliers d'emplois."],["L7-0358","测验","cèyàn","V/N","test; to test","prueba; examen; evaluar","test; contrôle; tester","死记硬背或许能应付一时的测验，却未必有助于融会贯通。","sǐ jì yìng bèi huò xǔ néng yìng fu yì shí de cè yàn què wèi bì yǒu zhù yú róng huì guàn tōng","Rote memorization may get someone through a test, but does not necessarily lead to an integrated understanding.","Memorizar de forma mecánica quizá sirva para salir del paso en una prueba, pero no necesariamente ayuda a comprender a fondo.","Apprendre par cœur peut permettre de s'en sortir lors d'un contrôle, mais n'aide pas forcément à bien assimiler."],["L7-0359","层出不穷","céngchū-bùqióng","","to emerge one after another","surgir sin cesar","se succéder sans cesse","随着网络的发展，新的诈骗手段层出不穷，大家要提高警惕。","suí zhe wǎng luò de fā zhǎn xīn de zhà piàn shǒu duàn céng chū bù qióng dà jiā yào tí gāo jǐng tì","With the growth of the internet, new scams keep emerging one after another, so everyone should stay alert.","Con el desarrollo de internet surgen sin cesar nuevos métodos de estafa, así que todos debemos estar más alerta.","Avec le développement d'internet, de nouvelles méthodes d'escroquerie apparaissent sans cesse ; il faut donc rester vigilant."],["L7-0360","蹭","cèng","V","to rub against; to freeload","rozar; gorrear","frotter; resquiller","小猫在我腿上蹭来蹭去，好像是饿了。","xiǎo māo zài wǒ tuǐ shàng cèng lái cèng qù hǎo xiàng shì è le","The kitten kept rubbing against my leg; it seemed to be hungry.","El gatito se frotaba contra mi pierna; parecía tener hambre.","Le chaton se frottait contre ma jambe ; il avait l'air d'avoir faim."],["L7-0361","差错","chācuò","N","mistake; error","error; fallo","erreur; faute","这份报告必须仔细检查，不能出一点儿差错。","zhè fèn bào gào bì xū zǐ xì jiǎn chá bù néng chū yì diǎnr chā cuò","This report must be checked carefully; there can't be the slightest mistake.","Este informe debe revisarse con cuidado; no puede haber ni el más mínimo error.","Ce rapport doit être vérifié avec soin ; il ne peut y avoir la moindre erreur."],["L7-0362","差额","chā'é","N","difference; balance","diferencia; saldo","écart; solde","我把那件外套换成便宜一些的，商家把差额退到了我的账户上。","wǒ bǎ nà jiàn wài tào huàn chéng pián yi yì xiē de shāng jiā bǎ chā é tuì dào le wǒ de zhàng hù shàng","I exchanged that coat for a cheaper one, and the seller refunded the price difference to my account.","Cambié esa chaqueta por una más barata y la tienda reembolsó la diferencia en mi cuenta.","J'ai échangé ce manteau contre un autre moins cher, et le vendeur a remboursé la différence sur mon compte."],["L7-0363","插手","chāshǒu","","to meddle; to get involved","intervenir; meterse","s'immiscer; intervenir","这是他们夫妻之间的事，外人最好不要插手。","zhè shì tā men fū qī zhī jiān de shì wài rén zuì hǎo bú yào chā shǒu","This is a matter between husband and wife, so outsiders had better not interfere.","Este es un asunto de la pareja; lo mejor es que los de fuera no se metan.","C'est une affaire entre mari et femme ; mieux vaut que les étrangers ne s'en mêlent pas."],["L7-0364","插图","chātú","N","illustration","ilustración","illustration","这本童话书的插图色彩鲜艳，孩子们都很喜欢。","zhè běn tóng huà shū de chā tú sè cǎi xiān yàn hái zi men dōu hěn xǐ huan","The illustrations in this fairy-tale book are brightly colored, and the children love them.","Las ilustraciones de este libro de cuentos tienen colores vivos y a los niños les gustan mucho.","Les illustrations de ce livre de contes sont d'un coloris vif, et les enfants les adorent."],["L7-0365","插嘴","chāzuǐ","","to interrupt; to butt in","interrumpir; meter baza","interrompre; couper la parole","大人说话的时候，小孩子不要随便插嘴。","dà ren shuō huà de shí hou xiǎo hái zi bú yào suí biàn chā zuǐ","Children shouldn't butt in while adults are talking.","Cuando los adultos hablan, los niños no deben interrumpir a su antojo.","Quand les adultes parlent, les enfants ne doivent pas les interrompre à tout bout de champ."],["L7-0366","茶道","chádào","N","tea ceremony","ceremonia del té","cérémonie du thé","她在日本留学期间学过茶道，对每个步骤都很讲究。","tā zài rì běn liú xué qī jiān xué guo chá dào duì měi ge bù zhòu dōu hěn jiǎng jiu","She studied the tea ceremony while studying in Japan and is very particular about every step.","Estudió la ceremonia del té cuando estuvo de intercambio en Japón y es muy exigente con cada paso.","Elle a appris la cérémonie du thé pendant ses études au Japon, et elle est très pointilleuse sur chaque étape."],["L7-0367","茶馆儿","cháguǎnr","N","teahouse","casa de té","maison de thé","偏僻的小巷里藏着一间茶馆儿，来往的客人多半是附近的街坊。","piān pì de xiǎo xiàng lǐ cáng zhe yì jiān chá guǎnr lái wǎng de kè rén duō bàn shì fù jìn de jiē fāng","A teahouse is tucked away in a secluded alley, and most of its customers are neighbors from nearby.","En un callejón apartado se esconde una casa de té, y la mayoría de los clientes son vecinos del barrio.","Dans une ruelle isolée se cache une maison de thé, dont la plupart des clients sont des voisins du quartier."],["L7-0368","查处","cháchǔ","V","to investigate and deal with","investigar y sancionar","enquêter et sanctionner","政府加大力度打击腐败，查处了一批官员。","zhèng fǔ jiā dà lì dù dǎ jī fǔ bài chá chǔ le yì pī guān yuán","The government stepped up its fight against corruption, investigating a number of officials and taking action against them.","El gobierno intensificó la lucha contra la corrupción e investigó y sancionó a varios funcionarios.","Le gouvernement a renforcé sa lutte contre la corruption et a enquêté sur un certain nombre de fonctionnaires, qu'il a sanctionnés."],["L7-0369","查明","chámíng","V","to ascertain; to find out","averiguar; esclarecer","établir; élucider","事故原因尚未查明，警方正在进一步调查。","shì gù yuán yīn shàng wèi chá míng jǐng fāng zhèng zài jìn yí bù diào chá","The cause of the accident has not yet been determined; police are investigating further.","Aún no se ha determinado la causa del accidente y la policía sigue investigando.","La cause de l'accident n'a pas encore été établie ; la police poursuit son enquête."],["L7-0370","查找","cházhǎo","V","to look up; to search for","buscar; consultar","chercher; rechercher","你可以在这个网站上按作者姓名查找相关论文。","nǐ kě yǐ zài zhè ge wǎng zhàn shàng àn zuò zhě xìng míng chá zhǎo xiāng guān lùn wén","You can search for relevant papers on this website by author name.","En este sitio web puedes buscar los trabajos relacionados por nombre de autor.","Sur ce site, tu peux rechercher des articles par nom d'auteur."],["L7-0371","察觉","chájué","V","to notice; to detect","percibir; darse cuenta de","remarquer; percevoir","他说话时声音有点发抖，但谁也没有察觉到他的紧张。","tā shuō huà shí shēng yīn yǒu diǎn fā dǒu dàn shéi yě méi yǒu chá jué dào tā de jǐn zhāng","His voice trembled a little as he spoke, but no one sensed how nervous he was.","Le temblaba un poco la voz al hablar, pero nadie notó lo nervioso que estaba.","Sa voix tremblait un peu quand il parlait, mais personne n'a remarqué sa nervosité."],["L7-0372","察看","chákàn","V","to observe; to inspect","observar; examinar","observer; inspecter","地震发生后，工程师立即赶到现场察看桥梁受损情况。","dì zhèn fā shēng hòu gōng chéng shī lì jí gǎn dào xiàn chǎng chá kàn qiáo liáng shòu sǔn qíng kuàng","After the earthquake, engineers rushed to the site to inspect the damage to the bridge.","Después del terremoto, los ingenieros acudieron de inmediato al lugar para inspeccionar los daños del puente.","Après le séisme, les ingénieurs se sont immédiatement rendus sur place pour inspecter les dégâts subis par le pont."],["L7-0373","诧异","chàyì","Adj","astonished; surprised","asombrado; sorprendido","stupéfait; surpris","听说他突然辞职了，同事们都感到十分诧异。","tīng shuō tā tū rán cí zhí le tóng shì men dōu gǎn dào shí fēn chà yì","When they heard he had suddenly resigned, his colleagues were all astonished.","Al enterarse de que había renunciado de repente, todos sus compañeros se quedaron muy sorprendidos.","En apprenant qu'il avait soudain démissionné, ses collègues ont tous été très surpris."],["L7-0374","掺","chān","V","to mix; to blend","mezclar","mélanger","这家店卖的蜂蜜里掺了糖水，被顾客投诉了。","zhè jiā diàn mài de fēng mì lǐ chān le táng shuǐ bèi gù kè tóu sù le","The honey sold by this shop had been mixed with sugar water, and customers complained about it.","La miel que vendía esta tienda estaba mezclada con agua azucarada y los clientes se quejaron.","Le miel vendu par ce magasin était coupé d'eau sucrée, et des clients ont porté plainte."],["L7-0375","搀","chān","V","to support by the arm; to mix","sostener del brazo; mezclar","soutenir par le bras; mélanger","雨天路滑，他小心地搀着奶奶走下台阶。","yǔ tiān lù huá tā xiǎo xīn de chān zhe nǎi nai zǒu xià tái jiē","The road was slippery in the rain, so he carefully helped his grandmother down the steps by the arm.","El camino estaba resbaladizo por la lluvia, así que él ayudó con cuidado a su abuela, sosteniéndola del brazo, a bajar los escalones.","La route était glissante à cause de la pluie, alors il a soutenu avec précaution sa grand-mère par le bras pour descendre les marches."],["L7-0376","馋","chán","Adj/V","greedy; to crave","goloso; antojarse de","gourmand; avoir envie de","看到桌上的美食，孩子馋得直流口水。","kàn dào zhuō shàng de měi shí hái zi chán de zhí liú kǒu shuǐ","Seeing the delicious food on the table, the child's mouth was watering.","Al ver la comida deliciosa sobre la mesa, al niño se le hacía agua la boca.","En voyant les plats appétissants sur la table, l'enfant en avait l'eau à la bouche."],["L7-0377","禅杖","chánzhàng","N","Buddhist monk's staff","bastón de monje budista","bâton de moine bouddhiste","老和尚拄着一根禅杖，慢慢走到了山顶的寺庙。","lǎo hé shang zhǔ zhe yì gēn chán zhàng màn màn zǒu dào le shān dǐng de sì miào","Leaning on his Buddhist monk's staff, the old monk slowly made his way to the temple at the top of the mountain.","Apoyado en un bastón de monje, el viejo bonzo subió despacio hasta el templo de la cima.","S'appuyant sur un bâton de moine, le vieux bonze a gravi lentement le chemin jusqu'au temple du sommet."],["L7-0378","缠","chán","V","to wrap around; to pester","enrollar; molestar","enrouler; importuner","一只小鸟被网缠住了，正在拼命挣扎。","yì zhī xiǎo niǎo bèi wǎng chán zhù le zhèng zài pīn mìng zhēng zhá","A little bird got caught in a net and is struggling desperately.","Un pajarito quedó atrapado en una red y forcejea desesperadamente.","Un petit oiseau s'est pris dans un filet et se débat désespérément."],["L7-0379","产","chǎn","V","to give birth; to produce","dar a luz; producir","accoucher; produire","这种酒是用当地产的糯米酿造的。","zhè zhǒng jiǔ shì yòng dāng dì chǎn de nuò mǐ niàng zào de","This wine is brewed from locally grown glutinous rice.","Este licor se elabora con arroz glutinoso producido en la región.","Cet alcool est brassé avec du riz gluant produit localement."],["L7-0380","产地","chǎndì","N","place of origin","lugar de origen","lieu de production","购买水果时，你可以看看标签上写的产地。","gòu mǎi shuǐ guǒ shí nǐ kě yǐ kàn kan biāo qiān shàng xiě de chǎn dì","When buying fruit, you can check the place of origin written on the label.","Al comprar fruta, puedes mirar el lugar de origen que indica la etiqueta.","Quand tu achètes des fruits, tu peux regarder l'origine indiquée sur l'étiquette."],["L7-0381","产物","chǎnwù","N","product; result","producto; resultado","produit; résultat","这项发明是两国科学家长期合作的产物。","zhè xiàng fā míng shì liǎng guó kē xué jiā cháng qī hé zuò de chǎn wù","This invention is the product of long-term cooperation between scientists of the two countries.","Este invento es fruto de la colaboración a largo plazo entre científicos de los dos países.","Cette invention est le fruit d'une longue coopération entre des scientifiques des deux pays."],["L7-0382","产值","chǎnzhí","N","output value","valor de producción","valeur de production","去年，这个小镇的旅游业产值比前年翻了一番。","qù nián zhè ge xiǎo zhèn de lǚ yóu yè chǎn zhí bǐ qián nián fān le yì fān","Last year, the output value of this town's tourism industry doubled compared with the year before.","El año pasado, el valor de producción del turismo de este pueblo se duplicó con respecto al año anterior.","L'année dernière, la valeur produite par le tourisme de cette petite ville a doublé par rapport à l'année précédente."],["L7-0383","铲","chǎn","V","to shovel; to scrape","palear; raspar","pelleter; racler","大雪过后，居民们一起拿着工具铲掉了门前的积雪。","dà xuě guò hòu jū mín men yì qǐ ná zhe gōng jù chǎn diào le mén qián de jī xuě","After the heavy snowfall, residents worked together, using tools to shovel away the snow in front of their doors.","Después de la gran nevada, los vecinos juntaron sus herramientas y quitaron la nieve acumulada frente a sus puertas.","Après la forte chute de neige, les habitants se sont munis d'outils et ont déblayé ensemble la neige devant leurs portes."],["L7-0384","铲子","chǎnzi","N","shovel; spatula","pala; espátula","pelle; spatule","炒菜时最好用木铲子，以免刮坏锅底。","chǎo cài shí zuì hǎo yòng mù chǎn zi yǐ miǎn guā huài guō dǐ","It's best to use a wooden spatula when stir-frying so you don't scratch the bottom of the pan.","Al saltear, es mejor usar una espátula de madera para no rayar el fondo del sartén.","Pour sauter les aliments, il vaut mieux utiliser une spatule en bois afin de ne pas rayer le fond de la poêle."],["L7-0385","阐述","chǎnshù","V","to expound; to elaborate","exponer; explicar en detalle","exposer; développer","作者并未回避样本的局限，而是在结论中明确阐述了适用的范畴。","zuò zhě bìng wèi huí bì yàng běn de jú xiàn ér shì zài jié lùn zhōng míng què chǎn shù le shì yòng de fàn chóu","The author did not avoid the limitations of the sample, but clearly set out the scope of applicability in the conclusion.","El autor no eludió las limitaciones de la muestra, sino que expuso con claridad en las conclusiones el ámbito de aplicación.","L'auteur n'a pas éludé les limites de l'échantillon ; il a au contraire exposé clairement dans la conclusion le champ d'application."],["L7-0386","颤抖","chàndǒu","V","to tremble; to shiver","temblar; estremecerse","trembler; frissonner","在寒风中等了一个小时，她冷得全身颤抖。","zài hán fēng zhōng děng le yí ge xiǎo shí tā lěng de quán shēn chàn dǒu","After waiting an hour in the cold wind, she was shivering all over.","Tras esperar una hora bajo el viento frío, temblaba de frío de pies a cabeza.","Après une heure d'attente dans le vent froid, elle tremblait de froid de la tête aux pieds."],["L7-0387","猖狂","chāngkuáng","Adj","rampant; arrogant","desenfrenado; insolente","effréné; insolent","最近这一带小偷十分猖狂，晚上出门一定要锁好车。","zuì jìn zhè yí dài xiǎo tōu shí fēn chāng kuáng wǎn shang chū mén yí dìng yào suǒ hǎo chē","Thieves have been very brazen in this area lately, so be sure to lock your car when you go out at night.","Últimamente los ladrones andan muy atrevidos por esta zona, así que por la noche asegúrate de cerrar bien el auto con llave.","Ces derniers temps, les voleurs sévissent effrontément dans ce secteur ; il faut donc bien verrouiller sa voiture quand on sort le soir."],["L7-0388","长达","cháng dá","","to be as long as; to last as long as","alcanzar una duración de; extenderse hasta","atteindre jusqu'à; durer jusqu'à","这场谈判长达三个月，双方最终达成了协议。","zhè chǎng tán pàn cháng dá sān gè yuè shuāng fāng zuì zhōng dá chéng le xié yì","The negotiations lasted as long as three months, and the two sides finally reached an agreement.","Estas negociaciones duraron tres meses y, al final, las dos partes llegaron a un acuerdo.","Ces négociations ont duré trois mois, et les deux parties ont fini par conclure un accord."],["L7-0389","长期以来","chángqī yǐlái","","for a long time","durante mucho tiempo","depuis longtemps","长期以来，这个村子的年轻人大多外出打工。","cháng qī yǐ lái zhè ge cūn zi de nián qīng rén dà duō wài chū dǎ gōng","For a long time, most young people in this village have left to work elsewhere.","Desde hace mucho tiempo, la mayoría de los jóvenes de este pueblo se van a trabajar fuera.","Depuis longtemps, la plupart des jeunes de ce village partent travailler ailleurs."],["L7-0390","长效","chángxiào","N/Adj","long-lasting; long-acting","de efecto prolongado","à effet durable","治理空气污染需要建立长效机制，不能只靠临时措施。","zhì lǐ kōng qì wū rǎn xū yào jiàn lì cháng xiào jī zhì bù néng zhǐ kào lín shí cuò shī","Tackling air pollution requires a long-term mechanism; we cannot rely only on temporary measures.","Controlar la contaminación del aire requiere establecer mecanismos de largo plazo; no basta con medidas provisionales.","Lutter contre la pollution de l'air exige de mettre en place un mécanisme durable ; on ne peut pas se contenter de mesures provisoires."],["L7-0391","长征","chángzhēng","N","Long March","Larga Marcha","Longue Marche","创业就像一场长征，只有坚持到底的人才能成功。","chuàng yè jiù xiàng yì chǎng cháng zhēng zhǐ yǒu jiān chí dào dǐ de rén cái néng chéng gōng","Starting a business is like a long march; only those who persevere to the end can succeed.","Emprender es como una larga marcha: solo quienes perseveran hasta el final pueden tener éxito.","Créer une entreprise, c'est comme une longue marche : seuls ceux qui tiennent jusqu'au bout peuvent réussir."],["L7-0392","长足","chángzú","Adj","remarkable; considerable","notable; considerable","remarquable; considérable","近年来，我国的新能源汽车技术取得了长足进步。","jìn nián lái wǒ guó de xīn néng yuán qì chē jì shù qǔ dé le cháng zú jìn bù","In recent years, our country's new-energy vehicle technology has made great strides.","En los últimos años, la tecnología de vehículos de nueva energía de nuestro país ha avanzado a pasos agigantados.","Ces dernières années, la technologie des véhicules à énergies nouvelles de notre pays a fait de grands progrès."],["L7-0393","常理","chánglǐ","N","common sense; normal reasoning","sentido común; lógica habitual","bon sens; logique ordinaire","按常理说，他这个时间早该到了，可能是路上堵车了。","àn cháng lǐ shuō tā zhè ge shí jiān zǎo gāi dào le kě néng shì lù shang dǔ chē le","Normally he should have arrived by now; maybe he got stuck in traffic.","Por lo normal, a esta hora ya debería haber llegado; tal vez se quedó atascado en el tráfico.","Normalement, il devrait déjà être arrivé à cette heure ; il est peut-être pris dans les embouteillages."],["L7-0394","常人","chángrén","N","ordinary person","persona común","personne ordinaire","他每天只睡四个小时却依然精力充沛，这让常人难以想象。","tā měi tiān zhǐ shuì sì gè xiǎo shí què yī rán jīng lì chōng pèi zhè ràng cháng rén nán yǐ xiǎng xiàng","He sleeps only four hours a day yet remains full of energy, which ordinary people find hard to imagine.","Solo duerme cuatro horas al día y aun así rebosa de energía, algo que la gente común no logra imaginar.","Il ne dort que quatre heures par jour et reste pourtant plein d'énergie, ce que le commun des mortels a du mal à imaginer."],["L7-0395","常态","chángtài","N","normal state","estado normal","état normal","在不少公司，加班几乎成了常态，员工们苦不堪言。","zài bù shǎo gōng sī jiā bān jī hū chéng le cháng tài yuán gōng men kǔ bù kān yán","At many companies, overtime has almost become the norm, and employees suffer greatly.","En muchas empresas, hacer horas extra se ha vuelto casi lo normal y los empleados sufren muchísimo.","Dans bien des entreprises, les heures supplémentaires sont presque devenues la norme, et les employés souffrent énormément."],["L7-0396","常温","chángwēn","N","room temperature","temperatura ambiente","température ambiante","这种牛奶开封前可以在常温下保存半年。","zhè zhǒng niú nǎi kāi fēng qián kě yǐ zài cháng wēn xià bǎo cún bàn nián","Before opening, this milk can be stored at room temperature for half a year.","Esta leche, antes de abrirse, se puede conservar medio año a temperatura ambiente.","Ce lait peut se conserver six mois à température ambiante avant ouverture."],["L7-0397","偿还","chánghuán","V","to repay; to reimburse","devolver; reembolsar","rembourser; rendre","他用了整整五年，才偿还了买房时向亲戚借的钱。","tā yòng le zhěng zhěng wǔ nián cái cháng huán le mǎi fáng shí xiàng qīn qi jiè de qián","It took him a full five years to repay the money he had borrowed from relatives to buy a home.","Tardó cinco años enteros en devolver el dinero que les había pedido prestado a sus familiares para comprar la casa.","Il lui a fallu cinq années entières pour rembourser l'argent emprunté à ses parents pour acheter sa maison."],["L7-0398","嫦娥","Cháng'é","N","Chang'e (moon goddess)","Chang'e (diosa de la luna)","Chang'e (déesse de la lune)","中秋节晚上，奶奶常给我们讲嫦娥奔月的故事。","zhōng qiū jié wǎn shang nǎi nai cháng gěi wǒ men jiǎng Cháng é bēn yuè de gù shi","On the night of the Mid-Autumn Festival, Grandma often tells us the story of Chang'e flying to the moon.","En la noche del Festival del Medio Otoño, la abuela solía contarnos la historia de Chang'e volando a la luna.","Le soir de la fête de la Mi-Automne, grand-mère nous racontait souvent l'histoire de Chang'e s'envolant vers la lune."],["L7-0399","厂家","chǎngjiā","N","manufacturer; factory","fabricante; fábrica","fabricant; usine","原材料价格持续攀升，压缩了中小厂家的利润空间。","yuán cái liào jià gé chí xù pān shēng yā suō le zhōng xiǎo chǎng jiā de lì rùn kōng jiān","The continuing rise in raw material prices has squeezed the profit margins of small and medium-sized manufacturers.","La subida constante del precio de las materias primas ha reducido el margen de ganancia de los fabricantes pequeños y medianos.","La hausse continue du prix des matières premières a réduit la marge bénéficiaire des petits et moyens fabricants."],["L7-0400","敞开","chǎngkāi","V","to open wide","abrir de par en par","ouvrir grand","天气太闷热了，他把办公室的门窗全都敞开了。","tiān qì tài mēn rè le tā bǎ bàn gōng shì de mén chuāng quán dōu chǎng kāi le","The weather was so muggy that he opened all the doors and windows of the office wide.","Hacía tanto bochorno que abrió de par en par todas las puertas y ventanas de la oficina.","Il faisait si lourd qu'il a grand ouvert toutes les portes et fenêtres du bureau."],["L7-0401","畅谈","chàngtán","V","to talk freely","hablar sin reservas","parler librement","突如其来的停电打乱了安排，大家却借此机会围坐在一起畅谈往事。","tū rú qí lái de tíng diàn dǎ luàn le ān pái dà jiā què jiè cǐ jī huì wéi zuò zài yì qǐ chàng tán wǎng shì","The sudden power cut disrupted their plans, but they used the opportunity to sit together and talk freely about the past.","El corte de luz repentino alteró sus planes, pero aprovecharon para sentarse juntos y conversar con libertad sobre el pasado.","La coupure de courant soudaine a bouleversé leurs plans, mais ils en ont profité pour s'asseoir ensemble et évoquer librement le passé."],["L7-0402","畅销","chàngxiāo","V","to sell well; bestselling","venderse bien; superventas","bien se vendre; à succès","这本小说一出版就十分畅销，很快加印了好几次。","zhè běn xiǎo shuō yì chū bǎn jiù shí fēn chàng xiāo hěn kuài jiā yìn le hǎo jǐ cì","This novel sold extremely well as soon as it was published and was quickly reprinted several times.","Esta novela se vendió muy bien desde que se publicó y pronto tuvo varias reimpresiones.","Dès sa parution, ce roman s'est très bien vendu et a rapidement été réimprimé plusieurs fois."],["L7-0403","倡议","chàngyì","V/N","to propose; initiative","proponer; iniciativa","proposer; initiative","学校倡议大家节约用水，从关好每一个水龙头做起。","xué xiào chàng yì dà jiā jié yuē yòng shuǐ cóng guān hǎo měi yí ge shuǐ lóng tóu zuò qǐ","The school is calling on everyone to save water, starting with turning off every tap properly.","La escuela invita a todos a ahorrar agua, empezando por cerrar bien cada grifo.","L'école invite chacun à économiser l'eau, à commencer par bien fermer chaque robinet."],["L7-0404","抄袭","chāoxí","V","to plagiarize; to copy","plagiar; copiar","plagier; copier","这两篇作文的内容高度雷同，老师怀疑有人抄袭。","zhè liǎng piān zuò wén de nèi róng gāo dù léi tóng lǎo shī huái yí yǒu rén chāo xí","The content of these two essays is nearly identical, and the teacher suspects plagiarism.","El contenido de estas dos redacciones es muy parecido y la maestra sospecha que alguien copió.","Le contenu de ces deux rédactions est extrêmement similaire, et la professeure soupçonne un plagiat."],["L7-0405","钞票","chāopiào","N","banknote; paper money","billete; papel moneda","billet de banque","请帮我把这张一百元的钞票换成零钱。","qǐng bāng wǒ bǎ zhè zhāng yì bǎi yuán de chāo piào huàn chéng líng qián","Please break this hundred-yuan note into small change for me.","Por favor, cámbiame este billete de cien yuanes por cambio.","Pouvez-vous me faire la monnaie sur ce billet de cent yuans, s'il vous plaît ?"],["L7-0406","超标","chāobiāo","","to exceed the standard","superar el límite establecido","dépasser la norme","检测结果显示，这批蔬菜的农药残留严重超标。","jiǎn cè jié guǒ xiǎn shì zhè pī shū cài de nóng yào cán liú yán zhòng chāo biāo","Test results show that pesticide residues in this batch of vegetables far exceed the permitted limit.","Los resultados de las pruebas muestran que los residuos de pesticidas de este lote de verduras superan gravemente el límite.","Les résultats des analyses montrent que les résidus de pesticides de ce lot de légumes dépassent largement la limite autorisée."],["L7-0407","超车","chāochē","","to overtake","adelantar (un coche)","dépasser (un véhicule)","在弯道上超车非常危险，司机千万不要这样做。","zài wān dào shàng chāo chē fēi cháng wēi xiǎn sī jī qiān wàn bú yào zhè yàng zuò","Overtaking on a curve is very dangerous, and drivers should never do it.","Adelantar en una curva es muy peligroso, y los conductores nunca deben hacerlo.","Dépasser dans un virage est très dangereux, et les conducteurs ne doivent jamais le faire."],["L7-0408","超前","chāoqián","Adj/V","ahead of the times; advanced","adelantado a su época; avanzado","en avance; d'avant-garde","这位建筑师的设计理念非常超前，几十年后看依然不过时。","zhè wèi jiàn zhù shī de shè jì lǐ niàn fēi cháng chāo qián jǐ shí nián hòu kàn yī rán bú guò shí","This architect's design ideas were far ahead of their time and still don't look dated decades later.","Las ideas de diseño de este arquitecto estaban muy adelantadas a su tiempo y, décadas después, todavía no pasan de moda.","Les idées de conception de cet architecte étaient très en avance sur leur temps, et des décennies plus tard elles ne sont toujours pas démodées."],["L7-0409","超速","chāosù","V","to speed; to exceed speed limit","exceder la velocidad","excès de vitesse","他因为在高速公路上超速行驶被罚了款。","tā yīn wèi zài gāo sù gōng lù shàng chāo sù xíng shǐ bèi fá le kuǎn","He was fined for speeding on the expressway.","Lo multaron por exceso de velocidad en la autopista.","Il a été verbalisé pour excès de vitesse sur l'autoroute."],["L7-0410","朝代","cháodài","N","dynasty","dinastía","dynastie","这座古城曾经是好几个朝代的都城。","zhè zuò gǔ chéng céng jīng shì hǎo jǐ ge cháo dài de dū chéng","This ancient city was once the capital of several dynasties.","Esta antigua ciudad fue en otro tiempo la capital de varias dinastías.","Cette ancienne ville a été la capitale de plusieurs dynasties."],["L7-0411","朝着","cháozhe","","towards; facing","hacia; en dirección a","vers; en direction de","这家公司正朝着国际化的目标稳步迈进。","zhè jiā gōng sī zhèng cháo zhe guó jì huà de mù biāo wěn bù mài jìn","The company is advancing steadily toward its goal of internationalization.","Esta empresa avanza con paso firme hacia su objetivo de internacionalización.","Cette entreprise progresse d'un pas assuré vers son objectif d'internationalisation."],["L7-0412","嘲弄","cháonòng","V","to mock; to tease","burlarse de; tomar el pelo","se moquer de; taquiner","他因为口音被几个同学嘲弄过，从此不太愿意开口说话。","tā yīn wèi kǒu yīn bèi jǐ ge tóng xué cháo nòng guo cóng cǐ bú tài yuàn yì kāi kǒu shuō huà","He was mocked by several classmates for his accent, and after that he was reluctant to speak up.","Varios compañeros se burlaron de su acento y desde entonces no tiene muchas ganas de hablar.","Plusieurs camarades se sont moqués de son accent, et depuis il n'aime plus trop prendre la parole."],["L7-0413","嘲笑","cháoxiào","V","to ridicule; to jeer at","ridiculizar; mofarse de","ridiculiser; railler","别人犯错的时候，我们应该帮助他，而不是嘲笑他。","bié rén fàn cuò de shí hou wǒ men yīng gāi bāng zhù tā ér bú shì cháo xiào tā","When someone makes a mistake, we should help them rather than laugh at them.","Cuando alguien comete un error, debemos ayudarle en lugar de burlarnos de él.","Quand quelqu'un fait une erreur, nous devons l'aider plutôt que nous moquer de lui."],["L7-0414","吵嘴","chǎozuǐ","","to quarrel; to bicker","discutir; reñir","se disputer; se chamailler","这对老夫妻虽然经常吵嘴，但感情一直很好。","zhè duì lǎo fū qī suī rán jīng cháng chǎo zuǐ dàn gǎn qíng yì zhí hěn hǎo","Although this elderly couple often bicker, they have always been very close.","Aunque esta pareja de ancianos discute a menudo, siempre se han querido mucho.","Bien que ce vieux couple se chamaille souvent, l'affection entre eux est toujours restée très forte."],["L7-0415","车道","chēdào","N","traffic lane; driveway","carril; entrada de vehículos","voie de circulation; allée","这条马路明年要拓宽成六车道。","zhè tiáo mǎ lù míng nián yào tuò kuān chéng liù chē dào","This road will be widened to six lanes next year.","El año que viene van a ensanchar esta calle a seis carriles.","L'année prochaine, cette route sera élargie à six voies."],["L7-0416","车祸","chēhuò","N","car accident","accidente de tráfico","accident de la route","他在昨天的车祸中受了重伤。","tā zài zuó tiān de chē huò zhōng shòu le zhòng shāng","He was seriously injured in yesterday's car accident.","Resultó gravemente herido en el accidente de coche de ayer.","Il a été gravement blessé dans l'accident de voiture d'hier."],["L7-0417","车间","chējiān","N","workshop","taller; sección de fábrica","atelier","新的安全规定必须在每个车间认真贯彻。","xīn de ān quán guī dìng bì xū zài měi ge chē jiān rèn zhēn guàn chè","The new safety regulations must be conscientiously implemented in every workshop.","Las nuevas normas de seguridad deben aplicarse rigurosamente en cada taller.","Les nouvelles règles de sécurité doivent être appliquées scrupuleusement dans chaque atelier."],["L7-0418","车轮","chēlún","N","wheel","rueda","roue","车轮陷进了泥坑里，我们几个人一起推才把车推出来。","chē lún xiàn jìn le ní kēng lǐ wǒ men jǐ ge rén yì qǐ tuī cái bǎ chē tuī chū lái","The wheels sank into a mud hole, and it took several of us pushing together to get the car out.","Las ruedas se hundieron en un bache de barro y tuvimos que empujar entre varios para sacar el auto.","Les roues se sont enfoncées dans un trou de boue, et il a fallu que nous poussions à plusieurs pour sortir la voiture."],["L7-0419","车速","chēsù","N","vehicle speed","velocidad del vehículo","vitesse du véhicule","进入学校附近的路段时，司机必须降低车速。","jìn rù xué xiào fù jìn de lù duàn shí sī jī bì xū jiàng dī chē sù","When entering the road section near a school, drivers must reduce their speed.","Al entrar en el tramo cercano a una escuela, los conductores deben reducir la velocidad.","En entrant dans le tronçon proche d'une école, les conducteurs doivent réduire leur vitesse."],["L7-0420","车位","chēwèi","N","parking space","plaza de aparcamiento","place de parking","小区里的车位太少，很多居民只能把车停在路边。","xiǎo qū lǐ de chē wèi tài shǎo hěn duō jū mín zhǐ néng bǎ chē tíng zài lù biān","There are too few parking spaces in the residential complex, so many residents have to park on the street.","En la urbanización hay muy pocos estacionamientos, así que muchos vecinos solo pueden dejar el auto en la calle.","Il y a trop peu de places de stationnement dans la résidence, et beaucoup d'habitants n'ont d'autre choix que de se garer dans la rue."],["L7-0421","车厢","chēxiāng","N","train carriage","vagón; compartimento","wagon; voiture","早高峰的地铁车厢里挤满了赶着上班的人。","zǎo gāo fēng de dì tiě chē xiāng lǐ jǐ mǎn le gǎn zhe shàng bān de rén","During the morning rush hour, the subway car was packed with people hurrying to work.","En la hora pico de la mañana, los vagones del metro iban llenos de gente apurada por llegar al trabajo.","Aux heures de pointe du matin, les rames de métro étaient bondées de gens pressés d'aller au travail."],["L7-0422","车型","chēxíng","N","vehicle model","modelo de vehículo","modèle de véhicule","这家汽车公司今年推出了三款新车型，价格都不算太高。","zhè jiā qì chē gōng sī jīn nián tuī chū le sān kuǎn xīn chē xíng jià gé dōu bú suàn tài gāo","This car company launched three new models this year, and none of them is very expensive.","Esta marca de autos lanzó este año tres modelos nuevos y los precios no son demasiado altos.","Ce constructeur automobile a lancé cette année trois nouveaux modèles, dont aucun n'est vraiment cher."],["L7-0423","车轴","chēzhóu","N","axle","eje","essieu","这辆马车的车轴断了，只能停在路边等人来修。","zhè liàng mǎ chē de chē zhóu duàn le zhǐ néng tíng zài lù biān děng rén lái xiū","The axle of this horse cart broke, so it had to wait by the roadside for someone to repair it.","El eje de este carruaje se rompió, así que tuvo que quedarse al lado del camino esperando a que alguien viniera a repararlo.","L'essieu de cette charrette s'est cassé, et elle a dû rester au bord de la route en attendant que quelqu'un vienne la réparer."],["L7-0424","扯","chě","V","to pull; to tear; to chat","jalar; rasgar; charlar","tirer; déchirer; bavarder","装修前最好把预算和工期写进合同，避免施工期间反复扯皮。","zhuāng xiū qián zuì hǎo bǎ yù suàn hé gōng qī xiě jìn hé tóng bì miǎn shī gōng qī jiān fǎn fù chě pí","Before renovating, it is best to put the budget and schedule into the contract to avoid repeated disputes during construction.","Antes de remodelar, lo mejor es poner por escrito en el contrato el presupuesto y los plazos, para evitar discusiones constantes durante las obras.","Avant de rénover, il vaut mieux inscrire le budget et le calendrier dans le contrat afin d'éviter des querelles à répétition pendant les travaux."],["L7-0425","彻夜","chèyè","Adv","all night","toda la noche","toute la nuit","为了赶在截止日期前交报告，他彻夜没有合眼。","wèi le gǎn zài jié zhǐ rì qī qián jiāo bào gào tā chè yè méi yǒu hé yǎn","To hand in the report before the deadline, he didn't sleep a wink all night.","Para entregar el informe antes de la fecha límite, no pegó ojo en toda la noche.","Pour rendre le rapport avant l'échéance, il n'a pas fermé l'œil de la nuit."],["L7-0426","撤","chè","V","to withdraw; to remove","retirar; quitar","retirer; enlever","他利用职权为自己谋利，被撤了职。","tā lì yòng zhí quán wèi zì jǐ móu lì bèi chè le zhí","He used his authority for personal gain and was dismissed.","Lo destituyeron por aprovecharse de su cargo para beneficio propio.","Il a été révoqué pour avoir abusé de son autorité à des fins personnelles."],["L7-0427","撤换","chèhuàn","V","to dismiss and replace","destituir y reemplazar","relever et remplacer","由于工程质量问题，负责这个项目的经理被撤换了。","yóu yú gōng chéng zhì liàng wèn tí fù zé zhè ge xiàng mù de jīng lǐ bèi chè huàn le","Because of construction quality problems, the manager in charge of the project was replaced.","Por problemas de calidad en la obra, reemplazaron al gerente a cargo del proyecto.","À cause de problèmes de qualité dans les travaux, le directeur responsable du projet a été remplacé."],["L7-0428","沉甸甸","chéndiàndiàn","Adj","heavy","muy pesado","bien lourd","秋天到了，果园里的苹果树上挂满了沉甸甸的果实。","qiū tiān dào le guǒ yuán lǐ de píng guǒ shù shàng guà mǎn le chén diàn diàn de guǒ shí","Autumn has arrived, and the apple trees in the orchard are loaded with heavy fruit.","Llegó el otoño y los manzanos del huerto están cargados de frutos pesados.","L'automne est arrivé, et les pommiers du verger sont chargés de fruits lourds."],["L7-0429","沉淀","chéndiàn","V/N","to settle; sediment","sedimentar; sedimento","se déposer; sédiment","把河水放在杯子里静置一会儿，泥沙就会慢慢沉淀下来。","bǎ hé shuǐ fàng zài bēi zi lǐ jìng zhì yí huìr ní shā jiù huì màn màn chén diàn xià lái","If you leave river water standing in a glass for a while, the sand and mud will slowly settle to the bottom.","Si dejas reposar un rato el agua del río en un vaso, el barro y la arena se irán asentando poco a poco.","Si l'on laisse reposer un moment l'eau de la rivière dans un verre, la boue et le sable se déposent peu à peu."],["L7-0430","沉浸","chénjìn","V","to immerse; to be steeped in","sumergir; estar inmerso en","plonger; être immergé dans","她沉浸在悠扬的乐曲中，一时忘却了工作上的烦恼。","tā chén jìn zài yōu yáng de yuè qǔ zhōng yì shí wàng què le gōng zuò shàng de fán nǎo","Absorbed in the melodious music, she briefly forgot her worries at work.","Absorta en la melodiosa música, por un momento olvidó las preocupaciones del trabajo.","Plongée dans une mélodie harmonieuse, elle a oublié un instant ses soucis professionnels."],["L7-0431","沉闷","chénmèn","Adj","oppressive; dull; gloomy","opresivo; apagado; sombrío","pesant; morne; terne","会议气氛十分沉闷，大家都低着头不说话。","huì yì qì fēn shí fēn chén mèn dà jiā dōu dī zhe tóu bù shuō huà","The atmosphere at the meeting was very dull and heavy, and everyone kept their heads down without speaking.","El ambiente de la reunión era muy pesado y todos bajaban la cabeza sin decir nada.","L'ambiance de la réunion était très lourde, et tout le monde baissait la tête sans rien dire."],["L7-0432","沉迷","chénmí","V","to be addicted; to be absorbed","estar absorto; ser adicto","s'adonner à; être accro","他沉迷赌博，最后弄得倾家荡产。","tā chén mí dǔ bó zuì hòu nòng de qīng jiā dàng chǎn","He became addicted to gambling and ended up losing everything he owned.","Se volvió adicto al juego y terminó en la ruina total.","Devenu accro au jeu, il a fini par perdre tout ce qu'il possédait."],["L7-0433","沉思","chénsī","V","to contemplate; to ponder","meditar; reflexionar","méditer; réfléchir","老教授望着窗外，陷入了长久的沉思。","lǎo jiào shòu wàng zhe chuāng wài xiàn rù le cháng jiǔ de chén sī","The old professor gazed out of the window and fell into deep thought for a long time.","El viejo profesor miró por la ventana y se sumió en una larga reflexión.","Le vieux professeur a regardé par la fenêtre et s'est plongé dans une longue méditation."],["L7-0434","沉稳","chénwěn","Adj","calm and steady","sereno; sosegado","posé; calme","新来的队长性格沉稳，遇到困难从不慌张。","xīn lái de duì zhǎng xìng gé chén wěn yù dào kùn nan cóng bù huāng zhāng","The new team captain has a steady temperament and never panics when facing difficulties.","El nuevo capitán del equipo es sereno y nunca se alarma ante las dificultades.","Le nouveau capitaine d'équipe est posé et ne s'affole jamais face aux difficultés."],["L7-0435","沉着","chénzhuó","Adj","composed; cool-headed","sereno; con aplomo","calme; posé","面对突如其来的火灾，消防员沉着地指挥大家撤离。","miàn duì tū rú qí lái de huǒ zāi xiāo fáng yuán chén zhuó de zhǐ huī dà jiā chè lí","Faced with the sudden fire, the firefighter calmly directed everyone to evacuate.","Ante el incendio repentino, el bombero dirigió con serenidad la evacuación de todos.","Face à l'incendie soudain, le pompier a dirigé calmement l'évacuation de tout le monde."],["L7-0436","陈旧","chénjiù","Adj","outdated; old-fashioned","anticuado; obsoleto","démodé; vieux","这座工厂的设备已经十分陈旧，急需更新换代。","zhè zuò gōng chǎng de shè bèi yǐ jīng shí fēn chén jiù jí xū gēng xīn huàn dài","The equipment in this factory is badly outdated and urgently needs to be upgraded.","El equipo de esta fábrica está muy anticuado y necesita con urgencia ser renovado.","Les équipements de cette usine sont très vétustes et doivent être renouvelés d'urgence."],["L7-0437","陈列","chénliè","V","to display; to exhibit","exhibir; exponer","exposer; présenter","展厅里陈列着几百件出土的古代陶器。","zhǎn tīng lǐ chén liè zhe jǐ bǎi jiàn chū tǔ de gǔ dài táo qì","Several hundred excavated ancient pottery pieces are on display in the exhibition hall.","En la sala de exposiciones se exhiben varios cientos de vasijas de cerámica antiguas desenterradas.","Dans la salle d'exposition sont présentées plusieurs centaines de poteries antiques exhumées."],["L7-0438","陈述","chénshù","V","to state; statement","declarar; exposición","énoncer; exposé","法官让证人如实陈述当晚看到的情况。","fǎ guān ràng zhèng rén rú shí chén shù dàng wǎn kàn dào de qíng kuàng","The judge asked the witness to give a truthful account of what they had seen that night.","El juez pidió al testigo que relatara con veracidad lo que había visto esa noche.","Le juge a demandé au témoin de relater fidèlement ce qu'il avait vu cette nuit-là."],["L7-0439","衬托","chèntuō","V","to set off; to contrast","realzar; hacer resaltar","mettre en valeur; faire ressortir","绿叶衬托着红花，让整幅画显得更加生动。","lǜ yè chèn tuō zhe hóng huā ràng zhěng fú huà xiǎn de gèng jiā shēng dòng","The green leaves set off the red flowers, making the whole painting look more vivid.","Las hojas verdes realzan las flores rojas y hacen que todo el cuadro se vea más vivo.","Les feuilles vertes mettent en valeur les fleurs rouges, rendant toute la peinture plus vivante."],["L7-0440","趁","chèn","Prep","to take advantage of","aprovechar","profiter de","趁大家不注意，他悄悄从会场溜了出去。","chèn dà jiā bú zhù yì tā qiāo qiāo cóng huì chǎng liū le chū qù","While no one was paying attention, he quietly slipped out of the meeting hall.","Aprovechando que nadie prestaba atención, salió a hurtadillas de la sala de reuniones.","Profitant de l'inattention générale, il s'est discrètement éclipsé de la salle de réunion."],["L7-0441","趁机","chènjī","Adv","to seize the opportunity","aprovechar la ocasión","profiter de l'occasion","小偷趁机挤进人群，偷走了游客的钱包。","xiǎo tōu chèn jī jǐ jìn rén qún tōu zǒu le yóu kè de qián bāo","The thief seized the chance to squeeze into the crowd and stole a tourist's wallet.","El ladrón aprovechó la ocasión para meterse entre la multitud y robó la cartera de un turista.","Le voleur en a profité pour se glisser dans la foule et a dérobé le portefeuille d'un touriste."],["L7-0442","趁早","chènzǎo","Adv","as early as possible","cuanto antes","le plus tôt possible","这份工作要是不适合你，还是趁早换一份吧。","zhè fèn gōng zuò yào shi bú shì hé nǐ hái shi chèn zǎo huàn yí fèn ba","If this job doesn't suit you, you'd better switch to another one sooner rather than later.","Si este trabajo no es adecuado para ti, mejor cámbialo cuanto antes.","Si ce travail ne te convient pas, mieux vaut en changer au plus tôt."],["L7-0443","趁着","chènzhe","","while; taking advantage of","aprovechando que; mientras","pendant que; en profitant de","趁着周末天气好，我们全家去郊外爬了山。","chèn zhe zhōu mò tiān qì hǎo wǒ men quán jiā qù jiāo wài pá le shān","Taking advantage of the good weather on the weekend, our whole family went hiking in the countryside.","Aprovechando que el fin de semana hacía buen tiempo, toda la familia fue a escalar una montaña a las afueras.","Profitant du beau temps du week-end, toute notre famille est allée faire une randonnée en montagne à la campagne."],["L7-0444","称呼","chēnghu","V/N","to address as; form of address","llamar; tratamiento","appeler; appellation","初次见面，我不知道该怎么称呼您才好。","chū cì jiàn miàn wǒ bù zhī dào gāi zěn me chēng hu nín cái hǎo","Since this is our first meeting, I'm not sure how I should address you.","Como es la primera vez que nos vemos, no sé cómo debería dirigirme a usted.","C'est la première fois que nous nous rencontrons et je ne sais pas comment je dois vous appeler."],["L7-0445","称作","chēngzuò","","to be called","llamarse; denominarse","être appelé","这种在高原上生活的牛被人们称作牦牛。","zhè zhǒng zài gāo yuán shàng shēng huó de niú bèi rén men chēng zuò máo niú","This kind of ox that lives on the plateau is called a yak.","A esta clase de bueyes que viven en la meseta la gente los llama yaks.","On appelle yaks ces bovidés qui vivent sur les hauts plateaux."],["L7-0446","成才","chéngcái","V","to become a useful person","llegar a ser alguien de provecho","réussir; devenir quelqu'un de valeur","父母都希望孩子将来能成才，但教育孩子时不能过于急躁。","fù mǔ dōu xī wàng hái zi jiāng lái néng chéng cái dàn jiào yù hái zi shí bù néng guò yú jí zào","All parents hope their children will become capable people, but they should not be too impatient when raising them.","Todos los padres desean que sus hijos lleguen a ser personas de provecho, pero no deben ser demasiado impacientes al educarlos.","Tous les parents espèrent que leurs enfants réussiront plus tard, mais ils ne doivent pas être trop impatients dans leur éducation."],["L7-0447","成家","chéngjiā","","to marry and settle down","casarse y formar un hogar","se marier; fonder un foyer","他工作稳定以后才决定成家，三十五岁那年结了婚。","tā gōng zuò wěn dìng yǐ hòu cái jué dìng chéng jiā sān shí wǔ suì nà nián jié le hūn","He decided to settle down only after his job was stable, and he got married at thirty-five.","Solo decidió formar una familia cuando tuvo un trabajo estable y se casó a los treinta y cinco años.","Il n'a décidé de fonder une famille qu'une fois son emploi stabilisé, et il s'est marié à trente-cinq ans."],["L7-0448","成年","chéngnián","V","adult; to reach adulthood","adulto; alcanzar la mayoría de edad","adulte; atteindre la majorité","在很多国家，年满十八岁就算成年了。","zài hěn duō guó jiā nián mǎn shí bā suì jiù suàn chéng nián le","In many countries, you are considered an adult once you turn eighteen.","En muchos países, se considera mayor de edad a quien cumple dieciocho años.","Dans de nombreux pays, on est considéré comme majeur dès l'âge de dix-huit ans."],["L7-0450","成千上万","chéngqiān-shàngwàn","","thousands upon thousands","miles y miles","des milliers","这项政策让成千上万的农民受益。","zhè xiàng zhèng cè ràng chéng qiān shàng wàn de nóng mín shòu yì","This policy has benefited tens of thousands of farmers.","Esta política ha beneficiado a decenas de miles de campesinos.","Cette politique a profité à des dizaines de milliers de paysans."],["L7-0451","成群结队","chéngqún-jiéduì","","in crowds; in droves","en grupos numerosos","en bandes; en masse","一到冬天，成群结队的候鸟就飞到这片湖区过冬。","yí dào dōng tiān chéng qún jié duì de hòu niǎo jiù fēi dào zhè piàn hú qū guò dōng","Every winter, flocks of migratory birds fly to this lake region to spend the winter.","En cuanto llega el invierno, bandadas de aves migratorias vuelan a esta zona de lagos a pasar el invierno.","Dès l'arrivée de l'hiver, des bandes d'oiseaux migrateurs viennent passer la mauvaise saison dans cette région de lacs."],["L7-0452","成天","chéngtiān","Adv","all day long","todo el día","toute la journée","这孩子成天抱着手机，连饭都不好好吃。","zhè hái zi chéng tiān bào zhe shǒu jī lián fàn dōu bù hǎo hǎo chī","This kid has a phone in hand all day long and doesn't even eat meals properly.","Este niño se pasa el día con el celular en la mano y ni siquiera come bien.","Cet enfant a le téléphone dans les bras toute la journée et ne mange même plus correctement."],["L7-0453","成问题","chéngwèntí","","to be a problem","ser un problema; ser dudoso","poser problème; être douteux","物价涨得太快，现在连吃饭都成问题了。","wù jià zhǎng de tài kuài xiàn zài lián chī fàn dōu chéng wèn tí le","Prices are rising so fast that now even putting food on the table has become a problem.","Los precios suben demasiado rápido y ahora hasta conseguir comida se ha vuelto un problema.","Les prix augmentent si vite que même se nourrir est devenu un problème."],["L7-0454","成型","chéngxíng","V","to take shape; to be formed","tomar forma; moldearse","prendre forme; se former","陶土放进模具压一压，很快就能成型。","táo tǔ fàng jìn mú jù yā yi yā hěn kuài jiù néng chéng xíng","Once the clay is pressed in the mold, it quickly takes shape.","Si metes la arcilla en el molde y la aprietas un poco, enseguida toma forma.","Une fois l'argile pressée dans le moule, elle prend rapidement forme."],["L7-0455","呈现","chéngxiàn","V","to appear; to present","mostrarse; presentar","apparaître; présenter","展览把不同时期的作品并列呈现，使风格的演变一目了然。","zhǎn lǎn bǎ bù tóng shí qī de zuò pǐn bìng liè chéng xiàn shǐ fēng gé de yǎn biàn yí mù liǎo rán","The exhibition presents works from different periods side by side, making the evolution of the style clear at a glance.","La exposición presenta obras de distintas épocas una al lado de la otra, de modo que la evolución del estilo se aprecia de un vistazo.","L'exposition présente côte à côte des œuvres de différentes époques, ce qui rend l'évolution du style évidente au premier coup d'œil."],["L7-0456","诚恳","chéngkěn","Adj","sincere; earnest","sincero; cordial","sincère; franc","他诚恳地向受到影响的顾客道了歉。","tā chéng kěn de xiàng shòu dào yǐng xiǎng de gù kè dào le qiàn","He sincerely apologized to the customers who had been affected.","Pidió disculpas con sinceridad a los clientes afectados.","Il a présenté sincèrement ses excuses aux clients concernés."],["L7-0457","诚心诚意","chéngxīn-chéngyì","","wholeheartedly; sincerely","de todo corazón; sinceramente","de tout cœur; sincèrement","我们是诚心诚意来跟贵公司谈合作的。","wǒ men shì chéng xīn chéng yì lái gēn guì gōng sī tán hé zuò de","We have come in all sincerity to discuss cooperation with your company.","Hemos venido con total sinceridad a hablar con su empresa sobre una colaboración.","Nous sommes venus en toute sincérité discuter d'une coopération avec votre entreprise."],["L7-0458","诚意","chéngyì","N","sincerity; good faith","sinceridad; buena fe","sincérité; bonne foi","对方在谈判中拿出了足够的诚意，主动降低了价格。","duì fāng zài tán pàn zhōng ná chū le zú gòu de chéng yì zhǔ dòng jiàng dī le jià gé","The other side showed enough good faith in the negotiations and lowered the price on their own initiative.","La otra parte mostró suficiente buena voluntad en la negociación y redujo el precio por iniciativa propia.","L'autre partie a fait preuve d'une bonne volonté suffisante lors de la négociation et a baissé le prix de sa propre initiative."],["L7-0459","诚挚","chéngzhì","Adj","sincere; heartfelt","sincero; cordial","sincère; cordial","我谨代表全体员工，向各位来宾表示诚挚的欢迎。","wǒ jǐn dài biǎo quán tǐ yuán gōng xiàng gè wèi lái bīn biǎo shì chéng zhì de huān yíng","On behalf of all our staff, I would like to extend a warm and sincere welcome to all our guests.","En nombre de todo el personal, quisiera darles una cordial y sincera bienvenida a todos los invitados.","Au nom de l'ensemble du personnel, je tiens à souhaiter une cordiale et sincère bienvenue à tous nos invités."],["L7-0460","承包","chéngbāo","V","to contract; to undertake","contratar; asumir por contrato","prendre en charge; sous-traiter","他家承包了二十亩地，种的全是水稻。","tā jiā chéng bāo le èr shí mǔ dì zhòng de quán shì shuǐ dào","His family leases twenty mu of land, all planted with rice.","Su familia tiene en arriendo veinte mu de tierra, todas sembradas de arroz.","Sa famille exploite vingt mu de terres en contrat, entièrement plantées de riz."],["L7-0461","承载","chéngzài","V","to bear; to carry","soportar; cargar","supporter; porter","这座古城的街巷保留了旧日的格局，也承载着几代居民的共同记忆。","zhè zuò gǔ chéng de jiē xiàng bǎo liú le jiù rì de gé jú yě chéng zài zhe jǐ dài jū mín de gòng tóng jì yì","The lanes of this ancient town preserve its former layout and hold the shared memories of generations of residents.","Las calles y callejones de esta antigua ciudad conservan el trazado de antaño y también guardan la memoria compartida de varias generaciones de habitantes.","Les rues et ruelles de cette ancienne cité conservent leur tracé d'autrefois et portent aussi la mémoire commune de plusieurs générations d'habitants."],["L7-0462","城墙","chéngqiáng","N","city wall","muralla de la ciudad","rempart; muraille","古人用泥土和石头筑城墙。","gǔ rén yòng ní tǔ hé shí tou zhù chéng qiáng","People in ancient times built city walls with earth and stone.","En la antigüedad, la gente levantaba murallas con tierra y piedra.","Dans l'Antiquité, on construisait les remparts avec de la terre et des pierres."],["L7-0463","乘人之危","chéngrénzhīwēi","","to take advantage of sb's difficulty","aprovecharse del apuro ajeno","profiter de la détresse d'autrui","他在朋友最困难的时候低价收购房子，简直是乘人之危。","tā zài péng you zuì kùn nan de shí hou dī jià shōu gòu fáng zi jiǎn zhí shì chéng rén zhī wēi","He bought his friend's house at a low price when the friend was in the worst trouble; that was simply taking advantage of someone in distress.","Compró la casa a precio bajo en el peor momento de su amigo; eso es simplemente aprovecharse de la desgracia ajena.","Il a racheté la maison de son ami à bas prix au moment où celui-ci était au plus mal ; c'était tout simplement profiter de la détresse d'autrui."],["L7-0464","盛","chéng","V","to fill; to hold; to ladle","servir; contener; llenar","servir; contenir; remplir","妈妈给每个人都盛了一大碗热腾腾的米饭。","mā ma gěi měi ge rén dōu chéng le yí dà wǎn rè téng téng de mǐ fàn","Mom served each person a large bowl of steaming hot rice.","Mamá le sirvió a cada uno un gran tazón de arroz caliente y humeante.","Maman a servi à chacun un grand bol de riz tout chaud et fumant."],["L7-0465","惩处","chéngchǔ","V","to punish","castigar; sancionar","punir; sanctionner","对于酒后驾车的行为，交通部门将依法严厉惩处。","duì yú jiǔ hòu jià chē de xíng wéi jiāo tōng bù mén jiāng yī fǎ yán lì chéng chǔ","Traffic authorities will severely punish drunk driving according to law.","Las autoridades de tránsito sancionarán con severidad, conforme a la ley, a quienes conduzcan bajo los efectos del alcohol.","Les services de la circulation puniront sévèrement la conduite en état d'ivresse, conformément à la loi."],["L7-0466","惩罚","chéngfá","V/N","to punish; punishment","castigar; castigo","punir; punition","孩子犯了错，单纯的惩罚并不一定能让他真正改正。","hái zi fàn le cuò dān chún de chéng fá bìng bù yí dìng néng ràng tā zhēn zhèng gǎi zhèng","When a child makes a mistake, punishment alone won't necessarily make them truly change.","Cuando un niño comete un error, un simple castigo no siempre logra que realmente se corrija.","Quand un enfant fait une erreur, une simple punition ne suffit pas toujours à le faire véritablement s'amender."],["L7-0467","澄清","chéngqīng","V/Adj","to clarify; clear","aclarar; claro","clarifier; clair","公司发表声明，澄清了网上流传的不实消息。","gōng sī fā biǎo shēng míng chéng qīng le wǎng shàng liú chuán de bù shí xiāo xi","The company issued a statement clarifying the false information circulating online.","La empresa emitió un comunicado en el que aclaró la información falsa que circulaba en internet.","L'entreprise a publié un communiqué pour démentir les fausses informations qui circulaient sur internet."],["L7-0468","橙汁","chéngzhī","N","orange juice","zumo de naranja","jus d'orange","早餐时我习惯喝一杯鲜榨橙汁。","zǎo cān shí wǒ xí guàn hē yì bēi xiān zhà chéng zhī","At breakfast I usually drink a glass of freshly squeezed orange juice.","En el desayuno suelo tomar un vaso de jugo de naranja recién exprimido.","Au petit-déjeuner, j'ai l'habitude de boire un verre de jus d'orange pressé."],["L7-0469","逞能","chěngnéng","","to show off","alardear de sus habilidades","faire le malin; se vanter","你的腿伤还没好，就别逞能去爬山了。","nǐ de tuǐ shāng hái méi hǎo jiù bié chěng néng qù pá shān le","Your leg injury hasn't healed yet, so don't try to show off by going mountain climbing.","Todavía no te has curado la lesión de la pierna, así que no te hagas el valiente y vayas a escalar montañas.","Ta blessure à la jambe n'est pas encore guérie, alors ne fais pas le fier-à-bras en allant escalader la montagne."],["L7-0470","逞强","chěngqiáng","","to show off one's strength","presumir de fuerza","faire le fanfaron","他明明不会游泳，却非要逞强跳进深水区。","tā míng míng bú huì yóu yǒng què fēi yào chěng qiáng tiào jìn shēn shuǐ qū","He clearly can't swim, yet he insisted on acting tough and jumping into the deep end.","Claramente no sabe nadar, pero se empeñó en hacerse el fuerte y se lanzó a la parte honda.","Il ne sait manifestement pas nager, mais il a tenu à faire le brave et à sauter dans le grand bain."],["L7-0471","秤","chèng","N","scale; balance","balanza; báscula","balance; pesée","菜市场门口放着一杆公平秤，顾客可以自己复称。","cài shì chǎng mén kǒu fàng zhe yì gān gōng píng chèng gù kè kě yǐ zì jǐ fù chēng","There is a public scale at the entrance to the market so customers can weigh their purchases again themselves.","A la entrada del mercado hay una balanza pública, y los clientes pueden volver a pesar lo que compraron.","À l'entrée du marché se trouve une balance publique, et les clients peuvent peser de nouveau eux-mêmes leurs achats."],["L7-0472","吃不上","chī bushàng","V","unable to get to eat","no tener qué comer","ne pas pouvoir manger","那几年家里穷，有时候连一顿饱饭都吃不上。","nà jǐ nián jiā lǐ qióng yǒu shí hou lián yí dùn bǎo fàn dōu chī bu shàng","Those years our family was poor, and sometimes we couldn't even get a full meal.","En esos años la familia era pobre y a veces ni siquiera teníamos para una comida completa.","À cette époque, notre famille était pauvre et nous n'arrivions parfois même pas à manger à notre faim."],["L7-0473","吃喝玩乐","chī-hē-wán-lè","","to indulge in pleasures","darse a los placeres","mener une vie de plaisirs","他整天只知道吃喝玩乐，把父母给的钱都花光了。","tā zhěng tiān zhǐ zhī dào chī hē wán lè bǎ fù mǔ gěi de qián dōu huā guāng le","All he knew was eating, drinking and having fun, and he spent all the money his parents had given him.","Se pasaba todo el día pensando solo en comer, beber y divertirse, y se gastó todo el dinero que le dieron sus padres.","Il ne pensait qu'à manger, boire et s'amuser toute la journée, et il a dépensé tout l'argent que lui avaient donné ses parents."],["L7-0474","吃苦","chīkǔ","","to endure hardship","soportar penurias","endurer des épreuves","年轻人要有吃苦的精神，才能在困难面前坚持下去。","nián qīng rén yào yǒu chī kǔ de jīng shén cái néng zài kùn nan miàn qián jiān chí xià qù","Young people need the spirit to endure hardship so they can persevere in the face of difficulties.","Los jóvenes necesitan espíritu de sacrificio para poder perseverar ante las dificultades.","Les jeunes ont besoin d'endurance face aux épreuves pour persévérer devant les difficultés."],["L7-0475","吃亏","chīkuī","","to lose out; to be at a disadvantage","salir perdiendo; perjudicarse","être lésé; y perdre","跟他做生意要多留个心眼，不然很容易吃亏。","gēn tā zuò shēng yi yào duō liú gè xīn yǎn bù rán hěn róng yì chī kuī","Be on your guard when doing business with him, or you could easily lose out.","Cuando hagas negocios con él, ten cuidado, porque si no, es fácil que salgas perdiendo.","Soyez sur vos gardes en affaires avec lui, sinon vous risquez facilement d'y perdre."],["L7-0476","痴呆","chīdāi","Adj","dementia","demencia","démence","爷爷患上了老年痴呆，常常认不出自己的孙子。","yé ye huàn shang le lǎo nián chī dāi cháng cháng rèn bù chū zì jǐ de sūn zi","Grandpa developed senile dementia and often can't recognize his own grandson.","Mi abuelo desarrolló demencia senil y a menudo no reconoce ni a su propio nieto.","Mon grand-père souffre de démence sénile et ne reconnaît souvent même plus son propre petit-fils."],["L7-0477","痴迷","chīmí","V","infatuated; obsessed","obsesionado; fascinado","obsédé; passionné","她从小就痴迷于京剧，每个周末都去剧院听戏。","tā cóng xiǎo jiù chī mí yú jīng jù měi ge zhōu mò dōu qù jù yuàn tīng xì","She has been passionate about Peking opera since childhood and goes to the theater every weekend.","Desde pequeña le fascina la ópera de Pekín y cada fin de semana va al teatro a escucharla.","Depuis l'enfance, elle est passionnée d'opéra de Pékin et se rend au théâtre tous les week-ends pour l'écouter."],["L7-0478","痴心","chīxīn","N","infatuation; blind devotion","fervor ciego; devoción","passion aveugle; dévotion","他对她一片痴心，等了她整整十年。","tā duì tā yí piàn chī xīn děng le tā zhěng zhěng shí nián","He was utterly devoted to her and waited for her for a full ten years.","Estaba perdidamente enamorado de ella y la esperó diez años enteros.","Il lui était entièrement dévoué et l'a attendue dix années entières."],["L7-0479","池塘","chítáng","N","pond","estanque","étang","夏天的夜晚，池塘边的青蛙叫个不停。","xià tiān de yè wǎn chí táng biān de qīng wā jiào gè bù tíng","On summer nights, the frogs by the pond croak endlessly.","En las noches de verano, las ranas junto al estanque no dejan de croar.","Les nuits d'été, les grenouilles au bord de l'étang coassent sans arrêt."],["L7-0480","驰名","chímíng","V","famous; renowned","famoso; renombrado","célèbre; renommé","这里出产的绿茶驰名中外，每年都出口到许多国家。","zhè lǐ chū chǎn de lǜ chá chí míng zhōng wài měi nián dōu chū kǒu dào xǔ duō guó jiā","The green tea produced here is famous at home and abroad and is exported to many countries every year.","El té verde que se produce aquí es famoso dentro y fuera del país y se exporta cada año a muchos países.","Le thé vert produit ici est célèbre en Chine comme à l'étranger et est exporté chaque année dans de nombreux pays."],["L7-0481","迟迟","chíchí","Adv","slowly; late","con retraso; tardíamente","tardivement; lentement","报名已经截止一周了，录取结果却迟迟没有公布。","bào míng yǐ jīng jié zhǐ yì zhōu le lù qǔ jié guǒ què chí chí méi yǒu gōng bù","Registration closed a week ago, yet the admission results still haven't been announced.","Hace una semana que se cerró la inscripción y los resultados de admisión todavía no se han publicado.","Les inscriptions sont closes depuis une semaine, mais les résultats d'admission tardent à être publiés."],["L7-0482","迟疑","chíyí","Adj","to hesitate","dudar; vacilar","hésiter","听到这个问题，他迟疑了一下，才慢慢说出了真相。","tīng dào zhè ge wèn tí tā chí yí le yí xià cái màn màn shuō chū le zhēn xiàng","Hearing the question, he hesitated for a moment before slowly telling the truth.","Al oír la pregunta, dudó un instante y luego dijo despacio la verdad.","En entendant la question, il a hésité un instant avant de dire lentement la vérité."],["L7-0483","迟早","chízǎo","Adv","sooner or later","tarde o temprano","tôt ou tard","纸是包不住火的，这件事迟早会被大家知道。","zhǐ shì bāo bu zhù huǒ de zhè jiàn shì chí zǎo huì bèi dà jiā zhī dào","You can't wrap fire in paper; sooner or later everyone will find out about this.","La verdad siempre sale a la luz; tarde o temprano todos se enterarán de esto.","On ne peut pas envelopper le feu dans du papier ; tôt ou tard, tout le monde apprendra cela."],["L7-0484","持","chí","V","to hold; to maintain","sostener; mantener","tenir; maintenir","对于这项新政策，不少专家持保留意见。","duì yú zhè xiàng xīn zhèng cè bù shǎo zhuān jiā chí bǎo liú yì jiàn","Many experts have reservations about this new policy.","Muchos expertos tienen reservas sobre esta nueva política.","De nombreux experts émettent des réserves sur cette nouvelle politique."],["L7-0485","持久","chíjiǔ","Adj","lasting; enduring","duradero; persistente","durable; persistant","这场干旱十分持久，农作物大面积减产。","zhè chǎng gān hàn shí fēn chí jiǔ nóng zuò wù dà miàn jī jiǎn chǎn","The drought has lasted a very long time, and crop yields have fallen across large areas.","Esta sequía ha sido muy prolongada y la producción de cultivos ha caído en grandes áreas.","Cette sécheresse a été très longue, et les récoltes ont baissé sur de vastes zones."],["L7-0486","持之以恒","chízhī-yǐhéng","","to persevere","perseverar","persévérer","即使暂时落后，也不必妄自菲薄；持之以恒的练习往往比急于求成更有效。","jí shǐ zàn shí luò hòu yě bú bì wàng zì fěi bó chí zhī yǐ héng de liàn xí wǎng wǎng bǐ jí yú qiú chéng gèng yǒu xiào","Even if you fall behind for a while, there is no need to belittle yourself; persistent practice is often more effective than seeking quick success.","Aunque por ahora vayas rezagado, no hace falta que te menosprecies; la práctica constante suele ser más eficaz que la prisa por obtener resultados.","Même si l'on est momentanément en retard, il n'y a pas lieu de se rabaisser ; une pratique persévérante est souvent plus efficace que la hâte d'obtenir des résultats."],["L7-0487","尺度","chǐdù","N","scale; yardstick","medida; criterio","mesure; critère","电影审查的尺度在不同国家差别很大。","diàn yǐng shěn chá de chǐ dù zài bù tóng guó jiā chā bié hěn dà","The standards of film censorship vary greatly from country to country.","El grado de censura cinematográfica varía mucho de un país a otro.","Le degré de censure cinématographique varie beaucoup d'un pays à l'autre."],["L7-0488","耻辱","chǐrǔ","N","disgrace; humiliation","vergüenza; humillación","honte; humiliation","考试作弊被抓，对他来说是一种莫大的耻辱。","kǎo shì zuò bì bèi zhuā duì tā lái shuō shì yì zhǒng mò dà de chǐ rǔ","Being caught cheating on the exam was an enormous disgrace for him.","Que lo atraparan copiando en el examen fue para él una humillación enorme.","Être surpris à tricher à l'examen a été pour lui une immense humiliation."],["L7-0489","耻笑","chǐxiào","V","to ridicule; to sneer at","ridiculizar; burlarse de","ridiculiser; se moquer de","他担心自己说错话被人耻笑，所以在会上一言不发。","tā dān xīn zì jǐ shuō cuò huà bèi rén chǐ xiào suǒ yǐ zài huì shàng yì yán bù fā","He was afraid of being ridiculed if he said something wrong, so he didn't say a word at the meeting.","Temía que se burlaran de él si decía algo equivocado, así que no dijo ni una palabra en la reunión.","Craignant qu'on se moque de lui s'il disait une bêtise, il n'a pas dit un mot pendant la réunion."],["L7-0490","赤字","chìzì","N","deficit","déficit","déficit","由于收入减少，这个城市的财政连续两年出现赤字。","yóu yú shōu rù jiǎn shǎo zhè ge chéng shì de cái zhèng lián xù liǎng nián chū xiàn chì zì","Because of falling revenue, the city's finances have run a deficit for two years in a row.","Debido a la caída de los ingresos, las finanzas de esta ciudad han registrado déficit durante dos años seguidos.","En raison de la baisse des recettes, les finances de cette ville sont déficitaires depuis deux ans."],["L7-0491","翅膀","chìbǎng","N","wing","ala","aile","小鸟受伤的翅膀慢慢恢复了，终于又能飞了。","xiǎo niǎo shòu shāng de chì bǎng màn màn huī fù le zhōng yú yòu néng fēi le","The little bird's injured wing gradually healed, and it could finally fly again.","El ala herida del pajarito se fue recuperando poco a poco y por fin pudo volver a volar.","L'aile blessée du petit oiseau s'est peu à peu rétablie, et il a enfin pu voler de nouveau."],["L7-0492","冲刺","chōngcì","V","to sprint; to make a final push","esprintar; hacer un último esfuerzo","sprinter; fournir un dernier effort","离高考只剩一个月了，同学们都进入了最后的冲刺阶段。","lí gāo kǎo zhǐ shèng yí ge yuè le tóng xué men dōu jìn rù le zuì hòu de chōng cì jiē duàn","With only a month left before the college entrance exam, the students have all entered the final sprint.","Falta solo un mes para el examen de ingreso a la universidad y todos los compañeros han entrado en la recta final.","Il ne reste qu'un mois avant le concours d'entrée à l'université, et tous les élèves sont entrés dans la dernière ligne droite."],["L7-0493","冲浪","chōnglàng","V","to surf; surfing","surfear; surf","surfer; surf","夏天，很多年轻人到海南学习冲浪。","xià tiān hěn duō nián qīng rén dào hǎi nán xué xí chōng làng","In summer, many young people go to Hainan to learn to surf.","En verano, muchos jóvenes van a Hainan a aprender a surfear.","En été, beaucoup de jeunes se rendent à Hainan pour apprendre le surf."],["L7-0494","冲洗","chōngxǐ","V","to rinse; to develop film","enjuagar; revelar fotos","rincer; développer","做完实验后，要用清水把试管冲洗干净。","zuò wán shí yàn hòu yào yòng qīng shuǐ bǎ shì guǎn chōng xǐ gān jìng","After the experiment, rinse the test tubes clean with water.","Después de terminar el experimento, hay que enjuagar bien los tubos de ensayo con agua limpia.","Après l'expérience, il faut rincer les tubes à essai à l'eau claire."],["L7-0495","冲撞","chōngzhuàng","V","to collide; to offend","chocar; ofender","heurter; offenser","他一时冲动，说话冲撞了老师，事后很后悔。","tā yì shí chōng dòng shuō huà chōng zhuàng le lǎo shī shì hòu hěn hòu huǐ","On an impulse he said something that offended his teacher, and afterwards he deeply regretted it.","En un arrebato le habló mal al maestro y después se arrepintió mucho.","Sur un coup de tête, il a tenu des propos qui ont heurté son professeur, et il l'a beaucoup regretté ensuite."],["L7-0496","充","chōng","V","to fill; to serve as; to pose as","llenar; hacer de; hacerse pasar por","remplir; faire office de; se faire passer pour","手机快没电了，我得找个插座充一下电。","shǒu jī kuài méi diàn le wǒ děi zhǎo gè chā zuò chōng yí xià diàn","My phone is almost out of battery, so I need to find an outlet to charge it for a bit.","Al celular casi no le queda batería; tengo que buscar un enchufe para cargarlo un rato.","Mon téléphone n'a presque plus de batterie ; il faut que je trouve une prise pour le recharger un moment."],["L7-0497","充当","chōngdāng","V","to act as; to serve as","actuar como; hacer de","servir de; faire office de","这次出国旅行，懂外语的姐姐充当了全家的翻译。","zhè cì chū guó lǚ xíng dǒng wài yǔ de jiě jie chōng dāng le quán jiā de fān yì","On this trip abroad, my older sister, who speaks foreign languages, acted as the family's interpreter.","En este viaje al extranjero, mi hermana mayor, que sabe idiomas, hizo de intérprete de toda la familia.","Pour ce voyage à l'étranger, ma sœur aînée, qui parle des langues étrangères, a servi d'interprète à toute la famille."],["L7-0498","充沛","chōngpèi","Adj","abundant; vigorous","abundante; vigoroso","abondant; vigoureux","经过一夜的休息，大家又变得精神充沛了。","jīng guò yí yè de xiū xi dà jiā yòu biàn de jīng shén chōng pèi le","After a night's rest, everyone was full of energy again.","Después de una noche de descanso, todos volvieron a estar llenos de energía.","Après une nuit de repos, tout le monde était de nouveau plein d'énergie."],["L7-0499","充实","chōngshí","Adj/V","rich; substantial; to enrich","pleno; sustancioso; enriquecer","riche; substantiel; enrichir","退休以后，他每天读书、练字、做志愿者，生活过得很充实。","tuì xiū yǐ hòu tā měi tiān dú shū liàn zì zuò zhì yuàn zhě shēng huó guò de hěn chōng shí","After retiring, he reads, practices calligraphy and volunteers every day, so his life is very full.","Después de jubilarse, lee, practica caligrafía y hace voluntariado todos los días, y lleva una vida muy plena.","Depuis sa retraite, il lit, pratique la calligraphie et fait du bénévolat chaque jour ; sa vie est très remplie."],["L7-0500","重播","chóngbō","V","to replay; to rerun","repetir; volver a emitir","rediffuser; rejouer","昨晚的足球比赛我没看成，只好等今天的重播。","zuó wǎn de zú qiú bǐ sài wǒ méi kàn chéng zhǐ hǎo děng jīn tiān de chóng bō","I didn't get to watch last night's football match, so I'll have to wait for today's rerun.","Anoche no pude ver el partido de fútbol, así que tendré que esperar la repetición de hoy.","Je n'ai pas pu voir le match de football d'hier soir, il me faudra donc attendre la rediffusion d'aujourd'hui."],["L7-0501","重叠","chóngdié","V","to overlap","superponerse; solaparse","se chevaucher; se superposer","两位老师的上课时间重叠了，学生只能选其中一门课。","liǎng wèi lǎo shī de shàng kè shí jiān chóng dié le xué shēng zhǐ néng xuǎn qí zhōng yì mén kè","The two teachers' class times overlap, so students can choose only one of the courses.","Los horarios de clase de los dos profesores se superponen, así que los alumnos solo pueden elegir una de las dos materias.","Les horaires de cours des deux professeurs se chevauchent, si bien que les élèves ne peuvent choisir que l'un des deux cours."],["L7-0502","重返","chóngfǎn","V","to return to","volver a","retourner à; revenir à","重返母校，他心中有很多感触。","chóng fǎn mǔ xiào tā xīn zhōng yǒu hěn duō gǎn chù","Returning to his old school, he was stirred by many feelings.","Al volver a su antigua escuela, sintió muchas emociones.","De retour dans son ancienne école, il a ressenti beaucoup d'émotions."],["L7-0503","重合","chónghé","V","to coincide; to overlap","coincidir","coïncider; se superposer","把这两张图纸叠在一起，你会发现线条几乎完全重合。","bǎ zhè liǎng zhāng tú zhǐ dié zài yì qǐ nǐ huì fā xiàn xiàn tiáo jī hū wán quán chóng hé","If you lay these two drawings on top of each other, you'll find that the lines coincide almost exactly.","Si superpones estos dos planos, verás que las líneas coinciden casi por completo.","Si tu superposes ces deux plans, tu verras que les lignes coïncident presque parfaitement."],["L7-0504","重申","chóngshēn","V","to reaffirm; to reiterate","reafirmar; reiterar","réaffirmer; réitérer","外交部发言人在记者会上重申了政府的一贯立场。","wài jiāo bù fā yán rén zài jì zhě huì shàng chóng shēn le zhèng fǔ de yí guàn lì chǎng","At the press conference, the foreign ministry spokesperson reaffirmed the government's consistent position.","En la rueda de prensa, el portavoz del Ministerio de Relaciones Exteriores reiteró la postura constante del gobierno.","Lors de la conférence de presse, le porte-parole du ministère des Affaires étrangères a réaffirmé la position constante du gouvernement."],["L7-0505","重现","chóngxiàn","V","to reappear","reaparecer","réapparaître","这部电影用大量细节重现了上世纪的城市生活。","zhè bù diàn yǐng yòng dà liàng xì jié chóng xiàn le shàng shì jì de chéng shì shēng huó","This film uses a wealth of detail to recreate city life in the last century.","Esta película recrea, con una gran cantidad de detalles, la vida urbana del siglo pasado.","Ce film recrée, grâce à une multitude de détails, la vie urbaine du siècle dernier."],["L7-0506","崇高","chónggāo","Adj","lofty; sublime","elevado; sublime","noble; sublime","救死扶伤是医生的职责，这个职业十分崇高。","jiù sǐ fú shāng shì yī shēng de zhí zé zhè ge zhí yè shí fēn chóng gāo","Doctors have a duty to save lives and treat the wounded; theirs is a noble profession.","Salvar vidas y atender a los heridos es el deber de un médico; es una profesión muy noble.","Sauver des vies et soigner les blessés est le devoir du médecin ; c'est une profession très noble."],["L7-0507","崇尚","chóngshàng","V","to esteem; to advocate","valorar; defender","priser; prôner","这个民族自古以来就崇尚勤劳节俭。","zhè ge mín zú zì gǔ yǐ lái jiù chóng shàng qín láo jié jiǎn","Since ancient times this people has held hard work and thrift in high esteem.","Desde la antigüedad, este pueblo ha valorado el trabajo duro y la austeridad.","Depuis l'Antiquité, ce peuple tient en haute estime le travail acharné et la frugalité."],["L7-0508","宠","chǒng","V","to dote on; to spoil","mimar; consentir","chouchouter; gâter","奶奶太宠孙子了，孩子要什么就给什么。","nǎi nai tài chǒng sūn zi le hái zi yào shén me jiù gěi shén me","Grandma spoils her grandson too much; she gives the child whatever he wants.","La abuela consiente demasiado a su nieto: le da todo lo que él pide.","Grand-mère gâte trop son petit-fils : elle lui donne tout ce qu'il demande."],["L7-0509","宠爱","chǒng'ài","V","to dote on; to favor","querer con mimo; favorecer","chérir; choyer","这只小狗深受全家人的宠爱，每天都有人陪它散步。","zhè zhī xiǎo gǒu shēn shòu quán jiā rén de chǒng ài měi tiān dōu yǒu rén péi tā sàn bù","This little dog is doted on by the whole family, and someone takes it for a walk every day.","Este perrito es muy querido por toda la familia y todos los días alguien lo saca a pasear.","Ce petit chien est adoré de toute la famille, et quelqu'un l'emmène se promener tous les jours."],["L7-0510","抽签","chōuqiān","","to draw lots","echar a suertes; sortear","tirer au sort","比赛分组将通过抽签决定，以保证公平。","bǐ sài fēn zǔ jiāng tōng guò chōu qiān jué dìng yǐ bǎo zhèng gōng píng","The groups for the competition will be decided by drawing lots to ensure fairness.","La formación de los grupos de la competencia se decidirá por sorteo para garantizar la equidad.","La composition des groupes de la compétition sera décidée par tirage au sort afin de garantir l'équité."],["L7-0511","抽屉","chōuti","N","drawer","cajón","tiroir","打开抽屉，一份失踪多年的合同赫然出现在眼前。","dǎ kāi chōu ti yí fèn shī zōng duō nián de hé tóng hè rán chū xiàn zài yǎn qián","When he opened the drawer, a contract missing for years suddenly appeared before his eyes.","Al abrir el cajón, apareció de pronto ante sus ojos un contrato que llevaba años perdido.","En ouvrant le tiroir, un contrat disparu depuis des années est soudain apparu sous ses yeux."],["L7-0512","抽象","chōuxiàng","Adj","abstract","abstracto","abstrait","老师用一个生活中的比喻，帮助学生理解抽象的概念。","lǎo shī yòng yí ge shēng huó zhōng de bǐ yù bāng zhù xué shēng lǐ jiě chōu xiàng de gài niàn","The teacher used a metaphor drawn from everyday life to help the students understand an abstract concept.","El maestro usó una metáfora de la vida cotidiana para ayudar a los alumnos a entender un concepto abstracto.","Le professeur a employé une métaphore tirée de la vie quotidienne pour aider les élèves à comprendre un concept abstrait."],["L7-0513","仇","chóu","N","hatred; enemy","odio; enemigo","haine; ennemi","他们俩以前到底有什么仇，见面连招呼都不打？","tā men liǎ yǐ qián dào dǐ yǒu shén me chóu jiàn miàn lián zhāo hu dōu bù dǎ","What grudge do those two have against each other that they won't even say hello when they meet?","¿Qué rencor tenían esos dos en el pasado que ni siquiera se saludan cuando se ven?","Quelle rancune ces deux-là ont-ils donc l'un envers l'autre pour ne même pas se saluer quand ils se croisent ?"],["L7-0514","仇恨","chóuhèn","V/N","to hate; hatred","odiar; odio","haïr; haine","战争在两个民族之间留下了深深的仇恨。","zhàn zhēng zài liǎng gè mín zú zhī jiān liú xià le shēn shēn de chóu hèn","The war left deep hatred between the two peoples.","La guerra dejó un profundo odio entre los dos pueblos.","La guerre a laissé une profonde haine entre les deux peuples."],["L7-0515","仇人","chóurén","N","enemy; foe","enemigo; rival","ennemi; adversaire","他们俩原本是好朋友，却因为一点小事成了仇人。","tā men liǎ yuán běn shì hǎo péng you què yīn wèi yì diǎn xiǎo shì chéng le chóu rén","The two of them used to be good friends, but they became enemies over a trivial matter.","Los dos eran buenos amigos, pero por una tontería se convirtieron en enemigos.","Ces deux-là étaient de bons amis, mais pour une broutille ils sont devenus ennemis."],["L7-0516","稠","chóu","Adj","thick; dense","espeso; denso","épais; dense","这锅粥熬得太稠了，再加点水吧。","zhè guō zhōu áo de tài chóu le zài jiā diǎn shuǐ ba","This pot of porridge has been cooked too thick, so add some more water.","Esta olla de congee quedó demasiado espesa; agrégale un poco más de agua.","Cette marmite de bouillie de riz est trop épaisse ; ajoute un peu d'eau."],["L7-0517","稠密","chóumì","Adj","dense","denso; densamente poblado","dense","这一带人口稠密，交通压力一直很大。","zhè yí dài rén kǒu chóu mì jiāo tōng yā lì yì zhí hěn dà","This area is densely populated, and traffic pressure has always been heavy.","Esta zona está muy densamente poblada y la presión del tráfico siempre ha sido enorme.","Ce quartier est très densément peuplé, et la pression de la circulation y a toujours été forte."],["L7-0518","愁眉苦脸","chóuméi-kǔliǎn","","with a gloomy face","con cara de preocupación","l'air sombre; la mine soucieuse","考试成绩出来以后，他整天愁眉苦脸的。","kǎo shì chéng jì chū lái yǐ hòu tā zhěng tiān chóu méi kǔ liǎn de","After the exam results came out, he went around looking miserable all day.","Desde que salieron los resultados del examen, anda con cara de preocupación todo el día.","Depuis la publication des résultats de l'examen, il a la mine sombre toute la journée."],["L7-0519","筹","chóu","V","to raise; to plan; token","reunir; planear; ficha","rassembler; planifier; jeton","为了给女儿治病，他四处奔走，好不容易才筹够了手术费。","wèi le gěi nǚ ér zhì bìng tā sì chù bēn zǒu hǎo bù róng yì cái chóu gòu le shǒu shù fèi","To get treatment for his daughter, he ran around everywhere and finally managed to raise enough for the operation.","Para curar a su hija, corrió de un lado a otro y con mucho esfuerzo logró reunir lo necesario para la operación.","Pour soigner sa fille, il a couru partout et a eu bien du mal à réunir la somme nécessaire à l'opération."],["L7-0520","筹办","chóubàn","V","to organize; to prepare","organizar; preparar","organiser; préparer","学生会正在筹办一场新年晚会。","xué shēng huì zhèng zài chóu bàn yì chǎng xīn nián wǎn huì","The student union is organizing a New Year's party.","La asociación de estudiantes está organizando una fiesta de Año Nuevo.","Le bureau des étudiants prépare une soirée du Nouvel An."],["L7-0521","筹备","chóubèi","V","to prepare; preparations","preparar; preparativos","préparer; préparatifs","这届运动会已经筹备了两年，各项工作基本就绪。","zhè jiè yùn dòng huì yǐ jīng chóu bèi le liǎng nián gè xiàng gōng zuò jī běn jiù xù","Preparations for this sports meet have been under way for two years, and nearly everything is ready.","Los preparativos de estos Juegos Deportivos llevan dos años y casi todo está listo.","Les préparatifs de ces Jeux sportifs durent depuis deux ans, et presque tout est prêt."],["L7-0522","筹措","chóucuò","V","to raise (funds)","reunir (fondos)","réunir (des fonds)","为了扩大生产，工厂正在想办法筹措资金。","wèi le kuò dà shēng chǎn gōng chǎng zhèng zài xiǎng bàn fǎ chóu cuò zī jīn","In order to expand production, the factory is looking for ways to raise funds.","Para ampliar la producción, la fábrica busca la manera de conseguir fondos.","Afin d'augmenter sa production, l'usine cherche des moyens de réunir des fonds."],["L7-0523","筹划","chóuhuà","V/N","to plan; to plan and prepare","planificar; trazar planes","planifier; organiser","他们早在半年前就开始筹划这次婚礼了。","tā men zǎo zài bàn nián qián jiù kāi shǐ chóu huà zhè cì hūn lǐ le","They started planning this wedding as early as six months ago.","Empezaron a planear esta boda desde hace medio año.","Ils ont commencé à préparer ce mariage dès il y a six mois."],["L7-0524","筹集","chóují","V","to raise funds","recaudar fondos","collecter des fonds","这场慈善晚会为山区儿童筹集了大量善款。","zhè chǎng cí shàn wǎn huì wèi shān qū ér tóng chóu jí le dà liàng shàn kuǎn","This charity gala raised substantial funds for children in mountainous areas.","Esta gala benéfica recaudó una gran cantidad de donaciones para los niños de las zonas montañosas.","Ce gala de charité a permis de collecter beaucoup de dons pour les enfants des régions de montagne."],["L7-0525","筹码","chóumǎ","N","chip; bargaining chip","ficha; baza de negociación","jeton; moyen de pression","掌握了核心技术，公司在谈判中就多了一个重要筹码。","zhǎng wò le hé xīn jì shù gōng sī zài tán pàn zhōng jiù duō le yí ge zhòng yào chóu mǎ","Having mastered the core technology, the company gained an important bargaining chip in the negotiations.","Al dominar la tecnología clave, la empresa tiene una importante carta bajo la manga en la negociación.","En maîtrisant la technologie clé, l'entreprise dispose d'un important atout dans les négociations."],["L7-0526","丑恶","chǒu'è","Adj","ugly; repulsive","repugnante; feo","laid; répugnant","这部小说揭露了官场中种种丑恶的现象。","zhè bù xiǎo shuō jiē lù le guān chǎng zhōng zhǒng zhǒng chǒu è de xiàn xiàng","This novel exposes all kinds of ugly practices in officialdom.","Esta novela expone toda clase de fenómenos repugnantes del mundo burocrático.","Ce roman dénonce toutes sortes de pratiques répugnantes dans le milieu des fonctionnaires."],["L7-0527","丑陋","chǒulòu","Adj","ugly","feo","laid","这座建筑外形丑陋，和周围的古城风格很不协调。","zhè zuò jiàn zhù wài xíng chǒu lòu hé zhōu wéi de gǔ chéng fēng gé hěn bù xié tiáo","This building looks ugly and clashes badly with the style of the surrounding old town.","Este edificio tiene un aspecto feo y desentona mucho con el estilo de la ciudad antigua que lo rodea.","Ce bâtiment est laid et jure fortement avec le style de la vieille ville qui l'entoure."],["L7-0528","丑闻","chǒuwén","N","scandal","escándalo","scandale","这起财务丑闻曝光后，公司的股价一路下跌。","zhè qǐ cái wù chǒu wén bào guāng hòu gōng sī de gǔ jià yí lù xià diē","After the financial scandal came to light, the company's share price kept falling.","Después de que salió a la luz este escándalo financiero, las acciones de la empresa cayeron sin parar.","Après la révélation de ce scandale financier, le cours de l'action de l'entreprise n'a cessé de chuter."],["L7-0529","瞅","chǒu","V","to look at","mirar","regarder","你瞅瞅这孩子，脸上全是泥。","nǐ chǒu chǒu zhè hái zi liǎn shàng quán shì ní","Take a look at this kid; his face is covered in mud.","Mira a este niño, tiene la cara llena de lodo.","Regarde un peu cet enfant, il a le visage plein de boue."],["L7-0530","出版社","chūbǎnshè","N","publishing house","editorial","maison d'édition","她的第一部小说被一家大出版社看中，明年就要出版了。","tā de dì yī bù xiǎo shuō bèi yì jiā dà chū bǎn shè kàn zhòng míng nián jiù yào chū bǎn le","A major publishing house took an interest in her first novel, and it will be published next year.","Una gran editorial se interesó en su primera novela y se publicará el año próximo.","Une grande maison d'édition s'est intéressée à son premier roman, qui paraîtra l'an prochain."],["L7-0531","出厂","chūchǎng","","to leave the factory","salir de fábrica","sortir d'usine","每台冰箱出厂前都要经过严格的质量检测。","měi tái bīng xiāng chū chǎng qián dōu yào jīng guò yán gé de zhì liàng jiǎn cè","Every refrigerator goes through strict quality inspection before it leaves the factory.","Cada refrigerador pasa por una estricta inspección de calidad antes de salir de la fábrica.","Chaque réfrigérateur subit un contrôle qualité rigoureux avant de quitter l'usine."],["L7-0532","出丑","chūchǒu","","to make a fool of oneself","hacer el ridículo","se ridiculiser","他第一次上台演讲，紧张得说不出话，很怕当众出丑。","tā dì yī cì shàng tái yǎn jiǎng jǐn zhāng de shuō bu chū huà hěn pà dāng zhòng chū chǒu","The first time he gave a speech on stage, he was so nervous he couldn't speak and was terrified of embarrassing himself in public.","La primera vez que dio un discurso en el escenario, estaba tan nervioso que no podía hablar y temía hacer el ridículo ante todos.","La première fois qu'il a fait un discours sur scène, il était si nerveux qu'il n'arrivait plus à parler et redoutait de se ridiculiser en public."],["L7-0533","出道","chūdào","","to debut; to start one's career","debutar; iniciar la carrera","débuter; commencer sa carrière","这位歌手十六岁出道，至今已经发行了十张专辑。","zhè wèi gē shǒu shí liù suì chū dào zhì jīn yǐ jīng fā xíng le shí zhāng zhuān jí","This singer debuted at sixteen and has released ten albums so far.","Este cantante debutó a los dieciséis años y hasta ahora ha lanzado diez álbumes.","Ce chanteur a débuté à seize ans et a sorti dix albums à ce jour."],["L7-0534","出发点","chūfādiǎn","N","starting point; motive","punto de partida; motivación","point de départ; motivation","父母的出发点是好的，可是方法用得不对。","fù mǔ de chū fā diǎn shì hǎo de kě shì fāng fǎ yòng de bú duì","The parents' intentions were good, but their methods were wrong.","Los padres tenían buenas intenciones, pero usaron un método equivocado.","Les parents partaient d'un bon sentiment, mais leur méthode n'était pas la bonne."],["L7-0535","出风头","chū fēngtou","","to show off; to seek the limelight","lucirse; buscar protagonismo","se mettre en avant; chercher la gloire","他在会上总爱出风头，同事们对他意见很大。","tā zài huì shàng zǒng ài chū fēng tou tóng shì men duì tā yì jiàn hěn dà","He always likes to grab the spotlight in meetings, and his colleagues resent him for it.","Siempre quiere lucirse en las reuniones y sus compañeros están muy molestos con él.","Il aime toujours se faire remarquer pendant les réunions, et ses collègues lui en veulent beaucoup."],["L7-0536","出境","chūjìng","","to leave the country","salir del país","quitter le pays","办理出境手续时，旅客需要出示有效证件。","bàn lǐ chū jìng shǒu xù shí lǚ kè xū yào chū shì yǒu xiào zhèng jiàn","When going through exit procedures, travelers need to show valid identification.","Al hacer los trámites de salida del país, los viajeros deben presentar un documento válido.","Pour accomplir les formalités de sortie du territoire, les voyageurs doivent présenter une pièce d'identité valide."],["L7-0537","出局","chūjú","","to be out; to be eliminated","quedar eliminado","être éliminé","这支球队在小组赛中就意外出局了。","zhè zhī qiú duì zài xiǎo zǔ sài zhōng jiù yì wài chū jú le","This team was unexpectedly eliminated in the group stage.","Este equipo quedó eliminado inesperadamente ya en la fase de grupos.","Cette équipe a été éliminée de façon inattendue dès la phase de groupes."],["L7-0538","出具","chūjù","V","to issue; to provide","expedir; emitir","délivrer; fournir","申请签证时，银行需要为你出具一份存款证明。","shēn qǐng qiān zhèng shí yín háng xū yào wèi nǐ chū jù yí fèn cún kuǎn zhèng míng","When you apply for a visa, the bank needs to issue you a document confirming your bank deposits.","Al solicitar la visa, el banco tiene que emitirte una constancia de tus depósitos.","Lors d'une demande de visa, la banque doit vous délivrer une attestation de dépôt."],["L7-0539","出口成章","chūkǒu-chéngzhāng","","eloquent; fluent in speech","hablar con elocuencia","parler avec éloquence","这位老先生学问渊博，说起话来出口成章。","zhè wèi lǎo xiān sheng xué wèn yuān bó shuō qǐ huà lái chū kǒu chéng zhāng","This old gentleman is very learned, and when he speaks, his words flow eloquently.","Este anciano es muy erudito y habla con elocuencia, como si cada frase fuera una obra literaria.","Ce vieux monsieur est très érudit, et il s'exprime avec une éloquence naturelle."],["L7-0540","出卖","chūmài","V","to sell out; to betray","traicionar; vender","trahir; vendre","为了一点儿钱出卖朋友，真是可悲。","wèi le yì diǎnr qián chū mài péng you zhēn shì kě bēi","Betraying a friend for a little money is truly pathetic.","Traicionar a un amigo por un poco de dinero es verdaderamente lamentable.","Trahir un ami pour un peu d'argent est vraiment déplorable."],["L7-0541","出毛病","chū máobìng","","to break down; to have a problem","averiarse; tener un problema","tomber en panne; avoir un problème","这台旧电脑最近老出毛病，开机要等好几分钟。","zhè tái jiù diàn nǎo zuì jìn lǎo chū máo bìng kāi jī yào děng hǎo jǐ fēn zhōng","This old computer keeps acting up lately; it takes several minutes to start up.","Esta vieja computadora últimamente falla a cada rato y tarda varios minutos en encenderse.","Ce vieil ordinateur tombe sans cesse en panne ces temps-ci, et il met plusieurs minutes à démarrer."],["L7-0542","出难题","chū nántí","","to pose a tough problem","plantear un problema difícil","poser une question difficile","面试官故意给他出难题，想看看他的应变能力。","miàn shì guān gù yì gěi tā chū nán tí xiǎng kàn kan tā de yìng biàn néng lì","The interviewer deliberately gave him a tough question to see how well he could think on his feet.","El entrevistador le puso a propósito un problema difícil para ver su capacidad de reacción.","L'examinateur lui a volontairement posé une question difficile pour voir sa capacité de réaction."],["L7-0543","出人意料","chūrényìliào","","unexpected","inesperado","inattendu","这部小说的构思很巧妙，结局完全出人意料。","zhè bù xiǎo shuō de gòu sī hěn qiǎo miào jié jú wán quán chū rén yì liào","The plot of this novel is cleverly conceived, and the ending is completely unexpected.","La trama de esta novela está muy bien pensada y el final es totalmente inesperado.","L'intrigue de ce roman est très ingénieusement conçue, et la fin est tout à fait inattendue."],["L7-0544","出任","chūrèn","V","to take up a post","asumir un cargo","assumer un poste","她从明年起将出任这所大学的校长。","tā cóng míng nián qǐ jiāng chū rèn zhè suǒ dà xué de xiào zhǎng","Starting next year, she will take office as president of this university.","A partir del año que viene ella asumirá como rectora de esta universidad.","À partir de l'année prochaine, elle occupera le poste de présidente de cette université."],["L7-0545","出山","chūshān","","to come out of seclusion","salir del retiro; aceptar un cargo","sortir de sa retraite","在大家的再三邀请下，退休多年的老厨师终于答应出山。","zài dà jiā de zài sān yāo qǐng xià tuì xiū duō nián de lǎo chú shī zhōng yú dā ying chū shān","After repeated invitations from everyone, the old chef who had been retired for years finally agreed to come out of retirement.","Tras la insistencia de todos, el viejo cocinero, jubilado desde hacía años, aceptó por fin volver al trabajo.","Après les invitations répétées de tous, le vieux cuisinier, retraité depuis des années, a enfin accepté de reprendre du service."],["L7-0546","出身","chūshēn","V/N","family background; to come from","origen; ser originario de","origine; être issu de","她因为出身富贵而显得十分高傲，不愿和普通人交往。","tā yīn wèi chū shēn fù guì ér xiǎn de shí fēn gāo ào bú yuàn hé pǔ tōng rén jiāo wǎng","Because she came from a wealthy family, she was very haughty and didn't want to mix with ordinary people.","Como proviene de una familia adinerada, parece muy altiva y no quiere tratar con la gente común.","Issue d'une famille riche, elle paraît très hautaine et ne veut pas fréquenter les gens ordinaires."],["L7-0547","出示","chūshì","V","to show; to produce","mostrar; presentar","présenter; montrer","进入会场前，请出示您的门票。","jìn rù huì chǎng qián qǐng chū shì nín de mén piào","Please show your ticket before entering the venue.","Por favor, muestre su entrada antes de ingresar al recinto.","Veuillez présenter votre billet avant d'entrer dans la salle."],["L7-0548","出手","chūshǒu","","to spend; to take action","gastar; actuar","dépenser; intervenir","他出手阔绰，一顿饭就花了好几千块。","tā chū shǒu kuò chuò yí dùn fàn jiù huā le hǎo jǐ qiān kuài","He spends lavishly; a single meal cost him several thousand yuan.","Gasta con generosidad: solo una comida le costó varios miles de yuanes.","Il dépense sans compter : un seul repas lui a coûté plusieurs milliers de yuans."],["L7-0549","出头","chūtóu","","to stand out; to take the lead","destacar; dar la cara","se distinguer; prendre l'initiative","新来的经理看上去才三十出头，却已经管理过好几家分公司。","xīn lái de jīng lǐ kàn shàng qù cái sān shí chū tóu què yǐ jīng guǎn lǐ guo hǎo jǐ jiā fēn gōng sī","The new manager looks just over thirty, yet he has already run several branch offices.","El nuevo gerente parece tener apenas treinta y pocos años, pero ya ha dirigido varias sucursales.","Le nouveau directeur n'a l'air d'avoir qu'une trentaine d'années, mais il a déjà dirigé plusieurs filiales."],["L7-0550","出土","chūtǔ","","to be unearthed","desenterrar; ser hallado en excavación","être exhumé; sortir de terre","这座古墓里出土了大量陪葬的陶器。","zhè zuò gǔ mù lǐ chū tǔ le dà liàng péi zàng de táo qì","A large number of pottery funerary objects were unearthed from this ancient tomb.","En esta antigua tumba se desenterraron muchas vasijas de cerámica que formaban parte del ajuar funerario.","On a exhumé de cette ancienne tombe un grand nombre de poteries déposées comme mobilier funéraire."],["L7-0551","出息","chūxi","N","prospects; promise","futuro prometedor; porvenir","avenir prometteur; perspectives","邻居家的儿子很有出息，年纪轻轻就开了自己的公司。","lín jū jiā de ér zi hěn yǒu chū xi nián jì qīng qīng jiù kāi le zì jǐ de gōng sī","The neighbors' son has done very well for himself; he started his own company at a young age.","El hijo de los vecinos tiene mucho futuro: abrió su propia empresa siendo muy joven.","Le fils des voisins promet beaucoup : il a ouvert sa propre entreprise très jeune."],["L7-0552","出血","chūxiě","","to bleed; to spend lavishly","sangrar; gastar a lo grande","saigner; dépenser sans compter","他不小心被刀划破了手指，伤口一直在出血。","tā bù xiǎo xīn bèi dāo huá pò le shǒu zhǐ shāng kǒu yì zhí zài chū xuè","He accidentally cut his finger with a knife, and the wound kept bleeding.","Sin querer se cortó el dedo con un cuchillo y la herida no dejaba de sangrar.","Il s'est coupé le doigt par inadvertance avec un couteau, et la plaie n'arrêtait pas de saigner."],["L7-0553","出演","chūyǎn","V","to appear; to perform","actuar; aparecer en escena","jouer; apparaître sur scène","这位演员将在新剧中出演一位乡村教师。","zhè wèi yǎn yuán jiāng zài xīn jù zhōng chū yǎn yí wèi xiāng cūn jiào shī","This actor will play a village teacher in the new drama.","Este actor interpretará a un maestro rural en la nueva serie.","Cet acteur jouera un instituteur de campagne dans la nouvelle série."],["L7-0554","出洋相","chū yángxiàng","","to make a fool of oneself","hacer el ridículo","se ridiculiser","第一次滑雪时我摔了好几跤，在朋友面前大出洋相。","dì yī cì huá xuě shí wǒ shuāi le hǎo jǐ jiāo zài péng you miàn qián dà chū yáng xiàng","The first time I went skiing, I fell several times and made a complete fool of myself in front of my friends.","La primera vez que esquié me caí varias veces y quedé en ridículo delante de mis amigos.","La première fois que j'ai fait du ski, je suis tombé plusieurs fois et je me suis ridiculisé devant mes amis."],["L7-0555","出游","chūyóu","V","to go on an outing","salir de excursión","partir en excursion","国庆长假期间，选择自驾出游的家庭越来越多。","guó qìng cháng jià qī jiān xuǎn zé zì jià chū yóu de jiā tíng yuè lái yuè duō","During the National Day holiday, more and more families are choosing to travel by car.","Durante las largas vacaciones del Día Nacional, cada vez más familias eligen viajar en su propio auto.","Pendant les longues vacances de la fête nationale, de plus en plus de familles choisissent de partir en voiture."],["L7-0556","出众","chūzhòng","Adj","outstanding","destacado; sobresaliente","remarquable; exceptionnel","她不但长相出众，而且工作能力也很强。","tā bú dàn zhǎng xiàng chū zhòng ér qiě gōng zuò néng lì yě hěn qiáng","She is not only strikingly good-looking but also very capable at work.","No solo es de aspecto sobresaliente, sino que también es muy competente en el trabajo.","Non seulement elle est d'une beauté remarquable, mais elle est aussi très compétente dans son travail."],["L7-0557","出主意","chū zhǔyi","","to give suggestions","dar ideas; aconsejar","donner des idées; conseiller","遇到难事的时候，他总是第一个站出来给大家出主意。","yù dào nán shì de shí hou tā zǒng shì dì yī ge zhàn chū lái gěi dà jiā chū zhǔ yi","Whenever there is a difficult problem, he is always the first to step forward and offer everyone ideas.","Cuando surge un problema difícil, él es siempre el primero en dar un paso al frente y aportar ideas a todos.","Face à une difficulté, il est toujours le premier à se manifester pour donner des idées à tout le monde."],["L7-0558","出资","chūzī","V","to fund; to invest","financiar; invertir","financer; investir","这座图书馆是由当地几位企业家共同出资修建的。","zhè zuò tú shū guǎn shì yóu dāng dì jǐ wèi qǐ yè jiā gòng tóng chū zī xiū jiàn de","This library was built with funds jointly contributed by several local entrepreneurs.","Esta biblioteca se construyó con el dinero aportado conjuntamente por varios empresarios locales.","Cette bibliothèque a été construite grâce à des fonds apportés conjointement par plusieurs entrepreneurs locaux."],["L7-0559","出自","chūzì","V","to come from","proceder de","provenir de","这句名言出自一位古代思想家之口。","zhè jù míng yán chū zì yí wèi gǔ dài sī xiǎng jiā zhī kǒu","This famous saying comes from an ancient thinker.","Esta famosa frase proviene de un pensador de la antigüedad.","Cette célèbre maxime vient d'un penseur de l'Antiquité."],["L7-0560","出走","chūzǒu","V","to run away; to leave home","huir de casa; marcharse","s'enfuir; quitter son foyer","这个男孩因为和父母吵架而离家出走，三天后才被找到。","zhè ge nán hái yīn wèi hé fù mǔ chǎo jià ér lí jiā chū zǒu sān tiān hòu cái bèi zhǎo dào","This boy ran away from home after a fight with his parents and wasn't found until three days later.","Este niño se fue de casa tras pelearse con sus padres y no lo encontraron hasta tres días después.","Ce garçon a fugué après une dispute avec ses parents et n'a été retrouvé que trois jours plus tard."],["L7-0561","初次","chūcì","N","first time","primera vez","première fois","初次见面，我不知道该怎么称呼您才好。","chū cì jiàn miàn wǒ bù zhī dào gāi zěn me chēng hu nín cái hǎo","Since this is our first meeting, I'm not sure how I should address you.","Como es la primera vez que nos vemos, no sé cómo debería dirigirme a usted.","C'est la première fois que nous nous rencontrons et je ne sais pas comment je dois vous appeler."],["L7-0562","初衷","chūzhōng","N","original intention","intención original","intention initiale","不管遇到多少困难，他都没有改变当初创业的初衷。","bù guǎn yù dào duō shao kùn nan tā dōu méi yǒu gǎi biàn dāng chū chuàng yè de chū zhōng","No matter how many difficulties he met, he never abandoned the original intention with which he started his business.","Por muchas dificultades que encontró, nunca cambió la intención con la que empezó su negocio.","Quelles que soient les difficultés rencontrées, il n'a jamais renoncé à l'intention première qui l'avait poussé à créer son entreprise."],["L7-0563","除此之外","chúcǐzhīwài","","besides this","aparte de esto","en dehors de cela","他每天坚持跑步，除此之外还经常去游泳。","tā měi tiān jiān chí pǎo bù chú cǐ zhī wài hái jīng cháng qù yóu yǒng","He runs every day, and besides that he often goes swimming.","Corre todos los días sin falta y, además de eso, va con frecuencia a nadar.","Il court tous les jours sans faute et, en plus de cela, va souvent nager."],["L7-0564","除去","chúqù","V/Prep","to remove; except for","eliminar; excepto","enlever; à l'exception de","除去房租和饭钱，他每个月剩不下多少工资。","chú qù fáng zū hé fàn qián tā měi ge yuè shèng bu xià duō shao gōng zī","After deducting rent and food expenses, he has little of his salary left each month.","Después de descontar el alquiler y la comida, cada mes le queda poco sueldo.","Une fois déduits le loyer et les repas, il ne lui reste pas grand-chose de son salaire chaque mois."],["L7-0565","除外","chúwài","V","except; excluded","excepto; excluido","excepté; exclu","这家博物馆每天都对外开放，周一除外。","zhè jiā bó wù guǎn měi tiān dōu duì wài kāi fàng zhōu yī chú wài","This museum is open to the public every day except Monday.","Este museo abre al público todos los días, excepto los lunes.","Ce musée est ouvert au public tous les jours, sauf le lundi."],["L7-0566","处方","chǔfāng","V/N","prescription","receta médica; prescribir","ordonnance; prescrire","护士仔细核对了处方，又向患者说明了药物可能产生的副作用。","hù shi zǐ xì hé duì le chǔ fāng yòu xiàng huàn zhě shuō míng le yào wù kě néng chǎn shēng de fù zuò yòng","The nurse carefully checked the prescription and explained the medication's possible side effects to the patient.","La enfermera revisó con cuidado la receta y le explicó al paciente los posibles efectos secundarios del medicamento.","L'infirmière a vérifié soigneusement l'ordonnance et a expliqué au patient les effets secondaires possibles du médicament."],["L7-0567","处境","chǔjìng","N","situation; plight","situación; circunstancias","situation; sort","公共资源的分配既要兼顾效率，也不能忽视处境不利的群体。","gōng gòng zī yuán de fēn pèi jì yào jiān gù xiào lǜ yě bù néng hū shì chǔ jìng bú lì de qún tǐ","The allocation of public resources should take efficiency into account without overlooking disadvantaged groups.","La distribución de los recursos públicos debe considerar la eficiencia sin descuidar a los grupos desfavorecidos.","La répartition des ressources publiques doit tenir compte de l'efficacité sans négliger les groupes défavorisés."],["L7-0568","处置","chǔzhì","V","to handle; to deal with","manejar; sancionar","traiter; s'occuper de","这批过期药品必须按照规定统一处置。","zhè pī guò qī yào pǐn bì xū àn zhào guī dìng tǒng yī chǔ zhì","These expired medicines must be disposed of uniformly according to regulations.","Estos medicamentos vencidos deben eliminarse de forma unificada según el reglamento.","Ces médicaments périmés doivent être éliminés de façon uniforme, conformément à la réglementation."],["L7-0569","储备","chǔbèi","V/N","reserves; to stockpile","reservas; almacenar","réserves; stocker","冬天来临之前，松鼠会储备大量的松果。","dōng tiān lái lín zhī qián sōng shǔ huì chǔ bèi dà liàng de sōng guǒ","Before winter comes, squirrels store up large amounts of pine cones.","Antes de que llegue el invierno, las ardillas almacenan gran cantidad de piñas.","Avant l'arrivée de l'hiver, les écureuils font de grandes réserves de pommes de pin."],["L7-0570","储蓄","chǔxù","V/N","to save; savings","ahorrar; ahorros","épargner; épargne","他有每个月把一部分工资存入银行储蓄的习惯。","tā yǒu měi ge yuè bǎ yí bù fen gōng zī cún rù yín háng chǔ xù de xí guàn","He has the habit of putting part of his salary into a bank savings account every month.","Tiene la costumbre de depositar cada mes una parte de su sueldo en una cuenta de ahorros del banco.","Il a l'habitude de placer chaque mois une partie de son salaire sur un compte d'épargne bancaire."],["L7-0571","触动","chùdòng","V","to touch; to stir up","conmover; remover","toucher; émouvoir","这部纪录片深深触动了观众的心。","zhè bù jì lù piàn shēn shēn chù dòng le guān zhòng de xīn","This documentary deeply moved the audience.","Este documental conmovió profundamente al público.","Ce documentaire a profondément ému le public."],["L7-0572","触犯","chùfàn","V","to violate; to offend","infringir; ofender","enfreindre; offenser","他的行为已经触犯了法律，必须承担相应的责任。","tā de xíng wéi yǐ jīng chù fàn le fǎ lǜ bì xū chéng dān xiāng yìng de zé rèn","His behavior has already broken the law, and he must bear the corresponding responsibility.","Su conducta ya infringió la ley y debe asumir la responsabilidad correspondiente.","Son comportement a déjà enfreint la loi, et il doit en assumer la responsabilité."],["L7-0573","触觉","chùjué","N","sense of touch","tacto","toucher","盲人的触觉往往特别灵敏，能通过手指阅读盲文。","máng rén de chù jué wǎng wǎng tè bié líng mǐn néng tōng guò shǒu zhǐ yuè dú máng wén","Blind people often have an especially keen sense of touch and can read Braille with their fingers.","Las personas ciegas suelen tener un tacto muy agudo y pueden leer braille con los dedos.","Les personnes aveugles ont souvent un toucher particulièrement fin et peuvent lire le braille avec leurs doigts."],["L7-0574","触摸","chùmō","V","to touch","tocar","toucher","博物馆里的展品请勿用手触摸。","bó wù guǎn lǐ de zhǎn pǐn qǐng wù yòng shǒu chù mō","Please do not touch the exhibits in the museum.","Por favor, no toque con las manos las piezas expuestas en el museo.","Veuillez ne pas toucher les objets exposés dans le musée."],["L7-0575","触目惊心","chùmù-jīngxīn","","shocking; horrifying","impactante; escalofriante","choquant; effroyable","洪水退去后，村子里一片狼藉，景象触目惊心。","hóng shuǐ tuì qù hòu cūn zi lǐ yí piàn láng jí jǐng xiàng chù mù jīng xīn","After the floodwaters receded, the village was left in a terrible mess, a shocking sight.","Cuando el agua de la inundación se retiró, el pueblo quedó hecho un desastre, una escena estremecedora.","Lorsque les eaux de la crue se sont retirées, le village était dévasté, un spectacle bouleversant."],["L7-0576","揣","chuāi","V","to tuck into pockets or clothes","guardar en el bolsillo","fourrer dans sa poche","他把钥匙往口袋里一揣，就匆匆出了门。","tā bǎ yào shi wǎng kǒu dài lǐ yì chuāi jiù cōng cōng chū le mén","He stuffed the keys into his pocket and hurried out the door.","Se metió las llaves en el bolsillo y salió apresurado de casa.","Il a fourré les clés dans sa poche et est sorti précipitamment."],["L7-0577","揣测","chuǎicè","V","to guess; to conjecture","conjeturar; suponer","conjecturer; supposer","我们不应该随便揣测别人的想法。","wǒ men bù yīng gāi suí biàn chuǎi cè bié rén de xiǎng fǎ","We shouldn't make careless guesses about what other people are thinking.","No debemos hacer conjeturas a la ligera sobre lo que piensan los demás.","Nous ne devons pas faire à la légère des suppositions sur ce que pensent les autres."],["L7-0578","揣摩","chuǎimó","V","to ponder; to try to fathom","tratar de descifrar; reflexionar","chercher à comprendre; méditer","他在实践中反复揣摩，终于领悟了师傅当年那番话的深意。","tā zài shí jiàn zhōng fǎn fù chuǎi mó zhōng yú lǐng wù le shī fu dāng nián nà fān huà de shēn yì","Through repeated reflection during practice, he finally grasped the deeper meaning of his master's words from years before.","Reflexionó una y otra vez durante la práctica y por fin comprendió el profundo sentido de aquellas palabras de su maestro.","À force d'y réfléchir en pratiquant, il a fini par saisir le sens profond de ce que son maître lui avait dit autrefois."],["L7-0579","踹","chuài","V","to kick","patear","donner un coup de pied","他一气之下，一脚把门踹开了。","tā yí qì zhī xià yì jiǎo bǎ mén chuài kāi le","In a fit of anger, he kicked the door open.","Furioso, abrió la puerta de una patada.","Dans un accès de colère, il a ouvert la porte d'un coup de pied."],["L7-0580","川流不息","chuānliú-bùxī","","in an endless stream","en flujo continuo","en flot ininterrompu","节假日的商业街上人群川流不息。","jié jià rì de shāng yè jiē shàng rén qún chuān liú bù xī","On holidays, an endless stream of people flows along the shopping street.","En los días festivos, la calle comercial está llena de gente que no deja de pasar.","Les jours fériés, une foule ininterrompue défile dans la rue commerçante."],["L7-0581","穿过","chuānguò","V","to pass through","atravesar","traverser","火车穿过高低起伏的群山，向西开去。","huǒ chē chuān guò gāo dī qǐ fú de qún shān xiàng xī kāi qù","The train headed west through the rolling mountains.","El tren atravesó montañas de relieve ondulado rumbo al oeste.","Le train a traversé des montagnes aux reliefs accidentés en direction de l'ouest."],["L7-0582","穿小鞋","chuān xiǎoxié","","to make life hard for sb","hacerle la vida difícil a alguien","mettre des bâtons dans les roues","他担心得罪了领导，以后会被穿小鞋。","tā dān xīn dé zuì le lǐng dǎo yǐ hòu huì bèi chuān xiǎo xié","He worried that if he offended his boss, he would be made to suffer for it later.","Temía haber ofendido al jefe y que más adelante le hicieran la vida difícil.","Il craignait qu'en froissant son supérieur, on lui fasse payer cela plus tard."],["L7-0583","穿越","chuānyuè","V","to cross; to traverse","atravesar; cruzar","traverser; franchir","他们打算徒步穿越这片沙漠。","tā men dǎ suàn tú bù chuān yuè zhè piàn shā mò","They plan to cross this desert on foot.","Piensan cruzar este desierto a pie.","Ils comptent traverser ce désert à pied."],["L7-0584","穿着","chuānzhuó","N","clothing; attire","vestimenta; atuendo","tenue; vêtements","参加面试时，穿着要整洁得体。","cān jiā miàn shì shí chuān zhuó yào zhěng jié dé tǐ","When going to a job interview, your attire should be neat and appropriate.","Al ir a una entrevista de trabajo, la ropa debe ser pulcra y apropiada.","Pour un entretien d'embauche, la tenue doit être soignée et convenable."],["L7-0585","传承","chuánchéng","V/N","to pass down; inheritance","transmitir; legado","transmettre; héritage","传统工艺要获得传承，既需要保存技法，也需要为年轻匠人提供谋生的空间。","chuán tǒng gōng yì yào huò dé chuán chéng jì xū yào bǎo cún jì fǎ yě xū yào wèi nián qīng jiàng rén tí gōng móu shēng de kōng jiān","Passing on traditional crafts requires both preserving techniques and giving young artisans a way to make a living.","Para que los oficios tradicionales se transmitan, hace falta tanto conservar las técnicas como ofrecer a los jóvenes artesanos un espacio para ganarse la vida.","Pour que les métiers traditionnels se transmettent, il faut à la fois préserver les techniques et offrir aux jeunes artisans de quoi gagner leur vie."],["L7-0586","传奇","chuánqí","N","legend; legendary","leyenda; legendario","légende; légendaire","这位老船长的一生充满了传奇色彩。","zhè wèi lǎo chuán zhǎng de yì shēng chōng mǎn le chuán qí sè cǎi","This old sea captain's life had a legendary quality.","La vida de este viejo capitán de barco estuvo llena de matices legendarios.","La vie de ce vieux capitaine fut empreinte de légende."],["L7-0587","传染","chuánrǎn","V","to infect; contagious","contagiar; contagioso","infecter; contagieux","流感很容易传染，生病的同学最好在家休息。","liú gǎn hěn róng yì chuán rǎn shēng bìng de tóng xué zuì hǎo zài jiā xiū xi","The flu is highly contagious, so students who are sick had better rest at home.","La gripe se contagia con mucha facilidad, así que los compañeros enfermos es mejor que descansen en casa.","La grippe est très contagieuse ; les camarades malades feraient mieux de se reposer chez eux."],["L7-0588","传染病","chuánrǎnbìng","N","infectious disease","enfermedad infecciosa","maladie infectieuse","医院把传染病人安排在隔离病房里治疗。","yī yuàn bǎ chuán rǎn bìng rén ān pái zài gé lí bìng fáng lǐ zhì liáo","The hospital arranges for patients with infectious diseases to receive treatment in isolation wards.","El hospital trata a los pacientes con enfermedades contagiosas en salas de aislamiento.","L'hôpital soigne les patients atteints de maladies contagieuses dans des chambres d'isolement."],["L7-0589","传人","chuánrén","N","successor; disciple","sucesor; discípulo","successeur; disciple","他是这门传统手艺的第四代传人。","tā shì zhè mén chuán tǒng shǒu yì de dì sì dài chuán rén","He is the fourth-generation inheritor of this traditional craft.","Es la cuarta generación en heredar este oficio tradicional.","Il est le quatrième de sa lignée à perpétuer ce savoir-faire traditionnel."],["L7-0590","传授","chuánshòu","V","to impart; to teach","transmitir; enseñar","transmettre; enseigner","老师无私地把知识传授给学生。","lǎo shī wú sī de bǎ zhī shi chuán shòu gěi xué shēng","The teacher selflessly passes on knowledge to the students.","El maestro transmite sus conocimientos a los alumnos con total generosidad.","Le professeur transmet généreusement son savoir à ses élèves."],["L7-0591","传闻","chuánwén","V/N","rumor; hearsay","rumor; se dice","rumeur; on-dit","网络上的一则传闻引发了恐慌，核实事实后，误解才逐渐消除。","wǎng luò shàng de yì zé chuán wén yǐn fā le kǒng huāng hé shí shì shí hòu wù jiě cái zhú jiàn xiāo chú","An online rumor sparked panic, and the misunderstanding gradually cleared up only after the facts were checked.","Un rumor en internet provocó pánico, y solo después de verificar los hechos se fue disipando el malentendido.","Une rumeur circulant sur internet a provoqué la panique, et ce n'est qu'après vérification des faits que le malentendu s'est peu à peu dissipé."],["L7-0592","船舶","chuánbó","N","ships; vessels","buques; embarcaciones","navires; bateaux","港口的工作人员每天都要检查进出的船舶。","gǎng kǒu de gōng zuò rén yuán měi tiān dōu yào jiǎn chá jìn chū de chuán bó","Port staff inspect the vessels coming in and going out every day.","El personal del puerto inspecciona todos los días los buques que entran y salen.","Le personnel du port inspecte chaque jour les navires qui entrent et sortent."],["L7-0593","船桨","chuánjiǎng","N","oar","remo","rame","他们握紧船桨，齐心协力把小船划向对岸。","tā men wò jǐn chuán jiǎng qí xīn xié lì bǎ xiǎo chuán huá xiàng duì àn","They gripped the oars and worked together to row the little boat to the opposite bank.","Agarraron con fuerza los remos y, uniendo esfuerzos, remaron el bote hasta la otra orilla.","Ils ont serré les rames et, unissant leurs efforts, ont ramé le petit bateau jusqu'à l'autre rive."],["L7-0594","喘","chuǎn","V","to pant; to gasp","jadear; resollar","haleter; souffler","他一口气跑上六楼，累得直喘。","tā yì kǒu qì pǎo shàng liù lóu lèi de zhí chuǎn","He ran all the way up to the sixth floor without stopping and was so tired that he kept panting.","Subió corriendo hasta el sexto piso de un tirón y quedó tan cansado que jadeaba.","Il a grimpé d'une traite jusqu'au sixième étage en courant, et il était si fatigué qu'il haletait."],["L7-0595","喘息","chuǎnxī","V","to gasp; to catch one's breath","jadear; tomar aliento","haleter; reprendre son souffle","连续加班了一个月，大家终于有了喘息的机会。","lián xù jiā bān le yí ge yuè dà jiā zhōng yú yǒu le chuǎn xī de jī huì","After a month of continuous overtime, everyone finally had a chance to catch their breath.","Después de un mes seguido de horas extra, todos por fin tuvieron un respiro.","Après un mois d'heures supplémentaires ininterrompues, tout le monde a enfin pu souffler un peu."],["L7-0596","串门","chuànmén","","to drop in on neighbors","visitar a los vecinos","rendre visite aux voisins","以前村里的邻居们吃过晚饭常常互相串门。","yǐ qián cūn lǐ de lín jū men chī guo wǎn fàn cháng cháng hù xiāng chuàn mén","In the past, neighbors in the village often dropped in on one another after dinner.","Antes, los vecinos del pueblo solían visitarse unos a otros después de la cena.","Autrefois, les voisins du village se rendaient souvent visite après le dîner."],["L7-0597","创伤","chuāngshāng","N","wound; trauma","herida; trauma","blessure; traumatisme","那场车祸给他留下了很深的心理创伤。","nà chǎng chē huò gěi tā liú xià le hěn shēn de xīn lǐ chuāng shāng","That car accident left him with deep psychological trauma.","Aquel accidente de auto le dejó un profundo trauma psicológico.","Cet accident de voiture lui a laissé un profond traumatisme psychologique."],["L7-0598","床位","chuángwèi","N","bed; berth","cama; plaza","lit; couchette","医院的床位十分紧张，有些病人只能睡在走廊里。","yī yuàn de chuáng wèi shí fēn jǐn zhāng yǒu xiē bìng rén zhǐ néng shuì zài zǒu láng lǐ","Hospital beds are in very short supply, and some patients have to sleep in the corridor.","Las camas del hospital escasean mucho y algunos pacientes tienen que dormir en el pasillo.","Les lits d'hôpital manquent cruellement, et certains patients doivent dormir dans le couloir."],["L7-0599","创","chuàng","V","to create; to start","crear; iniciar","créer; fonder","她在这次比赛中又创了一项新的全国纪录。","tā zài zhè cì bǐ sài zhōng yòu chuàng le yí xiàng xīn de quán guó jì lù","She set yet another national record in this competition.","En esta competencia volvió a establecer un nuevo récord nacional.","Lors de cette compétition, elle a de nouveau établi un nouveau record national."],["L7-0600","创始人","chuàngshǐrén","N","founder","fundador","fondateur","这家公司的创始人当年是在自家车库里开始创业的。","zhè jiā gōng sī de chuàng shǐ rén dāng nián shì zài zì jiā chē kù lǐ kāi shǐ chuàng yè de","The founder of this company started the business in his own garage back then.","El fundador de esta empresa empezó su negocio en el garaje de su propia casa.","Le fondateur de cette entreprise avait créé son affaire dans le garage de sa propre maison."],["L7-0601","吹了","chuī le","","to fall through; to break up","fracasar; romper","échouer; rompre","他们俩谈了三年恋爱，最后还是吹了。","tā men liǎ tán le sān nián liàn ài zuì hòu hái shi chuī le","The two of them dated for three years, but in the end they broke up.","Estuvieron de novios tres años, pero al final terminaron.","Ils sont sortis ensemble pendant trois ans, mais cela a fini par casser."],["L7-0602","吹牛","chuīniú","","to boast; to brag","fanfarronear; presumir","se vanter; fanfaronner","他总爱吹牛说自己认识很多名人，其实一个也不认识。","tā zǒng ài chuī niú shuō zì jǐ rèn shi hěn duō míng rén qí shí yí ge yě bú rèn shi","He loves to brag that he knows lots of famous people, but actually he doesn't know a single one.","Siempre presume de que conoce a mucha gente famosa, pero en realidad no conoce a ninguna.","Il adore se vanter de connaître beaucoup de célébrités, alors qu'en réalité il n'en connaît aucune."],["L7-0603","吹捧","chuīpěng","V","to flatter; to extol","adular; ensalzar","flatter; encenser","那些文章一味地吹捧这款产品，根本不提它的缺点。","nà xiē wén zhāng yí wèi de chuī pěng zhè kuǎn chǎn pǐn gēn běn bù tí tā de quē diǎn","Those articles do nothing but hype up the product and never mention its flaws.","Esos artículos se limitan a alabar este producto sin mencionar nunca sus defectos.","Ces articles ne font que vanter ce produit sans jamais mentionner ses défauts."],["L7-0604","垂","chuí","V","to hang down; to droop","colgar; caer","pendre; tomber","河边的柳树把长长的枝条垂到了水面上。","hé biān de liǔ shù bǎ cháng cháng de zhī tiáo chuí dào le shuǐ miàn shàng","The willows by the river hang their long branches down to the surface of the water.","Los sauces de la orilla del río dejan caer sus largas ramas hasta la superficie del agua.","Les saules au bord de la rivière laissent pendre leurs longues branches jusqu'à la surface de l'eau."],["L7-0605","垂头丧气","chuítóu-sàngqì","","dejected; crestfallen","abatido; cabizbajo","abattu; la tête basse","比赛输了以后，队员们一个个垂头丧气地走出了球场。","bǐ sài shū le yǐ hòu duì yuán men yí gè gè chuí tóu sàng qì de zǒu chū le qiú chǎng","After losing the match, the players walked off the field one by one, looking dejected.","Después de perder el partido, los jugadores salieron de la cancha uno a uno, cabizbajos.","Après avoir perdu le match, les joueurs ont quitté le terrain un à un, abattus."],["L7-0606","捶","chuí","V","to pound; to thump","golpear; machacar","marteler; frapper","奶奶坐久了腰疼，我常常帮她捶捶背。","nǎi nai zuò jiǔ le yāo téng wǒ cháng cháng bāng tā chuí chuí bèi","Grandma's back hurts when she sits too long, so I often pound her back gently for her.","A la abuela le duele la cintura cuando se sienta mucho tiempo, así que a menudo le doy golpecitos en la espalda.","Grand-mère a mal au dos quand elle reste longtemps assise, alors je lui tapote souvent le dos."],["L7-0607","锤子","chuízi","N","hammer","martillo","marteau","墙上的钉子松了，你帮我拿把锤子来。","qiáng shàng de dīng zi sōng le nǐ bāng wǒ ná bǎ chuí zi lái","The nail in the wall has come loose; please bring me a hammer.","El clavo de la pared se aflojó; tráeme un martillo, por favor.","Le clou dans le mur s'est desserré ; apporte-moi un marteau, s'il te plaît."],["L7-0608","纯粹","chúncuì","Adj","pure; purely","puro; puramente","pur; purement","他学画画纯粹是出于兴趣，并不想以此为职业。","tā xué huà huà chún cuì shì chū yú xìng qù bìng bù xiǎng yǐ cǐ wéi zhí yè","He learns painting purely out of interest and has no wish to make a career of it.","Aprende a pintar puramente por afición y no quiere hacer de ello su profesión.","Il apprend la peinture par pur plaisir et ne souhaite pas en faire son métier."],["L7-0609","纯洁","chúnjié","Adj/V","pure; innocent","puro; inocente","pur; innocent","孩子们纯洁的笑容让人忘记了所有烦恼。","hái zi men chún jié de xiào róng ràng rén wàng jì le suǒ yǒu fán nǎo","The children's innocent smiles made people forget all their worries.","Las sonrisas puras de los niños hacían olvidar todas las preocupaciones.","Les sourires innocents des enfants faisaient oublier tous les soucis."],["L7-0610","纯朴","chúnpǔ","Adj","simple and honest","sencillo y honesto","simple et honnête","山里的村民十分纯朴，对远方来的客人非常热情。","shān lǐ de cūn mín shí fēn chún pǔ duì yuǎn fāng lái de kè rén fēi cháng rè qíng","The villagers in the mountains are very simple and honest and extremely warm toward guests from afar.","Los aldeanos de la montaña son muy sencillos y muy cálidos con los visitantes que vienen de lejos.","Les villageois de la montagne sont très simples et accueillent chaleureusement les visiteurs venus de loin."],["L7-0611","醇厚","chúnhòu","Adj","mellow; rich","suave y rico; generoso","moelleux; riche","这款红酒口感醇厚，很适合搭配牛排。","zhè kuǎn hóng jiǔ kǒu gǎn chún hòu hěn shì hé dā pèi niú pái","This red wine has a rich, mellow taste and goes well with steak.","Este vino tinto tiene un sabor suave y con cuerpo, y combina muy bien con un filete.","Ce vin rouge a un goût rond et corsé, et se marie très bien avec un steak."],["L7-0612","蠢","chǔn","Adj","stupid","estúpido; tonto","stupide; bête","我真蠢，居然把钥匙锁在了车里。","wǒ zhēn chǔn jū rán bǎ yào shi suǒ zài le chē lǐ","How stupid of me—I actually locked the keys in the car.","Qué tonto soy, ¡cómo pude dejar las llaves encerradas dentro del auto!","Que je suis bête, j'ai vraiment enfermé les clés dans la voiture !"],["L7-0613","戳","chuō","V/N","to poke; to stab","clavar; pinchar","piquer; poignarder","他用手指轻轻戳了戳我的肩膀，示意我回头看。","tā yòng shǒu zhǐ qīng qīng chuō le chuō wǒ de jiān bǎng shì yì wǒ huí tóu kàn","He gave my shoulder a light poke with his finger to signal me to look back.","Con el dedo me dio un toquecito en el hombro para indicarme que mirara hacia atrás.","Il m'a donné un léger coup de doigt sur l'épaule pour me faire signe de me retourner."],["L7-0614","绰号","chuòhào","N","nickname","apodo","surnom","因为个子特别高，他上学时的绰号叫“长颈鹿”。","yīn wèi gè zi tè bié gāo tā shàng xué shí de chuò hào jiào cháng jǐng lù","Because he was especially tall, his nickname at school was \"Giraffe.\"","Como era especialmente alto, su apodo en la escuela era «Jirafa».","Comme il était particulièrement grand, son surnom à l'école était « Girafe »."],["L7-0615","瓷","cí","N","porcelain; china","porcelana","porcelaine","这套茶具是瓷的，搬运时要特别小心。","zhè tào chá jù shì cí de bān yùn shí yào tè bié xiǎo xīn","This tea set is porcelain, so take special care when moving it.","Este juego de té es de porcelana, así que hay que tener mucho cuidado al transportarlo.","Ce service à thé est en porcelaine ; il faut donc être particulièrement prudent en le transportant."],["L7-0616","瓷器","cíqì","N","porcelain; chinaware","porcelana; objetos de porcelana","porcelaine","这种瓷器是在窑里烧出来的。","zhè zhǒng cí qì shì zài yáo lǐ shāo chū lái de","This kind of porcelain is fired in a kiln.","Esta clase de porcelana se cuece en el horno.","Cette sorte de porcelaine est cuite au four."],["L7-0617","辞","cí","V","to resign; to decline","renunciar; rechazar","démissionner; refuser","她辞了工作，在家照料生病的母亲。","tā cí le gōng zuò zài jiā zhào liào shēng bìng de mǔ qīn","She quit her job to look after her sick mother at home.","Dejó su trabajo para cuidar en casa a su madre enferma.","Elle a quitté son emploi pour s'occuper à la maison de sa mère malade."],["L7-0618","辞呈","cíchéng","N","resignation letter","carta de renuncia","lettre de démission","因为身体原因，他向董事会递交了辞呈。","yīn wèi shēn tǐ yuán yīn tā xiàng dǒng shì huì dì jiāo le cí chéng","For health reasons, he submitted his resignation to the board of directors.","Por motivos de salud, presentó su renuncia a la junta directiva.","Pour des raisons de santé, il a remis sa démission au conseil d'administration."],["L7-0619","辞去","cíqù","","to resign from","renunciar a","démissionner de","他辞去了公职，下海经商去了。","tā cí qù le gōng zhí xià hǎi jīng shāng qù le","He resigned from public office and went into business.","Renunció a su cargo público y se dedicó a los negocios.","Il a quitté la fonction publique pour se lancer dans les affaires."],["L7-0620","辞退","cítuì","V","to dismiss; to decline","despedir; declinar","licencier; décliner","公司辞退了几名员工，并按约定支付了补偿金。","gōng sī cí tuì le jǐ míng yuán gōng bìng àn yuē dìng zhī fù le bǔ cháng jīn","The company dismissed several employees and paid them compensation as agreed.","La empresa despidió a varios empleados y les pagó la compensación acordada.","L'entreprise a licencié plusieurs employés et leur a versé l'indemnité convenue."],["L7-0621","慈善","císhàn","Adj","charitable; charity","caritativo; beneficencia","charitable; charité","这场慈善晚会为山区儿童筹集了大量善款。","zhè chǎng cí shàn wǎn huì wèi shān qū ér tóng chóu jí le dà liàng shàn kuǎn","This charity gala raised substantial funds for children in mountainous areas.","Esta gala benéfica recaudó una gran cantidad de donaciones para los niños de las zonas montañosas.","Ce gala de charité a permis de collecter beaucoup de dons pour les enfants des régions de montagne."],["L7-0622","慈祥","cíxiáng","Adj","kindly; benevolent","bondadoso; amable","bienveillant; doux","外婆总是带着慈祥的笑容，耐心地听我们讲话。","wài pó zǒng shì dài zhe cí xiáng de xiào róng nài xīn de tīng wǒ men jiǎng huà","Grandma always listens to us patiently with a kindly smile.","La abuela materna siempre escuchaba con paciencia y una sonrisa bondadosa cuando le hablábamos.","Ma grand-mère maternelle nous écoutait toujours patiemment, avec un sourire plein de bonté."],["L7-0623","磁带","cídài","N","magnetic tape; cassette","cinta magnética; casete","bande magnétique; cassette","爸爸至今还保存着年轻时听过的那些磁带。","bà ba zhì jīn hái bǎo cún zhe nián qīng shí tīng guo de nà xiē cí dài","Dad still keeps the cassette tapes he listened to when he was young.","Papá todavía conserva los casetes que escuchaba de joven.","Papa conserve encore les cassettes qu'il écoutait quand il était jeune."],["L7-0624","磁卡","cíkǎ","N","magnetic card","tarjeta magnética","carte magnétique","以前在街头打公用电话，需要先买一张磁卡。","yǐ qián zài jiē tóu dǎ gōng yòng diàn huà xū yào xiān mǎi yì zhāng cí kǎ","In the past, to make a call from a public phone on the street, you first had to buy a magnetic card.","Antes, para llamar desde un teléfono público en la calle, primero había que comprar una tarjeta magnética.","Autrefois, pour téléphoner depuis une cabine publique dans la rue, il fallait d'abord acheter une carte magnétique."],["L7-0625","磁盘","cípán","N","disk","disco","disque","电脑的磁盘空间快满了，你最好删掉一些不用的文件。","diàn nǎo de cí pán kōng jiān kuài mǎn le nǐ zuì hǎo shān diào yì xiē bú yòng de wén jiàn","Your computer's disk space is almost full, so you'd better delete some files you don't use.","El espacio del disco de tu computadora está casi lleno; más te vale borrar algunos archivos que no uses.","L'espace disque de ton ordinateur est presque plein ; tu ferais mieux de supprimer quelques fichiers inutiles."],["L7-0626","此起彼伏","cǐqǐ-bǐfú","","rising one after another","sucederse sin cesar","se succéder sans relâche","体育场里加油声此起彼伏，比赛气氛十分热烈。","tǐ yù chǎng lǐ jiā yóu shēng cǐ qǐ bǐ fú bǐ sài qì fēn shí fēn rè liè","Cheers rose one after another all around the stadium, and the atmosphere of the match was electric.","En el estadio los ánimos se oían por todas partes y el ambiente del partido era muy caliente.","Dans le stade, les encouragements fusaient de toutes parts et l'ambiance du match était très chaude."],["L7-0627","次日","cìrì","N","next day","el día siguiente","le lendemain","他们晚上十点到达酒店，次日一早就出发去了山区。","tā men wǎn shang shí diǎn dào dá jiǔ diàn cì rì yì zǎo jiù chū fā qù le shān qū","They arrived at the hotel at ten at night and set off for the mountains early the next morning.","Llegaron al hotel a las diez de la noche y a la mañana siguiente salieron temprano hacia la zona montañosa.","Ils sont arrivés à l'hôtel à dix heures du soir et sont partis tôt le lendemain matin pour la montagne."],["L7-0628","伺候","cìhou","V","to wait on; to serve","atender; servir","servir; être aux petits soins","她辞掉工作，在家专心伺候生病的母亲。","tā cí diào gōng zuò zài jiā zhuān xīn cì hou shēng bìng de mǔ qīn","She quit her job to stay at home and devote herself to looking after her sick mother.","Dejó su trabajo para quedarse en casa a cuidar con dedicación a su madre enferma.","Elle a quitté son travail pour rester à la maison et s'occuper avec dévouement de sa mère malade."],["L7-0629","刺耳","cì'ěr","Adj","ear-piercing; harsh","estridente; chirriante","strident; déchirant","楼下装修的电钻声特别刺耳，吵得人没法午睡。","lóu xià zhuāng xiū de diàn zuàn shēng tè bié cì ěr chǎo de rén méi fǎ wǔ shuì","The power drill from the renovation downstairs is so ear-piercing that nobody can take a nap.","El taladro de la obra de abajo suena tan estridente que no se puede dormir la siesta.","La perceuse des travaux en bas est si stridente qu'on ne peut pas faire la sieste."],["L7-0630","刺骨","cìgǔ","V","piercing; bone-chilling","penetrante; que cala los huesos","glacial; qui transperce","北方冬天的寒风刺骨，出门一定要戴好帽子和手套。","běi fāng dōng tiān de hán fēng cì gǔ chū mén yí dìng yào dài hǎo mào zi hé shǒu tào","In the north the winter wind is bitingly cold, so be sure to wear a hat and gloves when you go out.","En el norte el viento invernal es helado; al salir, ponte bien el gorro y los guantes.","Dans le nord, le vent d'hiver est glacial ; en sortant, mets bien un bonnet et des gants."],["L7-0631","刺绣","cìxiù","V/N","embroidery; to embroider","bordado; bordar","broderie; broder","苏州的刺绣做工精细，图案栩栩如生。","sū zhōu de cì xiù zuò gōng jīng xì tú àn xǔ xǔ rú shēng","Suzhou embroidery is finely crafted, and its patterns are extremely lifelike.","Los bordados de Suzhou están muy bien hechos y sus diseños parecen vivos.","Les broderies de Suzhou sont d'une grande finesse et leurs motifs paraissent vivants."],["L7-0632","赐","cì","V","to bestow; to grant","conceder; otorgar","accorder; octroyer","老人常说，是上天赐给了他这副好嗓子。","lǎo rén cháng shuō shì shàng tiān cì gěi le tā zhè fù hǎo sǎng zi","The old man often says that heaven blessed him with this fine voice.","El anciano suele decir que el cielo le regaló esa hermosa voz.","Le vieil homme dit souvent que c'est le ciel qui lui a donné cette belle voix."],["L7-0633","赐教","cìjiào","V","to enlighten; to give guidance","instruir; dar consejo","éclairer; faire profiter de son savoir","我刚入行不久，还有很多不懂的地方，请您多多赐教。","wǒ gāng rù háng bù jiǔ hái yǒu hěn duō bù dǒng de dì fang qǐng nín duō duō cì jiào","I'm new to this field and there's still a lot I don't understand, so I'd be grateful for your guidance.","Hace poco que entré en este campo y hay muchas cosas que no entiendo; le agradeceré mucho su orientación.","Je viens à peine de me lancer dans ce métier et il y a encore beaucoup de choses que je ne comprends pas ; je vous serais très reconnaissant de bien vouloir me conseiller."],["L7-0634","匆匆","cōngcōng","Adj","hurriedly","apresuradamente","à la hâte","他把钥匙往口袋里一揣，就匆匆出了门。","tā bǎ yào shi wǎng kǒu dài lǐ yì chuāi jiù cōng cōng chū le mén","He stuffed the keys into his pocket and hurried out the door.","Se metió las llaves en el bolsillo y salió apresurado de casa.","Il a fourré les clés dans sa poche et est sorti précipitamment."],["L7-0635","匆忙","cōngmáng","Adj","hasty; hurried","apresurado","précipité; pressé","出门太匆忙，我把手机忘在了家里。","chū mén tài cōng máng wǒ bǎ shǒu jī wàng zài le jiā lǐ","I left the house in such a rush that I forgot my phone at home.","Salí tan apurado de casa que olvidé el celular.","J'étais tellement pressé en sortant que j'ai oublié mon téléphone à la maison."],["L7-0636","葱","cōng","N","scallion; green onion","cebolleta; cebolla verde","oignon vert; ciboule","这道汤快出锅时撒上一把葱，味道会更香。","zhè dào tāng kuài chū guō shí sǎ shàng yì bǎ cōng wèi dào huì gèng xiāng","Sprinkle a handful of scallions into this soup just before it's done, and it will taste even better.","Echa un puñado de cebollín a esta sopa justo antes de sacarla de la olla y tendrá más sabor.","Ajoutez une poignée de ciboule à cette soupe juste avant de la retirer du feu, elle n'en sera que plus parfumée."],["L7-0637","从今以后","cóng jīn yǐhòu","","from now on","de ahora en adelante","désormais","从今以后，我每天都要坚持锻炼一个小时。","cóng jīn yǐ hòu wǒ měi tiān dōu yào jiān chí duàn liàn yí ge xiǎo shí","From now on, I'm going to exercise for an hour every day.","De ahora en adelante, voy a hacer ejercicio una hora todos los días sin falta.","À partir de maintenant, je vais m'entraîner une heure par jour sans faute."],["L7-0638","从来不","cónglái bù","","never","nunca","ne jamais","做汤的时候我从来不放味精。","zuò tāng de shí hou wǒ cóng lái bú fàng wèi jīng","I never add MSG when making soup.","Cuando preparo sopa, nunca le pongo glutamato.","Quand je fais de la soupe, je n'y mets jamais de glutamate."],["L7-0639","从容","cóngróng","Adj","calm; unhurried","sereno; con calma","calme; posé","面对记者尖锐的提问，她显得十分从容。","miàn duì jì zhě jiān ruì de tí wèn tā xiǎn de shí fēn cóng róng","Faced with the journalists' pointed questions, she appeared perfectly composed.","Ante las preguntas incisivas de los periodistas, ella se mostró muy serena.","Face aux questions pointues des journalistes, elle est restée parfaitement posée."],["L7-0640","从容不迫","cóngróng-bùpò","","calm and composed","sereno y tranquilo","calme et posé","屋里乱得一塌糊涂，他却从容不迫地收拾起来，仿佛这样的场面早已司空见惯。","wū lǐ luàn de yì tā hú tú tā què cóng róng bú pò de shōu shi qǐ lái fǎng fú zhè yàng de chǎng miàn zǎo yǐ sī kōng jiàn guàn","The room was in a terrible mess, but he began tidying it calmly, as though such a scene were already commonplace to him.","El cuarto estaba hecho un desastre, pero él empezó a ordenar con calma, como si ya estuviera acostumbrado a escenas así.","La pièce était dans un désordre épouvantable, mais il s'est mis à ranger calmement, comme si une telle scène lui était depuis longtemps familière."],["L7-0641","从头","cóngtóu","Adv","from the start; anew","desde el principio; de nuevo","depuis le début; à nouveau","这篇文章逻辑太乱了，我决定从头再写一遍。","zhè piān wén zhāng luó jí tài luàn le wǒ jué dìng cóng tóu zài xiě yí biàn","The logic of this essay is too confused, so I've decided to rewrite it from the beginning.","La lógica de este artículo es muy confusa, así que decidí volver a escribirlo desde el principio.","La logique de cet article est trop confuse ; j'ai décidé de le réécrire depuis le début."],["L7-0642","从未","cóngwèi","Adv","never","nunca","jamais","这么美的日出，我以前从未见过。","zhè me měi de rì chū wǒ yǐ qián cóng wèi jiàn guò","I had never seen such a beautiful sunrise before.","Nunca antes había visto un amanecer tan hermoso.","Je n'avais encore jamais vu un aussi beau lever de soleil."],["L7-0643","从业","cóngyè","V","to work in a profession","ejercer una profesión","exercer un métier","这家律师事务所的合伙人都有十年以上的从业经验。","zhè jiā lǜ shī shì wù suǒ de hé huǒ rén dōu yǒu shí nián yǐ shàng de cóng yè jīng yàn","The partners at this law firm all have at least ten years of professional experience.","Los socios de este bufete de abogados tienen todos más de diez años de experiencia profesional.","Les associés de ce cabinet d'avocats ont tous plus de dix ans d'expérience professionnelle."],["L7-0644","从早到晚","cóngzǎo-dàowǎn","","from morning till night","de la mañana a la noche","du matin au soir","农忙季节，村民们从早到晚都在地里干活。","nóng máng jì jié cūn mín men cóng zǎo dào wǎn dōu zài dì lǐ gàn huó","During the busy farming season, villagers work in the fields from morning till night.","En la temporada de más trabajo agrícola, los aldeanos trabajan en el campo de la mañana a la noche.","Pendant la saison des gros travaux agricoles, les villageois travaillent aux champs du matin au soir."],["L7-0645","丛林","cónglín","N","jungle; forest","jungla; selva","jungle; forêt","这支探险队在热带丛林里迷了路。","zhè zhī tàn xiǎn duì zài rè dài cóng lín lǐ mí le lù","The expedition team got lost in the tropical jungle.","Este equipo de exploración se perdió en la selva tropical.","Cette équipe d'exploration s'est perdue dans la jungle tropicale."],["L7-0646","凑","còu","V","to gather; to approach; by chance","juntar; acercarse; por casualidad","rassembler; s'approcher; par hasard","大家凑了点钱，给生病的同事买了一束花。","dà jiā còu le diǎn qián gěi shēng bìng de tóng shì mǎi le yí shù huā","Everyone chipped in some money to buy a bunch of flowers for our sick colleague.","Entre todos juntamos algo de dinero y compramos un ramo de flores para nuestro compañero enfermo.","Nous avons tous mis un peu d'argent pour acheter un bouquet de fleurs à notre collègue malade."],["L7-0647","凑合","còuhe","V","to make do; to get by","arreglárselas; conformarse","se contenter de; se débrouiller","房子虽然小了点，但我们一家三口凑合着住也够了。","fáng zi suī rán xiǎo le diǎn dàn wǒ men yì jiā sān kǒu còu he zhe zhù yě gòu le","The apartment is a bit small, but it's good enough for the three of us to make do.","La casa es un poco pequeña, pero para nosotros tres nos basta arreglándonos como podamos.","L'appartement est un peu petit, mais à trois on s'en contentera très bien."],["L7-0648","凑巧","còuqiǎo","Adj","by chance; luckily","por casualidad; afortunadamente","par hasard; par chance","真凑巧，我刚想给你打电话，你就来了。","zhēn còu qiǎo wǒ gāng xiǎng gěi nǐ dǎ diàn huà nǐ jiù lái le","What a coincidence—I was just about to call you when you showed up.","¡Qué casualidad! Justo iba a llamarte y llegaste.","Quelle coïncidence ! J'allais justement t'appeler et te voilà."],["L7-0649","粗暴","cūbào","Adj","rough; brutal","brusco; brutal","brutal; rude","他对待孩子的态度太粗暴了，动不动就大声训斥。","tā duì dài hái zi de tài dù tài cū bào le dòng bu dòng jiù dà shēng xùn chì","He is far too harsh with his children and scolds them loudly at the slightest thing.","Es demasiado brusco con sus hijos y los regaña a gritos por cualquier cosa.","Il est beaucoup trop brutal avec ses enfants et les gronde à haute voix pour un rien."],["L7-0650","粗糙","cūcāo","Adj","rough; coarse","áspero; tosco","rugueux; grossier","这件衣服的做工比较粗糙，线头到处都是。","zhè jiàn yī fu de zuò gōng bǐ jiào cū cāo xiàn tóu dào chù dōu shì","This garment is rather crudely made, with loose threads everywhere.","Esta prenda está bastante mal confeccionada, tiene hilos sueltos por todas partes.","Ce vêtement est assez mal fini, il y a des fils qui dépassent partout."],["L7-0651","粗鲁","cūlǔ","Adj","rude; boorish","grosero; tosco","grossier; rustre","那位顾客说话很粗鲁，服务员却一直保持着微笑。","nà wèi gù kè shuō huà hěn cū lǔ fú wù yuán què yì zhí bǎo chí zhe wēi xiào","That customer spoke very rudely, but the waiter kept smiling the whole time.","Ese cliente habló de manera muy grosera, pero el mesero siguió sonriendo todo el tiempo.","Ce client a parlé très grossièrement, mais le serveur n'a pas cessé de sourire."],["L7-0652","粗略","cūlüè","Adj","rough; sketchy","aproximado; somero","approximatif; sommaire","我粗略算了一下，这次装修大概要花十万块。","wǒ cū lüè suàn le yí xià zhè cì zhuāng xiū dà gài yào huā shí wàn kuài","By my rough estimate, this renovation will cost about a hundred thousand yuan.","Hice un cálculo aproximado: esta remodelación costará unos cien mil yuanes.","J'ai fait un calcul approximatif : ces travaux vont coûter environ cent mille yuans."],["L7-0653","粗心大意","cūxīn-dàyì","","careless","descuidado","négligent; étourdi","考试时千万不能粗心大意，做完要认真检查。","kǎo shì shí qiān wàn bù néng cū xīn dà yì zuò wán yào rèn zhēn jiǎn chá","You mustn't be careless in the exam; check your work carefully when you finish.","En el examen no debes descuidarte para nada; al terminar, revisa con atención.","À l'examen, il ne faut surtout pas être négligent ; une fois fini, relis attentivement."],["L7-0654","促成","cùchéng","V","to bring about; to facilitate","propiciar; hacer posible","favoriser; faire aboutir","正是这次偶然的相遇，促成了两家公司的合作。","zhèng shì zhè cì ǒu rán de xiāng yù cù chéng le liǎng jiā gōng sī de hé zuò","It was this chance encounter that brought about the cooperation between the two companies.","Fue precisamente este encuentro casual el que hizo posible la colaboración entre las dos empresas.","C'est précisément cette rencontre fortuite qui a permis la coopération entre les deux entreprises."],["L7-0655","簇拥","cùyōng","V","to crowd around","rodear; escoltar","entourer; faire cortège","明星一下飞机，就被热情的粉丝簇拥着走出了机场。","míng xīng yí xià fēi jī jiù bèi rè qíng de fěn sī cù yōng zhe zǒu chū le jī chǎng","As soon as the star got off the plane, she was surrounded by enthusiastic fans as she walked out of the airport.","En cuanto la estrella bajó del avión, los fanáticos entusiastas la rodearon y la acompañaron fuera del aeropuerto.","Dès que la star est descendue de l'avion, elle a été entourée de fans enthousiastes qui l'ont escortée hors de l'aéroport."],["L7-0656","窜","cuàn","V","to flee; to scurry","huir; escabullirse","fuir; détaler","一只老鼠突然从墙角窜了出来，把她吓了一跳。","yì zhī lǎo shǔ tū rán cóng qiáng jiǎo cuàn le chū lái bǎ tā xià le yí tiào","A mouse suddenly darted out from the corner, giving her a fright.","Un ratón salió disparado de pronto de la esquina de la pared y le dio un susto.","Une souris a surgi soudain du coin du mur et lui a fait peur."],["L7-0657","催","cuī","V","to urge; to hasten","apremiar; apresurar","presser; hâter","房东已经催了好几次，让我们尽快交房租。","fáng dōng yǐ jīng cuī le hǎo jǐ cì ràng wǒ men jǐn kuài jiāo fáng zū","The landlord has already pressed us several times to pay the rent as soon as possible.","El casero ya nos ha apurado varias veces para que paguemos el alquiler cuanto antes.","Le propriétaire nous a déjà relancés plusieurs fois pour que nous payions le loyer au plus vite."],["L7-0658","催促","cuīcù","V","to urge; to press","instar; apremiar","presser; exhorter","妈妈一遍遍地催促孩子快点起床，不然就要迟到了。","mā ma yí biàn biàn dì cuī cù hái zi kuài diǎn qǐ chuáng bù rán jiù yào chí dào le","Mom kept urging the child to get up quickly, or he would be late.","Mamá le insistía una y otra vez al niño que se levantara rápido, o llegaría tarde.","Maman pressait sans cesse l'enfant de se lever vite, sinon il serait en retard."],["L7-0659","催眠","cuīmián","V","hypnosis; to hypnotize","hipnosis; hipnotizar","hypnose; hypnotiser","这首曲子节奏缓慢，有很好的催眠效果。","zhè shǒu qǔ zi jié zòu huǎn màn yǒu hěn hǎo de cuī mián xiào guǒ","This piece of music has a slow rhythm and is very effective at lulling people to sleep.","Esta melodía tiene un ritmo lento y es muy eficaz para dar sueño.","Ce morceau a un rythme lent et un très bon effet soporifique."],["L7-0660","摧毁","cuīhuǐ","V","to destroy; to wreck","destruir; arrasar","détruire; anéantir","一场强烈的台风摧毁了沿海的许多房屋。","yì chǎng qiáng liè de tái fēng cuī huǐ le yán hǎi de xǔ duō fáng wū","A powerful typhoon destroyed many houses along the coast.","Un fuerte tifón destruyó muchas casas de la costa.","Un violent typhon a détruit de nombreuses maisons sur la côte."],["L7-0661","脆弱","cuìruò","Adj","fragile; weak","frágil; débil","fragile; faible","经历了这次失败，他的自信心变得十分脆弱。","jīng lì le zhè cì shī bài tā de zì xìn xīn biàn de shí fēn cuì ruò","After this failure, his self-confidence became very fragile.","Después de este fracaso, su confianza en sí mismo se volvió muy frágil.","Après cet échec, sa confiance en lui est devenue très fragile."],["L7-0662","翠绿","cuìlǜ","Adj","emerald green","verde esmeralda","vert émeraude","雨后的竹林显得格外翠绿。","yǔ hòu de zhú lín xiǎn de gé wài cuì lǜ","After the rain, the bamboo grove looked especially emerald green.","Después de la lluvia, el bosque de bambú se ve de un verde especialmente intenso.","Après la pluie, la bambouseraie paraît d'un vert particulièrement éclatant."],["L7-0663","存放","cúnfàng","V","to store; to deposit","guardar; depositar","entreposer; déposer","这些药品需要存放在阴凉干燥的地方。","zhè xiē yào pǐn xū yào cún fàng zài yīn liáng gān zào de dì fang","These medicines need to be stored in a cool, dry place.","Estos medicamentos deben guardarse en un lugar fresco y seco.","Ces médicaments doivent être conservés dans un endroit frais et sec."],["L7-0664","存心","cúnxīn","V/Adv","deliberately; on purpose","a propósito; deliberadamente","exprès; délibérément","他不是存心要伤害你，只是说话太直了。","tā bú shì cún xīn yào shāng hài nǐ zhǐ shì shuō huà tài zhí le","He didn't mean to hurt you on purpose; he's just too blunt.","No lo hizo con la intención de herirte; es que habla con demasiada franqueza.","Il n'a pas voulu te blesser exprès ; il parle simplement trop franchement."],["L7-0665","存折","cúnzhé","N","bankbook; passbook","libreta de ahorros","livret bancaire","现在用存折的人越来越少，大家都习惯用手机银行了。","xiàn zài yòng cún zhé de rén yuè lái yuè shǎo dà jiā dōu xí guàn yòng shǒu jī yín háng le","Fewer and fewer people use bankbooks now; everyone has gotten used to mobile banking.","Cada vez menos gente usa libretas de ahorro; todos se han acostumbrado a la banca móvil.","De moins en moins de gens utilisent un livret d'épargne ; tout le monde s'est habitué à la banque sur mobile."],["L7-0666","搓","cuō","V","to rub; to twist","frotar; retorcer","frotter; rouler","天太冷了，他不停地搓着双手取暖。","tiān tài lěng le tā bù tíng de cuō zhe shuāng shǒu qǔ nuǎn","It was so cold that he kept rubbing his hands together to keep warm.","Hacía tanto frío que se frotaba las manos sin parar para entrar en calor.","Il faisait si froid qu'il se frottait les mains sans arrêt pour se réchauffer."],["L7-0667","磋商","cuōshāng","V","to negotiate; to consult","negociar; consultar","négocier; se concerter","双方代表就合同细节进行了多轮磋商。","shuāng fāng dài biǎo jiù hé tóng xì jié jìn xíng le duō lún cuō shāng","Representatives of the two sides held several rounds of consultations on the details of the contract.","Los representantes de ambas partes mantuvieron varias rondas de negociación sobre los detalles del contrato.","Les représentants des deux parties ont mené plusieurs séries de négociations sur les détails du contrat."],["L7-0668","挫折","cuòzhé","V/N","setback; frustration","revés; frustración","revers; échec","遇到挫折时，他从来没有退缩过。","yù dào cuò zhé shí tā cóng lái méi yǒu tuì suō guo","He has never shrunk back when facing setbacks.","Cuando se ha topado con reveses, nunca se ha echado atrás.","Face aux revers, il n'a jamais reculé."],["L7-0669","措手不及","cuòshǒu-bùjí","","caught off guard","pillado desprevenido","pris au dépourvu","大雨来得太突然，让路上的行人措手不及。","dà yǔ lái de tài tū rán ràng lù shang de xíng rén cuò shǒu bù jí","The heavy rain came so suddenly that pedestrians were caught off guard.","La fuerte lluvia llegó tan de repente que tomó desprevenidos a los transeúntes.","La forte pluie est arrivée si brusquement que les passants ont été pris au dépourvu."],["L7-0670","错别字","cuòbiézì","N","incorrect characters; typos","caracteres erróneos; erratas","caractères erronés; fautes d'écriture","请用红笔把文章里的错别字框出来。","qǐng yòng hóng bǐ bǎ wén zhāng lǐ de cuò bié zì kuàng chū lái","Please use a red pen to draw boxes around the incorrectly written characters in the essay.","Por favor, encierra en un recuadro con bolígrafo rojo los caracteres mal escritos del texto.","Veuillez encadrer au stylo rouge les caractères erronés dans le texte."],["L7-0671","错觉","cuòjué","N","illusion; misperception","ilusión; percepción errónea","illusion; fausse impression","站在这幅画前面，人会产生一种画中人在动的错觉。","zhàn zài zhè fú huà qián miàn rén huì chǎn shēng yì zhǒng huà zhōng rén zài dòng de cuò jué","Standing in front of this painting, you get the illusion that the people in it are moving.","Al estar frente a este cuadro, uno tiene la ilusión de que las figuras pintadas se mueven.","Devant ce tableau, on a l'illusion que les personnages peints bougent."],["L7-0672","错位","cuòwèi","","to be misplaced; dislocation","estar fuera de lugar; dislocación","décalage; déplacement","他打篮球时摔了一跤，肩关节错位了。","tā dǎ lán qiú shí shuāi le yì jiāo jiān guān jié cuò wèi le","He fell while playing basketball and dislocated his shoulder.","Se cayó mientras jugaba baloncesto y se dislocó el hombro.","Il est tombé en jouant au basket et s'est luxé l'épaule."],["L7-0673","错综复杂","cuòzōng-fùzá","","intricate; tangled","intrincado; complejo","complexe; enchevêtré","这起案件的人物关系错综复杂，警方调查了好几个月。","zhè qǐ àn jiàn de rén wù guān xì cuò zōng fù zá jǐng fāng diào chá le hǎo jǐ ge yuè","The relationships among the people in this case were extremely complicated, and the police investigated for several months.","Las relaciones entre los personajes de este caso eran sumamente enmarañadas, y la policía investigó durante varios meses.","Les relations entre les personnes impliquées dans cette affaire étaient extrêmement complexes, et la police a enquêté pendant plusieurs mois."],["L7-0674","搭乘","dāchéng","V","to travel by; to ride","viajar en; subirse a","prendre; voyager par","我们搭乘早上八点的航班飞往上海。","wǒ men dā chéng zǎo shang bā diǎn de háng bān fēi wǎng shàng hǎi","We are taking the eight a.m. flight to Shanghai.","Tomamos el vuelo de las ocho de la mañana a Shanghái.","Nous prenons le vol de huit heures du matin pour Shanghai."],["L7-0675","搭建","dājiàn","V","to build; to set up","construir; montar","construire; monter","灾民们暂时住在临时搭建的简易房里。","zāi mín men zàn shí zhù zài lín shí dā jiàn de jiǎn yì fáng lǐ","The disaster victims are temporarily living in basic shelters built for temporary use.","Los damnificados viven por ahora en viviendas sencillas construidas de forma provisional.","Les sinistrés vivent provisoirement dans des abris rudimentaires construits à la hâte."],["L7-0676","达标","dábiāo","V","to meet the standard","alcanzar el estándar","atteindre la norme","这家工厂的废水排放已经达标，可以恢复生产了。","zhè jiā gōng chǎng de fèi shuǐ pái fàng yǐ jīng dá biāo kě yǐ huī fù shēng chǎn le","The factory's wastewater discharge now meets the standards, so it can resume production.","Las aguas residuales de esta fábrica ya cumplen con la norma, así que puede reanudar la producción.","Les rejets d'eaux usées de cette usine sont désormais conformes aux normes ; elle peut reprendre sa production."],["L7-0677","答辩","dábiàn","V","to defend a thesis; to reply","defender una tesis; replicar","soutenir une thèse; répliquer","下个月就要进行毕业论文答辩了，他正在认真准备。","xià ge yuè jiù yào jìn xíng bì yè lùn wén dá biàn le tā zhèng zài rèn zhēn zhǔn bèi","His graduation thesis defense is next month, and he is preparing for it carefully.","El mes que viene tiene la defensa de su tesis de grado y se está preparando con seriedad.","La soutenance de son mémoire de fin d'études a lieu le mois prochain et il s'y prépare sérieusement."],["L7-0678","打岔","dǎchà","","to interrupt","interrumpir; cambiar de tema","interrompre; détourner la conversation","我正在跟客户谈事情，你先别打岔。","wǒ zhèng zài gēn kè hù tán shì qing nǐ xiān bié dǎ chà","I'm in the middle of talking business with a client, so please don't interrupt.","Estoy hablando de negocios con un cliente, así que no me interrumpas por ahora.","Je suis en train de parler affaires avec un client, alors ne m'interromps pas."],["L7-0679","打倒","dǎdǎo","","to overthrow; down with","derrocar; abajo","renverser; à bas","这次挫折并没有把他打倒，他很快又振作了起来。","zhè cì cuò zhé bìng méi yǒu bǎ tā dǎ dǎo tā hěn kuài yòu zhèn zuò le qǐ lái","This setback didn't knock him down; he soon picked himself up again.","Este revés no lo derrumbó; pronto se levantó de nuevo.","Ce revers ne l'a pas abattu ; il s'est vite ressaisi."],["L7-0680","打盹儿","dǎdǔnr","","to doze off","dar una cabezada","faire un somme","爷爷坐在阳台的躺椅上打盹儿，手里还拿着报纸。","yé ye zuò zài yáng tái de tǎng yǐ shàng dǎ dǔnr shǒu lǐ hái ná zhe bào zhǐ","Grandpa was dozing in the lounge chair on the balcony with a newspaper still in his hand.","El abuelo dormitaba en la reposera del balcón, con el periódico todavía en la mano.","Grand-père sommeillait dans le transat du balcon, le journal encore à la main."],["L7-0681","打交道","dǎ jiāodao","","to deal with; to have dealings","tratar con; relacionarse con","avoir affaire à; traiter avec","做销售工作，每天都要跟各种各样的人打交道。","zuò xiāo shòu gōng zuò měi tiān dōu yào gēn gè zhǒng gè yàng de rén dǎ jiāo dao","In sales, you have to deal with all kinds of people every day.","En ventas, todos los días hay que tratar con toda clase de personas.","Dans la vente, on a affaire chaque jour à toutes sortes de gens."],["L7-0682","打搅","dǎjiǎo","V","to disturb; to bother","molestar; perturbar","déranger; importuner","这么晚还来打搅您，真是不好意思。","zhè me wǎn hái lái dǎ jiǎo nín zhēn shì bù hǎo yì si","I'm really sorry to bother you so late.","Lamento mucho molestarlo a esta hora tan tardía.","Je suis vraiment désolé de vous déranger à une heure aussi tardive."],["L7-0683","打捞","dǎlāo","V","to salvage; to fish out","rescatar del agua; pescar","repêcher; renflouer","潜水员花了三天时间才把沉船打捞上来。","qián shuǐ yuán huā le sān tiān shí jiān cái bǎ chén chuán dǎ lāo shàng lái","It took the divers three days to salvage the sunken ship.","Los buzos tardaron tres días en rescatar el barco hundido.","Il a fallu trois jours aux plongeurs pour renflouer l'épave."],["L7-0684","打量","dǎliang","V","to size up; to look over","examinar de arriba abajo; evaluar","dévisager; jauger","门卫上下打量了他一番，才让他进去。","mén wèi shàng xià dǎ liang le tā yì fān cái ràng tā jìn qù","The guard looked him up and down before letting him in.","El guardia lo miró de arriba abajo antes de dejarlo pasar.","Le gardien l'a toisé de haut en bas avant de le laisser entrer."],["L7-0685","打猎","dǎliè","","to hunt","cazar","chasser","以前这里的村民主要靠打猎为生。","yǐ qián zhè lǐ de cūn mín zhǔ yào kào dǎ liè wéi shēng","In the past the villagers here mainly made a living by hunting.","Antes, los aldeanos de aquí vivían principalmente de la caza.","Autrefois, les villageois d'ici vivaient surtout de la chasse."],["L7-0686","打磨","dǎmó","V","to polish; to refine","pulir; perfeccionar","polir; peaufiner","这张桌子经过工匠的精心打磨，表面十分光滑。","zhè zhāng zhuō zi jīng guò gōng jiàng de jīng xīn dǎ mó biǎo miàn shí fēn guāng huá","After careful sanding by the craftsman, the surface of this table is very smooth.","Después de que el artesano la lijó con esmero, la superficie de esta mesa quedó muy lisa.","Après avoir été soigneusement poncée par l'artisan, la surface de cette table est très lisse."],["L7-0687","打通","dǎtōng","","to open up; to get through","abrir paso; establecer comunicación","ouvrir; établir la communication","这条隧道打通以后，两个城市之间的车程缩短了一半。","zhè tiáo suì dào dǎ tōng yǐ hòu liǎng gè chéng shì zhī jiān de chē chéng suō duǎn le yí bàn","Once this tunnel is opened up, the driving time between the two cities will be cut in half.","Una vez que se abrió este túnel, el trayecto en coche entre las dos ciudades se redujo a la mitad.","Une fois ce tunnel percé, le trajet en voiture entre les deux villes a été réduit de moitié."],["L7-0688","打仗","dǎzhàng","","to fight; to go to war","combatir; ir a la guerra","se battre; faire la guerre","爷爷年轻时上过战场打仗，腿上至今还留着伤疤。","yé ye nián qīng shí shàng guo zhàn chǎng dǎ zhàng tuǐ shàng zhì jīn hái liú zhe shāng bā","Grandpa went to the battlefield to fight when he was young, and he still has a scar on his leg.","El abuelo fue a combatir al frente cuando era joven y todavía tiene una cicatriz en la pierna.","Grand-père est allé se battre au front dans sa jeunesse et il garde encore une cicatrice à la jambe."],["L7-0689","打招呼","dǎ zhāohu","","to greet; to give notice","saludar; avisar","saluer; prévenir","我跟他打招呼，可是他根本不理睬我。","wǒ gēn tā dǎ zhāo hu kě shì tā gēn běn bù lǐ cǎi wǒ","I said hello to him, but he completely ignored me.","Lo saludé, pero me ignoró por completo.","Je l'ai salué, mais il ne m'a absolument pas prêté attention."],["L7-0690","大包大揽","dàbāo-dàlǎn","","to take everything on","asumirlo todo","tout prendre en charge","做领导不能什么事都大包大揽，要学会让下属分担。","zuò lǐng dǎo bù néng shén me shì dōu dà bāo dà lǎn yào xué huì ràng xià shǔ fēn dān","A leader shouldn't take everything on himself; he needs to learn to let subordinates share the load.","Un líder no debe cargar con todo él solo; tiene que aprender a dejar que sus subordinados compartan la carga.","Un chef ne doit pas tout prendre en charge lui-même ; il doit apprendre à laisser ses subordonnés partager la tâche."],["L7-0691","大笔","dàbǐ","N","large sum","gran suma; cantidad grande","grosse somme","这幅画还缺个题名，恭请您大笔一挥。","zhè fú huà hái quē gè tí míng gōng qǐng nín dà bǐ yì huī","This painting still needs a title; would you kindly inscribe one with your brush?","A esta pintura todavía le falta un título; le ruego que tenga la amabilidad de escribirlo con su pincel.","Ce tableau n'a pas encore de titre ; je vous prie de bien vouloir l'inscrire d'un coup de pinceau."],["L7-0692","大臣","dàchén","N","minister","ministro","ministre","戏里的大臣跪在地上，请求皇上收回成命。","xì lǐ de dà chén guì zài dì shang qǐng qiú huáng shang shōu huí chéng mìng","In the play, the minister knelt and begged the emperor to withdraw his order.","En la obra, el ministro se arrodilló en el suelo y suplicó al emperador que retirara su orden.","Dans la pièce, le ministre s'agenouille et supplie l'empereur de revenir sur son décret."],["L7-0693","大吃一惊","dàchī-yījīng","","to be greatly shocked","llevarse un gran susto","être stupéfait","看到他一下子瘦了这么多，朋友们都大吃一惊。","kàn dào tā yí xià zi shòu le zhè me duō péng you men dōu dà chī yì jīng","His friends were all taken aback to see how much weight he had suddenly lost.","Al verlo tan delgado de repente, todos sus amigos se quedaron atónitos.","En le voyant avoir tout à coup autant maigri, ses amis ont tous été stupéfaits."],["L7-0694","大大咧咧","dàdaliēliē","Adj","careless; casual","despreocupado; descuidado","insouciant; sans-gêne","她性格大大咧咧的，从来不把小事放在心上。","tā xìng gé dà dà liē liē de cóng lái bù bǎ xiǎo shì fàng zài xīn shàng","She has a carefree personality and never takes little things to heart.","Es de carácter despreocupado y nunca se toma a pecho las cosas pequeñas.","Elle a un caractère insouciant et ne se soucie jamais des petites choses."],["L7-0695","大地","dàdì","N","earth; land","tierra; suelo","terre","春风吹过，大地又重新披上了绿装。","chūn fēng chuī guò dà dì yòu chóng xīn pī shàng le lǜ zhuāng","As the spring breeze blows, the earth is once again dressed in green.","Cuando sopla la brisa primaveral, la tierra se viste de nuevo de verde.","Quand souffle la brise printanière, la terre se revêt de nouveau de vert."],["L7-0696","大队","dàduì","N","large group; brigade","gran grupo; brigada","grand groupe; brigade","消防大队接到报警后，五分钟内就赶到了现场。","xiāo fáng dà duì jiē dào bào jǐng hòu wǔ fēn zhōng nèi jiù gǎn dào le xiàn chǎng","After receiving the alarm, the fire brigade reached the scene within five minutes.","Al recibir la alarma, la brigada de bomberos llegó al lugar en cinco minutos.","Après avoir reçu l'alerte, la brigade de pompiers est arrivée sur les lieux en moins de cinq minutes."],["L7-0697","大幅度","dà fúdù","","substantially; by a wide margin","considerablemente; en gran medida","considérablement; fortement","由于原材料涨价，这款手机的售价大幅度提高了。","yóu yú yuán cái liào zhǎng jià zhè kuǎn shǒu jī de shòu jià dà fú dù tí gāo le","Because raw material prices rose, the price of this phone went up substantially.","Debido al aumento de precio de las materias primas, el precio de este teléfono subió considerablemente.","En raison de la hausse du prix des matières premières, le prix de ce téléphone a fortement augmenté."],["L7-0698","大公无私","dàgōng-wúsī","","selfless and impartial","desinteresado e imparcial","désintéressé et impartial","他在工作中一向大公无私，从来不为自己谋好处。","tā zài gōng zuò zhōng yí xiàng dà gōng wú sī cóng lái bú wèi zì jǐ móu hǎo chù","He has always been completely selfless at work and never seeks advantages for himself.","En el trabajo siempre ha sido totalmente imparcial y desinteresado, y nunca busca beneficios para sí mismo.","Au travail, il a toujours été parfaitement désintéressé et ne cherche jamais à en tirer profit."],["L7-0699","大家庭","dàjiātíng","N","big family","familia numerosa","grande famille","过年时，我们这个大家庭四代人聚在一起吃团圆饭。","guò nián shí wǒ men zhè ge dà jiā tíng sì dài rén jù zài yì qǐ chī tuán yuán fàn","At New Year, four generations of our big family gather for a reunion dinner.","En Año Nuevo, cuatro generaciones de nuestra gran familia nos reunimos a cenar.","Au Nouvel An, quatre générations de notre grande famille se réunissent pour le dîner de retrouvailles."],["L7-0700","大街小巷","dàjiē-xiǎoxiàng","","streets and alleys everywhere","calles y callejones por doquier","rues et ruelles partout","春节期间，大街小巷都充满了喜庆的气氛。","chūn jié qī jiān dà jiē xiǎo xiàng dōu chōng mǎn le xǐ qìng de qì fēn","During the Spring Festival, the streets and lanes are full of a festive atmosphere.","Durante la Fiesta de la Primavera, todas las calles y callejones se llenan de un ambiente festivo.","Pendant la Fête du Printemps, toutes les rues et ruelles sont remplies d'une ambiance festive."],["L7-0701","大惊小怪","dàjīng-xiǎoguài","","to make a fuss over nothing","alarmarse por nada","faire toute une histoire pour rien","孩子摔一跤是很正常的事，你不必大惊小怪。","hái zi shuāi yì jiāo shì hěn zhèng cháng de shì nǐ bú bì dà jīng xiǎo guài","It's perfectly normal for a child to fall down; there's no need to make a fuss.","Es muy normal que un niño se caiga; no hace falta que armes tanto alboroto.","Il est tout à fait normal qu'un enfant tombe ; inutile d'en faire toute une histoire."],["L7-0702","大局","dàjú","N","overall situation; big picture","situación general; panorama","situation d'ensemble","遇到分歧时，大家要以大局为重，不要只考虑个人得失。","yù dào fēn qí shí dà jiā yào yǐ dà jú wéi zhòng bú yào zhǐ kǎo lǜ gè rén dé shī","When disagreements arise, everyone should put the big picture first and not think only of personal gain or loss.","Cuando surjan diferencias, hay que priorizar el interés general y no pensar solo en ganancias o pérdidas personales.","En cas de désaccord, il faut faire passer l'intérêt général avant tout et ne pas penser seulement à ses gains ou pertes personnels."],["L7-0703","大款","dàkuǎn","N","rich person; tycoon","ricachón; magnate","richard; nabab","他做生意发了财，成了村里有名的大款。","tā zuò shēng yi fā le cái chéng le cūn lǐ yǒu míng de dà kuǎn","He made a fortune in business and became a well-known moneybags in the village.","Hizo fortuna con los negocios y se convirtió en el ricachón más conocido del pueblo.","Il a fait fortune dans les affaires et est devenu le richard le plus connu du village."],["L7-0704","大面积","dà miànjī","","large area; widespread","gran superficie; a gran escala","grande surface; à grande échelle","这场干旱十分持久，农作物大面积减产。","zhè chǎng gān hàn shí fēn chí jiǔ nóng zuò wù dà miàn jī jiǎn chǎn","The drought has lasted a very long time, and crop yields have fallen across large areas.","Esta sequía ha sido muy prolongada y la producción de cultivos ha caído en grandes áreas.","Cette sécheresse a été très longue, et les récoltes ont baissé sur de vastes zones."],["L7-0705","大名鼎鼎","dàmíng-dǐngdǐng","","famous; renowned","famosísimo; de gran renombre","très célèbre; renommé","这位大名鼎鼎的导演，生活中其实非常低调。","zhè wèi dà míng dǐng dǐng de dǎo yǎn shēng huó zhōng qí shí fēi cháng dī diào","This famous director is actually very low-key in everyday life.","Este director tan famoso es, en realidad, muy discreto en su vida diaria.","Ce réalisateur très célèbre est en réalité très discret dans la vie de tous les jours."],["L7-0706","大模大样","dàmú-dàyàng","","boldly; self-assured","con aire arrogante; con desparpajo","avec aplomb; d'un air dégagé","他大模大样地坐在经理的椅子上，好像自己才是老板。","tā dà mú dà yàng de zuò zài jīng lǐ de yǐ zi shàng hǎo xiàng zì jǐ cái shì lǎo bǎn","He sat in the manager's chair as if he owned the place, acting like he was the boss.","Se sentó con total desparpajo en la silla del gerente, como si el jefe fuera él.","Il s'est assis avec aplomb dans le fauteuil du directeur, comme si c'était lui le patron."],["L7-0707","大棚","dàpéng","N","greenhouse","invernadero","serre","有了蔬菜大棚，冬天也能吃上新鲜的黄瓜和西红柿。","yǒu le shū cài dà péng dōng tiān yě néng chī shàng xīn xiān de huáng guā hé xī hóng shì","With vegetable greenhouses, we can eat fresh cucumbers and tomatoes even in winter.","Gracias a los invernaderos de hortalizas, en invierno también se pueden comer pepinos y tomates frescos.","Grâce aux serres maraîchères, on peut manger des concombres et des tomates frais même en hiver."],["L7-0708","大片","dàpiàn","N","vast area; blockbuster","gran extensión; superproducción","vaste étendue; superproduction","台风毁坏了大片农田和房屋。","tái fēng huǐ huài le dà piàn nóng tián hé fáng wū","The typhoon destroyed large areas of farmland and many houses.","El tifón destruyó extensas tierras de cultivo y muchas casas.","Le typhon a détruit de vastes étendues de terres agricoles et de nombreuses maisons."],["L7-0709","大气","dàqì","N","atmosphere; impressive","atmósfera; imponente","atmosphère; imposant","科学家发现，大气中的二氧化碳浓度逐年上升。","kē xué jiā fā xiàn dà qì zhōng de èr yǎng huà tàn nóng dù zhú nián shàng shēng","Scientists have found that the concentration of carbon dioxide in the atmosphere is rising year by year.","Los científicos han descubierto que la concentración de dióxido de carbono en la atmósfera aumenta cada año.","Les scientifiques ont constaté que la concentration de dioxyde de carbone dans l'atmosphère augmente d'année en année."],["L7-0710","大厦","dàshà","N","large building; mansion","edificio grande; rascacielos","grand immeuble; tour","这座新落成的大厦是城里最高的建筑。","zhè zuò xīn luò chéng de dà shà shì chéng lǐ zuì gāo de jiàn zhù","This newly completed tower is the tallest building in the city.","Este edificio recién terminado es la construcción más alta de la ciudad.","Cet immeuble tout juste achevé est le plus haut bâtiment de la ville."],["L7-0711","大数据","dàshùjù","N","big data","big data; datos masivos","big data; mégadonnées","商家通过大数据分析，了解顾客的购物习惯。","shāng jiā tōng guò dà shù jù fēn xī liǎo jiě gù kè de gòu wù xí guàn","Businesses use big data analysis to understand customers' shopping habits.","Los comerciantes analizan big data para conocer los hábitos de compra de los clientes.","Les commerçants analysent les mégadonnées pour comprendre les habitudes d'achat des clients."],["L7-0712","大肆","dàsì","Adv","wantonly; without restraint","desenfrenadamente","sans retenue; à outrance","殖民者曾经大肆掠夺这片土地上的资源。","zhí mín zhě céng jīng dà sì lüè duó zhè piàn tǔ dì shàng de zī yuán","The colonizers once plundered this land's resources on a massive scale.","Los colonizadores saquearon a gran escala los recursos de estas tierras.","Les colonisateurs ont pillé massivement les ressources de ces terres."],["L7-0713","大体","dàtǐ","Adv","in general; on the whole","en general; a grandes rasgos","dans l'ensemble; globalement","这两份报告的内容大体相同，只是数据略有出入。","zhè liǎng fèn bào gào de nèi róng dà tǐ xiāng tóng zhǐ shì shù jù lüè yǒu chū rù","The contents of the two reports are broadly the same; only the figures differ slightly.","El contenido de estos dos informes es básicamente el mismo; solo los datos difieren un poco.","Le contenu de ces deux rapports est globalement le même ; seuls les chiffres diffèrent légèrement."],["L7-0714","大体上","dàtǐ shang","","generally; on the whole","en general; en líneas generales","en général; dans l'ensemble","大体上说，这次改革还是比较成功的。","dà tǐ shàng shuō zhè cì gǎi gé hái shi bǐ jiào chéng gōng de","Generally speaking, this reform has been fairly successful.","En términos generales, esta reforma ha tenido bastante éxito.","Dans l'ensemble, cette réforme a plutôt bien réussi."],["L7-0715","大同小异","dàtóng-xiǎoyì","","largely the same","casi igual; con diferencias menores","à peu près identique","这几家店卖的东西大同小异，价格也差不多。","zhè jǐ jiā diàn mài de dōng xi dà tóng xiǎo yì jià gé yě chà bu duō","The goods sold in these few shops are much the same, and the prices are similar too.","Lo que venden estas tiendas es casi lo mismo y los precios también son parecidos.","Ces magasins vendent à peu près la même chose, et les prix sont à peu près identiques."],["L7-0716","大腕儿","dàwànr","N","big name; bigwig","figura destacada; pez gordo","grande figure; ponte","这部电影请来了好几位演艺圈的大腕儿。","zhè bù diàn yǐng qǐng lái le hǎo jǐ wèi yǎn yì quān de dà wànr","This film brought in several big names from show business.","Esta película contó con varias grandes figuras del mundo del espectáculo.","Ce film a fait appel à plusieurs grands noms du monde du spectacle."],["L7-0717","大选","dàxuǎn","V","general election","elecciones generales","élections générales","这个国家每四年举行一次大选。","zhè ge guó jiā měi sì nián jǔ xíng yí cì dà xuǎn","This country holds a general election every four years.","Este país celebra elecciones generales cada cuatro años.","Ce pays organise des élections générales tous les quatre ans."],["L7-0718","大雁","dàyàn","N","wild goose","ganso silvestre","oie sauvage","秋天来了，一群大雁排成人字形向南飞去。","qiū tiān lái le yì qún dà yàn pái chéng rén zì xíng xiàng nán fēi qù","Autumn has come, and a flock of wild geese is flying south in a V formation.","Llegó el otoño y una bandada de gansos salvajes vuela hacia el sur en forma de V.","L'automne est arrivé et une troupe d'oies sauvages s'envole vers le sud en formation en V."],["L7-0719","大意","dàyì","N","general idea; gist","idea general; esencia","idée générale; grandes lignes","这次是我太大意了，把开会的时间记错了。","zhè cì shì wǒ tài dà yi le bǎ kāi huì de shí jiān jì cuò le","It was my carelessness this time; I got the meeting time wrong.","Esta vez fui muy descuidado y anoté mal la hora de la reunión.","Cette fois, j'ai été trop distrait et je me suis trompé sur l'heure de la réunion."],["L7-0720","大意","dàyi","Adj","careless","descuidado","négligent","这次是我太大意了，把开会的时间记错了。","zhè cì shì wǒ tài dà yi le bǎ kāi huì de shí jiān jì cuò le","It was my carelessness this time; I got the meeting time wrong.","Esta vez fui muy descuidado y anoté mal la hora de la reunión.","Cette fois, j'ai été trop distrait et je me suis trompé sur l'heure de la réunion."],["L7-0721","大有可为","dàyǒu-kěwéi","","full of promise","con gran futuro; muy prometedor","plein d'avenir","随着人口老龄化，养老服务行业大有可为。","suí zhe rén kǒu lǎo líng huà yǎng lǎo fú wù háng yè dà yǒu kě wéi","With the aging of the population, the elderly care industry has great prospects.","Con el envejecimiento de la población, el sector de los servicios para adultos mayores tiene un gran futuro.","Avec le vieillissement de la population, le secteur des services aux personnes âgées a un grand avenir."],["L7-0722","大宗","dàzōng","Adj/N","large amount; bulk","gran cantidad; a granel","grande quantité; en gros","伊斯兰教是世界三大宗教之一。","yī sī lán jiào shì shì jiè sān dà zōng jiào zhī yī","Islam is one of the world's three major religions.","El islam es una de las tres grandes religiones del mundo.","L'islam est l'une des trois grandes religions du monde."],["L7-0723","歹徒","dǎitú","N","thug; criminal","malhechor; bandido","malfaiteur; bandit","那个歹徒手里拿着一支手枪。","nà ge dǎi tú shǒu lǐ ná zhe yì zhī shǒu qiāng","The gangster was holding a pistol in his hand.","Aquel malhechor tenía una pistola en la mano.","Ce malfrat tenait un pistolet à la main."],["L7-0724","逮","dǎi","V","to catch; to seize","atrapar; capturar","attraper; saisir","家里的小猫昨天夜里逮住了一只老鼠。","jiā lǐ de xiǎo māo zuó tiān yè lǐ dǎi zhù le yì zhī lǎo shǔ","Our kitten caught a mouse last night.","Anoche el gatito de casa atrapó un ratón.","Cette nuit, notre chaton a attrapé une souris."],["L7-0725","代号","dàihào","N","code name","nombre en clave","nom de code","这项秘密研究计划的代号叫“蓝鲸”。","zhè xiàng mì mì yán jiū jì huà de dài hào jiào lán jīng","The code name of this secret research project is \"Blue Whale.\"","El nombre clave de este proyecto de investigación secreto es «Ballena Azul».","Le nom de code de ce projet de recherche secret est « Baleine bleue »."],["L7-0726","代理人","dàilǐrén","N","agent; proxy","agente; representante","mandataire; agent","他出国期间，公司的日常事务由代理人负责处理。","tā chū guó qī jiān gōng sī de rì cháng shì wù yóu dài lǐ rén fù zé chǔ lǐ","While he is abroad, the company's daily affairs are handled by his agent.","Mientras él está en el extranjero, los asuntos cotidianos de la empresa están a cargo de su apoderado.","Pendant son séjour à l'étranger, les affaires courantes de l'entreprise sont gérées par son mandataire."],["L7-0727","代言人","dàiyánrén","N","spokesperson","portavoz","porte-parole","这位奥运冠军成了一家运动品牌的代言人。","zhè wèi ào yùn guàn jūn chéng le yì jiā yùn dòng pǐn pái de dài yán rén","This Olympic champion became the spokesperson for a sportswear brand.","Esta campeona olímpica se convirtió en la imagen de una marca deportiva.","Cette championne olympique est devenue l'ambassadrice d'une marque de sport."],["L7-0728","带队","dàiduì","V","to lead a group","dirigir un grupo","diriger un groupe","这次野外考察由王教授亲自带队。","zhè cì yě wài kǎo chá yóu wáng jiào shòu qīn zì dài duì","Professor Wang is personally leading this field survey.","Esta expedición de campo la dirige personalmente el profesor Wang.","Cette mission d'étude sur le terrain est menée en personne par le professeur Wang."],["L7-0729","带路","dàilù","","to lead the way","guiar; mostrar el camino","montrer le chemin","我对这一带不熟，能麻烦你给我带路吗？","wǒ duì zhè yí dài bù shú néng má fan nǐ gěi wǒ dài lù ma","I don't know this area well; could I trouble you to show me the way?","No conozco bien esta zona; ¿podrías hacerme el favor de guiarme?","Je ne connais pas bien ce quartier ; pourriez-vous me montrer le chemin ?"],["L7-0730","带头","dàitóu","","to take the lead","tomar la iniciativa; dar ejemplo","prendre l'initiative; donner l'exemple","在这次抗洪救灾中，党员们带头冲在了最前面。","zài zhè cì kàng hóng jiù zāi zhōng dǎng yuán men dài tóu chōng zài le zuì qián miàn","During the flood relief effort, party members took the lead and rushed to the front line.","En esta labor de lucha contra la inundación y auxilio, los miembros del partido tomaron la iniciativa y se pusieron en primera línea.","Lors de ces secours contre les inondations, les membres du Parti ont montré l'exemple en se précipitant en première ligne."],["L7-0731","带头人","dàitóurén","N","leader; pioneer","líder; pionero","chef de file; pionnier","他是村里脱贫致富的带头人，大家都很信任他。","tā shì cūn lǐ tuō pín zhì fù de dài tóu rén dà jiā dōu hěn xìn rèn tā","He is the leader of the village's efforts to escape poverty and get rich, and everyone trusts him.","Él es quien encabeza al pueblo en su salida de la pobreza hacia la prosperidad, y todos confían en él.","C'est lui qui mène le village hors de la pauvreté vers la prospérité, et tout le monde lui fait confiance."],["L7-0732","待","dài","V","to stay; to treat","quedarse; tratar","rester; traiter","失业以后，他变得很颓废，整天待在家里。","shī yè yǐ hòu tā biàn de hěn tuí fèi zhěng tiān dāi zài jiā lǐ","After losing his job, he became very dispirited and stayed home all day.","Tras perder el empleo, se volvió muy abatido y se pasaba todo el día en casa.","Après avoir perdu son emploi, il est devenu très abattu et reste chez lui toute la journée."],["L7-0733","怠工","dàigōng","","to slow down work","trabajar con desgana; hacer huelga de celo","ralentir le travail; faire la grève du zèle","工人们因为长期拿不到加班费，开始消极怠工。","gōng rén men yīn wèi cháng qī ná bu dào jiā bān fèi kāi shǐ xiāo jí dài gōng","Because they hadn't been paid overtime for a long time, the workers began a go-slow.","Como llevaban mucho tiempo sin cobrar las horas extras, los obreros empezaron a trabajar a desgana.","Comme ils n'étaient plus payés pour leurs heures supplémentaires depuis longtemps, les ouvriers ont commencé à ralentir volontairement le travail."],["L7-0734","怠慢","dàimàn","V","to slight; to neglect","desatender; tratar con descortesía","négliger; manquer d'égards","客人远道而来，我们可不能怠慢了人家。","kè rén yuǎn dào ér lái wǒ men kě bù néng dài màn le rén jia","Our guests have come a long way, so we mustn't neglect them.","Los invitados han venido de lejos; no podemos descuidar su atención.","Nos invités ont fait un long chemin ; nous ne devons surtout pas les négliger."],["L7-0735","逮捕","dàibǔ","V","to arrest","arrestar; detener","arrêter; appréhender","这名诈骗犯在机场被警方当场逮捕。","zhè míng zhà piàn fàn zài jī chǎng bèi jǐng fāng dāng chǎng dài bǔ","The swindler was arrested by police on the spot at the airport.","Este estafador fue detenido en el acto por la policía en el aeropuerto.","Ce fraudeur a été arrêté sur-le-champ par la police à l'aéroport."],["L7-0736","担","dān","V","to carry; to take on","cargar; asumir","porter; assumer","你放心去做吧，出了问题由我来担。","nǐ fàng xīn qù zuò ba chū le wèn tí yóu wǒ lái dān","Go ahead and do it without worry; if anything goes wrong, I'll take responsibility.","Tranquilo, hazlo; si surge algún problema, yo asumo la responsabilidad.","Vas-y sans crainte ; s'il y a un problème, j'en assume la responsabilité."],["L7-0737","担当","dāndāng","V","to take on; to bear responsibility","asumir; responsabilizarse de","assumer; prendre en charge","这项重任只有经验丰富的老李才能担当。","zhè xiàng zhòng rèn zhǐ yǒu jīng yàn fēng fù de lǎo lǐ cái néng dān dāng","Only the experienced Lao Li can take on this important task.","Esta tarea tan importante solo la puede asumir el experimentado Lao Li.","Seul le très expérimenté Lao Li peut assumer cette lourde tâche."],["L7-0738","担负","dānfù","V","to shoulder; to bear","asumir; cargar con","assumer; endosser","父亲去世后，他早早地担负起了养家的责任。","fù qīn qù shì hòu tā zǎo zǎo de dān fù qǐ le yǎng jiā de zé rèn","After his father died, he took on the responsibility of supporting the family at an early age.","Tras la muerte de su padre, asumió desde muy joven la responsabilidad de mantener a la familia.","Après la mort de son père, il a très tôt assumé la responsabilité de faire vivre la famille."],["L7-0739","单边","dānbiān","Adj","unilateral","unilateral","unilatéral","两国专家认为，单边制裁很难真正解决问题。","liǎng guó zhuān jiā rèn wéi dān biān zhì cái hěn nán zhēn zhèng jiě jué wèn tí","Experts from both countries believe unilateral sanctions can hardly solve the problem.","Los expertos de ambos países creen que las sanciones unilaterales difícilmente resolverán el problema de verdad.","Les experts des deux pays estiment que des sanctions unilatérales ont peu de chances de vraiment résoudre le problème."],["L7-0740","单薄","dānbó","Adj","thin; frail; weak","delgado; frágil; débil","mince; frêle; faible","天这么冷，你穿得太单薄了，小心感冒。","tiān zhè me lěng nǐ chuān de tài dān bó le xiǎo xīn gǎn mào","It's so cold out and you're dressed too thinly; be careful not to catch a cold.","Hace tanto frío y vas muy ligero de ropa; cuidado con resfriarte.","Il fait si froid et tu es trop légèrement vêtu ; fais attention de ne pas attraper un rhume."],["L7-0741","单方面","dānfāngmiàn","N","unilateral; one-sided","unilateral; por una sola parte","unilatéral","对方单方面撕毁了合同，我们只好通过法律途径解决。","duì fāng dān fāng miàn sī huǐ le hé tóng wǒ men zhǐ hǎo tōng guò fǎ lǜ tú jìng jiě jué","The other party unilaterally tore up the contract, so we had to resort to legal means.","La otra parte rompió el contrato unilateralmente, así que no nos quedó más remedio que resolverlo por la vía legal.","L'autre partie a déchiré le contrat unilatéralement, nous n'avons donc eu d'autre choix que de passer par la voie judiciaire."],["L7-0742","单身","dānshēn","N","single; unmarried","soltero; sin pareja","célibataire","他三十多岁了还是单身，父母天天催他找对象。","tā sān shí duō suì le hái shi dān shēn fù mǔ tiān tiān cuī tā zhǎo duì xiàng","He's in his thirties and still single, and his parents nag him every day to find a partner.","Ya pasó de los treinta y sigue soltero, y sus padres lo presionan todos los días para que busque pareja.","Il a plus de trente ans et est toujours célibataire ; ses parents le pressent tous les jours de se trouver quelqu'un."],["L7-0743","耽搁","dānge","V","to delay; to stop over","retrasar; detenerse","retarder; s'attarder","路上遇到了交通事故，我们耽搁了一个多小时。","lù shang yù dào le jiāo tōng shì gù wǒ men dān ge le yí ge duō xiǎo shí","We ran into a traffic accident on the way and were held up for more than an hour.","En el camino nos topamos con un accidente de tránsito y nos retrasamos más de una hora.","Nous sommes tombés sur un accident de la route et avons été retardés de plus d'une heure."],["L7-0744","耽误","dānwu","V","to delay; to waste time","retrasar; hacer perder tiempo","retarder; faire perdre du temps","你快去睡觉吧，别耽误了明天的考试。","nǐ kuài qù shuì jiào ba bié dān wu le míng tiān de kǎo shì","Go to bed now; don't let it affect tomorrow's exam.","Ve a dormir ya, que no vayas a arruinar el examen de mañana.","Va vite te coucher, ne compromets pas ton examen de demain."],["L7-0745","胆怯","dǎnqiè","Adj","timid; cowardly","tímido; cobarde","timide; peureux","第一次在这么多人面前唱歌，她心里有些胆怯。","dì yī cì zài zhè me duō rén miàn qián chàng gē tā xīn lǐ yǒu xiē dǎn qiè","It was her first time singing in front of so many people, and she felt a bit timid.","Era la primera vez que cantaba delante de tanta gente y se sentía algo cohibida.","C'était la première fois qu'elle chantait devant autant de monde, et elle était un peu intimidée."],["L7-0746","胆子","dǎnzi","N","courage; nerve","valor; coraje","courage; audace","这孩子胆子特别小，晚上不敢一个人睡觉。","zhè hái zi dǎn zi tè bié xiǎo wǎn shang bù gǎn yí ge rén shuì jiào","This child is very timid and doesn't dare to sleep alone at night.","Este niño es muy miedoso y no se atreve a dormir solo por la noche.","Cet enfant est très peureux et n'ose pas dormir seul la nuit."],["L7-0747","但愿","dànyuàn","V","I hope; if only","ojalá; espero que","pourvu que; espérons que","但愿明天不要下雨，我们还打算去郊游呢。","dàn yuàn míng tiān bú yào xià yǔ wǒ men hái dǎ suàn qù jiāo yóu ne","I hope it doesn't rain tomorrow; we're planning to go on an outing.","Ojalá no llueva mañana, porque pensamos ir de excursión.","Pourvu qu'il ne pleuve pas demain, nous comptons faire une sortie à la campagne."],["L7-0748","担","dàn","M","load (measure word)","carga (clasificador)","charge (classificateur)","你放心去做吧，出了问题由我来担。","nǐ fàng xīn qù zuò ba chū le wèn tí yóu wǒ lái dān","Go ahead and do it without worry; if anything goes wrong, I'll take responsibility.","Tranquilo, hazlo; si surge algún problema, yo asumo la responsabilidad.","Vas-y sans crainte ; s'il y a un problème, j'en assume la responsabilité."],["L7-0749","担子","dànzi","N","burden; responsibility","carga; responsabilidad","fardeau; responsabilité","这副担子太重了，他一个人挑不起来。","zhè fù dàn zi tài zhòng le tā yí ge rén tiāo bù qǐ lái","This load on the carrying pole is too heavy for him to lift alone.","Esta carga es demasiado pesada y él solo no puede levantarla.","Ce fardeau est trop lourd, il ne peut pas le soulever tout seul."],["L7-0750","诞辰","dànchén","N","birthday","cumpleaños; natalicio","anniversaire de naissance","今年是这位伟大作家诞辰一百五十周年。","jīn nián shì zhè wèi wěi dà zuò jiā dàn chén yì bǎi wǔ shí zhōu nián","This year marks the hundred-and-fiftieth anniversary of this great writer's birth.","Este año se cumplen ciento cincuenta años del nacimiento de este gran escritor.","Cette année marque le cent cinquantième anniversaire de la naissance de ce grand écrivain."],["L7-0751","淡化","dànhuà","V","to play down; to weaken","restar importancia; debilitar","minimiser; atténuer","他想淡化这次事故的影响，可是媒体不断追问。","tā xiǎng dàn huà zhè cì shì gù de yǐng xiǎng kě shì méi tǐ bú duàn zhuī wèn","He tried to play down the impact of the accident, but the media kept pressing him with questions.","Quiso restarle importancia al efecto del accidente, pero los medios no dejaban de preguntarle.","Il a voulu minimiser les conséquences de l'accident, mais les médias n'ont cessé de l'interroger."],["L7-0752","淡季","dànjì","N","off season","temporada baja","basse saison","旅游淡季的时候，机票和酒店都便宜很多。","lǚ yóu dàn jì de shí hou jī piào hé jiǔ diàn dōu pián yi hěn duō","During the tourist off-season, flights and hotels are much cheaper.","En temporada baja de turismo, los boletos de avión y los hoteles son mucho más baratos.","En basse saison touristique, les billets d'avion et les hôtels sont beaucoup moins chers."],["L7-0753","蛋白质","dànbáizhì","N","protein","proteína","protéine","鸡蛋和牛奶都含有丰富的蛋白质。","jī dàn hé niú nǎi dōu hán yǒu fēng fù de dàn bái zhì","Eggs and milk are both rich in protein.","Tanto los huevos como la leche contienen abundante proteína.","Les œufs et le lait sont tous deux riches en protéines."],["L7-0754","当即","dāngjí","Adv","immediately","de inmediato","aussitôt","听说村里发生了火灾，他当即开车赶了回去。","tīng shuō cūn lǐ fā shēng le huǒ zāi tā dāng jí kāi chē gǎn le huí qù","When he heard there was a fire in the village, he immediately drove back.","Al enterarse de que había un incendio en el pueblo, regresó de inmediato en coche.","En apprenant qu'un incendie s'était déclaré au village, il est aussitôt rentré en voiture."],["L7-0755","当今","dāngjīn","N","nowadays; present","hoy en día; actual","de nos jours; actuel","在当今社会，终身学习变得越来越重要。","zài dāng jīn shè huì zhōng shēn xué xí biàn de yuè lái yuè zhòng yào","In today's society, lifelong learning is becoming more and more important.","En la sociedad actual, el aprendizaje permanente se vuelve cada vez más importante.","Dans la société d'aujourd'hui, l'apprentissage tout au long de la vie devient de plus en plus important."],["L7-0756","当面","dāngmiàn","","face to face; to one's face","cara a cara; en persona","en face; en personne","他是个小人，当面一套，背后一套。","tā shì gè xiǎo rén dāng miàn yí tào bèi hòu yí tào","He is a petty person who says one thing to your face and another behind your back.","Es un hombre ruin: te dice una cosa en tu cara y hace otra a tus espaldas.","C'est un homme méprisable : il tient un discours en face et un autre dans votre dos."],["L7-0757","当日","dāngrì","N","that day; same day","ese día; el mismo día","ce jour-là; le jour même","这张门票仅在购买当日有效，过期作废。","zhè zhāng mén piào jǐn zài gòu mǎi dàng rì yǒu xiào guò qī zuò fèi","This admission ticket is valid only on the day of purchase and becomes void afterwards.","Esta entrada solo es válida el día de la compra; después queda anulada.","Ce billet n'est valable que le jour de l'achat ; passé ce délai, il est périmé."],["L7-0758","当事人","dāngshìrén","N","person concerned; party","parte implicada; interesado","personne concernée; partie","法院驳回了这项请求，但当事人仍可依法提出上诉。","fǎ yuàn bó huí le zhè xiàng qǐng qiú dàn dāng shì rén réng kě yī fǎ tí chū shàng sù","The court rejected the request, but the party concerned may still appeal in accordance with the law.","El tribunal rechazó esta solicitud, pero la parte interesada aún puede apelar conforme a la ley.","Le tribunal a rejeté cette demande, mais la partie concernée peut encore faire appel conformément à la loi."],["L7-0759","当务之急","dāngwùzhījí","","top priority","prioridad inmediata","priorité absolue","灾区的当务之急是尽快恢复供水和供电。","zāi qū de dāng wù zhī jí shì jǐn kuài huī fù gōng shuǐ hé gōng diàn","The most urgent task in the disaster area is to restore water and electricity as quickly as possible.","La tarea más urgente en la zona del desastre es restablecer cuanto antes el agua y la electricidad.","La priorité absolue dans la zone sinistrée est de rétablir au plus vite l'eau et l'électricité."],["L7-0760","当下","dāngxià","Adv","at once; right now","enseguida; ahora mismo","aussitôt; à présent","听完医生的话，他当下就决定戒烟。","tīng wán yī shēng de huà tā dāng xià jiù jué dìng jiè yān","After hearing what the doctor said, he decided on the spot to quit smoking.","Después de escuchar al médico, decidió en el acto dejar de fumar.","Après avoir écouté le médecin, il a décidé sur-le-champ d'arrêter de fumer."],["L7-0761","当心","dāngxīn","V","to be careful; to watch out","tener cuidado","faire attention; prendre garde","楼梯很滑，下楼时一定要当心。","lóu tī hěn huá xià lóu shí yí dìng yào dāng xīn","The stairs are slippery, so be careful going down.","Las escaleras están resbalosas; ten mucho cuidado al bajar.","L'escalier est glissant ; fais bien attention en descendant."],["L7-0762","当着","dāngzhe","","in front of","delante de","en présence de","这种话万万不能当着孩子的面说。","zhè zhǒng huà wàn wàn bù néng dāng zhe hái zi de miàn shuō","You absolutely must not say such things in front of the children.","Jamás se debe decir algo así delante de los niños.","On ne doit absolument pas dire de telles choses devant les enfants."],["L7-0763","当之无愧","dāngzhīwúkuì","","fully deserving","totalmente merecedor","pleinement digne","他为这座城市做了那么多贡献，获得这项荣誉当之无愧。","tā wèi zhè zuò chéng shì zuò le nà me duō gòng xiàn huò dé zhè xiàng róng yù dāng zhī wú kuì","He has contributed so much to this city that he fully deserves this honor.","Ha hecho tantas contribuciones a esta ciudad que merece plenamente este honor.","Il a tant apporté à cette ville qu'il mérite pleinement cet honneur."],["L7-0764","当众","dāngzhòng","Adv","in public","en público","en public","警方当众销毁了一批假药。","jǐng fāng dāng zhòng xiāo huǐ le yì pī jiǎ yào","The police publicly destroyed a batch of fake medicine.","La policía destruyó públicamente un lote de medicinas falsas.","La police a détruit publiquement un lot de faux médicaments."],["L7-0765","当晚","dàngwǎn","N","that evening","esa noche","ce soir-là","法官让证人如实陈述当晚看到的情况。","fǎ guān ràng zhèng rén rú shí chén shù dàng wǎn kàn dào de qíng kuàng","The judge asked the witness to give a truthful account of what they had seen that night.","El juez pidió al testigo que relatara con veracidad lo que había visto esa noche.","Le juge a demandé au témoin de relater fidèlement ce qu'il avait vu cette nuit-là."],["L7-0766","当真","dàngzhēn","V/Adv","to take seriously; really","tomar en serio; de veras","prendre au sérieux; vraiment","我只是开个玩笑，你别当真。","wǒ zhǐ shì kāi gè wán xiào nǐ bié dàng zhēn","I was only joking; don't take it seriously.","Solo era una broma; no lo tomes en serio.","Ce n'était qu'une plaisanterie ; ne le prends pas au sérieux."],["L7-0767","荡漾","dàngyàng","V","to ripple; to undulate","ondular; rizarse","onduler; se balancer","微风吹过，湖面上荡漾起一圈圈涟漪。","wēi fēng chuī guò hú miàn shàng dàng yàng qǐ yì quān quān lián yī","As a breeze blew past, ripples spread in rings across the surface of the lake.","Al pasar una brisa suave, la superficie del lago se llenó de ondas concéntricas.","Au passage d'une brise légère, des rides concentriques se sont propagées à la surface du lac."],["L7-0768","档次","dàngcì","N","grade; level","categoría; nivel","catégorie; niveau","这家酒店的档次很高，房价自然也不便宜。","zhè jiā jiǔ diàn de dàng cì hěn gāo fáng jià zì rán yě bù pián yi","This hotel is very upscale, so naturally the rooms aren't cheap.","Este hotel es de alta categoría, así que naturalmente las habitaciones no son baratas.","Cet hôtel est de très haut standing, les chambres ne sont donc évidemment pas bon marché."],["L7-0769","导弹","dǎodàn","N","missile","misil","missile","这次军事演习中试射了一种新型导弹。","zhè cì jūn shì yǎn xí zhōng shì shè le yì zhǒng xīn xíng dǎo dàn","A new type of missile was test-fired during this military exercise.","En estas maniobras militares se probó el lanzamiento de un nuevo tipo de misil.","Lors de ces manœuvres militaires, un nouveau type de missile a été testé."],["L7-0770","导航","dǎoháng","V","navigation; to navigate","navegación; navegar","navigation; naviguer","导航显示前方拥堵，司机便在下一个路口掉头，改走另一条路线。","dǎo háng xiǎn shì qián fāng yōng dǔ sī jī biàn zài xià yí ge lù kǒu diào tóu gǎi zǒu lìng yì tiáo lù xiàn","The navigation system showed congestion ahead, so the driver turned around at the next junction and took another route.","El navegador mostró congestión adelante, así que el conductor dio la vuelta en el siguiente cruce y tomó otra ruta.","Le GPS indiquait des embouteillages plus loin, alors le chauffeur a fait demi-tour au prochain carrefour et a pris un autre itinéraire."],["L7-0771","导火索","dǎohuǒsuǒ","N","fuse; trigger","mecha; detonante","mèche; élément déclencheur","一句玩笑话成了两人争吵的导火索。","yí jù wán xiào hua chéng le liǎng rén zhēng chǎo de dǎo huǒ suǒ","A joking remark became the trigger for the quarrel between the two of them.","Una frase en broma fue la chispa que desató la pelea entre los dos.","Une plaisanterie a mis le feu aux poudres entre eux deux."],["L7-0772","导师","dǎoshī","N","tutor; mentor","tutor; mentor","directeur; mentor","导师反复叮嘱我们，引用他人的论述时务必注明出处。","dǎo shī fǎn fù dīng zhǔ wǒ men yǐn yòng tā rén de lùn shù shí wù bì zhù míng chū chù","Our supervisor repeatedly reminded us to identify the source whenever we cite someone else's arguments.","El tutor nos recordó una y otra vez que, al citar los argumentos de otros, hay que indicar siempre la fuente.","Notre directeur de recherche nous a répété qu'il faut toujours indiquer la source lorsqu'on cite les propos d'autrui."],["L7-0773","导向","dǎoxiàng","V/N","orientation; to lead toward","orientación; orientar hacia","orientation; mener vers","这项政策的导向很明确，就是鼓励企业自主创新。","zhè xiàng zhèng cè de dǎo xiàng hěn míng què jiù shì gǔ lì qǐ yè zì zhǔ chuàng xīn","The direction of this policy is very clear: to encourage companies to innovate independently.","La orientación de esta política es muy clara: fomentar que las empresas innoven por cuenta propia.","L'orientation de cette politique est très claire : encourager les entreprises à innover de manière autonome."],["L7-0774","岛屿","dǎoyǔ","N","islands; island","isla; islas","île; îlots","这片海域分布着大大小小几百个岛屿。","zhè piàn hǎi yù fēn bù zhe dà dà xiǎo xiǎo jǐ bǎi gè dǎo yǔ","Several hundred islands, large and small, are scattered across this sea area.","En esta zona del mar se distribuyen cientos de islas, grandes y pequeñas.","Cette zone maritime compte des centaines d'îles, grandes et petites."],["L7-0775","捣乱","dǎoluàn","","to make trouble","causar problemas; alborotar","semer le trouble; perturber","上课的时候，有几个调皮的学生故意捣乱。","shàng kè de shí hou yǒu jǐ ge tiáo pí de xué shēng gù yì dǎo luàn","During class, a few naughty students deliberately made trouble.","Durante la clase, algunos alumnos traviesos armaron alboroto a propósito.","Pendant le cours, quelques élèves espiègles ont volontairement semé le désordre."],["L7-0776","倒卖","dǎomài","V","to resell for profit","revender con ganancia","revendre au marché noir","他因为倒卖火车票被警方处罚了。","tā yīn wèi dǎo mài huǒ chē piào bèi jǐng fāng chǔ fá le","He was punished by the police for scalping train tickets.","La policía lo sancionó por revender boletos de tren.","Il a été sanctionné par la police pour avoir revendu des billets de train au marché noir."],["L7-0777","倒霉","dǎoméi","","unlucky","tener mala suerte","avoir de la malchance","真倒霉，刚洗完车就下起了大雨。","zhēn dǎo méi gāng xǐ wán chē jiù xià qǐ le dà yǔ","What bad luck—it started pouring right after I washed my car.","¡Qué mala suerte! Justo cuando acababa de lavar el coche se puso a llover a cántaros.","Quelle poisse ! Je viens de laver la voiture et il se met à pleuvoir à verse."],["L7-0778","倒塌","dǎotā","V","to collapse","derrumbarse","s'effondrer","地震中，这座老房子的一面墙倒塌了。","dì zhèn zhōng zhè zuò lǎo fáng zi de yí miàn qiáng dǎo tā le","One wall of this old house collapsed in the earthquake.","Durante el terremoto, una pared de esta vieja casa se derrumbó.","Lors du tremblement de terre, un mur de cette vieille maison s'est effondré."],["L7-0779","倒下","dǎoxia","","to fall down; to collapse","caer; desplomarse","tomber; s'effondrer","马拉松比赛快结束时，一名选手突然倒下了。","mǎ lā sōng bǐ sài kuài jié shù shí yì míng xuǎn shǒu tū rán dǎo xià le","Near the end of the marathon, one runner suddenly collapsed.","Cerca del final del maratón, un corredor se desplomó de repente.","Vers la fin du marathon, un coureur s'est soudain effondré."],["L7-0780","到头来","dàotóulái","Adv","in the end","al final; a fin de cuentas","en fin de compte","他一心想走捷径，到头来却浪费了更多时间。","tā yì xīn xiǎng zǒu jié jìng dào tóu lái què làng fèi le gèng duō shí jiān","He was set on taking shortcuts, but in the end he wasted even more time.","Estaba empeñado en tomar atajos, pero al final perdió aún más tiempo.","Il voulait absolument prendre des raccourcis, mais il a fini par perdre encore plus de temps."],["L7-0781","到位","dàowèi","","to be in place; precise","estar en su lugar; adecuado","être en place; précis","这项举措能否长期奏效，取决于后续监督是否到位。","zhè xiàng jǔ cuò néng fǒu cháng qī zòu xiào qǔ jué yú hòu xù jiān dū shì fǒu dào wèi","Whether this measure remains effective over time depends on whether follow-up oversight is adequate.","Que esta medida siga dando resultados a largo plazo depende de que la supervisión posterior sea adecuada.","Que cette mesure reste efficace à long terme dépend de la qualité du suivi et du contrôle qui en découleront."],["L7-0782","倒计时","dàojìshí","V","countdown","cuenta atrás","compte à rebours","新年倒计时开始了，广场上的人们一起大声数数。","xīn nián dào jì shí kāi shǐ le guǎng chǎng shàng de rén men yì qǐ dà shēng shǔ shù","The New Year countdown began, and everyone in the square counted out loud together.","Comenzó la cuenta regresiva de Año Nuevo y la gente en la plaza contaba en voz alta, todos juntos.","Le compte à rebours du Nouvel An a commencé, et sur la place tout le monde comptait à voix haute."],["L7-0783","倒数","dàoshǔ","V","to count down; from the end","contar hacia atrás; desde el final","compter à rebours; en partant de la fin","他这次考试考了全班倒数第三，心里很难过。","tā zhè cì kǎo shì kǎo le quán bān dào shǔ dì sān xīn lǐ hěn nán guò","He came third from the bottom of the class in this exam and felt very upset.","En este examen quedó entre los tres últimos de la clase y se siente muy mal.","À cet examen, il est arrivé avant-avant-dernier de la classe et il en est très peiné."],["L7-0784","盗","dào","V","to steal; thief","robar; ladrón","voler; voleur","他的社交账号被盗了，有人用它发布了虚假广告。","tā de shè jiāo zhàng hào bèi dào le yǒu rén yòng tā fā bù le xū jiǎ guǎng gào","His social media account was hacked, and someone used it to post fake ads.","Le hackearon la cuenta de redes sociales y alguien la usó para publicar anuncios falsos.","Son compte de réseau social a été piraté et quelqu'un s'en est servi pour publier de fausses publicités."],["L7-0785","盗窃","dàoqiè","V","to steal; theft","robar; robo","voler; vol","这名男子因多次盗窃被判了刑。","zhè míng nán zǐ yīn duō cì dào qiè bèi pàn le xíng","This man was sentenced for repeated theft.","Este hombre fue condenado por robos reiterados.","Cet homme a été condamné pour vols à répétition."],["L7-0786","悼念","dàoniàn","V","to mourn","llorar la muerte de; honrar la memoria","pleurer; honorer la mémoire","人们自发来到广场，悼念在火灾中遇难的消防员。","rén men zì fā lái dào guǎng chǎng dào niàn zài huǒ zāi zhōng yù nàn de xiāo fáng yuán","People spontaneously gathered in the square to mourn the firefighters who died in the fire.","La gente acudió espontáneamente a la plaza para rendir homenaje a los bomberos que murieron en el incendio.","Les gens se sont spontanément rassemblés sur la place pour rendre hommage aux pompiers morts dans l'incendie."],["L7-0787","道具","dàojù","N","prop; stage property","utilería; accesorio","accessoire","这部电影里的很多道具都是工作人员手工制作的。","zhè bù diàn yǐng lǐ de hěn duō dào jù dōu shì gōng zuò rén yuán shǒu gōng zhì zuò de","Many of the props in this film were made by hand by the crew.","Muchos de los accesorios de utilería de esta película los hizo a mano el equipo de producción.","Beaucoup des accessoires de ce film ont été fabriqués à la main par l'équipe."],["L7-0788","稻草","dàocǎo","N","rice straw","paja de arroz","paille de riz","农民用稻草扎了一个稻草人，立在田里吓唬麻雀。","nóng mín yòng dào cǎo zhā le yí ge dào cǎo rén lì zài tián lǐ xià hu má què","The farmer tied straw into a scarecrow and stood it in the field to scare away sparrows.","El campesino ató paja para hacer un espantapájaros y lo puso en el campo para ahuyentar a los gorriones.","Le paysan a fabriqué un épouvantail avec de la paille et l'a planté dans le champ pour faire peur aux moineaux."],["L7-0789","得不偿失","débùchángshī","","gain not worth the loss","ganancia que no compensa la pérdida","le jeu n'en vaut pas la chandelle","为了省一点钱而买劣质产品，实在是得不偿失。","wèi le shěng yì diǎn qián ér mǎi liè zhì chǎn pǐn shí zài shì dé bù cháng shī","Buying shoddy products just to save a little money really isn't worth it.","Comprar productos de mala calidad solo para ahorrar un poco de dinero realmente sale a perder.","Acheter des produits de mauvaise qualité pour économiser un peu d'argent n'en vaut vraiment pas la peine."],["L7-0790","得当","dédàng","Adj","appropriate; proper","apropiado; adecuado","approprié; judicieux","只要方法得当，学习外语并没有想象中那么难。","zhǐ yào fāng fǎ dé dàng xué xí wài yǔ bìng méi yǒu xiǎng xiàng zhōng nà me nán","As long as you use the right method, learning a foreign language isn't as hard as you might think.","Con el método adecuado, aprender un idioma extranjero no es tan difícil como se imagina.","Avec la bonne méthode, apprendre une langue étrangère n'est pas aussi difficile qu'on l'imagine."],["L7-0791","得力","délì","Adj","capable; efficient","capaz; eficiente","compétent; efficace","她是经理最得力的助手，很多重要的事都交给她办。","tā shì jīng lǐ zuì dé lì de zhù shǒu hěn duō zhòng yào de shì dōu jiāo gěi tā bàn","She is the manager's most capable assistant, and many important matters are entrusted to her.","Es la mano derecha más eficaz del gerente, y muchos asuntos importantes se los encomiendan a ella.","Elle est l'assistante la plus efficace du directeur, et on lui confie bien des affaires importantes."],["L7-0792","得失","déshī","N","gains and losses","ganancias y pérdidas","gains et pertes","做决定之前，要先把各方面的得失考虑清楚。","zuò jué dìng zhī qián yào xiān bǎ gè fāng miàn de dé shī kǎo lǜ qīng chu","Before making a decision, you should think through the gains and losses on all sides.","Antes de tomar una decisión, hay que considerar con claridad lo que se gana y se pierde en todos los aspectos.","Avant de prendre une décision, il faut bien peser les gains et les pertes sous tous les angles."],["L7-0793","得手","déshǒu","Adj","to succeed; to go smoothly","tener éxito; salir bien","réussir; aboutir","商场里到处都装有监控，小偷很难得手。","shāng chǎng lǐ dào chù dōu zhuāng yǒu jiān kòng xiǎo tōu hěn nán dé shǒu","Surveillance cameras are installed throughout the mall, making it difficult for thieves to get away with stealing.","Hay cámaras de vigilancia por todo el centro comercial, así que a los ladrones les resulta difícil salirse con la suya.","Le centre commercial est truffé de caméras de surveillance, il est donc difficile pour les voleurs de réussir leur coup."],["L7-0794","得体","détǐ","Adj","appropriate; tactful","apropiado; adecuado","convenable; de bon ton","参加面试时，穿着要整洁得体。","cān jiā miàn shì shí chuān zhuó yào zhěng jié dé tǐ","When going to a job interview, your attire should be neat and appropriate.","Al ir a una entrevista de trabajo, la ropa debe ser pulcra y apropiada.","Pour un entretien d'embauche, la tenue doit être soignée et convenable."],["L7-0795","得天独厚","détiāndúhòu","","blessed with advantages","con ventajas excepcionales","exceptionnellement favorisé","这里气候温和，土地肥沃，发展农业有得天独厚的条件。","zhè lǐ qì hòu wēn hé tǔ dì féi wò fā zhǎn nóng yè yǒu dé tiān dú hòu de tiáo jiàn","With its mild climate and fertile soil, this place has exceptional conditions for developing agriculture.","Aquí el clima es templado y la tierra es fértil, así que hay condiciones privilegiadas para desarrollar la agricultura.","Avec son climat doux et sa terre fertile, cet endroit offre des conditions exceptionnelles pour développer l'agriculture."],["L7-0796","得益于","déyì yú","","to benefit from; thanks to","beneficiarse de; gracias a","bénéficier de; grâce à","这座城市的快速发展，得益于便利的交通条件。","zhè zuò chéng shì de kuài sù fā zhǎn dé yì yú biàn lì de jiāo tōng tiáo jiàn","The rapid development of this city is thanks to its convenient transport links.","El rápido desarrollo de esta ciudad se debe a sus cómodas condiciones de transporte.","Le développement rapide de cette ville est dû à la commodité de ses transports."],["L7-0797","得意扬扬","déyì-yángyáng","","proud and pleased with oneself","ufano; satisfecho de sí mismo","triomphant; plein de fierté","比赛赢了以后，他得意扬扬地向大家炫耀奖杯。","bǐ sài yíng le yǐ hòu tā dé yì yáng yáng de xiàng dà jiā xuàn yào jiǎng bēi","After winning the competition, he smugly showed off his trophy to everyone.","Tras ganar la competencia, presumió el trofeo ante todos con aire triunfante.","Après avoir gagné la compétition, il a exhibé son trophée à tout le monde d'un air triomphant."],["L7-0798","得知","dézhī","V","to learn of; to find out","enterarse de","apprendre; être informé de","得知父亲患上癌症后，她决定陪他一起面对。","dé zhī fù qīn huàn shàng ái zhèng hòu tā jué dìng péi tā yì qǐ miàn duì","After learning that her father had cancer, she decided to face it alongside him.","Al enterarse de que su padre tenía cáncer, decidió enfrentarlo junto a él.","En apprenant que son père avait un cancer, elle a décidé d'affronter l'épreuve à ses côtés."],["L7-0799","得罪","dézuì","V","to offend","ofender","offenser; fâcher","他担心得罪了领导，以后会被穿小鞋。","tā dān xīn dé zuì le lǐng dǎo yǐ hòu huì bèi chuān xiǎo xié","He worried that if he offended his boss, he would be made to suffer for it later.","Temía haber ofendido al jefe y que más adelante le hicieran la vida difícil.","Il craignait qu'en froissant son supérieur, on lui fasse payer cela plus tard."],["L7-0800","德","dé","N","Germany; German","Alemania; alemán","Allemagne; allemand","古人讲究以德服人，而不是以力服人。","gǔ rén jiǎng jiu yǐ dé fú rén ér bú shì yǐ lì fú rén","The ancients valued winning people over through virtue rather than through force.","Los antiguos valoraban ganarse a la gente con la virtud, y no por la fuerza.","Les Anciens tenaient à convaincre par la vertu plutôt que par la force."],["L7-0801","灯笼","dēnglong","N","lantern","farol","lanterne","元宵节晚上，孩子们提着灯笼在街上玩耍。","yuán xiāo jié wǎn shang hái zi men tí zhe dēng long zài jiē shang wán shuǎ","On the night of the Lantern Festival, children play in the streets carrying lanterns.","En la noche de la Fiesta de los Faroles, los niños juegan en la calle con farolitos en la mano.","Le soir de la fête des Lanternes, les enfants jouent dans la rue avec des lanternes à la main."],["L7-0802","灯泡","dēngpào","N","light bulb","bombilla","ampoule","卫生间的灯泡坏了，得换个新的。","wèi shēng jiān de dēng pào huài le děi huàn gè xīn de","The light bulb in the bathroom has burned out, so we need to replace it.","Se fundió el foco del baño; hay que cambiarlo por uno nuevo.","L'ampoule de la salle de bains a grillé ; il faut en mettre une nouvelle."],["L7-0803","登机","dēngjī","V","to board a plane","embarcar en un avión","embarquer dans un avion","请各位旅客带好随身物品，从三号门登机。","qǐng gè wèi lǚ kè dài hǎo suí shēn wù pǐn cóng sān hào mén dēng jī","Passengers, please take your belongings with you and board at Gate Three.","Estimados pasajeros, lleven consigo sus objetos personales y aborden por la puerta número tres.","Mesdames et messieurs les passagers, veuillez emporter vos effets personnels et embarquer par la porte numéro trois."],["L7-0804","登陆","dēnglù","","to land; to log in","desembarcar; iniciar sesión","débarquer; se connecter","气象台预计，台风将在明天凌晨登陆。","qì xiàng tái yù jì tái fēng jiāng zài míng tiān líng chén dēng lù","The weather bureau predicts the typhoon will make landfall early tomorrow morning.","El servicio meteorológico prevé que el tifón tocará tierra mañana de madrugada.","Le service météorologique prévoit que le typhon touchera terre demain aux premières heures."],["L7-0805","蹬","dēng","V","to step on; to pedal","pisar; pedalear","appuyer du pied; pédaler","他用力蹬着自行车，终于爬上了这个陡坡。","tā yòng lì dēng zhe zì xíng chē zhōng yú pá shàng le zhè ge dǒu pō","He pedaled hard and finally made it up the steep slope.","Pedaleó con fuerza en la bicicleta y por fin logró subir esta cuesta empinada.","Il a pédalé de toutes ses forces et a fini par gravir cette pente raide."],["L7-0806","凳子","dèngzi","N","stool","taburete","tabouret","教室后面放着几把凳子，供来听课的家长坐。","jiào shì hòu miàn fàng zhe jǐ bǎ dèng zi gōng lái tīng kè de jiā zhǎng zuò","There are several stools at the back of the classroom for parents who come to sit in on lessons.","Al fondo del aula hay unos banquillos para que se sienten los padres que vienen a presenciar la clase.","Au fond de la classe, il y a quelques tabourets pour les parents qui viennent assister au cours."],["L7-0807","瞪","dèng","V","to glare; to stare wide-eyed","mirar con enojo; abrir los ojos","fusiller du regard; écarquiller les yeux","他凶狠地瞪了我一眼，什么也没说。","tā xiōng hěn de dèng le wǒ yì yǎn shén me yě méi shuō","He glared at me fiercely and said nothing.","Me lanzó una mirada feroz y no dijo nada.","Il m'a lancé un regard féroce sans dire un mot."],["L7-0808","低调","dīdiào","N/Adj","low-key; subdued","discreto; de bajo perfil","discret; sobre","他虽然很有钱，但为人一向十分低调。","tā suī rán hěn yǒu qián dàn wéi rén yí xiàng shí fēn dī diào","Although he is very rich, he has always kept a low profile.","Aunque tiene mucho dinero, siempre ha sido una persona de perfil muy bajo.","Bien qu'il soit très riche, il a toujours fait preuve de beaucoup de discrétion."],["L7-0809","低估","dīgū","V","to underestimate","subestimar","sous-estimer","我们低估了这项工作的难度，结果没能按时完成。","wǒ men dī gū le zhè xiàng gōng zuò de nán dù jié guǒ méi néng àn shí wán chéng","We underestimated how difficult this work would be, so we failed to finish on time.","Subestimamos la dificultad de este trabajo y por eso no pudimos terminarlo a tiempo.","Nous avons sous-estimé la difficulté de ce travail et n'avons donc pas pu le terminer à temps."],["L7-0810","低谷","dīgǔ","N","low point; trough","punto bajo; valle","creux; point bas","经历了人生的低谷之后，他变得更加坚强了。","jīng lì le rén shēng de dī gǔ zhī hòu tā biàn de gèng jiā jiān qiáng le","After going through a low point in his life, he became even stronger.","Después de atravesar un momento muy bajo en la vida, se volvió aún más fuerte.","Après avoir traversé un creux dans sa vie, il est devenu encore plus fort."],["L7-0811","低价","dījià","N","low price","precio bajo","prix bas","这个低价广告其实是个陷阱。","zhè ge dī jià guǎng gào qí shí shì gè xiàn jǐng","This low-price advertisement is actually a trap.","Este anuncio de precios bajos en realidad es una trampa.","Cette publicité à prix cassés est en réalité un piège."],["L7-0812","低迷","dīmí","Adj","sluggish; in a slump","deprimido; en declive","morose; en berne","消费需求回暖，并不意味着所有行业都已摆脱低迷。","xiāo fèi xū qiú huí nuǎn bìng bú yì wèi zhe suǒ yǒu háng yè dōu yǐ bǎi tuō dī mí","A recovery in consumer demand does not mean that every industry has emerged from a slump.","Que la demanda de consumo se esté recuperando no significa que todos los sectores hayan salido del estancamiento.","La reprise de la demande des consommateurs ne signifie pas que tous les secteurs soient sortis de la morosité."],["L7-0813","低碳","dītàn","Adj","low-carbon","bajo en carbono","à faible teneur en carbone","越来越多的人选择骑自行车上班，践行低碳生活。","yuè lái yuè duō de rén xuǎn zé qí zì xíng chē shàng bān jiàn xíng dī tàn shēng huó","More and more people are choosing to cycle to work, putting a low-carbon lifestyle into practice.","Cada vez más personas eligen ir al trabajo en bicicleta y llevar a la práctica un estilo de vida bajo en carbono.","De plus en plus de gens choisissent d'aller travailler à vélo et adoptent un mode de vie bas carbone."],["L7-0814","低下","dīxià","Adj","low; inferior","bajo; inferior","bas; inférieur","第一次上台唱歌，她难为情地低下了头。","dì yī cì shàng tái chàng gē tā nán wéi qíng de dī xià le tóu","Singing on stage for the first time, she lowered her head bashfully.","Era la primera vez que cantaba en un escenario y, avergonzada, bajó la cabeza.","C'était la première fois qu'elle chantait sur scène ; gênée, elle a baissé la tête."],["L7-0815","堤","dī","N","dike; embankment","dique; terraplén","digue","洪水不断上涨，村民们连夜加固河堤。","hóng shuǐ bú duàn shàng zhǎng cūn mín men lián yè jiā gù hé dī","The floodwater kept rising, so the villagers worked through the night to reinforce the river dike.","La crecida seguía subiendo, así que los aldeanos reforzaron el dique del río durante toda la noche.","La crue continuait de monter, alors les villageois ont renforcé la digue toute la nuit."],["L7-0816","堤坝","dībà","N","dam; dike","presa; dique","digue; barrage","沿海地区正在加固堤坝，以抵御即将到来的强风和巨浪。","yán hǎi dì qū zhèng zài jiā gù dī bà yǐ dǐ yù jí jiāng dào lái de qiáng fēng hé jù làng","Coastal areas are reinforcing embankments to withstand the approaching strong winds and huge waves.","Las zonas costeras están reforzando los diques para resistir los fuertes vientos y las olas gigantes que se aproximan.","Les zones côtières renforcent leurs digues pour résister aux vents violents et aux vagues géantes qui approchent."],["L7-0817","提防","dīfang","V","to guard against","estar en guardia contra; precaverse","se méfier de; se prémunir contre","在网上交友要提防骗子，不要轻易透露个人信息。","zài wǎng shàng jiāo yǒu yào dī fang piàn zi bú yào qīng yì tòu lù gè rén xìn xī","When making friends online, watch out for scammers and don't give out personal information lightly.","Al hacer amigos por internet, hay que cuidarse de los estafadores y no revelar datos personales a la ligera.","Quand on se fait des amis en ligne, il faut se méfier des escrocs et ne pas divulguer à la légère ses informations personnelles."],["L7-0818","笛子","dízi","N","bamboo flute","flauta de bambú","flûte de bambou","他从小学吹笛子，现在已经能在舞台上独奏了。","tā cóng xiǎo xué chuī dí zi xiàn zài yǐ jīng néng zài wǔ tái shàng dú zòu le","He started learning to play the bamboo flute as a child and can now perform solo on stage.","Empezó a aprender a tocar la flauta de bambú desde niño y ahora ya puede hacer solos en el escenario.","Il a appris la flûte de bambou dès l'enfance et peut désormais se produire en solo sur scène."],["L7-0819","抵触","dǐchù","V","to conflict with","chocar con; contradecir","entrer en conflit avec; contredire","青春期的孩子往往对父母的管教有抵触情绪。","qīng chūn qī de hái zi wǎng wǎng duì fù mǔ de guǎn jiào yǒu dǐ chù qíng xù","Teenagers often feel resistant to their parents' discipline.","Los adolescentes suelen sentir rechazo hacia la disciplina de sus padres.","Les adolescents ont souvent du mal à accepter la discipline de leurs parents."],["L7-0820","抵挡","dǐdǎng","V","to resist; to withstand","resistir; contener","résister à; endiguer","这件薄外套根本抵挡不了山上的寒风。","zhè jiàn báo wài tào gēn běn dǐ dǎng bù liǎo shān shàng de hán fēng","This thin jacket can't keep out the cold wind on the mountain at all.","Esta chaqueta tan fina no aguanta en absoluto el viento frío de la montaña.","Cette veste légère ne protège absolument pas du vent froid de la montagne."],["L7-0821","抵消","dǐxiāo","V","to offset; to cancel out","compensar; anular","compenser; annuler","他这个月的奖金正好抵消了上个月的罚款。","tā zhè ge yuè de jiǎng jīn zhèng hǎo dǐ xiāo le shàng ge yuè de fá kuǎn","His bonus this month exactly offset last month's fine.","Su bono de este mes compensó justo la multa del mes pasado.","Sa prime de ce mois-ci a exactement compensé l'amende du mois dernier."],["L7-0822","抵押","dǐyā","V","to mortgage; collateral","hipotecar; garantía","hypothéquer; garantie","他把房子抵押给银行，贷款开了一家工厂。","tā bǎ fáng zi dǐ yā gěi yín háng dài kuǎn kāi le yì jiā gōng chǎng","He mortgaged his house to the bank and took out a loan to open a factory.","Hipotecó su casa al banco y con el préstamo abrió una fábrica.","Il a hypothéqué sa maison auprès de la banque et, grâce au prêt, a ouvert une usine."],["L7-0823","抵御","dǐyù","V","to resist; to defend against","resistir; defenderse de","résister à; se défendre contre","沿海地区正在加固堤坝，以抵御即将到来的强风和巨浪。","yán hǎi dì qū zhèng zài jiā gù dī bà yǐ dǐ yù jí jiāng dào lái de qiáng fēng hé jù làng","Coastal areas are reinforcing embankments to withstand the approaching strong winds and huge waves.","Las zonas costeras están reforzando los diques para resistir los fuertes vientos y las olas gigantes que se aproximan.","Les zones côtières renforcent leurs digues pour résister aux vents violents et aux vagues géantes qui approchent."],["L7-0824","抵制","dǐzhì","V","to boycott; to resist","boicotear; resistir","boycotter; résister à","有人在网上鼓动大家抵制这部电影。","yǒu rén zài wǎng shàng gǔ dòng dà jiā dǐ zhì zhè bù diàn yǐng","Someone online is urging people to boycott this film.","Alguien está instigando en internet a que todos boicoteen esta película.","Quelqu'un incite les internautes à boycotter ce film."],["L7-0825","底层","dǐcéng","N","ground floor; bottom","planta baja; capa inferior","rez-de-chaussée; couche inférieure","她在抽屉底层翻出一封泛黄的信，往事便一幕幕浮现在眼前。","tā zài chōu ti dǐ céng fān chū yì fēng fàn huáng de xìn wǎng shì biàn yí mù mù fú xiàn zài yǎn qián","She found a yellowed letter at the bottom of a drawer, and scenes from the past came back to her one by one.","Encontró en el fondo de un cajón una carta amarillenta, y los recuerdos del pasado desfilaron uno a uno ante sus ojos.","Elle a retrouvé au fond d'un tiroir une lettre jaunie, et le passé lui est revenu en mémoire, scène après scène."],["L7-0826","底线","dǐxiàn","N","bottom line; baseline","límite; línea de fondo","ligne rouge; ligne de fond","做生意可以灵活，但诚信是不能突破的底线。","zuò shēng yi kě yǐ líng huó dàn chéng xìn shì bù néng tū pò de dǐ xiàn","You can be flexible in business, but integrity is a bottom line that must not be crossed.","En los negocios se puede ser flexible, pero la honestidad es un límite que no se puede traspasar.","En affaires, on peut être souple, mais l'honnêteté est une limite à ne jamais franchir."],["L7-0827","底蕴","dǐyùn","N","depth; inner substance","trasfondo; riqueza interior","fond; richesse profonde","这座古城有着深厚的文化底蕴。","zhè zuò gǔ chéng yǒu zhe shēn hòu de wén huà dǐ yùn","This ancient city has a rich cultural heritage.","Esta ciudad antigua posee una profunda riqueza cultural.","Cette ville ancienne possède un riche patrimoine culturel."],["L7-0828","底子","dǐzi","N","foundation; base","base; fundamento","base; fondement","他的英语底子很好，出国后很快就适应了。","tā de yīng yǔ dǐ zi hěn hǎo chū guó hòu hěn kuài jiù shì yìng le","He has a solid foundation in English, so he adjusted quickly after going abroad.","Tiene una muy buena base de inglés, así que se adaptó rápido después de irse al extranjero.","Il a de très bonnes bases en anglais, il s'est donc vite adapté une fois à l'étranger."],["L7-0829","地步","dìbù","N","extent; plight; stage","punto; situación; extremo","point; situation; stade","事情发展到这个地步，已经很难挽回了。","shì qing fā zhǎn dào zhè ge dì bù yǐ jīng hěn nán wǎn huí le","Now that things have come to this point, it will be very hard to turn them around.","Ahora que las cosas han llegado a este punto, ya es muy difícil remediarlas.","Maintenant que les choses en sont arrivées là, il est devenu très difficile de les rattraper."],["L7-0830","地道","dìdào","N","tunnel; underground passage","túnel; pasaje subterráneo","tunnel; passage souterrain","这家饭馆的川菜原汁原味，很地道。","zhè jiā fàn guǎn de chuān cài yuán zhī yuán wèi hěn dì dao","The Sichuan food at this restaurant is authentic and true to its roots.","La comida de Sichuan de este restaurante es auténtica, con el sabor original.","La cuisine sichuanaise de ce restaurant est authentique et fidèle à la tradition."],["L7-0831","地道","dìdao","Adj","authentic; genuine","auténtico; genuino","authentique; véritable","这家饭馆的川菜原汁原味，很地道。","zhè jiā fàn guǎn de chuān cài yuán zhī yuán wèi hěn dì dao","The Sichuan food at this restaurant is authentic and true to its roots.","La comida de Sichuan de este restaurante es auténtica, con el sabor original.","La cuisine sichuanaise de ce restaurant est authentique et fidèle à la tradition."],["L7-0832","地段","dìduàn","N","district; area","zona; tramo","quartier; secteur","这套房子位于市中心的黄金地段，价格自然不便宜。","zhè tào fáng zi wèi yú shì zhōng xīn de huáng jīn dì duàn jià gé zì rán bù pián yi","This apartment is in a prime location in the city center, so naturally it isn't cheap.","Este apartamento está en una zona privilegiada del centro de la ciudad, así que, naturalmente, no es barato.","Cet appartement est situé dans un quartier de premier choix en centre-ville, son prix n'est donc évidemment pas bas."],["L7-0833","地理","dìlǐ","N","geography","geografía","géographie","这个国家的地理位置十分重要，连接着东西方的贸易通道。","zhè ge guó jiā de dì lǐ wèi zhì shí fēn zhòng yào lián jiē zhe dōng xī fāng de mào yì tōng dào","This country's geographical position is very important, linking trade routes between East and West.","La ubicación geográfica de este país es muy importante, pues conecta las rutas comerciales entre Oriente y Occidente.","La position géographique de ce pays est très importante : il relie les routes commerciales entre l'Orient et l'Occident."],["L7-0834","地毯","dìtǎn","N","carpet; rug","alfombra","tapis; moquette","客厅里铺着一块柔软的羊毛地毯。","kè tīng lǐ pū zhe yí kuài róu ruǎn de yáng máo dì tǎn","A soft wool rug is spread across the living room floor.","En la sala hay extendida una suave alfombra de lana.","Un doux tapis de laine est étendu dans le salon."],["L7-0835","地下水","dìxiàshuǐ","N","groundwater","agua subterránea","eaux souterraines","长期过度开采地下水，可能导致地面沉降，甚至危及建筑安全。","cháng qī guò dù kāi cǎi dì xià shuǐ kě néng dǎo zhì dì miàn chén jiàng shèn zhì wēi jí jiàn zhù ān quán","Prolonged overextraction of groundwater may cause land subsidence and even endanger the safety of buildings.","La sobreexplotación prolongada de las aguas subterráneas puede provocar hundimientos del terreno e incluso poner en peligro la seguridad de los edificios.","La surexploitation prolongée des eaux souterraines peut provoquer un affaissement du sol et même menacer la sécurité des bâtiments."],["L7-0836","地狱","dìyù","N","hell","infierno","enfer","对于那些难民来说，战争的那几年简直就是地狱。","duì yú nà xiē nàn mín lái shuō zhàn zhēng de nà jǐ nián jiǎn zhí jiù shì dì yù","For those refugees, the years of the war were simply hell.","Para esos refugiados, los años de la guerra fueron sencillamente un infierno.","Pour ces réfugiés, les années de guerre ont été un véritable enfer."],["L7-0837","地域","dìyù","N","region; area","región; zona","région; zone","这个国家地域辽阔，各地的饮食习惯差别很大。","zhè ge guó jiā dì yù liáo kuò gè dì de yǐn shí xí guàn chā bié hěn dà","This country covers a vast area, and eating habits vary greatly from region to region.","Este país tiene un territorio vasto y los hábitos alimentarios varían mucho de una región a otra.","Ce pays est très vaste et les habitudes alimentaires y diffèrent beaucoup d'une région à l'autre."],["L7-0838","地质","dìzhì","N","geology","geología","géologie","地质专家认为，这一带有发生滑坡的风险。","dì zhì zhuān jiā rèn wéi zhè yí dài yǒu fā shēng huá pō de fēng xiǎn","Geologists believe there is a risk of landslides in this area.","Los expertos en geología creen que en esta zona existe riesgo de deslizamientos de tierra.","Les géologues estiment qu'il existe un risque de glissement de terrain dans cette région."],["L7-0839","弟子","dìzǐ","N","disciple","discípulo","disciple","这位老画家一生收了几十个弟子。","zhè wèi lǎo huà jiā yì shēng shōu le jǐ shí gè dì zǐ","This old painter took on dozens of disciples in his lifetime.","Este viejo pintor tuvo decenas de discípulos a lo largo de su vida.","Ce vieux peintre a eu des dizaines de disciples au cours de sa vie."],["L7-0840","帝国","dìguó","N","empire","imperio","empire","这个古老的帝国曾经统治过欧洲的大片土地。","zhè ge gǔ lǎo de dì guó céng jīng tǒng zhì guo ōu zhōu de dà piàn tǔ dì","This ancient empire once ruled vast areas of Europe.","Este antiguo imperio llegó a dominar extensas tierras de Europa.","Cet ancien empire a autrefois dominé de vastes territoires en Europe."],["L7-0841","帝国主义","dìguó zhǔyì","","imperialism","imperialismo","impérialisme","这本历史书详细讲述了帝国主义对殖民地的掠夺。","zhè běn lì shǐ shū xiáng xì jiǎng shù le dì guó zhǔ yì duì zhí mín dì de lüè duó","This history book describes in detail imperialism's plunder of its colonies.","Este libro de historia narra en detalle el saqueo de las colonias por parte del imperialismo.","Ce livre d'histoire décrit en détail le pillage des colonies par l'impérialisme."],["L7-0842","递交","dìjiāo","V","to hand over; to submit","entregar; presentar","remettre; soumettre","因为身体原因，他向董事会递交了辞呈。","yīn wèi shēn tǐ yuán yīn tā xiàng dǒng shì huì dì jiāo le cí chéng","For health reasons, he submitted his resignation to the board of directors.","Por motivos de salud, presentó su renuncia a la junta directiva.","Pour des raisons de santé, il a remis sa démission au conseil d'administration."],["L7-0843","第一手","dìyīshǒu","Adj","first-hand","de primera mano","de première main","记者深入灾区，获得了大量第一手资料。","jì zhě shēn rù zāi qū huò dé le dà liàng dì yī shǒu zī liào","The reporter went deep into the disaster area and obtained a great deal of first-hand material.","El periodista se adentró en la zona del desastre y obtuvo una gran cantidad de información de primera mano.","Le journaliste s'est rendu au cœur de la zone sinistrée et a recueilli beaucoup d'informations de première main."],["L7-0844","第一线","dìyīxiàn","N","front line","primera línea","première ligne","疫情期间，医护人员一直奋战在抗疫第一线。","yì qíng qī jiān yī hù rén yuán yì zhí fèn zhàn zài kàng yì dì yī xiàn","During the epidemic, medical workers kept fighting on the front line.","Durante la epidemia, el personal sanitario estuvo siempre luchando en primera línea contra la enfermedad.","Pendant l'épidémie, le personnel soignant n'a cessé de se battre en première ligne contre la maladie."],["L7-0845","颠倒","diāndǎo","V","to reverse; to turn upside down","invertir; poner al revés","renverser; inverser","你把这两个数字的顺序写颠倒了，结果当然不对。","nǐ bǎ zhè liǎng gè shù zì de shùn xù xiě diān dǎo le jié guǒ dāng rán bú duì","You wrote these two numbers in reverse order, so of course the result is wrong.","Escribiste estos dos números en orden invertido, así que, por supuesto, el resultado es incorrecto.","Tu as écrit ces deux nombres dans le mauvais ordre, évidemment le résultat est faux."],["L7-0846","颠覆","diānfù","V","to overthrow; to subvert","derrocar; subvertir","renverser; subvertir","这项新技术可能会颠覆整个行业的传统模式。","zhè xiàng xīn jì shù kě néng huì diān fù zhěng gè háng yè de chuán tǒng mó shì","This new technology may overturn the traditional model of the entire industry.","Esta nueva tecnología podría trastocar el modelo tradicional de todo el sector.","Cette nouvelle technologie pourrait bouleverser le modèle traditionnel de tout le secteur."],["L7-0847","巅峰","diānfēng","N","peak; summit","cima; apogeo","sommet; apogée","那几年是这位歌手事业的巅峰时期。","nà jǐ nián shì zhè wèi gē shǒu shì yè de diān fēng shí qī","Those years were the peak of this singer's career.","Aquellos años fueron la cumbre de la carrera de este cantante.","Ces années-là ont été l'apogée de la carrière de ce chanteur."],["L7-0848","典范","diǎnfàn","N","model; paragon","modelo; ejemplo","modèle; parangon","这座小镇成了全国乡村旅游发展的典范。","zhè zuò xiǎo zhèn chéng le quán guó xiāng cūn lǚ yóu fā zhǎn de diǎn fàn","This town has become a model for rural tourism development nationwide.","Este pueblito se ha convertido en un modelo para el desarrollo del turismo rural en todo el país.","Cette petite ville est devenue un modèle pour le développement du tourisme rural dans tout le pays."],["L7-0849","点火","diǎnhuǒ","","to ignite; to light a fire","encender; prender fuego","allumer; mettre le feu","天然气灶打不着火，可能是点火装置坏了。","tiān rán qì zào dǎ bu zháo huǒ kě néng shì diǎn huǒ zhuāng zhì huài le","The gas stove won't light; maybe the ignition device is broken.","La estufa de gas no enciende; quizá el encendedor esté descompuesto.","La cuisinière à gaz ne s'allume pas ; peut-être que l'allumeur est cassé."],["L7-0850","点击率","diǎnjīlǜ","N","click-through rate","tasa de clics","taux de clics","更换图片后，这则网页广告的点击率明显提高了。","gēng huàn tú piàn hòu zhè zé wǎng yè guǎng gào de diǎn jī lǜ míng xiǎn tí gāo le","After the image was replaced, this web ad's click-through rate increased noticeably.","Tras cambiar la imagen, la tasa de clics de este anuncio web aumentó notablemente.","Après le remplacement de l'image, le taux de clics de cette publicité en ligne a nettement augmenté."],["L7-0851","点评","diǎnpíng","V/N","to comment on; commentary","comentar; comentario","commenter; commentaire","比赛结束后，评委对每位选手的表现进行了点评。","bǐ sài jié shù hòu píng wěi duì měi wèi xuǎn shǒu de biǎo xiàn jìn xíng le diǎn píng","After the competition, the judges commented on each contestant's performance.","Al terminar la competencia, el jurado comentó el desempeño de cada participante.","À l'issue de la compétition, le jury a commenté la prestation de chaque candidat."],["L7-0852","点心","diǎnxin","N","pastry; dim sum; snack","pastelito; dim sum; bocadillo","pâtisserie; dim sum; en-cas","这家店的点心做得小巧精致，很适合送人。","zhè jiā diàn de diǎn xin zuò de xiǎo qiǎo jīng zhì hěn shì hé sòng rén","The pastries in this shop are small and exquisitely made, perfect as gifts.","Los pastelitos de esta tienda son pequeños y delicados, ideales para regalar.","Les pâtisseries de cette boutique sont petites et raffinées, parfaites pour offrir."],["L7-0853","点缀","diǎnzhuì","V","to adorn; to decorate","adornar; decorar","orner; décorer","几朵小花点缀在草地上，让画面显得更有生气。","jǐ duǒ xiǎo huā diǎn zhuì zài cǎo dì shàng ràng huà miàn xiǎn de gèng yǒu shēng qì","A few little flowers dotted the grass, making the scene look more lively.","Unas cuantas florecillas salpicaban el césped y daban más vida a la escena.","Quelques petites fleurs parsemaient l'herbe et donnaient plus de vie à la scène."],["L7-0854","点子","diǎnzi","N","idea; spot","idea; punto","idée; point","他脑子很灵活，总能想出一些好点子。","tā nǎo zi hěn líng huó zǒng néng xiǎng chū yì xiē hǎo diǎn zi","He's very quick-witted and can always come up with good ideas.","Es muy ingenioso y siempre se le ocurren buenas ideas.","Il a l'esprit vif et trouve toujours de bonnes idées."],["L7-0855","电报","diànbào","N","telegram","telegrama","télégramme","以前有急事，人们就给家里打一封电报。","yǐ qián yǒu jí shì rén men jiù gěi jiā lǐ dǎ yì fēng diàn bào","In the past, when something urgent came up, people would send a telegram home.","Antes, cuando había una urgencia, la gente enviaba un telegrama a casa.","Autrefois, en cas d'urgence, on envoyait un télégramme à la maison."],["L7-0856","电铃","diànlíng","N","electric bell","timbre eléctrico","sonnette électrique","下课的电铃一响，学生们就冲出了教室。","xià kè de diàn líng yì xiǎng xué shēng men jiù chōng chū le jiào shì","As soon as the electric bell rang for the end of class, the students rushed out of the classroom.","En cuanto sonó el timbre eléctrico del fin de la clase, los alumnos salieron corriendo del aula.","Dès que la sonnerie électrique de fin de cours a retenti, les élèves se sont précipités hors de la classe."],["L7-0857","电网","diànwǎng","N","power grid","red eléctrica","réseau électrique","暴风雪导致部分地区电网受损，几万户居民停电。","bào fēng xuě dǎo zhì bù fen dì qū diàn wǎng shòu sǔn jǐ wàn hù jū mín tíng diàn","The blizzard damaged the power grid in some areas, leaving tens of thousands of households without electricity.","La tormenta de nieve dañó la red eléctrica de algunas zonas y decenas de miles de hogares se quedaron sin luz.","La tempête de neige a endommagé le réseau électrique dans certaines régions, privant de courant des dizaines de milliers de foyers."],["L7-0858","电线","diànxiàn","N","electric wire; cable","cable eléctrico","fil électrique","这栋楼的电线已经老化，存在安全隐患。","zhè dòng lóu de diàn xiàn yǐ jīng lǎo huà cún zài ān quán yǐn huàn","The wiring in this building has aged and poses a safety hazard.","El cableado de este edificio está envejecido y representa un riesgo para la seguridad.","Les câbles électriques de cet immeuble sont vieillissants et présentent un risque pour la sécurité."],["L7-0859","电信","diànxìn","N","telecommunications","telecomunicaciones","télécommunications","他在电信行业工作了十年。","tā zài diàn xìn háng yè gōng zuò le shí nián","He has worked in the telecommunications industry for ten years.","Ha trabajado diez años en el sector de las telecomunicaciones.","Il travaille depuis dix ans dans le secteur des télécommunications."],["L7-0860","电讯","diànxùn","N","telecommunications; telecom news","telecomunicaciones; despacho de noticias","télécommunications; dépêche","山区的电讯设施受损，居民暂时无法与外界联系。","shān qū de diàn xùn shè shī shòu sǔn jū mín zàn shí wú fǎ yǔ wài jiè lián xì","Telecommunications facilities in the mountain region were damaged, temporarily leaving residents unable to contact the outside world.","Las instalaciones de telecomunicaciones de la zona montañosa quedaron dañadas y los habitantes no pueden comunicarse con el exterior por el momento.","Les installations de télécommunications de la région montagneuse ont été endommagées, et les habitants ne peuvent momentanément plus communiquer avec l'extérieur."],["L7-0861","垫","diàn","V","cushion; to pad","cojín; acolchar; rellenar","coussin; rembourrer; caler","桌子有点不稳，他找了块木片垫在桌脚下面。","zhuō zi yǒu diǎn bù wěn tā zhǎo le kuài mù piàn diàn zài zhuō jiǎo xià miàn","The table was a bit wobbly, so he found a wood chip and wedged it under the table leg.","La mesa estaba un poco coja, así que buscó un trocito de madera y lo calzó bajo la pata.","La table était un peu bancale ; il a trouvé un morceau de bois et l'a calé sous le pied."],["L7-0862","垫底","diàndǐ","","to eat a little first; to be last","picar algo antes; quedar último","manger un peu; finir dernier","晚饭还没做好，他先吃了两块饼干垫底。","wǎn fàn hái méi zuò hǎo tā xiān chī le liǎng kuài bǐng gān diàn dǐ","Dinner wasn't ready yet, so he ate two cookies to tide himself over.","La cena todavía no estaba lista, así que primero se comió dos galletas para aguantar.","Le dîner n'était pas encore prêt, alors il a d'abord mangé deux biscuits pour tenir."],["L7-0863","垫子","diànzi","N","cushion; mat","cojín; colchoneta","coussin; tapis","练瑜伽的时候最好在地上铺一张垫子。","liàn yú jiā de shí hou zuì hǎo zài dì shang pū yì zhāng diàn zi","When doing yoga, it's best to put a mat on the floor.","Cuando practiques yoga, lo mejor es poner una colchoneta en el suelo.","Quand on fait du yoga, il vaut mieux étendre un tapis sur le sol."],["L7-0864","淀粉","diànfěn","N","starch","almidón; fécula","amidon; fécule","做这道菜时，加一点淀粉可以让汤汁更浓稠。","zuò zhè dào cài shí jiā yì diǎn diàn fěn kě yǐ ràng tāng zhī gèng nóng chóu","When making this dish, adding a little starch makes the sauce thicker.","Al preparar este plato, añadir un poco de almidón hace que la salsa quede más espesa.","Pour ce plat, ajouter un peu de fécule rend la sauce plus épaisse."],["L7-0865","惦记","diànjì","V","to keep thinking of; to worry about","tener presente; preocuparse por","penser sans cesse à; se soucier de","奶奶躺在病床上，还惦记着家里阳台上的那几盆花。","nǎi nai tǎng zài bìng chuáng shàng hái diàn jì zhe jiā lǐ yáng tái shàng de nà jǐ pén huā","Lying in her hospital bed, Grandma was still thinking about the pots of flowers on the balcony at home.","Acostada en la cama del hospital, la abuela aún se preocupaba por las macetas de flores del balcón de casa.","Allongée dans son lit d'hôpital, grand-mère pensait encore aux pots de fleurs sur le balcon de la maison."],["L7-0866","奠定","diàndìng","V","to establish; to lay","sentar; establecer","établir; poser","这次成功的实验为后来的研究奠定了基础。","zhè cì chéng gōng de shí yàn wèi hòu lái de yán jiū diàn dìng le jī chǔ","This successful experiment laid the foundation for later research.","Este experimento exitoso sentó las bases para investigaciones posteriores.","Cette expérience réussie a posé les bases des recherches ultérieures."],["L7-0867","殿堂","diàntáng","N","palace; hall; temple","palacio; templo; santuario","palais; temple","能在这座音乐殿堂里演出，是很多歌唱家的梦想。","néng zài zhè zuò yīn yuè diàn táng lǐ yǎn chū shì hěn duō gē chàng jiā de mèng xiǎng","Performing in this temple of music is the dream of many singers.","Actuar en este templo de la música es el sueño de muchos cantantes.","Se produire dans ce temple de la musique est le rêve de nombreux chanteurs."],["L7-0868","刁难","diāonàn","V","to make things difficult","poner trabas; dificultar","créer des difficultés; chercher des ennuis","面对记者的刁难，她机智地化解了尴尬。","miàn duì jì zhě de diāo nàn tā jī zhì de huà jiě le gān gà","Faced with a reporter's tough question, she cleverly defused the awkward moment.","Ante las preguntas capciosas del periodista, ella resolvió la situación incómoda con ingenio.","Face aux questions pièges du journaliste, elle a désamorcé le malaise avec intelligence."],["L7-0869","叼","diāo","V","to hold in the mouth","llevar en la boca","tenir dans la bouche","小狗叼着一根骨头，高兴地跑进了院子。","xiǎo gǒu diāo zhe yì gēn gǔ tou gāo xìng de pǎo jìn le yuàn zi","The puppy ran happily into the yard with a bone in its mouth.","El perrito entró feliz al patio con un hueso en la boca.","Le chiot est entré joyeusement dans la cour avec un os dans la gueule."],["L7-0870","雕","diāo","V","to carve; to engrave","tallar; grabar","sculpter; graver","老木匠用一块木头雕出了一只栩栩如生的小鸟。","lǎo mù jiàng yòng yí kuài mù tou diāo chū le yì zhī xǔ xǔ rú shēng de xiǎo niǎo","The old carpenter carved a lifelike little bird out of a block of wood.","El viejo carpintero talló con un trozo de madera un pajarito que parecía vivo.","Le vieux menuisier a sculpté dans un morceau de bois un petit oiseau plein de vie."],["L7-0871","雕刻","diāokè","V/N","to carve; carving","tallar; talla","sculpter; sculpture","这件玉器雕刻得十分精妙，是博物馆的镇馆之宝。","zhè jiàn yù qì diāo kè de shí fēn jīng miào shì bó wù guǎn de zhèn guǎn zhī bǎo","This jade piece is exquisitely carved and is the museum's most prized treasure.","Esta pieza de jade está tallada de forma exquisita y es el tesoro principal del museo.","Cette pièce de jade est sculptée avec une finesse exquise ; c'est le joyau du musée."],["L7-0872","雕塑","diāosù","V/N","sculpture; statue","escultura; estatua","sculpture; statue","广场中央立着一座英雄的雕塑。","guǎng chǎng zhōng yāng lì zhe yí zuò yīng xióng de diāo sù","A statue of a hero stands in the middle of the square.","En el centro de la plaza se alza la estatua de un héroe.","Une statue de héros se dresse au centre de la place."],["L7-0873","吊销","diàoxiāo","V","to revoke; to withdraw","revocar; retirar","révoquer; retirer","他因为多次酒后驾车，被吊销了驾驶证。","tā yīn wèi duō cì jiǔ hòu jià chē bèi diào xiāo le jià shǐ zhèng","His driver's license was revoked for repeated drunk driving.","Le retiraron la licencia de conducir por manejar ebrio en repetidas ocasiones.","Son permis de conduire a été retiré pour conduite en état d'ivresse à plusieurs reprises."],["L7-0874","钓鱼","diàoyú","V","to fish; to bait","pescar; tender un cebo","pêcher; appâter","周末爸爸常常带我去河边钓鱼。","zhōu mò bà ba cháng cháng dài wǒ qù hé biān diào yú","On weekends Dad often takes me fishing by the river.","Los fines de semana, papá suele llevarme a pescar al río.","Le week-end, papa m'emmène souvent pêcher au bord de la rivière."],["L7-0875","调度","diàodù","V/N","to dispatch; to schedule","despachar; coordinar","répartir; planifier","面对突如其来的订单，车间及时调度人手，避免了交货延误。","miàn duì tū rú qí lái de dìng dān chē jiān jí shí diào dù rén shǒu bì miǎn le jiāo huò yán wù","Faced with an unexpected order, the workshop promptly reassigned staff to avoid a delivery delay.","Ante un pedido inesperado, el taller reasignó personal a tiempo y evitó el retraso en la entrega.","Face à une commande imprévue, l'atelier a réaffecté du personnel à temps et évité un retard de livraison."],["L7-0876","掉队","diàoduì","","to fall behind","quedarse atrás","se laisser distancer","爬山时他体力跟不上，很快就掉队了。","pá shān shí tā tǐ lì gēn bu shàng hěn kuài jiù diào duì le","When climbing the mountain he couldn't keep up physically and soon fell behind.","Al subir la montaña no pudo seguir el ritmo físicamente y pronto se quedó atrás.","En montant la montagne, il n'avait pas assez d'endurance et s'est vite laissé distancer."],["L7-0877","掉头","diàotóu","","to turn around","dar la vuelta","faire demi-tour","导航显示前方拥堵，司机便在下一个路口掉头，改走另一条路线。","dǎo háng xiǎn shì qián fāng yōng dǔ sī jī biàn zài xià yí ge lù kǒu diào tóu gǎi zǒu lìng yì tiáo lù xiàn","The navigation system showed congestion ahead, so the driver turned around at the next junction and took another route.","El navegador mostró congestión adelante, así que el conductor dio la vuelta en el siguiente cruce y tomó otra ruta.","Le GPS indiquait des embouteillages plus loin, alors le chauffeur a fait demi-tour au prochain carrefour et a pris un autre itinéraire."],["L7-0878","爹","diē","N","dad; father","papá; padre","papa; père","他每年过年都要回老家看望爹娘。","tā měi nián guò nián dōu yào huí lǎo jiā kàn wàng diē niáng","Every New Year he goes back to his hometown to visit his parents.","Cada Año Nuevo vuelve a su pueblo natal a visitar a sus padres.","Chaque Nouvel An, il retourne dans son village natal rendre visite à ses parents."],["L7-0879","迭起","diéqǐ","V","to arise repeatedly","surgir una y otra vez","se succéder","这场比赛高潮迭起，观众们看得十分过瘾。","zhè chǎng bǐ sài gāo cháo dié qǐ guān zhòng men kàn de shí fēn guò yǐn","The match had one thrilling moment after another, and the spectators thoroughly enjoyed it.","El partido tuvo un momento emocionante tras otro y el público lo disfrutó muchísimo.","Le match a connu rebondissement sur rebondissement, et les spectateurs s'en sont délectés."],["L7-0880","叠","dié","V","to fold; to pile up","doblar; apilar","plier; empiler","她把洗好的衣服叠得整整齐齐，放进了衣柜。","tā bǎ xǐ hǎo de yī fu dié de zhěng zhěng qí qí fàng jìn le yī guì","She folded the clean clothes neatly and put them in the wardrobe.","Dobló la ropa lavada con mucho orden y la guardó en el armario.","Elle a plié soigneusement les vêtements propres et les a rangés dans l'armoire."],["L7-0881","丁","dīng","N","Ding (surname); fourth heavenly stem","Ding (apellido); cuarto tronco celestial","Ding (nom de famille); quatrième tronc céleste","把胡萝卜切成小丁，和米饭一起炒。","bǎ hú luó bo qiē chéng xiǎo dīng hé mǐ fàn yì qǐ chǎo","Cut the carrots into small cubes and stir-fry them with the rice.","Corta las zanahorias en cubitos y saltéalas con el arroz.","Coupez les carottes en petits dés et faites-les sauter avec le riz."],["L7-0882","叮嘱","dīngzhǔ","V","to urge repeatedly; to admonish","recomendar insistentemente","recommander instamment","导师反复叮嘱我们，引用他人的论述时务必注明出处。","dǎo shī fǎn fù dīng zhǔ wǒ men yǐn yòng tā rén de lùn shù shí wù bì zhù míng chū chù","Our supervisor repeatedly reminded us to identify the source whenever we cite someone else's arguments.","El tutor nos recordó una y otra vez que, al citar los argumentos de otros, hay que indicar siempre la fuente.","Notre directeur de recherche nous a répété qu'il faut toujours indiquer la source lorsqu'on cite les propos d'autrui."],["L7-0883","盯","dīng","V","to stare at; to watch closely","mirar fijamente; vigilar","fixer du regard; surveiller","他盯着窗外发愣，连老师叫他都没听见。","tā dīng zhe chuāng wài fā lèng lián lǎo shī jiào tā dōu méi tīng jiàn","He was staring blankly out of the window and didn't even hear the teacher calling him.","Estaba mirando absorto por la ventana y ni siquiera oyó que el profesor lo llamaba.","Il fixait la fenêtre d'un air absent et n'a même pas entendu le professeur l'appeler."],["L7-0884","钉子","dīngzi","N","nail; obstacle","clavo; obstáculo","clou; obstacle","墙上钉着一颗钉子，可以用来挂画。","qiáng shàng dìng zhe yì kē dīng zi kě yǐ yòng lái guà huà","There is a nail in the wall that can be used for hanging a picture.","Hay un clavo en la pared que sirve para colgar un cuadro.","Il y a un clou dans le mur qui peut servir à accrocher un tableau."],["L7-0885","顶多","dǐngduō","Adv","at most","como máximo","tout au plus","这点小伤不要紧，顶多休息两天就好了。","zhè diǎn xiǎo shāng bú yào jǐn dǐng duō xiū xi liǎng tiān jiù hǎo le","This little injury is nothing serious; at most you'll need a couple of days' rest.","Esta pequeña herida no es grave; como mucho, con descansar un par de días se te pasará.","Cette petite blessure n'est pas grave ; il suffira tout au plus de deux jours de repos."],["L7-0886","顶级","dǐngjí","Adj","top-level; top-notch","de primer nivel; de primera","de premier plan; haut de gamme","这家餐厅请来了一位世界顶级的厨师。","zhè jiā cān tīng qǐng lái le yí wèi shì jiè dǐng jí de chú shī","This restaurant has hired a world-class chef.","Este restaurante contrató a un chef de talla mundial.","Ce restaurant a engagé un chef de renommée mondiale."],["L7-0887","顶尖","dǐngjiān","N/Adj","top; best","cima; de lo mejor","sommet; excellent","这所大学汇聚了国内顶尖的科研人才。","zhè suǒ dà xué huì jù le guó nèi dǐng jiān de kē yán rén cái","This university brings together the country's top scientific researchers.","Esta universidad reúne a los mejores investigadores científicos del país.","Cette université rassemble les meilleurs chercheurs scientifiques du pays."],["L7-0888","订单","dìngdān","N","order","pedido","commande","如果您取消订单，押金将在三天内全额返还。","rú guǒ nín qǔ xiāo dìng dān yā jīn jiāng zài sān tiān nèi quán é fǎn huán","If you cancel your order, the deposit will be refunded in full within three days.","Si cancela su pedido, el depósito se le reembolsará íntegramente en un plazo de tres días.","Si vous annulez votre commande, l'acompte vous sera intégralement remboursé sous trois jours."],["L7-0889","订购","dìnggòu","V","to order; to subscribe","encargar; suscribirse","commander; s'abonner","我在网上订购了一台洗衣机，明天就能送到。","wǒ zài wǎng shàng dìng gòu le yì tái xǐ yī jī míng tiān jiù néng sòng dào","I ordered a washing machine online, and it will be delivered tomorrow.","Pedí una lavadora por internet y me llegará mañana.","J'ai commandé un lave-linge sur Internet, il sera livré demain."],["L7-0890","订婚","dìnghūn","","to get engaged","comprometerse; prometerse","se fiancer","他们俩交往了五年，上个月终于订婚了。","tā men liǎ jiāo wǎng le wǔ nián shàng ge yuè zhōng yú dìng hūn le","The two of them dated for five years and finally got engaged last month.","Los dos salieron juntos cinco años y por fin se comprometieron el mes pasado.","Tous les deux sont sortis ensemble pendant cinq ans et se sont enfin fiancés le mois dernier."],["L7-0891","订立","dìnglì","V","to conclude; to establish","concertar; establecer","conclure; établir","双方在平等自愿的基础上订立了合同。","shuāng fāng zài píng děng zì yuàn de jī chǔ shàng dìng lì le hé tóng","The two parties concluded the contract on the basis of equality and free will.","Ambas partes celebraron el contrato sobre la base de la igualdad y la libre voluntad.","Les deux parties ont conclu le contrat sur la base de l'égalité et du libre consentement."],["L7-0892","钉","dìng","V","nail; to follow closely","clavar; clavo; seguir de cerca","clouer; clou; suivre de près","墙上钉着一颗钉子，可以用来挂画。","qiáng shàng dìng zhe yì kē dīng zi kě yǐ yòng lái guà huà","There is a nail in the wall that can be used for hanging a picture.","Hay un clavo en la pared que sirve para colgar un cuadro.","Il y a un clou dans le mur qui peut servir à accrocher un tableau."],["L7-0893","定金","dìngjīn","N","deposit; down payment","depósito; anticipo","acompte; arrhes","买新车时，他先交了五千块钱定金。","mǎi xīn chē shí tā xiān jiāo le wǔ qiān kuài qián dìng jīn","When buying the new car, he first paid a five-thousand-yuan deposit.","Al comprar el coche nuevo, primero pagó un anticipo de cinco mil yuanes.","Pour l'achat de sa voiture neuve, il a d'abord versé un acompte de cinq mille yuans."],["L7-0894","定居","dìngjū","","to settle down","establecerse; fijar residencia","s'établir; s'installer","退休以后，他们夫妻俩在海边的小城定居了。","tuì xiū yǐ hòu tā men fū qī liǎ zài hǎi biān de xiǎo chéng dìng jū le","After retiring, the couple settled down in a small town by the sea.","Tras jubilarse, el matrimonio se estableció en un pueblito junto al mar.","Une fois à la retraite, le couple s'est installé dans une petite ville au bord de la mer."],["L7-0895","定论","dìnglùn","N","final conclusion","conclusión definitiva","conclusion définitive","面对相互矛盾的证据，研究者应当审慎推断，而非仓促下定论。","miàn duì xiāng hù máo dùn de zhèng jù yán jiū zhě yīng dāng shěn shèn tuī duàn ér fēi cāng cù xià dìng lùn","When faced with conflicting evidence, researchers should draw cautious inferences rather than rush to a definitive conclusion.","Ante pruebas contradictorias, los investigadores deben inferir con cautela en lugar de sacar conclusiones apresuradas.","Face à des preuves contradictoires, les chercheurs doivent raisonner avec prudence plutôt que de tirer des conclusions hâtives."],["L7-0896","定为","dìngwéi","","to set as; to designate as","fijar como; designar como","fixer comme; désigner comme","这一天被定为全国的植树节。","zhè yì tiān bèi dìng wéi quán guó de zhí shù jié","This day has been designated as National Tree-Planting Day.","Este día fue designado como el Día Nacional de la Plantación de Árboles.","Ce jour a été fixé comme Journée nationale de plantation d'arbres."],["L7-0897","定向","dìngxiàng","V","directional; to orient","direccional; orientar","directionnel; orienter","学校与几家企业签订了定向培养协议，毕业生可以直接进厂工作。","xué xiào yǔ jǐ jiā qǐ yè qiān dìng le dìng xiàng péi yǎng xié yì bì yè shēng kě yǐ zhí jiē jìn chǎng gōng zuò","The school has signed targeted training agreements with several companies, so graduates can go straight to work in their factories.","La escuela firmó con varias empresas acuerdos de formación dirigida, de modo que los egresados pueden incorporarse directamente a trabajar en las fábricas.","L'école a signé avec plusieurs entreprises des accords de formation ciblée, si bien que les diplômés peuvent aller directement travailler en usine."],["L7-0898","定心丸","dìngxīnwán","N","reassurance","tranquilizante; algo que da seguridad","réconfort; rassurance","医生的一番话给全家人吃了一颗定心丸。","yī shēng de yì fān huà gěi quán jiā rén chī le yì kē dìng xīn wán","The doctor's words were a great reassurance to the whole family.","Las palabras del médico tranquilizaron a toda la familia.","Les paroles du médecin ont rassuré toute la famille."],["L7-0899","定义","dìngyì","N","definition; to define","definición; definir","définition; définir","请你用自己的话给“幸福”下一个定义。","qǐng nǐ yòng zì jǐ de huà gěi xìng fú xià yí ge dìng yì","Please define \"happiness\" in your own words.","Define «felicidad» con tus propias palabras.","Définissez le « bonheur » avec vos propres mots."],["L7-0900","定做","dìngzuò","V","to make to order","hacer por encargo","faire sur commande","她在裁缝店定做了一件结婚穿的旗袍。","tā zài cái féng diàn dìng zuò le yí jiàn jié hūn chuān de qí páo","She had a qipao made to order at a tailor's shop for her wedding.","Mandó hacer a medida en una sastrería un qipao para llevar en su boda.","Elle a fait faire sur mesure chez un tailleur un qipao pour son mariage."],["L7-0901","丢掉","diūdiào","V","to lose; to throw away","perder; tirar","perdre; jeter","搬家时，我丢掉了很多多年不用的旧东西。","bān jiā shí wǒ diū diào le hěn duō duō nián bú yòng de jiù dōng xi","When I moved, I threw away a lot of old things I hadn't used in years.","Al mudarme, tiré muchas cosas viejas que llevaba años sin usar.","Lors de mon déménagement, j'ai jeté beaucoup de vieilles affaires que je n'utilisais plus depuis des années."],["L7-0902","丢脸","diūliǎn","","to lose face","quedar en ridículo; perder prestigio","perdre la face","他在比赛中犯了低级错误，觉得特别丢脸。","tā zài bǐ sài zhōng fàn le dī jí cuò wù jué de tè bié diū liǎn","He made an elementary mistake in the competition and felt really humiliated.","Cometió un error elemental en la competencia y sintió mucha vergüenza.","Il a commis une erreur de débutant pendant la compétition et en a éprouvé une grande honte."],["L7-0903","丢弃","diūqì","V","to discard; to abandon","desechar; abandonar","jeter; abandonner","随意丢弃垃圾的人可能会被罚款。","suí yì diū qì lā jī de rén kě néng huì bèi fá kuǎn","People who litter may be fined.","Quien tire basura donde le dé la gana puede ser multado.","Les personnes qui jettent des déchets n'importe où risquent une amende."],["L7-0904","丢人","diūrén","","to lose face; disgraceful","pasar vergüenza","avoir honte; perdre la face","这么简单的题都做错了，真丢人！","zhè me jiǎn dān de tí dōu zuò cuò le zhēn diū rén","Getting such an easy question wrong—how embarrassing!","¡Fallar una pregunta tan fácil, qué vergüenza!","Rater une question aussi facile, quelle honte !"],["L7-0905","丢失","diūshī","V","to lose; to misplace","perder; extraviar","perdre; égarer","丢失身份证以后，要尽快到公安局补办。","diū shī shēn fèn zhèng yǐ hòu yào jǐn kuài dào gōng ān jú bǔ bàn","If you lose your ID card, go to the public security bureau as soon as possible to get a replacement.","Si pierdes tu cédula de identidad, tramita cuanto antes su reposición en la oficina de seguridad pública.","Si vous perdez votre carte d'identité, rendez-vous au plus vite au bureau de sécurité publique pour en obtenir une nouvelle."],["L7-0906","东奔西走","dōngbēn-xīzǒu","","to rush about everywhere","ir de aquí para allá","courir de-ci de-là","为了给公司拉投资，他整整一年都在东奔西走。","wèi le gěi gōng sī lā tóu zī tā zhěng zhěng yì nián dōu zài dōng bēn xī zǒu","To attract investment for the company, he spent a whole year rushing around everywhere.","Para atraer inversión a la empresa, se pasó todo un año viajando de un lado a otro.","Pour attirer des investissements pour l'entreprise, il a couru partout pendant toute une année."],["L7-0907","东道主","dōngdàozhǔ","N","host","anfitrión","hôte; pays hôte","作为东道主，我们一定要让客人们感到宾至如归。","zuò wéi dōng dào zhǔ wǒ men yí dìng yào ràng kè rén men gǎn dào bīn zhì rú guī","As hosts, we must make our guests feel right at home.","Como anfitriones, tenemos que hacer que los invitados se sientan como en su casa.","En tant qu'hôtes, nous devons faire en sorte que nos invités se sentent comme chez eux."],["L7-0908","东张西望","dōngzhāng-xīwàng","","to look around","mirar a todos lados","regarder de tous côtés","他站在路口东张西望，好像在找什么人。","tā zhàn zài lù kǒu dōng zhāng xī wàng hǎo xiàng zài zhǎo shén me rén","He stood at the intersection looking all around, as if searching for someone.","Estaba en el cruce mirando a todos lados, como si buscara a alguien.","Il se tenait au carrefour, regardant de tous côtés, comme s'il cherchait quelqu'un."],["L7-0909","董事","dǒngshì","N","director; board member","director; consejero","administrateur","他是这家公司的独立董事，主要负责监督工作。","tā shì zhè jiā gōng sī de dú lì dǒng shì zhǔ yào fù zé jiān dū gōng zuò","He is an independent director of this company and is mainly responsible for oversight.","Es director independiente de esta empresa y se encarga principalmente de la supervisión.","Il est administrateur indépendant de cette société et est principalement chargé de la supervision."],["L7-0910","董事会","dǒngshìhuì","N","board of directors","consejo de administración","conseil d'administration","董事会任命她为公司的新总裁。","dǒng shì huì rèn mìng tā wéi gōng sī de xīn zǒng cái","The board appointed her as the company's new president.","La junta directiva nombró a ella como nueva presidenta de la empresa.","Le conseil d'administration l'a nommée nouvelle présidente de l'entreprise."],["L7-0911","董事长","dǒngshìzhǎng","N","chairman of the board","presidente del consejo","président du conseil","这家集团的董事长白手起家，三十年打造了一个商业王国。","zhè jiā jí tuán de dǒng shì zhǎng bái shǒu qǐ jiā sān shí nián dǎ zào le yí ge shāng yè wáng guó","The chairman of this group started from scratch and built a business empire over thirty years.","El presidente de este grupo empezó de la nada y en treinta años construyó un imperio empresarial.","Le président de ce groupe est parti de rien et a bâti en trente ans un empire commercial."],["L7-0912","懂事","dǒngshì","","sensible; understanding","sensato; maduro","raisonnable; mûr","这孩子很懂事，看到妈妈累了就主动帮忙做家务。","zhè hái zi hěn dǒng shì kàn dào mā ma lèi le jiù zhǔ dòng bāng máng zuò jiā wù","This child is very thoughtful; when she sees her mother is tired, she helps with the housework without being asked.","Esta niña es muy considerada: al ver cansada a su mamá, ayuda por iniciativa propia con los quehaceres.","Cette enfant est très raisonnable : quand elle voit sa mère fatiguée, elle l'aide spontanément aux tâches ménagères."],["L7-0913","动不动","dòngbudòng","Adv","at every turn; easily","a cada paso; por nada","à tout bout de champ","他脾气不好，动不动就跟别人吵架。","tā pí qi bù hǎo dòng bu dòng jiù gēn bié rén chǎo jià","He has a bad temper and gets into arguments with people at the slightest provocation.","Tiene mal genio y se pelea con la gente por cualquier cosa.","Il a mauvais caractère et se dispute avec les autres pour un oui ou pour un non."],["L7-0914","动荡","dòngdàng","V/Adj","turbulence; unrest","turbulencia; inestabilidad","turbulence; instabilité","这部小说通过主人公的遭遇，折射出一个时代的动荡与变迁。","zhè bù xiǎo shuō tōng guò zhǔ rén gōng de zāo yù zhé shè chū yí ge shí dài de dòng dàng yǔ biàn qiān","Through its protagonist's experiences, this novel reflects the upheavals and changes of an era.","A través de las vivencias del protagonista, esta novela refleja las turbulencias y transformaciones de una época.","À travers le parcours de son héros, ce roman reflète les troubles et les mutations d'une époque."],["L7-0915","动感","dònggǎn","N","dynamic feel; sense of motion","dinamismo; sensación de movimiento","dynamisme; sensation de mouvement","这首舞曲节奏明快，充满了动感。","zhè shǒu wǔ qǔ jié zòu míng kuài chōng mǎn le dòng gǎn","This dance tune has a brisk rhythm and is full of energy.","Esta pieza de baile tiene un ritmo ágil y está llena de energía.","Ce morceau de danse a un rythme enlevé et déborde d'énergie."],["L7-0916","动工","dònggōng","","to start construction","iniciar obras","commencer les travaux","新医院的建设项目下个月正式动工。","xīn yī yuàn de jiàn shè xiàng mù xià ge yuè zhèng shì dòng gōng","Construction of the new hospital officially starts next month.","El proyecto de construcción del nuevo hospital comenzará oficialmente el mes que viene.","Les travaux du nouvel hôpital débuteront officiellement le mois prochain."],["L7-0917","动静","dòngjing","N","movement; activity","movimiento; actividad","mouvement; bruit; activité","半夜里，他听见楼下有动静，赶紧起床查看。","bàn yè lǐ tā tīng jiàn lóu xià yǒu dòng jing gǎn jǐn qǐ chuáng chá kàn","In the middle of the night he heard a noise downstairs and quickly got up to check.","A medianoche oyó un ruido abajo y se levantó enseguida a ver.","En pleine nuit, il a entendu du bruit en bas et s'est vite levé pour aller voir."],["L7-0918","动脉","dòngmài","N","artery","arteria","artère","长期吸烟会增加动脉硬化的风险。","cháng qī xī yān huì zēng jiā dòng mài yìng huà de fēng xiǎn","Long-term smoking increases the risk of hardening of the arteries.","Fumar durante mucho tiempo aumenta el riesgo de arteriosclerosis.","Fumer sur une longue période augmente le risque d'artériosclérose."],["L7-0919","动身","dòngshēn","","to set out; to depart","ponerse en camino; partir","se mettre en route; partir","我们明天一早动身，争取中午前到达目的地。","wǒ men míng tiān yì zǎo dòng shēn zhēng qǔ zhōng wǔ qián dào dá mù dì dì","We'll set off early tomorrow morning and try to reach our destination before noon.","Mañana saldremos temprano e intentaremos llegar al destino antes del mediodía.","Nous partirons demain de bon matin et essaierons d'arriver à destination avant midi."],["L7-0920","动弹","dòngtan","V","to move; to budge","moverse","bouger","他的腿被压在车下面，一点也动弹不了。","tā de tuǐ bèi yā zài chē xià miàn yì diǎn yě dòng tan bù liǎo","His leg was pinned under the car, and he couldn't move it at all.","Tenía la pierna atrapada bajo el coche y no podía moverla en absoluto.","Sa jambe était coincée sous la voiture et il ne pouvait pas du tout la bouger."],["L7-0921","动听","dòngtīng","Adj","pleasant to hear","agradable de oír; melodioso","agréable à entendre","她的歌声清脆动听，像山间的泉水一样。","tā de gē shēng qīng cuì dòng tīng xiàng shān jiān de quán shuǐ yí yàng","Her singing is clear and pleasant to hear, like a mountain spring.","Su voz es clara y agradable, como el agua de un manantial de la montaña.","Sa voix est claire et agréable, comme une source de montagne."],["L7-0922","动向","dòngxiàng","N","trend; movement","tendencia; evolución","tendance; évolution","投资者正在密切关注市场的最新动向。","tóu zī zhě zhèng zài mì qiè guān zhù shì chǎng de zuì xīn dòng xiàng","Investors are closely watching the latest market trends.","Los inversionistas siguen de cerca las últimas tendencias del mercado.","Les investisseurs suivent de près les dernières évolutions du marché."],["L7-0923","动用","dòngyòng","V","to use; to draw on","utilizar; recurrir a","utiliser; mobiliser","为了寻找失踪的游客，当地动用了直升机参与搜救。","wèi le xún zhǎo shī zōng de yóu kè dāng dì dòng yòng le zhí shēng jī cān yù sōu jiù","To search for the missing tourists, local authorities deployed helicopters in the search and rescue.","Para buscar a los turistas desaparecidos, las autoridades locales emplearon helicópteros en las labores de búsqueda y rescate.","Pour retrouver les touristes disparus, les autorités locales ont mobilisé des hélicoptères pour les recherches et le sauvetage."],["L7-0924","冻结","dòngjié","V","to freeze","congelar","geler; bloquer","由于涉嫌诈骗，他的银行账户被依法冻结了。","yóu yú shè xián zhà piàn tā de yín háng zhàng hù bèi yī fǎ dòng jié le","Because he was suspected of fraud, his bank account was frozen according to law.","Por sospecha de fraude, su cuenta bancaria fue congelada conforme a la ley.","Soupçonné de fraude, il a vu son compte bancaire gelé conformément à la loi."],["L7-0925","栋","dòng","M","building (measure word)","edificio (clasificador)","bâtiment (classificateur)","地震的时候，整栋楼都在震动。","dì zhèn de shí hou zhěng dòng lóu dōu zài zhèn dòng","During the earthquake, the whole building was shaking.","Durante el terremoto, todo el edificio se sacudía.","Pendant le séisme, tout l'immeuble tremblait."],["L7-0926","栋梁","dòngliáng","N","pillar; mainstay","pilar; sostén","pilier; soutien","年轻人是国家的栋梁，应该多读书、多实践。","nián qīng rén shì guó jiā de dòng liáng yīng gāi duō dú shū duō shí jiàn","Young people are the pillars of the nation and should read widely and gain practical experience.","Los jóvenes son el pilar del país y deben leer más y adquirir más experiencia práctica.","Les jeunes sont les piliers de la nation ; ils doivent lire davantage et acquérir de l'expérience pratique."],["L7-0927","兜","dōu","V","pocket; to wrap; to circle","bolsillo; envolver; dar vueltas","poche; envelopper; tourner","他把手伸进兜里摸了半天，也没找到钥匙。","tā bǎ shǒu shēn jìn dōu lǐ mō le bàn tiān yě méi zhǎo dào yào shi","He felt around in his pocket for ages but couldn't find his keys.","Metió la mano al bolsillo y rebuscó un buen rato, pero no encontró las llaves.","Il a fouillé longtemps dans sa poche sans retrouver ses clés."],["L7-0928","兜儿","dōur","N","pocket; bag","bolsillo; bolsa","poche; sac","这件外套有好几个兜儿，出门放东西特别方便。","zhè jiàn wài tào yǒu hǎo jǐ ge dōur chū mén fàng dōng xi tè bié fāng biàn","This jacket has several pockets, which is very handy for carrying things when you go out.","Esta chaqueta tiene varios bolsillos, lo cual es muy práctico para llevar cosas al salir.","Cette veste a plusieurs poches, ce qui est très pratique pour emporter des affaires quand on sort."],["L7-0929","兜售","dōushòu","V","to peddle; to hawk","vender ambulante; ofrecer","colporter; vendre à la sauvette","几个小贩在景区门口向游客兜售假冒纪念品。","jǐ ge xiǎo fàn zài jǐng qū mén kǒu xiàng yóu kè dōu shòu jiǎ mào jì niàn pǐn","A few peddlers were hawking fake souvenirs to tourists at the entrance to the scenic area.","Unos vendedores ambulantes ofrecían a los turistas, en la entrada de la zona turística, recuerdos falsificados.","Quelques colporteurs vendaient de faux souvenirs aux touristes à l'entrée du site touristique."],["L7-0930","抖","dǒu","V","to shake; to tremble","sacudir; temblar","secouer; trembler","她把床单使劲抖了几下，抖掉了上面的灰尘。","tā bǎ chuáng dān shǐ jìn dǒu le jǐ xià dǒu diào le shàng miàn de huī chén","She gave the sheet a few hard shakes to shake off the dust.","Sacudió la sábana con fuerza varias veces para quitarle el polvo.","Elle a secoué le drap énergiquement plusieurs fois pour en faire tomber la poussière."],["L7-0931","陡","dǒu","Adj","steep; suddenly","empinado; de repente","escarpé; soudain","这条山路又窄又陡，下雨天特别难走。","zhè tiáo shān lù yòu zhǎi yòu dǒu xià yǔ tiān tè bié nán zǒu","This mountain path is narrow and steep, and especially hard to walk on rainy days.","Este camino de montaña es estrecho y empinado, y es especialmente difícil de transitar los días de lluvia.","Ce chemin de montagne est étroit et raide, et particulièrement difficile à parcourir les jours de pluie."],["L7-0932","斗","dòu","V","Big Dipper","Osa Mayor","Grande Ourse","他知道自己斗不过对手，干脆主动认输了。","tā zhī dào zì jǐ dòu bú guò duì shǒu gān cuì zhǔ dòng rèn shū le","He knew he couldn't beat his opponent, so he simply conceded.","Sabía que no podía ganarle a su rival, así que simplemente se rindió por iniciativa propia.","Sachant qu'il ne pouvait pas battre son adversaire, il a tout simplement abandonné de lui-même."],["L7-0933","斗志","dòuzhì","N","fighting spirit","espíritu de lucha","esprit combatif","虽然落后了十分，队员们的斗志依然很旺盛。","suī rán luò hòu le shí fēn duì yuán men de dòu zhì yī rán hěn wàng shèng","Although they were ten points behind, the players' fighting spirit was still strong.","Aunque iban perdiendo por diez puntos, el ánimo de lucha de los jugadores seguía siendo muy alto.","Bien qu'ils aient dix points de retard, les joueurs gardaient un moral de combat intact."],["L7-0934","豆浆","dòujiāng","N","soy milk","leche de soja","lait de soja","做豆浆之前，要先把黄豆浸泡一晚上。","zuò dòu jiāng zhī qián yào xiān bǎ huáng dòu jìn pào yì wǎn shang","Before making soy milk, you need to soak the soybeans overnight.","Antes de hacer leche de soya, hay que remojar los frijoles de soya toda la noche.","Avant de préparer du lait de soja, il faut faire tremper les graines de soja toute une nuit."],["L7-0935","豆子","dòuzi","N","bean","frijol; haba","haricot; légumineuse","把豆子提前泡一夜，第二天煮起来会快很多。","bǎ dòu zi tí qián pào yí yè dì èr tiān zhǔ qǐ lái huì kuài hěn duō","If you soak the beans overnight, they'll cook much faster the next day.","Si remojas los frijoles de víspera, al día siguiente se cocinarán mucho más rápido.","Si vous faites tremper les haricots la veille, ils cuiront bien plus vite le lendemain."],["L7-0936","逗","dòu","V/Adj","to tease; funny","bromear; gracioso","taquiner; drôle","他讲了个笑话，把大家都逗笑了。","tā jiǎng le gè xiào hua bǎ dà jiā dōu dòu xiào le","He told a joke and made everyone laugh.","Contó un chiste y todos se echaron a reír.","Il a raconté une blague et a fait rire tout le monde."],["L7-0937","都会","dūhuì","N","metropolis","metrópoli","métropole","上海是一座充满活力的国际大都会。","shàng hǎi shì yí zuò chōng mǎn huó lì de guó jì dà dū huì","Shanghai is a vibrant international metropolis.","Shanghái es una metrópolis internacional llena de vitalidad.","Shanghai est une grande métropole internationale pleine de vitalité."],["L7-0938","督促","dūcù","V","to urge; to supervise","instar; supervisar","exhorter; superviser","老师每天督促学生按时完成作业。","lǎo shī měi tiān dū cù xué shēng àn shí wán chéng zuò yè","The teacher urges the students every day to finish their homework on time.","La maestra insiste todos los días en que los alumnos terminen la tarea a tiempo.","Chaque jour, la maîtresse veille à ce que les élèves terminent leurs devoirs à temps."],["L7-0939","独","dú","Adv","alone; only","solo; único","seul; unique","每个人的指纹都是独一无二的。","měi ge rén de zhǐ wén dōu shì dú yī wú èr de","Everyone's fingerprints are unique.","Las huellas dactilares de cada persona son únicas.","Les empreintes digitales de chacun sont uniques."],["L7-0940","独唱","dúchàng","V","solo singing","cantar en solitario","chanter en solo","在今晚的音乐会上，她将演唱一首女声独唱。","zài jīn wǎn de yīn yuè huì shàng tā jiāng yǎn chàng yì shǒu nǚ shēng dú chàng","At tonight's concert, she will perform a solo for female voice.","En el concierto de esta noche, ella interpretará un solo de voz femenina.","Au concert de ce soir, elle interprétera un solo de voix féminine."],["L7-0941","独家","dújiā","N","exclusive","exclusivo","exclusif","这家报纸刊登了对这位明星的独家专访。","zhè jiā bào zhǐ kān dēng le duì zhè wèi míng xīng de dú jiā zhuān fǎng","This newspaper published an exclusive interview with the star.","Este periódico publicó una entrevista exclusiva con la estrella.","Ce journal a publié une interview exclusive de cette vedette."],["L7-0942","独立自主","dúlì-zìzhǔ","","independent and self-reliant","independiente y autónomo","indépendant et autonome","大学生活让他学会了独立自主地安排自己的时间。","dà xué shēng huó ràng tā xué huì le dú lì zì zhǔ de ān pái zì jǐ de shí jiān","University life taught him to manage his own time independently.","La vida universitaria le enseñó a organizar su tiempo de manera independiente y autónoma.","La vie universitaire lui a appris à gérer son temps de façon indépendante et autonome."],["L7-0943","独身","dúshēn","V","single; unmarried","soltero","célibataire","她一直独身，把全部精力都投入到了科研工作中。","tā yì zhí dú shēn bǎ quán bù jīng lì dōu tóu rù dào le kē yán gōng zuò zhōng","She has always stayed single and devoted all her energy to scientific research.","Ha permanecido siempre soltera y ha volcado toda su energía en la investigación científica.","Elle est toujours restée célibataire et a consacré toute son énergie à la recherche scientifique."],["L7-0944","独一无二","dúyī-wú'èr","","unique; unrivaled","único; sin igual","unique; sans égal","每个人的指纹都是独一无二的。","měi ge rén de zhǐ wén dōu shì dú yī wú èr de","Everyone's fingerprints are unique.","Las huellas dactilares de cada persona son únicas.","Les empreintes digitales de chacun sont uniques."],["L7-0945","堵塞","dǔsè","V","to block; blockage","obstruir; atasco","boucher; obstruction","下水道被头发堵塞了，水半天流不下去。","xià shuǐ dào bèi tóu fa dǔ sè le shuǐ bàn tiān liú bú xià qù","The drain was clogged with hair, and the water took ages to go down.","El desagüe estaba obstruido por cabellos y el agua tardó muchísimo en bajar.","La canalisation était bouchée par des cheveux et l'eau mettait un temps fou à s'écouler."],["L7-0946","杜绝","dùjué","V","to put an end to","acabar con; erradicar","mettre fin à; éradiquer","学校采取了多项措施，杜绝考试作弊现象。","xué xiào cǎi qǔ le duō xiàng cuò shī dù jué kǎo shì zuò bì xiàn xiàng","The school has taken a number of measures to put an end to cheating in exams.","La escuela adoptó varias medidas para erradicar las trampas en los exámenes.","L'école a pris plusieurs mesures pour mettre fin à la triche aux examens."],["L7-0947","妒忌","dùjì","V","to envy; to be jealous","envidiar; tener celos","envier; être jaloux","看到同事升了职，他心里有些妒忌。","kàn dào tóng shì shēng le zhí tā xīn lǐ yǒu xiē dù jì","Seeing his colleague promoted, he felt a little jealous.","Al ver ascendido a su compañero, sintió algo de envidia.","En voyant son collègue promu, il a ressenti un peu de jalousie."],["L7-0948","度","dù","Suffix","degree; to spend (time)","grado; pasar (tiempo)","degré; passer (le temps)","这两个城市的气温相差十度。","zhè liǎng gè chéng shì de qì wēn xiāng chà shí dù","The temperatures of these two cities differ by ten degrees.","La temperatura de estas dos ciudades difiere en diez grados.","La température de ces deux villes diffère de dix degrés."],["L7-0948#2","知名度","zhīmíngdù","N","fame; popularity","notoriedad; fama","notoriété; renommée"],["L7-0949","度假","dùjià","V","to go on vacation","ir de vacaciones","partir en vacances","度假回来以后，她整个人容光焕发。","dù jià huí lái yǐ hòu tā zhěng gè rén róng guāng huàn fā","After returning from vacation, she was absolutely glowing.","Después de volver de las vacaciones, ella se veía radiante.","Au retour de ses vacances, elle rayonnait."],["L7-0950","渡过","dùguò","","to cross; to get through","cruzar; superar","traverser; passer","在大家的帮助下，这家小店终于渡过了难关。","zài dà jiā de bāng zhù xià zhè jiā xiǎo diàn zhōng yú dù guò le nán guān","With everyone's help, the little shop finally got through its crisis.","Con la ayuda de todos, esta pequeña tienda por fin superó la crisis.","Grâce à l'aide de tous, cette petite boutique a enfin surmonté ses difficultés."],["L7-0951","端正","duānzhèng","Adj/V","upright; proper; to correct","recto; correcto; corregir","droit; correct; rectifier","这孩子品行端正，邻居们都很喜欢他。","zhè hái zi pǐn xíng duān zhèng lín jū men dōu hěn xǐ huan tā","This child is upright in conduct, and the neighbors all like him.","Este niño tiene buena conducta y a todos los vecinos les cae muy bien.","Cet enfant est d'une conduite irréprochable et tous les voisins l'apprécient beaucoup."],["L7-0952","短缺","duǎnquē","V","shortage","escasez","pénurie","那几年粮食短缺，很多人家都忍饥挨饿。","nà jǐ nián liáng shi duǎn quē hěn duō rén jiā dōu rěn jī ái è","In those years food was scarce, and many families went hungry.","En aquellos años escaseaban los alimentos y muchas familias pasaron hambre.","À cette époque, la nourriture manquait et beaucoup de familles souffraient de la faim."],["L7-0953","短暂","duǎnzàn","Adj","brief; short-lived","breve; efímero","bref; éphémère","我们在巴黎只有短暂的停留，没来得及参观博物馆。","wǒ men zài bā lí zhǐ yǒu duǎn zàn de tíng liú méi lái de jí cān guān bó wù guǎn","We had only a brief stop in Paris and didn't have time to visit the museums.","Solo hicimos una breve escala en París y no tuvimos tiempo de visitar los museos.","Nous n'avons fait qu'une brève escale à Paris et n'avons pas eu le temps de visiter les musées."],["L7-0954","段落","duànluò","N","paragraph; passage","párrafo; fragmento","paragraphe; passage","这篇文章的段落划分得很清楚，读起来很轻松。","zhè piān wén zhāng de duàn luò huà fēn de hěn qīng chu dú qǐ lái hěn qīng sōng","The paragraphs in this article are clearly divided, so it's easy to read.","Los párrafos de este artículo están muy bien divididos, así que se lee con facilidad.","Les paragraphes de cet article sont clairement découpés, ce qui rend la lecture très aisée."],["L7-0955","断定","duàndìng","V","to conclude; to determine","concluir; determinar","conclure; affirmer","根据现场的脚印，警察断定小偷是从后门进来的。","gēn jù xiàn chǎng de jiǎo yìn jǐng chá duàn dìng xiǎo tōu shì cóng hòu mén jìn lái de","Based on the footprints at the scene, the police concluded that the thief came in through the back door.","A partir de las huellas en el lugar, la policía concluyó que el ladrón entró por la puerta trasera.","D'après les empreintes de pas relevées sur place, la police a conclu que le voleur était entré par la porte de derrière."],["L7-0956","断断续续","duànduànxùxù","Adj","on and off; intermittent","intermitente; a ratos","par intermittence; décousu","昨天晚上的雨断断续续下了一整夜。","zuó tiān wǎn shang de yǔ duàn duàn xù xù xià le yì zhěng yè","Last night it rained on and off all night long.","La lluvia de anoche cayó de forma intermitente durante toda la noche.","La pluie d'hier soir est tombée par intermittence toute la nuit."],["L7-0957","断裂","duànliè","V","to fracture; to break","fracturarse; romperse","se fracturer; se rompre","大桥的一根钢索突然断裂，交通被迫中断。","dà qiáo de yì gēn gāng suǒ tū rán duàn liè jiāo tōng bèi pò zhōng duàn","One of the bridge's steel cables suddenly snapped, and traffic had to be halted.","Un cable de acero del puente se rompió de repente y el tráfico tuvo que interrumpirse.","Un des câbles d'acier du pont s'est soudain rompu et la circulation a dû être interrompue."],["L7-0958","堆砌","duīqì","V","to pile up; to pad (writing)","amontonar; rellenar (un texto)","empiler; truffer (un texte)","与其堆砌专业术语，不如用具体的个案说明概念之间的关联。","yǔ qí duī qì zhuān yè shù yǔ bù rú yòng jù tǐ de gè àn shuō míng gài niàn zhī jiān de guān lián","Rather than piling up technical terms, it is better to illustrate how the concepts relate through specific cases.","En lugar de acumular términos técnicos, es mejor usar casos concretos para explicar la relación entre los conceptos.","Plutôt que d'accumuler les termes techniques, mieux vaut illustrer par des cas concrets les liens entre les concepts."],["L7-0959","队形","duìxíng","N","formation","formación","formation","运动员们排着整齐的队形走进了体育场。","yùn dòng yuán men pái zhe zhěng qí de duì xíng zǒu jìn le tǐ yù chǎng","The athletes marched into the stadium in neat formation.","Los atletas entraron al estadio en formación ordenada.","Les athlètes sont entrés dans le stade en rangs bien alignés."],["L7-0960","对白","duìbái","N","dialogue","diálogo","dialogue","这部电影的对白幽默风趣，观众笑声不断。","zhè bù diàn yǐng de duì bái yōu mò fēng qù guān zhòng xiào shēng bú duàn","The dialogue in this film is witty and humorous, and the audience kept laughing.","Los diálogos de esta película son graciosos y divertidos, y el público no dejó de reír.","Les dialogues de ce film sont drôles et pleins d'esprit, et le public n'a cessé de rire."],["L7-0961","对策","duìcè","N","countermeasure","contramedida","contre-mesure","面对激烈的市场竞争，公司必须尽快拿出对策。","miàn duì jī liè de shì chǎng jìng zhēng gōng sī bì xū jǐn kuài ná chū duì cè","Faced with fierce market competition, the company must come up with countermeasures as soon as possible.","Ante la feroz competencia del mercado, la empresa debe presentar contramedidas cuanto antes.","Face à une concurrence acharnée sur le marché, l'entreprise doit au plus vite trouver des contre-mesures."],["L7-0962","对称","duìchèn","Adj","symmetrical; symmetry","simétrico; simetría","symétrique; symétrie","这座古建筑的左右两边完全对称，看起来非常庄重。","zhè zuò gǔ jiàn zhù de zuǒ yòu liǎng biān wán quán duì chèn kàn qǐ lái fēi cháng zhuāng zhòng","The left and right sides of this ancient building are perfectly symmetrical, giving it a very dignified look.","Los lados izquierdo y derecho de este antiguo edificio son completamente simétricos, lo que le da un aspecto muy solemne.","Les côtés gauche et droit de ce bâtiment ancien sont parfaitement symétriques, ce qui lui donne un air très majestueux."],["L7-0963","对得起","duìdeqǐ","V","to be worthy of; to not let down","estar a la altura; no defraudar","être digne de; ne pas décevoir","我一定要好好学习，才对得起父母这些年的辛苦。","wǒ yí dìng yào hǎo hǎo xué xí cái duì de qǐ fù mǔ zhè xiē nián de xīn kǔ","I must study hard to be worthy of all my parents' hard work over the years.","Tengo que estudiar con empeño para hacerme digno del esfuerzo que mis padres han hecho todos estos años.","Je dois bien travailler pour être digne de tous les sacrifices que mes parents ont consentis ces années-ci."],["L7-0964","对联","duìlián","N","couplet","pareado; dístico","distique; paire de sentences parallèles","春节前，家家户户都忙着打扫卫生、贴对联。","chūn jié qián jiā jiā hù hù dōu máng zhe dǎ sǎo wèi shēng tiē duì lián","Before Spring Festival, every household is busy cleaning and putting up couplets.","Antes de la Fiesta de la Primavera, todas las familias se ocupan de limpiar la casa y pegar los pareados.","Avant la Fête du Printemps, chaque foyer s'affaire à faire le ménage et à coller les distiques."],["L7-0965","对弈","duìyì","V","to play chess or go","jugar al ajedrez o go","jouer aux échecs ou au go","公园里两位围棋爱好者正在树下对弈，旁边围了不少观众。","gōng yuán lǐ liǎng wèi wéi qí ài hào zhě zhèng zài shù xià duì yì páng biān wéi le bù shǎo guān zhòng","In the park, two Go enthusiasts are playing under a tree, with quite a few onlookers gathered nearby.","En el parque, dos aficionados al go juegan bajo un árbol y a su alrededor se ha reunido bastante público.","Dans le parc, deux amateurs de go jouent sous un arbre, entourés d'un bon nombre de spectateurs."],["L7-0966","对照","duìzhào","V","to compare; to contrast","comparar; contrastar","comparer; confronter","请对照原文，检查一下译文有没有遗漏。","qǐng duì zhào yuán wén jiǎn chá yí xià yì wén yǒu méi yǒu yí lòu","Please compare the translation with the original and check whether anything has been left out.","Compara la traducción con el texto original y revisa si se omitió algo.","Veuillez comparer la traduction avec l'original et vérifier si rien n'a été omis."],["L7-0967","对峙","duìzhì","V","to confront; standoff","enfrentarse; enfrentamiento","s'affronter; face-à-face","抗议者和警察在广场上对峙了好几个小时。","kàng yì zhě hé jǐng chá zài guǎng chǎng shàng duì zhì le hǎo jǐ ge xiǎo shí","Protesters and police faced off in the square for several hours.","Los manifestantes y la policía estuvieron enfrentados en la plaza durante varias horas.","Les manifestants et la police se sont fait face sur la place pendant plusieurs heures."],["L7-0968","对准","duìzhǔn","","to aim at; to align","apuntar a; alinear","viser; aligner","摄影师把镜头对准了正在觅食的小鸟。","shè yǐng shī bǎ jìng tóu duì zhǔn le zhèng zài mì shí de xiǎo niǎo","The photographer pointed his lens at the little bird looking for food.","El fotógrafo apuntó su lente hacia el pajarito que buscaba comida.","Le photographe a pointé son objectif sur le petit oiseau qui cherchait sa nourriture."],["L7-0969","兑换","duìhuàn","V","to exchange; to convert","cambiar; canjear","échanger; convertir","出国前，我在银行兑换了一些目的地国家的货币。","chū guó qián wǒ zài yín háng duì huàn le yì xiē mù dì dì guó jiā de huò bì","Before going abroad, I exchanged money at the bank for some currency used in my destination country.","Antes de salir al extranjero, cambié en el banco algo de dinero a la moneda del país de destino.","Avant de partir à l'étranger, j'ai changé à la banque un peu d'argent contre la monnaie du pays de destination."],["L7-0970","兑现","duìxiàn","V","to cash; to honor a promise","cobrar; cumplir una promesa","encaisser; tenir sa promesse","当选以后，他并没有兑现竞选时许下的承诺。","dāng xuǎn yǐ hòu tā bìng méi yǒu duì xiàn jìng xuǎn shí xǔ xià de chéng nuò","After being elected, he did not keep the promises he made during the campaign.","Tras ser elegido, no cumplió las promesas que había hecho durante la campaña.","Une fois élu, il n'a pas tenu les promesses faites pendant la campagne."],["L7-0971","敦促","dūncù","V","to urge","instar","exhorter; presser","联合国敦促冲突双方尽快停火。","lián hé guó dūn cù chōng tū shuāng fāng jǐn kuài tíng huǒ","The United Nations urged both sides of the conflict to cease fire as soon as possible.","Las Naciones Unidas instaron a ambas partes del conflicto a un alto el fuego lo antes posible.","L'ONU a exhorté les deux parties au conflit à cesser le feu au plus vite."],["L7-0972","敦厚","dūnhòu","Adj","honest and kind","honesto y bondadoso","honnête et bon","他为人敦厚老实，邻居们都很喜欢他。","tā wéi rén dūn hòu lǎo shi lín jū men dōu hěn xǐ huan tā","He is honest and kind-hearted, and the neighbors all like him.","Es una persona honrada y de buen corazón, y a todos los vecinos les cae muy bien.","Il est d'une honnêteté et d'une bonté remarquables, et tous les voisins l'aiment beaucoup."],["L7-0973","炖","dùn","V","to stew","estofar; guisar","mijoter; cuire à l'étouffée","冬天喝一碗妈妈炖的鸡汤，全身都暖和了。","dōng tiān hē yì wǎn mā ma dùn de jī tāng quán shēn dōu nuǎn huo le","In winter, a bowl of the chicken soup Mom stews warms you all over.","En invierno, un tazón del caldo de pollo que cocina mamá te hace entrar en calor por completo.","En hiver, un bol du bouillon de poule mijoté par maman vous réchauffe tout le corps."],["L7-0974","顿时","dùnshí","Adv","immediately; suddenly","de inmediato; de repente","aussitôt; soudain","听到这个好消息，大家顿时欢呼起来。","tīng dào zhè ge hǎo xiāo xi dà jiā dùn shí huān hū qǐ lái","On hearing the good news, everyone burst into cheers at once.","Al oír la buena noticia, todos estallaron de inmediato en vítores.","En apprenant la bonne nouvelle, tout le monde a aussitôt poussé des cris de joie."],["L7-0975","多边","duōbiān","Adj","multilateral","multilateral","multilatéral","各国代表在会上就多边贸易问题展开了讨论。","gè guó dài biǎo zài huì shàng jiù duō biān mào yì wèn tí zhǎn kāi le tǎo lùn","Representatives of various countries held discussions on multilateral trade issues at the meeting.","Los representantes de varios países debatieron en la reunión sobre cuestiones de comercio multilateral.","Les représentants de plusieurs pays ont débattu des questions de commerce multilatéral lors de la réunion."],["L7-0976","多功能","duōgōngnéng","Adj","multifunctional","multifuncional","multifonctionnel","这款多功能料理机可以榨汁、搅拌，还能磨豆浆。","zhè kuǎn duō gōng néng liào lǐ jī kě yǐ zhà zhī jiǎo bàn hái néng mó dòu jiāng","This multifunctional food processor can extract juice, blend ingredients, and even make soy milk.","Este procesador de alimentos multifuncional sirve para hacer jugo, mezclar y hasta moler soya para leche.","Ce robot de cuisine multifonction permet de presser des jus, de mélanger et même de préparer du lait de soja."],["L7-0977","多亏","duōkuī","V","thanks to; luckily","gracias a; menos mal","grâce à; heureusement","多亏老师傅的指点，我很快就学会了。","duō kuī lǎo shī fu de zhǐ diǎn wǒ hěn kuài jiù xué huì le","Thanks to the experienced craftsman's guidance, I quickly learned how to do it.","Gracias a las indicaciones del maestro artesano, aprendí enseguida.","Grâce aux conseils du vieux maître, j'ai vite appris."],["L7-0978","多劳多得","duōláo-duōdé","","more work, more pay","a más trabajo, más ganancia","plus on travaille, plus on gagne","这家工厂实行多劳多得的制度，工人的积极性很高。","zhè jiā gōng chǎng shí xíng duō láo duō dé de zhì dù gōng rén de jī jí xìng hěn gāo","This factory has a system of more pay for more work, so the workers are very motivated.","Esta fábrica aplica el sistema de a más trabajo, más paga, y los obreros están muy motivados.","Cette usine applique le principe « plus on travaille, plus on gagne », et les ouvriers sont très motivés."],["L7-0979","多年来","duō nián lái","","over the past years","durante muchos años","depuis de nombreuses années","多年来，他一直坚持每天早上跑步。","duō nián lái tā yì zhí jiān chí měi tiān zǎo shang pǎo bù","For many years he has kept up running every morning.","Durante muchos años ha mantenido el hábito de salir a correr todas las mañanas.","Depuis de nombreuses années, il court tous les matins sans faillir."],["L7-0980","多心","duōxīn","","oversensitive; suspicious","suspicaz; susceptible","susceptible; soupçonneux","我只是随口问问，你别多心。","wǒ zhǐ shì suí kǒu wèn wèn nǐ bié duō xīn","I was just asking casually; don't read too much into it.","Solo preguntaba por preguntar; no le des más vueltas.","Je demandais ça comme ça ; ne te fais pas d'idées."],["L7-0981","多余","duōyú","V/Adj","superfluous; unnecessary","superfluo; innecesario","superflu; inutile","你的担心完全是多余的，他早就安全到家了。","nǐ de dān xīn wán quán shì duō yú de tā zǎo jiù ān quán dào jiā le","Your worry is completely unnecessary; he got home safely long ago.","Tu preocupación es completamente innecesaria; hace rato que llegó sano y salvo a casa.","Ton inquiétude est tout à fait inutile ; il est rentré chez lui sain et sauf depuis longtemps."],["L7-0982","多元","duōyuán","Adj","diverse; pluralistic","diverso; pluralista","diversifié; pluriel","这座城市文化多元，生活着来自世界各地的人。","zhè zuò chéng shì wén huà duō yuán shēng huó zhe lái zì shì jiè gè dì de rén","This city is culturally diverse, with people from all over the world living here.","Esta ciudad es culturalmente diversa y en ella vive gente de todo el mundo.","Cette ville est culturellement diverse et accueille des gens du monde entier."],["L7-0983","哆嗦","duōsuo","V","to tremble; to shiver","temblar; estremecerse","trembler; frissonner","他从冰冷的河水里爬上来，冻得直哆嗦。","tā cóng bīng lěng de hé shuǐ lǐ pá shàng lái dòng de zhí duō suo","He climbed out of the icy river, shivering with cold.","Salió del agua helada del río temblando de frío.","Il est sorti de l'eau glaciale de la rivière en grelottant de froid."],["L7-0984","夺冠","duóguàn","","to win the championship","ganar el campeonato","remporter le titre","国家队夺冠以后，各地纷纷发来贺电。","guó jiā duì duó guàn yǐ hòu gè dì fēn fēn fā lái hè diàn","After the national team won the championship, congratulatory telegrams poured in from everywhere.","Después de que la selección nacional ganó el campeonato, llegaron telegramas de felicitación de todas partes.","Après la victoire de l'équipe nationale au championnat, des télégrammes de félicitations ont afflué de partout."],["L7-0985","夺魁","duókuí","","to win first place","ganar el primer puesto","décrocher la première place","在这次全国比赛中，我们学校的代表队一举夺魁。","zài zhè cì quán guó bǐ sài zhōng wǒ men xué xiào de dài biǎo duì yì jǔ duó kuí","In this national competition, our school's team won first place in one go.","En este campeonato nacional, el equipo representante de nuestra escuela se llevó el primer lugar de un solo golpe.","À ce concours national, l'équipe de notre école a décroché la première place du premier coup."],["L7-0986","躲避","duǒbì","V","to dodge; to evade","esquivar; evitar","esquiver; éviter","为了躲避记者的追问，他从后门离开了会场。","wèi le duǒ bì jì zhě de zhuī wèn tā cóng hòu mén lí kāi le huì chǎng","To avoid the reporters' questions, he left the venue through the back door.","Para evitar las preguntas de los periodistas, salió del recinto por la puerta trasera.","Pour échapper aux questions des journalistes, il a quitté la salle par la porte de derrière."],["L7-0987","躲藏","duǒcáng","V","to hide","esconderse","se cacher","小猫受了惊吓，躲藏在沙发底下不肯出来。","xiǎo māo shòu le jīng xià duǒ cáng zài shā fā dǐ xia bù kěn chū lái","The kitten got a fright and hid under the sofa, refusing to come out.","El gatito se asustó y se escondió debajo del sofá sin querer salir.","Le chaton, effrayé, s'est caché sous le canapé et refuse d'en sortir."],["L7-0988","舵手","duòshǒu","N","helmsman","timonel","timonier","在风浪中，经验丰富的舵手稳稳地把住了方向。","zài fēng làng zhōng jīng yàn fēng fù de duò shǒu wěn wěn de bǎ zhù le fāng xiàng","In the wind and waves, the experienced helmsman steadily held the course.","En medio del viento y las olas, el timonel experimentado mantuvo el rumbo con firmeza.","Dans le vent et la houle, le timonier expérimenté a tenu fermement le cap."],["L7-0989","堕落","duòluò","V","to degenerate; to fall into depravity","degenerar; corromperse","dégénérer; se dépraver","他交上了坏朋友以后，一天比一天堕落。","tā jiāo shàng le huài péng you yǐ hòu yì tiān bǐ yì tiān duò luò","After falling in with bad friends, he sank lower day by day.","Después de juntarse con malas amistades, cada día se degrada más.","Depuis qu'il fréquente de mauvaises compagnies, il se dégrade de jour en jour."],["L7-0990","讹诈","ézhà","V","to blackmail; to extort","chantajear; extorsionar","faire chanter; extorquer","有人故意在车前摔倒，想借机讹诈司机一笔钱。","yǒu rén gù yì zài chē qián shuāi dǎo xiǎng jiè jī é zhà sī jī yì bǐ qián","Someone deliberately fell in front of the car, hoping to extort money from the driver.","Alguien se cayó a propósito frente al coche para aprovechar y sacarle dinero al conductor.","Quelqu'un est tombé exprès devant la voiture dans l'espoir de soutirer de l'argent au conducteur."],["L7-0991","俄语","Éyǔ","N","Russian (language)","ruso (idioma)","russe (langue)","她大学学的是俄语，毕业后在一家外贸公司当翻译。","tā dà xué xué de shì É yǔ bì yè hòu zài yì jiā wài mào gōng sī dāng fān yì","She studied Russian at university and works as a translator for a foreign trade company after graduating.","En la universidad estudió ruso y, tras graduarse, trabaja como traductora en una empresa de comercio exterior.","Elle a étudié le russe à l'université et, une fois diplômée, travaille comme traductrice dans une société de commerce extérieur."],["L7-0992","鹅","é","N","goose","ganso","oie","农家院子里养着几只大白鹅，见了生人就叫个不停。","nóng jiā yuàn zi lǐ yǎng zhe jǐ zhī dà bái é jiàn le shēng rén jiù jiào gè bù tíng","A few big white geese are kept in the farmyard, and they honk nonstop whenever they see a stranger.","En el patio de la granja crían unos cuantos gansos blancos grandes que graznan sin parar al ver a un desconocido.","Dans la cour de la ferme, on élève quelques grosses oies blanches qui cacardent sans arrêt dès qu'elles voient un inconnu."],["L7-0993","额外","éwài","Adj","extra; additional","extra; adicional","supplémentaire; en plus","周末加班的员工可以领到一笔额外的补贴。","zhōu mò jiā bān de yuán gōng kě yǐ lǐng dào yì bǐ é wài de bǔ tiē","Employees who work overtime on weekends can receive an extra allowance.","Los empleados que trabajen horas extra los fines de semana pueden recibir un complemento adicional.","Les employés qui font des heures supplémentaires le week-end peuvent toucher une prime supplémentaire."],["L7-0994","厄运","èyùn","N","misfortune; bad luck","desgracia; mala suerte","malheur; mauvais sort","这位老人一生遭遇了不少厄运，却始终乐观。","zhè wèi lǎo rén yì shēng zāo yù le bù shǎo è yùn què shǐ zhōng lè guān","This old man met with a lot of misfortune in his life but always stayed optimistic.","Este anciano sufrió muchas desgracias en la vida, pero siempre se mantuvo optimista.","Ce vieil homme a connu bien des malheurs dans sa vie, mais il est toujours resté optimiste."],["L7-0995","恶","è","Adj","evil; nauseous (in 恶心)","malo; náuseas (en 恶心)","mauvais; nausée (dans 恶心)","传说中，英雄一剑斩了那条恶龙。","chuán shuō zhōng yīng xióng yí jiàn zhǎn le nà tiáo è lóng","According to legend, the hero slew the evil dragon with one stroke of his sword.","Cuenta la leyenda que el héroe mató al malvado dragón de un solo espadazo.","Selon la légende, le héros a tué le méchant dragon d'un seul coup d'épée."],["L7-0996","恶化","èhuà","V","to worsen","empeorar","s'aggraver; se détériorer","由于没有及时治疗，他的病情迅速恶化了。","yóu yú méi yǒu jí shí zhì liáo tā de bìng qíng xùn sù è huà le","Because he wasn't treated in time, his condition deteriorated rapidly.","Al no recibir tratamiento a tiempo, su enfermedad empeoró rápidamente.","Faute d'avoir été soigné à temps, son état s'est rapidement aggravé."],["L7-0997","恶劣","èliè","Adj","nasty; vile; very poor","pésimo; deplorable","exécrable; très mauvais","天气这么恶劣，现在出海太冒险了。","tiān qì zhè me è liè xiàn zài chū hǎi tài mào xiǎn le","With weather this bad, going out to sea now is too risky.","Con un clima tan malo, salir ahora al mar es demasiado arriesgado.","Avec un temps aussi mauvais, prendre la mer maintenant est trop risqué."],["L7-0998","恶性","èxìng","Adj","malignant; vicious","maligno; vicioso","malin; vicieux","医生说他肚子里的肿瘤是良性的，不是恶性的。","yī shēng shuō tā dù zi lǐ de zhǒng liú shì liáng xìng de bú shì è xìng de","The doctor said the tumor in his abdomen is benign, not malignant.","El médico dijo que el tumor en su abdomen es benigno, no maligno.","Le médecin a dit que la tumeur dans son abdomen est bénigne, pas maligne."],["L7-0999","恶意","èyì","N","malice; ill intent","mala intención; malicia","malveillance; intention malveillante","你想到哪儿去了，我只是关心你，并没有恶意。","nǐ xiǎng dào nǎr qù le wǒ zhǐ shì guān xīn nǐ bìng méi yǒu è yì","What are you thinking? I'm just concerned about you, with no ill intent.","¿Qué estás pensando? Solo me preocupo por ti, no lo hago con mala intención.","Mais qu'est-ce que tu vas imaginer ? Je m'inquiète simplement pour toi, sans aucune mauvaise intention."],["L7-1000","遏制","èzhì","V","to restrain; to curb","contener; frenar","contenir; freiner","政府出台了一系列措施，遏制房价过快上涨。","zhèng fǔ chū tái le yí xì liè cuò shī è zhì fáng jià guò kuài shàng zhǎng","The government introduced a series of measures to curb the rapid rise in housing prices.","El gobierno puso en marcha una serie de medidas para frenar el alza acelerada de los precios de la vivienda.","Le gouvernement a adopté une série de mesures pour freiner la hausse trop rapide des prix de l'immobilier."],["L7-1001","鳄鱼","èyú","N","crocodile; alligator","cocodrilo; caimán","crocodile; alligator","动物园里的鳄鱼一动不动地趴在水边晒太阳。","dòng wù yuán lǐ de è yú yí dòng bú dòng de pā zài shuǐ biān shài tài yáng","At the zoo, the crocodile lay motionless by the water, basking in the sun.","El cocodrilo del zoológico estaba tumbado inmóvil a la orilla del agua, tomando el sol.","Au zoo, le crocodile était allongé, immobile, au bord de l'eau à se chauffer au soleil."],["L7-1002","恩赐","ēncì","V","to bestow as a favor; gift","conceder como favor; dádiva","accorder par faveur; faveur","他觉得这次难得的机会简直是命运的恩赐。","tā jué de zhè cì nán dé de jī huì jiǎn zhí shì mìng yùn de ēn cì","He felt this rare opportunity was simply a gift from fate.","Sentía que esta oportunidad tan rara era sencillamente un regalo del destino.","Il considérait cette occasion rare comme un véritable cadeau du destin."],["L7-1003","恩惠","ēnhuì","N","favor; kindness","favor; gracia","faveur; bienfait","受了别人的恩惠，我们应该记在心里。","shòu le bié rén de ēn huì wǒ men yīng gāi jì zài xīn lǐ","When we receive kindness from others, we should keep it in our hearts.","Cuando recibimos un favor de alguien, debemos tenerlo siempre presente.","Quand on reçoit un bienfait de quelqu'un, il faut le garder en mémoire."],["L7-1004","恩情","ēnqíng","N","kindness; favor received","benevolencia; favor recibido","bienfait; bonté","老师的恩情我一辈子也忘不了。","lǎo shī de ēn qíng wǒ yí bèi zi yě wàng bu liǎo","I will never forget my teacher's kindness as long as I live.","Nunca olvidaré en toda mi vida la bondad de mi maestro.","Je n'oublierai jamais de toute ma vie la bonté de mon professeur."],["L7-1005","恩怨","ēnyuàn","N","gratitude and grudges","favores y rencores","reconnaissance et rancune","两家人之间的恩怨持续了好几代。","liǎng jiā rén zhī jiān de ēn yuàn chí xù le hǎo jǐ dài","The feud between the two families lasted for several generations.","Los rencores entre las dos familias duraron varias generaciones.","La rancune entre les deux familles a duré plusieurs générations."],["L7-1006","而已","éryǐ","Aux","that's all; only","nada más; solamente","c'est tout; seulement","我们只是普通朋友而已，你别误会。","wǒ men zhǐ shì pǔ tōng péng you ér yǐ nǐ bié wù huì","We're just ordinary friends, that's all; don't get the wrong idea.","Solo somos amigos normales, nada más; no lo malinterpretes.","Nous ne sommes que de simples amis, rien de plus ; ne va pas te méprendre."],["L7-1007","耳光","ěrguāng","N","slap in the face","bofetada","gifle","他气得打了自己一记耳光，后悔说了那些话。","tā qì de dǎ le zì jǐ yí jì ěr guāng hòu huǐ shuō le nà xiē huà","He was so angry that he slapped himself across the face, regretting what he had said.","Estaba tan furioso que se dio una bofetada a sí mismo, arrepentido de lo que había dicho.","Il était si en colère qu'il s'est giflé lui-même, regrettant ses paroles."],["L7-1008","耳目一新","ěrmù-yīxīn","","refreshing; a breath of fresh air","renovador; como un soplo de aire fresco","rafraîchissant; un vent de fraîcheur","重新装修后的图书馆让人耳目一新。","chóng xīn zhuāng xiū hòu de tú shū guǎn ràng rén ěr mù yì xīn","The newly renovated library feels refreshingly new.","La biblioteca, tras su remodelación, tiene un aspecto completamente renovado.","La bibliothèque rénovée offre un aspect entièrement neuf."],["L7-1009","耳熟能详","ěrshú-néngxiáng","","so familiar one can recite it","tan familiar que se sabe de memoria","si familier qu'on peut le réciter","这些古诗大家都耳熟能详，连小孩子都会背。","zhè xiē gǔ shī dà jiā dōu ěr shú néng xiáng lián xiǎo hái zi dōu huì bèi","Everyone knows these ancient poems by heart; even small children can recite them.","Todos conocen de sobra estos poemas antiguos; hasta los niños pequeños saben recitarlos.","Tout le monde connaît ces poèmes anciens sur le bout des doigts ; même les petits enfants savent les réciter."],["L7-1010","耳闻目睹","ěrwén-mùdǔ","","to witness personally","presenciar personalmente","être témoin direct","他在乡下支教两年，耳闻目睹了很多孩子的不易。","tā zài xiāng xia zhī jiào liǎng nián ěr wén mù dǔ le hěn duō hái zi de bú yì","During two years teaching in the countryside, he personally witnessed the hardships of many children.","Enseñó dos años como voluntario en el campo y vio y oyó de primera mano las dificultades de muchos niños.","Pendant les deux années où il a enseigné à la campagne, il a vu de ses propres yeux les difficultés de bien des enfants."],["L7-1011","二手车","èrshǒuchē","N","second-hand car","coche de segunda mano","voiture d'occasion","购买二手车时，除了核对里程，还应查明车辆是否有过重大事故。","gòu mǎi èr shǒu chē shí chú le hé duì lǐ chéng hái yīng chá míng chē liàng shì fǒu yǒu guo zhòng dà shì gù","When buying a used car, check not only the mileage but also whether it has been involved in a major accident.","Al comprar un coche usado, además de verificar el kilometraje, conviene averiguar si ha sufrido algún accidente grave.","Lorsqu'on achète une voiture d'occasion, il faut non seulement vérifier le kilométrage, mais aussi s'assurer qu'elle n'a pas subi d'accident grave."],["L7-1012","二氧化碳","èryǎnghuàtàn","N","carbon dioxide","dióxido de carbono","dioxyde de carbone","科学家发现，大气中的二氧化碳浓度逐年上升。","kē xué jiā fā xiàn dà qì zhōng de èr yǎng huà tàn nóng dù zhú nián shàng shēng","Scientists have found that the concentration of carbon dioxide in the atmosphere is rising year by year.","Los científicos han descubierto que la concentración de dióxido de carbono en la atmósfera aumenta cada año.","Les scientifiques ont constaté que la concentration de dioxyde de carbone dans l'atmosphère augmente d'année en année."],["L7-1013","发布会","fābùhuì","N","press conference","rueda de prensa","conférence de presse","这家手机公司将在下周举行新品发布会。","zhè jiā shǒu jī gōng sī jiāng zài xià zhōu jǔ xíng xīn pǐn fā bù huì","This phone company will hold a product launch event next week.","Esta empresa de teléfonos celebrará la semana próxima la presentación de sus nuevos productos.","Cette entreprise de téléphonie organisera la semaine prochaine une présentation de ses nouveaux produits."],["L7-1014","发财","fācái","","to get rich","hacerse rico","s'enrichir","过年时，人们常常互相祝福“恭喜发财”。","guò nián shí rén men cháng cháng hù xiāng zhù fú gōng xǐ fā cái","At New Year, people often wish each other prosperity.","En Año Nuevo, la gente suele desearse mutuamente «¡que te enriquezcas!».","Au Nouvel An, on se souhaite souvent « Gong xi fa cai », c'est-à-dire prospérité et richesse."],["L7-1015","发愁","fāchóu","","to worry; to be anxious","preocuparse; angustiarse","se faire du souci","毕业快一年了，他还在为找工作发愁。","bì yè kuài yì nián le tā hái zài wèi zhǎo gōng zuò fā chóu","It's been almost a year since he graduated, and he's still worrying about finding a job.","Hace casi un año que se graduó y todavía se preocupa por encontrar trabajo.","Cela fait presque un an qu'il est diplômé et il se tracasse encore pour trouver du travail."],["L7-1016","发电机","fādiànjī","N","electric generator","generador eléctrico","générateur électrique","停电的时候，医院会马上启动备用发电机。","tíng diàn de shí hou yī yuàn huì mǎ shàng qǐ dòng bèi yòng fā diàn jī","When there is a power cut, the hospital immediately starts its backup generator.","Cuando se va la luz, el hospital pone en marcha de inmediato el generador de reserva.","Lorsqu'il y a une coupure de courant, l'hôpital met aussitôt en marche le groupe électrogène de secours."],["L7-1017","发抖","fādǒu","V","to tremble; to shiver","temblar; estremecerse","trembler; frissonner","她站在舞台上，紧张得双腿发抖。","tā zhàn zài wǔ tái shàng jǐn zhāng de shuāng tuǐ fā dǒu","Standing on the stage, she was so nervous her legs were trembling.","De pie en el escenario, estaba tan nerviosa que le temblaban las piernas.","Debout sur scène, elle était si nerveuse que ses jambes tremblaient."],["L7-1018","发愤图强","fāfèn-túqiáng","","to strive hard to succeed","esforzarse por superarse","s'efforcer de réussir","他高考落榜后发愤图强，第二年考上了理想的大学。","tā gāo kǎo luò bǎng hòu fā fèn tú qiáng dì èr nián kǎo shàng le lǐ xiǎng de dà xué","After failing the college entrance exam, he resolved to work hard and got into the university of his dreams the following year.","Tras reprobar el examen de ingreso a la universidad, se esforzó con ahínco y al año siguiente entró a la universidad que soñaba.","Après avoir échoué au concours d'entrée à l'université, il s'est mis à travailler avec acharnement et a intégré l'université de ses rêves l'année suivante."],["L7-1019","发光","fāguāng","","to emit light; to glow","emitir luz; brillar","émettre de la lumière; briller","俗话说，是金子总会发光的。","sú huà shuō shì jīn zi zǒng huì fā guāng de","As the saying goes, true gold will always shine.","Como dice el refrán, el oro siempre acaba brillando.","Comme dit le proverbe, l'or finit toujours par briller."],["L7-1020","发火","fāhuǒ","","to get angry; to ignite","enfadarse; encenderse","se mettre en colère; s'enflammer","他一听说孩子又逃课了，当场就发火了。","tā yì tīng shuō hái zi yòu táo kè le dāng chǎng jiù fā huǒ le","As soon as he heard his child had skipped class again, he flew into a rage right there.","En cuanto se enteró de que su hijo había faltado otra vez a clase, se enfureció en el acto.","Dès qu'il a appris que son enfant avait de nouveau séché les cours, il s'est mis en colère sur-le-champ."],["L7-1021","发酵","fājiào","","to ferment; to develop","fermentar; desarrollarse","fermenter; se développer","面团发酵以后会变大一倍，摸起来又软又轻。","miàn tuán fā jiào yǐ hòu huì biàn dà yí bèi mō qǐ lái yòu ruǎn yòu qīng","After fermenting, the dough doubles in size and feels soft and light.","Después de fermentar, la masa duplica su tamaño y al tacto es suave y ligera.","Après la fermentation, la pâte double de volume et paraît douce et légère au toucher."],["L7-1022","发掘","fājué","V","to excavate; to unearth","excavar; descubrir","fouiller; mettre au jour","这位导演善于发掘新人，捧红了好几位年轻演员。","zhè wèi dǎo yǎn shàn yú fā jué xīn rén pěng hóng le hǎo jǐ wèi nián qīng yǎn yuán","This director is good at discovering new talent and has made several young actors famous.","Este director es hábil para descubrir nuevos talentos y ha lanzado a la fama a varios jóvenes actores.","Ce réalisateur sait dénicher de nouveaux talents et a rendu célèbres plusieurs jeunes acteurs."],["L7-1023","发愣","fālèng","","to stare blankly; to be dazed","quedarse atónito","rester hébété","他盯着窗外发愣，连老师叫他都没听见。","tā dīng zhe chuāng wài fā lèng lián lǎo shī jiào tā dōu méi tīng jiàn","He was staring blankly out of the window and didn't even hear the teacher calling him.","Estaba mirando absorto por la ventana y ni siquiera oyó que el profesor lo llamaba.","Il fixait la fenêtre d'un air absent et n'a même pas entendu le professeur l'appeler."],["L7-1024","发脾气","fā píqi","","to lose one's temper","enfadarse; tener un berrinche","se mettre en colère","这孩子一不顺心就发脾气，摔东西。","zhè hái zi yí bú shùn xīn jiù fā pí qi shuāi dōng xi","Whenever things don't go his way, this child throws a tantrum and smashes things.","Cuando algo no le sale como quiere, este niño hace berrinche y tira cosas.","Dès que les choses ne vont pas comme il veut, cet enfant fait une crise et jette des objets."],["L7-1025","发起人","fāqǐrén","N","initiator; founder","iniciador; promotor","initiateur; fondateur","她是这个环保组织的发起人之一。","tā shì zhè ge huán bǎo zǔ zhī de fā qǐ rén zhī yī","She is one of the founders of this environmental organization.","Ella es una de las fundadoras de esta organización ecologista.","Elle est l'une des initiatrices de cette organisation écologiste."],["L7-1026","发热","fārè","","to have a fever; to give off heat","tener fiebre; desprender calor","avoir de la fièvre; dégager de la chaleur","孩子从昨晚开始发热，体温一直降不下来。","hái zi cóng zuó wǎn kāi shǐ fā rè tǐ wēn yì zhí jiàng bú xià lái","The child has had a fever since last night, and his temperature won't come down.","El niño tiene fiebre desde anoche y la temperatura no le baja.","L'enfant a de la fièvre depuis hier soir et sa température ne descend pas."],["L7-1027","发誓","fāshì","","to vow; to swear","jurar; prometer","jurer; faire le serment","他发誓永不放弃自己的梦想。","tā fā shì yǒng bú fàng qì zì jǐ de mèng xiǎng","He vowed never to give up his dream.","Juró que nunca renunciaría a sus sueños.","Il a juré de ne jamais renoncer à ses rêves."],["L7-1028","发泄","fāxiè","V","to vent (feelings)","desahogar; descargar","donner libre cours à; défouler","心情不好的时候，他喜欢去健身房发泄一下。","xīn qíng bù hǎo de shí hou tā xǐ huan qù jiàn shēn fáng fā xiè yí xià","When he's in a bad mood, he likes to go to the gym to let off steam.","Cuando está de mal humor, le gusta ir al gimnasio a desahogarse.","Quand il est de mauvaise humeur, il aime aller à la salle de sport pour se défouler."],["L7-1029","发扬","fāyáng","V","to develop; to carry forward","fomentar; desarrollar","promouvoir; faire fructifier","我们要发扬团结互助的精神，共同克服困难。","wǒ men yào fā yáng tuán jié hù zhù de jīng shén gòng tóng kè fú kùn nan","We must carry forward the spirit of unity and mutual help to overcome difficulties together.","Debemos fomentar el espíritu de unidad y ayuda mutua para superar juntos las dificultades.","Nous devons cultiver l'esprit d'unité et d'entraide pour surmonter ensemble les difficultés."],["L7-1030","发扬光大","fāyáng-guāngdà","","to promote and carry forward","promover y engrandecer","faire rayonner; développer","年轻一代有责任把传统手艺发扬光大。","nián qīng yí dài yǒu zé rèn bǎ chuán tǒng shǒu yì fā yáng guāng dà","The younger generation has a responsibility to carry traditional crafts forward and make them flourish.","La joven generación tiene la responsabilidad de promover y engrandecer las artesanías tradicionales.","La jeune génération a la responsabilité de faire rayonner et prospérer les savoir-faire traditionnels."],["L7-1031","发育","fāyù","V","to develop; to grow","desarrollarse; crecer","se développer; croître","医生说胎儿发育得很好，让她放心。","yī shēng shuō tāi ér fā yù de hěn hǎo ràng tā fàng xīn","The doctor said the fetus was developing well and told her not to worry.","El médico dijo que el feto se está desarrollando muy bien y le pidió que se quedara tranquila.","Le médecin a dit que le fœtus se développait très bien et lui a demandé de ne pas s'inquiéter."],["L7-1032","发源地","fāyuándì","N","birthplace; place of origin","cuna; lugar de origen","berceau; lieu d'origine","黄河的发源地位于青藏高原。","huáng hé de fā yuán dì wèi yú qīng zàng gāo yuán","The source of the Yellow River is on the Qinghai-Tibet Plateau.","El nacimiento del río Amarillo se encuentra en la meseta Qinghai-Tíbet.","La source du fleuve Jaune se trouve sur le plateau du Qinghai-Tibet."],["L7-1033","发作","fāzuò","V","to flare up; to break out","estallar; manifestarse","éclater; se déclencher","他的胃病又发作了，疼得整夜睡不着。","tā de wèi bìng yòu fā zuò le téng de zhěng yè shuì bu zháo","His stomach trouble flared up again, and the pain kept him awake all night.","Su problema de estómago volvió a atacarlo y el dolor no lo dejó dormir en toda la noche.","Son mal d'estomac l'a repris et la douleur l'a empêché de dormir toute la nuit."],["L7-1034","阀门","fámén","N","valve","válvula","valve","厨房漏水了，赶紧把总阀门关上！","chú fáng lòu shuǐ le gǎn jǐn bǎ zǒng fá mén guān shàng","The kitchen is leaking—quick, turn off the main valve!","¡Se está saliendo el agua en la cocina! ¡Rápido, cierra la llave general!","Il y a une fuite dans la cuisine ! Vite, ferme la vanne principale !"],["L7-1035","发型","fàxíng","N","hairstyle","peinado","coiffure","她换了一个短发型，整个人看起来精神多了。","tā huàn le yí ge duǎn fà xíng zhěng gè rén kàn qǐ lái jīng shen duō le","She switched to a short hairstyle and looks much livelier.","Se cambió a un corte de pelo corto y se ve mucho más enérgica.","Elle s'est fait couper les cheveux court et a l'air beaucoup plus pimpante."],["L7-1036","帆","fān","N","sail","vela","voile","小船扬起白帆，慢慢驶离了港口。","xiǎo chuán yáng qǐ bái fān màn màn shǐ lí le gǎng kǒu","The little boat hoisted its white sail and slowly left the harbor.","El botecito izó su vela blanca y se alejó lentamente del puerto.","Le petit bateau a hissé sa voile blanche et quitté lentement le port."],["L7-1037","帆船","fānchuán","N","sailboat","velero","voilier","每年夏天，海湾里都会举行帆船比赛。","měi nián xià tiān hǎi wān lǐ dōu huì jǔ xíng fān chuán bǐ sài","A sailing race is held in the bay every summer.","Todos los veranos se celebra en la bahía una regata de veleros.","Chaque été, une régate de voiliers a lieu dans la baie."],["L7-1038","翻番","fānfān","","to double","duplicarse","doubler","五年来，这个县的农民收入翻番了。","wǔ nián lái zhè ge xiàn de nóng mín shōu rù fān fān le","Over the past five years, farmers' incomes in this county have doubled.","En los últimos cinco años, el ingreso de los campesinos de este distrito se ha duplicado.","En cinq ans, le revenu des paysans de ce canton a doublé."],["L7-1039","翻来覆去","fānlái-fùqù","","to toss and turn; over and over","dar vueltas; una y otra vez","se retourner; maintes fois","他想着明天的面试，翻来覆去睡不着。","tā xiǎng zhe míng tiān de miàn shì fān lái fù qù shuì bu zháo","Thinking about tomorrow's interview, he tossed and turned and couldn't sleep.","Pensando en la entrevista de mañana, daba vueltas en la cama sin poder dormir.","En pensant à son entretien du lendemain, il se retournait dans son lit sans pouvoir dormir."],["L7-1040","翻天覆地","fāntiān-fùdì","","earth-shattering change","cambio radical","bouleversement total","三十年来，这个小渔村发生了翻天覆地的变化。","sān shí nián lái zhè ge xiǎo yú cūn fā shēng le fān tiān fù dì de biàn huà","Over the past thirty years, this little fishing village has undergone earth-shaking changes.","En los últimos treinta años, este pequeño pueblo pesquero ha experimentado cambios radicales.","En trente ans, ce petit village de pêcheurs a connu des transformations radicales."],["L7-1041","凡","fán","Adv","every; ordinary; mundane","todo; ordinario; mundano","tout; ordinaire; terrestre","凡年满十八岁的公民，都有选举权。","fán nián mǎn shí bā suì de gōng mín dōu yǒu xuǎn jǔ quán","All citizens who have reached the age of eighteen have the right to vote.","Todo ciudadano que haya cumplido dieciocho años tiene derecho al voto.","Tout citoyen ayant atteint l'âge de dix-huit ans a le droit de vote."],["L7-1042","烦闷","fánmèn","Adj","gloomy; depressed","melancólico; deprimido","morose; abattu","连着下了一周的雨，大家心里都有些烦闷。","lián zhe xià le yì zhōu de yǔ dà jiā xīn lǐ dōu yǒu xiē fán mèn","It rained for a whole week straight, and everyone felt rather gloomy.","Llovió durante toda una semana seguida y todos estábamos algo abatidos.","Il a plu toute une semaine d'affilée et tout le monde avait un peu le cafard."],["L7-1043","烦恼","fánnǎo","Adj","worried; worries","preocupado; preocupaciones","soucieux; soucis","孩子们纯洁的笑容让人忘记了所有烦恼。","hái zi men chún jié de xiào róng ràng rén wàng jì le suǒ yǒu fán nǎo","The children's innocent smiles made people forget all their worries.","Las sonrisas puras de los niños hacían olvidar todas las preocupaciones.","Les sourires innocents des enfants faisaient oublier tous les soucis."],["L7-1044","烦躁","fánzào","Adj","restless; irritable","inquieto; irritable","agité; irritable","天气太热，加上工作不顺，他变得十分烦躁。","tiān qì tài rè jiā shàng gōng zuò bú shùn tā biàn de shí fēn fán zào","The heat, combined with problems at work, made him extremely irritable.","El calor excesivo, sumado a que el trabajo no iba bien, lo puso sumamente irritable.","La chaleur, ajoutée aux difficultés au travail, l'a rendu extrêmement irritable."],["L7-1045","繁华","fánhuá","Adj","bustling; prosperous","próspero; bullicioso","prospère; animé","这条街是城里最繁华的商业区，夜里也灯火通明。","zhè tiáo jiē shì chéng lǐ zuì fán huá de shāng yè qū yè lǐ yě dēng huǒ tōng míng","This street is the busiest commercial area in town, brightly lit even at night.","Esta calle es la zona comercial más próspera de la ciudad y de noche también está bien iluminada.","Cette rue est le quartier commerçant le plus animé de la ville, et elle reste brillamment illuminée la nuit."],["L7-1046","繁忙","fánmáng","Adj","busy; bustling","ajetreado; muy ocupado","très occupé; animé","春节前后是铁路运输最繁忙的时候。","chūn jié qián hòu shì tiě lù yùn shū zuì fán máng de shí hou","The period around the Spring Festival is the busiest time for rail transport.","Los días alrededor de la Fiesta de la Primavera son los de mayor actividad del transporte ferroviario.","La période autour de la Fête du Printemps est la plus chargée pour le transport ferroviaire."],["L7-1047","繁体字","fántǐzì","N","traditional Chinese character","carácter chino tradicional","caractère chinois traditionnel","香港和台湾的报纸大多使用繁体字。","xiāng gǎng hé tái wān de bào zhǐ dà duō shǐ yòng fán tǐ zì","Most newspapers in Hong Kong and Taiwan use traditional characters.","La mayoría de los periódicos de Hong Kong y Taiwán usan caracteres tradicionales.","La plupart des journaux de Hong Kong et de Taïwan utilisent les caractères traditionnels."],["L7-1048","繁重","fánzhòng","Adj","heavy; arduous","pesado; arduo","lourd; pénible","他办事一向稳妥，即便任务繁重，也能分清轻重缓急。","tā bàn shì yí xiàng wěn tuǒ jí biàn rèn wu fán zhòng yě néng fēn qīng qīng zhòng huǎn jí","He has always handled matters reliably and can set priorities even under a heavy workload.","Siempre ha resuelto los asuntos con seguridad y, aunque la tarea sea pesada, sabe distinguir lo urgente de lo importante.","Il a toujours géré les dossiers avec fiabilité et, même sous une lourde charge de travail, il sait hiérarchiser les priorités."],["L7-1049","反驳","fǎnbó","V","to refute; to retort","refutar; replicar","réfuter; rétorquer","他的观点很有道理，在场的人谁也没法反驳。","tā de guān diǎn hěn yǒu dào lǐ zài chǎng de rén shéi yě méi fǎ fǎn bó","His argument was very reasonable, and no one present could refute it.","Su punto de vista era muy razonable y ninguno de los presentes pudo refutarlo.","Son point de vue était très pertinent et aucun des présents n'a pu le réfuter."],["L7-1050","反差","fǎnchā","N","contrast; disparity","contraste; disparidad","contraste; écart","这部电影里，主角前后性格的反差很大。","zhè bù diàn yǐng lǐ zhǔ jué qián hòu xìng gé de fǎn chā hěn dà","In this film, there is a sharp contrast between the protagonist's personality before and after.","En esta película hay un fuerte contraste entre el carácter del protagonista antes y después.","Dans ce film, il y a un fort contraste entre le caractère du héros avant et après."],["L7-1051","反常","fǎncháng","Adj","abnormal; unusual","anormal; inusual","anormal; inhabituel","最近天气很反常，十一月了还像夏天一样热。","zuì jìn tiān qì hěn fǎn cháng shí yī yuè le hái xiàng xià tiān yí yàng rè","The weather has been very unusual lately; it's November and still as hot as summer.","El clima ha estado muy raro últimamente: ya es noviembre y todavía hace calor como en verano.","Le temps est très anormal ces derniers temps : on est en novembre et il fait encore aussi chaud qu'en été."],["L7-1052","反倒","fǎndào","Adv","on the contrary; instead","al contrario; en cambio","au contraire; plutôt","我好心帮他，他反倒怪我多管闲事。","wǒ hǎo xīn bāng tā tā fǎn dào guài wǒ duō guǎn xián shì","I helped him out of kindness, but instead he blamed me for being nosy.","Lo ayudé con buena intención y, al contrario, me reprochó que me metiera donde no me llamaban.","Je l'ai aidé de bon cœur, et il m'a au contraire reproché de me mêler de ce qui ne me regardait pas."],["L7-1053","反感","fǎngǎn","Adj/N","aversion; to dislike","aversión; sentir rechazo","aversion; éprouver de l'antipathie","他说话总是居高临下，让人很反感。","tā shuō huà zǒng shì jū gāo lín xià ràng rén hěn fǎn gǎn","He always talks down to people, which puts everyone off.","Siempre habla con aire de superioridad, lo cual resulta muy antipático.","Il parle toujours avec condescendance, ce qui déplaît à tout le monde."],["L7-1054","反过来","fǎn guòlái","","conversely; the other way round","a la inversa; al revés","inversement; en sens inverse","父母关心孩子，孩子反过来也应该体谅父母。","fù mǔ guān xīn hái zi hái zi fǎn guò lái yě yīng gāi tǐ liàng fù mǔ","Parents care for their children, and in turn children should be understanding toward their parents.","Los padres cuidan de sus hijos y, a su vez, los hijos también deben ser comprensivos con sus padres.","Les parents s'occupent de leurs enfants, et les enfants doivent à leur tour se montrer compréhensifs envers leurs parents."],["L7-1055","反击","fǎnjī","V","to counterattack","contraatacar","contre-attaquer; riposter","客队在最后十分钟发动反击，连进两球。","kè duì zài zuì hòu shí fēn zhōng fā dòng fǎn jī lián jìn liǎng qiú","The visiting team launched a counterattack in the last ten minutes and scored two goals in a row.","El equipo visitante lanzó un contraataque en los últimos diez minutos y marcó dos goles seguidos.","L'équipe visiteuse a lancé une contre-attaque dans les dix dernières minutes et a marqué deux buts d'affilée."],["L7-1056","反馈","fǎnkuì","V","feedback; to feed back","retroalimentación; informar de vuelta","retour d'information; rétroaction","我们会认真收集用户的反馈，不断改进产品。","wǒ men huì rèn zhēn shōu jí yòng hù de fǎn kuì bú duàn gǎi jìn chǎn pǐn","We will carefully collect user feedback and keep improving the product.","Recopilaremos con atención los comentarios de los usuarios y mejoraremos el producto continuamente.","Nous recueillerons attentivement les retours des utilisateurs et améliorerons sans cesse le produit."],["L7-1057","反面","fǎnmiàn","N/Adj","reverse side; negative","reverso; lado negativo","revers; côté négatif","请在试卷的反面写上你的姓名和学号。","qǐng zài shì juàn de fǎn miàn xiě shàng nǐ de xìng míng hé xué hào","Please write your name and student number on the back of the exam paper.","Escribe tu nombre y tu número de estudiante en el reverso de la hoja del examen.","Veuillez inscrire votre nom et votre numéro d'étudiant au verso de la copie."],["L7-1058","反思","fǎnsī","V","to reflect on; to rethink","reflexionar; reconsiderar","réfléchir sur; repenser","失败以后，他认真反思了自己的问题。","shī bài yǐ hòu tā rèn zhēn fǎn sī le zì jǐ de wèn tí","After the failure, he reflected seriously on his own shortcomings.","Tras el fracaso, reflexionó con seriedad sobre sus propios problemas.","Après son échec, il s'est sérieusement remis en question."],["L7-1059","反弹","fǎntán","V","to rebound; to bounce back","rebotar; repuntar","rebondir; repartir à la hausse","股价在连续下跌一周后出现了小幅反弹。","gǔ jià zài lián xù xià diē yì zhōu hòu chū xiàn le xiǎo fú fǎn tán","After falling for a week straight, the share price rebounded slightly.","Tras caer durante una semana seguida, el precio de las acciones tuvo un ligero repunte.","Après une semaine de baisse continue, le cours de l'action a légèrement rebondi."],["L7-1060","反省","fǎnxǐng","V","to reflect on oneself","reflexionar; hacer autocrítica","faire son examen de conscience","犯了错误不要紧，关键是要好好反省。","fàn le cuò wù bú yào jǐn guān jiàn shì yào hǎo hǎo fǎn xǐng","Making a mistake isn't the end of the world; the key is to reflect on it seriously.","Cometer errores no importa; lo fundamental es reflexionar bien sobre ellos.","Ce n'est pas grave de commettre des erreurs ; l'essentiel est d'en tirer sérieusement les leçons."],["L7-1061","返还","fǎnhuán","V","to return; to refund","devolver; reembolsar","restituer; rembourser","如果您取消订单，押金将在三天内全额返还。","rú guǒ nín qǔ xiāo dìng dān yā jīn jiāng zài sān tiān nèi quán é fǎn huán","If you cancel your order, the deposit will be refunded in full within three days.","Si cancela su pedido, el depósito se le reembolsará íntegramente en un plazo de tres días.","Si vous annulez votre commande, l'acompte vous sera intégralement remboursé sous trois jours."],["L7-1062","犯愁","fànchóu","","to worry; to be anxious","preocuparse; angustiarse","se faire du souci","下个月的房租还没着落，他正为这事犯愁。","xià ge yuè de fáng zū hái méi zhuó luò tā zhèng wèi zhè shì fàn chóu","He still doesn't know where next month's rent will come from, and he's worried about it.","Todavía no tiene resuelto el alquiler del mes que viene y eso lo tiene preocupado.","Il ne sait toujours pas comment il paiera le loyer du mois prochain, et cela l'angoisse."],["L7-1063","饭碗","fànwǎn","N","rice bowl; livelihood","cuenco de arroz; sustento","bol de riz; gagne-pain","在经济不景气的时候，很多人担心丢了饭碗。","zài jīng jì bù jǐng qì de shí hou hěn duō rén dān xīn diū le fàn wǎn","When the economy is in a slump, many people worry about losing their jobs.","Cuando la economía está en crisis, mucha gente teme perder su empleo.","Quand l'économie va mal, beaucoup de gens craignent de perdre leur gagne-pain."],["L7-1064","泛滥","fànlàn","V","to flood; to spread unchecked","inundar; desbordarse","déborder; proliférer","每到雨季，这条河就容易泛滥成灾。","měi dào yǔ jì zhè tiáo hé jiù róng yì fàn làn chéng zāi","Every rainy season, this river is prone to flooding and causing disasters.","Cada temporada de lluvias, este río tiende a desbordarse y causar desastres.","Chaque saison des pluies, ce fleuve a tendance à déborder et à provoquer des catastrophes."],["L7-1065","范畴","fànchóu","N","category","categoría","catégorie","作者并未回避样本的局限，而是在结论中明确阐述了适用的范畴。","zuò zhě bìng wèi huí bì yàng běn de jú xiàn ér shì zài jié lùn zhōng míng què chǎn shù le shì yòng de fàn chóu","The author did not avoid the limitations of the sample, but clearly set out the scope of applicability in the conclusion.","El autor no eludió las limitaciones de la muestra, sino que expuso con claridad en las conclusiones el ámbito de aplicación.","L'auteur n'a pas éludé les limites de l'échantillon ; il a au contraire exposé clairement dans la conclusion le champ d'application."],["L7-1066","贩卖","fànmài","V","to sell; to peddle","vender; traficar","vendre; colporter","他因为非法贩卖野生动物被判了刑。","tā yīn wèi fēi fǎ fàn mài yě shēng dòng wù bèi pàn le xíng","He was sentenced for illegally trading in wild animals.","Lo condenaron por traficar ilegalmente con animales silvestres.","Il a été condamné pour trafic illégal d'animaux sauvages."],["L7-1067","方方面面","fāngfāngmiànmiàn","N","all aspects","todos los aspectos","tous les aspects","这次改革涉及社会生活的方方面面。","zhè cì gǎi gé shè jí shè huì shēng huó de fāng fāng miàn miàn","This reform touches on every aspect of social life.","Esta reforma abarca todos los aspectos de la vida social.","Cette réforme touche tous les aspects de la vie sociale."],["L7-1068","方向盘","fāngxiàngpán","N","steering wheel","volante","volant","第一次独自开车上路，他握着方向盘的手有些发抖。","dì yī cì dú zì kāi chē shàng lù tā wò zhe fāng xiàng pán de shǒu yǒu xiē fā dǒu","On his first drive alone, his hands trembled slightly on the steering wheel.","La primera vez que manejó solo por la carretera, le temblaban un poco las manos sobre el volante.","La première fois qu'il a pris la route seul au volant, ses mains tremblaient légèrement sur le volant."],["L7-1069","方言","fāngyán","N","dialect","dialecto","dialecte","这个地区的方言很难懂，外地人几乎听不明白。","zhè ge dì qū de fāng yán hěn nán dǒng wài dì rén jī hū tīng bù míng bai","The dialect of this region is hard to understand; outsiders can barely follow it.","El dialecto de esta región es muy difícil de entender y los forasteros casi no logran comprenderlo.","Le dialecte de cette région est très difficile à comprendre ; les gens de l'extérieur n'y comprennent presque rien."],["L7-1070","防盗","fángdào","V","anti-theft","antirrobo","antivol","这辆自行车装了防盗锁，不容易被偷。","zhè liàng zì xíng chē zhuāng le fáng dào suǒ bù róng yì bèi tōu","This bicycle has an anti-theft lock, so it's hard to steal.","Esta bicicleta tiene un candado antirrobo, así que no es fácil que se la roben.","Ce vélo est équipé d'un antivol, il n'est donc pas facile à voler."],["L7-1071","防盗门","fángdàomén","N","security door","puerta de seguridad","porte blindée","搬进新家后，我们先换了一扇结实的防盗门。","bān jìn xīn jiā hòu wǒ men xiān huàn le yí shàn jiē shi de fáng dào mén","After moving into our new home, the first thing we did was replace the existing door with a sturdy security door.","Al mudarnos a la casa nueva, lo primero que hicimos fue cambiar la puerta por una puerta blindada resistente.","Après avoir emménagé dans notre nouvelle maison, nous avons d'abord remplacé la porte par une porte blindée solide."],["L7-1072","防护","fánghù","V","to protect; to guard","proteger; resguardar","protéger; défendre","进入实验室必须穿戴好防护服和护目镜。","jìn rù shí yàn shì bì xū chuān dài hǎo fáng hù fú hé hù mù jìng","You must put on protective clothing and goggles before entering the lab.","Para entrar al laboratorio hay que ponerse la ropa protectora y las gafas de seguridad.","Pour entrer dans le laboratoire, il faut porter une combinaison de protection et des lunettes de sécurité."],["L7-1073","防火墙","fánghuǒqiáng","N","firewall","cortafuegos","pare-feu","公司的电脑都安装了防火墙，防止黑客入侵。","gōng sī de diàn nǎo dōu ān zhuāng le fáng huǒ qiáng fáng zhǐ hēi kè rù qīn","All the company's computers have firewalls installed to prevent hacker attacks.","Todas las computadoras de la empresa tienen instalado un firewall para evitar intrusiones de hackers.","Tous les ordinateurs de l'entreprise sont équipés d'un pare-feu pour empêcher les intrusions de pirates."],["L7-1074","防卫","fángwèi","V","to defend; defense","defender; defensa","défendre; défense","遇到歹徒袭击时，他出于自卫进行了正当防卫。","yù dào dǎi tú xí jī shí tā chū yú zì wèi jìn xíng le zhèng dàng fáng wèi","When attacked by a criminal, he acted in legitimate self-defense.","Al ser atacado por un delincuente, actuó en legítima defensa para protegerse.","Attaqué par un malfaiteur, il a agi en légitime défense."],["L7-1075","防汛","fángxùn","V","flood control","prevención de inundaciones","lutte contre les crues","进入七月以后，沿江各地都进入了防汛的关键时期。","jìn rù qī yuè yǐ hòu yán jiāng gè dì dōu jìn rù le fáng xùn de guān jiàn shí qī","After July began, all areas along the river entered a critical period for flood prevention.","A partir de julio, todas las zonas a lo largo del río entraron en el período clave de prevención de crecidas.","À partir de juillet, toutes les régions le long du fleuve sont entrées dans la période cruciale de prévention des crues."],["L7-1076","防疫","fángyì","V","to prevent epidemics","prevenir epidemias","prévenir les épidémies","学校组织学生接种疫苗，做好秋冬季防疫工作。","xué xiào zǔ zhī xué shēng jiē zhòng yì miáo zuò hǎo qiū dōng jì fáng yì gōng zuò","The school arranged vaccinations for students as part of its autumn and winter disease-prevention work.","La escuela organizó la vacunación de los alumnos para hacer bien el trabajo de prevención de enfermedades en otoño e invierno.","L'école a organisé la vaccination des élèves afin de bien mener la prévention sanitaire de l'automne et de l'hiver."],["L7-1077","防御","fángyù","V","to defend; defense","defender; defensa","défendre; défense","这座古城的城墙在当年是重要的防御工事。","zhè zuò gǔ chéng de chéng qiáng zài dāng nián shì zhòng yào de fáng yù gōng shì","The walls of this ancient city were important defensive fortifications in their day.","Las murallas de esta ciudad antigua fueron en su día importantes fortificaciones defensivas.","Les remparts de cette ancienne cité étaient autrefois d'importantes fortifications défensives."],["L7-1078","妨碍","fáng'ài","V","to hinder; to obstruct","obstaculizar; estorbar","gêner; entraver","车不要停在路口，会妨碍其他车辆通行。","chē bú yào tíng zài lù kǒu huì fáng ài qí tā chē liàng tōng xíng","Don't park at the intersection; it will obstruct other vehicles.","No estaciones el coche en el cruce; estorbará el paso de otros vehículos.","Ne stationnez pas au carrefour, cela gênerait la circulation des autres véhicules."],["L7-1079","妨害","fánghài","V","to harm; to undermine","perjudicar; dañar","nuire à; porter atteinte à","在公共场所大声喧哗，会妨害别人的正常休息。","zài gōng gòng chǎng suǒ dà shēng xuān huá huì fáng hài bié rén de zhèng cháng xiū xi","Making loud noise in public places interferes with other people's rest.","Hacer mucho ruido en lugares públicos perturba el descanso normal de los demás.","Faire beaucoup de bruit dans les lieux publics nuit au repos des autres."],["L7-1080","房地产","fángdìchǎn","N","real estate","bienes inmuebles","immobilier","近几年，这座城市的房地产市场有些降温。","jìn jǐ nián zhè zuò chéng shì de fáng dì chǎn shì chǎng yǒu xiē jiàng wēn","In recent years, the real estate market in this city has cooled somewhat.","En los últimos años, el mercado inmobiliario de esta ciudad se ha enfriado un poco.","Ces dernières années, le marché immobilier de cette ville s'est un peu refroidi."],["L7-1081","仿","fǎng","V","to imitate; to copy","imitar; copiar","imiter; copier","这家店的家具都是仿明代风格做的。","zhè jiā diàn de jiā jù dōu shì fǎng míng dài fēng gé zuò de","All the furniture in this shop is made in imitation of the Ming dynasty style.","Todos los muebles de esta tienda están hechos imitando el estilo de la dinastía Ming.","Tous les meubles de cette boutique sont fabriqués dans le style imité de la dynastie Ming."],["L7-1082","仿制","fǎngzhì","V","to copy; to replicate","copiar; reproducir","copier; reproduire","这些名画的仿制品几乎可以以假乱真。","zhè xiē míng huà de fǎng zhì pǐn jī hū kě yǐ yǐ jiǎ luàn zhēn","The reproductions of these famous paintings can almost pass for the real thing.","Las réplicas de estas pinturas famosas casi se pueden confundir con las originales.","Les reproductions de ces tableaux célèbres peuvent presque passer pour des originaux."],["L7-1083","访谈","fǎngtán","V","to interview","entrevistar; entrevista","interviewer; entretien","这档访谈节目每期都会邀请一位知名作家。","zhè dàng fǎng tán jié mù měi qī dōu huì yāo qǐng yí wèi zhī míng zuò jiā","Each episode of this interview program features a well-known writer.","Este programa de entrevistas invita en cada episodio a un escritor reconocido.","Chaque émission de cet entretien reçoit un écrivain réputé."],["L7-1084","纺织","fǎngzhī","V","spinning and weaving; textile","hilado y tejido; textil","filature et tissage; textile","这座城市过去以纺织业闻名全国。","zhè zuò chéng shì guò qù yǐ fǎng zhī yè wén míng quán guó","In the past, this city was famous nationwide for its textile industry.","Antiguamente, esta ciudad era famosa en todo el país por su industria textil.","Autrefois, cette ville était célèbre dans tout le pays pour son industrie textile."],["L7-1085","放过","fàngguò","","to let off; to let slip","perdonar; dejar pasar","épargner; laisser passer","警察仔细检查了现场，不放过任何一条线索。","jǐng chá zǐ xì jiǎn chá le xiàn chǎng bú fàng guò rèn hé yì tiáo xiàn suǒ","The police examined the scene carefully, not letting a single clue slip by.","La policía examinó la escena con minuciosidad, sin dejar pasar ni una sola pista.","La police a minutieusement examiné les lieux sans négliger le moindre indice."],["L7-1086","放水","fàngshuǐ","","to run water; to throw a game","abrir el agua; dejarse ganar","faire couler l'eau; laisser gagner","雨季来了，水库打开了闸放水。","yǔ jì lái le shuǐ kù dǎ kāi le zhá fàng shuǐ","The rainy season came, and the reservoir opened its sluice gates to release water.","Llegó la temporada de lluvias y el embalse abrió las compuertas para soltar agua.","La saison des pluies est arrivée et le barrage a ouvert ses vannes pour libérer de l'eau."],["L7-1087","放肆","fàngsì","Adj","presumptuous; unbridled","insolente; desenfrenado","insolent; effronté","在长辈面前说话，可不能这么放肆。","zài zhǎng bèi miàn qián shuō huà kě bù néng zhè me fàng sì","You mustn't speak so insolently in front of your elders.","Delante de los mayores no se puede hablar con tanto descaro.","On ne peut pas parler aussi effrontément devant les aînés."],["L7-1088","放映","fàngyìng","V","to screen; to show a film","proyectar (una película)","projeter (un film)","这部纪录片将在全国各大影院同时放映。","zhè bù jì lù piàn jiāng zài quán guó gè dà yǐng yuàn tóng shí fàng yìng","This documentary will be screened simultaneously in major cinemas across the country.","Este documental se proyectará simultáneamente en los principales cines de todo el país.","Ce documentaire sera projeté simultanément dans les principales salles de cinéma du pays."],["L7-1089","放置","fàngzhì","V","to place; to put","colocar; poner","placer; poser","请勿在楼道里放置杂物，以免影响通行。","qǐng wù zài lóu dào lǐ fàng zhì zá wù yǐ miǎn yǐng xiǎng tōng xíng","Please do not leave things in the stairwell, as they may block the way.","Por favor, no deje objetos en el pasillo de la escalera, para no obstruir el paso.","Veuillez ne pas laisser d'objets dans la cage d'escalier afin de ne pas gêner le passage."],["L7-1090","放纵","fàngzòng","V","to indulge; to let loose","consentir; dar rienda suelta","laisser faire; se laisser aller","对孩子不能一味放纵，该管的时候一定要管。","duì hái zi bù néng yí wèi fàng zòng gāi guǎn de shí hou yí dìng yào guǎn","You can't just indulge children all the time; when discipline is needed, you must provide it.","No se puede consentir a los niños sin límites; cuando hay que corregirlos, hay que hacerlo.","On ne peut pas céder en tout aux enfants ; quand il faut les cadrer, il faut le faire."],["L7-1091","飞速","fēisù","Adv","rapidly; at high speed","rápidamente; a gran velocidad","à toute vitesse; rapidement","近年来，人工智能技术飞速发展。","jìn nián lái rén gōng zhì néng jì shù fēi sù fā zhǎn","In recent years, artificial intelligence technology has developed at breakneck speed.","En los últimos años, la tecnología de inteligencia artificial se ha desarrollado a toda velocidad.","Ces dernières années, la technologie de l'intelligence artificielle s'est développée à une vitesse fulgurante."],["L7-1092","飞往","fēiwǎng","","to fly to","volar hacia","s'envoler pour","我们搭乘早上八点的航班飞往上海。","wǒ men dā chéng zǎo shang bā diǎn de háng bān fēi wǎng shàng hǎi","We are taking the eight a.m. flight to Shanghai.","Tomamos el vuelo de las ocho de la mañana a Shanghái.","Nous prenons le vol de huit heures du matin pour Shanghai."],["L7-1093","飞翔","fēixiáng","V","to soar; to fly","volar; planear","planer; voler","一群海鸥在蓝天下自由地飞翔。","yì qún hǎi ōu zài lán tiān xià zì yóu de fēi xiáng","A flock of seagulls is soaring freely under the blue sky.","Una bandada de gaviotas vuela libremente bajo el cielo azul.","Une volée de goélands plane librement sous le ciel bleu."],["L7-1094","飞跃","fēiyuè","V","to leap; leap","dar un salto; salto","faire un bond; bond","从手写信件到视频通话，通信方式实现了巨大的飞跃。","cóng shǒu xiě xìn jiàn dào shì pín tōng huà tōng xìn fāng shì shí xiàn le jù dà de fēi yuè","From handwritten letters to video calls, communication has made a huge leap forward.","De las cartas escritas a mano a las videollamadas, los medios de comunicación han dado un enorme salto.","De la lettre manuscrite à l'appel vidéo, les moyens de communication ont fait un bond considérable."],["L7-1095","非","fēi","Prefix","Africa (abbr.)","África (abrev.)","Afrique (abrév.)","这种动物非马非驴，模样十分古怪。","zhè zhǒng dòng wù fēi mǎ fēi lǘ mú yàng shí fēn gǔ guài","This animal is neither horse nor donkey and looks very strange.","Este animal no es ni caballo ni burro y tiene un aspecto muy extraño.","Cet animal n'est ni un cheval ni un âne et a un aspect très étrange."],["L7-1095#2","非金属","fēijīnshǔ","N","nonmetal","no metal","non-métal"],["L7-1096","非得","fēiděi","Adv","must; have to","tener que; deber","devoir absolument","这么重要的事，你非得亲自去一趟不可。","zhè me zhòng yào de shì nǐ fēi děi qīn zì qù yí tàng bù kě","For something this important, you have to go there in person.","Siendo algo tan importante, tienes que ir en persona sin falta.","Pour une chose aussi importante, il faut absolument que tu ailles là-bas en personne."],["L7-1097","非法","fēifǎ","Adj","illegal","ilegal","illégal","他因为非法贩卖野生动物被判了刑。","tā yīn wèi fēi fǎ fàn mài yě shēng dòng wù bèi pàn le xíng","He was sentenced for illegally trading in wild animals.","Lo condenaron por traficar ilegalmente con animales silvestres.","Il a été condamné pour trafic illégal d'animaux sauvages."],["L7-1098","非凡","fēifán","Adj","extraordinary","extraordinario","extraordinaire","这位年轻的钢琴家展现出了非凡的才华。","zhè wèi nián qīng de gāng qín jiā zhǎn xiàn chū le fēi fán de cái huá","This young pianist has shown extraordinary talent.","Este joven pianista ha demostrado un talento extraordinario.","Ce jeune pianiste a fait preuve d'un talent extraordinaire."],["L7-1099","绯闻","fēiwén","N","sex scandal; gossip","escándalo amoroso","scandale amoureux","这位明星最近陷入了一场绯闻，经纪公司出面辟谣。","zhè wèi míng xīng zuì jìn xiàn rù le yì chǎng fēi wén jīng jì gōng sī chū miàn pì yáo","This star was recently caught up in a romance rumor, and the agency stepped in to deny it.","Esta celebridad se vio envuelta recientemente en un rumor amoroso y su agencia salió a desmentirlo.","Cette star a récemment été mêlée à une rumeur de liaison, et son agence est intervenue pour la démentir."],["L7-1100","肥料","féiliào","N","fertilizer","fertilizante","engrais","农民们开始用有机肥料代替化肥。","nóng mín men kāi shǐ yòng yǒu jī féi liào dài tì huà féi","Farmers have started using organic fertilizer instead of chemical fertilizer.","Los campesinos han empezado a usar abono orgánico en lugar de fertilizantes químicos.","Les agriculteurs ont commencé à utiliser de l'engrais organique à la place des engrais chimiques."],["L7-1101","肥胖","féipàng","Adj","fat; obese","obeso; gordo","obèse; gros","长期缺乏运动是导致肥胖的重要原因之一。","cháng qī quē fá yùn dòng shì dǎo zhì féi pàng de zhòng yào yuán yīn zhī yī","A long-term lack of exercise is one of the main causes of obesity.","La falta prolongada de ejercicio es una de las causas importantes de la obesidad.","Le manque d'exercice prolongé est l'une des principales causes de l'obésité."],["L7-1102","肥沃","féiwò","Adj","fertile","fértil","fertile","这里的土壤很肥沃，适合种水稻。","zhè lǐ de tǔ rǎng hěn féi wò shì hé zhòng shuǐ dào","The soil here is very fertile and suitable for growing rice.","El suelo de aquí es muy fértil y propicio para cultivar arroz.","Le sol ici est très fertile et convient bien à la culture du riz."],["L7-1103","肥皂","féizào","N","soap","jabón","savon","吃饭前一定要用肥皂把手洗干净。","chī fàn qián yí dìng yào yòng féi zào bǎ shǒu xǐ gān jìng","Be sure to wash your hands clean with soap before eating.","Antes de comer, lávate bien las manos con jabón.","Avant de manger, lave-toi bien les mains avec du savon."],["L7-1104","诽谤","fěibàng","V","to slander; to libel","difamar; calumniar","diffamer; calomnier","他在网上散布谣言，诽谤他人，被依法拘留了。","tā zài wǎng shàng sàn bù yáo yán fěi bàng tā rén bèi yī fǎ jū liú le","He spread rumors online and slandered others, and was detained according to law.","Difundió rumores y difamó a otras personas en internet, y fue detenido conforme a la ley.","Il a répandu des rumeurs et diffamé autrui sur Internet, et a été placé en détention conformément à la loi."],["L7-1105","废","fèi","Adj/V","to abolish; useless","abolir; inútil","abolir; inutile","这条不合理的旧规定早就应该废了。","zhè tiáo bù hé lǐ de jiù guī dìng zǎo jiù yīng gāi fèi le","This unreasonable old rule should have been abolished long ago.","Esta antigua regla irrazonable debió haberse abolido hace mucho.","Cette vieille règle déraisonnable aurait dû être abolie depuis longtemps."],["L7-1106","废除","fèichú","V","to abolish; to repeal","abolir; derogar","abolir; abroger","有关规定已经废除，办事人员不应再据此拒绝受理申请。","yǒu guān guī dìng yǐ jīng fèi chú bàn shì rén yuán bù yīng zài jù cǐ jù jué shòu lǐ shēn qǐng","The relevant rule has been abolished, so staff should no longer use it as grounds to reject applications.","La norma en cuestión ya fue derogada, por lo que el personal no debería seguir rechazando solicitudes con base en ella.","La disposition en question a été abrogée ; le personnel ne devrait donc plus s'en servir pour refuser d'instruire les demandes."],["L7-1107","废话","fèihuà","N","nonsense; useless talk","tonterías; palabrería","bêtises; paroles inutiles","别说废话了，赶紧说重点吧。","bié shuō fèi huà le gǎn jǐn shuō zhòng diǎn ba","Stop talking nonsense and get to the point.","¡Déjate de tonterías y ve al grano!","Arrête de dire des bêtises et va droit au but."],["L7-1108","废品","fèipǐn","N","scrap; reject","desecho; artículo defectuoso","rebut; déchet","他每个月把家里攒的旧报纸卖给废品回收站。","tā měi ge yuè bǎ jiā lǐ zǎn de jiù bào zhǐ mài gěi fèi pǐn huí shōu zhàn","Every month he sells the old newspapers saved up at home to the recycling station.","Cada mes vende a la planta de reciclaje los periódicos viejos que guarda en casa.","Chaque mois, il vend à la déchetterie de recyclage les vieux journaux qu'il accumule à la maison."],["L7-1109","废寝忘食","fèiqǐn-wàngshí","","to forget sleep and food","olvidarse de dormir y comer","oublier de dormir et manger","为了完成这部小说，作家几乎废寝忘食。","wèi le wán chéng zhè bù xiǎo shuō zuò jiā jī hū fèi qǐn wàng shí","To finish this novel, the author almost forgot to eat and sleep.","Para terminar esta novela, el escritor casi se olvidó de comer y dormir.","Pour achever ce roman, l'écrivain en oubliait presque de manger et de dormir."],["L7-1110","废物","fèiwù","N","waste; useless person","desecho; inútil","déchet; bon à rien","这些手工艺品都是用废物做成的，既环保又漂亮。","zhè xiē shǒu gōng yì pǐn dōu shì yòng fèi wù zuò chéng de jì huán bǎo yòu piào liang","These handicrafts are all made from waste materials; they're both eco-friendly and beautiful.","Estas artesanías están hechas con materiales de desecho; además de ecológicas, son bonitas.","Ces objets artisanaux sont tous fabriqués à partir de déchets ; ils sont à la fois écologiques et jolis."],["L7-1111","废墟","fèixū","N","ruins","ruinas","ruines","大地震过后，整座城市几乎变成了一片废墟。","dà dì zhèn guò hòu zhěng zuò chéng shì jī hū biàn chéng le yí piàn fèi xū","After the great earthquake, almost the entire city was reduced to ruins.","Después del gran terremoto, casi toda la ciudad quedó convertida en ruinas.","Après le grand séisme, presque toute la ville n'était plus qu'un champ de ruines."],["L7-1112","沸沸扬扬","fèifèiyángyáng","Adj","abuzz; in an uproar","alborotado; en boca de todos","en ébullition; sur toutes les lèvres","这件事在网上闹得沸沸扬扬，几乎人人都在讨论。","zhè jiàn shì zài wǎng shàng nào de fèi fèi yáng yáng jī hū rén rén dōu zài tǎo lùn","This matter caused a huge stir online, and almost everyone was talking about it.","Este asunto causó un gran revuelo en internet y casi todo el mundo lo comentaba.","Cette affaire a fait un tapage énorme sur Internet et presque tout le monde en parlait."],["L7-1113","沸腾","fèiténg","V","to boil; to seethe","hervir; bullir","bouillir; être en ébullition","水沸腾以后再把面条放进去。","shuǐ fèi téng yǐ hòu zài bǎ miàn tiáo fàng jìn qù","Put the noodles in after the water comes to a boil.","Cuando el agua hierva, echa los fideos.","Mettez les nouilles une fois que l'eau bout."],["L7-1114","费劲","fèijìn","","to take effort; strenuous","costar esfuerzo; arduo","demander des efforts; pénible","这个箱子太重了，两个人抬都很费劲。","zhè ge xiāng zi tài zhòng le liǎng gè rén tái dōu hěn fèi jìn","This box is so heavy that even two people struggle to lift it.","Esta caja pesa tanto que ni entre dos personas cuesta mucho levantarla.","Cette caisse est si lourde que même à deux, on a du mal à la soulever."],["L7-1115","分辨","fēnbiàn","V","to distinguish; to tell apart","distinguir; discernir","distinguer; discerner","孩子从小就要学会分辨是非。","hái zi cóng xiǎo jiù yào xué huì fēn biàn shì fēi","Children should learn to tell right from wrong from an early age.","Los niños deben aprender desde pequeños a distinguir el bien del mal.","Les enfants doivent apprendre dès le plus jeune âge à distinguer le bien du mal."],["L7-1116","分寸","fēncun","N","propriety; sense of proper limits","mesura; sentido de los límites","mesure; sens des limites","和长辈开玩笑要注意分寸，不能太过分。","hé zhǎng bèi kāi wán xiào yào zhù yì fēn cun bù néng tài guò fèn","When joking with elders, you need a sense of propriety and shouldn't go too far.","Al bromear con los mayores hay que tener tacto y no pasarse de la raya.","Quand on plaisante avec les aînés, il faut savoir garder la mesure et ne pas aller trop loin."],["L7-1117","分担","fēndān","V","to share (a burden)","compartir (una carga)","partager (une charge)","做领导不能什么事都大包大揽，要学会让下属分担。","zuò lǐng dǎo bù néng shén me shì dōu dà bāo dà lǎn yào xué huì ràng xià shǔ fēn dān","A leader shouldn't take everything on himself; he needs to learn to let subordinates share the load.","Un líder no debe cargar con todo él solo; tiene que aprender a dejar que sus subordinados compartan la carga.","Un chef ne doit pas tout prendre en charge lui-même ; il doit apprendre à laisser ses subordonnés partager la tâche."],["L7-1118","分割","fēngē","V","to divide; to split","dividir; partir","diviser; découper","这片土地被一条河流分割成了两部分。","zhè piàn tǔ dì bèi yì tiáo hé liú fēn gē chéng le liǎng bù fen","This piece of land is divided into two parts by a river.","Este terreno está dividido en dos partes por un río.","Ce terrain est divisé en deux parties par un cours d'eau."],["L7-1119","分红","fēnhóng","","dividend; to share profits","dividendo; repartir beneficios","dividende; distribuer les bénéfices","公司今年效益不错，年底给股东们分红。","gōng sī jīn nián xiào yì bú cuò nián dǐ gěi gǔ dōng men fēn hóng","The company did well this year and will pay dividends to shareholders at year end.","A la empresa le fue bien este año y a fin de año repartirá dividendos entre los accionistas.","L'entreprise a bien marché cette année et distribuera des dividendes à ses actionnaires en fin d'année."],["L7-1120","分化","fēnhuà","V","to split; to differentiate","dividirse; diferenciarse","se diviser; se différencier","随着经济的发展，社会阶层出现了明显的分化。","suí zhe jīng jì de fā zhǎn shè huì jiē céng chū xiàn le míng xiǎn de fēn huà","With economic development, clear divisions have appeared between social classes.","Con el desarrollo económico, han surgido divisiones claras entre las clases sociales.","Avec le développement économique, des clivages nets sont apparus entre les classes sociales."],["L7-1121","分泌","fēnmì","V","to secrete","segregar; secretar","sécréter","人体里有很多种腺，它们能分泌不同的物质。","rén tǐ lǐ yǒu hěn duō zhǒng xiàn tā men néng fēn mì bù tóng de wù zhì","The human body has many kinds of glands that secrete different substances.","El cuerpo humano tiene muchos tipos de glándulas, que secretan distintas sustancias.","Le corps humain possède de nombreuses sortes de glandes, qui sécrètent des substances différentes."],["L7-1122","分明","fēnmíng","Adj/Adv","clear; clearly","claro; evidentemente","clair; manifestement","这个地区四季分明，春天和秋天都很宜人。","zhè ge dì qū sì jì fēn míng chūn tiān hé qiū tiān dōu hěn yí rén","This region has four distinct seasons, and both spring and autumn are very pleasant.","En esta región las cuatro estaciones están bien definidas, y tanto la primavera como el otoño son muy agradables.","Dans cette région, les quatre saisons sont bien marquées, et le printemps comme l'automne y sont très agréables."],["L7-1123","分歧","fēnqí","N/Adj","divergence; disagreement","divergencia; desacuerdo","divergence; désaccord","遇到分歧时，大家要以大局为重，不要只考虑个人得失。","yù dào fēn qí shí dà jiā yào yǐ dà jú wéi zhòng bú yào zhǐ kǎo lǜ gè rén dé shī","When disagreements arise, everyone should put the big picture first and not think only of personal gain or loss.","Cuando surjan diferencias, hay que priorizar el interés general y no pensar solo en ganancias o pérdidas personales.","En cas de désaccord, il faut faire passer l'intérêt général avant tout et ne pas penser seulement à ses gains ou pertes personnels."],["L7-1124","分赃","fēnzāng","","to share the loot","repartirse el botín","se partager le butin","两个小偷因为分赃不均，在街上吵了起来。","liǎng gè xiǎo tōu yīn wèi fēn zāng bù jūn zài jiē shang chǎo le qǐ lái","The two thieves started arguing in the street because the loot had been divided unequally.","Dos ladrones empezaron a pelearse en la calle porque repartieron el botín de forma desigual.","Deux voleurs se sont mis à se disputer dans la rue parce qu'ils s'étaient mal partagé le butin."],["L7-1125","分支","fēnzhī","N","branch; to branch off","rama; ramificarse","branche; se ramifier","这家银行在全国各地都设有分支机构。","zhè jiā yín háng zài quán guó gè dì dōu shè yǒu fēn zhī jī gòu","This bank has branches all over the country.","Este banco tiene sucursales en todo el país.","Cette banque possède des succursales dans tout le pays."],["L7-1126","芬芳","fēnfāng","Adj/N","fragrant; fragrance","fragante; fragancia","parfumé; parfum","春天的花园里，到处弥漫着花朵的芬芳。","chūn tiān de huā yuán lǐ dào chù mí màn zhe huā duǒ de fēn fāng","In the spring garden, the fragrance of flowers fills the air everywhere.","En el jardín primaveral, por todas partes se respira la fragancia de las flores.","Dans le jardin au printemps, le parfum des fleurs embaume partout."],["L7-1127","吩咐","fēnfù","V","to instruct; to tell","ordenar; encargar","ordonner; demander","经理吩咐我把这份文件尽快送到财务部。","jīng lǐ fēn fù wǒ bǎ zhè fèn wén jiàn jǐn kuài sòng dào cái wù bù","The manager told me to take this document to the finance department as soon as possible.","El gerente me encargó que llevara este documento al departamento de finanzas lo antes posible.","Le directeur m'a demandé de porter ce document au service financier au plus vite."],["L7-1128","氛围","fēnwéi","N","atmosphere; ambience","ambiente; atmósfera","ambiance; atmosphère","这家咖啡馆的氛围很安静，很适合看书。","zhè jiā kā fēi guǎn de fēn wéi hěn ān jìng hěn shì hé kàn shū","The atmosphere in this café is quiet, which makes it perfect for reading.","El ambiente de esta cafetería es muy tranquilo, ideal para leer.","L'ambiance de ce café est très calme, parfaite pour lire."],["L7-1129","坟","fén","N","grave; tomb","tumba; sepulcro","tombe; sépulture","清明节那天，我们全家去给爷爷上坟。","qīng míng jié nà tiān wǒ men quán jiā qù gěi yé ye shàng fén","On Qingming Festival, our whole family went to visit Grandpa's grave.","El día de Qingming, toda nuestra familia fue a visitar la tumba del abuelo.","Le jour de Qingming, toute notre famille est allée se recueillir sur la tombe de grand-père."],["L7-1130","坟墓","fénmù","N","grave; tomb","tumba; sepulcro","tombe; tombeau","考古学家在这里发现了一座两千多年前的坟墓。","kǎo gǔ xué jiā zài zhè lǐ fā xiàn le yí zuò liǎng qiān duō nián qián de fén mù","Archaeologists discovered a tomb here dating back more than two thousand years.","Los arqueólogos descubrieron aquí una tumba de hace más de dos mil años.","Les archéologues ont découvert ici une tombe vieille de plus de deux mille ans."],["L7-1131","焚烧","fénshāo","V","to burn; to incinerate","quemar; incinerar","brûler; incinérer","秋收以后，禁止在田里焚烧秸秆。","qiū shōu yǐ hòu jìn zhǐ zài tián lǐ fén shāo jiē gǎn","After the autumn harvest, burning crop stalks in the fields is prohibited.","Después de la cosecha de otoño, está prohibido quemar rastrojos en los campos.","Après la récolte d'automne, il est interdit de brûler les tiges de paille dans les champs."],["L7-1132","粉","fěn","N","powder; noodles; pink","polvo; fideos; rosa","poudre; nouilles; rose","她出门前在脸上擦了一层薄薄的粉。","tā chū mén qián zài liǎn shàng cā le yì céng báo báo de fěn","Before going out, she put a thin layer of powder on her face.","Antes de salir, se aplicó una capa fina de polvo en la cara.","Avant de sortir, elle s'est mis une fine couche de poudre sur le visage."],["L7-1133","粉丝","fěnsī","N","fan; vermicelli","fan; fideos de soja","fan; vermicelle","这位歌手在网上有几千万粉丝。","zhè wèi gē shǒu zài wǎng shàng yǒu jǐ qiān wàn fěn sī","This singer has tens of millions of fans online.","Este cantante tiene decenas de millones de seguidores en internet.","Ce chanteur compte des dizaines de millions de fans en ligne."],["L7-1134","粉碎","fěnsuì","Adj/V","to smash; to shatter","aplastar; triturar","écraser; broyer","这只花瓶从桌子上掉下来，摔得粉碎。","zhè zhī huā píng cóng zhuō zi shàng diào xià lái shuāi de fěn suì","The vase fell off the table and was smashed to pieces.","El jarrón se cayó de la mesa y se hizo añicos.","Le vase est tombé de la table et s'est brisé en mille morceaux."],["L7-1135","分量","fènliàng","N","weight; quantity","peso; cantidad","poids; quantité","他在公司工作了三十年，说话很有分量。","tā zài gōng sī gōng zuò le sān shí nián shuō huà hěn yǒu fèn liàng","He has worked at the company for thirty years, so his words carry a lot of weight.","Lleva treinta años trabajando en la empresa, así que su palabra tiene mucho peso.","Il travaille dans l'entreprise depuis trente ans, si bien que sa parole a beaucoup de poids."],["L7-1136","分外","fènwài","Adv","especially; exceptionally","especialmente; sumamente","particulièrement; exceptionnellement","久别重逢，两位老朋友显得分外高兴。","jiǔ bié chóng féng liǎng wèi lǎo péng you xiǎn de fèn wài gāo xìng","Meeting again after a long separation, the two old friends were especially happy.","Al reencontrarse tras mucho tiempo, los dos viejos amigos estaban especialmente contentos.","Les deux vieux amis, qui se retrouvaient après une longue séparation, étaient particulièrement heureux."],["L7-1137","份额","fèn'é","N","share; portion","cuota; parte","part; quote-part","几家大公司瓜分了国内大部分的市场份额。","jǐ jiā dà gōng sī guā fēn le guó nèi dà bù fen de shì chǎng fèn é","A few big companies have carved up most of the domestic market share.","Unas cuantas grandes empresas se repartieron la mayor parte de la cuota del mercado nacional.","Quelques grandes entreprises se sont partagé l'essentiel des parts du marché intérieur."],["L7-1138","奋力","fènlì","Adv","to strive with all one's might","esforzarse al máximo","faire tout son possible","落后的队员奋力追赶，终于在终点前超过了对手。","luò hòu de duì yuán fèn lì zhuī gǎn zhōng yú zài zhōng diǎn qián chāo guò le duì shǒu","The trailing runner sprinted with all his might and finally overtook his opponent before the finish line.","El corredor rezagado se esforzó por alcanzarlo y por fin superó a su rival antes de la meta.","Le coureur en retard a fourni un effort acharné et a fini par dépasser son adversaire avant la ligne d'arrivée."],["L7-1139","奋勇","fènyǒng","V","bravely; with courage","con valentía; con arrojo","courageusement; avec vaillance","洪水来临时，几名战士奋勇跳进激流救人。","hóng shuǐ lái lín shí jǐ míng zhàn shì fèn yǒng tiào jìn jī liú jiù rén","When the flood came, several soldiers bravely jumped into the torrent to rescue people.","Cuando llegó la inundación, varios soldados se lanzaron valientemente a la corriente para rescatar a la gente.","Quand la crue est arrivée, plusieurs soldats ont bravement sauté dans le torrent pour sauver des gens."],["L7-1140","粪","fèn","N","manure; dung","estiércol; excremento","fumier; excrément","农民把牛粪收集起来，用作田里的肥料。","nóng mín bǎ niú fèn shōu jí qǐ lái yòng zuò tián lǐ de féi liào","The farmers collect cow dung and use it as fertilizer for the fields.","Los campesinos recogen el estiércol de vaca y lo usan como abono para los campos.","Les paysans ramassent la bouse de vache et l'utilisent comme engrais pour les champs."],["L7-1141","粪便","fènbiàn","N","feces; excrement","heces; excrementos","excréments; selles","遛狗的时候，主人应该及时清理宠物的粪便。","liù gǒu de shí hou zhǔ rén yīng gāi jí shí qīng lǐ chǒng wù de fèn biàn","When walking their dogs, owners should clean up after their pets right away.","Al pasear al perro, el dueño debe recoger de inmediato los excrementos de su mascota.","En promenant leur chien, les propriétaires doivent ramasser aussitôt les déjections de leur animal."],["L7-1142","丰富多彩","fēngfù-duōcǎi","","rich and colorful","rico y variado","riche et varié","这座博物馆展示了当地丰富多彩的民俗文化。","zhè zuò bó wù guǎn zhǎn shì le dāng dì fēng fù duō cǎi de mín sú wén huà","This museum showcases the rich and colorful folk culture of the region.","Este museo muestra la rica y variada cultura popular de la región.","Ce musée présente la riche et colorée culture populaire de la région."],["L7-1143","丰厚","fēnghòu","Adj","generous; ample","generoso; abundante","généreux; copieux","这份工作待遇丰厚，吸引了很多求职者。","zhè fèn gōng zuò dài yù fēng hòu xī yǐn le hěn duō qiú zhí zhě","This job offers generous pay and benefits, attracting many applicants.","Este trabajo ofrece un salario y beneficios generosos, y ha atraído a muchos candidatos.","Cet emploi offre une rémunération généreuse et a attiré de nombreux candidats."],["L7-1144","丰满","fēngmǎn","Adj","plump; full-figured","rollizo; relleno","bien en chair; plantureux","这只小鸟的羽毛已经丰满了，很快就能学会飞。","zhè zhī xiǎo niǎo de yǔ máo yǐ jīng fēng mǎn le hěn kuài jiù néng xué huì fēi","This little bird's feathers are already fully grown, and it will soon learn to fly.","A este pajarito ya le crecieron bien las plumas y pronto aprenderá a volar.","Les plumes de ce petit oiseau ont bien poussé, et il apprendra bientôt à voler."],["L7-1145","丰盛","fēngshèng","Adj","sumptuous; rich","abundante; opíparo","somptueux; copieux","除夕晚上，妈妈准备了一桌丰盛的年夜饭。","chú xī wǎn shang mā ma zhǔn bèi le yì zhuō fēng shèng de nián yè fàn","On New Year's Eve, Mom prepared a sumptuous reunion dinner.","En la noche de fin de año, mamá preparó una cena de Año Nuevo suntuosa.","La veille du Nouvel An, maman a préparé un somptueux dîner de réveillon."],["L7-1146","丰硕","fēngshuò","Adj","bountiful; plentiful","abundante; cuantioso","abondant; fructueux","经过三年的努力，这个研究团队取得了丰硕的成果。","jīng guò sān nián de nǔ lì zhè ge yán jiū tuán duì qǔ dé le fēng shuò de chéng guǒ","After three years of hard work, this research team achieved fruitful results.","Tras tres años de esfuerzo, este equipo de investigación obtuvo resultados fructíferos.","Après trois ans d'efforts, cette équipe de recherche a obtenu des résultats fructueux."],["L7-1147","风波","fēngbō","N","disturbance; crisis","disturbio; crisis","remous; crise","一场关于工资的风波，让公司上下人心不安。","yì chǎng guān yú gōng zī de fēng bō ràng gōng sī shàng xià rén xīn bù ān","A dispute over wages left everyone in the company uneasy.","Una disputa por los salarios inquietó a toda la empresa, de arriba abajo.","Une querelle sur les salaires a semé l'inquiétude dans toute l'entreprise."],["L7-1148","风采","fēngcǎi","N","elegant bearing; charm","porte elegante; donaire","allure; prestance","时隔多年，这位老演员依然风采不减。","shí gé duō nián zhè wèi lǎo yǎn yuán yī rán fēng cǎi bù jiǎn","After all these years, this veteran actor has lost none of his charisma.","Pasados tantos años, este veterano actor sigue conservando todo su encanto.","Des années plus tard, ce vieil acteur n'a rien perdu de son éclat."],["L7-1149","风餐露宿","fēngcān-lùsù","","to rough it outdoors","vivir a la intemperie","vivre à la dure","为了拍到雪豹，摄影师在高原上风餐露宿了一个多月。","wèi le pāi dào xuě bào shè yǐng shī zài gāo yuán shàng fēng cān lù sù le yí ge duō yuè","To photograph snow leopards, the photographer roughed it on the plateau for over a month.","Para fotografiar al leopardo de las nieves, el fotógrafo pasó más de un mes a la intemperie en la meseta.","Pour photographier la panthère des neiges, le photographe a dormi à la belle étoile sur le plateau pendant plus d'un mois."],["L7-1150","风范","fēngfàn","N","demeanor; style","porte; estilo","allure; manières","他待人谦和，处事公正，很有长者风范。","tā dài rén qiān hé chǔ shì gōng zhèng hěn yǒu zhǎng zhě fēng fàn","He is modest toward others and fair in his dealings, with the bearing of a respected elder.","Es humilde con los demás y justo en su proceder, con el porte de un anciano respetable.","Il est modeste envers les autres et équitable dans sa conduite, avec toute l'allure d'un aîné respecté."],["L7-1151","风风雨雨","fēngfēngyǔyǔ","N","ups and downs; hardships","altibajos; vicisitudes","hauts et bas; épreuves","这对老夫妻一起经历了五十年的风风雨雨。","zhè duì lǎo fū qī yì qǐ jīng lì le wǔ shí nián de fēng fēng yǔ yǔ","This old couple have been through fifty years of ups and downs together.","Este anciano matrimonio ha pasado junto cincuenta años de altibajos.","Ce vieux couple a traversé ensemble cinquante ans de joies et d'épreuves."],["L7-1152","风和日丽","fēnghé-rìlì","","fine sunny weather","buen tiempo soleado","temps doux et ensoleillé","这个周末风和日丽，正是去公园野餐的好时候。","zhè ge zhōu mò fēng hé rì lì zhèng shì qù gōng yuán yě cān de hǎo shí hou","This weekend the weather is mild and sunny, just right for a picnic in the park.","Este fin de semana hace un día soleado y templado, ideal para hacer un picnic en el parque.","Ce week-end, il fait un temps doux et ensoleillé, idéal pour pique-niquer au parc."],["L7-1153","风浪","fēnglàng","N","wind and waves; hardship","oleaje; adversidades","vents et vagues; épreuves","在风浪中，经验丰富的舵手稳稳地把住了方向。","zài fēng làng zhōng jīng yàn fēng fù de duò shǒu wěn wěn de bǎ zhù le fāng xiàng","In the wind and waves, the experienced helmsman steadily held the course.","En medio del viento y las olas, el timonel experimentado mantuvo el rumbo con firmeza.","Dans le vent et la houle, le timonier expérimenté a tenu fermement le cap."],["L7-1154","风力","fēnglì","N","wind power; wind force","fuerza del viento; energía eólica","force du vent; énergie éolienne","这一带风力强劲，很适合建设风力发电站。","zhè yí dài fēng lì qiáng jìng hěn shì hé jiàn shè fēng lì fā diàn zhàn","The wind here is strong, which makes the area well suited to building wind power stations.","En esta zona el viento es fuerte, por lo que es muy adecuada para construir centrales eólicas.","Le vent est fort dans cette région, qui convient donc très bien à la construction de centrales éoliennes."],["L7-1155","风流","fēngliú","Adj","romantic; talented; dashing","romántico; talentoso; galante","romantique; brillant; galant","这位诗人才华横溢，是当时有名的风流才子。","zhè wèi shī rén cái huá héng yì shì dāng shí yǒu míng de fēng liú cái zǐ","This poet was brilliantly gifted and a famous free-spirited scholar of his day.","Este poeta era de un talento desbordante y un célebre erudito de espíritu libre de su época.","Ce poète, d'un talent débordant, était un lettré libre et fringant réputé de son temps."],["L7-1156","风貌","fēngmào","N","style; features","aspecto; fisonomía","style; physionomie","这条老街至今保留着上世纪初的建筑风貌。","zhè tiáo lǎo jiē zhì jīn bǎo liú zhe shàng shì jì chū de jiàn zhù fēng mào","This old street still retains the architectural style of the early twentieth century.","Esta antigua calle conserva todavía el aspecto arquitectónico de principios del siglo pasado.","Cette vieille rue conserve encore l'aspect architectural du début du siècle dernier."],["L7-1157","风气","fēngqì","N","general mood; common practice","ambiente social; costumbre","climat social; usage","这个班的学习风气很好，同学们都很用功。","zhè ge bān de xué xí fēng qì hěn hǎo tóng xué men dōu hěn yòng gōng","This class has a very good study atmosphere; the students all work hard.","Esta clase tiene un excelente ambiente de estudio y los compañeros se esfuerzan mucho.","Cette classe a un très bon climat d'étude, et tous les élèves travaillent dur."],["L7-1158","风情","fēngqíng","N","charm; amorous feelings","encanto; coquetería","charme; séduction","这座海边小城充满了浓郁的异国风情。","zhè zuò hǎi biān xiǎo chéng chōng mǎn le nóng yù de yì guó fēng qíng","This seaside town is full of exotic charm.","Esta ciudad costera rebosa de un intenso aire exótico.","Cette petite ville balnéaire est empreinte d'un fort parfum d'exotisme."],["L7-1159","风趣","fēngqù","N","humor; wit","humor; ingenio","humour; esprit","这部电影的对白幽默风趣，观众笑声不断。","zhè bù diàn yǐng de duì bái yōu mò fēng qù guān zhòng xiào shēng bú duàn","The dialogue in this film is witty and humorous, and the audience kept laughing.","Los diálogos de esta película son graciosos y divertidos, y el público no dejó de reír.","Les dialogues de ce film sont drôles et pleins d'esprit, et le public n'a cessé de rire."],["L7-1160","风沙","fēngshā","N","sandstorm; wind-blown sand","tormenta de arena","tempête de sable","春天这里风沙很大，出门最好戴上口罩。","chūn tiān zhè lǐ fēng shā hěn dà chū mén zuì hǎo dài shàng kǒu zhào","In spring there's a lot of wind-blown sand here, so it's best to wear a mask when you go out.","En primavera aquí hay mucho viento con arena, así que conviene ponerse una mascarilla al salir.","Au printemps, il y a beaucoup de vent chargé de sable ici ; il vaut mieux porter un masque en sortant."],["L7-1161","风尚","fēngshàng","N","current fashion; custom","moda; costumbre","mode; coutume","勤俭节约正在成为年轻人中的新风尚。","qín jiǎn jié yuē zhèng zài chéng wéi nián qīng rén zhōng de xīn fēng shàng","Thrift is becoming a new trend among young people.","La laboriosidad y el ahorro se están convirtiendo en una nueva moda entre los jóvenes.","La frugalité et l'économie deviennent une nouvelle tendance chez les jeunes."],["L7-1162","风水","fēngshuǐ","N","feng shui","feng shui","feng shui","老人们盖房子之前，总要请人看看风水。","lǎo rén men gài fáng zi zhī qián zǒng yào qǐng rén kàn kan fēng shuǐ","Before building a house, older people always ask someone to check its feng shui.","Antes de construir una casa, los mayores siempre piden que alguien consulte el feng shui.","Avant de construire une maison, les personnes âgées font toujours consulter quelqu'un sur le feng shui."],["L7-1163","风味","fēngwèi","N","flavor; local style","sabor; estilo típico","saveur; goût local","这家小店的烤鸭很有地方风味，吸引了不少游客。","zhè jiā xiǎo diàn de kǎo yā hěn yǒu dì fāng fēng wèi xī yǐn le bù shǎo yóu kè","The roast duck at this little shop has a distinctive local flavor and attracts many tourists.","El pato asado de esta pequeña tienda tiene un auténtico sabor regional y atrae a muchos turistas.","Le canard laqué de cette petite échoppe a un fort goût du terroir et attire de nombreux touristes."],["L7-1164","风雨","fēngyǔ","N","wind and rain; hardships","viento y lluvia; adversidades","vent et pluie; épreuves","任外面风雨多大，屋里也温暖如春。","rèn wài miàn fēng yǔ duō dà wū lǐ yě wēn nuǎn rú chūn","No matter how fierce the wind and rain are outside, it is as warm as spring indoors.","Por muy fuertes que sean el viento y la lluvia afuera, adentro hace un calor primaveral.","Quelle que soit la violence du vent et de la pluie dehors, il fait doux comme au printemps à l'intérieur."],["L7-1165","风云","fēngyún","N","unstable situation; turbulent events","situación convulsa; vicisitudes","situation instable; bouleversements","这位企业家曾经是商界的风云人物。","zhè wèi qǐ yè jiā céng jīng shì shāng jiè de fēng yún rén wù","This entrepreneur was once a high-profile figure in the business world.","Este empresario fue en su día una figura destacada del mundo de los negocios.","Cet entrepreneur a été autrefois une figure marquante du monde des affaires."],["L7-1166","风筝","fēngzheng","N","kite","cometa","cerf-volant","春天到了，广场上有很多人在放风筝。","chūn tiān dào le guǎng chǎng shàng yǒu hěn duō rén zài fàng fēng zheng","Spring is here, and lots of people are flying kites in the square.","Llegó la primavera y mucha gente está volando cometas en la plaza.","Le printemps est arrivé, et beaucoup de gens font voler des cerfs-volants sur la place."],["L7-1167","封顶","fēngdǐng","V","to top out; to cap","rematar (la obra); poner tope","achever le toit; plafonner","这座摩天大楼昨天顺利封顶，预计明年投入使用。","zhè zuò mó tiān dà lóu zuó tiān shùn lì fēng dǐng yù jì míng nián tóu rù shǐ yòng","This skyscraper was successfully topped out yesterday and is expected to open next year.","Este rascacielos terminó ayer su estructura sin contratiempos y se prevé que entre en funcionamiento el año que viene.","Ce gratte-ciel a vu hier son gros œuvre s'achever sans encombre et devrait entrer en service l'an prochain."],["L7-1168","封建","fēngjiàn","N/Adj","feudal; feudalism","feudal; feudalismo","féodal; féodalisme","这部小说描写了封建家庭中年轻人的悲剧。","zhè bù xiǎo shuō miáo xiě le fēng jiàn jiā tíng zhōng nián qīng rén de bēi jù","This novel depicts the tragedy of young people in a feudal family.","Esta novela describe la tragedia de los jóvenes en una familia feudal.","Ce roman décrit la tragédie des jeunes gens dans une famille féodale."],["L7-1169","封面","fēngmiàn","N","cover (of a publication)","portada","couverture","这本杂志的封面设计得很有创意。","zhè běn zá zhì de fēng miàn shè jì de hěn yǒu chuàng yì","The cover of this magazine is very creatively designed.","La portada de esta revista está diseñada con mucha creatividad.","La couverture de ce magazine est conçue avec beaucoup de créativité."],["L7-1170","封锁","fēngsuǒ","V","to blockade; to seal off","bloquear; cerrar","bloquer; boucler","事故发生后，警方立即封锁了现场。","shì gù fā shēng hòu jǐng fāng lì jí fēng suǒ le xiàn chǎng","After the accident, police immediately sealed off the scene.","Tras el accidente, la policía acordonó de inmediato la zona.","Après l'accident, la police a aussitôt bouclé les lieux."],["L7-1171","疯子","fēngzi","N","madman; lunatic","loco; lunático","fou; dément","大家都说他是疯子，竟然一个人骑车去了西藏。","dà jiā dōu shuō tā shì fēng zi jìng rán yí ge rén qí chē qù le xī zàng","Everyone said he was crazy—he actually cycled to Tibet on his own.","Todos decían que estaba loco: ¡se fue en bicicleta él solo hasta el Tíbet!","Tout le monde disait qu'il était fou : il est même allé tout seul au Tibet à vélo !"],["L7-1172","峰回路转","fēnghuí-lùzhuǎn","","a sudden turn for the better","giro inesperado hacia lo mejor","retournement de situation favorable","山路峰回路转，转过一个弯，眼前突然出现了一个美丽的湖泊。","shān lù fēng huí lù zhuǎn zhuǎn guò yí ge wān yǎn qián tū rán chū xiàn le yí ge měi lì de hú pō","The mountain road wound around the peaks, and after one bend, a beautiful lake suddenly appeared before us.","El camino de montaña serpenteaba entre los picos y, al doblar una curva, apareció de pronto ante nosotros un hermoso lago.","Le chemin de montagne serpentait entre les pics, et, au détour d'un virage, un beau lac est soudain apparu devant nous."],["L7-1173","蜂蜜","fēngmì","N","honey","miel","miel","这家店卖的蜂蜜里掺了糖水，被顾客投诉了。","zhè jiā diàn mài de fēng mì lǐ chān le táng shuǐ bèi gù kè tóu sù le","The honey sold by this shop had been mixed with sugar water, and customers complained about it.","La miel que vendía esta tienda estaba mezclada con agua azucarada y los clientes se quejaron.","Le miel vendu par ce magasin était coupé d'eau sucrée, et des clients ont porté plainte."],["L7-1174","逢","féng","V","to meet; to come across","encontrar; topar con","rencontrer; tomber sur","爷爷逢人就说，他的孙子考上了名牌大学。","yé ye féng rén jiù shuō tā de sūn zi kǎo shàng le míng pái dà xué","Grandpa tells everyone he meets that his grandson got into a top university.","El abuelo se lo cuenta a todo el que encuentra: su nieto entró a una universidad de prestigio.","Grand-père le dit à tous ceux qu'il croise : son petit-fils est entré dans une grande université."],["L7-1175","缝","féng","V","to sew; to stitch","coser","coudre","衬衫上掉了一颗纽扣，我得找针线缝上。","chèn shān shàng diào le yì kē niǔ kòu wǒ děi zhǎo zhēn xiàn féng shàng","A button fell off my shirt, so I need a needle and thread to sew it back on.","Se le cayó un botón a la camisa; tengo que buscar aguja e hilo para coserlo.","Un bouton est tombé de ma chemise ; il faut que je trouve une aiguille et du fil pour le recoudre."],["L7-1176","缝合","fénghé","V","to suture; to sew up","suturar; coser","suturer; recoudre","医生给他的伤口缝合了五针。","yī shēng gěi tā de shāng kǒu féng hé le wǔ zhēn","The doctor stitched his wound with five stitches.","El médico le suturó la herida con cinco puntos.","Le médecin lui a recousu la plaie avec cinq points de suture."],["L7-1177","讽刺","fěngcì","V","to satirize; irony","satirizar; ironía","ridiculiser; ironie","这个故事讽刺了商人贪婪的本性。","zhè ge gù shi fěng cì le shāng rén tān lán de běn xìng","This story satirizes the merchant's greedy nature.","Este cuento satiriza la codicia innata de los comerciantes.","Cette histoire tourne en dérision la cupidité naturelle des marchands."],["L7-1178","凤凰","fènghuáng","N","phoenix","fénix","phénix","传说中，凤凰是一种象征吉祥的神鸟。","chuán shuō zhōng fèng huáng shì yì zhǒng xiàng zhēng jí xiáng de shén niǎo","In legend, the phoenix is a sacred bird that symbolizes good fortune.","Según la leyenda, el fénix es un ave sagrada que simboliza la buena fortuna.","Dans la légende, le phénix est un oiseau sacré symbolisant la bonne fortune."],["L7-1179","缝","fèng","N","seam; crack","costura; grieta","couture; fente","衬衫上掉了一颗纽扣，我得找针线缝上。","chèn shān shàng diào le yì kē niǔ kòu wǒ děi zhǎo zhēn xiàn féng shàng","A button fell off my shirt, so I need a needle and thread to sew it back on.","Se le cayó un botón a la camisa; tengo que buscar aguja e hilo para coserlo.","Un bouton est tombé de ma chemise ; il faut que je trouve une aiguille et du fil pour le recoudre."],["L7-1180","否决","fǒujué","V","to veto; to reject","vetar; rechazar","opposer son veto; rejeter","这项提案在会议上被大多数代表否决了。","zhè xiàng tí àn zài huì yì shàng bèi dà duō shù dài biǎo fǒu jué le","This proposal was voted down by most of the delegates at the meeting.","Esta propuesta fue rechazada en la reunión por la mayoría de los delegados.","Cette proposition a été rejetée lors de la réunion par la plupart des délégués."],["L7-1181","孵化","fūhuà","V","to incubate; to hatch","incubar; empollar","couver; incuber","这些小鸡是用孵化器孵化出来的。","zhè xiē xiǎo jī shì yòng fū huà qì fū huà chū lái de","These chicks were hatched in an incubator.","Estos pollitos nacieron en una incubadora.","Ces poussins ont éclos dans une couveuse."],["L7-1182","敷","fū","V","to apply; to spread","aplicar; extender","appliquer; étaler","脚扭伤以后，要先用冰袋敷一敷，减轻肿胀。","jiǎo niǔ shāng yǐ hòu yào xiān yòng bīng dài fū yi fū jiǎn qīng zhǒng zhàng","After spraining your ankle, apply an ice pack first to reduce the swelling.","Después de torcerse el tobillo, lo primero es aplicar una bolsa de hielo para reducir la hinchazón.","Après une entorse à la cheville, il faut d'abord appliquer une poche de glace pour réduire le gonflement."],["L7-1183","扶持","fúchí","V","to support; to help","apoyar; ayudar","soutenir; aider","政府出台政策，大力扶持小微企业发展。","zhèng fǔ chū tái zhèng cè dà lì fú chí xiǎo wēi qǐ yè fā zhǎn","The government introduced policies to vigorously support the development of small businesses.","El gobierno emitió políticas para apoyar con fuerza el desarrollo de las pequeñas y microempresas.","Le gouvernement a adopté des politiques pour soutenir vigoureusement le développement des petites et microentreprises."],["L7-1184","服饰","fúshì","N","apparel; clothing","vestimenta; atuendo","vêtements; parure","这个博物馆展出了各个朝代的传统服饰。","zhè ge bó wù guǎn zhǎn chū le gè gè cháo dài de chuán tǒng fú shì","This museum displays traditional clothing from various dynasties.","Este museo exhibe la indumentaria tradicional de diversas dinastías.","Ce musée expose des costumes traditionnels de différentes dynasties."],["L7-1185","服务器","fúwùqì","N","server","servidor","serveur","为了排查故障，工程师逐一核对了服务器的运行日志。","wèi le pái chá gù zhàng gōng chéng shī zhú yī hé duì le fú wù qì de yùn xíng rì zhì","To troubleshoot the fault, the engineer checked the server's operating logs one by one.","Para localizar la falla, el ingeniero revisó uno por uno los registros de funcionamiento del servidor.","Pour diagnostiquer la panne, l'ingénieur a vérifié un à un les journaux de fonctionnement du serveur."],["L7-1186","服用","fúyòng","V","to take (medicine)","tomar (medicina)","prendre (un médicament)","这种药必须饭后服用，每天三次。","zhè zhǒng yào bì xū fàn hòu fú yòng měi tiān sān cì","This medicine must be taken after meals, three times a day.","Este medicamento debe tomarse después de las comidas, tres veces al día.","Ce médicament doit être pris après les repas, trois fois par jour."],["L7-1187","俘获","fúhuò","V","to capture","capturar","capturer","她用真诚和善良俘获了大家的心。","tā yòng zhēn chéng hé shàn liáng fú huò le dà jiā de xīn","She won everyone's hearts with her sincerity and kindness.","Conquistó el corazón de todos con su sinceridad y su bondad.","Elle a conquis le cœur de tous par sa sincérité et sa gentillesse."],["L7-1188","俘虏","fúlǔ","N","captive; prisoner of war","prisionero; cautivo","prisonnier; captif","战争结束后，双方交换了俘虏。","zhàn zhēng jié shù hòu shuāng fāng jiāo huàn le fú lǔ","After the war ended, the two sides exchanged prisoners.","Terminada la guerra, ambos bandos intercambiaron prisioneros.","Une fois la guerre terminée, les deux camps ont échangé leurs prisonniers."],["L7-1189","浮力","fúlì","N","buoyancy","flotabilidad","flottabilité","木头比水轻，在水的浮力作用下能漂在水面上。","mù tou bǐ shuǐ qīng zài shuǐ de fú lì zuò yòng xià néng piāo zài shuǐ miàn shàng","Wood is lighter than water, so buoyancy lets it float on the surface.","La madera pesa menos que el agua y, por la flotabilidad, puede flotar en la superficie.","Le bois est plus léger que l'eau et, grâce à la poussée d'Archimède, il peut flotter à la surface."],["L7-1190","浮现","fúxiàn","V","to emerge; to appear","aflorar; surgir","apparaître; émerger","那天的情景至今还常常浮现在我的脑海中。","nà tiān de qíng jǐng zhì jīn hái cháng cháng fú xiàn zài wǒ de nǎo hǎi zhōng","The scene from that day still often comes back to my mind.","La escena de aquel día todavía me viene a la mente con frecuencia.","La scène de ce jour-là me revient encore souvent à l'esprit."],["L7-1191","浮躁","fúzào","Adj","restless; impetuous","inquieto; impulsivo","agité; impétueux","现在社会节奏快，很多人变得浮躁，难以静下心来读书。","xiàn zài shè huì jié zòu kuài hěn duō rén biàn de fú zào nán yǐ jìng xià xīn lái dú shū","Life moves so fast these days that many people have become restless and find it hard to settle down and read.","Con el ritmo acelerado de la sociedad actual, mucha gente se ha vuelto inquieta y le cuesta sosegarse para leer.","Le rythme de la société actuelle est si rapide que beaucoup de gens sont devenus agités et ont du mal à se poser pour lire."],["L7-1192","辐射","fúshè","V","radiation","radiación","rayonnement","手机辐射对人体的影响，至今仍有争议。","shǒu jī fú shè duì rén tǐ de yǐng xiǎng zhì jīn réng yǒu zhēng yì","The effect of mobile phone radiation on the human body is still debated.","El efecto de la radiación de los teléfonos móviles en el cuerpo humano sigue siendo objeto de debate.","L'effet des rayonnements des téléphones portables sur le corps humain fait encore débat."],["L7-1193","福气","fúqi","N","good fortune","buena fortuna; suerte","bonne fortune; chance","儿女都这么孝顺，您真有福气。","ér nǚ dōu zhè me xiào shùn nín zhēn yǒu fú qi","Your children are all so devoted to you—you're truly blessed.","Sus hijos son todos tan filiales; usted sí que tiene suerte.","Vos enfants sont tous si dévoués ; vous avez vraiment de la chance."],["L7-1194","抚摸","fǔmō","V","to caress; to stroke","acariciar","caresser","她轻轻抚摸着小狗的头，小狗舒服地闭上了眼睛。","tā qīng qīng fǔ mō zhe xiǎo gǒu de tóu xiǎo gǒu shū fu de bì shàng le yǎn jing","She gently stroked the puppy's head, and it closed its eyes contentedly.","Acarició suavemente la cabeza del perrito, y este cerró los ojos con placer.","Elle a caressé doucement la tête du chiot, qui a fermé les yeux de bien-être."],["L7-1195","抚恤","fǔxù","V","to give relief to victims' families","indemnizar a los familiares","indemniser les proches","政府向遇难矿工的家属发放了抚恤金。","zhèng fǔ xiàng yù nàn kuàng gōng de jiā shǔ fā fàng le fǔ xù jīn","The government paid compensation to the families of the miners who died.","El gobierno entregó una indemnización a las familias de los mineros fallecidos.","Le gouvernement a versé des indemnités aux familles des mineurs décédés."],["L7-1196","抚养","fǔyǎng","V","to raise; to bring up","criar; mantener","élever; subvenir aux besoins de","她独自抚养孩子多年，却很少向别人诉说生活的艰辛。","tā dú zì fǔ yǎng hái zi duō nián què hěn shǎo xiàng bié rén sù shuō shēng huó de jiān xīn","She raised her child alone for years, but seldom spoke to others about life's hardships.","Crió sola a su hijo durante muchos años, pero rara vez le contó a nadie las dificultades de la vida.","Elle a élevé seule son enfant pendant des années, mais elle parlait rarement à autrui des difficultés de sa vie."],["L7-1197","抚养费","fǔyǎngfèi","N","child support","pensión alimenticia","pension alimentaire","离婚后，孩子的父亲每月按时支付抚养费。","lí hūn hòu hái zi de fù qīn měi yuè àn shí zhī fù fǔ yǎng fèi","After the divorce, the child's father pays child support on time every month.","Después del divorcio, el padre del niño paga puntualmente la pensión alimenticia cada mes.","Depuis le divorce, le père de l'enfant verse la pension alimentaire à temps chaque mois."],["L7-1198","斧子","fǔzi","N","axe","hacha","hache","他用斧子把木头劈成小块，准备生火。","tā yòng fǔ zi bǎ mù tou pī chéng xiǎo kuài zhǔn bèi shēng huǒ","He split the wood into small pieces with an axe to start a fire.","Partió la leña en trozos pequeños con un hacha para encender el fuego.","Il a fendu le bois en petits morceaux à la hache pour allumer un feu."],["L7-1199","俯首","fǔshǒu","V","to bow one's head","inclinar la cabeza","baisser la tête","面对确凿的证据，他只好俯首认罪。","miàn duì què záo de zhèng jù tā zhǐ hǎo fǔ shǒu rèn zuì","Faced with conclusive evidence, he had no choice but to bow his head and confess.","Ante las pruebas irrefutables, no le quedó más remedio que agachar la cabeza y confesar su culpa.","Face à des preuves irréfutables, il n'a eu d'autre choix que de baisser la tête et d'avouer."],["L7-1200","辅导","fǔdǎo","V","to tutor; to coach","asesorar; dar clases particulares","encadrer; donner des cours","周末她给邻居家的孩子辅导数学。","zhōu mò tā gěi lín jū jiā de hái zi fǔ dǎo shù xué","On weekends she tutors the neighbors' child in math.","Los fines de semana da clases de refuerzo de matemáticas al hijo de los vecinos.","Le week-end, elle donne des cours de soutien en mathématiques à l'enfant des voisins."],["L7-1201","腐败","fǔbài","Adj","corruption; rotten","corrupción; podrido","corruption; pourri","政府加大力度打击腐败，查处了一批官员。","zhèng fǔ jiā dà lì dù dǎ jī fǔ bài chá chǔ le yì pī guān yuán","The government stepped up its fight against corruption, investigating a number of officials and taking action against them.","El gobierno intensificó la lucha contra la corrupción e investigó y sancionó a varios funcionarios.","Le gouvernement a renforcé sa lutte contre la corruption et a enquêté sur un certain nombre de fonctionnaires, qu'il a sanctionnés."],["L7-1202","腐化","fǔhuà","V","to decay; to become corrupt","corromperse; descomponerse","se corrompre; pourrir","权力如果缺乏监督，就很容易使人腐化。","quán lì rú guǒ quē fá jiān dū jiù hěn róng yì shǐ rén fǔ huà","Without oversight, power easily corrupts people.","Si el poder carece de supervisión, es muy fácil que corrompa a las personas.","Sans contrôle, le pouvoir corrompt facilement les gens."],["L7-1203","腐烂","fǔlàn","V/Adj","to rot; to decay","pudrirse; descomponerse","pourrir; se décomposer","这些水果放得太久，已经开始腐烂了。","zhè xiē shuǐ guǒ fàng de tài jiǔ yǐ jīng kāi shǐ fǔ làn le","This fruit has been left out too long and has started to rot.","Estas frutas llevan demasiado tiempo guardadas y ya empezaron a pudrirse.","Ces fruits sont restés trop longtemps et ont commencé à pourrir."],["L7-1204","腐蚀","fǔshí","V","to corrode; corrosion","corroer; corrosión","corroder; corrosion","海水会腐蚀船体，所以船要定期刷漆。","hǎi shuǐ huì fǔ shí chuán tǐ suǒ yǐ chuán yào dìng qī shuā qī","Seawater corrodes a ship's hull, so ships need to be repainted regularly.","El agua de mar corroe el casco de los barcos, por lo que hay que repintarlos periódicamente.","L'eau de mer corrode la coque des bateaux, qui doivent donc être repeints régulièrement."],["L7-1205","腐朽","fǔxiǔ","Adj","rotten; decadent","podrido; decadente","pourri; décadent","这座老木桥的桥板已经腐朽，不能再走人了。","zhè zuò lǎo mù qiáo de qiáo bǎn yǐ jīng fǔ xiǔ bù néng zài zǒu rén le","The planks of this old wooden bridge have rotted and are no longer safe to walk on.","Las tablas de este viejo puente de madera están podridas y ya no se puede caminar por él.","Les planches de ce vieux pont de bois sont pourries et on ne peut plus l'emprunter."],["L7-1206","付费","fùfèi","V","to pay","pagar","payer","这个软件的基础功能免费，高级功能需要付费。","zhè ge ruǎn jiàn de jī chǔ gōng néng miǎn fèi gāo jí gōng néng xū yào fù fèi","The basic features of this software are free, but the advanced features require payment.","Las funciones básicas de este software son gratuitas, pero las avanzadas requieren pago.","Les fonctions de base de ce logiciel sont gratuites, mais les fonctions avancées sont payantes."],["L7-1207","付款","fùkuǎn","V","to pay; payment","pagar; pago","payer; paiement","现在很少有人用支票付款了。","xiàn zài hěn shǎo yǒu rén yòng zhī piào fù kuǎn le","Nowadays few people pay by check.","Hoy en día muy poca gente paga con cheque.","De nos jours, peu de gens paient par chèque."],["L7-1208","负面","fùmiàn","Adj","negative","negativo","négatif","这条新闻给公司带来了很大的负面影响。","zhè tiáo xīn wén gěi gōng sī dài lái le hěn dà de fù miàn yǐng xiǎng","This news has had a strongly negative impact on the company.","Esta noticia tuvo un gran impacto negativo en la empresa.","Cette nouvelle a eu un impact très négatif sur l'entreprise."],["L7-1209","负有","fùyǒu","","to bear (responsibility)","tener (responsabilidad)","être responsable de","作为监护人，父母对孩子负有教育的责任。","zuò wéi jiān hù rén fù mǔ duì hái zi fù yǒu jiào yù de zé rèn","As guardians, parents bear responsibility for their children's education.","Como tutores legales, los padres tienen la responsabilidad de educar a sus hijos.","En tant que tuteurs, les parents ont la responsabilité d'éduquer leurs enfants."],["L7-1210","附","fù","V","to attach; to append","adjuntar; añadir","joindre; annexer","申请表后面请附上一张近期的照片。","shēn qǐng biǎo hòu miàn qǐng fù shàng yì zhāng jìn qī de zhào piàn","Please attach a recent photo to the back of the application form.","Adjunte al reverso del formulario de solicitud una foto reciente.","Veuillez joindre au dos du formulaire de demande une photo récente."],["L7-1211","附带","fùdài","V/Adj","additional; incidentally","adicional; de paso","accessoire; incidemment","这台电脑附带一年的免费维修服务。","zhè tái diàn nǎo fù dài yì nián de miǎn fèi wéi xiū fú wù","This computer comes with a year of free repair service.","Esta computadora incluye un año de servicio de reparación gratuito.","Cet ordinateur est livré avec un an de service de réparation gratuit."],["L7-1212","附和","fùhè","V","to echo; to chime in","hacer eco; secundar","abonder dans le sens de","他从来没有自己的主见，总是附和别人的意见。","tā cóng lái méi yǒu zì jǐ de zhǔ jiàn zǒng shì fù hè bié rén de yì jiàn","He never has his own opinion and always just echoes what others say.","Nunca tiene criterio propio y siempre se suma a la opinión de los demás.","Il n'a jamais d'opinion personnelle et se range toujours à l'avis des autres."],["L7-1213","附加","fùjiā","V","additional; to attach","adicional; añadir","supplémentaire; ajouter","企业不能一味依赖低价竞争，而应通过研发提升产品的附加值。","qǐ yè bù néng yí wèi yī lài dī jià jìng zhēng ér yīng tōng guò yán fā tí shēng chǎn pǐn de fù jiā zhí","Companies should not rely solely on price competition, but should increase the added value of their products through research and development.","Las empresas no pueden depender solo de la competencia por precios bajos; deben aumentar el valor agregado de sus productos mediante la investigación y el desarrollo.","Les entreprises ne doivent pas s'en remettre uniquement à la concurrence par les prix, mais accroître la valeur ajoutée de leurs produits par la recherche et le développement."],["L7-1214","附属","fùshǔ","V/Adj","affiliated; subsidiary","afiliado; subsidiario","affilié; subsidiaire","她在医科大学的附属医院当护士。","tā zài yī kē dà xué de fù shǔ yī yuàn dāng hù shi","She works as a nurse at the hospital affiliated with the medical university.","Trabaja como enfermera en el hospital universitario de la facultad de medicina.","Elle est infirmière à l'hôpital rattaché à l'université de médecine."],["L7-1215","赴","fù","V","to go to; to attend","ir a; asistir a","se rendre à; assister à","他明天将赴上海参加一个国际会议。","tā míng tiān jiāng fù shàng hǎi cān jiā yí ge guó jì huì yì","Tomorrow he will go to Shanghai to attend an international conference.","Mañana viajará a Shanghái para asistir a una conferencia internacional.","Demain, il se rendra à Shanghai pour assister à une conférence internationale."],["L7-1216","复查","fùchá","V","to re-examine; to check again","volver a examinar; revisar","réexaminer; revérifier","病情虽然有所缓解，他仍然按照医嘱定期复查，没有擅自停药。","bìng qíng suī rán yǒu suǒ huǎn jiě tā réng rán àn zhào yī zhǔ dìng qī fù chá méi yǒu shàn zì tíng yào","Although his condition had improved, he continued regular follow-up examinations as instructed and did not stop his medication on his own.","Aunque su enfermedad había mejorado, siguió acudiendo periódicamente a sus controles según las indicaciones del médico y no dejó la medicación por su cuenta.","Bien que son état se soit amélioré, il a continué de se faire examiner régulièrement selon l'ordonnance du médecin et n'a pas arrêté son traitement de son propre chef."],["L7-1217","复发","fùfā","V","to recur; to relapse","reaparecer; recaer","récidiver; rechuter","医生提醒他按时吃药，否则旧病可能复发。","yī shēng tí xǐng tā àn shí chī yào fǒu zé jiù bìng kě néng fù fā","The doctor reminded him to take his medicine on time, or his previous illness might recur.","El médico le recordó que tomara su medicina a tiempo, o su antigua enfermedad podría reaparecer.","Le médecin lui a rappelé de prendre ses médicaments à l'heure, faute de quoi sa maladie pourrait récidiver."],["L7-1218","复合","fùhé","V","to reconcile; to get back together","reconciliarse; volver (con la pareja)","se remettre ensemble","他们分手半年以后，又复合了。","tā men fēn shǒu bàn nián yǐ hòu yòu fù hé le","Half a year after breaking up, they got back together.","Medio año después de separarse, volvieron a estar juntos.","Six mois après leur rupture, ils se sont remis ensemble."],["L7-1219","复活","fùhuó","V","to revive; to resurrect","resucitar; revivir","ressusciter; revivre","每年春天，冬眠的动物们又复活了一般，重新活跃起来。","měi nián chūn tiān dōng mián de dòng wù men yòu fù huó le yì bān chóng xīn huó yuè qǐ lái","Every spring, hibernating animals become active again as if they had come back to life.","Cada primavera, los animales que hibernaban vuelven a la actividad como si hubieran resucitado.","Chaque printemps, les animaux en hibernation redeviennent actifs comme s'ils ressuscitaient."],["L7-1220","复兴","fùxīng","V","to revive; revival","renacer; renacimiento","renaître; renouveau","这座城市正在推动老工业区的复兴。","zhè zuò chéng shì zhèng zài tuī dòng lǎo gōng yè qū de fù xīng","The city is working to revitalize its old industrial district.","Esta ciudad está impulsando la revitalización de su antigua zona industrial.","Cette ville s'emploie à relancer son ancienne zone industrielle."],["L7-1221","复原","fùyuán","","to recover; to restore","recuperarse; restaurar","se rétablir; restaurer","她摔伤的膝盖经过半年的治疗才完全复原。","tā shuāi shāng de xī gài jīng guò bàn nián de zhì liáo cái wán quán fù yuán","Her injured knee took half a year of treatment to fully recover.","La rodilla que se lastimó en la caída tardó medio año de tratamiento en recuperarse por completo.","Son genou blessé dans sa chute a mis six mois de soins à guérir complètement."],["L7-1222","副作用","fùzuòyòng","N","side effect","efecto secundario","effet secondaire","护士仔细核对了处方，又向患者说明了药物可能产生的副作用。","hù shi zǐ xì hé duì le chǔ fāng yòu xiàng huàn zhě shuō míng le yào wù kě néng chǎn shēng de fù zuò yòng","The nurse carefully checked the prescription and explained the medication's possible side effects to the patient.","La enfermera revisó con cuidado la receta y le explicó al paciente los posibles efectos secundarios del medicamento.","L'infirmière a vérifié soigneusement l'ordonnance et a expliqué au patient les effets secondaires possibles du médicament."],["L7-1223","赋予","fùyǔ","V","to endow; to give","conferir; otorgar","conférer; accorder","法律赋予了公民言论自由的权利。","fǎ lǜ fù yǔ le gōng mín yán lùn zì yóu de quán lì","The law grants citizens the right to freedom of speech.","La ley otorga a los ciudadanos el derecho a la libertad de expresión.","La loi accorde aux citoyens le droit à la liberté d'expression."],["L7-1224","富含","fùhán","V","to be rich in","ser rico en","être riche en","深海鱼富含对大脑有益的营养成分。","shēn hǎi yú fù hán duì dà nǎo yǒu yì de yíng yǎng chéng fèn","Deep-sea fish are rich in nutrients that are good for the brain.","Los peces de aguas profundas son ricos en nutrientes beneficiosos para el cerebro.","Les poissons des grands fonds sont riches en nutriments bénéfiques pour le cerveau."],["L7-1225","富豪","fùháo","N","tycoon; wealthy person","magnate; millonario","magnat; richissime","这位富豪把一半财产捐给了教育事业。","zhè wèi fù háo bǎ yí bàn cái chǎn juān gěi le jiào yù shì yè","This tycoon donated half of his fortune to education.","Este multimillonario donó la mitad de su fortuna a la educación.","Ce richissime homme d'affaires a fait don de la moitié de sa fortune à l'éducation."],["L7-1226","富强","fùqiáng","Adj","prosperous and powerful","próspero y poderoso","prospère et puissant","每一代人都在为国家的富强而努力奋斗。","měi yí dài rén dōu zài wèi guó jiā de fù qiáng ér nǔ lì fèn dòu","Every generation strives for the prosperity and strength of the nation.","Cada generación se esfuerza por la prosperidad y el poderío del país.","Chaque génération s'efforce de rendre la nation prospère et puissante."],["L7-1227","富翁","fùwēng","N","rich person; millionaire","rico; millonario","riche; millionnaire","他中了彩票，一夜之间成了百万富翁。","tā zhòng le cǎi piào yí yè zhī jiān chéng le bǎi wàn fù wēng","He won the lottery and became a millionaire overnight.","Ganó la lotería y de la noche a la mañana se volvió millonario.","Il a gagné à la loterie et est devenu millionnaire du jour au lendemain."],["L7-1228","富裕","fùyù","Adj","prosperous; well-off","próspero; acomodado","prospère; aisé","经过多年的发展，村民们的生活越来越富裕了。","jīng guò duō nián de fā zhǎn cūn mín men de shēng huó yuè lái yuè fù yù le","After years of development, the villagers' lives have become more and more prosperous.","Tras años de desarrollo, la vida de los aldeanos es cada vez más próspera.","Après des années de développement, la vie des villageois est de plus en plus aisée."],["L7-1229","富足","fùzú","Adj","plentiful; well-off","abundante; acomodado","abondant; aisé","他们的日子虽然不算富足，但一家人过得很开心。","tā men de rì zi suī rán bú suàn fù zú dàn yì jiā rén guò de hěn kāi xīn","Their life isn't exactly affluent, but the family lives very happily.","Aunque su vida no es precisamente holgada, la familia vive muy contenta.","Leur vie n'est pas vraiment aisée, mais la famille est très heureuse."],["L7-1230","腹部","fùbù","N","abdomen; belly","abdomen; vientre","abdomen; ventre","病人说腹部一直隐隐作痛，医生让他去做个检查。","bìng rén shuō fù bù yì zhí yǐn yǐn zuò tòng yī shēng ràng tā qù zuò gè jiǎn chá","The patient said he had a dull pain in his abdomen, so the doctor sent him for a checkup.","El paciente dijo que sentía un dolor sordo constante en el abdomen y el médico lo mandó a hacerse un examen.","Le patient a dit avoir une douleur sourde persistante au ventre, et le médecin l'a envoyé passer des examens."],["L7-1231","腹泻","fùxiè","V","diarrhea","diarrea","diarrhée","吃了不干净的食物，很容易引起腹泻。","chī le bù gān jìng de shí wù hěn róng yì yǐn qǐ fù xiè","Eating contaminated food can easily cause diarrhea.","Comer alimentos en mal estado puede provocar diarrea con facilidad.","Manger des aliments avariés provoque facilement de la diarrhée."],["L7-1232","覆盖","fùgài","V","to cover","cubrir","couvrir","一夜大雪过后，整个村庄都被白雪覆盖了。","yí yè dà xuě guò hòu zhěng gè cūn zhuāng dōu bèi bái xuě fù gài le","After a night of heavy snow, the whole village was covered in white.","Tras una noche de intensa nevada, todo el pueblo quedó cubierto de blanco.","Après une nuit de fortes chutes de neige, tout le village était recouvert de blanc."],["L7-1233","该","gāi","Pron","should; ought to","deber; tener que","devoir; falloir","天这么晚了，我该回家了。","tiān zhè me wǎn le wǒ gāi huí jiā le","It's so late; I should go home.","Ya es tan tarde que debería irme a casa.","Il est déjà si tard, je dois rentrer."],["L7-1234","改版","gǎibǎn","","to revise (an edition)","revisar (una edición)","réviser (une édition)","这本杂志改版以后，内容和排版都更年轻化了。","zhè běn zá zhì gǎi bǎn yǐ hòu nèi róng hé pái bǎn dōu gèng nián qīng huà le","After its redesign, the magazine's content and layout became more youthful.","Tras el rediseño de la revista, tanto el contenido como la maquetación se volvieron más juveniles.","Depuis la refonte du magazine, son contenu comme sa mise en page sont devenus plus jeunes."],["L7-1235","改编","gǎibiān","V","to adapt; to revise","adaptar; reescribir","adapter; remanier","改编经典并不意味着照搬原作，但也不能抛开作品最核心的精神。","gǎi biān jīng diǎn bìng bú yì wèi zhe zhào bān yuán zuò dàn yě bù néng pāo kāi zuò pǐn zuì hé xīn de jīng shén","Adapting a classic does not mean copying the original exactly, but neither should it abandon the work's central spirit.","Adaptar un clásico no significa copiar el original al pie de la letra, pero tampoco se puede dejar de lado el espíritu central de la obra.","Adapter un classique ne veut pas dire reproduire l'original tel quel, mais on ne peut pas non plus abandonner l'esprit essentiel de l'œuvre."],["L7-1236","改动","gǎidòng","V","to alter; to modify","modificar; cambiar","modifier; changer","合同签了以后，任何一方都不能随意改动条款。","hé tóng qiān le yǐ hòu rèn hé yì fāng dōu bù néng suí yì gǎi dòng tiáo kuǎn","Once the contract is signed, neither party may change its terms at will.","Una vez firmado el contrato, ninguna de las partes puede modificar las cláusulas a su antojo.","Une fois le contrat signé, aucune des parties ne peut en modifier les clauses à sa guise."],["L7-1237","改革开放","gǎigé kāifàng","","reform and opening-up","reforma y apertura","réforme et ouverture","改革开放以后，中国经济进入了快速发展的时期。","gǎi gé kāi fàng yǐ hòu zhōng guó jīng jì jìn rù le kuài sù fā zhǎn de shí qī","After reform and opening up, the Chinese economy entered a period of rapid development.","Después de la reforma y apertura, la economía china entró en un período de rápido desarrollo.","Après la réforme et l'ouverture, l'économie chinoise est entrée dans une période de développement rapide."],["L7-1238","改良","gǎiliáng","V","to improve; to reform","mejorar; reformar","améliorer; réformer","科学家通过改良品种，大大提高了水稻产量。","kē xué jiā tōng guò gǎi liáng pǐn zhǒng dà dà tí gāo le shuǐ dào chǎn liàng","By improving the varieties, scientists greatly increased rice yields.","Los científicos mejoraron las variedades y aumentaron notablemente la producción de arroz.","En améliorant les variétés, les scientifiques ont considérablement augmenté la production de riz."],["L7-1239","改名","gǎimíng","V","to change one's name","cambiar de nombre","changer de nom","这家老字号最近改名了，很多老顾客都不太习惯。","zhè jiā lǎo zì hào zuì jìn gǎi míng le hěn duō lǎo gù kè dōu bú tài xí guàn","This old brand recently changed its name, and many longtime customers aren't used to it.","Esta casa tradicional cambió de nombre hace poco y a muchos clientes de siempre les cuesta acostumbrarse.","Cette maison de longue date a récemment changé de nom, et beaucoup de clients fidèles ont du mal à s'y habituer."],["L7-1240","改日","gǎirì","Adv","another day","otro día","un autre jour","今天太晚了，我们改日再聊吧。","jīn tiān tài wǎn le wǒ men gǎi rì zài liáo ba","It's too late today; let's talk another day.","Hoy ya es muy tarde; mejor charlemos otro día.","Il est trop tard aujourd'hui ; parlons-en un autre jour."],["L7-1241","改为","gǎiwéi","","to change into","cambiar a","changer en","由于天气原因，户外音乐会改为在室内举行。","yóu yú tiān qì yuán yīn hù wài yīn yuè huì gǎi wéi zài shì nèi jǔ xíng","Because of the weather, the outdoor concert has been moved indoors.","Debido al clima, el concierto al aire libre se trasladó a un recinto cerrado.","En raison de la météo, le concert en plein air a été déplacé en salle."],["L7-1242","改邪归正","gǎixié-guīzhèng","","to turn over a new leaf","enmendarse; reformarse","se racheter; changer de vie","他出狱以后改邪归正，开了一家小饭馆，日子过得踏踏实实。","tā chū yù yǐ hòu gǎi xié guī zhèng kāi le yì jiā xiǎo fàn guǎn rì zi guò de tā tā shí shí","After getting out of prison he mended his ways, opened a small restaurant, and now lives a steady life.","Al salir de prisión se reformó, abrió un pequeño restaurante y ahora lleva una vida tranquila y estable.","À sa sortie de prison, il s'est amendé, a ouvert un petit restaurant et mène désormais une vie sans histoires."],["L7-1243","钙","gài","N","calcium","calcio","calcium","老年人容易缺钙，应该多喝牛奶、多晒太阳。","lǎo nián rén róng yì quē gài yīng gāi duō hē niú nǎi duō shài tài yáng","Older people are prone to calcium deficiency and should drink more milk and get more sun.","Las personas mayores tienden a tener falta de calcio, así que deben beber más leche y tomar más el sol.","Les personnes âgées sont sujettes aux carences en calcium et devraient boire plus de lait et s'exposer davantage au soleil."],["L7-1244","盖子","gàizi","N","lid; cover","tapa","couvercle","妈妈用一个盖子把菜罩了起来，免得落灰。","mā ma yòng yí ge gài zi bǎ cài zhào le qǐ lái miǎn de luò huī","Mom covered the food with a lid to keep dust off.","Mamá cubrió la comida con una tapa para que no se llenara de polvo.","Maman a recouvert les plats d'un couvercle pour éviter la poussière."],["L7-1245","概况","gàikuàng","N","general situation; overview","panorama general; resumen","aperçu; situation générale","导游先给我们介绍了一下这座城市的概况。","dǎo yóu xiān gěi wǒ men jiè shào le yí xià zhè zuò chéng shì de gài kuàng","The tour guide first gave us a general overview of the city.","El guía nos dio primero una visión general de la ciudad.","Le guide nous a d'abord présenté un aperçu général de la ville."],["L7-1246","概率","gàilǜ","N","probability","probabilidad","probabilité","连续抛十次硬币都是正面的概率非常小。","lián xù pāo shí cì yìng bì dōu shì zhèng miàn de gài lǜ fēi cháng xiǎo","The probability of a coin landing heads ten times in a row is very small.","La probabilidad de que una moneda salga cara diez veces seguidas es muy pequeña.","La probabilité qu'une pièce tombe dix fois de suite sur pile est très faible."],["L7-1247","概论","gàilùn","N","introduction; outline","introducción; compendio","introduction; aperçu général","这学期我们开了一门心理学概论课。","zhè xué qī wǒ men kāi le yì mén xīn lǐ xué gài lùn kè","This semester we started an introductory course in psychology.","Este semestre abrimos una asignatura de introducción a la psicología.","Ce semestre, nous avons un cours d'introduction à la psychologie."],["L7-1248","干戈","gāngē","N","weapons of war; war","armas; guerra","armes; guerre","经过调解，两家人终于化干戈为玉帛，重归于好。","jīng guò tiáo jiě liǎng jiā rén zhōng yú huà gān gē wéi yù bó chóng guī yú hǎo","After mediation, the two families finally buried the hatchet and made peace.","Tras la mediación, las dos familias por fin dejaron atrás sus diferencias y se reconciliaron.","Grâce à la médiation, les deux familles ont enfin enterré la hache de guerre et se sont réconciliées."],["L7-1249","干旱","gānhàn","Adj","drought; arid","sequía; árido","sécheresse; aride","这场干旱十分持久，农作物大面积减产。","zhè chǎng gān hàn shí fēn chí jiǔ nóng zuò wù dà miàn jī jiǎn chǎn","The drought has lasted a very long time, and crop yields have fallen across large areas.","Esta sequía ha sido muy prolongada y la producción de cultivos ha caído en grandes áreas.","Cette sécheresse a été très longue, et les récoltes ont baissé sur de vastes zones."],["L7-1250","干燥","gānzào","Adj","dry; dull","seco; árido","sec; aride","冬天空气干燥，要注意保护肌肤。","dōng tiān kōng qì gān zào yào zhù yì bǎo hù jī fū","The air is dry in winter, so take care to protect your skin.","En invierno el aire es seco, así que hay que cuidar la piel.","En hiver, l'air est sec, il faut donc bien protéger sa peau."],["L7-1251","甘心","gānxīn","V","to be willing; to resign oneself","conformarse; estar dispuesto","se résigner; consentir","他不甘心就这样认输，决定再试一次。","tā bù gān xīn jiù zhè yàng rèn shū jué dìng zài shì yí cì","He wasn't willing to give up just like that and decided to try once more.","No se resignaba a darse por vencido así como así y decidió intentarlo una vez más.","Il ne voulait pas s'avouer vaincu aussi facilement et a décidé de réessayer."],["L7-1252","肝脏","gānzàng","N","liver","hígado","foie","长期大量饮酒会严重损害肝脏。","cháng qī dà liàng yǐn jiǔ huì yán zhòng sǔn hài gān zàng","Heavy drinking over a long period seriously damages the liver.","Beber mucho alcohol durante mucho tiempo daña gravemente el hígado.","Une forte consommation d'alcool sur une longue période endommage gravement le foie."],["L7-1253","尴尬","gāngà","Adj","awkward; embarrassed","incómodo; avergonzado","gênant; embarrassé","面对记者的刁难，她机智地化解了尴尬。","miàn duì jì zhě de diāo nàn tā jī zhì de huà jiě le gān gà","Faced with a reporter's tough question, she cleverly defused the awkward moment.","Ante las preguntas capciosas del periodista, ella resolvió la situación incómoda con ingenio.","Face aux questions pièges du journaliste, elle a désamorcé le malaise avec intelligence."],["L7-1254","赶赴","gǎnfù","V","to rush to","ir de prisa a","se hâter vers","接到求救电话后，救援队连夜赶赴灾区。","jiē dào qiú jiù diàn huà hòu jiù yuán duì lián yè gǎn fù zāi qū","After receiving the call for help, the rescue team rushed to the disaster area overnight.","Tras recibir la llamada de auxilio, el equipo de rescate se dirigió a toda prisa a la zona del desastre durante la noche.","Après avoir reçu l'appel à l'aide, l'équipe de secours s'est précipitée dans la nuit vers la zone sinistrée."],["L7-1255","赶往","gǎnwǎng","","to hurry to","apresurarse hacia","se hâter vers","他接到电话，随即开车赶往医院。","tā jiē dào diàn huà suí jí kāi chē gǎn wǎng yī yuàn","He got the call and immediately drove to the hospital.","Recibió la llamada e inmediatamente se fue en coche al hospital.","Il a reçu l'appel et s'est aussitôt rendu à l'hôpital en voiture."],["L7-1256","敢情","gǎnqing","Adv","as it turns out; of course","resulta que; desde luego","en fait; bien sûr","我还以为他不来了，敢情他早就到了。","wǒ hái yǐ wéi tā bù lái le gǎn qing tā zǎo jiù dào le","I thought he wasn't coming, but it turns out he'd arrived long ago.","Pensé que ya no vendría; resulta que llegó hace rato.","Je croyais qu'il ne viendrait plus, mais en fait il était arrivé depuis longtemps."],["L7-1257","感","gǎn","Suffix","feeling; to feel","sensación; sentir","sentiment; ressentir","重返母校，他心中有很多感触。","chóng fǎn mǔ xiào tā xīn zhōng yǒu hěn duō gǎn chù","Returning to his old school, he was stirred by many feelings.","Al volver a su antigua escuela, sintió muchas emociones.","De retour dans son ancienne école, il a ressenti beaucoup d'émotions."],["L7-1257#2","责任感","zérèngǎn","N","sense of responsibility","sentido de responsabilidad","sens des responsabilités"],["L7-1258","感触","gǎnchù","N","feelings; emotions","sentimientos; impresión","sentiments; impressions","重返母校，他心中有很多感触。","chóng fǎn mǔ xiào tā xīn zhōng yǒu hěn duō gǎn chù","Returning to his old school, he was stirred by many feelings.","Al volver a su antigua escuela, sintió muchas emociones.","De retour dans son ancienne école, il a ressenti beaucoup d'émotions."],["L7-1259","感恩","gǎn'ēn","","to be grateful","agradecer; estar agradecido","être reconnaissant","我们要怀着感恩的心，回报那些帮助过我们的人。","wǒ men yào huái zhe gǎn ēn de xīn huí bào nà xiē bāng zhù guo wǒ men de rén","We should repay those who have helped us with grateful hearts.","Debemos tener un corazón agradecido y corresponder a quienes nos han ayudado.","Nous devons avoir un cœur reconnaissant et rendre la pareille à ceux qui nous ont aidés."],["L7-1260","感激","gǎnjī","V","to be grateful","agradecer; estar agradecido","être reconnaissant","那位医生救了我父亲一命，我们全家都非常感激他。","nà wèi yī shēng jiù le wǒ fù qīn yí mìng wǒ men quán jiā dōu fēi cháng gǎn jī tā","That doctor saved my father's life, and our whole family is deeply grateful to him.","Aquel médico le salvó la vida a mi padre y toda nuestra familia le está muy agradecida.","Ce médecin a sauvé la vie de mon père, et toute notre famille lui est infiniment reconnaissante."],["L7-1261","感慨","gǎnkǎi","V","to sigh with emotion","suspirar con emoción","soupirer d'émotion","看着老照片，奶奶感慨时间过得太快了。","kàn zhe lǎo zhào piàn nǎi nai gǎn kǎi shí jiān guò de tài kuài le","Looking at the old photos, Grandma sighed about how fast time has flown.","Mirando las fotos antiguas, la abuela suspiró de lo rápido que pasa el tiempo.","En regardant les vieilles photos, grand-mère soupirait de voir comme le temps passe vite."],["L7-1262","感染","gǎnrǎn","V","to infect; infection","infectar; infección","infecter; infection","伤口要及时消毒，防止细菌感染。","shāng kǒu yào jí shí xiāo dú fáng zhǐ xì jūn gǎn rǎn","Wounds should be disinfected promptly to prevent bacterial infection.","Las heridas deben desinfectarse a tiempo para evitar infecciones bacterianas.","Il faut désinfecter rapidement les plaies pour prévenir l'infection bactérienne."],["L7-1263","感染力","gǎnrǎnlì","N","power to influence; infectiousness","poder de contagio; atractivo","pouvoir de contagion; impact","她的演讲很有感染力，台下的观众都被打动了。","tā de yǎn jiǎng hěn yǒu gǎn rǎn lì tái xià de guān zhòng dōu bèi dǎ dòng le","Her speech was very moving, and everyone in the audience was touched.","Su discurso fue muy conmovedor y el público quedó emocionado.","Son discours était très communicatif et le public en a été touché."],["L7-1264","感叹","gǎntàn","V","to sigh; to lament","suspirar; lamentar","soupirer; déplorer","站在山顶上，大家都感叹大自然的神奇。","zhàn zài shān dǐng shàng dà jiā dōu gǎn tàn dà zì rán de shén qí","Standing on the mountaintop, everyone marveled at the wonders of nature.","De pie en la cima de la montaña, todos se maravillaron ante lo prodigiosa que es la naturaleza.","Debout au sommet de la montagne, tous s'émerveillaient des prodiges de la nature."],["L7-1265","感性","gǎnxìng","Adj","perceptual; emotional","sensible; emocional","sensible; émotionnel","她是个很感性的人，看电影常常感动得流泪。","tā shì gè hěn gǎn xìng de rén kàn diàn yǐng cháng cháng gǎn dòng de liú lèi","She is a very emotional person and often cries at movies.","Es una persona muy sensible y a menudo llora viendo películas.","C'est une personne très sensible, et elle pleure souvent devant les films."],["L7-1266","干部","gànbù","N","cadre; official","cuadro; funcionario","cadre; fonctionnaire","洪水还在上涨，村干部要求大家马上往山上撤。","hóng shuǐ hái zài shàng zhǎng cūn gàn bù yāo qiú dà jiā mǎ shàng wǎng shān shàng chè","The floodwater was still rising, so the village officials told everyone to withdraw up the mountain at once.","La inundación seguía subiendo, y los cuadros del pueblo pidieron que todos se retiraran de inmediato hacia la montaña.","La crue continuait de monter, et les responsables du village ont demandé à tout le monde de se replier immédiatement vers la montagne."],["L7-1267","干事","gànshi","N","administrator; secretary","encargado; secretario","responsable; secrétaire","她在学生会当宣传干事，负责设计活动海报。","tā zài xué shēng huì dāng xuān chuán gàn shi fù zé shè jì huó dòng hǎi bào","She is the publicity officer in the student union and is responsible for designing event posters.","Es la encargada de propaganda en la asociación de estudiantes y se ocupa de diseñar los carteles de las actividades.","Elle est chargée de la communication au sein du bureau des étudiants et s'occupe de concevoir les affiches des événements."],["L7-1268","刚毅","gāngyì","Adj","resolute; steadfast","firme; resuelto","résolu; ferme","这位老将军性格刚毅，从不轻易流露感情。","zhè wèi lǎo jiāng jūn xìng gé gāng yì cóng bù qīng yì liú lù gǎn qíng","The old general had a resolute character and seldom showed his emotions.","El viejo general tenía un carácter firme y casi nunca dejaba traslucir sus sentimientos.","Le vieux général avait un caractère ferme et laissait rarement transparaître ses sentiments."],["L7-1269","纲领","gānglǐng","N","program; guiding principle","programa; principio rector","programme; principe directeur","这个政党在大会上公布了新的行动纲领。","zhè ge zhèng dǎng zài dà huì shàng gōng bù le xīn de xíng dòng gāng lǐng","The party announced its new program of action at the congress.","El partido dio a conocer en el congreso su nuevo programa de acción.","Le parti a rendu public son nouveau programme d'action lors du congrès."],["L7-1270","纲要","gāngyào","N","outline; essentials","esquema; puntos esenciales","plan; grandes lignes","老师把这一章的复习纲要发给了大家。","lǎo shī bǎ zhè yì zhāng de fù xí gāng yào fā gěi le dà jiā","The teacher handed out the review outline for this chapter to everyone.","La profesora repartió a todos el esquema de repaso de este capítulo.","Le professeur a distribué à tout le monde le plan de révision de ce chapitre."],["L7-1271","钢","gāng","N","steel","acero","acier","大桥的一根钢索突然断裂，交通被迫中断。","dà qiáo de yì gēn gāng suǒ tū rán duàn liè jiāo tōng bèi pò zhōng duàn","One of the bridge's steel cables suddenly snapped, and traffic had to be halted.","Un cable de acero del puente se rompió de repente y el tráfico tuvo que interrumpirse.","Un des câbles d'acier du pont s'est soudain rompu et la circulation a dû être interrompue."],["L7-1272","缸","gāng","N","jar; vat","tinaja; cuba","jarre; cuve","院子里放着一口大水缸，里面养了几条金鱼。","yuàn zi lǐ fàng zhe yì kǒu dà shuǐ gāng lǐ miàn yǎng le jǐ tiáo jīn yú","There is a big water vat in the yard with a few goldfish in it.","En el patio hay una tinaja grande con unos cuantos peces dorados.","Dans la cour, il y a une grande jarre où vivent quelques poissons rouges."],["L7-1273","港","gǎng","N","Hong Kong (abbr.); harbor","Hong Kong (abrev.); puerto","Hong Kong (abrév.); port","台风来临前，渔船纷纷回港避风。","tái fēng lái lín qián yú chuán fēn fēn huí gǎng bì fēng","Before the typhoon arrived, fishing boats returned to port one after another to shelter from the wind.","Antes de la llegada del tifón, los barcos de pesca regresaron al puerto uno tras otro para resguardarse del viento.","Avant l'arrivée du typhon, les bateaux de pêche sont rentrés au port les uns après les autres pour s'abriter du vent."],["L7-1274","杠铃","gànglíng","N","barbell","barra de pesas","haltère","他每天在健身房练杠铃，肌肉越来越结实。","tā měi tiān zài jiàn shēn fáng liàn gàng líng jī ròu yuè lái yuè jiē shi","He lifts barbells at the gym every day, and his muscles are getting stronger and stronger.","Todos los días levanta pesas en el gimnasio, y sus músculos están cada vez más firmes.","Il soulève des haltères à la salle de sport tous les jours, et ses muscles sont de plus en plus solides."],["L7-1275","高昂","gāo'áng","V/Adj","expensive; high (spirits)","elevado; caro; animado","élevé; coûteux; exalté","虽然连续加班，大家的士气依然十分高昂。","suī rán lián xù jiā bān dà jiā de shì qì yī rán shí fēn gāo áng","Despite the continuous overtime, everyone's morale remained high.","Aunque hicieron horas extra seguidas, la moral de todos seguía muy alta.","Bien qu'ils aient enchaîné les heures supplémentaires, le moral de tous restait très haut."],["L7-1276","高傲","gāo'ào","Adj","arrogant; haughty","arrogante; altivo","arrogant; hautain","她因为出身富贵而显得十分高傲，不愿和普通人交往。","tā yīn wèi chū shēn fù guì ér xiǎn de shí fēn gāo ào bú yuàn hé pǔ tōng rén jiāo wǎng","Because she came from a wealthy family, she was very haughty and didn't want to mix with ordinary people.","Como proviene de una familia adinerada, parece muy altiva y no quiere tratar con la gente común.","Issue d'une famille riche, elle paraît très hautaine et ne veut pas fréquenter les gens ordinaires."],["L7-1277","高超","gāochāo","Adj","excellent; superb","excelente; sobresaliente","excellent; remarquable","这位老师傅剪纸的技艺非常高超。","zhè wèi lǎo shī fu jiǎn zhǐ de jì yì fēi cháng gāo chāo","This old master's papercutting skill is truly superb.","La destreza de este viejo maestro para el papel recortado es extraordinaria.","Ce vieux maître possède une technique de découpage de papier extraordinaire."],["L7-1278","高低","gāodī","N","height; pitch; ups and downs","altura; tono; altibajos","hauteur; ton; hauts et bas","火车穿过高低起伏的群山，向西开去。","huǒ chē chuān guò gāo dī qǐ fú de qún shān xiàng xī kāi qù","The train headed west through the rolling mountains.","El tren atravesó montañas de relieve ondulado rumbo al oeste.","Le train a traversé des montagnes aux reliefs accidentés en direction de l'ouest."],["L7-1279","高调","gāodiào","N","high-profile; bombast","llamativo; grandilocuente","voyant; grandiloquent","他做慈善从来不高调，很多人都不知道他捐了款。","tā zuò cí shàn cóng lái bù gāo diào hěn duō rén dōu bù zhī dào tā juān le kuǎn","He never makes a show of his charity work, and many people don't know he has donated.","Nunca hace ostentación de su labor benéfica; mucha gente ni siquiera sabe que hizo donaciones.","Il ne fait jamais étalage de ses œuvres de charité, et beaucoup de gens ignorent qu'il a fait des dons."],["L7-1280","高额","gāo'é","Adj","large amount; high (sum)","elevado (monto); gran cantidad","montant élevé; forte somme","市场份额虽然有所增长，但高额的运营成本仍然不容忽视。","shì chǎng fèn é suī rán yǒu suǒ zēng zhǎng dàn gāo é de yùn yíng chéng běn réng rán bù róng hū shì","Although market share has increased, the high operating costs still cannot be overlooked.","Aunque la cuota de mercado ha crecido, no se pueden ignorar los altos costos operativos.","Même si la part de marché a progressé, on ne peut pas négliger les coûts d'exploitation élevés."],["L7-1281","高尔夫球","gāo'ěrfūqiú","N","golf","golf","golf","退休以后，他爱上了打高尔夫球。","tuì xiū yǐ hòu tā ài shàng le dǎ gāo ěr fū qiú","After retiring, he fell in love with playing golf.","Después de jubilarse, se aficionó a jugar al golf.","Après sa retraite, il s'est pris de passion pour le golf."],["L7-1282","高峰期","gāofēngqī","N","peak period; rush hour","hora punta; período pico","heure de pointe; période de pointe","上下班高峰期，地铁里人多得几乎挤不进去。","shàng xià bān gāo fēng qī dì tiě lǐ rén duō de jī hū jǐ bú jìn qù","During the morning and evening rush hours, the subway is so crowded you can hardly squeeze on.","En las horas punta de entrada y salida del trabajo, el metro va tan lleno que casi no se puede entrar.","Aux heures de pointe, le métro est tellement bondé qu'on a presque du mal à y monter."],["L7-1283","高贵","gāoguì","Adj","noble; dignified","noble; distinguido","noble; distingué","这件晚礼服设计简洁，却显得非常高贵。","zhè jiàn wǎn lǐ fú shè jì jiǎn jié què xiǎn de fēi cháng gāo guì","This evening gown has a simple design, yet it looks very elegant.","Este vestido de noche tiene un diseño sencillo, pero se ve muy elegante.","Cette robe de soirée a un design épuré, mais elle paraît très élégante."],["L7-1284","高空","gāokōng","N","high altitude","gran altitud","haute altitude","高空作业的工人必须系好安全带。","gāo kōng zuò yè de gōng rén bì xū jì hǎo ān quán dài","Workers working at heights must fasten their safety harnesses.","Los obreros que trabajan en altura deben ponerse el arnés de seguridad.","Les ouvriers qui travaillent en hauteur doivent obligatoirement attacher leur harnais de sécurité."],["L7-1285","高龄","gāolíng","N/Adj","elderly; advanced age","anciano; edad avanzada","âgé; grand âge","奶奶已经九十高龄了，每天还坚持散步。","nǎi nai yǐ jīng jiǔ shí gāo líng le měi tiān hái jiān chí sàn bù","Grandma is ninety years old and still takes a walk every day.","La abuela ya tiene noventa años y todavía insiste en salir a caminar todos los días.","Grand-mère a déjà quatre-vingt-dix ans et continue de faire sa promenade chaque jour."],["L7-1286","高明","gāomíng","Adj","brilliant; wise","brillante; sabio","brillant; habile","你这个办法真高明，一下子就解决了问题。","nǐ zhè ge bàn fǎ zhēn gāo míng yí xià zi jiù jiě jué le wèn tí","Your method is really brilliant; it solved the problem in one go.","Tu método es realmente genial: resolvió el problema de una vez.","Ta méthode est vraiment géniale : elle a réglé le problème d'un seul coup."],["L7-1287","高山","gāoshān","N","high mountain","alta montaña","haute montagne","这种花只生长在海拔很高的高山地区。","zhè zhǒng huā zhǐ shēng zhǎng zài hǎi bá hěn gāo de gāo shān dì qū","This flower grows only in high mountain areas at great altitudes.","Esta flor solo crece en zonas de alta montaña, a gran altitud.","Cette fleur ne pousse que dans les régions de haute montagne, à très haute altitude."],["L7-1288","高效","gāoxiào","Adj","efficient; highly effective","eficiente; muy eficaz","efficace; performant","这种新型电池充电快，储能高效。","zhè zhǒng xīn xíng diàn chí chōng diàn kuài chǔ néng gāo xiào","This new type of battery charges quickly and stores energy efficiently.","Este nuevo tipo de batería se carga rápido y almacena la energía de forma eficiente.","Ce nouveau type de batterie se recharge vite et stocke l'énergie de manière efficace."],["L7-1289","高新技术","gāoxīn-jìshù","","high technology","alta tecnología","haute technologie","这座城市正在大力发展高新技术产业。","zhè zuò chéng shì zhèng zài dà lì fā zhǎn gāo xīn jì shù chǎn yè","The city is vigorously developing high-tech industries.","Esta ciudad está impulsando con fuerza las industrias de alta tecnología.","Cette ville développe activement les industries de haute technologie."],["L7-1290","高血压","gāoxuèyā","N","high blood pressure","hipertensión","hypertension","高血压患者要少吃盐，注意控制情绪。","gāo xuè yā huàn zhě yào shǎo chī yán zhù yì kòng zhì qíng xù","People with high blood pressure should eat less salt and keep their emotions in check.","Las personas con hipertensión deben comer menos sal y cuidar de controlar sus emociones.","Les personnes souffrant d'hypertension doivent manger moins de sel et veiller à maîtriser leurs émotions."],["L7-1291","高压","gāoyā","N","high pressure; high-handed","alta presión; despótico","haute pression; autoritaire","受高压天气系统控制，未来几天将以晴天为主。","shòu gāo yā tiān qì xì tǒng kòng zhì wèi lái jǐ tiān jiāng yǐ qíng tiān wéi zhǔ","Under the influence of a high-pressure system, the next few days will be mostly sunny.","Bajo la influencia de un sistema de alta presión, en los próximos días predominará el tiempo soleado.","Sous l'influence d'un anticyclone, les prochains jours seront majoritairement ensoleillés."],["L7-1292","高雅","gāoyǎ","Adj","elegant; refined","elegante; refinado","élégant; raffiné","她喜欢听古典音乐，平时穿着也很高雅。","tā xǐ huan tīng gǔ diǎn yīn yuè píng shí chuān zhuó yě hěn gāo yǎ","She likes listening to classical music and usually dresses very elegantly.","Le gusta escuchar música clásica y normalmente también se viste con mucha elegancia.","Elle aime écouter de la musique classique et s'habille généralement avec beaucoup de raffinement."],["L7-1293","高涨","gāozhǎng","V/Adj","to surge; to run high","aumentar; intensificarse","monter; s'intensifier","随着比赛临近，球迷们的热情越来越高涨。","suí zhe bǐ sài lín jìn qiú mí men de rè qíng yuè lái yuè gāo zhǎng","As the match approached, the fans' enthusiasm ran higher and higher.","A medida que se acercaba el partido, el entusiasmo de los aficionados iba en aumento.","À l'approche du match, l'enthousiasme des supporters montait de plus en plus."],["L7-1294","搞鬼","gǎoguǐ","","to play tricks; to make mischief","hacer travesuras; tramar algo","faire des manigances","电脑突然死机了，肯定是有病毒在搞鬼。","diàn nǎo tū rán sǐ jī le kěn dìng shì yǒu bìng dú zài gǎo guǐ","The computer suddenly froze; there must be a virus causing trouble.","La computadora se bloqueó de repente; seguro que algún virus está haciendo de las suyas.","L'ordinateur a soudain planté ; il y a sûrement un virus qui fait des siennes."],["L7-1295","搞笑","gǎoxiào","V","funny; to make people laugh","gracioso; hacer reír","drôle; faire rire","这部电影情节搞笑，看得大家哈哈大笑。","zhè bù diàn yǐng qíng jié gǎo xiào kàn de dà jiā hā hā dà xiào","This film's plot is hilarious, and everyone roared with laughter.","El argumento de esta película es graciosísimo y todos se rieron a carcajadas.","L'intrigue de ce film est hilarante, et tout le monde a éclaté de rire."],["L7-1296","告","gào","V","to tell; to announce","decir; anunciar","dire; annoncer","要是明天再交不上报告，我就完蛋了。","yào shi míng tiān zài jiāo bú shàng bào gào wǒ jiù wán dàn le","If I can't hand in the report tomorrow either, I'm done for.","Si mañana tampoco puedo entregar el informe, estoy acabado.","Si je ne rends pas le rapport demain non plus, je suis fichu."],["L7-1297","告辞","gàocí","V","to take one's leave","despedirse","prendre congé","时间不早了，我该告辞了，谢谢您的款待。","shí jiān bù zǎo le wǒ gāi gào cí le xiè xie nín de kuǎn dài","It's getting late, so I should take my leave. Thank you for your hospitality.","Ya es tarde, debo despedirme. Gracias por su hospitalidad.","Il se fait tard, je dois prendre congé. Merci de votre hospitalité."],["L7-1298","告诫","gàojiè","V","to warn; to admonish","advertir; amonestar","avertir; exhorter","父亲告诫他，做人一定要诚实守信。","fù qīn gào jiè tā zuò rén yí dìng yào chéng shí shǒu xìn","His father warned him that he must always be honest and keep his word.","Su padre le advirtió que, para ser una buena persona, siempre debía ser honesto y cumplir su palabra.","Son père l'a mis en garde : pour être quelqu'un de bien, il faut être honnête et tenir parole."],["L7-1299","告示","gàoshi","N","notice; announcement","aviso; anuncio","avis; annonce","村口贴了一张告示，通知大家下周停水。","cūn kǒu tiē le yì zhāng gào shi tōng zhī dà jiā xià zhōu tíng shuǐ","A notice posted at the village entrance informs everyone that the water will be cut off next week.","En la entrada del pueblo pegaron un aviso para informar a todos de que la próxima semana cortarán el agua.","Un avis affiché à l'entrée du village informe tout le monde que l'eau sera coupée la semaine prochaine."],["L7-1300","告知","gàozhī","V","to inform","informar","informer","如果航班有变动，航空公司会及时告知旅客。","rú guǒ háng bān yǒu biàn dòng háng kōng gōng sī huì jí shí gào zhī lǚ kè","If there are any changes to the flight, the airline will promptly notify passengers.","Si hay algún cambio en el vuelo, la aerolínea avisará a los pasajeros de inmediato.","En cas de changement de vol, la compagnie aérienne en informera rapidement les passagers."],["L7-1301","告状","gàozhuàng","","to tell on someone; to sue","acusar; demandar","rapporter; porter plainte","弟弟一被欺负，就跑去找妈妈告状。","dì di yí bèi qī fu jiù pǎo qù zhǎo mā ma gào zhuàng","Whenever my younger brother gets picked on, he runs to tell on them to Mom.","En cuanto alguien se mete con mi hermano menor, corre a acusarlo con mamá.","Dès qu'on s'en prend à mon petit frère, il court se plaindre à maman."],["L7-1302","戈壁","gēbì","N","Gobi (desert)","Gobi (desierto)","Gobi (désert)","汽车在荒凉的戈壁上行驶了整整一天。","qì chē zài huāng liáng de gē bì shàng xíng shǐ le zhěng zhěng yì tiān","The car drove across the desolate Gobi for a whole day.","El coche recorrió el desolado desierto de Gobi durante todo un día.","La voiture a roulé toute une journée à travers le désert de Gobi, aride et désolé."],["L7-1303","胳膊","gēbo","N","arm","brazo","bras","被蚊子咬了以后，胳膊上痒得很。","bèi wén zi yǎo le yǐ hòu gē bo shàng yǎng de hěn","After being bitten by mosquitoes, my arm itches terribly.","Después de que me picaron los mosquitos, el brazo me pica muchísimo.","Après avoir été piqué par des moustiques, j'ai le bras qui me démange terriblement."],["L7-1304","鸽子","gēzi","N","pigeon; dove","paloma","pigeon; colombe","广场上有一大群鸽子，孩子们正在喂它们。","guǎng chǎng shàng yǒu yí dà qún gē zi hái zi men zhèng zài wèi tā men","There is a big flock of pigeons in the square, and the children are feeding them.","En la plaza hay una gran bandada de palomas y los niños les están dando de comer.","Il y a une grande volée de pigeons sur la place, et les enfants leur donnent à manger."],["L7-1305","搁","gē","V","to put; to set aside","poner; dejar de lado","poser; mettre de côté","你先把行李搁在门口，一会儿我帮你搬上楼。","nǐ xiān bǎ xíng li gē zài mén kǒu yí huìr wǒ bāng nǐ bān shàng lóu","Just put your luggage by the door for now; I'll help you carry it upstairs in a bit.","Primero deja el equipaje en la puerta; en un rato te ayudo a subirlo.","Pose d'abord tes bagages près de la porte ; dans un moment, je t'aiderai à les monter à l'étage."],["L7-1306","搁浅","gēqiǎn","","to run aground; to stall","encallar; quedar estancado","s'échouer; s'enliser","由于资金不足，这个建设项目暂时搁浅了。","yóu yú zī jīn bù zú zhè ge jiàn shè xiàng mù zàn shí gē qiǎn le","Because of a lack of funds, this construction project has stalled for the time being.","Por falta de fondos, este proyecto de construcción quedó paralizado por el momento.","Faute de financement, ce projet de construction est pour l'instant au point mort."],["L7-1307","搁置","gēzhì","V","to shelve; to set aside","aplazar; dejar de lado","mettre de côté; suspendre","调解员劝双方暂时搁置分歧，先就赔偿的范围达成共识。","tiáo jiě yuán quàn shuāng fāng zàn shí gē zhì fēn qí xiān jiù péi cháng de fàn wéi dá chéng gòng shí","The mediator urged both sides to set aside their differences for the moment and first agree on the scope of compensation.","El mediador instó a ambas partes a dejar de lado por ahora sus diferencias y a llegar primero a un acuerdo sobre el alcance de la indemnización.","Le médiateur a exhorté les deux parties à mettre provisoirement leurs désaccords de côté et à s'entendre d'abord sur l'étendue de l'indemnisation."],["L7-1308","割","gē","V","to cut","cortar","couper","秋天到了，农民们忙着在田里割稻子。","qiū tiān dào le nóng mín men máng zhe zài tián lǐ gē dào zi","Autumn has come, and the farmers are busy cutting rice in the fields.","Llegó el otoño y los campesinos están ocupados cortando el arroz en los campos.","L'automne est arrivé, et les paysans sont occupés à moissonner le riz dans les champs."],["L7-1309","歌剧","gējù","N","opera","ópera","opéra","这家剧院今晚上演的是一部意大利歌剧。","zhè jiā jù yuàn jīn wǎn shàng yǎn de shì yí bù yì dà lì gē jù","The theater is staging an Italian opera tonight.","Esta noche el teatro pone en escena una ópera italiana.","Ce soir, ce théâtre donne un opéra italien."],["L7-1310","歌颂","gēsòng","V","to praise; to extol","elogiar; ensalzar","louer; célébrer","这首诗歌颂了母亲无私的爱。","zhè shǒu shī gē sòng le mǔ qīn wú sī de ài","This poem praises a mother's selfless love.","Este poema canta el amor desinteresado de una madre.","Ce poème célèbre l'amour désintéressé d'une mère."],["L7-1311","歌舞","gēwǔ","N","song and dance","canto y baile","chant et danse","晚会上，各民族的演员表演了精彩的歌舞。","wǎn huì shàng gè mín zú de yǎn yuán biǎo yǎn le jīng cǎi de gē wǔ","At the evening gala, performers from various ethnic groups put on wonderful song and dance shows.","En la gala de la noche, artistas de distintas etnias ofrecieron magníficos números de canto y baile.","Lors de la soirée de gala, des artistes de différentes ethnies ont présenté de magnifiques spectacles de chant et de danse."],["L7-1312","歌咏","gēyǒng","V","to sing","cantar","chanter","学校每年秋天都会举行一次歌咏比赛。","xué xiào měi nián qiū tiān dōu huì jǔ xíng yí cì gē yǒng bǐ sài","The school holds a singing competition every autumn.","Todos los otoños la escuela organiza un concurso de canto.","Chaque automne, l'école organise un concours de chant."],["L7-1313","革命","gémìng","V/Adj","revolution; revolutionary","revolución; revolucionario","révolution; révolutionnaire","蒸汽机的广泛应用推动了工业革命。","zhēng qì jī de guǎng fàn yìng yòng tuī dòng le gōng yè gé mìng","The widespread use of the steam engine helped drive the Industrial Revolution.","El uso generalizado de la máquina de vapor impulsó la Revolución Industrial.","L'utilisation généralisée de la machine à vapeur a favorisé la révolution industrielle."],["L7-1314","格","gé","N","square; frame; rule","casilla; marco; norma","case; cadre; règle","这张表格的每一格只能填一个字。","zhè zhāng biǎo gé de měi yì gé zhǐ néng tián yí ge zì","Only one character may be written in each box of this form.","En cada casilla de este formulario solo se puede escribir un carácter.","Dans chaque case de ce formulaire, on ne peut écrire qu'un seul caractère."],["L7-1315","格格不入","gégé-bùrù","","incompatible; out of place","incompatible; desentonar","incompatible; en décalage","他的想法太传统，和公司年轻人的风格格格不入。","tā de xiǎng fǎ tài chuán tǒng hé gōng sī nián qīng rén de fēng gé gé gé bú rù","His ideas are too traditional and clash with the style of the company's young people.","Sus ideas son demasiado tradicionales y no encajan con el estilo de los jóvenes de la empresa.","Ses idées sont trop traditionnelles et détonnent avec le style des jeunes de l'entreprise."],["L7-1316","格局","géjú","N","structure; layout","estructura; configuración","structure; configuration","这座古城的街巷保留了旧日的格局，也承载着几代居民的共同记忆。","zhè zuò gǔ chéng de jiē xiàng bǎo liú le jiù rì de gé jú yě chéng zài zhe jǐ dài jū mín de gòng tóng jì yì","The lanes of this ancient town preserve its former layout and hold the shared memories of generations of residents.","Las calles y callejones de esta antigua ciudad conservan el trazado de antaño y también guardan la memoria compartida de varias generaciones de habitantes.","Les rues et ruelles de cette ancienne cité conservent leur tracé d'autrefois et portent aussi la mémoire commune de plusieurs générations d'habitants."],["L7-1317","格式","géshi","N","format","formato","format","论文的格式必须符合学校的统一要求。","lùn wén de gé shì bì xū fú hé xué xiào de tǒng yī yāo qiú","The format of the thesis must comply with the university's standard requirements.","El formato de la tesis debe ajustarse a los requisitos uniformes de la escuela.","Le format du mémoire doit être conforme aux exigences communes de l'établissement."],["L7-1318","隔阂","géhé","N","estrangement; barrier","distanciamiento; barrera","mésentente; barrière","两人因误会产生了隔阂，直到一次坦诚的交谈才重新建立信任。","liǎng rén yīn wù huì chǎn shēng le gé hé zhí dào yí cì tǎn chéng de jiāo tán cái chóng xīn jiàn lì xìn rèn","A misunderstanding drove a wedge between them, and only a frank conversation restored their trust.","Un malentendido creó distancia entre los dos, y solo una conversación sincera restableció la confianza.","Un malentendu avait creusé un fossé entre eux, et il a fallu une conversation franche pour rétablir la confiance."],["L7-1319","隔离","gélí","V","to isolate; to quarantine","aislar; poner en cuarentena","isoler; mettre en quarantaine","医院把传染病人安排在隔离病房里治疗。","yī yuàn bǎ chuán rǎn bìng rén ān pái zài gé lí bìng fáng lǐ zhì liáo","The hospital arranges for patients with infectious diseases to receive treatment in isolation wards.","El hospital trata a los pacientes con enfermedades contagiosas en salas de aislamiento.","L'hôpital soigne les patients atteints de maladies contagieuses dans des chambres d'isolement."],["L7-1320","个案","gè'àn","N","individual case","caso individual","cas individuel","与其堆砌专业术语，不如用具体的个案说明概念之间的关联。","yǔ qí duī qì zhuān yè shù yǔ bù rú yòng jù tǐ de gè àn shuō míng gài niàn zhī jiān de guān lián","Rather than piling up technical terms, it is better to illustrate how the concepts relate through specific cases.","En lugar de acumular términos técnicos, es mejor usar casos concretos para explicar la relación entre los conceptos.","Plutôt que d'accumuler les termes techniques, mieux vaut illustrer par des cas concrets les liens entre les concepts."],["L7-1321","个头儿","gètóur","N","size; height","tamaño; estatura","taille; stature","这孩子才十二岁，个头儿已经比他爸爸还高了。","zhè hái zi cái shí èr suì gè tóur yǐ jīng bǐ tā bà ba hái gāo le","This child is only twelve, but he's already taller than his father.","Este niño tiene apenas doce años y ya es más alto que su papá.","Cet enfant n'a que douze ans, mais il est déjà plus grand que son père."],["L7-1322","各奔前程","gèbènqiánchéng","","each goes their own way","cada uno sigue su camino","chacun suit sa voie","大学毕业以后，同学们各奔前程，很少有机会再聚。","dà xué bì yè yǐ hòu tóng xué men gè bèn qián chéng hěn shǎo yǒu jī huì zài jù","After graduating from university, the classmates went their separate ways and rarely had a chance to get together again.","Después de graduarse de la universidad, los compañeros siguieron cada uno su camino y rara vez tuvieron oportunidad de reunirse otra vez.","Après l'université, les camarades ont chacun suivi leur voie et ont rarement eu l'occasion de se retrouver."],["L7-1323","各式各样","gèshì-gèyàng","","all kinds of","de todo tipo","de toutes sortes","超市里摆满了各式各样的月饼。","chāo shì lǐ bǎi mǎn le gè shì gè yàng de yuè bǐng","The supermarket is full of mooncakes of every kind.","El supermercado está lleno de pasteles de luna de todo tipo.","Le supermarché regorge de gâteaux de lune de toutes sortes."],["L7-1324","根基","gēnjī","N","foundation","cimientos; base","fondations; base","这家老店的根基很深，经营了一百多年。","zhè jiā lǎo diàn de gēn jī hěn shēn jīng yíng le yì bǎi duō nián","This old shop is deeply rooted and has been in business for over a hundred years.","Este viejo negocio tiene raíces profundas y lleva más de cien años funcionando.","Cette vieille boutique est solidement implantée et fonctionne depuis plus de cent ans."],["L7-1325","根深蒂固","gēnshēn-dìgù","","deep-rooted","arraigado","profondément enraciné","重男轻女的观念在一些地方仍然根深蒂固。","zhòng nán qīng nǚ de guān niàn zài yì xiē dì fang réng rán gēn shēn dì gù","The idea of valuing sons over daughters is still deeply rooted in some places.","La idea de preferir a los hijos varones sobre las mujeres sigue profundamente arraigada en algunos lugares.","L'idée de préférer les garçons aux filles reste profondément ancrée dans certains endroits."],["L7-1326","根源","gēnyuán","N","root cause; origin","raíz; origen","cause profonde; origine","找到问题的根源，才能从根本上解决问题。","zhǎo dào wèn tí de gēn yuán cái néng cóng gēn běn shàng jiě jué wèn tí","Only by finding the root cause can the problem be solved fundamentally.","Solo encontrando la raíz del problema se puede resolver desde el fondo.","Ce n'est qu'en trouvant la cause profonde du problème qu'on peut le résoudre à la racine."],["L7-1327","根治","gēnzhì","V","to cure radically","curar de raíz","guérir radicalement","这种慢性病目前还没有办法根治。","zhè zhǒng màn xìng bìng mù qián hái méi yǒu bàn fǎ gēn zhì","There is currently no way to cure this chronic disease completely.","Por ahora no existe forma de curar por completo esta enfermedad crónica.","Il n'existe pour l'instant aucun moyen de guérir définitivement cette maladie chronique."],["L7-1328","跟不上","gēn bu shàng","","unable to keep up with","no poder seguir el ritmo","ne pas pouvoir suivre","老人走得慢，跟不上旅行团的速度。","lǎo rén zǒu de màn gēn bu shàng lǚ xíng tuán de sù dù","The old man walked slowly and couldn't keep up with the tour group.","El anciano caminaba despacio y no podía seguir el ritmo del grupo turístico.","Le vieil homme marchait lentement et n'arrivait pas à suivre le rythme du groupe de touristes."],["L7-1329","跟上","gēnshang","","to keep up with","seguir el ritmo; alcanzar","suivre; rattraper","教育也要与时俱进，跟上时代的发展。","jiào yù yě yào yǔ shí jù jìn gēn shàng shí dài de fā zhǎn","Education must also keep up with the times.","La educación también debe ir con los tiempos y avanzar al ritmo del desarrollo de la época.","L'éducation doit elle aussi évoluer avec son temps et suivre le développement de l'époque."],["L7-1330","跟踪","gēnzōng","V","to follow; to track","seguir; rastrear","suivre; pister","警察跟踪了嫌疑人好几天，终于找到了他的住处。","jǐng chá gēn zōng le xián yí rén hǎo jǐ tiān zhōng yú zhǎo dào le tā de zhù chù","The police tailed the suspect for several days and finally found where he lived.","La policía siguió al sospechoso durante varios días y por fin encontró dónde vivía.","La police a filé le suspect pendant plusieurs jours et a fini par trouver où il habitait."],["L7-1331","更改","gēnggǎi","V","to change; to alter","cambiar; modificar","changer; modifier","合同中的条款一经双方签署，任何一方都不能擅自更改。","hé tóng zhōng de tiáo kuǎn yì jīng shuāng fāng qiān shǔ rèn hé yì fāng dōu bù néng shàn zì gēng gǎi","Once both parties sign the contract, neither may alter its terms without authorization.","Una vez que ambas partes firman las cláusulas del contrato, ninguna puede modificarlas por su cuenta.","Une fois les clauses du contrat signées par les deux parties, aucune d'elles ne peut les modifier de sa propre initiative."],["L7-1332","更衣室","gēngyīshì","N","changing room","vestuario","vestiaire","运动员们在更衣室里换好球衣，准备上场。","yùn dòng yuán men zài gēng yī shì lǐ huàn hǎo qiú yī zhǔn bèi shàng chǎng","The players changed into their jerseys in the locker room, ready to take the field.","Los jugadores se cambiaron las camisetas en el vestuario y se prepararon para salir a la cancha.","Les joueurs ont enfilé leur maillot dans le vestiaire et se sont préparés à entrer sur le terrain."],["L7-1333","耕地","gēngdì","N","arable land; to plow","tierra cultivable; arar","terre arable; labourer","随着城市不断扩张，耕地面积越来越少。","suí zhe chéng shì bú duàn kuò zhāng gēng dì miàn jī yuè lái yuè shǎo","As cities keep expanding, there is less and less farmland.","A medida que las ciudades se siguen expandiendo, la superficie de tierras cultivables es cada vez menor.","Au fur et à mesure que les villes s'étendent, les terres cultivées se font de plus en plus rares."],["L7-1334","耿直","gěngzhí","Adj","honest; upright","honesto; íntegro","honnête; droit","他性格耿直，看到不公平的事就会站出来说话。","tā xìng gé gěng zhí kàn dào bù gōng píng de shì jiù huì zhàn chū lái shuō huà","He is very upright, and whenever he sees injustice he speaks out.","Es de carácter recto: cuando ve una injusticia, da un paso al frente y habla.","Il est d'une grande droiture, et dès qu'il voit une injustice, il prend la parole."],["L7-1335","工地","gōngdì","N","construction site","obra; sitio de construcción","chantier","这家公司专门为建筑工地提供劳务人员。","zhè jiā gōng sī zhuān mén wèi jiàn zhù gōng dì tí gōng láo wù rén yuán","This company specializes in supplying laborers to construction sites.","Esta empresa se especializa en proporcionar mano de obra a obras de construcción.","Cette entreprise est spécialisée dans la fourniture de main-d'œuvre pour les chantiers de construction."],["L7-1336","工会","gōnghuì","N","labor union","sindicato","syndicat","工会代表全体员工和公司协商工资问题。","gōng huì dài biǎo quán tǐ yuán gōng hé gōng sī xié shāng gōng zī wèn tí","The trade union negotiates wages with the company on behalf of all employees.","El sindicato negocia los salarios con la empresa en nombre de todos los empleados.","Le syndicat négocie les salaires avec l'entreprise au nom de tous les employés."],["L7-1337","工科","gōngkē","N","engineering (field)","ingeniería (carrera)","études d'ingénieur","她高中时数学很好，所以大学选择了工科。","tā gāo zhōng shí shù xué hěn hǎo suǒ yǐ dà xué xuǎn zé le gōng kē","She was very good at math in high school, so she chose engineering at university.","En la preparatoria era muy buena en matemáticas, así que en la universidad eligió ingeniería.","Au lycée, elle était très bonne en maths, alors elle a choisi une filière d'ingénieur à l'université."],["L7-1338","工商界","gōngshāngjiè","N","business circles","círculos empresariales","milieux d'affaires","这次论坛邀请了工商界的多位知名人士。","zhè cì lùn tán yāo qǐng le gōng shāng jiè de duō wèi zhī míng rén shì","This forum invited many well-known figures from the business world.","Este foro invitó a varias personalidades destacadas del mundo empresarial.","Ce forum a invité plusieurs personnalités connues du monde des affaires."],["L7-1339","工序","gōngxù","N","work procedure; process","proceso; procedimiento de trabajo","étape de production","做一件这样的瓷器，要经过七十多道工序。","zuò yí jiàn zhè yàng de cí qì yào jīng guò qī shí duō dào gōng xù","Making a piece of porcelain like this involves more than seventy steps.","Para hacer una pieza de porcelana como esta hay que pasar por más de setenta procesos.","Pour fabriquer une porcelaine comme celle-ci, il faut passer par plus de soixante-dix étapes."],["L7-1340","工整","gōngzhěng","Adj","neat; carefully done","esmerado; pulcro","soigné; net","他的作业字迹工整，老师常拿来做示范。","tā de zuò yè zì jì gōng zhěng lǎo shī cháng ná lái zuò shì fàn","His homework is written so neatly that the teacher often uses it as an example.","Su tarea está escrita con letra tan prolija que la maestra suele usarla como ejemplo.","Ses devoirs sont écrits d'une écriture si soignée que le professeur s'en sert souvent comme exemple."],["L7-1341","工作量","gōngzuòliàng","N","workload","carga de trabajo","charge de travail","年底的工作量特别大，大家几乎天天加班。","nián dǐ de gōng zuò liàng tè bié dà dà jiā jī hū tiān tiān jiā bān","The workload at the end of the year is especially heavy, and everyone works overtime almost every day.","La carga de trabajo a fin de año es especialmente grande, y todos hacen horas extra casi todos los días.","La charge de travail de fin d'année est particulièrement lourde, et tout le monde fait des heures supplémentaires presque tous les jours."],["L7-1342","弓","gōng","N","bow; Gong (surname)","arco; Gong (apellido)","arc; Gong (nom de famille)","他拉开弓，一箭射中了靶心。","tā lā kāi gōng yí jiàn shè zhòng le bǎ xīn","He drew the bow and hit the bull's-eye with a single arrow.","Tensó el arco y acertó de una flecha en el centro de la diana.","Il a bandé son arc et a atteint le centre de la cible d'une seule flèche."],["L7-1343","公安局","gōng'ānjú","N","public security bureau","oficina de seguridad pública","bureau de la sécurité publique","丢失身份证以后，要尽快到公安局补办。","diū shī shēn fèn zhèng yǐ hòu yào jǐn kuài dào gōng ān jú bǔ bàn","If you lose your ID card, go to the public security bureau as soon as possible to get a replacement.","Si pierdes tu cédula de identidad, tramita cuanto antes su reposición en la oficina de seguridad pública.","Si vous perdez votre carte d'identité, rendez-vous au plus vite au bureau de sécurité publique pour en obtenir une nouvelle."],["L7-1344","公车","gōngchē","N","bus; official car","autobús; coche oficial","bus; voiture de fonction","我每天坐公车上班，路上大概要四十分钟。","wǒ měi tiān zuò gōng chē shàng bān lù shang dà gài yào sì shí fēn zhōng","I take the bus to work every day; the trip takes about forty minutes.","Todos los días voy al trabajo en autobús; el trayecto dura unos cuarenta minutos.","Je vais au travail en bus tous les jours ; le trajet prend environ quarante minutes."],["L7-1345","公道","gōngdao","Adj","fairness; fair","justicia; justo","équité; équitable","老村长办事公道，全村人都很敬重他。","lǎo cūn zhǎng bàn shì gōng dao quán cūn rén dōu hěn jìng zhòng tā","The old village head handles matters fairly, and the whole village holds him in high regard.","El viejo jefe de la aldea es justo en sus decisiones, y todo el pueblo lo respeta mucho.","Le vieux chef du village est équitable dans ses décisions, et tout le village le respecte beaucoup."],["L7-1346","公费","gōngfèi","N","at public expense","a cargo del erario","aux frais de l'État","他获得了公费出国留学的机会。","tā huò dé le gōng fèi chū guó liú xué de jī huì","He won the opportunity to study abroad at public expense.","Obtuvo la oportunidad de estudiar en el extranjero con una beca pagada por el Estado.","Il a obtenu la possibilité d'aller étudier à l'étranger aux frais de l'État."],["L7-1347","公共场所","gōnggòng chǎngsuǒ","","public place","lugar público","lieu public","在公共场所乱扔东西是很野蛮的行为。","zài gōng gòng chǎng suǒ luàn rēng dōng xi shì hěn yě mán de xíng wéi","Throwing things around in public places is very uncivilized behavior.","Tirar cosas en los lugares públicos es un comportamiento muy incivilizado.","Jeter des détritus dans les lieux publics est un comportement très barbare."],["L7-1348","公关","gōngguān","N","public relations","relaciones públicas","relations publiques","她在一家外企负责公关工作，经常要接待媒体。","tā zài yì jiā wài qǐ fù zé gōng guān gōng zuò jīng cháng yào jiē dài méi tǐ","She is in charge of public relations at a foreign company and often has to deal with the media.","Se encarga de las relaciones públicas en una empresa extranjera y con frecuencia tiene que atender a los medios.","Elle s'occupe des relations publiques dans une entreprise étrangère et doit souvent recevoir des journalistes."],["L7-1349","公函","gōnghán","N","official letter","carta oficial","lettre officielle","学校给对方单位发了一份公函，请求协助调查。","xué xiào gěi duì fāng dān wèi fā le yí fèn gōng hán qǐng qiú xié zhù diào chá","The school sent an official letter to the other organization requesting assistance with the investigation.","La escuela envió un oficio a la otra institución solicitando colaboración en la investigación.","L'école a envoyé un courrier officiel à l'autre organisme pour demander son aide dans l'enquête."],["L7-1350","公积金","gōngjījīn","N","reserve fund; provident fund","fondo de reserva","fonds de réserve","他用住房公积金贷款买了一套小房子。","tā yòng zhù fáng gōng jī jīn dài kuǎn mǎi le yí tào xiǎo fáng zi","He bought a small apartment with a loan from his housing provident fund.","Compró un pequeño apartamento con un préstamo del fondo de previsión para la vivienda.","Il a acheté un petit appartement grâce à un prêt du fonds de prévoyance pour le logement."],["L7-1351","公开信","gōngkāixìn","N","open letter","carta abierta","lettre ouverte","几十位科学家联名发表了一封公开信。","jǐ shí wèi kē xué jiā lián míng fā biǎo le yì fēng gōng kāi xìn","Dozens of scientists jointly published an open letter.","Varias decenas de científicos publicaron conjuntamente una carta abierta.","Des dizaines de scientifiques ont publié ensemble une lettre ouverte."],["L7-1352","公款","gōngkuǎn","N","public funds","fondos públicos","fonds publics","这位官员因为贪污公款被撤职了。","zhè wèi guān yuán yīn wèi tān wū gōng kuǎn bèi chè zhí le","The official was dismissed for embezzling public funds.","Ese funcionario fue destituido por malversar fondos públicos.","Ce fonctionnaire a été révoqué pour avoir détourné des fonds publics."],["L7-1353","公立","gōnglì","Adj","public (school, hospital)","público (escuela, hospital)","public (école, hôpital)","这所公立学校的学费比私立学校便宜得多。","zhè suǒ gōng lì xué xiào de xué fèi bǐ sī lì xué xiào pián yi de duō","The tuition at this public school is much cheaper than at private schools.","La matrícula de esta escuela pública es mucho más barata que la de las privadas.","Les frais de scolarité de cette école publique sont bien moins chers que ceux des écoles privées."],["L7-1354","公墓","gōngmù","N","public cemetery","cementerio público","cimetière public","清明节期间，前往公墓扫墓的人特别多。","qīng míng jié qī jiān qián wǎng gōng mù sǎo mù de rén tè bié duō","During the Qingming Festival, a great many people go to cemeteries to sweep the graves.","Durante el Festival de Qingming, es muy grande la cantidad de personas que van al cementerio a limpiar las tumbas.","Pendant la fête de Qingming, énormément de gens se rendent au cimetière pour entretenir les tombes."],["L7-1355","公仆","gōngpú","N","public servant","servidor público","serviteur de l'État","官员应该是人民的公仆，而不是高高在上的老爷。","guān yuán yīng gāi shì rén mín de gōng pú ér bú shì gāo gāo zài shàng de lǎo ye","Officials should be servants of the people, not lords high above them.","Los funcionarios deben ser servidores del pueblo, no señores que se creen por encima de todos.","Les fonctionnaires devraient être les serviteurs du peuple, et non des seigneurs placés très haut au-dessus de lui."],["L7-1356","公顷","gōngqǐng","M","hectare","hectárea","hectare","这个农场占地五百公顷，主要种植玉米和大豆。","zhè ge nóng chǎng zhàn dì wǔ bǎi gōng qǐng zhǔ yào zhòng zhí yù mǐ hé dà dòu","This farm covers five hundred hectares and mainly grows corn and soybeans.","Esta granja ocupa quinientas hectáreas y cultiva principalmente maíz y soya.","Cette ferme couvre cinq cents hectares et cultive principalement du maïs et du soja."],["L7-1357","公然","gōngrán","Adv","openly; blatantly","abiertamente; descaradamente","ouvertement; effrontément","他竟然公然在考场上抄别人的答案。","tā jìng rán gōng rán zài kǎo chǎng shàng chāo bié rén de dá àn","He actually copied someone else's answers openly in the exam room.","¡Incluso copió abiertamente las respuestas de otro en la sala del examen!","Il a même osé copier ouvertement les réponses d'un autre dans la salle d'examen !"],["L7-1358","公示","gōngshì","V","to publish for public notice","hacer público; exponer al público","rendre public; afficher","新录用的员工名单已经在网站上公示。","xīn lù yòng de yuán gōng míng dān yǐ jīng zài wǎng zhàn shàng gōng shì","The list of newly hired employees has been publicly posted on the website.","La lista de los empleados recién contratados ya se publicó en el sitio web.","La liste des employés nouvellement recrutés a été publiée sur le site web."],["L7-1359","公事","gōngshì","N","official business","asuntos oficiales","affaires officielles","上班时间请谈公事，私事下班以后再说。","shàng bān shí jiān qǐng tán gōng shì sī shì xià bān yǐ hòu zài shuō","Please talk about work during office hours; leave personal matters until after work.","En horario de trabajo hablemos de asuntos laborales; los asuntos personales, después de la jornada.","Pendant les heures de bureau, parlons de travail ; les affaires personnelles, ce sera après le travail."],["L7-1360","公务","gōngwù","N","official duties","asuntos oficiales","affaires officielles","他这次出差是为了处理一些紧急公务。","tā zhè cì chū chāi shì wèi le chǔ lǐ yì xiē jǐn jí gōng wù","He went on this business trip to handle some urgent official business.","Hizo este viaje de trabajo para atender unos asuntos oficiales urgentes.","Il est parti en déplacement professionnel pour régler quelques affaires officielles urgentes."],["L7-1361","公益","gōngyì","N","public welfare","bien público; beneficencia","intérêt public","她每个月都会抽出时间参加公益活动。","tā měi ge yuè dōu huì chōu chū shí jiān cān jiā gōng yì huó dòng","Every month she sets aside time to take part in charity activities.","Cada mes saca tiempo para participar en actividades de beneficencia.","Chaque mois, elle prend le temps de participer à des activités caritatives."],["L7-1362","公益性","gōngyìxìng","N","public-interest nature","carácter de interés público","caractère d'intérêt public","这家博物馆是公益性的，对所有人免费开放。","zhè jiā bó wù guǎn shì gōng yì xìng de duì suǒ yǒu rén miǎn fèi kāi fàng","This museum operates for the public benefit and is open to everyone free of charge.","Este museo es de beneficio público y abre sus puertas gratis a todos.","Ce musée est d'utilité publique et ouvre gratuitement ses portes à tous."],["L7-1363","公用","gōngyòng","V","for public use","de uso público","à usage public","这台公用电话已经很多年没人用了。","zhè tái gōng yòng diàn huà yǐ jīng hěn duō nián méi rén yòng le","No one has used this public phone for many years.","Hace muchos años que nadie usa este teléfono público.","Cela fait de nombreuses années que personne n'utilise cette cabine téléphonique."],["L7-1364","公寓","gōngyù","N","apartment building","edificio de apartamentos","immeuble d'appartements","他在市中心租了一套小公寓，上班很方便。","tā zài shì zhōng xīn zū le yí tào xiǎo gōng yù shàng bān hěn fāng biàn","He rents a small apartment downtown, which makes getting to work very convenient.","Alquiló un pequeño departamento en el centro de la ciudad, lo que le resulta muy cómodo para ir al trabajo.","Il loue un petit appartement en centre-ville, ce qui est très pratique pour aller travailler."],["L7-1365","公约","gōngyuē","N","convention; pact","convenio; pacto","convention; pacte","一百多个国家签署了这项保护野生动物的国际公约。","yì bǎi duō ge guó jiā qiān shǔ le zhè xiàng bǎo hù yě shēng dòng wù de guó jì gōng yuē","More than a hundred countries signed this international convention on protecting wildlife.","Más de cien países firmaron esta convención internacional para proteger la fauna silvestre.","Plus de cent pays ont signé cette convention internationale pour la protection de la faune sauvage."],["L7-1366","公证","gōngzhèng","V","notarization","notarización; legalizar ante notario","notarisation; authentifier","这份遗嘱已经在公证处办理了公证。","zhè fèn yí zhǔ yǐ jīng zài gōng zhèng chù bàn lǐ le gōng zhèng","This will has been notarized at the notary office.","Este testamento ya fue autenticado en la notaría.","Ce testament a déjà été notarié à l'étude notariale."],["L7-1367","公职","gōngzhí","N","public office","cargo público","fonction publique","他辞去了公职，下海经商去了。","tā cí qù le gōng zhí xià hǎi jīng shāng qù le","He resigned from public office and went into business.","Renunció a su cargo público y se dedicó a los negocios.","Il a quitté la fonction publique pour se lancer dans les affaires."],["L7-1368","功","gōng","N","merit; achievement","mérito; logro","mérite; exploit","这位选手凭借稳定的发挥夺冠，却把胜利归功于团队的默契配合。","zhè wèi xuǎn shǒu píng jiè wěn dìng de fā huī duó guàn què bǎ shèng lì guī gōng yú tuán duì de mò qì pèi hé","The athlete won the title through a steady performance, but credited the victory to the team's well-coordinated cooperation.","Este jugador ganó el título gracias a un rendimiento estable, pero atribuyó la victoria a la excelente coordinación del equipo.","Ce joueur a remporté le titre grâce à une performance régulière, mais il a attribué la victoire à la belle complicité de l'équipe."],["L7-1369","功臣","gōngchén","N","distinguished servant","servidor meritorio","serviteur méritant","他是这家公司的元老和功臣，为公司打下了半壁江山。","tā shì zhè jiā gōng sī de yuán lǎo hé gōng chén wèi gōng sī dǎ xià le bàn bì jiāng shān","He is a company veteran and a major contributor to its success, having built up half of its business.","Es un veterano de la empresa y uno de sus grandes artífices; construyó la mitad de su negocio.","C'est un vétéran de l'entreprise et l'un de ses grands artisans : il a bâti la moitié de son activité."],["L7-1370","功底","gōngdǐ","N","basic skills; foundation","dominio de lo básico; base","bases solides; acquis","这位书法家的功底十分扎实，每个字都写得很有力。","zhè wèi shū fǎ jiā de gōng dǐ shí fēn zhā shi měi ge zì dōu xiě de hěn yǒu lì","This calligrapher has very solid basic skills, and every character he writes is powerful.","Este calígrafo tiene una base muy sólida, y cada carácter que escribe tiene mucha fuerza.","Ce calligraphe a des bases très solides, et chaque caractère qu'il trace est plein de force."],["L7-1371","功劳","gōngláo","N","contribution; credit","contribución; mérito","contribution; mérite","他没有把功劳归于自己，而是如实说明了整个团队的付出。","tā méi yǒu bǎ gōng láo guī yú zì jǐ ér shì rú shí shuō míng le zhěng gè tuán duì de fù chū","He did not take the credit himself, but gave an honest account of the whole team's efforts.","No se atribuyó el mérito a sí mismo, sino que explicó con honestidad el esfuerzo de todo el equipo.","Il ne s'est pas attribué le mérite, mais a exposé honnêtement les efforts de toute l'équipe."],["L7-1372","功力","gōnglì","N","skill; competence","destreza; competencia","compétence; maîtrise","这位老演员的表演功力深厚，一个眼神就能打动观众。","zhè wèi lǎo yǎn yuán de biǎo yǎn gōng lì shēn hòu yí ge yǎn shén jiù néng dǎ dòng guān zhòng","This veteran actor's acting skill runs deep; a single look can move the audience.","Este veterano actor tiene una capacidad interpretativa muy profunda; con una sola mirada conmueve al público.","Ce vieil acteur a un jeu d'une grande profondeur : un seul regard suffit à émouvoir le public."],["L7-1373","功率","gōnglǜ","N","power (output)","potencia","puissance","这台空调功率太大，用起来特别费电。","zhè tái kōng tiáo gōng lǜ tài dà yòng qǐ lái tè bié fèi diàn","This air conditioner's power rating is too high, so it uses a lot of electricity.","Este aire acondicionado tiene demasiada potencia y consume muchísima electricidad.","La puissance de cette climatisation est trop élevée, elle consomme énormément d'électricité."],["L7-1374","功效","gōngxiào","N","efficacy","eficacia","efficacité","这种草药有清热解毒的功效。","zhè zhǒng cǎo yào yǒu qīng rè jiě dú de gōng xiào","This herb has the effect of clearing heat and detoxifying the body.","Esta hierba medicinal tiene el efecto de eliminar el calor y desintoxicar el organismo.","Cette herbe médicinale a pour effet de dissiper la chaleur et de désintoxiquer l'organisme."],["L7-1375","攻","gōng","V","to attack; to study","atacar; estudiar a fondo","attaquer; étudier à fond","教练没有因一次失利而全盘否定队员，而是耐心分析了攻防中的漏洞。","jiào liàn méi yǒu yīn yí cì shī lì ér quán pán fǒu dìng duì yuán ér shì nài xīn fēn xī le gōng fáng zhōng de lòu dòng","The coach did not dismiss the players after a single defeat, but patiently analyzed the gaps in their attack and defense.","El entrenador no descalificó por completo a los jugadores por una sola derrota, sino que analizó con paciencia las fallas en el ataque y la defensa.","L'entraîneur n'a pas rejeté tous ses joueurs après une seule défaite ; il a analysé patiemment les failles de l'attaque et de la défense."],["L7-1376","攻读","gōngdú","V","to study for a degree","cursar (un posgrado)","poursuivre des études (supérieures)","她大学毕业后去国外攻读博士学位。","tā dà xué bì yè hòu qù guó wài gōng dú bó shì xué wèi","After graduating from university, she went abroad to study for a doctorate.","Después de graduarse de la universidad, se fue al extranjero a cursar un doctorado.","Après ses études universitaires, elle est partie à l'étranger préparer un doctorat."],["L7-1377","攻关","gōngguān","V","to tackle a key problem","abordar un problema clave","s'attaquer à un problème clé","科研人员日夜攻关，终于解决了这个技术难题。","kē yán rén yuán rì yè gōng guān zhōng yú jiě jué le zhè ge jì shù nán tí","The researchers worked day and night on the problem and finally solved this technical difficulty.","Los investigadores trabajaron día y noche en ello y por fin resolvieron esta dificultad técnica.","Les chercheurs ont travaillé jour et nuit et ont fini par résoudre cette difficulté technique."],["L7-1378","供","gōng","V","to supply; to provide","suministrar; proveer","fournir; approvisionner","公园里放了很多长椅，供游客休息。","gōng yuán lǐ fàng le hěn duō cháng yǐ gōng yóu kè xiū xi","Many benches have been placed in the park for visitors to rest on.","En el parque hay muchas bancas para que descansen los visitantes.","Il y a de nombreux bancs dans le parc pour que les visiteurs se reposent."],["L7-1379","供不应求","gōngbùyìngqiú","","demand exceeds supply","la demanda supera la oferta","la demande dépasse l'offre","这款新手机一上市就供不应求，很多店都卖断了货。","zhè kuǎn xīn shǒu jī yí shàng shì jiù gōng bú yìng qiú hěn duō diàn dōu mài duàn le huò","As soon as this new phone went on sale, demand outstripped supply, and many shops sold out.","En cuanto salió a la venta este nuevo celular, la demanda superó a la oferta y en muchas tiendas se agotó.","Dès sa sortie, ce nouveau téléphone a connu une demande supérieure à l'offre, et de nombreux magasins étaient en rupture de stock."],["L7-1380","供暖","gōngnuǎn","V","heating supply","calefacción; suministrar calefacción","chauffage; fournir le chauffage","北方的城市一般从十一月中旬开始供暖。","běi fāng de chéng shì yì bān cóng shí yī yuè zhōng xún kāi shǐ gōng nuǎn","Cities in the north generally start supplying heating in mid-November.","Las ciudades del norte suelen empezar a dar calefacción a mediados de noviembre.","Dans les villes du nord, le chauffage est généralement mis en service à la mi-novembre."],["L7-1381","供求","gōngqiú","N","supply and demand","oferta y demanda","offre et demande","市场价格主要由供求关系决定。","shì chǎng jià gé zhǔ yào yóu gōng qiú guān xì jué dìng","Market prices are mainly determined by supply and demand.","Los precios del mercado están determinados principalmente por la relación entre oferta y demanda.","Les prix du marché sont principalement déterminés par le rapport entre l'offre et la demande."],["L7-1382","宫殿","gōngdiàn","N","palace","palacio","palais","这座宫殿是六百多年前修建的，至今保存完好。","zhè zuò gōng diàn shì liù bǎi duō nián qián xiū jiàn de zhì jīn bǎo cún wán hǎo","This palace was built more than six hundred years ago and is still well preserved.","Este palacio fue construido hace más de seiscientos años y hasta hoy se conserva en buen estado.","Ce palais a été construit il y a plus de six cents ans et est encore bien conservé aujourd'hui."],["L7-1383","宫廷","gōngtíng","N","royal court","corte real","cour royale","这部电视剧讲述的是古代宫廷里的故事。","zhè bù diàn shì jù jiǎng shù de shì gǔ dài gōng tíng lǐ de gù shi","This TV drama tells stories of the ancient imperial court.","Esta serie de televisión cuenta historias de la antigua corte imperial.","Cette série télévisée raconte des histoires de l'ancienne cour impériale."],["L7-1384","恭维","gōngwéi","V","to flatter; to compliment","halagar; adular","flatter; faire des compliments","他嘴上恭维老板，心里却很不服气。","tā zuǐ shàng gōng wéi lǎo bǎn xīn lǐ què hěn bù fú qì","He flatters his boss, but inwardly he is unwilling to concede that the boss is better than he is.","De palabra elogia al jefe, pero por dentro no se resigna a reconocer que sea mejor que él.","Il flatte son patron de bouche, mais au fond il refuse d'admettre qu'il lui est supérieur."],["L7-1385","恭喜","gōngxǐ","V","congratulations","felicidades; felicitar","félicitations; féliciter","听说你考上了研究生，恭喜恭喜！","tīng shuō nǐ kǎo shàng le yán jiū shēng gōng xǐ gōng xǐ","I heard you got into graduate school—congratulations!","Oí que entraste a la maestría. ¡Felicidades, felicidades!","J'ai appris que tu as été admis en master. Félicitations, félicitations !"],["L7-1386","拱","gǒng","V","to arch; to salute with cupped hands","arquear; saludar con las manos","voûter; saluer les mains jointes","小猪用鼻子在泥土里拱来拱去，寻找吃的。","xiǎo zhū yòng bí zi zài ní tǔ lǐ gǒng lái gǒng qù xún zhǎo chī de","The piglet nosed around in the dirt, looking for something to eat.","El cerdito hozaba en la tierra de un lado a otro con el hocico, buscando algo de comer.","Le porcelet fouillait la terre de son groin dans tous les sens, à la recherche de nourriture."],["L7-1387","共鸣","gòngmíng","V","resonance; sympathetic response","resonancia; empatía","résonance; écho favorable","这首歌唱出了许多年轻人的心声，引起了强烈共鸣。","zhè shǒu gē chàng chū le xǔ duō nián qīng rén de xīn shēng yǐn qǐ le qiáng liè gòng míng","This song voices the feelings of many young people and has struck a strong chord.","Esta canción expresa lo que sienten muchos jóvenes y despertó una fuerte resonancia.","Cette chanson exprime ce que ressentent beaucoup de jeunes et a suscité un fort écho."],["L7-1388","共识","gòngshí","N","consensus","consenso","consensus","调解员劝双方暂时搁置分歧，先就赔偿的范围达成共识。","tiáo jiě yuán quàn shuāng fāng zàn shí gē zhì fēn qí xiān jiù péi cháng de fàn wéi dá chéng gòng shí","The mediator urged both sides to set aside their differences for the moment and first agree on the scope of compensation.","El mediador instó a ambas partes a dejar de lado por ahora sus diferencias y a llegar primero a un acuerdo sobre el alcance de la indemnización.","Le médiateur a exhorté les deux parties à mettre provisoirement leurs désaccords de côté et à s'entendre d'abord sur l'étendue de l'indemnisation."],["L7-1389","共同体","gòngtóngtǐ","N","community","comunidad","communauté","各国应该携手合作，共同建设人类命运共同体。","gè guó yīng gāi xié shǒu hé zuò gòng tóng jiàn shè rén lèi mìng yùn gòng tóng tǐ","All countries should work together to build a community with a shared future for mankind.","Todos los países deberían cooperar de la mano para construir juntos una comunidad de destino compartido para la humanidad.","Tous les pays devraient coopérer main dans la main pour bâtir ensemble une communauté de destin pour l'humanité."],["L7-1390","共性","gòngxìng","N","common characteristics","rasgos comunes","caractéristiques communes","这几种疾病虽然症状不同，但也有一些共性。","zhè jǐ zhǒng jí bìng suī rán zhèng zhuàng bù tóng dàn yě yǒu yì xiē gòng xìng","Although these diseases have different symptoms, they also share some common features.","Aunque los síntomas de estas enfermedades son distintos, también tienen algunas características comunes.","Bien que les symptômes de ces maladies soient différents, elles présentent aussi certaines caractéristiques communes."],["L7-1391","供奉","gòngfèng","V/N","to enshrine; offering","venerar; ofrenda","vénérer; offrande","寺庙的大殿里供奉着一尊菩萨像。","sì miào de dà diàn lǐ gòng fèng zhe yì zūn pú sà xiàng","A statue of a bodhisattva is enshrined in the temple's main hall.","En el salón principal del templo se venera una estatua de un bodhisattva.","Dans la grande salle du temple est vénérée une statue de bodhisattva."],["L7-1392","勾","gōu","V","to hook; to outline; Gou (surname)","enganchar; trazar; Gou (apellido)","accrocher; esquisser; Gou (nom)","这首老歌勾起了我对童年的回忆。","zhè shǒu lǎo gē gōu qǐ le wǒ duì tóng nián de huí yì","This old song brought back memories of my childhood.","Esta vieja canción me trajo recuerdos de mi infancia.","Cette vieille chanson a ravivé mes souvenirs d'enfance."],["L7-1393","勾画","gōuhuà","V","to sketch; to outline","esbozar; delinear","esquisser; tracer","这份规划为城市未来的发展勾画了蓝图。","zhè fèn guī huà wèi chéng shì wèi lái de fā zhǎn gōu huà le lán tú","This plan sketches out a blueprint for the city's future development.","Este plan traza el esbozo del futuro desarrollo de la ciudad.","Ce plan esquisse le projet de développement futur de la ville."],["L7-1394","勾结","gōujié","V","to collude with","confabularse con","comploter avec; collusion","这几名官员和商人相互勾结，侵吞了大量国有资产。","zhè jǐ míng guān yuán hé shāng rén xiāng hù gōu jié qīn tūn le dà liàng guó yǒu zī chǎn","These officials colluded with businessmen to embezzle large amounts of state assets.","Estos funcionarios y empresarios se confabularon y se apropiaron de una gran cantidad de bienes del Estado.","Ces fonctionnaires se sont entendus avec des hommes d'affaires pour détourner d'importants biens de l'État."],["L7-1395","钩","gōu","V","hook","gancho","crochet","她的毛衣不小心被钉子钩破了一个洞。","tā de máo yī bù xiǎo xīn bèi dīng zi gōu pò le yí ge dòng","Her sweater got caught on a nail and a hole was torn in it.","Su suéter se enganchó sin querer en un clavo y se le hizo un agujero.","Son pull s'est accroché par mégarde à un clou et s'est troué."],["L7-1396","钩子","gōuzi","N","hook","gancho","crochet","门后面有个钩子，你可以把外套挂在上面。","mén hòu miàn yǒu gè gōu zi nǐ kě yǐ bǎ wài tào guà zài shàng miàn","There's a hook behind the door where you can hang your coat.","Detrás de la puerta hay un gancho donde puedes colgar el abrigo.","Derrière la porte, il y a un crochet où tu peux accrocher ton manteau."],["L7-1397","构思","gòusī","V","to conceive; to plan out","concebir; idear","concevoir; élaborer","这部小说的构思很巧妙，结局完全出人意料。","zhè bù xiǎo shuō de gòu sī hěn qiǎo miào jié jú wán quán chū rén yì liào","The plot of this novel is cleverly conceived, and the ending is completely unexpected.","La trama de esta novela está muy bien pensada y el final es totalmente inesperado.","L'intrigue de ce roman est très ingénieusement conçue, et la fin est tout à fait inattendue."],["L7-1398","构想","gòuxiǎng","V/N","to envision; concept","concebir; concepto","concevoir; concept","市政府提出了建设绿色城市的初步构想。","shì zhèng fǔ tí chū le jiàn shè lǜ sè chéng shì de chū bù gòu xiǎng","The city government put forward a preliminary concept for building a green city.","El gobierno municipal presentó una idea preliminar para construir una ciudad verde.","La municipalité a présenté une première esquisse pour construire une ville verte."],["L7-1399","购","gòu","V","to buy; to purchase","comprar","acheter","图书馆每年都会购进大量新书籍。","tú shū guǎn měi nián dōu huì gòu jìn dà liàng xīn shū jí","The library buys in large numbers of new books every year.","La biblioteca adquiere cada año una gran cantidad de libros nuevos.","Chaque année, la bibliothèque acquiert un grand nombre de nouveaux livres."],["L7-1400","够呛","gòuqiàng","Adj","unbearable; unlikely","insoportable; improbable","insupportable; peu probable","今天热得够呛，在外面走几步就一身汗。","jīn tiān rè de gòu qiàng zài wài miàn zǒu jǐ bù jiù yì shēn hàn","It's terribly hot today; take a few steps outside and you're covered in sweat.","Hoy hace un calor terrible: das unos pasos afuera y ya estás empapado en sudor.","Il fait une chaleur épouvantable aujourd'hui : on fait quelques pas dehors et on est déjà en sueur."],["L7-1401","估算","gūsuàn","V","to estimate","estimar; calcular","estimer; évaluer","专家估算，这次洪水造成的经济损失超过十亿元。","zhuān jiā gū suàn zhè cì hóng shuǐ zào chéng de jīng jì sǔn shī chāo guò shí yì yuán","Experts estimate that the economic losses from this flood exceed one billion yuan.","Los expertos calculan que las pérdidas económicas causadas por esta inundación superan los mil millones de yuanes.","Les experts estiment que les pertes économiques causées par cette inondation dépassent un milliard de yuans."],["L7-1402","沽名钓誉","gūmíng-diàoyù","","to fish for fame","buscar fama inmerecida","chercher la gloire à tout prix","他做这些善事并不是为了沽名钓誉，而是真心想帮助别人。","tā zuò zhè xiē shàn shì bìng bú shì wèi le gū míng diào yù ér shì zhēn xīn xiǎng bāng zhù bié rén","He does these good deeds not to court fame but out of a genuine wish to help others.","Hace estas buenas obras no para ganarse fama, sino porque de verdad quiere ayudar a los demás.","S'il fait ces bonnes actions, ce n'est pas pour se faire valoir, mais parce qu'il veut sincèrement aider les autres."],["L7-1403","孤单","gūdān","Adj","lonely; alone","solitario; solo","seul; solitaire","孩子们都去外地工作了，老人一个人在家很孤单。","hái zi men dōu qù wài dì gōng zuò le lǎo rén yí ge rén zài jiā hěn gū dān","The children have all gone to work in other cities, and the old man is very lonely at home by himself.","Los hijos se fueron a trabajar a otras ciudades y el anciano se siente muy solo en casa.","Les enfants sont tous partis travailler ailleurs, et le vieil homme se sent très seul chez lui."],["L7-1404","孤立","gūlì","Adj/V","isolated; to isolate","aislado; aislar","isolé; isoler","他在班上被孤立了，没有同学愿意和他玩。","tā zài bān shàng bèi gū lì le méi yǒu tóng xué yuàn yì hé tā wán","He was isolated in his class, and none of his classmates wanted to play with him.","Lo aislaron en la clase y ningún compañero quería jugar con él.","Il a été mis à l'écart dans sa classe, et aucun camarade ne voulait jouer avec lui."],["L7-1405","孤零零","gūlínglíng","Adj","all alone; solitary","completamente solo","tout seul; solitaire","山顶上孤零零地立着一棵老松树。","shān dǐng shàng gū líng líng de lì zhe yì kē lǎo sōng shù","A lone old pine tree stands all by itself on the mountaintop.","En la cima de la montaña se alza un viejo pino solitario.","Au sommet de la montagne se dresse un vieux pin tout seul."],["L7-1406","孤陋寡闻","gūlòu-guǎwén","","ignorant; ill-informed","ignorante; mal informado","ignorant; mal informé","我真是孤陋寡闻，从来没听说过这种水果。","wǒ zhēn shì gū lòu guǎ wén cóng lái méi tīng shuō guo zhè zhǒng shuǐ guǒ","I'm really ignorant—I've never even heard of this kind of fruit.","Qué ignorante soy: nunca había oído hablar de esta fruta.","Je suis vraiment ignorant : je n'avais jamais entendu parler de ce fruit."],["L7-1407","辜负","gūfù","V","to let down; to fail (expectations)","defraudar; no estar a la altura","décevoir; trahir","我一定会好好干，绝不辜负大家对我的信任。","wǒ yí dìng huì hǎo hǎo gàn jué bù gū fù dà jiā duì wǒ de xìn rèn","I'll work hard and never betray the trust everyone has placed in me.","Voy a esforzarme al máximo y no defraudaré la confianza que todos han depositado en mí.","Je vais travailler dur et ne décevrai jamais la confiance que vous m'avez tous accordée."],["L7-1408","古董","gǔdǒng","N","antique; curio","antigüedad; objeto curioso","antiquité; objet de curiosité","他在古董方面是个行家，一眼就能看出真假。","tā zài gǔ dǒng fāng miàn shì gè háng jia yì yǎn jiù néng kàn chū zhēn jiǎ","He's an expert on antiques and can tell genuine from fake at a glance.","Es un experto en antigüedades y con una sola mirada distingue lo auténtico de lo falso.","C'est un connaisseur en antiquités : un coup d'œil lui suffit pour distinguer le vrai du faux."],["L7-1409","古怪","gǔguài","Adj","strange; eccentric","extraño; excéntrico","étrange; excentrique","这种动物非马非驴，模样十分古怪。","zhè zhǒng dòng wù fēi mǎ fēi lǘ mú yàng shí fēn gǔ guài","This animal is neither horse nor donkey and looks very strange.","Este animal no es ni caballo ni burro y tiene un aspecto muy extraño.","Cet animal n'est ni un cheval ni un âne et a un aspect très étrange."],["L7-1410","古迹","gǔjì","N","historic site","sitio histórico","site historique","这座城市名胜古迹众多，每年吸引大量游客。","zhè zuò chéng shì míng shèng gǔ jì zhòng duō měi nián xī yǐn dà liàng yóu kè","This city has many scenic spots and historic sites and attracts large numbers of tourists every year.","Esta ciudad tiene muchos sitios célebres y monumentos históricos, y atrae a un gran número de turistas cada año.","Cette ville compte de nombreux sites célèbres et vestiges historiques, et attire chaque année un grand nombre de touristes."],["L7-1411","古今中外","gǔjīn-zhōngwài","","all times and places","todos los tiempos y lugares","tous temps et tous pays","古今中外，有成就的人大多都很勤奋。","gǔ jīn zhōng wài yǒu chéng jiù de rén dà duō dōu hěn qín fèn","Throughout history and all over the world, most accomplished people have been very hardworking.","En todas las épocas y en todo el mundo, la mayoría de las personas con logros han sido muy trabajadoras.","De tout temps et dans le monde entier, la plupart des gens qui ont réussi ont été très travailleurs."],["L7-1412","古朴","gǔpǔ","Adj","simple and unadorned","sencillo y rústico","simple et rustique","这个村子的民居风格古朴，保留着传统的样子。","zhè ge cūn zi de mín jū fēng gé gǔ pǔ bǎo liú zhe chuán tǒng de yàng zi","The houses in this village have a simple, old-fashioned style and retain their traditional look.","Las casas de este pueblo tienen un estilo sencillo y antiguo, y conservan su aspecto tradicional.","Les maisons de ce village ont un style simple et ancien et conservent leur aspect traditionnel."],["L7-1413","古人","gǔrén","N","ancient people","antiguos; gente de la antigüedad","anciens; hommes de l'Antiquité","古人常用占卜来预测吉凶。","gǔ rén cháng yòng zhān bǔ lái yù cè jí xiōng","Ancient people often used divination to predict good or bad fortune.","Los antiguos solían recurrir a la adivinación para predecir la buena o la mala fortuna.","Les Anciens recouraient souvent à la divination pour prédire les bons ou les mauvais présages."],["L7-1414","股份","gǔfèn","N","share; stock","acción; participación","action; part","他把自己在公司的股份全部转让给了合伙人。","tā bǎ zì jǐ zài gōng sī de gǔ fèn quán bù zhuǎn ràng gěi le hé huǒ rén","He transferred all his shares in the company to his partner.","Traspasó a su socio todas sus acciones de la empresa.","Il a cédé à son associé toutes ses parts dans l'entreprise."],["L7-1415","股民","gǔmín","N","stock investor","inversor bursátil","petit investisseur boursier","股市连续下跌，很多股民损失惨重。","gǔ shì lián xù xià diē hěn duō gǔ mín sǔn shī cǎn zhòng","The stock market kept falling, and many retail investors suffered heavy losses.","La bolsa siguió cayendo y muchos inversionistas sufrieron grandes pérdidas.","La Bourse a continué de chuter, et de nombreux petits porteurs ont subi de lourdes pertes."],["L7-1416","股市","gǔshì","N","stock market","bolsa de valores","marché boursier","股市连续下跌，很多股民损失惨重。","gǔ shì lián xù xià diē hěn duō gǔ mín sǔn shī cǎn zhòng","The stock market kept falling, and many retail investors suffered heavy losses.","La bolsa siguió cayendo y muchos inversionistas sufrieron grandes pérdidas.","La Bourse a continué de chuter, et de nombreux petits porteurs ont subi de lourdes pertes."],["L7-1417","骨干","gǔgàn","N","backbone; mainstay","pilar; elemento clave","pilier; élément clé","她是研发部的技术骨干，公司离不开她。","tā shì yán fā bù de jì shù gǔ gàn gōng sī lí bu kāi tā","She is a key technical member of the R&D department, and the company can't do without her.","Es una pieza clave del equipo técnico del departamento de I+D, y la empresa no puede prescindir de ella.","Elle est l'un des piliers techniques du service de R&D, et l'entreprise ne peut se passer d'elle."],["L7-1418","骨气","gǔqì","N","integrity; backbone","entereza; carácter","courage moral; caractère","他宁可饿着肚子，也不肯低头求人，很有骨气。","tā nìng kě è zhe dù zi yě bù kěn dī tóu qiú rén hěn yǒu gǔ qì","He would rather go hungry than beg for help; he has real backbone.","Prefiere pasar hambre antes que agachar la cabeza para pedir ayuda; tiene mucho carácter.","Il préfère avoir le ventre vide plutôt que de s'abaisser à demander de l'aide ; il a vraiment du caractère."],["L7-1419","骨折","gǔzhé","V","fracture; to break a bone","fractura; fracturarse","fracture; se fracturer","他滑雪时摔断了腿，医生说是小腿骨折。","tā huá xuě shí shuāi duàn le tuǐ yī shēng shuō shì xiǎo tuǐ gǔ zhé","He broke his leg skiing; the doctor said it was a fracture of the lower leg.","Se rompió la pierna esquiando; el médico dijo que fue una fractura de la tibia.","Il s'est cassé la jambe en skiant ; le médecin a parlé d'une fracture du bas de la jambe."],["L7-1420","鼓动","gǔdòng","V","to urge; to incite","incitar; instigar","inciter; encourager","有人在网上鼓动大家抵制这部电影。","yǒu rén zài wǎng shàng gǔ dòng dà jiā dǐ zhì zhè bù diàn yǐng","Someone online is urging people to boycott this film.","Alguien está instigando en internet a que todos boicoteen esta película.","Quelqu'un incite les internautes à boycotter ce film."],["L7-1421","鼓舞","gǔwǔ","V/Adj","to inspire; encouraging","animar; alentador","encourager; stimulant","这场胜利极大地鼓舞了全队的士气。","zhè chǎng shèng lì jí dà de gǔ wǔ le quán duì de shì qì","This victory greatly boosted the whole team's morale.","Esta victoria levantó enormemente la moral de todo el equipo.","Cette victoire a considérablement remonté le moral de toute l'équipe."],["L7-1422","固然","gùrán","Conj","admittedly; it's true that","si bien es cierto; aunque","certes; il est vrai que","金钱固然重要，但是健康更重要。","jīn qián gù rán zhòng yào dàn shì jiàn kāng gèng zhòng yào","Money is certainly important, but health is more important.","El dinero es importante, sin duda, pero la salud lo es más.","L'argent est certes important, mais la santé l'est encore plus."],["L7-1423","固执","gùzhi","Adj","stubborn; obstinate","terco; obstinado","têtu; obstiné","爷爷很固执，生病了也不肯去医院。","yé ye hěn gù zhí shēng bìng le yě bù kěn qù yī yuàn","Grandpa is very stubborn and won't go to the hospital even when he's ill.","El abuelo es muy terco y, aun enfermo, no quiere ir al hospital.","Grand-père est très têtu et refuse d'aller à l'hôpital même quand il est malade."],["L7-1424","故","gù","Adv/Conj","reason; therefore; former","razón; por lo tanto; antiguo","raison; donc; ancien","因跑道结冰，故本次航班推迟起飞。","yīn pǎo dào jié bīng gù běn cì háng bān tuī chí qǐ fēi","Because the runway is icy, this flight's departure is delayed.","Debido a que la pista está congelada, el despegue de este vuelo se retrasa.","La piste étant verglacée, le décollage de ce vol est retardé."],["L7-1425","顾不得","gùbu dé","","unable to attend to","no poder atender","ne pas pouvoir se soucier de","看到孩子掉进水里，他顾不得多想就跳了下去。","kàn dào hái zi diào jìn shuǐ lǐ tā gù bu dé duō xiǎng jiù tiào le xià qù","Seeing the child fall into the water, he jumped in without stopping to think.","Al ver que el niño caía al agua, se lanzó sin pensarlo dos veces.","Voyant l'enfant tomber à l'eau, il a plongé sans prendre le temps de réfléchir."],["L7-1426","顾不上","gùbushàng","","unable to attend to","no tener tiempo para","ne pas avoir le temps de","最近工作太忙，他连吃饭都顾不上。","zuì jìn gōng zuò tài máng tā lián chī fàn dōu gù bu shàng","He's been so busy at work lately that he can barely find time to eat.","Últimamente está tan ocupado con el trabajo que ni siquiera tiene tiempo de comer.","Ces derniers temps, il est tellement occupé par son travail qu'il n'a même pas le temps de manger."],["L7-1427","顾及","gùjí","V","to take into account","tener en cuenta; atender","prendre en compte; se soucier de","做决定的时候，也要顾及其他人的感受。","zuò jué dìng de shí hou yě yào gù jí qí tā rén de gǎn shòu","When making decisions, you also need to take other people's feelings into account.","Al tomar una decisión, también hay que tener en cuenta los sentimientos de los demás.","Quand on prend une décision, il faut aussi tenir compte des sentiments des autres."],["L7-1428","顾虑","gùlǜ","N/V","misgiving; worry","reserva; preocupación","scrupule; inquiétude","有什么顾虑你尽管说出来，我们一起想办法。","yǒu shén me gù lǜ nǐ jǐn guǎn shuō chū lái wǒ men yì qǐ xiǎng bàn fǎ","If you have any misgivings, just say so and we'll work out a solution together.","Si tienes alguna preocupación, dila sin problema y buscaremos juntos una solución.","Si tu as des réserves ou des inquiétudes, dis-les sans hésiter, et nous trouverons une solution ensemble."],["L7-1429","顾全大局","gùquán-dàjú","","to consider the big picture","velar por el interés general","préserver l'intérêt général","在这种关键时刻，每个人都要顾全大局。","zài zhè zhǒng guān jiàn shí kè měi ge rén dōu yào gù quán dà jú","At a critical time like this, everyone must put the common good first.","En un momento crítico como este, todos deben velar por el interés general.","Dans un moment critique comme celui-ci, chacun doit penser à l'intérêt général."],["L7-1430","雇","gù","V","to hire; to employ","contratar","embaucher; employer","他们雇了一位保姆来照顾家里的老人。","tā men gù le yí wèi bǎo mǔ lái zhào gù jiā lǐ de lǎo rén","They hired a caregiver to look after the elderly person at home.","Contrataron a una niñera para cuidar a la persona mayor de la casa.","Ils ont engagé une aide à domicile pour s'occuper de la personne âgée de la maison."],["L7-1431","雇佣","gùyōng","V","to employ; to hire","emplear; contratar","employer; embaucher","这家农场雇佣了二十多名季节工。","zhè jiā nóng chǎng gù yōng le èr shí duō míng jì jié gōng","This farm employs more than twenty seasonal workers.","Esta granja emplea a más de veinte trabajadores de temporada.","Cette ferme emploie plus de vingt travailleurs saisonniers."],["L7-1432","雇员","gùyuán","N","employee","empleado","employé","公司规定，所有雇员每年可以享受十五天带薪假。","gōng sī guī dìng suǒ yǒu gù yuán měi nián kě yǐ xiǎng shòu shí wǔ tiān dài xīn jià","The company's rules entitle every employee to fifteen days of paid leave a year.","La empresa establece que todos los empleados pueden disfrutar de quince días de vacaciones pagadas al año.","Le règlement de l'entreprise prévoit que tous les salariés bénéficient de quinze jours de congés payés par an."],["L7-1433","雇主","gùzhǔ","N","employer","empleador","employeur","雇主必须按时为员工缴纳社会保险。","gù zhǔ bì xū àn shí wèi yuán gōng jiǎo nà shè huì bǎo xiǎn","Employers must pay social insurance for their employees on time.","El empleador debe pagar a tiempo el seguro social de sus trabajadores.","L'employeur doit verser à temps les cotisations de sécurité sociale de ses salariés."],["L7-1434","瓜分","guāfēn","V","to carve up; to divide","repartirse; dividir","se partager; dépecer","几家大公司瓜分了国内大部分的市场份额。","jǐ jiā dà gōng sī guā fēn le guó nèi dà bù fen de shì chǎng fèn é","A few big companies have carved up most of the domestic market share.","Unas cuantas grandes empresas se repartieron la mayor parte de la cuota del mercado nacional.","Quelques grandes entreprises se sont partagé l'essentiel des parts du marché intérieur."],["L7-1435","瓜子","guāzǐ","N","melon seeds; sunflower seeds","pipas; semillas de melón","graines de pastèque; graines de tournesol","过年的时候，桌上摆满了瓜子和糖果。","guò nián de shí hou zhuō shàng bǎi mǎn le guā zǐ hé táng guǒ","At New Year, the table is covered with sunflower seeds and candy.","En Año Nuevo, la mesa se llena de semillas de girasol y dulces.","Pour le Nouvel An, la table est couverte de graines de tournesol et de bonbons."],["L7-1436","刮风","guā fēng","","to be windy","haber viento","il y a du vent","这几天一直在刮风，出门的时候要多穿点。","zhè jǐ tiān yì zhí zài guā fēng chū mén de shí hou yào duō chuān diǎn","It's been windy for the past few days, so dress warmly when you go out.","Estos días ha estado soplando viento, así que abrígate más cuando salgas.","Il y a du vent ces derniers jours, alors couvre-toi bien quand tu sors."],["L7-1437","寡妇","guǎfu","N","widow","viuda","veuve","她年轻时就成了寡妇，一个人把三个孩子养大。","tā nián qīng shí jiù chéng le guǎ fu yí ge rén bǎ sān gè hái zi yǎng dà","She was widowed young and raised three children on her own.","Quedó viuda siendo joven y crió sola a sus tres hijos.","Devenue veuve très jeune, elle a élevé seule ses trois enfants."],["L7-1438","挂钩","guàgōu","N","to link; to hook","vincular; enganchar","lier; accrocher","这家公司把员工的奖金和业绩直接挂钩。","zhè jiā gōng sī bǎ yuán gōng de jiǎng jīn hé yè jì zhí jiē guà gōu","This company links employee bonuses directly to performance.","Esta empresa vincula directamente las bonificaciones de los empleados con su rendimiento.","Cette entreprise lie directement les primes des employés à leurs résultats."],["L7-1439","挂号","guàhào","","to register; to send registered mail","inscribirse; enviar certificado","prendre rendez-vous; envoyer en recommandé","看病之前要先在网上或者窗口挂号。","kàn bìng zhī qián yào xiān zài wǎng shàng huò zhě chuāng kǒu guà hào","Before seeing a doctor, you need to register online or at the counter.","Antes de ir al médico hay que sacar turno por internet o en la ventanilla.","Avant de consulter un médecin, il faut prendre rendez-vous en ligne ou au guichet."],["L7-1440","挂念","guàniàn","V","to worry about; to miss","preocuparse por; echar de menos","s'inquiéter pour; penser à","她一个人在国外读书，家里人总是很挂念她。","tā yí ge rén zài guó wài dú shū jiā lǐ rén zǒng shì hěn guà niàn tā","She is studying abroad on her own, and her family is always worried about her.","Estudia sola en el extranjero y su familia siempre está muy pendiente de ella.","Elle étudie seule à l'étranger, et sa famille pense toujours beaucoup à elle."],["L7-1441","挂失","guàshī","","to report a loss","denunciar una pérdida","déclarer une perte","银行卡丢了以后，要马上打电话挂失。","yín háng kǎ diū le yǐ hòu yào mǎ shàng dǎ diàn huà guà shī","If you lose your bank card, call right away to report it lost.","Si pierdes la tarjeta bancaria, llama de inmediato para reportar la pérdida.","Si vous perdez votre carte bancaire, appelez immédiatement pour faire opposition."],["L7-1442","乖","guāi","Adj","well-behaved; clever","obediente; listo","sage; malin","这孩子特别乖，从来不让父母操心。","zhè hái zi tè bié guāi cóng lái bú ràng fù mǔ cāo xīn","This child is very well-behaved and never gives her parents any trouble.","Este niño es muy bueno y nunca les da preocupaciones a sus padres.","Cet enfant est très sage et ne cause jamais de soucis à ses parents."],["L7-1443","乖巧","guāiqiǎo","Adj","clever; cute","listo; adorable","futé; mignon","这个小女孩又乖巧又懂事，亲戚们都特别喜欢她。","zhè ge xiǎo nǚ hái yòu guāi qiǎo yòu dǒng shì qīn qi men dōu tè bié xǐ huan tā","This little girl is sweet and sensible, and all the relatives adore her.","Esta niña es dulce y juiciosa, y todos los parientes la quieren muchísimo.","Cette petite fille est à la fois sage et raisonnable, et tous ses proches l'adorent."],["L7-1444","拐弯","guǎiwān","","to turn a corner","doblar la esquina; girar","tourner au coin","前面路口往左拐弯，再走两百米就是地铁站。","qián miàn lù kǒu wǎng zuǒ guǎi wān zài zǒu liǎng bǎi mǐ jiù shì dì tiě zhàn","Turn left at the next intersection, and the subway station is two hundred meters further on.","Dobla a la izquierda en el próximo cruce y, doscientos metros más adelante, está la estación del metro.","Tournez à gauche au prochain carrefour, et la station de métro se trouve deux cents mètres plus loin."],["L7-1445","拐杖","guǎizhàng","N","crutch; walking stick","muleta; bastón","béquille; canne","爷爷拄着拐杖慢慢地走过来。","yé ye zhǔ zhe guǎi zhàng màn màn de zǒu guò lái","Grandpa slowly walked over leaning on his cane.","El abuelo se acercó caminando despacio, apoyado en su bastón.","Grand-père s'est approché lentement, appuyé sur sa canne."],["L7-1446","怪不得","guàibude","Adv/V","no wonder","no es de extrañar","pas étonnant","原来他昨晚加班到两点，怪不得今天这么没精神。","yuán lái tā zuó wǎn jiā bān dào liǎng diǎn guài bu de jīn tiān zhè me méi jīng shen","So he worked overtime until two last night — no wonder he looks so tired today.","Con razón hoy está tan decaído: resulta que anoche hizo horas extra hasta las dos.","Ah, il a fait des heures supplémentaires jusqu'à deux heures hier soir ; pas étonnant qu'il soit si fatigué aujourd'hui."],["L7-1447","怪物","guàiwu","N","monster; freak","monstruo; bicho raro","monstre; phénomène","孩子看完电影后，夜里梦见自己被怪物追赶。","hái zi kàn wán diàn yǐng hòu yè lǐ mèng jiàn zì jǐ bèi guài wu zhuī gǎn","After watching the movie, the child dreamed at night of being chased by a monster.","Después de ver la película, el niño soñó por la noche que un monstruo lo perseguía.","Après avoir regardé le film, l'enfant a rêvé la nuit qu'un monstre le poursuivait."],["L7-1448","怪异","guàiyì","Adj","strange; weird","extraño; raro","étrange; bizarre","深夜里传来一阵怪异的声音，吓得她不敢开门。","shēn yè lǐ chuán lái yí zhèn guài yì de shēng yīn xià de tā bù gǎn kāi mén","A strange sound came in the middle of the night, so frightening that she didn't dare open the door.","En plena noche se oyó un ruido extraño que la asustó tanto que no se atrevió a abrir la puerta.","Au milieu de la nuit, un bruit étrange s'est fait entendre, et elle a eu si peur qu'elle n'a pas osé ouvrir la porte."],["L7-1449","关掉","guāndiào","","to turn off","apagar; cerrar","éteindre; fermer","离开办公室之前，请记得关掉电脑和空调。","lí kāi bàn gōng shì zhī qián qǐng jì de guān diào diàn nǎo hé kōng tiáo","Before leaving the office, please remember to switch off the computer and the air conditioner.","Antes de salir de la oficina, recuerden apagar la computadora y el aire acondicionado.","Avant de quitter le bureau, pensez à éteindre l'ordinateur et la climatisation."],["L7-1450","关节","guānjié","N","joint; key point","articulación; punto clave","articulation; point crucial","他打篮球时摔了一跤，肩关节错位了。","tā dǎ lán qiú shí shuāi le yì jiāo jiān guān jié cuò wèi le","He fell while playing basketball and dislocated his shoulder.","Se cayó mientras jugaba baloncesto y se dislocó el hombro.","Il est tombé en jouant au basket et s'est luxé l'épaule."],["L7-1451","关税","guānshuì","N","customs duty; tariff","arancel; aduana","droits de douane; tarif douanier","提高进口关税以后，这类商品的价格明显上涨了。","tí gāo jìn kǒu guān shuì yǐ hòu zhè lèi shāng pǐn de jià gé míng xiǎn shàng zhǎng le","After import tariffs were raised, prices of these goods rose noticeably.","Después de que se subieron los aranceles de importación, el precio de este tipo de productos subió notablemente.","Depuis le relèvement des droits de douane à l'importation, les prix de ces produits ont nettement augmenté."],["L7-1452","关头","guāntóu","N","critical moment","momento crítico","moment critique","在生死关头，他毫不犹豫地救了战友。","zài shēng sǐ guān tóu tā háo bù yóu yù de jiù le zhàn yǒu","At the moment of life and death, he saved his comrade without the slightest hesitation.","En el momento crítico entre la vida y la muerte, salvó a su compañero sin dudarlo.","À l'instant décisif entre la vie et la mort, il a sauvé son camarade sans la moindre hésitation."],["L7-1453","关照","guānzhào","V","to look after; to remind","cuidar de; avisar","prendre soin de; prévenir","我第一次来这里工作，以后还请大家多多关照。","wǒ dì yī cì lái zhè lǐ gōng zuò yǐ hòu hái qǐng dà jiā duō duō guān zhào","This is my first time working here, so I hope everyone will look after me from now on.","Es la primera vez que trabajo aquí; les pido que me ayuden mucho de ahora en adelante.","C'est la première fois que je travaille ici, alors je compte sur votre bienveillance à tous."],["L7-1454","观测","guāncè","V","to observe; observation","observar; observación","observer; observation","气象站每天都要观测气温、湿度和风速的变化。","qì xiàng zhàn měi tiān dōu yào guān cè qì wēn shī dù hé fēng sù de biàn huà","The weather station observes changes in temperature, humidity, and wind speed every day.","La estación meteorológica observa todos los días los cambios de temperatura, humedad y velocidad del viento.","La station météorologique observe chaque jour l'évolution de la température, de l'humidité et de la vitesse du vent."],["L7-1455","观感","guāngǎn","N","impressions","impresiones","impressions","参观结束后，老师让每个学生写一篇观感。","cān guān jié shù hòu lǎo shī ràng měi ge xué shēng xiě yì piān guān gǎn","After the visit, the teacher asked each student to write about their impressions.","Al terminar la visita, la maestra pidió a cada alumno que escribiera sus impresiones.","À la fin de la visite, le professeur a demandé à chaque élève de rédiger ses impressions."],["L7-1456","观摩","guānmó","V","to observe and learn from","observar para aprender","observer pour s'inspirer","新老师们被安排到优秀教师的课堂上观摩学习。","xīn lǎo shī men bèi ān pái dào yōu xiù jiào shī de kè táng shàng guān mó xué xí","The new teachers were assigned to sit in on outstanding teachers' classes and learn from them.","A los profesores nuevos los destinaron a las clases de profesores destacados para observar y aprender.","Les nouveaux professeurs ont été affectés aux cours d'enseignants remarquables pour observer et apprendre."],["L7-1457","观赏","guānshǎng","V","to enjoy viewing; ornamental","contemplar; ornamental","admirer; ornemental","每年春天，很多游客专程来这里观赏樱花。","měi nián chūn tiān hěn duō yóu kè zhuān chéng lái zhè lǐ guān shǎng yīng huā","Every spring, many tourists come here specially to admire the cherry blossoms.","Cada primavera, muchos turistas vienen expresamente aquí a admirar los cerezos en flor.","Chaque printemps, de nombreux touristes viennent spécialement ici admirer les cerisiers en fleurs."],["L7-1458","观望","guānwàng","V","to wait and see","esperar y ver","attendre et voir","房价走势还不明朗，不少买家选择继续观望。","fáng jià zǒu shì hái bù míng lǎng bù shǎo mǎi jiā xuǎn zé jì xù guān wàng","With the direction of housing prices still unclear, many buyers have chosen to keep waiting and watching.","La tendencia de los precios de la vivienda todavía no está clara, y muchos compradores prefieren seguir esperando.","L'évolution des prix de l'immobilier reste floue, et beaucoup d'acheteurs préfèrent continuer d'attendre."],["L7-1459","官兵","guānbīng","N","officers and soldiers","oficiales y soldados","officiers et soldats","洪水来临时，部队官兵连夜赶到大堤上抢险。","hóng shuǐ lái lín shí bù duì guān bīng lián yè gǎn dào dà dī shàng qiǎng xiǎn","When the flood came, officers and soldiers rushed to the embankment overnight to fight it.","Cuando llegó la inundación, los oficiales y soldados del ejército corrieron durante la noche al dique para atender la emergencia.","Quand la crue est arrivée, officiers et soldats se sont précipités sur la digue pendant la nuit pour lutter contre le danger."],["L7-1460","官吏","guānlì","N","official; bureaucrat","funcionario; burócrata","fonctionnaire; mandarin","古代有些官吏利用职权欺压百姓。","gǔ dài yǒu xiē guān lì lì yòng zhí quán qī yā bǎi xìng","In ancient times, some officials abused their power to oppress the common people.","En la antigüedad, algunos funcionarios abusaban de su autoridad para oprimir al pueblo.","Dans l'Antiquité, certains fonctionnaires abusaient de leur pouvoir pour opprimer le peuple."],["L7-1461","官僚","guānliáo","N","bureaucrat; bureaucracy","burócrata; burocracia","bureaucrate; bureaucratie","这位领导一点儿也不官僚，经常到基层听取意见。","zhè wèi lǐng dǎo yì diǎnr yě bù guān liáo jīng cháng dào jī céng tīng qǔ yì jiàn","This leader isn't bureaucratic at all and often goes to the grassroots to hear opinions.","Este dirigente no es nada burocrático y con frecuencia va a las bases a escuchar opiniones.","Ce dirigeant n'est pas du tout bureaucrate et va souvent à la base recueillir des avis."],["L7-1462","官僚主义","guānliáo zhǔyì","","bureaucracy","burocratismo","bureaucratisme","群众最反感的就是办事拖拉的官僚主义作风。","qún zhòng zuì fǎn gǎn de jiù shì bàn shì tuō lā de guān liáo zhǔ yì zuò fēng","What the public resents most is the bureaucratic style of dragging things out.","Lo que más rechaza la gente es el estilo burocrático de retrasar los trámites.","Ce que la population déteste le plus, c'est le style bureaucratique qui fait traîner les démarches."],["L7-1463","官员","guānyuán","N","official; administrator","funcionario; autoridad","fonctionnaire; responsable","这名官员因受贿被判了十年。","zhè míng guān yuán yīn shòu huì bèi pàn le shí nián","The official was sentenced to ten years for taking bribes.","Ese funcionario fue condenado a diez años por aceptar sobornos.","Ce fonctionnaire a été condamné à dix ans de prison pour corruption."],["L7-1464","棺材","guāncai","N","coffin","ataúd","cercueil","按照当地的风俗，老人很早就给自己准备好了棺材。","àn zhào dāng dì de fēng sú lǎo rén hěn zǎo jiù gěi zì jǐ zhǔn bèi hǎo le guān cai","Following local custom, the old man prepared his own coffin long in advance.","Según la costumbre local, el anciano preparó su propio ataúd con mucha anticipación.","Conformément à la coutume locale, le vieil homme avait préparé son propre cercueil bien à l'avance."],["L7-1465","管家","guǎnjiā","N","butler; housekeeper","mayordomo; ama de llaves","majordome; intendant","小说里，管家为了财产谋害了自己的主人。","xiǎo shuō lǐ guǎn jiā wèi le cái chǎn móu hài le zì jǐ de zhǔ rén","In the novel, the butler murdered his master for the master's property.","En la novela, el mayordomo asesinó a su amo para quedarse con su fortuna.","Dans le roman, le majordome assassine son maître pour s'emparer de sa fortune."],["L7-1466","管教","guǎnjiào","V/N","to discipline; to supervise","disciplinar; educar","discipliner; éduquer","孩子犯了错，父母要耐心管教，不能只靠打骂。","hái zi fàn le cuò fù mǔ yào nài xīn guǎn jiào bù néng zhǐ kào dǎ mà","When children make mistakes, parents should discipline them patiently rather than just scolding and hitting.","Cuando los hijos se equivocan, los padres deben corregirlos con paciencia y no solo con gritos y golpes.","Quand un enfant fait une erreur, les parents doivent l'éduquer avec patience, et non se contenter de le gronder ou de le frapper."],["L7-1467","管理费","guǎnlǐfèi","N","management fee","gastos de administración","frais de gestion","这个小区每月的物业管理费是按面积收取的。","zhè ge xiǎo qū měi yuè de wù yè guǎn lǐ fèi shì àn miàn jī shōu qǔ de","The monthly property management fee in this residential complex is charged by floor area.","La cuota mensual de administración de este condominio se cobra según la superficie.","Les charges mensuelles de gestion de cette résidence sont calculées selon la surface."],["L7-1468","管辖","guǎnxiá","V","to have jurisdiction over","tener jurisdicción sobre","avoir juridiction sur","这起案件发生在邻市，不归我们派出所管辖。","zhè qǐ àn jiàn fā shēng zài lín shì bù guī wǒ men pài chū suǒ guǎn xiá","This case happened in a neighboring city and falls outside our police station's jurisdiction.","Este caso ocurrió en la ciudad vecina y no es de la jurisdicción de nuestra comisaría.","Cette affaire s'est produite dans la ville voisine et ne relève pas de la compétence de notre commissariat."],["L7-1469","管用","guǎnyòng","","effective; useful","eficaz; útil","efficace; utile","这种土办法看起来简单，治咳嗽却挺管用。","zhè zhǒng tǔ bàn fǎ kàn qǐ lái jiǎn dān zhì ké sou què tǐng guǎn yòng","This folk remedy looks simple, but it works quite well for coughs.","Este remedio casero parece sencillo, pero es bastante eficaz para la tos.","Ce remède de grand-mère a l'air simple, mais il est plutôt efficace contre la toux."],["L7-1470","管子","guǎnzi","N","pipe; tube","tubo; caño","tuyau; tube","厨房水池下面的管子漏水了，得赶紧找人来修。","chú fáng shuǐ chí xià miàn de guǎn zi lòu shuǐ le děi gǎn jǐn zhǎo rén lái xiū","The pipe under the kitchen sink is leaking, so we need to get someone to fix it right away.","El tubo debajo del fregadero de la cocina tiene una fuga; hay que llamar a alguien para que lo arregle cuanto antes.","Le tuyau sous l'évier de la cuisine fuit ; il faut vite faire venir quelqu'un pour le réparer."],["L7-1471","贯彻","guànchè","V","to implement; to carry out","aplicar; llevar a cabo","mettre en œuvre; appliquer","新的安全规定必须在每个车间认真贯彻。","xīn de ān quán guī dìng bì xū zài měi ge chē jiān rèn zhēn guàn chè","The new safety regulations must be conscientiously implemented in every workshop.","Las nuevas normas de seguridad deben aplicarse rigurosamente en cada taller.","Les nouvelles règles de sécurité doivent être appliquées scrupuleusement dans chaque atelier."],["L7-1472","贯穿","guànchuān","V","to run through","atravesar; recorrer","traverser; parcourir","环保意识应该贯穿于孩子成长的每一个阶段。","huán bǎo yì shí yīng gāi guàn chuān yú hái zi chéng zhǎng de měi yí ge jiē duàn","Environmental awareness should run through every stage of a child's growth.","La conciencia ambiental debe estar presente en cada etapa del crecimiento de los niños.","La conscience écologique doit accompagner chaque étape de la croissance de l'enfant."],["L7-1473","贯通","guàntōng","V","to link up; to connect","conectar; comunicar","relier; faire communiquer","死记硬背或许能应付一时的测验，却未必有助于融会贯通。","sǐ jì yìng bèi huò xǔ néng yìng fu yì shí de cè yàn què wèi bì yǒu zhù yú róng huì guàn tōng","Rote memorization may get someone through a test, but does not necessarily lead to an integrated understanding.","Memorizar de forma mecánica quizá sirva para salir del paso en una prueba, pero no necesariamente ayuda a comprender a fondo.","Apprendre par cœur peut permettre de s'en sortir lors d'un contrôle, mais n'aide pas forcément à bien assimiler."],["L7-1474","惯","guàn","V","used to; to spoil","acostumbrado; malcriar","habitué; gâter","这个枕头太高了，我睡不惯。","zhè ge zhěn tou tài gāo le wǒ shuì bú guàn","This pillow is too high; I can't get used to sleeping on it.","Esta almohada es demasiado alta; no me acostumbro a dormir con ella.","Cet oreiller est trop haut ; je n'arrive pas à m'habituer à dormir dessus."],["L7-1475","惯例","guànlì","N","convention; usual practice","convención; costumbre","usage; convention","按照公司惯例，新员工入职第一天要请大家喝茶。","àn zhào gōng sī guàn lì xīn yuán gōng rù zhí dì yī tiān yào qǐng dà jiā hē chá","By company custom, new employees treat everyone to tea on their first day.","Por costumbre de la empresa, el primer día los empleados nuevos invitan té a todos.","Selon l'usage de l'entreprise, le premier jour, les nouveaux employés offrent le thé à tout le monde."],["L7-1476","惯性","guànxìng","N","inertia; habit","inercia; costumbre","inertie; habitude","汽车突然刹车时，乘客会因为惯性向前倾。","qì chē tū rán shā chē shí chéng kè huì yīn wèi guàn xìng xiàng qián qīng","When a car brakes suddenly, passengers lean forward because of inertia.","Cuando un auto frena de repente, los pasajeros se inclinan hacia adelante por la inercia.","Quand une voiture freine brusquement, les passagers se penchent vers l'avant à cause de l'inertie."],["L7-1477","灌","guàn","V","to pour; to irrigate","verter; regar","verser; irriguer","他往保温杯里灌满了热水，准备带去爬山。","tā wǎng bǎo wēn bēi lǐ guàn mǎn le rè shuǐ zhǔn bèi dài qu pá shān","He filled his thermos with hot water to take along on the hike.","Llenó el termo con agua caliente para llevarlo a la excursión a la montaña.","Il a rempli sa bouteille isotherme d'eau chaude pour l'emporter en randonnée."],["L7-1478","灌溉","guàngài","V","to irrigate","regar; irrigar","irriguer","这条水渠建成后，附近几千亩农田都能得到灌溉。","zhè tiáo shuǐ qú jiàn chéng hòu fù jìn jǐ qiān mǔ nóng tián dōu néng dé dào guàn gài","Once this canal is built, thousands of mu of nearby farmland can be irrigated.","Una vez construido este canal, se podrán regar varios miles de mu de tierras de cultivo de los alrededores.","Une fois ce canal construit, plusieurs milliers de mu de terres agricoles des environs pourront être irriguées."],["L7-1479","灌输","guànshū","V","to instill; to inculcate","inculcar; infundir","inculquer; instiller","教学不应局限于知识的灌输，还应引导学生提出问题、独立思考。","jiào xué bù yīng jú xiàn yú zhī shi de guàn shū hái yīng yǐn dǎo xué shēng tí chū wèn tí dú lì sī kǎo","Teaching should go beyond imparting knowledge and guide students to ask questions and think independently.","La enseñanza no debe limitarse a transmitir conocimientos, sino también guiar a los alumnos a plantear preguntas y pensar por sí mismos.","L'enseignement ne devrait pas se limiter à transmettre des connaissances, mais aussi amener les élèves à poser des questions et à réfléchir par eux-mêmes."],["L7-1480","罐","guàn","N","can; jar","lata; tarro","boîte; pot","妈妈从老家带回来一罐自己做的辣椒酱。","mā ma cóng lǎo jiā dài huí lái yí guàn zì jǐ zuò de là jiāo jiàng","Mom brought back a jar of homemade chili sauce from her hometown.","Mamá trajo de su pueblo un frasco de salsa de chile hecha por ella misma.","Maman a rapporté de sa région natale un pot de sauce pimentée qu'elle a préparée elle-même."],["L7-1481","罐头","guàntou","N","canned food; can","conserva; lata","conserve; boîte de conserve","这种罐头虽然保存时间长，但开封后要尽快吃完。","zhè zhǒng guàn tou suī rán bǎo cún shí jiān cháng dàn kāi fēng hòu yào jǐn kuài chī wán","This canned food keeps for a long time, but it should be eaten as soon as possible after opening.","Aunque esta conserva dura mucho tiempo, una vez abierta hay que comerla cuanto antes.","Cette conserve se garde longtemps, mais une fois ouverte, il faut la consommer le plus vite possible."],["L7-1482","光彩","guāngcǎi","N/Adj","splendor; glory","esplendor; gloria","éclat; gloire","他靠欺骗赚钱，这种事一点儿也不光彩。","tā kào qī piàn zhuàn qián zhè zhǒng shì yì diǎnr yě bù guāng cǎi","He made money by cheating — there's nothing honorable about that at all.","Gana dinero engañando a la gente; eso no tiene nada de honroso.","Il gagne de l'argent en trompant les gens, et il n'y a vraiment rien de glorieux là-dedans."],["L7-1483","光碟","guāngdié","N","CD; optical disc","CD; disco óptico","CD; disque optique","现在大家都在网上看电影，很少有人再买光碟了。","xiàn zài dà jiā dōu zài wǎng shàng kàn diàn yǐng hěn shǎo yǒu rén zài mǎi guāng dié le","Nowadays everyone watches movies online, and hardly anyone buys discs anymore.","Hoy en día todos ven películas en internet y casi nadie compra discos ya.","De nos jours, tout le monde regarde des films en ligne, et presque plus personne n'achète de disques."],["L7-1484","光顾","guānggù","V","to patronize; to visit (a shop)","frecuentar; visitar (una tienda)","fréquenter; visiter (un magasin)","他光顾着看手机，锅里的饭都糊了。","tā guāng gù zhe kàn shǒu jī guō lǐ de fàn dōu hú le","He was so absorbed in his phone that the rice in the pot burned.","Estaba tan pendiente del celular que el arroz de la olla se quemó.","Il était tellement absorbé par son téléphone que le riz s'est mis à brûler dans la casserole."],["L7-1485","光滑","guānghuá","Adj","smooth; glossy","liso; brillante","lisse; brillant","海边的岩石被海浪冲刷得很光滑。","hǎi biān de yán shí bèi hǎi làng chōng shuā de hěn guāng huá","The rocks by the sea have been worn smooth by the waves.","Las olas han dejado muy lisas las rocas de la orilla del mar.","Les rochers du bord de mer ont été polis par les vagues."],["L7-1486","光环","guānghuán","N","halo; aura","halo; aureola","halo; auréole","获得冠军以后，他头上多了很多光环，压力也更大了。","huò dé guàn jūn yǐ hòu tā tóu shàng duō le hěn duō guāng huán yā lì yě gèng dà le","After winning the championship he gained a lot of glory, but also more pressure.","Después de ganar el campeonato, le llovieron los elogios, pero también aumentó la presión.","Après avoir remporté le championnat, il s'est vu auréolé de gloire, mais la pression est aussi devenue plus forte."],["L7-1487","光缆","guānglǎn","N","optical cable","cable de fibra óptica","câble optique","这条海底光缆连接了两个大洲的互联网。","zhè tiáo hǎi dǐ guāng lǎn lián jiē le liǎng gè dà zhōu de hù lián wǎng","This undersea optical cable connects the internet of two continents.","Este cable submarino de fibra óptica conecta el internet de dos continentes.","Ce câble optique sous-marin relie l'internet de deux continents."],["L7-1488","光芒","guāngmáng","N","rays of light; radiance","rayos de luz; resplandor","rayons de lumière; éclat","清晨，太阳的光芒照在湖面上，闪闪发亮。","qīng chén tài yáng de guāng máng zhào zài hú miàn shàng shǎn shǎn fā liàng","In the early morning, the sun's rays shine on the lake, sparkling brightly.","Al amanecer, los rayos del sol se reflejan en la superficie del lago y brillan con destellos.","Au petit matin, les rayons du soleil éclairent la surface du lac et scintillent."],["L7-1489","光明磊落","guāngmíng-lěiluò","","open and upright","franco y honrado","franc et droit","他为人光明磊落，从来不在背后说别人坏话。","tā wéi rén guāng míng lěi luò cóng lái bú zài bèi hòu shuō bié rén huài huà","He is open and aboveboard and never speaks ill of others behind their backs.","Es una persona franca y recta, que jamás habla mal de los demás a sus espaldas.","C'est un homme droit et franc, qui ne dit jamais de mal des autres dans leur dos."],["L7-1490","光泽","guāngzé","N","luster; gloss","brillo; lustre","éclat; lustre","这种护发素能让头发变得柔软而有光泽。","zhè zhǒng hù fà sù néng ràng tóu fa biàn de róu ruǎn ér yǒu guāng zé","This conditioner makes hair soft and glossy.","Este acondicionador deja el cabello suave y brillante.","Cet après-shampooing rend les cheveux doux et brillants."],["L7-1491","广义","guǎngyì","N","broad sense","sentido amplio","sens large","从广义上讲，文化包括人类创造的一切物质和精神财富。","cóng guǎng yì shàng jiǎng wén huà bāo kuò rén lèi chuàng zào de yí qiè wù zhì hé jīng shén cái fù","In the broad sense, culture includes all the material and spiritual wealth humanity has created.","En sentido amplio, la cultura abarca toda la riqueza material y espiritual creada por la humanidad.","Au sens large, la culture comprend toutes les richesses matérielles et spirituelles créées par l'humanité."],["L7-1492","归根到底","guīgēn-dàodǐ","","in the final analysis","en última instancia","en fin de compte","归根到底，企业之间的竞争是人才的竞争。","guī gēn dào dǐ qǐ yè zhī jiān de jìng zhēng shì rén cái de jìng zhēng","In the final analysis, competition between companies is competition for talent.","En última instancia, la competencia entre las empresas es una competencia por el talento.","En fin de compte, la concurrence entre les entreprises est une concurrence pour les talents."],["L7-1493","归还","guīhuán","V","to return; to give back","devolver","rendre; restituer","借图书馆的书要按时归还，否则要交罚款。","jiè tú shū guǎn de shū yào àn shí guī huán fǒu zé yào jiāo fá kuǎn","Library books must be returned on time, or you'll have to pay a fine.","Los libros prestados de la biblioteca deben devolverse a tiempo; de lo contrario hay que pagar una multa.","Les livres empruntés à la bibliothèque doivent être rendus à temps, sous peine d'amende."],["L7-1494","归结","guījié","V","to sum up; to boil down to","resumir; reducirse a","résumer; se ramener à","专家把事故的原因归结为管理上的漏洞。","zhuān jiā bǎ shì gù de yuán yīn guī jié wéi guǎn lǐ shàng de lòu dòng","The experts attributed the accident to failings in management.","Los expertos atribuyeron la causa del accidente a fallas en la gestión.","Les experts ont imputé la cause de l'accident à des failles de gestion."],["L7-1495","归来","guīlái","V","to return; to come back","regresar; volver","revenir; rentrer","全家人都在期盼着他平安归来。","quán jiā rén dōu zài qī pàn zhe tā píng ān guī lái","The whole family is longing for his safe return.","Toda la familia espera con ansias que regrese sano y salvo.","Toute la famille attend avec impatience qu'il revienne sain et sauf."],["L7-1496","归纳","guīnà","V","to summarize; to induce","resumir; inducir","résumer; induire","请大家把这篇文章的主要观点归纳成三条。","qǐng dà jiā bǎ zhè piān wén zhāng de zhǔ yào guān diǎn guī nà chéng sān tiáo","Please summarize the main points of this article in three items.","Por favor, resuman en tres puntos las ideas principales de este artículo.","Veuillez résumer en trois points les idées principales de cet article."],["L7-1497","归属","guīshǔ","V","to belong to; belonging","pertenecer a; pertenencia","appartenir à; appartenance","这块土地的归属问题已经争论了好几年。","zhè kuài tǔ dì de guī shǔ wèn tí yǐ jīng zhēng lùn le hǎo jǐ nián","The question of who owns this piece of land has been disputed for several years.","La cuestión de a quién pertenece este terreno lleva varios años en disputa.","La question de l'appartenance de ce terrain est débattue depuis plusieurs années."],["L7-1498","归宿","guīsù","N","final destination; home","destino final; hogar","destination finale; foyer","对很多老人来说，回到故乡是最好的归宿。","duì hěn duō lǎo rén lái shuō huí dào gù xiāng shì zuì hǎo de guī sù","For many older people, their hometown is the best place to settle in later life.","Para muchos ancianos, volver a su tierra natal es el mejor destino.","Pour beaucoup de personnes âgées, retourner dans leur région natale est la meilleure façon de finir leurs jours."],["L7-1499","龟","guī","N","turtle; tortoise","tortuga","tortue","这只龟已经在我家养了二十多年，爬得特别慢。","zhè zhī guī yǐ jīng zài wǒ jiā yǎng le èr shí duō nián pá de tè bié màn","This tortoise has been kept in our home for over twenty years, and it crawls very slowly.","Esta tortuga lleva más de veinte años en mi casa y se arrastra muy despacio.","Cette tortue vit chez nous depuis plus de vingt ans et se déplace très lentement."],["L7-1500","规格","guīgé","N","specification; standard","especificación; norma","spécification; norme","这批零件的规格不符合要求，只好全部退回。","zhè pī líng jiàn de guī gé bù fú hé yāo qiú zhǐ hǎo quán bù tuì huí","This batch of parts didn't meet the specifications, so all of it had to be sent back.","Las especificaciones de este lote de piezas no cumplían los requisitos, así que hubo que devolverlo todo.","Les spécifications de ce lot de pièces ne répondaient pas aux exigences, il a donc fallu tout renvoyer."],["L7-1501","规矩","guīju","N/Adj","rule; well-behaved","regla; formal","règle; sage","这些规矩都是老祖宗留下来的。","zhè xiē guī ju dōu shì lǎo zǔ zong liú xià lái de","These rules were all handed down by our forefathers.","Todas estas reglas nos las dejaron los antepasados.","Toutes ces règles nous ont été transmises par nos ancêtres."],["L7-1502","闺女","guīnü","N","girl; daughter","muchacha; hija","jeune fille; fille","老王的闺女今年考上了大学，全家都很高兴。","lǎo wáng de guī nü jīn nián kǎo shàng le dà xué quán jiā dōu hěn gāo xìng","Old Wang's daughter got into university this year, and the whole family is delighted.","La hija del viejo Wang entró este año a la universidad y toda la familia está muy contenta.","La fille du vieux Wang est entrée à l'université cette année, et toute la famille est ravie."],["L7-1503","瑰宝","guībǎo","N","treasure; gem","tesoro; joya","trésor; joyau","京剧是中国传统文化中的瑰宝。","jīng jù shì zhōng guó chuán tǒng wén huà zhōng de guī bǎo","Peking opera is a treasure of traditional Chinese culture.","La ópera de Pekín es un tesoro de la cultura tradicional china.","L'opéra de Pékin est un trésor de la culture traditionnelle chinoise."],["L7-1504","轨迹","guǐjì","N","trajectory; track","trayectoria; rastro","trajectoire; trace","科学家通过计算准确地预测了这颗彗星的运行轨迹。","kē xué jiā tōng guò jì suàn zhǔn què de yù cè le zhè kē huì xīng de yùn xíng guǐ jì","By calculation, scientists accurately predicted the orbit of this comet.","Mediante cálculos, los científicos predijeron con exactitud la órbita de este cometa.","Par le calcul, les scientifiques ont prédit avec précision la trajectoire de cette comète."],["L7-1505","柜台","guìtái","N","counter","mostrador","comptoir","她在银行柜台前排了半个小时的队才办完业务。","tā zài yín háng guì tái qián pái le bàn ge xiǎo shí de duì cái bàn wán yè wù","She waited in line at the bank counter for half an hour before finishing her business.","Hizo fila media hora en la ventanilla del banco antes de terminar su trámite.","Elle a fait la queue une demi-heure au guichet de la banque avant d'en avoir fini avec ses opérations."],["L7-1506","贵宾","guìbīn","N","VIP; honored guest","invitado de honor; VIP","invité d'honneur; VIP","机场为这些贵宾专门开辟了一条快速通道。","jī chǎng wèi zhè xiē guì bīn zhuān mén kāi pì le yì tiáo kuài sù tōng dào","The airport opened a special fast lane for these distinguished guests.","El aeropuerto habilitó un carril rápido especial para estos invitados distinguidos.","L'aéroport a spécialement aménagé une voie rapide pour ces invités de marque."],["L7-1507","贵重","guìzhòng","Adj","precious; valuable","precioso; valioso","précieux; de valeur","请把贵重物品随身携带，不要放在行李箱里托运。","qǐng bǎ guì zhòng wù pǐn suí shēn xié dài bú yào fàng zài xíng li xiāng lǐ tuō yùn","Please keep valuables with you and do not check them in your suitcase.","Lleve consigo los objetos de valor y no los facture en la maleta.","Veuillez garder vos objets de valeur sur vous et ne pas les mettre dans la valise enregistrée."],["L7-1508","贵族","guìzú","N","noble; aristocrat","noble; aristócrata","noble; aristocrate","这座城堡过去是一个贵族家庭的住所。","zhè zuò chéng bǎo guò qù shì yí ge guì zú jiā tíng de zhù suǒ","This castle used to be the residence of a noble family.","Este castillo fue en el pasado la residencia de una familia noble.","Ce château était autrefois la demeure d'une famille noble."],["L7-1509","桂花","guìhuā","N","osmanthus flower","flor de osmanto","fleur d'osmanthus","秋天一到，满街都飘着桂花的香味。","qiū tiān yí dào mǎn jiē dōu piāo zhe guì huā de xiāng wèi","As soon as autumn comes, the whole street is filled with the scent of osmanthus.","En cuanto llega el otoño, todas las calles se llenan del aroma de los osmantos.","Dès l'arrivée de l'automne, toute la rue embaume l'osmanthus."],["L7-1510","滚动","gǔndòng","V","to roll; to scroll","rodar; desplazarse (pantalla)","rouler; défiler","屏幕下方滚动播放着最新的天气预报。","píng mù xià fāng gǔn dòng bō fàng zhe zuì xīn de tiān qì yù bào","The latest weather forecast scrolls along the bottom of the screen.","En la parte inferior de la pantalla se desplaza el último pronóstico del tiempo.","En bas de l'écran défilent les dernières prévisions météo."],["L7-1511","棍","gùn","N","stick; rod","palo; vara","bâton; barre","老人手里拿着一根长棍，慢慢地往山上走。","lǎo rén shǒu lǐ ná zhe yì gēn cháng gùn màn màn de wǎng shān shàng zǒu","Holding a long stick, the old man slowly made his way up the mountain.","El anciano, con un palo largo en la mano, subía lentamente la montaña.","Le vieil homme, un long bâton à la main, montait lentement la montagne."],["L7-1512","棍子","gùnzi","N","stick; rod","palo; vara","bâton; barre","小狗叼着一根棍子，高高兴兴地跑了回来。","xiǎo gǒu diāo zhe yì gēn gùn zi gāo gāo xìng xìng de pǎo le huí lái","The puppy came running back happily with a stick in its mouth.","El perrito volvió corriendo muy contento con un palo en la boca.","Le chiot est revenu en courant, tout content, un bâton dans la gueule."],["L7-1513","国宝","guóbǎo","N","national treasure","tesoro nacional","trésor national","大熊猫被称为中国的国宝，深受各国人民喜爱。","dà xióng māo bèi chēng wéi zhōng guó de guó bǎo shēn shòu gè guó rén mín xǐ ài","The giant panda is called China's national treasure and is loved by people around the world.","El panda gigante es considerado el tesoro nacional de China y es muy querido en todo el mundo.","Le panda géant est considéré comme le trésor national de la Chine et est très aimé dans le monde entier."],["L7-1514","国防","guófáng","N","national defense","defensa nacional","défense nationale","一个国家的国防力量关系到人民的安全。","yí ge guó jiā de guó fáng lì liàng guān xì dào rén mín de ān quán","A country's national defense capability bears on the safety of its people.","La capacidad de defensa nacional de un país está ligada a la seguridad de su pueblo.","La force de défense nationale d'un pays touche à la sécurité de sa population."],["L7-1515","国画","guóhuà","N","traditional Chinese painting","pintura tradicional china","peinture chinoise traditionnelle","他从小跟着爷爷学国画，最擅长画山水。","tā cóng xiǎo gēn zhe yé ye xué guó huà zuì shàn cháng huà shān shuǐ","He has studied traditional Chinese painting with his grandfather since childhood and is best at landscapes.","Desde pequeño aprendió pintura tradicional china con su abuelo y lo que mejor pinta son los paisajes.","Depuis l'enfance, il apprend la peinture traditionnelle chinoise avec son grand-père, et c'est dans le paysage qu'il excelle."],["L7-1516","国徽","guóhuī","N","national emblem","emblema nacional","emblème national","法院大门上方挂着庄严的国徽。","fǎ yuàn dà mén shàng fāng guà zhe zhuāng yán de guó huī","The solemn national emblem hangs above the court's main entrance.","Sobre la puerta principal del tribunal cuelga el solemne escudo nacional.","Au-dessus de l'entrée principale du tribunal est accroché le solennel emblème national."],["L7-1517","国情","guóqíng","N","national conditions","situación del país","situation nationale","制定政策必须从本国的国情出发。","zhì dìng zhèng cè bì xū cóng běn guó de guó qíng chū fā","Policies must be formulated on the basis of the country's actual conditions.","Las políticas deben formularse partiendo de la situación real del país.","Les politiques doivent être élaborées à partir de la situation réelle du pays."],["L7-1518","国土","guótǔ","N","national territory","territorio nacional","territoire national","保护每一寸国土是军人的神圣职责。","bǎo hù měi yí cùn guó tǔ shì jūn rén de shén shèng zhí zé","Defending every inch of the nation's territory is a soldier's sacred duty.","Proteger cada palmo del territorio nacional es un deber sagrado de los militares.","Défendre chaque pouce du territoire national est le devoir sacré des militaires."],["L7-1519","国学","guóxué","N","Chinese classical studies","estudios clásicos chinos","études classiques chinoises","近年来，越来越多的家长让孩子学习国学经典。","jìn nián lái yuè lái yuè duō de jiā zhǎng ràng hái zi xué xí guó xué jīng diǎn","In recent years, more and more parents have had their children study the Chinese classics.","En los últimos años, cada vez más padres hacen que sus hijos estudien los clásicos de la cultura china.","Ces dernières années, de plus en plus de parents font étudier à leurs enfants les classiques de la culture chinoise."],["L7-1520","国有","guóyǒu","V","state-owned","estatal; de propiedad estatal","appartenant à l'État","这几名官员和商人相互勾结，侵吞了大量国有资产。","zhè jǐ míng guān yuán hé shāng rén xiāng hù gōu jié qīn tūn le dà liàng guó yǒu zī chǎn","These officials colluded with businessmen to embezzle large amounts of state assets.","Estos funcionarios y empresarios se confabularon y se apropiaron de una gran cantidad de bienes del Estado.","Ces fonctionnaires se sont entendus avec des hommes d'affaires pour détourner d'importants biens de l'État."],["L7-1521","果断","guǒduàn","Adj","decisive; resolute","decidido; resuelto","décidé; résolu","遇到紧急情况时，他总能果断地作出决定。","yù dào jǐn jí qíng kuàng shí tā zǒng néng guǒ duàn de zuò chū jué dìng","In an emergency, he can always make decisions decisively.","En una situación de emergencia, siempre sabe tomar decisiones con determinación.","En cas d'urgence, il sait toujours prendre des décisions avec fermeté."],["L7-1522","果园","guǒyuán","N","orchard","huerto frutal","verger","秋天到了，果园里的苹果挂满了枝头。","qiū tiān dào le guǒ yuán lǐ de píng guǒ guà mǎn le zhī tóu","Autumn has come, and the branches in the orchard are heavy with apples.","Llegó el otoño y las ramas del huerto están cargadas de manzanas.","L'automne est arrivé, et les branches du verger ploient sous les pommes."],["L7-1523","果真","guǒzhēn","Adv/Conj","really; as expected","en efecto; de verdad","effectivement; vraiment","天气预报说今天有雨，下午果真下起了大雨。","tiān qì yù bào shuō jīn tiān yǒu yǔ xià wǔ guǒ zhēn xià qǐ le dà yǔ","The forecast said it would rain today, and sure enough it poured in the afternoon.","El pronóstico del tiempo decía que hoy llovería y, efectivamente, por la tarde cayó un aguacero.","La météo avait annoncé de la pluie aujourd'hui, et effectivement, il s'est mis à pleuvoir à verse l'après-midi."],["L7-1524","裹","guǒ","V","to wrap; to bundle","envolver","envelopper","外面风很大，她用围巾把脸裹得严严实实。","wài miàn fēng hěn dà tā yòng wéi jīn bǎ liǎn guǒ de yán yán shi shí","It was very windy outside, so she wrapped her face tightly in a scarf.","Afuera hacía mucho viento y se envolvió bien la cara con una bufanda.","Il y avait beaucoup de vent dehors, alors elle s'est bien emmitouflé le visage dans une écharpe."],["L7-1525","过半","guòbàn","V","more than half","más de la mitad","plus de la moitié","这次调查中，过半的受访者表示愿意尝试新产品。","zhè cì diào chá zhōng guò bàn de shòu fǎng zhě biǎo shì yuàn yì cháng shì xīn chǎn pǐn","In this survey, more than half of the respondents said they were willing to try the new product.","En esta encuesta, más de la mitad de los participantes dijo estar dispuesta a probar el nuevo producto.","Dans cette enquête, plus de la moitié des personnes interrogées se sont dites prêtes à essayer le nouveau produit."],["L7-1526","过不去","guòbuqù","V","to give a hard time; to be unable to pass","hacer la vida difícil; no poder pasar","chercher des ennuis à; ne pas pouvoir passer","大家都是同事，他何必总跟我过不去呢？","dà jiā dōu shì tóng shì tā hé bì zǒng gēn wǒ guò bu qù ne","We're all colleagues, so why does he keep making things hard for me?","Todos somos compañeros de trabajo; ¿por qué tiene que llevarme siempre la contraria?","Nous sommes tous collègues, alors pourquoi faut-il qu'il me mette toujours des bâtons dans les roues ?"],["L7-1527","过错","guòcuò","N","fault; mistake","culpa; error","faute; erreur","孩子犯了过错，最重要的是让他明白错在哪里。","hái zi fàn le guò cuò zuì zhòng yào de shì ràng tā míng bai cuò zài nǎ lǐ","When a child does something wrong, the most important thing is to make him understand where he went wrong.","Cuando un niño comete una falta, lo más importante es que entienda en qué se equivocó.","Quand un enfant commet une faute, le plus important est de lui faire comprendre où il s'est trompé."],["L7-1528","过道","guòdào","N","corridor; aisle","pasillo","couloir; allée","火车上人太多了，连过道里都站满了乘客。","huǒ chē shàng rén tài duō le lián guò dào lǐ dōu zhàn mǎn le chéng kè","The train was so crowded that even the aisle was full of standing passengers.","El tren iba tan lleno que hasta el pasillo estaba repleto de pasajeros de pie.","Le train était tellement bondé que même le couloir était plein de passagers debout."],["L7-1529","过关","guòguān","","to pass a test; to get through","superar una prueba; pasar","réussir une épreuve; passer","他练了整整一个月，驾照考试终于一次过关。","tā liàn le zhěng zhěng yí ge yuè jià zhào kǎo shì zhōng yú yí cì guò guān","After practicing for a whole month, he finally passed the driving test on the first try.","Practicó durante un mes entero y por fin aprobó el examen de manejo a la primera.","Après un mois entier d'entraînement, il a enfin réussi son permis de conduire du premier coup."],["L7-1530","过奖","guòjiǎng","V","to overpraise","halagar en exceso","trop me flatter","您过奖了，我只是做了自己应该做的事情。","nín guò jiǎng le wǒ zhǐ shì zuò le zì jǐ yīng gāi zuò de shì qing","You flatter me — I only did what I was supposed to do.","Me halaga usted demasiado; solo hice lo que debía hacer.","Vous me flattez trop ; je n'ai fait que ce que j'avais à faire."],["L7-1531","过节","guòjié","","to celebrate a festival","celebrar una fiesta","fêter une fête","每到过节的时候，超市里总是挤满了买东西的人。","měi dào guò jié de shí hou chāo shì lǐ zǒng shì jǐ mǎn le mǎi dōng xi de rén","Whenever there's a holiday, the supermarket is always packed with shoppers.","Cada vez que hay una fiesta, el supermercado se llena de gente comprando.","À chaque jour de fête, le supermarché est toujours plein de monde."],["L7-1532","过境","guòjìng","","to pass through; transit","transitar; tránsito","transiter; transit","这些货物只是过境运输，不在本国销售。","zhè xiē huò wù zhǐ shì guò jìng yùn shū bú zài běn guó xiāo shòu","These goods are only in transit and will not be sold in this country.","Estas mercancías solo van en tránsito y no se venderán en este país.","Ces marchandises sont seulement en transit et ne seront pas vendues dans ce pays."],["L7-1533","过滤","guòlǜ","V","to filter","filtrar","filtrer","自来水最好经过过滤再喝，这样更健康。","zì lái shuǐ zuì hǎo jīng guò guò lǜ zài hē zhè yàng gèng jiàn kāng","It's best to filter tap water before drinking it — it's healthier that way.","Es mejor filtrar el agua del grifo antes de beberla; así es más saludable.","Il vaut mieux filtrer l'eau du robinet avant de la boire ; c'est meilleur pour la santé."],["L7-1534","过期","guòqī","","to expire; overdue","caducar; vencido","expirer; périmé","这张优惠券已经过期失效了。","zhè zhāng yōu huì quàn yǐ jīng guò qī shī xiào le","This coupon has expired and is no longer valid.","Este cupón de descuento ya caducó y ya no es válido.","Ce bon de réduction est périmé et n'est plus valable."],["L7-1535","过日子","guò rìzi","","to live one's life; to get by","vivir; salir adelante","vivre; se débrouiller","她过日子精打细算，每个月都能存下一些钱。","tā guò rì zi jīng dǎ xì suàn měi ge yuè dōu néng cún xià yì xiē qián","She budgets carefully and manages to save some money every month.","Administra muy bien el dinero de la casa y todos los meses logra ahorrar algo.","Elle gère son budget avec beaucoup de soin et parvient à mettre un peu d'argent de côté chaque mois."],["L7-1536","过剩","guòshèng","V","surplus; excessive","excedente; excesivo","excédentaire; excessif","由于生产过剩，今年的蔬菜价格跌得很厉害。","yóu yú shēng chǎn guò shèng jīn nián de shū cài jià gé diē de hěn lì hai","Because of overproduction, vegetable prices have fallen sharply this year.","Debido a la sobreproducción, los precios de las verduras han caído mucho este año.","En raison de la surproduction, les prix des légumes ont fortement chuté cette année."],["L7-1537","过失","guòshī","N","fault; negligence","falta; negligencia","faute; négligence","真诚的道歉需要正视自己的过失，而不是把责任推卸给对方。","zhēn chéng de dào qiàn xū yào zhèng shì zì jǐ de guò shī ér bú shì bǎ zé rèn tuī xiè gěi duì fāng","A sincere apology requires facing one's own mistakes rather than shifting responsibility to the other person.","Una disculpa sincera exige reconocer los propios errores, en lugar de echarle la culpa a la otra persona.","Des excuses sincères exigent de regarder ses propres torts en face, au lieu de rejeter la responsabilité sur l'autre."],["L7-1538","过头","guòtóu","","to overdo; excessively","pasarse; en exceso","exagérer; excessivement","开玩笑要有分寸，玩笑开过头就会伤人。","kāi wán xiào yào yǒu fēn cun wán xiào kāi guò tóu jiù huì shāng rén","Jokes need a sense of proportion; take them too far and they can hurt people.","Hay que bromear con mesura; si te pasas de la raya, puedes herir a alguien.","Il faut plaisanter avec mesure : une blague poussée trop loin finit par blesser."],["L7-1539","过往","guòwǎng","V/N","past; to come and go","pasado; ir y venir","passé; aller et venir","路口装了红绿灯以后，过往车辆都放慢了速度。","lù kǒu zhuāng le hóng lǜ dēng yǐ hòu guò wǎng chē liàng dōu fàng màn le sù dù","After traffic lights were installed at the intersection, passing vehicles all slowed down.","Después de instalar semáforos en el cruce, los vehículos que pasan reducen la velocidad.","Depuis l'installation de feux de circulation au carrefour, les véhicules qui passent ralentissent tous."],["L7-1540","过意不去","guòyìbùqù","","to feel apologetic","sentirse mal; disculparse","se sentir gêné; être désolé","麻烦你跑了这么远的路，我心里真过意不去。","má fan nǐ pǎo le zhè me yuǎn de lù wǒ xīn lǐ zhēn guò yì bú qù","I really feel bad for making you come all this way.","Siento mucha pena de que hayas tenido que venir de tan lejos por mí.","Je suis vraiment désolé de t'avoir fait faire tout ce chemin."],["L7-1541","过瘾","guòyǐn","","to be satisfying; to get a kick","ser muy satisfactorio; disfrutar","être jouissif; se faire plaisir","这场比赛高潮迭起，观众们看得十分过瘾。","zhè chǎng bǐ sài gāo cháo dié qǐ guān zhòng men kàn de shí fēn guò yǐn","The match had one thrilling moment after another, and the spectators thoroughly enjoyed it.","El partido tuvo un momento emocionante tras otro y el público lo disfrutó muchísimo.","Le match a connu rebondissement sur rebondissement, et les spectateurs s'en sont délectés."],["L7-1542","过硬","guòyìng","","first-rate; solid","de primera; sólido","excellent; solide","要想当一名好医生，必须有过硬的专业本领。","yào xiǎng dāng yì míng hǎo yī shēng bì xū yǒu guò yìng de zhuān yè běn lǐng","To become a good doctor, you must have solid professional skills.","Para ser un buen médico, hay que tener una sólida competencia profesional.","Pour devenir un bon médecin, il faut posséder de solides compétences professionnelles."],["L7-1543","过早","guò zǎo","","too early; premature","demasiado pronto; prematuro","trop tôt; prématuré","很多专家认为，让孩子过早接触手机不利于成长。","hěn duō zhuān jiā rèn wéi ràng hái zi guò zǎo jiē chù shǒu jī bú lì yú chéng zhǎng","Many experts believe letting children use phones too early is bad for their development.","Muchos expertos creen que exponer a los niños al celular demasiado pronto no es bueno para su desarrollo.","De nombreux experts estiment qu'exposer trop tôt les enfants au téléphone portable nuit à leur développement."],["L7-1544","海岸","hǎi'àn","N","coast; seacoast","costa","côte; littoral","沿着海岸线骑车，一路上都能看到美丽的风景。","yán zhe hǎi àn xiàn qí chē yí lù shang dōu néng kàn dào měi lì de fēng jǐng","Cycling along the coastline, you can see beautiful scenery all the way.","Si andas en bicicleta por la costa, verás hermosos paisajes durante todo el camino.","En faisant du vélo le long du littoral, on voit de beaux paysages tout au long du trajet."],["L7-1545","海拔","hǎibá","N","altitude above sea level","altitud sobre el nivel del mar","altitude","这种花只生长在海拔很高的高山地区。","zhè zhǒng huā zhǐ shēng zhǎng zài hǎi bá hěn gāo de gāo shān dì qū","This flower grows only in high mountain areas at great altitudes.","Esta flor solo crece en zonas de alta montaña, a gran altitud.","Cette fleur ne pousse que dans les régions de haute montagne, à très haute altitude."],["L7-1546","海滨","hǎibīn","N","seaside; shore","costa; orilla del mar","bord de mer; rivage","暑假里，我们全家去了一座美丽的海滨城市度假。","shǔ jià lǐ wǒ men quán jiā qù le yí zuò měi lì de hǎi bīn chéng shì dù jià","During the summer vacation, our whole family went on holiday to a beautiful seaside city.","En las vacaciones de verano, toda nuestra familia fue a pasar unos días a una hermosa ciudad costera.","Pendant les vacances d'été, toute notre famille est partie en vacances dans une belle ville balnéaire."],["L7-1547","海盗","hǎidào","N","pirate","pirata","pirate","这部电影讲的是一群海盗寻找宝藏的故事。","zhè bù diàn yǐng jiǎng de shì yì qún hǎi dào xún zhǎo bǎo zàng de gù shi","This film tells the story of a band of pirates searching for treasure.","Esta película cuenta la historia de un grupo de piratas que buscan un tesoro.","Ce film raconte l'histoire d'une bande de pirates à la recherche d'un trésor."],["L7-1548","海量","hǎiliàng","N","huge volume","enorme cantidad","volume énorme","借助人工智能，研究人员可以快速分析海量数据。","jiè zhù rén gōng zhì néng yán jiū rén yuán kě yǐ kuài sù fēn xī hǎi liàng shù jù","With the help of artificial intelligence, researchers can quickly analyze massive amounts of data.","Con ayuda de la inteligencia artificial, los investigadores pueden analizar rápidamente enormes cantidades de datos.","Grâce à l'intelligence artificielle, les chercheurs peuvent analyser rapidement d'énormes quantités de données."],["L7-1549","海绵","hǎimián","N","sponge","esponja","éponge","这种厨房海绵吸水性很强，洗碗特别方便。","zhè zhǒng chú fáng hǎi mián xī shuǐ xìng hěn qiáng xǐ wǎn tè bié fāng biàn","This kitchen sponge is very absorbent and makes washing dishes easy.","Esta esponja de cocina absorbe muchísimo y hace muy cómodo lavar los platos.","Cette éponge de cuisine est très absorbante et rend la vaisselle très pratique."],["L7-1550","海面","hǎimiàn","N","sea surface","superficie del mar","surface de la mer","清晨，一轮旭日从海面上升起。","qīng chén yì lún xù rì cóng hǎi miàn shàng shēng qǐ","In the early morning, the rising sun came up over the sea.","Al amanecer, el sol naciente se elevó sobre el mar.","Au petit matin, un soleil levant a surgi au-dessus de la mer."],["L7-1551","海内外","hǎi nèiwài","","at home and abroad","dentro y fuera del país","en Chine et à l'étranger","这位作家的小说在海内外都拥有大量读者。","zhè wèi zuò jiā de xiǎo shuō zài hǎi nèi wài dōu yōng yǒu dà liàng dú zhě","This writer's novels have a large readership both at home and abroad.","Las novelas de este escritor tienen una gran cantidad de lectores dentro y fuera del país.","Les romans de cet écrivain ont de nombreux lecteurs, en Chine comme à l'étranger."],["L7-1552","海滩","hǎitān","N","beach","playa","plage","孩子们在海滩上堆沙堡，玩得不想回家。","hái zi men zài hǎi tān shàng duī shā bǎo wán de bù xiǎng huí jiā","The children built sandcastles on the beach and had so much fun they didn't want to go home.","Los niños hicieron castillos de arena en la playa y se divirtieron tanto que no querían volver a casa.","Les enfants ont construit des châteaux de sable sur la plage et s'amusaient tant qu'ils ne voulaient plus rentrer."],["L7-1553","海峡","hǎixiá","N","strait","estrecho","détroit","这座跨海大桥连接了海峡两岸的城市。","zhè zuò kuà hǎi dà qiáo lián jiē le hǎi xiá liǎng àn de chéng shì","This sea-crossing bridge links the cities on both sides of the strait.","Este puente sobre el mar une las ciudades de ambos lados del estrecho.","Ce pont maritime relie les villes des deux rives du détroit."],["L7-1554","海啸","hǎixiào","N","tsunami","tsunami","tsunami","地震引发的海啸摧毁了沿岸的许多村庄。","dì zhèn yǐn fā de hǎi xiào cuī huǐ le yán àn de xǔ duō cūn zhuāng","The tsunami triggered by the earthquake destroyed many villages along the coast.","El tsunami provocado por el terremoto destruyó muchos pueblos de la costa.","Le tsunami déclenché par le séisme a détruit de nombreux villages côtiers."],["L7-1555","海域","hǎiyù","N","sea area; waters","zona marítima; aguas","zone maritime; eaux","这片海域分布着大大小小几百个岛屿。","zhè piàn hǎi yù fēn bù zhe dà dà xiǎo xiǎo jǐ bǎi gè dǎo yǔ","Several hundred islands, large and small, are scattered across this sea area.","En esta zona del mar se distribuyen cientos de islas, grandes y pequeñas.","Cette zone maritime compte des centaines d'îles, grandes et petites."],["L7-1556","海运","hǎiyùn","V","sea shipping","transporte marítimo","transport maritime","海运虽然速度慢，但运费比空运便宜得多。","hǎi yùn suī rán sù dù màn dàn yùn fèi bǐ kōng yùn pián yi de duō","Although sea freight is slow, it is much cheaper than air freight.","Aunque el transporte marítimo es lento, el flete es mucho más barato que el aéreo.","Le transport maritime est lent, mais son coût est bien inférieur à celui du fret aérien."],["L7-1557","海藻","hǎizǎo","N","seaweed","alga marina","algue marine","有些海藻不但可以食用，还能用来制作化妆品。","yǒu xiē hǎi zǎo bú dàn kě yǐ shí yòng hái néng yòng lái zhì zuò huà zhuāng pǐn","Some seaweeds are not only edible but can also be used to make cosmetics.","Algunas algas no solo son comestibles, sino que también sirven para fabricar cosméticos.","Certaines algues sont non seulement comestibles, mais peuvent aussi servir à fabriquer des cosmétiques."],["L7-1558","骇人听闻","hàiréntīngwén","","shocking; appalling","espantoso; escalofriante","choquant; atroce","这起骇人听闻的案件引起了全社会的关注。","zhè qǐ hài rén tīng wén de àn jiàn yǐn qǐ le quán shè huì de guān zhù","This shocking case drew the attention of the whole of society.","Este caso espeluznante atrajo la atención de toda la sociedad.","Cette affaire effroyable a attiré l'attention de toute la société."],["L7-1559","害虫","hàichóng","N","pest; harmful insect","plaga; insecto dañino","nuisible; insecte nuisible","农民们用生物方法消灭害虫，减少使用农药。","nóng mín men yòng shēng wù fāng fǎ xiāo miè hài chóng jiǎn shǎo shǐ yòng nóng yào","Farmers use biological methods to eliminate pests and reduce pesticide use.","Los agricultores usan métodos biológicos para eliminar las plagas y reducir el uso de pesticidas.","Les agriculteurs utilisent des méthodes biologiques pour éliminer les nuisibles et réduire l'emploi de pesticides."],["L7-1560","害臊","hàisào","","to feel ashamed; bashful","sentir vergüenza","avoir honte; être gêné","这么大的人了还跟小孩抢糖吃，你也不害臊！","zhè me dà de rén le hái gēn xiǎo hái qiǎng táng chī nǐ yě bú hài sào","A grown-up like you fighting a child over candy — aren't you ashamed!","¡Un adulto como tú peleándose con un niño por un dulce! ¿No te da vergüenza?","À ton âge, te disputer des bonbons avec un enfant ! Tu n'as pas honte ?"],["L7-1561","害羞","hàixiū","","shy; bashful","tímido; ruborizarse","timide; gêné","她性格比较害羞，在陌生人面前很少说话。","tā xìng gé bǐ jiào hài xiū zài mò shēng rén miàn qián hěn shǎo shuō huà","She is rather shy and seldom speaks in front of strangers.","Es bastante tímida y casi no habla frente a desconocidos.","Elle est plutôt timide et parle rarement devant des inconnus."],["L7-1562","酣畅","hānchàng","Adj","unrestrained; hearty","desenfadado; pleno","sans retenue; à cœur joie","这篇文章写得酣畅淋漓，读起来让人非常痛快。","zhè piān wén zhāng xiě de hān chàng lín lí dú qǐ lái ràng rén fēi cháng tòng kuài","This essay is written with great verve and is a real pleasure to read.","Este artículo está escrito con tanta fluidez y fuerza que da mucho gusto leerlo.","Cet article est écrit avec tant de verve et d'éclat qu'on a un vrai plaisir à le lire."],["L7-1563","酣睡","hānshuì","V","to sleep soundly","dormir profundamente","dormir à poings fermés","爬了一整天山，大家一回到旅馆就酣睡起来。","pá le yì zhěng tiān shān dà jiā yì huí dào lǚ guǎn jiù hān shuì qǐ lái","After climbing mountains all day, everyone fell fast asleep as soon as they got back to the hotel.","Después de escalar montañas todo el día, apenas volvieron al hotel todos cayeron en un sueño profundo.","Après avoir escaladé des montagnes toute la journée, tout le monde s'est endormi profondément dès le retour à l'hôtel."],["L7-1564","含糊","hánhu","Adj","vague; careless","vago; descuidado","vague; négligent","记者问到关键问题时，这位发言人的回答总是很含糊。","jì zhě wèn dào guān jiàn wèn tí shí zhè wèi fā yán rén de huí dá zǒng shì hěn hán hu","Whenever reporters ask the key questions, this spokesperson's answers are always vague.","Cuando los periodistas preguntan lo esencial, las respuestas de este portavoz siempre son vagas.","Quand les journalistes posent les questions essentielles, les réponses de ce porte-parole sont toujours vagues."],["L7-1565","含蓄","hánxù","V/Adj","reserved; implicit","reservado; implícito","réservé; implicite","中国人表达感情往往比较含蓄，不习惯直接说出来。","zhōng guó rén biǎo dá gǎn qíng wǎng wǎng bǐ jiào hán xù bù xí guàn zhí jiē shuō chū lái","Chinese people tend to express feelings in a reserved way and aren't used to saying them outright.","Los chinos suelen expresar sus sentimientos de forma reservada y no acostumbran decirlos directamente.","Les Chinois expriment souvent leurs sentiments avec retenue et n'ont pas l'habitude de les dire ouvertement."],["L7-1566","函授","hánshòu","V","correspondence teaching","enseñanza por correspondencia","enseignement par correspondance","她一边工作一边参加函授学习，拿到了本科文凭。","tā yì biān gōng zuò yì biān cān jiā hán shòu xué xí ná dào le běn kē wén píng","While working, she studied by correspondence and earned a bachelor's degree.","Mientras trabajaba, estudió a distancia por correspondencia y obtuvo el título de licenciatura.","Tout en travaillant, elle a suivi des cours par correspondance et a obtenu sa licence."],["L7-1567","涵盖","hángài","V","to cover; to include","abarcar; incluir","couvrir; englober","这本词典涵盖了日常生活中的大部分常用词语。","zhè běn cí diǎn hán gài le rì cháng shēng huó zhōng de dà bù fen cháng yòng cí yǔ","This dictionary covers most of the common words used in daily life.","Este diccionario abarca la mayor parte de las palabras de uso común en la vida diaria.","Ce dictionnaire couvre la plupart des mots courants de la vie quotidienne."],["L7-1568","涵义","hányì","N","meaning; implication","significado; connotación","sens; connotation","这句古诗的涵义很深，需要结合历史背景来理解。","zhè jù gǔ shī de hán yì hěn shēn xū yào jié hé lì shǐ bèi jǐng lái lǐ jiě","The meaning of this line of classical poetry is deep and must be understood in its historical context.","El significado de este verso antiguo es muy profundo y hay que entenderlo en su contexto histórico.","Le sens de ce vers ancien est très profond et doit se comprendre à la lumière de son contexte historique."],["L7-1569","罕见","hǎnjiàn","Adj","rare; uncommon","raro; poco común","rare; peu commun","今年冬天这里下了一场罕见的大雪。","jīn nián dōng tiān zhè lǐ xià le yì chǎng hǎn jiàn de dà xuě","This winter there was a rare heavy snowfall here.","Este invierno cayó aquí una nevada intensa poco común.","Cet hiver, il est tombé ici une neige abondante d'une rareté exceptionnelle."],["L7-1570","汗水","hànshuǐ","N","sweat","sudor","sueur","他跑得满头大汗，汗水顺着脸往下淌。","tā pǎo de mǎn tóu dà hàn hàn shuǐ shùn zhe liǎn wǎng xià tǎng","He ran until he was drenched in sweat, which trickled down his face.","Corrió hasta quedar bañado en sudor, que le resbalaba por la cara.","Il a couru jusqu'à avoir le front ruisselant de sueur, qui lui coulait le long du visage."],["L7-1571","旱","hàn","Adj","drought; dry","sequía; seco","sécheresse; sec","今年夏天特别旱，河里的水位降低了一大半。","jīn nián xià tiān tè bié hàn hé lǐ de shuǐ wèi jiàng dī le yí dà bàn","This summer has been especially dry, and the river's water level has dropped by more than half.","Este verano ha sido especialmente seco y el nivel del río ha bajado más de la mitad.","Cet été a été particulièrement sec, et le niveau de la rivière a baissé de plus de moitié."],["L7-1572","旱灾","hànzāi","N","drought","sequía","sécheresse","连续几个月不下雨，这个地区遭遇了严重的旱灾。","lián xù jǐ ge yuè bú xià yǔ zhè ge dì qū zāo yù le yán zhòng de hàn zāi","After months without rain, the region was hit by a severe drought.","Tras varios meses seguidos sin llover, esta región sufrió una grave sequía.","Après plusieurs mois sans pluie, la région a subi une grave sécheresse."],["L7-1573","捍卫","hànwèi","V","to defend; to safeguard","defender; salvaguardar","défendre; sauvegarder","他们拿起法律武器，坚决捍卫自己的合法权益。","tā men ná qǐ fǎ lǜ wǔ qì jiān jué hàn wèi zì jǐ de hé fǎ quán yì","They took up the weapon of the law to firmly defend their legitimate rights.","Recurrieron a las armas de la ley para defender con firmeza sus derechos e intereses legítimos.","Ils ont pris les armes de la loi pour défendre fermement leurs droits et intérêts légitimes."],["L7-1574","焊","hàn","V","to weld; to solder","soldar","souder","师傅用了不到十分钟就把断了的铁栏杆焊好了。","shī fu yòng le bú dào shí fēn zhōng jiù bǎ duàn le de tiě lán gān hàn hǎo le","The technician welded the broken iron railing back together in under ten minutes.","El maestro soldó la barandilla de hierro rota en menos de diez minutos.","Le technicien a ressoudé la rambarde de fer cassée en moins de dix minutes."],["L7-1575","行家","hángjia","N","expert; connoisseur","experto; conocedor","expert; connaisseur","他在古董方面是个行家，一眼就能看出真假。","tā zài gǔ dǒng fāng miàn shì gè háng jia yì yǎn jiù néng kàn chū zhēn jiǎ","He's an expert on antiques and can tell genuine from fake at a glance.","Es un experto en antigüedades y con una sola mirada distingue lo auténtico de lo falso.","C'est un connaisseur en antiquités : un coup d'œil lui suffit pour distinguer le vrai du faux."],["L7-1576","行列","hángliè","N","ranks; array","filas; hilera","rangs; rangée","越来越多的年轻人加入了志愿者的行列。","yuè lái yuè duō de nián qīng rén jiā rù le zhì yuàn zhě de háng liè","More and more young people have joined the ranks of volunteers.","Cada vez más jóvenes se suman a las filas de los voluntarios.","De plus en plus de jeunes rejoignent les rangs des bénévoles."],["L7-1577","行情","hángqíng","N","market price; market situation","cotización; situación del mercado","cours du marché; conjoncture","最近股市行情不好，很多人都不敢投资了。","zuì jìn gǔ shì háng qíng bù hǎo hěn duō rén dōu bù gǎn tóu zī le","The stock market has been doing badly lately, and many people are afraid to invest.","Últimamente la bolsa no va bien y mucha gente no se atreve a invertir.","La Bourse ne se porte pas bien ces derniers temps, et beaucoup de gens n'osent plus investir."],["L7-1578","航海","hánghǎi","V","sea navigation","navegación marítima","navigation maritime","郑和的航海经历在中国历史上留下了重要的一页。","zhèng hé de háng hǎi jīng lì zài zhōng guó lì shǐ shàng liú xià le zhòng yào de yí yè","Zheng He's voyages left an important page in Chinese history.","Los viajes marítimos de Zheng He dejaron una página importante en la historia de China.","Les expéditions maritimes de Zheng He ont laissé une page importante dans l'histoire de la Chine."],["L7-1579","航天","hángtiān","V","space flight","vuelo espacial","vol spatial","中国的航天事业近年来取得了很大的进步。","zhōng guó de háng tiān shì yè jìn nián lái qǔ dé le hěn dà de jìn bù","China's space program has made great progress in recent years.","El programa espacial de China ha avanzado mucho en los últimos años.","Le programme spatial chinois a fait de grands progrès ces dernières années."],["L7-1580","航天员","hángtiānyuán","N","astronaut","astronauta","astronaute","三名航天员在太空站里生活和工作了半年。","sān míng háng tiān yuán zài tài kōng zhàn lǐ shēng huó hé gōng zuò le bàn nián","Three astronauts lived and worked on the space station for half a year.","Tres astronautas vivieron y trabajaron seis meses en la estación espacial.","Trois astronautes ont vécu et travaillé pendant six mois dans la station spatiale."],["L7-1581","航行","hángxíng","V","to sail; to navigate","navegar","naviguer","这艘潜艇可以在深海里连续航行几个月。","zhè sōu qián tǐng kě yǐ zài shēn hǎi lǐ lián xù háng xíng jǐ ge yuè","This submarine can sail continuously in the deep sea for several months.","Este submarino puede navegar de forma continua durante varios meses en aguas profundas.","Ce sous-marin peut naviguer en continu pendant plusieurs mois en eaux profondes."],["L7-1582","航运","hángyùn","N","shipping; transport","transporte marítimo","transport maritime","长江是中国最繁忙的内河航运通道之一。","cháng jiāng shì zhōng guó zuì fán máng de nèi hé háng yùn tōng dào zhī yī","The Yangtze is one of China's busiest inland shipping routes.","El Yangtsé es una de las vías de navegación fluvial interior más concurridas de China.","Le Yangzi est l'une des voies de navigation fluviale intérieure les plus fréquentées de Chine."],["L7-1583","毫不","háo bù","","not at all","en absoluto","pas du tout","面对批评，他毫不在意，照样按自己的想法去做。","miàn duì pī píng tā háo bú zài yì zhào yàng àn zì jǐ de xiǎng fǎ qù zuò","Faced with criticism, he didn't care in the least and went on doing things his own way.","Ante las críticas, no le importó en absoluto y siguió haciendo las cosas a su manera.","Face aux critiques, il s'en moquait complètement et continuait à faire les choses à sa façon."],["L7-1584","毫不犹豫","háo bù yóuyù","","without hesitation","sin dudarlo","sans hésiter","在生死关头，他毫不犹豫地救了战友。","zài shēng sǐ guān tóu tā háo bù yóu yù de jiù le zhàn yǒu","At the moment of life and death, he saved his comrade without the slightest hesitation.","En el momento crítico entre la vida y la muerte, salvó a su compañero sin dudarlo.","À l'instant décisif entre la vie et la mort, il a sauvé son camarade sans la moindre hésitation."],["L7-1585","毫无","háo wú","","completely lacking","carente por completo de","totalement dépourvu de","这种说法毫无根据，大家不要轻易相信。","zhè zhǒng shuō fǎ háo wú gēn jù dà jiā bú yào qīng yì xiāng xìn","This claim has no basis whatsoever, so don't believe it lightly.","Esta afirmación carece por completo de fundamento; no se la crean tan fácilmente.","Cette affirmation n'a aucun fondement ; ne la croyez pas à la légère."],["L7-1586","豪华","háohuá","Adj","luxurious","lujoso","luxueux","这家酒店装修得十分豪华，住一晚要好几千块。","zhè jiā jiǔ diàn zhuāng xiū de shí fēn háo huá zhù yì wǎn yào hǎo jǐ qiān kuài","This hotel is decorated very luxuriously, and a night there costs several thousand yuan.","Este hotel está decorado con mucho lujo, y una noche cuesta varios miles de yuanes.","Cet hôtel est décoré avec un grand luxe, et une nuit y coûte plusieurs milliers de yuans."],["L7-1587","好比","hǎobǐ","V","just like; to compare to","igual que; equivaler a","tout comme; comparable à","读书好比交朋友，要选择对自己有益的。","dú shū hǎo bǐ jiāo péng you yào xuǎn zé duì zì jǐ yǒu yì de","Reading books is like making friends: you should choose ones that do you good.","Leer libros es como hacer amigos: hay que elegir los que nos hacen bien.","Lire, c'est comme se faire des amis : il faut choisir ceux qui nous font du bien."],["L7-1588","好歹","hǎodǎi","N/Adv","in any case; good or bad","en cualquier caso; bien o mal","en tout cas; bon gré mal gré","不管怎么说，他好歹也是你的哥哥，你应该尊重他。","bù guǎn zěn me shuō tā hǎo dǎi yě shì nǐ de gē ge nǐ yīng gāi zūn zhòng tā","Whatever you say, he is your brother after all, and you should respect him.","Digas lo que digas, al fin y al cabo es tu hermano mayor y debes respetarlo.","Quoi qu'on dise, c'est quand même ton frère, et tu dois le respecter."],["L7-1589","好感","hǎogǎn","N","good impression; favor","buena impresión; simpatía","bonne impression; sympathie","第一次见面，她就对这个热情的小伙子产生了好感。","dì yī cì jiàn miàn tā jiù duì zhè ge rè qíng de xiǎo huǒ zi chǎn shēng le hǎo gǎn","At their first meeting, she took a liking to this warm young man.","En el primer encuentro, ella se sintió simpatía por ese joven tan amable.","Dès leur première rencontre, elle a eu une bonne impression de ce jeune homme chaleureux."],["L7-1590","好坏","hǎohuài","N","good and bad","lo bueno y lo malo","le bon et le mauvais","一本书的好坏，不能只看它卖了多少本。","yì běn shū de hǎo huài bù néng zhǐ kàn tā mài le duō shao běn","Whether a book is good or bad can't be judged only by how many copies it sells.","Que un libro sea bueno o malo no se puede juzgar solo por cuántos ejemplares vendió.","La qualité d'un livre ne se juge pas uniquement au nombre d'exemplaires vendus."],["L7-1591","好家伙","hǎojiāhuo","Intj","wow; oh boy","¡caramba!; ¡vaya!","ça alors; mince alors","好家伙，这么大的西瓜，我还是第一次见！","hǎo jiā huo zhè me dà de xī guā wǒ hái shi dì yī cì jiàn","Wow, a watermelon this big — this is the first time I've seen one!","¡Caramba, una sandía tan grande! ¡Es la primera vez que veo una!","Ça alors, une pastèque aussi énorme ! C'est la première fois que j'en vois une !"],["L7-1592","好评","hǎopíng","N","favorable review","buena crítica","critique favorable","这款新手机上市以后，得到了用户的一致好评。","zhè kuǎn xīn shǒu jī shàng shì yǐ hòu dé dào le yòng hù de yí zhì hǎo píng","After this new phone came out, it received unanimous praise from users.","Después de salir al mercado, este nuevo celular recibió elogios unánimes de los usuarios.","Après sa sortie, ce nouveau téléphone a reçu les éloges unanimes des utilisateurs."],["L7-1593","好说","hǎoshuō","V","no problem; you flatter me","no hay problema; me halaga","pas de problème; vous me flattez","他的批评正好说中了问题的要害。","tā de pī píng zhèng hǎo shuō zhòng le wèn tí de yào hài","His criticism hit right at the crux of the problem.","Su crítica dio justo en el punto clave del problema.","Sa critique a touché précisément le point crucial du problème."],["L7-1594","好笑","hǎoxiào","Adj","funny; ridiculous","gracioso; ridículo","drôle; ridicule","他一本正经地讲笑话，样子特别好笑。","tā yì běn zhèng jīng de jiǎng xiào hua yàng zi tè bié hǎo xiào","He told jokes with a perfectly straight face, which looked hilarious.","Contaba chistes con toda seriedad, y su aspecto resultaba graciosísimo.","Il racontait des blagues avec un sérieux imperturbable, ce qui était particulièrement drôle."],["L7-1595","好心","hǎoxīn","N","kindness; kind-hearted","buena intención; bondadoso","bonne intention; bienveillant","我好心帮他，他反倒怪我多管闲事。","wǒ hǎo xīn bāng tā tā fǎn dào guài wǒ duō guǎn xián shì","I helped him out of kindness, but instead he blamed me for being nosy.","Lo ayudé con buena intención y, al contrario, me reprochó que me metiera donde no me llamaban.","Je l'ai aidé de bon cœur, et il m'a au contraire reproché de me mêler de ce qui ne me regardait pas."],["L7-1596","好心人","hǎoxīnrén","N","kind-hearted person","persona de buen corazón","personne de bon cœur","多亏一位好心人帮忙，她才找回了丢失的钱包。","duō kuī yí wèi hǎo xīn rén bāng máng tā cái zhǎo huí le diū shī de qián bāo","Thanks to help from a kindhearted person, she was able to recover her lost wallet.","Gracias a la ayuda de una persona de buen corazón, pudo recuperar la cartera que había perdido.","Grâce à l'aide d'une personne de bonne volonté, elle a pu retrouver son portefeuille perdu."],["L7-1597","好意","hǎoyì","N","good intention; kindness","buena intención; amabilidad","bonne intention; gentillesse","她不愿勉强别人接受自己的好意，也懂得在适当的时候保持距离。","tā bú yuàn miǎn qiǎng bié rén jiē shòu zì jǐ de hǎo yì yě dǒng de zài shì dàng de shí hou bǎo chí jù lí","She did not want to force her goodwill on others and knew when to give them space.","No quería obligar a los demás a aceptar su buena voluntad, y sabía mantener la distancia en el momento oportuno.","Elle ne voulait pas forcer les autres à accepter ses bonnes intentions, et savait garder ses distances au bon moment."],["L7-1598","好在","hǎozài","Adv","luckily; fortunately","por suerte; afortunadamente","heureusement; par chance","下班路上碰上大雨，我只好在地铁站等雨停。","xià bān lù shang pèng shàng dà yǔ wǒ zhǐ hǎo zài dì tiě zhàn děng yǔ tíng","I ran into a downpour on the way home from work and had to wait in the subway station for it to stop.","De camino a casa me agarró un fuerte aguacero y no tuve más remedio que esperar en la estación del metro a que parara.","En rentrant du travail, j'ai été pris par une pluie battante et j'ai dû attendre dans la station de métro qu'elle s'arrête."],["L7-1599","号称","hàochēng","V","to be known as; to claim to be","ser conocido como; presumir de","être réputé; prétendre être","这座城市号称“火炉”，夏天常常热得让人受不了。","zhè zuò chéng shì hào chēng huǒ lú xià tiān cháng cháng rè de ràng rén shòu bù liǎo","This city is known as a “furnace,” and summers are often unbearably hot.","Esta ciudad tiene fama de ser un «horno»; en verano a menudo hace un calor insoportable.","Cette ville est surnommée « la fournaise », et l'été, la chaleur y est souvent insupportable."],["L7-1600","好客","hàokè","Adj","hospitable","hospitalario","hospitalier","这里的村民为人质朴，热情好客。","zhè lǐ de cūn mín wéi rén zhì pǔ rè qíng hào kè","The villagers here are simple and honest, warm and hospitable.","Los aldeanos de aquí son sencillos, cálidos y hospitalarios.","Les villageois d'ici sont simples, chaleureux et hospitaliers."],["L7-1601","好奇心","hàoqíxīn","N","curiosity","curiosidad","curiosité","孩子的好奇心很强，看到什么都想问个为什么。","hái zi de hào qí xīn hěn qiáng kàn dào shén me dōu xiǎng wèn gè wèi shén me","Children are very curious and want to ask why about everything they see.","Los niños son muy curiosos y quieren preguntar el porqué de todo lo que ven.","Les enfants sont très curieux et veulent demander pourquoi à propos de tout ce qu'ils voient."],["L7-1602","耗","hào","V","to consume; to waste","consumir; gastar","consommer; gaspiller","为了修改这份方案，他足足耗了三天时间。","wèi le xiū gǎi zhè fèn fāng àn tā zú zú hào le sān tiān shí jiān","He spent a full three days revising this proposal.","Para corregir este plan, se pasó tres días enteros.","Pour réviser ce projet, il a passé trois jours entiers."],["L7-1603","耗费","hàofèi","V","to expend; to waste","gastar; derrochar","dépenser; consommer","这项工程耗费了大量的人力和物力。","zhè xiàng gōng chéng hào fèi le dà liàng de rén lì hé wù lì","This project consumed a great deal of manpower and material resources.","Esta obra consumió una gran cantidad de recursos humanos y materiales.","Ce chantier a englouti d'importantes ressources humaines et matérielles."],["L7-1604","耗时","hàoshí","V","time-consuming","que lleva tiempo","chronophage; prendre du temps","手工制作一件这样的瓷器非常耗时，至少要一个月。","shǒu gōng zhì zuò yí jiàn zhè yàng de cí qì fēi cháng hào shí zhì shǎo yào yí ge yuè","Making a piece of porcelain like this by hand is very time-consuming and takes at least a month.","Hacer a mano una pieza de porcelana como esta lleva muchísimo tiempo, al menos un mes.","Fabriquer à la main une porcelaine comme celle-ci prend énormément de temps, au moins un mois."],["L7-1605","浩劫","hàojié","N","catastrophe; calamity","catástrofe; calamidad","catastrophe; désastre","那场战争对这座古城来说是一场浩劫。","nà chǎng zhàn zhēng duì zhè zuò gǔ chéng lái shuō shì yì chǎng hào jié","That war was a catastrophe for this ancient city.","Aquella guerra fue una catástrofe para esta antigua ciudad.","Cette guerre a été une catastrophe pour cette ancienne cité."],["L7-1606","呵护","hēhù","V","to cherish; to take good care of","cuidar con esmero; proteger","chérir; protéger avec soin","父母用心呵护着孩子，陪伴他们健康成长。","fù mǔ yòng xīn hē hù zhe hái zi péi bàn tā men jiàn kāng chéng zhǎng","Parents lovingly protect their children and accompany them as they grow up healthy.","Los padres cuidan con esmero a sus hijos y los acompañan para que crezcan sanos.","Les parents protègent leurs enfants avec amour et les accompagnent pour qu'ils grandissent en bonne santé."],["L7-1607","禾苗","hémiáo","N","seedlings (of grain)","plántulas de cereal","plants de céréales","一场春雨过后，田里的禾苗长得绿油油的。","yì chǎng chūn yǔ guò hòu tián lǐ de hé miáo zhǎng de lǜ yóu yóu de","After a spring rain, the seedlings in the fields grew lush and green.","Después de una lluvia de primavera, los brotes de los campos crecieron de un verde exuberante.","Après une pluie de printemps, les jeunes pousses des champs ont verdi à vue d'œil."],["L7-1608","合唱","héchàng","V","chorus; to sing in chorus","coro; cantar en coro","chœur; chanter en chœur","这个合唱团的团员大多是退休老人。","zhè ge hé chàng tuán de tuán yuán dà duō shì tuì xiū lǎo rén","Most of the members of this choir are retired seniors.","La mayoría de los miembros de este coro son personas mayores jubiladas.","La plupart des membres de cette chorale sont des retraités."],["L7-1609","合乎","héhū","V","to conform to","ajustarse a; cumplir con","être conforme à","这种做法既合乎法律，也合乎情理。","zhè zhǒng zuò fǎ jì hé hū fǎ lǜ yě hé hū qíng lǐ","This approach is both legal and reasonable.","Esta forma de proceder es conforme tanto a la ley como a la razón.","Cette façon de faire est à la fois conforme à la loi et conforme au bon sens."],["L7-1610","合伙","héhuǒ","V","to form a partnership","asociarse","s'associer","几个年轻人合伙开办了一家网络公司。","jǐ ge nián qīng rén hé huǒ kāi bàn le yì jiā wǎng luò gōng sī","Several young people jointly set up an internet company.","Varios jóvenes se asociaron y abrieron una empresa de internet.","Quelques jeunes se sont associés pour créer une entreprise internet."],["L7-1611","合计","héjì","V","to add up; to reckon","sumar; calcular","additionner; calculer","这几项费用合计起来，一共是三千五百元。","zhè jǐ xiàng fèi yòng hé jì qǐ lái yí gòng shì sān qiān wǔ bǎi yuán","All these expenses add up to three thousand five hundred yuan in total.","Sumados, estos gastos dan un total de tres mil quinientos yuanes.","Ces frais additionnés représentent un total de trois mille cinq cents yuans."],["L7-1612","合情合理","héqíng-hélǐ","","fair and reasonable","razonable y justo","raisonnable et équitable","你的要求合情合理，我们一定会认真考虑。","nǐ de yāo qiú hé qíng hé lǐ wǒ men yí dìng huì rèn zhēn kǎo lǜ","Your request is fair and reasonable, and we will certainly consider it carefully.","Tu petición es justa y razonable; sin duda la consideraremos con seriedad.","Votre demande est légitime et raisonnable, nous l'examinerons sérieusement."],["L7-1613","合影","héyǐng","","group photo","foto de grupo","photo de groupe","毕业典礼结束后，全班同学在校门口合影留念。","bì yè diǎn lǐ jié shù hòu quán bān tóng xué zài xiào mén kǒu hé yǐng liú niàn","After the graduation ceremony, the whole class took a group photo at the school gate as a keepsake.","Al terminar la ceremonia de graduación, todo el grupo se tomó una foto de recuerdo en la puerta de la escuela.","Après la cérémonie de remise des diplômes, toute la classe s'est photographiée devant le portail de l'école en souvenir."],["L7-1614","合资","hézī","V","joint venture","empresa conjunta","coentreprise","这家工厂是由中外双方合资建立的。","zhè jiā gōng chǎng shì yóu zhōng wài shuāng fāng hé zī jiàn lì de","This factory was established as a Sino-foreign joint venture.","Esta fábrica fue establecida como empresa conjunta entre capital chino y extranjero.","Cette usine a été créée en coentreprise sino-étrangère."],["L7-1615","合作社","hézuòshè","N","cooperative","cooperativa","coopérative","村里成立了农民合作社，帮助大家把农产品卖到城里。","cūn lǐ chéng lì le nóng mín hé zuò shè bāng zhù dà jiā bǎ nóng chǎn pǐn mài dào chéng lǐ","The village set up a farmers' cooperative to help everyone sell their produce in the city.","En el pueblo se fundó una cooperativa de campesinos para ayudar a todos a vender sus productos agrícolas en la ciudad.","Le village a créé une coopérative agricole pour aider chacun à vendre ses produits en ville."],["L7-1616","何必","hébì","Adv","why bother; no need","para qué; no hace falta","à quoi bon; inutile de","这点小事你何必生那么大的气呢？","zhè diǎn xiǎo shì nǐ hé bì shēng nà me dà de qì ne","Why get so angry over such a small thing?","¿Para qué enojarte tanto por una cosa tan pequeña?","Pourquoi te mettre tant en colère pour une si petite chose ?"],["L7-1617","何处","hé chù","","where","dónde","où","离开家乡多年，他常常想知道老朋友们如今身在何处。","lí kāi jiā xiāng duō nián tā cháng cháng xiǎng zhī dào lǎo péng you men rú jīn shēn zài hé chù","After years away from his hometown, he often wonders where his old friends are now.","Tras muchos años lejos de su tierra, a menudo se pregunta dónde estarán ahora sus viejos amigos.","Après de longues années loin de sa région natale, il se demande souvent où se trouvent aujourd'hui ses vieux amis."],["L7-1618","何苦","hékǔ","Adv","why bother","para qué molestarse","pourquoi se donner du mal","明知道他不会听，你又何苦去劝他？","míng zhī dào tā bú huì tīng nǐ yòu hé kǔ qù quàn tā","You know perfectly well he won't listen, so why bother trying to persuade him?","Sabiendo que no te va a hacer caso, ¿para qué te molestas en aconsejarle?","Tu sais très bien qu'il n'écoutera pas, alors pourquoi te donner la peine de le raisonner ?"],["L7-1619","何况","hékuàng","Conj","let alone; moreover","y más aún; además","à plus forte raison; d'ailleurs","大人都觉得累，何况是这么小的孩子呢？","dà ren dōu jué de lèi hé kuàng shì zhè me xiǎo de hái zi ne","Even the adults are tired, let alone such a small child.","Hasta los adultos se sienten cansados, ¿cuánto más un niño tan pequeño?","Même les adultes sont fatigués, alors imaginez un enfant si petit !"],["L7-1620","何时","hé shí","","when","cuándo","quand","谁也不知道这场疫情何时才能彻底结束。","shéi yě bù zhī dào zhè chǎng yì qíng hé shí cái néng chè dǐ jié shù","No one knows when this epidemic will finally be completely over.","Nadie sabe cuándo terminará por completo esta epidemia.","Personne ne sait quand cette épidémie prendra enfin complètement fin."],["L7-1621","和蔼","hé'ǎi","Adj","kindly; amiable","afable; amable","aimable; affable","新来的校长待人和蔼，同学们都愿意跟他聊天。","xīn lái de xiào zhǎng dài rén hé ǎi tóng xué men dōu yuàn yì gēn tā liáo tiān","The new principal is kind to people, and the students all like chatting with him.","El nuevo director es amable con todos y los alumnos disfrutan conversando con él.","Le nouveau directeur est aimable avec tout le monde, et les élèves aiment bavarder avec lui."],["L7-1622","和解","héjiě","V","to reconcile; to settle","reconciliarse; llegar a un acuerdo","se réconcilier; transiger","经过法院调解，双方最终同意和解，不再打官司。","jīng guò fǎ yuàn tiáo jiě shuāng fāng zuì zhōng tóng yì hé jiě bú zài dǎ guān si","After mediation by the court, the two parties finally agreed to settle and drop the lawsuit.","Tras la mediación del tribunal, ambas partes acordaron finalmente conciliarse y no seguir con el pleito.","Après la médiation du tribunal, les deux parties ont finalement accepté de se réconcilier et de renoncer au procès."],["L7-1623","和睦","hémù","Adj","harmonious","armonioso","harmonieux","他们一家三代住在一起，生活得非常和睦。","tā men yì jiā sān dài zhù zài yì qǐ shēng huó de fēi cháng hé mù","Three generations of their family live together very harmoniously.","Tres generaciones de su familia viven juntas en total armonía.","Trois générations de leur famille vivent ensemble dans une grande harmonie."],["L7-1624","和平共处","hépíng gòngchǔ","","peaceful coexistence","coexistencia pacífica","coexistence pacifique","不同文化背景的人应该学会相互尊重、和平共处。","bù tóng wén huà bèi jǐng de rén yīng gāi xué huì xiāng hù zūn zhòng hé píng gòng chǔ","People from different cultural backgrounds should learn to respect each other and coexist peacefully.","Las personas de diferentes contextos culturales deben aprender a respetarse mutuamente y a convivir en paz.","Les personnes de cultures différentes devraient apprendre à se respecter mutuellement et à coexister pacifiquement."],["L7-1625","和气","héqi","Adj/N","friendly; amiable","amable; cordial","aimable; cordial","这家店的老板说话和气，从来不跟顾客红脸。","zhè jiā diàn de lǎo bǎn shuō huà hé qi cóng lái bù gēn gù kè hóng liǎn","The owner of this shop speaks gently and never gets angry with customers.","El dueño de esta tienda habla con amabilidad y nunca se enoja con los clientes.","Le patron de cette boutique parle avec douceur et ne se fâche jamais contre les clients."],["L7-1626","和尚","héshang","N","Buddhist monk","monje budista","moine bouddhiste","山上的寺庙里住着十几个和尚。","shān shàng de sì miào lǐ zhù zhe shí jǐ ge hé shang","A dozen or so monks live in the temple on the mountain.","En el templo de la montaña viven una docena de monjes.","Une douzaine de moines vivent dans le temple de la montagne."],["L7-1627","河流","héliú","N","river","río","rivière; fleuve","这片土地被一条河流分割成了两部分。","zhè piàn tǔ dì bèi yì tiáo hé liú fēn gē chéng le liǎng bù fen","This piece of land is divided into two parts by a river.","Este terreno está dividido en dos partes por un río.","Ce terrain est divisé en deux parties par un cours d'eau."],["L7-1628","河畔","hépàn","N","riverside","ribera","bord de rivière","傍晚时分，很多居民喜欢在河畔散步。","bàng wǎn shí fēn hěn duō jū mín xǐ huan zài hé pàn sàn bù","In the evening, many residents like to stroll along the riverside.","Al caer la tarde, a muchos vecinos les gusta pasear por la orilla del río.","Au crépuscule, beaucoup d'habitants aiment se promener au bord de la rivière."],["L7-1629","荷花","héhuā","N","lotus","loto","lotus","夏天的西湖开满了荷花，吸引了大批游客。","xià tiān de xī hú kāi mǎn le hé huā xī yǐn le dà pī yóu kè","In summer, West Lake is full of blooming lotus flowers, attracting crowds of tourists.","En verano, el Lago del Oeste se llena de flores de loto y atrae a multitud de turistas.","En été, le lac de l'Ouest se couvre de fleurs de lotus et attire une foule de touristes."],["L7-1630","核","hé","N","pit; nucleus; nuclear","hueso; núcleo; nuclear","noyau; nucléaire","吃樱桃的时候要小心，别把核咽下去。","chī yīng táo de shí hou yào xiǎo xīn bié bǎ hé yàn xià qù","Be careful when eating cherries not to swallow the pits.","Ten cuidado al comer cerezas y no te tragues el hueso.","Fais attention en mangeant des cerises de ne pas avaler le noyau."],["L7-1631","核电站","hédiànzhàn","N","nuclear power plant","central nuclear","centrale nucléaire","这座核电站为周边几个城市提供电力。","zhè zuò hé diàn zhàn wèi zhōu biān jǐ ge chéng shì tí gōng diàn lì","This nuclear power plant supplies electricity to several surrounding cities.","Esta central nuclear suministra electricidad a varias ciudades de los alrededores.","Cette centrale nucléaire fournit de l'électricité à plusieurs villes environnantes."],["L7-1632","核对","héduì","V","to check; to verify","cotejar; verificar","vérifier; contrôler","光看包装很难辨别真假，还需要核对商品的来源。","guāng kàn bāo zhuāng hěn nán biàn bié zhēn jiǎ hái xū yào hé duì shāng pǐn de lái yuán","It is difficult to tell genuine products from fakes by their packaging alone; their source also needs to be checked.","Solo con ver el empaque es difícil distinguir lo auténtico de lo falso; también hay que verificar el origen del producto.","Il est difficile de distinguer le vrai du faux rien qu'à l'emballage ; il faut aussi vérifier l'origine du produit."],["L7-1633","核能","hénéng","N","nuclear energy","energía nuclear","énergie nucléaire","核能是一种清洁能源，但安全问题必须高度重视。","hé néng shì yì zhǒng qīng jié néng yuán dàn ān quán wèn tí bì xū gāo dù zhòng shì","Nuclear energy is a clean source of power, but its safety issues must be taken very seriously.","La energía nuclear es una energía limpia, pero hay que prestar mucha atención a los problemas de seguridad.","L'énergie nucléaire est une énergie propre, mais ses problèmes de sécurité doivent être pris très au sérieux."],["L7-1634","核实","héshí","V","to verify","verificar; comprobar","vérifier; s'assurer de","这个消息来源不太可信，我们还需要核实。","zhè ge xiāo xi lái yuán bú tài kě xìn wǒ men hái xū yào hé shí","This news source isn't very reliable; we still need to verify it.","La fuente de esta noticia no es muy confiable; todavía tenemos que verificarla.","La source de cette information n'est pas très fiable ; nous devons encore la vérifier."],["L7-1635","核桃","hétao","N","walnut","nuez","noix","奶奶说经常吃核桃对大脑有好处。","nǎi nai shuō jīng cháng chī hé tao duì dà nǎo yǒu hǎo chù","Grandma says eating walnuts often is good for the brain.","La abuela dice que comer nueces con frecuencia es bueno para el cerebro.","Grand-mère dit que manger souvent des noix est bon pour le cerveau."],["L7-1636","核武器","héwǔqì","N","nuclear weapon","arma nuclear","arme nucléaire","国际社会一直在努力防止核武器扩散。","guó jì shè huì yì zhí zài nǔ lì fáng zhǐ hé wǔ qì kuò sàn","The international community has long worked to prevent the proliferation of nuclear weapons.","La comunidad internacional lleva tiempo esforzándose por evitar la proliferación de las armas nucleares.","La communauté internationale s'efforce depuis longtemps d'empêcher la prolifération des armes nucléaires."],["L7-1637","贺电","hèdiàn","N","congratulatory telegram","telegrama de felicitación","télégramme de félicitations","国家队夺冠以后，各地纷纷发来贺电。","guó jiā duì duó guàn yǐ hòu gè dì fēn fēn fā lái hè diàn","After the national team won the championship, congratulatory telegrams poured in from everywhere.","Después de que la selección nacional ganó el campeonato, llegaron telegramas de felicitación de todas partes.","Après la victoire de l'équipe nationale au championnat, des télégrammes de félicitations ont afflué de partout."],["L7-1638","贺信","hèxìn","N","congratulatory letter","carta de felicitación","lettre de félicitations","校长给获奖的同学写了一封热情洋溢的贺信。","xiào zhǎng gěi huò jiǎng de tóng xué xiě le yì fēng rè qíng yáng yì de hè xìn","The principal wrote a warm letter of congratulations to the prize-winning students.","El director escribió una cálida carta de felicitación a los alumnos premiados.","Le directeur a écrit une lettre de félicitations chaleureuse aux élèves récompensés."],["L7-1639","喝彩","hècǎi","","to cheer; to applaud","aclamar; vitorear","acclamer; applaudir","演员刚唱完最后一句，台下观众就纷纷起立喝彩。","yǎn yuán gāng chàng wán zuì hòu yí jù tái xià guān zhòng jiù fēn fēn qǐ lì hè cǎi","As soon as the actor sang the last line, the audience rose to their feet and cheered.","Apenas el actor terminó de cantar la última frase, el público se puso de pie y lo ovacionó.","À peine l'acteur avait-il chanté la dernière phrase que le public s'est levé pour l'acclamer."],["L7-1640","赫然","hèrán","Adj","suddenly; strikingly","de pronto; de forma llamativa","soudain; de façon frappante","打开抽屉，一份失踪多年的合同赫然出现在眼前。","dǎ kāi chōu ti yí fèn shī zōng duō nián de hé tóng hè rán chū xiàn zài yǎn qián","When he opened the drawer, a contract missing for years suddenly appeared before his eyes.","Al abrir el cajón, apareció de pronto ante sus ojos un contrato que llevaba años perdido.","En ouvrant le tiroir, un contrat disparu depuis des années est soudain apparu sous ses yeux."],["L7-1641","鹤立鸡群","hèlìjīqún","","to stand out from the crowd","destacar entre la multitud","se démarquer nettement","他身高一米九，站在同学中间简直是鹤立鸡群。","tā shēn gāo yì mǐ jiǔ zhàn zài tóng xué zhōng jiān jiǎn zhí shì hè lì jī qún","At one meter ninety, he stands head and shoulders above his classmates.","Mide un metro noventa, y entre sus compañeros destaca a simple vista.","Il mesure un mètre quatre-vingt-dix et dépasse tous ses camarades d'une tête."],["L7-1642","黑白","hēibái","N","black and white; right and wrong","blanco y negro; bien y mal","noir et blanc; bien et mal","爷爷家里还保存着几张五十年前的黑白照片。","yé ye jiā lǐ hái bǎo cún zhe jǐ zhāng wǔ shí nián qián de hēi bái zhào piàn","A few black-and-white photos from fifty years ago are still kept at Grandpa's home.","En casa del abuelo todavía se conservan unas fotos en blanco y negro de hace cincuenta años.","Chez grand-père, on conserve encore quelques photos en noir et blanc d'il y a cinquante ans."],["L7-1643","黑客","hēikè","N","hacker","hacker; pirata informático","pirate informatique","公司的电脑都安装了防火墙，防止黑客入侵。","gōng sī de diàn nǎo dōu ān zhuāng le fáng huǒ qiáng fáng zhǐ hēi kè rù qīn","All the company's computers have firewalls installed to prevent hacker attacks.","Todas las computadoras de la empresa tienen instalado un firewall para evitar intrusiones de hackers.","Tous les ordinateurs de l'entreprise sont équipés d'un pare-feu pour empêcher les intrusions de pirates."],["L7-1644","黑马","hēimǎ","N","dark horse","caballo oscuro; sorpresa","outsider; cheval noir","这名年轻选手是本届比赛最大的黑马，一路打进了决赛。","zhè míng nián qīng xuǎn shǒu shì běn jiè bǐ sài zuì dà de hēi mǎ yí lù dǎ jìn le jué sài","This young player is the biggest dark horse of the tournament and fought all the way to the final.","Este joven jugador es la mayor sorpresa del torneo y avanzó hasta la final.","Ce jeune joueur est la grande surprise de cette édition et s'est hissé jusqu'en finale."],["L7-1645","黑手","hēishǒu","N","hidden manipulator","mano negra; instigador oculto","main cachée; instigateur","警方正在调查这起事件背后的黑手。","jǐng fāng zhèng zài diào chá zhè qǐ shì jiàn bèi hòu de hēi shǒu","The police are investigating who is pulling the strings behind this incident.","La policía investiga quién está detrás de este incidente.","La police enquête sur celui qui tire les ficelles de cet incident."],["L7-1646","黑心","hēixīn","Adj/N","ruthless; unscrupulous","despiadado; sin escrúpulos","sans scrupules; cruel","这个黑心老板用过期原料做食品，终于被查处了。","zhè ge hēi xīn lǎo bǎn yòng guò qī yuán liào zuò shí pǐn zhōng yú bèi chá chǔ le","This unscrupulous boss used expired ingredients to make food and was eventually investigated and penalized.","Este dueño sin escrúpulos usaba ingredientes caducados para preparar comida y por fin lo investigaron y sancionaron.","Ce patron sans scrupules fabriquait des aliments avec des ingrédients périmés, et il a fini par être mis en cause et sanctionné."],["L7-1647","嘿","hēi","Intj","hey","eh; oye","hé","嘿，你怎么也在这儿？我们好久没见了！","hēi nǐ zěn me yě zài zhèr wǒ men hǎo jiǔ méi jiàn le","Hey, what are you doing here too? We haven't seen each other in ages!","¡Oye! ¿Tú también estás aquí? ¡Hace mucho que no nos vemos!","Tiens, toi aussi, tu es là ? Ça fait longtemps qu'on ne s'était pas vus !"],["L7-1648","痕迹","hénjì","N","trace; mark","rastro; huella","trace; marque","这些旧摆设虽然不值钱，却保留着祖母生活的痕迹。","zhè xiē jiù bǎi she suī rán bù zhí qián què bǎo liú zhe zǔ mǔ shēng huó de hén jì","Although these old ornaments are not worth much, they preserve traces of my grandmother's life.","Aunque estos viejos adornos no valen mucho, conservan las huellas de la vida de mi abuela.","Même si ces vieux bibelots n'ont pas beaucoup de valeur, ils gardent les traces de la vie de ma grand-mère."],["L7-1649","恨不得","hènbude","V","to be dying to; to wish one could","morirse por; desear poder","avoir très envie de; mourir d'envie de","听说妈妈病了，她恨不得马上飞回家去。","tīng shuō mā ma bìng le tā hèn bu de mǎ shàng fēi huí jiā qù","Hearing that her mother was ill, she wished she could fly home right away.","Al enterarse de que su mamá estaba enferma, deseó poder volar a casa en ese mismo instante.","En apprenant que sa mère était malade, elle aurait voulu pouvoir s'envoler immédiatement vers la maison."],["L7-1650","哼","hēng","V","to hum; to snort","tararear; resoplar","fredonner; grogner","奶奶一边做饭一边哼着小曲。","nǎi nai yì biān zuò fàn yì biān hēng zhe xiǎo qǔ","Grandma hums a little tune while cooking.","La abuela tararea una cancioncita mientras cocina.","Grand-mère fredonne un petit air tout en faisant la cuisine."],["L7-1651","横七竖八","héngqī-shùbā","","in a mess; scattered about","desordenado; esparcido","en désordre; pêle-mêle","搬家以后，客厅里横七竖八地堆满了箱子。","bān jiā yǐ hòu kè tīng lǐ héng qī shù bā de duī mǎn le xiāng zi","After the move, boxes were piled in a jumble all over the living room.","Después de la mudanza, la sala estaba llena de cajas apiladas en completo desorden.","Après le déménagement, le salon était rempli de cartons empilés en désordre."],["L7-1652","横向","héngxiàng","Adj","horizontal; lateral","horizontal; lateral","horizontal; latéral","这次研究对几个国家的教育制度进行了横向比较。","zhè cì yán jiū duì jǐ ge guó jiā de jiào yù zhì dù jìn xíng le héng xiàng bǐ jiào","This study made a cross-sectional comparison of the education systems of several countries.","Este estudio hizo una comparación transversal de los sistemas educativos de varios países.","Cette étude a réalisé une comparaison transversale des systèmes éducatifs de plusieurs pays."],["L7-1653","横","hèng","Adj","horizontal; across","horizontal; a lo ancho","horizontal; en travers","这张床太长了，只能横着放在房间里。","zhè zhāng chuáng tài cháng le zhǐ néng héng zhe fàng zài fáng jiān lǐ","This bed is too long; it can only be placed sideways in the room.","Esta cama es demasiado larga y solo se puede colocar en la habitación de forma transversal.","Ce lit est trop long, on ne peut le placer dans la chambre qu'en travers."],["L7-1654","轰","hōng","V/Phonetic","boom; to bomb","estruendo; bombardear","détonation; bombarder","厨房里飞进来一只苍蝇，奶奶拿着扇子把它轰了出去。","chú fáng lǐ fēi jìn lái yì zhī cāng ying nǎi nai ná zhe shàn zi bǎ tā hōng le chū qù","A fly got into the kitchen, and Grandma shooed it out with a fan.","Entró una mosca volando a la cocina y la abuela la espantó con un abanico.","Une mouche est entrée dans la cuisine, et grand-mère l'a chassée avec un éventail."],["L7-1655","轰动","hōngdòng","V","to cause a sensation","causar sensación","faire sensation","这本小说问世以后，马上引起了轰动。","zhè běn xiǎo shuō wèn shì yǐ hòu mǎ shàng yǐn qǐ le hōng dòng","As soon as this novel came out, it caused a sensation.","En cuanto salió esta novela, causó sensación de inmediato.","Dès sa parution, ce roman a fait sensation."],["L7-1656","轰炸","hōngzhà","V","to bomb","bombardear","bombarder","战争期间，这座城市几乎每天都遭到轰炸。","zhàn zhēng qī jiān zhè zuò chéng shì jī hū měi tiān dōu zāo dào hōng zhà","During the war, this city was bombed almost every day.","Durante la guerra, esta ciudad fue bombardeada casi todos los días.","Pendant la guerre, cette ville était bombardée presque tous les jours."],["L7-1657","哄","hōng","Phonetic","roar of laughter; hubbub","carcajada general; alboroto","éclat de rire; tumulte","孩子哭个不停，妈妈只好拿玩具哄他。","hái zi kū gè bù tíng mā ma zhǐ hǎo ná wán jù hǒng tā","The child wouldn't stop crying, so his mother had to coax him with a toy.","El niño no paraba de llorar y su mamá no tuvo más remedio que calmarlo con un juguete.","L'enfant n'arrêtait pas de pleurer, et sa mère a dû le consoler avec un jouet."],["L7-1658","哄堂大笑","hōngtáng-dàxiào","","the room roars with laughter","toda la sala estalla en risas","toute la salle éclate de rire","他一句幽默的话，引得全班同学哄堂大笑。","tā yí jù yōu mò de huà yǐn dé quán bān tóng xué hōng táng dà xiào","One humorous remark from him set the whole class roaring with laughter.","Un comentario humorístico suyo hizo estallar de risa a toda la clase.","Une phrase pleine d'humour de sa part a déclenché l'hilarité de toute la classe."],["L7-1659","烘干","hōnggān","V","to dry (by heat)","secar con calor","sécher à la chaleur","下雨天衣服晾不干，只好用机器烘干。","xià yǔ tiān yī fu liàng bu gān zhǐ hǎo yòng jī qì hōng gān","On rainy days the clothes won't air-dry, so we have to dry them in the machine.","En los días de lluvia la ropa no se seca al aire, así que hay que usar la secadora.","Les jours de pluie, le linge ne sèche pas, alors il faut le passer au sèche-linge."],["L7-1660","烘托","hōngtuō","V","to set off; to enhance","realzar; destacar","mettre en valeur; rehausser","画家用灰暗的天空来烘托人物悲伤的心情。","huà jiā yòng huī àn de tiān kōng lái hōng tuō rén wù bēi shāng de xīn qíng","The painter used a gloomy sky to set off the figure's sorrowful mood.","El pintor usó un cielo sombrío para realzar el estado de ánimo triste del personaje.","Le peintre a utilisé un ciel sombre pour souligner la tristesse du personnage."],["L7-1661","弘扬","hóngyáng","V","to promote; to carry forward","promover; difundir","promouvoir; faire rayonner","我们应该弘扬尊老爱幼的传统美德。","wǒ men yīng gāi hóng yáng zūn lǎo ài yòu de chuán tǒng měi dé","We should promote the traditional virtue of respecting the old and caring for the young.","Debemos promover la virtud tradicional de respetar a los mayores y cuidar a los pequeños.","Nous devrions promouvoir la vertu traditionnelle de respecter les aînés et de prendre soin des jeunes."],["L7-1662","红灯","hóngdēng","N","red light","luz roja; semáforo en rojo","feu rouge","节日里，大街两旁悬挂着红灯笼。","jié rì lǐ dà jiē liǎng páng xuán guà zhe hóng dēng lóng","During the festival, red lanterns hang on both sides of the street.","Durante la fiesta, a ambos lados de la calle cuelgan faroles rojos.","Pendant la fête, des lanternes rouges sont suspendues des deux côtés de la rue."],["L7-1663","红火","hónghuo","Adj","prosperous; thriving","próspero; floreciente","prospère; florissant","新开的饭馆生意越来越红火，每天都要排队。","xīn kāi de fàn guǎn shēng yi yuè lái yuè hóng huo měi tiān dōu yào pái duì","Business at the new restaurant is getting better and better, and there's a line every day.","El restaurante recién abierto tiene cada vez más clientela y todos los días hay fila.","Le nouveau restaurant marche de mieux en mieux, et il y a la queue tous les jours."],["L7-1664","红扑扑","hóngpūpū","Adj","rosy; flushed","sonrosado; colorado","rosé; rougissant","在外面玩了一下午，孩子们的小脸冻得红扑扑的。","zài wài miàn wán le yí xià wǔ hái zi men de xiǎo liǎn dòng de hóng pū pū de","After playing outside all afternoon, the children's little faces were rosy from the cold.","Después de jugar afuera toda la tarde, las caritas de los niños estaban coloradas por el frío.","Après avoir joué dehors tout l'après-midi, les petits visages des enfants étaient rouges de froid."],["L7-1665","红润","hóngrùn","Adj","rosy; ruddy","sonrosado; rubicundo","rose; vermeil","休养了一个月，她的脸色渐渐变得红润起来。","xiū yǎng le yí ge yuè tā de liǎn sè jiàn jiàn biàn de hóng rùn qǐ lái","After a month of rest, her complexion gradually became rosy again.","Después de un mes de reposo, su rostro fue recuperando poco a poco un color sano.","Après un mois de repos, son teint a peu à peu retrouvé des couleurs."],["L7-1666","红薯","hóngshǔ","N","sweet potato","batata; boniato","patate douce","冬天的街头，常常能闻到烤红薯的香味。","dōng tiān de jiē tóu cháng cháng néng wén dào kǎo hóng shǔ de xiāng wèi","On winter streets you can often smell roasted sweet potatoes.","En invierno, en las calles se huele con frecuencia el aroma de los camotes asados.","En hiver, on sent souvent dans les rues l'odeur des patates douces grillées."],["L7-1667","红眼","hóngyǎn","V","envious; furious","envidioso; furioso","envieux; furieux","看到同事升了职，他有些红眼，心里很不舒服。","kàn dào tóng shì shēng le zhí tā yǒu xiē hóng yǎn xīn lǐ hěn bù shū fu","Seeing his colleague promoted, he turned a bit green with envy and felt uneasy.","Al ver que ascendieron a su compañero, sintió envidia y se quedó muy incómodo.","En voyant son collègue promu, il en est devenu vert de jalousie et s'est senti très mal à l'aise."],["L7-1668","宏观","hóngguān","Adj","macro; macroscopic","macro; macroscópico","macro; macroscopique","政府通过宏观调控来稳定物价。","zhèng fǔ tōng guò hóng guān tiáo kòng lái wěn dìng wù jià","The government stabilizes prices through macroeconomic regulation.","El gobierno estabiliza los precios mediante la regulación macroeconómica.","Le gouvernement stabilise les prix grâce à une régulation macroéconomique."],["L7-1669","宏伟","hóngwěi","Adj","magnificent; grand","grandioso; magnífico","grandiose; magnifique","站在宏伟的长城上，大家都感到非常震撼。","zhàn zài hóng wěi de cháng chéng shàng dà jiā dōu gǎn dào fēi cháng zhèn hàn","Standing on the magnificent Great Wall, everyone felt deeply awed.","De pie sobre la majestuosa Gran Muralla, todos se sintieron profundamente impresionados.","Debout sur l'imposante Grande Muraille, tout le monde s'est senti profondément impressionné."],["L7-1670","洪亮","hóngliàng","Adj","loud and clear","sonoro; fuerte y claro","sonore; retentissant","老校长的声音依然洪亮，一点儿也不像八十岁的人。","lǎo xiào zhǎng de shēng yīn yī rán hóng liàng yì diǎnr yě bú xiàng bā shí suì de rén","The old principal's voice is still loud and clear, not at all like that of an eighty-year-old.","La voz del viejo director sigue siendo potente, nada propia de alguien de ochenta años.","La voix du vieux directeur est toujours sonore, pas du tout celle d'un homme de quatre-vingts ans."],["L7-1671","哄","hǒng","V","to coax; to deceive","engatusar; engañar","cajoler; tromper","孩子哭个不停，妈妈只好拿玩具哄他。","hái zi kū gè bù tíng mā ma zhǐ hǎo ná wán jù hǒng tā","The child wouldn't stop crying, so his mother had to coax him with a toy.","El niño no paraba de llorar y su mamá no tuvo más remedio que calmarlo con un juguete.","L'enfant n'arrêtait pas de pleurer, et sa mère a dû le consoler avec un jouet."],["L7-1672","哄","hòng","V","to make a din; to joke","alborotar; bromear","chahuter; plaisanter","孩子哭个不停，妈妈只好拿玩具哄他。","hái zi kū gè bù tíng mā ma zhǐ hǎo ná wán jù hǒng tā","The child wouldn't stop crying, so his mother had to coax him with a toy.","El niño no paraba de llorar y su mamá no tuvo más remedio que calmarlo con un juguete.","L'enfant n'arrêtait pas de pleurer, et sa mère a dû le consoler avec un jouet."],["L7-1673","喉咙","hóulóng","N","throat","garganta","gorge","冬天空气干燥，喝点梨汤可以润润喉咙。","dōng tiān kōng qì gān zào hē diǎn lí tāng kě yǐ rùn rùn hóu lóng","The air is dry in winter, and a little pear soup can soothe your throat.","En invierno el aire es seco, y un poco de sopa de pera te calma la garganta.","En hiver, l'air est sec, et un peu de soupe de poire apaise la gorge."],["L7-1674","吼","hǒu","V","to roar; to bellow","rugir; gritar","rugir; hurler","他气得冲着电话大吼，把旁边的人都吓了一跳。","tā qì de chòng zhe diàn huà dà hǒu bǎ páng biān de rén dōu xià le yí tiào","He was so angry he roared into the phone, startling everyone nearby.","Estaba tan enojado que le gritó al teléfono, y asustó a los que estaban cerca.","Il était si en colère qu'il a hurlé dans le téléphone, faisant sursauter tous ceux qui étaient à côté."],["L7-1675","后备","hòubèi","Adj/N","reserve; backup","reserva; de respaldo","réserve; de secours","每个部门都要培养一些后备力量。","měi ge bù mén dōu yào péi yǎng yì xiē hòu bèi lì liàng","Every department should train some reserve staff.","Cada departamento debe formar algunos cuadros de reserva.","Chaque service doit former quelques personnes de réserve."],["L7-1676","后备箱","hòubèixiāng","N","car trunk","maletero","coffre (de voiture)","出发前，他把帐篷和行李都放进了后备箱。","chū fā qián tā bǎ zhàng peng hé xíng li dōu fàng jìn le hòu bèi xiāng","Before setting off, he put the tent and luggage in the trunk.","Antes de salir, metió la tienda de campaña y el equipaje en la cajuela.","Avant de partir, il a mis la tente et les bagages dans le coffre."],["L7-1677","后代","hòudài","N","descendants","descendientes; posteridad","descendants; postérité","我们要为子孙后代保护好环境。","wǒ men yào wèi zǐ sūn hòu dài bǎo hù hǎo huán jìng","We must protect the environment for our descendants.","Debemos proteger bien el medio ambiente para nuestros descendientes.","Nous devons bien protéger l'environnement pour nos descendants."],["L7-1678","后盾","hòudùn","N","backing; support","respaldo; apoyo","soutien; appui","家人永远是你最坚强的后盾。","jiā rén yǒng yuǎn shì nǐ zuì jiān qiáng de hòu dùn","Your family will always be your strongest support.","La familia siempre será tu apoyo más firme.","Ta famille sera toujours ton soutien le plus solide."],["L7-1679","后顾之忧","hòugùzhīyōu","","worries about the rear","preocupaciones por lo que queda atrás","soucis pour l'arrière","公司为员工的孩子办了幼儿园，解除了他们的后顾之忧。","gōng sī wèi yuán gōng de hái zi bàn le yòu ér yuán jiě chú le tā men de hòu gù zhī yōu","The company set up a kindergarten for employees' children, freeing them from worries at home.","La empresa abrió un jardín de niños para los hijos de sus empleados, y así los liberó de preocupaciones en casa.","L'entreprise a ouvert une crèche pour les enfants de ses employés, ce qui les a libérés de tout souci côté famille."],["L7-1680","后期","hòuqī","N","later stage","etapa posterior","dernière phase","这部电影的后期制作花了将近一年的时间。","zhè bù diàn yǐng de hòu qī zhì zuò huā le jiāng jìn yì nián de shí jiān","Post-production on this film took nearly a year.","La posproducción de esta película tomó casi un año.","La postproduction de ce film a pris près d'un an."],["L7-1681","后勤","hòuqín","N","logistics","logística","logistique","运动会期间，后勤人员负责大家的吃住问题。","yùn dòng huì qī jiān hòu qín rén yuán fù zé dà jiā de chī zhù wèn tí","During the sports meet, logistics staff took care of everyone's food and lodging.","Durante los juegos deportivos, el personal de logística se encargó de la comida y el alojamiento de todos.","Pendant la compétition sportive, le personnel de logistique s'est occupé de l'hébergement et des repas de tous."],["L7-1682","后人","hòurén","N","later generations","generaciones posteriores","générations futures","俗话说，前人栽树，后人乘凉，我们也要为下一代着想。","sú huà shuō qián rén zāi shù hòu rén chéng liáng wǒ men yě yào wèi xià yí dài zhuó xiǎng","As the saying goes, one generation plants trees and the next enjoys the shade, so we too must think of the next generation.","Como dice el refrán, unos plantan el árbol y otros disfrutan de su sombra; nosotros también debemos pensar en la próxima generación.","Comme dit le proverbe, les uns plantent les arbres et les autres profitent de leur ombre ; nous aussi, nous devons penser à la génération suivante."],["L7-1683","后台","hòutái","N","backstage; back end","bastidores; back-end","coulisses; back-end","演出开始前，演员们都在后台紧张地化妆。","yǎn chū kāi shǐ qián yǎn yuán men dōu zài hòu tái jǐn zhāng de huà zhuāng","Before the performance, the actors were busily putting on makeup backstage.","Antes de que empezara la función, los actores se maquillaban nerviosos tras bambalinas.","Avant le début du spectacle, les acteurs se maquillaient nerveusement en coulisses."],["L7-1684","后退","hòutuì","V","to retreat; to step back","retroceder","reculer","看到前面有一条大狗，小女孩吓得连连后退。","kàn dào qián miàn yǒu yì tiáo dà gǒu xiǎo nǚ hái xià de lián lián hòu tuì","Seeing a big dog ahead, the little girl was so scared she kept backing away.","Al ver un perro grande delante, la niña se asustó y retrocedió una y otra vez.","En voyant un gros chien devant elle, la petite fille a eu si peur qu'elle a reculé à plusieurs reprises."],["L7-1685","后续","hòuxù","Adj","follow-up","posterior; de seguimiento","ultérieur; de suivi","这项举措能否长期奏效，取决于后续监督是否到位。","zhè xiàng jǔ cuò néng fǒu cháng qī zòu xiào qǔ jué yú hòu xù jiān dū shì fǒu dào wèi","Whether this measure remains effective over time depends on whether follow-up oversight is adequate.","Que esta medida siga dando resultados a largo plazo depende de que la supervisión posterior sea adecuada.","Que cette mesure reste efficace à long terme dépend de la qualité du suivi et du contrôle qui en découleront."],["L7-1686","后遗症","hòuyízhèng","N","aftereffects; sequelae","secuelas","séquelles","那次车祸给他留下了严重的后遗症，至今走路还不方便。","nà cì chē huò gěi tā liú xià le yán zhòng de hòu yí zhèng zhì jīn zǒu lù hái bù fāng biàn","That car accident left him with serious after-effects, and he still has trouble walking.","Aquel accidente de coche le dejó graves secuelas, y hasta hoy le cuesta caminar.","Cet accident de voiture lui a laissé de graves séquelles, et il a encore du mal à marcher aujourd'hui."],["L7-1687","后裔","hòuyì","N","descendant","descendiente","descendant","据说这个村子里的人都是同一个家族的后裔。","jù shuō zhè ge cūn zi lǐ de rén dōu shì tóng yī ge jiā zú de hòu yì","It is said that the people in this village are all descendants of the same clan.","Dicen que la gente de este pueblo es descendiente de un mismo clan.","On dit que les habitants de ce village descendent tous du même clan."],["L7-1688","后者","hòuzhě","N","the latter","este último","ce dernier","他在学习和赚钱之间选择了后者，放弃了读研究生。","tā zài xué xí hé zhuàn qián zhī jiān xuǎn zé le hòu zhě fàng qì le dú yán jiū shēng","Choosing between studying and earning money, he chose the latter and gave up graduate school.","Entre estudiar y ganar dinero, eligió lo segundo y renunció a hacer un posgrado.","Entre les études et gagner de l'argent, il a choisi la seconde option et a renoncé à faire un master."],["L7-1689","厚道","hòudao","Adj","kind and honest","bondadoso y honrado","bon et honnête","老张为人厚道，从来不占别人的便宜。","lǎo zhāng wéi rén hòu dao cóng lái bú zhàn bié rén de pián yi","Old Zhang is kind and honest and never takes advantage of others.","Lao Zhang es un hombre bondadoso y honesto, y jamás se aprovecha de los demás.","Lao Zhang est bon et honnête et ne profite jamais des autres."],["L7-1690","厚度","hòudù","N","thickness","grosor","épaisseur","这种玻璃的厚度只有一毫米，却非常结实。","zhè zhǒng bō li de hòu dù zhǐ yǒu yì háo mǐ què fēi cháng jiē shi","This glass is only one millimeter thick yet very strong.","Este vidrio tiene solo un milímetro de grosor, pero es muy resistente.","Ce verre ne fait qu'un millimètre d'épaisseur, mais il est très solide."],["L7-1691","候选人","hòuxuǎnrén","N","candidate","candidato","candidat","这次选举一共有五名候选人。","zhè cì xuǎn jǔ yí gòng yǒu wǔ míng hòu xuǎn rén","There are five candidates in this election in total.","En estas elecciones hay cinco candidatos en total.","Il y a cinq candidats au total pour cette élection."],["L7-1692","呼风唤雨","hūfēng-huànyǔ","","to wield great power","tener poder sobrenatural","déchaîner les éléments","他在这个行业里能呼风唤雨，谁也不敢得罪他。","tā zài zhè ge háng yè lǐ néng hū fēng huàn yǔ shéi yě bù gǎn dé zuì tā","He wields enormous power in this industry, and no one dares to offend him.","En este sector tiene tanto poder que puede mover los hilos a su antojo, y nadie se atreve a ofenderlo.","Dans ce secteur, il fait la pluie et le beau temps, et personne n'ose le froisser."],["L7-1693","呼唤","hūhuàn","V","to call out","llamar","appeler","远处传来妈妈呼唤孩子回家吃饭的声音。","yuǎn chù chuán lái mā ma hū huàn hái zi huí jiā chī fàn de shēng yīn","From afar came the sound of a mother calling her child home for dinner.","A lo lejos se oía la voz de una madre llamando a su hijo para que volviera a casa a comer.","On entendait au loin la voix d'une mère appelant son enfant à rentrer manger."],["L7-1694","呼救","hūjiù","V","to call for help","pedir socorro","appeler au secours","听到河边有人呼救，几个年轻人立刻跑了过去。","tīng dào hé biān yǒu rén hū jiù jǐ ge nián qīng rén lì kè pǎo le guò qù","Hearing someone cry for help by the river, several young people immediately ran over.","Al oír que alguien pedía auxilio junto al río, varios jóvenes corrieron enseguida hacia allí.","En entendant quelqu'un appeler à l'aide au bord de la rivière, plusieurs jeunes y ont couru aussitôt."],["L7-1695","呼声","hūshēng","N","call; public demand","clamor; demanda popular","appel; revendication","要求改善公共交通的呼声越来越高。","yāo qiú gǎi shàn gōng gòng jiāo tōng de hū shēng yuè lái yuè gāo","Calls for better public transport are growing louder and louder.","Cada vez son más fuertes los reclamos para que se mejore el transporte público.","Les appels à l'amélioration des transports en commun se font de plus en plus pressants."],["L7-1696","呼应","hūyìng","V","to echo; to coordinate","hacer eco; corresponderse","faire écho; se répondre","文章的结尾和开头互相呼应，结构非常完整。","wén zhāng de jié wěi hé kāi tóu hù xiāng hū yìng jié gòu fēi cháng wán zhěng","The ending of the essay echoes its opening, giving it a very complete structure.","El final del texto hace eco del comienzo, y la estructura queda muy completa.","La fin du texte répond à son début, ce qui donne une structure très cohérente."],["L7-1697","呼吁","hūyù","V","to appeal; to call on","hacer un llamamiento","lancer un appel","环保组织呼吁大家减少使用塑料袋。","huán bǎo zǔ zhī hū yù dà jiā jiǎn shǎo shǐ yòng sù liào dài","Environmental groups are calling on everyone to use fewer plastic bags.","Las organizaciones ecologistas piden a todos que reduzcan el uso de bolsas de plástico.","Les organisations écologistes appellent chacun à réduire l'usage des sacs en plastique."],["L7-1698","忽高忽低","hūgāo-hūdī","","fluctuating","fluctuante","fluctuant","这几天她的体温忽高忽低，家人都很担心。","zhè jǐ tiān tā de tǐ wēn hū gāo hū dī jiā rén dōu hěn dān xīn","Her temperature has been going up and down these past few days, and her family is very worried.","En estos días su temperatura sube y baja, y la familia está muy preocupada.","Ces derniers jours, sa température monte et descend sans cesse, et sa famille est très inquiète."],["L7-1699","忽悠","hūyou","V","to sway; to deceive","balancearse; engañar","osciller; berner","别听那个推销员瞎忽悠，这种保健品根本没有用。","bié tīng nà ge tuī xiāo yuán xiā hū you zhè zhǒng bǎo jiàn pǐn gēn běn méi yǒu yòng","Don't let that salesman sweet-talk you — this health supplement is completely useless.","No le hagas caso a ese vendedor, que solo te está engatusando; este suplemento no sirve para nada.","Ne l'écoute pas, ce vendeur te raconte n'importe quoi : ce complément alimentaire ne sert à rien."],["L7-1700","胡闹","húnào","V","to fool around; to make trouble","hacer tonterías; armar lío","faire des bêtises; faire du grabuge","课堂上不许胡闹，大家要认真听讲。","kè táng shàng bù xǔ hú nào dà jiā yào rèn zhēn tīng jiǎng","No fooling around in class — everyone should listen carefully.","En clase no se permite hacer payasadas; todos deben escuchar con atención.","Pas de chahut en classe : tout le monde doit écouter attentivement."],["L7-1701","胡说","húshuō","V/N","to talk nonsense","decir tonterías","dire des bêtises","你别胡说，这件事根本不是他干的。","nǐ bié hú shuō zhè jiàn shì gēn běn bú shì tā gàn de","Don't talk nonsense — he had nothing to do with it.","No digas tonterías: esto no lo hizo él en absoluto.","Ne raconte pas n'importe quoi : ce n'est absolument pas lui qui a fait ça."],["L7-1702","胡思乱想","húsī-luànxiǎng","","to let one's imagination run wild","darle vueltas a la cabeza","se faire des idées","考试前一天晚上，她躺在床上胡思乱想，怎么也睡不着。","kǎo shì qián yì tiān wǎn shang tā tǎng zài chuáng shàng hú sī luàn xiǎng zěn me yě shuì bu zháo","The night before the exam, she lay in bed with her mind racing and couldn't fall asleep.","La noche antes del examen, acostada en la cama, no dejaba de darle vueltas a mil cosas y no podía dormir.","La veille de l'examen, couchée dans son lit, elle ressassait toutes sortes de pensées et n'arrivait pas à s'endormir."],["L7-1703","湖泊","húpō","N","lake","lago","lac","这一带湖泊众多，被称为“千湖之乡”。","zhè yí dài hú pō zhòng duō bèi chēng wéi qiān hú zhī xiāng","There are many lakes in this area, and it is called “the land of a thousand lakes.”","En esta zona hay muchos lagos, y por eso se la llama «la tierra de los mil lagos».","Cette région compte de nombreux lacs et est appelée « le pays des mille lacs »."],["L7-1704","糊","hú","V","to paste; to stick","pegar; engomar","coller; tartiner","他光顾着看手机，锅里的饭都糊了。","tā guāng gù zhe kàn shǒu jī guō lǐ de fàn dōu hú le","He was so absorbed in his phone that the rice in the pot burned.","Estaba tan pendiente del celular que el arroz de la olla se quemó.","Il était tellement absorbé par son téléphone que le riz s'est mis à brûler dans la casserole."],["L7-1705","糊涂","hútu","Adj","muddled; confused","confuso; despistado","confus; embrouillé","他一时糊涂，被那些花言巧语所欺骗。","tā yì shí hú tu bèi nà xiē huā yán qiǎo yǔ suǒ qī piàn","In a moment of confusion, he was taken in by those sweet words.","En un momento de confusión, se dejó engañar por aquellas palabras zalameras.","Dans un moment d'égarement, il s'est laissé abuser par ces belles paroles."],["L7-1706","互补","hùbǔ","V","to complement each other","complementarse","se compléter","他们两个人性格互补，合作起来特别顺利。","tā men liǎng gè rén xìng gé hù bǔ hé zuò qǐ lái tè bié shùn lì","The two of them have complementary personalities and work together very smoothly.","Sus personalidades se complementan, y trabajan juntos con mucha facilidad.","Leurs caractères se complètent, et ils travaillent ensemble avec beaucoup d'aisance."],["L7-1707","互访","hùfǎng","V","to exchange visits","intercambiar visitas","échanger des visites","两国领导人保持定期互访，关系越来越密切。","liǎng guó lǐng dǎo rén bǎo chí dìng qī hù fǎng guān xì yuè lái yuè mì qiè","The leaders of the two countries make regular reciprocal visits, and relations are growing ever closer.","Los líderes de los dos países se visitan periódicamente, y las relaciones son cada vez más estrechas.","Les dirigeants des deux pays se rendent régulièrement visite, et les relations sont de plus en plus étroites."],["L7-1708","互信","hùxìn","V","mutual trust","confianza mutua","confiance mutuelle","双方只有建立互信，合作才能长久。","shuāng fāng zhǐ yǒu jiàn lì hù xìn hé zuò cái néng cháng jiǔ","Only when both sides build mutual trust can cooperation last.","Solo si ambas partes construyen confianza mutua, la cooperación podrá durar mucho tiempo.","Ce n'est que si les deux parties instaurent une confiance mutuelle que la coopération pourra durer."],["L7-1709","互助","hùzhù","V","mutual aid","ayuda mutua","entraide","我们要发扬团结互助的精神，共同克服困难。","wǒ men yào fā yáng tuán jié hù zhù de jīng shén gòng tóng kè fú kùn nan","We must carry forward the spirit of unity and mutual help to overcome difficulties together.","Debemos fomentar el espíritu de unidad y ayuda mutua para superar juntos las dificultades.","Nous devons cultiver l'esprit d'unité et d'entraide pour surmonter ensemble les difficultés."],["L7-1710","护理","hùlǐ","V","to nurse; nursing","cuidar; enfermería","soigner; soins infirmiers","她在医院负责护理刚做完手术的病人。","tā zài yī yuàn fù zé hù lǐ gāng zuò wán shǒu shù de bìng rén","At the hospital she is responsible for caring for patients who have just had surgery.","En el hospital se encarga de cuidar a los pacientes que acaban de ser operados.","À l'hôpital, elle est chargée de soigner les patients qui viennent de subir une opération."],["L7-1711","花瓣","huābàn","N","petal","pétalo","pétale","一阵风吹过，粉红色的花瓣落了一地。","yí zhèn fēng chuī guò fěn hóng sè de huā bàn luò le yí dì","A gust of wind blew past, and pink petals covered the ground.","Pasó una ráfaga de viento y los pétalos rosados cubrieron el suelo.","Une rafale de vent a soufflé, et les pétales roses ont jonché le sol."],["L7-1712","花卉","huāhuì","N","flowers; plants","flores; plantas ornamentales","fleurs; plantes ornementales","这个市场主要批发各种花卉和盆景。","zhè ge shì chǎng zhǔ yào pī fā gè zhǒng huā huì hé pén jǐng","This market mainly wholesales all kinds of flowers and potted landscapes.","Este mercado vende al por mayor principalmente flores y bonsáis de todo tipo.","Ce marché est principalement un marché de gros de fleurs et de bonsaïs en tout genre."],["L7-1713","花纹","huāwén","N","pattern; design","dibujo; estampado","motif; dessin","这块地毯上的花纹是手工织出来的。","zhè kuài dì tǎn shàng de huā wén shì shǒu gōng zhī chū lái de","The patterns on this carpet were woven by hand.","Los dibujos de esta alfombra fueron tejidos a mano.","Les motifs de ce tapis ont été tissés à la main."],["L7-1714","花样","huāyàng","N","pattern; trick","diseño; truco","motif; astuce","这家店的早餐花样很多，每天都不重复。","zhè jiā diàn de zǎo cān huā yàng hěn duō měi tiān dōu bù chóng fù","This shop's breakfasts come in many varieties, never the same two days running.","Esta tienda ofrece muchas variedades de desayuno y cada día son distintas.","Cette boutique propose un grand choix de petits-déjeuners, différents chaque jour."],["L7-1715","划算","huásuàn","V/Adj","worthwhile; cost-effective","rentable; conveniente","avantageux; rentable","买一张月票比每次买单程票划算多了。","mǎi yì zhāng yuè piào bǐ měi cì mǎi dān chéng piào huá suàn duō le","Buying a monthly pass is much better value than buying single tickets every time.","Comprar un abono mensual conviene mucho más que comprar un boleto sencillo cada vez.","Acheter un abonnement mensuel est bien plus avantageux que d'acheter un billet simple à chaque fois."],["L7-1716","华丽","huálì","Adj","gorgeous; splendid","espléndido; suntuoso","somptueux; splendide","包装再华丽，也不能掩盖商品本身的缺陷。","bāo zhuāng zài huá lì yě bù néng yǎn gài shāng pǐn běn shēn de quē xiàn","However elaborate the packaging, it cannot conceal the defects of the product itself.","Por muy lujoso que sea el empaque, no puede ocultar los defectos del producto en sí.","Aussi luxueux que soit l'emballage, il ne peut masquer les défauts du produit lui-même."],["L7-1717","华侨","huáqiáo","N","overseas Chinese","chino de ultramar","Chinois d'outre-mer","这所学校是一位老华侨捐钱建起来的。","zhè suǒ xué xiào shì yí wèi lǎo huá qiáo juān qián jiàn qǐ lái de","This school was built with money donated by an elderly overseas Chinese.","Esta escuela fue construida con el dinero donado por un anciano chino residente en el extranjero.","Cette école a été construite grâce à un don d'un vieux Chinois d'outre-mer."],["L7-1718","华裔","huáyì","N","person of Chinese descent","persona de origen chino","personne d'origine chinoise","她是在美国出生的华裔，中文说得却很流利。","tā shì zài měi guó chū shēng de huá yì zhōng wén shuō de què hěn liú lì","She is an American-born ethnic Chinese, yet she speaks Chinese fluently.","Es descendiente de chinos nacida en Estados Unidos, pero habla chino con fluidez.","Elle est d'origine chinoise, née aux États-Unis, mais elle parle couramment le chinois."],["L7-1719","哗变","huábiàn","V","mutiny","motín","mutinerie","由于长期拿不到军饷，一部分士兵发动了哗变。","yóu yú cháng qī ná bu dào jūn xiǎng yí bù fen shì bīng fā dòng le huá biàn","Because they had gone unpaid for a long time, some of the soldiers mutinied.","Como llevaban mucho tiempo sin recibir su paga, una parte de los soldados se amotinó.","Comme ils n'avaient pas reçu leur solde depuis longtemps, une partie des soldats se sont mutinés."],["L7-1720","哗然","huárán","Adj","in an uproar","revuelo; conmoción","en émoi; tumulte","消息一公布，舆论一片哗然。","xiāo xi yì gōng bù yú lùn yí piàn huá rán","As soon as the news was announced, there was a public uproar.","En cuanto se anunció la noticia, la opinión pública se escandalizó.","Dès l'annonce de la nouvelle, l'opinion publique s'est soulevée."],["L7-1721","滑冰","huábīng","V","to skate; skating","patinar; patinaje","patiner; patinage","冬天湖面结了冰，很多孩子在上面滑冰。","dōng tiān hú miàn jié le bīng hěn duō hái zi zài shàng miàn huá bīng","In winter the lake freezes over, and many children skate on it.","En invierno el lago se congela y muchos niños patinan sobre el hielo.","En hiver, le lac gèle et de nombreux enfants y font du patin à glace."],["L7-1722","滑稽","huájī","Adj","funny; comical","gracioso; cómico","drôle; comique","小丑滑稽的动作把孩子们逗得哈哈大笑。","xiǎo chǒu huá jī de dòng zuò bǎ hái zi men dòu de hā hā dà xiào","The clown's comical antics made the children roar with laughter.","Los movimientos cómicos del payaso hicieron reír a carcajadas a los niños.","Les gestes comiques du clown ont fait éclater de rire les enfants."],["L7-1723","滑梯","huátī","N","slide","tobogán","toboggan","公园里新装了一个滑梯，孩子们排着队玩。","gōng yuán lǐ xīn zhuāng le yí ge huá tī hái zi men pái zhe duì wán","A new slide has been installed in the park, and the children line up to play on it.","En el parque instalaron un tobogán nuevo y los niños hacen fila para jugar.","Un nouveau toboggan a été installé dans le parc, et les enfants font la queue pour jouer dessus."],["L7-1724","滑雪","huáxuě","V","to ski; skiing","esquiar; esquí","skier; ski","春节假期，我们一家人去东北滑雪了。","chūn jié jià qī wǒ men yì jiā rén qù dōng běi huá xuě le","Over the Spring Festival holiday, our family went skiing in the Northeast.","En las vacaciones de la Fiesta de la Primavera, nuestra familia fue a esquiar al noreste.","Pendant les vacances de la fête du Printemps, toute la famille est allée skier dans le nord-est."],["L7-1725","化肥","huàféi","N","chemical fertilizer","fertilizante químico","engrais chimique","农民们开始用有机肥料代替化肥。","nóng mín men kāi shǐ yòng yǒu jī féi liào dài tì huà féi","Farmers have started using organic fertilizer instead of chemical fertilizer.","Los campesinos han empezado a usar abono orgánico en lugar de fertilizantes químicos.","Les agriculteurs ont commencé à utiliser de l'engrais organique à la place des engrais chimiques."],["L7-1726","化身","huàshēn","N","incarnation; embodiment","encarnación; personificación","incarnation; personnification","在孩子们眼里，这位老师就是善良和智慧的化身。","zài hái zi men yǎn lǐ zhè wèi lǎo shī jiù shì shàn liáng hé zhì huì de huà shēn","In the children's eyes, this teacher is the embodiment of kindness and wisdom.","A los ojos de los niños, esta maestra es la encarnación de la bondad y la sabiduría.","Aux yeux des enfants, cette institutrice est l'incarnation de la bonté et de la sagesse."],["L7-1727","化纤","huàxiān","N","synthetic fiber","fibra sintética","fibre synthétique","这件衬衫是化纤的，夏天穿有点儿闷。","zhè jiàn chèn shān shì huà xiān de xià tiān chuān yǒu diǎnr mēn","This shirt is made of synthetic fiber and feels a bit stuffy in summer.","Esta camisa es de fibra sintética y en verano resulta un poco sofocante.","Cette chemise est en fibres synthétiques et paraît un peu étouffante en été."],["L7-1728","化险为夷","huàxiǎnwéiyí","","to turn danger into safety","convertir el peligro en seguridad","transformer le danger en sécurité","多亏司机反应快，才化险为夷，避免了一场车祸。","duō kuī sī jī fǎn yìng kuài cái huà xiǎn wéi yí bì miǎn le yì chǎng chē huò","Thanks to the driver's quick reactions, danger was averted and a crash was avoided.","Gracias a los rápidos reflejos del conductor, se evitó el peligro y no hubo accidente.","Grâce aux réflexes rapides du conducteur, le danger a été écarté et un accident évité."],["L7-1729","化验","huàyàn","V","lab test","análisis de laboratorio","analyse en laboratoire","医生让他先去抽血化验，结果出来再开药。","yī shēng ràng tā xiān qù chōu xuè huà yàn jié guǒ chū lái zài kāi yào","The doctor told him to have a blood test first and would prescribe medicine once the results came out.","El médico le dijo que primero se hiciera un análisis de sangre y que le recetaría medicinas cuando salieran los resultados.","Le médecin lui a dit de faire d'abord une prise de sang et qu'il lui prescrirait des médicaments une fois les résultats arrivés."],["L7-1730","化妆","huàzhuāng","","to put on makeup","maquillarse","se maquiller","她每天早上化妆要花半个小时。","tā měi tiān zǎo shang huà zhuāng yào huā bàn ge xiǎo shí","She spends half an hour putting on makeup every morning.","Todas las mañanas tarda media hora en maquillarse.","Chaque matin, elle met une demi-heure à se maquiller."],["L7-1731","划时代","huàshídài","Adj","epoch-making","que marca una época","qui fait date","蒸汽机的发明是一项划时代的成就。","zhēng qì jī de fā míng shì yí xiàng huà shí dài de chéng jiù","The invention of the steam engine was an epoch-making achievement.","La invención de la máquina de vapor fue un logro que marcó una época.","L'invention de la machine à vapeur fut une réalisation qui a fait date."],["L7-1732","画册","huàcè","N","picture album","álbum ilustrado","album illustré","书架上摆着一本介绍敦煌壁画的画册。","shū jià shàng bǎi zhe yì běn jiè shào dūn huáng bì huà de huà cè","On the bookshelf is a picture album introducing the Dunhuang murals.","En el estante hay un álbum que presenta los murales de Dunhuang.","Sur l'étagère se trouve un album qui présente les peintures murales de Dunhuang."],["L7-1733","画龙点睛","huàlóng-diǎnjīng","","to add the finishing touch","dar el toque final","donner la touche finale","标题里这个词用得好，起到了画龙点睛的作用。","biāo tí lǐ zhè ge cí yòng de hǎo qǐ dào le huà lóng diǎn jīng de zuò yòng","The word in this headline is well chosen and provides the finishing touch.","La palabra del título está muy bien elegida y le da el toque final.","Le mot choisi dans ce titre est excellent, c'est la touche finale qui donne tout son relief."],["L7-1734","画蛇添足","huàshé-tiānzú","","to overdo; to gild the lily","pasarse de la raya; añadir lo superfluo","en faire trop; ajouter le superflu","这篇文章已经很好了，再加这一段就是画蛇添足。","zhè piān wén zhāng yǐ jīng hěn hǎo le zài jiā zhè yí duàn jiù shì huà shé tiān zú","This essay is already good; adding this paragraph would be gilding the lily.","Este artículo ya está muy bien; añadir este párrafo sería querer mejorar lo que ya está perfecto.","Cet article est déjà très bien ; ajouter ce paragraphe serait superflu et gâcherait l'ensemble."],["L7-1735","画展","huàzhǎn","N","art exhibition","exposición de arte","exposition de peinture","朋友的画展开幕那天，我们都去捧场了。","péng you de huà zhǎn kāi mù nà tiān wǒ men dōu qù pěng chǎng le","On the opening day of our friend's art exhibition, we all went to show our support.","El día de la inauguración de la exposición de pintura de nuestro amigo, todos fuimos a apoyarlo.","Le jour du vernissage de l'exposition de peinture de notre ami, nous y sommes tous allés pour le soutenir."],["L7-1736","话费","huàfèi","N","call charges","gastos de llamada","frais d'appel","这个月话费又涨了二十块。","zhè ge yuè huà fèi yòu zhǎng le èr shí kuài","The phone bill went up by another twenty yuan this month.","Este mes la factura del teléfono subió otros veinte yuanes.","Ce mois-ci, la facture de téléphone a encore augmenté de vingt yuans."],["L7-1737","话筒","huàtǒng","N","microphone; receiver","micrófono; auricular","micro; combiné","主持人把话筒递给了台下的一位观众。","zhǔ chí rén bǎ huà tǒng dì gěi le tái xià de yí wèi guān zhòng","The host passed the microphone to a member of the audience.","El presentador le pasó el micrófono a un espectador del público.","L'animateur a tendu le micro à un spectateur du public."],["L7-1738","话语","huàyǔ","N","words; speech","palabras; discurso","paroles; discours","听了妈妈这些话语，他忍不住哭了。","tīng le mā ma zhè xiē huà yǔ tā rěn bu zhù kū le","Hearing these words from his mother, he couldn't help crying.","Al escuchar estas palabras de su madre, no pudo evitar llorar.","En écoutant ces paroles de sa mère, il n'a pas pu s'empêcher de pleurer."],["L7-1739","怀抱","huáibào","V/N","to embrace; bosom","abrazar; regazo","embrasser; giron","离开家乡多年后，他终于回到了祖国的怀抱。","lí kāi jiā xiāng duō nián hòu tā zhōng yú huí dào le zǔ guó de huái bào","After many years away from his hometown, he finally returned to the embrace of his homeland.","Tras muchos años lejos de su tierra, por fin regresó al seno de su patria.","Après de longues années loin de chez lui, il est enfin revenu dans le giron de sa patrie."],["L7-1740","怀旧","huáijiù","V","nostalgia; to feel nostalgic","nostalgia; sentir nostalgia","nostalgie; être nostalgique","这家餐厅的装修很有怀旧风格，吸引了不少中年顾客。","zhè jiā cān tīng de zhuāng xiū hěn yǒu huái jiù fēng gé xī yǐn le bù shǎo zhōng nián gù kè","This restaurant's décor has a nostalgic style that attracts many middle-aged customers.","La decoración de este restaurante tiene un estilo nostálgico que atrae a muchos clientes de mediana edad.","La décoration de ce restaurant a un style nostalgique qui attire beaucoup de clients d'âge mûr."],["L7-1741","怀里","huái li","","in one's arms; bosom","en brazos; en el regazo","dans les bras; dans son giron","小猫蜷在主人怀里，舒服地睡着了。","xiǎo māo quán zài zhǔ rén huái lǐ shū fu de shuì zháo le","The kitten curled up in its owner's arms and fell comfortably asleep.","El gatito se acurrucó en los brazos de su dueño y se durmió plácidamente.","Le chaton s'est blotti dans les bras de son maître et s'est endormi confortablement."],["L7-1742","怀孕","huáiyùn","","to be pregnant","estar embarazada","être enceinte","她怀孕以后就不再喝咖啡了。","tā huái yùn yǐ hòu jiù bú zài hē kā fēi le","She stopped drinking coffee after she became pregnant.","Desde que quedó embarazada, ya no toma café.","Depuis qu'elle est enceinte, elle ne boit plus de café."],["L7-1743","怀着","huáizhe","","to harbor; to be filled with","albergar; con (sentimiento)","nourrir; animé de","他怀着激动的心情走进了大学校园。","tā huái zhe jī dòng de xīn qíng zǒu jìn le dà xué xiào yuán","He walked onto the university campus filled with excitement.","Entró en el campus universitario lleno de emoción.","Il est entré sur le campus de l'université, le cœur plein d'émotion."],["L7-1744","槐树","huáishù","N","locust tree","acacia japonesa","sophora du Japon","村口那棵老槐树已经有三百多年的历史了。","cūn kǒu nà kē lǎo huái shù yǐ jīng yǒu sān bǎi duō nián de lì shǐ le","The old pagoda tree at the village entrance is more than three hundred years old.","El viejo sófora de la entrada del pueblo tiene más de trescientos años de historia.","Le vieux sophora à l'entrée du village a plus de trois cents ans."],["L7-1745","坏事","huàishì","N","bad thing; misdeed","mala acción; algo malo","mauvaise action; mal","做坏事的人最后都不会有好下场。","zuò huài shì de rén zuì hòu dōu bú huì yǒu hǎo xià chǎng","People who do bad things never come to a good end.","Los que hacen cosas malas nunca acaban bien.","Ceux qui font le mal finissent toujours mal."],["L7-1746","欢呼","huānhū","V","to cheer; to acclaim","vitorear; aclamar","acclamer; ovationner","听到这个好消息，大家顿时欢呼起来。","tīng dào zhè ge hǎo xiāo xi dà jiā dùn shí huān hū qǐ lái","On hearing the good news, everyone burst into cheers at once.","Al oír la buena noticia, todos estallaron de inmediato en vítores.","En apprenant la bonne nouvelle, tout le monde a aussitôt poussé des cris de joie."],["L7-1747","欢聚","huānjù","V","to get together joyfully","reunirse con alegría","se réunir joyeusement","每年除夕，全家人都会欢聚一堂吃年夜饭。","měi nián chú xī quán jiā rén dōu huì huān jù yì táng chī nián yè fàn","Every New Year's Eve, the whole family gathers happily for the reunion dinner.","Cada Nochevieja, toda la familia se reúne alegremente para la cena de fin de año.","Chaque réveillon du Nouvel An, toute la famille se retrouve joyeusement pour le dîner de réveillon."],["L7-1748","欢快","huānkuài","Adj","cheerful; lively","alegre; animado","joyeux; entraînant","音乐响起，孩子们跟着欢快的节奏跳起舞来。","yīn yuè xiǎng qǐ hái zi men gēn zhe huān kuài de jié zòu tiào qǐ wǔ lái","The music started, and the children began dancing to the lively rhythm.","Sonó la música y los niños empezaron a bailar al ritmo alegre.","La musique a retenti, et les enfants se sont mis à danser sur le rythme joyeux."],["L7-1749","欢声笑语","huānshēng-xiàoyǔ","","cheers and laughter","vítores y risas","cris de joie et rires","节日的公园里到处是欢声笑语。","jié rì de gōng yuán lǐ dào chù shì huān shēng xiào yǔ","The park on the holiday was full of cheers and laughter everywhere.","El parque en día de fiesta estaba lleno de gritos de alegría y risas por todas partes.","Le parc, en ce jour de fête, résonnait partout de cris joyeux et de rires."],["L7-1750","还款","huán kuǎn","","to repay a loan","reembolsar; pagar una deuda","rembourser","如果不能按时还款，银行会收取一定的利息。","rú guǒ bù néng àn shí huán kuǎn yín háng huì shōu qǔ yí dìng de lì xī","If you can't repay on time, the bank will charge a certain amount of interest.","Si no se puede pagar a tiempo, el banco cobrará cierto interés.","Si vous ne remboursez pas à temps, la banque prélèvera des intérêts."],["L7-1751","还原","huányuán","","to restore; to reduce","restaurar; reducir (química)","restituer; réduire","警方通过监控录像还原了事故发生的经过。","jǐng fāng tōng guò jiān kòng lù xiàng huán yuán le shì gù fā shēng de jīng guò","Police reconstructed how the accident happened using surveillance footage.","La policía reconstruyó cómo ocurrió el accidente a partir de las grabaciones de las cámaras de vigilancia.","La police a reconstitué le déroulement de l'accident grâce aux enregistrements de vidéosurveillance."],["L7-1752","环球","huánqiú","V","around the world; global","alrededor del mundo; global","autour du monde; mondial","他辞掉工作，花了一年时间进行环球旅行。","tā cí diào gōng zuò huā le yì nián shí jiān jìn xíng huán qiú lǚ xíng","He quit his job and spent a year traveling around the world.","Renunció a su trabajo y pasó un año dando la vuelta al mundo.","Il a quitté son travail et a passé un an à faire le tour du monde."],["L7-1753","环绕","huánrào","V","to surround; to circle","rodear; circundar","entourer; encercler","这座小城四面环绕着青山，风景非常优美。","zhè zuò xiǎo chéng sì miàn huán rào zhe qīng shān fēng jǐng fēi cháng yōu měi","This small town is surrounded on all sides by green hills and has lovely scenery.","Esta pequeña ciudad está rodeada de montañas verdes por todos lados y tiene un paisaje hermosísimo.","Cette petite ville est entourée de collines verdoyantes de tous côtés et offre un paysage magnifique."],["L7-1754","缓","huǎn","V","slow; to delay","lento; aplazar","lent; retarder","他办事一向稳妥，即便任务繁重，也能分清轻重缓急。","tā bàn shì yí xiàng wěn tuǒ jí biàn rèn wu fán zhòng yě néng fēn qīng qīng zhòng huǎn jí","He has always handled matters reliably and can set priorities even under a heavy workload.","Siempre ha resuelto los asuntos con seguridad y, aunque la tarea sea pesada, sabe distinguir lo urgente de lo importante.","Il a toujours géré les dossiers avec fiabilité et, même sous une lourde charge de travail, il sait hiérarchiser les priorités."],["L7-1755","缓和","huǎnhé","V/Adj","to ease; to alleviate","aliviar; suavizar","détendre; atténuer","经过双方多次谈判，紧张的局势终于有所缓和。","jīng guò shuāng fāng duō cì tán pàn jǐn zhāng de jú shì zhōng yú yǒu suǒ huǎn hé","After several rounds of talks between the two sides, the tense situation finally eased somewhat.","Tras varias rondas de negociaciones entre las dos partes, la tensa situación por fin se alivió un poco.","Après plusieurs négociations entre les deux parties, la situation tendue s'est enfin un peu apaisée."],["L7-1756","缓缓","huǎnhuǎn","Adv","slowly; gradually","lentamente; poco a poco","lentement; peu à peu","一条小河从村子中间缓缓流淌而过。","yì tiáo xiǎo hé cóng cūn zi zhōng jiān huǎn huǎn liú tǎng ér guò","A small river flows slowly through the middle of the village.","Un riachuelo pasa lentamente por el centro del pueblo.","Une petite rivière traverse lentement le village en son milieu."],["L7-1757","缓慢","huǎnmàn","Adj","slow","lento","lent","这首曲子节奏缓慢，有很好的催眠效果。","zhè shǒu qǔ zi jié zòu huǎn màn yǒu hěn hǎo de cuī mián xiào guǒ","This piece of music has a slow rhythm and is very effective at lulling people to sleep.","Esta melodía tiene un ritmo lento y es muy eficaz para dar sueño.","Ce morceau a un rythme lent et un très bon effet soporifique."],["L7-1758","幻觉","huànjué","N","illusion; hallucination","ilusión; alucinación","illusion; hallucination","他发烧烧得厉害，甚至出现了幻觉。","tā fā shāo shāo de lì hai shèn zhì chū xiàn le huàn jué","He had such a high fever that he even started hallucinating.","Tenía tanta fiebre que incluso tuvo alucinaciones.","Il avait une si forte fièvre qu'il a même eu des hallucinations."],["L7-1759","幻影","huànyǐng","N","phantom; mirage","fantasma; espejismo","fantôme; mirage","沙漠里看到的那片湖，原来只是一个幻影。","shā mò lǐ kàn dào de nà piàn hú yuán lái zhǐ shì yí ge huàn yǐng","The lake seen in the desert turned out to be only a mirage.","Aquel lago que se veía en el desierto resultó ser solo un espejismo.","Le lac qu'on voyait dans le désert n'était en réalité qu'un mirage."],["L7-1760","换成","huànchéng","","to change into; to replace with","cambiar por; convertir en","changer en; remplacer par","请帮我把这张一百元的钞票换成零钱。","qǐng bāng wǒ bǎ zhè zhāng yì bǎi yuán de chāo piào huàn chéng líng qián","Please break this hundred-yuan note into small change for me.","Por favor, cámbiame este billete de cien yuanes por cambio.","Pouvez-vous me faire la monnaie sur ce billet de cent yuans, s'il vous plaît ?"],["L7-1761","换取","huànqǔ","V","to exchange for","obtener a cambio de","obtenir en échange de","他们用自己种的粮食换取生活用品。","tā men yòng zì jǐ zhòng de liáng shi huàn qǔ shēng huó yòng pǐn","They exchange the grain they grow for daily necessities.","Cambian el grano que cultivan por artículos de uso diario.","Ils troquent les céréales qu'ils cultivent contre des produits de première nécessité."],["L7-1762","换位","huànwèi","V","to swap positions","intercambiar posiciones","changer de place","遇到矛盾时，学会换位思考就容易理解对方。","yù dào máo dùn shí xué huì huàn wèi sī kǎo jiù róng yì lǐ jiě duì fāng","When conflicts arise, learning to put yourself in the other's shoes makes it easier to understand them.","Cuando surgen conflictos, aprender a ponerse en el lugar del otro facilita entenderlo.","Quand un conflit éclate, apprendre à se mettre à la place de l'autre aide à le comprendre."],["L7-1763","换言之","huànyánzhī","","in other words","en otras palabras","autrement dit","他每天只睡四个小时，换言之，他每天有二十个小时是醒着的。","tā měi tiān zhǐ shuì sì gè xiǎo shí huàn yán zhī tā měi tiān yǒu èr shí gè xiǎo shí shì xǐng zhe de","He sleeps only four hours a day; in other words, he is awake for twenty hours each day.","Duerme solo cuatro horas al día; en otras palabras, pasa veinte horas despierto.","Il ne dort que quatre heures par jour ; autrement dit, il est éveillé vingt heures par jour."],["L7-1764","唤起","huànqǐ","V","to arouse; to evoke","despertar; evocar","éveiller; évoquer","这首老歌唤起了她对童年的美好回忆。","zhè shǒu lǎo gē huàn qǐ le tā duì tóng nián de měi hǎo huí yì","This old song brought back her fond memories of childhood.","Esta vieja canción le trajo bellos recuerdos de la infancia.","Cette vieille chanson a réveillé en elle de beaux souvenirs d'enfance."],["L7-1765","患","huàn","V","to suffer from; trouble","padecer; problema","souffrir de; ennui","患糖尿病的人要严格控制饮食。","huàn táng niào bìng de rén yào yán gé kòng zhì yǐn shí","People with diabetes must strictly control their diet.","Las personas con diabetes deben controlar estrictamente su alimentación.","Les personnes atteintes de diabète doivent suivre un régime alimentaire strict."],["L7-1766","患病","huànbìng","V","to fall ill","enfermar","tomber malade","近年来，年轻人患病的比例有所上升。","jìn nián lái nián qīng rén huàn bìng de bǐ lì yǒu suǒ shàng shēng","In recent years, the proportion of young people falling ill has risen somewhat.","En los últimos años, la proporción de jóvenes que se enferman ha aumentado un poco.","Ces dernières années, la proportion de jeunes tombant malades a légèrement augmenté."],["L7-1767","患有","huànyǒu","","to suffer from","padecer","souffrir de","他从小患有哮喘，不能做剧烈运动。","tā cóng xiǎo huàn yǒu xiào chuǎn bù néng zuò jù liè yùn dòng","He has had asthma since childhood and can't do strenuous exercise.","Desde niño sufre de asma y no puede hacer ejercicio intenso.","Il souffre d'asthme depuis l'enfance et ne peut pas faire d'exercice intense."],["L7-1768","焕发","huànfā","V","to radiate; to glow","irradiar; resplandecer","rayonner; resplendir","退休以后，老人参加了合唱团，整个人焕发出新的活力。","tuì xiū yǐ hòu lǎo rén cān jiā le hé chàng tuán zhěng gè rén huàn fā chū xīn de huó lì","After retiring, the old man joined a choir and was full of new vitality.","Tras jubilarse, el anciano se unió a un coro y se le ve lleno de una nueva vitalidad.","Après sa retraite, le vieil homme a rejoint une chorale, et il rayonne d'une vitalité nouvelle."],["L7-1769","荒","huāng","V","desolate; scarce; absurd","desolado; escaso; absurdo","désert; rare; absurde","祖辈们在这片荒地上开垦出了大片良田。","zǔ bèi men zài zhè piàn huāng dì shang kāi kěn chū le dà piàn liáng tián","Our ancestors reclaimed vast stretches of fertile farmland from this wasteland.","Nuestros antepasados convirtieron este terreno baldío en extensas tierras fértiles.","Nos aïeux ont défriché cette friche pour en faire de vastes terres fertiles."],["L7-1770","荒诞","huāngdàn","Adj","absurd; preposterous","absurdo; disparatado","absurde; extravagant","这部小说的情节虽然荒诞，却反映了真实的社会问题。","zhè bù xiǎo shuō de qíng jié suī rán huāng dàn què fǎn yìng le zhēn shí de shè huì wèn tí","Although the plot of this novel is absurd, it reflects real social problems.","Aunque la trama de esta novela es absurda, refleja problemas sociales reales.","Bien que l'intrigue de ce roman soit absurde, elle reflète de vrais problèmes de société."],["L7-1771","荒凉","huāngliáng","Adj","desolate; bleak","desolado; yermo","désolé; aride","汽车在荒凉的戈壁上行驶了整整一天。","qì chē zài huāng liáng de gē bì shàng xíng shǐ le zhěng zhěng yì tiān","The car drove across the desolate Gobi for a whole day.","El coche recorrió el desolado desierto de Gobi durante todo un día.","La voiture a roulé toute une journée à travers le désert de Gobi, aride et désolé."],["L7-1772","荒谬","huāngmiù","Adj","absurd; ridiculous","absurdo; ridículo","absurde; ridicule","如果输入的数据存在偏差，再精密的模型也可能得出荒谬的结论。","rú guǒ shū rù de shù jù cún zài piān chā zài jīng mì de mó xíng yě kě néng dé chū huāng miù de jié lùn","If the input data is biased, even a highly precise model may produce absurd conclusions.","Si los datos de entrada tienen sesgos, hasta el modelo más preciso puede llegar a conclusiones absurdas.","Si les données saisies sont biaisées, même le modèle le plus précis peut aboutir à des conclusions absurdes."],["L7-1773","慌乱","huāngluàn","Adj","flustered; in a flurry","agitado; confuso","affolé; troublé","听到火警铃声，大家虽然有些慌乱，但还是有序地撤离了。","tīng dào huǒ jǐng líng shēng dà jiā suī rán yǒu xiē huāng luàn dàn hái shi yǒu xù de chè lí le","When the fire alarm rang, everyone was somewhat flustered but still evacuated in an orderly way.","Cuando sonó la alarma de incendios, aunque todos estaban algo nerviosos, evacuaron de forma ordenada.","Quand l'alarme incendie a retenti, tout le monde était un peu affolé, mais l'évacuation s'est faite dans l'ordre."],["L7-1774","慌张","huāngzhāng","Adj","flustered; panicky","nervioso; azorado","paniqué; affolé","遇到突发情况，大家不要慌张。","yù dào tū fā qíng kuàng dà jiā bú yào huāng zhāng","When an emergency occurs, don't panic.","Ante una situación imprevista, que nadie se alarme.","En cas de situation imprévue, que personne ne panique."],["L7-1775","皇宫","huánggōng","N","imperial palace","palacio imperial","palais impérial","故宫是明清两代的皇宫，现在是一座博物馆。","gù gōng shì míng qīng liǎng dài de huáng gōng xiàn zài shì yí zuò bó wù guǎn","The Forbidden City was the imperial palace of the Ming and Qing dynasties and is now a museum.","La Ciudad Prohibida fue el palacio imperial de las dinastías Ming y Qing, y hoy es un museo.","La Cité interdite fut le palais impérial des dynasties Ming et Qing et est aujourd'hui un musée."],["L7-1776","皇后","huánghòu","N","empress; queen","emperatriz; reina","impératrice; reine","这部电视剧讲的是一位皇后在宫中的生活。","zhè bù diàn shì jù jiǎng de shì yí wèi huáng hòu zài gōng zhōng de shēng huó","This TV drama is about an empress's life in the palace.","Esta serie de televisión trata de la vida de una emperatriz en el palacio.","Cette série télévisée raconte la vie d'une impératrice au palais."],["L7-1777","皇上","huángshang","N","the emperor","el emperador","l'empereur","戏里的大臣跪在地上，请求皇上收回成命。","xì lǐ de dà chén guì zài dì shang qǐng qiú huáng shang shōu huí chéng mìng","In the play, the minister knelt and begged the emperor to withdraw his order.","En la obra, el ministro se arrodilló en el suelo y suplicó al emperador que retirara su orden.","Dans la pièce, le ministre s'agenouille et supplie l'empereur de revenir sur son décret."],["L7-1778","皇室","huángshì","N","royal family","familia real","famille royale","这座城堡至今仍归皇室所有。","zhè zuò chéng bǎo zhì jīn réng guī huáng shì suǒ yǒu","This castle is still owned by the royal family to this day.","Este castillo sigue perteneciendo hasta hoy a la familia real.","Ce château appartient encore aujourd'hui à la famille royale."],["L7-1779","黄昏","huánghūn","N","dusk; twilight","crepúsculo; anochecer","crépuscule; tombée du jour","黄昏时分，夕阳把整个海面染成了金色。","huáng hūn shí fēn xī yáng bǎ zhěng gè hǎi miàn rǎn chéng le jīn sè","At dusk, the setting sun dyed the whole sea gold.","Al atardecer, el sol poniente teñía de dorado todo el mar.","Au crépuscule, le soleil couchant a teint toute la mer d'or."],["L7-1780","恍然大悟","huǎngrán-dàwù","","to suddenly realize","caer en la cuenta de repente","comprendre soudain","听了老师的解释，他才恍然大悟，原来是自己理解错了。","tīng le lǎo shī de jiě shì tā cái huǎng rán dà wù yuán lái shì zì jǐ lǐ jiě cuò le","Only after hearing the teacher's explanation did he suddenly realize he had misunderstood.","Después de oír la explicación de la maestra, de pronto lo entendió todo: se había equivocado al interpretarlo.","Après avoir écouté l'explication du professeur, il a soudain compris : c'était lui qui s'était trompé."],["L7-1781","晃","huǎng","V","to shake; to sway","sacudir; balancear","secouer; balancer","书架有点晃，我拿螺丝刀把螺丝拧紧了。","shū jià yǒu diǎn huàng wǒ ná luó sī dāo bǎ luó sī nǐng jǐn le","The bookshelf was a bit wobbly, so I tightened the screws with a screwdriver.","El librero se movía un poco, así que apreté los tornillos con un destornillador.","L'étagère bougeait un peu, alors j'ai resserré les vis avec un tournevis."],["L7-1782","谎话","huǎnghuà","N","lie","mentira","mensonge","他为自己说过的谎话感到很羞愧。","tā wèi zì jǐ shuō guo de huǎng huà gǎn dào hěn xiū kuì","He felt deeply ashamed of the lies he had told.","Siente mucha vergüenza por las mentiras que dijo.","Il a très honte des mensonges qu'il a dits."],["L7-1783","谎言","huǎngyán","N","lie","mentira","mensonge","时间一长，他的谎言终于被揭穿了。","shí jiān yì cháng tā de huǎng yán zhōng yú bèi jiē chuān le","In time, his lies were finally exposed.","Con el tiempo, sus mentiras por fin quedaron al descubierto.","Avec le temps, ses mensonges ont fini par être démasqués."],["L7-1784","晃","huàng","V","to flash; to sway","destellar; balancearse","passer en un éclair; osciller","书架有点晃，我拿螺丝刀把螺丝拧紧了。","shū jià yǒu diǎn huàng wǒ ná luó sī dāo bǎ luó sī nǐng jǐn le","The bookshelf was a bit wobbly, so I tightened the screws with a screwdriver.","El librero se movía un poco, así que apreté los tornillos con un destornillador.","L'étagère bougeait un peu, alors j'ai resserré les vis avec un tournevis."],["L7-1785","晃荡","huàngdang","V","to sway; to wander","balancearse; deambular","se balancer; flâner","小男孩坐在桥边，两条腿在空中晃荡着。","xiǎo nán hái zuò zài qiáo biān liǎng tiáo tuǐ zài kōng zhōng huàng dang zhe","The little boy sat on the edge of the bridge, his legs dangling in the air.","El niño estaba sentado al borde del puente con las piernas colgando en el aire.","Le petit garçon était assis au bord du pont, les jambes qui se balançaient dans le vide."],["L7-1786","灰","huī","N/Adj","ash; dust; gray","ceniza; polvo; gris","cendre; poussière; gris","一个月没人住，桌子上已经落了一层灰。","yí ge yuè méi rén zhù zhuō zi shàng yǐ jīng luò le yì céng huī","No one has lived here for a month, and a layer of dust has already settled on the table.","Nadie ha vivido aquí durante un mes y ya se ha acumulado una capa de polvo sobre la mesa.","Personne n'a habité ici depuis un mois, et une couche de poussière s'est déjà déposée sur la table."],["L7-1787","灰尘","huīchén","N","dust","polvo","poussière","她把床单使劲抖了几下，抖掉了上面的灰尘。","tā bǎ chuáng dān shǐ jìn dǒu le jǐ xià dǒu diào le shàng miàn de huī chén","She gave the sheet a few hard shakes to shake off the dust.","Sacudió la sábana con fuerza varias veces para quitarle el polvo.","Elle a secoué le drap énergiquement plusieurs fois pour en faire tomber la poussière."],["L7-1788","灰心","huīxīn","","to lose heart","desanimarse","se décourager","一次失败不算什么，千万不要灰心。","yí cì shī bài bú suàn shén me qiān wàn bú yào huī xīn","One failure is nothing — whatever you do, don't lose heart.","Un fracaso no es nada; por favor, no te desanimes.","Un échec, ce n'est rien ; surtout, ne te décourage pas."],["L7-1789","挥","huī","V","to wave; to wield","agitar; blandir","agiter; brandir","这幅画还缺个题名，恭请您大笔一挥。","zhè fú huà hái quē gè tí míng gōng qǐng nín dà bǐ yì huī","This painting still needs a title; would you kindly inscribe one with your brush?","A esta pintura todavía le falta un título; le ruego que tenga la amabilidad de escribirlo con su pincel.","Ce tableau n'a pas encore de titre ; je vous prie de bien vouloir l'inscrire d'un coup de pinceau."],["L7-1790","辉煌","huīhuáng","Adj","splendid; glorious","espléndido; glorioso","splendide; glorieux","这家老字号曾经有过辉煌的历史。","zhè jiā lǎo zì hào céng jīng yǒu guo huī huáng de lì shǐ","This time-honored brand once had a glorious history.","Esta marca de renombre tuvo en el pasado una historia brillante.","Cette maison de longue date a connu autrefois une histoire glorieuse."],["L7-1791","回归","huíguī","V","to return; regression","regresar; regresión","revenir; régression","在城市生活多年以后，他决定回归田园，过简单的日子。","zài chéng shì shēng huó duō nián yǐ hòu tā jué dìng huí guī tián yuán guò jiǎn dān de rì zi","After many years of city life, he decided to return to the countryside and live simply.","Después de muchos años de vida en la ciudad, decidió volver al campo y llevar una vida sencilla.","Après de nombreuses années de vie en ville, il a décidé de retourner à la campagne et de mener une vie simple."],["L7-1792","回扣","huíkòu","N","kickback; commission","comisión ilegal; soborno","pot-de-vin; commission","这名采购经理因为收受回扣被公司开除了。","zhè míng cǎi gòu jīng lǐ yīn wèi shōu shòu huí kòu bèi gōng sī kāi chú le","This purchasing manager was fired by the company for taking kickbacks.","Este gerente de compras fue despedido por la empresa por aceptar comisiones ilegales.","Ce responsable des achats a été licencié par l'entreprise pour avoir touché des pots-de-vin."],["L7-1793","回馈","huíkuì","V","to give back; feedback","devolver; retroalimentación","rendre la pareille; retour","为了回馈老顾客，商店推出了一系列优惠活动。","wèi le huí kuì lǎo gù kè shāng diàn tuī chū le yí xì liè yōu huì huó dòng","To give back to loyal customers, the store launched a series of special offers.","Para corresponder a sus clientes de siempre, la tienda lanzó una serie de promociones.","Pour remercier ses clients fidèles, le magasin a lancé une série d'offres promotionnelles."],["L7-1794","回落","huíluò","V","to fall back","descender; retroceder","retomber; refluer","连续上涨了几个月之后，猪肉价格开始回落。","lián xù shàng zhǎng le jǐ ge yuè zhī hòu zhū ròu jià gé kāi shǐ huí luò","After rising for several months in a row, pork prices have begun to fall back.","Tras subir varios meses seguidos, el precio de la carne de cerdo empezó a bajar.","Après plusieurs mois de hausse consécutifs, le prix du porc a commencé à redescendre."],["L7-1795","回升","huíshēng","V","to rise again; to rebound","repuntar; recuperarse","remonter; rebondir","天气转暖，气温逐渐回升到二十度左右。","tiān qì zhuǎn nuǎn qì wēn zhú jiàn huí shēng dào èr shí dù zuǒ yòu","The weather is warming up, and temperatures are gradually climbing back to about twenty degrees.","El tiempo se va calentando y la temperatura vuelve poco a poco a unos veinte grados.","Le temps se réchauffe, et les températures remontent peu à peu autour de vingt degrés."],["L7-1796","回首","huíshǒu","V","to look back","mirar atrás","se retourner; regarder en arrière","回首往事，他觉得最对不起的是自己的父母。","huí shǒu wǎng shì tā jué de zuì duì bu qǐ de shì zì jǐ de fù mǔ","Looking back on the past, he feels he has let his parents down the most.","Al mirar atrás, siente que a quienes más ha fallado es a sus padres.","En repensant au passé, il estime que ce sont ses parents qu'il a le plus déçus."],["L7-1797","回味","huíwèi","N/V","to savor; aftertaste","rememorar; regusto","savourer en souvenir; arrière-goût","这道菜的味道让人回味无穷。","zhè dào cài de wèi dào ràng rén huí wèi wú qióng","The flavor of this dish leaves a lasting aftertaste.","El sabor de este plato deja un recuerdo que no se acaba.","Le goût de ce plat laisse un souvenir qu'on n'oublie pas."],["L7-1798","回想","huíxiǎng","V","to recall; to think back","recordar; rememorar","se rappeler; repenser à","回想起童年的生活，他心里感到很甜蜜。","huí xiǎng qǐ tóng nián de shēng huó tā xīn lǐ gǎn dào hěn tián mì","Recalling his childhood, he felt a warm glow of happiness.","Al recordar su vida de la infancia, sintió el corazón lleno de dulzura.","En repensant à sa vie d'enfant, il a ressenti une douce chaleur."],["L7-1799","回忆录","huíyìlù","N","memoir","memorias","mémoires","这位老将军退休后写了一本回忆录，记录了自己的一生。","zhè wèi lǎo jiāng jūn tuì xiū hòu xiě le yì běn huí yì lù jì lù le zì jǐ de yì shēng","After retiring, the old general wrote a memoir recording his life.","Después de jubilarse, el viejo general escribió unas memorias donde recogió su vida.","Après sa retraite, le vieux général a écrit des mémoires où il a consigné toute sa vie."],["L7-1800","悔恨","huǐhèn","V","remorse; regret","remordimiento; arrepentimiento","remords; regret","他为自己年轻时的冲动感到深深的悔恨。","tā wèi zì jǐ nián qīng shí de chōng dòng gǎn dào shēn shēn de huǐ hèn","He feels deep remorse for his impulsiveness when he was young.","Siente un profundo arrepentimiento por su impulsividad de juventud.","Il éprouve de profonds remords pour son impulsivité de jeunesse."],["L7-1801","毁坏","huǐhuài","V","to damage; to destroy","dañar; destruir","endommager; détruire","台风毁坏了大片农田和房屋。","tái fēng huǐ huài le dà piàn nóng tián hé fáng wū","The typhoon destroyed large areas of farmland and many houses.","El tifón destruyó extensas tierras de cultivo y muchas casas.","Le typhon a détruit de vastes étendues de terres agricoles et de nombreuses maisons."],["L7-1802","毁灭","huǐmiè","V","to destroy; to perish","destruir; perecer","détruire; anéantir","这部科幻电影讲的是人类如何避免地球毁灭。","zhè bù kē huàn diàn yǐng jiǎng de shì rén lèi rú hé bì miǎn dì qiú huǐ miè","This science-fiction film is about how humanity avoids the destruction of the Earth.","Esta película de ciencia ficción trata de cómo la humanidad evita la destrucción de la Tierra.","Ce film de science-fiction raconte comment l'humanité évite la destruction de la Terre."],["L7-1803","汇合","huìhé","V","to converge; to join","confluir; juntarse","converger; se rejoindre","两条河流在城市东边汇合，然后流入大海。","liǎng tiáo hé liú zài chéng shì dōng bian huì hé rán hòu liú rù dà hǎi","The two rivers converge east of the city and then flow into the sea.","Los dos ríos confluyen al este de la ciudad y luego desembocan en el mar.","Les deux fleuves se rejoignent à l'est de la ville, puis se jettent dans la mer."],["L7-1804","汇集","huìjí","V","to gather; to compile","reunir; recopilar","rassembler; compiler","这本书汇集了几位大师作品的精华。","zhè běn shū huì jí le jǐ wèi dà shī zuò pǐn de jīng huá","This book brings together the best of several masters' works.","Este libro reúne lo mejor de las obras de varios maestros.","Ce livre rassemble le meilleur des œuvres de plusieurs maîtres."],["L7-1805","汇聚","huìjù","V","to converge; to come together","converger; reunirse","converger; se rassembler","这所大学汇聚了国内顶尖的科研人才。","zhè suǒ dà xué huì jù le guó nèi dǐng jiān de kē yán rén cái","This university brings together the country's top scientific researchers.","Esta universidad reúne a los mejores investigadores científicos del país.","Cette université rassemble les meilleurs chercheurs scientifiques du pays."],["L7-1806","会场","huìchǎng","N","meeting place; venue","sala de reuniones; recinto","salle de réunion; lieu de rencontre","进入会场前，请出示您的门票。","jìn rù huì chǎng qián qǐng chū shì nín de mén piào","Please show your ticket before entering the venue.","Por favor, muestre su entrada antes de ingresar al recinto.","Veuillez présenter votre billet avant d'entrer dans la salle."],["L7-1807","会面","huìmiàn","","to meet; meeting","reunirse; reunión","se rencontrer; rencontre","两位老同学约好周末在咖啡馆会面。","liǎng wèi lǎo tóng xué yuē hǎo zhōu mò zài kā fēi guǎn huì miàn","The two old classmates arranged to meet at a café on the weekend.","Los dos viejos compañeros de clase quedaron en verse el fin de semana en una cafetería.","Les deux anciens camarades de classe se sont donné rendez-vous dans un café ce week-end."],["L7-1808","会晤","huìwù","V","to meet; meeting","reunirse; entrevista","se rencontrer; entrevue","两国外长在北京举行了正式会晤。","liǎng guó wài zhǎng zài běi jīng jǔ xíng le zhèng shì huì wù","The foreign ministers of the two countries held a formal meeting in Beijing.","Los cancilleres de los dos países sostuvieron una reunión formal en Beijing.","Les ministres des Affaires étrangères des deux pays ont tenu une rencontre officielle à Pékin."],["L7-1809","会意","huìyì","V","compound ideograph; to understand","ideograma compuesto; comprender","idéogramme composé; comprendre","他向我使了个眼色，我马上会意，不再说话了。","tā xiàng wǒ shǐ le gè yǎn sè wǒ mǎ shàng huì yì bú zài shuō huà le","He gave me a look, and I immediately understood and stopped talking.","Me lanzó una mirada, y yo lo entendí enseguida y dejé de hablar.","Il m'a fait un clin d'œil, j'ai tout de suite compris et j'ai cessé de parler."],["L7-1810","会诊","huìzhěn","","medical consultation","consulta médica conjunta","consultation médicale collégiale","这家医院为偏远乡村提供远程会诊，减少了患者长途奔波的负担。","zhè jiā yī yuàn wèi piān yuǎn xiāng cūn tí gōng yuǎn chéng huì zhěn jiǎn shǎo le huàn zhě cháng tú bēn bō de fù dān","This hospital offers remote consultations to isolated villages, reducing the burden of long journeys for patients.","Este hospital ofrece consultas a distancia a pueblos remotos, lo que alivia a los pacientes de largos desplazamientos.","Cet hôpital propose des téléconsultations aux villages isolés, ce qui évite aux patients de longs déplacements."],["L7-1811","绘声绘色","huìshēng-huìsè","","vivid and lifelike","vívido; con todo detalle","vivant; très imagé","爷爷绘声绘色地讲起了年轻时打猎的故事。","yé ye huì shēng huì sè de jiǎng qǐ le nián qīng shí dǎ liè de gù shi","Grandpa vividly told stories about hunting when he was young.","El abuelo se puso a contar con todo detalle y viveza historias de cuando cazaba de joven.","Grand-père s'est mis à raconter avec beaucoup de vivacité des histoires de chasse de sa jeunesse."],["L7-1812","贿赂","huìlù","V/N","to bribe; bribe","sobornar; soborno","corrompre; pot-de-vin","这名官员因为接受贿赂被判了十年。","zhè míng guān yuán yīn wèi jiē shòu huì lù bèi pàn le shí nián","This official was sentenced to ten years for accepting bribes.","Este funcionario fue condenado a diez años por aceptar sobornos.","Ce fonctionnaire a été condamné à dix ans de prison pour avoir accepté des pots-de-vin."],["L7-1813","昏迷","hūnmí","V","coma; to lose consciousness","coma; perder el conocimiento","coma; perdre connaissance","他被救护车送到医院时已经昏迷了。","tā bèi jiù hù chē sòng dào yī yuàn shí yǐ jīng hūn mí le","He was already unconscious when the ambulance brought him to the hospital.","Cuando la ambulancia lo llevó al hospital, ya estaba inconsciente.","Quand l'ambulance l'a amené à l'hôpital, il était déjà inconscient."],["L7-1814","婚纱","hūnshā","N","wedding dress","vestido de novia","robe de mariée","她穿上洁白的婚纱，看起来美极了。","tā chuān shàng jié bái de hūn shā kàn qǐ lái měi jí le","She put on the pure white wedding dress and looked absolutely beautiful.","Con su vestido de novia blanco inmaculado, se veía hermosísima.","Vêtue de sa robe de mariée d'un blanc immaculé, elle était absolument magnifique."],["L7-1815","婚姻","hūnyīn","N","marriage","matrimonio","mariage","幸福的婚姻需要双方共同努力去经营。","xìng fú de hūn yīn xū yào shuāng fāng gòng tóng nǔ lì qù jīng yíng","A happy marriage requires both partners to work at it together.","Un matrimonio feliz requiere que ambos se esfuercen juntos por cuidarlo.","Un mariage heureux exige que les deux conjoints s'y consacrent ensemble."],["L7-1816","浑身","húnshēn","N","whole body; all over","todo el cuerpo","tout le corps","淋了一场大雨，他浑身都湿透了。","lín le yì chǎng dà yǔ tā hún shēn dōu shī tòu le","Caught in a downpour, he was soaked from head to toe.","Lo sorprendió un aguacero y quedó empapado de pies a cabeza.","Pris sous une pluie battante, il était trempé des pieds à la tête."],["L7-1817","魂","hún","N","soul; spirit","alma; espíritu","âme; esprit","一声巨响把她吓得魂都快没了。","yì shēng jù xiǎng bǎ tā xià de hún dōu kuài méi le","A loud bang nearly scared the life out of her.","Un estruendo la asustó tanto que casi se le fue el alma del cuerpo.","Un grand fracas lui a fait si peur qu'elle a failli en perdre connaissance."],["L7-1818","混凝土","hùnníngtǔ","N","concrete","hormigón","béton","这座大桥是用钢筋混凝土建成的。","zhè zuò dà qiáo shì yòng gāng jīn hùn níng tǔ jiàn chéng de","This bridge is built of reinforced concrete.","Este puente está construido con hormigón armado.","Ce pont est construit en béton armé."],["L7-1819","混淆","hùnxiáo","V","to confuse; to mix up","confundir; mezclar","confondre; mélanger","这两个词意思相近，学生很容易混淆。","zhè liǎng gè cí yì si xiāng jìn xué shēng hěn róng yì hùn xiáo","These two words have similar meanings, and students easily confuse them.","Estas dos palabras tienen significados parecidos y los alumnos las confunden con facilidad.","Ces deux mots ont des sens proches et les élèves les confondent facilement."],["L7-1820","混浊","hùnzhuó","Adj","turbid; muddy","turbio; sucio","trouble; boueux","下过大雨以后，河水变得非常混浊。","xià guo dà yǔ yǐ hòu hé shuǐ biàn de fēi cháng hùn zhuó","After the heavy rain, the river water became very muddy.","Después de la lluvia intensa, el agua del río se puso muy turbia.","Après les fortes pluies, l'eau de la rivière est devenue très trouble."],["L7-1821","豁","huō","V","opening; to risk everything","abertura; jugárselo todo","brèche; tout risquer","他的裤子被铁丝豁了一个大口子。","tā de kù zi bèi tiě sī huō le yí ge dà kǒu zi","His trousers were torn open in a big gash by a wire.","Un alambre le hizo un gran desgarrón en el pantalón.","Un fil de fer a fait une grande déchirure dans son pantalon."],["L7-1822","豁出去","huōchuqu","","to go all out; to risk it all","jugárselo todo","tout risquer","为了救孩子，她什么都豁出去了。","wèi le jiù hái zi tā shén me dōu huō chu qu le","To save her child, she was willing to risk everything.","Por salvar a su hijo, lo arriesgó todo.","Pour sauver son enfant, elle était prête à tout risquer."],["L7-1823","活该","huógāi","V","serves one right","bien merecido","bien fait pour","他不听劝非要冒险，摔伤了也是活该。","tā bù tīng quàn fēi yào mào xiǎn shuāi shāng le yě shì huó gāi","He wouldn't listen to advice and insisted on taking the risk, so getting hurt serves him right.","No quiso escuchar consejos y se empeñó en arriesgarse, así que si se lastimó, se lo merece.","Il n'a pas voulu écouter les conseils et a insisté pour prendre des risques ; s'il s'est blessé, c'est bien fait pour lui."],["L7-1824","活期","huóqī","Adj","current (account); demand (deposit)","a la vista; corriente","à vue; courant","活期存款虽然利息低，但随时可以取钱。","huó qī cún kuǎn suī rán lì xī dī dàn suí shí kě yǐ qǔ qián","Although current-account deposits pay low interest, you can withdraw money at any time.","Aunque los depósitos a la vista pagan pocos intereses, se puede retirar el dinero en cualquier momento.","Les dépôts à vue rapportent peu d'intérêts, mais on peut retirer son argent à tout moment."],["L7-1825","活儿","huór","N","work; job","trabajo; tarea","travail; besogne","今天的活儿太多了，我估计要加班到很晚。","jīn tiān de huór tài duō le wǒ gū jì yào jiā bān dào hěn wǎn","There's too much work today; I expect I'll have to work late.","Hoy hay demasiado trabajo; calculo que tendré que quedarme hasta muy tarde.","Il y a trop de travail aujourd'hui ; je pense que je vais devoir faire des heures supplémentaires jusque tard."],["L7-1826","火暴","huǒbào","Adj","fiery; bustling","ardiente; animado","ardent; animé","这家新开的商场开业第一天生意就特别火暴。","zhè jiā xīn kāi de shāng chǎng kāi yè dì yī tiān shēng yi jiù tè bié huǒ bào","Business at this new mall was booming on its very first day.","Este centro comercial recién inaugurado tuvo un éxito arrollador desde el primer día.","Ce nouveau centre commercial a connu un succès fou dès son premier jour d'ouverture."],["L7-1827","火锅","huǒguō","N","hotpot","fondue china; hotpot","fondue chinoise","这家店的麻辣火锅很正宗，就是太辣了。","zhè jiā diàn de má là huǒ guō hěn zhèng zōng jiù shì tài là le","This restaurant's spicy numbing hotpot is authentic, just too hot.","El hotpot picante de esta tienda es muy auténtico, pero pica demasiado.","Le fondue pimentée de ce restaurant est très authentique, mais beaucoup trop piquante."],["L7-1828","火候","huǒhou","N","heat control; crucial moment","punto de cocción; momento clave","cuisson juste; moment crucial","炒青菜要掌握好火候，炒久了就不脆了。","chǎo qīng cài yào zhǎng wò hǎo huǒ hou chǎo jiǔ le jiù bú cuì le","When stir-frying greens you have to get the heat right; cook them too long and they lose their crunch.","Al saltear verduras hay que controlar bien el fuego; si se cocinan demasiado, pierden lo crujiente.","Pour sauter des légumes verts, il faut bien maîtriser la cuisson ; trop cuits, ils perdent leur croquant."],["L7-1829","火花","huǒhuā","N","spark","chispa","étincelle","两种不同文化的交流，往往能碰撞出新的火花。","liǎng zhǒng bù tóng wén huà de jiāo liú wǎng wǎng néng pèng zhuàng chū xīn de huǒ huā","Exchanges between two different cultures can often strike new sparks.","El intercambio entre dos culturas distintas suele hacer saltar nuevas chispas.","Les échanges entre deux cultures différentes font souvent jaillir de nouvelles étincelles."],["L7-1830","火炬","huǒjù","N","torch","antorcha","torche","奥运会开幕式上，最后一名火炬手点燃了主火炬。","ào yùn huì kāi mù shì shàng zuì hòu yì míng huǒ jù shǒu diǎn rán le zhǔ huǒ jù","At the Olympic opening ceremony, the last torchbearer lit the main torch.","En la ceremonia de inauguración de los Juegos Olímpicos, el último relevista encendió el pebetero principal.","À la cérémonie d'ouverture des Jeux olympiques, le dernier porteur de la flamme a allumé la vasque principale."],["L7-1831","火辣辣","huǒlàlà","Adj","burning hot; fiery","abrasador; ardiente","brûlant; ardent","中午的太阳火辣辣的，晒得人睁不开眼睛。","zhōng wǔ de tài yáng huǒ là là de shài de rén zhēng bù kāi yǎn jing","The midday sun was scorching, so bright that people couldn't keep their eyes open.","El sol del mediodía abrasaba y daba tanta luz que no se podían abrir los ojos.","Le soleil de midi était brûlant, si éblouissant qu'on n'arrivait pas à garder les yeux ouverts."],["L7-1832","火热","huǒrè","Adj","fiery; passionate","ardiente; apasionado","brûlant; passionné","两个年轻人正处在火热的恋爱之中。","liǎng gè nián qīng rén zhèng chǔ zài huǒ rè de liàn ài zhī zhōng","The two young people are in the midst of a passionate romance.","Los dos jóvenes están en pleno y apasionado romance.","Les deux jeunes gens vivent une histoire d'amour brûlante."],["L7-1833","火山","huǒshān","N","volcano","volcán","volcan","这座火山已经休眠了几百年。","zhè zuò huǒ shān yǐ jīng xiū mián le jǐ bǎi nián","This volcano has been dormant for several hundred years.","Este volcán lleva varios siglos inactivo.","Ce volcan est en sommeil depuis plusieurs siècles."],["L7-1834","火速","huǒsù","Adv","at top speed; urgently","a toda prisa; urgentemente","à toute vitesse; d'urgence","接到报警后，消防队员火速赶到了现场。","jiē dào bào jǐng hòu xiāo fáng duì yuán huǒ sù gǎn dào le xiàn chǎng","After receiving the alarm, the firefighters rushed to the scene at top speed.","Al recibir la alerta, los bomberos llegaron al lugar a toda velocidad.","Après avoir reçu l'alerte, les pompiers se sont rendus sur place à toute vitesse."],["L7-1835","火焰","huǒyàn","N","flame; blaze","llama; fuego","flamme","壁炉里的火焰跳动着，屋子里暖洋洋的。","bì lú lǐ de huǒ yàn tiào dòng zhe wū zi lǐ nuǎn yáng yáng de","The flames danced in the fireplace, and the room was warm and cozy.","Las llamas danzaban en la chimenea y la habitación estaba calentita.","Les flammes dansaient dans la cheminée, et la pièce était délicieusement chaude."],["L7-1836","火药","huǒyào","N","gunpowder","pólvora","poudre à canon","火药是中国古代的四大发明之一。","huǒ yào shì zhōng guó gǔ dài de sì dà fā míng zhī yī","Gunpowder is one of the Four Great Inventions of ancient China.","La pólvora es uno de los cuatro grandes inventos de la antigua China.","La poudre à canon est l'une des quatre grandes inventions de la Chine antique."],["L7-1837","伙食","huǒshí","N","meals; food","comidas; alimentación","repas; nourriture","我们学校食堂的伙食又便宜又好吃。","wǒ men xué xiào shí táng de huǒ shí yòu pián yi yòu hǎo chī","The food in our school canteen is both cheap and tasty.","La comida del comedor de nuestra escuela es barata y rica.","La nourriture de la cantine de notre école est bon marché et délicieuse."],["L7-1838","或多或少","huòduō-huòshǎo","","more or less","más o menos","plus ou moins","每个人或多或少都会有一些坏习惯。","měi ge rén huò duō huò shǎo dōu huì yǒu yì xiē huài xí guàn","Everyone has some bad habits to a greater or lesser extent.","Todos tenemos, más o menos, algunos malos hábitos.","Tout le monde a plus ou moins de mauvaises habitudes."],["L7-1839","货币","huòbì","N","currency; money","moneda; divisa","monnaie; devise","很多国家正在研究发行数字货币。","hěn duō guó jiā zhèng zài yán jiū fā xíng shù zì huò bì","Many countries are studying the issuance of digital currencies.","Muchos países están estudiando la emisión de monedas digitales.","De nombreux pays étudient l'émission de monnaies numériques."],["L7-1840","货车","huòchē","N","truck; freight car","camión de carga; vagón","camion; wagon de marchandises","这辆货车因为超载被交警扣押了。","zhè liàng huò chē yīn wèi chāo zài bèi jiāo jǐng kòu yā le","This truck was impounded by traffic police for being overloaded.","Este camión fue retenido por la policía de tránsito por exceso de carga.","Ce camion a été saisi par la police de la route pour surcharge."],["L7-1841","货物","huòwù","N","goods; merchandise","mercancías; bienes","marchandises; biens","这批货物预计下周一运到港口。","zhè pī huò wù yù jì xià zhōu yí yùn dào gǎng kǒu","This shipment of goods is expected to arrive at the port next Monday.","Se calcula que este cargamento llegará al puerto el próximo lunes.","Cette cargaison devrait arriver au port lundi prochain."],["L7-1842","货运","huòyùn","N","freight transport","transporte de carga","transport de marchandises","新的铁路线建成后，这个地区的货运能力大大提高了。","xīn de tiě lù xiàn jiàn chéng hòu zhè ge dì qū de huò yùn néng lì dà dà tí gāo le","After the new railway line was built, the region's freight capacity increased greatly.","Después de construirse la nueva línea de ferrocarril, la capacidad de transporte de carga de esta región aumentó mucho.","Après la construction de la nouvelle ligne ferroviaire, la capacité de transport de fret de la région a considérablement augmenté."],["L7-1843","获胜","huòshèng","V","to win; to triumph","ganar; triunfar","gagner; l'emporter","听到球队获胜的消息，球迷们在街上欢呼起来。","tīng dào qiú duì huò shèng de xiāo xi qiú mí men zài jiē shang huān hū qǐ lái","Hearing that their team had won, the fans began cheering in the streets.","Al oír la noticia de que su equipo había ganado, los aficionados empezaron a vitorear en la calle.","En apprenant la victoire de leur équipe, les supporters se sont mis à pousser des acclamations dans la rue."],["L7-1844","获悉","huòxī","V","to learn of; to find out","enterarse de; saber","apprendre; être informé de","记者从有关部门获悉，这条地铁线将于年底开通。","jì zhě cóng yǒu guān bù mén huò xī zhè tiáo dì tiě xiàn jiāng yú nián dǐ kāi tōng","Reporters have learned from the relevant department that this subway line will open at the end of the year.","Según supo el reportero por los departamentos competentes, esta línea de metro abrirá a finales de año.","Les journalistes ont appris auprès des services concernés que cette ligne de métro ouvrira à la fin de l'année."],["L7-1845","祸害","huòhai","N/V","disaster; to harm","desastre; perjudicar","fléau; nuire à","这些野猪经常下山祸害庄稼，农民们头疼极了。","zhè xiē yě zhū jīng cháng xià shān huò hai zhuāng jia nóng mín men tóu téng jí le","These wild boars often come down the mountain and ruin the crops, giving farmers a real headache.","Estos jabalíes bajan a menudo de la montaña a arruinar los cultivos, y los campesinos están desesperados.","Ces sangliers descendent souvent de la montagne pour ravager les cultures, ce qui donne bien du souci aux paysans."],["L7-1846","霍乱","huòluàn","N","cholera","cólera","choléra","霍乱是一种通过不干净的水传播的传染病。","huò luàn shì yì zhǒng tōng guò bù gān jìng de shuǐ chuán bō de chuán rǎn bìng","Cholera is an infectious disease spread through unclean water.","El cólera es una enfermedad infecciosa que se transmite por agua contaminada.","Le choléra est une maladie infectieuse transmise par l'eau souillée."],["L7-1847","豁达","huòdá","Adj","open-minded; magnanimous","de mente abierta; generoso","large d'esprit; magnanime","爷爷性格豁达，遇到什么事都想得开。","yé ye xìng gé huò dá yù dào shén me shì dōu xiǎng de kāi","Grandpa has an easygoing nature and takes everything in stride.","El abuelo tiene un carácter desenfadado y se toma todo con filosofía.","Grand-père a un caractère large d'esprit et prend tout du bon côté."],["L7-1848","几率","jīlǜ","N","probability; odds","probabilidad","probabilité","研究表明，经常运动可以降低患心脏病的几率。","yán jiū biǎo míng jīng cháng yùn dòng kě yǐ jiàng dī huàn xīn zàng bìng de jī lǜ","Research shows that regular exercise can lower the chance of developing heart disease.","Las investigaciones muestran que hacer ejercicio con regularidad puede reducir la probabilidad de padecer enfermedades del corazón.","Les recherches montrent qu'une activité physique régulière peut réduire le risque de maladie cardiaque."],["L7-1849","讥笑","jīxiào","V","to sneer at; to mock","burlarse de","se moquer de","他刚开始学画画时，常常被别人讥笑。","tā gāng kāi shǐ xué huà huà shí cháng cháng bèi bié rén jī xiào","When he first started learning to paint, he was often mocked by others.","Cuando empezó a aprender a pintar, a menudo se burlaban de él.","Quand il a commencé à apprendre la peinture, on se moquait souvent de lui."],["L7-1850","饥饿","jī'è","Adj","hunger; starvation","hambre; inanición","faim; famine","在那个年代，很多人都尝过饥饿的滋味。","zài nà ge nián dài hěn duō rén dōu cháng guo jī è de zī wèi","In those days, many people knew what it was like to go hungry.","En aquella época, mucha gente conoció el sabor del hambre.","À cette époque, beaucoup de gens ont connu la faim."],["L7-1851","机舱","jīcāng","N","aircraft cabin","cabina del avión","cabine d'avion","飞机降落以后，乘客们陆续走出了机舱。","fēi jī jiàng luò yǐ hòu chéng kè men lù xù zǒu chū le jī cāng","After the plane landed, the passengers filed out of the cabin.","Después de que aterrizó el avión, los pasajeros fueron saliendo uno tras otro de la cabina.","Après l'atterrissage de l'avion, les passagers sont sortis de la cabine les uns après les autres."],["L7-1852","机动","jīdòng","Adj","flexible; motorized","flexible; motorizado","flexible; motorisé","我们留出两天机动时间，以防计划有变。","wǒ men liú chū liǎng tiān jī dòng shí jiān yǐ fáng jì huà yǒu biàn","We've set aside two days of flexible time in case the plan changes.","Dejamos dos días de margen por si cambia el plan.","Nous avons prévu deux jours de marge au cas où le plan changerait."],["L7-1853","机灵","jīling","Adj","clever; quick-witted","espabilado; ágil de mente","malin; vif","这个小男孩很机灵，一教就会。","zhè ge xiǎo nán hái hěn jī ling yì jiāo jiù huì","This little boy is very quick and learns as soon as he's taught.","Este niño es muy despierto: aprende con solo enseñarle una vez.","Ce petit garçon est très vif : il apprend dès qu'on lui montre."],["L7-1854","机密","jīmì","Adj/N","secret; classified","secreto; confidencial","secret; confidentiel","这些文件属于公司机密，不能随便给外人看。","zhè xiē wén jiàn shǔ yú gōng sī jī mì bù néng suí biàn gěi wài rén kàn","These documents contain confidential company information, so you can't just show them to outsiders.","Estos documentos son confidenciales de la empresa y no se pueden mostrar a cualquier persona ajena.","Ces documents sont confidentiels pour l'entreprise et ne doivent pas être montrés à n'importe quel étranger."],["L7-1855","机智","jīzhì","Adj","quick-witted; resourceful","ingenioso; agudo","vif d'esprit; ingénieux","面对记者的刁难，她机智地化解了尴尬。","miàn duì jì zhě de diāo nàn tā jī zhì de huà jiě le gān gà","Faced with a reporter's tough question, she cleverly defused the awkward moment.","Ante las preguntas capciosas del periodista, ella resolvió la situación incómoda con ingenio.","Face aux questions pièges du journaliste, elle a désamorcé le malaise avec intelligence."],["L7-1856","肌肤","jīfū","N","skin; flesh","piel; carne","peau; chair","冬天空气干燥，要注意保护肌肤。","dōng tiān kōng qì gān zào yào zhù yì bǎo hù jī fū","The air is dry in winter, so take care to protect your skin.","En invierno el aire es seco, así que hay que cuidar la piel.","En hiver, l'air est sec, il faut donc bien protéger sa peau."],["L7-1857","积","jī","V","to accumulate; product","acumular; producto","accumuler; produit","下了一夜的雨，路上的坑里积满了水。","xià le yí yè de yǔ lù shang de kēng lǐ jī mǎn le shuǐ","After a night of rain, the potholes in the road were full of water.","Después de llover toda la noche, los baches del camino estaban llenos de agua.","Après une nuit de pluie, les nids-de-poule de la route étaient remplis d'eau."],["L7-1858","积淀","jīdiàn","V/N","to accumulate over time","acumular con el tiempo","sédimenter; accumuler","这座古城有着深厚的文化积淀。","zhè zuò gǔ chéng yǒu zhe shēn hòu de wén huà jī diàn","This ancient city has a deep cultural heritage built up over time.","Esta antigua ciudad posee una profunda herencia cultural acumulada a lo largo del tiempo.","Cette ville ancienne possède un riche héritage culturel accumulé au fil des siècles."],["L7-1859","积蓄","jīxù","V/N","to save; savings","ahorrar; ahorros","économiser; économies","老人捐出了自己的积蓄，为村里修桥铺路。","lǎo rén juān chū le zì jǐ de jī xù wèi cūn lǐ xiū qiáo pū lù","The old man donated his savings to build bridges and pave roads for the village.","El anciano donó todos sus ahorros para construir puentes y caminos en el pueblo.","Le vieil homme a fait don de toutes ses économies pour construire des ponts et paver des routes dans le village."],["L7-1860","基本功","jīběngōng","N","basic skills","habilidades básicas","bases techniques","练书法先要打好基本功，不能急于求成。","liàn shū fǎ xiān yào dǎ hǎo jī běn gōng bù néng jí yú qiú chéng","In learning calligraphy you must first master the basics; you can't rush.","Para practicar caligrafía, primero hay que dominar lo básico; no se puede tener prisa.","Pour pratiquer la calligraphie, il faut d'abord maîtriser les bases ; on ne peut pas brûler les étapes."],["L7-1861","基层","jīcéng","N","grassroots; basic level","base; nivel de base","base; échelon de base","他大学毕业后主动要求到基层工作。","tā dà xué bì yè hòu zhǔ dòng yāo qiú dào jī céng gōng zuò","After graduating from university, he volunteered to work at the grassroots level.","Después de graduarse de la universidad, pidió por iniciativa propia trabajar en la base.","Après ses études universitaires, il a demandé de lui-même à travailler sur le terrain, à la base."],["L7-1862","基因","jīyīn","N","gene","gen","gène","科学家发现，这种疾病和某些基因有关。","kē xué jiā fā xiàn zhè zhǒng jí bìng hé mǒu xiē jī yīn yǒu guān","Scientists have found that this disease is related to certain genes.","Los científicos han descubierto que esta enfermedad está relacionada con ciertos genes.","Les scientifiques ont découvert que cette maladie est liée à certains gènes."],["L7-1863","基于","jīyú","Prep","based on; in view of","basado en; en vista de","basé sur; compte tenu de","基于以上分析，我们决定暂停这个项目。","jī yú yǐ shàng fēn xī wǒ men jué dìng zàn tíng zhè ge xiàng mù","Based on the above analysis, we have decided to suspend this project.","Con base en el análisis anterior, hemos decidido suspender este proyecto.","Sur la base de l'analyse ci-dessus, nous avons décidé de suspendre ce projet."],["L7-1864","基准","jīzhǔn","N","benchmark; standard","referencia; criterio","référence; norme","这次考试成绩将作为分班的基准。","zhè cì kǎo shì chéng jì jiāng zuò wéi fēn bān de jī zhǔn","The results of this exam will serve as the benchmark for class placement.","Los resultados de este examen servirán de referencia para dividir los grupos.","Les résultats de cet examen serviront de référence pour la répartition des classes."],["L7-1865","畸形","jīxíng","Adj","deformity; abnormal","deformidad; anormal","difformité; anormal","这个地区的经济发展有些畸形，过分依赖旅游业。","zhè ge dì qū de jīng jì fā zhǎn yǒu xiē jī xíng guò fèn yī lài lǚ yóu yè","This region's economic development is somewhat lopsided, relying too heavily on tourism.","El desarrollo económico de esta región es algo desequilibrado y depende demasiado del turismo.","Le développement économique de cette région est quelque peu déséquilibré et dépend trop du tourisme."],["L7-1866","激发","jīfā","V","to stimulate; to arouse","estimular; despertar","stimuler; susciter","好老师懂得如何激发学生的学习兴趣。","hǎo lǎo shī dǒng de rú hé jī fā xué shēng de xué xí xìng qù","Good teachers know how to spark students' interest in learning.","Un buen maestro sabe cómo despertar el interés de los alumnos por aprender.","Un bon enseignant sait susciter l'intérêt des élèves pour l'apprentissage."],["L7-1867","激光","jīguāng","N","laser","láser","laser","医生用激光为她做了眼科手术，她很快就恢复了。","yī shēng yòng jī guāng wèi tā zuò le yǎn kē shǒu shù tā hěn kuài jiù huī fù le","The doctor performed eye surgery on her with a laser, and she recovered quickly.","El médico la operó de los ojos con láser y se recuperó rápidamente.","Le médecin l'a opérée des yeux au laser, et elle s'est vite rétablie."],["L7-1868","激化","jīhuà","V","to intensify","agudizar; intensificar","exacerber; intensifier","如果不及时沟通，双方的矛盾可能会进一步激化。","rú guǒ bù jí shí gōu tōng shuāng fāng de máo dùn kě néng huì jìn yí bù jī huà","If they don't communicate promptly, the conflict between the two sides may intensify further.","Si no se comunican a tiempo, el conflicto entre ambas partes podría agravarse aún más.","S'ils ne communiquent pas rapidement, le conflit entre les deux parties risque de s'aggraver encore."],["L7-1869","激活","jīhuó","V","to activate","activar","activer","新办的银行卡需要先激活才能使用。","xīn bàn de yín háng kǎ xū yào xiān jī huó cái néng shǐ yòng","A newly issued bank card must be activated before it can be used.","Una tarjeta bancaria nueva debe activarse antes de poder usarse.","Une carte bancaire neuve doit être activée avant de pouvoir être utilisée."],["L7-1870","激励","jīlì","V","to encourage; incentive","motivar; incentivo","encourager; incitation","他的成功故事激励了很多年轻人去创业。","tā de chéng gōng gù shi jī lì le hěn duō nián qīng rén qù chuàng yè","His success story has inspired many young people to start businesses.","Su historia de éxito animó a muchos jóvenes a emprender.","Son histoire de réussite a encouragé de nombreux jeunes à créer leur entreprise."],["L7-1871","激起","jīqǐ","V","to stir up; to arouse","suscitar; provocar","susciter; provoquer","这条新闻激起了网友们的强烈不满。","zhè tiáo xīn wén jī qǐ le wǎng yǒu men de qiáng liè bù mǎn","This news provoked strong dissatisfaction among netizens.","Esta noticia provocó el fuerte descontento de los internautas.","Cette nouvelle a suscité un vif mécontentement chez les internautes."],["L7-1872","激素","jīsù","N","hormone","hormona","hormone","这类含有激素的药物，应按医嘱服用。","zhè lèi hán yǒu jī sù de yào wù yīng àn yī zhǔ fú yòng","This type of hormone-containing medication should be taken as prescribed by a doctor.","Los medicamentos de este tipo, que contienen hormonas, deben tomarse según la indicación médica.","Ce type de médicaments contenant des hormones doit être pris conformément à l'ordonnance du médecin."],["L7-1873","及","jí","Conj","and; to reach","y; alcanzar","et; atteindre","本次会议将讨论明年的预算及人员安排。","běn cì huì yì jiāng tǎo lùn míng nián de yù suàn jí rén yuán ān pái","This meeting will discuss next year's budget and staffing arrangements.","En esta reunión se tratarán el presupuesto del próximo año y la organización del personal.","Cette réunion portera sur le budget de l'année prochaine et l'organisation du personnel."],["L7-1874","及其","jí qí","","and its; and their","y su; y sus","et son; et leurs","这份报告分析了空气污染的原因及其危害。","zhè fèn bào gào fēn xī le kōng qì wū rǎn de yuán yīn jí qí wēi hài","This report analyzes the causes of air pollution and its harmful effects.","Este informe analiza las causas de la contaminación del aire y sus daños.","Ce rapport analyse les causes de la pollution atmosphérique ainsi que ses effets nocifs."],["L7-1875","及早","jízǎo","Adv","as early as possible","cuanto antes","dès que possible","发现问题要及早解决，不要等到情况变严重。","fā xiàn wèn tí yào jí zǎo jiě jué bú yào děng dào qíng kuàng biàn yán zhòng","When you find a problem, deal with it early; don't wait until it gets serious.","Cuando detectes un problema, resuélvelo cuanto antes y no esperes a que se agrave.","Quand on découvre un problème, il faut le régler au plus tôt, sans attendre que la situation s'aggrave."],["L7-1876","吉普","jípǔ","N","jeep","jeep","jeep","他们开着一辆旧吉普，穿过了大半个沙漠。","tā men kāi zhe yí liàng jiù jí pǔ chuān guò le dà bàn ge shā mò","They drove an old jeep across most of the desert.","Cruzaron la mayor parte del desierto en un viejo jeep.","Ils ont traversé presque tout le désert à bord d'une vieille jeep."],["L7-1877","吉他","jítā","N","guitar","guitarra","guitare","吉他的一根弦断了，我得去换一根。","jí tā de yì gēn xián duàn le wǒ děi qù huàn yì gēn","One of the guitar's strings broke; I have to go replace it.","Se rompió una cuerda de la guitarra; tengo que ir a cambiarla.","Une corde de la guitare a cassé ; il faut que j'aille la remplacer."],["L7-1878","吉祥物","jíxiángwù","N","mascot","mascota","mascotte","这届运动会的吉祥物是一只可爱的熊猫。","zhè jiè yùn dòng huì de jí xiáng wù shì yì zhī kě ài de xióng māo","The mascot of this sports meet is a cute panda.","La mascota de estos juegos deportivos es un adorable panda.","La mascotte de ces jeux sportifs est un adorable panda."],["L7-1879","级别","jíbié","N","rank; grade","rango; nivel","rang; niveau","参加这次会议的官员级别都比较高。","cān jiā zhè cì huì yì de guān yuán jí bié dōu bǐ jiào gāo","The officials attending this meeting are all of fairly high rank.","Los funcionarios que asisten a esta reunión son de rango bastante alto.","Les responsables qui participent à cette réunion sont d'un rang assez élevé."],["L7-1880","极度","jídù","Adv","extremely","extremadamente","extrêmement","连续工作了三十个小时，他感到极度疲劳。","lián xù gōng zuò le sān shí gè xiǎo shí tā gǎn dào jí dù pí láo","After working for thirty hours straight, he felt extremely exhausted.","Tras trabajar treinta horas seguidas, se sentía agotadísimo.","Après avoir travaillé trente heures d'affilée, il se sentait extrêmement épuisé."],["L7-1881","极力","jílì","Adv","with all one's might","con todas las fuerzas","de toutes ses forces","朋友们极力劝他不要辞职，可他还是走了。","péng you men jí lì quàn tā bú yào cí zhí kě tā hái shi zǒu le","His friends did their utmost to persuade him not to quit, but he left anyway.","Sus amigos hicieron todo lo posible por convencerlo de que no renunciara, pero aun así se fue.","Ses amis ont tout fait pour le dissuader de démissionner, mais il est parti quand même."],["L7-1882","极少数","jí shǎoshù","","very few; small minority","muy pocos; pequeña minoría","très peu; infime minorité","只有极少数学生能在一年内通过这门考试。","zhǐ yǒu jí shǎo shù xué shēng néng zài yì nián nèi tōng guò zhè mén kǎo shì","Only a very small number of students can pass this exam within a year.","Solo una minoría muy pequeña de estudiantes puede aprobar este examen en un año.","Seul un très petit nombre d'étudiants peut réussir cet examen en un an."],["L7-1883","极为","jíwéi","Adv","extremely","sumamente","extrêmement","这次发现对研究古代历史极为重要。","zhè cì fā xiàn duì yán jiū gǔ dài lì shǐ jí wéi zhòng yào","This discovery is extremely important for research into ancient history.","Este descubrimiento es sumamente importante para la investigación de la historia antigua.","Cette découverte est extrêmement importante pour la recherche sur l'histoire ancienne."],["L7-1884","极限","jíxiàn","N","limit; extreme","límite; extremo","limite; extrême","竞技体育的魅力在于不断挑战人类的极限。","jìng jì tǐ yù de mèi lì zài yú bú duàn tiǎo zhàn rén lèi de jí xiàn","The appeal of competitive sports lies in constantly challenging human limits.","El atractivo del deporte de competición radica en desafiar constantemente los límites del ser humano.","L'attrait du sport de compétition réside dans le défi constant lancé aux limites de l'être humain."],["L7-1885","即","jí","Adv","namely; immediately","es decir; inmediatamente","c'est-à-dire; aussitôt","这道菜的鱼肉做得很嫩，入口即化。","zhè dào cài de yú ròu zuò de hěn nèn rù kǒu jí huà","The fish in this dish is very tender and melts in your mouth.","El pescado de este plato está muy tierno y se deshace en la boca.","Le poisson de ce plat est très tendre et fond dans la bouche."],["L7-1886","即便","jíbiàn","Conj","even if","aunque; incluso si","même si","即便工作再忙，他也会抽时间陪孩子。","jí biàn gōng zuò zài máng tā yě huì chōu shí jiān péi hái zi","Even when work is busy, he still makes time for his children.","Aunque esté muy ocupado con el trabajo, siempre saca tiempo para estar con sus hijos.","Même quand il est très occupé par son travail, il trouve toujours du temps pour ses enfants."],["L7-1887","即可","jíkě","V","then one can; will suffice","bastará con; se puede","il suffit de; on peut alors","在网上填好申请表，然后到窗口领取证件即可。","zài wǎng shàng tián hǎo shēn qǐng biǎo rán hòu dào chuāng kǒu lǐng qǔ zhèng jiàn jí kě","Just fill in the application online, then collect your document at the counter.","Llena la solicitud por internet y luego pasa a la ventanilla a recoger el documento.","Remplissez le formulaire de demande en ligne, puis venez retirer votre document au guichet."],["L7-1888","急剧","jíjù","Adj","rapid; sudden","rápido; brusco","rapide; brusque","近年来，这座城市的人口急剧增加。","jìn nián lái zhè zuò chéng shì de rén kǒu jí jù zēng jiā","In recent years the population of this city has increased sharply.","En los últimos años, la población de esta ciudad ha aumentado de forma vertiginosa.","Ces dernières années, la population de cette ville a fortement augmenté."],["L7-1889","急迫","jípò","Adj","urgent; pressing","urgente; apremiante","urgent; pressant","病人的情况十分急迫，必须马上手术。","bìng rén de qíng kuàng shí fēn jí pò bì xū mǎ shàng shǒu shù","The patient's condition is very urgent, and surgery must be done immediately.","El estado del paciente es muy urgente y hay que operarlo de inmediato.","L'état du patient est très urgent, il faut l'opérer immédiatement."],["L7-1890","急性","jíxìng","Adj","acute","agudo","aigu","他得了急性肠胃炎，在医院打了两天点滴。","tā dé le jí xìng cháng wèi yán zài yī yuàn dǎ le liǎng tiān diǎn dī","He came down with acute gastroenteritis and spent two days on an IV drip in hospital.","Tuvo una gastroenteritis aguda y pasó dos días en el hospital con suero.","Il a fait une gastro-entérite aiguë et est resté deux jours à l'hôpital sous perfusion."],["L7-1891","急需","jíxū","V","to urgently need","necesitar con urgencia","avoir un besoin urgent de","地震灾区急需帐篷、食品和药品。","dì zhèn zāi qū jí xū zhàng peng shí pǐn hé yào pǐn","The earthquake zone urgently needs tents, food, and medicine.","La zona del terremoto necesita con urgencia tiendas de campaña, alimentos y medicinas.","La zone sinistrée par le séisme a un besoin urgent de tentes, de nourriture et de médicaments."],["L7-1892","急于","jíyú","V","eager to; anxious to","ansioso por; con prisa por","impatient de; pressé de","受伤之后，他没有急于复出，而是在康复师指导下循序渐进地训练。","shòu shāng zhī hòu tā méi yǒu jí yú fù chū ér shì zài kāng fù shī zhǐ dǎo xià xún xù jiàn jìn de xùn liàn","After his injury, he did not rush to return, but trained gradually under a rehabilitation specialist's guidance.","Tras lesionarse, no tuvo prisa por volver, sino que entrenó de forma gradual bajo la guía de un fisioterapeuta.","Après sa blessure, il ne s'est pas pressé de reprendre la compétition, mais s'est entraîné progressivement sous la direction d'un rééducateur."],["L7-1893","急诊","jízhěn","V/N","emergency treatment","urgencias; atención de urgencia","urgences; soins d'urgence","他半夜肚子疼得厉害，只好去医院看急诊。","tā bàn yè dù zi téng de lì hai zhǐ hǎo qù yī yuàn kàn jí zhěn","In the middle of the night his stomach hurt so badly that he had to go to the hospital emergency room.","A medianoche le dolía muchísimo el estómago y no tuvo más remedio que ir a urgencias.","En pleine nuit, il avait tellement mal au ventre qu'il a dû aller aux urgences de l'hôpital."],["L7-1894","急转弯","jízhuǎnwān","","sharp turn","giro brusco","virage serré","前方有个急转弯，司机提醒大家坐好扶稳。","qián fāng yǒu gè jí zhuǎn wān sī jī tí xǐng dà jiā zuò hǎo fú wěn","There's a sharp bend ahead, and the driver reminded everyone to sit tight and hold on.","Más adelante hay una curva cerrada y el conductor les recordó a todos sentarse bien y sujetarse.","Il y a un virage serré un peu plus loin, et le chauffeur a rappelé à tout le monde de bien s'asseoir et de se tenir."],["L7-1895","棘手","jíshǒu","Adj","thorny; tricky","espinoso; difícil","épineux; délicat","这个问题非常棘手，我们需要请专家来帮忙。","zhè ge wèn tí fēi cháng jí shǒu wǒ men xū yào qǐng zhuān jiā lái bāng máng","This problem is very tricky; we need to bring in experts to help.","Este problema es muy espinoso; necesitamos pedir ayuda a expertos.","Ce problème est très épineux ; nous devons faire appel à des experts."],["L7-1896","集会","jíhuì","N/V","assembly; to gather","reunión; congregarse","rassemblement; se rassembler","未经批准，不能在这里举行大型集会。","wèi jīng pī zhǔn bù néng zài zhè lǐ jǔ xíng dà xíng jí huì","Large gatherings may not be held here without approval.","No se pueden celebrar aquí grandes concentraciones sin autorización.","On ne peut pas organiser de grands rassemblements ici sans autorisation."],["L7-1897","集结","jíjié","V","to assemble; to mass","concentrar; reunir","rassembler; masser","救援队伍已经在山脚下集结完毕，随时准备出发。","jiù yuán duì wǔ yǐ jīng zài shān jiǎo xià jí jié wán bì suí shí zhǔn bèi chū fā","The rescue teams have finished assembling at the foot of the mountain and are ready to set off.","Los equipos de rescate ya se han concentrado al pie de la montaña y están listos para partir en cualquier momento.","Les équipes de secours sont déjà rassemblées au pied de la montagne, prêtes à partir à tout moment."],["L7-1898","集邮","jíyóu","","stamp collecting","filatelia; coleccionar sellos","philatélie; collection de timbres","爸爸年轻时喜欢集邮，攒了好几大本邮票。","bà ba nián qīng shí xǐ huan jí yóu zǎn le hǎo jǐ dà běn yóu piào","When Dad was young he loved stamp collecting and accumulated several big albums of stamps.","Cuando papá era joven le gustaba coleccionar sellos, y reunió varios álbumes grandes.","Quand papa était jeune, il aimait la philatélie et avait accumulé plusieurs gros albums de timbres."],["L7-1899","集装箱","jízhuāngxiāng","N","shipping container","contenedor","conteneur","码头上整齐地堆放着各种颜色的集装箱。","mǎ tóu shàng zhěng qí de duī fàng zhe gè zhǒng yán sè de jí zhuāng xiāng","Shipping containers of various colors are stacked neatly on the dock.","En el muelle hay contenedores de varios colores apilados con orden.","Sur le quai, des conteneurs de toutes les couleurs sont empilés avec soin."],["L7-1900","集资","jízī","V","to raise funds","recaudar fondos","collecter des fonds","村民们自发集资，修了一条通往镇上的公路。","cūn mín men zì fā jí zī xiū le yì tiáo tōng wǎng zhèn shàng de gōng lù","The villagers spontaneously pooled money and built a road leading to the town.","Los aldeanos reunieron dinero por iniciativa propia y construyeron una carretera hasta el pueblo cabecera.","Les villageois ont spontanément réuni des fonds et construit une route menant à la bourgade."],["L7-1901","嫉妒","jídù","V","to be jealous of; to envy","envidiar; tener celos","envier; être jaloux de","他嫉妒同事的成绩，背后常说别人的坏话。","tā jí dù tóng shì de chéng jì bèi hòu cháng shuō bié rén de huài huà","He envies his colleagues' achievements and often speaks ill of them behind their backs.","Envidia los logros de sus colegas y a menudo habla mal de ellos a sus espaldas.","Il jalouse les réussites de ses collègues et dit souvent du mal d'eux dans leur dos."],["L7-1902","挤压","jǐyā","V","to squeeze; to compress","apretar; comprimir","presser; comprimer","长时间坐着不动，会使腰椎受到挤压。","cháng shí jiān zuò zhe bú dòng huì shǐ yāo zhuī shòu dào jǐ yā","Sitting still for long periods puts pressure on the lumbar spine.","Permanecer sentado mucho tiempo sin moverse comprime la columna lumbar.","Rester assis longtemps sans bouger comprime les vertèbres lombaires."],["L7-1903","脊梁","jǐliáng","N","backbone; spine","columna vertebral; espalda","colonne vertébrale; dos","这些默默奉献的普通劳动者，才是民族的脊梁。","zhè xiē mò mò fèng xiàn de pǔ tōng láo dòng zhě cái shì mín zú de jǐ liáng","These ordinary working people who quietly devote themselves are the true backbone of the nation.","Estos trabajadores comunes que se entregan en silencio son el verdadero pilar de la nación.","Ces travailleurs ordinaires qui se dévouent en silence sont la véritable colonne vertébrale de la nation."],["L7-1904","计","jì","N/V","plan; Ji (surname)","plan; Ji (apellido)","plan; Ji (nom de famille)","这份兼职按小时计工资，每小时三十元。","zhè fèn jiān zhí àn xiǎo shí jì gōng zī měi xiǎo shí sān shí yuán","This part-time job pays by the hour, thirty yuan an hour.","Este trabajo de medio tiempo se paga por hora, treinta yuanes la hora.","Ce travail à temps partiel est payé à l'heure, trente yuans de l'heure."],["L7-1905","计策","jìcè","N","stratagem; plan","estratagema","stratagème","诸葛亮想出了一个巧妙的计策，打败了敌人。","zhū gě liàng xiǎng chū le yí ge qiǎo miào de jì cè dǎ bài le dí rén","Zhuge Liang came up with a clever stratagem and defeated the enemy.","Zhuge Liang ideó una estratagema ingeniosa y derrotó al enemigo.","Zhuge Liang a imaginé un stratagème ingénieux et a vaincu l'ennemi."],["L7-1906","计较","jìjiào","V","to haggle; to fuss over","regatear; quejarse por","chicaner; se formaliser de","他心胸宽广，从来不跟别人计较。","tā xīn xiōng kuān guǎng cóng lái bù gēn bié rén jì jiào","He is broad-minded and never quibbles with others.","Es de mente amplia y nunca se pone a discutir cada detalle con los demás.","Il a l'esprit large et ne chicane jamais avec les autres."],["L7-1907","计时","jìshí","V","to time; timekeeping","cronometrar; medir el tiempo","chronométrer; mesurer le temps","比赛开始后，裁判员就开始计时了。","bǐ sài kāi shǐ hòu cái pàn yuán jiù kāi shǐ jì shí le","Once the race began, the referee started timing.","En cuanto empezó la competencia, el árbitro comenzó a cronometrar.","Dès le début de la course, l'arbitre a lancé le chronométrage."],["L7-1908","记号","jìhao","N","mark; symbol","marca; señal","marque; signe","他在书上做了很多记号，方便以后复习。","tā zài shū shàng zuò le hěn duō jì hao fāng biàn yǐ hòu fù xí","He made many marks in the book to make later review easier.","Hizo muchas marcas en el libro para facilitar el repaso posterior.","Il a fait de nombreux repères dans son livre pour faciliter les révisions ultérieures."],["L7-1909","记忆犹新","jìyì-yóuxīn","","still fresh in memory","aún fresco en la memoria","encore frais dans la mémoire","十年前第一次出国的情景，她至今记忆犹新。","shí nián qián dì yī cì chū guó de qíng jǐng tā zhì jīn jì yì yóu xīn","She still remembers vividly her first trip abroad ten years ago.","Todavía recuerda con toda nitidez la escena de su primer viaje al extranjero hace diez años.","Elle se souvient encore très nettement de son premier voyage à l'étranger il y a dix ans."],["L7-1910","纪录片","jìlùpiàn","N","documentary","documental","documentaire","这部纪录片的画面非常震撼。","zhè bù jì lù piàn de huà miàn fēi cháng zhèn hàn","The images in this documentary are very powerful.","Las imágenes de este documental son impresionantes.","Les images de ce documentaire sont saisissantes."],["L7-1911","纪念碑","jìniànbēi","N","monument","monumento","monument","广场中央矗立着一座英雄纪念碑。","guǎng chǎng zhōng yāng chù lì zhe yí zuò yīng xióng jì niàn bēi","A monument to heroes stands in the middle of the square.","En el centro de la plaza se alza un monumento a los héroes.","Au centre de la place se dresse un monument aux héros."],["L7-1912","纪念馆","jìniànguǎn","N","memorial hall","sala conmemorativa","musée commémoratif","纪念馆里展出了这位作家的生平事迹。","jì niàn guǎn lǐ zhǎn chū le zhè wèi zuò jiā de shēng píng shì jì","The memorial hall displays the life story of this writer.","En el museo conmemorativo se exhibe la vida y obra de este escritor.","Le mémorial expose la vie et les faits marquants de cet écrivain."],["L7-1913","纪念日","jìniànrì","N","anniversary; memorial day","aniversario; día conmemorativo","anniversaire; jour commémoratif","今天是他们结婚二十周年纪念日。","jīn tiān shì tā men jié hūn èr shí zhōu nián jì niàn rì","Today is their twentieth wedding anniversary.","Hoy es el vigésimo aniversario de su boda.","Aujourd'hui, c'est leur vingtième anniversaire de mariage."],["L7-1914","纪实","jìshí","V/N","documentary; factual record","documental; relato fiel","documentaire; récit factuel","这本书是一部纪实文学作品，记录了山区教师的真实生活。","zhè běn shū shì yí bù jì shí wén xué zuò pǐn jì lù le shān qū jiào shī de zhēn shí shēng huó","This book is a work of literary nonfiction that documents the real lives of teachers in mountainous areas.","Este libro es una obra de literatura documental que recoge la vida real de los maestros de zonas montañosas.","Ce livre est une œuvre de littérature documentaire qui retrace la vie réelle des enseignants des régions montagneuses."],["L7-1915","技艺","jìyì","N","skill; craftsmanship","destreza; arte","savoir-faire; art","这位老师傅剪纸的技艺非常高超。","zhè wèi lǎo shī fu jiǎn zhǐ de jì yì fēi cháng gāo chāo","This old master's papercutting skill is truly superb.","La destreza de este viejo maestro para el papel recortado es extraordinaria.","Ce vieux maître possède une technique de découpage de papier extraordinaire."],["L7-1916","忌","jì","V","to avoid; to dread","evitar; temer","éviter; redouter","医生说他胃不好，饮食要忌生冷和辛辣。","yī shēng shuō tā wèi bù hǎo yǐn shí yào jì shēng lěng hé xīn là","The doctor said that because of his bad stomach he should avoid raw, cold, and spicy food.","El médico dijo que, como tiene mal el estómago, debe evitar las comidas crudas, frías y picantes.","Le médecin a dit qu'il avait l'estomac fragile et devait éviter les aliments crus, froids et épicés."],["L7-1917","忌讳","jìhuì","V","taboo; to avoid","tabú; evitar","tabou; éviter","在有些地方，送礼时忌讳送钟。","zài yǒu xiē dì fang sòng lǐ shí jì huì sòng zhōng","In some places, giving a clock as a gift is taboo.","En algunos lugares es tabú regalar un reloj de pared.","À certains endroits, il est tabou d'offrir une horloge en cadeau."],["L7-1918","忌口","jìkǒu","","to avoid certain foods","evitar ciertos alimentos","éviter certains aliments","吃中药期间要注意忌口，别吃太油腻的东西。","chī zhōng yào qī jiān yào zhù yì jì kǒu bié chī tài yóu nì de dōng xi","While taking Chinese medicine you should watch your diet and avoid greasy food.","Mientras se toma medicina china, hay que cuidar la dieta y no comer cosas demasiado grasosas.","Pendant un traitement de médecine chinoise, il faut surveiller son alimentation et éviter les aliments trop gras."],["L7-1919","剂","jì","N/M","dose; medicine","dosis; medicamento","dose; médicament","老中医给他开了三剂药，让他回家每天煎一剂。","lǎo zhōng yī gěi tā kāi le sān jì yào ràng tā huí jiā měi tiān jiān yí jì","The old Chinese doctor prescribed him three doses of herbal medicine and told him to brew one a day at home.","El viejo médico tradicional le recetó tres dosis de medicina y le dijo que en casa preparara una cada día.","Le vieux médecin de médecine chinoise lui a prescrit trois doses de remède et lui a dit d'en préparer une par jour chez lui."],["L7-1920","迹象","jìxiàng","N","sign; indication","indicio; señal","signe; indice","种种迹象表明，经济正在慢慢复苏。","zhǒng zhǒng jì xiàng biǎo míng jīng jì zhèng zài màn màn fù sū","All signs indicate that the economy is slowly recovering.","Muchas señales indican que la economía se está recuperando poco a poco.","Tous les signes indiquent que l'économie se redresse peu à peu."],["L7-1921","继","jì","V","to continue; to succeed","continuar; suceder","continuer; succéder","继北京之后，上海也出台了类似的规定。","jì běi jīng zhī hòu shàng hǎi yě chū tái le lèi sì de guī dìng","Following Beijing, Shanghai has also introduced similar regulations.","Después de Beijing, Shanghai también ha emitido una normativa similar.","Après Pékin, Shanghai a également adopté une réglementation similaire."],["L7-1922","继而","jì'ér","Conj","then; afterwards","luego; a continuación","puis; ensuite","他先是沉默，继而大声哭了起来。","tā xiān shì chén mò jì ér dà shēng kū le qǐ lái","At first he was silent, then he began to cry loudly.","Primero se quedó callado y luego se puso a llorar a gritos.","Il est d'abord resté silencieux, puis s'est mis à pleurer bruyamment."],["L7-1923","继父","jìfù","N","stepfather","padrastro","beau-père","她的继父对她非常好，就像对亲生女儿一样。","tā de jì fù duì tā fēi cháng hǎo jiù xiàng duì qīn shēng nǚ ér yí yàng","Her stepfather treats her very well, just as he would his own daughter.","Su padrastro la trata muy bien, como si fuera su hija de sangre.","Son beau-père la traite très bien, exactement comme sa propre fille."],["L7-1924","继母","jìmǔ","N","stepmother","madrastra","belle-mère","童话故事里的继母常常是坏人，但现实并不都是这样。","tóng huà gù shì lǐ de jì mǔ cháng cháng shì huài rén dàn xiàn shí bìng bù dōu shì zhè yàng","Stepmothers in fairy tales are often villains, but reality isn't always like that.","En los cuentos de hadas las madrastras suelen ser malas, pero la realidad no siempre es así.","Dans les contes de fées, les belles-mères sont souvent méchantes, mais la réalité n'est pas toujours ainsi."],["L7-1925","祭","jì","V","to offer sacrifice to","ofrecer sacrificios a","offrir un sacrifice à","清明节那天，人们来到烈士墓前祭英烈。","qīng míng jié nà tiān rén men lái dào liè shì mù qián jì yīng liè","On Tomb-Sweeping Day, people came to the martyrs' graves to honor the fallen heroes.","El día de Qingming, la gente fue a las tumbas de los mártires a rendir homenaje a los héroes caídos.","Le jour de Qingming, les gens se sont rendus devant les tombes des martyrs pour honorer les héros disparus."],["L7-1926","祭奠","jìdiàn","V","to hold a memorial service","rendir homenaje a los difuntos","rendre hommage aux défunts","每年这一天，他都会带着鲜花去祭奠去世的父亲。","měi nián zhè yì tiān tā dōu huì dài zhe xiān huā qù jì diàn qù shì de fù qīn","Every year on this day he takes flowers to pay tribute to his late father.","Cada año, en este día, lleva flores para honrar a su padre fallecido.","Chaque année, ce jour-là, il apporte des fleurs pour rendre hommage à son père décédé."],["L7-1927","祭祀","jìsì","V","to offer sacrifices","ofrecer sacrificios","offrir des sacrifices","古代皇帝每年都要在天坛举行祭祀活动。","gǔ dài huáng dì měi nián dōu yào zài tiān tán jǔ xíng jì sì huó dòng","Every year, ancient emperors held sacrificial ceremonies at the Temple of Heaven.","Cada año, los antiguos emperadores celebraban ceremonias de sacrificio en el Templo del Cielo.","Chaque année, les empereurs de l'Antiquité célébraient des cérémonies sacrificielles au Temple du Ciel."],["L7-1928","寄托","jìtuō","V","to entrust; to place (hope) in","depositar (esperanza); confiar","placer (espoir) en; confier","这件旧毛衣虽然已经褪色，却寄托着她对祖母的深深怀念。","zhè jiàn jiù máo yī suī rán yǐ jīng tuì sè què jì tuō zhe tā duì zǔ mǔ de shēn shēn huái niàn","Although this old sweater has faded, it carries her deep affection and memories of her grandmother.","Aunque este viejo suéter se ha desteñido, guarda el profundo cariño y los recuerdos que ella tiene de su abuela.","Même si ce vieux pull est décoloré, elle y a placé toute sa profonde tendresse et son souvenir de sa grand-mère."],["L7-1929","寂静","jìjìng","Adj","quiet; silent","silencioso; quieto","silencieux; calme","一阵急促的脚步声打破了寂静，他下意识地抬头望向走廊。","yí zhèn jí cù de jiǎo bù shēng dǎ pò le jì jìng tā xià yì shí de tái tóu wàng xiàng zǒu láng","A burst of hurried footsteps broke the silence, and he instinctively looked up toward the corridor.","Un ruido de pasos apresurados rompió el silencio y él levantó la vista instintivamente hacia el pasillo.","Un bruit de pas précipités rompit le silence, et il leva instinctivement les yeux vers le couloir."],["L7-1930","寂寞","jìmò","Adj","lonely; lonesome","solitario; solo","seul; solitaire","孩子们都在外地工作，老两口在家有些寂寞。","hái zi men dōu zài wài dì gōng zuò lǎo liǎng kǒu zài jiā yǒu xiē jì mò","The children all work elsewhere, so the elderly couple feels rather lonely at home.","Los hijos trabajan todos en otras ciudades, así que la pareja de ancianos se siente un poco sola en casa.","Les enfants travaillent tous ailleurs, si bien que le vieux couple se sent un peu seul à la maison."],["L7-1931","加紧","jiājǐn","V","to step up; to speed up","intensificar; acelerar","intensifier; accélérer","离考试只剩一个月了，大家都在加紧复习。","lí kǎo shì zhǐ shèng yí ge yuè le dà jiā dōu zài jiā jǐn fù xí","With only a month left before the exam, everyone is stepping up their review.","Falta solo un mes para el examen y todos están redoblando el repaso.","Il ne reste qu'un mois avant l'examen et tout le monde intensifie ses révisions."],["L7-1932","加剧","jiājù","V","to intensify; to worsen","agravar; intensificar","aggraver; s'intensifier","全球气候变暖加剧了部分地区的干旱。","quán qiú qì hòu biàn nuǎn jiā jù le bù fen dì qū de gān hàn","Global warming has exacerbated drought in some regions.","El calentamiento global ha agravado la sequía en algunas regiones.","Le réchauffement climatique a aggravé la sécheresse dans certaines régions."],["L7-1933","加深","jiāshēn","V","to deepen","profundizar","approfondir","通过这次交流，两国人民加深了相互了解。","tōng guò zhè cì jiāo liú liǎng guó rén mín jiā shēn le xiāng hù liǎo jiě","Through this exchange, the people of the two countries deepened their mutual understanding.","Gracias a este intercambio, los pueblos de ambos países han profundizado su comprensión mutua.","Grâce à cet échange, les peuples des deux pays ont approfondi leur compréhension mutuelle."],["L7-1934","加重","jiāzhòng","V","to aggravate; to intensify","agravar; intensificar","aggraver; intensifier","他没有按时吃药，结果病情加重了。","tā méi yǒu àn shí chī yào jié guǒ bìng qíng jiā zhòng le","He didn't take his medicine on schedule, and as a result his condition worsened.","No tomó la medicina a su hora y, como resultado, su enfermedad empeoró.","Il n'a pas pris ses médicaments à l'heure et, résultat, son état s'est aggravé."],["L7-1935","佳节","jiājié","N","festive day; holiday","día festivo; fiesta","jour de fête; fête","每逢佳节倍思亲，过年时她特别想念家人。","měi féng jiā jié bèi sī qīn guò nián shí tā tè bié xiǎng niàn jiā rén","On every festive occasion one misses one's family all the more, and at New Year she misses hers terribly.","En cada día festivo se extraña el doble a la familia; en Año Nuevo ella echa muchísimo de menos a los suyos.","À chaque fête, la famille nous manque davantage ; au Nouvel An, la sienne lui manque terriblement."],["L7-1936","家伙","jiāhuo","N","guy; fellow","tipo; sujeto","type; gars","这家伙真懒，每天睡到中午才起床。","zhè jiā huo zhēn lǎn měi tiān shuì dào zhōng wǔ cái qǐ chuáng","This guy is so lazy; he sleeps until noon every day.","Qué flojo es este tipo: todos los días se levanta al mediodía.","Quel paresseux, ce type : il ne se lève qu'à midi tous les jours."],["L7-1937","家家户户","jiājiāhùhù","N","every household","todas las familias","chaque foyer","春节前，家家户户都张灯结彩。","chūn jié qián jiā jiā hù hù dōu zhāng dēng jié cǎi","Before the Spring Festival, every household is decorated with lanterns and streamers.","Antes del Festival de Primavera, todas las casas se adornan con faroles y cintas.","Avant la fête du Printemps, toutes les maisons sont décorées de lanternes et de guirlandes."],["L7-1938","家教","jiājiào","N","family upbringing; private tutor","educación familiar; tutor particular","éducation familiale; précepteur","看他这么有礼貌，就知道他家教很好。","kàn tā zhè me yǒu lǐ mào jiù zhī dào tā jiā jiào hěn hǎo","Seeing how polite he is, you can tell he had a good upbringing.","Viendo lo educado que es, se nota que tuvo una buena crianza.","À voir sa politesse, on devine qu'il a reçu une bonne éducation."],["L7-1939","家境","jiājìng","N","family financial situation","situación económica familiar","situation financière familiale","她家境贫寒，但学习非常刻苦。","tā jiā jìng pín hán dàn xué xí fēi cháng kè kǔ","Her family is poor, but she studies very hard.","Su familia es pobre, pero ella estudia con muchísimo esfuerzo.","Sa famille est pauvre, mais elle étudie avec beaucoup d'ardeur."],["L7-1940","家禽","jiāqín","N","poultry","aves de corral","volaille","为了防止疫情扩散，这个市场暂停了家禽交易。","wèi le fáng zhǐ yì qíng kuò sàn zhè ge shì chǎng zàn tíng le jiā qín jiāo yì","To prevent the epidemic from spreading, this market has suspended poultry trading.","Para evitar que se propague la epidemia, este mercado ha suspendido la venta de aves de corral.","Pour empêcher l'épidémie de se propager, ce marché a suspendu le commerce de volaille."],["L7-1941","家用","jiāyòng","N/Adj","household; family expenses","doméstico; gastos del hogar","domestique; dépenses du foyer","科学家用实验验证了这个理论。","kē xué jiā yòng shí yàn yàn zhèng le zhè ge lǐ lùn","The scientists verified this theory through experiments.","Los científicos comprobaron esta teoría mediante experimentos.","Les scientifiques ont vérifié cette théorie par des expériences."],["L7-1942","家喻户晓","jiāyù-hùxiǎo","","known to everyone","conocido por todos","connu de tous","听说这位家喻户晓的歌手要来演出，许多乐迷连夜排队购买门票。","tīng shuō zhè wèi jiā yù hù xiǎo de gē shǒu yào lái yǎn chū xǔ duō yuè mí lián yè pái duì gòu mǎi mén piào","Hearing that this household-name singer would perform, many fans queued overnight to buy tickets.","Al enterarse de que este cantante, conocido por todos, iba a actuar, muchos fans hicieron fila toda la noche para comprar entradas.","En apprenant que ce chanteur connu de tous allait se produire, de nombreux fans ont fait la queue toute la nuit pour acheter des billets."],["L7-1943","家政","jiāzhèng","N","housekeeping","economía doméstica","gestion du foyer","她在一家家政公司工作，主要负责照顾老人。","tā zài yì jiā jiā zhèng gōng sī gōng zuò zhǔ yào fù zé zhào gù lǎo rén","She works at a housekeeping services company, mainly looking after elderly people.","Trabaja en una empresa de servicios domésticos y se encarga principalmente de cuidar a personas mayores.","Elle travaille dans une entreprise de services à domicile, où elle s'occupe principalement des personnes âgées."],["L7-1944","家族","jiāzú","N","family; clan","familia; clan","famille; clan","这两个家族之间有血脉关系。","zhè liǎng gè jiā zú zhī jiān yǒu xuè mài guān xì","There is a blood relationship between these two families.","Entre estas dos familias existe un vínculo de sangre.","Il existe un lien de sang entre ces deux familles."],["L7-1945","嘉年华","jiāniánhuá","N","carnival","carnaval","carnaval","暑假期间，海边举办了一场热闹的嘉年华。","shǔ jià qī jiān hǎi biān jǔ bàn le yì chǎng rè nao de jiā nián huá","During the summer holiday, a lively carnival was held by the sea.","Durante las vacaciones de verano se celebró un animado carnaval junto al mar.","Pendant les vacances d'été, un carnaval animé a été organisé en bord de mer."],["L7-1946","假定","jiǎdìng","V","to assume; assumption","suponer; suposición","supposer; hypothèse","假定明天下雨，运动会就改到下周举行。","jiǎ dìng míng tiān xià yǔ yùn dòng huì jiù gǎi dào xià zhōu jǔ xíng","Suppose it rains tomorrow; then the sports meet will be moved to next week.","Supongamos que mañana llueve: entonces la competencia deportiva se pasará a la próxima semana.","Supposons qu'il pleuve demain : dans ce cas, la compétition sportive sera reportée à la semaine prochaine."],["L7-1947","假冒","jiǎmào","V","to impersonate; to counterfeit","hacerse pasar por; falsificar","se faire passer pour; contrefaire","政府加大了打击假冒商品的力度。","zhèng fǔ jiā dà le dǎ jī jiǎ mào shāng pǐn de lì dù","The government has stepped up its crackdown on counterfeit goods.","El gobierno ha intensificado la lucha contra los productos falsificados.","Le gouvernement a renforcé la lutte contre les produits contrefaits."],["L7-1948","假设","jiǎshè","V/N","to suppose; hypothesis","suponer; hipótesis","supposer; hypothèse","这项研究的创新之处，在于将抽象的理论转化为可检验的假设。","zhè xiàng yán jiū de chuàng xīn zhī chù zài yú jiāng chōu xiàng de lǐ lùn zhuǎn huà wéi kě jiǎn yàn de jiǎ shè","The innovation of this study lies in turning abstract theory into testable hypotheses.","La innovación de este estudio radica en convertir una teoría abstracta en hipótesis verificables.","L'originalité de cette étude tient à ce qu'elle transforme une théorie abstraite en hypothèses vérifiables."],["L7-1949","假使","jiǎshǐ","Conj","if; in case","si; en caso de que","si; au cas où","假使你当时在场，你会怎么做呢？","jiǎ shǐ nǐ dāng shí zài chǎng nǐ huì zěn me zuò ne","If you had been there at the time, what would you have done?","Si hubieras estado allí en ese momento, ¿qué habrías hecho?","Si tu avais été là à ce moment-là, qu'aurais-tu fait ?"],["L7-1950","假装","jiǎzhuāng","V","to pretend; to feign","fingir; aparentar","faire semblant; feindre","他假装没听见，继续低头玩手机。","tā jiǎ zhuāng méi tīng jiàn jì xù dī tóu wán shǒu jī","He pretended not to hear and kept his head down playing on his phone.","Fingió no oír y siguió con la cabeza baja jugando con el celular.","Il a fait semblant de ne pas entendre et a continué à jouer sur son téléphone, la tête baissée."],["L7-1951","价位","jiàwèi","N","price level","nivel de precios","niveau de prix","这家餐厅的菜价位适中，适合家庭聚餐。","zhè jiā cān tīng de cài jià wèi shì zhōng shì hé jiā tíng jù cān","The dishes at this restaurant are moderately priced, good for family meals.","Los platos de este restaurante tienen precios moderados y son ideales para comidas familiares.","Les plats de ce restaurant sont à des prix raisonnables et conviennent bien aux repas de famille."],["L7-1952","价值观","jiàzhíguān","N","value system","sistema de valores","système de valeurs","两个人的价值观差别太大，很难长期相处。","liǎng gè rén de jià zhí guān chā bié tài dà hěn nán cháng qī xiāng chǔ","Their values differ too much for the two of them to get along in the long run.","Sus valores son demasiado distintos, así que les resultará difícil convivir a largo plazo.","Leurs valeurs sont trop différentes, il leur sera difficile de s'entendre sur la durée."],["L7-1953","驾","jià","V","Jia (surname)","Jia (apellido)","Jia (nom de famille)","老人驾着一辆马车，慢悠悠地走在山路上。","lǎo rén jià zhe yí liàng mǎ chē màn yōu yōu de zǒu zài shān lù shàng","The old man drove a horse cart, ambling along the mountain road.","El anciano conducía un carro de caballos y avanzaba despacio por el camino de montaña.","Le vieil homme conduisait une charrette tirée par un cheval et avançait lentement sur le chemin de montagne."],["L7-1954","驾车","jià chē","","to drive a vehicle","conducir un vehículo","conduire un véhicule","酒后驾车非常危险，也是违法的。","jiǔ hòu jià chē fēi cháng wēi xiǎn yě shì wéi fǎ de","Driving after drinking is very dangerous and also illegal.","Conducir después de beber es muy peligroso y además es ilegal.","Conduire après avoir bu est très dangereux et aussi illégal."],["L7-1955","驾驭","jiàyù","V","to control; to handle","dominar; manejar","maîtriser; gérer","这位作家驾驭语言的能力非常强。","zhè wèi zuò jiā jià yù yǔ yán de néng lì fēi cháng qiáng","This writer has a remarkable command of language.","Este escritor tiene un dominio excelente del lenguaje.","Cet écrivain maîtrise remarquablement la langue."],["L7-1956","架势","jiàshi","N","posture; manner","actitud; postura","allure; attitude","看他挽起袖子的架势，是准备大干一场了。","kàn tā wǎn qǐ xiù zi de jià shi shì zhǔn bèi dà gàn yì chǎng le","Judging by the way he rolled up his sleeves, he was ready to get stuck in.","Por cómo se remangó, se ve que se prepara para ponerse a trabajar a fondo.","À la façon dont il retrousse ses manches, on voit qu'il s'apprête à se mettre au travail pour de bon."],["L7-1957","架子","jiàzi","N","shelf; frame; airs","estante; armazón; aires","étagère; cadre; grands airs","他当了经理以后一点儿架子也没有，对谁都很客气。","tā dāng le jīng lǐ yǐ hòu yì diǎnr jià zi yě méi yǒu duì shéi dōu hěn kè qi","Even after becoming manager he isn't stuck-up at all and is polite to everyone.","Desde que es gerente no se da ningún aire de importancia y es amable con todos.","Depuis qu'il est devenu directeur, il ne se donne aucun genre et se montre aimable avec tout le monde."],["L7-1958","嫁","jià","V","(of a woman) to marry","casarse (una mujer); casar a una hija","se marier (femme); marier sa fille","她大学毕业后嫁到了南方，很少回老家。","tā dà xué bì yè hòu jià dào le nán fāng hěn shǎo huí lǎo jiā","After graduating from university she married and moved to the south, and rarely goes back to her hometown.","Después de graduarse de la universidad se casó y se fue al sur, y rara vez regresa a su pueblo natal.","Après ses études universitaires, elle s'est mariée et installée dans le sud, et elle retourne rarement dans sa ville natale."],["L7-1959","嫁妆","jiàzhuang","N","dowry","dote","dot","按照当地习俗，新娘的嫁妆里一定要有被子。","àn zhào dāng dì xí sú xīn niáng de jià zhuang lǐ yí dìng yào yǒu bèi zi","According to local custom, a bride's dowry must include quilts.","Según la costumbre local, el ajuar de la novia debe incluir cobijas.","Selon la coutume locale, la dot de la mariée doit comprendre des couettes."],["L7-1960","尖端","jiānduān","N/Adj","tip; cutting-edge","punta; vanguardia","pointe; de pointe","这家公司掌握了多项尖端技术。","zhè jiā gōng sī zhǎng wò le duō xiàng jiān duān jì shù","This company has mastered a number of cutting-edge technologies.","Esta empresa domina varias tecnologías de punta.","Cette entreprise maîtrise plusieurs technologies de pointe."],["L7-1961","尖锐","jiānruì","Adj","sharp; acute","agudo; afilado","aigu; tranchant","记者提出了一个十分尖锐的问题。","jì zhě tí chū le yí ge shí fēn jiān ruì de wèn tí","The reporter asked a very pointed question.","El reportero hizo una pregunta muy incisiva.","Le journaliste a posé une question très incisive."],["L7-1962","奸诈","jiānzhà","Adj","devious; treacherous","astuto; traicionero","rusé; perfide","小说里的这个商人奸诈狡猾，专门欺骗穷人。","xiǎo shuō lǐ de zhè ge shāng rén jiān zhà jiǎo huá zhuān mén qī piàn qióng rén","The merchant in this novel is treacherous and cunning, specializing in cheating the poor.","El comerciante de esta novela es traicionero y astuto, y se dedica a engañar a los pobres.","Le marchand de ce roman est perfide et rusé, et se spécialise dans l'escroquerie des pauvres."],["L7-1963","歼灭","jiānmiè","V","to annihilate","aniquilar","anéantir","这场战役中，敌军主力被全部歼灭。","zhè chǎng zhàn yì zhōng dí jūn zhǔ lì bèi quán bù jiān miè","In this campaign, the main enemy force was completely wiped out.","En esta batalla, las fuerzas principales del enemigo fueron aniquiladas por completo.","Au cours de cette bataille, le gros des forces ennemies a été entièrement anéanti."],["L7-1964","坚持不懈","jiānchí-bùxiè","","to persevere unremittingly","perseverar sin cesar","persévérer sans relâche","只要坚持不懈地练习，你的口语一定会进步。","zhǐ yào jiān chí bú xiè de liàn xí nǐ de kǒu yǔ yí dìng huì jìn bù","As long as you keep practicing persistently, your spoken language will definitely improve.","Mientras practiques con constancia, tu expresión oral sin duda mejorará.","Tant que tu t'entraîneras avec persévérance, ton expression orale progressera à coup sûr."],["L7-1965","坚韧","jiānrèn","Adj","tenacious; tough","tenaz; resistente","tenace; résistant","这种竹子非常坚韧，可以用来编织家具。","zhè zhǒng zhú zi fēi cháng jiān rèn kě yǐ yòng lái biān zhī jiā jù","This bamboo is very tough and can be woven into furniture.","Este bambú es muy resistente y se puede usar para tejer muebles.","Ce bambou est très résistant et peut servir à tresser des meubles."],["L7-1966","坚实","jiānshí","Adj","solid; firm","sólido; firme","solide; ferme","良好的基础教育为孩子的未来打下了坚实的基础。","liáng hǎo de jī chǔ jiào yù wèi hái zi de wèi lái dǎ xià le jiān shí de jī chǔ","A good basic education lays a solid foundation for a child's future.","Una buena educación básica sienta bases sólidas para el futuro de un niño.","Une bonne éducation de base pose des fondations solides pour l'avenir d'un enfant."],["L7-1967","坚守","jiānshǒu","V","to hold fast to","mantenerse firme en","rester fidèle à","大雪中，医生们坚守在岗位上，一夜没有休息。","dà xuě zhōng yī shēng men jiān shǒu zài gǎng wèi shàng yí yè méi yǒu xiū xi","In the heavy snow, the doctors stood fast at their posts and didn't rest all night.","Bajo la fuerte nevada, los médicos se mantuvieron firmes en sus puestos y no descansaron en toda la noche.","Sous la neige abondante, les médecins sont restés fermement à leur poste et n'ont pas pris de repos de toute la nuit."],["L7-1968","坚信","jiānxìn","V","to firmly believe","creer firmemente","croire fermement","她坚信只要努力，梦想总有一天会实现。","tā jiān xìn zhǐ yào nǔ lì mèng xiǎng zǒng yǒu yì tiān huì shí xiàn","She firmly believes that with effort her dream will come true one day.","Ella cree firmemente que, con esfuerzo, algún día su sueño se hará realidad.","Elle est fermement convaincue qu'avec des efforts, son rêve se réalisera un jour."],["L7-1969","坚硬","jiānyìng","Adj","hard; solid","duro; sólido","dur; solide","这种木材质地坚硬，很适合做家具。","zhè zhǒng mù cái zhì dì jiān yìng hěn shì hé zuò jiā jù","This wood is hard and well suited for making furniture.","Esta madera es dura y muy adecuada para hacer muebles.","Ce bois est dur et très bien adapté à la fabrication de meubles."],["L7-1970","肩膀","jiānbǎng","N","shoulder","hombro","épaule","他用手指轻轻戳了戳我的肩膀，示意我回头看。","tā yòng shǒu zhǐ qīng qīng chuō le chuō wǒ de jiān bǎng shì yì wǒ huí tóu kàn","He gave my shoulder a light poke with his finger to signal me to look back.","Con el dedo me dio un toquecito en el hombro para indicarme que mirara hacia atrás.","Il m'a donné un léger coup de doigt sur l'épaule pour me faire signe de me retourner."],["L7-1971","肩负","jiānfù","V","to shoulder; to bear","asumir; cargar con","assumer; porter","年轻一代肩负着建设国家的重任。","nián qīng yí dài jiān fù zhe jiàn shè guó jiā de zhòng rèn","The younger generation shoulders the heavy responsibility of building the country.","La joven generación carga con la pesada responsabilidad de construir el país.","La jeune génération porte la lourde responsabilité de bâtir le pays."],["L7-1972","艰巨","jiānjù","Adj","arduous; formidable","arduo; formidable","ardu; redoutable","修建这条穿山隧道是一项非常艰巨的任务。","xiū jiàn zhè tiáo chuān shān suì dào shì yí xiàng fēi cháng jiān jù de rèn wu","Building this tunnel through the mountain is an extremely arduous task.","Construir este túnel a través de la montaña es una tarea extremadamente ardua.","Construire ce tunnel à travers la montagne est une tâche extrêmement ardue."],["L7-1973","艰苦奋斗","jiānkǔ-fèndòu","","to struggle arduously","luchar arduamente","lutter avec acharnement","老一辈人艰苦奋斗的精神值得我们学习。","lǎo yí bèi rén jiān kǔ fèn dòu de jīng shén zhí dé wǒ men xué xí","The older generation's spirit of hard struggle is worth learning from.","El espíritu de lucha y sacrificio de las generaciones mayores merece que aprendamos de él.","L'esprit de lutte acharnée des anciennes générations mérite que nous nous en inspirions."],["L7-1974","艰险","jiānxiǎn","Adj","dangerous and difficult","difícil y peligroso","difficile et dangereux","探险队员们克服重重艰险，终于登上了峰顶。","tàn xiǎn duì yuán men kè fú chóng chóng jiān xiǎn zhōng yú dēng shàng le fēng dǐng","The expedition members overcame danger after danger and finally reached the summit.","Los miembros de la expedición superaron peligro tras peligro y por fin llegaron a la cima.","Les membres de l'expédition ont surmonté danger sur danger et ont enfin atteint le sommet."],["L7-1975","艰辛","jiānxīn","Adj","hardship; arduous","penalidades; arduo","épreuves; pénible","她独自抚养孩子多年，却很少向别人诉说生活的艰辛。","tā dú zì fǔ yǎng hái zi duō nián què hěn shǎo xiàng bié rén sù shuō shēng huó de jiān xīn","She raised her child alone for years, but seldom spoke to others about life's hardships.","Crió sola a su hijo durante muchos años, pero rara vez le contó a nadie las dificultades de la vida.","Elle a élevé seule son enfant pendant des années, mais elle parlait rarement à autrui des difficultés de sa vie."],["L7-1976","监察","jiānchá","V","to supervise; to inspect","supervisar; inspeccionar","superviser; contrôler","监察部门正在调查这起违规案件。","jiān chá bù mén zhèng zài diào chá zhè qǐ wéi guī àn jiàn","The supervisory department is investigating this violation case.","El departamento de supervisión está investigando este caso de infracción.","Le service de contrôle enquête sur cette affaire d'infraction."],["L7-1977","监管","jiānguǎn","V","to oversee; to supervise","supervisar; vigilar","superviser; surveiller","政府加强了对食品安全的监管。","zhèng fǔ jiā qiáng le duì shí pǐn ān quán de jiān guǎn","The government has strengthened its oversight of food safety.","El gobierno ha reforzado la supervisión de la seguridad alimentaria.","Le gouvernement a renforcé la surveillance de la sécurité alimentaire."],["L7-1978","监护","jiānhù","V","to act as guardian","ser tutor legal; custodiar","servir de tuteur; surveiller","父母去世后，孩子由他的叔叔负责监护。","fù mǔ qù shì hòu hái zi yóu tā de shū shu fù zé jiān hù","After the parents died, the child's uncle became responsible for his guardianship.","Tras la muerte de sus padres, su tío quedó a cargo de la tutela del niño.","Après la mort de ses parents, c'est son oncle qui a été chargé de la tutelle de l'enfant."],["L7-1979","监控","jiānkòng","V","to monitor","monitorear; controlar","surveiller; contrôler","他说的情况和监控录像完全吻合。","tā shuō de qíng kuàng hé jiān kòng lù xiàng wán quán wěn hé","What he said matches the surveillance footage completely.","Lo que dijo coincide por completo con las grabaciones de las cámaras de vigilancia.","Ce qu'il a dit correspond parfaitement aux images de vidéosurveillance."],["L7-1980","监视","jiānshì","V","to monitor; surveillance","vigilar; vigilancia","surveiller; surveillance","警察在楼下悄悄监视着嫌疑人的一举一动。","jǐng chá zài lóu xià qiāo qiāo jiān shì zhe xián yí rén de yì jǔ yí dòng","Downstairs, the police quietly kept watch on the suspect's every move.","Abajo, la policía vigilaba discretamente cada movimiento del sospechoso.","En bas, la police surveillait discrètement le moindre fait et geste du suspect."],["L7-1981","监狱","jiānyù","N","prison","prisión","prison","他因为偷窃被关进了监狱，判了三年。","tā yīn wèi tōu qiè bèi guān jìn le jiān yù pàn le sān nián","He was sent to prison for theft and sentenced to three years.","Lo metieron a la cárcel por robo y lo condenaron a tres años.","Il a été mis en prison pour vol et condamné à trois ans."],["L7-1982","兼","jiān","V","also; concurrently","además; simultáneamente","aussi; simultanément","他是我们班的数学老师，兼篮球队的教练。","tā shì wǒ men bān de shù xué lǎo shī jiān lán qiú duì de jiào liàn","He is our class's math teacher and also coach of the basketball team.","Es el profesor de matemáticas de nuestra clase y además entrenador del equipo de baloncesto.","C'est notre professeur de maths, et il est aussi l'entraîneur de l'équipe de basket."],["L7-1983","兼顾","jiāngù","V","to balance several things","atender varias cosas a la vez","concilier plusieurs choses","公共资源的分配既要兼顾效率，也不能忽视处境不利的群体。","gōng gòng zī yuán de fēn pèi jì yào jiān gù xiào lǜ yě bù néng hū shì chǔ jìng bú lì de qún tǐ","The allocation of public resources should take efficiency into account without overlooking disadvantaged groups.","La distribución de los recursos públicos debe considerar la eficiencia sin descuidar a los grupos desfavorecidos.","La répartition des ressources publiques doit tenir compte de l'efficacité sans négliger les groupes défavorisés."],["L7-1984","兼任","jiānrèn","V","to hold concurrent posts","desempeñar varios cargos","cumuler plusieurs fonctions","她除了上课以外，还兼任学校图书馆的馆长。","tā chú le shàng kè yǐ wài hái jiān rèn xué xiào tú shū guǎn de guǎn zhǎng","Besides teaching, she also serves as director of the school library.","Además de dar clases, ella también ocupa el cargo de directora de la biblioteca de la escuela.","En plus de ses cours, elle assume aussi la direction de la bibliothèque de l'école."],["L7-1985","兼容","jiānróng","V","compatible","compatible","compatible","这款软件和旧版本的系统不兼容。","zhè kuǎn ruǎn jiàn hé jiù bǎn běn de xì tǒng bù jiān róng","This software is not compatible with the older version of the system.","Este software no es compatible con la versión anterior del sistema.","Ce logiciel n'est pas compatible avec l'ancienne version du système."],["L7-1986","兼职","jiānzhí","N","part-time job; side job","trabajo a tiempo parcial","emploi à temps partiel","这份兼职的收入相当可观。","zhè fèn jiān zhí de shōu rù xiāng dāng kě guān","The income from this part-time job is quite considerable.","Los ingresos de este trabajo de medio tiempo son bastante considerables.","Les revenus de ce travail à temps partiel sont assez considérables."],["L7-1987","煎","jiān","V","to pan-fry","freír en sartén","faire frire à la poêle","老中医给他开了三剂药，让他回家每天煎一剂。","lǎo zhōng yī gěi tā kāi le sān jì yào ràng tā huí jiā měi tiān jiān yí jì","The old Chinese doctor prescribed him three doses of herbal medicine and told him to brew one a day at home.","El viejo médico tradicional le recetó tres dosis de medicina y le dijo que en casa preparara una cada día.","Le vieux médecin de médecine chinoise lui a prescrit trois doses de remède et lui a dit d'en préparer une par jour chez lui."],["L7-1988","拣","jiǎn","V","to pick; to choose","escoger; recoger","choisir; ramasser","她在一堆苹果里拣了几个又大又红的。","tā zài yì duī píng guǒ lǐ jiǎn le jǐ ge yòu dà yòu hóng de","She picked out a few big red ones from the pile of apples.","De la pila de manzanas escogió algunas grandes y rojas.","Dans le tas de pommes, elle en a choisi quelques-unes bien grosses et bien rouges."],["L7-1989","检察","jiǎnchá","V","to inspect; to prosecute","inspeccionar; fiscalizar","inspecter; poursuivre","检察机关对这起案件提起了公诉。","jiǎn chá jī guān duì zhè qǐ àn jiàn tí qǐ le gōng sù","The procuratorate brought a public prosecution in this case.","La fiscalía presentó acusación pública en este caso.","Le parquet a engagé des poursuites publiques dans cette affaire."],["L7-1990","检讨","jiǎntǎo","V","self-criticism; review","autocrítica; revisión","autocritique; bilan","他在会上检讨了自己工作中的失误。","tā zài huì shàng jiǎn tǎo le zì jǐ gōng zuò zhōng de shī wù","At the meeting he made a self-criticism of the mistakes in his work.","En la reunión hizo una autocrítica de los errores cometidos en su trabajo.","Lors de la réunion, il a fait son autocritique sur les erreurs commises dans son travail."],["L7-1991","减免","jiǎnmiǎn","V","to reduce or waive","reducir o eximir","réduire ou exonérer","家庭困难的学生可以申请减免学费。","jiā tíng kùn nan de xué shēng kě yǐ shēn qǐng jiǎn miǎn xué fèi","Students from families in difficulty can apply for reduced or waived tuition.","Los estudiantes de familias con dificultades pueden solicitar una reducción o exención de la matrícula.","Les étudiants issus de familles en difficulté peuvent demander une réduction ou une exonération des frais de scolarité."],["L7-1992","减弱","jiǎnruò","V","to weaken","debilitar","affaiblir","登山队在山腰扎营，待风势减弱后再向山顶进发。","dēng shān duì zài shān yāo zhā yíng dài fēng shì jiǎn ruò hòu zài xiàng shān dǐng jìn fā","The mountaineering team camped halfway up the mountain and waited for the wind to ease before setting off for the summit.","El equipo de alpinistas acampó a media ladera y esperó a que el viento amainara antes de avanzar hacia la cima.","L'équipe d'alpinistes a installé son camp à mi-pente et a attendu que le vent faiblisse avant de repartir vers le sommet."],["L7-1993","减速","jiǎnsù","","to slow down","reducir la velocidad","ralentir","前方学校路段，请减速慢行。","qián fāng xué xiào lù duàn qǐng jiǎn sù màn xíng","School zone ahead — please slow down.","Zona escolar adelante: reduzca la velocidad.","Zone scolaire à proximité : ralentissez."],["L7-1994","减压","jiǎnyā","V","to reduce pressure; to relax","aliviar la tensión; relajarse","réduire la pression; se détendre","听音乐是很多上班族减压的好方法。","tīng yīn yuè shì hěn duō shàng bān zú jiǎn yā de hǎo fāng fǎ","Listening to music is a good way for many office workers to relieve stress.","Escuchar música es una buena forma de aliviar el estrés para muchos oficinistas.","Écouter de la musique est un bon moyen de relâcher la pression pour beaucoup de salariés."],["L7-1995","简称","jiǎnchēng","V/N","abbreviation; to be abbreviated","abreviatura; abreviar","abréviation; abréger","北京大学简称“北大”，是中国最有名的大学之一。","běi jīng dà xué jiǎn chēng běi dà shì zhōng guó zuì yǒu míng de dà xué zhī yī","Peking University, called “Beida” for short, is one of China's most famous universities.","La Universidad de Pekín, abreviada «Beida», es una de las universidades más famosas de China.","L'Université de Pékin, appelée « Beida » en abrégé, est l'une des universités les plus célèbres de Chine."],["L7-1996","简短","jiǎnduǎn","Adj","brief; short","breve; corto","bref; court","校长在开学典礼上作了简短的讲话。","xiào zhǎng zài kāi xué diǎn lǐ shàng zuò le jiǎn duǎn de jiǎng huà","The principal gave a brief speech at the opening ceremony.","El director pronunció un breve discurso en la ceremonia de inicio del curso.","Le proviseur a prononcé une brève allocution lors de la cérémonie de rentrée."],["L7-1997","简化","jiǎnhuà","V","to simplify","simplificar","simplifier","为了方便群众，政府简化了办事手续。","wèi le fāng biàn qún zhòng zhèng fǔ jiǎn huà le bàn shì shǒu xù","To make things easier for the public, the government simplified its procedures.","Para facilitar las cosas a la gente, el gobierno simplificó los trámites.","Pour faciliter la vie des citoyens, le gouvernement a simplifié les démarches administratives."],["L7-1998","简洁","jiǎnjié","Adj","concise","conciso","concis","这篇报告语言简洁，重点突出。","zhè piān bào gào yǔ yán jiǎn jié zhòng diǎn tū chū","This report is concise in language and highlights the key points.","Este informe es conciso en su redacción y resalta los puntos clave.","Ce rapport est rédigé de façon concise et met bien en relief les points essentiels."],["L7-1999","简陋","jiǎnlòu","Adj","crude; simple","rudimentario; sencillo","rudimentaire; sommaire","虽然教室条件简陋，孩子们学习却非常认真。","suī rán jiào shì tiáo jiàn jiǎn lòu hái zi men xué xí què fēi cháng rèn zhēn","Although the classrooms are very basic, the children study very earnestly.","Aunque las aulas son muy modestas, los niños estudian con gran seriedad.","Bien que les salles de classe soient très rudimentaires, les enfants étudient avec beaucoup de sérieux."],["L7-2000","简体字","jiǎntǐzì","N","simplified characters","caracteres simplificados","caractères simplifiés","中国大陆使用简体字，台湾和香港则使用繁体字。","zhōng guó dà lù shǐ yòng jiǎn tǐ zì tái wān hé xiāng gǎng zé shǐ yòng fán tǐ zì","Mainland China uses simplified characters, while Taiwan and Hong Kong use traditional characters.","La China continental usa caracteres simplificados, mientras que Taiwán y Hong Kong usan caracteres tradicionales.","La Chine continentale utilise les caractères simplifiés, tandis que Taïwan et Hong Kong utilisent les caractères traditionnels."],["L7-2001","简要","jiǎnyào","Adj","concise; brief","conciso; breve","concis; succinct","请你简要介绍一下这个项目的主要内容。","qǐng nǐ jiǎn yào jiè shào yí xià zhè ge xiàng mù de zhǔ yào nèi róng","Please briefly introduce the main content of this project.","Por favor, presenta brevemente el contenido principal de este proyecto.","Présentez brièvement, s'il vous plaît, le contenu principal de ce projet."],["L7-2002","简易","jiǎnyì","Adj","simple and easy","sencillo; fácil","simple; facile","灾民们暂时住在临时搭建的简易房里。","zāi mín men zàn shí zhù zài lín shí dā jiàn de jiǎn yì fáng lǐ","The disaster victims are temporarily living in basic shelters built for temporary use.","Los damnificados viven por ahora en viviendas sencillas construidas de forma provisional.","Les sinistrés vivent provisoirement dans des abris rudimentaires construits à la hâte."],["L7-2003","见解","jiànjiě","N","opinion; view","opinión; punto de vista","opinion; point de vue","她对教育问题有很多独到的见解。","tā duì jiào yù wèn tí yǒu hěn duō dú dào de jiàn jiě","She has many original views on educational issues.","Ella tiene muchas opiniones originales sobre los problemas de la educación.","Elle a beaucoup d'idées originales sur les questions d'éducation."],["L7-2004","见钱眼开","jiànqián-yǎnkāi","","mercenary; greedy for money","codicioso; ávido de dinero","cupide; avide d'argent","这个人见钱眼开，为了钱什么事都干得出来。","zhè ge rén jiàn qián yǎn kāi wèi le qián shén me shì dōu gàn de chū lái","This person's eyes light up at the sight of money; he'd do anything for it.","A este tipo se le van los ojos con el dinero; por dinero es capaz de cualquier cosa.","Cet homme ne pense qu'à l'argent ; pour de l'argent, il est capable de tout."],["L7-2005","见仁见智","jiànrén-jiànzhì","","opinions differ","las opiniones difieren","les avis divergent","这部电影到底好不好，大家见仁见智。","zhè bù diàn yǐng dào dǐ hǎo bu hǎo dà jiā jiàn rén jiàn zhì","Whether this film is any good is a matter on which opinions differ.","Si esta película es buena o no, sobre eso cada quien tiene su opinión.","Que ce film soit bon ou non, chacun en juge à sa façon."],["L7-2006","见识","jiànshi","V/N","experience; knowledge","experiencia; conocimiento","expérience; connaissances","出国留学让他长了不少见识。","chū guó liú xué ràng tā zhǎng le bù shǎo jiàn shi","Studying abroad broadened his horizons considerably.","Estudiar en el extranjero le abrió mucho los ojos.","Ses études à l'étranger lui ont beaucoup ouvert l'esprit."],["L7-2007","见外","jiànwài","Adj","to stand on ceremony","tratar con formalidad","faire des manières","我们是老朋友了，你别这么见外。","wǒ men shì lǎo péng you le nǐ bié zhè me jiàn wài","We're old friends — don't stand on ceremony like that.","Somos viejos amigos, no seas tan formal conmigo.","On est de vieux amis, ne fais pas autant de manières."],["L7-2008","见效","jiànxiào","V","to take effect","surtir efecto","faire effet","如果考核只看短期业绩，员工就可能忽视那些见效缓慢却必不可少的工作。","rú guǒ kǎo hé zhǐ kàn duǎn qī yè jì yuán gōng jiù kě néng hū shì nà xiē jiàn xiào huǎn màn què bì bù kě shǎo de gōng zuò","If performance reviews focus only on short-term results, employees may neglect work that is slow to produce results but essential.","Si la evaluación solo considera los resultados a corto plazo, los empleados podrían descuidar tareas que tardan en dar frutos pero son indispensables.","Si l'évaluation ne regarde que les résultats à court terme, les employés risquent de négliger les tâches qui portent leurs fruits lentement mais qui sont indispensables."],["L7-2009","见义勇为","jiànyì-yǒngwéi","","to act courageously for justice","actuar con valentía por la justicia","agir courageusement pour la justice","他见义勇为，抓住了抢包的小偷。","tā jiàn yì yǒng wéi zhuā zhù le qiǎng bāo de xiǎo tōu","He bravely stepped in and caught the thief who had snatched a bag.","Actuó con valentía y atrapó al ladrón que había arrebatado una bolsa.","Il a agi courageusement et attrapé le voleur qui avait arraché un sac."],["L7-2010","见证","jiànzhèng","V/N","to witness; witness","presenciar; testigo","témoigner; témoin","这座老桥见证了城市一百多年的变化。","zhè zuò lǎo qiáo jiàn zhèng le chéng shì yì bǎi duō nián de biàn huà","This old bridge has witnessed more than a century of change in the city.","Este viejo puente ha sido testigo de más de cien años de cambios en la ciudad.","Ce vieux pont a été témoin de plus d'un siècle de transformations de la ville."],["L7-2011","间谍","jiàndié","N","spy","espía","espion","那名外交官因为从事间谍活动被驱逐出境。","nà míng wài jiāo guān yīn wèi cóng shì jiàn dié huó dòng bèi qū zhú chū jìng","The diplomat was expelled from the country for espionage.","Ese diplomático fue expulsado del país por realizar actividades de espionaje.","Ce diplomate a été expulsé du pays pour activités d'espionnage."],["L7-2012","间断","jiànduàn","V","interrupted; break","interrumpido; interrupción","interrompu; interruption","他学习中文十年，从来没有间断过。","tā xué xí zhōng wén shí nián cóng lái méi yǒu jiàn duàn guo","He has studied Chinese for ten years without ever stopping.","Lleva diez años estudiando chino y nunca ha parado.","Il étudie le chinois depuis dix ans sans jamais s'être arrêté."],["L7-2013","间隔","jiàngé","V/N","interval; gap","intervalo; espacio","intervalle; écart","这条公交线路每隔十分钟发一班车，间隔很短。","zhè tiáo gōng jiāo xiàn lù měi gé shí fēn zhōng fā yì bān chē jiàn gé hěn duǎn","Buses on this route leave every ten minutes, so the interval is short.","Esta línea de autobús sale cada diez minutos, así que el intervalo es muy corto.","Sur cette ligne, un bus part toutes les dix minutes ; l'intervalle est donc très court."],["L7-2014","间隙","jiànxì","N","gap; interval","intervalo; hueco","intervalle; interstice","他利用工作的间隙，给家里打了个电话。","tā lì yòng gōng zuò de jiàn xì gěi jiā lǐ dǎ le gè diàn huà","He used a break in his work to call home.","Aprovechó un respiro en el trabajo para llamar a casa.","Il a profité d'une pause dans son travail pour appeler chez lui."],["L7-2015","建交","jiànjiāo","","to establish diplomatic ties","establecer relaciones diplomáticas","établir des relations diplomatiques","两国建交以来，经济往来越来越频繁。","liǎng guó jiàn jiāo yǐ lái jīng jì wǎng lái yuè lái yuè pín fán","Since the two countries established diplomatic relations, economic exchanges have grown more and more frequent.","Desde que ambos países establecieron relaciones diplomáticas, los intercambios económicos son cada vez más frecuentes.","Depuis l'établissement de relations diplomatiques entre les deux pays, les échanges économiques sont de plus en plus fréquents."],["L7-2016","建树","jiànshù","V/N","to make a contribution","hacer una contribución","apporter une contribution","这位科学家在物理学领域颇有建树。","zhè wèi kē xué jiā zài wù lǐ xué lǐng yù pō yǒu jiàn shù","This scientist has made considerable contributions in the field of physics.","Este científico ha hecho aportes considerables en el campo de la física.","Ce scientifique a apporté des contributions notables dans le domaine de la physique."],["L7-2017","建筑师","jiànzhùshī","N","architect","arquitecto","architecte","这座博物馆是由一位著名建筑师设计的。","zhè zuò bó wù guǎn shì yóu yí wèi zhù míng jiàn zhù shī shè jì de","This museum was designed by a famous architect.","Este museo fue diseñado por un famoso arquitecto.","Ce musée a été conçu par un célèbre architecte."],["L7-2018","建筑物","jiànzhùwù","N","building; structure","edificio; construcción","bâtiment; construction","地震中，许多老旧的建筑物都倒塌了。","dì zhèn zhōng xǔ duō lǎo jiù de jiàn zhù wù dōu dǎo tā le","Many old buildings collapsed in the earthquake.","En el terremoto se derrumbaron muchos edificios antiguos.","Lors du séisme, de nombreux vieux bâtiments se sont effondrés."],["L7-2019","贱","jiàn","Adj","cheap; despicable","barato; despreciable","bon marché; méprisable","今年苹果大丰收，在地头卖得特别贱。","jīn nián píng guǒ dà fēng shōu zài dì tóu mài de tè bié jiàn","There was a bumper apple harvest this year, and they sold very cheaply at the farm.","Este año hubo una cosecha enorme de manzanas y se vendieron muy baratas en la huerta.","Cette année, la récolte de pommes a été exceptionnelle et elles se vendent à très bas prix directement au verger."],["L7-2020","健美","jiànměi","N/Adj","bodybuilding; fit and beautiful","culturismo; saludable y bello","culturisme; sain et beau","她每周去三次健身房，练出了健美的身材。","tā měi zhōu qù sān cì jiàn shēn fáng liàn chū le jiàn měi de shēn cái","She goes to the gym three times a week and has built a fit, shapely figure.","Va al gimnasio tres veces por semana y ha logrado una figura atlética y bien formada.","Elle va à la salle de sport trois fois par semaine et s'est forgé une silhouette tonique et harmonieuse."],["L7-2021","健壮","jiànzhuàng","Adj","robust; sturdy","robusto; fuerte","robuste; vigoureux","经过几个月的锻炼，他的身体变得健壮多了。","jīng guò jǐ ge yuè de duàn liàn tā de shēn tǐ biàn de jiàn zhuàng duō le","After several months of exercise, he became much more robust.","Después de varios meses de ejercicio, su cuerpo se volvió mucho más robusto.","Après plusieurs mois d'entraînement, il est devenu beaucoup plus robuste."],["L7-2022","溅","jiàn","V","to splash","salpicar","éclabousser","一辆汽车开过去，溅了我一身泥水。","yí liàng qì chē kāi guò qù jiàn le wǒ yì shēn ní shuǐ","A car drove past and splashed muddy water all over me.","Pasó un carro y me salpicó de agua con lodo de pies a cabeza.","Une voiture est passée et m'a éclaboussé de boue de la tête aux pieds."],["L7-2023","鉴别","jiànbié","V","to distinguish; to identify","distinguir; discernir","distinguer; discerner","专家用仪器鉴别这幅画的真假。","zhuān jiā yòng yí qì jiàn bié zhè fú huà de zhēn jiǎ","Experts used instruments to determine whether this painting is genuine.","Los expertos usaron instrumentos para determinar si este cuadro es auténtico o falso.","Les experts ont utilisé des instruments pour distinguer l'authenticité de ce tableau."],["L7-2024","鉴赏","jiànshǎng","V","to appreciate; to enjoy","apreciar; saborear","apprécier; savourer","这门课主要教学生如何鉴赏古典诗词。","zhè mén kè zhǔ yào jiāo xué shēng rú hé jiàn shǎng gǔ diǎn shī cí","This course mainly teaches students how to appreciate classical poetry.","Este curso enseña principalmente a los estudiantes a apreciar la poesía clásica.","Ce cours apprend surtout aux étudiants à apprécier la poésie classique."],["L7-2025","鉴于","jiànyú","Prep","in view of; considering","en vista de; dado que","vu que; étant donné","鉴于天气原因，今天的航班全部取消。","jiàn yú tiān qì yuán yīn jīn tiān de háng bān quán bù qǔ xiāo","In view of the weather, all of today's flights have been canceled.","Debido al clima, todos los vuelos de hoy han sido cancelados.","Compte tenu de la météo, tous les vols d'aujourd'hui sont annulés."],["L7-2026","姜","jiāng","N","Jiang (surname); ginger","Jiang (apellido); jengibre","Jiang (nom de famille); gingembre","这条鱼有点儿腥，多放点儿姜吧。","zhè tiáo yú yǒu diǎnr xīng duō fàng diǎnr jiāng ba","This fish smells a bit fishy; add some more ginger.","Este pescado huele un poco fuerte; ponle más jengibre.","Ce poisson sent un peu fort ; mets-y encore du gingembre."],["L7-2027","僵","jiāng","Adj","stiff; rigid","rígido; entumecido","raide; rigide","为了一点儿小事，他们俩的关系搞得很僵。","wèi le yì diǎnr xiǎo shì tā men liǎ de guān xì gǎo de hěn jiāng","Over a trivial matter, things between the two of them have become very strained.","Por una tontería, la relación entre los dos ha quedado muy tensa.","Pour une broutille, leur relation est devenue très tendue."],["L7-2028","僵化","jiānghuà","V","to become rigid","volverse rígido","se scléroser","思想僵化的人很难接受新事物。","sī xiǎng jiāng huà de rén hěn nán jiē shòu xīn shì wù","People with rigid thinking find it hard to accept new things.","A las personas de pensamiento rígido les cuesta aceptar cosas nuevas.","Les personnes à la pensée rigide ont du mal à accepter la nouveauté."],["L7-2029","僵局","jiāngjú","N","impasse; deadlock","impasse; punto muerto","impasse; blocage","经过一个星期的谈判，双方终于打破了僵局。","jīng guò yí ge xīng qī de tán pàn shuāng fāng zhōng yú dǎ pò le jiāng jú","After a week of negotiations, the two sides finally broke the deadlock.","Tras una semana de negociaciones, las dos partes por fin rompieron el estancamiento.","Après une semaine de négociations, les deux parties ont enfin brisé l'impasse."],["L7-2030","讲解","jiǎngjiě","V","to explain","explicar","expliquer","老师着重讲解了这道题的解法。","lǎo shī zhuó zhòng jiǎng jiě le zhè dào tí de jiě fǎ","The teacher focused on explaining how to solve this problem.","La maestra hizo hincapié en explicar cómo se resuelve este problema.","Le professeur a surtout insisté sur la façon de résoudre ce problème."],["L7-2031","讲述","jiǎngshù","V","to narrate; to recount","narrar; relatar","raconter; relater","这部电影讲述了一个囚犯越狱的故事。","zhè bù diàn yǐng jiǎng shù le yí ge qiú fàn yuè yù de gù shi","This film tells the story of a prisoner's escape from jail.","Esta película cuenta la historia de un preso que se fuga de la cárcel.","Ce film raconte l'histoire d'un prisonnier qui s'évade de prison."],["L7-2032","讲学","jiǎngxué","","to lecture","dar una conferencia","donner un cours","这位老教授经常应邀到国外讲学。","zhè wèi lǎo jiào shòu jīng cháng yìng yāo dào guó wài jiǎng xué","This old professor is often invited abroad to lecture.","Este anciano profesor es invitado con frecuencia a dar conferencias en el extranjero.","Ce vieux professeur est souvent invité à donner des conférences à l'étranger."],["L7-2033","奖杯","jiǎngbēi","N","trophy cup","copa; trofeo","coupe; trophée","队长高高举起了冠军奖杯。","duì zhǎng gāo gāo jǔ qǐ le guàn jūn jiǎng bēi","The captain raised the championship trophy high.","El capitán levantó bien alto el trofeo de campeón.","Le capitaine a brandi bien haut le trophée de champion."],["L7-2034","奖牌","jiǎngpái","N","medal","medalla","médaille","这块奖牌是全队共同的荣誉。","zhè kuài jiǎng pái shì quán duì gòng tóng de róng yù","This medal is an honor shared by the whole team.","Esta medalla es un honor compartido por todo el equipo.","Cette médaille est un honneur que partage toute l'équipe."],["L7-2035","奖品","jiǎngpǐn","N","prize; award","premio","prix; récompense","答对问题的观众可以得到一份精美的奖品。","dá duì wèn tí de guān zhòng kě yǐ dé dào yí fèn jīng měi de jiǎng pǐn","Audience members who answer correctly can win a lovely prize.","Los espectadores que respondan correctamente podrán ganar un bonito premio.","Les spectateurs qui répondent correctement peuvent remporter un joli lot."],["L7-2036","奖项","jiǎngxiàng","N","award; prize","premio; galardón","prix; distinction","这部电影获得了包括最佳导演在内的多个奖项。","zhè bù diàn yǐng huò dé le bāo kuò zuì jiā dǎo yǎn zài nèi de duō ge jiǎng xiàng","This film won several awards, including Best Director.","Esta película obtuvo varios premios, entre ellos el de mejor director.","Ce film a remporté plusieurs prix, dont celui du meilleur réalisateur."],["L7-2037","降临","jiànglín","V","to descend; to arrive","descender; llegar","descendre; arriver","夜幕降临，城市里亮起了万家灯火。","yè mù jiàng lín chéng shì lǐ liàng qǐ le wàn jiā dēng huǒ","As night fell, lights came on in countless homes across the city.","Al caer la noche, se encendieron las luces de miles de hogares en la ciudad.","À la tombée de la nuit, des milliers de foyers de la ville se sont illuminés."],["L7-2038","交叉","jiāochā","V","to cross; to intersect","cruzar; intersecarse","croiser; se recouper","这两条公路在城市北边交叉。","zhè liǎng tiáo gōng lù zài chéng shì běi bian jiāo chā","These two highways intersect on the north side of the city.","Estas dos carreteras se cruzan al norte de la ciudad.","Ces deux routes se croisent au nord de la ville."],["L7-2039","交锋","jiāofēng","","to cross swords","medir fuerzas; enfrentarse","croiser le fer; s'affronter","两支球队上次交锋时，比赛打得非常激烈。","liǎng zhī qiú duì shàng cì jiāo fēng shí bǐ sài dǎ de fēi cháng jī liè","The last time the two teams met, the match was extremely fierce.","La última vez que se enfrentaron los dos equipos, el partido fue muy reñido.","La dernière fois que les deux équipes se sont affrontées, le match a été extrêmement acharné."],["L7-2040","交付","jiāofù","V","to hand over; to deliver","entregar","remettre; livrer","新房子预计明年三月交付使用。","xīn fáng zi yù jì míng nián sān yuè jiāo fù shǐ yòng","The new apartments are expected to be handed over for use next March.","Se prevé que las viviendas nuevas se entreguen para su uso en marzo del próximo año.","Les nouveaux logements devraient être livrés en mars prochain."],["L7-2041","交集","jiāojí","V","to mingle; common ground","mezclarse; intersección","se mêler; intersection","他们俩一个在城市，一个在农村，生活几乎没有交集。","tā men liǎ yí ge zài chéng shì yí ge zài nóng cūn shēng huó jī hū méi yǒu jiāo jí","One lives in the city and the other in the countryside, so their lives barely overlap.","Uno vive en la ciudad y el otro en el campo, así que sus vidas casi no tienen puntos en común.","L'un vit en ville et l'autre à la campagne ; leurs vies n'ont presque aucun point commun."],["L7-2042","交接","jiāojiē","V","to hand over; to meet","entregar; relevar; contactar","transmettre; relayer; se rencontrer","请把会议纪要抄送给相关同事，以免口头交接造成疏漏。","qǐng bǎ huì yì jì yào chāo sòng gěi xiāng guān tóng shì yǐ miǎn kǒu tóu jiāo jiē zào chéng shū lòu","Please copy the relevant colleagues on the meeting minutes to prevent omissions during a verbal handover.","Por favor, envíen copia del acta de la reunión a los colegas pertinentes para evitar omisiones por una transferencia verbal.","Veuillez mettre en copie les collègues concernés du compte rendu de réunion, afin d'éviter les oublis dus à une passation orale."],["L7-2043","交界","jiāojiè","V","border; boundary","frontera; límite","frontière; limite","这个小镇位于三个省的交界处，交通十分方便。","zhè ge xiǎo zhèn wèi yú sān gè shěng de jiāo jiè chù jiāo tōng shí fēn fāng biàn","This small town lies where three provinces meet, and transport is very convenient.","Este pueblo está en el límite de tres provincias y tiene muy buenas conexiones de transporte.","Cette petite ville est située à la jonction de trois provinces et les transports y sont très pratiques."],["L7-2044","交纳","jiāonà","V","to pay (dues)","pagar (cuotas)","payer (cotisations)","每个会员每年需要交纳一百元会费。","měi ge huì yuán měi nián xū yào jiāo nà yì bǎi yuán huì fèi","Each member must pay an annual membership fee of one hundred yuan.","Cada socio debe pagar una cuota anual de cien yuanes.","Chaque membre doit verser une cotisation annuelle de cent yuans."],["L7-2045","交情","jiāoqing","N","friendship; relationship","amistad; relación","amitié; relation","我们俩是二十多年的老交情了，有什么话尽管说。","wǒ men liǎ shì èr shí duō nián de lǎo jiāo qing le yǒu shén me huà jǐn guǎn shuō","We've been friends for over twenty years, so feel free to say whatever's on your mind.","Somos amigos de más de veinte años, así que dime lo que quieras sin reparos.","Nous sommes amis depuis plus de vingt ans, alors dis-moi tout ce que tu as à dire."],["L7-2046","交涉","jiāoshè","V","to negotiate","negociar","négocier","因为航班取消，乘客们正在和航空公司交涉。","yīn wèi háng bān qǔ xiāo chéng kè men zhèng zài hé háng kōng gōng sī jiāo shè","Because the flight was canceled, passengers are negotiating with the airline.","Como el vuelo fue cancelado, los pasajeros están negociando con la aerolínea.","Le vol ayant été annulé, les passagers sont en pourparlers avec la compagnie aérienne."],["L7-2047","交谈","jiāotán","V","to converse; to chat","conversar; charlar","converser; discuter","两人因误会产生了隔阂，直到一次坦诚的交谈才重新建立信任。","liǎng rén yīn wù huì chǎn shēng le gé hé zhí dào yí cì tǎn chéng de jiāo tán cái chóng xīn jiàn lì xìn rèn","A misunderstanding drove a wedge between them, and only a frank conversation restored their trust.","Un malentendido creó distancia entre los dos, y solo una conversación sincera restableció la confianza.","Un malentendu avait creusé un fossé entre eux, et il a fallu une conversation franche pour rétablir la confiance."],["L7-2048","交替","jiāotì","V","to alternate; to replace","alternar; sustituir","alterner; remplacer","这个季节冷暖交替，很容易感冒。","zhè ge jì jié lěng nuǎn jiāo tì hěn róng yì gǎn mào","Cold and warm weather alternate at this time of year, making it easy to catch a cold.","En esta época del año alternan el frío y el calor, y es fácil resfriarse.","À cette saison, le froid et la douceur alternent, et il est facile de s'enrhumer."],["L7-2049","交头接耳","jiāotóu-jiē'ěr","","to whisper to each other","susurrarse al oído","chuchoter à l'oreille","考试的时候，不许交头接耳。","kǎo shì de shí hou bù xǔ jiāo tóu jiē ěr","During the exam, no whispering to one another is allowed.","Durante el examen no se permite cuchichear entre compañeros.","Pendant l'examen, il est interdit de chuchoter entre voisins."],["L7-2050","交响乐","jiāoxiǎngyuè","N","symphony","sinfonía","symphonie","今晚乐团将在音乐厅演奏贝多芬的交响乐。","jīn wǎn yuè tuán jiāng zài yīn yuè tīng yǎn zòu bèi duō fēn de jiāo xiǎng yuè","The orchestra will perform a Beethoven symphony at the concert hall tonight.","Esta noche la orquesta interpretará una sinfonía de Beethoven en la sala de conciertos.","Ce soir, l'orchestre jouera une symphonie de Beethoven à la salle de concert."],["L7-2051","郊外","jiāowài","N","outskirts","afueras","banlieue; environs","他搬到郊外住，就是为了图个清静。","tā bān dào jiāo wài zhù jiù shì wèi le tú gè qīng jìng","He moved to the suburbs just for some peace and quiet.","Se mudó a las afueras solo para tener algo de paz y tranquilidad.","Il a déménagé en banlieue uniquement pour avoir un peu de calme."],["L7-2052","郊游","jiāoyóu","V","to go on an outing","ir de excursión","faire une excursion","天气暖和了，学校组织同学们去郊游。","tiān qì nuǎn huo le xué xiào zǔ zhī tóng xué men qù jiāo yóu","Now that it's warm, the school organized an outing for the students.","Ahora que hace calor, la escuela organizó una excursión para los alumnos.","Maintenant qu'il fait doux, l'école a organisé une sortie à la campagne pour les élèves."],["L7-2053","浇","jiāo","V","to pour; to water","verter; regar","verser; arroser","这盆花不能浇太多水，三天浇一次就够了。","zhè pén huā bù néng jiāo tài duō shuǐ sān tiān jiāo yí cì jiù gòu le","This potted plant shouldn't be overwatered; watering it once every three days is enough.","A esta maceta no hay que echarle demasiada agua; con regarla una vez cada tres días basta.","Cette plante en pot ne doit pas être trop arrosée ; une fois tous les trois jours suffit."],["L7-2054","娇惯","jiāoguàn","V","to pamper; to spoil","consentir; mimar","dorloter; gâter","父母太娇惯孩子，反而会害了他。","fù mǔ tài jiāo guàn hái zi fǎn ér huì hài le tā","Parents who pamper their children too much end up harming them.","Los padres que consienten demasiado a sus hijos terminan perjudicándolos.","Des parents qui gâtent trop leurs enfants finissent par leur nuire."],["L7-2055","娇气","jiāoqì","Adj","delicate; fragile","delicado; frágil","délicat; fragile","这孩子太娇气了，走几步路就喊累。","zhè hái zi tài jiāo qì le zǒu jǐ bù lù jiù hǎn lèi","This child is so pampered that he complains of being tired after just a few steps.","Este niño es muy consentido: se queja de cansancio después de caminar unos pocos pasos.","Cet enfant est tellement gâté qu'il se plaint d'être fatigué après quelques pas."],["L7-2056","胶囊","jiāonáng","N","capsule","cápsula","gélule; capsule","这种胶囊每天吃两次，每次一粒。","zhè zhǒng jiāo náng měi tiān chī liǎng cì měi cì yí lì","Take this capsule twice a day, one each time.","Tome esta cápsula dos veces al día, una cada vez.","Prenez cette gélule deux fois par jour, une à chaque prise."],["L7-2057","胶片","jiāopiàn","N","film; photographic film","película fotográfica; carrete","pellicule; film photo","现在拍照都用数码相机，很少有人用胶片了。","xiàn zài pāi zhào dōu yòng shù mǎ xiàng jī hěn shǎo yǒu rén yòng jiāo piàn le","Now everyone takes photos with digital cameras; few people use film anymore.","Hoy todos toman fotos con cámaras digitales; casi nadie usa ya película.","Aujourd'hui, tout le monde photographie avec un appareil numérique ; presque plus personne n'utilise de pellicule."],["L7-2058","焦","jiāo","Adj","Jiao (surname); burnt","Jiao (apellido); quemado","Jiao (nom de famille); brûlé","火开得太大了，鱼的一面已经有点儿焦了。","huǒ kāi de tài dà le yú de yí miàn yǐ jīng yǒu diǎnr jiāo le","The heat was too high, and one side of the fish is already a bit scorched.","El fuego estaba demasiado fuerte y un lado del pescado ya se ha quemado un poco.","Le feu était trop fort et un côté du poisson est déjà un peu brûlé."],["L7-2059","焦急","jiāojí","Adj","anxious","ansioso; inquieto","anxieux; impatient","手术室门口，家属们焦急地等待着。","shǒu shù shì mén kǒu jiā shǔ men jiāo jí de děng dài zhe","Outside the operating room, the family waited anxiously.","A la puerta del quirófano, los familiares esperaban con ansiedad.","À la porte du bloc opératoire, la famille attendait avec angoisse."],["L7-2060","焦距","jiāojù","N","focal length","distancia focal","distance focale","这支镜头的焦距较长，适合拍摄远处的动物。","zhè zhī jìng tóu de jiāo jù jiào cháng shì hé pāi shè yuǎn chù de dòng wù","This lens has a long focal length and is suitable for photographing distant animals.","Este objetivo tiene una distancia focal larga y es adecuado para fotografiar animales lejanos.","Cet objectif a une longue focale et convient pour photographier des animaux éloignés."],["L7-2061","焦虑","jiāolǜ","Adj","anxious; worried","ansioso; preocupado","anxieux; inquiet","考试临近，不少学生出现了焦虑情绪。","kǎo shì lín jìn bù shǎo xué shēng chū xiàn le jiāo lǜ qíng xù","As the exam approaches, many students are feeling anxious.","Al acercarse el examen, muchos estudiantes sienten ansiedad.","À l'approche de l'examen, beaucoup d'étudiants ressentent de l'anxiété."],["L7-2062","焦躁","jiāozào","Adj","fretful; impatient","irritable; impaciente","irritable; impatient","堵了一个多小时的车，司机们都变得焦躁不安。","dǔ le yí ge duō xiǎo shí de chē sī jī men dōu biàn de jiāo zào bù ān","After being stuck in traffic for over an hour, the drivers all grew restless and irritable.","Tras más de una hora atrapados en el tráfico, todos los conductores se pusieron inquietos e irritables.","Après plus d'une heure d'embouteillage, les conducteurs étaient tous devenus agités et irritables."],["L7-2063","礁石","jiāoshí","N","reef","arrecife","récif","海浪一次又一次地拍打着岸边的礁石。","hǎi làng yí cì yòu yí cì de pāi da zhe àn biān de jiāo shí","The waves beat again and again against the rocks by the shore.","Las olas golpeaban una y otra vez las rocas de la orilla.","Les vagues battaient sans cesse les rochers du rivage."],["L7-2064","嚼","jiáo","V","to chew","masticar","mâcher","这块牛肉的筋太多，炖了很久还是嚼不动。","zhè kuài niú ròu de jīn tài duō dùn le hěn jiǔ hái shi jiáo bú dòng","This beef has too much sinew; even after stewing for a long time it's still too tough to chew.","Esta carne de res tiene demasiados nervios; aun después de cocerla mucho tiempo sigue siendo imposible de masticar.","Ce bœuf a trop de nerfs ; même après une longue cuisson, il reste impossible à mâcher."],["L7-2065","角落","jiǎoluò","N","nook; corner","rincón; esquina","recoin; coin","她一个人坐在教室的角落里，静静地看书。","tā yí ge rén zuò zài jiào shì de jiǎo luò lǐ jìng jìng de kàn shū","She sat alone in the corner of the classroom, quietly reading.","Ella estaba sentada sola en un rincón del aula, leyendo en silencio.","Elle était assise seule dans un coin de la classe, en train de lire tranquillement."],["L7-2066","狡猾","jiǎohuá","Adj","cunning; sly","astuto; taimado","rusé; malin","狐狸在很多故事里都是狡猾的形象。","hú li zài hěn duō gù shi lǐ dōu shì jiǎo huá de xíng xiàng","In many stories the fox is portrayed as cunning.","En muchos cuentos el zorro aparece como un personaje astuto.","Dans beaucoup d'histoires, le renard est dépeint comme rusé."],["L7-2067","绞","jiǎo","V","to twist; to wring","retorcer; estrangular","tordre; essorer","妈妈把猪肉绞成肉馅，准备包饺子。","mā ma bǎ zhū ròu jiǎo chéng ròu xiàn zhǔn bèi bāo jiǎo zi","Mom ground the pork into filling to make dumplings.","Mamá picó la carne de cerdo para el relleno y se puso a preparar los dumplings.","Maman a haché le porc pour la farce et s'apprête à faire des raviolis."],["L7-2068","矫正","jiǎozhèng","V","to correct; to rectify","corregir; rectificar","corriger; rectifier","孩子的牙齿不整齐，医生建议早点儿矫正。","hái zi de yá chǐ bù zhěng qí yī shēng jiàn yì zǎo diǎnr jiǎo zhèng","The child's teeth are uneven, and the dentist recommended correcting them early.","Los dientes del niño no están alineados y el dentista recomendó corregirlos pronto.","Les dents de l'enfant ne sont pas bien alignées et le dentiste conseille de les redresser tôt."],["L7-2069","搅","jiǎo","V","to stir; to disturb","remover; molestar","remuer; perturber","他一来就把好好的聚会搅得一团糟。","tā yì lái jiù bǎ hǎo hǎo de jù huì jiǎo de yì tuán zāo","As soon as he arrived, he threw a perfectly good party into chaos.","En cuanto llegó, convirtió una fiesta que iba muy bien en un desastre.","Dès son arrivée, il a transformé une fête qui se passait très bien en joyeux désordre."],["L7-2070","搅拌","jiǎobàn","V","to stir; to mix","remover; mezclar","remuer; mélanger","把鸡蛋和面粉放在一起，用筷子搅拌均匀。","bǎ jī dàn hé miàn fěn fàng zài yì qǐ yòng kuài zi jiǎo bàn jūn yún","Put the eggs and flour together and stir them evenly with chopsticks.","Pon los huevos y la harina juntos y mézclalos bien con los palillos.","Mets les œufs et la farine ensemble et mélange bien avec les baguettes."],["L7-2071","缴","jiǎo","V","to hand in; to pay","entregar; pagar","remettre; payer","租房合同规定，房租必须在每月五号以前缴清。","zū fáng hé tóng guī dìng fáng zū bì xū zài měi yuè wǔ hào yǐ qián jiǎo qīng","The lease stipulates that rent must be paid in full before the fifth of each month.","El contrato de alquiler estipula que la renta debe pagarse por completo antes del día cinco de cada mes.","Le bail stipule que le loyer doit être intégralement réglé avant le 5 de chaque mois."],["L7-2072","缴费","jiǎofèi","V","to pay a fee","pagar una cuota","payer des frais","现在用手机就可以缴费，不用再去银行排队了。","xiàn zài yòng shǒu jī jiù kě yǐ jiǎo fèi bú yòng zài qù yín háng pái duì le","Now you can pay bills with your phone, so you no longer have to queue at the bank.","Ahora se pueden pagar las cuentas con el celular, así que ya no hay que hacer fila en el banco.","Maintenant, on peut payer ses factures avec son téléphone, plus besoin de faire la queue à la banque."],["L7-2073","缴纳","jiǎonà","V","to pay (taxes)","pagar (impuestos)","payer (impôts)","企业应该依法按时缴纳税款。","qǐ yè yīng gāi yī fǎ àn shí jiǎo nà shuì kuǎn","Enterprises should pay their taxes on time according to law.","Las empresas deben pagar sus impuestos a tiempo conforme a la ley.","Les entreprises doivent acquitter leurs impôts à temps conformément à la loi."],["L7-2074","叫板","jiàobǎn","","to cue the musicians (opera)","dar la entrada a los músicos","donner le signal aux musiciens","这家新公司公开向行业老大叫板。","zhè jiā xīn gōng sī gōng kāi xiàng háng yè lǎo dà jiào bǎn","This new company openly challenged the industry leader.","Esta nueva empresa desafió abiertamente al líder del sector.","Cette nouvelle entreprise a ouvertement défié le leader du secteur."],["L7-2075","叫好","jiàohǎo","","to applaud; to cheer","aplaudir; vitorear","applaudir; acclamer","他的精彩表演赢得了观众的阵阵叫好。","tā de jīng cǎi biǎo yǎn yíng dé le guān zhòng de zhèn zhèn jiào hǎo","His brilliant performance won round after round of cheers from the audience.","Su brillante actuación le valió una y otra vez los vítores del público.","Sa brillante prestation lui a valu les acclamations répétées du public."],["L7-2076","轿车","jiàochē","N","car; sedan","automóvil; sedán","voiture; berline","他攒了好几年钱，终于买了一辆小轿车。","tā zǎn le hǎo jǐ nián qián zhōng yú mǎi le yí liàng xiǎo jiào chē","He saved for several years and finally bought a car.","Ahorró dinero durante varios años y por fin se compró un auto.","Il a économisé pendant plusieurs années et a enfin acheté une voiture."],["L7-2077","较劲","jiàojìn","","to compete; to be at odds","competir; medir fuerzas","rivaliser; se mesurer","两个人都不服输，暗地里一直在较劲。","liǎng gè rén dōu bù fú shū àn dì lǐ yì zhí zài jiào jìn","Neither of them will admit defeat, and they've been quietly competing all along.","Ninguno de los dos quiere darse por vencido y han estado compitiendo en secreto todo este tiempo.","Aucun des deux ne veut s'avouer vaincu, et ils se livrent une lutte sourde depuis le début."],["L7-2078","较量","jiàoliàng","V","to compete; to contest","competir; medirse","rivaliser; se mesurer","这场比赛是两支强队之间的一次较量。","zhè chǎng bǐ sài shì liǎng zhī qiáng duì zhī jiān de yí cì jiào liàng","This match is a contest between two strong teams.","Este partido es un duelo entre dos equipos fuertes.","Ce match est un affrontement entre deux équipes fortes."],["L7-2079","教科书","jiàokēshū","N","textbook","libro de texto","manuel scolaire","这本教科书是由几位资深教师共同编写的。","zhè běn jiào kē shū shì yóu jǐ wèi zī shēn jiào shī gòng tóng biān xiě de","This textbook was jointly written by several senior teachers.","Este libro de texto fue escrito conjuntamente por varios profesores con mucha experiencia.","Ce manuel a été rédigé conjointement par plusieurs enseignants chevronnés."],["L7-2080","教条","jiàotiáo","N/Adj","dogma; dogmatic","dogma; dogmático","dogme; dogmatique","学习理论不能死守教条，要结合实际情况。","xué xí lǐ lùn bù néng sǐ shǒu jiào tiáo yào jié hé shí jì qíng kuàng","When studying theory you can't cling rigidly to dogma; you must combine it with actual conditions.","Al estudiar teoría no hay que aferrarse a los dogmas; hay que tener en cuenta la situación real.","Quand on étudie la théorie, il ne faut pas s'accrocher aux dogmes ; il faut tenir compte de la réalité."],["L7-2081","教养","jiàoyǎng","V/N","to bring up; upbringing","educar; educación","éduquer; éducation","一个人有没有教养，从说话的态度就能看出来。","yí ge rén yǒu méi yǒu jiào yǎng cóng shuō huà de tài dù jiù néng kàn chū lái","Whether a person is well brought up can be seen from the way they speak.","Se nota si una persona tiene buena educación por la forma en que habla.","On voit si une personne est bien élevée à sa manière de parler."],["L7-2082","阶层","jiēcéng","N","social class","clase social","classe sociale","社会各阶层的人都对这项政策表示关注。","shè huì gè jiē céng de rén dōu duì zhè xiàng zhèng cè biǎo shì guān zhù","People from all strata of society have shown concern about this policy.","Personas de todos los estratos de la sociedad han mostrado interés por esta política.","Des gens de toutes les couches de la société se sont montrés attentifs à cette politique."],["L7-2083","阶级","jiējí","N","social class","clase social","classe sociale","这本小说描写了不同阶级之间的冲突。","zhè běn xiǎo shuō miáo xiě le bù tóng jiē jí zhī jiān de chōng tū","This novel depicts conflicts between different classes.","Esta novela describe los conflictos entre distintas clases sociales.","Ce roman décrit les conflits entre différentes classes sociales."],["L7-2084","阶梯","jiētī","N","flight of steps; stepping stone","escalera; peldaño","escalier; marche","知识是人类进步的阶梯。","zhī shi shì rén lèi jìn bù de jiē tī","Knowledge is the ladder of human progress.","El conocimiento es la escalera del progreso de la humanidad.","Le savoir est l'échelle du progrès de l'humanité."],["L7-2085","皆","jiē","Adv","all; each and every","todos; todo","tous; tout","这两种付款方式皆可，您看哪种方便？","zhè liǎng zhǒng fù kuǎn fāng shì jiē kě nín kàn nǎ zhǒng fāng biàn","Either of these two payment methods is fine — which is more convenient for you?","Cualquiera de estas dos formas de pago sirve. ¿Cuál le resulta más cómoda?","L'un ou l'autre de ces deux modes de paiement convient. Lequel vous arrange le mieux ?"],["L7-2086","结","jiē","V","to bear fruit","dar fruto","porter des fruits","秋天到了，菜园里结了好几个大南瓜。","qiū tiān dào le cài yuán lǐ jiē le hǎo jǐ ge dà nán guā","Autumn has come, and several big pumpkins have grown in the vegetable garden.","Llegó el otoño y en la huerta han crecido varias calabazas grandes.","L'automne est arrivé et plusieurs grosses citrouilles ont poussé dans le potager."],["L7-2087","结果","jiēguǒ","","to bear fruit; result","dar fruto; resultado","porter des fruits; résultat","比赛结果将在明天上午揭晓。","bǐ sài jié guǒ jiāng zài míng tiān shàng wǔ jiē xiǎo","The results of the competition will be announced tomorrow morning.","El resultado del concurso se dará a conocer mañana por la mañana.","Les résultats du concours seront annoncés demain matin."],["L7-2088","接班","jiēbān","","to take over a shift","relevar el turno","prendre la relève","老厂长退休以后，由他的副手接班。","lǎo chǎng zhǎng tuì xiū yǐ hòu yóu tā de fù shǒu jiē bān","After the old factory director retired, his deputy took over.","Cuando el viejo director de la fábrica se jubiló, su adjunto tomó el relevo.","Après le départ à la retraite de l'ancien directeur de l'usine, son adjoint a pris la relève."],["L7-2089","接班人","jiēbānrén","N","successor","sucesor","successeur","公司正在培养年轻的接班人。","gōng sī zhèng zài péi yǎng nián qīng de jiē bān rén","The company is training young successors.","La empresa está formando a jóvenes sucesores.","L'entreprise est en train de former de jeunes successeurs."],["L7-2090","接二连三","jiē'èr-liánsān","","one after another","uno tras otro","l'un après l'autre","这段时间，坏消息接二连三地传来。","zhè duàn shí jiān huài xiāo xi jiē èr lián sān de chuán lái","Lately, bad news has been coming in one piece after another.","En este tiempo han llegado malas noticias una tras otra.","Ces temps-ci, les mauvaises nouvelles se succèdent sans arrêt."],["L7-2091","接轨","jiēguǐ","","to integrate; to connect","conectar; alinearse con","s'aligner sur; se raccorder","我国的教育制度正在逐步与国际接轨。","wǒ guó de jiào yù zhì dù zhèng zài zhú bù yǔ guó jì jiē guǐ","Our country's education system is gradually being brought into line with international standards.","El sistema educativo de nuestro país se va alineando poco a poco con los estándares internacionales.","Le système éducatif de notre pays s'aligne progressivement sur les standards internationaux."],["L7-2092","接济","jiējì","V","to give material aid","ayudar materialmente","aider matériellement","他经常拿出自己的工资接济生活困难的学生。","tā jīng cháng ná chū zì jǐ de gōng zī jiē jì shēng huó kùn nan de xué shēng","He often uses his own salary to help students who are struggling financially.","A menudo usa su propio sueldo para ayudar a estudiantes con dificultades económicas.","Il utilise souvent son propre salaire pour aider des étudiants en difficulté financière."],["L7-2093","接见","jiējiàn","V","to receive (a visitor)","recibir (a alguien)","recevoir (un visiteur)","市长接见了参加比赛的全体运动员。","shì zhǎng jiē jiàn le cān jiā bǐ sài de quán tǐ yùn dòng yuán","The mayor received all the athletes taking part in the competition.","El alcalde recibió a todos los atletas que participaron en la competencia.","Le maire a reçu tous les athlètes ayant participé à la compétition."],["L7-2094","接力","jiēlì","V","relay","relevo","relais","运动会的最后一个项目是四百米接力。","yùn dòng huì de zuì hòu yí ge xiàng mù shì sì bǎi mǐ jiē lì","The last event of the sports meet is the four-hundred-meter relay.","La última prueba de la competencia deportiva es el relevo de cuatrocientos metros.","La dernière épreuve de la compétition sportive est le relais de quatre cents mètres."],["L7-2095","接纳","jiēnà","V","to admit (as member)","admitir; aceptar","admettre; accueillir","这个社区热情地接纳了来自外地的新居民。","zhè ge shè qū rè qíng de jiē nà le lái zì wài dì de xīn jū mín","This community warmly welcomed the new residents from other places.","Esta comunidad acogió con calidez a los nuevos residentes llegados de otros lugares.","Ce quartier a chaleureusement accueilli les nouveaux habitants venus d'ailleurs."],["L7-2096","接手","jiēshǒu","V","to take over","asumir; hacerse cargo","prendre en charge; reprendre","原来的负责人调走了，这个项目由小王接手。","yuán lái de fù zé rén diào zǒu le zhè ge xiàng mù yóu xiǎo wáng jiē shǒu","The original person in charge was transferred, so Xiao Wang took over this project.","El responsable anterior fue trasladado, así que Xiao Wang se hizo cargo de este proyecto.","Le responsable précédent a été muté, et c'est Xiao Wang qui a repris ce projet."],["L7-2097","接送","jiēsòng","V","to pick up and drop off","llevar y recoger","conduire et raccompagner","爷爷每天负责接送孙子上下学。","yé ye měi tiān fù zé jiē sòng sūn zi shàng xià xué","Grandpa is responsible for taking his grandson to and from school every day.","El abuelo se encarga todos los días de llevar y recoger a su nieto de la escuela.","Grand-père est chargé d'accompagner et d'aller chercher son petit-fils à l'école tous les jours."],["L7-2098","接替","jiētì","V","to replace; to take over","reemplazar; relevar","remplacer; prendre la relève","王老师生病期间，由李老师接替她上课。","wáng lǎo shī shēng bìng qī jiān yóu lǐ lǎo shī jiē tì tā shàng kè","While Ms. Wang is ill, Ms. Li is taking over her classes.","Mientras la profesora Wang está enferma, la profesora Li la reemplaza en las clases.","Pendant la maladie de Mme Wang, Mme Li la remplace pour ses cours."],["L7-2099","接听","jiētīng","V","to answer the phone","contestar el teléfono","répondre au téléphone","开会的时候不方便接听电话，请稍后再打。","kāi huì de shí hou bù fāng biàn jiē tīng diàn huà qǐng shāo hòu zài dǎ","It's inconvenient to answer the phone during the meeting; please call back later.","Durante la reunión no es conveniente contestar llamadas; por favor, llame más tarde.","Il n'est pas commode de répondre au téléphone pendant la réunion ; veuillez rappeler plus tard."],["L7-2100","接通","jiētōng","V","to connect; to put through","conectar; poner en comunicación","connecter; mettre en communication","电话一接通，她就激动得说不出话来。","diàn huà yì jiē tōng tā jiù jī dòng de shuō bu chū huà lái","As soon as the call went through, she was too excited to speak.","En cuanto se conectó la llamada, ella se emocionó tanto que no pudo decir nada.","Dès que la communication a été établie, elle était si émue qu'elle n'a pas pu dire un mot."],["L7-2101","揭发","jiēfā","V","to expose; to reveal","denunciar; sacar a la luz","dénoncer; révéler","一名员工勇敢地揭发了公司的违法行为。","yì míng yuán gōng yǒng gǎn de jiē fā le gōng sī de wéi fǎ xíng wéi","An employee courageously exposed the company's illegal conduct.","Un empleado denunció con valentía las actividades ilegales de la empresa.","Un employé a courageusement dénoncé les agissements illégaux de l'entreprise."],["L7-2102","揭露","jiēlù","V","to expose; to unmask","desenmascarar; revelar","démasquer; révéler","这部小说揭露了官场中种种丑恶的现象。","zhè bù xiǎo shuō jiē lù le guān chǎng zhōng zhǒng zhǒng chǒu è de xiàn xiàng","This novel exposes all kinds of ugly practices in officialdom.","Esta novela expone toda clase de fenómenos repugnantes del mundo burocrático.","Ce roman dénonce toutes sortes de pratiques répugnantes dans le milieu des fonctionnaires."],["L7-2103","揭示","jiēshì","V","to show; to reveal","mostrar; revelar","montrer; révéler","这部小说深刻地揭示了人性的复杂。","zhè bù xiǎo shuō shēn kè de jiē shì le rén xìng de fù zá","This novel profoundly reveals the complexity of human nature.","Esta novela revela con profundidad la complejidad de la naturaleza humana.","Ce roman révèle avec profondeur la complexité de la nature humaine."],["L7-2104","揭晓","jiēxiǎo","V","to announce publicly","anunciar públicamente","annoncer publiquement","比赛结果将在明天上午揭晓。","bǐ sài jié guǒ jiāng zài míng tiān shàng wǔ jiē xiǎo","The results of the competition will be announced tomorrow morning.","El resultado del concurso se dará a conocer mañana por la mañana.","Les résultats du concours seront annoncés demain matin."],["L7-2105","节俭","jiéjiǎn","Adj","frugal","frugal; ahorrador","frugal; économe","这个民族自古以来就崇尚勤劳节俭。","zhè ge mín zú zì gǔ yǐ lái jiù chóng shàng qín láo jié jiǎn","Since ancient times this people has held hard work and thrift in high esteem.","Desde la antigüedad, este pueblo ha valorado el trabajo duro y la austeridad.","Depuis l'Antiquité, ce peuple tient en haute estime le travail acharné et la frugalité."],["L7-2106","节气","jiéqì","N","solar term","término solar","terme solaire","二十四节气是古人根据太阳运行总结出来的。","èr shí sì jié qì shì gǔ rén gēn jù tài yáng yùn xíng zǒng jié chū lái de","The twenty-four solar terms were worked out by the ancients based on the movement of the sun.","Los veinticuatro términos solares fueron sintetizados por los antiguos a partir del movimiento del sol.","Les vingt-quatre termes solaires ont été établis par les anciens d'après le mouvement du soleil."],["L7-2107","节水","jiéshuǐ","V","to save water","ahorrar agua","économiser l'eau","这种新型马桶非常节水，每次只用三升水。","zhè zhǒng xīn xíng mǎ tǒng fēi cháng jié shuǐ měi cì zhǐ yòng sān shēng shuǐ","This new type of toilet saves a lot of water, using only three liters per flush.","Este nuevo tipo de inodoro ahorra mucha agua: solo usa tres litros por descarga.","Ce nouveau type de toilettes économise beaucoup d'eau : trois litres seulement par chasse."],["L7-2108","节衣缩食","jiéyī-suōshí","","to live frugally","vivir con austeridad","vivre frugalement","为了供孩子上大学，父母节衣缩食了好几年。","wèi le gōng hái zi shàng dà xué fù mǔ jié yī suō shí le hǎo jǐ nián","To put their child through university, the parents tightened their belts for several years.","Para costear los estudios universitarios de su hijo, los padres se apretaron el cinturón durante varios años.","Pour payer les études universitaires de leur enfant, les parents se sont serré la ceinture pendant plusieurs années."],["L7-2109","劫","jié","V","calamity; robbery","desastre; robo","calamité; vol","他晚上回家的路上被人劫了，钱包和手机都没了。","tā wǎn shang huí jiā de lù shang bèi rén jié le qián bāo hé shǒu jī dōu méi le","He was robbed on his way home at night and lost both his wallet and phone.","Lo asaltaron de noche cuando volvía a casa y perdió la cartera y el celular.","Il s'est fait voler en rentrant chez lui le soir et a perdu son portefeuille et son téléphone."],["L7-2110","劫持","jiéchí","V","to hijack; to kidnap","secuestrar","détourner; enlever","这部电影讲的是一架飞机被劫持后的故事。","zhè bù diàn yǐng jiǎng de shì yí jià fēi jī bèi jié chí hòu de gù shi","This film tells the story of what happens after a plane is hijacked.","Esta película cuenta la historia de lo que sucede después de que secuestran un avión.","Ce film raconte ce qui arrive après le détournement d'un avion."],["L7-2111","洁净","jiéjìng","Adj","clean; to cleanse","limpio; limpiar","propre; nettoyer","这家医院的病房宽敞洁净，让人感觉很舒服。","zhè jiā yī yuàn de bìng fáng kuān chang jié jìng ràng rén gǎn jué hěn shū fu","The wards in this hospital are spacious and spotless, which makes people feel at ease.","Las habitaciones de este hospital son amplias e impecables, y hacen que uno se sienta cómodo.","Les chambres de cet hôpital sont spacieuses et impeccables, ce qui met à l'aise."],["L7-2112","结冰","jiébīng","V","to freeze","congelarse","geler","因跑道结冰，故本次航班推迟起飞。","yīn pǎo dào jié bīng gù běn cì háng bān tuī chí qǐ fēi","Because the runway is icy, this flight's departure is delayed.","Debido a que la pista está congelada, el despegue de este vuelo se retrasa.","La piste étant verglacée, le décollage de ce vol est retardé."],["L7-2113","结晶","jiéjīng","N","crystal; crystallization; fruit","cristal; cristalización; fruto","cristal; cristallisation; fruit","这部作品是他十年心血的结晶。","zhè bù zuò pǐn shì tā shí nián xīn xuè de jié jīng","This work is the fruit of ten years of his painstaking effort.","Esta obra es el fruto de diez años de esfuerzo y dedicación suyos.","Cette œuvre est le fruit de dix ans de labeur de sa part."],["L7-2114","结局","jiéjú","N","ending; outcome","desenlace; final","dénouement; fin","这个故事的结局，我们下期再讲。","zhè ge gù shi de jié jú wǒ men xià qī zài jiǎng","We'll tell the ending of this story in the next issue.","El final de esta historia lo contaremos en la próxima entrega.","Nous raconterons la fin de cette histoire dans le prochain numéro."],["L7-2115","结识","jiéshí","V","to get to know","conocer; entablar amistad","faire connaissance","他在国外结识了不少友人。","tā zài guó wài jié shí le bù shǎo yǒu rén","He made quite a few friends abroad.","En el extranjero conoció a bastantes amigos.","À l'étranger, il s'est fait pas mal d'amis."],["L7-2116","结尾","jiéwěi","V/N","ending; to wind up","final; terminar","fin; terminer","这篇文章的结尾写得很感人。","zhè piān wén zhāng de jié wěi xiě de hěn gǎn rén","The ending of this essay is very moving.","El final de este artículo está escrito de forma muy conmovedora.","La fin de cet article est très émouvante."],["L7-2117","截","jié","V/M","to cut off; section","cortar; tramo","couper; tronçon","他用锯子从长木头上截下一段，做成了小板凳。","tā yòng jù zi cóng cháng mù tou shàng jié xià yí duàn zuò chéng le xiǎo bǎn dèng","He sawed a section off the long piece of wood and made it into a small stool.","Con una sierra cortó un trozo de un tronco largo y con él hizo un banquito.","Avec une scie, il a coupé un morceau dans une longue bûche et en a fait un petit tabouret."],["L7-2118","截然不同","jiérán-bùtóng","","entirely different","completamente distinto","totalement différent","双胞胎兄弟长得一模一样，性格却截然不同。","shuāng bāo tāi xiōng dì zhǎng de yì mú yí yàng xìng gé què jié rán bù tóng","The twin brothers look exactly alike, yet their personalities are completely different.","Los hermanos gemelos son idénticos, pero sus personalidades son completamente distintas.","Les frères jumeaux se ressemblent comme deux gouttes d'eau, mais leurs caractères sont tout à fait différents."],["L7-2119","竭尽全力","jiéjìn-quánlì","","to spare no effort","no escatimar esfuerzos","ne ménager aucun effort","医生们竭尽全力抢救，终于让病人脱离了危险。","yī shēng men jié jìn quán lì qiǎng jiù zhōng yú ràng bìng rén tuō lí le wēi xiǎn","The doctors did everything in their power and finally brought the patient out of danger.","Los médicos hicieron todo lo posible por salvarlo y por fin lograron sacar al paciente del peligro.","Les médecins ont tout fait pour le sauver et ont fini par tirer le patient d'affaire."],["L7-2120","竭力","jiélì","Adv","to do one's utmost","esforzarse al máximo","faire de son mieux","朋友们竭力挽留他，但他还是决定离开。","péng you men jié lì wǎn liú tā dàn tā hái shi jué dìng lí kāi","His friends tried their hardest to make him stay, but he still decided to leave.","Sus amigos hicieron todo lo posible por retenerlo, pero aun así decidió irse.","Ses amis ont tout fait pour le retenir, mais il a quand même décidé de partir."],["L7-2121","解答","jiědá","V","to solve; to answer","resolver; responder","résoudre; répondre","老师耐心地解答了同学们提出的每一个问题。","lǎo shī nài xīn de jiě dá le tóng xué men tí chū de měi yí ge wèn tí","The teacher patiently answered every question the students raised.","La maestra respondió con paciencia cada una de las preguntas de los alumnos.","Le professeur a répondu patiemment à chacune des questions des élèves."],["L7-2122","解读","jiědú","V","to decipher; to interpret","descifrar; interpretar","déchiffrer; interpréter","专家在电视上解读了新出台的住房政策。","zhuān jiā zài diàn shì shàng jiě dú le xīn chū tái de zhù fáng zhèng cè","Experts explained the newly introduced housing policy on television.","Unos expertos explicaron en televisión la política de vivienda recién anunciada.","Des experts ont décrypté à la télévision la nouvelle politique du logement."],["L7-2123","解雇","jiěgù","V","to fire; to dismiss","despedir","licencier","公司不能没有正当理由就随便解雇员工。","gōng sī bù néng méi yǒu zhèng dàng lǐ yóu jiù suí biàn jiě gù yuán gōng","A company cannot dismiss employees arbitrarily without good reason.","Una empresa no puede despedir a sus empleados a su antojo sin una causa justificada.","Une entreprise ne peut pas licencier ses employés à sa guise sans motif légitime."],["L7-2124","解救","jiějiù","V","to rescue","rescatar; salvar","secourir; sauver","经过警方的努力，人质全部被安全解救。","jīng guò jǐng fāng de nǔ lì rén zhì quán bù bèi ān quán jiě jiù","Through the efforts of the police, all the hostages were rescued safely.","Gracias a los esfuerzos de la policía, todos los rehenes fueron rescatados sanos y salvos.","Grâce aux efforts de la police, tous les otages ont été libérés sains et saufs."],["L7-2125","解剖","jiěpōu","V","to dissect; to analyze","disecar; analizar","disséquer; analyser","医学院的学生要上解剖课，了解人体结构。","yī xué yuàn de xué shēng yào shàng jiě pōu kè liǎo jiě rén tǐ jié gòu","Medical students must take anatomy classes to learn the structure of the human body.","Los estudiantes de medicina tienen clases de anatomía para conocer la estructura del cuerpo humano.","Les étudiants en médecine suivent des cours d'anatomie pour connaître la structure du corps humain."],["L7-2126","解散","jiěsàn","V","to dissolve; to disband","disolver","dissoudre","由于成员越来越少，这个乐队最终解散了。","yóu yú chéng yuán yuè lái yuè shǎo zhè ge yuè duì zuì zhōng jiě sàn le","As it lost more and more members, this band eventually broke up.","Como cada vez tenía menos integrantes, la banda terminó disolviéndose.","Comme il avait de moins en moins de membres, le groupe a fini par se séparer."],["L7-2127","解体","jiětǐ","V","to disintegrate; to collapse","desintegrarse; desmoronarse","se désintégrer; s'effondrer","这家大企业解体以后，分成了几家小公司。","zhè jiā dà qǐ yè jiě tǐ yǐ hòu fēn chéng le jǐ jiā xiǎo gōng sī","After this large enterprise broke up, it split into several smaller companies.","Tras la desintegración de esta gran empresa, se dividió en varias compañías pequeñas.","Après l'éclatement de cette grande entreprise, elle s'est scindée en plusieurs petites sociétés."],["L7-2128","解脱","jiětuō","V","to free oneself; to absolve","liberarse; absolver","se libérer; absoudre","退休以后，他终于从繁忙的工作中解脱出来了。","tuì xiū yǐ hòu tā zhōng yú cóng fán máng de gōng zuò zhōng jiě tuō chū lái le","After retiring, he was at last freed from his busy work.","Después de jubilarse, por fin se liberó del trabajo tan agitado.","Une fois à la retraite, il s'est enfin libéré d'un travail très prenant."],["L7-2129","解围","jiěwéi","","to lift a siege; to help out","levantar un asedio; sacar de apuros","lever un siège; tirer d'embarras","看到朋友被问得说不出话，我赶紧帮他解围。","kàn dào péng you bèi wèn de shuō bu chū huà wǒ gǎn jǐn bāng tā jiě wéi","Seeing my friend stuck for words under questioning, I quickly helped him out.","Al ver que a mi amigo le preguntaban tanto que no sabía qué decir, enseguida lo saqué del apuro.","Voyant mon ami à court de mots sous le feu des questions, je suis vite venu à son secours."],["L7-2130","解析","jiěxī","V","to analyze; analysis","analizar; análisis","analyser; analyse","老师把这道难题的解题思路解析得清清楚楚。","lǎo shī bǎ zhè dào nán tí de jiě tí sī lù jiě xī de qīng qīng chu chǔ","The teacher analyzed the approach to this difficult problem very clearly.","La maestra analizó con total claridad el planteamiento para resolver este difícil problema.","Le professeur a analysé très clairement la démarche pour résoudre ce problème difficile."],["L7-2131","介入","jièrù","V","to intervene","intervenir","intervenir","这起纠纷已经有律师介入了。","zhè qǐ jiū fēn yǐ jīng yǒu lǜ shī jiè rù le","Lawyers have already become involved in this dispute.","En esta disputa ya han intervenido abogados.","Des avocats sont déjà intervenus dans ce litige."],["L7-2132","介意","jièyì","","to mind; to take offense","importar; ofenderse","se soucier; s'offusquer","我在这里抽支烟，你介意吗？","wǒ zài zhè lǐ chōu zhī yān nǐ jiè yì ma","Do you mind if I smoke here?","Voy a fumar un cigarrillo aquí, ¿te molesta?","Je vais fumer une cigarette ici, ça te dérange ?"],["L7-2133","介于","jièyú","V","between; to lie between","estar entre; intermedio","se situer entre","这里的气候介于南方和北方之间，四季分明。","zhè lǐ de qì hòu jiè yú nán fāng hé běi fāng zhī jiān sì jì fēn míng","The climate here is between that of the south and the north, with four distinct seasons.","El clima de aquí está entre el del sur y el del norte, con cuatro estaciones bien definidas.","Le climat d'ici se situe entre celui du sud et celui du nord, avec quatre saisons bien marquées."],["L7-2134","戒备","jièbèi","V","to take precautions","estar en guardia","se tenir sur ses gardes","大型活动期间，警方加强了戒备。","dà xíng huó dòng qī jiān jǐng fāng jiā qiáng le jiè bèi","During the large event, the police stepped up security.","Durante el gran evento, la policía reforzó la vigilancia.","Pendant cet événement de grande ampleur, la police a renforcé la sécurité."],["L7-2135","戒烟","jiè yān","","to quit smoking","dejar de fumar","arrêter de fumer","听完医生的话，他当下就决定戒烟。","tīng wán yī shēng de huà tā dāng xià jiù jué dìng jiè yān","After hearing what the doctor said, he decided on the spot to quit smoking.","Después de escuchar al médico, decidió en el acto dejar de fumar.","Après avoir écouté le médecin, il a décidé sur-le-champ d'arrêter de fumer."],["L7-2136","戒指","jièzhi","N","ring","anillo","bague","她的戒指上镶着一颗小钻石。","tā de jiè zhi shàng xiāng zhe yì kē xiǎo zuàn shí","Her ring is set with a small diamond.","Su anillo lleva engastado un pequeño diamante.","Sa bague est sertie d'un petit diamant."],["L7-2137","届时","jièshí","Adv","at that time","llegado el momento","le moment venu","新图书馆下个月开放，届时欢迎大家参观。","xīn tú shū guǎn xià ge yuè kāi fàng jiè shí huān yíng dà jiā cān guān","The new library opens next month, and everyone is welcome to visit then.","La nueva biblioteca abrirá el próximo mes; para entonces, todos están invitados a visitarla.","La nouvelle bibliothèque ouvrira le mois prochain ; vous serez alors tous les bienvenus pour la visiter."],["L7-2138","界定","jièdìng","V","to define; definition","definir; definición","définir; définition","这个概念很难准确界定，学者们的看法也不一样。","zhè ge gài niàn hěn nán zhǔn què jiè dìng xué zhě men de kàn fǎ yě bù yí yàng","This concept is hard to define precisely, and scholars differ in their views.","Este concepto es difícil de definir con precisión y los estudiosos tienen opiniones distintas.","Ce concept est difficile à définir avec précision, et les chercheurs ne sont pas du même avis."],["L7-2139","界限","jièxiàn","N","boundary; limit","límite; frontera","limite; frontière","亲人之间也应尊重彼此的界限，不能以关心为名干涉所有决定。","qīn rén zhī jiān yě yīng zūn zhòng bǐ cǐ de jiè xiàn bù néng yǐ guān xīn wéi míng gān shè suǒ yǒu jué dìng","Family members should also respect one another's boundaries rather than interfere in every decision in the name of care.","Entre familiares también hay que respetar los límites de cada uno y no inmiscuirse en todas sus decisiones en nombre del cariño.","Entre proches, il faut aussi respecter les limites de chacun, et ne pas s'immiscer dans toutes les décisions au nom de l'affection."],["L7-2140","界线","jièxiàn","N","boundary line; limits","línea divisoria; límites","ligne de démarcation; limites","工作和生活之间要划清界线，才能休息好。","gōng zuò hé shēng huó zhī jiān yào huà qīng jiè xiàn cái néng xiū xi hǎo","You need to draw a clear line between work and life in order to rest well.","Hay que trazar una línea clara entre el trabajo y la vida personal para poder descansar bien.","Il faut tracer une frontière nette entre travail et vie privée pour bien se reposer."],["L7-2141","借口","jièkǒu","V/N","excuse; to use as pretext","excusa; pretexto","excuse; prétexte","他说的那些不过是借口罢了，你别当真。","tā shuō de nà xiē bú guò shì jiè kǒu bà le nǐ bié dàng zhēn","What he said is nothing but excuses; don't take it seriously.","Lo que dijo no son más que excusas; no lo tomes en serio.","Ce qu'il a dit n'est que prétexte, ne le prends pas au sérieux."],["L7-2142","借条","jiètiáo","N","IOU","pagaré","reconnaissance de dette","借钱给别人的时候，最好让对方写张借条。","jiè qián gěi bié rén de shí hou zuì hǎo ràng duì fāng xiě zhāng jiè tiáo","When lending money to someone, it's best to have them write an IOU.","Cuando le prestes dinero a alguien, lo mejor es que te firme un pagaré.","Quand on prête de l'argent à quelqu'un, mieux vaut lui faire signer une reconnaissance de dette."],["L7-2143","借用","jièyòng","V","to borrow for use","tomar prestado; aprovechar","emprunter; utiliser","能借用一下你的笔吗？我的没水了。","néng jiè yòng yí xià nǐ de bǐ ma wǒ de méi shuǐ le","Could I borrow your pen? Mine has run out of ink.","¿Me prestas tu bolígrafo? El mío se quedó sin tinta.","Je peux t'emprunter ton stylo ? Le mien n'a plus d'encre."],["L7-2144","借助","jièzhù","V","to draw on; with help of","valerse de; con ayuda de","s'aider de; grâce à","借助翻译软件，他看懂了这封外文邮件。","jiè zhù fān yì ruǎn jiàn tā kàn dǒng le zhè fēng wài wén yóu jiàn","With the help of translation software, he understood this foreign-language email.","Con la ayuda de un software de traducción, entendió este correo en otro idioma.","À l'aide d'un logiciel de traduction, il a compris ce courriel en langue étrangère."],["L7-2145","金属","jīnshǔ","N","metal","metal","métal","这种金属很轻，常用来制造飞机零件。","zhè zhǒng jīn shǔ hěn qīng cháng yòng lái zhì zào fēi jī líng jiàn","This metal is very light and is often used to make aircraft parts.","Este metal es muy ligero y se usa con frecuencia para fabricar piezas de avión.","Ce métal est très léger et sert souvent à fabriquer des pièces d'avion."],["L7-2146","金子","jīnzi","N","Kaneko (Japanese surname)","Kaneko (apellido japonés)","Kaneko (nom japonais)","俗话说，是金子总会发光的。","sú huà shuō shì jīn zi zǒng huì fā guāng de","As the saying goes, true gold will always shine.","Como dice el refrán, el oro siempre acaba brillando.","Comme dit le proverbe, l'or finit toujours par briller."],["L7-2147","金字塔","jīnzìtǎ","N","pyramid","pirámide","pyramide","埃及的金字塔已经有四千多年的历史了。","āi jí de jīn zì tǎ yǐ jīng yǒu sì qiān duō nián de lì shǐ le","The pyramids of Egypt are more than four thousand years old.","Las pirámides de Egipto tienen más de cuatro mil años de historia.","Les pyramides d'Égypte ont plus de quatre mille ans d'histoire."],["L7-2148","津津有味","jīnjīn-yǒuwèi","","with great relish","con gran interés; con gusto","avec grand plaisir","小狗趴在地上，津津有味地啃着一根骨头。","xiǎo gǒu pā zài dì shang jīn jīn yǒu wèi de kěn zhe yì gēn gǔ tou","The puppy lay on the ground, happily gnawing on a bone.","El perrito, echado en el suelo, roía un hueso con muchísimo gusto.","Le chiot, couché par terre, rongeait un os avec délectation."],["L7-2149","津贴","jīntiē","N","allowance; subsidy","subsidio; prestación","allocation; indemnité","在高原地区工作的员工每月可以领取额外的津贴。","zài gāo yuán dì qū gōng zuò de yuán gōng měi yuè kě yǐ lǐng qǔ é wài de jīn tiē","Employees working in high-altitude areas receive an extra monthly allowance.","Los empleados que trabajan en zonas de gran altitud reciben cada mes un subsidio adicional.","Les employés qui travaillent en haute altitude perçoivent chaque mois une indemnité supplémentaire."],["L7-2150","筋","jīn","N","muscle; tendon","músculo; tendón","muscle; tendon","这块牛肉的筋太多，炖了很久还是嚼不动。","zhè kuài niú ròu de jīn tài duō dùn le hěn jiǔ hái shi jiáo bú dòng","This beef has too much sinew; even after stewing for a long time it's still too tough to chew.","Esta carne de res tiene demasiados nervios; aun después de cocerla mucho tiempo sigue siendo imposible de masticar.","Ce bœuf a trop de nerfs ; même après une longue cuisson, il reste impossible à mâcher."],["L7-2151","禁不住","jīnbuzhù","V","can't help (doing)","no poder evitar","ne pas pouvoir s'empêcher","听到这个好消息，她禁不住流下了眼泪。","tīng dào zhè ge hǎo xiāo xi tā jīn bu zhù liú xià le yǎn lèi","Hearing the good news, she couldn't help shedding tears.","Al oír la buena noticia, no pudo evitar derramar lágrimas.","En apprenant la bonne nouvelle, elle n'a pu s'empêcher de verser des larmes."],["L7-2152","仅次于","jǐn cì yú","","second only to","solo superado por","second après","这座城市的人口仅次于首都，排名全国第二。","zhè zuò chéng shì de rén kǒu jǐn cì yú shǒu dū pái míng quán guó dì èr","This city's population is second only to the capital's, ranking second in the country.","La población de esta ciudad solo es superada por la de la capital y ocupa el segundo lugar del país.","La population de cette ville n'est dépassée que par celle de la capitale ; elle se classe deuxième du pays."],["L7-2153","尽","jǐn","V/Adv","to the utmost; to exhaust","al máximo; agotar","au maximum; épuiser","依法纳税是每个公民应尽的义务。","yī fǎ nà shuì shì měi ge gōng mín yīng jìn de yì wù","Paying taxes according to law is every citizen's duty.","Pagar impuestos conforme a la ley es una obligación de todo ciudadano.","Payer ses impôts conformément à la loi est un devoir de tout citoyen."],["L7-2154","尽早","jǐnzǎo","Adv","as early as possible","lo antes posible","le plus tôt possible","发现自己生病了，一定要尽早去医院检查。","fā xiàn zì jǐ shēng bìng le yí dìng yào jǐn zǎo qù yī yuàn jiǎn chá","If you find you're ill, be sure to get checked at the hospital as early as possible.","Si te das cuenta de que estás enfermo, ve cuanto antes al hospital a que te revisen.","Si vous vous découvrez malade, allez vous faire examiner à l'hôpital le plus tôt possible."],["L7-2155","紧凑","jǐncòu","Adj","compact; tight","compacto; apretado","compact; serré","这部电影剧情紧凑，从头到尾都很吸引人。","zhè bù diàn yǐng jù qíng jǐn còu cóng tóu dào wěi dōu hěn xī yǐn rén","This film has a tight plot and is gripping from beginning to end.","Esta película tiene una trama muy compacta y resulta cautivadora de principio a fin.","L'intrigue de ce film est serrée et captivante du début à la fin."],["L7-2156","紧接着","jǐn jiēzhe","","immediately after","inmediatamente después","tout de suite après","他先打了个喷嚏，紧接着又咳嗽起来。","tā xiān dǎ le gè pēn tì jǐn jiē zhe yòu ké sou qǐ lái","First he sneezed, and right after that he started coughing.","Primero estornudó y enseguida empezó a toser.","Il a d'abord éternué, puis s'est mis à tousser aussitôt après."],["L7-2157","紧迫","jǐnpò","Adj","urgent; pressing","urgente; apremiante","urgent; pressant","时间紧迫，我们必须在今天之内完成任务。","shí jiān jǐn pò wǒ men bì xū zài jīn tiān zhī nèi wán chéng rèn wu","Time is pressing, and we must finish the task today.","El tiempo apremia y tenemos que terminar la tarea hoy mismo.","Le temps presse et nous devons terminer la tâche aujourd'hui même."],["L7-2158","紧缺","jǐnquē","Adj","in short supply","escaso","en pénurie","这个地区医生紧缺，很多病人看病要等很久。","zhè ge dì qū yī shēng jǐn quē hěn duō bìng rén kàn bìng yào děng hěn jiǔ","Doctors are in short supply in this region, and many patients have to wait a long time.","En esta zona escasean los médicos y muchos pacientes tienen que esperar mucho para ser atendidos.","Les médecins manquent dans cette région, et beaucoup de patients doivent attendre longtemps pour être soignés."],["L7-2159","紧缩","jǐnsuō","V","to cut back; to tighten","reducir; recortar","réduire; resserrer","由于经济不景气，很多公司都在紧缩开支。","yóu yú jīng jì bù jǐng qì hěn duō gōng sī dōu zài jǐn suō kāi zhī","Because of the economic downturn, many companies are cutting back on spending.","Debido a la recesión económica, muchas empresas están reduciendo sus gastos.","En raison de la morosité économique, beaucoup d'entreprises réduisent leurs dépenses."],["L7-2160","锦旗","jǐnqí","N","silk banner","pendón de seda","bannière de soie","病人家属给医生送来一面锦旗，表示感谢。","bìng rén jiā shǔ gěi yī shēng sòng lái yí miàn jǐn qí biǎo shì gǎn xiè","The patient's family presented the doctor with a silk banner to express their thanks.","Los familiares del paciente le entregaron al médico un estandarte de seda como muestra de agradecimiento.","La famille du patient a offert au médecin une bannière de soie en signe de remerciement."],["L7-2161","谨慎","jǐnshèn","Adj","cautious; prudent","cauteloso; prudente","prudent; circonspect","投资有风险，一定要谨慎做决定。","tóu zī yǒu fēng xiǎn yí dìng yào jǐn shèn zuò jué dìng","Investing is risky, so you must make decisions cautiously.","Invertir conlleva riesgos, así que hay que tomar las decisiones con cautela.","Investir comporte des risques ; il faut donc décider avec prudence."],["L7-2162","尽情","jìnqíng","Adv","to one's heart's content","a placer; a más no poder","à cœur joie","放假了，孩子们在海边尽情地玩耍。","fàng jià le hái zi men zài hǎi biān jìn qíng de wán shuǎ","The holiday has begun, and the children are playing to their hearts' content by the sea.","Ya es vacaciones y los niños juegan a sus anchas junto al mar.","Les vacances ont commencé et les enfants jouent à cœur joie au bord de la mer."],["L7-2163","尽头","jìntóu","N","end; limit","final; límite","bout; fin","沿着这条路走到尽头，就能看到那座小教堂。","yán zhe zhè tiáo lù zǒu dào jìn tóu jiù néng kàn dào nà zuò xiǎo jiào táng","Walk to the end of this road and you'll see the little church.","Sigue por este camino hasta el final y verás la pequeña iglesia.","Suivez cette route jusqu'au bout et vous verrez la petite église."],["L7-2164","进场","jìnchǎng","V","to enter the venue","entrar al recinto","entrer sur le site","比赛开始前一个小时，观众就可以进场了。","bǐ sài kāi shǐ qián yí ge xiǎo shí guān zhòng jiù kě yǐ jìn chǎng le","Spectators can enter the venue an hour before the match begins.","El público puede entrar al recinto una hora antes de que empiece el partido.","Les spectateurs peuvent entrer dans l'enceinte une heure avant le début du match."],["L7-2165","进程","jìnchéng","N","process; course","proceso; transcurso","processus; cours","互联网大大加快了全球化的进程。","hù lián wǎng dà dà jiā kuài le quán qiú huà de jìn chéng","The internet has greatly accelerated the process of globalization.","Internet ha acelerado enormemente el proceso de globalización.","Internet a considérablement accéléré le processus de mondialisation."],["L7-2166","进出","jìnchū","V","to go in and out","entrar y salir","entrer et sortir","这个小区管理很严，进出都要刷卡。","zhè ge xiǎo qū guǎn lǐ hěn yán jìn chū dōu yào shuā kǎ","This residential complex is strictly managed; you have to swipe a card to go in and out.","Este complejo residencial tiene un control muy estricto: para entrar y salir hay que pasar una tarjeta.","Cette résidence est très surveillée : il faut badger pour entrer et sortir."],["L7-2167","进出口","jìn-chūkǒu","","import and export","importación y exportación","import-export","今年上半年，我国进出口总额有所增长。","jīn nián shàng bàn nián wǒ guó jìn chū kǒu zǒng é yǒu suǒ zēng zhǎng","In the first half of this year, the country's total imports and exports grew somewhat.","En el primer semestre de este año, el total de importaciones y exportaciones del país aumentó ligeramente.","Au premier semestre de cette année, le total des importations et exportations du pays a quelque peu augmenté."],["L7-2168","进度","jìndù","N","progress; pace","avance; ritmo","progression; rythme","为了赶上工作进度，他这周每天都加班。","wèi le gǎn shàng gōng zuò jìn dù tā zhè zhōu měi tiān dōu jiā bān","To keep up with the work schedule, he worked overtime every day this week.","Para cumplir con el avance del trabajo, esta semana hizo horas extra todos los días.","Pour tenir le calendrier de travail, il a fait des heures supplémentaires tous les jours cette semaine."],["L7-2169","进而","jìn'ér","Conj","and then; furthermore","y luego; además","puis; en outre","先要了解客户的需求，进而提供合适的服务。","xiān yào liǎo jiě kè hù de xū qiú jìn ér tí gōng hé shì de fú wù","First you need to understand customers' needs, and then provide suitable services.","Primero hay que entender las necesidades del cliente y, a partir de ahí, ofrecerle un servicio adecuado.","Il faut d'abord comprendre les besoins du client, puis lui proposer un service adapté."],["L7-2170","进修","jìnxiū","V","to pursue further study","cursar estudios avanzados","suivre une formation continue","工作几年以后，她去国外进修了一年。","gōng zuò jǐ nián yǐ hòu tā qù guó wài jìn xiū le yì nián","After working for a few years, she went abroad for a year of further study.","Después de trabajar unos años, se fue al extranjero a hacer un año de estudios de perfeccionamiento.","Après quelques années de travail, elle est partie un an à l'étranger pour se perfectionner."],["L7-2171","近年来","jìnnián lái","","in recent years","en los últimos años","ces dernières années","近年来，人工智能技术飞速发展。","jìn nián lái rén gōng zhì néng jì shù fēi sù fā zhǎn","In recent years, artificial intelligence technology has developed at breakneck speed.","En los últimos años, la tecnología de inteligencia artificial se ha desarrollado a toda velocidad.","Ces dernières années, la technologie de l'intelligence artificielle s'est développée à une vitesse fulgurante."],["L7-2172","劲头","jìntóu","N","vigor; enthusiasm","energía; entusiasmo","énergie; entrain","一说要去旅游，孩子们的劲头就上来了。","yì shuō yào qù lǚ yóu hái zi men de jìn tóu jiù shàng lái le","As soon as a trip is mentioned, the children perk up with enthusiasm.","En cuanto se habla de ir de viaje, a los niños les entra el entusiasmo.","Dès qu'on parle de partir en voyage, les enfants s'enthousiasment."],["L7-2173","晋升","jìnshēng","V","to be promoted","ascender","être promu","由于工作出色，她今年晋升为部门经理。","yóu yú gōng zuò chū sè tā jīn nián jìn shēng wéi bù mén jīng lǐ","Because of her outstanding work, she was promoted to department manager this year.","Por su excelente desempeño, este año fue ascendida a gerente de departamento.","Grâce à l'excellence de son travail, elle a été promue cette année responsable de service."],["L7-2174","浸泡","jìnpào","V","to soak; to steep","remojar; sumergir","tremper; faire infuser","做豆浆之前，要先把黄豆浸泡一晚上。","zuò dòu jiāng zhī qián yào xiān bǎ huáng dòu jìn pào yì wǎn shang","Before making soy milk, you need to soak the soybeans overnight.","Antes de hacer leche de soya, hay que remojar los frijoles de soya toda la noche.","Avant de préparer du lait de soja, il faut faire tremper les graines de soja toute une nuit."],["L7-2175","禁忌","jìnjì","N/V","taboo; contraindication","tabú; contraindicación","tabou; contre-indication","服用这种药之前，请仔细阅读说明书中的禁忌。","fú yòng zhè zhǒng yào zhī qián qǐng zǐ xì yuè dú shuō míng shū zhōng de jìn jì","Before taking this medicine, please carefully read the contraindications listed in the package insert.","Antes de tomar este medicamento, lea con atención las contraindicaciones del prospecto.","Avant de prendre ce médicament, lisez attentivement les contre-indications figurant dans la notice."],["L7-2176","禁区","jìnqū","N","restricted area","zona prohibida","zone interdite","这里是军事禁区，游客不得随便进入。","zhè lǐ shì jūn shì jìn qū yóu kè bù dé suí biàn jìn rù","This is a restricted military zone, and tourists may not enter freely.","Esta es una zona militar restringida y los turistas no pueden entrar libremente.","Il s'agit d'une zone militaire interdite, et les touristes n'ont pas le droit d'y entrer librement."],["L7-2177","茎","jīng","N","stem; stalk","tallo","tige","这种植物的茎很细，但非常结实。","zhè zhǒng zhí wù de jīng hěn xì dàn fēi cháng jiē shi","The stem of this plant is very thin but very strong.","El tallo de esta planta es muy delgado, pero muy resistente.","La tige de cette plante est très fine, mais très solide."],["L7-2178","经","jīng","V","Jing (surname)","Jing (apellido)","Jing (nom de famille)","这件事经他一解释，大家就都明白了。","zhè jiàn shì jīng tā yì jiě shì dà jiā jiù dōu míng bai le","Once he explained the matter, everyone understood.","En cuanto él explicó el asunto, todos lo entendieron.","Dès qu'il a expliqué l'affaire, tout le monde a compris."],["L7-2179","经度","jīngdù","N","longitude","longitud","longitude","地图上的经度和纬度可以帮助我们确定位置。","dì tú shàng de jīng dù hé wěi dù kě yǐ bāng zhù wǒ men què dìng wèi zhì","Longitude and latitude on a map can help us pinpoint a location.","La longitud y la latitud de un mapa nos ayudan a determinar una ubicación.","La longitude et la latitude sur une carte nous aident à déterminer un emplacement."],["L7-2180","经久不息","jīngjiǔ-bùxī","","prolonged; long-lasting","prolongado; duradero","prolongé; durable","演出结束后，剧场里响起了经久不息的掌声。","yǎn chū jié shù hòu jù chǎng lǐ xiǎng qǐ le jīng jiǔ bù xī de zhǎng shēng","After the performance, prolonged applause filled the theater.","Al terminar la función, el teatro se llenó de unos aplausos que no cesaban.","Après la représentation, des applaudissements interminables ont retenti dans le théâtre."],["L7-2181","经贸","jīngmào","N","trade","comercio","commerce","两国在经贸领域的合作越来越密切。","liǎng guó zài jīng mào lǐng yù de hé zuò yuè lái yuè mì qiè","Cooperation between the two countries in economics and trade is growing ever closer.","La cooperación entre los dos países en el ámbito económico y comercial es cada vez más estrecha.","La coopération entre les deux pays dans le domaine économique et commercial est de plus en plus étroite."],["L7-2182","经商","jīngshāng","","to do business","dedicarse al comercio","faire du commerce","他辞去了公职，下海经商去了。","tā cí qù le gōng zhí xià hǎi jīng shāng qù le","He resigned from public office and went into business.","Renunció a su cargo público y se dedicó a los negocios.","Il a quitté la fonction publique pour se lancer dans les affaires."],["L7-2183","经受","jīngshòu","V","to endure; to withstand","soportar; resistir","endurer; résister","这座老房子经受住了上百年的风雨。","zhè zuò lǎo fáng zi jīng shòu zhù le shàng bǎi nián de fēng yǔ","This old house has withstood over a hundred years of wind and rain.","Esta vieja casa ha resistido más de cien años de viento y lluvia.","Cette vieille maison a résisté à plus de cent ans de vents et de pluies."],["L7-2184","荆棘","jīngjí","N","brambles; thorns","zarzas; espinas","ronces; épines","创业的道路上布满了荆棘，需要很大的勇气。","chuàng yè de dào lù shàng bù mǎn le jīng jí xū yào hěn dà de yǒng qì","The road of entrepreneurship is full of thorns and takes great courage.","El camino del emprendimiento está lleno de espinas y exige mucho valor.","Le chemin de l'entrepreneuriat est semé d'épines et demande beaucoup de courage."],["L7-2185","惊","jīng","V","to startle; to be scared","asustar; sobresaltarse","effrayer; s'effrayer","这个消息着实让人吃了一惊。","zhè ge xiāo xi zhuó shí ràng rén chī le yì jīng","This news was truly startling.","Esta noticia realmente nos sorprendió.","Cette nouvelle a vraiment été une surprise."],["L7-2186","惊诧","jīngchà","Adj","stunned; amazed","atónito; asombrado","stupéfait; interdit","他的突然离职让同事们十分惊诧。","tā de tū rán lí zhí ràng tóng shì men shí fēn jīng chà","His sudden resignation astonished his colleagues.","Su renuncia repentina dejó atónitos a sus compañeros.","Sa démission soudaine a stupéfié ses collègues."],["L7-2187","惊慌","jīnghuāng","Adj","to panic; alarmed","entrar en pánico; alarmado","paniquer; alarmé","遇到地震不要惊慌，要迅速找到安全的地方躲避。","yù dào dì zhèn bú yào jīng huāng yào xùn sù zhǎo dào ān quán de dì fang duǒ bì","In an earthquake don't panic; quickly find a safe place to take cover.","Si hay un terremoto, no te asustes; busca rápidamente un lugar seguro donde ponerte a salvo.","En cas de séisme, ne paniquez pas ; trouvez vite un endroit sûr où vous abriter."],["L7-2188","惊慌失措","jīnghuāng-shīcuò","","to panic and lose one's head","perder la cabeza por el miedo","perdre la tête de peur","听到着火的消息，他惊慌失措，连鞋都忘了穿。","tīng dào zháo huǒ de xiāo xi tā jīng huāng shī cuò lián xié dōu wàng le chuān","Hearing there was a fire, he panicked so much he even forgot to put on his shoes.","Al oír que había un incendio, entró en pánico y se olvidó hasta de ponerse los zapatos.","En apprenant qu'il y avait un incendie, il a paniqué au point d'oublier même de mettre ses chaussures."],["L7-2189","惊奇","jīngqí","Adj","amazed; to wonder","asombrado; maravillarse","étonné; s'émerveiller","孩子惊奇地发现，种子居然发芽了。","hái zi jīng qí de fā xiàn zhǒng zi jū rán fā yá le","The child was amazed to discover that the seed had actually sprouted.","El niño descubrió con asombro que la semilla había germinado.","L'enfant a découvert avec émerveillement que la graine avait germé."],["L7-2190","惊叹","jīngtàn","V","to exclaim in admiration","exclamar con admiración","s'extasier; s'exclamer","游客们都惊叹于这里壮丽的自然风光。","yóu kè men dōu jīng tàn yú zhè lǐ zhuàng lì de zì rán fēng guāng","The tourists all marveled at the magnificent natural scenery here.","Todos los turistas se maravillaron ante el magnífico paisaje natural de este lugar.","Tous les touristes se sont extasiés devant les magnifiques paysages naturels de cet endroit."],["L7-2191","惊天动地","jīngtiān-dòngdì","","earth-shattering","que estremece al mundo","qui ébranle le monde","那场地震惊天动地，许多房屋都倒塌了。","nà chǎng dì zhèn jīng tiān dòng dì xǔ duō fáng wū dōu dǎo tā le","That earthquake shook heaven and earth, and many houses collapsed.","Aquel terremoto fue impresionante y muchas casas se derrumbaron.","Ce séisme a ébranlé la terre entière et de nombreuses maisons se sont effondrées."],["L7-2192","惊险","jīngxiǎn","Adj","thrilling; perilous","emocionante; peligroso","palpitant; périlleux","这部电影里有很多惊险的打斗场面。","zhè bù diàn yǐng lǐ yǒu hěn duō jīng xiǎn de dǎ dòu chǎng miàn","This film has many thrilling fight scenes.","Esta película tiene muchas escenas de pelea emocionantes y llenas de peligro.","Ce film comporte de nombreuses scènes de combat à suspense."],["L7-2193","惊心动魄","jīngxīn-dòngpò","","breathtaking","impresionante; escalofriante","à couper le souffle","那场比赛打得惊心动魄，直到最后一秒才分出胜负。","nà chǎng bǐ sài dǎ de jīng xīn dòng pò zhí dào zuì hòu yì miǎo cái fēn chū shèng fù","That match was nail-biting, and the winner wasn't decided until the final second.","Aquel partido fue de infarto y el ganador no se decidió hasta el último segundo.","Ce match était haletant, et le vainqueur n'a été connu qu'à la dernière seconde."],["L7-2194","惊醒","jīngxǐng","V","to wake with a start","despertarse sobresaltado","se réveiller en sursaut","半夜里，她被一阵电话铃声惊醒了。","bàn yè lǐ tā bèi yí zhèn diàn huà líng shēng jīng xǐng le","In the middle of the night, she was jolted awake by a ringing phone.","A medianoche, el timbre del teléfono la despertó sobresaltada.","Au milieu de la nuit, une sonnerie de téléphone l'a réveillée en sursaut."],["L7-2195","惊讶","jīngyà","Adj","astonished; amazed","asombrado; sorprendido","étonné; stupéfait","看到他这么快就学会了，老师感到很惊讶。","kàn dào tā zhè me kuài jiù xué huì le lǎo shī gǎn dào hěn jīng yà","The teacher was surprised to see him learn it so quickly.","Al ver que lo aprendió tan rápido, la maestra se sorprendió mucho.","En le voyant apprendre si vite, le professeur a été très surpris."],["L7-2196","晶莹","jīngyíng","Adj","sparkling; translucent","reluciente; translúcido","scintillant; translucide","清晨，草叶上挂着晶莹的露珠。","qīng chén cǎo yè shàng guà zhe jīng yíng de lù zhū","In the early morning, glistening dewdrops hang on the blades of grass.","Por la mañana temprano, brillantes gotas de rocío cuelgan de las hojas de hierba.","Au petit matin, de brillantes gouttes de rosée perlent sur les brins d'herbe."],["L7-2197","兢兢业业","jīngjīngyèyè","Adj","conscientious; assiduous","concienzudo; diligente","consciencieux; assidu","他在这个岗位上兢兢业业干了三十年。","tā zài zhè ge gǎng wèi shàng jīng jīng yè yè gàn le sān shí nián","He worked conscientiously in this post for thirty years.","Trabajó con total dedicación en este puesto durante treinta años.","Il a travaillé avec un dévouement sans faille à ce poste pendant trente ans."],["L7-2198","精打细算","jīngdǎ-xìsuàn","","to calculate carefully","calcular con esmero","calculer avec soin","她过日子精打细算，每个月都能存下一些钱。","tā guò rì zi jīng dǎ xì suàn měi ge yuè dōu néng cún xià yì xiē qián","She budgets carefully and manages to save some money every month.","Administra muy bien el dinero de la casa y todos los meses logra ahorrar algo.","Elle gère son budget avec beaucoup de soin et parvient à mettre un peu d'argent de côté chaque mois."],["L7-2199","精华","jīnghuá","N","essence; best part","esencia; lo mejor","essence; quintessence","这本书汇集了几位大师作品的精华。","zhè běn shū huì jí le jǐ wèi dà shī zuò pǐn de jīng huá","This book brings together the best of several masters' works.","Este libro reúne lo mejor de las obras de varios maestros.","Ce livre rassemble le meilleur des œuvres de plusieurs maîtres."],["L7-2200","精简","jīngjiǎn","V","to streamline; to reduce","simplificar; reducir","alléger; réduire","公司决定精简机构，提高工作效率。","gōng sī jué dìng jīng jiǎn jī gòu tí gāo gōng zuò xiào lǜ","The company decided to streamline its structure to improve efficiency.","La empresa decidió simplificar su estructura para mejorar la eficiencia.","L'entreprise a décidé d'alléger sa structure pour améliorer son efficacité."],["L7-2201","精练","jīngliàn","Adj","concise; polished","conciso; pulido","concis; épuré","他的发言简短精练，只用了三分钟就讲清了问题。","tā de fā yán jiǎn duǎn jīng liàn zhǐ yòng le sān fēn zhōng jiù jiǎng qīng le wèn tí","His remarks were brief and to the point, explaining the issue in only three minutes.","Su intervención fue breve y concisa: en solo tres minutos dejó clara la cuestión.","Son intervention était brève et concise : en trois minutes seulement, il a éclairci la question."],["L7-2202","精妙","jīngmiào","Adj","exquisite; delicate","exquisito; fino","exquis; délicat","这件玉器雕刻得十分精妙，是博物馆的镇馆之宝。","zhè jiàn yù qì diāo kè de shí fēn jīng miào shì bó wù guǎn de zhèn guǎn zhī bǎo","This jade piece is exquisitely carved and is the museum's most prized treasure.","Esta pieza de jade está tallada de forma exquisita y es el tesoro principal del museo.","Cette pièce de jade est sculptée avec une finesse exquise ; c'est le joyau du musée."],["L7-2203","精明","jīngmíng","Adj","shrewd; smart","astuto; listo","avisé; astucieux","这位老板非常精明，从来不做亏本的生意。","zhè wèi lǎo bǎn fēi cháng jīng míng cóng lái bú zuò kuī běn de shēng yi","This boss is very shrewd and never does business at a loss.","Este jefe es muy astuto y nunca hace negocios en los que pierda dinero.","Ce patron est très malin et ne fait jamais d'affaires à perte."],["L7-2204","精疲力竭","jīngpí-lìjié","","utterly exhausted","completamente agotado","complètement épuisé","爬到山顶的时候，大家都已经精疲力竭了。","pá dào shān dǐng de shí hou dà jiā dōu yǐ jīng jīng pí lì jié le","By the time they reached the summit, everyone was completely exhausted.","Cuando llegaron a la cima, todos estaban ya completamente agotados.","Quand ils sont arrivés au sommet, tout le monde était déjà complètement épuisé."],["L7-2205","精确","jīngquè","Adj","accurate; precise","exacto; preciso","exact; précis","这台仪器可以精确地测量出物体的重量。","zhè tái yí qì kě yǐ jīng què de cè liáng chū wù tǐ de zhòng liàng","This instrument can precisely measure the weight of an object.","Este instrumento puede medir con precisión el peso de un objeto.","Cet instrument peut mesurer avec précision le poids d'un objet."],["L7-2206","精神病","jīngshénbìng","N","mental illness","enfermedad mental","maladie mentale","精神病患者需要得到社会更多的理解和关心。","jīng shén bìng huàn zhě xū yào dé dào shè huì gèng duō de lǐ jiě hé guān xīn","People with mental illness need more understanding and care from society.","Las personas con enfermedades mentales necesitan más comprensión y atención por parte de la sociedad.","Les personnes atteintes de troubles mentaux ont besoin de plus de compréhension et d'attention de la part de la société."],["L7-2207","精髓","jīngsuǐ","N","essence; marrow","esencia; médula","essence; moelle","要真正理解一种文化，就得掌握它的精髓。","yào zhēn zhèng lǐ jiě yì zhǒng wén huà jiù děi zhǎng wò tā de jīng suǐ","To truly understand a culture, you have to grasp its essence.","Para entender de verdad una cultura, hay que captar su esencia.","Pour comprendre vraiment une culture, il faut en saisir l'essence."],["L7-2208","精通","jīngtōng","V","to be proficient in; to master","dominar; ser experto en","maîtriser; être expert en","他精通三门外语，经常给公司做翻译。","tā jīng tōng sān mén wài yǔ jīng cháng gěi gōng sī zuò fān yì","He is fluent in three foreign languages and often interprets for the company.","Domina tres idiomas extranjeros y con frecuencia hace traducciones para la empresa.","Il maîtrise trois langues étrangères et fait souvent office d'interprète pour l'entreprise."],["L7-2209","精细","jīngxì","Adj","meticulous; fine","minucioso; fino","minutieux; fin","苏州的刺绣做工精细，图案栩栩如生。","sū zhōu de cì xiù zuò gōng jīng xì tú àn xǔ xǔ rú shēng","Suzhou embroidery is finely crafted, and its patterns are extremely lifelike.","Los bordados de Suzhou están muy bien hechos y sus diseños parecen vivos.","Les broderies de Suzhou sont d'une grande finesse et leurs motifs paraissent vivants."],["L7-2210","精心","jīngxīn","Adj","with great care","con sumo cuidado","avec grand soin","她精心准备了一桌菜，为父亲庆祝生日。","tā jīng xīn zhǔn bèi le yì zhuō cài wèi fù qīn qìng zhù shēng rì","She carefully prepared a table full of dishes to celebrate her father's birthday.","Preparó con esmero una mesa llena de platos para celebrar el cumpleaños de su padre.","Elle a soigneusement préparé une table pleine de plats pour fêter l'anniversaire de son père."],["L7-2211","精益求精","jīngyìqiújīng","","to strive for perfection","buscar la perfección constantemente","viser toujours la perfection","这位老工匠做每件作品都精益求精。","zhè wèi lǎo gōng jiàng zuò měi jiàn zuò pǐn dōu jīng yì qiú jīng","This old craftsman strives for perfection in every piece he makes.","Este viejo artesano busca la perfección en cada una de sus piezas.","Ce vieil artisan cherche la perfection dans chacune de ses pièces."],["L7-2212","精英","jīngyīng","N","elite","élite","élite","参加这次论坛的都是各个行业的精英。","cān jiā zhè cì lùn tán de dōu shì gè gè háng yè de jīng yīng","The participants in this forum are all elites from various industries.","Los participantes de este foro son todos figuras destacadas de diversos sectores.","Les participants à ce forum sont tous l'élite de différents secteurs."],["L7-2213","精致","jīngzhì","Adj","exquisite; refined","exquisito; refinado","exquis; raffiné","这家店的点心做得小巧精致，很适合送人。","zhè jiā diàn de diǎn xin zuò de xiǎo qiǎo jīng zhì hěn shì hé sòng rén","The pastries in this shop are small and exquisitely made, perfect as gifts.","Los pastelitos de esta tienda son pequeños y delicados, ideales para regalar.","Les pâtisseries de cette boutique sont petites et raffinées, parfaites pour offrir."],["L7-2214","颈部","jǐngbù","N","neck","cuello","cou","长时间低头看手机，容易引起颈部疼痛。","cháng shí jiān dī tóu kàn shǒu jī róng yì yǐn qǐ jǐng bù téng tòng","Looking down at your phone for long periods can easily cause neck pain.","Mirar el celular con la cabeza agachada durante mucho tiempo puede causar fácilmente dolor de cuello.","Rester longtemps la tête baissée sur son téléphone peut facilement provoquer des douleurs cervicales."],["L7-2215","景观","jǐngguān","N","landscape; scenery","paisaje","paysage","江边新建的公园成了这座城市一道亮丽的景观。","jiāng biān xīn jiàn de gōng yuán chéng le zhè zuò chéng shì yí dào liàng lì de jǐng guān","The newly built riverside park has become a striking feature of the city's landscape.","El parque recién construido junto al río se ha convertido en un hermoso rasgo del paisaje de la ciudad.","Le parc récemment aménagé au bord du fleuve est devenu un bel élément du paysage de la ville."],["L7-2216","景区","jǐngqū","N","scenic area","zona turística","site touristique","国庆节期间，各大景区都人山人海。","guó qìng jié qī jiān gè dà jǐng qū dōu rén shān rén hǎi","During the National Day holiday, all the major scenic spots are packed with people.","Durante la fiesta nacional, todos los principales sitios turísticos están abarrotados de gente.","Pendant les vacances de la fête nationale, tous les grands sites touristiques sont noirs de monde."],["L7-2217","警车","jǐngchē","N","police car","coche de policía","voiture de police","接到报警电话后，几名警察迅速乘警车赶到现场。","jiē dào bào jǐng diàn huà hòu jǐ míng jǐng chá xùn sù chéng jǐng chē gǎn dào xiàn chǎng","After receiving the emergency call, several police officers quickly arrived at the scene in a police car.","Tras recibir la llamada de emergencia, varios policías llegaron rápidamente al lugar en una patrulla.","Après avoir reçu l'appel d'urgence, plusieurs policiers sont arrivés rapidement sur les lieux en voiture de police."],["L7-2218","警官","jǐngguān","N","police officer","agente de policía","policier","一位警官耐心地帮迷路的老人找到了家。","yí wèi jǐng guān nài xīn de bāng mí lù de lǎo rén zhǎo dào le jiā","A police officer patiently helped the lost old man find his way home.","Un policía ayudó con paciencia a un anciano perdido a encontrar el camino a casa.","Un policier a patiemment aidé un vieil homme égaré à retrouver sa maison."],["L7-2219","警惕","jǐngtì","V","to be vigilant; alert","estar alerta; vigilante","être vigilant; vigilant","接到陌生电话要提高警惕，小心被骗。","jiē dào mò shēng diàn huà yào tí gāo jǐng tì xiǎo xīn bèi piàn","Be on your guard when you get calls from strangers, and watch out for scams.","Cuando recibas llamadas de desconocidos, mantente alerta y cuidado con las estafas.","Quand vous recevez un appel d'un inconnu, restez vigilant et méfiez-vous des arnaques."],["L7-2220","警钟","jǐngzhōng","N","alarm bell","campana de alarma","signal d'alarme","这次事故给所有工厂都敲响了警钟。","zhè cì shì gù gěi suǒ yǒu gōng chǎng dōu qiāo xiǎng le jǐng zhōng","This accident sounded the alarm for every factory.","Este accidente fue una llamada de atención para todas las fábricas.","Cet accident a sonné l'alarme pour toutes les usines."],["L7-2221","净化","jìnghuà","V","to purify","purificar","purifier","这种植物可以净化室内空气。","zhè zhǒng zhí wù kě yǐ jìng huà shì nèi kōng qì","This plant can purify indoor air.","Esta planta puede purificar el aire de interiores.","Cette plante peut purifier l'air intérieur."],["L7-2222","竞技","jìngjì","V","athletic competition","competición deportiva","compétition sportive","竞技体育的魅力在于不断挑战人类的极限。","jìng jì tǐ yù de mèi lì zài yú bú duàn tiǎo zhàn rén lèi de jí xiàn","The appeal of competitive sports lies in constantly challenging human limits.","El atractivo del deporte de competición radica en desafiar constantemente los límites del ser humano.","L'attrait du sport de compétition réside dans le défi constant lancé aux limites de l'être humain."],["L7-2223","竞相","jìngxiāng","Adv","competitively; eagerly","a porfía; con afán","à qui mieux mieux","春天到了，公园里的樱花竞相绽放。","chūn tiān dào le gōng yuán lǐ de yīng huā jìng xiāng zhàn fàng","Spring has arrived, and the cherry blossoms in the park are blooming as if competing with one another.","Llegó la primavera y los cerezos del parque florecen a porfía.","Le printemps est là et les cerisiers du parc fleurissent à qui mieux mieux."],["L7-2224","竞选","jìngxuǎn","V","to run for election","presentarse a elecciones","se présenter aux élections","她决定竞选学生会主席，正在准备演讲稿。","tā jué dìng jìng xuǎn xué shēng huì zhǔ xí zhèng zài zhǔn bèi yǎn jiǎng gǎo","She has decided to run for student union president and is preparing her speech.","Decidió presentarse como candidata a presidenta del consejo estudiantil y está preparando su discurso.","Elle a décidé de se présenter à la présidence du bureau des élèves et prépare son discours."],["L7-2225","竟","jìng","Adv","unexpectedly; actually","inesperadamente; incluso","étonnamment; même","看守一时疏忽，竟把犯人跑了。","kān shǒu yì shí shū hu jìng bǎ fàn rén pǎo le","The guard was careless for a moment and actually let the prisoner escape.","El guardia se descuidó un momento y, increíblemente, dejó escapar al preso.","Le gardien s'est relâché un instant et a laissé le prisonnier s'enfuir."],["L7-2226","竟敢","jìnggǎn","V","to dare (impertinently)","atreverse (con descaro)","oser (avec audace)","这个小偷竟敢在警察局门口偷东西。","zhè ge xiǎo tōu jìng gǎn zài jǐng chá jú mén kǒu tōu dōng xi","This thief actually had the nerve to steal right outside the police station.","Este ladrón tuvo el descaro de robar justo a la puerta de la comisaría.","Ce voleur a eu l'audace de voler juste devant le commissariat."],["L7-2227","敬","jìng","V","to respect; to offer politely","respetar; ofrecer con cortesía","respecter; offrir poliment","婚礼上，新郎新娘向双方父母各敬了一杯茶。","hūn lǐ shàng xīn láng xīn niáng xiàng shuāng fāng fù mǔ gè jìng le yì bēi chá","At the wedding, the bride and groom each respectfully served a cup of tea to both sets of parents.","En la boda, los novios ofrecieron una taza de té a los padres de ambas partes.","Lors du mariage, les mariés ont chacun offert une tasse de thé aux parents des deux familles."],["L7-2228","敬爱","jìng'ài","V","to respect and love","respetar y querer","respecter et aimer","他是一位深受学生敬爱的老教师。","tā shì yí wèi shēn shòu xué shēng jìng ài de lǎo jiào shī","He is an old teacher deeply loved and respected by his students.","Es un viejo maestro muy querido y respetado por sus alumnos.","C'est un vieux professeur profondément aimé et respecté de ses élèves."],["L7-2229","敬而远之","jìng'éryuǎnzhī","","to keep a respectful distance","mantener una distancia respetuosa","garder ses distances par respect","他脾气太坏，同事们都对他敬而远之。","tā pí qi tài huài tóng shì men dōu duì tā jìng ér yuǎn zhī","He has such a bad temper that his colleagues all keep a respectful distance from him.","Tiene tan mal carácter que sus compañeros lo evitan con respeto.","Il a si mauvais caractère que ses collègues le tiennent à distance."],["L7-2230","敬酒","jìngjiǔ","V","to propose a toast","brindar","porter un toast","宴会上，主人举起杯子向客人们敬酒。","yàn huì shàng zhǔ rén jǔ qǐ bēi zi xiàng kè rén men jìng jiǔ","At the banquet, the host raised his glass and toasted the guests.","En el banquete, el anfitrión levantó su copa y brindó por los invitados.","Lors du banquet, l'hôte a levé son verre pour porter un toast à ses invités."],["L7-2231","敬礼","jìnglǐ","","to salute; salute","saludar; saludo","saluer; salut","升国旗的时候，少先队员们都向国旗敬礼。","shēng guó qí de shí hou shào xiān duì yuán men dōu xiàng guó qí jìng lǐ","When the national flag was raised, the Young Pioneers all saluted it.","Cuando se izó la bandera nacional, todos los jóvenes pioneros la saludaron.","Lorsque le drapeau national a été hissé, tous les jeunes pionniers l'ont salué."],["L7-2232","敬佩","jìngpèi","V","to admire","admirar","admirer","她一个人照顾生病的母亲十几年，让人十分敬佩。","tā yí ge rén zhào gù shēng bìng de mǔ qīn shí jǐ nián ràng rén shí fēn jìng pèi","She has cared for her sick mother alone for more than ten years, which is truly admirable.","Cuidó sola de su madre enferma durante más de diez años, lo cual es muy admirable.","Elle s'est occupée seule de sa mère malade pendant plus de dix ans, ce qui force l'admiration."],["L7-2233","敬请","jìngqǐng","V","kindly (please)","se ruega; por favor","veuillez; prière de","新店将于下周开业，敬请各位光临。","xīn diàn jiāng yú xià zhōu kāi yè jìng qǐng gè wèi guāng lín","The new store opens next week, and we respectfully invite you all to visit.","La nueva tienda abrirá la próxima semana y los invitamos cordialmente a visitarnos.","Le nouveau magasin ouvrira la semaine prochaine et nous vous invitons cordialement à venir nombreux."],["L7-2234","敬业","jìngyè","V","dedicated to one's work","dedicado a su trabajo","dévoué à son travail","他工作非常敬业，常常最后一个离开办公室。","tā gōng zuò fēi cháng jìng yè cháng cháng zuì hòu yí ge lí kāi bàn gōng shì","He is very dedicated to his work and is often the last to leave the office.","Es muy dedicado a su trabajo y a menudo es el último en salir de la oficina.","Il est très investi dans son travail et est souvent le dernier à quitter le bureau."],["L7-2235","敬意","jìngyì","N","respect; esteem","respeto; estima","respect; estime","请允许我向所有医护人员表示崇高的敬意。","qǐng yǔn xǔ wǒ xiàng suǒ yǒu yī hù rén yuán biǎo shì chóng gāo de jìng yì","Please allow me to express my highest respect to all the medical staff.","Permítanme expresar mi más alto respeto a todo el personal médico.","Permettez-moi d'exprimer mon plus profond respect à tout le personnel soignant."],["L7-2236","敬重","jìngzhòng","V","to respect deeply; to revere","respetar profundamente; venerar","respecter profondément; vénérer","老村长办事公道，全村人都很敬重他。","lǎo cūn zhǎng bàn shì gōng dao quán cūn rén dōu hěn jìng zhòng tā","The old village head handles matters fairly, and the whole village holds him in high regard.","El viejo jefe de la aldea es justo en sus decisiones, y todo el pueblo lo respeta mucho.","Le vieux chef du village est équitable dans ses décisions, et tout le village le respecte beaucoup."],["L7-2237","静止","jìngzhǐ","V","still; stationary","inmóvil; estático","immobile; statique","在静止的状态下，人的心跳会慢一些。","zài jìng zhǐ de zhuàng tài xià rén de xīn tiào huì màn yì xiē","In a state of rest, a person's heartbeat is slower.","En estado de reposo, el latido del corazón de una persona es más lento.","Au repos, le rythme cardiaque d'une personne est plus lent."],["L7-2238","境地","jìngdì","N","plight; circumstances","situación; circunstancias","situation; circonstances","公司资金链断裂，陷入了十分艰难的境地。","gōng sī zī jīn liàn duàn liè xiàn rù le shí fēn jiān nán de jìng dì","The company's cash flow broke down, and it fell into a very difficult situation.","La cadena de financiación de la empresa se rompió y quedó en una situación muy difícil.","La chaîne de financement de l'entreprise s'est rompue et celle-ci s'est retrouvée dans une situation très difficile."],["L7-2239","境界","jìngjiè","N","realm; level","nivel; reino","niveau; sphère","他的书法已经达到了很高的境界。","tā de shū fǎ yǐ jīng dá dào le hěn gāo de jìng jiè","His calligraphy has reached a very high level.","Su caligrafía ha alcanzado un nivel muy alto.","Sa calligraphie a atteint un très haut niveau."],["L7-2240","境内","jìngnèi","N","within the borders; domestic","dentro del país; interno","à l'intérieur du pays; national","这条大河全长三千公里，大部分在我国境内。","zhè tiáo dà hé quán cháng sān qiān gōng lǐ dà bù fen zài wǒ guó jìng nèi","This great river is three thousand kilometers long, most of it within our country's borders.","Este gran río mide tres mil kilómetros de largo y la mayor parte está dentro de las fronteras de nuestro país.","Ce grand fleuve mesure trois mille kilomètres de long, et la plus grande partie se trouve sur le territoire de notre pays."],["L7-2241","境外","jìngwài","N","overseas; outside the borders","extranjero; fuera de las fronteras","à l'étranger; hors des frontières","出国旅游时，在境外使用银行卡可能要付手续费。","chū guó lǚ yóu shí zài jìng wài shǐ yòng yín háng kǎ kě néng yào fù shǒu xù fèi","When traveling abroad, using your bank card outside the country may incur a fee.","Al viajar al extranjero, usar la tarjeta bancaria fuera del país puede implicar una comisión.","En voyage à l'étranger, l'utilisation de sa carte bancaire hors du pays peut entraîner des frais."],["L7-2242","境遇","jìngyù","N","circumstances; lot","circunstancias; situación","circonstances; sort","这部小说描写了一群农民工在城市里的境遇。","zhè bù xiǎo shuō miáo xiě le yì qún nóng mín gōng zài chéng shì lǐ de jìng yù","This novel depicts the circumstances of a group of migrant workers in the city.","Esta novela retrata la situación de un grupo de trabajadores migrantes del campo en la ciudad.","Ce roman décrit la condition d'un groupe de travailleurs migrants à la ville."],["L7-2243","窘迫","jiǒngpò","Adj","hard-pressed; destitute","apurado; empobrecido","gêné; dans la gêne","刚到城里的那几年，他的生活非常窘迫。","gāng dào chéng lǐ de nà jǐ nián tā de shēng huó fēi cháng jiǒng pò","In his first few years in the city, he lived in great hardship.","Durante sus primeros años en la ciudad, vivió en una gran penuria.","Pendant ses premières années en ville, il a vécu dans une grande gêne."],["L7-2244","纠缠","jiūchán","V","to entangle; to nag","enredar; importunar","empêtrer; harceler","那个推销员一直纠缠着我，非让我买他的产品。","nà ge tuī xiāo yuán yì zhí jiū chán zhe wǒ fēi ràng wǒ mǎi tā de chǎn pǐn","The salesman kept pestering me, insisting I buy his product.","Ese vendedor no dejaba de acosarme y se empeñaba en que le comprara su producto.","Ce vendeur n'arrêtait pas de me harceler et voulait absolument que j'achète son produit."],["L7-2245","揪","jiū","V","to seize; to grab and pull","agarrar; jalar","saisir; tirer","警察一把揪住了小偷的衣领。","jǐng chá yì bǎ jiū zhù le xiǎo tōu de yī lǐng","The policeman grabbed the thief by the collar.","El policía agarró de golpe al ladrón por el cuello de la ropa.","Le policier a empoigné le voleur par le col."],["L7-2246","久违","jiǔwéi","V","long time no see","cuánto tiempo sin vernos","longtemps qu'on ne s'est vu","走进久违的家乡小院，他心里感慨万千。","zǒu jìn jiǔ wéi de jiā xiāng xiǎo yuàn tā xīn lǐ gǎn kǎi wàn qiān","Walking into the hometown courtyard he hadn't seen for so long, he was overcome with emotion.","Al entrar en el patio de su pueblo, que hacía tanto no veía, lo invadió una profunda emoción.","En entrant dans la petite cour de son village natal qu'il n'avait pas vue depuis si longtemps, il fut submergé d'émotions."],["L7-2247","久仰","jiǔyǎng","V","pleased to meet you","encantado de conocerle","enchanté de vous rencontrer","久仰大名，今天终于见到您本人了。","jiǔ yǎng dà míng jīn tiān zhōng yú jiàn dào nín běn rén le","I've long heard of you, and today I finally get to meet you in person.","Hace tiempo que oigo hablar de usted; por fin hoy tengo el gusto de conocerlo en persona.","Il y a longtemps que j'entends parler de vous ; je suis enchanté de vous rencontrer enfin en personne."],["L7-2248","酒精","jiǔjīng","N","alcohol","alcohol","alcool","这种饮料虽然好喝，但酒精含量不低。","zhè zhǒng yǐn liào suī rán hǎo hē dàn jiǔ jīng hán liàng bù dī","This drink tastes good, but its alcohol content is not low.","Aunque esta bebida sabe bien, su contenido de alcohol no es bajo.","Cette boisson est bonne, mais sa teneur en alcool n'est pas faible."],["L7-2249","酒楼","jiǔlóu","N","restaurant","restaurante","restaurant","全家人在一家老字号酒楼订了年夜饭。","quán jiā rén zài yì jiā lǎo zì hào jiǔ lóu dìng le nián yè fàn","The whole family booked New Year's Eve dinner at a long-established restaurant.","Toda la familia reservó la cena de Nochevieja en un restaurante de toda la vida.","Toute la famille a réservé le dîner du réveillon dans un restaurant de longue date."],["L7-2250","救护车","jiùhùchē","N","ambulance","ambulancia","ambulance","他被救护车送到医院时已经昏迷了。","tā bèi jiù hù chē sòng dào yī yuàn shí yǐ jīng hūn mí le","He was already unconscious when the ambulance brought him to the hospital.","Cuando la ambulancia lo llevó al hospital, ya estaba inconsciente.","Quand l'ambulance l'a amené à l'hôpital, il était déjà inconscient."],["L7-2251","救济","jiùjì","V","relief; to aid the needy","ayuda; socorrer a los necesitados","secours; aider les nécessiteux","政府向受灾群众发放了救济物资。","zhèng fǔ xiàng shòu zāi qún zhòng fā fàng le jiù jì wù zī","The government distributed relief supplies to the disaster victims.","El gobierno distribuyó suministros de ayuda a las personas damnificadas.","Le gouvernement a distribué des secours aux sinistrés."],["L7-2252","救治","jiùzhì","V","to give emergency treatment","dar atención de emergencia","prodiguer des soins d'urgence","受伤的游客已经被送往附近医院救治。","shòu shāng de yóu kè yǐ jīng bèi sòng wǎng fù jìn yī yuàn jiù zhì","The injured tourists have been taken to a nearby hospital for treatment.","Los turistas heridos ya fueron trasladados a un hospital cercano para recibir atención.","Les touristes blessés ont déjà été transportés dans un hôpital voisin pour y être soignés."],["L7-2253","就餐","jiùcān","V","to dine","comer; cenar","dîner; prendre un repas","这家餐厅中午就餐的人特别多，最好提前订座。","zhè jiā cān tīng zhōng wǔ jiù cān de rén tè bié duō zuì hǎo tí qián dìng zuò","Lots of people dine at this restaurant at noon, so it's best to book in advance.","En este restaurante hay muchísima gente a mediodía, así que es mejor reservar mesa con anticipación.","Ce restaurant est très fréquenté à midi ; mieux vaut réserver une table à l'avance."],["L7-2254","就地","jiùdì","Adv","on the spot; locally","in situ; localmente","sur place; localement","这些垃圾不能就地焚烧，必须运到处理厂。","zhè xiē lā jī bù néng jiù dì fén shāo bì xū yùn dào chǔ lǐ chǎng","This garbage must not be burned on the spot; it has to be taken to a processing plant.","Esta basura no se puede quemar en el lugar; hay que llevarla a la planta de tratamiento.","Ces déchets ne doivent pas être brûlés sur place ; il faut les transporter jusqu'à l'usine de traitement."],["L7-2255","就读","jiùdú","V","to attend school","estudiar en; cursar","être scolarisé; étudier","她目前在一所师范大学就读，学的是中文专业。","tā mù qián zài yì suǒ shī fàn dà xué jiù dú xué de shì zhōng wén zhuān yè","She is currently studying at a teachers' university, majoring in Chinese.","Actualmente estudia en una universidad pedagógica, en la carrera de lengua china.","Elle étudie actuellement dans une université de formation des enseignants, en filière chinois."],["L7-2256","就近","jiùjìn","Adv","nearby; close at hand","cerca; en las inmediaciones","à proximité","孩子上小学一般就近入学，不用跑太远。","hái zi shàng xiǎo xué yì bān jiù jìn rù xué bú yòng pǎo tài yuǎn","Children usually attend a nearby primary school and don't have to travel far.","Los niños suelen ir a la escuela primaria más cercana, sin tener que desplazarse lejos.","Les enfants vont généralement à l'école primaire la plus proche, sans avoir à aller loin."],["L7-2257","就任","jiùrèn","V","to take office","asumir un cargo","prendre ses fonctions","新市长将于下个月正式就任。","xīn shì zhǎng jiāng yú xià ge yuè zhèng shì jiù rèn","The new mayor will formally take office next month.","El nuevo alcalde asumirá oficialmente el cargo el próximo mes.","Le nouveau maire prendra officiellement ses fonctions le mois prochain."],["L7-2258","就医","jiùyī","","to seek medical treatment","recibir atención médica","se faire soigner","由于山区交通不便，村民就医很困难。","yóu yú shān qū jiāo tōng bú biàn cūn mín jiù yī hěn kùn nan","Because transport is poor in the mountains, it's hard for villagers to get medical treatment.","Como el transporte en la zona montañosa es incómodo, a los aldeanos les resulta muy difícil recibir atención médica.","Les transports étant peu pratiques en montagne, les villageois ont beaucoup de mal à consulter un médecin."],["L7-2259","就诊","jiùzhěn","","to see a doctor","consultar al médico","consulter un médecin","就诊时请带好身份证和医保卡。","jiù zhěn shí qǐng dài hǎo shēn fèn zhèng hé yī bǎo kǎ","Please bring your ID card and medical insurance card when you see the doctor.","Al acudir a consulta, traiga su documento de identidad y su tarjeta del seguro médico.","Pour votre consultation, veuillez apporter votre carte d'identité et votre carte d'assurance maladie."],["L7-2260","就职","jiùzhí","","to take office","tomar posesión del cargo","entrer en fonction","他毕业后在一家外资企业就职。","tā bì yè hòu zài yì jiā wài zī qǐ yè jiù zhí","After graduating, he took a job at a foreign-funded company.","Después de graduarse, trabajó en una empresa de capital extranjero.","Après son diplôme, il a travaillé dans une entreprise à capitaux étrangers."],["L7-2261","就座","jiùzuò","","to take a seat","tomar asiento","s'asseoir","请各位来宾按照座位号就座。","qǐng gè wèi lái bīn àn zhào zuò wèi hào jiù zuò","All guests are requested to take their seats according to their seat numbers.","Se ruega a los invitados que tomen asiento según el número de su lugar.","Les invités sont priés de s'installer selon leur numéro de place."],["L7-2262","舅舅","jiùjiu","N","maternal uncle","tío materno","oncle maternel","我舅舅是一名医生，在省城的大医院工作。","wǒ jiù jiu shì yì míng yī shēng zài shěng chéng de dà yī yuàn gōng zuò","My uncle is a doctor and works at a big hospital in the provincial capital.","Mi tío es médico y trabaja en un gran hospital de la capital de la provincia.","Mon oncle est médecin et travaille dans un grand hôpital de la capitale provinciale."],["L7-2263","拘留","jūliú","V","to detain; to hold in custody","detener; arrestar","détenir; mettre en garde à vue","他因为酒后打人被警方拘留了十天。","tā yīn wèi jiǔ hòu dǎ rén bèi jǐng fāng jū liú le shí tiān","He was detained by the police for ten days for hitting someone while drunk.","La policía lo detuvo diez días por golpear a alguien estando ebrio.","Il a été placé en garde à vue pendant dix jours par la police pour avoir frappé quelqu'un en état d'ébriété."],["L7-2264","拘束","jūshù","V/Adj","to restrict; constrained","restringir; cohibido","restreindre; gêné","第一次去女朋友家，他显得有些拘束。","dì yī cì qù nǚ péng you jiā tā xiǎn de yǒu xiē jū shù","Visiting his girlfriend's home for the first time, he seemed a little ill at ease.","La primera vez que fue a casa de su novia, se mostró algo cohibido.","La première fois qu'il est allé chez sa petite amie, il paraissait un peu gêné."],["L7-2265","居高临下","jūgāo-línxià","","to look down from above","mirar desde arriba","dominer de haut","他说话总是居高临下，让人很反感。","tā shuō huà zǒng shì jū gāo lín xià ràng rén hěn fǎn gǎn","He always talks down to people, which puts everyone off.","Siempre habla con aire de superioridad, lo cual resulta muy antipático.","Il parle toujours avec condescendance, ce qui déplaît à tout le monde."],["L7-2266","居民楼","jūmínlóu","N","apartment building","edificio residencial","immeuble résidentiel","这片居民楼建于上世纪八十年代，没有电梯。","zhè piàn jū mín lóu jiàn yú shàng shì jì bā shí nián dài méi yǒu diàn tī","These apartment buildings were built in the nineteen-eighties and have no elevators.","Estos edificios residenciales se construyeron en los años ochenta del siglo pasado y no tienen ascensor.","Ces immeubles d'habitation ont été construits dans les années 1980 et n'ont pas d'ascenseur."],["L7-2267","鞠躬","jūgōng","","to bow","hacer una reverencia","s'incliner","演出结束后，演员们向观众鞠躬下台。","yǎn chū jié shù hòu yǎn yuán men xiàng guān zhòng jū gōng xià tái","After the performance, the actors bowed to the audience and left the stage.","Al terminar la función, los actores hicieron una reverencia al público y salieron del escenario.","À la fin du spectacle, les acteurs se sont inclinés devant le public avant de quitter la scène."],["L7-2268","局部","júbù","N","part; local","parte; local","partie; local","明天局部地区有小雨，出门请带伞。","míng tiān jú bù dì qū yǒu xiǎo yǔ chū mén qǐng dài sǎn","There will be light rain in some areas tomorrow, so take an umbrella when you go out.","Mañana habrá lluvias ligeras en algunas zonas; lleva paraguas al salir.","Demain, il y aura de légères pluies par endroits ; prenez un parapluie en sortant."],["L7-2269","局势","júshì","N","situation; state of affairs","situación; panorama","situation; état des choses","那个地区的局势仍然很紧张。","nà ge dì qū de jú shì réng rán hěn jǐn zhāng","The situation in that region remains very tense.","La situación en esa región sigue siendo muy tensa.","La situation dans cette région reste très tendue."],["L7-2270","局限","júxiàn","V","to limit; to confine","limitar; restringir","limiter; confiner","教学不应局限于知识的灌输，还应引导学生提出问题、独立思考。","jiào xué bù yīng jú xiàn yú zhī shi de guàn shū hái yīng yǐn dǎo xué shēng tí chū wèn tí dú lì sī kǎo","Teaching should go beyond imparting knowledge and guide students to ask questions and think independently.","La enseñanza no debe limitarse a transmitir conocimientos, sino también guiar a los alumnos a plantear preguntas y pensar por sí mismos.","L'enseignement ne devrait pas se limiter à transmettre des connaissances, mais aussi amener les élèves à poser des questions et à réfléchir par eux-mêmes."],["L7-2271","菊花","júhuā","N","chrysanthemum","crisantemo","chrysanthème","他在父亲的墓碑前放了一束白菊花。","tā zài fù qīn de mù bēi qián fàng le yí shù bái jú huā","He laid a bunch of white chrysanthemums before his father's gravestone.","Dejó un ramo de crisantemos blancos frente a la lápida de su padre.","Il a déposé un bouquet de chrysanthèmes blancs devant la pierre tombale de son père."],["L7-2272","橘子","júzi","N","tangerine","mandarina","mandarine","她坐在窗边剥橘子，孩子在一旁听她讲故事。","tā zuò zài chuāng biān bāo jú zi hái zi zài yì páng tīng tā jiǎng gù shi","She sat by the window peeling oranges while the child listened to her tell a story.","Ella pelaba mandarinas junto a la ventana mientras el niño la escuchaba contar un cuento.","Assise près de la fenêtre, elle épluchait des mandarines pendant que l'enfant l'écoutait raconter une histoire."],["L7-2273","沮丧","jǔsàng","Adj","dejected; dispirited","abatido; desanimado","abattu; découragé","面试失败后，他沮丧了好几天。","miàn shì shī bài hòu tā jǔ sàng le hǎo jǐ tiān","After failing the interview, he was dejected for several days.","Después de fracasar en la entrevista, estuvo desanimado varios días.","Après avoir raté son entretien, il est resté abattu plusieurs jours."],["L7-2274","举报","jǔbào","V","to report; to denounce","denunciar","dénoncer; signaler","市民可以拨打热线电话举报违法行为。","shì mín kě yǐ bō dǎ rè xiàn diàn huà jǔ bào wéi fǎ xíng wéi","Citizens can call a hotline to report illegal activities.","Los ciudadanos pueden llamar a la línea directa para denunciar actividades ilegales.","Les citoyens peuvent appeler la ligne directe pour signaler des activités illégales."],["L7-2275","举措","jǔcuò","N","move; measure","medida; acción","mesure; initiative","这项举措能否长期奏效，取决于后续监督是否到位。","zhè xiàng jǔ cuò néng fǒu cháng qī zòu xiào qǔ jué yú hòu xù jiān dū shì fǒu dào wèi","Whether this measure remains effective over time depends on whether follow-up oversight is adequate.","Que esta medida siga dando resultados a largo plazo depende de que la supervisión posterior sea adecuada.","Que cette mesure reste efficace à long terme dépend de la qualité du suivi et du contrôle qui en découleront."],["L7-2276","举例","jǔlì","","to give an example","dar un ejemplo","donner un exemple","孩子遇到难题时，老师没有直接给出答案，而是鼓励他举例说明自己的推理过程。","hái zi yù dào nán tí shí lǎo shī méi yǒu zhí jiē gěi chū dá àn ér shì gǔ lì tā jǔ lì shuō míng zì jǐ de tuī lǐ guò chéng","When the child met a difficult problem, the teacher did not give the answer directly but encouraged him to illustrate his reasoning with examples.","Cuando el niño se topó con un problema difícil, el maestro no le dio la respuesta directamente, sino que lo animó a explicar su razonamiento con ejemplos.","Quand l'enfant a rencontré un problème difficile, le professeur ne lui a pas donné directement la réponse, mais l'a encouragé à illustrer son raisonnement par des exemples."],["L7-2277","举世闻名","jǔshì-wénmíng","","world-famous","mundialmente famoso","mondialement célèbre","长城是举世闻名的古代建筑。","cháng chéng shì jǔ shì wén míng de gǔ dài jiàn zhù","The Great Wall is a world-famous ancient structure.","La Gran Muralla es una construcción antigua famosa en todo el mundo.","La Grande Muraille est un ouvrage antique connu dans le monde entier."],["L7-2278","举世无双","jǔshì-wúshuāng","","unrivaled","sin igual","sans égal","这件青铜器工艺精湛，可以说举世无双。","zhè jiàn qīng tóng qì gōng yì jīng zhàn kě yǐ shuō jǔ shì wú shuāng","This bronze artifact is exquisitely crafted and can be said to be unrivaled in the world.","Este objeto de bronce tiene una factura exquisita y se puede decir que no tiene igual en el mundo.","Cet objet en bronze est d'une facture exquise et on peut dire qu'il n'a pas son pareil au monde."],["L7-2279","举世瞩目","jǔshì-zhǔmù","","to attract worldwide attention","atraer la atención mundial","attirer l'attention du monde","这场比赛举世瞩目，全球有数亿人观看了直播。","zhè chǎng bǐ sài jǔ shì zhǔ mù quán qiú yǒu shù yì rén guān kàn le zhí bō","This match drew worldwide attention, with hundreds of millions watching the live broadcast.","Este partido atrajo la atención del mundo entero: cientos de millones de personas vieron la transmisión en vivo.","Ce match a attiré l'attention du monde entier : des centaines de millions de personnes ont suivi la retransmission en direct."],["L7-2280","举一反三","jǔyī-fǎnsān","","to infer many from one","deducir mucho de un solo caso","déduire beaucoup d'un seul cas","她善于举一反三，学会一种方法后，总能把它迁移到新的情境中。","tā shàn yú jǔ yì fǎn sān xué huì yì zhǒng fāng fǎ hòu zǒng néng bǎ tā qiān yí dào xīn de qíng jìng zhōng","She is good at drawing broader lessons: after learning one method, she can apply it in new contexts.","Es buena para extrapolar: después de aprender un método, siempre logra aplicarlo a situaciones nuevas.","Elle sait généraliser : après avoir appris une méthode, elle parvient toujours à la transposer à de nouvelles situations."],["L7-2281","举止","jǔzhǐ","N","bearing; manner","porte; comportamiento","maintien; manières","她举止优雅，说话温和，很有气质。","tā jǔ zhǐ yōu yǎ shuō huà wēn hé hěn yǒu qì zhì","She carries herself gracefully, speaks gently and has real poise.","Tiene modales elegantes, habla con suavidad y mucha distinción.","Elle a des manières élégantes, parle avec douceur et beaucoup de classe."],["L7-2282","举重","jǔzhòng","N","weightlifting","levantamiento de pesas","haltérophilie","他从小练习举重，曾经打破过全国纪录。","tā cóng xiǎo liàn xí jǔ zhòng céng jīng dǎ pò guo quán guó jì lù","He has practiced weightlifting since childhood and once broke a national record.","Practica levantamiento de pesas desde niño y una vez batió un récord nacional.","Il pratique l'haltérophilie depuis l'enfance et a même battu un record national."],["L7-2283","巨额","jù'é","Adj","huge (sum)","enorme (cantidad)","énorme (somme)","这家公司欠下了巨额债务。","zhè jiā gōng sī qiàn xià le jù é zhài wù","This company has run up huge debts.","Esta empresa ha contraído deudas enormes.","Cette entreprise a accumulé des dettes colossales."],["L7-2284","巨人","jùrén","N","giant","gigante","géant","在孩子眼里，父亲就像一个无所不能的巨人。","zài hái zi yǎn lǐ fù qīn jiù xiàng yí ge wú suǒ bù néng de jù rén","In a child's eyes, a father is like an all-powerful giant.","A los ojos de un niño, el padre es como un gigante todopoderoso.","Aux yeux d'un enfant, son père est comme un géant tout-puissant."],["L7-2285","巨头","jùtóu","N","tycoon; magnate","magnate; gigante","magnat; géant","几家科技巨头正在争夺人工智能市场。","jǐ jiā kē jì jù tóu zhèng zài zhēng duó rén gōng zhì néng shì chǎng","Several tech giants are competing for the artificial intelligence market.","Varios gigantes tecnológicos se disputan el mercado de la inteligencia artificial.","Plusieurs géants de la technologie se disputent le marché de l'intelligence artificielle."],["L7-2286","巨星","jùxīng","N","superstar; giant star","superestrella; estrella gigante","superstar; étoile géante","这位足球巨星退役的消息让球迷们非常伤心。","zhè wèi zú qiú jù xīng tuì yì de xiāo xi ràng qiú mí men fēi cháng shāng xīn","The news of this football superstar's retirement saddened fans greatly.","La noticia de la retirada de esta superestrella del fútbol entristeció mucho a los aficionados.","L'annonce de la retraite de cette superstar du football a beaucoup attristé les supporters."],["L7-2287","巨型","jùxíng","Adj","giant; enormous","gigante; enorme","géant; énorme","港口新安装了几台巨型起重机。","gǎng kǒu xīn ān zhuāng le jǐ tái jù xíng qǐ zhòng jī","Several giant cranes have been newly installed at the port.","En el puerto se han instalado recientemente varias grúas gigantes.","Plusieurs grues géantes ont été récemment installées dans le port."],["L7-2288","剧烈","jùliè","Adj","violent; severe","violento; intenso","violent; intense","两辆车发生了剧烈的撞击。","liǎng liàng chē fā shēng le jù liè de zhuàng jī","The two cars collided violently.","Los dos autos chocaron con violencia.","Les deux voitures se sont violemment percutées."],["L7-2289","剧目","jùmù","N","repertoire; play","repertorio; obra","répertoire; pièce","这家剧院每年都会推出几个新剧目。","zhè jiā jù yuàn měi nián dōu huì tuī chū jǐ ge xīn jù mù","This theater launches several new productions every year.","Este teatro estrena varias obras nuevas cada año.","Ce théâtre présente chaque année plusieurs nouvelles pièces."],["L7-2290","剧情","jùqíng","N","plot; storyline","trama; argumento","intrigue; scénario","这部电影剧情紧凑，从头到尾都很吸引人。","zhè bù diàn yǐng jù qíng jǐn còu cóng tóu dào wěi dōu hěn xī yǐn rén","This film has a tight plot and is gripping from beginning to end.","Esta película tiene una trama muy compacta y resulta cautivadora de principio a fin.","L'intrigue de ce film est serrée et captivante du début à la fin."],["L7-2291","剧团","jùtuán","N","theater troupe","compañía teatral","troupe de théâtre","这个地方剧团经常到农村为村民演出。","zhè ge dì fāng jù tuán jīng cháng dào nóng cūn wèi cūn mín yǎn chū","This local theater troupe often performs for villagers in the countryside.","Esta compañía de teatro local suele ir al campo a actuar para los aldeanos.","Cette troupe de théâtre locale se produit souvent à la campagne pour les villageois."],["L7-2292","剧院","jùyuàn","N","theater","teatro","théâtre","这家剧院每年都会推出几个新剧目。","zhè jiā jù yuàn měi nián dōu huì tuī chū jǐ ge xīn jù mù","This theater launches several new productions every year.","Este teatro estrena varias obras nuevas cada año.","Ce théâtre présente chaque année plusieurs nouvelles pièces."],["L7-2293","剧组","jùzǔ","N","cast and crew","equipo de rodaje; elenco","équipe de tournage","整个剧组在山区拍了三个月的戏。","zhěng gè jù zǔ zài shān qū pāi le sān gè yuè de xì","The entire cast and crew spent three months filming in the mountains.","Todo el equipo de la producción pasó tres meses rodando en la zona montañosa.","Toute l'équipe du tournage a passé trois mois à filmer en montagne."],["L7-2294","据此","jùcǐ","V","according to this","según esto","selon cela","有关规定已经废除，办事人员不应再据此拒绝受理申请。","yǒu guān guī dìng yǐ jīng fèi chú bàn shì rén yuán bù yīng zài jù cǐ jù jué shòu lǐ shēn qǐng","The relevant rule has been abolished, so staff should no longer use it as grounds to reject applications.","La norma en cuestión ya fue derogada, por lo que el personal no debería seguir rechazando solicitudes con base en ella.","La disposition en question a été abrogée ; le personnel ne devrait donc plus s'en servir pour refuser d'instruire les demandes."],["L7-2295","据悉","jùxī","V","it is reported that","según se informa","selon les informations","据悉，这条高铁线路将于明年年底建成通车。","jù xī zhè tiáo gāo tiě xiàn lù jiāng yú míng nián nián dǐ jiàn chéng tōng chē","It is reported that this high-speed rail line will be completed and opened at the end of next year.","Según se informa, esta línea de tren de alta velocidad estará terminada y abierta al tráfico a finales del año que viene.","Selon les informations disponibles, cette ligne à grande vitesse sera achevée et mise en service fin de l'année prochaine."],["L7-2296","距","jù","V","distance; apart from","distancia; distar de","distance; distant de","我们学校距火车站只有五百米，走路几分钟就到。","wǒ men xué xiào jù huǒ chē zhàn zhǐ yǒu wǔ bǎi mǐ zǒu lù jǐ fēn zhōng jiù dào","Our school is only five hundred meters from the train station, a few minutes' walk.","Nuestra escuela está a solo quinientos metros de la estación de tren, a pocos minutos a pie.","Notre école n'est qu'à cinq cents mètres de la gare, à quelques minutes à pied."],["L7-2297","锯","jù","N/V","saw; to saw","sierra; serrar","scie; scier","工人们正在把倒在路上的大树锯成几段。","gōng rén men zhèng zài bǎ dǎo zài lù shang de dà shù jù chéng jǐ duàn","The workers are sawing the big tree that fell across the road into several pieces.","Los obreros están cortando en varios trozos el gran árbol que cayó en el camino.","Les ouvriers sont en train de scier en plusieurs morceaux le gros arbre tombé en travers de la route."],["L7-2298","聚集","jùjí","V","to gather; to assemble","reunirse; congregarse","se rassembler","广场上聚集了很多等着看烟花的人。","guǎng chǎng shàng jù jí le hěn duō děng zhe kàn yān huā de rén","Many people waiting to watch the fireworks gathered in the square.","En la plaza se reunió mucha gente que esperaba para ver los fuegos artificiales.","Sur la place, beaucoup de gens se sont rassemblés pour attendre le feu d'artifice."],["L7-2299","聚精会神","jùjīng-huìshén","","to concentrate attention","concentrar la atención","se concentrer","学生们聚精会神地听老师讲解实验步骤。","xué shēng men jù jīng huì shén de tīng lǎo shī jiǎng jiě shí yàn bù zhòu","The students listened with rapt attention as the teacher explained the experiment's steps.","Los alumnos escuchaban concentrados al profesor explicar los pasos del experimento.","Les élèves écoutaient avec une grande concentration le professeur expliquer les étapes de l'expérience."],["L7-2300","捐献","juānxiàn","V","to donate","donar","faire un don","他去世以后，家人按照他的遗愿捐献了他的器官。","tā qù shì yǐ hòu jiā rén àn zhào tā de yí yuàn juān xiàn le tā de qì guān","After he died, his family donated his organs in accordance with his wishes.","Tras su fallecimiento, su familia donó sus órganos conforme a su última voluntad.","Après sa mort, sa famille a fait don de ses organes conformément à ses dernières volontés."],["L7-2301","卷入","juǎnrù","V","to be drawn into","verse envuelto en","être entraîné dans","他不想卷入同事之间的矛盾，所以什么也没说。","tā bù xiǎng juǎn rù tóng shì zhī jiān de máo dùn suǒ yǐ shén me yě méi shuō","He didn't want to get drawn into the conflicts between his colleagues, so he said nothing.","No quería verse envuelto en los conflictos entre sus compañeros, así que no dijo nada.","Il ne voulait pas être entraîné dans les conflits entre ses collègues, alors il n'a rien dit."],["L7-2302","卷子","juànzi","N","test paper; exam paper","examen escrito; hoja de examen","copie d'examen; feuille d'examen","考试时间到了，老师让大家停笔交卷子。","kǎo shì shí jiān dào le lǎo shī ràng dà jiā tíng bǐ jiāo juàn zi","Time was up, and the teacher told everyone to put down their pens and hand in their papers.","Se acabó el tiempo del examen y la maestra pidió a todos que dejaran de escribir y entregaran las hojas.","Le temps de l'examen était écoulé et le professeur a demandé à tous de poser leur stylo et de rendre leur copie."],["L7-2303","圈","juàn","N","pen; to pen in","corral; encerrar","enclos; enfermer","他失恋以后，整个人都瘦了一圈。","tā shī liàn yǐ hòu zhěng gè rén dōu shòu le yì quān","After his breakup, he lost a lot of weight.","Después de que lo dejó su pareja, adelgazó muchísimo.","Depuis sa rupture amoureuse, il a beaucoup maigri."],["L7-2304","决议","juéyì","N","resolution","resolución","résolution","大会经过讨论，通过了一项重要决议。","dà huì jīng guò tǎo lùn tōng guò le yí xiàng zhòng yào jué yì","After discussion, the conference adopted an important resolution.","Tras la discusión, la asamblea aprobó una resolución importante.","Après discussion, l'assemblée a adopté une résolution importante."],["L7-2305","诀别","juébié","V","to part forever; to bid farewell","despedirse para siempre; despedida","faire ses adieux; adieu","这封信是他和家人诀别时写下的。","zhè fēng xìn shì tā hé jiā rén jué bié shí xiě xià de","This letter was written when he bade his family a final farewell.","Esta carta la escribió al despedirse de su familia para siempre.","Cette lettre a été écrite lorsqu'il a fait ses adieux définitifs à sa famille."],["L7-2306","诀窍","juéqiào","N","knack; trick","truco; clave","astuce; secret","学好外语没有什么诀窍，关键是多听多说。","xué hǎo wài yǔ méi yǒu shén me jué qiào guān jiàn shì duō tīng duō shuō","There's no secret to learning a foreign language well; the key is to listen and speak a lot.","No hay ningún truco para aprender bien un idioma extranjero; lo clave es escuchar y hablar mucho.","Il n'y a pas de secret pour bien apprendre une langue étrangère ; l'essentiel est d'écouter et de parler beaucoup."],["L7-2307","角逐","juézhú","V","to contend; to compete","competir; disputar","rivaliser; disputer","十多家公司参加了这个项目的角逐。","shí duō jiā gōng sī cān jiā le zhè ge xiàng mù de jué zhú","More than ten companies competed for this project.","Más de diez empresas compitieron por este proyecto.","Plus de dix entreprises se sont disputé ce projet."],["L7-2308","觉醒","juéxǐng","V","to awaken","despertar; tomar conciencia","s'éveiller; prendre conscience","这次事件让许多人的环保意识开始觉醒。","zhè cì shì jiàn ràng xǔ duō rén de huán bǎo yì shí kāi shǐ jué xǐng","This incident awakened many people's environmental awareness.","Este suceso hizo que mucha gente empezara a despertar su conciencia ambiental.","Cet événement a éveillé la conscience écologique de nombreuses personnes."],["L7-2309","绝技","juéjì","N","consummate skill; stunt","destreza suprema; proeza","prouesse; talent suprême","这位杂技演员表演了一项高难度的绝技。","zhè wèi zá jì yǎn yuán biǎo yǎn le yí xiàng gāo nán dù de jué jì","This acrobat performed an extremely difficult feat.","Este acróbata realizó una proeza de gran dificultad.","Cet acrobate a exécuté un tour de force d'une extrême difficulté."],["L7-2310","绝缘","juéyuán","V","to insulate; to cut off from","aislar; incomunicar","isoler; couper de","他一心工作，似乎跟娱乐活动完全绝缘。","tā yì xīn gōng zuò sì hū gēn yú lè huó dòng wán quán jué yuán","He's so devoted to his work that he seems completely cut off from entertainment.","Está tan entregado al trabajo que parece totalmente ajeno a cualquier actividad de ocio.","Il est tellement absorbé par son travail qu'il semble totalement étranger à toute forme de divertissement."],["L7-2311","绝招","juézhāo","N","unique skill; masterstroke","habilidad única; golpe maestro","talent unique; coup de maître","做红烧肉是奶奶的绝招，谁也学不会。","zuò hóng shāo ròu shì nǎi nai de jué zhāo shéi yě xué bú huì","Making braised pork is Grandma's specialty, and no one can master it.","Hacer cerdo estofado en salsa de soya es la especialidad de la abuela y nadie ha logrado aprenderla.","Le porc braisé à la sauce soja est la botte secrète de grand-mère, et personne n'a réussi à l'imiter."],["L7-2312","倔强","juéjiàng","Adj","stubborn","terco; obstinado","têtu; obstiné","这个孩子性格倔强，摔倒了也不肯哭。","zhè ge hái zi xìng gé jué jiàng shuāi dǎo le yě bù kěn kū","This child is stubborn and won't cry even when he falls down.","Este niño es testarudo y ni siquiera llora cuando se cae.","Cet enfant est têtu et refuse de pleurer, même quand il tombe."],["L7-2313","崛起","juéqǐ","V","to rise abruptly","surgir; emerger","surgir; s'élever","近年来，一批年轻的科技企业迅速崛起。","jìn nián lái yì pī nián qīng de kē jì qǐ yè xùn sù jué qǐ","In recent years, a batch of young tech companies has risen rapidly.","En los últimos años han surgido rápidamente numerosas empresas tecnológicas jóvenes.","Ces dernières années, une série de jeunes entreprises technologiques se sont rapidement imposées."],["L7-2314","爵士","juéshì","N","knight; jazz","caballero; jazz","chevalier; jazz","他最喜欢在安静的夜晚听爵士音乐。","tā zuì xǐ huan zài ān jìng de yè wǎn tīng jué shì yīn yuè","He most enjoys listening to jazz on quiet evenings.","Lo que más le gusta es escuchar jazz en las noches tranquilas.","Ce qu'il préfère, c'est écouter du jazz par les soirées tranquilles."],["L7-2315","倔","juè","Adj","stubborn","terco; obstinado","têtu; obstiné","这老头儿脾气很倔，别人怎么劝都不听。","zhè lǎo tóur pí qi hěn juè bié rén zěn me quàn dōu bù tīng","This old man is very stubborn and won't listen no matter how people try to persuade him.","Este viejo es muy terco y no hace caso por más que le aconsejen.","Ce vieil homme est très têtu et n'écoute personne, quoi qu'on lui dise pour le convaincre."],["L7-2316","军官","jūnguān","N","military officer","oficial militar","officier","他的父亲是一名退伍军官，对孩子要求很严格。","tā de fù qīn shì yì míng tuì wǔ jūn guān duì hái zi yāo qiú hěn yán gé","His father is a retired military officer who is very strict with his children.","Su padre es un oficial militar retirado y es muy exigente con sus hijos.","Son père est un officier militaire à la retraite, très strict avec ses enfants."],["L7-2317","均衡","jūnhéng","Adj","balanced; equal","equilibrado; igual","équilibré; égal","青少年要注意营养均衡，不能挑食。","qīng shào nián yào zhù yì yíng yǎng jūn héng bù néng tiāo shí","Teenagers should pay attention to a balanced diet and not be picky eaters.","Los adolescentes deben cuidar el equilibrio nutricional y no ser quisquillosos con la comida.","Les adolescents doivent veiller à une alimentation équilibrée et ne pas faire les difficiles."],["L7-2318","均匀","jūnyún","Adj","even; uniform","uniforme; parejo","uniforme; régulier","把调料撒均匀，烤出来的肉味道才好。","bǎ tiáo liào sǎ jūn yún kǎo chū lái de ròu wèi dào cái hǎo","Sprinkle the seasoning evenly, and the grilled meat will taste good.","Espolvorea el condimento de manera uniforme y así la carne asada quedará sabrosa.","Répartissez bien l'assaisonnement, et la viande grillée aura bon goût."],["L7-2319","君子","jūnzǐ","N","gentleman; person of noble character","caballero; persona de carácter noble","homme de bien; gentilhomme","君子之交淡如水，真正的朋友不需要天天联系。","jūn zǐ zhī jiāo dàn rú shuǐ zhēn zhèng de péng you bù xū yào tiān tiān lián xì","Friendship between gentlemen is as plain as water; true friends don't need to be in touch every day.","La amistad entre hombres de bien es sencilla como el agua; los verdaderos amigos no necesitan comunicarse todos los días.","L'amitié entre honnêtes gens est simple comme l'eau ; les vrais amis n'ont pas besoin de se contacter tous les jours."],["L7-2320","俊","jùn","Adj","handsome; talented","apuesto; talentoso","beau; talentueux","这小伙子长得真俊，浓眉大眼的。","zhè xiǎo huǒ zi zhǎng de zhēn jùn nóng méi dà yǎn de","This young man is really handsome, with thick eyebrows and big eyes.","Este muchacho es realmente guapo, de cejas pobladas y ojos grandes.","Ce jeune homme est vraiment beau, avec ses sourcils épais et ses grands yeux."],["L7-2321","俊俏","jùnqiào","Adj","good-looking; charming","atractivo; encantador","joli; charmant","照片上的姑娘模样俊俏，笑起来特别甜。","zhào piàn shàng de gū niang mú yàng jùn qiào xiào qǐ lái tè bié tián","The girl in the photo is pretty and has a very sweet smile.","La chica de la foto es muy bonita y su sonrisa es especialmente dulce.","La jeune fille de la photo est ravissante et son sourire est particulièrement doux."],["L7-2322","骏马","jùnmǎ","N","fine horse; steed","corcel; caballo excelente","cheval de race; destrier","一匹骏马在辽阔的草原上奔跑。","yì pǐ jùn mǎ zài liáo kuò de cǎo yuán shàng bēn pǎo","A fine steed galloped across the vast grassland.","Un hermoso corcel galopaba por la vasta pradera.","Un superbe destrier galopait à travers la vaste prairie."],["L7-2323","竣工","jùngōng","V","to complete (a project)","terminar (una obra)","achever (un chantier)","这座跨江大桥预计明年六月竣工。","zhè zuò kuà jiāng dà qiáo yù jì míng nián liù yuè jùn gōng","This bridge across the river is expected to be completed next June.","Se prevé que este puente sobre el río esté terminado el próximo junio.","Ce pont enjambant le fleuve devrait être achevé en juin prochain."],["L7-2324","卡车","kǎchē","N","truck","camión","camion","工人们把货从卡车上卸了下来。","gōng rén men bǎ huò cóng kǎ chē shàng xiè le xià lái","The workers unloaded the goods from the truck.","Los obreros bajaron la mercancía del camión.","Les ouvriers ont déchargé la marchandise du camion."],["L7-2325","卡片","kǎpiàn","N","card","tarjeta; ficha","carte; fiche","她给每位老师都写了一张感谢卡片。","tā gěi měi wèi lǎo shī dōu xiě le yì zhāng gǎn xiè kǎ piàn","She wrote a thank-you card to every teacher.","Escribió una tarjeta de agradecimiento para cada uno de los maestros.","Elle a écrit une carte de remerciement à chacun de ses professeurs."],["L7-2326","卡通","kǎtōng","N","cartoon","dibujos animados","dessin animé","这家店卖的文具上都印着可爱的卡通图案。","zhè jiā diàn mài de wén jù shàng dōu yìn zhe kě ài de kǎ tōng tú àn","The stationery sold in this shop is printed with cute cartoon designs.","Los útiles escolares que vende esta tienda tienen estampados de dibujos animados muy lindos.","Les articles de papeterie vendus dans ce magasin sont ornés de mignons motifs de dessin animé."],["L7-2327","开办","kāibàn","V","to set up; to start (a business)","abrir; fundar","ouvrir; fonder","几个年轻人合伙开办了一家网络公司。","jǐ ge nián qīng rén hé huǒ kāi bàn le yì jiā wǎng luò gōng sī","Several young people jointly set up an internet company.","Varios jóvenes se asociaron y abrieron una empresa de internet.","Quelques jeunes se sont associés pour créer une entreprise internet."],["L7-2328","开采","kāicǎi","V","to mine; to exploit","extraer; explotar","extraire; exploiter","长期过度开采地下水，可能导致地面沉降，甚至危及建筑安全。","cháng qī guò dù kāi cǎi dì xià shuǐ kě néng dǎo zhì dì miàn chén jiàng shèn zhì wēi jí jiàn zhù ān quán","Prolonged overextraction of groundwater may cause land subsidence and even endanger the safety of buildings.","La sobreexplotación prolongada de las aguas subterráneas puede provocar hundimientos del terreno e incluso poner en peligro la seguridad de los edificios.","La surexploitation prolongée des eaux souterraines peut provoquer un affaissement du sol et même menacer la sécurité des bâtiments."],["L7-2329","开场","kāichǎng","","to begin; opening","empezar; comienzo","commencer; début","演出七点半准时开场，请大家提前入座。","yǎn chū qī diǎn bàn zhǔn shí kāi chǎng qǐng dà jiā tí qián rù zuò","The performance begins promptly at seven-thirty; please take your seats early.","La función comienza puntualmente a las siete y media; por favor, tomen asiento con anticipación.","Le spectacle commence à sept heures et demie précises ; veuillez vous installer à l'avance."],["L7-2330","开场白","kāichǎngbái","N","opening remarks; prologue","palabras de apertura; prólogo","préambule; prologue","主持人的开场白幽默风趣，一下子就吸引了观众。","zhǔ chí rén de kāi chǎng bái yōu mò fēng qù yí xià zi jiù xī yǐn le guān zhòng","The host's opening remarks were witty and immediately grabbed the audience.","La introducción del presentador fue ingeniosa y divertida, y cautivó al público de inmediato.","Le mot d'ouverture de l'animateur, plein d'humour, a immédiatement captivé le public."],["L7-2331","开除","kāichú","V","to expel; to fire","expulsar; despedir","expulser; licencier","他因为多次违反校规被学校开除了。","tā yīn wèi duō cì wéi fǎn xiào guī bèi xué xiào kāi chú le","He was expelled from school for repeatedly breaking the rules.","Lo expulsaron de la escuela por violar el reglamento escolar en repetidas ocasiones.","Il a été renvoyé de l'école pour avoir enfreint à plusieurs reprises le règlement."],["L7-2332","开动","kāidòng","V","to start up; to set in motion","poner en marcha; arrancar","démarrer; mettre en marche","大家都到齐了，开动吧，菜要凉了。","dà jiā dōu dào qí le kāi dòng ba cài yào liáng le","Everyone's here — let's dig in before the food gets cold.","Ya llegamos todos; a comer, que se enfría la comida.","Tout le monde est là ; à table, les plats vont refroidir."],["L7-2333","开发区","kāifāqū","N","development zone","zona de desarrollo","zone de développement","这个开发区吸引了上百家外资企业。","zhè ge kāi fā qū xī yǐn le shàng bǎi jiā wài zī qǐ yè","This development zone has attracted over a hundred foreign-invested enterprises.","Esta zona de desarrollo ha atraído a más de cien empresas de capital extranjero.","Cette zone de développement a attiré plus d'une centaine d'entreprises à capitaux étrangers."],["L7-2334","开发商","kāifāshāng","N","developer","promotor; desarrollador","promoteur; développeur","开发商承诺这个小区明年年底交房。","kāi fā shāng chéng nuò zhè ge xiǎo qū míng nián nián dǐ jiāo fáng","The developer promised to hand over the apartments in this complex at the end of next year.","La constructora prometió entregar las viviendas de este complejo a finales del próximo año.","Le promoteur s'est engagé à livrer les logements de cette résidence fin de l'année prochaine."],["L7-2335","开工","kāigōng","","to start work","empezar a trabajar","commencer le travail","新厂房下个月开工，预计一年建成。","xīn chǎng fáng xià ge yuè kāi gōng yù jì yì nián jiàn chéng","Construction of the new factory building starts next month and is expected to take a year.","La obra de la nueva nave industrial comenzará el próximo mes y se calcula que estará terminada en un año.","Les travaux du nouveau bâtiment de l'usine commenceront le mois prochain et devraient durer un an."],["L7-2336","开垦","kāikěn","V","to reclaim (land)","roturar; poner en cultivo","défricher; mettre en culture","祖辈们在这片荒地上开垦出了大片良田。","zǔ bèi men zài zhè piàn huāng dì shang kāi kěn chū le dà piàn liáng tián","Our ancestors reclaimed vast stretches of fertile farmland from this wasteland.","Nuestros antepasados convirtieron este terreno baldío en extensas tierras fértiles.","Nos aïeux ont défriché cette friche pour en faire de vastes terres fertiles."],["L7-2337","开口","kāikǒu","","to open one's mouth; to speak","abrir la boca; hablar","ouvrir la bouche; parler","他办事很爽快，我刚开口他就答应帮忙了。","tā bàn shì hěn shuǎng kuai wǒ gāng kāi kǒu tā jiù dā ying bāng máng le","He's very straightforward — as soon as I asked, he agreed to help.","Es muy directo para resolver las cosas: apenas se lo pedí, aceptó ayudarme.","Il est très franc et rapide : à peine lui avais-je demandé qu'il a accepté de m'aider."],["L7-2338","开阔","kāikuò","Adj/V","wide; spacious","amplio; espacioso","vaste; spacieux","出国留学开阔了他的视野。","chū guó liú xué kāi kuò le tā de shì yě","Studying abroad broadened his horizons.","Estudiar en el extranjero amplió sus horizontes.","Ses études à l'étranger ont élargi ses horizons."],["L7-2339","开朗","kāilǎng","Adj","cheerful; open","alegre; abierto","jovial; ouvert","她性格开朗，跟谁都能聊得来。","tā xìng gé kāi lǎng gēn shéi dōu néng liáo de lái","She has a cheerful personality and can chat with anyone.","Tiene un carácter abierto y puede conversar con cualquiera.","Elle est d'un naturel jovial et peut discuter avec n'importe qui."],["L7-2340","开辟","kāipì","V","to open up; to establish","abrir; establecer","ouvrir; établir","机场为这些贵宾专门开辟了一条快速通道。","jī chǎng wèi zhè xiē guì bīn zhuān mén kāi pì le yì tiáo kuài sù tōng dào","The airport opened a special fast lane for these distinguished guests.","El aeropuerto habilitó un carril rápido especial para estos invitados distinguidos.","L'aéroport a spécialement aménagé une voie rapide pour ces invités de marque."],["L7-2341","开启","kāiqǐ","V","to open; to start","abrir; iniciar","ouvrir; démarrer","大学毕业意味着开启人生的新阶段。","dà xué bì yè yì wèi zhe kāi qǐ rén shēng de xīn jiē duàn","Graduating from university means starting a new stage of life.","Graduarse de la universidad significa abrir una nueva etapa de la vida.","Obtenir son diplôme universitaire, c'est ouvrir une nouvelle étape de sa vie."],["L7-2342","开枪","kāi qiāng","","to open fire","abrir fuego; disparar","ouvrir le feu; tirer","警察鸣枪示警后，歹徒仍不投降，警察只好开枪。","jǐng chá míng qiāng shì jǐng hòu dǎi tú réng bù tóu xiáng jǐng chá zhǐ hǎo kāi qiāng","After the police fired a warning shot, the criminal still refused to surrender, so the police had to open fire.","Después de que la policía disparó un tiro de advertencia, el delincuente aún se negó a rendirse, así que la policía tuvo que abrir fuego.","Après un coup de semonce de la police, le malfaiteur refusant toujours de se rendre, les policiers n'ont eu d'autre choix que de tirer."],["L7-2343","开天辟地","kāitiān-pìdì","","the dawn of creation","la creación del mundo","l'origine du monde","古代神话中，盘古开天辟地，创造了世界。","gǔ dài shén huà zhōng pán gǔ kāi tiān pì dì chuàng zào le shì jiè","In ancient myth, Pangu separated heaven and earth and created the world.","En la mitología antigua, Pangu separó el cielo de la tierra y creó el mundo.","Dans les mythes anciens, Pangu sépara le ciel et la terre et créa le monde."],["L7-2344","开拓","kāituò","V","to pioneer; to open up","abrir camino; explorar","défricher; ouvrir de nouvelles voies","公司正在积极开拓海外市场。","gōng sī zhèng zài jī jí kāi tuò hǎi wài shì chǎng","The company is actively opening up overseas markets.","La empresa está explorando activamente los mercados del extranjero.","L'entreprise prospecte activement les marchés étrangers."],["L7-2345","开销","kāixiāo","V/N","expenses; to pay expenses","gastos; sufragar gastos","dépenses; régler des frais","搬到大城市以后，他每个月的开销增加了不少。","bān dào dà chéng shì yǐ hòu tā měi ge yuè de kāi xiāo zēng jiā le bù shǎo","After moving to a big city, his monthly expenses increased considerably.","Desde que se mudó a una gran ciudad, sus gastos mensuales han aumentado bastante.","Depuis qu'il a déménagé dans une grande ville, ses dépenses mensuelles ont considérablement augmenté."],["L7-2346","开张","kāizhāng","","to open for business","abrir un negocio","ouvrir un commerce","这家面包店明天开张，前一百位顾客可以免费品尝。","zhè jiā miàn bāo diàn míng tiān kāi zhāng qián yì bǎi wèi gù kè kě yǐ miǎn fèi pǐn cháng","This bakery opens tomorrow, and the first hundred customers get a free tasting.","Esta panadería abre mañana y los primeros cien clientes podrán probar sus productos gratis.","Cette boulangerie ouvre demain, et les cent premiers clients pourront déguster gratuitement."],["L7-2347","开支","kāizhī","N","expenses; expenditure","gastos; desembolso","dépenses","为了买房，他们尽量减少日常开支。","wèi le mǎi fáng tā men jǐn liàng jiǎn shǎo rì cháng kāi zhī","To buy a home, they cut their daily expenditures as much as possible.","Para comprar una casa, reducen al máximo sus gastos diarios.","Pour acheter un logement, ils réduisent autant que possible leurs dépenses courantes."],["L7-2348","凯歌","kǎigē","N","victory song","canto de victoria","chant de victoire","球队奏响凯歌，以三比零战胜了对手。","qiú duì zòu xiǎng kǎi gē yǐ sān bǐ líng zhàn shèng le duì shǒu","The team triumphed, beating its opponent three to nil.","El equipo cantó victoria y derrotó a su rival por tres a cero.","L'équipe a triomphé de son adversaire par trois buts à zéro."],["L7-2349","楷模","kǎimó","N","model; paragon","modelo; ejemplo","modèle; exemple","这位老医生一生救死扶伤，是我们学习的楷模。","zhè wèi lǎo yī shēng yì shēng jiù sǐ fú shāng shì wǒ men xué xí de kǎi mó","This old doctor spent his life healing the sick and is a model for us all.","Este viejo médico dedicó su vida a salvar vidas y es un ejemplo a seguir para nosotros.","Ce vieux médecin a consacré sa vie à sauver des vies ; c'est un modèle pour nous tous."],["L7-2350","刊登","kāndēng","V","to publish (in print)","publicar (en prensa)","publier (dans la presse)","这家报纸刊登了对这位明星的独家专访。","zhè jiā bào zhǐ kān dēng le duì zhè wèi míng xīng de dú jiā zhuān fǎng","This newspaper published an exclusive interview with the star.","Este periódico publicó una entrevista exclusiva con la estrella.","Ce journal a publié une interview exclusive de cette vedette."],["L7-2351","刊物","kānwù","N","publication","publicación","publication","这是一份面向中学生的科普刊物。","zhè shì yí fèn miàn xiàng zhōng xué shēng de kē pǔ kān wù","This is a popular-science publication aimed at secondary school students.","Esta es una publicación de divulgación científica dirigida a estudiantes de secundaria.","Voici une revue de vulgarisation scientifique destinée aux collégiens et lycéens."],["L7-2352","看护","kānhù","V/N","to nurse; to look after","cuidar; vigilar","soigner; surveiller","父亲住院期间，兄妹几个轮流在医院看护。","fù qīn zhù yuàn qī jiān xiōng mèi jǐ ge lún liú zài yī yuàn kān hù","While their father was in hospital, the siblings took turns looking after him there.","Mientras el padre estuvo hospitalizado, los hermanos se turnaron para cuidarlo en el hospital.","Pendant l'hospitalisation de leur père, les frères et sœurs se sont relayés à son chevet."],["L7-2353","勘探","kāntàn","V","to prospect; to survey","prospectar; explorar","prospecter; explorer","地质队在这一带勘探出了丰富的石油资源。","dì zhì duì zài zhè yí dài kān tàn chū le fēng fù de shí yóu zī yuán","The geological team discovered rich oil resources in this area through surveying.","El equipo geológico descubrió ricos recursos petroleros en esta zona mediante prospecciones.","L'équipe de géologues a découvert d'importantes ressources pétrolières dans cette zone grâce à des prospections."],["L7-2354","堪称","kānchēng","V","can be called","se puede considerar","mériter le nom de","这座古桥设计精巧，堪称建筑史上的奇迹。","zhè zuò gǔ qiáo shè jì jīng qiǎo kān chēng jiàn zhù shǐ shàng de qí jì","This ancient bridge is ingeniously designed and can be called a miracle in architectural history.","Este antiguo puente tiene un diseño ingenioso y puede considerarse un milagro en la historia de la arquitectura.","Ce pont ancien est d'une conception ingénieuse et peut être qualifié de miracle de l'histoire de l'architecture."],["L7-2355","侃大山","kǎn dàshān","","to chat idly; to brag","charlar; fanfarronear","bavarder; se vanter","晚饭后，几个老人坐在树下侃大山。","wǎn fàn hòu jǐ ge lǎo rén zuò zài shù xià kǎn dà shān","After dinner, a few elderly people sat under a tree shooting the breeze.","Después de cenar, unos ancianos se sentaron bajo un árbol a charlar de todo un poco.","Après le dîner, quelques personnes âgées se sont assises sous un arbre pour bavarder de tout et de rien."],["L7-2356","砍","kǎn","V","to chop; to cut down","talar; cortar","couper; abattre","为了修路，村里砍了好几棵老树。","wèi le xiū lù cūn lǐ kǎn le hǎo jǐ kē lǎo shù","To build the road, the village cut down several old trees.","Para construir la carretera, en el pueblo talaron varios árboles viejos.","Pour construire la route, le village a abattu plusieurs vieux arbres."],["L7-2357","看得出","kàndechū","V","can tell; can see","poder notar; distinguir","pouvoir deviner; discerner","看得出来，他对这份工作非常满意。","kàn de chū lái tā duì zhè fèn gōng zuò fēi cháng mǎn yì","You can tell he is very satisfied with this job.","Se nota que está muy satisfecho con este trabajo.","On voit bien qu'il est très satisfait de ce travail."],["L7-2358","看热闹","kàn rènao","","to watch the commotion","mirar el bullicio","regarder l'agitation","路上出了车祸，很多人围在那里看热闹。","lù shang chū le chē huò hěn duō rén wéi zài nà lǐ kàn rè nao","There was a car accident on the road, and many people gathered round to gawk.","Hubo un accidente de tráfico en la calle y mucha gente se juntó a mirar.","Il y a eu un accident de la route, et beaucoup de curieux se sont attroupés pour regarder."],["L7-2359","看似","kànsì","V","to seem; to look like","parecer","sembler; avoir l'air","这道题看似简单，其实很容易出错。","zhè dào tí kàn sì jiǎn dān qí shí hěn róng yì chū cuò","This question seems simple, but it's actually easy to get wrong.","Esta pregunta parece sencilla, pero en realidad es muy fácil equivocarse.","Cette question paraît simple, mais il est en fait très facile de se tromper."],["L7-2360","看台","kàntái","N","grandstand","tribuna","tribune","球迷们在看台上为自己的球队助威。","qiú mí men zài kàn tái shàng wèi zì jǐ de qiú duì zhù wēi","The fans cheered for their team from the stands.","Los aficionados animaban a su equipo desde las gradas.","Les supporters encourageaient leur équipe depuis les tribunes."],["L7-2361","看样子","kàn yàngzi","","it seems; it looks like","parece que","il semble que","天这么阴，看样子快要下雨了。","tiān zhè me yīn kàn yàng zi kuài yào xià yǔ le","The sky is so overcast — it looks like it's about to rain.","Está tan nublado que parece que va a llover pronto.","Le ciel est tellement couvert qu'il va sûrement bientôt pleuvoir."],["L7-2362","看中","kànzhòng","","to take a liking to; to choose","fijarse en; escoger","jeter son dévolu sur; choisir","她在商场里看中了一件大衣，可惜太贵了。","tā zài shāng chǎng lǐ kàn zhòng le yí jiàn dà yī kě xī tài guì le","She took a fancy to a coat in the mall, but unfortunately it was too expensive.","En el centro comercial le gustó un abrigo, pero lamentablemente era demasiado caro.","Au centre commercial, elle a eu un coup de cœur pour un manteau, mais malheureusement il était trop cher."],["L7-2363","看重","kànzhòng","V","to value; to regard as important","valorar; dar importancia","accorder de l'importance à","现在很多公司招聘时都很看重学历。","xiàn zài hěn duō gōng sī zhāo pìn shí dōu hěn kàn zhòng xué lì","Nowadays many companies attach great importance to educational background when hiring.","Hoy en día, muchas empresas dan gran importancia al nivel de estudios al contratar.","Aujourd'hui, de nombreuses entreprises accordent beaucoup d'importance au niveau de diplôme lors du recrutement."],["L7-2364","慷慨","kāngkǎi","Adj","generous; fervent","generoso; ferviente","généreux; fervent","他为人慷慨，经常帮助有困难的朋友。","tā wéi rén kāng kǎi jīng cháng bāng zhù yǒu kùn nan de péng you","He is generous and often helps friends in difficulty.","Es generoso y con frecuencia ayuda a amigos que pasan apuros.","Il est généreux et aide souvent ses amis en difficulté."],["L7-2365","扛","káng","V","to carry on shoulder; to bear","cargar al hombro; asumir","porter sur l'épaule; assumer","他一个人扛着两袋大米上了五楼。","tā yí ge rén káng zhe liǎng dài dà mǐ shàng le wǔ lóu","He carried two sacks of rice up to the fifth floor on his shoulders all by himself.","Él solo subió al quinto piso cargando dos sacos de arroz al hombro.","Il a monté tout seul deux sacs de riz sur l'épaule jusqu'au cinquième étage."],["L7-2366","抗衡","kànghéng","V","to counter; to rival","contrarrestar; rivalizar","contrebalancer; rivaliser","这家小企业根本无法和行业巨头抗衡。","zhè jiā xiǎo qǐ yè gēn běn wú fǎ hé háng yè jù tóu kàng héng","This small business simply can't compete with the industry giants.","Esta pequeña empresa no puede competir en absoluto con los gigantes del sector.","Cette petite entreprise n'est absolument pas en mesure de rivaliser avec les géants du secteur."],["L7-2367","抗拒","kàngjù","V","to resist; to defy","resistir; desafiar","résister; défier","面对美食的诱惑，很多人都难以抗拒。","miàn duì měi shí de yòu huò hěn duō rén dōu nán yǐ kàng jù","Faced with the temptation of delicious food, many people find it hard to resist.","Ante la tentación de la buena comida, a mucha gente le cuesta resistirse.","Face à la tentation de la bonne cuisine, beaucoup de gens ont du mal à résister."],["L7-2368","抗生素","kàngshēngsù","N","antibiotic","antibiótico","antibiotique","抗生素不能随便吃，一定要听医生的。","kàng shēng sù bù néng suí biàn chī yí dìng yào tīng yī shēng de","Antibiotics shouldn't be taken casually; you must follow the doctor's advice.","Los antibióticos no se deben tomar a la ligera; hay que hacer caso al médico.","Les antibiotiques ne se prennent pas à la légère ; il faut suivre l'avis du médecin."],["L7-2369","抗争","kàngzhēng","V","to resist; to fight against","resistir; luchar contra","résister; lutter contre","面对不公平的待遇，工人们开始抗争。","miàn duì bù gōng píng de dài yù gōng rén men kāi shǐ kàng zhēng","Faced with unfair treatment, the workers began to fight back.","Ante el trato injusto, los obreros comenzaron a protestar.","Face à ce traitement injuste, les ouvriers ont commencé à se battre."],["L7-2370","考量","kǎoliáng","V","to consider; consideration","considerar; consideración","considérer; considération","选择工作时，他首先考量的是职业发展机会。","xuǎn zé gōng zuò shí tā shǒu xiān kǎo liáng de shì zhí yè fā zhǎn jī huì","When choosing a job, he first considers opportunities for career development.","Al elegir un trabajo, lo primero que considera son las oportunidades de desarrollo profesional.","Lorsqu'il choisit un emploi, ce qu'il considère en premier, ce sont les perspectives d'évolution de carrière."],["L7-2371","烤","kǎo","V","to roast; to bake","asar; hornear","rôtir; cuire au four","把调料撒均匀，烤出来的肉味道才好。","bǎ tiáo liào sǎ jūn yún kǎo chū lái de ròu wèi dào cái hǎo","Sprinkle the seasoning evenly, and the grilled meat will taste good.","Espolvorea el condimento de manera uniforme y así la carne asada quedará sabrosa.","Répartissez bien l'assaisonnement, et la viande grillée aura bon goût."],["L7-2372","靠拢","kàolǒng","V","to draw close to","acercarse a","se rapprocher de","天黑了，走散的队员们都向营地靠拢。","tiān hēi le zǒu sàn de duì yuán men dōu xiàng yíng dì kào lǒng","As night fell, the scattered team members all made their way back toward the camp.","Al anochecer, los miembros dispersos del equipo se fueron reuniendo en el campamento.","La nuit tombée, les membres de l'équipe dispersés se sont tous rapprochés du camp."],["L7-2373","苛刻","kēkè","Adj","harsh; demanding","severo; exigente","sévère; exigeant","这家公司对员工的要求太苛刻了，很多人干不久就走了。","zhè jiā gōng sī duì yuán gōng de yāo qiú tài kē kè le hěn duō rén gàn bù jiǔ jiù zǒu le","This company's demands on its employees are so harsh that many leave after a short time.","Esta empresa es tan exigente con sus empleados que muchos se van al poco tiempo.","Cette entreprise est si exigeante avec ses employés que beaucoup partent au bout de peu de temps."],["L7-2374","科幻","kēhuàn","N","science fiction","ciencia ficción","science-fiction","他从小就喜欢看科幻小说，梦想成为一名宇航员。","tā cóng xiǎo jiù xǐ huan kàn kē huàn xiǎo shuō mèng xiǎng chéng wéi yì míng yǔ háng yuán","He has loved science fiction since childhood and dreams of becoming an astronaut.","Desde niño le gusta leer novelas de ciencia ficción y sueña con ser astronauta.","Depuis l'enfance, il adore lire de la science-fiction et rêve de devenir astronaute."],["L7-2375","科目","kēmù","N","subject; course","asignatura; materia","matière; discipline","这次考试一共有六个科目，要考三天。","zhè cì kǎo shì yí gòng yǒu liù gè kē mù yào kǎo sān tiān","This exam has six subjects in total and takes three days.","Este examen tiene seis materias en total y dura tres días.","Cet examen comporte six matières au total et dure trois jours."],["L7-2376","科普","kēpǔ","N","popular science","divulgación científica","vulgarisation scientifique","这是一份面向中学生的科普刊物。","zhè shì yí fèn miàn xiàng zhōng xué shēng de kē pǔ kān wù","This is a popular-science publication aimed at secondary school students.","Esta es una publicación de divulgación científica dirigida a estudiantes de secundaria.","Voici une revue de vulgarisation scientifique destinée aux collégiens et lycéens."],["L7-2377","磕","kē","V","to knock; to tap","golpear; tocar","cogner; frapper","他走路不小心，膝盖磕在了桌子角上。","tā zǒu lù bù xiǎo xīn xī gài kē zài le zhuō zi jiǎo shàng","Walking carelessly, he knocked his knee against the corner of the table.","Caminaba sin cuidado y se golpeó la rodilla con la esquina de la mesa.","Il marchait sans faire attention et s'est cogné le genou contre le coin de la table."],["L7-2378","壳","ké","N","shell; crust","cáscara; caparazón","coquille; carapace","松鼠用牙齿咬开坚果的壳，吃里面的果仁。","sōng shǔ yòng yá chǐ yǎo kāi jiān guǒ de ké chī lǐ miàn de guǒ rén","The squirrel bites open the shell of the nut with its teeth and eats the kernel inside.","La ardilla abre con los dientes la cáscara de la nuez y se come lo de adentro.","L'écureuil casse la coquille de la noix avec ses dents et mange l'amande à l'intérieur."],["L7-2379","咳嗽","késou","V","to cough","toser","tousser","他感冒咳嗽，嗓子里总是有痰。","tā gǎn mào ké sou sǎng zi lǐ zǒng shì yǒu tán","He has a cold and a cough, and there's always phlegm in his throat.","Está resfriado y con tos, y siempre tiene flema en la garganta.","Il est enrhumé, il tousse et a toujours des glaires dans la gorge."],["L7-2380","可悲","kěbēi","Adj","lamentable; sad","lamentable; triste","lamentable; triste","为了一点儿钱出卖朋友，真是可悲。","wèi le yì diǎnr qián chū mài péng you zhēn shì kě bēi","Betraying a friend for a little money is truly pathetic.","Traicionar a un amigo por un poco de dinero es verdaderamente lamentable.","Trahir un ami pour un peu d'argent est vraiment déplorable."],["L7-2381","可不是","kěbùshi","Adv","exactly; that's right","así es; exacto","exactement; c'est ça","我说今天真热，同事马上接话：可不是嘛，都快四十度了。","wǒ shuō jīn tiān zhēn rè tóng shì mǎ shàng jiē huà kě bú shì ma dōu kuài sì shí dù le","When I said it was really hot today, my colleague chimed in: it sure is — it's nearly forty degrees.","Dije que hoy hacía mucho calor y mi compañero respondió enseguida: «Y que lo digas, casi cuarenta grados».","J'ai dit qu'il faisait vraiment chaud aujourd'hui, et mon collègue a aussitôt enchaîné : « C'est bien vrai, il fait presque quarante degrés. »"],["L7-2382","可乘之机","kěchéngzhījī","","exploitable opportunity","oportunidad aprovechable","occasion à exploiter","门窗一定要锁好，别给小偷可乘之机。","mén chuāng yí dìng yào suǒ hǎo bié gěi xiǎo tōu kě chéng zhī jī","Be sure to lock the doors and windows; don't give thieves an opening.","Asegúrate de cerrar bien puertas y ventanas; no le des oportunidad a los ladrones.","Verrouillez bien portes et fenêtres ; ne donnez pas aux voleurs l'occasion d'agir."],["L7-2383","可耻","kěchǐ","Adj","shameful","vergonzoso","honteux","欺负比自己弱小的人是非常可耻的行为。","qī fu bǐ zì jǐ ruò xiǎo de rén shì fēi cháng kě chǐ de xíng wéi","Bullying people weaker than yourself is shameful behavior.","Abusar de quien es más débil que uno es una conducta vergonzosa.","S'en prendre à plus faible que soi est un comportement honteux."],["L7-2384","可歌可泣","kěgē-kěqì","","deeply moving; heroic","conmovedor; heroico","émouvant; héroïque","这本书记录了许多抗洪英雄可歌可泣的故事。","zhè běn shū jì lù le xǔ duō kàng hóng yīng xióng kě gē kě qì de gù shi","This book records many deeply moving stories of flood-fighting heroes.","Este libro recoge muchas historias conmovedoras y heroicas de quienes lucharon contra las inundaciones.","Ce livre rapporte de nombreuses histoires héroïques et bouleversantes de ceux qui ont lutté contre les crues."],["L7-2385","可观","kěguān","Adj","considerable; impressive","considerable; notable","considérable; impressionnant","这份兼职的收入相当可观。","zhè fèn jiān zhí de shōu rù xiāng dāng kě guān","The income from this part-time job is quite considerable.","Los ingresos de este trabajo de medio tiempo son bastante considerables.","Les revenus de ce travail à temps partiel sont assez considérables."],["L7-2386","可贵","kěguì","Adj","valuable; praiseworthy","valioso; digno de elogio","précieux; digne d'éloge","在困难面前不放弃，这种精神非常可贵。","zài kùn nan miàn qián bú fàng qì zhè zhǒng jīng shén fēi cháng kě guì","The spirit of not giving up in the face of difficulties is truly admirable.","No rendirse ante las dificultades es un espíritu muy valioso.","Ne pas abandonner face aux difficultés : cet état d'esprit est très précieux."],["L7-2387","可口","kěkǒu","Adj","tasty","sabroso","savoureux","妈妈做的饭菜又可口又营养。","mā ma zuò de fàn cài yòu kě kǒu yòu yíng yǎng","The meals Mom makes are both tasty and nutritious.","La comida que prepara mamá es sabrosa y nutritiva a la vez.","Les repas que prépare maman sont à la fois délicieux et nourrissants."],["L7-2388","可谓","kěwèi","V","it can be said","se puede decir","on peut dire","他一年之内换了三份工作，可谓经历丰富。","tā yì nián zhī nèi huàn le sān fèn gōng zuò kě wèi jīng lì fēng fù","He changed jobs three times in one year — you could say he's had plenty of experience.","Cambió de trabajo tres veces en un año; se puede decir que tiene mucha experiencia.","Il a changé trois fois d'emploi en un an ; on peut dire qu'il a de l'expérience."],["L7-2389","可恶","kěwù","Adj","hateful; detestable","odioso; detestable","odieux; détestable","这些骗子专门骗老人的钱，实在太可恶了。","zhè xiē piàn zi zhuān mén piàn lǎo rén de qián shí zài tài kě wù le","These swindlers specifically cheat old people out of their money — it's truly despicable.","Estos estafadores se dedican a quitarles el dinero a los ancianos; es realmente detestable.","Ces escrocs s'en prennent spécialement à l'argent des personnes âgées ; c'est vraiment odieux."],["L7-2390","可想而知","kěxiǎng'érzhī","","as one can imagine","como cabe imaginar","comme on peut l'imaginer","连续加班一个月，他有多累可想而知。","lián xù jiā bān yí ge yuè tā yǒu duō lèi kě xiǎng ér zhī","After a month of overtime in a row, you can imagine how tired he is.","Tras un mes seguido de horas extra, se puede imaginar lo cansado que está.","Après un mois d'heures supplémentaires d'affilée, on devine à quel point il est fatigué."],["L7-2391","可笑","kěxiào","Adj","funny; ridiculous","gracioso; ridículo","drôle; ridicule","现在想起当年的那些想法，觉得真可笑。","xiàn zài xiǎng qǐ dāng nián de nà xiē xiǎng fǎ jué de zhēn kě xiào","Thinking back on those ideas I had back then, they seem really ridiculous.","Ahora, al recordar las ideas que tenía en aquel entonces, me parecen realmente ridículas.","Maintenant, quand je repense aux idées que j'avais à l'époque, elles me semblent vraiment ridicules."],["L7-2392","可信","kěxìn","Adj","trustworthy; credible","fiable; creíble","digne de confiance; crédible","这个消息来源不太可信，我们还需要核实。","zhè ge xiāo xi lái yuán bú tài kě xìn wǒ men hái xū yào hé shí","This news source isn't very reliable; we still need to verify it.","La fuente de esta noticia no es muy confiable; todavía tenemos que verificarla.","La source de cette information n'est pas très fiable ; nous devons encore la vérifier."],["L7-2393","可行","kěxíng","Adj","feasible","viable","faisable","综上所述，这个方案是可行的。","zōng shàng suǒ shù zhè ge fāng àn shì kě xíng de","To sum up, this plan is feasible.","En resumen, este plan es viable.","En résumé, ce plan est réalisable."],["L7-2394","可疑","kěyí","Adj","suspicious","sospechoso","suspect","保安发现一个可疑的人在停车场转来转去。","bǎo ān fā xiàn yí ge kě yí de rén zài tíng chē chǎng zhuàn lái zhuàn qù","The security guard noticed a suspicious person wandering around the parking lot.","El guardia de seguridad vio a una persona sospechosa dando vueltas por el estacionamiento.","L'agent de sécurité a remarqué une personne suspecte qui rôdait sur le parking."],["L7-2395","克隆","kèlóng","V","clone","clon; clonar","clone; cloner","世界上第一只克隆羊是在英国诞生的。","shì jiè shàng dì yī zhī kè lóng yáng shì zài yīng guó dàn shēng de","The world's first cloned sheep was born in Britain.","La primera oveja clonada del mundo nació en el Reino Unido.","Le premier mouton cloné au monde est né en Grande-Bretagne."],["L7-2396","克制","kèzhì","V","to restrain; self-control","contener; autocontrol","retenir; maîtrise de soi","他气得想拍桌子，但还是克制住了自己。","tā qì de xiǎng pāi zhuō zi dàn hái shi kè zhì zhù le zì jǐ","He was so angry he wanted to bang the table, but he managed to restrain himself.","Estaba tan furioso que quería golpear la mesa, pero logró contenerse.","Il était si en colère qu'il voulait frapper du poing sur la table, mais il a réussi à se retenir."],["L7-2397","刻苦","kèkǔ","Adj","hardworking","esforzado; aplicado","studieux; assidu","她家境贫寒，但学习非常刻苦。","tā jiā jìng pín hán dàn xué xí fēi cháng kè kǔ","Her family is poor, but she studies very hard.","Su familia es pobre, pero ella estudia con muchísimo esfuerzo.","Sa famille est pauvre, mais elle étudie avec beaucoup d'ardeur."],["L7-2398","刻意","kèyì","Adv","deliberately","deliberadamente; a propósito","délibérément; exprès","她的表演没有刻意煽情，却凭借细腻的神态打动了观众。","tā de biǎo yǎn méi yǒu kè yì shān qíng què píng jiè xì nì de shén tài dǎ dòng le guān zhòng","Her performance avoided deliberate sentimentality, yet moved the audience through subtle expressions.","Su actuación no buscó deliberadamente el sentimentalismo, pero conmovió al público con la sutileza de sus gestos.","Son jeu ne cherchait pas délibérément à faire pleurer, mais il a ému le public par la subtilité de ses expressions."],["L7-2399","刻舟求剑","kèzhōu-qiújiàn","","to be rigidly inflexible","ser rígido ante el cambio","rester figé face au changement","情况已经变了，还用老办法就是刻舟求剑。","qíng kuàng yǐ jīng biàn le hái yòng lǎo bàn fǎ jiù shì kè zhōu qiú jiàn","The situation has changed; sticking to the old methods would be like marking the boat to find the sword.","La situación ha cambiado; seguir usando los métodos de antes sería como marcar el barco para buscar la espada.","La situation a changé ; continuer avec les vieilles méthodes, c'est comme marquer le bateau pour retrouver l'épée tombée à l'eau."],["L7-2400","客房","kèfáng","N","guest room","habitación de huéspedes","chambre d'hôtes","这家酒店一共有三百多间客房，大部分都能看到海。","zhè jiā jiǔ diàn yí gòng yǒu sān bǎi duō jiān kè fáng dà bù fen dōu néng kàn dào hǎi","This hotel has more than three hundred guest rooms, most of them with sea views.","Este hotel tiene más de trescientas habitaciones, y la mayoría tienen vista al mar.","Cet hôtel compte plus de trois cents chambres, dont la plupart ont vue sur la mer."],["L7-2401","客机","kèjī","N","passenger plane","avión de pasajeros","avion de ligne","这架客机可以同时搭载三百名乘客。","zhè jià kè jī kě yǐ tóng shí dā zài sān bǎi míng chéng kè","This airliner can carry three hundred passengers at once.","Este avión de pasajeros puede transportar trescientas personas a la vez.","Cet avion de ligne peut transporter trois cents passagers à la fois."],["L7-2402","客流","kèliú","N","passenger flow","flujo de pasajeros","flux de voyageurs","春节前后，火车站的客流量明显增加。","chūn jié qián hòu huǒ chē zhàn de kè liú liàng míng xiǎn zēng jiā","Around Spring Festival, passenger flow at the railway station rises noticeably.","Alrededor del Festival de Primavera, el flujo de pasajeros en la estación de tren aumenta notablemente.","Autour de la fête du Printemps, l'affluence à la gare augmente nettement."],["L7-2403","客运","kèyùn","N","passenger transport","transporte de pasajeros","transport de voyageurs","这座城市新建了一个长途客运中心。","zhè zuò chéng shì xīn jiàn le yí ge cháng tú kè yùn zhōng xīn","This city has built a new long-distance passenger transport center.","Esta ciudad ha construido una nueva terminal de autobuses de larga distancia.","Cette ville a construit une nouvelle gare routière pour les longues distances."],["L7-2404","恳求","kěnqiú","V","to beg; to entreat","suplicar; implorar","supplier; implorer","她恳求医生想办法救救自己的孩子。","tā kěn qiú yī shēng xiǎng bàn fǎ jiù jiù zì jǐ de hái zi","She begged the doctor to find a way to save her child.","Le suplicó al médico que encontrara la manera de salvar a su hijo.","Elle a supplié le médecin de trouver un moyen de sauver son enfant."],["L7-2405","啃","kěn","V","to gnaw; to nibble","roer; mordisquear","ronger; grignoter","小狗趴在地上，津津有味地啃着一根骨头。","xiǎo gǒu pā zài dì shang jīn jīn yǒu wèi de kěn zhe yì gēn gǔ tou","The puppy lay on the ground, happily gnawing on a bone.","El perrito, echado en el suelo, roía un hueso con muchísimo gusto.","Le chiot, couché par terre, rongeait un os avec délectation."],["L7-2406","坑","kēng","V/N","pit; hole","hoyo; pozo","trou; fosse","下了一夜的雨，路上的坑里积满了水。","xià le yí yè de yǔ lù shang de kēng lǐ jī mǎn le shuǐ","After a night of rain, the potholes in the road were full of water.","Después de llover toda la noche, los baches del camino estaban llenos de agua.","Après une nuit de pluie, les nids-de-poule de la route étaient remplis d'eau."],["L7-2407","空荡荡","kōngdàngdàng","Adj","empty; deserted","vacío; desierto","vide; désert","放假了，学生们都回家了，宿舍里空荡荡的。","fàng jià le xué shēng men dōu huí jiā le sù shè lǐ kōng dàng dàng de","It's the holidays and the students have all gone home, so the dormitory is empty.","Llegaron las vacaciones, los estudiantes se fueron a casa y el dormitorio está vacío.","Les vacances ont commencé, les étudiants sont tous rentrés chez eux et le dortoir est désert."],["L7-2408","空难","kōngnàn","N","air crash","accidente aéreo","accident aérien","这次空难中只有两名乘客幸存。","zhè cì kōng nàn zhōng zhǐ yǒu liǎng míng chéng kè xìng cún","Only two passengers survived this air crash.","En este accidente aéreo solo sobrevivieron dos pasajeros.","Dans cet accident d'avion, seuls deux passagers ont survécu."],["L7-2409","空前","kōngqián","V","unprecedented","sin precedentes","sans précédent","这次展览规模空前，吸引了几十万观众。","zhè cì zhǎn lǎn guī mó kōng qián xī yǐn le jǐ shí wàn guān zhòng","This exhibition was unprecedented in scale and drew hundreds of thousands of visitors.","Esta exposición fue de una magnitud sin precedentes y atrajo a cientos de miles de visitantes.","Cette exposition, d'une ampleur sans précédent, a attiré des centaines de milliers de visiteurs."],["L7-2410","空想","kōngxiǎng","V/N","daydream; fantasy","ensoñación; fantasía","rêverie; fantasme","只有空想没有行动，梦想永远不会实现。","zhǐ yǒu kōng xiǎng méi yǒu xíng dòng mèng xiǎng yǒng yuǎn bú huì shí xiàn","With only daydreams and no action, a dream will never come true.","Si solo hay ilusiones y no se actúa, el sueño nunca se hará realidad.","Avec des rêves en l'air mais sans action, un rêve ne se réalisera jamais."],["L7-2411","空虚","kōngxū","Adj","hollow; empty","vacío; hueco","creux; vide","退休以后无事可做，他觉得生活很空虚。","tuì xiū yǐ hòu wú shì kě zuò tā jué de shēng huó hěn kōng xū","After retiring with nothing to do, he felt his life was empty.","Después de jubilarse, sin nada que hacer, sintió que su vida estaba vacía.","À la retraite, sans rien à faire, il a trouvé sa vie bien vide."],["L7-2412","恐怖","kǒngbù","Adj","terrible; terror","terrible; terror","terrible; terreur","她不敢一个人看恐怖电影。","tā bù gǎn yí ge rén kàn kǒng bù diàn yǐng","She doesn't dare watch horror films alone.","No se atreve a ver películas de terror sola.","Elle n'ose pas regarder seule des films d'horreur."],["L7-2413","恐吓","kǒnghè","V","to threaten; to intimidate","amenazar; intimidar","menacer; intimider","那个人打电话恐吓她，她马上报了警。","nà ge rén dǎ diàn huà kǒng hè tā tā mǎ shàng bào le jǐng","That person called to threaten her, and she immediately reported it to the police.","Esa persona la amenazó por teléfono y ella llamó de inmediato a la policía.","Cette personne l'a menacée par téléphone, et elle a immédiatement appelé la police."],["L7-2414","恐慌","kǒnghuāng","Adj","panic; panicky","pánico; presa del pánico","panique; paniqué","有人在网上散布虚假消息，造成了恐慌。","yǒu rén zài wǎng shàng sàn bù xū jiǎ xiāo xi zào chéng le kǒng huāng","Someone spread false information online, causing panic.","Alguien difundió información falsa en internet y causó pánico.","Quelqu'un a diffusé de fausses informations sur Internet, provoquant la panique."],["L7-2415","恐惧","kǒngjù","Adj","fear; dread","miedo; terror","peur; effroi","医生用通俗的语言解释了手术的风险，使家属不再一味恐惧。","yī shēng yòng tōng sú de yǔ yán jiě shì le shǒu shù de fēng xiǎn shǐ jiā shǔ bú zài yí wèi kǒng jù","The doctor explained the risks of the operation in plain language, helping the family move beyond sheer fear.","El médico explicó los riesgos de la operación en un lenguaje sencillo, de modo que la familia dejó de limitarse a sentir miedo.","Le médecin a expliqué les risques de l'opération en termes simples, ce qui a permis à la famille de ne plus se laisser submerger par la peur."],["L7-2416","恐龙","kǒnglóng","N","dinosaur","dinosaurio","dinosaure","博物馆里展出了一具完整的恐龙化石。","bó wù guǎn lǐ zhǎn chū le yí jù wán zhěng de kǒng lóng huà shí","The museum displays a complete dinosaur fossil.","En el museo se exhibe un fósil completo de dinosaurio.","Le musée expose un fossile de dinosaure complet."],["L7-2417","空白","kòngbái","N","blank space","espacio en blanco","espace vide","这项研究填补了国内这个领域的空白。","zhè xiàng yán jiū tián bǔ le guó nèi zhè ge lǐng yù de kòng bái","This research filled a gap in this field in the country.","Esta investigación llenó un vacío en este campo dentro del país.","Cette recherche a comblé une lacune dans ce domaine à l'échelle nationale."],["L7-2418","空地","kòngdì","N","vacant land","terreno baldío","terrain vague","楼前有一块空地，孩子们常在那儿踢球。","lóu qián yǒu yí kuài kòng dì hái zi men cháng zài nàr tī qiú","There's an open space in front of the building where the children often play football.","Frente al edificio hay un terreno baldío donde los niños suelen jugar al fútbol.","Devant l'immeuble se trouve un terrain vague où les enfants jouent souvent au football."],["L7-2419","空隙","kòngxì","N","gap; crack","hueco; rendija","interstice; fissure","他利用午休的空隙，看完了半本小说。","tā lì yòng wǔ xiū de kòng xì kàn wán le bàn běn xiǎo shuō","He used the gap during his lunch break to read half a novel.","Aprovechó el hueco de la pausa del almuerzo para leer la mitad de una novela.","Il a profité de la pause déjeuner pour lire la moitié d'un roman."],["L7-2420","控告","kònggào","V","to accuse; to charge","acusar; denunciar","accuser; porter plainte","这家公司被前员工控告拖欠工资。","zhè jiā gōng sī bèi qián yuán gōng kòng gào tuō qiàn gōng zī","Former employees have filed a complaint against the company over unpaid wages.","Esta empresa fue demandada por antiguos empleados por adeudar salarios.","Cette entreprise a été poursuivie par d'anciens employés pour retard de paiement des salaires."],["L7-2421","抠","kōu","V/Adj","to dig out; stingy","escarbar; tacaño","gratter; pingre","孩子用手指抠着墙上的石灰，被妈妈说了一顿。","hái zi yòng shǒu zhǐ kōu zhe qiáng shàng de shí huī bèi mā ma shuō le yí dùn","The child picked at the plaster on the wall with his finger and got scolded by his mother.","El niño estaba rascando con el dedo el yeso de la pared y su mamá lo regañó.","L'enfant grattait le plâtre du mur avec son doigt, et sa mère l'a grondé."],["L7-2422","口碑","kǒubēi","N","public reputation","reputación pública","réputation publique","这家餐厅口碑很好，很多人都是朋友推荐来的。","zhè jiā cān tīng kǒu bēi hěn hǎo hěn duō rén dōu shì péng you tuī jiàn lái de","This restaurant has an excellent reputation, and many diners come on friends' recommendations.","Este restaurante tiene muy buena fama y mucha gente viene por recomendación de amigos.","Ce restaurant a une excellente réputation, et beaucoup de clients viennent sur recommandation d'amis."],["L7-2423","口才","kǒucái","N","eloquence","elocuencia","éloquence","他口才很好，很适合做销售工作。","tā kǒu cái hěn hǎo hěn shì hé zuò xiāo shòu gōng zuò","He is very eloquent and well suited to sales work.","Tiene mucha labia y es muy apto para trabajar en ventas.","Il a beaucoup d'éloquence et convient très bien aux métiers de la vente."],["L7-2424","口吃","kǒuchī","V","to stutter","tartamudear","bégayer","他小时候有点儿口吃，经过练习现在说话很流利。","tā xiǎo shí hou yǒu diǎnr kǒu chī jīng guò liàn xí xiàn zài shuō huà hěn liú lì","He stammered a bit as a child, but after practice he now speaks very fluently.","De niño tartamudeaba un poco, pero con la práctica ahora habla con mucha fluidez.","Enfant, il bégayait un peu, mais à force de pratique, il parle maintenant très couramment."],["L7-2425","口感","kǒugǎn","N","mouthfeel; texture","sensación en la boca; textura","sensation en bouche; texture","这种面包外脆里软，口感特别好。","zhè zhǒng miàn bāo wài cuì lǐ ruǎn kǒu gǎn tè bié hǎo","This bread is crisp outside and soft inside, with a wonderful texture.","Este pan es crujiente por fuera y suave por dentro, con una textura excelente.","Ce pain est croustillant à l'extérieur et moelleux à l'intérieur, avec une texture excellente."],["L7-2426","口径","kǒujìng","N","caliber; stance","calibre; postura oficial","calibre; position officielle","对外发布消息时，各部门要统一口径。","duì wài fā bù xiāo xi shí gè bù mén yào tǒng yī kǒu jìng","When releasing information to the public, all departments must keep their story consistent.","Al dar información al exterior, todos los departamentos deben unificar su versión.","Lors de la diffusion d'informations vers l'extérieur, tous les services doivent s'accorder sur un discours commun."],["L7-2427","口令","kǒulìng","N","command; password","orden; contraseña","ordre; mot de passe","教官一声口令，全体学生立刻站好了队。","jiào guān yì shēng kǒu lìng quán tǐ xué shēng lì kè zhàn hǎo le duì","At the instructor's command, all the students immediately fell into line.","Al oír la voz de mando del instructor, todos los estudiantes se formaron de inmediato.","Sur un mot d'ordre de l'instructeur, tous les élèves se sont aussitôt mis en rang."],["L7-2428","口气","kǒuqì","N","tone of voice","tono de voz","ton; manière de parler","听他说话的口气，好像对结果不太满意。","tīng tā shuō huà de kǒu qì hǎo xiàng duì jié guǒ bú tài mǎn yì","From his tone of voice, he doesn't seem very satisfied with the result.","Por el tono con que habla, parece que no está muy conforme con el resultado.","À entendre le ton de sa voix, il ne semble pas très satisfait du résultat."],["L7-2429","口腔","kǒuqiāng","N","oral cavity","cavidad bucal","cavité buccale","每天早晚刷牙，才能保持口腔健康。","měi tiān zǎo wǎn shuā yá cái néng bǎo chí kǒu qiāng jiàn kāng","Brushing your teeth morning and night is the way to keep your mouth healthy.","Cepillarse los dientes por la mañana y por la noche es la manera de mantener sana la boca.","Se brosser les dents matin et soir permet de garder une bonne santé bucco-dentaire."],["L7-2430","口哨","kǒushào","N","whistle","silbido; silbato","sifflement; sifflet","他一边洗车，一边吹着口哨。","tā yì biān xǐ chē yì biān chuī zhe kǒu shào","He whistled as he washed the car.","Mientras lavaba el auto, iba silbando.","Tout en lavant la voiture, il sifflotait."],["L7-2431","口水","kǒushuǐ","N","saliva","saliva","salive","看到桌上的美食，孩子馋得直流口水。","kàn dào zhuō shàng de měi shí hái zi chán de zhí liú kǒu shuǐ","Seeing the delicious food on the table, the child's mouth was watering.","Al ver la comida deliciosa sobre la mesa, al niño se le hacía agua la boca.","En voyant les plats appétissants sur la table, l'enfant en avait l'eau à la bouche."],["L7-2432","口头","kǒutóu","N/Adj","oral; verbal","oral; verbal","oral; verbal","请假需要提交书面申请，口头说一声是不行的。","qǐng jià xū yào tí jiāo shū miàn shēn qǐng kǒu tóu shuō yì shēng shì bù xíng de","To take leave you must submit a written request; just saying so isn't enough.","Para pedir permiso hay que presentar una solicitud por escrito; decirlo de palabra no basta.","Pour demander un congé, il faut déposer une demande écrite ; le dire de vive voix ne suffit pas."],["L7-2433","口味","kǒuwèi","N","taste; flavor","gusto; sabor","goût; saveur","这道菜的口味偏甜，比较适合南方人。","zhè dào cài de kǒu wèi piān tián bǐ jiào shì hé nán fāng rén","This dish leans toward the sweet side and suits southerners better.","Este platillo tiene un sabor algo dulce y es más adecuado para la gente del sur.","Ce plat est plutôt sucré et convient mieux aux gens du sud."],["L7-2434","口香糖","kǒuxiāngtáng","N","chewing gum","chicle","chewing-gum","在公共场所乱吐口香糖是很不文明的行为。","zài gōng gòng chǎng suǒ luàn tǔ kǒu xiāng táng shì hěn bù wén míng de xíng wéi","Spitting chewing gum in public places is very uncivil behavior.","Tirar chicle en lugares públicos es una conducta muy incívica.","Cracher son chewing-gum dans les lieux publics est un comportement très incivil."],["L7-2435","口音","kǒuyīn","N","accent","acento","accent","她说话带着浓浓的四川口音。","tā shuō huà dài zhe nóng nóng de sì chuān kǒu yīn","She speaks with a strong Sichuan accent.","Habla con un marcado acento de Sichuan.","Elle parle avec un fort accent du Sichuan."],["L7-2436","口罩","kǒuzhào","N","face mask","mascarilla","masque","春天这里风沙很大，出门最好戴上口罩。","chūn tiān zhè lǐ fēng shā hěn dà chū mén zuì hǎo dài shàng kǒu zhào","In spring there's a lot of wind-blown sand here, so it's best to wear a mask when you go out.","En primavera aquí hay mucho viento con arena, así que conviene ponerse una mascarilla al salir.","Au printemps, il y a beaucoup de vent chargé de sable ici ; il vaut mieux porter un masque en sortant."],["L7-2437","口子","kǒuzi","N","opening; gash","abertura; corte","ouverture; entaille","他的裤子被铁丝豁了一个大口子。","tā de kù zi bèi tiě sī huō le yí ge dà kǒu zi","His trousers were torn open in a big gash by a wire.","Un alambre le hizo un gran desgarrón en el pantalón.","Un fil de fer a fait une grande déchirure dans son pantalon."],["L7-2438","扣除","kòuchú","V","to deduct","deducir; descontar","déduire; retenir","扣除房租和水电费，他每个月剩不下多少钱。","kòu chú fáng zū hé shuǐ diàn fèi tā měi ge yuè shèng bu xià duō shao qián","After rent and utilities are deducted, he has little money left each month.","Después de descontar la renta y los servicios de agua y luz, le queda muy poco dinero cada mes.","Une fois le loyer et les charges déduits, il ne lui reste pas grand-chose chaque mois."],["L7-2439","扣留","kòuliú","V","to detain; to confiscate","detener; confiscar","retenir; confisquer","这批货物因为手续不全，被海关扣留了。","zhè pī huò wù yīn wèi shǒu xù bù quán bèi hǎi guān kòu liú le","This shipment of goods was held by customs because the paperwork was incomplete.","Esta mercancía fue retenida por la aduana porque los trámites estaban incompletos.","Ce lot de marchandises a été retenu par la douane car les formalités étaient incomplètes."],["L7-2440","扣人心弦","kòurénxīnxián","","thrilling; gripping","emocionante; apasionante","palpitant; captivant","这场比赛扣人心弦，直到最后一分钟才分出胜负。","zhè chǎng bǐ sài kòu rén xīn xián zhí dào zuì hòu yì fēn zhōng cái fēn chū shèng fù","This match was gripping, and the winner wasn't decided until the final minute.","Este partido fue apasionante y el ganador no se decidió hasta el último minuto.","Ce match était palpitant, et le vainqueur n'a été connu qu'à la dernière minute."],["L7-2441","扣押","kòuyā","V","to detain; to seize","detener; embargar","détenir; saisir","这辆货车因为超载被交警扣押了。","zhè liàng huò chē yīn wèi chāo zài bèi jiāo jǐng kòu yā le","This truck was impounded by traffic police for being overloaded.","Este camión fue retenido por la policía de tránsito por exceso de carga.","Ce camion a été saisi par la police de la route pour surcharge."],["L7-2442","枯燥","kūzào","Adj","dull; dry","aburrido; árido","ennuyeux; aride","这门课的内容有些枯燥，但老师讲得很生动。","zhè mén kè de nèi róng yǒu xiē kū zào dàn lǎo shī jiǎng de hěn shēng dòng","The content of this course is somewhat dry, but the teacher presents it vividly.","El contenido de este curso es algo aburrido, pero el maestro lo explica de forma muy amena.","Le contenu de ce cours est un peu aride, mais le professeur l'expose de façon très vivante."],["L7-2443","哭泣","kūqì","V","to weep","llorar","pleurer","她一个人躲在房间里低声哭泣。","tā yí ge rén duǒ zài fáng jiān lǐ dī shēng kū qì","She hid alone in her room, weeping softly.","Se escondió sola en su cuarto y lloraba en voz baja.","Elle s'est cachée seule dans sa chambre et pleurait doucement."],["L7-2444","哭笑不得","kūxiào-bùdé","","not know whether to laugh or cry","no saber si reír o llorar","ne savoir s'il faut rire ou pleurer","孩子把我的手机泡在了鱼缸里，真让人哭笑不得。","hái zi bǎ wǒ de shǒu jī pào zài le yú gāng lǐ zhēn ràng rén kū xiào bù dé","My child soaked my phone in the fish tank—I didn't know whether to laugh or cry.","Mi hijo metió mi celular en la pecera; no supe si reír o llorar.","Mon enfant a plongé mon téléphone dans l'aquarium ; je ne savais pas si je devais rire ou pleurer."],["L7-2445","窟窿","kūlong","N","hole; deficit","agujero; déficit","trou; déficit","这件旧毛衣的袖子上破了一个窟窿。","zhè jiàn jiù máo yī de xiù zi shàng pò le yí ge kū long","There's a hole in the sleeve of this old sweater.","Este viejo suéter tiene un agujero en la manga.","Ce vieux pull a un trou à la manche."],["L7-2446","苦力","kǔlì","N","coolie; manual laborer","culi; peón","coolie; manœuvre","以前码头上有很多靠扛货为生的苦力。","yǐ qián mǎ tóu shàng yǒu hěn duō kào káng huò wéi shēng de kǔ lì","In the past there were many laborers on the docks who lived by carrying cargo.","Antes había muchos peones en el muelle que vivían de cargar mercancía.","Autrefois, il y avait sur les quais beaucoup de coolies qui gagnaient leur vie en portant des marchandises."],["L7-2447","苦练","kǔ liàn","","to train hard","entrenar duro","s'entraîner dur","为了参加比赛，她每天苦练六个小时。","wèi le cān jiā bǐ sài tā měi tiān kǔ liàn liù gè xiǎo shí","To compete, she practices hard for six hours every day.","Para participar en la competencia, entrena duramente seis horas al día.","Pour participer à la compétition, elle s'entraîne dur six heures par jour."],["L7-2448","苦难","kǔnàn","N","suffering; hardship","sufrimiento; penurias","souffrance; épreuves","这部小说描写了战争给普通百姓带来的苦难。","zhè bù xiǎo shuō miáo xiě le zhàn zhēng gěi pǔ tōng bǎi xìng dài lái de kǔ nàn","This novel depicts the suffering that war brought to ordinary people.","Esta novela describe el sufrimiento que la guerra trajo a la gente común.","Ce roman décrit les souffrances que la guerre a infligées à la population ordinaire."],["L7-2449","苦恼","kǔnǎo","Adj","vexed; distressed","afligido; angustiado","tourmenté; affligé","他最近为找不到工作而苦恼。","tā zuì jìn wèi zhǎo bu dào gōng zuò ér kǔ nǎo","He's been distressed lately about not being able to find a job.","Últimamente está angustiado porque no encuentra trabajo.","Il est tourmenté ces derniers temps de ne pas trouver de travail."],["L7-2450","苦笑","kǔxiào","V","to smile wryly","sonreír con amargura","sourire jaune","听到这个消息，他只能苦笑着摇了摇头。","tīng dào zhè ge xiāo xi tā zhǐ néng kǔ xiào zhe yáo le yáo tóu","Hearing the news, he could only smile bitterly and shake his head.","Al oír la noticia, solo pudo sonreír con amargura y mover la cabeza.","En apprenant la nouvelle, il n'a pu que sourire amèrement en secouant la tête."],["L7-2451","苦心","kǔxīn","N/Adv","painstaking effort","esfuerzo meticuloso","efforts minutieux","父母的一片苦心，孩子长大后才能明白。","fù mǔ de yí piàn kǔ xīn hái zi zhǎng dà hòu cái néng míng bai","Children only understand their parents' painstaking care once they grow up.","Los hijos solo comprenden el esfuerzo y la dedicación de sus padres cuando crecen.","Les enfants ne comprennent les efforts et la sollicitude de leurs parents qu'une fois adultes."],["L7-2452","酷似","kùsì","V","to strikingly resemble","parecerse mucho a","ressembler à s'y méprendre","这个小男孩长得酷似他的爷爷。","zhè ge xiǎo nán hái zhǎng de kù sì tā de yé ye","This little boy looks strikingly like his grandfather.","Este niño se parece muchísimo a su abuelo.","Ce petit garçon ressemble étonnamment à son grand-père."],["L7-2453","夸","kuā","V","to praise; to boast","elogiar; presumir","louer; se vanter","他向我竖起大拇指，夸我做得好。","tā xiàng wǒ shù qǐ dà mu zhǐ kuā wǒ zuò de hǎo","He gave me a thumbs-up and praised my work.","Me levantó el pulgar y me felicitó por lo bien que lo hice.","Il m'a fait un pouce levé et m'a félicité pour mon bon travail."],["L7-2454","夸大","kuādà","V","to exaggerate","exagerar","exagérer","研究团队并未夸大实验成果，而是坦言距离实际应用尚有差距。","yán jiū tuán duì bìng wèi kuā dà shí yàn chéng guǒ ér shì tǎn yán jù lí shí jì yìng yòng shàng yǒu chā jù","The research team did not exaggerate its experimental results, but frankly acknowledged the gap that remains before practical application.","El equipo de investigación no exageró los resultados del experimento, sino que reconoció con franqueza que aún hay una brecha para su aplicación práctica.","L'équipe de recherche n'a pas exagéré les résultats de l'expérience, mais a reconnu franchement qu'il restait un écart avant toute application concrète."],["L7-2455","夸奖","kuājiǎng","V","to praise; to compliment","elogiar; halagar","féliciter; complimenter","客人们都夸奖妈妈做的菜好吃。","kè rén men dōu kuā jiǎng mā ma zuò de cài hǎo chī","The guests all praised Mom's cooking.","Todos los invitados elogiaron lo rica que estaba la comida de mamá.","Les invités ont tous complimenté maman pour la qualité de sa cuisine."],["L7-2456","夸夸其谈","kuākuā-qítán","","to talk big","hablar con grandilocuencia","parler pompeusement","他只会夸夸其谈，真正做起事来却一点儿也不行。","tā zhǐ huì kuā kuā qí tán zhēn zhèng zuò qǐ shì lái què yì diǎnr yě bù xíng","He can only talk big; when it comes to actually doing things, he's useless.","Solo sabe hablar por hablar; a la hora de hacer las cosas de verdad, no sirve para nada.","Il ne sait que faire de grands discours ; quand il faut vraiment agir, il n'est bon à rien."],["L7-2457","夸耀","kuāyào","V","to flaunt; to brag about","alardear de; presumir de","faire étalage de; se vanter de","他总喜欢在朋友面前夸耀自己的新车。","tā zǒng xǐ huan zài péng you miàn qián kuā yào zì jǐ de xīn chē","He always likes to show off his new car in front of his friends.","Siempre le gusta presumir de su auto nuevo delante de sus amigos.","Il aime toujours faire étalage de sa nouvelle voiture devant ses amis."],["L7-2458","夸张","kuāzhāng","Adj/N","exaggerated; to exaggerate","exagerado; exagerar","exagéré; exagérer","这个广告太夸张了，说吃一个月就能瘦二十斤。","zhè ge guǎng gào tài kuā zhāng le shuō chī yí ge yuè jiù néng shòu èr shí jīn","This ad is too exaggerated — it claims you can lose twenty jin in a month.","Este anuncio es demasiado exagerado: dice que en un mes se pueden bajar diez kilos.","Cette publicité est exagérée : elle prétend qu'on peut perdre dix kilos en un mois."],["L7-2459","垮","kuǎ","V","to collapse","derrumbarse","s'effondrer","由于经营不善，这家工厂最后还是垮了。","yóu yú jīng yíng bú shàn zhè jiā gōng chǎng zuì hòu hái shi kuǎ le","Because of poor management, this factory collapsed in the end.","Por la mala gestión, esta fábrica terminó quebrando.","À cause d'une mauvaise gestion, cette usine a fini par s'effondrer."],["L7-2460","挎","kuà","V","to carry slung (on arm/shoulder)","llevar colgado del brazo","porter en bandoulière","老太太挎着一个竹篮，到集市上去买菜。","lǎo tài tai kuà zhe yí ge zhú lán dào jí shì shàng qù mǎi cài","The old lady, with a bamboo basket over her arm, went to the market to buy vegetables.","La anciana, con una canasta de bambú colgada del brazo, fue al mercado a comprar verduras.","La vieille dame, un panier de bambou au bras, est allée au marché acheter des légumes."],["L7-2461","跨国","kuàguó","V","transnational","transnacional","transnational","她大学毕业后进了一家跨国公司工作。","tā dà xué bì yè hòu jìn le yì jiā kuà guó gōng sī gōng zuò","After graduating from university she joined a multinational company.","Después de graduarse de la universidad, entró a trabajar en una empresa multinacional.","Après ses études universitaires, elle est entrée dans une multinationale."],["L7-2462","跨越","kuàyuè","V","to cross; to span","cruzar; superar","franchir; dépasser","这座大桥跨越长江，连接了南北两岸。","zhè zuò dà qiáo kuà yuè cháng jiāng lián jiē le nán běi liǎng àn","This bridge spans the Yangtze River, linking its north and south banks.","Este gran puente cruza el río Yangtsé y une las orillas norte y sur.","Ce grand pont enjambe le Yangzi et relie les rives nord et sud."],["L7-2463","快捷","kuàijié","Adj","quick; fast","rápido; ágil","rapide; prompt","网上支付快捷方便，越来越受欢迎。","wǎng shàng zhī fù kuài jié fāng biàn yuè lái yuè shòu huān yíng","Online payment is fast and convenient and is increasingly popular.","El pago en línea es rápido y cómodo, y cada vez es más popular.","Le paiement en ligne est rapide et pratique, et il est de plus en plus populaire."],["L7-2464","宽敞","kuānchang","Adj","spacious","espacioso; amplio","spacieux; vaste","新房子的客厅又宽敞又明亮。","xīn fáng zi de kè tīng yòu kuān chang yòu míng liàng","The living room in the new house is spacious and bright.","La sala de la casa nueva es amplia y luminosa.","Le salon de la nouvelle maison est spacieux et lumineux."],["L7-2465","宽泛","kuānfàn","Adj","broad; wide-ranging","amplio; de gran alcance","large; étendu","这个题目太宽泛了，不好写，最好再具体一点儿。","zhè ge tí mù tài kuān fàn le bù hǎo xiě zuì hǎo zài jù tǐ yì diǎnr","This topic is too broad to write about well; it's best to make it more specific.","Este tema es demasiado amplio y difícil de desarrollar; es mejor concretarlo un poco más.","Ce sujet est trop vaste pour être bien traité ; il vaudrait mieux le préciser davantage."],["L7-2466","宽厚","kuānhòu","Adj","tolerant; generous","tolerante; generoso","tolérant; généreux","爷爷待人宽厚，从来不跟别人计较。","yé ye dài rén kuān hòu cóng lái bù gēn bié rén jì jiào","Grandpa is kind and tolerant toward others and never makes a fuss over small matters.","El abuelo es bondadoso y tolerante con los demás, y nunca se pone a discutir por pequeñeces.","Grand-père est bienveillant et généreux avec les autres et ne chicane jamais pour des broutilles."],["L7-2467","宽容","kuānróng","V","tolerant; to forgive","tolerante; perdonar","tolérant; pardonner","对待别人的小错误，我们应该学会宽容。","duì dài bié rén de xiǎo cuò wù wǒ men yīng gāi xué huì kuān róng","We should learn to be tolerant of other people's small mistakes.","Debemos aprender a ser tolerantes con los pequeños errores de los demás.","Nous devrions apprendre à être tolérants envers les petites erreurs d'autrui."],["L7-2468","宽恕","kuānshù","V","to forgive; forgiveness","perdonar; perdón","pardonner; pardon","他真诚地道了歉，希望得到朋友的宽恕。","tā zhēn chéng de dào le qiàn xī wàng dé dào péng you de kuān shù","He apologized sincerely, hoping for his friend's forgiveness.","Se disculpó con sinceridad, esperando el perdón de su amigo.","Il s'est sincèrement excusé, espérant le pardon de son ami."],["L7-2469","宽松","kuānsōng","Adj","spacious; loose","holgado; relajado","spacieux; ample","她喜欢穿宽松的衣服，觉得舒服。","tā xǐ huan chuān kuān sōng de yī fu jué de shū fu","She likes to wear loose clothes because they feel comfortable.","Le gusta usar ropa holgada porque le resulta cómoda.","Elle aime porter des vêtements amples parce qu'elle s'y sent à l'aise."],["L7-2470","款式","kuǎnshì","N","style; design","estilo; diseño","style; modèle","这件衣服是中性的款式，男女都能穿。","zhè jiàn yī fu shì zhōng xìng de kuǎn shì nán nǚ dōu néng chuān","This garment is a unisex style that both men and women can wear.","Esta prenda es de estilo unisex y la pueden usar tanto hombres como mujeres.","Ce vêtement est de style unisexe et peut être porté aussi bien par les hommes que par les femmes."],["L7-2471","款项","kuǎnxiàng","N","funds; sum of money","fondos; suma de dinero","fonds; somme d'argent","这笔款项将全部用于修建山区学校。","zhè bǐ kuǎn xiàng jiāng quán bù yòng yú xiū jiàn shān qū xué xiào","This sum of money will be used entirely to build schools in the mountains.","Esta suma de dinero se destinará íntegramente a la construcción de escuelas en zonas montañosas.","Cette somme sera entièrement consacrée à la construction d'écoles en montagne."],["L7-2472","筐","kuāng","N","basket","cesta","panier","奶奶从地里摘回来满满一筐西红柿。","nǎi nai cóng dì lǐ zhāi huí lái mǎn mǎn yì kuāng xī hóng shì","Grandma picked a full basket of tomatoes from the field and brought them back.","La abuela trajo del campo una canasta llena de tomates.","Grand-mère est revenue des champs avec un panier plein de tomates."],["L7-2473","狂欢","kuánghuān","V","revelry; carousal","juerga; festejo","fête; bamboche","比赛胜利后，球迷们在街头狂欢到深夜。","bǐ sài shèng lì hòu qiú mí men zài jiē tóu kuáng huān dào shēn yè","After the victory, fans celebrated wildly in the streets until late at night.","Después de la victoria, los aficionados festejaron como locos en las calles hasta bien entrada la noche.","Après la victoire, les supporters ont fait la fête dans les rues jusque tard dans la nuit."],["L7-2474","狂欢节","kuánghuānjié","N","carnival","carnaval","carnaval","每年二月，这座城市都会举办盛大的狂欢节。","měi nián èr yuè zhè zuò chéng shì dōu huì jǔ bàn shèng dà de kuáng huān jié","Every February this city holds a grand carnival.","Cada febrero, esta ciudad celebra un gran carnaval.","Chaque février, cette ville organise un grand carnaval."],["L7-2475","狂热","kuángrè","Adj","fanatical; feverish","fanático; febril","fanatique; fébrile","他对足球的狂热，从小到大一直没变。","tā duì zú qiú de kuáng rè cóng xiǎo dào dà yì zhí méi biàn","His fervent enthusiasm for football has remained unchanged since childhood.","Su fanatismo por el fútbol no ha cambiado desde que era niño.","Sa passion dévorante pour le football n'a pas changé depuis l'enfance."],["L7-2476","旷课","kuàngkè","","to skip class","faltar a clase","sécher les cours","他这学期旷课太多，被学校警告了。","tā zhè xué qī kuàng kè tài duō bèi xué xiào jǐng gào le","He skipped too many classes this semester and received a warning from the school.","Faltó demasiado a clases este semestre y la escuela lo amonestó.","Il a séché trop de cours ce semestre et a reçu un avertissement de l'école."],["L7-2477","况且","kuàngqiě","Conj","moreover; besides","además; por otra parte","d'ailleurs; en outre","这件衣服太贵了，况且颜色我也不喜欢。","zhè jiàn yī fu tài guì le kuàng qiě yán sè wǒ yě bù xǐ huan","This piece of clothing is too expensive, and besides, I don't like the color.","Esta ropa es demasiado cara y, además, el color no me gusta.","Ce vêtement est trop cher et, de plus, je n'aime pas la couleur."],["L7-2478","矿藏","kuàngcáng","N","mineral resources","recursos minerales","ressources minérales","这一带地下有丰富的矿藏。","zhè yí dài dì xià yǒu fēng fù de kuàng cáng","There are rich mineral deposits underground in this area.","En esta zona hay abundantes yacimientos minerales bajo tierra.","Le sous-sol de cette région recèle de riches gisements minéraux."],["L7-2479","框","kuàng","N/V","frame; framework","marco; enmarcar","cadre; encadrer","请用红笔把文章里的错别字框出来。","qǐng yòng hóng bǐ bǎ wén zhāng lǐ de cuò bié zì kuàng chū lái","Please use a red pen to draw boxes around the incorrectly written characters in the essay.","Por favor, encierra en un recuadro con bolígrafo rojo los caracteres mal escritos del texto.","Veuillez encadrer au stylo rouge les caractères erronés dans le texte."],["L7-2480","框架","kuàngjià","N","frame; framework","armazón; marco","ossature; cadre","双方已经就合作的基本框架达成了一致。","shuāng fāng yǐ jīng jiù hé zuò de jī běn kuàng jià dá chéng le yí zhì","The two sides have reached agreement on the basic framework for cooperation.","Las dos partes ya llegaron a un acuerdo sobre el marco básico de la cooperación.","Les deux parties se sont mises d'accord sur le cadre de base de la coopération."],["L7-2481","亏本","kuīběn","","to lose money","tener pérdidas","travailler à perte","这笔生意他做亏本了，赔了好几万。","zhè bǐ shēng yi tā zuò kuī běn le péi le hǎo jǐ wàn","He lost money on this deal, tens of thousands of yuan.","Salió perdiendo en este negocio: perdió varias decenas de miles.","Il a fait une mauvaise affaire et y a perdu plusieurs dizaines de milliers de yuans."],["L7-2482","亏损","kuīsǔn","V","deficit; loss","déficit; pérdida","déficit; perte","由于原材料涨价，公司今年出现了亏损。","yóu yú yuán cái liào zhǎng jià gōng sī jīn nián chū xiàn le kuī sǔn","Because raw material prices rose, the company posted a loss this year.","Debido al aumento del precio de las materias primas, la empresa tuvo pérdidas este año.","En raison de la hausse du prix des matières premières, l'entreprise a enregistré des pertes cette année."],["L7-2483","昆虫","kūnchóng","N","insect","insecto","insecte","这只昆虫把自己伪装成一片树叶。","zhè zhī kūn chóng bǎ zì jǐ wěi zhuāng chéng yí piàn shù yè","This insect disguises itself as a leaf.","Este insecto se camufla como una hoja.","Cet insecte se camoufle en feuille."],["L7-2484","捆","kǔn","V/M","bundle; to tie up","fardo; atar","botte; ficeler","他把旧报纸捆起来，准备拿去卖掉。","tā bǎ jiù bào zhǐ kǔn qǐ lái zhǔn bèi ná qù mài diào","He tied up the old newspapers, ready to sell them.","Ató los periódicos viejos en un fardo para ir a venderlos.","Il a ficelé les vieux journaux en paquet pour aller les vendre."],["L7-2485","困惑","kùnhuò","Adj/V","bewildered; confused","desconcertado; confundido","perplexe; confus","这道题的答案让很多学生感到困惑。","zhè dào tí de dá àn ràng hěn duō xué shēng gǎn dào kùn huò","The answer to this question puzzled many students.","La respuesta a esta pregunta dejó desconcertados a muchos estudiantes.","La réponse à cette question a laissé perplexes beaucoup d'élèves."],["L7-2486","困境","kùnjìng","N","predicament; plight","apuro; situación difícil","situation difficile; impasse","面对困境，他没有放弃，而是想办法解决。","miàn duì kùn jìng tā méi yǒu fàng qì ér shì xiǎng bàn fǎ jiě jué","Faced with difficulties, he didn't give up but looked for a way to solve them.","Ante la adversidad, no se rindió, sino que buscó la manera de resolverla.","Face aux difficultés, il n'a pas renoncé, mais a cherché comment les résoudre."],["L7-2487","扩","kuò","V","to enlarge; to expand","ampliar; expandir","agrandir; élargir","这条马路明年要扩成双向六车道。","zhè tiáo mǎ lù míng nián yào kuò chéng shuāng xiàng liù chē dào","This road will be widened next year to six lanes in total, three in each direction.","El próximo año esta calle se ampliará a seis carriles, tres en cada sentido.","L'an prochain, cette route sera élargie à six voies, trois dans chaque sens."],["L7-2488","扩建","kuòjiàn","V","to extend (a building)","ampliar (una construcción)","agrandir (un bâtiment)","机场正在扩建，明年将新增一条跑道。","jī chǎng zhèng zài kuò jiàn míng nián jiāng xīn zēng yì tiáo pǎo dào","The airport is being expanded and will add a new runway next year.","El aeropuerto está en ampliación y el próximo año tendrá una nueva pista.","L'aéroport est en cours d'agrandissement et disposera d'une nouvelle piste l'an prochain."],["L7-2489","扩散","kuòsàn","V","to spread; to diffuse","propagarse; difundirse","se propager; se diffuser","癌细胞已经扩散，治疗起来非常困难。","ái xì bāo yǐ jīng kuò sàn zhì liáo qǐ lái fēi cháng kùn nan","The cancer cells have already spread, making treatment very difficult.","Las células cancerosas ya se han diseminado y el tratamiento es muy difícil.","Les cellules cancéreuses se sont déjà propagées, ce qui rend le traitement très difficile."],["L7-2490","扩张","kuòzhāng","V","to expand; expansion","expandir; expansión","étendre; expansion","随着城市不断扩张，耕地面积越来越少。","suí zhe chéng shì bú duàn kuò zhāng gēng dì miàn jī yuè lái yuè shǎo","As cities keep expanding, there is less and less farmland.","A medida que las ciudades se siguen expandiendo, la superficie de tierras cultivables es cada vez menor.","Au fur et à mesure que les villes s'étendent, les terres cultivées se font de plus en plus rares."],["L7-2491","括弧","kuòhú","N","parentheses","paréntesis","parenthèses","请把补充说明写在括弧里面。","qǐng bǎ bǔ chōng shuō míng xiě zài kuò hú lǐ miàn","Please write the additional notes inside the parentheses.","Por favor, escribe la nota adicional entre paréntesis.","Veuillez écrire la remarque complémentaire entre parenthèses."],["L7-2492","阔绰","kuòchuò","Adj","extravagant; lavish","ostentoso; derrochador","fastueux; dépensier","他出手阔绰，一顿饭就花了好几千块。","tā chū shǒu kuò chuò yí dùn fàn jiù huā le hǎo jǐ qiān kuài","He spends lavishly; a single meal cost him several thousand yuan.","Gasta con generosidad: solo una comida le costó varios miles de yuanes.","Il dépense sans compter : un seul repas lui a coûté plusieurs milliers de yuans."],["L7-2493","拉动","lādòng","V","to pull; to stimulate","jalar; estimular","tirer; stimuler","旅游业的发展有力地拉动了当地经济。","lǚ yóu yè de fā zhǎn yǒu lì de lā dòng le dāng dì jīng jì","The growth of tourism has strongly boosted the local economy.","El desarrollo del turismo ha impulsado con fuerza la economía local.","Le développement du tourisme a fortement stimulé l'économie locale."],["L7-2494","拉拢","lālǒng","V","to win over; to rope in","ganarse; atraer","rallier; s'attacher","他想用请客送礼的办法拉拢领导。","tā xiǎng yòng qǐng kè sòng lǐ de bàn fǎ lā lǒng lǐng dǎo","He wanted to win over his boss by treating him to meals and giving him gifts.","Quería ganarse el favor del jefe invitándolo a comer y haciéndole regalos.","Il voulait s'attirer les bonnes grâces de son supérieur en l'invitant à dîner et en lui offrant des cadeaux."],["L7-2495","拉锁","lāsuǒ","N","zipper","cremallera","fermeture éclair","这个包的拉锁坏了，拉不上了。","zhè ge bāo de lā suǒ huài le lā bú shàng le","The zipper on this bag is broken and won't close.","El cierre de esta bolsa se rompió y no se puede cerrar.","La fermeture éclair de ce sac est cassée et ne se ferme plus."],["L7-2496","啦啦队","lālāduì","N","cheerleading squad","equipo de animadoras","équipe de pom-pom girls","场边的啦啦队一直在为队员们加油。","chǎng biān de lā lā duì yì zhí zài wèi duì yuán men jiā yóu","The cheerleading squad on the sidelines kept cheering the players on.","El grupo de porristas a un lado del campo animó a los jugadores todo el tiempo.","Les pom-pom girls au bord du terrain n'ont cessé d'encourager les joueurs."],["L7-2497","喇叭","lǎba","N","horn; loudspeaker","bocina; altavoz","klaxon; haut-parleur","在医院附近开车，请不要按喇叭。","zài yī yuàn fù jìn kāi chē qǐng bú yào àn lǎ ba","When driving near a hospital, please don't honk your horn.","Al conducir cerca de un hospital, por favor no toque el claxon.","Lorsque vous conduisez près d'un hôpital, veuillez ne pas klaxonner."],["L7-2498","腊月","làyuè","N","twelfth lunar month","duodécimo mes lunar","douzième mois lunaire","一进腊月，家家户户就开始准备过年了。","yí jìn là yuè jiā jiā hù hù jiù kāi shǐ zhǔn bèi guò nián le","As soon as the twelfth lunar month begins, every household starts preparing for the New Year.","En cuanto llega el duodécimo mes lunar, todas las familias empiezan a prepararse para el Año Nuevo.","Dès que commence le douzième mois lunaire, toutes les familles se mettent à préparer le Nouvel An."],["L7-2499","蜡","là","N","wax; candle","cera; vela","cire; bougie","蜡烛烧完了，桌子上留下了一层蜡。","là zhú shāo wán le zhuō zi shàng liú xià le yì céng là","The candle burned down and left a layer of wax on the table.","La vela se consumió y dejó una capa de cera sobre la mesa.","La bougie s'est consumée et a laissé une couche de cire sur la table."],["L7-2500","蜡烛","làzhú","N","candle","vela","bougie","蜡烛烧完了，桌子上留下了一层蜡。","là zhú shāo wán le zhuō zi shàng liú xià le yì céng là","The candle burned down and left a layer of wax on the table.","La vela se consumió y dejó una capa de cera sobre la mesa.","La bougie s'est consumée et a laissé une couche de cire sur la table."],["L7-2501","辣椒","làjiāo","N","chili pepper","chile; ají","piment","四川菜的特点是放很多辣椒和花椒。","sì chuān cài de tè diǎn shì fàng hěn duō là jiāo hé huā jiāo","Sichuan cuisine is characterized by plenty of chili peppers and Sichuan pepper.","La comida de Sichuan se caracteriza por llevar mucho chile y pimienta de Sichuan.","La cuisine du Sichuan se caractérise par beaucoup de piment et de poivre du Sichuan."],["L7-2502","来宾","láibīn","N","guest; visitor","invitado; visitante","invité; visiteur","请各位来宾按照座位号就座。","qǐng gè wèi lái bīn àn zhào zuò wèi hào jiù zuò","All guests are requested to take their seats according to their seat numbers.","Se ruega a los invitados que tomen asiento según el número de su lugar.","Les invités sont priés de s'installer selon leur numéro de place."],["L7-2503","来电","láidiàn","V/N","incoming call","llamada entrante","appel entrant","如有疑问，欢迎来电咨询。","rú yǒu yí wèn huān yíng lái diàn zī xún","If you have any questions, you're welcome to call us for information.","Si tiene alguna duda, le invitamos a llamarnos para consultar.","Pour toute question, n'hésitez pas à nous appeler pour vous renseigner."],["L7-2504","来访","láifǎng","V","to pay a visit","hacer una visita","rendre visite","欢迎各位来访的外国朋友。","huān yíng gè wèi lái fǎng de wài guó péng you","We welcome all our visiting foreign friends.","Damos la bienvenida a todos los amigos extranjeros que nos visitan.","Nous souhaitons la bienvenue à tous nos amis étrangers en visite."],["L7-2505","来回","láihuí","Adv/N","round trip; back and forth","ida y vuelta; de un lado a otro","aller-retour; va-et-vient","他在几家公司之间来回周旋。","tā zài jǐ jiā gōng sī zhī jiān lái huí zhōu xuán","He went back and forth dealing with several companies.","Anduvo de un lado a otro negociando entre varias empresas.","Il a fait des allées et venues pour mener ses tractations entre plusieurs entreprises."],["L7-2506","来历","láilì","N","origin; background","origen; antecedentes","origine; passé","这块古玉的来历至今还是个谜。","zhè kuài gǔ yù de lái lì zhì jīn hái shi gè mí","The origin of this ancient jade is still a mystery.","El origen de este antiguo jade sigue siendo un misterio hasta hoy.","L'origine de ce jade ancien reste à ce jour un mystère."],["L7-2507","来临","láilín","V","to approach; to arrive","acercarse; llegar","approcher; arriver","台风来临前，渔船纷纷回港避风。","tái fēng lái lín qián yú chuán fēn fēn huí gǎng bì fēng","Before the typhoon arrived, fishing boats returned to port one after another to shelter from the wind.","Antes de la llegada del tifón, los barcos de pesca regresaron al puerto uno tras otro para resguardarse del viento.","Avant l'arrivée du typhon, les bateaux de pêche sont rentrés au port les uns après les autres pour s'abriter du vent."],["L7-2508","来龙去脉","láilóng-qùmài","","whole story; ins and outs","toda la historia; pormenores","tenants et aboutissants","这份报告虽然篇幅有限，却对争议的来龙去脉作了深入的剖析。","zhè fèn bào gào suī rán piān fú yǒu xiàn què duì zhēng yì de lái lóng qù mài zuò le shēn rù de pōu xī","Although limited in length, this report offers an in-depth analysis of how the dispute arose and developed.","Aunque este informe es breve, analiza a fondo cómo surgió y se desarrolló la controversia.","Bien que ce rapport soit de longueur limitée, il analyse en profondeur les tenants et aboutissants de la controverse."],["L7-2509","来年","láinián","N","next year","el próximo año","l'année prochaine","农民们希望来年还能有个好收成。","nóng mín men xī wàng lái nián hái néng yǒu gè hǎo shōu chéng","The farmers hope for another good harvest in the coming year.","Los campesinos esperan que el año que viene vuelva a haber una buena cosecha.","Les paysans espèrent une nouvelle bonne récolte l'année prochaine."],["L7-2510","来源于","láiyuán yú","","to originate from","tener su origen en","provenir de","这个故事来源于一个古老的民间传说。","zhè ge gù shi lái yuán yú yí ge gǔ lǎo de mín jiān chuán shuō","This story originates from an ancient folk legend.","Esta historia proviene de una antigua leyenda popular.","Cette histoire tire son origine d'une ancienne légende populaire."],["L7-2511","拦","lán","V","to block; to flag down","bloquear; parar","barrer; héler","她站在路边，拦了一辆出租车去机场。","tā zhàn zài lù biān lán le yí liàng chū zū chē qù jī chǎng","She stood by the road and flagged down a taxi to the airport.","Se paró al borde de la calle y detuvo un taxi para ir al aeropuerto.","Elle s'est postée au bord de la route et a hélé un taxi pour aller à l'aéroport."],["L7-2512","栏","lán","N","fence; column","valla; columna","barrière; colonne","这座桥历经风雨仍然坚固，桥栏上的雕刻却已留下岁月的痕迹。","zhè zuò qiáo lì jīng fēng yǔ réng rán jiān gù qiáo lán shàng de diāo kè què yǐ liú xià suì yuè de hén jì","The bridge remains sturdy after years of weathering, though the carvings on its railings bear the marks of time.","Este puente sigue firme después de soportar tantos años de viento y lluvia, aunque los grabados de su barandilla muestran las huellas del tiempo.","Ce pont reste solide malgré les intempéries des ans, mais les sculptures de sa balustrade portent la marque du temps."],["L7-2513","栏杆","lángān","N","railing","barandilla","balustrade","保安劝阻游客不要翻越栏杆拍照。","bǎo ān quàn zǔ yóu kè bú yào fān yuè lán gān pāi zhào","The security guard urged the tourists not to climb over the railing to take photos.","El guardia de seguridad pidió a los turistas que no saltaran la barandilla para tomarse fotos.","L'agent de sécurité a dissuadé les touristes d'enjamber la balustrade pour se prendre en photo."],["L7-2514","蓝图","lántú","N","blueprint","plano; proyecto","plan; projet","这份规划为城市未来的发展勾画了蓝图。","zhè fèn guī huà wèi chéng shì wèi lái de fā zhǎn gōu huà le lán tú","This plan sketches out a blueprint for the city's future development.","Este plan traza el esbozo del futuro desarrollo de la ciudad.","Ce plan esquisse le projet de développement futur de la ville."],["L7-2515","揽","lǎn","V","to monopolize; to embrace","acaparar; abrazar","accaparer; embrasser","妈妈把哭着的孩子揽在怀里，轻声安慰他。","mā ma bǎ kū zhe de hái zi lǎn zài huái lǐ qīng shēng ān wèi tā","Mom drew the crying child into her arms and comforted him softly.","Mamá abrazó al niño que lloraba y lo consoló en voz baja.","Maman a serré contre elle l'enfant en larmes et l'a consolé doucement."],["L7-2516","缆车","lǎnchē","N","cable car","teleférico","téléphérique","我们坐缆车上了山顶，不用爬山了。","wǒ men zuò lǎn chē shàng le shān dǐng bú yòng pá shān le","We took the cable car to the summit, so we didn't have to climb.","Subimos a la cima en teleférico y no tuvimos que escalar.","Nous sommes montés au sommet en téléphérique, sans avoir à grimper."],["L7-2517","懒得","lǎnde","V","to not feel like","no tener ganas de","ne pas avoir envie de","天太热了，我懒得出门，就在家里看书。","tiān tài rè le wǒ lǎn de chū mén jiù zài jiā lǐ kàn shū","It's so hot that I can't be bothered to go out, so I'm reading at home.","Hace tanto calor que me da pereza salir, así que me quedo leyendo en casa.","Il fait si chaud que je n'ai pas envie de sortir ; je reste lire à la maison."],["L7-2518","懒惰","lǎnduò","Adj","lazy; idle","perezoso; holgazán","paresseux; oisif","懒惰的人很难取得成功。","lǎn duò de rén hěn nán qǔ dé chéng gōng","Lazy people find it hard to succeed.","A las personas perezosas les cuesta mucho tener éxito.","Les paresseux ont du mal à réussir."],["L7-2519","滥用","lànyòng","V","to misuse; to abuse","abusar de; usar mal","abuser de; mal utiliser","抗生素不能滥用，否则会产生耐药性。","kàng shēng sù bù néng làn yòng fǒu zé huì chǎn shēng nài yào xìng","Antibiotics must not be abused, or drug resistance will develop.","Los antibióticos no deben usarse en exceso, de lo contrario se genera resistencia.","Il ne faut pas abuser des antibiotiques, sinon une résistance se développe."],["L7-2520","狼","láng","N","wolf","lobo","loup","这部纪录片展示了狼凶残的一面。","zhè bù jì lù piàn zhǎn shì le láng xiōng cán de yí miàn","This documentary shows the savage side of wolves.","Este documental muestra el lado feroz de los lobos.","Ce documentaire montre le côté féroce des loups."],["L7-2521","狼狈","lángbèi","Adj","in a sorry state; embarrassed","apurado; en apuros","piteux; dans l'embarras","他忘了带伞，被雨淋得十分狼狈。","tā wàng le dài sǎn bèi yǔ lín de shí fēn láng bèi","He forgot his umbrella and was left in a sorry state by the rain.","Olvidó el paraguas y la lluvia lo dejó hecho una lástima.","Il a oublié son parapluie et s'est retrouvé trempé et dans un piteux état."],["L7-2522","朗诵","lǎngsòng","V","to recite; to declaim","recitar; declamar","réciter; déclamer","她在晚会上朗诵了一首自己写的诗。","tā zài wǎn huì shàng lǎng sòng le yì shǒu zì jǐ xiě de shī","At the party she recited a poem she had written herself.","En la fiesta recitó un poema que ella misma escribió.","À la soirée, elle a récité un poème de sa composition."],["L7-2523","浪","làng","N","wave; unrestrained","ola; desenfrenado","vague; débridé","夏天，很多年轻人到海南学习冲浪。","xià tiān hěn duō nián qīng rén dào hǎi nán xué xí chōng làng","In summer, many young people go to Hainan to learn to surf.","En verano, muchos jóvenes van a Hainan a aprender a surfear.","En été, beaucoup de jeunes se rendent à Hainan pour apprendre le surf."],["L7-2524","捞","lāo","V","to fish out; to dredge up","pescar; sacar del agua","repêcher; extraire","他的手机掉进了河里，好不容易才捞上来。","tā de shǒu jī diào jìn le hé lǐ hǎo bù róng yì cái lāo shàng lái","His phone fell into the river, and he only fished it out with great difficulty.","Su celular se cayó al río y con mucho trabajo logró sacarlo.","Son téléphone est tombé dans la rivière, et il a eu bien du mal à le repêcher."],["L7-2525","劳动力","láodònglì","N","labor force","mano de obra","main-d'œuvre","这轮产业转型既带来了新的机遇，也迫使企业重新审视劳动力的配置。","zhè lún chǎn yè zhuǎn xíng jì dài lái le xīn de jī yù yě pò shǐ qǐ yè chóng xīn shěn shì láo dòng lì de pèi zhì","This round of industrial transformation has created new opportunities while compelling companies to reconsider how they allocate their workforce.","Esta ola de transformación industrial ha traído nuevas oportunidades, pero también obliga a las empresas a replantearse la distribución de su fuerza laboral.","Cette vague de transformation industrielle a apporté de nouvelles opportunités, mais oblige aussi les entreprises à repenser la répartition de leur main-d'œuvre."],["L7-2526","劳累","láolèi","Adj","tired; exhausted","cansado; agotado","fatigué; épuisé","由于长期劳累，他终于病倒了。","yóu yú cháng qī láo lèi tā zhōng yú bìng dǎo le","Because of prolonged overwork, he finally fell ill.","Por el agotamiento prolongado, al final cayó enfermo.","À force de surmenage, il a fini par tomber malade."],["L7-2527","劳务","láowù","N","services; labor","servicios; trabajo","services; main-d'œuvre","这家公司专门为建筑工地提供劳务人员。","zhè jiā gōng sī zhuān mén wèi jiàn zhù gōng dì tí gōng láo wù rén yuán","This company specializes in supplying laborers to construction sites.","Esta empresa se especializa en proporcionar mano de obra a obras de construcción.","Cette entreprise est spécialisée dans la fourniture de main-d'œuvre pour les chantiers de construction."],["L7-2528","牢固","láogù","Adj","firm; secure","firme; seguro","solide; sûr","这座桥建得非常牢固，经历了几次地震都没事。","zhè zuò qiáo jiàn de fēi cháng láo gù jīng lì le jǐ cì dì zhèn dōu méi shì","This bridge was built very solidly and has survived several earthquakes unharmed.","Este puente está construido de forma muy sólida y ha resistido varios terremotos sin problemas.","Ce pont est très solidement construit et a résisté à plusieurs séismes sans dommage."],["L7-2529","牢记","láojì","V","to remember firmly","recordar bien","garder fermement en mémoire","我们要牢记历史，珍惜今天的和平生活。","wǒ men yào láo jì lì shǐ zhēn xī jīn tiān de hé píng shēng huó","We must remember history and cherish today's peaceful life.","Debemos recordar la historia y valorar la vida pacífica de hoy.","Nous devons garder l'histoire en mémoire et chérir la vie paisible d'aujourd'hui."],["L7-2530","牢牢","láoláo","","firmly","firmemente","fermement","他牢牢地抓住绳子，一步一步爬了上去。","tā láo láo de zhuā zhù shéng zi yí bù yí bù pá le shàng qù","He gripped the rope firmly and climbed up step by step.","Se agarró con fuerza de la cuerda y fue trepando paso a paso.","Il s'est agrippé fermement à la corde et a grimpé pas à pas."],["L7-2531","唠叨","láodao","V","to nag; to chatter","regañar; parlotear","rabâcher; radoter","妈妈每天都唠叨着让我早点儿睡觉。","mā ma měi tiān dōu láo dao zhe ràng wǒ zǎo diǎnr shuì jiào","Mom nags me every day to go to bed early.","Mamá me repite todos los días que me acueste temprano.","Maman me rabâche tous les jours d'aller me coucher plus tôt."],["L7-2532","老伴儿","lǎobànr","N","one's old spouse","mi viejo/a (cónyuge)","conjoint âgé; mon vieux","爷爷和老伴儿每天早上都一起去公园散步。","yé ye hé lǎo bànr měi tiān zǎo shang dōu yì qǐ qù gōng yuán sàn bù","Every morning Grandpa and his wife walk in the park together.","El abuelo y su esposa van juntos al parque a pasear todas las mañanas.","Grand-père et sa femme vont se promener ensemble au parc chaque matin."],["L7-2533","老大","lǎodà","N/Adv","eldest child; boss","hijo mayor; jefe","aîné; patron","这家新公司公开向行业老大叫板。","zhè jiā xīn gōng sī gōng kāi xiàng háng yè lǎo dà jiào bǎn","This new company openly challenged the industry leader.","Esta nueva empresa desafió abiertamente al líder del sector.","Cette nouvelle entreprise a ouvertement défié le leader du secteur."],["L7-2534","老汉","lǎohàn","N","old man","anciano","vieil homme","一位六十多岁的老汉在路边卖西瓜。","yí wèi liù shí duō suì de lǎo hàn zài lù biān mài xī guā","A man in his sixties was selling watermelons by the roadside.","Un hombre de más de sesenta años vendía sandías al borde del camino.","Un homme d'une soixantaine d'années vendait des pastèques au bord de la route."],["L7-2535","老化","lǎohuà","V","to age; to become outdated","envejecer; quedar obsoleto","vieillir; se périmer","这栋楼的电线已经老化，存在安全隐患。","zhè dòng lóu de diàn xiàn yǐ jīng lǎo huà cún zài ān quán yǐn huàn","The wiring in this building has aged and poses a safety hazard.","El cableado de este edificio está envejecido y representa un riesgo para la seguridad.","Les câbles électriques de cet immeuble sont vieillissants et présentent un risque pour la sécurité."],["L7-2536","老人家","lǎorenjia","N","elderly person (polite)","persona mayor (cortés)","personne âgée (poli)","您老人家今年多大岁数了？","nín lǎo rén jiā jīn nián duō dà suì shu le","How old are you this year, sir?","Señor, ¿cuántos años cumple este año?","Quel âge avez-vous cette année, monsieur ?"],["L7-2537","老实说","lǎoshishuō","","to be honest","para ser sincero","à vrai dire","老实说，我对这个结果并不满意。","lǎo shí shuō wǒ duì zhè ge jié guǒ bìng bù mǎn yì","To be honest, I'm not satisfied with this result.","Para ser sincero, no estoy satisfecho con este resultado.","Pour être honnête, ce résultat ne me satisfait pas."],["L7-2538","老远","lǎo yuǎn","","very far away","muy lejos","très loin","他老远就看见我了，一边跑一边挥手。","tā lǎo yuǎn jiù kàn jiàn wǒ le yì biān pǎo yì biān huī shǒu","He saw me from far away and waved as he ran over.","Me vio desde muy lejos y venía corriendo y saludando con la mano.","Il m'a aperçu de très loin et est venu en courant, en agitant la main."],["L7-2539","老字号","lǎozìhao","N","time-honored brand","marca de larga tradición","enseigne de longue tradition","这家老字号曾经有过辉煌的历史。","zhè jiā lǎo zì hào céng jīng yǒu guo huī huáng de lì shǐ","This time-honored brand once had a glorious history.","Esta marca de renombre tuvo en el pasado una historia brillante.","Cette maison de longue date a connu autrefois une histoire glorieuse."],["L7-2540","姥姥","lǎolao","N","maternal grandmother","abuela materna","grand-mère maternelle","每年暑假，我都去乡下姥姥家住一个月。","měi nián shǔ jià wǒ dōu qù xiāng xia lǎo lao jiā zhù yí ge yuè","Every summer vacation I stay at my grandma's in the countryside for a month.","Cada verano, en las vacaciones, paso un mes en casa de mi abuela, en el campo.","Chaque été, pendant les vacances, je passe un mois chez ma grand-mère maternelle, à la campagne."],["L7-2541","姥爷","lǎoye","N","maternal grandfather","abuelo materno","grand-père maternel","姥爷年轻时是一名铁路工人。","lǎo ye nián qīng shí shì yì míng tiě lù gōng rén","My maternal grandfather was a railway worker when he was young.","Mi abuelo materno fue ferroviario de joven.","Mon grand-père maternel était cheminot dans sa jeunesse."],["L7-2542","涝","lào","Adj","flooded; waterlogged","inundado; anegado","inondé; détrempé","今年夏天雨水太多，地里的庄稼都涝了。","jīn nián xià tiān yǔ shuǐ tài duō dì lǐ de zhuāng jia dōu lào le","There was so much rain this summer that the crops in the fields were waterlogged.","Este verano llovió demasiado y los cultivos de los campos se anegaron.","Il a trop plu cet été et les cultures des champs ont été inondées."],["L7-2543","乐意","lèyì","V/Adj","willing; happy to","dispuesto; con gusto","volontiers; disposé à","只要你需要，我很乐意帮忙。","zhǐ yào nǐ xū yào wǒ hěn lè yì bāng máng","As long as you need it, I'm happy to help.","Mientras lo necesites, con gusto te ayudo.","Du moment que tu en as besoin, je t'aiderai volontiers."],["L7-2544","乐园","lèyuán","N","paradise","paraíso","paradis","这座公园是孩子们的乐园。","zhè zuò gōng yuán shì hái zi men de lè yuán","This park is a paradise for children.","Este parque es un paraíso para los niños.","Ce parc est un paradis pour les enfants."],["L7-2545","勒","lēi","V","to strap tightly; to bind","atar con fuerza; ceñir","serrer; ligoter","搬家前，他用绳子把箱子勒得紧紧的。","bān jiā qián tā yòng shéng zi bǎ xiāng zi lēi de jǐn jǐn de","Before moving, he tied the boxes up tightly with rope.","Antes de la mudanza, ató las cajas muy bien apretadas con una cuerda.","Avant le déménagement, il a ficelé les cartons bien serrés avec une corde."],["L7-2546","雷同","léitóng","Adj","identical; duplicating others","idéntico; repetitivo","identique; banal","这两篇作文的内容高度雷同，老师怀疑有人抄袭。","zhè liǎng piān zuò wén de nèi róng gāo dù léi tóng lǎo shī huái yí yǒu rén chāo xí","The content of these two essays is nearly identical, and the teacher suspects plagiarism.","El contenido de estas dos redacciones es muy parecido y la maestra sospecha que alguien copió.","Le contenu de ces deux rédactions est extrêmement similaire, et la professeure soupçonne un plagiat."],["L7-2547","累积","lěijī","V","to accumulate","acumular","accumuler","经验是在工作中一点一点累积起来的。","jīng yàn shì zài gōng zuò zhōng yì diǎn yì diǎn lěi jī qǐ lái de","Experience is accumulated bit by bit through work.","La experiencia se va acumulando poco a poco en el trabajo.","L'expérience s'accumule petit à petit dans le travail."],["L7-2548","累计","lěijì","V","cumulative total; to total up","total acumulado; sumar","total cumulé; totaliser","这部电影上映一个月，票房累计超过十亿元。","zhè bù diàn yǐng shàng yìng yí ge yuè piào fáng lěi jì chāo guò shí yì yuán","A month after release, this film's cumulative box office exceeded one billion yuan.","A un mes de su estreno, la taquilla acumulada de esta película superó los mil millones de yuanes.","Un mois après sa sortie, les recettes cumulées de ce film ont dépassé le milliard de yuans."],["L7-2549","类别","lèibié","N","category","categoría; clasificación","catégorie; classification","图书馆的书按照类别摆放，很容易找到。","tú shū guǎn de shū àn zhào lèi bié bǎi fàng hěn róng yì zhǎo dào","The library's books are arranged by category, so they're easy to find.","Los libros de la biblioteca están ordenados por categorías, así que es fácil encontrarlos.","Les livres de la bibliothèque sont rangés par catégorie, ils sont donc faciles à trouver."],["L7-2550","棱角","léngjiǎo","N","edge; sharp angle","borde; ángulo agudo","arête; angle vif","经历了很多挫折，他身上的棱角慢慢被磨平了。","jīng lì le hěn duō cuò zhé tā shēn shang de léng jiǎo màn màn bèi mó píng le","After many setbacks, his sharp edges were gradually worn smooth.","Tras pasar por muchos reveses, sus asperezas se fueron puliendo poco a poco.","Après de nombreux revers, ses aspérités se sont peu à peu émoussées."],["L7-2551","冷淡","lěngdàn","Adj/V","cold; indifferent","frío; indiferente","froid; indifférent","自从上次吵架以后，她对我的态度一直很冷淡。","zì cóng shàng cì chǎo jià yǐ hòu tā duì wǒ de tài dù yì zhí hěn lěng dàn","Since our last argument, her attitude toward me has been very cold.","Desde la última discusión, su actitud hacia mí ha sido muy fría.","Depuis notre dernière dispute, son attitude envers moi est très froide."],["L7-2552","冷冻","lěngdòng","V","to freeze","congelar","congeler","买回来的肉如果不马上吃，最好放进冰箱冷冻。","mǎi huí lái de ròu rú guǒ bù mǎ shàng chī zuì hǎo fàng jìn bīng xiāng lěng dòng","If you're not going to eat the meat right away, it's best to freeze it.","Si no vas a comer la carne que compraste enseguida, es mejor congelarla en el refrigerador.","Si vous ne mangez pas tout de suite la viande achetée, mieux vaut la mettre au congélateur."],["L7-2553","冷酷","lěngkù","Adj","callous; unfeeling","cruel; insensible","dur; insensible","电影里的这个杀手冷酷得让人害怕。","diàn yǐng lǐ de zhè ge shā shǒu lěng kù de ràng rén hài pà","The killer in this film is frighteningly cold-blooded.","El asesino de esta película es tan frío y despiadado que da miedo.","Le tueur de ce film est d'une froideur qui fait peur."],["L7-2554","冷酷无情","lěngkù-wúqíng","","cold-hearted","desalmado","sans cœur","他对待下属冷酷无情，大家都怕他。","tā duì dài xià shǔ lěng kù wú qíng dà jiā dōu pà tā","He is ruthless toward his subordinates, and everyone is afraid of him.","Es cruel y despiadado con sus subordinados, y todos le tienen miedo.","Il est dur et impitoyable avec ses subordonnés, et tout le monde le craint."],["L7-2555","冷落","lěngluò","Adj/V","to snub; desolate","desairar; desolado","snober; délaissé","她觉得自己在聚会上被大家冷落了，很不高兴。","tā jué de zì jǐ zài jù huì shàng bèi dà jiā lěng luò le hěn bù gāo xìng","She felt she had been left out by everyone at the party and was unhappy.","Sintió que todos la habían ignorado en la reunión y estaba muy disgustada.","Elle a eu l'impression d'avoir été délaissée par tous à la fête, et en était très contrariée."],["L7-2556","冷门","lěngmén","N","dark horse; neglected field","campo poco popular; sorpresa","domaine négligé; surprise","考古学以前是冷门专业，现在报考的人越来越多。","kǎo gǔ xué yǐ qián shì lěng mén zhuān yè xiàn zài bào kǎo de rén yuè lái yuè duō","Archaeology used to be an unpopular major, but more and more people are applying now.","La arqueología solía ser una carrera poco popular, pero ahora cada vez más personas se inscriben.","L'archéologie était autrefois une filière peu prisée, mais de plus en plus de candidats s'y inscrivent aujourd'hui."],["L7-2557","冷漠","lěngmò","Adj","cold; indifferent","frío; indiferente","froid; indifférent","面对别人的困难，我们不能表现得那么冷漠。","miàn duì bié rén de kùn nan wǒ men bù néng biǎo xiàn de nà me lěng mò","We can't be so indifferent when others are in difficulty.","Ante las dificultades de los demás, no podemos mostrarnos tan indiferentes.","Face aux difficultés des autres, nous ne pouvons pas rester aussi indifférents."],["L7-2558","冷笑","lěngxiào","V","to sneer","sonreír con desprecio; burlarse","ricaner; goguenarder","他冷笑了一声，根本不相信我的解释。","tā lěng xiào le yì shēng gēn běn bù xiāng xìn wǒ de jiě shì","He gave a cold laugh and didn't believe my explanation at all.","Soltó una risa fría; no creía en absoluto mi explicación.","Il a eu un rire glacial, ne croyant pas du tout à mon explication."],["L7-2559","冷战","lěngzhàn","N","Cold War","Guerra Fría","Guerre froide","小两口吵架以后冷战了三天，谁也不理谁。","xiǎo liǎng kǒu chǎo jià yǐ hòu lěng zhàn le sān tiān shéi yě bù lǐ shéi","After the argument, the young couple gave each other the silent treatment for three days.","Después de la discusión, la joven pareja estuvo tres días en guerra fría sin dirigirse la palabra.","Après leur dispute, le jeune couple s'est boudé pendant trois jours sans s'adresser la parole."],["L7-2560","愣","lèng","V/Adj","to stare blankly; dumbstruck","quedarse atónito; mirar fijamente","rester interdit; fixer d'un air hébété","听到这个消息，他愣了半天才说出话来。","tīng dào zhè ge xiāo xi tā lèng le bàn tiān cái shuō chū huà lái","Hearing the news, he was stunned for a long while before he could speak.","Al oír la noticia, se quedó atónito un buen rato antes de poder hablar.","En apprenant la nouvelle, il est resté stupéfait un long moment avant de pouvoir parler."],["L7-2561","离谱儿","lípǔr","","outrageous; off the mark","exagerado; fuera de lugar","exagéré; déplacé","这家店的东西贵得离谱儿，一杯咖啡要一百块。","zhè jiā diàn de dōng xi guì de lí pǔr yì bēi kā fēi yào yì bǎi kuài","Things in this shop are outrageously expensive — a cup of coffee costs a hundred yuan.","Las cosas de esta tienda son carísimas de forma absurda: un café cuesta cien yuanes.","Les prix de ce magasin sont complètement exorbitants : un café coûte cent yuans."],["L7-2562","离奇","líqí","Adj","bizarre; odd","extraño; estrafalario","bizarre; étrange","这部小说的情节非常离奇，让人猜不到结局。","zhè bù xiǎo shuō de qíng jié fēi cháng lí qí ràng rén cāi bu dào jié jú","The plot of this novel is so bizarre that you can't guess the ending.","La trama de esta novela es tan extraña que no se puede adivinar el final.","L'intrigue de ce roman est si étrange qu'on ne peut pas en deviner la fin."],["L7-2563","离职","lízhí","","to leave one's job","dejar el empleo","quitter son emploi","他的突然离职让同事们十分惊诧。","tā de tū rán lí zhí ràng tóng shì men shí fēn jīng chà","His sudden resignation astonished his colleagues.","Su renuncia repentina dejó atónitos a sus compañeros.","Sa démission soudaine a stupéfié ses collègues."],["L7-2564","黎明","límíng","N","dawn","alba; amanecer","aube","摄影师在黎明前赶到湖畔，只为捕捉雾气散去的一瞬间。","shè yǐng shī zài lí míng qián gǎn dào hú pàn zhǐ wèi bǔ zhuō wù qì sàn qù de yí shùn jiān","The photographer reached the lakeside before dawn just to capture the moment when the mist lifted.","El fotógrafo llegó a la orilla del lago antes del amanecer solo para captar el instante en que se disipaba la niebla.","Le photographe est arrivé au bord du lac avant l'aube, juste pour saisir l'instant où la brume se dissipe."],["L7-2565","礼服","lǐfú","N","formal attire; ceremonial dress","traje de gala","tenue de cérémonie","参加晚宴的客人都穿着正式的礼服。","cān jiā wǎn yàn de kè rén dōu chuān zhe zhèng shì de lǐ fú","The guests at the dinner were all dressed in formal attire.","Los invitados a la cena iban todos con traje de gala.","Les invités du dîner étaient tous en tenue de soirée."],["L7-2566","礼品","lǐpǐn","N","gift; present","regalo; obsequio","cadeau","商场里卖各种节日礼品，非常热闹。","shāng chǎng lǐ mài gè zhǒng jié rì lǐ pǐn fēi cháng rè nao","The mall sells all kinds of holiday gifts and is very lively.","En el centro comercial se venden todo tipo de regalos de temporada y hay mucho ambiente.","Le centre commercial vend toutes sortes de cadeaux de fête et l'ambiance y est très animée."],["L7-2567","礼仪","lǐyí","N","etiquette; protocol","etiqueta; protocolo","étiquette; protocole","去别的国家之前，最好先了解一下当地的礼仪。","qù bié de guó jiā zhī qián zuì hǎo xiān liǎo jiě yí xià dāng dì de lǐ yí","Before going to another country, it's best to learn a bit about the local etiquette.","Antes de viajar a otro país, conviene informarse primero sobre la etiqueta local.","Avant de partir dans un autre pays, mieux vaut se renseigner sur les usages locaux."],["L7-2568","里程碑","lǐchéngbēi","N","milestone","hito","jalon","这次成功发射是中国航天史上的一个里程碑。","zhè cì chéng gōng fā shè shì zhōng guó háng tiān shǐ shàng de yí ge lǐ chéng bēi","This successful launch is a milestone in the history of Chinese spaceflight.","Este lanzamiento exitoso es un hito en la historia aeroespacial de China.","Ce lancement réussi est un jalon dans l'histoire de l'aérospatiale chinoise."],["L7-2569","理睬","lǐcǎi","V","to pay attention to; to heed","hacer caso; prestar atención","prêter attention; tenir compte","她根本没理睬我，转身就走了。","tā gēn běn méi lǐ cǎi wǒ zhuǎn shēn jiù zǒu le","She completely ignored me and turned and walked away.","Ella ni me hizo caso; se dio la vuelta y se fue.","Elle m'a complètement ignoré, a fait demi-tour et s'est éloignée."],["L7-2570","理会","lǐhuì","V","to take notice of; to understand","hacer caso; comprender","prêter attention; comprendre","别理会那些闲话，做好自己的事就行。","bié lǐ huì nà xiē xián huà zuò hǎo zì jǐ de shì jiù xíng","Don't pay any attention to that gossip; just do your own thing.","No hagas caso de esos chismes; ocúpate de lo tuyo y ya.","Ne fais pas attention à ces commérages ; occupe-toi de tes affaires."],["L7-2571","理科","lǐkē","N","natural sciences","ciencias","sciences","她高中时选了理科，后来考上了医学院。","tā gāo zhōng shí xuǎn le lǐ kē hòu lái kǎo shàng le yī xué yuàn","In high school she chose the science track and later got into medical school.","En la preparatoria eligió el área de ciencias y después ingresó a la facultad de medicina.","Au lycée, elle a choisi la filière scientifique, puis est entrée en faculté de médecine."],["L7-2572","理念","lǐniàn","N","concept; philosophy","concepto; filosofía","concept; philosophie","这家公司的经营理念是一切为了顾客。","zhè jiā gōng sī de jīng yíng lǐ niàn shì yí qiè wèi le gù kè","This company's business philosophy is that everything is for the customer.","La filosofía de gestión de esta empresa es que todo es por el cliente.","La philosophie de gestion de cette entreprise est de tout faire pour le client."],["L7-2573","理事","lǐshì","N/V","council member; director","miembro del consejo; director","membre du conseil; administrateur","她被选为协会的理事，负责组织会员活动。","tā bèi xuǎn wéi xié huì de lǐ shì fù zé zǔ zhī huì yuán huó dòng","She was elected a council member of the association, responsible for organizing members' activities.","Fue elegida miembro del consejo de la asociación y se encarga de organizar las actividades de los socios.","Elle a été élue membre du conseil de l'association et est chargée d'organiser les activités des adhérents."],["L7-2574","理所当然","lǐsuǒdāngrán","","as expected; naturally","naturalmente; lógico","naturellement; cela va de soi","父母照顾孩子不是理所当然的，我们应该懂得感恩。","fù mǔ zhào gù hái zi bú shì lǐ suǒ dāng rán de wǒ men yīng gāi dǒng de gǎn ēn","Parents caring for their children shouldn't be taken for granted; we should be grateful.","Que los padres cuiden a sus hijos no es algo que se dé por sentado; debemos aprender a agradecer.","Que les parents s'occupent de leurs enfants n'a rien d'évident ; nous devons savoir être reconnaissants."],["L7-2575","理性","lǐxìng","Adj/N","rational; reason","racional; razón","rationnel; raison","遇到问题要保持理性，不能感情用事。","yù dào wèn tí yào bǎo chí lǐ xìng bù néng gǎn qíng yòng shì","When problems arise, stay rational and don't act on emotion.","Cuando surjan problemas hay que mantener la racionalidad y no dejarse llevar por las emociones.","Face aux problèmes, il faut rester rationnel et ne pas se laisser guider par ses émotions."],["L7-2576","理直气壮","lǐzhí-qìzhuàng","","in the right and confident","con razón y seguridad","sûr de son bon droit","他明明迟到了，却理直气壮地说是路上堵车。","tā míng míng chí dào le què lǐ zhí qì zhuàng de shuō shì lù shang dǔ chē","He was clearly late, yet he insisted with a straight face that the traffic was to blame.","Llegó tarde, evidentemente, pero con toda la desfachatez dijo que había mucho tráfico.","Il était manifestement en retard, mais il a affirmé avec aplomb que c'était à cause des embouteillages."],["L7-2577","力不从心","lìbùcóngxīn","","to be unable to do what one wants","faltar fuerzas para lo que se quiere","ne pas pouvoir faire ce qu'on veut","爷爷想帮忙搬东西，可年纪大了，力不从心。","yé ye xiǎng bāng máng bān dōng xi kě nián jì dà le lì bù cóng xīn","Grandpa wanted to help move things, but at his age his strength wasn't up to it.","El abuelo quería ayudar a cargar cosas, pero con la edad que tiene, las fuerzas no le alcanzan.","Grand-père voulait aider à déménager des affaires, mais à son âge, ses forces ne suivent plus."],["L7-2578","力度","lìdù","N","strength; intensity","intensidad; fuerza","force; intensité","政府加大了打击假冒商品的力度。","zhèng fǔ jiā dà le dǎ jī jiǎ mào shāng pǐn de lì dù","The government has stepped up its crackdown on counterfeit goods.","El gobierno ha intensificado la lucha contra los productos falsificados.","Le gouvernement a renforcé la lutte contre les produits contrefaits."],["L7-2579","力求","lìqiú","V","to strive to","esforzarse por","s'efforcer de","这篇报道力求客观真实地反映事件经过。","zhè piān bào dào lì qiú kè guān zhēn shí de fǎn yìng shì jiàn jīng guò","This report strives to reflect what happened objectively and truthfully.","Este reportaje procura reflejar los hechos de forma objetiva y veraz.","Ce reportage s'efforce de rendre compte des faits de manière objective et fidèle."],["L7-2580","力所能及","lìsuǒnéngjí","","within one's capabilities","dentro de las propias posibilidades","dans la mesure de ses moyens","孩子应该在家里做一些力所能及的家务。","hái zi yīng gāi zài jiā lǐ zuò yì xiē lì suǒ néng jí de jiā wù","Children should do some housework within their abilities at home.","Los niños deben hacer en casa algunas tareas domésticas acordes con sus capacidades.","Les enfants devraient faire à la maison quelques tâches ménagères à leur portée."],["L7-2581","力争","lìzhēng","V","to strive for; to fight for","luchar por; esforzarse por","s'efforcer d'obtenir; lutter pour","我们力争在年底以前完成这项工程。","wǒ men lì zhēng zài nián dǐ yǐ qián wán chéng zhè xiàng gōng chéng","We are striving to complete this project before the end of the year.","Nos esforzamos por terminar esta obra antes de fin de año.","Nous nous efforçons d'achever ce chantier avant la fin de l'année."],["L7-2582","历程","lìchéng","N","course; process","trayectoria; proceso","parcours; processus","这本书记录了他从农村孩子到科学家的成长历程。","zhè běn shū jì lù le tā cóng nóng cūn hái zi dào kē xué jiā de chéng zhǎng lì chéng","This book records his journey from village child to scientist.","Este libro relata su trayectoria de niño de aldea a científico.","Ce livre retrace son parcours d'enfant de la campagne à scientifique."],["L7-2583","历届","lìjiè","Adj","all previous","todos los anteriores","tous les précédents","历届运动会上，这个项目一直是中国队的强项。","lì jiè yùn dòng huì shàng zhè ge xiàng mù yì zhí shì zhōng guó duì de qiáng xiàng","At all previous editions of the games, this event has been a strength of the Chinese team.","En todas las ediciones anteriores de los juegos, esta prueba ha sido un punto fuerte del equipo chino.","À toutes les éditions précédentes des Jeux, cette discipline a toujours été un point fort de l'équipe de Chine."],["L7-2584","历经","lìjīng","V","to go through; to experience","atravesar; experimentar","traverser; connaître","这座桥历经风雨仍然坚固，桥栏上的雕刻却已留下岁月的痕迹。","zhè zuò qiáo lì jīng fēng yǔ réng rán jiān gù qiáo lán shàng de diāo kè què yǐ liú xià suì yuè de hén jì","The bridge remains sturdy after years of weathering, though the carvings on its railings bear the marks of time.","Este puente sigue firme después de soportar tantos años de viento y lluvia, aunque los grabados de su barandilla muestran las huellas del tiempo.","Ce pont reste solide malgré les intempéries des ans, mais les sculptures de sa balustrade portent la marque du temps."],["L7-2585","历来","lìlái","Adv","always; all along","siempre; desde siempre","toujours; depuis toujours","这所大学历来重视学生的实践能力。","zhè suǒ dà xué lì lái zhòng shì xué shēng de shí jiàn néng lì","This university has always attached importance to students' practical skills.","Esta universidad siempre ha dado importancia a la capacidad práctica de los estudiantes.","Cette université a toujours accordé de l'importance aux compétences pratiques des étudiants."],["L7-2586","历时","lìshí","V/Adj","to last; to take (time)","durar; tardar","durer; prendre (du temps)","这项研究历时五年，终于取得了成果。","zhè xiàng yán jiū lì shí wǔ nián zhōng yú qǔ dé le chéng guǒ","This research lasted five years and finally produced results.","Esta investigación duró cinco años y por fin dio resultados.","Cette recherche a duré cinq ans et a enfin abouti à des résultats."],["L7-2587","立方","lìfāng","N/M","cube; cubic","cubo; cúbico","cube; cubique","二的立方等于八，这是一道很简单的数学题。","èr de lì fāng děng yú bā zhè shì yí dào hěn jiǎn dān de shù xué tí","Two cubed equals eight — that's a very simple math problem.","Dos al cubo es igual a ocho; es un problema de matemáticas muy sencillo.","Deux au cube égale huit ; c'est un problème de maths très simple."],["L7-2588","立方米","lìfāngmǐ","M","cubic meter","metro cúbico","mètre cube","这个游泳池能装两千立方米的水。","zhè ge yóu yǒng chí néng zhuāng liǎng qiān lì fāng mǐ de shuǐ","This swimming pool holds two thousand cubic meters of water.","Esta piscina tiene capacidad para dos mil metros cúbicos de agua.","Cette piscine peut contenir deux mille mètres cubes d'eau."],["L7-2589","立功","lìgōng","","to render meritorious service","prestar un servicio meritorio","accomplir un exploit","他立功以后，很快就被提拔了。","tā lì gōng yǐ hòu hěn kuài jiù bèi tí bá le","After he performed meritorious service, he was quickly promoted.","Después de lograr un mérito destacado, lo ascendieron rápidamente.","Après avoir rendu un service remarquable, il a été rapidement promu."],["L7-2590","立交桥","lìjiāoqiáo","N","overpass","paso elevado","pont routier","为了缓解交通拥堵，市里新修了一座立交桥。","wèi le huǎn jiě jiāo tōng yōng dǔ shì lǐ xīn xiū le yí zuò lì jiāo qiáo","To ease traffic congestion, the city built a new overpass.","Para aliviar la congestión del tráfico, la ciudad construyó un nuevo paso elevado.","Pour réduire les embouteillages, la ville a construit un nouveau pont routier."],["L7-2591","立体","lìtǐ","Adj","three-dimensional","tridimensional","tridimensionnel","这部电影是立体的，观看时需要戴特殊的眼镜。","zhè bù diàn yǐng shì lì tǐ de guān kàn shí xū yào dài tè shū de yǎn jìng","This film is three-dimensional, and you need special glasses to watch it.","Esta película es en tres dimensiones y para verla se necesitan lentes especiales.","Ce film est en relief et il faut porter des lunettes spéciales pour le regarder."],["L7-2592","立足","lìzú","V","to base oneself; to gain a foothold","basarse en; afianzarse","se baser sur; s'implanter","这家企业立足本地市场，逐步向全国发展。","zhè jiā qǐ yè lì zú běn dì shì chǎng zhú bù xiàng quán guó fā zhǎn","This business is rooted in the local market and is gradually expanding nationwide.","Esta empresa se apoya en el mercado local y se va expandiendo poco a poco por todo el país.","Cette entreprise s'appuie sur le marché local et se développe progressivement à l'échelle nationale."],["L7-2593","励志","lìzhì","V","inspirational; to strive with resolve","motivador; esforzarse con determinación","motivant; se fixer un but","这部励志电影讲述了一个残疾运动员的奋斗故事。","zhè bù lì zhì diàn yǐng jiǎng shù le yí ge cán jí yùn dòng yuán de fèn dòu gù shi","This inspirational film tells the story of a disabled athlete's struggle.","Esta película motivadora cuenta la historia de superación de un atleta con discapacidad.","Ce film inspirant raconte le combat d'un athlète handicapé."],["L7-2594","利害","lìhài","N","pros and cons","pros y contras","avantages et inconvénients","做决定之前，要先权衡一下利害。","zuò jué dìng zhī qián yào xiān quán héng yí xià lì hài","Before making a decision, weigh the pros and cons.","Antes de tomar una decisión, hay que sopesar primero los pros y los contras.","Avant de prendre une décision, il faut d'abord peser le pour et le contre."],["L7-2595","利率","lìlǜ","N","interest rate","tasa de interés","taux d'intérêt","银行最近又降低了贷款利率。","yín háng zuì jìn yòu jiàng dī le dài kuǎn lì lǜ","The bank recently lowered its loan interest rates again.","El banco volvió a reducir recientemente la tasa de interés de los préstamos.","La banque a récemment abaissé de nouveau ses taux d'intérêt sur les prêts."],["L7-2596","利索","lìsuo","Adj","nimble; neat","ágil; diestro","agile; efficace","她干活儿很利索，一会儿就把屋子收拾干净了。","tā gàn huór hěn lì suo yí huìr jiù bǎ wū zi shōu shi gān jìng le","She works efficiently and tidied up the room in no time.","Trabaja con mucha agilidad y en un momento dejó la habitación limpia y ordenada.","Elle travaille avec efficacité et a rangé la pièce en un rien de temps."],["L7-2597","粒","lì","M","grain; small round thing","grano; (clasificador de objetos pequeños)","grain; (classificateur de petits objets)","这种胶囊每天吃两次，每次一粒。","zhè zhǒng jiāo náng měi tiān chī liǎng cì měi cì yí lì","Take this capsule twice a day, one each time.","Tome esta cápsula dos veces al día, una cada vez.","Prenez cette gélule deux fois par jour, une à chaque prise."],["L7-2598","连滚带爬","liángǔn-dàipá","","to scramble frantically","huir a trompicones","fuir en roulant et rampant","看到一条大蛇，他吓得连滚带爬地跑下了山。","kàn dào yì tiáo dà shé tā xià de lián gǔn dài pá de pǎo xià le shān","Seeing a big snake, he was so frightened that he scrambled down the mountain.","Al ver una serpiente enorme, se asustó tanto que bajó la montaña rodando y a trompicones.","À la vue d'un gros serpent, il a eu si peur qu'il a dévalé la montagne en roulant et en rampant."],["L7-2599","连绵","liánmián","V","continuous; unbroken","continuo; ininterrumpido","continu; ininterrompu","连绵的山岭在云雾中若隐若现。","lián mián de shān lǐng zài yún wù zhōng ruò yǐn ruò xiàn","The rolling mountain ridges loom in and out of the mist.","Las montañas que se extienden sin fin aparecen y desaparecen entre las nubes y la niebla.","Les chaînes de montagnes qui se succèdent apparaissent et disparaissent dans les nuages et la brume."],["L7-2600","连任","liánrèn","V","to be re-elected","ser reelegido","être réélu","这位市长获得连任，将继续领导这座城市四年。","zhè wèi shì zhǎng huò dé lián rèn jiāng jì xù lǐng dǎo zhè zuò chéng shì sì nián","This mayor was reelected and will continue leading the city for four more years.","Este alcalde fue reelegido y seguirá dirigiendo la ciudad durante cuatro años más.","Ce maire a été réélu et continuera de diriger la ville pendant quatre ans."],["L7-2601","连锁","liánsuǒ","Adj","chain; interlocking","cadena; encadenado","chaîne; en chaîne","一家企业倒闭，可能引起一系列连锁反应。","yì jiā qǐ yè dǎo bì kě néng yǐn qǐ yí xì liè lián suǒ fǎn yìng","One company going bankrupt can set off a series of chain reactions.","La quiebra de una empresa puede provocar una serie de reacciones en cadena.","La faillite d'une entreprise peut déclencher une série de réactions en chaîne."],["L7-2602","连锁店","liánsuǒdiàn","N","chain store","tienda de cadena","magasin de chaîne","这家咖啡品牌在全国开了上千家连锁店。","zhè jiā kā fēi pǐn pái zài quán guó kāi le shàng qiān jiā lián suǒ diàn","This coffee brand has opened over a thousand chain stores nationwide.","Esta marca de café ha abierto más de mil tiendas de la cadena en todo el país.","Cette marque de café a ouvert plus d'un millier de points de vente dans tout le pays."],["L7-2603","连夜","liányè","Adv","that very night","esa misma noche","dans la nuit même","洪水不断上涨，村民们连夜加固河堤。","hóng shuǐ bú duàn shàng zhǎng cūn mín men lián yè jiā gù hé dī","The floodwater kept rising, so the villagers worked through the night to reinforce the river dike.","La crecida seguía subiendo, así que los aldeanos reforzaron el dique del río durante toda la noche.","La crue continuait de monter, alors les villageois ont renforcé la digue toute la nuit."],["L7-2604","怜惜","liánxī","V","to take pity on","compadecer; apiadarse de","prendre en pitié; plaindre","看着这个瘦弱的孩子，老师心里充满了怜惜。","kàn zhe zhè ge shòu ruò de hái zi lǎo shī xīn lǐ chōng mǎn le lián xī","Looking at this frail child, the teacher's heart was filled with tenderness.","Al ver a ese niño tan delgado y frágil, a la maestra se le llenó el corazón de ternura.","En voyant cet enfant frêle et chétif, l'institutrice sentit son cœur se remplir de tendresse."],["L7-2605","帘子","liánzi","N","curtain","cortina","rideau","阳光太刺眼了，请把窗户上的帘子拉上。","yáng guāng tài cì yǎn le qǐng bǎ chuāng hu shàng de lián zi lā shàng","The sunlight is too bright; please draw the curtain on the window.","El sol deslumbra demasiado; por favor, corre la cortina de la ventana.","Le soleil est trop éblouissant ; tire le rideau de la fenêtre, s'il te plaît."],["L7-2606","莲子","liánzǐ","N","lotus seed","semilla de loto","graine de lotus","妈妈用莲子和红枣熬了一锅甜汤。","mā ma yòng lián zǐ hé hóng zǎo áo le yì guō tián tāng","Mom simmered a pot of sweet soup with lotus seeds and red dates.","Mamá preparó una olla de sopa dulce con semillas de loto y azufaifas rojas.","Maman a mijoté une marmite de soupe sucrée aux graines de lotus et aux jujubes rouges."],["L7-2607","联邦","liánbāng","N","federation; federal","federación; federal","fédération; fédéral","美国和德国都是联邦制国家。","měi guó hé dé guó dōu shì lián bāng zhì guó jiā","The United States and Germany are both federal states.","Estados Unidos y Alemania son ambos Estados federales.","Les États-Unis et l'Allemagne sont tous deux des États fédéraux."],["L7-2608","联欢","liánhuān","V","to have a get-together","celebrar una reunión festiva","faire une fête collective","新年前夕，学校举办了一场师生联欢晚会。","xīn nián qián xī xué xiào jǔ bàn le yì chǎng shī shēng lián huān wǎn huì","On New Year's Eve, the school held a party for teachers and students.","En vísperas de Año Nuevo, la escuela organizó una fiesta para profesores y alumnos.","À la veille du Nouvel An, l'école a organisé une soirée festive pour les professeurs et les élèves."],["L7-2609","联网","liánwǎng","","to connect to a network","conectar a la red","se connecter au réseau","这台电脑没有联网，所以收不到邮件。","zhè tái diàn nǎo méi yǒu lián wǎng suǒ yǐ shōu bu dào yóu jiàn","This computer isn't connected to the internet, so it can't receive email.","Esta computadora no está conectada a internet, así que no puede recibir correos.","Cet ordinateur n'est pas connecté à Internet, donc il ne peut pas recevoir de courriels."],["L7-2610","廉价","liánjià","Adj","cheap; low-cost","barato; de bajo costo","bon marché; peu coûteux","这家超市的商品很廉价，但质量也一般。","zhè jiā chāo shì de shāng pǐn hěn lián jià dàn zhì liàng yě yì bān","The goods in this supermarket are cheap, but the quality is only average.","Los productos de este supermercado son baratos, pero la calidad es regular.","Les produits de ce supermarché sont bon marché, mais la qualité est moyenne."],["L7-2611","廉洁","liánjié","Adj","incorruptible; honest","incorruptible; honesto","incorruptible; intègre","他当了二十年官，一直清正廉洁。","tā dāng le èr shí nián guān yì zhí qīng zhèng lián jié","He was an official for twenty years and remained honest and incorruptible throughout.","Fue funcionario durante veinte años y siempre se mantuvo íntegro e incorruptible.","Il a été fonctionnaire pendant vingt ans et est toujours resté intègre et incorruptible."],["L7-2612","廉正","liánzhèng","Adj","upright; honest","íntegro; honrado","intègre; probe","担任这个职位的人必须廉正无私。","dān rèn zhè ge zhí wèi de rén bì xū lián zhèng wú sī","Whoever holds this position must be upright and selfless.","Quien ocupe este puesto debe ser honesto y desinteresado.","La personne qui occupe ce poste doit être intègre et désintéressée."],["L7-2613","廉政","liánzhèng","V","clean government","gobierno íntegro","gouvernement intègre","政府采取了一系列措施加强廉政建设。","zhèng fǔ cǎi qǔ le yí xì liè cuò shī jiā qiáng lián zhèng jiàn shè","The government has taken a series of measures to strengthen clean governance.","El gobierno ha adoptado una serie de medidas para reforzar la lucha contra la corrupción.","Le gouvernement a pris une série de mesures pour renforcer l'intégrité de l'administration."],["L7-2614","脸颊","liǎnjiá","N","cheek","mejilla","joue","寒风吹得她的脸颊通红。","hán fēng chuī de tā de liǎn jiá tōng hóng","The cold wind turned her cheeks bright red.","El viento helado le puso las mejillas rojas como tomates.","Le vent glacial lui avait rougi les joues."],["L7-2615","炼","liàn","V","to refine; to smelt","refinar; fundir","raffiner; fondre","这块铁矿石要放在高温炉里炼很长时间。","zhè kuài tiě kuàng shí yào fàng zài gāo wēn lú lǐ liàn hěn cháng shí jiān","This iron ore has to be smelted in a high-temperature furnace for a long time.","Este mineral de hierro debe fundirse mucho tiempo en un horno de alta temperatura.","Ce minerai de fer doit être fondu longtemps dans un four à haute température."],["L7-2616","恋恋不舍","liànliàn-bùshě","","reluctant to part","reacio a separarse","ne pas vouloir se séparer","假期结束了，孩子们恋恋不舍地离开了外婆家。","jià qī jié shù le hái zi men liàn liàn bù shě de lí kāi le wài pó jiā","The holiday ended, and the children reluctantly left their grandmother's house.","Terminaron las vacaciones y los niños dejaron la casa de su abuela con pena.","Les vacances étaient finies et les enfants quittèrent à regret la maison de leur grand-mère."],["L7-2617","良","liáng","Adj","good; very","bueno; muy","bon; très","这次考试他得了一个良，离优秀只差两分。","zhè cì kǎo shì tā dé le yí ge liáng lí yōu xiù zhǐ chà liǎng fēn","He got a \"good\" on this exam, just two points short of \"excellent.\"","En este examen sacó \"bueno\", a solo dos puntos de \"excelente\".","À cet examen, il a eu la mention « bien », à deux points seulement de « excellent »."],["L7-2618","良心","liángxīn","N","conscience","conciencia","conscience","拿了别人的钱不还，他的良心过得去吗？","ná le bié rén de qián bù huán tā de liáng xīn guò dé qù ma","Taking someone's money and not returning it — how can his conscience bear it?","Se quedó con el dinero de otro y no lo devolvió; ¿cómo puede vivir con su conciencia?","Il a pris l'argent de quelqu'un sans le rendre ; comment sa conscience peut-elle le supporter ?"],["L7-2619","良性","liángxìng","Adj","benign; positive","benigno; positivo","bénin; positif","两家企业通过良性竞争，不断提高产品质量。","liǎng jiā qǐ yè tōng guò liáng xìng jìng zhēng bú duàn tí gāo chǎn pǐn zhì liàng","The two companies keep improving product quality through healthy competition.","Las dos empresas mejoran constantemente la calidad de sus productos gracias a una competencia sana.","Les deux entreprises améliorent sans cesse la qualité de leurs produits grâce à une concurrence saine."],["L7-2620","凉爽","liángshuǎng","Adj","cool and refreshing","fresco; refrescante","frais; rafraîchissant","秋天的早晨空气凉爽，最适合跑步。","qiū tiān de zǎo chén kōng qì liáng shuǎng zuì shì hé pǎo bù","The air on autumn mornings is cool and refreshing, perfect for running.","El aire de las mañanas de otoño es fresco, ideal para salir a correr.","L'air frais des matins d'automne est idéal pour courir."],["L7-2621","两口子","liǎngkǒuzi","N","married couple","pareja de casados","couple marié","楼下的两口子很恩爱，结婚三十年从没吵过架。","lóu xià de liǎng kǒu zi hěn ēn ài jié hūn sān shí nián cóng méi chǎo guo jià","The couple downstairs are devoted to each other and haven't quarreled once in thirty years of marriage.","La pareja del piso de abajo se quiere mucho; en treinta años de matrimonio nunca han peleado.","Le couple du dessous est très uni ; en trente ans de mariage, ils ne se sont jamais disputés."],["L7-2622","两栖","liǎngqī","V","amphibious; dual-talented","anfibio; con doble talento","amphibie; aux talents doubles","青蛙是一种两栖动物，既能在水里也能在陆地上生活。","qīng wā shì yì zhǒng liǎng qī dòng wù jì néng zài shuǐ lǐ yě néng zài lù dì shàng shēng huó","The frog is an amphibian and can live both in water and on land.","La rana es un anfibio y puede vivir tanto en el agua como en tierra.","La grenouille est un amphibien : elle peut vivre aussi bien dans l'eau que sur terre."],["L7-2623","亮点","liàngdiǎn","N","highlight; bright spot","punto destacado","point fort; temps fort","这次展览的最大亮点是几件从未公开过的文物。","zhè cì zhǎn lǎn de zuì dà liàng diǎn shì jǐ jiàn cóng wèi gōng kāi guo de wén wù","The biggest highlight of this exhibition is several never-before-shown relics.","Lo más destacado de esta exposición son varias reliquias que nunca se habían mostrado al público.","Le point fort de cette exposition, ce sont plusieurs objets antiques jamais présentés au public."],["L7-2624","亮丽","liànglì","Adj","bright and beautiful","luminoso y bello","éclatant et beau","街道两旁的新楼成了城市一道亮丽的风景。","jiē dào liǎng páng de xīn lóu chéng le chéng shì yí dào liàng lì de fēng jǐng","The new buildings on both sides of the street have become a bright and beautiful sight in the city.","Los edificios nuevos a ambos lados de la calle se han convertido en un hermoso paisaje de la ciudad.","Les nouveaux immeubles des deux côtés de la rue sont devenus un bel élément du paysage urbain."],["L7-2625","亮相","liàngxiàng","","to make a public appearance","hacer una aparición pública","faire une apparition publique","这款新车将在下个月的车展上首次亮相。","zhè kuǎn xīn chē jiāng zài xià ge yuè de chē zhǎn shàng shǒu cì liàng xiàng","This new car will make its debut at next month's auto show.","Este nuevo automóvil se presentará por primera vez en el salón del automóvil del mes próximo.","Cette nouvelle voiture sera présentée pour la première fois au salon de l'automobile le mois prochain."],["L7-2626","谅解","liàngjiě","V","to forgive; to understand","comprender; disculpar","comprendre; pardonner","由于我们的失误给您带来不便，敬请谅解。","yóu yú wǒ men de shī wù gěi nín dài lái bú biàn jìng qǐng liàng jiě","We apologize for the inconvenience caused by our mistake and ask for your understanding.","Lamentamos las molestias causadas por nuestro error y les pedimos su comprensión.","Nous vous prions de bien vouloir excuser la gêne causée par notre erreur."],["L7-2627","辽阔","liáokuò","Adj","vast; extensive","vasto; extenso","vaste; étendu","一匹骏马在辽阔的草原上奔跑。","yì pǐ jùn mǎ zài liáo kuò de cǎo yuán shàng bēn pǎo","A fine steed galloped across the vast grassland.","Un hermoso corcel galopaba por la vasta pradera.","Un superbe destrier galopait à travers la vaste prairie."],["L7-2628","疗法","liáofǎ","N","therapy; treatment","terapia; tratamiento","thérapie; traitement","医生建议他采用中西医结合的疗法。","yī shēng jiàn yì tā cǎi yòng zhōng xī yī jié hé de liáo fǎ","The doctor recommended a treatment combining Chinese and Western medicine.","El médico le recomendó un tratamiento que combina la medicina china y la occidental.","Le médecin lui a conseillé un traitement associant médecine chinoise et médecine occidentale."],["L7-2629","疗效","liáoxiào","N","therapeutic effect","efecto terapéutico","effet thérapeutique","这种新药的疗效还需要进一步观察。","zhè zhǒng xīn yào de liáo xiào hái xū yào jìn yí bù guān chá","The efficacy of this new drug still needs further observation.","La eficacia de este nuevo medicamento aún debe observarse más.","L'efficacité de ce nouveau médicament doit encore être observée de plus près."],["L7-2630","寥寥无几","liáoliáo-wújǐ","","very few","poquísimos","très rares","下着大雨，公园里的游客寥寥无几。","xià zhe dà yǔ gōng yuán lǐ de yóu kè liáo liáo wú jǐ","It was pouring rain, and there were hardly any visitors in the park.","Llovía a cántaros y en el parque casi no había visitantes.","Il pleuvait à verse et il y avait à peine quelques visiteurs dans le parc."],["L7-2631","潦草","liáocǎo","Adj","sloppy; scrawled","descuidado; garabateado","bâclé; griffonné","他的字写得太潦草了，谁也看不清楚。","tā de zì xiě de tài liáo cǎo le shéi yě kàn bu qīng chǔ","His handwriting is so sloppy that no one can read it.","Su letra es tan desordenada que nadie la entiende.","Son écriture est si brouillonne que personne n'arrive à la lire."],["L7-2632","了结","liǎojié","V","to settle; to wind up","concluir; liquidar","régler; conclure","这起纠纷拖了两年，终于在法院了结了。","zhè qǐ jiū fēn tuō le liǎng nián zhōng yú zài fǎ yuàn liǎo jié le","This dispute dragged on for two years and was finally settled in court.","Esta disputa se alargó dos años y por fin se resolvió en el tribunal.","Ce litige a traîné pendant deux ans avant d'être enfin réglé devant le tribunal."],["L7-2633","了却","liǎoquè","V","to resolve; to settle","resolver; zanjar","régler; dissiper","陪父亲回老家看看，总算了却了他的一个心愿。","péi fù qīn huí lǎo jiā kàn kan zǒng suàn liǎo què le tā de yí ge xīn yuàn","Accompanying my father on a visit to his hometown finally fulfilled one of his wishes.","Acompañar a mi padre a visitar su pueblo natal por fin cumplió uno de sus deseos.","Accompagner mon père dans sa ville natale a enfin permis de réaliser l'un de ses vœux."],["L7-2634","料到","liàodào","","to foresee","prever","prévoir","谁也没料到，这场比赛最后会是这样的结果。","shéi yě méi liào dào zhè chǎng bǐ sài zuì hòu huì shì zhè yàng de jié guǒ","No one expected the match to end like this.","Nadie imaginó que el partido terminaría así.","Personne n'aurait imaginé que le match se terminerait ainsi."],["L7-2635","料理","liàolǐ","V/N","to handle; cuisine","gestionar; cocina","gérer; cuisine","父亲去世后，他回老家料理后事。","fù qīn qù shì hòu tā huí lǎo jiā liào lǐ hòu shì","After his father died, he went back to his hometown to handle the funeral arrangements.","Después de que murió su padre, volvió a su pueblo para encargarse de los arreglos del funeral.","Après la mort de son père, il est retourné dans son village natal pour s'occuper des obsèques."],["L7-2636","咧嘴","liězuǐ","","to grin","sonreír mostrando los dientes","sourire jusqu'aux oreilles","听到这个笑话，他咧嘴笑了起来。","tīng dào zhè ge xiào hua tā liě zuǐ xiào le qǐ lái","Hearing the joke, he grinned broadly.","Al oír el chiste, soltó una amplia sonrisa.","En entendant la blague, il a souri jusqu'aux oreilles."],["L7-2637","列举","lièjǔ","V","to list; to enumerate","enumerar; listar","énumérer; lister","老师在课上列举了很多例子来说明这个道理。","lǎo shī zài kè shàng liè jǔ le hěn duō lì zi lái shuō míng zhè ge dào lǐ","In class the teacher gave many examples to illustrate this principle.","En clase, el profesor dio muchos ejemplos para explicar este principio.","En classe, le professeur a cité de nombreux exemples pour expliquer ce principe."],["L7-2638","劣势","lièshì","N","disadvantage","desventaja","désavantage","虽然我们队处于劣势，但大家都没有放弃。","suī rán wǒ men duì chǔ yú liè shì dàn dà jiā dōu méi yǒu fàng qì","Although our team was at a disadvantage, no one gave up.","Aunque nuestro equipo estaba en desventaja, nadie se rindió.","Bien que notre équipe fût en position défavorable, personne n'a abandonné."],["L7-2639","劣质","lièzhì","Adj","shoddy; inferior","de mala calidad; deficiente","de mauvaise qualité; médiocre","这批劣质奶粉已经被全部下架了。","zhè pī liè zhì nǎi fěn yǐ jīng bèi quán bù xià jià le","This batch of substandard milk powder has all been pulled from the shelves.","Todo este lote de leche en polvo de mala calidad ya fue retirado de los estantes.","Tout ce lot de lait en poudre de mauvaise qualité a été retiré des rayons."],["L7-2640","烈士","lièshì","N","martyr","mártir","martyr","清明节那天，人们来到烈士墓前祭英烈。","qīng míng jié nà tiān rén men lái dào liè shì mù qián jì yīng liè","On Tomb-Sweeping Day, people came to the martyrs' graves to honor the fallen heroes.","El día de Qingming, la gente fue a las tumbas de los mártires a rendir homenaje a los héroes caídos.","Le jour de Qingming, les gens se sont rendus devant les tombes des martyrs pour honorer les héros disparus."],["L7-2641","猎犬","lièquǎn","N","hound","perro de caza","chien de chasse","这条猎犬嗅觉灵敏，很快就找到了受伤的野兔。","zhè tiáo liè quǎn xiù jué líng mǐn hěn kuài jiù zhǎo dào le shòu shāng de yě tù","This hound has a keen sense of smell and quickly found the injured hare.","Este perro de caza tiene un olfato agudo y pronto encontró a la liebre herida.","Ce chien de chasse a l'odorat fin et a vite retrouvé le lièvre blessé."],["L7-2642","猎人","lièrén","N","hunter","cazador","chasseur","老猎人在山里住了几十年，熟悉每一条小路。","lǎo liè rén zài shān lǐ zhù le jǐ shí nián shú xī měi yì tiáo xiǎo lù","The old hunter has lived in the mountains for decades and knows every trail.","El viejo cazador lleva décadas viviendo en la montaña y conoce cada sendero.","Le vieux chasseur vit dans la montagne depuis des dizaines d'années et connaît chaque sentier."],["L7-2643","裂缝","lièfèng","N","crack; crevice","grieta; hendidura","fissure; crevasse","地震过后，墙上出现了好几道裂缝。","dì zhèn guò hòu qiáng shàng chū xiàn le hǎo jǐ dào liè fèng","After the earthquake, several cracks appeared in the wall.","Después del terremoto aparecieron varias grietas en la pared.","Après le tremblement de terre, plusieurs fissures sont apparues dans le mur."],["L7-2644","裂痕","lièhén","N","rift; crack","grieta; fisura","fissure; fracture","那次争吵之后，两人的友谊出现了裂痕。","nà cì zhēng chǎo zhī hòu liǎng rén de yǒu yì chū xiàn le liè hén","After that quarrel, a rift appeared in their friendship.","Después de aquella discusión, su amistad se resquebrajó.","Après cette dispute, une fissure est apparue dans leur amitié."],["L7-2645","拎","līn","V","to carry in hand; to lift","llevar en la mano; levantar","porter à la main; soulever","她一手拎着菜篮子，一手牵着孩子过马路。","tā yì shǒu līn zhe cài lán zi yì shǒu qiān zhe hái zi guò mǎ lù","Carrying a vegetable basket in one hand, she led her child across the street with the other.","Con una mano llevaba la canasta de las verduras y con la otra guiaba a su hijo para cruzar la calle.","Un panier de légumes à une main, elle faisait traverser la rue à son enfant de l'autre."],["L7-2646","邻国","línguó","N","neighboring country","país vecino","pays voisin","两个邻国签署了新的贸易协定，以促进边境地区的发展。","liǎng gè lín guó qiān shǔ le xīn de mào yì xié dìng yǐ cù jìn biān jìng dì qū de fā zhǎn","The two neighboring countries signed a new trade agreement to promote development in the border areas.","Los dos países vecinos firmaron un nuevo acuerdo comercial para impulsar el desarrollo de las zonas fronterizas.","Les deux pays voisins ont signé un nouvel accord commercial pour favoriser le développement des régions frontalières."],["L7-2647","临","lín","V/Prep","to face; about to","dar a; estar a punto de","faire face à; sur le point de","这座小楼背山临水，四周风景十分秀丽。","zhè zuò xiǎo lóu bèi shān lín shuǐ sì zhōu fēng jǐng shí fēn xiù lì","This small building has mountains behind it and faces the water, with beautiful scenery all around.","Este pequeño edificio tiene una montaña detrás y el agua enfrente, y el paisaje a su alrededor es precioso.","Ce petit bâtiment est adossé à la montagne et donne sur l'eau, avec un paysage magnifique tout autour."],["L7-2648","临床","línchuáng","V","clinical","clínico","clinique","临床研究需要严格遵循伦理规范，并充分尊重参与者的知情权。","lín chuáng yán jiū xū yào yán gé zūn xún lún lǐ guī fàn bìng chōng fèn zūn zhòng cān yù zhě de zhī qíng quán","Clinical research must strictly follow ethical standards and fully respect participants' right to be informed.","La investigación clínica debe seguir estrictamente las normas éticas y respetar plenamente el derecho de los participantes a estar informados.","La recherche clinique doit respecter strictement les normes éthiques et le droit des participants à être informés."],["L7-2649","临街","línjiē","V","facing the street","que da a la calle","donnant sur la rue","他把临街的那间屋子改成了一家小咖啡馆。","tā bǎ lín jiē de nà jiān wū zi gǎi chéng le yì jiā xiǎo kā fēi guǎn","He turned the room facing the street into a small café.","Convirtió la habitación que da a la calle en una pequeña cafetería.","Il a transformé la pièce donnant sur la rue en un petit café."],["L7-2650","临近","línjìn","V","close to; approaching","cercano; acercarse","proche de; approcher","考试临近，不少学生出现了焦虑情绪。","kǎo shì lín jìn bù shǎo xué shēng chū xiàn le jiāo lǜ qíng xù","As the exam approaches, many students are feeling anxious.","Al acercarse el examen, muchos estudiantes sienten ansiedad.","À l'approche de l'examen, beaucoup d'étudiants ressentent de l'anxiété."],["L7-2651","淋","lín","V","to drench; to pour","empapar; verter","tremper; verser","淋了一场大雨，他浑身都湿透了。","lín le yì chǎng dà yǔ tā hún shēn dōu shī tòu le","Caught in a downpour, he was soaked from head to toe.","Lo sorprendió un aguacero y quedó empapado de pies a cabeza.","Pris sous une pluie battante, il était trempé des pieds à la tête."],["L7-2652","灵","líng","Adj","clever; effective","ágil; eficaz","vif; efficace","出海以前，渔民们照例祈求神灵保佑家人平安。","chū hǎi yǐ qián yú mín men zhào lì qí qiú shén líng bǎo yòu jiā rén píng ān","Before setting out to sea, the fishermen customarily prayed for divine protection for their families.","Antes de salir al mar, los pescadores, como de costumbre, pedían a los dioses que protegieran a sus familias.","Avant de prendre la mer, les pêcheurs imploraient comme d'habitude la protection des dieux pour la sécurité de leurs familles."],["L7-2653","灵感","línggǎn","N","inspiration","inspiración","inspiration","这首歌的灵感来自他小时候在海边的生活。","zhè shǒu gē de líng gǎn lái zì tā xiǎo shí hou zài hǎi biān de shēng huó","The inspiration for this song came from his childhood by the sea.","La inspiración para esta canción nació de su infancia junto al mar.","L'inspiration de cette chanson lui vient de son enfance au bord de la mer."],["L7-2654","灵魂","línghún","N","soul; spirit","alma; espíritu","âme; esprit","他认为音乐是一个民族的灵魂。","tā rèn wéi yīn yuè shì yí ge mín zú de líng hún","He believes music is the soul of a nation.","Él piensa que la música es el alma de un pueblo.","Il pense que la musique est l'âme d'un peuple."],["L7-2655","灵机一动","língjī-yīdòng","","a bright idea strikes","tener una idea repentina","avoir une idée soudaine","找不到开瓶器，他灵机一动，用钥匙撬开了瓶盖。","zhǎo bu dào kāi píng qì tā líng jī yí dòng yòng yào shi qiào kāi le píng gài","Unable to find a bottle opener, he hit upon an idea and pried the cap off with a key.","Al no encontrar el abrebotellas, se le ocurrió una idea y abrió la tapa con una llave.","Ne trouvant pas de décapsuleur, il a eu une idée soudaine et a fait sauter la capsule avec une clé."],["L7-2656","灵敏","língmǐn","Adj","sharp; sensitive","agudo; sensible","vif; sensible","狗的嗅觉比人灵敏得多。","gǒu de xiù jué bǐ rén líng mǐn de duō","A dog's sense of smell is much keener than a person's.","El olfato de los perros es mucho más agudo que el de las personas.","L'odorat du chien est bien plus fin que celui de l'homme."],["L7-2657","灵巧","língqiǎo","Adj","deft; nimble","diestro; ágil","habile; agile","老奶奶的双手十分灵巧，一会儿就剪出了一只蝴蝶。","lǎo nǎi nai de shuāng shǒu shí fēn líng qiǎo yí huìr jiù jiǎn chū le yì zhī hú dié","The old woman's hands are very nimble; in no time she cut out a paper butterfly.","La anciana tiene unas manos muy hábiles; en un momento recortó una mariposa.","La vieille dame a des mains très habiles ; en un rien de temps, elle a découpé un papillon."],["L7-2658","灵通","língtōng","Adj","well-informed; effective","bien informado; eficaz","bien informé; efficace","他消息灵通，公司里有什么变动总是第一个知道。","tā xiāo xi líng tōng gōng sī lǐ yǒu shén me biàn dòng zǒng shì dì yī ge zhī dào","He is well-informed and is always the first to know about any changes in the company.","Está muy bien informado y siempre es el primero en enterarse de cualquier cambio en la empresa.","Il est bien informé et le premier à savoir tout changement dans l'entreprise."],["L7-2659","凌晨","língchén","N","before dawn","de madrugada","avant l'aube","他最近压力很大，经常失眠到凌晨。","tā zuì jìn yā lì hěn dà jīng cháng shī mián dào líng chén","He's been under a lot of pressure lately and often can't sleep until the early hours.","Últimamente está sometido a mucha presión y a menudo no puede dormir hasta la madrugada.","Il subit beaucoup de pression ces derniers temps et souffre souvent d'insomnie jusqu'au petit matin."],["L7-2660","零花钱","línghuāqián","N","pocket money","dinero de bolsillo","argent de poche","她把每个月的零花钱存起来，想给妈妈买一份生日礼物。","tā bǎ měi ge yuè de líng huā qián cún qǐ lái xiǎng gěi mā ma mǎi yí fèn shēng rì lǐ wù","She saves her pocket money every month to buy her mother a birthday present.","Ella ahorra su dinero de bolsillo cada mes para comprarle un regalo de cumpleaños a su mamá.","Elle met de côté son argent de poche chaque mois pour offrir un cadeau d'anniversaire à sa mère."],["L7-2661","零件","língjiàn","N","part; component","pieza; componente","pièce; composant","这种金属很轻，常用来制造飞机零件。","zhè zhǒng jīn shǔ hěn qīng cháng yòng lái zhì zào fēi jī líng jiàn","This metal is very light and is often used to make aircraft parts.","Este metal es muy ligero y se usa con frecuencia para fabricar piezas de avión.","Ce métal est très léger et sert souvent à fabriquer des pièces d'avion."],["L7-2662","零钱","língqián","N","small change","cambio; monedas","monnaie","请帮我把这张一百元的钞票换成零钱。","qǐng bāng wǒ bǎ zhè zhāng yì bǎi yuán de chāo piào huàn chéng líng qián","Please break this hundred-yuan note into small change for me.","Por favor, cámbiame este billete de cien yuanes por cambio.","Pouvez-vous me faire la monnaie sur ce billet de cent yuans, s'il vous plaît ?"],["L7-2663","零售","língshòu","V","to retail","vender al por menor","vendre au détail","这家工厂的产品不零售，只批发给商店。","zhè jiā gōng chǎng de chǎn pǐn bù líng shòu zhǐ pī fā gěi shāng diàn","This factory's products are not sold retail, only wholesale to stores.","Los productos de esta fábrica no se venden al por menor, solo al por mayor a las tiendas.","Les produits de cette usine ne sont pas vendus au détail, seulement en gros aux magasins."],["L7-2664","领队","lǐngduì","V/N","group leader; to lead a group","jefe de grupo; dirigir un grupo","chef de groupe; mener un groupe","这次登山活动的领队经验丰富，大家都很放心。","zhè cì dēng shān huó dòng de lǐng duì jīng yàn fēng fù dà jiā dōu hěn fàng xīn","The leader of this climbing trip is very experienced, so everyone feels at ease.","El guía de esta excursión de montaña tiene mucha experiencia, así que todos están tranquilos.","Le chef de cette sortie en montagne a beaucoup d'expérience, alors tout le monde est rassuré."],["L7-2665","领会","lǐnghuì","V","to grasp; to comprehend","comprender; captar","saisir; comprendre","老师讲了两遍，我才真正领会了这篇文章的意思。","lǎo shī jiǎng le liǎng biàn wǒ cái zhēn zhèng lǐng huì le zhè piān wén zhāng de yì si","Only after the teacher explained it twice did I truly grasp the meaning of this article.","Solo después de que el profesor lo explicó dos veces entendí de verdad el sentido de este texto.","Ce n'est qu'après deux explications du professeur que j'ai vraiment saisi le sens de ce texte."],["L7-2666","领军","lǐngjūn","V","to lead; leading","liderar; líder","mener; de premier plan","她是国内人工智能研究的领军人物之一。","tā shì guó nèi rén gōng zhì néng yán jiū de lǐng jūn rén wù zhī yī","She is one of the leading figures in artificial intelligence research in the country.","Ella es una de las figuras más destacadas de la investigación en inteligencia artificial del país.","Elle est l'une des figures de proue de la recherche en intelligence artificielle dans le pays."],["L7-2667","领略","lǐnglüè","V","to appreciate; to experience","apreciar; experimentar","apprécier; goûter","这次旅行让我们领略到了江南水乡的独特风光。","zhè cì lǚ xíng ràng wǒ men lǐng lüè dào le jiāng nán shuǐ xiāng de dú tè fēng guāng","This trip let us take in the unique scenery of the water towns south of the Yangtze.","Este viaje nos permitió apreciar el paisaje singular de los pueblos acuáticos del sur del Yangtsé.","Ce voyage nous a permis de goûter le paysage unique des villes d'eau au sud du Yangzi."],["L7-2668","领事","lǐngshì","N","consul","cónsul","consul","领事在会见中表示，会尽力帮助受困的本国公民。","lǐng shì zài huì jiàn zhōng biǎo shì huì jìn lì bāng zhù shòu kùn de běn guó gōng mín","At the meeting, the consul said he would do his best to help his stranded fellow citizens.","En la reunión, el cónsul dijo que haría todo lo posible por ayudar a los ciudadanos de su país que estaban en apuros.","Lors de la rencontre, le consul a déclaré qu'il ferait son possible pour aider ses compatriotes en difficulté."],["L7-2669","领事馆","lǐngshìguǎn","N","consulate","consulado","consulat","护照丢失后，他立刻去领事馆申请了临时证件。","hù zhào diū shī hòu tā lì kè qù lǐng shì guǎn shēn qǐng le lín shí zhèng jiàn","After losing his passport, he immediately went to the consulate to apply for temporary documents.","Tras perder el pasaporte, fue de inmediato al consulado a solicitar un documento provisional.","Après avoir perdu son passeport, il est aussitôt allé au consulat demander un document provisoire."],["L7-2670","领土","lǐngtǔ","N","territory","territorio","territoire","任何国家都不会允许别国侵犯自己的领土。","rèn hé guó jiā dōu bú huì yǔn xǔ bié guó qīn fàn zì jǐ de lǐng tǔ","No country will allow another to violate its territory.","Ningún país permitirá que otro viole su territorio.","Aucun pays ne permettra à un autre de violer son territoire."],["L7-2671","领悟","lǐngwù","V","to comprehend; to grasp","comprender; captar","comprendre; saisir","他在实践中反复揣摩，终于领悟了师傅当年那番话的深意。","tā zài shí jiàn zhōng fǎn fù chuǎi mó zhōng yú lǐng wù le shī fu dāng nián nà fān huà de shēn yì","Through repeated reflection during practice, he finally grasped the deeper meaning of his master's words from years before.","Reflexionó una y otra vez durante la práctica y por fin comprendió el profundo sentido de aquellas palabras de su maestro.","À force d'y réfléchir en pratiquant, il a fini par saisir le sens profond de ce que son maître lui avait dit autrefois."],["L7-2672","领养","lǐngyǎng","V","to adopt (a child)","adoptar (a un niño)","adopter (un enfant)","他们从动物救助站领养了一只三条腿的小猫。","tā men cóng dòng wù jiù zhù zhàn lǐng yǎng le yì zhī sān tiáo tuǐ de xiǎo māo","They adopted a three-legged kitten from the animal rescue center.","Adoptaron un gatito de tres patas en un refugio de animales.","Ils ont adopté un chaton à trois pattes dans un refuge pour animaux."],["L7-2673","领域","lǐngyù","N","field; domain","campo; ámbito","domaine; secteur","这位科学家在物理学领域颇有建树。","zhè wèi kē xué jiā zài wù lǐ xué lǐng yù pō yǒu jiàn shù","This scientist has made considerable contributions in the field of physics.","Este científico ha hecho aportes considerables en el campo de la física.","Ce scientifique a apporté des contributions notables dans le domaine de la physique."],["L7-2674","溜","liū","V","to slip away; to skate","escabullirse; patinar","se faufiler; patiner","趁大家不注意，他悄悄从会场溜了出去。","chèn dà jiā bú zhù yì tā qiāo qiāo cóng huì chǎng liū le chū qù","While no one was paying attention, he quietly slipped out of the meeting hall.","Aprovechando que nadie prestaba atención, salió a hurtadillas de la sala de reuniones.","Profitant de l'inattention générale, il s'est discrètement éclipsé de la salle de réunion."],["L7-2675","溜达","liūda","V","to stroll","pasear","se promener","吃完晚饭，爷爷喜欢到公园里溜达一圈。","chī wán wǎn fàn yé ye xǐ huan dào gōng yuán lǐ liū da yì quān","After dinner, Grandpa likes to take a stroll around the park.","Después de cenar, al abuelo le gusta dar una vuelta por el parque.","Après le dîner, grand-père aime faire un tour dans le parc."],["L7-2676","浏览","liúlǎn","V","to browse; to skim","hojear; navegar","parcourir; naviguer","我每天早上都会花十分钟浏览一下新闻。","wǒ měi tiān zǎo shang dōu huì huā shí fēn zhōng liú lǎn yí xià xīn wén","Every morning I spend ten minutes browsing the news.","Todas las mañanas dedico diez minutos a echar un vistazo a las noticias.","Chaque matin, je consacre dix minutes à parcourir les actualités."],["L7-2677","浏览器","liúlǎnqì","N","browser","navegador","navigateur","网页打不开的话，可以换一个浏览器试试。","wǎng yè dǎ bù kāi de huà kě yǐ huàn yí ge liú lǎn qì shì shì","If the web page won't open, try a different browser.","Si la página web no abre, prueba con otro navegador.","Si la page web ne s'ouvre pas, essaie un autre navigateur."],["L7-2678","留恋","liúliàn","V","reluctant to leave","no querer irse","ne pas vouloir partir","毕业那天，大家都很留恋生活了四年的校园。","bì yè nà tiān dà jiā dōu hěn liú liàn shēng huó le sì nián de xiào yuán","On graduation day, everyone was reluctant to leave the campus where they had lived for four years.","El día de la graduación, a todos les costaba despedirse del campus donde habían vivido cuatro años.","Le jour de la remise des diplômes, tout le monde avait du mal à quitter le campus où l'on avait vécu quatre ans."],["L7-2679","留念","liúniàn","V","to keep as a souvenir","conservar como recuerdo","garder en souvenir","游客们纷纷在长城脚下拍照留念。","yóu kè men fēn fēn zài cháng chéng jiǎo xià pāi zhào liú niàn","Tourists took photos at the foot of the Great Wall as souvenirs.","Los turistas se tomaban fotos como recuerdo al pie de la Gran Muralla.","Les touristes se faisaient photographier au pied de la Grande Muraille en souvenir."],["L7-2680","留神","liúshén","","to be careful","tener cuidado","faire attention","下雨天路滑，走路的时候要多留神。","xià yǔ tiān lù huá zǒu lù de shí hou yào duō liú shén","The road is slippery on rainy days, so be careful when walking.","Los días de lluvia el camino resbala, así que ten cuidado al caminar.","Les jours de pluie, la route est glissante ; fais attention en marchant."],["L7-2681","留心","liúxīn","","to pay attention to","prestar atención","faire attention à","只要平时多留心观察，就能发现生活中的许多乐趣。","zhǐ yào píng shí duō liú xīn guān chá jiù néng fā xiàn shēng huó zhōng de xǔ duō lè qù","If you just pay a little more attention in daily life, you can discover a great deal of fun in it.","Con solo prestar un poco más de atención en el día a día, se descubren muchos placeres en la vida.","Il suffit d'observer avec un peu plus d'attention au quotidien pour découvrir bien des plaisirs dans la vie."],["L7-2682","留意","liúyì","","to take note of","tener en cuenta; notar","prêter attention à; remarquer","办理签证需提前一个月预约，请大家留意时间。","bàn lǐ qiān zhèng xū tí qián yí ge yuè yù yuē qǐng dà jiā liú yì shí jiān","To apply for a visa, you must make an appointment a month in advance, so please keep this timing requirement in mind.","Para tramitar la visa hay que pedir cita con un mes de anticipación, así que presten atención a los plazos.","Pour demander un visa, il faut prendre rendez-vous un mois à l'avance ; veuillez donc faire attention aux délais."],["L7-2683","流畅","liúchàng","Adj","fluent; smooth","fluido; fluente","fluide; coulant","她的中文说得非常流畅，几乎听不出外国口音。","tā de zhōng wén shuō de fēi cháng liú chàng jī hū tīng bù chū wài guó kǒu yīn","She speaks Chinese very fluently, with hardly any foreign accent.","Habla chino con mucha fluidez, casi sin acento extranjero.","Elle parle chinois très couramment, presque sans accent étranger."],["L7-2684","流程","liúchéng","N","workflow; process","flujo de trabajo; proceso","processus; flux de travail","新员工可以参照这份手册上的流程办理入职手续。","xīn yuán gōng kě yǐ cān zhào zhè fèn shǒu cè shàng de liú chéng bàn lǐ rù zhí shǒu xù","New employees can refer to the procedures in this handbook to complete their onboarding formalities.","Los empleados nuevos pueden consultar el procedimiento de este manual para completar los trámites de incorporación.","Les nouveaux employés peuvent se référer aux procédures de ce guide pour accomplir leurs formalités d'embauche."],["L7-2685","流浪","liúlàng","V","to wander; to roam","vagar; errar","errer; vagabonder","这只流浪狗在街头生活了很久，终于被好心人收养了。","zhè zhī liú làng gǒu zài jiē tóu shēng huó le hěn jiǔ zhōng yú bèi hǎo xīn rén shōu yǎng le","This stray dog lived on the streets for a long time before finally being taken in by a kind person.","Este perro callejero vivió mucho tiempo en la calle hasta que por fin lo adoptó una persona de buen corazón.","Ce chien errant a longtemps vécu dans la rue avant d'être enfin recueilli par une personne bienveillante."],["L7-2686","流泪","liúlèi","V","to shed tears","derramar lágrimas","verser des larmes","她是个很感性的人，看电影常常感动得流泪。","tā shì gè hěn gǎn xìng de rén kàn diàn yǐng cháng cháng gǎn dòng de liú lèi","She is a very emotional person and often cries at movies.","Es una persona muy sensible y a menudo llora viendo películas.","C'est une personne très sensible, et elle pleure souvent devant les films."],["L7-2687","流量","liúliàng","N","flow; traffic volume","flujo; volumen de tráfico","débit; volume de trafic","节假日期间，这条高速公路的车流量明显增加。","jié jià rì qī jiān zhè tiáo gāo sù gōng lù de chē liú liàng míng xiǎn zēng jiā","During holidays, the traffic volume on this expressway increases noticeably.","En los días festivos, el tráfico de esta autopista aumenta notablemente.","Pendant les jours fériés, le trafic sur cette autoroute augmente nettement."],["L7-2688","流露","liúlù","V","to reveal; to show","dejar traslucir; mostrar","laisser transparaître; montrer","这封信里流露出了他的真情。","zhè fēng xìn lǐ liú lù chū le tā de zhēn qíng","This letter reveals his true feelings.","Esta carta deja ver sus sentimientos sinceros.","Cette lettre laisse transparaître ses sentiments sincères."],["L7-2689","流氓","liúmáng","N","hooligan; gangster","rufián; gánster","voyou; gangster","那个流氓在车上骚扰乘客，被警察当场带走了。","nà ge liú máng zài chē shàng sāo rǎo chéng kè bèi jǐng chá dāng chǎng dài zǒu le","The hoodlum who harassed passengers on the bus was taken away by police on the spot.","Ese rufián acosó a los pasajeros en el vehículo y la policía se lo llevó en el acto.","Ce voyou qui harcelait les passagers dans le véhicule a été emmené sur-le-champ par la police."],["L7-2690","流入","liúrù","","to flow into; inflow","fluir hacia; entrada","affluer; afflux","每年都有大量外地人口流入这座城市。","měi nián dōu yǒu dà liàng wài dì rén kǒu liú rù zhè zuò chéng shì","Every year a large number of people from other regions flow into this city.","Cada año llega a esta ciudad una gran cantidad de gente de otras regiones.","Chaque année, un grand nombre de personnes venues d'autres régions affluent dans cette ville."],["L7-2691","流失","liúshī","V","to be lost; to wash away","perderse; erosionarse","se perdre; s'éroder","山上的树被砍光以后，水土流失越来越严重。","shān shàng de shù bèi kǎn guāng yǐ hòu shuǐ tǔ liú shī yuè lái yuè yán zhòng","After the trees on the mountain were cut down, soil erosion became increasingly serious.","Después de talar los árboles de la montaña, la erosión del suelo se ha vuelto cada vez más grave.","Depuis que les arbres de la montagne ont été abattus, l'érosion des sols s'aggrave de plus en plus."],["L7-2692","流水","liúshuǐ","N","running water; turnover","agua corriente; facturación","eau courante; chiffre d'affaires","山间的流水清澈见底，能看见小鱼游来游去。","shān jiān de liú shuǐ qīng chè jiàn dǐ néng kàn jiàn xiǎo yú yóu lái yóu qù","The mountain stream is so clear you can see the bottom and little fish swimming about.","El agua del arroyo de la montaña es tan clara que se ve el fondo y se distinguen los pececitos nadando.","L'eau du ruisseau de montagne est si limpide qu'on voit le fond et les petits poissons qui nagent."],["L7-2693","流淌","liútǎng","V","to flow","fluir; correr","couler","一条小河从村子中间缓缓流淌而过。","yì tiáo xiǎo hé cóng cūn zi zhōng jiān huǎn huǎn liú tǎng ér guò","A small river flows slowly through the middle of the village.","Un riachuelo pasa lentamente por el centro del pueblo.","Une petite rivière traverse lentement le village en son milieu."],["L7-2694","流向","liúxiàng","N","flow direction; to flow toward","dirección del flujo; fluir hacia","sens du courant; couler vers","这些捐款的流向必须向公众公开。","zhè xiē juān kuǎn de liú xiàng bì xū xiàng gōng zhòng gōng kāi","Where these donations go must be disclosed to the public.","El destino de estas donaciones debe hacerse público.","La destination de ces dons doit être rendue publique."],["L7-2695","流血","liúxuè","V","to bleed; to shed blood","sangrar; derramar sangre","saigner; verser le sang","他的膝盖摔破了，一直在流血。","tā de xī gài shuāi pò le yì zhí zài liú xuè","He scraped his knee in a fall, and it kept bleeding.","Se cayó y se raspó la rodilla, y no deja de sangrar.","Il est tombé et s'est écorché le genou, qui n'arrête pas de saigner."],["L7-2696","流域","liúyù","N","river basin","cuenca fluvial","bassin fluvial","长江流域自古以来就是重要的农业区。","cháng jiāng liú yù zì gǔ yǐ lái jiù shì zhòng yào de nóng yè qū","The Yangtze River basin has been an important agricultural region since ancient times.","La cuenca del río Yangtsé ha sido desde la antigüedad una importante región agrícola.","Le bassin du Yangzi est depuis l'Antiquité une importante région agricole."],["L7-2697","流转","liúzhuǎn","V","to circulate; to roam","circular; vagar","circuler; errer","他年轻时流转各地，靠给人修鞋维持生计。","tā nián qīng shí liú zhuǎn gè dì kào gěi rén xiū xié wéi chí shēng jì","When he was young, he wandered from place to place, making a living repairing shoes.","De joven anduvo de un lugar a otro ganándose la vida arreglando zapatos.","Dans sa jeunesse, il erra de lieu en lieu en gagnant sa vie à réparer des chaussures."],["L7-2698","柳树","liǔshù","N","willow","sauce","saule","河边的柳树把长长的枝条垂到了水面上。","hé biān de liǔ shù bǎ cháng cháng de zhī tiáo chuí dào le shuǐ miàn shàng","The willows by the river hang their long branches down to the surface of the water.","Los sauces de la orilla del río dejan caer sus largas ramas hasta la superficie del agua.","Les saules au bord de la rivière laissent pendre leurs longues branches jusqu'à la surface de l'eau."],["L7-2699","遛","liù","V","to stroll; to walk (an animal)","pasear; sacar a pasear","se promener; promener","他每天傍晚都要牵着狗到小区里遛一遛。","tā měi tiān bàng wǎn dōu yào qiān zhe gǒu dào xiǎo qū lǐ liù yi liù","Every evening he takes his dog for a walk around the neighborhood.","Todas las tardes saca a pasear a su perro por la urbanización.","Chaque soir, il promène son chien dans le quartier."],["L7-2700","龙舟","lóngzhōu","N","dragon boat","barco dragón","bateau-dragon","端午节那天，河上举行了热闹的龙舟比赛。","duān wǔ jié nà tiān hé shàng jǔ xíng le rè nao de lóng zhōu bǐ sài","On the Dragon Boat Festival, a lively dragon boat race was held on the river.","El día del Festival del Bote del Dragón se celebró en el río una animada competencia de botes dragón.","Le jour de la fête des bateaux-dragons, une animée course de bateaux-dragons a eu lieu sur la rivière."],["L7-2701","聋","lóng","Adj","deaf","sordo","sourd","爷爷的左耳有点聋，跟他说话要大声一点。","yé ye de zuǒ ěr yǒu diǎn lóng gēn tā shuō huà yào dà shēng yì diǎn","Grandpa is a bit deaf in his left ear, so speak up when you talk to him.","El abuelo es un poco sordo del oído izquierdo, así que háblale más fuerte.","Grand-père est un peu sourd de l'oreille gauche ; parle-lui plus fort."],["L7-2702","聋人","lóngrén","N","deaf person","persona sorda","personne sourde","这家咖啡馆雇用了几位聋人员工，顾客用手语点餐。","zhè jiā kā fēi guǎn gù yòng le jǐ wèi lóng rén yuán gōng gù kè yòng shǒu yǔ diǎn cān","This café employs several deaf staff, and customers order in sign language.","Esta cafetería emplea a varias personas sordas, y los clientes piden en lengua de señas.","Ce café emploie plusieurs personnes sourdes, et les clients commandent en langue des signes."],["L7-2703","笼子","lóngzi","N","cage","jaula","cage","他打开笼子，把养好伤的小鸟放回了树林。","tā dǎ kāi lóng zi bǎ yǎng hǎo shāng de xiǎo niǎo fàng huí le shù lín","He opened the cage and released the healed bird back into the woods.","Abrió la jaula y devolvió al bosque al pajarito ya recuperado de su herida.","Il a ouvert la cage et a relâché dans le bois le petit oiseau guéri de sa blessure."],["L7-2704","隆重","lóngzhòng","Adj","grand; solemn","solemne; grandioso","solennel; grandiose","学校为新生举行了隆重的开学典礼。","xué xiào wèi xīn shēng jǔ xíng le lóng zhòng de kāi xué diǎn lǐ","The school held a grand opening ceremony for the new students.","La escuela celebró una solemne ceremonia de inicio de clases para los alumnos de nuevo ingreso.","L'école a organisé une grande cérémonie de rentrée pour les nouveaux élèves."],["L7-2705","垄断","lǒngduàn","V","to monopolize","monopolizar","monopoliser","政府出台新规，防止少数企业垄断市场。","zhèng fǔ chū tái xīn guī fáng zhǐ shǎo shù qǐ yè lǒng duàn shì chǎng","The government issued new rules to prevent a few companies from monopolizing the market.","El gobierno emitió nuevas normas para evitar que unas pocas empresas monopolicen el mercado.","Le gouvernement a édicté de nouvelles règles pour empêcher quelques entreprises de monopoliser le marché."],["L7-2706","笼统","lǒngtǒng","Adj","general; vague","general; vago","général; vague","你的计划说得太笼统了，能不能讲得具体一点？","nǐ de jì huà shuō de tài lǒng tǒng le néng bu néng jiǎng de jù tǐ yì diǎn","Your plan is too vague — could you be more specific?","Tu plan está explicado de manera demasiado general; ¿podrías ser más específico?","Ton plan est trop vague ; pourrais-tu être plus précis ?"],["L7-2707","笼罩","lǒngzhào","V","to envelop; to shroud","envolver; cubrir","envelopper; couvrir","清晨，整座山城都笼罩在浓浓的雾气中。","qīng chén zhěng zuò shān chéng dōu lǒng zhào zài nóng nóng de wù qì zhōng","In the early morning, the whole mountain city is shrouded in thick fog.","Al amanecer, toda la ciudad de montaña está envuelta en una densa niebla.","Au petit matin, toute la ville de montagne est enveloppée d'un épais brouillard."],["L7-2708","搂","lǒu","V","to hug; to gather up","abrazar; recoger","serrer dans ses bras; relever","妈妈紧紧搂着受惊的孩子，轻声安慰他。","mā ma jǐn jǐn lǒu zhe shòu jīng de hái zi qīng shēng ān wèi tā","The mother held her frightened child tightly and comforted him softly.","La madre abrazó con fuerza a su hijo asustado y lo consoló en voz baja.","La mère serra fort son enfant effrayé contre elle et le réconforta doucement."],["L7-2709","露面","lòumiàn","","to appear in public","dejarse ver; aparecer en público","se montrer; apparaître en public","这位演员已经很久没有在公开场合露面了。","zhè wèi yǎn yuán yǐ jīng hěn jiǔ méi yǒu zài gōng kāi chǎng hé lòu miàn le","This actor hasn't appeared in public for a long time.","Este actor lleva mucho tiempo sin aparecer en público.","Cet acteur ne s'est plus montré en public depuis longtemps."],["L7-2710","芦花","lúhuā","N","reed catkin","inflorescencia de caña","panicule de roseau","秋风吹过湖边，满地的芦花像雪一样飘了起来。","qiū fēng chuī guò hú biān mǎn dì de lú huā xiàng xuě yí yàng piāo le qǐ lái","When the autumn wind blew along the lakeshore, the reed catkins covering the ground rose and drifted like snow.","Cuando el viento de otoño sopló por la orilla del lago, los plumeros de caña que cubrían el suelo se alzaron flotando como nieve.","Quand le vent d'automne a soufflé sur la rive du lac, les aigrettes de roseaux qui couvraient le sol se sont envolées comme de la neige."],["L7-2711","炉灶","lúzào","N","stove","cocina; fogón","cuisinière; fourneau","厨房重新装修以后，换上了新的炉灶。","chú fáng chóng xīn zhuāng xiū yǐ hòu huàn shàng le xīn de lú zào","After the kitchen was renovated, a new stove was installed.","Después de remodelar la cocina, le pusieron una estufa nueva.","Après la rénovation de la cuisine, on y a installé un nouveau fourneau."],["L7-2712","炉子","lúzi","N","stove; furnace","estufa; horno","poêle; fourneau","冬天屋里生着炉子，暖和极了。","dōng tiān wū lǐ shēng zhe lú zi nuǎn huo jí le","In winter, with the stove lit, the room is wonderfully warm.","En invierno, con la estufa encendida, la habitación está calentita.","En hiver, avec le poêle allumé, la pièce est délicieusement chaude."],["L7-2713","卤味","lǔwèi","N","soy-braised food","alimentos estofados en salsa de soja","aliments braisés à la sauce soja","这家小店的卤味很有名，每天下午都有人排队。","zhè jiā xiǎo diàn de lǔ wèi hěn yǒu míng měi tiān xià wǔ dōu yǒu rén pái duì","This little shop's braised specialties are famous, and there's a queue every afternoon.","Los platillos guisados de esta tiendita son muy famosos y todas las tardes hay fila.","Les spécialités braisées de cette petite boutique sont très réputées, et il y a la queue chaque après-midi."],["L7-2714","鲁莽","lǔmǎng","Adj","rash; reckless","imprudente; temerario","imprudent; téméraire","他做事太鲁莽，还没弄清情况就和人吵了起来。","tā zuò shì tài lǔ mǎng hái méi nòng qīng qíng kuàng jiù hé rén chǎo le qǐ lái","He is too rash — he started arguing before even understanding the situation.","Es demasiado impulsivo: se puso a discutir con alguien sin siquiera entender la situación.","Il est trop impulsif : il s'est disputé avec quelqu'un sans même avoir compris la situation."],["L7-2715","录制","lùzhì","V","to record (audio/video)","grabar (audio/video)","enregistrer (audio/vidéo)","主持人正在演播室里录制节目。","zhǔ chí rén zhèng zài yǎn bō shì lǐ lù zhì jié mù","The host is recording a program in the studio.","El presentador está grabando un programa en el estudio.","L'animateur enregistre une émission en studio."],["L7-2716","鹿","lù","N","deer","ciervo","cerf","清晨的树林里，一只小鹿正低头喝水。","qīng chén de shù lín lǐ yì zhī xiǎo lù zhèng dī tóu hē shuǐ","In the woods at dawn, a little deer was bending its head to drink.","En el bosque al amanecer, un cervatillo bajaba la cabeza para beber agua.","Dans le bois, à l'aube, un jeune cerf baissait la tête pour boire."],["L7-2717","路程","lùchéng","N","distance; journey","trayecto; distancia","trajet; distance","从这里到机场的路程不远，开车二十分钟就到了。","cóng zhè lǐ dào jī chǎng de lù chéng bù yuǎn kāi chē èr shí fēn zhōng jiù dào le","The trip from here to the airport isn't long; it's twenty minutes by car.","El trayecto de aquí al aeropuerto no es largo; en coche se llega en veinte minutos.","Le trajet d'ici à l'aéroport n'est pas long : on y est en vingt minutes en voiture."],["L7-2718","路灯","lùdēng","N","street lamp","farola","réverbère","天黑以后，街道两旁的路灯一盏接一盏地亮了起来。","tiān hēi yǐ hòu jiē dào liǎng páng de lù dēng yì zhǎn jiē yì zhǎn de liàng le qǐ lái","After dark, the street lamps on both sides of the road lit up one after another.","Al oscurecer, las farolas a ambos lados de la calle fueron encendiéndose una tras otra.","À la tombée de la nuit, les lampadaires des deux côtés de la rue se sont allumés l'un après l'autre."],["L7-2719","路段","lùduàn","N","road section","tramo de carretera","tronçon de route","前方学校路段，请减速慢行。","qián fāng xué xiào lù duàn qǐng jiǎn sù màn xíng","School zone ahead — please slow down.","Zona escolar adelante: reduzca la velocidad.","Zone scolaire à proximité : ralentissez."],["L7-2720","路况","lùkuàng","N","road conditions","estado de la carretera","état de la route","出发前，司机先在手机上查了一下路况。","chū fā qián sī jī xiān zài shǒu jī shàng chá le yí xià lù kuàng","Before setting off, the driver checked the road conditions on his phone.","Antes de salir, el conductor revisó el estado del tráfico en su celular.","Avant de partir, le chauffeur a consulté l'état de la circulation sur son téléphone."],["L7-2721","路面","lùmiàn","N","road surface","superficie de la carretera","chaussée","大雪过后路面结了冰，很多车都开得特别慢。","dà xuě guò hòu lù miàn jié le bīng hěn duō chē dōu kāi de tè bié màn","After the heavy snow, the road surface froze and many cars drove very slowly.","Después de la fuerte nevada, la calzada se cubrió de hielo y muchos coches circulaban muy despacio.","Après la forte chute de neige, la chaussée a verglacé et beaucoup de voitures roulaient très lentement."],["L7-2722","路人","lùrén","N","passer-by","transeúnte","passant","几名路人合力制服了持刀抢劫的歹徒。","jǐ míng lù rén hé lì zhì fú le chí dāo qiǎng jié de dǎi tú","Several passers-by worked together to subdue the knife-wielding robber.","Varios transeúntes se unieron para reducir al delincuente que intentó asaltar con un cuchillo.","Plusieurs passants se sont unis pour maîtriser le malfaiteur qui commettait un braquage armé d'un couteau."],["L7-2723","路途","lùtú","N","road; journey","camino; trayecto","route; chemin","纵然路途遥远，他也每年回家看望父母。","zòng rán lù tú yáo yuǎn tā yě měi nián huí jiā kàn wàng fù mǔ","Even though the journey is long, he goes home to see his parents every year.","Aunque el camino es largo, él vuelve a casa todos los años a visitar a sus padres.","Même si le trajet est long, il rentre chaque année voir ses parents."],["L7-2724","路子","lùzi","N","method; way","método; manera","méthode; moyen","做生意要先找对路子，不能盲目投资。","zuò shēng yi yào xiān zhǎo duì lù zi bù néng máng mù tóu zī","In business, you must first find the right approach rather than investing blindly.","Para hacer negocios primero hay que encontrar el camino correcto y no invertir a ciegas.","En affaires, il faut d'abord trouver la bonne voie et ne pas investir à l'aveuglette."],["L7-2725","露天","lùtiān","N/Adj","outdoors; open-air","al aire libre","en plein air","夏天的晚上，广场上会放露天电影。","xià tiān de wǎn shang guǎng chǎng shàng huì fàng lù tiān diàn yǐng","On summer evenings, open-air films are shown in the square.","En las noches de verano se proyectan películas al aire libre en la plaza.","Les soirs d'été, on projette des films en plein air sur la place."],["L7-2726","旅程","lǚchéng","N","journey; trip","viaje; trayecto","voyage; trajet","祝你旅程愉快，到了记得给家里打个电话。","zhù nǐ lǚ chéng yú kuài dào le jì de gěi jiā lǐ dǎ gè diàn huà","Have a pleasant journey, and remember to call home when you arrive.","¡Que tengas un buen viaje! Cuando llegues, acuérdate de llamar a casa.","Bon voyage ! N'oublie pas d'appeler à la maison en arrivant."],["L7-2727","旅途","lǚtú","N","journey; trip","viaje; trayecto","voyage; trajet","她把旅途中的见闻一长一短地讲给我们听。","tā bǎ lǚ tú zhōng de jiàn wén yì cháng yì duǎn de jiǎng gěi wǒ men tīng","She gave us a long-winded account of what she had seen and heard on her trip.","Nos contó con todo detalle y sin prisa lo que había visto y oído durante su viaje.","Elle nous a raconté en long et en large tout ce qu'elle avait vu et entendu pendant son voyage."],["L7-2728","铝","lǚ","N","aluminum","aluminio","aluminium","这扇窗户的框是铝做的，又轻又不容易生锈。","zhè shàn chuāng hu de kuàng shì lǚ zuò de yòu qīng yòu bù róng yì shēng xiù","This window's frame is made of aluminum; it's light and doesn't rust easily.","El marco de esta ventana es de aluminio; es ligero y no se oxida con facilidad.","Le cadre de cette fenêtre est en aluminium ; il est léger et ne rouille pas facilement."],["L7-2729","屡","lǚ","Adv","repeatedly","repetidamente","à plusieurs reprises","这家工厂屡遭投诉，却一直没有认真整改。","zhè jiā gōng chǎng lǚ zāo tóu sù què yì zhí méi yǒu rèn zhēn zhěng gǎi","This factory has repeatedly drawn complaints yet has never seriously fixed its problems.","Esta fábrica ha recibido quejas una y otra vez, pero nunca ha corregido los problemas con seriedad.","Cette usine a fait l'objet de plaintes à répétition, mais n'a jamais sérieusement corrigé ses défauts."],["L7-2730","屡次","lǚcì","Adv","repeatedly; time and again","repetidamente; una y otra vez","à maintes reprises","项目屡次受挫后，负责人主动承担责任，并提出了切实可行的补救方案。","xiàng mù lǚ cì shòu cuò hòu fù zé rén zhǔ dòng chéng dān zé rèn bìng tí chū le qiè shí kě xíng de bǔ jiù fāng àn","After repeated setbacks to the project, the person in charge took responsibility and proposed a practical remedy.","Tras los reiterados reveses del proyecto, el responsable asumió la responsabilidad y propuso un plan de remedio viable.","Après les revers répétés du projet, le responsable a assumé ses responsabilités et proposé un plan correctif réaliste."],["L7-2731","缕","lǚ","M","wisp; strand","hebra; mechón; (clasificador de hilos)","mèche; fil; (classificateur de filaments)","一缕阳光从窗帘的缝隙里照了进来。","yì lǚ yáng guāng cóng chuāng lián de fèng xì lǐ zhào le jìn lái","A ray of sunlight shone in through a gap in the curtains.","Un rayo de sol entró por la rendija de las cortinas.","Un rayon de soleil est entré par l'interstice des rideaux."],["L7-2732","履行","lǚxíng","V","to fulfill; to carry out","cumplir; llevar a cabo","remplir; accomplir","签了合同，双方就必须按约定履行各自的义务。","qiān le hé tóng shuāng fāng jiù bì xū àn yuē dìng lǚ xíng gè zì de yì wù","Once the contract is signed, both parties must fulfill their obligations as agreed.","Una vez firmado el contrato, ambas partes deben cumplir sus respectivas obligaciones según lo acordado.","Une fois le contrat signé, les deux parties doivent remplir leurs obligations respectives comme convenu."],["L7-2733","率","lǜ","Suffix","rate; frequency","tasa; frecuencia","taux; fréquence","赛后，教练率全队向现场观众鞠躬致谢。","sài hòu jiào liàn shuài quán duì xiàng xiàn chǎng guān zhòng jū gōng zhì xiè","After the match, the coach led the whole team in bowing to the spectators in thanks.","Al terminar el partido, el entrenador encabezó al equipo para hacer una reverencia de agradecimiento al público presente.","Après le match, l'entraîneur a conduit toute l'équipe à s'incliner pour remercier les spectateurs présents."],["L7-2733#2","成功率","chénggōnglǜ","N","success rate","tasa de éxito","taux de réussite"],["L7-2734","绿灯","lǜdēng","N","green light","luz verde","feu vert","绿灯亮了，行人才可以过马路。","lǜ dēng liàng le xíng rén cái kě yǐ guò mǎ lù","Pedestrians may cross the street only when the light turns green.","Los peatones solo pueden cruzar la calle cuando la luz se pone en verde.","Les piétons ne peuvent traverser que lorsque le feu passe au vert."],["L7-2735","绿地","lǜdì","N","green space","zona verde","espace vert","小区里新建了一大片绿地，孩子们有了玩耍的地方。","xiǎo qū lǐ xīn jiàn le yí dà piàn lǜ dì hái zi men yǒu le wán shuǎ de dì fang","A large green space was built in the neighborhood, giving children a place to play.","En la urbanización se construyó una gran zona verde, y los niños ya tienen dónde jugar.","Un grand espace vert a été aménagé dans le quartier, et les enfants ont maintenant un endroit où jouer."],["L7-2736","孪生","luánshēng","Adj","twin","gemelo","jumeau","这对孪生姐妹长得一模一样，连老师都分不清。","zhè duì luán shēng jiě mèi zhǎng de yì mú yí yàng lián lǎo shī dōu fēn bu qīng","These twin sisters look exactly alike; even their teacher can't tell them apart.","Estas hermanas gemelas son idénticas; ni siquiera la maestra puede distinguirlas.","Ces sœurs jumelles se ressemblent comme deux gouttes d'eau ; même leur professeur ne les distingue pas."],["L7-2737","卵","luǎn","N","egg; ovum","huevo; óvulo","œuf; ovule","每到春天，青蛙就会把卵产在池塘的浅水里。","měi dào chūn tiān qīng wā jiù huì bǎ luǎn chǎn zài chí táng de qiǎn shuǐ lǐ","Every spring, frogs lay their eggs in the shallow water of the pond.","Cada primavera, las ranas ponen sus huevos en el agua poco profunda del estanque.","Chaque printemps, les grenouilles pondent leurs œufs dans les eaux peu profondes de l'étang."],["L7-2738","乱七八糟","luànqībāzāo","Adj","chaotic; messy","caótico; desordenado","chaotique; en désordre","孩子们走后，客厅里被弄得乱七八糟。","hái zi men zǒu hòu kè tīng lǐ bèi nòng de luàn qī bā zāo","After the children left, the living room was a complete mess.","Cuando se fueron los niños, la sala quedó hecha un desastre.","Après le départ des enfants, le salon était sens dessus dessous."],["L7-2739","掠夺","lüèduó","V","to plunder","saquear","piller","殖民者曾经大肆掠夺这片土地上的资源。","zhí mín zhě céng jīng dà sì lüè duó zhè piàn tǔ dì shàng de zī yuán","The colonizers once plundered this land's resources on a massive scale.","Los colonizadores saquearon a gran escala los recursos de estas tierras.","Les colonisateurs ont pillé massivement les ressources de ces terres."],["L7-2740","略","lüè","V/Adj","brief; slightly; to omit","breve; ligeramente; omitir","bref; légèrement; omettre","这件外套略大了一点，不过还能穿。","zhè jiàn wài tào lüè dà le yì diǎn bú guò hái néng chuān","This coat is slightly too big, but it's still wearable.","Este abrigo me queda un poco grande, pero todavía se puede usar.","Ce manteau est un peu trop grand, mais on peut encore le porter."],["L7-2741","略微","lüèwēi","Adv","slightly; a little","ligeramente; un poco","légèrement; un peu","他略微想了想，就给出了答案。","tā lüè wēi xiǎng le xiǎng jiù gěi chū le dá àn","He thought for a moment and gave the answer.","Pensó un momento y dio la respuesta.","Il a réfléchi un instant, puis a donné la réponse."],["L7-2742","抡","lūn","V","to swing; to wave","blandir; agitar","brandir; agiter","他抡起斧头，一下就把木头劈成了两半。","tā lūn qǐ fǔ tóu yí xià jiù bǎ mù tou pī chéng le liǎng bàn","He swung the axe and split the log in two with a single blow.","Levantó el hacha y partió el leño en dos de un solo golpe.","Il a brandi la hache et fendu la bûche en deux d'un seul coup."],["L7-2743","伦理","lúnlǐ","N","ethics","ética","éthique","临床研究需要严格遵循伦理规范，并充分尊重参与者的知情权。","lín chuáng yán jiū xū yào yán gé zūn xún lún lǐ guī fàn bìng chōng fèn zūn zhòng cān yù zhě de zhī qíng quán","Clinical research must strictly follow ethical standards and fully respect participants' right to be informed.","La investigación clínica debe seguir estrictamente las normas éticas y respetar plenamente el derecho de los participantes a estar informados.","La recherche clinique doit respecter strictement les normes éthiques et le droit des participants à être informés."],["L7-2744","轮换","lúnhuàn","V","to take turns; to rotate","turnarse; rotar","alterner; faire une rotation","为了保护土地，农民们每年轮换种植不同的作物。","wèi le bǎo hù tǔ dì nóng mín men měi nián lún huàn zhòng zhí bù tóng de zuò wù","To protect the soil, farmers rotate different crops each year.","Para proteger la tierra, los agricultores rotan cada año diferentes cultivos.","Pour protéger les sols, les agriculteurs pratiquent chaque année la rotation des cultures."],["L7-2745","轮廓","lúnkuò","N","outline; silhouette","contorno; silueta","contour; silhouette","远处山峰的轮廓在晚霞中显得格外清晰。","yuǎn chù shān fēng de lún kuò zài wǎn xiá zhōng xiǎn de gé wài qīng xī","The outline of the distant peaks stood out sharply against the sunset glow.","El contorno de las cumbres lejanas se veía especialmente nítido bajo el resplandor del atardecer.","Le contour des sommets lointains se détachait avec une netteté particulière dans la lueur du couchant."],["L7-2746","轮流","lúnliú","V","to take turns","turnarse","se relayer","兄妹俩轮流照顾生病的母亲。","xiōng mèi liǎ lún liú zhào gù shēng bìng de mǔ qīn","The brother and sister took turns caring for their sick mother.","Los dos hermanos se turnaban para cuidar a su madre enferma.","Le frère et la sœur se relayaient pour s'occuper de leur mère malade."],["L7-2747","轮胎","lúntāi","N","tire","neumático","pneu","车开到半路，一个轮胎突然漏气了。","chē kāi dào bàn lù yí ge lún tāi tū rán lòu qì le","Halfway through the drive, one of the tires suddenly went flat.","A medio camino, de repente se le pinchó una llanta al coche.","À mi-chemin, un pneu s'est soudain dégonflé."],["L7-2748","论述","lùnshù","V","to discuss; exposition","exponer; exposición","exposer; exposé","导师反复叮嘱我们，引用他人的论述时务必注明出处。","dǎo shī fǎn fù dīng zhǔ wǒ men yǐn yòng tā rén de lùn shù shí wù bì zhù míng chū chù","Our supervisor repeatedly reminded us to identify the source whenever we cite someone else's arguments.","El tutor nos recordó una y otra vez que, al citar los argumentos de otros, hay que indicar siempre la fuente.","Notre directeur de recherche nous a répété qu'il faut toujours indiquer la source lorsqu'on cite les propos d'autrui."],["L7-2749","论坛","lùntán","N","forum","foro","forum","参加这次论坛的都是各个行业的精英。","cān jiā zhè cì lùn tán de dōu shì gè gè háng yè de jīng yīng","The participants in this forum are all elites from various industries.","Los participantes de este foro son todos figuras destacadas de diversos sectores.","Les participants à ce forum sont tous l'élite de différents secteurs."],["L7-2750","论证","lùnzhèng","V","to demonstrate; to prove","demostrar; argumentar","démontrer; argumenter","评价一篇作文，既要看措辞是否贴切，也要看论证是否严谨。","píng jià yì piān zuò wén jì yào kàn cuò cí shì fǒu tiē qiè yě yào kàn lùn zhèng shì fǒu yán jǐn","Evaluating an essay requires attention both to apt wording and to rigorous reasoning.","Para evaluar una redacción hay que fijarse tanto en si las palabras son adecuadas como en si la argumentación es rigurosa.","Pour évaluer une rédaction, il faut regarder à la fois si les mots sont justes et si l'argumentation est rigoureuse."],["L7-2751","罗","luó","N/V","Luo (surname)","Luo (apellido)","Luo (nom de famille)","新来的罗老师说话幽默，学生们都很喜欢他。","xīn lái de luó lǎo shī shuō huà yōu mò xué shēng men dōu hěn xǐ huan tā","The new teacher, Mr. Luo, speaks with humor, and the students all like him.","El nuevo profesor Luo habla con humor y a todos los alumnos les cae muy bien.","Le nouveau professeur, M. Luo, a beaucoup d'humour et tous les élèves l'apprécient."],["L7-2752","萝卜","luóbo","N","radish","rábano","radis","冬天喝一碗萝卜炖排骨汤，全身都暖和了。","dōng tiān hē yì wǎn luó bo dùn pái gǔ tāng quán shēn dōu nuǎn huo le","A bowl of pork rib and radish soup in winter warms you all over.","Un tazón de sopa de costillas de cerdo con rábano en invierno te hace entrar en calor por completo.","En hiver, un bol de soupe de côtes de porc au radis vous réchauffe tout le corps."],["L7-2753","螺丝","luósī","N","screw","tornillo","vis","书架有点晃，我拿螺丝刀把螺丝拧紧了。","shū jià yǒu diǎn huàng wǒ ná luó sī dāo bǎ luó sī nǐng jǐn le","The bookshelf was a bit wobbly, so I tightened the screws with a screwdriver.","El librero se movía un poco, así que apreté los tornillos con un destornillador.","L'étagère bougeait un peu, alors j'ai resserré les vis avec un tournevis."],["L7-2754","裸","luǒ","V","naked; bare","desnudo","nu","他裸着上身在烈日下搬砖，后背晒得通红。","tā luǒ zhe shàng shēn zài liè rì xià bān zhuān hòu bèi shài de tōng hóng","Bare to the waist, he hauled bricks under the scorching sun until his back was burned red.","Con el torso desnudo, cargaba ladrillos bajo el sol abrasador y la espalda se le puso roja de las quemaduras.","Torse nu, il portait des briques sous un soleil de plomb, et son dos était brûlé et tout rouge."],["L7-2755","裸露","luǒlù","V","naked; exposed","desnudo; expuesto","nu; exposé","山坡上的树被砍光了，大片土地裸露在外。","shān pō shàng de shù bèi kǎn guāng le dà piàn tǔ dì luǒ lù zài wài","The trees on the hillside were all cut down, leaving large areas of land exposed.","Talaron todos los árboles de la ladera y grandes extensiones de terreno quedaron al descubierto.","Les arbres du versant ont tous été abattus, laissant de vastes étendues de terre à nu."],["L7-2756","络绎不绝","luòyì-bùjué","","in an endless stream","en un flujo continuo","sans interruption","国庆期间，前来参观故宫的游客络绎不绝。","guó qìng qī jiān qián lái cān guān gù gōng de yóu kè luò yì bù jué","During the National Day holiday, visitors to the Palace Museum came in an endless stream.","Durante el Día Nacional, los visitantes del Museo del Palacio llegaban sin cesar.","Pendant la fête nationale, les visiteurs de la Cité interdite se succédaient sans interruption."],["L7-2757","落差","luòchā","N","drop; gap","desnivel; brecha","dénivelé; écart","刚参加工作时，理想和现实之间的落差让他很失望。","gāng cān jiā gōng zuò shí lǐ xiǎng hé xiàn shí zhī jiān de luò chā ràng tā hěn shī wàng","When he first started working, the gap between his ideals and reality left him very disappointed.","Cuando empezó a trabajar, la distancia entre sus ideales y la realidad lo decepcionó mucho.","Quand il a commencé à travailler, l'écart entre ses idéaux et la réalité l'a beaucoup déçu."],["L7-2758","落地","luòdì","","to land; to touch the ground","aterrizar; caer al suelo","atterrir; toucher le sol","经过十二个小时的飞行，飞机终于平稳落地了。","jīng guò shí èr gè xiǎo shí de fēi xíng fēi jī zhōng yú píng wěn luò dì le","After a twelve-hour flight, the plane finally landed smoothly.","Tras doce horas de vuelo, el avión por fin aterrizó con suavidad.","Après douze heures de vol, l'avion a enfin atterri en douceur."],["L7-2759","落户","luòhù","","to settle down","establecerse; asentarse","s'établir; s'installer","大学毕业后，他决定在这座城市落户。","dà xué bì yè hòu tā jué dìng zài zhè zuò chéng shì luò hù","After graduating from university, he decided to settle permanently in this city.","Después de graduarse de la universidad, decidió establecerse en esta ciudad.","Après ses études universitaires, il a décidé de s'installer définitivement dans cette ville."],["L7-2760","落下","luòxia","","to fall; to drop","caer; descender","tomber; descendre","太阳从西边慢慢落下，天空被染成了橘红色。","tài yáng cóng xī bian màn màn luò xià tiān kōng bèi rǎn chéng le jú hóng sè","The sun slowly sank in the west, dyeing the sky orange-red.","El sol se ponía lentamente por el oeste y teñía el cielo de un rojo anaranjado.","Le soleil déclinait lentement à l'ouest et teintait le ciel d'un rouge orangé."],["L7-2761","麻","má","N","hemp; numb","cáñamo; entumecido","chanvre; engourdi","在地上坐久了，我的两条腿都麻了。","zài dì shang zuò jiǔ le wǒ de liǎng tiáo tuǐ dōu má le","After sitting on the floor for so long, both my legs went numb.","De tanto estar sentado en el suelo, se me durmieron las dos piernas.","À force de rester assis par terre, j'ai les deux jambes engourdies."],["L7-2763","麻痹","mábì","V","paralysis; to numb","parálisis; adormecer","paralysie; engourdir","医生检查后确认，他的面部麻痹是神经受损造成的。","yī shēng jiǎn chá hòu què rèn tā de miàn bù má bì shì shén jīng shòu sǔn zào chéng de","After examining him, the doctor confirmed that his facial paralysis was caused by nerve damage.","Tras examinarlo, el médico confirmó que su parálisis facial se debía a un daño en los nervios.","Après l'avoir examiné, le médecin a confirmé que sa paralysie faciale était due à une lésion nerveuse."],["L7-2764","麻将","májiàng","N","mahjong","mahjong","mah-jong","过年的时候，一家人常常围坐在一起打麻将。","guò nián de shí hou yì jiā rén cháng cháng wéi zuò zài yì qǐ dǎ má jiàng","During the New Year, the family often sits around together playing mahjong.","En Año Nuevo, la familia suele reunirse a jugar mahjong.","Pour le Nouvel An, la famille se réunit souvent pour jouer au mah-jong."],["L7-2765","麻辣","málà","Adj","spicy and numbing","picante y entumecedor","piquant et engourdissant","这家店的麻辣火锅很正宗，就是太辣了。","zhè jiā diàn de má là huǒ guō hěn zhèng zōng jiù shì tài là le","This restaurant's spicy numbing hotpot is authentic, just too hot.","El hotpot picante de esta tienda es muy auténtico, pero pica demasiado.","Le fondue pimentée de ce restaurant est très authentique, mais beaucoup trop piquante."],["L7-2766","麻木","mámù","Adj","numb; apathetic","entumecido; apático","engourdi; apathique","在寒风里站了一个小时，我的手指都冻得麻木了。","zài hán fēng lǐ zhàn le yí ge xiǎo shí wǒ de shǒu zhǐ dōu dòng de má mù le","After standing in the cold wind for an hour, my fingers were numb with cold.","Después de una hora de pie bajo el viento helado, se me entumecieron los dedos del frío.","Après une heure debout dans le vent glacial, j'avais les doigts engourdis par le froid."],["L7-2767","麻醉","mázuì","V","anesthesia; to anesthetize","anestesia; anestesiar","anesthésie; anesthésier","手术前，医生先给病人做了局部麻醉。","shǒu shù qián yī shēng xiān gěi bìng rén zuò le jú bù má zuì","Before the operation, the doctor gave the patient a local anesthetic.","Antes de la operación, el médico le puso al paciente anestesia local.","Avant l'opération, le médecin a fait au patient une anesthésie locale."],["L7-2768","马后炮","mǎhòupào","N","hindsight advice","consejo tardío","conseil après coup","考试都结束了，你现在才告诉我重点，真是马后炮。","kǎo shì dōu jié shù le nǐ xiàn zài cái gào su wǒ zhòng diǎn zhēn shì mǎ hòu pào","The exam is already over and only now you tell me what was important — that's too little, too late.","El examen ya terminó y apenas ahora me dices qué era lo importante; llegas tarde.","L'examen est fini et tu ne me dis qu'à présent ce qui était important : c'est trop tard."],["L7-2769","马虎","mǎhu","Adj","careless; sloppy","descuidado; negligente","négligent; bâclé","他做事太马虎，报告里错了好几个数据。","tā zuò shì tài mǎ hu bào gào lǐ cuò le hǎo jǐ ge shù jù","He's too careless; his report got several figures wrong.","Es muy descuidado; en el informe se equivocó en varias cifras.","Il est trop négligent : son rapport contenait plusieurs chiffres erronés."],["L7-2770","马力","mǎlì","M","horsepower","caballo de fuerza","cheval-vapeur","这台拖拉机马力很大，再陡的坡也能爬上去。","zhè tái tuō lā jī mǎ lì hěn dà zài dǒu de pō yě néng pá shàng qù","This tractor is very powerful and can climb even the steepest slope.","Este tractor tiene mucha potencia y puede subir incluso las pendientes más empinadas.","Ce tracteur est très puissant et peut gravir même les pentes les plus raides."],["L7-2771","马桶","mǎtǒng","N","toilet bowl","inodoro","cuvette des toilettes","卫生间的马桶堵住了，得赶紧找人来修。","wèi shēng jiān de mǎ tǒng dǔ zhù le děi gǎn jǐn zhǎo rén lái xiū","The toilet in the bathroom is clogged; we need to get someone to fix it right away.","El inodoro del baño se tapó; hay que llamar enseguida a alguien para que lo arregle.","Les toilettes de la salle de bains sont bouchées ; il faut vite faire venir quelqu'un pour les réparer."],["L7-2772","马戏","mǎxì","N","circus","circo","cirque","马戏团里的小丑逗得孩子们哈哈大笑。","mǎ xì tuán lǐ de xiǎo chǒu dòu de hái zi men hā hā dà xiào","The clown in the circus made the children roar with laughter.","El payaso del circo hizo que los niños se rieran a carcajadas.","Le clown du cirque a fait éclater de rire les enfants."],["L7-2773","码","mǎ","V","number; code; to stack","número; código; apilar","numéro; code; empiler","您可以用手机扫码付款，也可以刷卡。","nín kě yǐ yòng shǒu jī sǎo mǎ fù kuǎn yě kě yǐ shuā kǎ","You can pay by scanning the code with your phone or by card.","Puede pagar escaneando el código con su celular o con tarjeta.","Vous pouvez payer en scannant le code avec votre téléphone ou par carte."],["L7-2775","埋藏","máicáng","V","to bury; buried","enterrar; oculto","enfouir; enfoui","据说这座山里埋藏着丰富的矿产资源。","jù shuō zhè zuò shān lǐ mái cáng zhe fēng fù de kuàng chǎn zī yuán","It is said that rich mineral resources lie buried in this mountain.","Se dice que en esta montaña están enterrados abundantes recursos minerales.","On dit que cette montagne recèle d'abondantes ressources minérales."],["L7-2776","埋伏","máifú","V","to ambush; ambush","emboscar; emboscada","tendre une embuscade; embuscade","敌人在山谷两侧埋伏了很多士兵。","dí rén zài shān gǔ liǎng cè mái fú le hěn duō shì bīng","The enemy placed many soldiers in ambush on both sides of the valley.","El enemigo emboscó a muchos soldados a ambos lados del valle.","L'ennemi a posté de nombreux soldats en embuscade des deux côtés de la vallée."],["L7-2777","埋没","máimò","V","to bury; to stifle talent","enterrar; desaprovechar","ensevelir; étouffer","山体滑坡后，整座村庄都被泥土埋没了。","shān tǐ huá pō hòu zhěng zuò cūn zhuāng dōu bèi ní tǔ mái mò le","After the landslide, the entire village was buried under earth.","Después del deslizamiento de tierra, todo el pueblo quedó sepultado bajo el lodo.","Après le glissement de terrain, tout le village a été enseveli sous la boue."],["L7-2778","买不起","mǎi bu qǐ","","cannot afford (to buy)","no poder permitirse comprar","ne pas avoir les moyens d'acheter","这里的房价太高，普通年轻人根本买不起。","zhè lǐ de fáng jià tài gāo pǔ tōng nián qīng rén gēn běn mǎi bu qǐ","Housing prices here are so high that ordinary young people simply can't afford them.","Aquí los precios de la vivienda son tan altos que los jóvenes comunes simplemente no pueden comprar.","Les prix de l'immobilier ici sont si élevés que les jeunes ordinaires n'ont tout simplement pas les moyens d'acheter."],["L7-2779","迈","mài","V","to stride; to step","dar un paso; avanzar a zancadas","enjamber; marcher à grands pas","他迈着大步走进会议室，脸上带着自信的笑容。","tā mài zhe dà bù zǒu jìn huì yì shì liǎn shàng dài zhe zì xìn de xiào róng","He strode into the meeting room with a confident smile.","Entró a la sala de reuniones a grandes zancadas, con una sonrisa de seguridad en el rostro.","Il est entré dans la salle de réunion d'un pas large, un sourire assuré aux lèvres."],["L7-2780","迈进","màijìn","V","to stride forward","avanzar a grandes pasos","avancer à grands pas","这家公司正朝着国际化的目标稳步迈进。","zhè jiā gōng sī zhèng cháo zhe guó jì huà de mù biāo wěn bù mài jìn","The company is advancing steadily toward its goal of internationalization.","Esta empresa avanza con paso firme hacia su objetivo de internacionalización.","Cette entreprise progresse d'un pas assuré vers son objectif d'internationalisation."],["L7-2781","卖弄","màinong","V","to show off","presumir; alardear","se vanter; faire étalage","他总喜欢在别人面前卖弄自己的学问。","tā zǒng xǐ huan zài bié rén miàn qián mài nong zì jǐ de xué wèn","He always likes to show off his learning in front of others.","Siempre le gusta presumir de sus conocimientos delante de los demás.","Il aime toujours faire étalage de son savoir devant les autres."],["L7-2782","脉搏","màibó","N","pulse","pulso","pouls","护士一边看表，一边给病人测脉搏。","hù shi yì biān kàn biǎo yì biān gěi bìng rén cè mài bó","The nurse took the patient's pulse while watching her watch.","La enfermera tomaba el pulso al paciente mientras miraba el reloj.","L'infirmière prenait le pouls du patient tout en regardant sa montre."],["L7-2783","脉络","màiluò","N","vascular system; context","sistema vascular; hilo conductor","réseau vasculaire; fil conducteur","爷爷手背上的脉络清晰可见。","yé ye shǒu bèi shàng de mài luò qīng xī kě jiàn","The network of veins on the backs of Grandpa's hands is clearly visible.","Las venas del dorso de las manos del abuelo se ven claramente.","Les veines sur le dos des mains de grand-père sont bien visibles."],["L7-2784","埋怨","mányuàn","V","to complain; to blame","quejarse; reprochar","se plaindre; reprocher","事情已经发生了，互相埋怨也没有用。","shì qing yǐ jīng fā shēng le hù xiāng mán yuàn yě méi yǒu yòng","It has already happened; blaming each other is no use.","Ya pasó lo que pasó; de nada sirve culparse mutuamente.","C'est déjà arrivé ; se reprocher les uns aux autres ne sert à rien."],["L7-2785","蛮","mán","Adv","quite; barbarian","bastante; bárbaro","assez; barbare","这部电影蛮有意思的，你也可以去看看。","zhè bù diàn yǐng mán yǒu yì si de nǐ yě kě yǐ qù kàn kan","This movie is quite interesting; you should go see it too.","Esta película es bastante interesante; tú también podrías ir a verla.","Ce film est plutôt intéressant ; tu devrais aller le voir aussi."],["L7-2786","瞒","mán","V","to conceal from","ocultar","cacher à","这件事你瞒得了一时，瞒不了一世。","zhè jiàn shì nǐ mán de liǎo yì shí mán bu liǎo yí shì","You can hide this for a while, but not forever.","Esto lo puedes ocultar por un tiempo, pero no para siempre.","Tu peux cacher cela un moment, mais pas éternellement."],["L7-2787","满怀","mǎnhuái","V","filled with; to be full of","lleno de; rebosar de","plein de; rempli de","她满怀信心地走上了比赛的舞台。","tā mǎn huái xìn xīn de zǒu shàng le bǐ sài de wǔ tái","She stepped onto the competition stage full of confidence.","Subió al escenario de la competencia llena de confianza.","Elle est montée sur la scène du concours, pleine de confiance."],["L7-2788","蔓延","mànyán","V","to spread; to extend","propagarse; extenderse","se propager; s'étendre","大火迅速蔓延，很快就烧到了山顶。","dà huǒ xùn sù màn yán hěn kuài jiù shāo dào le shān dǐng","The fire spread rapidly and soon reached the top of the mountain.","El incendio se propagó rápidamente y pronto llegó a la cima de la montaña.","L'incendie s'est propagé rapidement et a vite atteint le sommet de la montagne."],["L7-2789","漫","màn","V","free; to overflow","libre; desbordarse","libre; déborder","连续下了几天大雨，河水漫过了堤岸。","lián xù xià le jǐ tiān dà yǔ hé shuǐ màn guò le dī àn","After several days of heavy rain, the river overflowed its banks.","Tras varios días de lluvia fuerte, el río se desbordó por encima de las orillas.","Après plusieurs jours de pluie battante, la rivière a débordé de ses berges."],["L7-2790","漫游","mànyóu","V","to roam; roaming","vagar; roaming","errer; itinérance","他花了半年时间骑自行车漫游欧洲。","tā huā le bàn nián shí jiān qí zì xíng chē màn yóu ōu zhōu","He spent half a year roaming around Europe by bicycle.","Pasó medio año recorriendo Europa en bicicleta, sin prisa.","Il a passé six mois à parcourir l'Europe à vélo, au gré de ses envies."],["L7-2791","慢慢来","mànmàn lái","","take your time","con calma; sin prisa","doucement; prenez votre temps","别着急，慢慢来，第一次做错了很正常。","bié zháo jí màn màn lái dì yī cì zuò cuò le hěn zhèng cháng","Don't rush, take your time — it's normal to make mistakes the first time.","No te apures, ve con calma; es normal equivocarse la primera vez.","Ne te presse pas, vas-y doucement : il est normal de se tromper la première fois."],["L7-2792","慢性","mànxìng","Adj","chronic; slow-acting","crónico; de efecto lento","chronique; à action lente","他患有慢性胃病，吃东西必须非常小心。","tā huàn yǒu màn xìng wèi bìng chī dōng xi bì xū fēi cháng xiǎo xīn","He suffers from a chronic stomach ailment and must be very careful about what he eats.","Sufre de una enfermedad crónica del estómago y tiene que tener mucho cuidado con lo que come.","Il souffre d'une maladie chronique de l'estomac et doit faire très attention à ce qu'il mange."],["L7-2793","忙活","mánghuo","V","to be busy","estar muy ocupado","s'affairer","奶奶在厨房里忙活了一上午，做了一大桌菜。","nǎi nai zài chú fáng lǐ máng huo le yí shàng wǔ zuò le yí dà zhuō cài","Grandma bustled about in the kitchen all morning and made a whole table of dishes.","La abuela se pasó toda la mañana afanada en la cocina y preparó una mesa llena de platillos.","Grand-mère s'est affairée toute la matinée dans la cuisine et a préparé une table entière de plats."],["L7-2794","忙碌","mánglù","Adj","busy; bustling","ocupado; atareado","occupé; affairé","她每天都在忙碌地工作，很少有时间休息。","tā měi tiān dōu zài máng lù de gōng zuò hěn shǎo yǒu shí jiān xiū xi","She works busily every day and rarely has time to rest.","Trabaja afanosamente todos los días y rara vez tiene tiempo para descansar.","Elle travaille sans relâche chaque jour et a rarement le temps de se reposer."],["L7-2795","忙乱","mángluàn","Adj","hectic; flustered","ajetreado; confuso","affairé; désordonné","早上起晚了，他忙乱中把钥匙忘在了家里。","zǎo shang qǐ wǎn le tā máng luàn zhōng bǎ yào shi wàng zài le jiā lǐ","He overslept, and in the rush he left his keys at home.","Se levantó tarde y, con las prisas, olvidó las llaves en casa.","Il s'est levé tard et, dans la précipitation, il a oublié ses clés à la maison."],["L7-2796","盲目","mángmù","Adj","blind; blindly","ciego; a ciegas","aveugle; aveuglément","做生意要先找对路子，不能盲目投资。","zuò shēng yi yào xiān zhǎo duì lù zi bù néng máng mù tóu zī","In business, you must first find the right approach rather than investing blindly.","Para hacer negocios primero hay que encontrar el camino correcto y no invertir a ciegas.","En affaires, il faut d'abord trouver la bonne voie et ne pas investir à l'aveuglette."],["L7-2797","茫然","mángrán","Adj","blank; at a loss","desconcertado; perplejo","perplexe; désemparé","面对突如其来的问题，他一脸茫然，不知道该怎么回答。","miàn duì tū rú qí lái de wèn tí tā yì liǎn máng rán bù zhī dào gāi zěn me huí dá","Faced with the sudden question, he looked blank and didn't know how to answer.","Ante la pregunta inesperada, se quedó desconcertado sin saber qué responder.","Face à cette question soudaine, il est resté perplexe, sans savoir quoi répondre."],["L7-2798","矛头","máotóu","N","spearhead; target of criticism","punta de lanza; blanco de críticas","fer de lance; cible de critiques","记者在文章中把矛头直接指向了有关部门。","jì zhě zài wén zhāng zhōng bǎ máo tóu zhí jiē zhǐ xiàng le yǒu guān bù mén","In the article, the reporter aimed his criticism directly at the relevant authorities.","En su artículo, el periodista dirigió directamente sus críticas a los departamentos competentes.","Dans son article, le journaliste a dirigé ses critiques directement contre les services concernés."],["L7-2799","茅台","Máotái","N","Maotai (town; liquor)","Maotai (pueblo; licor)","Maotai (bourg; alcool)","这瓶茅台是爷爷留着过年时招待客人的。","zhè píng máo tái shì yé ye liú zhe guò nián shí zhāo dài kè rén de","Grandpa is saving this bottle of Maotai to serve guests at New Year.","El abuelo guarda esta botella de Moutai para atender a las visitas en Año Nuevo.","Grand-père garde cette bouteille de Maotai pour recevoir ses invités au Nouvel An."],["L7-2799#2","茅台酒","Máotáijiǔ","N","Maotai liquor","licor Maotai","alcool Maotai"],["L7-2800","茂密","màomì","Adj","dense; lush","denso; frondoso","dense; touffu","山上的树林十分茂密，阳光几乎照不进来。","shān shàng de shù lín shí fēn mào mì yáng guāng jī hū zhào bú jìn lái","The forest on the mountain is so dense that sunlight barely gets through.","El bosque de la montaña es tan tupido que casi no entra la luz del sol.","La forêt de la montagne est si dense que le soleil y pénètre à peine."],["L7-2801","茂盛","màoshèng","Adj","lush; luxuriant","exuberante; frondoso","luxuriant; florissant","经过一场春雨，田里的庄稼长得更茂盛了。","jīng guò yì chǎng chūn yǔ tián lǐ de zhuāng jia zhǎng de gèng mào shèng le","After a spring rain, the crops in the fields grew even more lush.","Después de una lluvia de primavera, los cultivos de los campos crecieron más frondosos.","Après une pluie de printemps, les cultures des champs ont poussé plus vigoureusement encore."],["L7-2802","冒充","màochōng","V","to pass oneself off as","hacerse pasar por","se faire passer pour","有人冒充银行工作人员，打电话骗取老人的存款。","yǒu rén mào chōng yín háng gōng zuò rén yuán dǎ diàn huà piàn qǔ lǎo rén de cún kuǎn","Someone posed as a bank employee and phoned elderly people to cheat them out of their savings.","Alguien se hizo pasar por empleado de un banco y llamó por teléfono a ancianos para estafarles sus ahorros.","Quelqu'un se faisant passer pour un employé de banque a appelé des personnes âgées pour leur escroquer leurs économies."],["L7-2803","冒犯","màofàn","V","to offend","ofender","offenser","如果我刚才的话冒犯了您，请您多多原谅。","rú guǒ wǒ gāng cái de huà mào fàn le nín qǐng nín duō duō yuán liàng","If what I said just now offended you, please forgive me.","Si lo que dije hace un momento lo ofendió, le pido que me disculpe.","Si mes paroles de tout à l'heure vous ont offensé, je vous prie de bien vouloir m'excuser."],["L7-2804","冒昧","màomèi","Adj","presumptuous; to take the liberty","atrevido; tomarse la libertad","audacieux; se permettre","恕我冒昧，能问一下您今年多大年纪吗？","shù wǒ mào mèi néng wèn yí xià nín jīn nián duō dà nián jì ma","Excuse my boldness, but may I ask how old you are?","Perdone mi atrevimiento, ¿le puedo preguntar cuántos años tiene?","Pardonnez mon audace, puis-je vous demander quel âge vous avez ?"],["L7-2805","冒险","màoxiǎn","","to take risks; adventure","arriesgarse; aventura","prendre des risques; aventure","天气这么恶劣，现在出海太冒险了。","tiān qì zhè me è liè xiàn zài chū hǎi tài mào xiǎn le","With weather this bad, going out to sea now is too risky.","Con un clima tan malo, salir ahora al mar es demasiado arriesgado.","Avec un temps aussi mauvais, prendre la mer maintenant est trop risqué."],["L7-2806","没劲","méijìn","Adj","boring; listless","aburrido; sin energía","ennuyeux; sans énergie","这部电视剧越看越没劲，我看了两集就不想看了。","zhè bù diàn shì jù yuè kàn yuè méi jìn wǒ kàn le liǎng jí jiù bù xiǎng kàn le","This TV series got duller the more I watched; after two episodes I gave up.","Esta serie de televisión se me hace cada vez más aburrida; vi dos episodios y ya no quise seguir.","Plus je regarde cette série, plus elle m'ennuie ; après deux épisodes, je n'ai plus voulu continuer."],["L7-2807","没说的","méishuōde","","nothing to complain about","nada que objetar; excelente","rien à redire; excellent","他这个人办事认真，人品也没说的。","tā zhè ge rén bàn shì rèn zhēn rén pǐn yě méi shuō de","He is conscientious in his work, and his character is beyond reproach.","Es una persona muy responsable en su trabajo y su carácter es intachable.","Il est consciencieux dans son travail et sa moralité est irréprochable."],["L7-2808","没完没了","méiwán-méiliǎo","","endless; on and on","interminable; sin parar","interminable; sans fin","楼上的装修声没完没了，吵得我根本没法午睡。","lóu shàng de zhuāng xiū shēng méi wán méi liǎo chǎo de wǒ gēn běn méi fǎ wǔ shuì","The renovation noise upstairs goes on and on, so I can't take a nap at all.","El ruido de la remodelación del piso de arriba no termina nunca y no me deja dormir la siesta.","Le bruit des travaux à l'étage au-dessus n'en finit pas, et je ne peux absolument pas faire la sieste."],["L7-2809","没意思","méi yìsi","","boring","aburrido","ennuyeux","一个人去看电影太没意思了，你陪我去吧。","yí ge rén qù kàn diàn yǐng tài méi yì si le nǐ péi wǒ qù ba","Going to the movies alone is no fun; come with me.","Ir solo al cine es muy aburrido; acompáñame.","Aller seul au cinéma, ça n'a aucun intérêt ; accompagne-moi."],["L7-2810","没辙","méizhé","","at one's wit's end","sin saber qué hacer","ne plus savoir que faire","钥匙锁在车里了，我实在没辙，只好打电话叫人来开锁。","yào shi suǒ zài chē lǐ le wǒ shí zài méi zhé zhǐ hǎo dǎ diàn huà jiào rén lái kāi suǒ","The keys were locked in the car; I was at my wit's end and had to call a locksmith.","Las llaves quedaron encerradas dentro del coche y no supe qué hacer; tuve que llamar a un cerrajero.","Les clés étaient enfermées dans la voiture, je ne savais plus quoi faire et j'ai dû appeler un serrurier."],["L7-2811","没准儿","méizhǔnr","","maybe; not sure","quizás; no estar seguro","peut-être; pas sûr","你先别急着走，他没准儿一会儿就回来了。","nǐ xiān bié jí zhe zǒu tā méi zhǔnr yí huìr jiù huí lái le","Don't rush off yet — he might be back any minute.","No te vayas todavía; quizás regrese en un rato.","Ne pars pas tout de suite ; il sera peut-être de retour dans un instant."],["L7-2812","玫瑰","méigui","N","rose","rosa","rose","情人节那天，他给女朋友送了一束红玫瑰。","qíng rén jié nà tiān tā gěi nǚ péng you sòng le yí shù hóng méi gui","On Valentine's Day, he gave his girlfriend a bouquet of red roses.","El día de San Valentín, le regaló a su novia un ramo de rosas rojas.","À la Saint-Valentin, il a offert à sa petite amie un bouquet de roses rouges."],["L7-2813","枚","méi","M","(measure word for coins, stamps)","(clasificador de monedas, sellos)","(classificateur de pièces, timbres)","他花了半年工资买了一枚钻石戒指。","tā huā le bàn nián gōng zī mǎi le yì méi zuàn shí jiè zhi","He spent half a year's salary on a diamond ring.","Gastó el sueldo de medio año en un anillo de diamante.","Il a dépensé six mois de salaire pour une bague en diamant."],["L7-2814","眉开眼笑","méikāi-yǎnxiào","","beaming with joy","radiante de alegría","rayonnant de joie","听说孙子考上了大学，奶奶乐得眉开眼笑。","tīng shuō sūn zi kǎo shàng le dà xué nǎi nai lè de méi kāi yǎn xiào","Hearing that her grandson had gotten into university, Grandma was all smiles.","Al saber que su nieto había entrado a la universidad, la abuela estaba radiante de alegría.","En apprenant que son petit-fils était admis à l'université, grand-mère rayonnait de joie."],["L7-2815","眉毛","méimao","N","eyebrow","ceja","sourcil","他一生气就皱起眉毛，一句话也不说。","tā yì shēng qì jiù zhòu qǐ méi mao yí jù huà yě bù shuō","Whenever he gets angry, he knits his brows and says nothing.","Cuando se enoja, frunce el ceño y no dice una palabra.","Quand il se met en colère, il fronce les sourcils et ne dit pas un mot."],["L7-2816","煤矿","méikuàng","N","coal mine","mina de carbón","mine de charbon","这座小城过去主要靠煤矿发展经济。","zhè zuò xiǎo chéng guò qù zhǔ yào kào méi kuàng fā zhǎn jīng jì","This small town used to rely mainly on coal mining for its economy.","Esta pequeña ciudad dependía antes principalmente de las minas de carbón para su economía.","Cette petite ville a longtemps fondé son économie sur les mines de charbon."],["L7-2817","煤炭","méitàn","N","coal","carbón","charbon","为了减少污染，很多工厂已经不再烧煤炭了。","wèi le jiǎn shǎo wū rǎn hěn duō gōng chǎng yǐ jīng bú zài shāo méi tàn le","To reduce pollution, many factories no longer burn coal.","Para reducir la contaminación, muchas fábricas ya no queman carbón.","Pour réduire la pollution, beaucoup d'usines ne brûlent plus de charbon."],["L7-2818","每当","měidāng","Prep","whenever","siempre que; cada vez que","chaque fois que","每当听到这首歌，我就会想起大学时的朋友。","měi dāng tīng dào zhè shǒu gē wǒ jiù huì xiǎng qǐ dà xué shí de péng you","Whenever I hear this song, I think of my friends from university.","Cada vez que escucho esta canción, me acuerdo de mis amigos de la universidad.","Chaque fois que j'entends cette chanson, je pense à mes amis de l'université."],["L7-2819","每逢","měiféng","V","every time; whenever","cada vez que","chaque fois que","每逢节假日，这条街上都挤满了游客。","měi féng jié jià rì zhè tiáo jiē shang dōu jǐ mǎn le yóu kè","On every holiday, this street is packed with tourists.","En cada día festivo, esta calle se llena de turistas.","À chaque jour férié, cette rue est pleine de touristes."],["L7-2820","美德","měidé","N","virtue","virtud","vertu","诚实守信是中华民族的传统美德。","chéng shí shǒu xìn shì zhōng huá mín zú de chuán tǒng měi dé","Honesty and keeping one's word are traditional virtues of the Chinese nation.","La honestidad y la palabra cumplida son virtudes tradicionales de la nación china.","L'honnêteté et la fidélité à sa parole sont des vertus traditionnelles de la nation chinoise."],["L7-2821","美观","měiguān","Adj","pleasing to the eye","vistoso; hermoso","esthétique; joli à voir","这套家具既美观又实用，很受年轻人欢迎。","zhè tào jiā jù jì měi guān yòu shí yòng hěn shòu nián qīng rén huān yíng","This furniture set is both attractive and practical, and very popular with young people.","Este juego de muebles es bonito y práctico a la vez, y tiene mucha aceptación entre los jóvenes.","Cet ensemble de meubles est à la fois joli et pratique, et très apprécié des jeunes."],["L7-2822","美化","měihuà","V","to beautify","embellecer","embellir","居民们在楼前种了很多花，美化了小区环境。","jū mín men zài lóu qián zhòng le hěn duō huā měi huà le xiǎo qū huán jìng","Residents planted many flowers in front of their buildings, beautifying the neighborhood.","Los vecinos plantaron muchas flores frente a los edificios y embellecieron el entorno de la urbanización.","Les habitants ont planté beaucoup de fleurs devant les immeubles et embelli le cadre du quartier."],["L7-2823","美景","měijǐng","N","beautiful scenery","hermoso paisaje","beau paysage","游客们对这里的美景赞叹不已。","yóu kè men duì zhè lǐ de měi jǐng zàn tàn bù yǐ","The tourists marveled endlessly at the beautiful scenery here.","Los turistas no dejaban de admirar el hermoso paisaje de este lugar.","Les touristes ne cessaient d'admirer le beau paysage de cet endroit."],["L7-2824","美满","měimǎn","Adj","happy; blissful","feliz; dichoso","heureux; comblé","他们结婚三十年，一直过着美满的生活。","tā men jié hūn sān shí nián yì zhí guò zhe měi mǎn de shēng huó","They have been married for thirty years and have always led a happy life.","Llevan treinta años casados y siempre han tenido una vida feliz.","Ils sont mariés depuis trente ans et ont toujours mené une vie heureuse."],["L7-2825","美妙","měimiào","Adj","wonderful; splendid","maravilloso; espléndido","merveilleux; splendide","清晨的树林里传来美妙的鸟叫声。","qīng chén de shù lín lǐ chuán lái měi miào de niǎo jiào shēng","The lovely sound of birdsong came from the woods in the early morning.","Desde el bosque, en la madrugada, llegaba el hermoso canto de los pájaros.","Du bois, au petit matin, montait le chant merveilleux des oiseaux."],["L7-2826","美人","měirén","N","beauty; belle","belleza; mujer hermosa","beauté; belle femme","她年轻时是村里有名的美人。","tā nián qīng shí shì cūn lǐ yǒu míng de měi rén","In her youth she was a well-known beauty in the village.","De joven fue una belleza muy conocida en el pueblo.","Dans sa jeunesse, elle était une beauté réputée dans le village."],["L7-2827","美味","měiwèi","N","delicious; delicacy","delicioso; manjar","délicieux; mets délicat","妈妈做的红烧鱼是我心中最美味的菜。","mā ma zuò de hóng shāo yú shì wǒ xīn zhōng zuì měi wèi de cài","The braised fish my mother makes is, to me, the most delicious dish.","El pescado en salsa de soya que prepara mi mamá es para mí el platillo más delicioso.","Le poisson braisé que prépare ma mère est, pour moi, le plat le plus délicieux."],["L7-2828","美中不足","měizhōng-bùzú","","a fly in the ointment","una pequeña pega","un petit défaut","这家酒店环境很好，美中不足的是离地铁站太远。","zhè jiā jiǔ diàn huán jìng hěn hǎo měi zhōng bù zú de shì lí dì tiě zhàn tài yuǎn","The hotel is lovely; the only drawback is that it's too far from the subway station.","Este hotel tiene un entorno muy agradable; lo único malo es que queda demasiado lejos de la estación del metro.","Cet hôtel est dans un très bel environnement ; seul bémol, il est trop loin de la station de métro."],["L7-2829","美滋滋","měizīzī","Adj","elated; very happy","encantado; muy contento","ravi; très content","拿到第一个月的工资，他心里美滋滋的。","ná dào dì yī ge yuè de gōng zī tā xīn lǐ měi zī zī de","When he received his first month's pay, he was very pleased with himself.","Al recibir el sueldo de su primer mes, se sintió muy contento por dentro.","En touchant son premier mois de salaire, il était ravi."],["L7-2830","魅力","mèilì","N","charm; charisma","encanto; carisma","charme; charisme","竞技体育的魅力在于不断挑战人类的极限。","jìng jì tǐ yù de mèi lì zài yú bú duàn tiǎo zhàn rén lèi de jí xiàn","The appeal of competitive sports lies in constantly challenging human limits.","El atractivo del deporte de competición radica en desafiar constantemente los límites del ser humano.","L'attrait du sport de compétition réside dans le défi constant lancé aux limites de l'être humain."],["L7-2831","闷","mēn","Adj/V","stuffy; to smother","sofocante; encerrado","étouffant; confiné","这件衬衫是化纤的，夏天穿有点儿闷。","zhè jiàn chèn shān shì huà xiān de xià tiān chuān yǒu diǎnr mēn","This shirt is made of synthetic fiber and feels a bit stuffy in summer.","Esta camisa es de fibra sintética y en verano resulta un poco sofocante.","Cette chemise est en fibres synthétiques et paraît un peu étouffante en été."],["L7-2832","门当户对","méndāng-hùduì","","well-matched socially","de igual posición social","de condition sociale équivalente","过去的人结婚很讲究门当户对。","guò qù de rén jié hūn hěn jiǎng jiu mén dāng hù duì","In the past, people placed great importance on marrying someone of equal social standing.","Antiguamente, al casarse se le daba mucha importancia a que las familias fueran de igual posición social.","Autrefois, on tenait beaucoup à ce que les époux soient de condition sociale équivalente."],["L7-2833","门槛","ménkǎn","N","threshold; entry barrier","umbral; barrera de entrada","seuil; barrière à l'entrée","这项技术的普及降低了使用门槛，也使信息安全问题更加凸显。","zhè xiàng jì shù de pǔ jí jiàng dī le shǐ yòng mén kǎn yě shǐ xìn xī ān quán wèn tí gèng jiā tū xiǎn","The spread of this technology has lowered the barrier to use while making information security issues more prominent.","La difusión de esta tecnología ha reducido las barreras de uso, pero también ha hecho más evidentes los problemas de seguridad de la información.","La diffusion de cette technologie a abaissé le seuil d'utilisation, mais a aussi mis davantage en évidence les problèmes de sécurité de l'information."],["L7-2834","门铃","ménlíng","N","doorbell","timbre de la puerta","sonnette","门铃响了，我猜是送快递的来了。","mén líng xiǎng le wǒ cāi shì sòng kuài dì de lái le","The doorbell rang; I guess it's the delivery person.","Sonó el timbre; supongo que es el repartidor de paquetes.","La sonnette a retenti ; je suppose que c'est le livreur."],["L7-2835","门路","ménlu","N","way; connections","manera; contactos","moyen; relations","他想找个门路，把自家种的水果卖到城里去。","tā xiǎng zhǎo gè mén lu bǎ zì jiā zhòng de shuǐ guǒ mài dào chéng lǐ qù","He wants to find a way to sell his homegrown fruit in the city.","Quiere encontrar alguna manera de vender en la ciudad las frutas que cultiva en su casa.","Il cherche un moyen d'aller vendre en ville les fruits qu'il cultive chez lui."],["L7-2836","闷","mèn","Adj","stuffy; depressed","sofocante; deprimido","étouffant; déprimé","这件衬衫是化纤的，夏天穿有点儿闷。","zhè jiàn chèn shān shì huà xiān de xià tiān chuān yǒu diǎnr mēn","This shirt is made of synthetic fiber and feels a bit stuffy in summer.","Esta camisa es de fibra sintética y en verano resulta un poco sofocante.","Cette chemise est en fibres synthétiques et paraît un peu étouffante en été."],["L7-2837","萌发","méngfā","V","to sprout; to bud","brotar; germinar","germer; bourgeonner","春天到了，种子在泥土里开始萌发。","chūn tiān dào le zhǒng zi zài ní tǔ lǐ kāi shǐ méng fā","Spring has come, and the seeds have begun to sprout in the soil.","Llegó la primavera y las semillas empezaron a brotar en la tierra.","Le printemps est arrivé et les graines commencent à germer dans la terre."],["L7-2838","萌芽","méngyá","V/N","to sprout; germ","brotar; germen","germer; germe","一些不好的苗头，要在萌芽状态就及时制止。","yì xiē bù hǎo de miáo tou yào zài méng yá zhuàng tài jiù jí shí zhì zhǐ","Bad tendencies should be stopped promptly while they are still in the bud.","Algunas tendencias negativas hay que frenarlas a tiempo, cuando apenas empiezan a brotar.","Certaines mauvaises tendances doivent être stoppées à temps, dès qu'elles apparaissent."],["L7-2839","盟友","méngyǒu","N","ally","aliado","allié","两国在战争期间一直是亲密的盟友。","liǎng guó zài zhàn zhēng qī jiān yì zhí shì qīn mì de méng yǒu","The two countries were close allies throughout the war.","Los dos países fueron aliados cercanos durante toda la guerra.","Les deux pays ont été des alliés étroits tout au long de la guerre."],["L7-2840","朦胧","ménglóng","Adj","hazy; dim","borroso; tenue","flou; vague","月光朦胧，远处的小山只剩下模糊的影子。","yuè guāng méng lóng yuǎn chù de xiǎo shān zhǐ shèng xià mó hu de yǐng zi","In the hazy moonlight, the distant hills were only blurred shadows.","La luz de la luna era tenue y las colinas lejanas se reducían a sombras borrosas.","Le clair de lune était vaporeux et les collines lointaines n'étaient plus que des ombres floues."],["L7-2841","猛烈","měngliè","Adj","fierce; violent","feroz; violento","violent; intense","台风来袭，风势猛烈，许多大树被吹倒了。","tái fēng lái xí fēng shì měng liè xǔ duō dà shù bèi chuī dǎo le","The typhoon brought fierce winds that knocked down many large trees.","Llegó el tifón con vientos violentos y derribó muchos árboles grandes.","Le typhon a frappé avec des vents violents et a abattu de nombreux grands arbres."],["L7-2842","猛然","měngrán","Adv","suddenly; abruptly","de repente; bruscamente","soudain; brusquement","走到半路，他猛然想起忘了锁门。","zǒu dào bàn lù tā měng rán xiǎng qǐ wàng le suǒ mén","Halfway there, he suddenly remembered that he had forgotten to lock the door.","A mitad de camino, de pronto se acordó de que había olvidado cerrar la puerta con llave.","À mi-chemin, il s'est soudain rappelé qu'il avait oublié de fermer la porte à clé."],["L7-2843","梦幻","mènghuàn","N","dream; illusion","sueño; ilusión","rêve; illusion","夜晚的灯光让整座小镇显得如同梦幻一般。","yè wǎn de dēng guāng ràng zhěng zuò xiǎo zhèn xiǎn de rú tóng mèng huàn yì bān","At night the lights make the whole town look like something out of a dream.","Las luces de la noche hacen que todo el pueblo parezca sacado de un sueño.","Les lumières de la nuit donnent à toute la petite ville un air de rêve."],["L7-2844","弥补","míbǔ","V","to make up for","compensar; suplir","compenser; combler","他想尽办法弥补自己工作上的失误。","tā xiǎng jìn bàn fǎ mí bǔ zì jǐ gōng zuò shàng de shī wù","He did everything he could to make up for his mistake at work.","Hizo todo lo posible por reparar su error en el trabajo.","Il a tout fait pour réparer son erreur au travail."],["L7-2845","弥漫","mímàn","V","to pervade; to fill the air","impregnar; difundirse","envahir; se répandre","春天的花园里，到处弥漫着花朵的芬芳。","chūn tiān de huā yuán lǐ dào chù mí màn zhe huā duǒ de fēn fāng","In the spring garden, the fragrance of flowers fills the air everywhere.","En el jardín primaveral, por todas partes se respira la fragancia de las flores.","Dans le jardin au printemps, le parfum des fleurs embaume partout."],["L7-2846","迷惑","míhuò","Adj/V","to confuse; to puzzle","confundir; desconcertar","dérouter; tromper","不要被这些夸张的广告迷惑了，买之前多比较一下。","bú yào bèi zhè xiē kuā zhāng de guǎng gào mí huò le mǎi zhī qián duō bǐ jiào yí xià","Don't be taken in by these exaggerated ads; compare more before you buy.","No te dejes engañar por estos anuncios exagerados; compara más antes de comprar.","Ne te laisse pas abuser par ces publicités exagérées ; compare davantage avant d'acheter."],["L7-2847","迷惑不解","míhuò-bùjiě","","to feel puzzled","sentirse perplejo","rester perplexe","他一向准时，今天却迟到了一个小时，大家都迷惑不解。","tā yí xiàng zhǔn shí jīn tiān què chí dào le yí ge xiǎo shí dà jiā dōu mí huò bù jiě","He is always punctual, yet today he was an hour late, and everyone was puzzled.","Él siempre es puntual, pero hoy llegó una hora tarde y todos quedaron desconcertados.","Il est toujours ponctuel, mais aujourd'hui il a eu une heure de retard et tout le monde était perplexe."],["L7-2848","迷恋","míliàn","V","to be infatuated with","estar apasionado por","être épris de","他从小就迷恋围棋，一下就是一整天。","tā cóng xiǎo jiù mí liàn wéi qí yí xià jiù shì yì zhěng tiān","He has been infatuated with Go since childhood and can play all day.","Desde niño está fascinado con el go y es capaz de jugar un día entero.","Dès l'enfance, il est passionné de go et peut y jouer toute la journée."],["L7-2849","迷路","mílù","","to get lost","perderse","se perdre","在森林里迷路的时候，指南针很有用。","zài sēn lín lǐ mí lù de shí hou zhǐ nán zhēn hěn yǒu yòng","A compass is very useful when you're lost in a forest.","Cuando te pierdes en el bosque, una brújula es muy útil.","Quand on est perdu dans la forêt, une boussole est très utile."],["L7-2850","迷失","míshī","V","to lose one's bearings","desorientarse; perderse","se désorienter; se perdre","在大城市里打拼多年，他渐渐迷失了自己的方向。","zài dà chéng shì lǐ dǎ pīn duō nián tā jiàn jiàn mí shī le zì jǐ de fāng xiàng","After years of struggling in the big city, he gradually lost his sense of direction.","Tras años de esforzarse en la gran ciudad, poco a poco perdió el rumbo.","Après des années de lutte dans la grande ville, il a peu à peu perdu ses repères."],["L7-2851","谜","mí","N","riddle","adivinanza; enigma","devinette; énigme","这块古玉的来历至今还是个谜。","zhè kuài gǔ yù de lái lì zhì jīn hái shi gè mí","The origin of this ancient jade is still a mystery.","El origen de este antiguo jade sigue siendo un misterio hasta hoy.","L'origine de ce jade ancien reste à ce jour un mystère."],["L7-2852","谜底","mídǐ","N","answer to a riddle","solución de un acertijo","solution d'une devinette","大家猜了半天，最后老师才揭开了谜底。","dà jiā cāi le bàn tiān zuì hòu lǎo shī cái jiē kāi le mí dǐ","Everyone guessed for a long time before the teacher finally revealed the answer.","Todos estuvieron adivinando un buen rato hasta que por fin el profesor reveló la respuesta.","Tout le monde a cherché longtemps avant que le professeur ne révèle enfin la solution."],["L7-2853","谜团","mítuán","N","enigma; mystery","enigma; misterio","énigme; mystère","警方找到了关键证据，案件的谜团终于解开了。","jǐng fāng zhǎo dào le guān jiàn zhèng jù àn jiàn de mí tuán zhōng yú jiě kāi le","The police found key evidence, and the mystery of the case was finally solved.","La policía encontró la prueba clave y por fin se resolvió el misterio del caso.","La police a trouvé la preuve décisive et le mystère de l'affaire a enfin été résolu."],["L7-2854","谜语","míyǔ","N","riddle","adivinanza","devinette","元宵节晚上，公园里挂满了写着谜语的灯笼。","yuán xiāo jié wǎn shang gōng yuán lǐ guà mǎn le xiě zhe mí yǔ de dēng long","On the Lantern Festival night, the park was hung with lanterns bearing riddles.","En la noche del Festival de los Faroles, el parque estaba lleno de faroles con adivinanzas escritas.","Le soir de la fête des Lanternes, le parc était orné de lanternes portant des devinettes."],["L7-2855","秘方","mìfāng","N","secret recipe","receta secreta","recette secrète","这家老店的酱料用的是祖传的秘方。","zhè jiā lǎo diàn de jiàng liào yòng de shì zǔ chuán de mì fāng","This old shop's sauce is made from a secret recipe handed down through the family.","Las salsas de este viejo local se hacen con una receta secreta heredada de la familia.","Les sauces de cette vieille boutique sont préparées selon une recette secrète transmise de génération en génération."],["L7-2856","秘诀","mìjué","N","secret; key to success","secreto; clave","secret; clé du succès","有人问他长寿的秘诀，他说就是心态好。","yǒu rén wèn tā cháng shòu de mì jué tā shuō jiù shì xīn tài hǎo","When asked the secret to his long life, he said it was simply a good attitude.","Cuando le preguntaron el secreto de su larga vida, dijo que era simplemente tener una buena actitud.","Quand on lui a demandé le secret de sa longévité, il a répondu que c'était tout simplement un bon état d'esprit."],["L7-2857","密不可分","mìbùkěfēn","","inseparable","inseparable","inséparable","经济的发展和教育水平的提高是密不可分的。","jīng jì de fā zhǎn hé jiào yù shuǐ píng de tí gāo shì mì bù kě fēn de","Economic development and higher levels of education are inseparable.","El desarrollo económico y la mejora del nivel educativo son inseparables.","Le développement économique et l'élévation du niveau d'éducation sont indissociables."],["L7-2858","密度","mìdù","N","density","densidad","densité","这座城市人口密度很高，交通压力非常大。","zhè zuò chéng shì rén kǒu mì dù hěn gāo jiāo tōng yā lì fēi cháng dà","This city has a very high population density, and traffic pressure is enormous.","Esta ciudad tiene una densidad de población muy alta y una enorme presión de tráfico.","Cette ville a une très forte densité de population et la pression sur la circulation y est énorme."],["L7-2859","密封","mìfēng","V","to seal up","sellar","sceller","吃不完的饼干要密封好，不然很快就会受潮。","chī bù wán de bǐng gān yào mì fēng hǎo bù rán hěn kuài jiù huì shòu cháo","Uneaten biscuits should be sealed tightly, or they'll soon go soft.","Las galletas que no te acabes hay que guardarlas bien selladas; si no, pronto se ablandarán.","Les biscuits qu'on ne finit pas doivent être bien fermés, sinon ils ramolliront vite."],["L7-2860","密集","mìjí","V/Adj","dense; concentrated","denso; concentrado","dense; concentré","这一带高楼密集，白天几乎看不到阳光。","zhè yí dài gāo lóu mì jí bái tiān jī hū kàn bu dào yáng guāng","High-rises are packed together in this area, so you can hardly see the sun during the day.","En esta zona los edificios altos están muy juntos y de día casi no se ve el sol.","Dans ce quartier, les immeubles sont si serrés qu'on voit à peine le soleil de la journée."],["L7-2861","蜜","mì","N","honey","miel","miel","这种蜜是从深山里的野花上采来的，特别香甜。","zhè zhǒng mì shì cóng shēn shān lǐ de yě huā shàng cǎi lái de tè bié xiāng tián","This honey comes from wildflowers deep in the mountains and is especially fragrant and sweet.","Esta miel se recolecta de flores silvestres de las montañas profundas y es especialmente aromática y dulce.","Ce miel est récolté sur des fleurs sauvages au fond des montagnes ; il est particulièrement parfumé et doux."],["L7-2862","蜜蜂","mìfēng","N","bee","abeja","abeille","花园里开满了花，引来了很多蜜蜂。","huā yuán lǐ kāi mǎn le huā yǐn lái le hěn duō mì fēng","The garden is full of flowers, attracting many bees.","El jardín está lleno de flores y atrae a muchas abejas.","Le jardin est plein de fleurs et attire beaucoup d'abeilles."],["L7-2863","蜜月","mìyuè","N","honeymoon","luna de miel","lune de miel","他们结婚后打算去云南度蜜月。","tā men jié hūn hòu dǎ suàn qù yún nán dù mì yuè","After getting married, they plan to go to Yunnan for their honeymoon.","Después de casarse, piensan ir a Yunnan de luna de miel.","Après leur mariage, ils comptent passer leur lune de miel au Yunnan."],["L7-2864","棉花","miánhuā","N","cotton","algodón","coton","这床被子里装的是新疆产的棉花，又软又暖和。","zhè chuáng bèi zi lǐ zhuāng de shì xīn jiāng chǎn de mián huā yòu ruǎn yòu nuǎn huo","This quilt is filled with cotton from Xinjiang; it's soft and warm.","Este edredón está relleno de algodón de Xinjiang; es suave y calentito.","Cette couette est garnie de coton du Xinjiang ; elle est douce et chaude."],["L7-2865","免","miǎn","V","to exempt; to avoid","eximir; evitar","exempter; éviter","这些客套话就免了吧，咱们直接谈正事。","zhè xiē kè tào huà jiù miǎn le ba zán men zhí jiē tán zhèng shì","Let's skip the pleasantries and get straight to business.","Dejemos estas formalidades y vayamos directo al asunto.","Passons sur ces politesses et abordons directement le sujet sérieux."],["L7-2866","免不了","miǎnbuliǎo","V","unavoidable","inevitable","inévitable","刚开始学开车，免不了会有些紧张。","gāng kāi shǐ xué kāi chē miǎn bu liǎo huì yǒu xiē jǐn zhāng","When you first learn to drive, it's inevitable to feel a little nervous.","Cuando apenas empiezas a aprender a manejar, es inevitable sentirse un poco nervioso.","Quand on débute en conduite, il est inévitable d'être un peu nerveux."],["L7-2867","免除","miǎnchú","V","to exempt; to avoid","eximir; evitar","exempter; éviter","这项新政策免除了农民的部分税费。","zhè xiàng xīn zhèng cè miǎn chú le nóng mín de bù fen shuì fèi","This new policy exempted farmers from some taxes and fees.","Esta nueva política eximió a los agricultores de una parte de los impuestos y cargos.","Cette nouvelle politique a exonéré les agriculteurs d'une partie des impôts et des taxes."],["L7-2868","免疫","miǎnyì","V","immunity","inmunidad","immunité","打过疫苗以后，身体就会对这种病毒产生免疫。","dǎ guo yì miáo yǐ hòu shēn tǐ jiù huì duì zhè zhǒng bìng dú chǎn shēng miǎn yì","After vaccination, the body develops immunity to this virus.","Después de vacunarse, el cuerpo desarrolla inmunidad contra este virus.","Après la vaccination, l'organisme développe une immunité contre ce virus."],["L7-2869","免职","miǎnzhí","","to dismiss from a post","destituir de un cargo","destituer d'un poste","这位官员因为严重失职被免职了。","zhè wèi guān yuán yīn wèi yán zhòng shī zhí bèi miǎn zhí le","The official was removed from his post for serious dereliction of duty.","Este funcionario fue destituido por negligencia grave en el cumplimiento de sus deberes.","Ce fonctionnaire a été révoqué pour manquement grave à ses devoirs."],["L7-2870","勉强","miǎnqiǎng","Adj/V","barely enough; reluctant; to force","apenas suficiente; reacio; forzar","tout juste suffisant; réticent; forcer","她不愿勉强别人接受自己的好意，也懂得在适当的时候保持距离。","tā bú yuàn miǎn qiǎng bié rén jiē shòu zì jǐ de hǎo yì yě dǒng de zài shì dàng de shí hou bǎo chí jù lí","She did not want to force her goodwill on others and knew when to give them space.","No quería obligar a los demás a aceptar su buena voluntad, y sabía mantener la distancia en el momento oportuno.","Elle ne voulait pas forcer les autres à accepter ses bonnes intentions, et savait garder ses distances au bon moment."],["L7-2871","缅怀","miǎnhuái","V","to recall fondly","recordar con nostalgia","se remémorer avec émotion","每年这一天，人们都会来到这里缅怀牺牲的英雄。","měi nián zhè yì tiān rén men dōu huì lái dào zhè lǐ miǎn huái xī shēng de yīng xióng","Every year on this day, people come here to commemorate the fallen heroes.","Cada año, en este día, la gente viene aquí a recordar a los héroes caídos.","Chaque année à cette date, les gens viennent ici honorer la mémoire des héros morts au combat."],["L7-2872","面部","miànbù","N","face (body part)","rostro","visage","这次摔倒造成他面部轻度受伤。","zhè cì shuāi dǎo zào chéng tā miàn bù qīng dù shòu shāng","The fall left him with minor injuries to his face.","Esta caída le causó heridas leves en el rostro.","Cette chute lui a causé de légères blessures au visage."],["L7-2873","面粉","miànfěn","N","flour","harina","farine","包饺子之前，妈妈先把面粉和好了。","bāo jiǎo zi zhī qián mā ma xiān bǎ miàn fěn huó hǎo le","Before making dumplings, Mom mixed the flour into dough.","Antes de hacer los dumplings, mamá amasó primero la harina.","Avant de faire les raviolis, maman a d'abord pétri la pâte."],["L7-2874","面红耳赤","miànhóng-ěrchì","","flushed with anger or excitement","sonrojado de ira o excitación","rouge de colère ou d'excitation","两个人为了一点小事争得面红耳赤。","liǎng gè rén wèi le yì diǎn xiǎo shì zhēng dé miàn hóng ěr chì","The two of them argued over a trifle until they were red in the face.","Los dos discutieron por una tontería hasta ponerse rojos de furia.","Les deux hommes se sont disputés pour une broutille jusqu'à en devenir rouges comme des tomates."],["L7-2875","面面俱到","miànmiàn-jùdào","","to cover every aspect","abarcar todos los aspectos","couvrir tous les aspects","时间有限，这次报告不可能面面俱到，只讲重点。","shí jiān yǒu xiàn zhè cì bào gào bù kě néng miàn miàn jù dào zhǐ jiǎng zhòng diǎn","Time is limited, so this report can't cover everything; I'll only address the key points.","El tiempo es limitado, así que este informe no podrá abarcarlo todo; solo trataré los puntos clave.","Le temps est limité ; ce rapport ne pourra pas tout couvrir et ne portera que sur l'essentiel."],["L7-2876","面目全非","miànmù-quánfēi","","changed beyond recognition","irreconocible","méconnaissable","多年没回老家，那里早已变得面目全非。","duō nián méi huí lǎo jiā nà lǐ zǎo yǐ biàn de miàn mù quán fēi","I hadn't been back to my hometown for many years, and it had changed beyond recognition.","Hacía años que no volvía a mi pueblo natal, y hacía tiempo que había cambiado hasta volverse irreconocible.","Cela faisait des années que je n'étais pas retourné dans ma ville natale, et elle avait changé au point d'en être méconnaissable."],["L7-2877","苗","miáo","N","Miao (Hmong) people; surname Miao","miao (hmong); apellido Miao","Miao (Hmong); nom de famille Miao","地里的苗刚长出来，这几天要经常浇水。","dì lǐ de miáo gāng zhǎng chū lái zhè jǐ tiān yào jīng cháng jiāo shuǐ","The seedlings in the field have just come up, so they need frequent watering these days.","Las plántulas del campo acaban de brotar, así que estos días hay que regarlas con frecuencia.","Les jeunes pousses du champ viennent de sortir de terre ; ces jours-ci, il faut les arroser souvent."],["L7-2878","苗条","miáotiao","Adj","slim; slender","esbelta; delgada","mince; svelte","她每天坚持跑步，身材越来越苗条了。","tā měi tiān jiān chí pǎo bù shēn cái yuè lái yuè miáo tiao le","She runs every day and is getting slimmer and slimmer.","Corre todos los días con constancia y cada vez está más esbelta.","Elle court tous les jours sans faillir et sa silhouette s'affine de plus en plus."],["L7-2879","苗头","miáotou","N","first signs; trend","primeros indicios; tendencia","premiers signes; tendance","一些不好的苗头，要在萌芽状态就及时制止。","yì xiē bù hǎo de miáo tou yào zài méng yá zhuàng tài jiù jí shí zhì zhǐ","Bad tendencies should be stopped promptly while they are still in the bud.","Algunas tendencias negativas hay que frenarlas a tiempo, cuando apenas empiezan a brotar.","Certaines mauvaises tendances doivent être stoppées à temps, dès qu'elles apparaissent."],["L7-2880","描绘","miáohuì","V","to describe; to portray","describir; retratar","décrire; dépeindre","市长在会上描绘了城市未来十年的发展蓝图。","shì zhǎng zài huì shàng miáo huì le chéng shì wèi lái shí nián de fā zhǎn lán tú","At the meeting the mayor outlined the blueprint for the city's development over the next decade.","En la reunión, el alcalde trazó el proyecto de desarrollo de la ciudad para los próximos diez años.","Lors de la réunion, le maire a décrit le plan de développement de la ville pour les dix prochaines années."],["L7-2881","瞄准","miáozhǔn","","to take aim at; to target","apuntar a; fijar como objetivo","viser; cibler","这家公司把目标瞄准了年轻消费者。","zhè jiā gōng sī bǎ mù biāo miáo zhǔn le nián qīng xiāo fèi zhě","This company has set its sights on young consumers.","Esta empresa ha puesto la mira en los consumidores jóvenes.","Cette entreprise a pris pour cible les jeunes consommateurs."],["L7-2882","渺小","miǎoxiǎo","Adj","tiny; insignificant","minúsculo; insignificante","minuscule; insignifiant","站在大海边，人会觉得自己非常渺小。","zhàn zài dà hǎi biān rén huì jué de zì jǐ fēi cháng miǎo xiǎo","Standing by the sea, one feels very small.","De pie frente al mar, uno se siente muy pequeño.","Devant la mer, on se sent tout petit."],["L7-2883","庙","miào","N","temple; shrine","templo; santuario","temple; sanctuaire","山顶上有一座几百年的老庙，香火一直很旺。","shān dǐng shàng yǒu yí zuò jǐ bǎi nián de lǎo miào xiāng huǒ yì zhí hěn wàng","On the mountaintop is a centuries-old temple that has always drawn many worshippers.","En la cima de la montaña hay un templo de varios siglos que siempre ha tenido muchos fieles.","Au sommet de la montagne se trouve un temple vieux de plusieurs siècles qui a toujours attiré de nombreux fidèles."],["L7-2884","庙会","miàohuì","N","temple fair","feria del templo","foire du temple","春节期间，我们全家去逛了庙会。","chūn jié qī jiān wǒ men quán jiā qù guàng le miào huì","During the Spring Festival, our whole family went to the temple fair.","Durante el Festival de Primavera, toda nuestra familia fue a la feria del templo.","Pendant la fête du Printemps, toute notre famille est allée à la foire du temple."],["L7-2885","灭绝","mièjué","V","to become extinct; to exterminate","extinguirse; exterminar","disparaître; exterminer","由于过度捕猎，这种动物已经灭绝了。","yóu yú guò dù bǔ liè zhè zhǒng dòng wù yǐ jīng miè jué le","Because of overhunting, this animal has become extinct.","Debido a la caza excesiva, este animal se ha extinguido.","À cause de la chasse excessive, cet animal s'est éteint."],["L7-2886","灭亡","mièwáng","V","to perish; to be destroyed","perecer; ser destruido","périr; être détruit","历史上很多王朝都是因为腐败而灭亡的。","lì shǐ shàng hěn duō wáng cháo dōu shì yīn wèi fǔ bài ér miè wáng de","Many dynasties in history fell because of corruption.","En la historia, muchas dinastías cayeron a causa de la corrupción.","Dans l'histoire, de nombreuses dynasties se sont effondrées à cause de la corruption."],["L7-2887","民办","mínbàn","Adj","privately run","de gestión privada","géré par le privé","她大学毕业后在一所民办学校当老师。","tā dà xué bì yè hòu zài yì suǒ mín bàn xué xiào dāng lǎo shī","After graduating from university, she became a teacher at a private school.","Después de graduarse de la universidad, trabajó como maestra en una escuela privada.","Après ses études universitaires, elle est devenue professeure dans une école privée."],["L7-2888","民俗","mínsú","N","folk customs","costumbres populares","coutumes populaires","这座博物馆展示了当地丰富多彩的民俗文化。","zhè zuò bó wù guǎn zhǎn shì le dāng dì fēng fù duō cǎi de mín sú wén huà","This museum showcases the rich and colorful folk culture of the region.","Este museo muestra la rica y variada cultura popular de la región.","Ce musée présente la riche et colorée culture populaire de la région."],["L7-2889","民用","mínyòng","Adj","civilian use","de uso civil","à usage civil","这座机场原来是军用的，后来改成了民用机场。","zhè zuò jī chǎng yuán lái shì jūn yòng de hòu lái gǎi chéng le mín yòng jī chǎng","This airport was originally military and was later converted into a civilian airport.","Este aeropuerto era originalmente militar y más tarde se convirtió en un aeropuerto civil.","Cet aéroport était à l'origine militaire, puis il a été converti en aéroport civil."],["L7-2890","民众","mínzhòng","N","the masses; common people","las masas; el pueblo","les masses; le peuple","政府召开听证会，听取民众对涨价的意见。","zhèng fǔ zhào kāi tīng zhèng huì tīng qǔ mín zhòng duì zhǎng jià de yì jiàn","The government held a hearing to listen to the public's views on the price rise.","El gobierno celebró una audiencia pública para escuchar las opiniones de la población sobre el aumento de precios.","Le gouvernement a tenu une audition publique pour recueillir l'avis de la population sur la hausse des prix."],["L7-2891","敏捷","mǐnjié","Adj","nimble; quick","ágil; rápido","agile; vif","这只猫动作敏捷，一下就跳上了屋顶。","zhè zhī māo dòng zuò mǐn jié yí xià jiù tiào shàng le wū dǐng","The cat is agile and leapt onto the roof in one bound.","Este gato es ágil y de un salto subió al techo.","Ce chat est agile ; d'un seul bond, il a sauté sur le toit."],["L7-2892","敏锐","mǐnruì","Adj","keen; sharp","agudo; perspicaz","vif; aigu","好的记者要有敏锐的观察力。","hǎo de jì zhě yào yǒu mǐn ruì de guān chá lì","A good journalist needs keen powers of observation.","Un buen periodista debe tener una gran capacidad de observación.","Un bon journaliste doit avoir un sens aigu de l'observation."],["L7-2893","名副其实","míngfùqíshí","","worthy of the name","digno de su nombre","digne de son nom","这里四季鲜花盛开，是名副其实的花城。","zhè lǐ sì jì xiān huā shèng kāi shì míng fù qí shí de huā chéng","Flowers bloom here in all four seasons; it truly lives up to its name as a city of flowers.","Aquí florecen las flores en las cuatro estaciones; de verdad merece el nombre de ciudad de las flores.","Les fleurs s'épanouissent ici en toute saison ; c'est vraiment une ville des fleurs digne de ce nom."],["L7-2894","名贵","míngguì","Adj","famous and precious; rare","famoso y valioso; raro","célèbre et précieux; rare","这棵名贵的兰花是朋友送给爷爷的生日礼物。","zhè kē míng guì de lán huā shì péng you sòng gěi yé ye de shēng rì lǐ wù","This rare and valuable orchid was a birthday present to Grandpa from a friend.","Esta valiosa orquídea fue el regalo de cumpleaños que un amigo le dio al abuelo.","Cette orchidée rare et précieuse est le cadeau d'anniversaire qu'un ami a offert à grand-père."],["L7-2895","名利","mínglì","N","fame and fortune","fama y fortuna","gloire et fortune","他一生淡泊名利，把全部精力都放在了研究上。","tā yì shēng dàn bó míng lì bǎ quán bù jīng lì dōu fàng zài le yán jiū shàng","All his life he was indifferent to fame and fortune, devoting all his energy to research.","Toda su vida fue indiferente a la fama y la riqueza y dedicó todas sus energías a la investigación.","Toute sa vie, il est resté indifférent à la gloire et à la fortune et a consacré toute son énergie à la recherche."],["L7-2896","名气","míngqi","N","reputation; fame","reputación; fama","réputation; renommée","他的名气越来越大，找他画画的人也多了。","tā de míng qi yuè lái yuè dà zhǎo tā huà huà de rén yě duō le","As his fame grew, more and more people came to him for paintings.","Su fama crece cada vez más y también hay más gente que le encarga pinturas.","Sa réputation grandit de plus en plus, et il y a aussi plus de gens qui viennent lui demander des tableaux."],["L7-2897","名声","míngshēng","N","reputation","reputación","réputation","他做生意讲诚信，在行业里名声很好。","tā zuò shēng yi jiǎng chéng xìn zài háng yè lǐ míng shēng hěn hǎo","He does business honestly and has a good reputation in the industry.","Hace negocios con honradez y tiene muy buena reputación en el sector.","Il fait des affaires avec honnêteté et jouit d'une excellente réputation dans le secteur."],["L7-2898","名言","míngyán","N","famous saying","frase célebre","citation célèbre","这句名言出自一位古代思想家之口。","zhè jù míng yán chū zì yí wèi gǔ dài sī xiǎng jiā zhī kǒu","This famous saying comes from an ancient thinker.","Esta famosa frase proviene de un pensador de la antigüedad.","Cette célèbre maxime vient d'un penseur de l'Antiquité."],["L7-2899","名著","míngzhù","N","masterpiece","obra maestra","chef-d'œuvre","寒假里，我读完了好几部中国古典名著。","hán jià lǐ wǒ dú wán le hǎo jǐ bù zhōng guó gǔ diǎn míng zhù","Over the winter break, I finished several classic Chinese masterpieces.","En las vacaciones de invierno terminé de leer varias obras maestras de la literatura clásica china.","Pendant les vacances d'hiver, j'ai fini de lire plusieurs chefs-d'œuvre de la littérature classique chinoise."],["L7-2900","明朗","mínglǎng","Adj","bright; clear; open","luminoso; claro; franco","lumineux; clair; franc","经过几次会谈，双方的合作前景渐渐明朗起来。","jīng guò jǐ cì huì tán shuāng fāng de hé zuò qián jǐng jiàn jiàn míng lǎng qǐ lái","After several rounds of talks, the prospects for cooperation between the two sides gradually became clear.","Tras varias rondas de conversaciones, las perspectivas de cooperación entre las dos partes se fueron aclarando.","Après plusieurs rencontres, les perspectives de coopération entre les deux parties se sont peu à peu éclaircies."],["L7-2901","明媚","míngmèi","Adj","bright and beautiful","radiante; hermoso","radieux; magnifique","春光明媚，公园里到处是散步的人。","chūn guāng míng mèi gōng yuán lǐ dào chù shì sàn bù de rén","The spring sunshine is bright and beautiful, and the park is full of people out for a stroll.","La primavera brilla radiante y el parque está lleno de gente paseando.","Le soleil printanier est radieux et le parc est plein de promeneurs."],["L7-2902","明智","míngzhì","Adj","wise; sensible","sensato; prudente","sage; judicieux","在情况不明的时候先等一等，是比较明智的做法。","zài qíng kuàng bù míng de shí hou xiān děng yì děng shì bǐ jiào míng zhì de zuò fǎ","When the situation is unclear, waiting a while is the wiser course.","Cuando la situación no está clara, lo más sensato es esperar un poco.","Quand la situation n'est pas claire, il est plus sage d'attendre un peu."],["L7-2903","铭记","míngjì","V","to engrave in one's memory","grabar en la memoria","graver dans sa mémoire","老师的教导，我会永远铭记在心。","lǎo shī de jiào dǎo wǒ huì yǒng yuǎn míng jì zài xīn","I will always keep my teacher's guidance engraved in my heart.","Las enseñanzas de mi maestro las llevaré grabadas en el corazón para siempre.","Je garderai à jamais gravés dans mon cœur les enseignements de mon professeur."],["L7-2904","命","mìng","V","life; fate; order","vida; destino; orden","vie; destin; ordre","戏里的大臣跪在地上，请求皇上收回成命。","xì lǐ de dà chén guì zài dì shang qǐng qiú huáng shang shōu huí chéng mìng","In the play, the minister knelt and begged the emperor to withdraw his order.","En la obra, el ministro se arrodilló en el suelo y suplicó al emperador que retirara su orden.","Dans la pièce, le ministre s'agenouille et supplie l'empereur de revenir sur son décret."],["L7-2905","命名","mìngmíng","","to name; to designate","nombrar; denominar","nommer; désigner","这颗新发现的小行星以一位科学家的名字命名。","zhè kē xīn fā xiàn de xiǎo xíng xīng yǐ yí wèi kē xué jiā de míng zi mìng míng","The newly discovered asteroid was named after a scientist.","Este asteroide recién descubierto fue bautizado con el nombre de un científico.","Cet astéroïde nouvellement découvert porte le nom d'un scientifique."],["L7-2906","命题","mìngtí","","proposition; to set a topic","proposición; fijar un tema","proposition; fixer un sujet","这次作文考试的命题和环保有关。","zhè cì zuò wén kǎo shì de mìng tí hé huán bǎo yǒu guān","The topic set for this essay exam relates to environmental protection.","El tema de este examen de redacción tiene que ver con la protección del medio ambiente.","Le sujet de cet examen de rédaction porte sur la protection de l'environnement."],["L7-2907","摸索","mōsuǒ","V","to grope; to feel one's way","tantear; buscar a tientas","tâtonner; chercher à tâtons","刚到公司时，很多事情都得自己慢慢摸索。","gāng dào gōng sī shí hěn duō shì qing dōu děi zì jǐ màn màn mō suǒ","When I first joined the company, I had to figure many things out on my own.","Cuando recién entré a la empresa, tuve que ir descubriendo muchas cosas por mi cuenta.","Quand je suis arrivé dans l'entreprise, j'ai dû découvrir bien des choses par moi-même, à tâtons."],["L7-2908","模拟","mónǐ","V","to simulate; to imitate","simular; imitar","simuler; imiter","新系统上线之前，需要在模拟环境中反复测试，以排除潜在的漏洞。","xīn xì tǒng shàng xiàn zhī qián xū yào zài mó nǐ huán jìng zhōng fǎn fù cè shì yǐ pái chú qián zài de lòu dòng","Before the new system goes live, it needs repeated testing in a simulated environment to eliminate potential vulnerabilities.","Antes de que el nuevo sistema entre en funcionamiento, hay que probarlo repetidamente en un entorno simulado para eliminar posibles vulnerabilidades.","Avant la mise en service du nouveau système, il faut le tester à plusieurs reprises dans un environnement simulé afin d'éliminer les failles potentielles."],["L7-2909","磨合","móhé","V","to break in; to adapt to each other","rodar; adaptarse mutuamente","roder; s'adapter mutuellement","新组建的团队还需要一段时间来磨合。","xīn zǔ jiàn de tuán duì hái xū yào yí duàn shí jiān lái mó hé","The newly formed team still needs some time to get used to working together.","El equipo recién formado todavía necesita un tiempo para acoplarse.","L'équipe nouvellement formée a encore besoin d'un peu de temps pour trouver ses marques."],["L7-2910","磨难","mónàn","N","hardship; tribulation","adversidad; tribulación","épreuve; tribulation","经历了这么多磨难，她变得更加坚强了。","jīng lì le zhè me duō mó nàn tā biàn de gèng jiā jiān qiáng le","Having gone through so many hardships, she has become even stronger.","Después de pasar por tantas penalidades, ella se ha vuelto aún más fuerte.","Après avoir traversé tant d'épreuves, elle est devenue encore plus forte."],["L7-2911","磨损","mósǔn","V","to wear out","desgastarse","s'user","这双鞋穿了三年，鞋底已经严重磨损了。","zhè shuāng xié chuān le sān nián xié dǐ yǐ jīng yán zhòng mó sǔn le","I've worn these shoes for three years, and the soles are badly worn.","Llevo tres años usando estos zapatos y las suelas ya están muy gastadas.","Je porte ces chaussures depuis trois ans et les semelles sont très usées."],["L7-2912","蘑菇","mógu","N","mushroom; to pester","champiñón; fastidiar","champignon; harceler","这种蘑菇有毒，千万不能食用。","zhè zhǒng mó gu yǒu dú qiān wàn bù néng shí yòng","This mushroom is poisonous and must never be eaten.","Este hongo es venenoso; bajo ninguna circunstancia se debe comer.","Ce champignon est toxique ; il ne faut surtout pas le manger."],["L7-2913","魔鬼","móguǐ","N","devil","demonio","démon","为了参加比赛，他接受了一个月的魔鬼训练。","wèi le cān jiā bǐ sài tā jiē shòu le yí ge yuè de mó guǐ xùn liàn","To take part in the competition, he underwent a month of grueling training.","Para participar en la competencia, siguió un mes de entrenamiento infernal.","Pour participer à la compétition, il a suivi un mois d'entraînement infernal."],["L7-2914","魔术","móshù","N","magic","magia","magie","晚会上，一位魔术师表演了精彩的魔术。","wǎn huì shàng yí wèi mó shù shī biǎo yǎn le jīng cǎi de mó shù","At the party, a magician performed some amazing magic tricks.","En la fiesta, un mago hizo unos trucos de magia espectaculares.","Pendant la soirée, un magicien a présenté de superbes tours de magie."],["L7-2915","抹","mǒ","V","to smear; to wipe","untar; limpiar","étaler; essuyer","出门前，她往脸上抹了一层防晒霜。","chū mén qián tā wǎng liǎn shàng mǒ le yì céng fáng shài shuāng","Before going out, she put a layer of sunscreen on her face.","Antes de salir, se aplicó una capa de protector solar en la cara.","Avant de sortir, elle s'est étalé une couche de crème solaire sur le visage."],["L7-2916","末日","mòrì","N","doomsday; end of days","día del juicio final; fin de los tiempos","fin du monde; jugement dernier","大风把屋顶都掀了，那天晚上就像世界末日一样。","dà fēng bǎ wū dǐng dōu xiān le nà tiān wǎn shang jiù xiàng shì jiè mò rì yí yàng","The wind tore off the roof; that night felt like the end of the world.","El viento fuerte arrancó el techo; esa noche parecía el fin del mundo.","Le vent a arraché le toit ; cette nuit-là, on aurait cru la fin du monde."],["L7-2917","没落","mòluò","V","to decline; to wane","decaer; declinar","décliner; être en déclin","随着网络购物的兴起，一些传统商场逐渐没落了。","suí zhe wǎng luò gòu wù de xīng qǐ yì xiē chuán tǒng shāng chǎng zhú jiàn mò luò le","With the rise of online shopping, some traditional malls have gradually declined.","Con el auge de las compras por internet, algunos centros comerciales tradicionales han ido decayendo.","Avec l'essor des achats en ligne, certains centres commerciaux traditionnels ont peu à peu décliné."],["L7-2918","陌生","mòshēng","Adj","strange; unfamiliar","extraño; desconocido","étranger; inconnu","接到陌生电话要提高警惕，小心被骗。","jiē dào mò shēng diàn huà yào tí gāo jǐng tì xiǎo xīn bèi piàn","Be on your guard when you get calls from strangers, and watch out for scams.","Cuando recibas llamadas de desconocidos, mantente alerta y cuidado con las estafas.","Quand vous recevez un appel d'un inconnu, restez vigilant et méfiez-vous des arnaques."],["L7-2919","莫非","mòfēi","Adv","could it be that","¿acaso será que?","serait-ce que","门怎么开着，莫非家里来了客人？","mén zěn me kāi zhe mò fēi jiā lǐ lái le kè rén","Why is the door open? Could it be that guests have come?","¿Por qué está abierta la puerta? ¿Será que llegaron visitas a casa?","Pourquoi la porte est-elle ouverte ? Des invités seraient-ils arrivés ?"],["L7-2920","莫过于","mòguòyú","V","nothing surpasses","nada supera a","rien ne surpasse","人生最大的快乐莫过于和家人在一起。","rén shēng zuì dà de kuài lè mò guò yú hé jiā rén zài yì qǐ","There is no greater happiness in life than being with one's family.","La mayor felicidad de la vida es estar con la familia.","Il n'y a pas de plus grand bonheur dans la vie que d'être avec sa famille."],["L7-2921","莫名其妙","mòmíngqímiào","","baffling; inexplicable","desconcertante; inexplicable","déconcertant; inexplicable","不知怎么的，最近他总是莫名其妙地发脾气。","bù zhī zěn me de zuì jìn tā zǒng shì mò míng qí miào de fā pí qi","For some reason, he has been losing his temper for no apparent reason lately.","No sé por qué, pero últimamente se enoja sin motivo alguno.","Je ne sais pas pourquoi, mais ces derniers temps il se met en colère sans raison."],["L7-2922","漠然","mòrán","Adj","indifferent; apathetic","indiferente; apático","indifférent; apathique","面对别人的求助，他只是漠然地摇了摇头。","miàn duì bié rén de qiú zhù tā zhǐ shì mò rán de yáo le yáo tóu","Faced with someone's plea for help, he just shook his head indifferently.","Ante la petición de ayuda de alguien, él solo negó con la cabeza con indiferencia.","Face à la demande d'aide de quelqu'un, il s'est contenté de secouer la tête avec indifférence."],["L7-2923","墨","mò","N","surname Mo; Mexico (abbr.)","apellido Mo; México (abrev.)","nom de famille Mo; Mexique (abrév.)","爷爷用毛笔蘸了蘸墨，在红纸上写下一个大大的福字。","yé ye yòng máo bǐ zhàn le zhàn mò zài hóng zhǐ shàng xiě xià yí ge dà dà de fú zì","Grandpa dipped his brush in ink and wrote a big character for \"fortune\" on red paper.","El abuelo mojó el pincel en la tinta y escribió un enorme carácter «fortuna» en papel rojo.","Grand-père a trempé son pinceau dans l'encre et tracé un grand caractère « fortune » sur du papier rouge."],["L7-2924","默读","mòdú","V","to read silently","leer en silencio","lire en silence","考试前，同学们都在教室里默读课文。","kǎo shì qián tóng xué men dōu zài jiào shì lǐ mò dú kè wén","Before the exam, all the students were silently reading the lesson text in the classroom.","Antes del examen, los compañeros leían el texto en silencio en el salón.","Avant l'examen, les élèves lisaient le texte en silence dans la salle de classe."],["L7-2925","默默无闻","mòmò-wúwén","","obscure; unknown","desconocido; anónimo","inconnu; obscur","他在山区默默无闻地教了三十年书。","tā zài shān qū mò mò wú wén de jiāo le sān shí nián shū","He taught in the mountains for thirty years without any recognition.","Dio clases treinta años en las zonas montañosas en el anonimato.","Il a enseigné pendant trente ans dans les régions montagneuses, dans l'anonymat le plus complet."],["L7-2926","默契","mòqì","Adj/N","tacit understanding","entendimiento tácito","entente tacite","这位选手凭借稳定的发挥夺冠，却把胜利归功于团队的默契配合。","zhè wèi xuǎn shǒu píng jiè wěn dìng de fā huī duó guàn què bǎ shèng lì guī gōng yú tuán duì de mò qì pèi hé","The athlete won the title through a steady performance, but credited the victory to the team's well-coordinated cooperation.","Este jugador ganó el título gracias a un rendimiento estable, pero atribuyó la victoria a la excelente coordinación del equipo.","Ce joueur a remporté le titre grâce à une performance régulière, mais il a attribué la victoire à la belle complicité de l'équipe."],["L7-2927","谋害","móuhài","V","to plot to murder","conspirar para asesinar","comploter pour assassiner","小说里，管家为了财产谋害了自己的主人。","xiǎo shuō lǐ guǎn jiā wèi le cái chǎn móu hài le zì jǐ de zhǔ rén","In the novel, the butler murdered his master for the master's property.","En la novela, el mayordomo asesinó a su amo para quedarse con su fortuna.","Dans le roman, le majordome assassine son maître pour s'emparer de sa fortune."],["L7-2928","谋求","móuqiú","V","to seek; to strive for","buscar; procurar","rechercher; viser","两国希望通过对话谋求和平解决争端。","liǎng guó xī wàng tōng guò duì huà móu qiú hé píng jiě jué zhēng duān","The two countries hope to seek a peaceful settlement of the dispute through dialogue.","Los dos países esperan resolver pacíficamente la disputa mediante el diálogo.","Les deux pays espèrent parvenir à un règlement pacifique du différend par le dialogue."],["L7-2929","谋生","móushēng","V","to earn a living","ganarse la vida","gagner sa vie","传统工艺要获得传承，既需要保存技法，也需要为年轻匠人提供谋生的空间。","chuán tǒng gōng yì yào huò dé chuán chéng jì xū yào bǎo cún jì fǎ yě xū yào wèi nián qīng jiàng rén tí gōng móu shēng de kōng jiān","Passing on traditional crafts requires both preserving techniques and giving young artisans a way to make a living.","Para que los oficios tradicionales se transmitan, hace falta tanto conservar las técnicas como ofrecer a los jóvenes artesanos un espacio para ganarse la vida.","Pour que les métiers traditionnels se transmettent, il faut à la fois préserver les techniques et offrir aux jeunes artisans de quoi gagner leur vie."],["L7-2930","牡丹","mǔdan","N","peony","peonía","pivoine","每年四月，洛阳的牡丹花开满全城。","měi nián sì yuè luò yáng de mǔ dan huā kāi mǎn quán chéng","Every April, peonies bloom all over the city of Luoyang.","Todos los años en abril, las peonías de Luoyang florecen por toda la ciudad.","Chaque année en avril, les pivoines de Luoyang fleurissent dans toute la ville."],["L7-2931","亩","mǔ","M","mu (area unit)","mu (unidad de superficie)","mu (unité de surface)","他家承包了二十亩地，种的全是水稻。","tā jiā chéng bāo le èr shí mǔ dì zhòng de quán shì shuǐ dào","His family leases twenty mu of land, all planted with rice.","Su familia tiene en arriendo veinte mu de tierra, todas sembradas de arroz.","Sa famille exploite vingt mu de terres en contrat, entièrement plantées de riz."],["L7-2932","木板","mùbǎn","N","board; plank","tabla; tablón","planche","他用几块旧木板给小狗搭了一个窝。","tā yòng jǐ kuài jiù mù bǎn gěi xiǎo gǒu dā le yí ge wō","He built a doghouse for the puppy out of a few old boards.","Con unas tablas viejas le construyó una casita al perrito.","Avec quelques vieilles planches, il a construit une niche pour le chiot."],["L7-2933","木材","mùcái","N","timber; wood","madera","bois","这种木材质地坚硬，很适合做家具。","zhè zhǒng mù cái zhì dì jiān yìng hěn shì hé zuò jiā jù","This wood is hard and well suited for making furniture.","Esta madera es dura y muy adecuada para hacer muebles.","Ce bois est dur et très bien adapté à la fabrication de meubles."],["L7-2934","木匠","mùjiàng","N","carpenter","carpintero","charpentier","老木匠用一块木头雕出了一只栩栩如生的小鸟。","lǎo mù jiàng yòng yí kuài mù tou diāo chū le yì zhī xǔ xǔ rú shēng de xiǎo niǎo","The old carpenter carved a lifelike little bird out of a block of wood.","El viejo carpintero talló con un trozo de madera un pajarito que parecía vivo.","Le vieux menuisier a sculpté dans un morceau de bois un petit oiseau plein de vie."],["L7-2935","木偶","mù'ǒu","N","puppet","marioneta","marionnette","孩子们围在舞台前，看木偶戏看得入了迷。","hái zi men wéi zài wǔ tái qián kàn mù ǒu xì kàn de rù le mí","The children gathered in front of the stage, entranced by the puppet show.","Los niños se reunieron frente al escenario, fascinados con el teatro de títeres.","Les enfants s'étaient rassemblés devant la scène, fascinés par le spectacle de marionnettes."],["L7-2936","目不转睛","mùbùzhuǎnjīng","","to stare unblinkingly","mirar fijamente","regarder fixement","孩子们看杂技表演看得目不转睛。","hái zi men kàn zá jì biǎo yǎn kàn de mù bù zhuǎn jīng","The children watched the acrobatic show without taking their eyes off it.","Los niños miraban el espectáculo acrobático sin pestañear.","Les enfants regardaient le spectacle d'acrobaties sans détourner les yeux."],["L7-2937","目瞪口呆","mùdèng-kǒudāi","","dumbstruck; stunned","boquiabierto; atónito","bouche bée; stupéfait","看到自己的成绩，他惊得目瞪口呆。","kàn dào zì jǐ de chéng jì tā jīng de mù dèng kǒu dāi","When he saw his grade, he was struck dumb with astonishment.","Al ver su calificación, se quedó boquiabierto de asombro.","En voyant sa note, il est resté bouche bée de stupéfaction."],["L7-2938","目的地","mùdìdì","N","destination","destino","destination","我们明天一早动身，争取中午前到达目的地。","wǒ men míng tiān yì zǎo dòng shēn zhēng qǔ zhōng wǔ qián dào dá mù dì dì","We'll set off early tomorrow morning and try to reach our destination before noon.","Mañana saldremos temprano e intentaremos llegar al destino antes del mediodía.","Nous partirons demain de bon matin et essaierons d'arriver à destination avant midi."],["L7-2939","目睹","mùdǔ","V","to witness","presenciar","être témoin de","他亲眼目睹了这场车祸的全过程。","tā qīn yǎn mù dǔ le zhè chǎng chē huò de quán guò chéng","He witnessed the entire car accident with his own eyes.","Presenció con sus propios ojos todo el accidente de tráfico.","Il a assisté de ses propres yeux à tout l'accident de la route."],["L7-2940","目录","mùlù","N","catalog; table of contents; directory","catálogo; índice; directorio","catalogue; table des matières; répertoire","先看一下目录，就知道这本书讲了哪些内容。","xiān kàn yí xià mù lù jiù zhī dào zhè běn shū jiǎng le nǎ xiē nèi róng","A quick look at the table of contents tells you what the book covers.","Con solo mirar primero el índice, se sabe de qué trata el libro.","Il suffit de jeter un coup d'œil à la table des matières pour savoir de quoi parle ce livre."],["L7-2941","目中无人","mùzhōng-wúrén","","arrogant; looking down on everyone","arrogante; sin tener en cuenta a nadie","arrogant; méprisant envers tous","他取得一点成绩就目中无人，同事们都不愿和他合作。","tā qǔ dé yì diǎn chéng jì jiù mù zhōng wú rén tóng shì men dōu bú yuàn hé tā hé zuò","After a little success he became arrogant, and his colleagues no longer wanted to work with him.","Con apenas un pequeño logro se volvió arrogante y sus compañeros ya no quieren colaborar con él.","Il s'est mis à regarder tout le monde de haut après un petit succès, et ses collègues ne veulent plus travailler avec lui."],["L7-2942","沐浴露","mùyùlù","N","shower gel","gel de ducha","gel douche","这种沐浴露味道清淡，适合皮肤敏感的人用。","zhè zhǒng mù yù lù wèi dào qīng dàn shì hé pí fū mǐn gǎn de rén yòng","This shower gel has a light scent and suits people with sensitive skin.","Este gel de baño tiene un aroma suave y es adecuado para personas de piel sensible.","Ce gel douche a un parfum léger et convient aux peaux sensibles."],["L7-2943","牧场","mùchǎng","N","pasture; ranch","pasto; rancho","pâturage; ranch","夏天，牧民们赶着羊群转到山上的牧场。","xià tiān mù mín men gǎn zhe yáng qún zhuǎn dào shān shàng de mù chǎng","In summer, the herders drive their flocks up to the mountain pastures.","En verano, los pastores llevan los rebaños de ovejas a los pastizales de la montaña.","En été, les bergers conduisent leurs troupeaux de moutons vers les pâturages de montagne."],["L7-2944","牧民","mùmín","N","herdsman","pastor","éleveur nomade","夏天，牧民们赶着羊群转到山上的牧场。","xià tiān mù mín men gǎn zhe yáng qún zhuǎn dào shān shàng de mù chǎng","In summer, the herders drive their flocks up to the mountain pastures.","En verano, los pastores llevan los rebaños de ovejas a los pastizales de la montaña.","En été, les bergers conduisent leurs troupeaux de moutons vers les pâturages de montagne."],["L7-2945","募捐","mùjuān","","to collect donations","recaudar donaciones","collecter des dons","学生们在街头为受灾地区募捐。","xué shēng men zài jiē tóu wèi shòu zāi dì qū mù juān","Students collected donations on the street for the disaster-stricken area.","Los estudiantes recaudaron donativos en la calle para la zona damnificada.","Les étudiants ont collecté des dons dans la rue pour la région sinistrée."],["L7-2946","墓碑","mùbēi","N","gravestone","lápida","pierre tombale","他在父亲的墓碑前放了一束白菊花。","tā zài fù qīn de mù bēi qián fàng le yí shù bái jú huā","He laid a bunch of white chrysanthemums before his father's gravestone.","Dejó un ramo de crisantemos blancos frente a la lápida de su padre.","Il a déposé un bouquet de chrysanthèmes blancs devant la pierre tombale de son père."],["L7-2947","墓地","mùdì","N","cemetery","cementerio","cimetière","清明节那天，墓地里来了很多扫墓的人。","qīng míng jié nà tiān mù dì lǐ lái le hěn duō sǎo mù de rén","On Qingming Festival, many people came to the cemetery to sweep the graves.","El día de Qingming llegó mucha gente al cementerio a limpiar las tumbas.","Le jour de Qingming, beaucoup de gens sont venus au cimetière entretenir les tombes."],["L7-2948","幕","mù","N","curtain; screen; act (of a play)","telón; pantalla; acto","rideau; écran; acte","看到这一幕，在场的很多观众都感动得流泪了。","kàn dào zhè yí mù zài chǎng de hěn duō guān zhòng dōu gǎn dòng de liú lèi le","Seeing this scene, many in the audience were moved to tears.","Al ver esa escena, muchos de los espectadores presentes se conmovieron hasta las lágrimas.","En voyant cette scène, beaucoup de spectateurs présents ont été émus aux larmes."],["L7-2949","幕后","mùhòu","N","behind the scenes","entre bastidores","dans les coulisses","这部电影的成功离不开幕后工作人员的努力。","zhè bù diàn yǐng de chéng gōng lí bu kāi mù hòu gōng zuò rén yuán de nǔ lì","The film's success owes much to the efforts of the people behind the scenes.","El éxito de esta película no se habría logrado sin el esfuerzo del personal entre bastidores.","Le succès de ce film doit beaucoup aux efforts des équipes de l'ombre."],["L7-2950","穆斯林","mùsīlín","N","Muslim","musulmán","musulman","这家餐厅专门为穆斯林顾客提供清真菜。","zhè jiā cān tīng zhuān mén wèi mù sī lín gù kè tí gōng qīng zhēn cài","This restaurant specially serves halal food for Muslim customers.","Este restaurante ofrece platillos halal especialmente para clientes musulmanes.","Ce restaurant propose des plats halal spécialement pour sa clientèle musulmane."],["L7-2951","拿手","náshǒu","Adj","good at; expert in","ser experto en; hábil","être doué pour; expert en","红烧肉是我爸爸的拿手菜，每次做都被吃得精光。","hóng shāo ròu shì wǒ bà ba de ná shǒu cài měi cì zuò dōu bèi chī de jīng guāng","Braised pork is my dad's specialty; whenever he makes it, it's eaten up completely.","El cerdo estofado en salsa de soya es la especialidad de mi papá; cada vez que lo prepara, se acaba todo.","Le porc braisé est la spécialité de mon père ; chaque fois qu'il le prépare, il ne reste rien."],["L7-2952","哪知道","nǎ zhīdào","","who would have thought","quién iba a pensar","qui aurait cru","我以为他只是开玩笑，哪知道他第二天真的辞职了。","wǒ yǐ wéi tā zhǐ shì kāi wán xiào nǎ zhī dào tā dì èr tiān zhēn de cí zhí le","I thought he was only joking — who'd have thought he'd actually resign the next day?","Pensé que solo bromeaba, pero quién iba a imaginar que al día siguiente renunciaría de verdad.","Je croyais qu'il plaisantait, mais qui aurait cru qu'il démissionnerait vraiment le lendemain ?"],["L7-2953","呐喊","nàhǎn","V","to shout; to cheer","gritar; vitorear","crier; acclamer","比赛进入最后阶段，看台上的球迷一齐呐喊助威。","bǐ sài jìn rù zuì hòu jiē duàn kàn tái shàng de qiú mí yì qí nà hǎn zhù wēi","As the match entered its final stage, the fans in the stands shouted together to cheer the team on.","El partido entró en su fase final y los aficionados en las gradas gritaron a coro para alentar al equipo.","Le match est entré dans sa phase finale et les supporters dans les tribunes ont crié tous ensemble pour encourager l'équipe."],["L7-2954","纳闷儿","nàmènr","","to be puzzled","estar perplejo","être perplexe","他平时很少迟到，今天怎么还没来，真让人纳闷儿。","tā píng shí hěn shǎo chí dào jīn tiān zěn me hái méi lái zhēn ràng rén nà mènr","He's rarely late, so it's puzzling that he hasn't arrived yet today.","Casi nunca llega tarde; me extraña que todavía no haya llegado hoy.","Il est rarement en retard ; c'est vraiment étrange qu'il ne soit pas encore arrivé aujourd'hui."],["L7-2955","纳入","nàrù","V","to incorporate; to bring into","incorporar; integrar","intégrer; incorporer","这项改革已经被纳入明年的工作计划。","zhè xiàng gǎi gé yǐ jīng bèi nà rù míng nián de gōng zuò jì huà","This reform has been incorporated into next year's work plan.","Esta reforma ya fue incluida en el plan de trabajo del próximo año.","Cette réforme a déjà été intégrée au plan de travail de l'année prochaine."],["L7-2956","纳税","nàshuì","","to pay taxes","pagar impuestos","payer des impôts","依法纳税是每个公民应尽的义务。","yī fǎ nà shuì shì měi ge gōng mín yīng jìn de yì wù","Paying taxes according to law is every citizen's duty.","Pagar impuestos conforme a la ley es una obligación de todo ciudadano.","Payer ses impôts conformément à la loi est un devoir de tout citoyen."],["L7-2957","纳税人","nàshuìrén","N","taxpayer","contribuyente","contribuable","政府花的钱有很大一部分来自纳税人。","zhèng fǔ huā de qián yǒu hěn dà yí bù fen lái zì nà shuì rén","A large share of the money the government spends comes from taxpayers.","Gran parte del dinero que gasta el gobierno proviene de los contribuyentes.","Une grande partie de l'argent dépensé par le gouvernement provient des contribuables."],["L7-2958","乃","nǎi","Adv","to be; thus; then","ser; así; entonces","être; ainsi; alors","勤奋乃成功之本，这句话他一直记在心里。","qín fèn nǎi chéng gōng zhī běn zhè jù huà tā yì zhí jì zài xīn lǐ","\"Diligence is the root of success\" — he has always kept these words in mind.","«La diligencia es la base del éxito»: siempre ha tenido presente esta frase.","« L'assiduité est la base du succès » : il a toujours gardé cette phrase à l'esprit."],["L7-2959","乃至","nǎizhì","Conj","and even","e incluso","et même","这场危机影响了整个地区乃至全世界的经济。","zhè chǎng wēi jī yǐng xiǎng le zhěng gè dì qū nǎi zhì quán shì jiè de jīng jì","This crisis affected the economy of the whole region and even the whole world.","Esta crisis afectó la economía de toda la región e incluso del mundo entero.","Cette crise a touché l'économie de toute la région, et même du monde entier."],["L7-2960","耐","nài","V","to endure; to withstand","soportar; resistir","endurer; résister à","这种塑料盆特别耐摔，掉在地上也不会坏。","zhè zhǒng sù liào pén tè bié nài shuāi diào zài dì shang yě bú huì huài","This plastic basin is very durable; it won't break even if dropped on the floor.","Esta palangana de plástico es muy resistente a los golpes; aunque se caiga al suelo no se rompe.","Cette bassine en plastique résiste très bien aux chocs ; elle ne casse pas même si elle tombe par terre."],["L7-2961","耐人寻味","nàirénxúnwèi","","thought-provoking","que invita a la reflexión","qui donne à réfléchir","老人临走前说的那句话十分耐人寻味。","lǎo rén lín zǒu qián shuō de nà jù huà shí fēn nài rén xún wèi","What the old man said before leaving gives much food for thought.","Esas palabras que dijo el anciano antes de irse dan mucho que pensar.","La phrase que le vieil homme a prononcée avant de partir donne beaucoup à réfléchir."],["L7-2962","耐性","nàixìng","N","patience","paciencia","patience","教小孩子学钢琴，一定要有足够的耐性。","jiāo xiǎo hái zi xué gāng qín yí dìng yào yǒu zú gòu de nài xìng","Teaching young children piano requires plenty of patience.","Para enseñar piano a niños pequeños hay que tener mucha paciencia.","Pour enseigner le piano aux jeunes enfants, il faut beaucoup de patience."],["L7-2963","南瓜","nánguā","N","pumpkin","calabaza","citrouille","秋天到了，菜园里结了好几个大南瓜。","qiū tiān dào le cài yuán lǐ jiē le hǎo jǐ ge dà nán guā","Autumn has come, and several big pumpkins have grown in the vegetable garden.","Llegó el otoño y en la huerta han crecido varias calabazas grandes.","L'automne est arrivé et plusieurs grosses citrouilles ont poussé dans le potager."],["L7-2964","难处","nánchù","N","difficulty; trouble","dificultad; apuro","difficulté; ennui","每个人都有自己的难处，我们要多体谅别人。","měi ge rén dōu yǒu zì jǐ de nán chù wǒ men yào duō tǐ liàng bié rén","Everyone has their own difficulties, so we should be more understanding of others.","Cada quien tiene sus propias dificultades; debemos ser más comprensivos con los demás.","Chacun a ses propres difficultés ; nous devrions être plus compréhensifs envers les autres."],["L7-2965","难得一见","nándé yī jiàn","","rarely seen","raramente visto","rarement vu","今晚可以看到流星雨，这可是难得一见的天文现象。","jīn wǎn kě yǐ kàn dào liú xīng yǔ zhè kě shì nán dé yí jiàn de tiān wén xiàn xiàng","A meteor shower will be visible tonight — a rarely seen astronomical event.","Esta noche se podrá ver una lluvia de estrellas, un fenómeno astronómico que se ve muy pocas veces.","Ce soir, on pourra voir une pluie d'étoiles filantes, un phénomène astronomique rare."],["L7-2966","难点","nándiǎn","N","difficulty; difficult point","dificultad; punto difícil","difficulté; point difficile","这一课的难点是几个容易混淆的语法结构。","zhè yí kè de nán diǎn shì jǐ ge róng yì hùn xiáo de yǔ fǎ jié gòu","The difficult part of this lesson is a few easily confused grammatical structures.","Lo difícil de esta lección son unas estructuras gramaticales que se confunden fácilmente.","La difficulté de cette leçon, ce sont quelques structures grammaticales faciles à confondre."],["L7-2967","难怪","nánguài","Adv/V","no wonder","no es de extrañar","pas étonnant","原来他在中国住过十年，难怪中文说得这么好。","yuán lái tā zài zhōng guó zhù guo shí nián nán guài zhōng wén shuō de zhè me hǎo","So he lived in China for ten years — no wonder his Chinese is so good.","Resulta que vivió diez años en China; con razón habla tan bien el chino.","Ah, il a vécu dix ans en Chine ; pas étonnant qu'il parle si bien chinois."],["L7-2968","难关","nánguān","N","difficulty; crisis","obstáculo; crisis","obstacle; crise","在大家的帮助下，这家小店终于渡过了难关。","zài dà jiā de bāng zhù xià zhè jiā xiǎo diàn zhōng yú dù guò le nán guān","With everyone's help, the little shop finally got through its crisis.","Con la ayuda de todos, esta pequeña tienda por fin superó la crisis.","Grâce à l'aide de tous, cette petite boutique a enfin surmonté ses difficultés."],["L7-2969","难堪","nánkān","V/Adj","embarrassed; hard to bear","incómodo; difícil de soportar","gêné; difficile à supporter","笑也不是，不笑也不是，我当时难堪极了。","xiào yě bú shì bú xiào yě bú shì wǒ dāng shí nán kān jí le","I didn't know whether to laugh or not; I felt extremely embarrassed.","No sabía si reírme o no; en ese momento me sentí sumamente avergonzado.","Je ne savais ni rire ni ne pas rire ; j'étais extrêmement gêné à ce moment-là."],["L7-2970","难说","nánshuō","V","hard to say","difícil de decir","difficile à dire","明天会不会下雨，现在还难说。","míng tiān huì bu huì xià yǔ xiàn zài hái nán shuō","Whether it will rain tomorrow is hard to say right now.","Si lloverá mañana o no, por ahora es difícil de decir.","Impossible de dire pour l'instant s'il pleuvra demain."],["L7-2971","难为情","nánwéiqíng","Adj","embarrassed","avergonzado","gêné","第一次上台唱歌，她难为情地低下了头。","dì yī cì shàng tái chàng gē tā nán wéi qíng de dī xià le tóu","Singing on stage for the first time, she lowered her head bashfully.","Era la primera vez que cantaba en un escenario y, avergonzada, bajó la cabeza.","C'était la première fois qu'elle chantait sur scène ; gênée, elle a baissé la tête."],["L7-2972","难以想象","nányǐ-xiǎngxiàng","","unimaginable","inimaginable","inimaginable","三十年前，人们难以想象手机会改变生活的方方面面。","sān shí nián qián rén men nán yǐ xiǎng xiàng shǒu jī huì gǎi biàn shēng huó de fāng fāng miàn miàn","Thirty years ago, people could hardly imagine that mobile phones would change every aspect of life.","Hace treinta años, la gente apenas podía imaginar que los celulares cambiarían todos los aspectos de la vida.","Il y a trente ans, on avait du mal à imaginer que les téléphones portables changeraient tous les aspects de la vie."],["L7-2973","难以置信","nányǐ-zhìxìn","","hard to believe","difícil de creer","difficile à croire","这么小的孩子能解出这道数学题，真让人难以置信。","zhè me xiǎo de hái zi néng jiě chū zhè dào shù xué tí zhēn ràng rén nán yǐ zhì xìn","It's hard to believe that such a young child could solve this math problem.","Es difícil de creer que un niño tan pequeño pueda resolver este problema de matemáticas.","C'est incroyable qu'un enfant si petit puisse résoudre ce problème de mathématiques."],["L7-2974","挠","náo","V","to scratch; to thwart","rascar; obstaculizar","gratter; entraver","他不好意思地挠了挠头，说自己忘了带作业。","tā bù hǎo yì si de náo le náo tóu shuō zì jǐ wàng le dài zuò yè","He scratched his head sheepishly and said he had forgotten his homework.","Se rascó la cabeza, avergonzado, y dijo que se había olvidado de traer la tarea.","Il s'est gratté la tête d'un air gêné et a dit qu'il avait oublié ses devoirs."],["L7-2975","恼羞成怒","nǎoxiū-chéngnù","","to fly into a rage from shame","montar en cólera por vergüenza","se mettre en colère de honte","被人当场揭穿谎言，他恼羞成怒，摔门而去。","bèi rén dāng chǎng jiē chuān huǎng yán tā nǎo xiū chéng nù shuāi mén ér qù","When his lie was exposed on the spot, he flew into a rage out of embarrassment and slammed the door as he left.","Cuando lo descubrieron mintiendo en el acto, se puso furioso de vergüenza y se fue dando un portazo.","Démasqué sur-le-champ dans son mensonge, il s'est emporté de honte et est parti en claquant la porte."],["L7-2976","脑海","nǎohǎi","N","mind","mente","esprit","那天的情景至今还常常浮现在我的脑海中。","nà tiān de qíng jǐng zhì jīn hái cháng cháng fú xiàn zài wǒ de nǎo hǎi zhōng","The scene from that day still often comes back to my mind.","La escena de aquel día todavía me viene a la mente con frecuencia.","La scène de ce jour-là me revient encore souvent à l'esprit."],["L7-2977","脑筋","nǎojīn","N","brains; way of thinking","cerebro; manera de pensar","cervelle; façon de penser","这道题要动动脑筋才能想出来。","zhè dào tí yào dòng dòng nǎo jīn cái néng xiǎng chū lái","You have to use your brain to work out this problem.","A este problema hay que darle vueltas en la cabeza para poder resolverlo.","Il faut se creuser un peu la tête pour trouver la réponse à ce problème."],["L7-2978","闹事","nàoshì","","to cause trouble","causar disturbios","semer le trouble","这几个人因为在网上煽动闹事被拘留了。","zhè jǐ ge rén yīn wèi zài wǎng shàng shān dòng nào shì bèi jū liú le","These people were detained for inciting trouble online.","Estas personas fueron detenidas por incitar a disturbios en internet.","Ces personnes ont été placées en détention pour avoir incité à des troubles sur Internet."],["L7-2979","闹着玩儿","nàozhewánr","","to joke around","bromear","plaisanter","你别生气，我刚才是跟你闹着玩儿的。","nǐ bié shēng qì wǒ gāng cái shì gēn nǐ nào zhe wánr de","Don't be angry — I was only joking with you just now.","No te enojes, hace un momento solo estaba bromeando contigo.","Ne te fâche pas, tout à l'heure je plaisantais avec toi."],["L7-2980","内存","nèicún","N","memory (RAM)","memoria (RAM)","mémoire (RAM)","手机内存不够了，我得删掉一些旧照片。","shǒu jī nèi cún bú gòu le wǒ děi shān diào yì xiē jiù zhào piàn","My phone is out of storage, so I need to delete some old photos.","A mi celular ya no le queda memoria; tengo que borrar algunas fotos viejas.","Mon téléphone n'a plus assez de mémoire ; je dois supprimer quelques vieilles photos."],["L7-2981","内阁","nèigé","N","cabinet (government)","gabinete (gobierno)","cabinet (gouvernement)","新首相上任后很快组建了新内阁。","xīn shǒu xiàng shàng rèn hòu hěn kuài zǔ jiàn le xīn nèi gé","Soon after taking office, the new prime minister formed a new cabinet.","El nuevo primer ministro formó rápidamente un nuevo gabinete tras asumir el cargo.","Peu après son entrée en fonction, le nouveau Premier ministre a formé un nouveau cabinet."],["L7-2982","内涵","nèihán","N","connotation; inner quality","connotación; cualidad interior","connotation; qualité intérieure","这首诗看起来简单，其实内涵非常丰富。","zhè shǒu shī kàn qǐ lái jiǎn dān qí shí nèi hán fēi cháng fēng fù","This poem looks simple, but it is actually rich in meaning.","Este poema parece sencillo, pero en realidad tiene un contenido muy rico.","Ce poème paraît simple, mais il est en réalité très riche de sens."],["L7-2983","内行","nèiháng","Adj","expert; experienced","experto; con experiencia","expert; expérimenté","买旧车最好找个内行帮你看一看。","mǎi jiù chē zuì hǎo zhǎo gè nèi háng bāng nǐ kàn yí kàn","When buying a used car, it's best to have an expert take a look for you.","Cuando compres un coche usado, lo mejor es que un experto te ayude a revisarlo.","Quand on achète une voiture d'occasion, mieux vaut demander à un connaisseur de jeter un œil."],["L7-2984","内幕","nèimù","N","inside story","información privilegiada","dessous; coulisses","这位记者花了半年时间调查这起事件的内幕。","zhè wèi jì zhě huā le bàn nián shí jiān diào chá zhè qǐ shì jiàn de nèi mù","The journalist spent half a year investigating the inside story of the incident.","Este periodista pasó medio año investigando los entresijos del caso.","Ce journaliste a passé six mois à enquêter sur les coulisses de l'affaire."],["L7-2985","内向","nèixiàng","Adj","introverted; reserved","introvertido; reservado","introverti; réservé","他性格内向，在陌生人面前很少说话。","tā xìng gé nèi xiàng zài mò shēng rén miàn qián hěn shǎo shuō huà","He is introverted and rarely speaks in front of strangers.","Es de carácter introvertido y rara vez habla delante de desconocidos.","Il est introverti et parle rarement devant des inconnus."],["L7-2986","内需","nèixū","N","domestic demand","demanda interna","demande intérieure","政府出台了一系列措施来扩大内需。","zhèng fǔ chū tái le yí xì liè cuò shī lái kuò dà nèi xū","The government introduced a series of measures to boost domestic demand.","El gobierno adoptó una serie de medidas para estimular la demanda interna.","Le gouvernement a adopté une série de mesures pour stimuler la demande intérieure."],["L7-2987","嫩","nèn","Adj","tender; young; inexperienced","tierno; joven; inexperto","tendre; jeune; inexpérimenté","这道菜的鱼肉做得很嫩，入口即化。","zhè dào cài de yú ròu zuò de hěn nèn rù kǒu jí huà","The fish in this dish is very tender and melts in your mouth.","El pescado de este plato está muy tierno y se deshace en la boca.","Le poisson de ce plat est très tendre et fond dans la bouche."],["L7-2988","能耗","nénghào","N","energy consumption","consumo de energía","consommation d'énergie","与传统设备相比，这种传感器体积更小，能耗也更低。","yǔ chuán tǒng shè bèi xiāng bǐ zhè zhǒng chuán gǎn qì tǐ jī gèng xiǎo néng hào yě gèng dī","Compared with conventional equipment, this type of sensor is smaller and consumes less energy.","En comparación con los equipos tradicionales, este tipo de sensor es más pequeño y consume menos energía.","Comparé aux équipements traditionnels, ce type de capteur est plus petit et consomme moins d'énergie."],["L7-2989","能耐","néngnai","N/Adj","ability; capability","capacidad; habilidad","capacité; compétence","他真有能耐，一个人就把这么大的公司管理得井井有条。","tā zhēn yǒu néng nai yí ge rén jiù bǎ zhè me dà de gōng sī guǎn lǐ de jǐng jǐng yǒu tiáo","He's really capable — he runs such a big company single-handedly and keeps it in perfect order.","Qué capacidad tiene: él solo maneja una empresa tan grande de manera impecable.","Il est vraiment doué : à lui seul, il dirige une si grande entreprise de façon parfaitement ordonnée."],["L7-2990","能人","néngrén","N","capable person","persona capaz","personne capable","村里的能人带着大家种果树，日子越过越好。","cūn lǐ de néng rén dài zhe dà jiā zhòng guǒ shù rì zi yuè guò yuè hǎo","A capable person in the village led everyone in planting fruit trees, and their lives kept getting better.","Un hombre hábil del pueblo guió a todos en el cultivo de árboles frutales, y la vida fue mejorando cada vez más.","Un homme capable du village a guidé tout le monde dans la plantation d'arbres fruitiers, et la vie s'est améliorée de jour en jour."],["L7-2991","能源","néngyuán","N","energy; power source","energía; fuente de energía","énergie; source d'énergie","太阳能是一种清洁的可再生能源。","tài yáng néng shì yì zhǒng qīng jié de kě zài shēng néng yuán","Solar power is a clean, renewable source of energy.","La energía solar es una fuente de energía limpia y renovable.","L'énergie solaire est une source d'énergie propre et renouvelable."],["L7-2992","尼龙","nílóng","N","nylon","nailon","nylon","这种尼龙绳又轻又结实，很适合露营时用。","zhè zhǒng ní lóng shéng yòu qīng yòu jiē shi hěn shì hé lù yíng shí yòng","This nylon rope is light and strong, ideal for camping.","Esta cuerda de nailon es ligera y resistente, muy adecuada para acampar.","Cette corde en nylon est légère et solide, idéale pour le camping."],["L7-2993","泥潭","nítán","N","quagmire","lodazal","bourbier","这家公司陷入了债务的泥潭，很难再翻身了。","zhè jiā gōng sī xiàn rù le zhài wù de ní tán hěn nán zài fān shēn le","The company has sunk into a quagmire of debt and will find it hard to recover.","Esta empresa se hundió en el pantano de las deudas y le será muy difícil recuperarse.","Cette entreprise s'est enlisée dans le bourbier de la dette et aura du mal à se relever."],["L7-2994","泥土","nítǔ","N","soil; mud","tierra; barro","terre; boue","古人用泥土和石头筑城墙。","gǔ rén yòng ní tǔ hé shí tou zhù chéng qiáng","People in ancient times built city walls with earth and stone.","En la antigüedad, la gente levantaba murallas con tierra y piedra.","Dans l'Antiquité, on construisait les remparts avec de la terre et des pierres."],["L7-2995","拟","nǐ","V","to draft; to imitate","redactar; imitar","rédiger; imiter","公司拟于下个月召开年度股东大会。","gōng sī nǐ yú xià ge yuè zhào kāi nián dù gǔ dōng dà huì","The company plans to hold its annual shareholders' meeting next month.","La empresa tiene previsto celebrar la junta anual de accionistas el mes próximo.","L'entreprise prévoit de tenir son assemblée générale annuelle des actionnaires le mois prochain."],["L7-2996","拟定","nǐdìng","V","to draw up; to draft","elaborar; redactar","élaborer; rédiger","双方代表正在拟定合作协议的具体条款。","shuāng fāng dài biǎo zhèng zài nǐ dìng hé zuò xié yì de jù tǐ tiáo kuǎn","Representatives of both sides are drafting the specific terms of the cooperation agreement.","Los representantes de ambas partes están redactando los términos concretos del acuerdo de cooperación.","Les représentants des deux parties sont en train de rédiger les clauses précises de l'accord de coopération."],["L7-2997","逆","nì","V","contrary; to go against","contrario; ir en contra","contraire; aller à l'encontre","在大家都争着卖出的时候，他却逆潮流而动，大量买进。","zài dà jiā dōu zhēng zhe mài chū de shí hou tā què nì cháo liú ér dòng dà liàng mǎi jìn","While everyone else was rushing to sell, he went against the tide and bought heavily.","Cuando todos se apresuraban a vender, él fue contra la corriente y compró en grandes cantidades.","Alors que tout le monde se pressait de vendre, il est allé à contre-courant et a acheté massivement."],["L7-2998","匿名","nìmíng","V","anonymous","anónimo","anonyme","有人匿名给这所学校捐了一大笔钱。","yǒu rén nì míng gěi zhè suǒ xué xiào juān le yí dà bǐ qián","Someone anonymously donated a large sum of money to the school.","Alguien donó de forma anónima una gran suma de dinero a esta escuela.","Quelqu'un a fait un don important à cette école de façon anonyme."],["L7-2999","年画","niánhuà","N","New Year picture","pintura de Año Nuevo","image du Nouvel An","过年前，奶奶在门上贴了一张新年画。","guò nián qián nǎi nai zài mén shàng tiē le yì zhāng xīn nián huà","Before the New Year, Grandma put up a new New Year picture on the door.","Antes del Año Nuevo, la abuela pegó en la puerta una nueva estampa de Año Nuevo.","Avant le Nouvel An, grand-mère a collé sur la porte une nouvelle image du Nouvel An."],["L7-3000","年迈","niánmài","Adj","old; aged","anciano; de edad avanzada","âgé; vieux","他辞去了城里的工作，回老家照顾年迈的父母。","tā cí qù le chéng lǐ de gōng zuò huí lǎo jiā zhào gù nián mài de fù mǔ","He quit his job in the city and returned home to look after his aged parents.","Renunció a su trabajo en la ciudad y volvió a su pueblo para cuidar de sus padres ancianos.","Il a quitté son emploi en ville et est rentré chez lui pour s'occuper de ses parents âgés."],["L7-3001","年限","niánxiàn","N","fixed number of years","plazo de años","nombre d'années fixé","这种电池的使用年限一般是五到八年。","zhè zhǒng diàn chí de shǐ yòng nián xiàn yì bān shì wǔ dào bā nián","The service life of this type of battery is generally five to eight years.","La vida útil de este tipo de batería suele ser de cinco a ocho años.","La durée de vie de ce type de batterie est généralement de cinq à huit ans."],["L7-3002","年薪","niánxīn","N","annual salary","salario anual","salaire annuel","他跳槽到了一家大公司，年薪比原来翻了一倍。","tā tiào cáo dào le yì jiā dà gōng sī nián xīn bǐ yuán lái fān le yí bèi","He moved to a large company, and his annual salary doubled.","Cambió de empleo a una gran empresa y su salario anual se duplicó.","Il a changé pour une grande entreprise et son salaire annuel a doublé."],["L7-3003","年夜饭","niányèfàn","N","New Year's Eve dinner","cena de Nochevieja china","dîner du réveillon du Nouvel An","全家人在一家老字号酒楼订了年夜饭。","quán jiā rén zài yì jiā lǎo zì hào jiǔ lóu dìng le nián yè fàn","The whole family booked New Year's Eve dinner at a long-established restaurant.","Toda la familia reservó la cena de Nochevieja en un restaurante de toda la vida.","Toute la famille a réservé le dîner du réveillon dans un restaurant de longue date."],["L7-3004","年终","niánzhōng","N","end of the year","fin de año","fin d'année","年终的时候，公司给每位员工发了奖金。","nián zhōng de shí hou gōng sī gěi měi wèi yuán gōng fā le jiǎng jīn","At the end of the year, the company gave every employee a bonus.","A fin de año, la empresa dio un bono a cada empleado.","En fin d'année, l'entreprise a versé une prime à chaque employé."],["L7-3005","黏","nián","Adj","sticky; to stick","pegajoso; pegar","collant; coller","刚蒸好的年糕很黏，吃的时候要小心。","gāng zhēng hǎo de nián gāo hěn nián chī de shí hou yào xiǎo xīn","Freshly steamed rice cake is very sticky, so be careful when eating it.","El pastel de arroz recién cocido al vapor es muy pegajoso; ten cuidado al comerlo.","Le gâteau de riz tout juste cuit à la vapeur est très collant ; fais attention en le mangeant."],["L7-3006","念念不忘","niànniàn-bùwàng","","to keep in mind constantly","no olvidar jamás","ne jamais oublier","他对小时候吃过的那碗面一直念念不忘。","tā duì xiǎo shí hou chī guo de nà wǎn miàn yì zhí niàn niàn bú wàng","He has never forgotten that bowl of noodles he ate as a child.","Nunca ha olvidado aquel tazón de fideos que comió de niño.","Il n'a jamais oublié ce bol de nouilles qu'il mangeait dans son enfance."],["L7-3007","念书","niànshū","","to study; to read","estudiar; leer","étudier; lire","那时候家里穷，他十四岁就不念书了，出去打工。","nà shí hou jiā lǐ qióng tā shí sì suì jiù bú niàn shū le chū qù dǎ gōng","His family was poor then, so he left school at fourteen to work.","En aquel entonces su familia era pobre, así que a los catorce años dejó los estudios y se fue a trabajar.","À cette époque sa famille était pauvre, alors à quatorze ans il a arrêté l'école pour aller travailler."],["L7-3008","念头","niàntou","N","thought; idea","idea; pensamiento","idée; pensée","看到招聘广告，他心里产生了换工作的念头。","kàn dào zhāo pìn guǎng gào tā xīn lǐ chǎn shēng le huàn gōng zuò de niàn tou","Seeing the job ad, he started thinking about changing jobs.","Al ver el anuncio de empleo, le vino la idea de cambiar de trabajo.","En voyant l'offre d'emploi, l'idée de changer de travail lui est venue."],["L7-3009","娘","niáng","N","mother; young lady","madre; señorita","mère; jeune fille","他每年过年都要回老家看望爹娘。","tā měi nián guò nián dōu yào huí lǎo jiā kàn wàng diē niáng","Every New Year he goes back to his hometown to visit his parents.","Cada Año Nuevo vuelve a su pueblo natal a visitar a sus padres.","Chaque Nouvel An, il retourne dans son village natal rendre visite à ses parents."],["L7-3010","酿造","niàngzào","V","to brew; to ferment","elaborar; fermentar","brasser; fermenter","这种酒是用当地产的糯米酿造的。","zhè zhǒng jiǔ shì yòng dāng dì chǎn de nuò mǐ niàng zào de","This wine is brewed from locally grown glutinous rice.","Este licor se elabora con arroz glutinoso producido en la región.","Cet alcool est brassé avec du riz gluant produit localement."],["L7-3011","鸟巢","niǎocháo","N","bird's nest; Bird's Nest stadium","nido de pájaro; estadio Nido de Pájaro","nid d'oiseau; stade du Nid d'oiseau","树枝上有一个鸟巢，里面躺着三只小鸟。","shù zhī shàng yǒu yí ge niǎo cháo lǐ miàn tǎng zhe sān zhī xiǎo niǎo","There's a bird's nest on the branch with three baby birds in it.","En la rama hay un nido de pájaros con tres pajaritos dentro.","Il y a un nid sur la branche, avec trois oisillons dedans."],["L7-3012","尿","niào","V/N","to urinate; urine","orinar; orina","uriner; urine","小狗不小心在地毯上撒了一泡尿。","xiǎo gǒu bù xiǎo xīn zài dì tǎn shàng sā le yí pào niào","The puppy accidentally peed on the carpet.","Sin querer, el perrito hizo pipí en la alfombra.","Le chiot a fait pipi sur le tapis sans le vouloir."],["L7-3013","捏","niē","V","to pinch; to mold","pellizcar; moldear","pincer; modeler","奶奶笑着捏了捏孙子胖乎乎的小脸。","nǎi nai xiào zhe niē le niē sūn zi pàng hū hū de xiǎo liǎn","Grandma smiled and pinched her grandson's chubby cheeks.","La abuela sonrió y pellizcó la carita regordeta de su nieto.","Grand-mère a souri et pincé les joues rondelettes de son petit-fils."],["L7-3014","拧","níng","V","to wring; to pinch","retorcer; pellizcar","tordre; pincer","她把湿毛巾拧干，挂在了阳台上。","tā bǎ shī máo jīn níng gān guà zài le yáng tái shàng","She wrung out the wet towel and hung it on the balcony.","Escurrió la toalla mojada y la colgó en el balcón.","Elle a essoré la serviette mouillée et l'a étendue sur le balcon."],["L7-3015","凝固","nínggù","V","to solidify; to congeal","solidificar; coagular","se solidifier; se figer","水在零度以下就会凝固成冰。","shuǐ zài líng dù yǐ xià jiù huì níng gù chéng bīng","Water freezes into ice below zero degrees.","El agua se congela y se convierte en hielo por debajo de cero grados.","L'eau se solidifie en glace au-dessous de zéro degré."],["L7-3016","凝聚","níngjù","V","to condense; to unite","condensar; unir","condenser; rassembler","这本书凝聚了作者十年的心血。","zhè běn shū níng jù le zuò zhě shí nián de xīn xuè","This book embodies ten years of the author's painstaking effort.","Este libro concentra diez años de esfuerzo del autor.","Ce livre condense dix années d'efforts de son auteur."],["L7-3017","拧","nǐng","V","to twist; to screw","torcer; enroscar","tordre; visser","她把湿毛巾拧干，挂在了阳台上。","tā bǎ shī máo jīn níng gān guà zài le yáng tái shàng","She wrung out the wet towel and hung it on the balcony.","Escurrió la toalla mojada y la colgó en el balcón.","Elle a essoré la serviette mouillée et l'a étendue sur le balcon."],["L7-3018","宁可","nìngkě","Adv","would rather","preferir","préférer","他宁可饿着肚子，也不肯低头求人，很有骨气。","tā nìng kě è zhe dù zi yě bù kěn dī tóu qiú rén hěn yǒu gǔ qì","He would rather go hungry than beg for help; he has real backbone.","Prefiere pasar hambre antes que agachar la cabeza para pedir ayuda; tiene mucho carácter.","Il préfère avoir le ventre vide plutôt que de s'abaisser à demander de l'aide ; il a vraiment du caractère."],["L7-3019","宁愿","nìngyuàn","Adv","would rather","preferir","préférer","她宁愿少挣点钱，也要多陪陪孩子。","tā nìng yuàn shǎo zhèng diǎn qián yě yào duō péi péi hái zi","She would rather earn a bit less in order to spend more time with her children.","Prefiere ganar un poco menos con tal de pasar más tiempo con sus hijos.","Elle préfère gagner un peu moins pour passer plus de temps avec ses enfants."],["L7-3020","扭曲","niǔqū","V","to twist; to distort","torcer; distorsionar","tordre; déformer","这张照片被人恶意修改过，事实完全被扭曲了。","zhè zhāng zhào piàn bèi rén è yì xiū gǎi guo shì shí wán quán bèi niǔ qū le","This photo was maliciously altered, completely distorting the facts.","Esta foto fue alterada con mala intención y los hechos quedaron totalmente tergiversados.","Cette photo a été retouchée de façon malveillante et les faits en sont complètement déformés."],["L7-3021","扭头","niǔtóu","","to turn one's head","volver la cabeza","tourner la tête","听到有人喊他的名字，他扭头看了一眼。","tīng dào yǒu rén hǎn tā de míng zi tā niǔ tóu kàn le yì yǎn","Hearing someone call his name, he turned his head to look.","Al oír que alguien gritaba su nombre, volteó la cabeza para mirar.","En entendant quelqu'un crier son nom, il a tourné la tête pour regarder."],["L7-3022","扭转","niǔzhuǎn","V","to reverse; to turn around","revertir; dar la vuelta a","inverser; redresser","下半场换了两名队员后，他们终于扭转了被动的局面。","xià bàn chǎng huàn le liǎng míng duì yuán hòu tā men zhōng yú niǔ zhuǎn le bèi dòng de jú miàn","After two substitutions in the second half, they finally turned the tables on their opponents.","Tras hacer dos cambios en el segundo tiempo, por fin lograron revertir la situación desfavorable.","Après deux remplacements en seconde période, ils ont enfin renversé une situation qui leur était défavorable."],["L7-3023","纽带","niǔdài","N","bond; tie","vínculo; lazo","lien; attache","语言是连接两国人民的重要纽带。","yǔ yán shì lián jiē liǎng guó rén mín de zhòng yào niǔ dài","Language is an important link between the peoples of the two countries.","El idioma es un vínculo importante entre los pueblos de los dos países.","La langue est un lien important entre les peuples des deux pays."],["L7-3024","纽扣","niǔkòu","N","button","botón","bouton","衬衫上掉了一颗纽扣，我得找针线缝上。","chèn shān shàng diào le yì kē niǔ kòu wǒ děi zhǎo zhēn xiàn féng shàng","A button fell off my shirt, so I need a needle and thread to sew it back on.","Se le cayó un botón a la camisa; tengo que buscar aguja e hilo para coserlo.","Un bouton est tombé de ma chemise ; il faut que je trouve une aiguille et du fil pour le recoudre."],["L7-3025","农场","nóngchǎng","N","farm","granja","ferme","这个农场饲养了几百头奶牛。","zhè ge nóng chǎng sì yǎng le jǐ bǎi tóu nǎi niú","This farm raises several hundred dairy cows.","Esta granja cría varios cientos de vacas lecheras.","Cette ferme élève plusieurs centaines de vaches laitières."],["L7-3026","农历","nónglì","N","lunar calendar","calendario lunar","calendrier lunaire","农历八月十五是中秋节，家家户户都要吃月饼。","nóng lì bā yuè shí wǔ shì zhōng qiū jié jiā jiā hù hù dōu yào chī yuè bǐng","The fifteenth day of the eighth lunar month is the Mid-Autumn Festival, when every family eats mooncakes.","El día quince del octavo mes lunar es el Festival del Medio Otoño, y en todas las casas se comen pasteles de luna.","Le quinzième jour du huitième mois lunaire est la fête de la Mi-Automne, où chaque famille mange des gâteaux de lune."],["L7-3027","农民工","nóngmíngōng","N","migrant worker","trabajador migrante","travailleur migrant","每到春节，大批农民工从城市返回家乡。","měi dào chūn jié dà pī nóng mín gōng cóng chéng shì fǎn huí jiā xiāng","Every Spring Festival, huge numbers of migrant workers return from the cities to their hometowns.","Cada Festival de Primavera, un gran número de trabajadores migrantes regresan de las ciudades a sus pueblos.","Chaque fête du Printemps, de nombreux travailleurs migrants rentrent des villes dans leur région natale."],["L7-3028","农作物","nóngzuòwù","N","crops","cultivos","cultures","这场干旱十分持久，农作物大面积减产。","zhè chǎng gān hàn shí fēn chí jiǔ nóng zuò wù dà miàn jī jiǎn chǎn","The drought has lasted a very long time, and crop yields have fallen across large areas.","Esta sequía ha sido muy prolongada y la producción de cultivos ha caído en grandes áreas.","Cette sécheresse a été très longue, et les récoltes ont baissé sur de vastes zones."],["L7-3029","浓厚","nónghòu","Adj","dense; strong; deep","denso; fuerte; profundo","dense; fort; profond","他从小就对历史产生了浓厚的兴趣。","tā cóng xiǎo jiù duì lì shǐ chǎn shēng le nóng hòu de xìng qù","He developed a strong interest in history from an early age.","Desde pequeño se interesó mucho por la historia.","Dès son plus jeune âge, il s'est passionné pour l'histoire."],["L7-3030","浓缩","nóngsuō","V","to concentrate; concentrated","concentrar; concentrado","concentrer; concentré","这部电影把作者一生的经历浓缩在两个小时里。","zhè bù diàn yǐng bǎ zuò zhě yì shēng de jīng lì nóng suō zài liǎng gè xiǎo shí lǐ","This film condenses the author's whole life into two hours.","Esta película condensa en dos horas toda la vida del autor.","Ce film condense en deux heures toute la vie de l'auteur."],["L7-3031","浓郁","nóngyù","Adj","rich; strong (fragrance)","intenso; rico","riche; intense","厨房里飘出一股浓郁的咖啡香。","chú fáng lǐ piāo chū yì gǔ nóng yù de kā fēi xiāng","A rich aroma of coffee drifted out of the kitchen.","De la cocina salía un intenso aroma a café.","Un riche parfum de café s'échappait de la cuisine."],["L7-3032","浓重","nóngzhòng","Adj","thick; heavy; strong","espeso; fuerte; pesado","épais; lourd; fort","他说话带着浓重的南方口音，我有时听不太懂。","tā shuō huà dài zhe nóng zhòng de nán fāng kǒu yīn wǒ yǒu shí tīng bú tài dǒng","He speaks with a heavy southern accent that I sometimes can't quite understand.","Habla con un fuerte acento del sur que a veces no logro entender bien.","Il parle avec un fort accent du sud que je ne comprends pas toujours bien."],["L7-3033","弄虚作假","nòngxū-zuòjiǎ","","to practice fraud","cometer fraude","pratiquer la fraude","这家企业因为在产品检测中弄虚作假，受到了严厉处罚。","zhè jiā qǐ yè yīn wèi zài chǎn pǐn jiǎn cè zhōng nòng xū zuò jiǎ shòu dào le yán lì chǔ fá","The company was severely punished for falsifying its product test results.","Esta empresa fue sancionada con severidad por falsificar los resultados de las pruebas de sus productos.","Cette entreprise a été lourdement sanctionnée pour avoir truqué les contrôles de ses produits."],["L7-3034","奴隶","núlì","N","slave","esclavo","esclave","这部小说讲述了一个奴隶争取自由的故事。","zhè bù xiǎo shuō jiǎng shù le yí ge nú lì zhēng qǔ zì yóu de gù shi","This novel tells the story of a slave's struggle for freedom.","Esta novela cuenta la historia de un esclavo que lucha por su libertad.","Ce roman raconte l'histoire d'un esclave qui lutte pour sa liberté."],["L7-3035","女婿","nǚxu","N","son-in-law","yerno","gendre","老两口对这个女婿非常满意，逢人就夸他孝顺。","lǎo liǎng kǒu duì zhè ge nǚ xu fēi cháng mǎn yì féng rén jiù kuā tā xiào shùn","The old couple are very pleased with their son-in-law and praise his devotion to everyone they meet.","El matrimonio mayor está muy contento con su yerno y a todo el que encuentra le alaba lo atento que es con ellos.","Le vieux couple est très satisfait de son gendre et vante sa piété filiale à tous ceux qu'il rencontre."],["L7-3036","暖烘烘","nuǎnhōnghōng","Adj","nice and warm; cozy","calentito; acogedor","bien chaud; douillet","冬天的午后，阳光照在身上暖烘烘的。","dōng tiān de wǔ hòu yáng guāng zhào zài shēn shang nuǎn hōng hōng de","On a winter afternoon, the sunshine feels warm and cozy on your body.","En una tarde de invierno, el sol se siente calentito sobre el cuerpo.","Par un après-midi d'hiver, le soleil sur la peau est agréablement chaud."],["L7-3037","虐待","nüèdài","V","to mistreat; to abuse","maltratar; abusar de","maltraiter; abuser de","邻居发现有人虐待小狗，立刻报了警。","lín jū fā xiàn yǒu rén nüè dài xiǎo gǒu lì kè bào le jǐng","A neighbor discovered someone abusing a puppy and immediately called the police.","Un vecino vio que alguien maltrataba a un cachorro y llamó de inmediato a la policía.","Un voisin a vu quelqu'un maltraiter un chiot et a aussitôt appelé la police."],["L7-3038","挪","nuó","V","to move; to shift","mover; desplazar","déplacer; bouger","麻烦你把车往前挪一下，挡住我的路了。","má fan nǐ bǎ chē wǎng qián nuó yí xià dǎng zhù wǒ de lù le","Could you please move your car forward a bit? It's blocking my way.","¿Podrías mover un poco el coche hacia adelante? Me está bloqueando el paso.","Pourriez-vous avancer un peu votre voiture ? Elle me bloque le passage."],["L7-3039","诺言","nuòyán","N","promise","promesa","promesse","我们不能违背自己的诺言。","wǒ men bù néng wéi bèi zì jǐ de nuò yán","We must not go back on our promises.","No debemos faltar a nuestra palabra.","Nous ne devons pas trahir nos promesses."],["L7-3040","哦","ò","Intj","oh","ah; oh","ah; oh","哦，原来你也是在这所大学毕业的啊！","ò yuán lái nǐ yě shì zài zhè suǒ dà xué bì yè de a","Oh, so you also graduated from this university!","¡Ah, así que tú también te graduaste en esta universidad!","Ah, alors toi aussi tu as fait tes études dans cette université !"],["L7-3041","殴打","ōudǎ","V","to beat up","golpear; agredir","battre; agresser","两名男子因当街殴打他人被警方拘留。","liǎng míng nán zǐ yīn dāng jiē ōu dǎ tā rén bèi jǐng fāng jū liú","Two men were detained by police for beating someone up in the street.","Dos hombres fueron detenidos por la policía por golpear a otra persona en plena calle.","Deux hommes ont été placés en garde à vue par la police pour avoir frappé quelqu'un en pleine rue."],["L7-3042","呕吐","ǒutù","V","to vomit","vomitar","vomir","他晕船晕得厉害，一路上不停地呕吐。","tā yùn chuán yūn de lì hai yí lù shang bù tíng de ǒu tù","He was badly seasick and kept vomiting the whole way.","Se mareaba muchísimo en el barco y vomitó sin parar todo el camino.","Il avait terriblement le mal de mer et a vomi sans arrêt tout le trajet."],["L7-3043","趴","pā","V","to lie on one's stomach; to lean on","tumbarse boca abajo; apoyarse en","s'allonger à plat ventre; s'appuyer sur","小猫趴在窗台上一动不动。","xiǎo māo pā zài chuāng tái shàng yí dòng bú dòng","The kitten lay motionless on the windowsill.","El gatito estaba echado en el alféizar de la ventana sin moverse.","Le chaton était couché sur le rebord de la fenêtre, sans bouger."],["L7-3044","拍板","pāibǎn","","to make a final decision; to beat time","tomar la decisión final; marcar el compás","trancher; battre la mesure","方案讨论了很久，最后还是由总经理拍板决定。","fāng àn tǎo lùn le hěn jiǔ zuì hòu hái shi yóu zǒng jīng lǐ pāi bǎn jué dìng","The plan was discussed for a long time, and in the end the general manager made the final call.","El plan se discutió mucho tiempo y al final fue el gerente general quien tomó la decisión.","Le projet a été longuement débattu et c'est finalement le directeur général qui a tranché."],["L7-3045","拍卖","pāimài","V","to auction; auction","subastar; subasta","vendre aux enchères; enchères","这幅古画在拍卖会上以很高的价格成交了。","zhè fú gǔ huà zài pāi mài huì shàng yǐ hěn gāo de jià gé chéng jiāo le","This ancient painting sold for a very high price at the auction.","Esta antigua pintura se vendió a un precio muy alto en la subasta.","Ce tableau ancien s'est vendu à un prix très élevé lors de la vente aux enchères."],["L7-3046","拍戏","pāixì","","to shoot a movie","rodar una película","tourner un film","她最近在外地拍戏，好几个月没回家了。","tā zuì jìn zài wài dì pāi xì hǎo jǐ ge yuè méi huí jiā le","She has been shooting a film out of town recently and hasn't been home for months.","Últimamente está filmando en otra ciudad y lleva varios meses sin volver a casa.","Elle tourne un film en province ces derniers temps et n'est pas rentrée chez elle depuis plusieurs mois."],["L7-3047","排斥","páichì","V","to reject; to exclude","rechazar; excluir","rejeter; exclure","刚转学过来时，他总觉得被同学们排斥。","gāng zhuǎn xué guò lái shí tā zǒng jué de bèi tóng xué men pái chì","When he first transferred to the school, he always felt excluded by his classmates.","Cuando recién se cambió de escuela, siempre sentía que sus compañeros lo rechazaban.","Quand il venait d'arriver dans l'école, il avait toujours l'impression d'être rejeté par ses camarades."],["L7-3048","排放","páifàng","V","to emit; to discharge","emitir; descargar","émettre; rejeter","工厂排放的污水严重污染了附近的河流。","gōng chǎng pái fàng de wū shuǐ yán zhòng wū rǎn le fù jìn de hé liú","Wastewater discharged by the factory has seriously polluted the nearby river.","Las aguas residuales vertidas por la fábrica contaminaron gravemente el río cercano.","Les eaux usées rejetées par l'usine ont gravement pollué la rivière voisine."],["L7-3049","排练","páiliàn","V","to rehearse; rehearsal","ensayar; ensayo","répéter; répétition","为了新年晚会，同学们每天放学后都在排练节目。","wèi le xīn nián wǎn huì tóng xué men měi tiān fàng xué hòu dōu zài pái liàn jié mù","For the New Year's party, the students rehearse their show every day after school.","Para la fiesta de Año Nuevo, los alumnos ensayan su número todos los días después de clases.","Pour la soirée du Nouvel An, les élèves répètent leur spectacle tous les jours après la classe."],["L7-3050","徘徊","páihuái","V","to pace back and forth; to hesitate","deambular; dudar","faire les cent pas; hésiter","面试前，他在公司门口徘徊了很久，才鼓起勇气走进去。","miàn shì qián tā zài gōng sī mén kǒu pái huái le hěn jiǔ cái gǔ qǐ yǒng qì zǒu jìn qù","Ahead of his interview, he paced back and forth outside the company entrance for a long time before mustering the courage to go in.","Antes de la entrevista, estuvo mucho tiempo rondando la entrada de la empresa hasta que se armó de valor para entrar.","Avant l'entretien, il a longuement hésité devant l'entrée de l'entreprise avant de trouver le courage d'entrer."],["L7-3051","牌照","páizhào","N","license plate; license","matrícula; licencia","plaque d'immatriculation; licence","这座城市对汽车牌照实行摇号发放。","zhè zuò chéng shì duì qì chē pái zhào shí xíng yáo hào fā fàng","This city issues car license plates by lottery.","Esta ciudad asigna las placas de los automóviles mediante sorteo.","Cette ville attribue les plaques d'immatriculation par tirage au sort."],["L7-3052","派别","pàibié","N","faction; school; sect","facción; escuela; secta","faction; école; secte","这位画家不属于任何派别，风格十分独特。","zhè wèi huà jiā bù shǔ yú rèn hé pài bié fēng gé shí fēn dú tè","This painter belongs to no school and has a very distinctive style.","Este pintor no pertenece a ninguna escuela y su estilo es muy singular.","Ce peintre n'appartient à aucune école et son style est très particulier."],["L7-3053","派遣","pàiqiǎn","V","to dispatch; to send","enviar; despachar","envoyer; dépêcher","公司派遣他到海外分公司工作两年。","gōng sī pài qiǎn tā dào hǎi wài fēn gōng sī gōng zuò liǎng nián","The company sent him to work at its overseas branch for two years.","La empresa lo envió a trabajar dos años en la filial del extranjero.","L'entreprise l'a envoyé travailler deux ans dans sa filiale à l'étranger."],["L7-3054","攀","pān","V","to climb; to cling to","trepar; aferrarse a","grimper; s'accrocher à","几个年轻人攀着绳子，一点一点爬上了岩壁。","jǐ ge nián qīng rén pān zhe shéng zi yì diǎn yì diǎn pá shàng le yán bì","A few young people pulled themselves up the rope bit by bit to climb the rock face.","Unos jóvenes se agarraron de la cuerda y fueron trepando poco a poco por la pared de roca.","Quelques jeunes, accrochés à la corde, ont escaladé peu à peu la paroi rocheuse."],["L7-3055","攀升","pānshēng","V","to climb; to rise","escalar; subir","grimper; augmenter","原材料价格持续攀升，压缩了中小厂家的利润空间。","yuán cái liào jià gé chí xù pān shēng yā suō le zhōng xiǎo chǎng jiā de lì rùn kōng jiān","The continuing rise in raw material prices has squeezed the profit margins of small and medium-sized manufacturers.","La subida constante del precio de las materias primas ha reducido el margen de ganancia de los fabricantes pequeños y medianos.","La hausse continue du prix des matières premières a réduit la marge bénéficiaire des petits et moyens fabricants."],["L7-3056","盘","pán","V","plate; dish; tray","plato; bandeja","plat; plateau","下午茶的时候，奶奶端出了一盘刚做好的点心。","xià wǔ chá de shí hou nǎi nai duān chū le yì pán gāng zuò hǎo de diǎn xin","At afternoon tea, Grandma brought out a plate of freshly made pastries.","A la hora del té de la tarde, la abuela sacó un plato de pastelitos recién hechos.","À l'heure du goûter, grand-mère a apporté une assiette de pâtisseries fraîchement faites."],["L7-3057","盘算","pánsuan","V","to calculate; to scheme","calcular; maquinar","calculer; manigancer","他心里盘算着，攒够了钱就回老家开一家小店。","tā xīn lǐ pán suan zhe zǎn gòu le qián jiù huí lǎo jiā kāi yì jiā xiǎo diàn","He was planning in his mind to go back home and open a small shop once he'd saved enough money.","Iba calculando en su mente que, en cuanto juntara suficiente dinero, regresaría a su pueblo para abrir una tiendita.","Il calculait dans sa tête qu'une fois assez d'argent économisé, il rentrerait chez lui ouvrir une petite boutique."],["L7-3058","判处","pànchǔ","V","to sentence","condenar","condamner","法院以诈骗罪判处他有期徒刑五年。","fǎ yuàn yǐ zhà piàn zuì pàn chǔ tā yǒu qī tú xíng wǔ nián","The court sentenced him to five years in prison for fraud.","El tribunal lo condenó a cinco años de prisión por fraude.","Le tribunal l'a condamné à cinq ans de prison pour escroquerie."],["L7-3059","判定","pàndìng","V","to judge; to determine","juzgar; determinar","juger; déterminer","裁判判定这个球出界了，比赛继续进行。","cái pàn pàn dìng zhè ge qiú chū jiè le bǐ sài jì xù jìn xíng","The referee ruled that the ball was out, and play continued.","El árbitro determinó que el balón había salido y el partido continuó.","L'arbitre a jugé que le ballon était sorti et le match a repris."],["L7-3060","判决","pànjué","V","verdict; to sentence","sentencia; dictar sentencia","jugement; condamner","法院的判决结果让受害者家属感到满意。","fǎ yuàn de pàn jué jié guǒ ràng shòu hài zhě jiā shǔ gǎn dào mǎn yì","The court's verdict satisfied the victim's family.","El resultado de la sentencia del tribunal dejó satisfechos a los familiares de la víctima.","Le verdict du tribunal a satisfait la famille de la victime."],["L7-3061","盼","pàn","V","to hope for; to long for","esperar; anhelar","espérer; aspirer à","奶奶天天盼着在外地工作的孙子回家过年。","nǎi nai tiān tiān pàn zhe zài wài dì gōng zuò de sūn zi huí jiā guò nián","Every day Grandma longs for her grandson, who works far away, to come home for the New Year.","La abuela espera cada día que su nieto, que trabaja lejos, regrese a casa para el Año Nuevo.","Chaque jour, grand-mère attend que son petit-fils, qui travaille loin, rentre pour le Nouvel An."],["L7-3062","叛逆","pànnì","V/N","to rebel; rebel","rebelarse; rebelde","se rebeller; rebelle","孩子到了十几岁，往往会有些叛逆。","hái zi dào le shí jǐ suì wǎng wǎng huì yǒu xiē pàn nì","When children reach their teens, they often become somewhat rebellious.","Cuando los niños llegan a la adolescencia, suelen volverse algo rebeldes.","Quand les enfants arrivent à l'adolescence, ils deviennent souvent un peu rebelles."],["L7-3063","庞大","pángdà","Adj","huge; enormous","enorme; descomunal","énorme; colossal","这个项目规模庞大，需要政府和企业共同投资。","zhè ge xiàng mù guī mó páng dà xū yào zhèng fǔ hé qǐ yè gòng tóng tóu zī","This project is enormous in scale and requires joint investment from the government and businesses.","Este proyecto es de gran escala y requiere la inversión conjunta del gobierno y las empresas.","Ce projet est de grande envergure et nécessite un investissement conjoint de l'État et des entreprises."],["L7-3064","旁观","pángguān","V","to look on; to be a bystander","observar como espectador","assister en spectateur","这场比赛他没有参加，只是站在场边旁观。","zhè chǎng bǐ sài tā méi yǒu cān jiā zhǐ shì zhàn zài chǎng biān páng guān","He didn't take part in this match; he just stood on the sidelines watching.","No participó en este partido; solo se quedó mirando desde la banda.","Il n'a pas participé à ce match ; il est simplement resté à regarder en bord de terrain."],["L7-3065","抛","pāo","V","to throw; to toss; to abandon","lanzar; arrojar; abandonar","jeter; lancer; abandonner","连续抛十次硬币都是正面的概率非常小。","lián xù pāo shí cì yìng bì dōu shì zhèng miàn de gài lǜ fēi cháng xiǎo","The probability of a coin landing heads ten times in a row is very small.","La probabilidad de que una moneda salga cara diez veces seguidas es muy pequeña.","La probabilité qu'une pièce tombe dix fois de suite sur pile est très faible."],["L7-3066","抛开","pāokāi","","to cast aside; to get rid of","dejar de lado; deshacerse de","mettre de côté; se débarrasser de","改编经典并不意味着照搬原作，但也不能抛开作品最核心的精神。","gǎi biān jīng diǎn bìng bú yì wèi zhe zhào bān yuán zuò dàn yě bù néng pāo kāi zuò pǐn zuì hé xīn de jīng shén","Adapting a classic does not mean copying the original exactly, but neither should it abandon the work's central spirit.","Adaptar un clásico no significa copiar el original al pie de la letra, pero tampoco se puede dejar de lado el espíritu central de la obra.","Adapter un classique ne veut pas dire reproduire l'original tel quel, mais on ne peut pas non plus abandonner l'esprit essentiel de l'œuvre."],["L7-3067","抛弃","pāoqì","V","to abandon; to discard","abandonar; desechar","abandonner; rejeter","不能因为宠物生病了就把它抛弃。","bù néng yīn wèi chǒng wù shēng bìng le jiù bǎ tā pāo qì","You can't abandon a pet just because it's sick.","No se debe abandonar a una mascota solo porque se enfermó.","On ne doit pas abandonner un animal de compagnie simplement parce qu'il est malade."],["L7-3068","刨","páo","V","to dig; to deduct","cavar; descontar","creuser; déduire","小狗在院子里刨了一个坑，把骨头埋了进去。","xiǎo gǒu zài yuàn zi lǐ páo le yí ge kēng bǎ gǔ tou mái le jìn qù","The puppy dug a hole in the yard and buried its bone in it.","El perrito cavó un hoyo en el patio y enterró el hueso en él.","Le chiot a creusé un trou dans la cour et y a enterré son os."],["L7-3069","跑车","pǎochē","N","sports car","coche deportivo","voiture de sport","一辆红色的跑车从我们身边飞驰而过。","yí liàng hóng sè de pǎo chē cóng wǒ men shēn biān fēi chí ér guò","A red sports car sped past us.","Un auto deportivo rojo pasó volando a nuestro lado.","Une voiture de sport rouge nous a dépassés à toute vitesse."],["L7-3070","跑道","pǎodào","N","track; runway","pista; pista de aterrizaje","piste; piste d'atterrissage","因跑道结冰，故本次航班推迟起飞。","yīn pǎo dào jié bīng gù běn cì háng bān tuī chí qǐ fēi","Because the runway is icy, this flight's departure is delayed.","Debido a que la pista está congelada, el despegue de este vuelo se retrasa.","La piste étant verglacée, le décollage de ce vol est retardé."],["L7-3071","跑龙套","pǎo lóngtào","","to play a bit part","hacer un papel secundario","jouer un petit rôle","他在剧组跑龙套跑了十年，终于演上了主角。","tā zài jù zǔ pǎo lóng tào pǎo le shí nián zhōng yú yǎn shàng le zhǔ jué","After ten years of playing bit parts, he finally landed a leading role.","Hizo papeles de relleno durante diez años en las producciones y por fin consiguió un papel protagónico.","Après dix ans de petits rôles de figurant, il a enfin décroché un rôle principal."],["L7-3072","泡沫","pàomò","N","foam; bubble","espuma; burbuja","mousse; bulle","啤酒倒得太快，杯子里全是泡沫。","pí jiǔ dào de tài kuài bēi zi lǐ quán shì pào mò","The beer was poured too fast, and the glass was full of foam.","La cerveza se sirvió demasiado rápido y el vaso quedó lleno de espuma.","La bière a été versée trop vite et le verre est plein de mousse."],["L7-3073","胚胎","pēitāi","N","embryo","embrión","embryon","科学家通过显微镜观察胚胎的发育过程。","kē xué jiā tōng guò xiǎn wēi jìng guān chá pēi tāi de fā yù guò chéng","Scientists observe the development of the embryo through a microscope.","Los científicos observan con un microscopio el proceso de desarrollo del embrión.","Les scientifiques observent au microscope le développement de l'embryon."],["L7-3074","陪伴","péibàn","V","to accompany","acompañar","accompagner","父母用心呵护着孩子，陪伴他们健康成长。","fù mǔ yòng xīn hē hù zhe hái zi péi bàn tā men jiàn kāng chéng zhǎng","Parents lovingly protect their children and accompany them as they grow up healthy.","Los padres cuidan con esmero a sus hijos y los acompañan para que crezcan sanos.","Les parents protègent leurs enfants avec amour et les accompagnent pour qu'ils grandissent en bonne santé."],["L7-3075","陪葬","péizàng","V","to be buried together with","enterrarse junto con","être enterré avec","这座古墓里出土了大量陪葬的陶器。","zhè zuò gǔ mù lǐ chū tǔ le dà liàng péi zàng de táo qì","A large number of pottery funerary objects were unearthed from this ancient tomb.","En esta antigua tumba se desenterraron muchas vasijas de cerámica que formaban parte del ajuar funerario.","On a exhumé de cette ancienne tombe un grand nombre de poteries déposées comme mobilier funéraire."],["L7-3076","赔钱","péiqián","","to lose money; to pay damages","perder dinero; pagar daños","perdre de l'argent; payer des dommages","第一年开店就赔钱了，他差点儿放弃。","dì yī nián kāi diàn jiù péi qián le tā chà diǎnr fàng qì","His shop lost money in its first year, and he nearly gave up.","El primer año de abrir la tienda perdió dinero y casi se rindió.","La première année d'ouverture de sa boutique, il a perdu de l'argent et a failli abandonner."],["L7-3077","佩服","pèifú","V","to admire","admirar","admirer","他讲课喜欢引经据典，学生们都很佩服。","tā jiǎng kè xǐ huan yǐn jīng jù diǎn xué shēng men dōu hěn pèi fú","He likes to quote the classics in his lectures, and the students admire him.","Le gusta citar a los clásicos en sus clases y los alumnos lo admiran.","Il aime citer les classiques dans ses cours, et ses élèves l'admirent."],["L7-3078","配件","pèijiàn","N","accessory; spare part","accesorio; repuesto","accessoire; pièce détachée","这款手机的原装配件都在盒子里。","zhè kuǎn shǒu jī de yuán zhuāng pèi jiàn dōu zài hé zi lǐ","All the original accessories for this phone are in the box.","Todos los accesorios originales de este celular están dentro de la caja.","Tous les accessoires d'origine de ce téléphone sont dans la boîte."],["L7-3079","配偶","pèi'ǒu","N","spouse","cónyuge","conjoint","填写表格时，需要写上配偶的姓名和工作单位。","tián xiě biǎo gé shí xū yào xiě shàng pèi ǒu de xìng míng hé gōng zuò dān wèi","When filling out the form, you need to enter your spouse's name and employer.","Al llenar el formulario, hay que escribir el nombre y el lugar de trabajo del cónyuge.","En remplissant le formulaire, il faut indiquer le nom et le lieu de travail de son conjoint."],["L7-3080","配送","pèisòng","V","to deliver goods","entregar mercancías","livrer des marchandises","这家超市提供免费配送服务，下单后两小时送到。","zhè jiā chāo shì tí gōng miǎn fèi pèi sòng fú wù xià dān hòu liǎng xiǎo shí sòng dào","This supermarket offers free delivery, and orders are delivered within two hours of being placed.","Este supermercado ofrece servicio de entrega gratuito y el pedido llega dos horas después de hacerlo.","Ce supermarché propose la livraison gratuite, et la commande arrive deux heures après avoir été passée."],["L7-3081","配音","pèiyīn","","dubbing","doblaje","doublage","这部外国动画片的中文配音非常生动。","zhè bù wài guó dòng huà piàn de zhōng wén pèi yīn fēi cháng shēng dòng","The Chinese dubbing of this foreign animated film is very lively.","El doblaje al chino de esta película de animación extranjera es muy expresivo.","Le doublage en chinois de ce dessin animé étranger est très vivant."],["L7-3082","喷泉","pēnquán","N","fountain","fuente","fontaine","广场中央的喷泉随着音乐变换出各种形状。","guǎng chǎng zhōng yāng de pēn quán suí zhe yīn yuè biàn huàn chū gè zhǒng xíng zhuàng","The fountain in the middle of the square changes shape in time with the music.","La fuente en el centro de la plaza cambia de forma al ritmo de la música.","La fontaine au centre de la place change de forme au rythme de la musique."],["L7-3083","抨击","pēngjī","V","to attack; to criticize","criticar duramente; atacar","critiquer vivement; attaquer","这篇评论文章猛烈抨击了乱收费的现象。","zhè piān píng lùn wén zhāng měng liè pēng jī le luàn shōu fèi de xiàn xiàng","This commentary fiercely attacked the practice of arbitrary fees.","Este artículo de opinión criticó con dureza la práctica de cobrar tarifas arbitrarias.","Cet article d'opinion a vivement critiqué la pratique des frais abusifs."],["L7-3084","烹调","pēngtiáo","V","to cook","cocinar","cuisiner","这道菜的烹调方法很简单，十分钟就能做好。","zhè dào cài de pēng tiáo fāng fǎ hěn jiǎn dān shí fēn zhōng jiù néng zuò hǎo","The cooking method for this dish is simple; it can be ready in ten minutes.","El método de preparación de este platillo es muy sencillo; en diez minutos queda listo.","La recette de ce plat est très simple ; il est prêt en dix minutes."],["L7-3085","蓬勃","péngbó","Adj","flourishing; vigorous","floreciente; vigoroso","florissant; vigoureux","近年来，这座城市的旅游业蓬勃发展。","jìn nián lái zhè zuò chéng shì de lǚ yóu yè péng bó fā zhǎn","In recent years, tourism in this city has flourished.","En los últimos años, el turismo de esta ciudad se ha desarrollado con gran vigor.","Ces dernières années, le tourisme de cette ville connaît un essor remarquable."],["L7-3086","鹏程万里","péngchéng-wànlǐ","","brilliant future prospects","futuro brillante","avenir brillant","毕业典礼上，校长祝同学们鹏程万里。","bì yè diǎn lǐ shàng xiào zhǎng zhù tóng xué men péng chéng wàn lǐ","At the graduation ceremony, the principal wished the students a brilliant future.","En la ceremonia de graduación, el director les deseó a los alumnos un futuro brillante.","À la cérémonie de remise des diplômes, le directeur a souhaité aux élèves un avenir radieux."],["L7-3087","膨胀","péngzhàng","V","to expand; to inflate","expandirse; inflarse","se dilater; gonfler","物体受热后一般会膨胀，遇冷则会收缩。","wù tǐ shòu rè hòu yì bān huì péng zhàng yù lěng zé huì shōu suō","Objects generally expand when heated and contract when cooled.","Por lo general, los objetos se dilatan con el calor y se contraen con el frío.","En général, les corps se dilatent sous l'effet de la chaleur et se contractent sous l'effet du froid."],["L7-3088","捧","pěng","V","to hold in both hands; to praise","sostener con ambas manos; elogiar","tenir à deux mains; louer","小女孩双手捧着一杯热茶，小心地递给了爷爷。","xiǎo nǚ hái shuāng shǒu pěng zhe yì bēi rè chá xiǎo xīn de dì gěi le yé ye","Holding a cup of hot tea in both hands, the little girl carefully handed it to her grandfather.","La niña sostuvo con ambas manos una taza de té caliente y se la entregó con cuidado a su abuelo.","La petite fille, une tasse de thé chaud entre les deux mains, l'a tendue avec précaution à son grand-père."],["L7-3089","捧场","pěngchǎng","","to cheer on; to flatter","animar; halagar","encourager; flatter","朋友的画展开幕那天，我们都去捧场了。","péng you de huà zhǎn kāi mù nà tiān wǒ men dōu qù pěng chǎng le","On the opening day of our friend's art exhibition, we all went to show our support.","El día de la inauguración de la exposición de pintura de nuestro amigo, todos fuimos a apoyarlo.","Le jour du vernissage de l'exposition de peinture de notre ami, nous y sommes tous allés pour le soutenir."],["L7-3090","碰钉子","pèng dīngzi","","to meet with a rebuff","recibir un rechazo","essuyer un refus","他去好几家公司推销产品，都碰钉子了。","tā qù hǎo jǐ jiā gōng sī tuī xiāo chǎn pǐn dōu pèng dīng zi le","He tried selling his product to several companies, but was rebuffed every time.","Fue a varias empresas a ofrecer su producto y en todas lo rechazaron.","Il a essayé de vendre son produit à plusieurs entreprises, mais s'est fait éconduire partout."],["L7-3091","碰巧","pèngqiǎo","Adv","by chance; to happen to","por casualidad; resultar que","par hasard; se trouver que","我去找他的时候，他碰巧出门了。","wǒ qù zhǎo tā de shí hou tā pèng qiǎo chū mén le","When I went to see him, he happened to be out.","Cuando fui a buscarlo, justo había salido.","Quand je suis allé le voir, il venait justement de sortir."],["L7-3092","碰上","pèngshang","","to run into; to meet","toparse con; encontrar","tomber sur; rencontrer","我今天特意早起，偏偏又碰上了堵车。","wǒ jīn tiān tè yì zǎo qǐ piān piān yòu pèng shàng le dǔ chē","I got up especially early today, and of all things I got stuck in traffic again.","Hoy me levanté temprano a propósito y, para colmo, me topé con un embotellamiento.","Aujourd'hui je me suis levé tôt exprès, et il a fallu que je tombe sur des embouteillages."],["L7-3093","碰撞","pèngzhuàng","V","to collide; collision","chocar; colisión","entrer en collision; collision","两辆车在路口发生了碰撞，幸好没有人受伤。","liǎng liàng chē zài lù kǒu fā shēng le pèng zhuàng xìng hǎo méi yǒu rén shòu shāng","Two cars collided at the intersection; fortunately, no one was hurt.","Dos coches chocaron en el cruce; por suerte, nadie resultó herido.","Deux voitures sont entrées en collision au carrefour ; heureusement, il n'y a eu aucun blessé."],["L7-3094","批发","pīfā","V","wholesale","venta al por mayor","vente en gros","这个市场主要批发各种花卉和盆景。","zhè ge shì chǎng zhǔ yào pī fā gè zhǒng huā huì hé pén jǐng","This market mainly wholesales all kinds of flowers and potted landscapes.","Este mercado vende al por mayor principalmente flores y bonsáis de todo tipo.","Ce marché est principalement un marché de gros de fleurs et de bonsaïs en tout genre."],["L7-3095","批判","pīpàn","V","to criticize; critique","criticar; crítica","critiquer; critique","我们要用批判的眼光看待网上的信息。","wǒ men yào yòng pī pàn de yǎn guāng kàn dài wǎng shàng de xìn xī","We should look at online information with a critical eye.","Debemos mirar la información de internet con ojo crítico.","Nous devons aborder les informations en ligne avec un regard critique."],["L7-3096","披露","pīlù","V","to reveal; to make public","revelar; hacer público","révéler; rendre public","未经许可披露他人的隐私，即使没有牟利，也可能构成侵权。","wèi jīng xǔ kě pī lù tā rén de yǐn sī jí shǐ méi yǒu móu lì yě kě néng gòu chéng qīn quán","Disclosing another person's private information without permission may constitute an infringement even without financial gain.","Divulgar la privacidad de otra persona sin su permiso puede constituir una violación de derechos, aunque no haya ánimo de lucro.","Divulguer sans autorisation la vie privée d'autrui peut constituer une atteinte à ses droits, même sans but lucratif."],["L7-3097","劈","pī","V","to chop; to split","cortar; partir","fendre; couper","他用斧子把木头劈成小块，准备生火。","tā yòng fǔ zi bǎ mù tou pī chéng xiǎo kuài zhǔn bèi shēng huǒ","He split the wood into small pieces with an axe to start a fire.","Partió la leña en trozos pequeños con un hacha para encender el fuego.","Il a fendu le bois en petits morceaux à la hache pour allumer un feu."],["L7-3098","皮带","pídài","N","belt; strap","cinturón; correa","ceinture; courroie","他最近瘦了不少，皮带都得往里多扣一个孔。","tā zuì jìn shòu le bù shǎo pí dài dōu děi wǎng lǐ duō kòu yí ge kǒng","He has lost quite a bit of weight recently and has to fasten his belt one notch tighter.","Últimamente ha adelgazado bastante y tiene que abrocharse el cinturón un agujero más adentro.","Il a pas mal maigri récemment et doit boucler sa ceinture d'un cran de plus."],["L7-3099","疲惫","píbèi","Adj","exhausted; tired","agotado; cansado","épuisé; fatigué","连续加了一周的班，他看起来非常疲惫。","lián xù jiā le yì zhōu de bān tā kàn qǐ lái fēi cháng pí bèi","After a week of working overtime, he looks exhausted.","Tras una semana seguida de horas extra, se ve agotadísimo.","Après une semaine entière d'heures supplémentaires, il a l'air épuisé."],["L7-3100","疲惫不堪","píbèi-bùkān","","utterly exhausted","exhausto","à bout de forces","爬了一整天山，大家回到旅馆时都疲惫不堪。","pá le yì zhěng tiān shān dà jiā huí dào lǚ guǎn shí dōu pí bèi bù kān","After climbing mountains all day, everyone was utterly exhausted when they got back to the inn.","Después de pasar todo el día escalando montañas, todos llegaron a la posada agotados.","Après avoir passé toute la journée à escalader des montagnes, tout le monde est rentré à l'auberge complètement épuisé."],["L7-3101","疲倦","píjuàn","Adj","tired","cansado","fatigué","开了几个小时的车，他感到有些疲倦，就在服务区休息了一会儿。","kāi le jǐ ge xiǎo shí de chē tā gǎn dào yǒu xiē pí juàn jiù zài fú wù qū xiū xi le yí huìr","After driving for several hours, he felt a bit tired and rested for a while at a service area.","Tras conducir varias horas, se sintió algo cansado y descansó un rato en un área de servicio.","Après plusieurs heures au volant, il se sentait un peu fatigué et s'est reposé un moment sur une aire de service."],["L7-3102","疲劳","píláo","Adj","fatigue; weary","fatiga; cansado","fatigue; las","长时间看电脑容易造成眼睛疲劳。","cháng shí jiān kàn diàn nǎo róng yì zào chéng yǎn jing pí láo","Looking at a computer for long periods can easily cause eye strain.","Mirar la computadora durante mucho tiempo puede causar fácilmente fatiga visual.","Regarder un ordinateur trop longtemps peut facilement provoquer une fatigue oculaire."],["L7-3103","脾","pí","N","spleen","bazo","rate","中医认为，常吃生冷的东西容易伤脾。","zhōng yī rèn wéi cháng chī shēng lěng de dōng xi róng yì shāng pí","Traditional Chinese medicine holds that eating raw and cold food often can harm the spleen.","La medicina china sostiene que comer con frecuencia alimentos crudos y fríos daña el bazo.","La médecine chinoise estime que manger souvent des aliments crus et froids fatigue la rate."],["L7-3104","匹配","pǐpèi","V","to match; compatible","emparejar; compatible","assortir; compatible","这款充电器和你的手机型号不匹配。","zhè kuǎn chōng diàn qì hé nǐ de shǒu jī xíng hào bù pǐ pèi","This charger isn't compatible with your phone model.","Este cargador no es compatible con el modelo de tu celular.","Ce chargeur n'est pas compatible avec le modèle de ton téléphone."],["L7-3105","媲美","pìměi","V","to rival; to be comparable to","rivalizar con; ser comparable a","rivaliser avec; égaler","这家小饭馆的菜，味道可以和大酒店媲美。","zhè jiā xiǎo fàn guǎn de cài wèi dào kě yǐ hé dà jiǔ diàn pì měi","The food at this little restaurant can rival that of the big hotels.","La comida de este pequeño restaurante puede competir en sabor con la de los grandes hoteles.","La cuisine de ce petit restaurant n'a rien à envier à celle des grands hôtels."],["L7-3106","僻静","pìjìng","Adj","secluded; quiet","apartado; tranquilo","isolé; tranquille","他们在郊外找了一个僻静的地方，搭起了帐篷。","tā men zài jiāo wài zhǎo le yí ge pì jìng de dì fang dā qǐ le zhàng peng","They found a secluded spot in the countryside and pitched their tent.","Encontraron un lugar apartado en las afueras y armaron la carpa.","Ils ont trouvé un endroit retiré en pleine campagne et y ont monté leur tente."],["L7-3107","譬如","pìrú","V","for example","por ejemplo","par exemple","多吃粗粮对身体有好处，譬如玉米和燕麦。","duō chī cū liáng duì shēn tǐ yǒu hǎo chù pì rú yù mǐ hé yàn mài","Eating more whole grains is good for your health — corn and oats, for example.","Comer más cereales integrales es bueno para la salud, por ejemplo el maíz y la avena.","Manger davantage de céréales complètes est bon pour la santé, par exemple le maïs et l'avoine."],["L7-3108","譬如说","pìrú shuō","","for example","por ejemplo","par exemple","学习方法有很多，譬如说每天坚持听半小时录音。","xué xí fāng fǎ yǒu hěn duō pì rú shuō měi tiān jiān chí tīng bàn xiǎo shí lù yīn","There are many ways to study — for example, listening to recordings for half an hour every day.","Hay muchos métodos de estudio, por ejemplo, escuchar grabaciones media hora todos los días.","Il existe de nombreuses méthodes d'étude, par exemple écouter des enregistrements une demi-heure chaque jour."],["L7-3109","片子","piānzi","N","film; movie; record","película; disco","film; disque","这部片子讲的是一个普通家庭三十年的变化。","zhè bù piān zi jiǎng de shì yí ge pǔ tōng jiā tíng sān shí nián de biàn huà","This film is about thirty years of change in an ordinary family.","Esta película trata de los cambios que vivió una familia común a lo largo de treinta años.","Ce film raconte trente ans de changements dans une famille ordinaire."],["L7-3110","偏差","piānchā","N","deviation; bias","desviación; sesgo","écart; biais","如果输入的数据存在偏差，再精密的模型也可能得出荒谬的结论。","rú guǒ shū rù de shù jù cún zài piān chā zài jīng mì de mó xíng yě kě néng dé chū huāng miù de jié lùn","If the input data is biased, even a highly precise model may produce absurd conclusions.","Si los datos de entrada tienen sesgos, hasta el modelo más preciso puede llegar a conclusiones absurdas.","Si les données saisies sont biaisées, même le modèle le plus précis peut aboutir à des conclusions absurdes."],["L7-3111","偏方","piānfāng","N","folk remedy","remedio casero","remède de bonne femme","他听信了一个治感冒的偏方，结果病得更重了。","tā tīng xìn le yí ge zhì gǎn mào de piān fāng jié guǒ bìng de gèng zhòng le","He trusted a folk remedy for colds, and ended up even sicker.","Creyó en un remedio casero para el resfriado y terminó enfermándose más.","Il a cru à un remède de bonne femme contre le rhume et est tombé encore plus malade."],["L7-3112","偏见","piānjiàn","N","prejudice; bias","prejuicio; sesgo","préjugé; biais","我们不应该对外地人抱有偏见。","wǒ men bù yīng gāi duì wài dì rén bào yǒu piān jiàn","We shouldn't be prejudiced against people from other places.","No deberíamos tener prejuicios contra la gente de otros lugares.","Nous ne devrions pas avoir de préjugés envers les gens venus d'ailleurs."],["L7-3113","偏僻","piānpì","Adj","remote; out-of-the-way","remoto; apartado","isolé; reculé","偏僻的小巷里藏着一间茶馆儿，来往的客人多半是附近的街坊。","piān pì de xiǎo xiàng lǐ cáng zhe yì jiān chá guǎnr lái wǎng de kè rén duō bàn shì fù jìn de jiē fāng","A teahouse is tucked away in a secluded alley, and most of its customers are neighbors from nearby.","En un callejón apartado se esconde una casa de té, y la mayoría de los clientes son vecinos del barrio.","Dans une ruelle isolée se cache une maison de thé, dont la plupart des clients sont des voisins du quartier."],["L7-3114","偏偏","piānpiān","Adv","unfortunately; as luck would have it","por desgracia; justamente","malheureusement; par malchance","我今天特意早起，偏偏又碰上了堵车。","wǒ jīn tiān tè yì zǎo qǐ piān piān yòu pèng shàng le dǔ chē","I got up especially early today, and of all things I got stuck in traffic again.","Hoy me levanté temprano a propósito y, para colmo, me topé con un embotellamiento.","Aujourd'hui je me suis levé tôt exprès, et il a fallu que je tombe sur des embouteillages."],["L7-3115","偏向","piānxiàng","V/N","to favor; to lean toward","favorecer; inclinarse hacia","favoriser; pencher vers","父母不应该偏向任何一个孩子。","fù mǔ bù yīng gāi piān xiàng rèn hé yí ge hái zi","Parents shouldn't favor any one of their children.","Los padres no deben tener preferencia por ninguno de sus hijos.","Les parents ne devraient favoriser aucun de leurs enfants."],["L7-3116","偏远","piānyuǎn","Adj","remote; far-flung","remoto; alejado","reculé; éloigné","这位年轻干部主动要求到最偏远的山村工作。","zhè wèi nián qīng gàn bù zhǔ dòng yāo qiú dào zuì piān yuǎn de shān cūn gōng zuò","This young official volunteered to work in the most remote mountain village.","Este joven cuadro pidió voluntariamente ir a trabajar al pueblo de montaña más remoto.","Ce jeune cadre a demandé de lui-même à travailler dans le village de montagne le plus reculé."],["L7-3117","篇幅","piānfú","N","length; space (of a text)","extensión; espacio (de un texto)","longueur; place (d'un texte)","这份报告虽然篇幅有限，却对争议的来龙去脉作了深入的剖析。","zhè fèn bào gào suī rán piān fú yǒu xiàn què duì zhēng yì de lái lóng qù mài zuò le shēn rù de pōu xī","Although limited in length, this report offers an in-depth analysis of how the dispute arose and developed.","Aunque este informe es breve, analiza a fondo cómo surgió y se desarrolló la controversia.","Bien que ce rapport soit de longueur limitée, il analyse en profondeur les tenants et aboutissants de la controverse."],["L7-3118","片段","piànduàn","N","fragment; excerpt","fragmento; extracto","fragment; extrait","老师在课上给我们放了这部电影的几个片段。","lǎo shī zài kè shàng gěi wǒ men fàng le zhè bù diàn yǐng de jǐ ge piàn duàn","In class, the teacher played us a few clips from this film.","En clase, el profesor nos puso algunos fragmentos de esta película.","En classe, le professeur nous a passé quelques extraits de ce film."],["L7-3119","骗人","piàn rén","","to cheat people; to lie","engañar a la gente","tromper les gens","他说的那些话全是骗人的，你千万别信。","tā shuō de nà xiē huà quán shì piàn rén de nǐ qiān wàn bié xìn","Everything he said was a lie; don't believe a word of it.","Todo lo que dijo es mentira; no le creas nada.","Tout ce qu'il a dit est faux ; surtout, ne le crois pas."],["L7-3120","漂","piāo","V","to float; to drift","flotar; ir a la deriva","flotter; dériver","秋天的河面上漂着一片片金黄的落叶。","qiū tiān de hé miàn shàng piāo zhe yí piàn piàn jīn huáng de luò yè","In autumn, golden fallen leaves float on the surface of the river.","En otoño, sobre el río flotan hojas caídas de color dorado.","En automne, des feuilles mortes dorées flottent à la surface de la rivière."],["L7-3121","飘","piāo","V/Adj","to float; to flutter","flotar; ondear","flotter; voltiger","厨房里飘出一股浓郁的咖啡香。","chú fáng lǐ piāo chū yì gǔ nóng yù de kā fēi xiāng","A rich aroma of coffee drifted out of the kitchen.","De la cocina salía un intenso aroma a café.","Un riche parfum de café s'échappait de la cuisine."],["L7-3122","票房","piàofáng","N","box office","taquilla","box-office","这部电影上映一个月，票房累计超过十亿元。","zhè bù diàn yǐng shàng yìng yí ge yuè piào fáng lěi jì chāo guò shí yì yuán","A month after release, this film's cumulative box office exceeded one billion yuan.","A un mes de su estreno, la taquilla acumulada de esta película superó los mil millones de yuanes.","Un mois après sa sortie, les recettes cumulées de ce film ont dépassé le milliard de yuans."],["L7-3123","撇","piě","V/N","to discard; to skim off","desechar; quitar","jeter; écumer","他撇下妻子和孩子，一个人去了国外。","tā piē xia qī zi hé hái zi yí ge rén qù le guó wài","He left his wife and children behind and went abroad alone.","Abandonó a su esposa y a sus hijos y se fue solo al extranjero.","Il a laissé derrière lui sa femme et ses enfants et est parti seul à l'étranger."],["L7-3124","拼搏","pīnbó","V","to struggle; to strive hard","luchar; esforzarse","lutter; se battre","这些年轻人在大城市里努力拼搏，希望实现自己的梦想。","zhè xiē nián qīng rén zài dà chéng shì lǐ nǔ lì pīn bó xī wàng shí xiàn zì jǐ de mèng xiǎng","These young people are striving hard in the big city, hoping to realize their dreams.","Estos jóvenes se esfuerzan en la gran ciudad con la esperanza de cumplir sus sueños.","Ces jeunes se battent avec acharnement dans la grande ville dans l'espoir de réaliser leurs rêves."],["L7-3125","拼命","pīnmìng","","to go all out; desperately","esforzarse al máximo; desesperadamente","se donner à fond; désespérément","他拼命追赶前面的选手。","tā pīn mìng zhuī gǎn qián miàn de xuǎn shǒu","He tried desperately to catch up with the runner ahead.","Persiguió con todas sus fuerzas al corredor que iba adelante.","Il a poursuivi de toutes ses forces le concurrent qui le précédait."],["L7-3126","贫富","pín fù","","rich and poor","ricos y pobres","riches et pauvres","这个国家经济发展很快，但贫富差距也越来越大。","zhè ge guó jiā jīng jì fā zhǎn hěn kuài dàn pín fù chā jù yě yuè lái yuè dà","This country's economy is growing fast, but the gap between rich and poor is also widening.","La economía de este país crece rápidamente, pero la brecha entre ricos y pobres también es cada vez mayor.","L'économie de ce pays se développe vite, mais l'écart entre riches et pauvres se creuse aussi de plus en plus."],["L7-3127","贫穷","pínqióng","Adj","poor; impoverished","pobre; empobrecido","pauvre; appauvri","他出生在一个贫穷的山村，靠奖学金读完了大学。","tā chū shēng zài yí ge pín qióng de shān cūn kào jiǎng xué jīn dú wán le dà xué","He was born in a poor mountain village and completed university on a scholarship.","Nació en un pueblo pobre de montaña y terminó la universidad gracias a una beca.","Il est né dans un pauvre village de montagne et a terminé l'université grâce à une bourse."],["L7-3128","频率","pínlǜ","N","frequency","frecuencia","fréquence","最近他头疼的频率越来越高，应该去医院检查一下。","zuì jìn tā tóu téng de pín lǜ yuè lái yuè gāo yīng gāi qù yī yuàn jiǎn chá yí xià","His headaches have become more frequent lately; he should get checked at a hospital.","Últimamente le duele la cabeza cada vez con más frecuencia; debería ir al hospital a revisarse.","Ses maux de tête sont de plus en plus fréquents ces derniers temps ; il devrait aller se faire examiner à l'hôpital."],["L7-3129","频频","pínpín","Adv","repeatedly; again and again","repetidamente; una y otra vez","à maintes reprises; sans cesse","演讲结束时，台下的观众频频点头表示赞同。","yǎn jiǎng jié shù shí tái xià de guān zhòng pín pín diǎn tóu biǎo shì zàn tóng","At the end of the speech, the audience nodded repeatedly in agreement.","Al terminar el discurso, el público asintió repetidamente en señal de acuerdo.","À la fin du discours, le public a hoché la tête à plusieurs reprises en signe d'approbation."],["L7-3130","品尝","pǐncháng","V","to taste; to sample","probar; degustar","goûter; déguster","我们在夜市里品尝了各种当地小吃。","wǒ men zài yè shì lǐ pǐn cháng le gè zhǒng dāng dì xiǎo chī","At the night market, we sampled all kinds of local snacks.","En el mercado nocturno probamos todo tipo de bocadillos locales.","Au marché nocturne, nous avons goûté toutes sortes de spécialités locales."],["L7-3131","品德","pǐndé","N","moral character","carácter moral","caractère moral","学校不仅重视学生的成绩，也重视他们的品德。","xué xiào bù jǐn zhòng shì xué shēng de chéng jì yě zhòng shì tā men de pǐn dé","The school values not only students' grades but also their moral character.","La escuela no solo valora las calificaciones de los alumnos, sino también su carácter moral.","L'école accorde de l'importance non seulement aux résultats des élèves, mais aussi à leur caractère moral."],["L7-3132","品位","pǐnwèi","N","taste; quality","gusto; calidad","goût; qualité","她穿衣服很有品位，从来不追求名牌。","tā chuān yī fú hěn yǒu pǐn wèi cóng lái bù zhuī qiú míng pái","She dresses with real taste and never chases after brand names.","Se viste con mucho gusto y nunca persigue las marcas famosas.","Elle s'habille avec beaucoup de goût et ne court jamais après les grandes marques."],["L7-3133","品行","pǐnxíng","N","conduct; behavior","conducta; comportamiento","conduite; comportement","这孩子品行端正，邻居们都很喜欢他。","zhè hái zi pǐn xíng duān zhèng lín jū men dōu hěn xǐ huan tā","This child is upright in conduct, and the neighbors all like him.","Este niño tiene buena conducta y a todos los vecinos les cae muy bien.","Cet enfant est d'une conduite irréprochable et tous les voisins l'apprécient beaucoup."],["L7-3134","聘","pìn","V","to hire; to engage","contratar","engager; recruter","学校聘他为客座教授，每年来讲一个月的课。","xué xiào pìn tā wéi kè zuò jiào shòu měi nián lái jiǎng yí ge yuè de kè","The university appointed him visiting professor, to lecture for one month each year.","La universidad lo contrató como profesor invitado para dar clases un mes cada año.","L'école l'a engagé comme professeur invité pour donner des cours pendant un mois chaque année."],["L7-3135","聘任","pìnrèn","V","to appoint","nombrar; designar","nommer; désigner","公司聘任了一位有经验的财务总监。","gōng sī pìn rèn le yí wèi yǒu jīng yàn de cái wù zǒng jiān","The company appointed an experienced finance director.","La empresa contrató a un director financiero con experiencia.","L'entreprise a engagé un directeur financier expérimenté."],["L7-3136","聘用","pìnyòng","V","to employ; to hire","emplear; contratar","employer; embaucher","这家餐厅聘用了几名退休的老厨师。","zhè jiā cān tīng pìn yòng le jǐ míng tuì xiū de lǎo chú shī","This restaurant has hired several retired veteran chefs.","Este restaurante contrató a varios cocineros veteranos ya jubilados.","Ce restaurant a embauché plusieurs vieux cuisiniers à la retraite."],["L7-3137","乒乓球","pīngpāngqiú","N","table tennis","tenis de mesa","tennis de table","爷爷每天早上都去社区活动中心打乒乓球。","yé ye měi tiān zǎo shang dōu qù shè qū huó dòng zhōng xīn dǎ pīng pāng qiú","Every morning Grandpa goes to the community center to play table tennis.","Todas las mañanas el abuelo va al centro comunitario a jugar ping pong.","Chaque matin, grand-père va au centre de loisirs du quartier jouer au tennis de table."],["L7-3138","平常心","píngchángxīn","N","calm and composure","serenidad; ecuanimidad","sérénité; équanimité","比赛前教练让大家保持平常心，不要有太大压力。","bǐ sài qián jiào liàn ràng dà jiā bǎo chí píng cháng xīn bú yào yǒu tài dà yā lì","Before the match, the coach told everyone to stay calm and not feel too much pressure.","Antes del partido, el entrenador les dijo a todos que mantuvieran la calma y no se pusieran demasiada presión.","Avant le match, l'entraîneur a demandé à tous de rester sereins et de ne pas se mettre trop de pression."],["L7-3139","平淡","píngdàn","Adj","dull; ordinary","insulso; ordinario","terne; banal","他们的生活虽然平淡，却过得很幸福。","tā men de shēng huó suī rán píng dàn què guò de hěn xìng fú","Although their life is uneventful, they live very happily.","Aunque su vida es sencilla, son muy felices.","Leur vie est certes sans éclat, mais ils sont très heureux."],["L7-3140","平和","pínghé","Adj/V","gentle; peaceful","apacible; pacífico","doux; paisible","老人说话语气平和，从来不对人发脾气。","lǎo rén shuō huà yǔ qì píng hé cóng lái bú duì rén fā pí qi","The old man speaks in a gentle tone and never loses his temper with anyone.","El anciano habla con un tono sereno y nunca se enoja con nadie.","Le vieil homme parle d'un ton paisible et ne se met jamais en colère contre personne."],["L7-3141","平价","píngjià","V/N","affordable; reasonably priced","asequible; de precio razonable","abordable; à prix raisonnable","这家平价超市的蔬菜又新鲜又便宜。","zhè jiā píng jià chāo shì de shū cài yòu xīn xiān yòu pián yi","The vegetables at this discount supermarket are fresh and cheap.","Las verduras de este supermercado de precios bajos son frescas y baratas.","Les légumes de ce supermarché discount sont frais et bon marché."],["L7-3142","平面","píngmiàn","N","plane; flat surface","plano; superficie plana","plan; surface plane","设计师先画了一张房子的平面图给我们看。","shè jì shī xiān huà le yì zhāng fáng zi de píng miàn tú gěi wǒ men kàn","The designer first drew a floor plan of the house to show us.","El diseñador primero dibujó un plano de planta de la casa para mostrárnoslo.","Le concepteur a d'abord dessiné le plan de la maison pour nous le montrer."],["L7-3143","平民","píngmín","N","commoner; civilian","plebeyo; civil","roturier; civil","在这场战争中，很多无辜的平民失去了家园。","zài zhè chǎng zhàn zhēng zhōng hěn duō wú gū de píng mín shī qù le jiā yuán","In this war, many innocent civilians lost their homes.","En esta guerra, muchos civiles inocentes perdieron sus hogares.","Dans cette guerre, beaucoup de civils innocents ont perdu leur foyer."],["L7-3144","平日","píngrì","N","ordinary days; usually","días normales; normalmente","jours ordinaires; habituellement","他平日工作很忙，只有周末才能陪陪孩子。","tā píng rì gōng zuò hěn máng zhǐ yǒu zhōu mò cái néng péi péi hái zi","He is busy with work on ordinary days and can only spend time with his kids on weekends.","Entre semana está muy ocupado con el trabajo y solo puede pasar tiempo con los niños los fines de semana.","En temps normal, il est très occupé par son travail et ne peut s'occuper de ses enfants que le week-end."],["L7-3145","平息","píngxī","V","to calm down; to settle","calmar; apaciguar","apaiser; calmer","经过双方协商，这场纠纷终于平息了。","jīng guò shuāng fāng xié shāng zhè chǎng jiū fēn zhōng yú píng xī le","After negotiations between the two sides, the dispute was finally settled.","Tras la negociación entre ambas partes, la disputa por fin se calmó.","Après la négociation entre les deux parties, le différend s'est enfin apaisé."],["L7-3146","评定","píngdìng","V","to evaluate; to assess","evaluar; valorar","évaluer; apprécier","专家们将对参赛作品进行评定，下周公布结果。","zhuān jiā men jiāng duì cān sài zuò pǐn jìn xíng píng dìng xià zhōu gōng bù jié guǒ","Experts will evaluate the entries and announce the results next week.","Los expertos evaluarán las obras participantes y publicarán los resultados la próxima semana.","Des experts évalueront les œuvres en lice et publieront les résultats la semaine prochaine."],["L7-3147","评论员","pínglùnyuán","N","commentator","comentarista","commentateur","这位体育评论员的解说既专业又幽默。","zhè wèi tǐ yù píng lùn yuán de jiě shuō jì zhuān yè yòu yōu mò","This sports commentator's commentary is both professional and humorous.","Los comentarios de este comentarista deportivo son profesionales y a la vez divertidos.","Les commentaires de ce journaliste sportif sont à la fois professionnels et pleins d'humour."],["L7-3148","评判","píngpàn","V","to judge; to appraise","juzgar; valorar","juger; apprécier","节能措施是否奏效，需要通过长期监测来评判，不能仅凭一次测量就下结论。","jié néng cuò shī shì fǒu zòu xiào xū yào tōng guò cháng qī jiān cè lái píng pàn bù néng jǐn píng yí cì cè liáng jiù xià jié lùn","Whether energy-saving measures work needs to be judged through long-term monitoring, rather than a single measurement.","Si las medidas de ahorro de energía funcionan o no debe juzgarse mediante un monitoreo prolongado, y no se puede concluir con una sola medición.","L'efficacité des mesures d'économie d'énergie doit être jugée par un suivi sur la durée, et non conclue à partir d'une seule mesure."],["L7-3149","评审","píngshěn","V","to review; to evaluate","evaluar; revisar","examiner; évaluer","这次科研项目的评审工作由五位专家负责。","zhè cì kē yán xiàng mù de píng shěn gōng zuò yóu wǔ wèi zhuān jiā fù zé","The review of these research projects is handled by five experts.","La evaluación de estos proyectos de investigación científica está a cargo de cinco expertos.","L'évaluation de ces projets de recherche est confiée à cinq experts."],["L7-3150","评委","píngwěi","N","judge; judging panel","jurado; miembro del jurado","juré; jury","她的演唱打动了所有评委，获得了第一名。","tā de yǎn chàng dǎ dòng le suǒ yǒu píng wěi huò dé le dì yī míng","Her singing moved all the judges, and she won first place.","Su interpretación conmovió a todos los jurados y ganó el primer lugar.","Son interprétation a ému tous les membres du jury et elle a remporté la première place."],["L7-3151","凭借","píngjiè","V","to rely on; by means of","apoyarse en; gracias a","s'appuyer sur; grâce à","她的表演没有刻意煽情，却凭借细腻的神态打动了观众。","tā de biǎo yǎn méi yǒu kè yì shān qíng què píng jiè xì nì de shén tài dǎ dòng le guān zhòng","Her performance avoided deliberate sentimentality, yet moved the audience through subtle expressions.","Su actuación no buscó deliberadamente el sentimentalismo, pero conmovió al público con la sutileza de sus gestos.","Son jeu ne cherchait pas délibérément à faire pleurer, mais il a ému le public par la subtilité de ses expressions."],["L7-3152","凭着","píngzhe","","relying on; based on","basándose en; gracias a","en se fondant sur; grâce à","他凭着多年的经验，很快找到了机器的故障。","tā píng zhe duō nián de jīng yàn hěn kuài zhǎo dào le jī qì de gù zhàng","Relying on years of experience, he quickly found the machine's fault.","Gracias a sus muchos años de experiencia, encontró enseguida la avería de la máquina.","Fort de ses années d'expérience, il a vite trouvé la panne de la machine."],["L7-3153","凭证","píngzhèng","N","proof; voucher","comprobante; justificante","preuve; justificatif","请妥善保存购物凭证，以便商品出现瑕疵时申请退换。","qǐng tuǒ shàn bǎo cún gòu wù píng zhèng yǐ biàn shāng pǐn chū xiàn xiá cī shí shēn qǐng tuì huàn","Please keep your proof of purchase so that you can request a return or exchange if the product has a defect.","Conserve bien su comprobante de compra para poder solicitar un cambio o devolución si el producto presenta algún defecto.","Veuillez conserver soigneusement votre justificatif d'achat afin de pouvoir demander un retour ou un échange en cas de défaut du produit."],["L7-3154","瓶颈","píngjǐng","N","bottleneck","cuello de botella","goulot d'étranglement","公司的发展遇到了瓶颈，急需新的技术突破。","gōng sī de fā zhǎn yù dào le píng jǐng jí xū xīn de jì shù tū pò","The company's growth has hit a bottleneck and urgently needs a new technological breakthrough.","El crecimiento de la empresa ha llegado a un cuello de botella y necesita con urgencia un nuevo avance tecnológico.","La croissance de l'entreprise a atteint un goulot d'étranglement et a un besoin urgent d'une nouvelle percée technologique."],["L7-3155","萍水相逢","píngshuǐ-xiāngféng","","to meet by chance as strangers","encontrarse por casualidad entre desconocidos","se rencontrer par hasard entre inconnus","我们虽然萍水相逢，但他却热情地帮了我很大的忙。","wǒ men suī rán píng shuǐ xiāng féng dàn tā què rè qíng de bāng le wǒ hěn dà de máng","Although we had only met by chance, he warmly helped me a great deal.","Aunque nos conocimos por casualidad, él me ayudó muchísimo con gran amabilidad.","Bien que nous ne nous soyons rencontrés que par hasard, il m'a rendu un grand service avec chaleur."],["L7-3156","泼冷水","pō lěngshuǐ","","to dampen enthusiasm","aguar el entusiasmo","doucher l'enthousiasme","孩子想学画画，你别总给他泼冷水。","hái zi xiǎng xué huà huà nǐ bié zǒng gěi tā pō lěng shuǐ","Your child wants to learn to paint, so stop pouring cold water on the idea.","Tu hijo quiere aprender a pintar; no le eches siempre agua fría al entusiasmo.","Ton enfant veut apprendre à peindre ; ne lui jette pas toujours de l'eau froide sur l'enthousiasme."],["L7-3157","颇","pō","Adv","quite; rather","bastante; más bien","assez; plutôt","这本小说在年轻读者中颇受欢迎。","zhè běn xiǎo shuō zài nián qīng dú zhě zhōng pō shòu huān yíng","This novel is quite popular among young readers.","Esta novela es bastante popular entre los lectores jóvenes.","Ce roman est assez populaire auprès des jeunes lecteurs."],["L7-3158","迫不及待","pòbùjídài","","impatient; eager","impaciente; ansioso","impatient; avide","一放假，孩子们就迫不及待地跑到海边去玩。","yí fàng jià hái zi men jiù pò bù jí dài de pǎo dào hǎi biān qù wán","As soon as the holidays started, the children couldn't wait to run off to the beach.","En cuanto comenzaron las vacaciones, los niños corrieron impacientes a jugar a la playa.","Dès le début des vacances, les enfants ont couru, impatients, jouer au bord de la mer."],["L7-3159","迫害","pòhài","V","to persecute","perseguir","persécuter","这位作家年轻时曾因为发表文章而受到迫害。","zhè wèi zuò jiā nián qīng shí céng yīn wèi fā biǎo wén zhāng ér shòu dào pò hài","When he was young, this writer was persecuted for publishing his articles.","Cuando era joven, este escritor fue perseguido por publicar sus artículos.","Dans sa jeunesse, cet écrivain a été persécuté pour avoir publié ses articles."],["L7-3160","迫使","pòshǐ","V","to force; to compel","obligar; forzar","forcer; contraindre","这轮产业转型既带来了新的机遇，也迫使企业重新审视劳动力的配置。","zhè lún chǎn yè zhuǎn xíng jì dài lái le xīn de jī yù yě pò shǐ qǐ yè chóng xīn shěn shì láo dòng lì de pèi zhì","This round of industrial transformation has created new opportunities while compelling companies to reconsider how they allocate their workforce.","Esta ola de transformación industrial ha traído nuevas oportunidades, pero también obliga a las empresas a replantearse la distribución de su fuerza laboral.","Cette vague de transformation industrielle a apporté de nouvelles opportunités, mais oblige aussi les entreprises à repenser la répartition de leur main-d'œuvre."],["L7-3161","破案","pò'àn","","to solve a case","resolver un caso","résoudre une affaire","警方只用了三天就破案了，抓住了犯罪嫌疑人。","jǐng fāng zhǐ yòng le sān tiān jiù pò àn le zhuā zhù le fàn zuì xián yí rén","The police solved the case in just three days and caught the suspect.","La policía resolvió el caso en solo tres días y capturó al sospechoso.","La police a résolu l'affaire en trois jours seulement et arrêté le suspect."],["L7-3162","破除","pòchú","V","to eliminate; to do away with","eliminar; acabar con","éliminer; en finir avec","我们要破除迷信，相信科学。","wǒ men yào pò chú mí xìn xiāng xìn kē xué","We should do away with superstition and believe in science.","Debemos erradicar la superstición y creer en la ciencia.","Il faut en finir avec la superstition et croire en la science."],["L7-3163","破解","pòjiě","V","to decipher; to crack","descifrar; descodificar","déchiffrer; décoder","科学家们花了十几年时间才破解了这个难题。","kē xué jiā men huā le shí jǐ nián shí jiān cái pò jiě le zhè ge nán tí","Scientists spent over a decade cracking this difficult problem.","Los científicos tardaron más de diez años en resolver este difícil problema.","Les scientifiques ont mis plus de dix ans à résoudre ce problème difficile."],["L7-3164","破旧","pòjiù","Adj","shabby; worn","desgastado; viejo","miteux; usé","他开着一辆破旧的小货车，每天往城里送菜。","tā kāi zhe yí liàng pò jiù de xiǎo huò chē měi tiān wǎng chéng lǐ sòng cài","He drives a battered old van, delivering vegetables to the city every day.","Conduce una vieja camioneta destartalada y todos los días lleva verduras a la ciudad.","Il conduit une vieille camionnette déglinguée et livre chaque jour des légumes en ville."],["L7-3165","破裂","pòliè","V","to rupture; to break down","romperse; fracasar","se rompre; échouer","由于价格谈不拢，双方的谈判破裂了。","yóu yú jià gé tán bù lǒng shuāng fāng de tán pàn pò liè le","Because they couldn't agree on a price, the negotiations between the two sides broke down.","Como no lograron ponerse de acuerdo en el precio, las negociaciones entre las dos partes se rompieron.","Faute d'accord sur le prix, les négociations entre les deux parties ont échoué."],["L7-3166","破灭","pòmiè","V","to be shattered (hopes)","desvanecerse; frustrarse","s'effondrer; s'évanouir","公司倒闭以后，他发财的梦想彻底破灭了。","gōng sī dǎo bì yǐ hòu tā fā cái de mèng xiǎng chè dǐ pò miè le","After the company went bankrupt, his dream of getting rich was completely shattered.","Después de la quiebra de la empresa, su sueño de hacerse rico se desvaneció por completo.","Après la faillite de l'entreprise, son rêve de s'enrichir s'est complètement brisé."],["L7-3167","破碎","pòsuì","V","to shatter; broken","romper en pedazos; roto","briser; brisé","花瓶从桌上掉下来，破碎的瓷片散落了一地。","huā píng cóng zhuō shàng diào xià lái pò suì de cí piàn sàn luò le yí dì","The vase fell off the table, scattering broken pieces of porcelain all over the floor.","El jarrón cayó de la mesa y los pedazos rotos de porcelana quedaron esparcidos por todo el suelo.","Le vase est tombé de la table et les morceaux de porcelaine brisée se sont éparpillés sur le sol."],["L7-3168","魄力","pòlì","N","courage; boldness","valentía; audacia","courage; audace","新来的校长很有魄力，上任不久就进行了一系列改革。","xīn lái de xiào zhǎng hěn yǒu pò lì shàng rèn bù jiǔ jiù jìn xíng le yí xì liè gǎi gé","The new principal is very bold and carried out a series of reforms soon after taking office.","El nuevo director tiene mucha determinación y poco después de asumir el cargo llevó a cabo una serie de reformas.","Le nouveau directeur a beaucoup de poigne et a mené une série de réformes peu après sa prise de fonctions."],["L7-3169","扑克","pūkè","N","poker; playing cards","póker; naipes","poker; cartes à jouer","过年的时候，一家人围在一起打扑克。","guò nián de shí hou yì jiā rén wéi zài yì qǐ dǎ pū kè","At New Year, the family sits around together playing cards.","En Año Nuevo, la familia se reúne a jugar a las cartas.","Au Nouvel An, la famille se réunit pour jouer aux cartes."],["L7-3170","扑面而来","pūmiàn-érlái","","to hit one in the face","golpear de frente","frapper de plein fouet","一走出机场，一股热浪就扑面而来。","yì zǒu chū jī chǎng yì gǔ rè làng jiù pū miàn ér lái","As soon as we walked out of the airport, a wave of heat hit us in the face.","Apenas salimos del aeropuerto, una ola de calor nos golpeó en la cara.","À peine sortis de l'aéroport, une vague de chaleur nous a frappés au visage."],["L7-3171","铺路","pūlù","","to pave; to lay the groundwork","pavimentar; sentar las bases","paver; préparer le terrain","老人捐出了自己的积蓄，为村里修桥铺路。","lǎo rén juān chū le zì jǐ de jī xù wèi cūn lǐ xiū qiáo pū lù","The old man donated his savings to build bridges and pave roads for the village.","El anciano donó todos sus ahorros para construir puentes y caminos en el pueblo.","Le vieil homme a fait don de toutes ses économies pour construire des ponts et paver des routes dans le village."],["L7-3172","菩萨","púsà","N","Bodhisattva","bodisatva","bodhisattva","寺庙的大殿里供奉着一尊菩萨像。","sì miào de dà diàn lǐ gòng fèng zhe yì zūn pú sà xiàng","A statue of a bodhisattva is enshrined in the temple's main hall.","En el salón principal del templo se venera una estatua de un bodhisattva.","Dans la grande salle du temple est vénérée une statue de bodhisattva."],["L7-3173","朴实","pǔshí","Adj","simple; honest","sencillo; honesto","simple; honnête","这位领导作风朴实，深受大家欢迎。","zhè wèi lǐng dǎo zuò fēng pǔ shí shēn shòu dà jiā huān yíng","This leader has a down-to-earth style and is very popular.","Este dirigente tiene un estilo sencillo y es muy querido por todos.","Ce dirigeant a un style simple et sans prétention et il est très apprécié de tous."],["L7-3174","朴素","pǔsù","Adj","plain; simple","sencillo; sobrio","simple; sobre","这套家具外观朴素，做工却很精细，放在小客厅里也不显笨重。","zhè tào jiā jù wài guān pǔ sù zuò gōng què hěn jīng xì fàng zài xiǎo kè tīng lǐ yě bù xiǎn bèn zhòng","This set of furniture looks plain but is finely made and does not appear bulky even in a small living room.","Este juego de muebles tiene un aspecto sencillo pero está muy bien hecho, y no se ve pesado ni siquiera en una sala pequeña.","Ce mobilier a un aspect sobre mais est très finement fabriqué, et il ne paraît pas lourd même dans un petit salon."],["L7-3175","普通人","pǔtōng rén","","ordinary person","persona común","personne ordinaire","他虽然是名人，但生活和普通人没什么两样。","tā suī rán shì míng rén dàn shēng huó hé pǔ tōng rén méi shén me liǎng yàng","Although he is famous, his life is no different from an ordinary person's.","Aunque es una persona famosa, su vida no es diferente a la de la gente común.","Bien qu'il soit célèbre, sa vie ne diffère en rien de celle des gens ordinaires."],["L7-3176","谱","pǔ","V/N","score; chart; list","partitura; tabla; lista","partition; tableau; liste","她弹钢琴的时候从来不用看谱。","tā tán gāng qín de shí hou cóng lái bú yòng kàn pǔ","She never needs to look at the sheet music when she plays the piano.","Cuando toca el piano, nunca necesita mirar la partitura.","Quand elle joue du piano, elle n'a jamais besoin de regarder la partition."],["L7-3177","瀑布","pùbù","N","waterfall","cascada","cascade","从山上流下来的瀑布有一百多米高。","cóng shān shàng liú xià lái de pù bù yǒu yì bǎi duō mǐ gāo","The waterfall flowing down from the mountain is more than a hundred meters high.","La cascada que cae desde la montaña tiene más de cien metros de altura.","La cascade qui dévale la montagne mesure plus de cent mètres de haut."],["L7-3178","七嘴八舌","qīzuǐ-bāshé","","everyone talking at once","todos hablando a la vez","tout le monde parlant en même temps","听说要去春游，同学们七嘴八舌地讨论去哪儿玩。","tīng shuō yào qù chūn yóu tóng xué men qī zuǐ bā shé de tǎo lùn qù nǎr wán","Hearing about the spring outing, the students all chimed in at once discussing where to go.","Al enterarse de que iban a salir de excursión de primavera, los compañeros discutían todos a la vez adónde ir.","En apprenant qu'il y aurait une sortie de printemps, les élèves discutaient à qui mieux mieux de l'endroit où aller."],["L7-3179","沏","qī","V","to steep (tea)","preparar (té)","infuser (du thé)","客人一进门，妈妈就给他们沏了一壶热茶。","kè rén yí jìn mén mā ma jiù gěi tā men qī le yì hú rè chá","As soon as the guests came in, Mom made them a pot of hot tea.","En cuanto entraron los invitados, mamá les preparó una tetera de té caliente.","Dès l'entrée des invités, maman leur a préparé une théière de thé chaud."],["L7-3180","凄凉","qīliáng","Adj","desolate; miserable","desolado; lastimoso","désolé; lugubre","老房子空了很多年，院子里显得十分凄凉。","lǎo fáng zi kōng le hěn duō nián yuàn zi lǐ xiǎn de shí fēn qī liáng","The old house has been empty for many years, and the courtyard looks very desolate.","La vieja casa lleva muchos años vacía y el patio se ve muy desolado.","La vieille maison est vide depuis de nombreuses années et la cour paraît très désolée."],["L7-3181","期盼","qīpàn","V","to look forward to","esperar con ilusión","attendre avec impatience","全家人都在期盼着他平安归来。","quán jiā rén dōu zài qī pàn zhe tā píng ān guī lái","The whole family is longing for his safe return.","Toda la familia espera con ansias que regrese sano y salvo.","Toute la famille attend avec impatience qu'il revienne sain et sauf."],["L7-3182","欺骗","qīpiàn","V","to deceive; to cheat","engañar","tromper","他一时糊涂，被那些花言巧语所欺骗。","tā yì shí hú tu bèi nà xiē huā yán qiǎo yǔ suǒ qī piàn","In a moment of confusion, he was taken in by those sweet words.","En un momento de confusión, se dejó engañar por aquellas palabras zalameras.","Dans un moment d'égarement, il s'est laissé abuser par ces belles paroles."],["L7-3183","欺诈","qīzhà","V","to cheat; to swindle","estafar; defraudar","escroquer; frauder","消费者如果遇到商家欺诈，可以要求赔偿。","xiāo fèi zhě rú guǒ yù dào shāng jiā qī zhà kě yǐ yāo qiú péi cháng","If consumers encounter fraud by a merchant, they can demand compensation.","Si los consumidores son víctimas de un fraude por parte de un comerciante, pueden exigir una indemnización.","Si les consommateurs sont victimes de la fraude d'un commerçant, ils peuvent exiger réparation."],["L7-3184","漆","qī","N/V","paint; lacquer; to paint","pintura; laca; pintar","peinture; laque; peindre","铁门好几年没刷漆，都锈了。","tiě mén hǎo jǐ nián méi shuā qī dōu xiù le","The iron gate hasn't been painted for years and has rusted.","La puerta de hierro lleva varios años sin repintarse y está oxidada.","Le portail en fer n'a pas été repeint depuis des années et il est rouillé."],["L7-3185","齐心协力","qíxīn-xiélì","","to work together as one","unir esfuerzos","unir ses efforts","他们握紧船桨，齐心协力把小船划向对岸。","tā men wò jǐn chuán jiǎng qí xīn xié lì bǎ xiǎo chuán huá xiàng duì àn","They gripped the oars and worked together to row the little boat to the opposite bank.","Agarraron con fuerza los remos y, uniendo esfuerzos, remaron el bote hasta la otra orilla.","Ils ont serré les rames et, unissant leurs efforts, ont ramé le petit bateau jusqu'à l'autre rive."],["L7-3186","其后","qíhòu","N","afterwards; later","después; más tarde","ensuite; plus tard","他先在北京读完大学，其后又去国外深造。","tā xiān zài běi jīng dú wán dà xué qí hòu yòu qù guó wài shēn zào","He first finished university in Beijing and later went abroad for further study.","Primero terminó la universidad en Beijing y luego se fue al extranjero a seguir estudiando.","Il a d'abord terminé ses études universitaires à Pékin, puis est parti se perfectionner à l'étranger."],["L7-3187","其间","qíjiān","N","meanwhile; in between","durante ese tiempo; entre tanto","entre-temps; pendant ce temps","他在国外生活了十年，其间只回过两次国。","tā zài guó wài shēng huó le shí nián qí jiān zhǐ huí guo liǎng cì guó","He lived abroad for ten years, during which he came back only twice.","Vivió diez años en el extranjero y durante ese tiempo solo regresó al país dos veces.","Il a vécu dix ans à l'étranger et, pendant ce temps, n'est rentré au pays que deux fois."],["L7-3188","奇花异草","qíhuā-yìcǎo","","rare and exotic plants","plantas raras y exóticas","plantes rares et exotiques","这座植物园里种满了来自世界各地的奇花异草。","zhè zuò zhí wù yuán lǐ zhòng mǎn le lái zì shì jiè gè dì de qí huā yì cǎo","This botanical garden is full of exotic flowers and plants from all over the world.","Este jardín botánico está lleno de flores y plantas exóticas de todo el mundo.","Ce jardin botanique regorge de fleurs et de plantes rares venues du monde entier."],["L7-3189","奇迹","qíjì","N","miracle; wonder","milagro; maravilla","miracle; merveille","医生都说他能活下来真是一个奇迹。","yī shēng dōu shuō tā néng huó xià lái zhēn shì yí ge qí jì","The doctors all said it was a miracle that he survived.","Los médicos dijeron que su supervivencia fue un verdadero milagro.","Tous les médecins ont dit que sa survie était un véritable miracle."],["L7-3190","奇特","qítè","Adj","peculiar; unusual","peculiar; inusual","singulier; insolite","这座建筑的外形十分奇特，像一朵正在开放的花。","zhè zuò jiàn zhù de wài xíng shí fēn qí tè xiàng yì duǒ zhèng zài kāi fàng de huā","The building has a very unusual shape, like a flower in bloom.","Este edificio tiene una forma muy singular, como una flor que se abre.","Ce bâtiment a une forme très singulière, comme une fleur en train d'éclore."],["L7-3191","歧视","qíshì","V","to discriminate against","discriminar","discriminer","公司在招聘时不得有性别歧视。","gōng sī zài zhāo pìn shí bù dé yǒu xìng bié qí shì","Companies must not discriminate on the basis of gender when hiring.","Las empresas no deben discriminar por razón de género al contratar personal.","Les entreprises ne doivent pas pratiquer de discrimination fondée sur le sexe lors du recrutement."],["L7-3192","祈祷","qídǎo","V","to pray; prayer","rezar; oración","prier; prière","她双手合十，默默地为生病的母亲祈祷。","tā shuāng shǒu hé shí mò mò de wèi shēng bìng de mǔ qīn qí dǎo","Palms pressed together, she prayed silently for her sick mother.","Juntó las manos y rezó en silencio por su madre enferma.","Les mains jointes, elle priait en silence pour sa mère malade."],["L7-3193","棋","qí","N","chess; board game","ajedrez; juego de mesa","échecs; jeu de plateau","这盘棋他们已经下了两个多小时，还没分出胜负。","zhè pán qí tā men yǐ jīng xià le liǎng gè duō xiǎo shí hái méi fēn chū shèng fù","They have been playing this game of chess for over two hours and still haven't decided a winner.","Llevan más de dos horas jugando esta partida de ajedrez y todavía no hay un ganador.","Ils jouent cette partie d'échecs depuis plus de deux heures sans qu'un vainqueur se dégage."],["L7-3194","棋子","qízǐ","N","chess piece; pawn","pieza de ajedrez; peón","pièce d'échecs; pion","小孙子不小心把棋子撒了一地。","xiǎo sūn zi bù xiǎo xīn bǎ qí zǐ sǎ le yí dì","The little grandson accidentally scattered the chess pieces all over the floor.","Sin querer, el nietecito tiró todas las fichas de ajedrez al suelo.","Le petit-fils a accidentellement renversé tous les pions par terre."],["L7-3195","旗袍","qípáo","N","qipao; cheongsam","qipao; cheongsam","qipao; cheongsam","她在裁缝店定做了一件结婚穿的旗袍。","tā zài cái féng diàn dìng zuò le yí jiàn jié hūn chuān de qí páo","She had a qipao made to order at a tailor's shop for her wedding.","Mandó hacer a medida en una sastrería un qipao para llevar en su boda.","Elle a fait faire sur mesure chez un tailleur un qipao pour son mariage."],["L7-3196","旗帜","qízhì","N","flag; banner","bandera; estandarte","drapeau; bannière","运动会开幕式上，各国的旗帜在空中飘扬。","yùn dòng huì kāi mù shì shàng gè guó de qí zhì zài kōng zhōng piāo yáng","At the opening ceremony of the games, the flags of every nation fluttered in the air.","En la ceremonia de inauguración de los juegos, las banderas de todos los países ondeaban en el aire.","À la cérémonie d'ouverture des jeux, les drapeaux de tous les pays flottaient dans les airs."],["L7-3197","乞丐","qǐgài","N","beggar","mendigo","mendiant","小说里的主人公从一个乞丐变成了富商。","xiǎo shuō lǐ de zhǔ rén gōng cóng yí ge qǐ gài biàn chéng le fù shāng","The novel's hero rises from beggar to wealthy merchant.","El protagonista de la novela pasa de ser un mendigo a un rico comerciante.","Le héros du roman passe de mendiant à riche marchand."],["L7-3198","乞求","qǐqiú","V","to beg","suplicar; implorar","supplier; implorer","他跪在地上，乞求对方原谅自己。","tā guì zài dì shang qǐ qiú duì fāng yuán liàng zì jǐ","He knelt on the ground and begged the other person for forgiveness.","Se arrodilló en el suelo y le suplicó a la otra persona que lo perdonara.","Il s'est agenouillé par terre et a supplié l'autre de lui pardonner."],["L7-3199","乞讨","qǐtǎo","V","to beg","mendigar","mendier","灾荒年间，很多人不得不外出乞讨。","zāi huāng nián jiān hěn duō rén bù dé bú wài chū qǐ tǎo","In years of famine, many people were forced to go out begging.","En los años de hambruna, mucha gente se vio obligada a salir a pedir limosna.","Pendant les années de famine, beaucoup de gens ont été contraints d'aller mendier."],["L7-3200","岂有此理","qǐyǒucǐlǐ","","preposterous; outrageous","absurdo; indignante","absurde; scandaleux","他不但不道歉，还反过来骂人，真是岂有此理！","tā bú dàn bú dào qiàn hái fǎn guò lái mà rén zhēn shì qǐ yǒu cǐ lǐ","Not only did he refuse to apologize, he turned around and cursed at people — how outrageous!","No solo no se disculpó, sino que además se puso a insultar a la gente. ¡Qué descaro!","Non seulement il ne s'est pas excusé, mais il s'est mis à injurier les gens en retour : c'est inadmissible !"],["L7-3201","启迪","qǐdí","V","to enlighten","iluminar; inspirar","éclairer; inspirer","这本书给了我很多关于人生的启迪。","zhè běn shū gěi le wǒ hěn duō guān yú rén shēng de qǐ dí","This book gave me a lot of insight into life.","Este libro me dio muchas ideas esclarecedoras sobre la vida.","Ce livre m'a beaucoup éclairé sur la vie."],["L7-3202","启蒙","qǐméng","V","to enlighten; to instruct beginners","iniciar; ilustrar","initier; éclairer","爷爷是我书法的启蒙老师。","yé ye shì wǒ shū fǎ de qǐ méng lǎo shī","Grandpa was the teacher who first introduced me to calligraphy.","El abuelo fue mi primer maestro de caligrafía.","Grand-père a été mon premier professeur de calligraphie."],["L7-3203","启示","qǐshì","V/N","enlightenment; revelation","revelación; inspiración","révélation; enseignement","这次失败给了我们一个重要的启示：做事不能急于求成。","zhè cì shī bài gěi le wǒ men yí ge zhòng yào de qǐ shì zuò shì bù néng jí yú qiú chéng","This failure taught us an important lesson: don't be too eager for quick success.","Este fracaso nos dejó una enseñanza importante: no se puede ser impaciente por obtener resultados rápidos.","Cet échec nous a donné une leçon importante : il ne faut pas être trop pressé d'obtenir des résultats."],["L7-3204","起步","qǐbù","V","to start; to begin","comenzar; arrancar","commencer; démarrer","我国的这项研究起步较晚，但发展得非常快。","wǒ guó de zhè xiàng yán jiū qǐ bù jiào wǎn dàn fā zhǎn de fēi cháng kuài","Our country's research in this area started relatively late but has developed very quickly.","Esta investigación en nuestro país empezó relativamente tarde, pero se ha desarrollado muy rápido.","Les recherches de notre pays dans ce domaine ont débuté assez tard, mais elles se sont développées très vite."],["L7-3205","起草","qǐcǎo","","to draft","redactar un borrador","rédiger un brouillon","秘书正在为经理起草一份发言稿。","mì shū zhèng zài wèi jīng lǐ qǐ cǎo yí fèn fā yán gǎo","The secretary is drafting a speech for the manager.","La secretaria está redactando un borrador del discurso para el gerente.","La secrétaire est en train de rédiger un brouillon de discours pour le directeur."],["L7-3206","起程","qǐchéng","V","to set out","ponerse en marcha","se mettre en route","代表团明天一早起程前往上海。","dài biǎo tuán míng tiān yì zǎo qǐ chéng qián wǎng shàng hǎi","The delegation will set out for Shanghai early tomorrow morning.","La delegación partirá mañana a primera hora hacia Shanghái.","La délégation partira demain de bon matin pour Shanghai."],["L7-3207","起初","qǐchū","N","at first; originally","al principio; originalmente","au début; à l'origine","起初我并不喜欢这份工作，后来才慢慢爱上了它。","qǐ chū wǒ bìng bù xǐ huan zhè fèn gōng zuò hòu lái cái màn màn ài shàng le tā","At first I didn't like this job, but I gradually came to love it.","Al principio no me gustaba este trabajo, pero poco a poco terminé por amarlo.","Au début, je n'aimais pas ce travail, puis j'ai fini par l'adorer peu à peu."],["L7-3208","起伏","qǐfú","V","to undulate; ups and downs","ondular; altibajos","onduler; hauts et bas","火车穿过高低起伏的群山，向西开去。","huǒ chē chuān guò gāo dī qǐ fú de qún shān xiàng xī kāi qù","The train headed west through the rolling mountains.","El tren atravesó montañas de relieve ondulado rumbo al oeste.","Le train a traversé des montagnes aux reliefs accidentés en direction de l'ouest."],["L7-3209","起劲","qǐjìn","Adj","energetic; enthusiastic","enérgico; entusiasta","énergique; enthousiaste","孩子们在雪地里玩得正起劲，谁也不想回家。","hái zi men zài xuě dì lǐ wán de zhèng qǐ jìn shéi yě bù xiǎng huí jiā","The children were having a great time in the snow, and none of them wanted to go home.","Los niños estaban jugando muy entusiasmados en la nieve y nadie quería volver a casa.","Les enfants s'amusaient avec entrain dans la neige et personne ne voulait rentrer."],["L7-3210","起跑线","qǐpǎoxiàn","N","starting line","línea de salida","ligne de départ","不少家长担心孩子输在起跑线上。","bù shǎo jiā zhǎng dān xīn hái zi shū zài qǐ pǎo xiàn shàng","Many parents worry that their children will fall behind right from the starting line.","A muchos padres les preocupa que sus hijos partan en desventaja desde la línea de salida.","De nombreux parents craignent que leurs enfants soient déjà distancés dès la ligne de départ."],["L7-3211","起源","qǐyuán","V/N","origin; to originate","origen; originarse","origine; provenir","科学家们一直在探求生命起源的奥秘。","kē xué jiā men yì zhí zài tàn qiú shēng mìng qǐ yuán de ào mì","Scientists have long been seeking the secrets of the origin of life.","Los científicos llevan mucho tiempo buscando los secretos del origen de la vida.","Les scientifiques cherchent depuis longtemps à percer les mystères de l'origine de la vie."],["L7-3212","气愤","qìfèn","Adj","furious; indignant","furioso; indignado","furieux; indigné","听说有人在网上造谣，他感到非常气愤。","tīng shuō yǒu rén zài wǎng shàng zào yáo tā gǎn dào fēi cháng qì fèn","Hearing that someone was spreading rumors online, he was furious.","Al enterarse de que alguien difundía rumores en internet, se puso furioso.","En apprenant que quelqu'un répandait des rumeurs sur Internet, il était furieux."],["L7-3213","气管","qìguǎn","N","windpipe; trachea","tráquea","trachée","他的气管不太好，一到冬天就咳嗽。","tā de qì guǎn bú tài hǎo yí dào dōng tiān jiù ké sou","He has problems with his trachea and coughs every winter.","Tiene problemas en la tráquea y tose cada vez que llega el invierno.","Il a la trachée fragile et tousse dès que l'hiver arrive."],["L7-3214","气馁","qìněi","Adj","to be discouraged","desanimarse","se décourager","这次没考好不要气馁，下次再努力就是了。","zhè cì méi kǎo hǎo bú yào qì něi xià cì zài nǔ lì jiù shì le","Don't be discouraged by doing badly this time; just try harder next time.","No te desanimes por no haber salido bien esta vez; esfuérzate más la próxima.","Ne te décourage pas parce que tu as raté cette fois ; fais simplement plus d'efforts la prochaine fois."],["L7-3215","气派","qìpài","N/Adj","imposing; stylish","imponente; elegante","imposant; élégant","新建的火车站非常气派，吸引了很多人来拍照。","xīn jiàn de huǒ chē zhàn fēi cháng qì pài xī yǐn le hěn duō rén lái pāi zhào","The newly built railway station is very impressive and attracts many people to take photos.","La nueva estación de tren es muy imponente y atrae a mucha gente que viene a tomarse fotos.","La nouvelle gare est très imposante et attire beaucoup de gens qui viennent la photographier."],["L7-3216","气泡","qìpào","N","bubble","burbuja","bulle","鱼缸里不断冒出小小的气泡。","yú gāng lǐ bú duàn mào chū xiǎo xiǎo de qì pào","Small bubbles keep rising in the fish tank.","En la pecera suben burbujitas sin parar.","De petites bulles montent sans cesse dans l'aquarium."],["L7-3217","气魄","qìpò","N","boldness; grandeur","audacia; grandeza","audace; grandeur","这座大桥的设计很有气魄，横跨整个海湾。","zhè zuò dà qiáo de shè jì hěn yǒu qì pò héng kuà zhěng gè hǎi wān","The bridge's design is bold and grand, spanning the entire bay.","El diseño de este puente es audaz y grandioso, y atraviesa toda la bahía.","La conception de ce pont est audacieuse et grandiose : il enjambe toute la baie."],["L7-3218","气势","qìshì","N","imposing manner; momentum","imponencia; ímpetu","allure imposante; élan","从远处看，这道瀑布气势磅礴，非常壮观。","cóng yuǎn chù kàn zhè dào pù bù qì shì páng bó fēi cháng zhuàng guān","Seen from a distance, this waterfall is majestic and spectacular.","Vista desde lejos, esta cascada es imponente y espectacular.","Vue de loin, cette cascade est majestueuse et vraiment spectaculaire."],["L7-3219","气味","qìwèi","N","smell; odor","olor","odeur","下水道里满是污秽的东西，气味很难闻。","xià shuǐ dào lǐ mǎn shì wū huì de dōng xi qì wèi hěn nán wén","The sewer is full of filthy things and smells terrible.","La alcantarilla está llena de porquería y huele muy mal.","Les égouts sont pleins d'immondices et sentent très mauvais."],["L7-3220","气息","qìxī","N","breath; smell; flavor","aliento; olor; aire","souffle; odeur; atmosphère","一走进这条老街，就能感受到浓浓的生活气息。","yì zǒu jìn zhè tiáo lǎo jiē jiù néng gǎn shòu dào nóng nóng de shēng huó qì xī","As soon as you step onto this old street, you can feel the strong flavor of everyday life.","En cuanto entras en esta calle antigua, se siente intensamente el ambiente de la vida cotidiana.","Dès qu'on entre dans cette vieille rue, on y sent une forte atmosphère de vie quotidienne."],["L7-3221","气质","qìzhì","N","temperament; disposition","temperamento; carácter","tempérament; caractère","她举止优雅，说话温和，很有气质。","tā jǔ zhǐ yōu yǎ shuō huà wēn hé hěn yǒu qì zhì","She carries herself gracefully, speaks gently and has real poise.","Tiene modales elegantes, habla con suavidad y mucha distinción.","Elle a des manières élégantes, parle avec douceur et beaucoup de classe."],["L7-3222","迄今","qìjīn","V","so far; to date","hasta ahora","jusqu'à présent","这座古桥迄今已有八百多年的历史。","zhè zuò gǔ qiáo qì jīn yǐ yǒu bā bǎi duō nián de lì shǐ","This ancient bridge has a history of more than eight hundred years to date.","Este puente antiguo tiene hasta hoy más de ochocientos años de historia.","Ce vieux pont a, à ce jour, plus de huit cents ans d'histoire."],["L7-3223","迄今为止","qìjīn-wéizhǐ","","so far; up to now","hasta la fecha","jusqu'à présent","迄今为止，还没有人能打破他创造的纪录。","qì jīn wéi zhǐ hái méi yǒu rén néng dǎ pò tā chuàng zào de jì lù","So far, no one has been able to break the record he set.","Hasta ahora, nadie ha podido batir el récord que estableció.","Jusqu'à présent, personne n'a pu battre le record qu'il a établi."],["L7-3224","契机","qìjī","N","opportunity; turning point","oportunidad; punto de inflexión","occasion; tournant","这次合作成了两家公司共同发展的契机。","zhè cì hé zuò chéng le liǎng jiā gōng sī gòng tóng fā zhǎn de qì jī","This cooperation became a turning point for the joint development of the two companies.","Esta colaboración fue la oportunidad para el desarrollo conjunto de las dos empresas.","Cette coopération a été l'occasion d'un développement commun pour les deux entreprises."],["L7-3225","契约","qìyuē","N","contract; agreement","contrato; acuerdo","contrat; accord","双方签订了契约，明确了各自的权利和义务。","shuāng fāng qiān dìng le qì yuē míng què le gè zì de quán lì hé yì wù","The two parties signed a contract specifying their respective rights and obligations.","Las dos partes firmaron un contrato en el que se especificaban sus respectivos derechos y obligaciones.","Les deux parties ont signé un contrat précisant leurs droits et obligations respectifs."],["L7-3226","器材","qìcái","N","equipment","equipo; material","équipement; matériel","学校新买了一批体育器材，供学生课外使用。","xué xiào xīn mǎi le yì pī tǐ yù qì cái gōng xué shēng kè wài shǐ yòng","The school bought a batch of new sports equipment for students to use outside class.","La escuela compró un lote de equipo deportivo nuevo para que los alumnos lo usen fuera de clase.","L'école a acheté un lot de nouveau matériel de sport que les élèves peuvent utiliser en dehors des cours."],["L7-3227","器械","qìxiè","N","apparatus; equipment","aparato; instrumental","appareil; instrument","这家医院引进了一批先进的医疗器械。","zhè jiā yī yuàn yǐn jìn le yì pī xiān jìn de yī liáo qì xiè","This hospital has brought in a batch of advanced medical instruments.","Este hospital incorporó una serie de equipos médicos avanzados.","Cet hôpital a acquis une série d'appareils médicaux de pointe."],["L7-3228","掐","qiā","V","to pinch; to pick","pellizcar; arrancar","pincer; cueillir","他掐了一下自己的胳膊，确认不是在做梦。","tā qiā le yí xià zì jǐ de gē bo què rèn bú shì zài zuò mèng","He pinched his own arm to make sure he wasn't dreaming.","Se pellizcó el brazo para comprobar que no estaba soñando.","Il s'est pincé le bras pour s'assurer qu'il ne rêvait pas."],["L7-3229","卡","qiǎ","V","to get stuck; checkpoint; clip","atascar; puesto de control; pinza","coincer; poste de contrôle; pince","就诊时请带好身份证和医保卡。","jiù zhěn shí qǐng dài hǎo shēn fèn zhèng hé yī bǎo kǎ","Please bring your ID card and medical insurance card when you see the doctor.","Al acudir a consulta, traiga su documento de identidad y su tarjeta del seguro médico.","Pour votre consultation, veuillez apporter votre carte d'identité et votre carte d'assurance maladie."],["L7-3230","卡子","qiǎzi","N","clip; checkpoint","pasador; puesto de control","barrette; poste de contrôle","她用一个蝴蝶形状的卡子把头发别了起来。","tā yòng yí ge hú dié xíng zhuàng de qiǎ zi bǎ tóu fa bié le qǐ lái","She pinned up her hair with a butterfly-shaped clip.","Se recogió el cabello con un broche en forma de mariposa.","Elle a relevé ses cheveux avec une barrette en forme de papillon."],["L7-3231","洽谈","qiàtán","V","to discuss; to negotiate","negociar; tratar","négocier; discuter","两家公司的代表正在会议室里洽谈合作事宜。","liǎng jiā gōng sī de dài biǎo zhèng zài huì yì shì lǐ qià tán hé zuò shì yí","Representatives of the two companies are discussing cooperation in the meeting room.","Los representantes de las dos empresas están negociando la cooperación en la sala de reuniones.","Les représentants des deux entreprises discutent de leur coopération dans la salle de réunion."],["L7-3232","恰到好处","qiàdào-hǎochù","","just right","justo en su punto","juste ce qu'il faut","这道菜咸淡恰到好处，大家都很爱吃。","zhè dào cài xián dàn qià dào hǎo chù dà jiā dōu hěn ài chī","This dish is seasoned just right, and everyone loves it.","Este platillo tiene el punto justo de sal y a todos les encanta.","Ce plat est assaisonné juste comme il faut et tout le monde l'adore."],["L7-3233","恰恰相反","qiàqià xiāngfǎn","","just the opposite","justo lo contrario","tout à fait le contraire","他并不懒，恰恰相反，他是全班最勤奋的学生。","tā bìng bù lǎn qià qià xiāng fǎn tā shì quán bān zuì qín fèn de xué shēng","He isn't lazy — quite the opposite, he's the most hardworking student in the class.","No es nada perezoso; al contrario, es el alumno más aplicado de toda la clase.","Il n'est pas paresseux du tout ; au contraire, c'est l'élève le plus travailleur de la classe."],["L7-3234","恰巧","qiàqiǎo","Adv","by chance; coincidentally","por casualidad","par hasard","我正想给他打电话，恰巧他就来了。","wǒ zhèng xiǎng gěi tā dǎ diàn huà qià qiǎo tā jiù lái le","Just as I was about to call him, he happened to show up.","Justo cuando pensaba llamarlo por teléfono, llegó él.","Au moment où j'allais l'appeler, il est justement arrivé."],["L7-3235","恰如其分","qiàrú-qífèn","","appropriate; just right","apropiado; justo","approprié; juste","老师对这篇作文的评价恰如其分。","lǎo shī duì zhè piān zuò wén de píng jià qià rú qí fèn","The teacher's assessment of this essay was entirely apt.","La valoración que hizo la maestra de esta redacción fue totalmente acertada.","L'appréciation du professeur sur cette rédaction était tout à fait juste."],["L7-3236","千变万化","qiānbiàn-wànhuà","","constantly changing","cambiante","en constante évolution","山里的天气千变万化，上山前一定要带好雨衣。","shān lǐ de tiān qì qiān biàn wàn huà shàng shān qián yí dìng yào dài hǎo yǔ yī","Mountain weather is ever-changing, so be sure to bring a raincoat before going up.","El clima en la montaña cambia constantemente, así que antes de subir hay que llevar impermeable.","Le temps en montagne est très changeant : avant de monter, pensez à prendre un imperméable."],["L7-3237","千方百计","qiānfāng-bǎijì","","by every possible means","por todos los medios","par tous les moyens","为了给孩子治病，父母千方百计筹集医药费。","wèi le gěi hái zi zhì bìng fù mǔ qiān fāng bǎi jì chóu jí yī yào fèi","To get their child treated, the parents tried every possible means to raise money for medical bills.","Para curar a su hijo, los padres hicieron todo lo posible por reunir dinero para los gastos médicos.","Pour soigner leur enfant, les parents ont tout tenté pour réunir l'argent des frais médicaux."],["L7-3238","千家万户","qiānjiā-wànhù","","every household","todos los hogares","tous les foyers","这项工程将造福千家万户。","zhè xiàng gōng chéng jiāng zào fú qiān jiā wàn hù","This project will benefit thousands of households.","Esta obra beneficiará a miles de familias.","Ce chantier profitera à des milliers de foyers."],["L7-3239","千军万马","qiānjūn-wànmǎ","","huge army; great force","gran ejército; gran multitud","grande armée; grande foule","每年高考就像千军万马过独木桥，竞争非常激烈。","měi nián gāo kǎo jiù xiàng qiān jūn wàn mǎ guò dú mù qiáo jìng zhēng fēi cháng jī liè","Every year the college entrance exam is like a vast army crossing a single-log bridge — the competition is fierce.","Cada año, el examen de ingreso a la universidad es como un ejército enorme cruzando un puente de un solo tronco: la competencia es muy dura.","Chaque année, le concours d'entrée à l'université ressemble à une armée entière traversant un pont d'un seul tronc : la concurrence est féroce."],["L7-3240","千钧一发","qiānjūn-yīfà","","hanging by a thread","pender de un hilo","tenir à un fil","在这千钧一发的时刻，消防员冲进火场救出了孩子。","zài zhè qiān jūn yí fà de shí kè xiāo fáng yuán chōng jìn huǒ chǎng jiù chū le hái zi","At that critical moment, the firefighter rushed into the fire and rescued the child.","En ese momento crítico, el bombero se lanzó al incendio y salvó al niño.","À ce moment critique, le pompier s'est précipité dans l'incendie et a sauvé l'enfant."],["L7-3241","迁","qiān","V","to move; to relocate","mudar; trasladar","déménager; déplacer","他们家去年从农村迁到了城里。","tā men jiā qù nián cóng nóng cūn qiān dào le chéng lǐ","Last year his family moved from the countryside to the city.","Su familia se mudó del campo a la ciudad el año pasado.","Sa famille a quitté la campagne pour la ville l'an dernier."],["L7-3242","迁就","qiānjiù","V","to accommodate; to yield to","acomodarse; ceder ante","s'accommoder de; céder à","父母不能什么事都迁就孩子，该拒绝的时候要拒绝。","fù mǔ bù néng shén me shì dōu qiān jiù hái zi gāi jù jué de shí hou yào jù jué","Parents can't give in to their children on everything; they must say no when necessary.","Los padres no pueden ceder ante sus hijos en todo; cuando hay que negarse, hay que negarse.","Les parents ne peuvent pas céder à leurs enfants en tout ; il faut savoir refuser quand c'est nécessaire."],["L7-3243","迁移","qiānyí","V","to migrate; to move","migrar; trasladarse","migrer; se déplacer","她善于举一反三，学会一种方法后，总能把它迁移到新的情境中。","tā shàn yú jǔ yì fǎn sān xué huì yì zhǒng fāng fǎ hòu zǒng néng bǎ tā qiān yí dào xīn de qíng jìng zhōng","She is good at drawing broader lessons: after learning one method, she can apply it in new contexts.","Es buena para extrapolar: después de aprender un método, siempre logra aplicarlo a situaciones nuevas.","Elle sait généraliser : après avoir appris une méthode, elle parvient toujours à la transposer à de nouvelles situations."],["L7-3244","牵扯","qiānchě","V","to involve; to implicate","implicar; involucrar","impliquer; mêler","这件事牵扯到好几个部门，处理起来很麻烦。","zhè jiàn shì qiān chě dào hǎo jǐ ge bù mén chǔ lǐ qǐ lái hěn má fan","This matter involves several departments, which makes it troublesome to handle.","Este asunto involucra a varios departamentos y es muy complicado de tramitar.","Cette affaire implique plusieurs services et est compliquée à traiter."],["L7-3245","牵挂","qiānguà","V","to worry about","preocuparse por","se soucier de","在外地读书的女儿让妈妈天天牵挂。","zài wài dì dú shū de nǚ ér ràng mā ma tiān tiān qiān guà","Her daughter studying far away keeps the mother worrying every day.","Su hija, que estudia en otra ciudad, tiene a la madre preocupada todos los días.","Sa fille, qui étudie loin de la maison, inquiète sa mère jour après jour."],["L7-3246","牵涉","qiānshè","V","to involve; to implicate","implicar; afectar","impliquer; concerner","这起案件牵涉的人很多，调查需要一段时间。","zhè qǐ àn jiàn qiān shè de rén hěn duō diào chá xū yào yí duàn shí jiān","Many people are involved in this case, so the investigation will take some time.","En este caso están implicadas muchas personas, así que la investigación llevará un tiempo.","Beaucoup de personnes sont impliquées dans cette affaire ; l'enquête prendra donc un certain temps."],["L7-3247","牵头","qiāntóu","","to take the lead; to coordinate","tomar la iniciativa; coordinar","prendre l'initiative; coordonner","这个项目由市政府牵头，多家企业共同参与。","zhè ge xiàng mù yóu shì zhèng fǔ qiān tóu duō jiā qǐ yè gòng tóng cān yù","This project is led by the city government, with many companies taking part.","Este proyecto está encabezado por el gobierno municipal y en él participan conjuntamente varias empresas.","Ce projet est piloté par la municipalité, avec la participation conjointe de plusieurs entreprises."],["L7-3248","牵制","qiānzhì","V","to restrain; to pin down","frenar; inmovilizar","entraver; fixer","我方派出两名队员专门牵制对方的主力。","wǒ fāng pài chū liǎng míng duì yuán zhuān mén qiān zhì duì fāng de zhǔ lì","Our side assigned two players specifically to contain the opponent's key player.","Nuestro equipo asignó a dos jugadores específicamente para neutralizar al jugador estrella rival.","Notre équipe a désigné deux joueurs spécialement pour neutraliser le meilleur élément adverse."],["L7-3249","铅","qiān","N","lead (metal)","plomo","plomb","这种老式水管里含有铅，长期使用对健康有害。","zhè zhǒng lǎo shì shuǐ guǎn lǐ hán yǒu qiān cháng qī shǐ yòng duì jiàn kāng yǒu hài","These old-fashioned water pipes contain lead, which is harmful to health with long-term use.","Estas tuberías de agua antiguas contienen plomo, que es perjudicial para la salud con el uso prolongado.","Ces anciennes canalisations contiennent du plomb, ce qui est mauvais pour la santé à long terme."],["L7-3250","谦逊","qiānxùn","Adj","modest; humble","modesto; humilde","modeste; humble","这位老教授学问很深，但待人一向谦逊。","zhè wèi lǎo jiào shòu xué wèn hěn shēn dàn dài rén yí xiàng qiān xùn","This old professor is deeply learned yet has always been humble toward others.","Este anciano profesor tiene un gran saber, pero siempre ha sido humilde con los demás.","Ce vieux professeur est très savant, mais s'est toujours montré humble envers les autres."],["L7-3251","签","qiān","N","to sign; lot; label","firmar; suerte; etiqueta","signer; bâtonnet; étiquette","请您在合同的最后一页签上自己的名字。","qǐng nín zài hé tóng de zuì hòu yí yè qiān shàng zì jǐ de míng zi","Please sign your name on the last page of the contract.","Por favor, firme con su nombre en la última página del contrato.","Veuillez signer de votre nom à la dernière page du contrat."],["L7-3252","签署","qiānshǔ","V","to sign (an agreement)","firmar (un acuerdo)","signer (un accord)","一百多个国家签署了这项保护野生动物的国际公约。","yì bǎi duō ge guó jiā qiān shǔ le zhè xiàng bǎo hù yě shēng dòng wù de guó jì gōng yuē","More than a hundred countries signed this international convention on protecting wildlife.","Más de cien países firmaron esta convención internacional para proteger la fauna silvestre.","Plus de cent pays ont signé cette convention internationale pour la protection de la faune sauvage."],["L7-3253","前辈","qiánbèi","N","senior; elder","veterano; mayor","aîné; ancien","多听听前辈的建议，可以少走弯路。","duō tīng tīng qián bèi de jiàn yì kě yǐ shǎo zǒu wān lù","Listening to the advice of those more experienced can save you detours.","Escuchar más los consejos de los mayores con experiencia te permite evitar rodeos innecesarios.","Écouter davantage les conseils de ses aînés permet d'éviter bien des détours."],["L7-3254","前不久","qiánbùjiǔ","N","not long ago","hace poco","il n'y a pas longtemps","前不久，我在超市里碰到了多年不见的老同学。","qián bù jiǔ wǒ zài chāo shì lǐ pèng dào le duō nián bú jiàn de lǎo tóng xué","Not long ago, I ran into an old classmate I hadn't seen in years at the supermarket.","Hace poco me encontré en el supermercado con un antiguo compañero de clase al que hacía años que no veía.","Il n'y a pas longtemps, j'ai croisé au supermarché un ancien camarade de classe que je n'avais pas vu depuis des années."],["L7-3255","前赴后继","qiánfù-hòujì","","to advance wave upon wave","avanzar sin cesar","avancer sans relâche","为了国家的独立，无数先烈前赴后继，英勇奋斗。","wèi le guó jiā de dú lì wú shù xiān liè qián fù hòu jì yīng yǒng fèn dòu","For the nation's independence, countless martyrs fought bravely, one wave after another.","Por la independencia del país, innumerables mártires lucharon con valentía, uno tras otro.","Pour l'indépendance de la nation, d'innombrables martyrs se sont battus avec bravoure, génération après génération."],["L7-3256","前期","qiánqī","N","early stage","etapa inicial","première phase","这个项目的前期准备工作已经基本完成。","zhè ge xiàng mù de qián qī zhǔn bèi gōng zuò yǐ jīng jī běn wán chéng","The preparatory work for the early stage of this project is basically complete.","Los trabajos preparatorios de la etapa inicial de este proyecto ya están prácticamente terminados.","Les travaux préparatoires de la phase initiale de ce projet sont pratiquement terminés."],["L7-3257","前任","qiánrèn","N","predecessor; former","predecesor; anterior","prédécesseur; ancien","新经理上任后，改变了前任的很多做法。","xīn jīng lǐ shàng rèn hòu gǎi biàn le qián rèn de hěn duō zuò fǎ","After taking office, the new manager changed many of his predecessor's practices.","Después de asumir el cargo, el nuevo gerente cambió muchas de las prácticas de su predecesor.","Après sa prise de fonctions, le nouveau directeur a changé beaucoup des méthodes de son prédécesseur."],["L7-3258","前所未有","qiánsuǒwèiyǒu","","unprecedented","sin precedentes","sans précédent","这次大地震给当地造成了前所未有的损失。","zhè cì dà dì zhèn gěi dāng dì zào chéng le qián suǒ wèi yǒu de sǔn shī","The major earthquake caused unprecedented losses to the area.","Este gran terremoto causó a la región pérdidas sin precedentes.","Ce grand séisme a causé à la région des pertes sans précédent."],["L7-3259","前台","qiántái","N","front desk; stage","recepción; escenario","réception; scène","到了酒店以后，先去前台办理入住手续。","dào le jiǔ diàn yǐ hòu xiān qù qián tái bàn lǐ rù zhù shǒu xù","When you arrive at the hotel, first go to the front desk to check in.","Al llegar al hotel, primero ve a la recepción a hacer el registro.","En arrivant à l'hôtel, rendez-vous d'abord à la réception pour vous enregistrer."],["L7-3260","前无古人","qiánwúgǔrén","","unprecedented","sin precedentes","sans précédent","他在这个领域取得的成就可以说是前无古人。","tā zài zhè ge lǐng yù qǔ dé de chéng jiù kě yǐ shuō shì qián wú gǔ rén","His achievements in this field can be said to be unprecedented.","Los logros que ha alcanzado en este campo se puede decir que no tienen precedentes.","On peut dire que ses réalisations dans ce domaine sont sans précédent."],["L7-3261","前夕","qiánxī","N","eve","víspera","veille","春节前夕，商场里到处是购买年货的人。","chūn jié qián xī shāng chǎng lǐ dào chù shì gòu mǎi nián huò de rén","On the eve of the Spring Festival, the malls are full of people buying New Year goods.","En vísperas del Festival de Primavera, los centros comerciales están llenos de gente comprando para el Año Nuevo.","À la veille de la fête du Printemps, les centres commerciaux sont pleins de gens qui font leurs achats du Nouvel An."],["L7-3262","前线","qiánxiàn","N","front line","primera línea","front; première ligne","战争期间，他的爷爷曾经在前线当过医生。","zhàn zhēng qī jiān tā de yé ye céng jīng zài qián xiàn dāng guo yī shēng","During the war, his grandfather served as a doctor at the front.","Durante la guerra, su abuelo trabajó como médico en el frente.","Pendant la guerre, son grand-père a été médecin au front."],["L7-3263","前沿","qiányán","N","frontier; cutting edge","frontera; vanguardia","frontière; pointe","这所大学的实验室一直处在人工智能研究的前沿。","zhè suǒ dà xué de shí yàn shì yì zhí chǔ zài rén gōng zhì néng yán jiū de qián yán","This university's lab has always been at the forefront of artificial intelligence research.","El laboratorio de esta universidad siempre ha estado a la vanguardia de la investigación en inteligencia artificial.","Le laboratoire de cette université a toujours été à la pointe de la recherche en intelligence artificielle."],["L7-3264","前仰后合","qiányǎng-hòuhé","","to sway back and forth","balancearse adelante y atrás","se balancer d'avant en arrière","他讲的笑话把大家逗得前仰后合。","tā jiǎng de xiào hua bǎ dà jiā dòu de qián yǎng hòu hé","His jokes had everyone doubled over with laughter.","Sus chistes hicieron que todos se doblaran de la risa.","Ses blagues ont fait rire tout le monde aux éclats."],["L7-3265","前者","qiánzhě","N","the former","el primero; el anterior","le premier; le précédent","城市和农村的生活各有好处，我更喜欢前者。","chéng shì hé nóng cūn de shēng huó gè yǒu hǎo chù wǒ gèng xǐ huan qián zhě","City life and country life each have their advantages; I prefer the former.","La vida en la ciudad y la del campo tienen cada una sus ventajas; yo prefiero la primera.","La vie en ville et la vie à la campagne ont chacune leurs avantages ; je préfère la première."],["L7-3266","虔诚","qiánchéng","Adj","devout; pious","devoto; piadoso","dévot; pieux","老太太虔诚地跪在佛像前，为家人祈福。","lǎo tài tai qián chéng de guì zài fó xiàng qián wèi jiā rén qí fú","The old woman knelt devoutly before the Buddha statue, praying for blessings for her family.","La anciana se arrodilló devotamente ante la estatua de Buda para pedir bendiciones para su familia.","La vieille dame s'est agenouillée avec dévotion devant la statue du Bouddha pour prier pour sa famille."],["L7-3267","钱财","qiáncái","N","money; wealth","dinero; riqueza","argent; richesse","利用朋友的信任骗走钱财，这种手段实在卑鄙。","lì yòng péng you de xìn rèn piàn zǒu qián cái zhè zhǒng shǒu duàn shí zài bēi bǐ","Using a friend's trust to swindle money is a truly despicable tactic.","Aprovecharse de la confianza de un amigo para estafarlo es un recurso realmente despreciable.","Profiter de la confiance d'un ami pour lui escroquer son argent est un procédé vraiment ignoble."],["L7-3268","钳子","qiánzi","N","pliers","alicates; pinzas","pince; tenailles","水管上的螺母太紧了，得用钳子才能拧开。","shuǐ guǎn shàng de luó mǔ tài jǐn le děi yòng qián zi cái néng nǐng kāi","The nut on the water pipe is too tight; it takes pliers to loosen it.","La tuerca de la tubería está demasiado apretada; hace falta unas pinzas para aflojarla.","L'écrou du tuyau est trop serré ; il faut des pinces pour le desserrer."],["L7-3269","潜能","qiánnéng","N","potential","potencial","potentiel","好的老师善于发现和激发学生的潜能。","hǎo de lǎo shī shàn yú fā xiàn hé jī fā xué shēng de qián néng","A good teacher is skilled at discovering and unlocking students' potential.","Un buen maestro sabe descubrir y despertar el potencial de sus alumnos.","Un bon professeur sait déceler et stimuler le potentiel de ses élèves."],["L7-3270","潜水","qiánshuǐ","V","to dive; to scuba","bucear","plonger","暑假里，我们在海边学会了潜水。","shǔ jià lǐ wǒ men zài hǎi biān xué huì le qián shuǐ","During the summer holidays, we learned to dive at the seaside.","En las vacaciones de verano aprendimos a bucear en la playa.","Pendant les vacances d'été, nous avons appris la plongée au bord de la mer."],["L7-3271","潜艇","qiántǐng","N","submarine","submarino","sous-marin","这艘潜艇可以在深海里连续航行几个月。","zhè sōu qián tǐng kě yǐ zài shēn hǎi lǐ lián xù háng xíng jǐ ge yuè","This submarine can sail continuously in the deep sea for several months.","Este submarino puede navegar de forma continua durante varios meses en aguas profundas.","Ce sous-marin peut naviguer en continu pendant plusieurs mois en eaux profondes."],["L7-3272","潜移默化","qiányí-mòhuà","","subtle influence","influencia sutil","influence insensible","父母的言行对孩子有潜移默化的影响。","fù mǔ de yán xíng duì hái zi yǒu qián yí mò huà de yǐng xiǎng","Parents' words and actions have a subtle, imperceptible influence on their children.","Las palabras y los actos de los padres influyen de manera sutil e imperceptible en los hijos.","Les paroles et les actes des parents influencent leurs enfants de façon subtile et imperceptible."],["L7-3273","潜在","qiánzài","Adj","potential; latent","potencial; latente","potentiel; latent","新系统上线之前，需要在模拟环境中反复测试，以排除潜在的漏洞。","xīn xì tǒng shàng xiàn zhī qián xū yào zài mó nǐ huán jìng zhōng fǎn fù cè shì yǐ pái chú qián zài de lòu dòng","Before the new system goes live, it needs repeated testing in a simulated environment to eliminate potential vulnerabilities.","Antes de que el nuevo sistema entre en funcionamiento, hay que probarlo repetidamente en un entorno simulado para eliminar posibles vulnerabilidades.","Avant la mise en service du nouveau système, il faut le tester à plusieurs reprises dans un environnement simulé afin d'éliminer les failles potentielles."],["L7-3274","谴责","qiǎnzé","V","to condemn; to denounce","condenar; denunciar","condamner; dénoncer","国际社会强烈谴责了这次恐怖袭击。","guó jì shè huì qiáng liè qiǎn zé le zhè cì kǒng bù xí jī","The international community strongly condemned the terrorist attack.","La comunidad internacional condenó enérgicamente este atentado terrorista.","La communauté internationale a fermement condamné cet attentat terroriste."],["L7-3275","欠缺","qiànquē","V/N","to lack; deficiency","carecer de; deficiencia","manquer de; lacune","他技术很好，就是欠缺一些管理经验。","tā jì shù hěn hǎo jiù shì qiàn quē yì xiē guǎn lǐ jīng yàn","His technical skills are good; he just lacks some management experience.","Tiene muy buena técnica; solo le falta algo de experiencia en gestión.","Il est très bon techniquement ; il lui manque seulement un peu d'expérience en gestion."],["L7-3276","欠条","qiàntiáo","N","IOU","pagaré","reconnaissance de dette","他借钱的时候写了一张欠条，答应半年内还清。","tā jiè qián de shí hou xiě le yì zhāng qiàn tiáo dā ying bàn nián nèi huán qīng","When he borrowed the money, he wrote an IOU, promising to repay it within six months.","Cuando pidió el préstamo, escribió un pagaré y prometió devolverlo todo en seis meses.","Quand il a emprunté de l'argent, il a rédigé une reconnaissance de dette et promis de tout rembourser en six mois."],["L7-3277","歉意","qiànyì","N","apology; regret","disculpa; pesar","excuses; regret","对于给您带来的不便，我们深表歉意。","duì yú gěi nín dài lái de bú biàn wǒ men shēn biǎo qiàn yì","We deeply apologize for the inconvenience caused to you.","Lamentamos profundamente las molestias que le hayamos causado.","Nous nous excusons sincèrement pour la gêne que nous vous avons occasionnée."],["L7-3278","呛","qiāng","V","to choke","atragantarse","s'étrangler","他喝水喝得太急，被呛得直咳嗽。","tā hē shuǐ hē de tài jí bèi qiāng de zhí ké sou","He drank the water too fast, choked, and couldn't stop coughing.","Bebió el agua demasiado rápido, se atragantó y no paraba de toser.","Il a bu trop vite, s'est étranglé et n'arrêtait pas de tousser."],["L7-3279","枪毙","qiāngbì","V","to execute by shooting","fusilar","fusiller","这部电影里，主人公差点儿被敌人枪毙。","zhè bù diàn yǐng lǐ zhǔ rén gōng chà diǎnr bèi dí rén qiāng bì","In this film, the hero is nearly executed by the enemy.","En esta película, el protagonista casi es fusilado por el enemigo.","Dans ce film, le héros est sur le point d'être fusillé par l'ennemi."],["L7-3280","腔","qiāng","N","cavity; tune; accent","cavidad; melodía; acento","cavité; mélodie; accent","这个年轻人怀着一腔热血，来到边疆当了老师。","zhè ge nián qīng rén huái zhe yì qiāng rè xuè lái dào biān jiāng dāng le lǎo shī","Full of youthful passion, this young man came to the border region to become a teacher.","Este joven, lleno de entusiasmo, llegó a la frontera para ser maestro.","Plein d'ardeur, ce jeune homme est venu dans la région frontalière pour devenir enseignant."],["L7-3281","强加","qiángjiā","V","to impose","imponer","imposer","不要把自己的想法强加给别人。","bú yào bǎ zì jǐ de xiǎng fǎ qiáng jiā gěi bié rén","Don't force your ideas on others.","No impongas tus ideas a los demás.","N'impose pas tes idées aux autres."],["L7-3282","强劲","qiángjìng","Adj","strong; powerful","fuerte; potente","fort; puissant","这一带风力强劲，很适合建设风力发电站。","zhè yí dài fēng lì qiáng jìng hěn shì hé jiàn shè fēng lì fā diàn zhàn","The wind here is strong, which makes the area well suited to building wind power stations.","En esta zona el viento es fuerte, por lo que es muy adecuada para construir centrales eólicas.","Le vent est fort dans cette région, qui convient donc très bien à la construction de centrales éoliennes."],["L7-3283","强项","qiángxiàng","N","strong suit; forte","punto fuerte","point fort","数学是他的强项，每次考试都是全班第一。","shù xué shì tā de qiáng xiàng měi cì kǎo shì dōu shì quán bān dì yī","Math is his strong suit; he comes first in the class on every exam.","Las matemáticas son su fuerte; en cada examen es el primero de la clase.","Les mathématiques sont son point fort ; à chaque examen, il est premier de la classe."],["L7-3284","强行","qiángxíng","Adv","to force; forcibly","forzar; por la fuerza","forcer; de force","他无视房主的反对，强行进入了住宅。","tā wú shì fáng zhǔ de fǎn duì qiáng xíng jìn rù le zhù zhái","Ignoring the homeowner's objections, he forced his way into the house.","Haciendo caso omiso de la oposición del dueño, entró por la fuerza en la casa.","Sans tenir compte de l'opposition du propriétaire, il est entré de force dans la maison."],["L7-3285","强硬","qiángyìng","Adj","tough; hard-line","duro; inflexible","ferme; intransigeant","面对对方的无理要求，他的态度十分强硬。","miàn duì duì fāng de wú lǐ yāo qiú tā de tài dù shí fēn qiáng yìng","Faced with the other side's unreasonable demands, he took a very firm stance.","Ante las exigencias poco razonables de la otra parte, adoptó una actitud muy firme.","Face aux exigences déraisonnables de l'autre partie, il a adopté une attitude très ferme."],["L7-3286","强占","qiángzhàn","V","to seize by force","ocupar por la fuerza","s'emparer de force de","这块土地曾经被外国军队强占了十几年。","zhè kuài tǔ dì céng jīng bèi wài guó jūn duì qiáng zhàn le shí jǐ nián","This land was once occupied by foreign troops for more than a decade.","Este terreno estuvo ocupado a la fuerza por tropas extranjeras durante más de diez años.","Ce territoire a été occupé de force par des troupes étrangères pendant plus de dix ans."],["L7-3287","强制","qiángzhì","V","to force; compulsory","obligar; obligatorio","contraindre; obligatoire","新规定强制所有车辆安装行车记录仪。","xīn guī dìng qiáng zhì suǒ yǒu chē liàng ān zhuāng xíng chē jì lù yí","The new regulation requires all vehicles to be fitted with dashcams.","La nueva normativa obliga a todos los vehículos a instalar una cámara de conducción.","La nouvelle réglementation oblige tous les véhicules à être équipés d'une caméra embarquée."],["L7-3288","抢夺","qiǎngduó","V","to seize; to snatch","arrebatar; apoderarse de","arracher; s'emparer de","两只小狗为了抢夺一根骨头打了起来。","liǎng zhī xiǎo gǒu wèi le qiǎng duó yì gēn gǔ tou dǎ le qǐ lái","The two puppies got into a fight over a bone.","Los dos perritos se pusieron a pelear por un hueso.","Les deux chiots se sont battus pour un os."],["L7-3289","抢劫","qiǎngjié","V","to rob; robbery","robar; robo","voler; vol","那个男人因为抢劫银行被判了十年。","nà ge nán rén yīn wèi qiǎng jié yín háng bèi pàn le shí nián","That man was sentenced to ten years for robbing a bank.","Ese hombre fue condenado a diez años por asaltar un banco.","Cet homme a été condamné à dix ans de prison pour avoir braqué une banque."],["L7-3290","抢眼","qiǎngyǎn","Adj","eye-catching","llamativo","accrocheur","她穿了一条红裙子，在人群中特别抢眼。","tā chuān le yì tiáo hóng qún zi zài rén qún zhōng tè bié qiǎng yǎn","She wore a red dress and stood out in the crowd.","Llevaba un vestido rojo y destacaba mucho entre la multitud.","Elle portait une robe rouge et se faisait remarquer dans la foule."],["L7-3291","敲边鼓","qiāo biāngǔ","","to back someone up","apoyar a alguien","soutenir quelqu'un","我跟老板提加薪的时候，你可得在旁边敲边鼓啊。","wǒ gēn lǎo bǎn tí jiā xīn de shí hou nǐ kě děi zài páng biān qiāo biān gǔ a","When I ask the boss for a raise, you'd better back me up.","Cuando le pida un aumento de sueldo al jefe, tienes que apoyarme desde el costado.","Quand je demanderai une augmentation au patron, il faudra que tu me soutiennes."],["L7-3292","敲诈","qiāozhà","V","to extort; to blackmail","extorsionar; chantajear","extorquer; faire chanter","他用别人的隐私进行敲诈，最后被警察抓了。","tā yòng bié rén de yǐn sī jìn xíng qiāo zhà zuì hòu bèi jǐng chá zhuā le","He used other people's private information to extort money and was eventually arrested.","Usó la información privada de otras personas para chantajearlas y al final la policía lo detuvo.","Il a utilisé la vie privée d'autrui pour faire du chantage et s'est finalement fait arrêter par la police."],["L7-3293","乔装","qiáozhuāng","V","to disguise oneself","disfrazarse","se déguiser","警察乔装成乘客，在地铁上抓住了小偷。","jǐng chá qiáo zhuāng chéng chéng kè zài dì tiě shàng zhuā zhù le xiǎo tōu","Disguised as passengers, the police caught the thief on the subway.","Los policías se disfrazaron de pasajeros y atraparon al ladrón en el metro.","Déguisés en voyageurs, les policiers ont arrêté le voleur dans le métro."],["L7-3294","瞧不起","qiáobuqǐ","V","to look down on","menospreciar","mépriser","不要瞧不起任何一份工作，劳动没有高低贵贱之分。","bú yào qiáo bu qǐ rèn hé yí fèn gōng zuò láo dòng méi yǒu gāo dī guì jiàn zhī fēn","Don't look down on any kind of job; all work is equally honorable.","No desprecies ningún trabajo; el trabajo no tiene categorías de superior o inferior.","Ne méprise aucun métier ; tout travail est honorable, sans distinction."],["L7-3295","巧合","qiǎohé","Adj","coincidence","coincidencia","coïncidence","我们俩同一天生日，真是太巧合了。","wǒ men liǎ tóng yī tiān shēng rì zhēn shì tài qiǎo hé le","We share the same birthday — what a coincidence!","Los dos cumplimos años el mismo día, ¡qué coincidencia!","Nous avons le même jour d'anniversaire, quelle coïncidence !"],["L7-3296","窍门","qiàomén","N","knack; trick","truco; maña","truc; astuce","学外语其实有窍门，关键是每天坚持。","xué wài yǔ qí shí yǒu qiào mén guān jiàn shì měi tiān jiān chí","There's a trick to learning a foreign language; the key is to keep at it every day.","En realidad, aprender un idioma tiene su truco; lo fundamental es ser constante cada día.","Apprendre une langue étrangère a en fait ses astuces ; l'essentiel est de persévérer chaque jour."],["L7-3297","翘","qiào","V","to raise; to curl up","levantar; curvarse","relever; se recourber","他翘着腿坐在沙发上，一边吃零食一边看电视。","tā qiào zhe tuǐ zuò zài shā fā shàng yì biān chī líng shí yì biān kàn diàn shì","He sat on the sofa with his legs crossed, eating snacks while watching TV.","Estaba sentado en el sofá con las piernas cruzadas, comiendo botanas mientras veía televisión.","Il était assis sur le canapé, les jambes croisées, en train de grignoter devant la télé."],["L7-3298","撬","qiào","V","to pry open","forzar con palanca","forcer avec un levier","小偷撬开了一楼的窗户，钻进了屋里。","xiǎo tōu qiào kāi le yī lóu de chuāng hu zuān jìn le wū lǐ","The thief pried open a ground-floor window and climbed into the house.","El ladrón forzó la ventana de la planta baja y se coló en la casa.","Le voleur a forcé la fenêtre du rez-de-chaussée et s'est introduit dans la maison."],["L7-3299","切除","qiēchú","V","to remove surgically","extirpar; resecar","exciser; retirer","手术很成功，医生把肿瘤全部切除了。","shǒu shù hěn chéng gōng yī shēng bǎ zhǒng liú quán bù qiē chú le","The operation was a success; the doctor removed the entire tumor.","La operación fue un éxito y el médico extirpó todo el tumor.","L'opération a été un succès et le médecin a retiré toute la tumeur."],["L7-3300","切断","qiēduàn","","to cut off","cortar","couper","台风把电线刮断了，整个小区的电都被切断了。","tái fēng bǎ diàn xiàn guā duàn le zhěng gè xiǎo qū de diàn dōu bèi qiē duàn le","The typhoon blew down the power lines, cutting off electricity to the whole neighborhood.","El tifón derribó los cables eléctricos y se cortó la luz en toda la urbanización.","Le typhon a arraché les lignes électriques et toute la résidence a été privée de courant."],["L7-3301","切割","qiēgē","V","to cut","cortar","couper","工人们用机器把大块的石头切割成整齐的石板。","gōng rén men yòng jī qì bǎ dà kuài de shí tou qiē gē chéng zhěng qí de shí bǎn","The workers use machines to cut large stones into neat slabs.","Los obreros usan máquinas para cortar grandes bloques de piedra en losas regulares.","Les ouvriers utilisent des machines pour découper de gros blocs de pierre en dalles bien nettes."],["L7-3302","且","qiě","Adv","moreover; and","además; y","de plus; et","这款手机价格便宜，且功能齐全。","zhè kuǎn shǒu jī jià gé pián yi qiě gōng néng qí quán","This phone is cheap, and it has a full range of features as well.","Este teléfono es barato y, además, tiene todas las funciones.","Ce téléphone est bon marché et, en plus, il offre toutes les fonctions."],["L7-3304","切身","qièshēn","Adj","personal; directly concerning","personal; que afecta directamente","personnel; qui concerne directement","提高最低工资关系到每个劳动者的切身利益。","tí gāo zuì dī gōng zī guān xì dào měi ge láo dòng zhě de qiè shēn lì yì","Raising the minimum wage concerns the vital interests of every worker.","Subir el salario mínimo afecta directamente los intereses de cada trabajador.","Relever le salaire minimum touche de près les intérêts de chaque travailleur."],["L7-3305","窃取","qièqǔ","V","to steal","robar; sustraer","voler; dérober","这名员工因为窃取公司的商业机密被起诉了。","zhè míng yuán gōng yīn wèi qiè qǔ gōng sī de shāng yè jī mì bèi qǐ sù le","This employee was prosecuted for stealing the company's trade secrets.","Este empleado fue demandado por robar los secretos comerciales de la empresa.","Cet employé a été poursuivi en justice pour avoir volé les secrets commerciaux de l'entreprise."],["L7-3306","钦佩","qīnpèi","V","to admire; to respect","admirar; respetar","admirer; respecter","他舍己救人的行为让所有人都十分钦佩。","tā shě jǐ jiù rén de xíng wéi ràng suǒ yǒu rén dōu shí fēn qīn pèi","His selfless act of saving others earned everyone's deep admiration.","Su acto de sacrificarse para salvar a otros despertó la admiración de todos.","Son geste de sacrifice pour sauver autrui a suscité l'admiration de tous."],["L7-3307","侵害","qīnhài","V","to infringe on","violar; atentar contra","porter atteinte à","未经同意公开他人的照片，可能侵害对方的权利。","wèi jīng tóng yì gōng kāi tā rén de zhào piàn kě néng qīn hài duì fāng de quán lì","Publishing someone's photos without consent may infringe on their rights.","Publicar fotos de otra persona sin su consentimiento puede vulnerar sus derechos.","Publier les photos de quelqu'un sans son consentement peut porter atteinte à ses droits."],["L7-3308","侵略","qīnlüè","V","to invade; invasion","invadir; invasión","envahir; invasion","这座纪念馆记录了当年侵略者犯下的罪行。","zhè zuò jì niàn guǎn jì lù le dāng nián qīn lüè zhě fàn xià de zuì xíng","This memorial hall records the crimes committed by the invaders back then.","Este museo conmemorativo documenta los crímenes que cometieron los invasores en aquella época.","Ce mémorial retrace les crimes commis par les envahisseurs à l'époque."],["L7-3309","侵权","qīnquán","V","to infringe rights","violar derechos","violer les droits","未经许可披露他人的隐私，即使没有牟利，也可能构成侵权。","wèi jīng xǔ kě pī lù tā rén de yǐn sī jí shǐ méi yǒu móu lì yě kě néng gòu chéng qīn quán","Disclosing another person's private information without permission may constitute an infringement even without financial gain.","Divulgar la privacidad de otra persona sin su permiso puede constituir una violación de derechos, aunque no haya ánimo de lucro.","Divulguer sans autorisation la vie privée d'autrui peut constituer une atteinte à ses droits, même sans but lucratif."],["L7-3310","侵占","qīnzhàn","V","to occupy by force","ocupar por la fuerza","occuper par la force","有人私自在公共绿地上盖房子，侵占了大家的活动空间。","yǒu rén sī zì zài gōng gòng lǜ dì shàng gài fáng zi qīn zhàn le dà jiā de huó dòng kōng jiān","Someone built a house on the public green without permission, encroaching on everyone's recreation space.","Alguien construyó una casa por su cuenta en una zona verde pública y ocupó el espacio de recreo de todos.","Quelqu'un a construit une maison de son propre chef sur un espace vert public, empiétant sur l'espace de loisirs de tous."],["L7-3311","亲和力","qīnhélì","N","affinity; approachability","afinidad; cercanía","affinité; sympathie","这位主持人很有亲和力，观众都很喜欢她。","zhè wèi zhǔ chí rén hěn yǒu qīn hé lì guān zhòng dōu hěn xǐ huan tā","This host is very approachable, and the audience loves her.","Esta presentadora es muy cercana y al público le cae muy bien.","Cette animatrice est très sympathique et le public l'adore."],["L7-3312","亲近","qīnjìn","Adj/V","close; to get close to","cercano; acercarse a","proche; se rapprocher de","这只小狗很喜欢亲近人，见谁都摇尾巴。","zhè zhī xiǎo gǒu hěn xǐ huan qīn jìn rén jiàn shéi dōu yáo wěi ba","This puppy loves being close to people and wags its tail at everyone.","A este perrito le encanta estar cerca de la gente y mueve la cola ante cualquiera.","Ce chiot adore s'approcher des gens et remue la queue devant tout le monde."],["L7-3313","亲朋好友","qīnpéng-hǎoyǒu","","relatives and friends","familiares y amigos","parents et amis","婚礼那天，亲朋好友都来为他们送上祝福。","hūn lǐ nà tiān qīn péng hǎo yǒu dōu lái wèi tā men sòng shàng zhù fú","On the wedding day, friends and family all came to give them their blessings.","El día de la boda, familiares y amigos vinieron a darles sus buenos deseos.","Le jour du mariage, parents et amis sont tous venus leur adresser leurs vœux de bonheur."],["L7-3314","亲戚","qīnqi","N","relative","pariente","parent","过年的时候，我们要去好几家亲戚家拜年。","guò nián de shí hou wǒ men yào qù hǎo jǐ jiā qīn qi jiā bài nián","At New Year, we visit several relatives' homes to pay our respects.","En Año Nuevo, vamos a visitar a varios parientes para felicitarlos.","Au Nouvel An, nous allons présenter nos vœux dans plusieurs familles de parents."],["L7-3315","亲情","qīnqíng","N","family affection","cariño familiar","affection familiale","离开家乡以后，他才真正体会到亲情的可贵。","lí kāi jiā xiāng yǐ hòu tā cái zhēn zhèng tǐ huì dào qīn qíng de kě guì","Only after leaving home did he truly appreciate how precious family love is.","Solo después de irse de su tierra natal comprendió de verdad lo valioso que es el cariño familiar.","Ce n'est qu'après avoir quitté son pays natal qu'il a vraiment compris le prix des liens familiaux."],["L7-3316","亲热","qīnrè","Adj/V","affectionate; warm","cariñoso; afectuoso","affectueux; chaleureux","两个老朋友一见面，就亲热地拥抱在一起。","liǎng gè lǎo péng you yí jiàn miàn jiù qīn rè de yōng bào zài yì qǐ","As soon as the two old friends met, they hugged each other warmly.","En cuanto los dos viejos amigos se vieron, se abrazaron con calidez.","Dès qu'ils se sont vus, les deux vieux amis se sont chaleureusement étreints."],["L7-3317","亲身","qīnshēn","Adj","personal; in person","personal; en persona","personnel; en personne","这门课程把讲授与实地考察相结合，让学生亲身了解当地的社会变迁。","zhè mén kè chéng bǎ jiǎng shòu yǔ shí dì kǎo chá xiāng jié hé ràng xué shēng qīn shēn liǎo jiě dāng dì de shè huì biàn qiān","This course combines instruction with field visits, allowing students to experience local social change firsthand.","Este curso combina las clases teóricas con visitas de campo para que los estudiantes conozcan de primera mano los cambios sociales de la región.","Ce cours associe enseignement et visites de terrain, afin que les étudiants découvrent par eux-mêmes les transformations sociales de la région."],["L7-3318","亲生","qīnshēng","Adj","biological","biológico","biologique","她的继父对她非常好，就像对亲生女儿一样。","tā de jì fù duì tā fēi cháng hǎo jiù xiàng duì qīn shēng nǚ ér yí yàng","Her stepfather treats her very well, just as he would his own daughter.","Su padrastro la trata muy bien, como si fuera su hija de sangre.","Son beau-père la traite très bien, exactement comme sa propre fille."],["L7-3319","亲手","qīnshǒu","Adv","with one's own hands","con las propias manos","de ses propres mains","这件毛衣是奶奶亲手给我织的。","zhè jiàn máo yī shì nǎi nai qīn shǒu gěi wǒ zhī de","Grandma knitted this sweater for me with her own hands.","Este suéter me lo tejió mi abuela con sus propias manos.","Ce pull, c'est ma grand-mère qui me l'a tricoté de ses propres mains."],["L7-3320","亲友","qīnyǒu","N","relatives and friends","familiares y amigos","parents et amis","他出国留学前，邀请亲友们来家里吃了一顿饭。","tā chū guó liú xué qián yāo qǐng qīn yǒu men lái jiā lǐ chī le yí dùn fàn","Before going abroad to study, he invited friends and relatives over for a meal.","Antes de irse a estudiar al extranjero, invitó a sus familiares y amigos a comer en casa.","Avant de partir étudier à l'étranger, il a invité ses proches à dîner chez lui."],["L7-3321","勤工俭学","qíngōng-jiǎnxué","","work-study","trabajar mientras se estudia","travailler en étudiant","他大学四年一直勤工俭学，没有向家里要过钱。","tā dà xué sì nián yì zhí qín gōng jiǎn xué méi yǒu xiàng jiā lǐ yào guo qián","Throughout his four years of university he worked part-time and never asked his family for money.","Durante los cuatro años de universidad trabajó medio tiempo para pagarse los estudios y nunca le pidió dinero a su familia.","Pendant ses quatre années d'université, il a travaillé pour payer ses études et n'a jamais demandé d'argent à sa famille."],["L7-3322","勤快","qínkuai","Adj","diligent; hardworking","diligente; trabajador","diligent; travailleur","这个小伙子很勤快，每天第一个到店里打扫卫生。","zhè ge xiǎo huǒ zi hěn qín kuai měi tiān dì yī ge dào diàn lǐ dǎ sǎo wèi shēng","This young man is very hardworking; every day he's the first to arrive and clean the shop.","Este muchacho es muy trabajador: todos los días es el primero en llegar a la tienda a limpiar.","Ce jeune homme est très zélé : chaque jour, il est le premier à arriver au magasin pour faire le ménage."],["L7-3323","勤劳","qínláo","Adj","hardworking; industrious","trabajador; laborioso","travailleur; laborieux","勤劳的农民天不亮就下地干活了。","qín láo de nóng mín tiān bú liàng jiù xià dì gàn huó le","The hardworking farmers go out to the fields before dawn.","Los campesinos trabajadores salen a los campos antes del amanecer.","Les paysans laborieux partent aux champs avant l'aube."],["L7-3324","寝室","qǐnshì","N","dormitory; bedroom","dormitorio; habitación","dortoir; chambre","我们寝室住着四个人，大家相处得很好。","wǒ men qǐn shì zhù zhe sì gè rén dà jiā xiāng chǔ de hěn hǎo","Four of us live in our dorm room, and we all get along well.","En nuestro dormitorio vivimos cuatro personas y nos llevamos muy bien.","Nous sommes quatre dans notre chambre d'étudiants et nous nous entendons très bien."],["L7-3325","青春期","qīngchūnqī","N","puberty; adolescence","pubertad; adolescencia","puberté; adolescence","青春期是孩子身体发育的重要阶段。","qīng chūn qī shì hái zi shēn tǐ fā yù de zhòng yào jiē duàn","Adolescence is an important stage of children's physical development.","La pubertad es una etapa importante del desarrollo físico de los niños.","La puberté est une étape importante du développement physique des enfants."],["L7-3326","青蛙","qīngwā","N","frog","rana","grenouille","夏天的夜晚，池塘边的青蛙叫个不停。","xià tiān de yè wǎn chí táng biān de qīng wā jiào gè bù tíng","On summer nights, the frogs by the pond croak endlessly.","En las noches de verano, las ranas junto al estanque no dejan de croar.","Les nuits d'été, les grenouilles au bord de l'étang coassent sans arrêt."],["L7-3327","轻而易举","qīng'éryìjǔ","","easy; effortless","fácil; sin esfuerzo","facile; sans effort","这么重的箱子，他轻而易举就搬上了楼。","zhè me zhòng de xiāng zi tā qīng ér yì jǔ jiù bān shàng le lóu","He carried such a heavy box upstairs with no effort at all.","Una caja tan pesada, y la subió al piso de arriba sin ningún esfuerzo.","Une caisse aussi lourde, et il l'a montée à l'étage sans le moindre effort."],["L7-3328","轻蔑","qīngmiè","V","contemptuous; contempt","despectivo; desprecio","méprisant; mépris","他轻蔑地看了对手一眼，根本没把对方放在眼里。","tā qīng miè de kàn le duì shǒu yì yǎn gēn běn méi bǎ duì fāng fàng zài yǎn lǐ","He glanced at his opponent contemptuously, not taking him seriously at all.","Miró a su rival con desprecio, como si ni siquiera lo tomara en cuenta.","Il lança un regard méprisant à son adversaire, sans le prendre le moins du monde au sérieux."],["L7-3329","轻微","qīngwēi","Adj","slight; minor","leve; ligero","léger; mineur","这次地震很轻微，大部分人都没有感觉到。","zhè cì dì zhèn hěn qīng wēi dà bù fen rén dōu méi yǒu gǎn jué dào","The earthquake was very slight, and most people didn't feel it.","Este sismo fue muy leve y la mayoría de la gente ni lo sintió.","Ce séisme était très faible et la plupart des gens ne l'ont pas senti."],["L7-3330","轻型","qīngxíng","Adj","light-duty; lightweight","ligero; de poco peso","léger; de petit gabarit","这种轻型飞机只能坐两个人，主要用于训练。","zhè zhǒng qīng xíng fēi jī zhǐ néng zuò liǎng gè rén zhǔ yào yòng yú xùn liàn","This light aircraft seats only two and is mainly used for training.","Esta avioneta solo tiene capacidad para dos personas y se usa principalmente para entrenamiento.","Cet avion léger ne peut transporter que deux personnes et sert principalement à l'entraînement."],["L7-3331","倾家荡产","qīngjiā-dàngchǎn","","to lose all one's wealth","perder toda la fortuna","perdre toute sa fortune","他沉迷赌博，最后弄得倾家荡产。","tā chén mí dǔ bó zuì hòu nòng de qīng jiā dàng chǎn","He became addicted to gambling and ended up losing everything he owned.","Se volvió adicto al juego y terminó en la ruina total.","Devenu accro au jeu, il a fini par perdre tout ce qu'il possédait."],["L7-3332","倾诉","qīngsù","V","to pour out one's feelings","desahogarse","se confier","遇到烦恼的时候，找个朋友倾诉一下会好受很多。","yù dào fán nǎo de shí hou zhǎo gè péng you qīng sù yí xià huì hǎo shòu hěn duō","When you're troubled, confiding in a friend makes you feel much better.","Cuando tienes preocupaciones, desahogarte con un amigo te hace sentir mucho mejor.","Quand on a des soucis, se confier à un ami fait beaucoup de bien."],["L7-3333","倾听","qīngtīng","V","to listen attentively","escuchar con atención","écouter attentivement","志愿者挨家挨户走访，耐心倾听独居老人的诉求。","zhì yuàn zhě āi jiā āi hù zǒu fǎng nài xīn qīng tīng dú jū lǎo rén de sù qiú","The volunteers visited homes one by one and patiently listened to the needs of older people living alone.","Los voluntarios visitaron casa por casa y escucharon con paciencia las necesidades de los ancianos que viven solos.","Les bénévoles sont allés de porte en porte et ont écouté avec patience les besoins des personnes âgées vivant seules."],["L7-3334","倾销","qīngxiāo","V","to dump (goods)","practicar dumping","faire du dumping","这家外国公司被指控在本地市场低价倾销产品。","zhè jiā wài guó gōng sī bèi zhǐ kòng zài běn dì shì chǎng dī jià qīng xiāo chǎn pǐn","This foreign company was accused of dumping its products on the local market at low prices.","Se acusa a esta empresa extranjera de practicar dumping en el mercado local, vendiendo sus productos a precios bajísimos.","Cette entreprise étrangère est accusée de pratiquer le dumping sur le marché local en bradant ses produits."],["L7-3335","倾斜","qīngxié","V","to tilt; to slant","inclinar; ladear","incliner; pencher","这座古塔已经倾斜了好几度，但几百年来一直没倒。","zhè zuò gǔ tǎ yǐ jīng qīng xié le hǎo jǐ dù dàn jǐ bǎi nián lái yì zhí méi dǎo","This ancient pagoda has tilted several degrees, yet it hasn't fallen for centuries.","Esta antigua pagoda ya se inclinó varios grados, pero lleva siglos sin caerse.","Cette ancienne pagode penche déjà de plusieurs degrés, mais elle tient debout depuis des siècles."],["L7-3336","清除","qīngchú","V","to clear away; to eliminate","eliminar; despejar","éliminer; déblayer","下雪以后，环卫工人连夜清除了路上的积雪。","xià xuě yǐ hòu huán wèi gōng rén lián yè qīng chú le lù shang de jī xuě","After the snowfall, sanitation workers cleared the snow from the roads overnight.","Después de la nevada, los trabajadores de limpieza urbana despejaron la nieve de las calles durante la noche.","Après la chute de neige, les agents de nettoyage ont déblayé les routes pendant la nuit."],["L7-3337","清脆","qīngcuì","Adj","crisp; clear (sound)","nítido; cristalino","clair; cristallin","树林里传来几声清脆的鸟叫。","shù lín lǐ chuán lái jǐ shēng qīng cuì de niǎo jiào","A few crisp bird calls came from the woods.","Del bosque llegaron unos cantos de pájaro claros y nítidos.","Quelques chants d'oiseaux clairs montaient de la forêt."],["L7-3338","清单","qīngdān","N","list; inventory","lista; inventario","liste; inventaire","面对琳琅满目的促销商品，她依然按照清单采购，没有盲目囤积。","miàn duì lín láng mǎn mù de cù xiāo shāng pǐn tā yī rán àn zhào qīng dān cǎi gòu méi yǒu máng mù tún jī","Faced with a dazzling array of sale items, she still shopped according to her list rather than stockpiling indiscriminately.","Ante la deslumbrante variedad de productos en oferta, ella siguió comprando según su lista y no acumuló cosas sin sentido.","Face à l'éblouissante profusion d'articles en promotion, elle a continué à faire ses achats selon sa liste, sans stocker à l'aveuglette."],["L7-3339","清淡","qīngdàn","Adj","light (food); bland","ligero (comida); suave","léger (nourriture); fade","这种沐浴露味道清淡，适合皮肤敏感的人用。","zhè zhǒng mù yù lù wèi dào qīng dàn shì hé pí fū mǐn gǎn de rén yòng","This shower gel has a light scent and suits people with sensitive skin.","Este gel de baño tiene un aroma suave y es adecuado para personas de piel sensible.","Ce gel douche a un parfum léger et convient aux peaux sensibles."],["L7-3340","清静","qīngjìng","Adj","quiet; peaceful","tranquilo; sosegado","calme; paisible","他搬到郊外住，就是为了图个清静。","tā bān dào jiāo wài zhù jiù shì wèi le tú gè qīng jìng","He moved to the suburbs just for some peace and quiet.","Se mudó a las afueras solo para tener algo de paz y tranquilidad.","Il a déménagé en banlieue uniquement pour avoir un peu de calme."],["L7-3341","清凉","qīngliáng","Adj","cool; refreshing","fresco; refrescante","frais; rafraîchissant","夏天喝一杯冰镇绿豆汤，感觉特别清凉。","xià tiān hē yì bēi bīng zhèn lǜ dòu tāng gǎn jué tè bié qīng liáng","A glass of iced mung bean soup in summer feels wonderfully refreshing.","Tomar en verano un vaso de sopa fría de frijol mungo es especialmente refrescante.","En été, un verre de soupe glacée de haricots mungo est délicieusement rafraîchissant."],["L7-3342","清明","qīngmíng","Adj","Qingming; clear and bright","Qingming; claro y luminoso","Qingming; clair et lumineux","每年清明前后，江南一带常常阴雨连绵。","měi nián qīng míng qián hòu jiāng nán yí dài cháng cháng yīn yǔ lián mián","Every year around Qingming, the region south of the Yangtze often has continuous rain.","Cada año, por la época de Qingming, en la región al sur del Yangtsé suele llover sin parar.","Chaque année, vers la fête de Qingming, il pleut souvent sans interruption dans la région au sud du Yangzi."],["L7-3343","清晰","qīngxī","Adj","clear; distinct","claro; nítido","clair; net","爷爷手背上的脉络清晰可见。","yé ye shǒu bèi shàng de mài luò qīng xī kě jiàn","The network of veins on the backs of Grandpa's hands is clearly visible.","Las venas del dorso de las manos del abuelo se ven claramente.","Les veines sur le dos des mains de grand-père sont bien visibles."],["L7-3344","清新","qīngxīn","Adj","fresh; refreshing","fresco; refrescante","frais; rafraîchissant","雨后的空气格外清新，大家都出来散步了。","yǔ hòu de kōng qì gé wài qīng xīn dà jiā dōu chū lái sàn bù le","The air after the rain is especially fresh, and everyone has come out for a walk.","Después de la lluvia el aire está especialmente fresco y todos salieron a pasear.","L'air après la pluie est particulièrement frais, et tout le monde est sorti se promener."],["L7-3345","清真寺","qīngzhēnsì","N","mosque","mezquita","mosquée","这座清真寺已有几百年的历史，是城里的著名建筑。","zhè zuò qīng zhēn sì yǐ yǒu jǐ bǎi nián de lì shǐ shì chéng lǐ de zhù míng jiàn zhù","This mosque is several hundred years old and is a famous landmark in the city.","Esta mezquita tiene varios siglos de historia y es un edificio famoso de la ciudad.","Cette mosquée a plusieurs siècles d'histoire et est un monument célèbre de la ville."],["L7-3346","情","qíng","N","feeling; emotion; situation","sentimiento; emoción; situación","sentiment; émotion; situation","老师的恩情我一辈子也忘不了。","lǎo shī de ēn qíng wǒ yí bèi zi yě wàng bu liǎo","I will never forget my teacher's kindness as long as I live.","Nunca olvidaré en toda mi vida la bondad de mi maestro.","Je n'oublierai jamais de toute ma vie la bonté de mon professeur."],["L7-3347","情报","qíngbào","N","intelligence; information","información; inteligencia","renseignement; information","这部电影讲的是一位情报人员在敌后工作的故事。","zhè bù diàn yǐng jiǎng de shì yí wèi qíng bào rén yuán zài dí hòu gōng zuò de gù shi","This film tells the story of an intelligence agent working behind enemy lines.","Esta película cuenta la historia de un agente de inteligencia que trabaja tras las líneas enemigas.","Ce film raconte l'histoire d'un agent de renseignement opérant derrière les lignes ennemies."],["L7-3348","情不自禁","qíngbùzìjīn","","cannot help oneself","no poder contenerse","ne pouvoir s'empêcher","听到熟悉的歌声，她情不自禁地跟着唱了起来。","tīng dào shú xī de gē shēng tā qíng bú zì jīn de gēn zhe chàng le qǐ lái","Hearing the familiar song, she couldn't help singing along.","Al oír la canción conocida, no pudo evitar ponerse a cantar.","En entendant la chanson familière, elle n'a pas pu s'empêcher de chanter avec."],["L7-3349","情调","qíngdiào","N","mood; atmosphere","ambiente; tono","atmosphère; ambiance","这家咖啡馆装修得很有情调，很受年轻人欢迎。","zhè jiā kā fēi guǎn zhuāng xiū de hěn yǒu qíng diào hěn shòu nián qīng rén huān yíng","This café is decorated with real charm and is popular with young people.","Esta cafetería está decorada con mucho encanto y es muy popular entre los jóvenes.","Ce café est décoré avec beaucoup de charme et il est très apprécié des jeunes."],["L7-3350","情怀","qínghuái","N","feelings; sentiments","sentimientos; sensibilidad","sentiments; sensibilité","这首诗表达了诗人深深的思乡情怀。","zhè shǒu shī biǎo dá le shī rén shēn shēn de sī xiāng qíng huái","This poem expresses the poet's deep feelings of homesickness.","Este poema expresa la profunda nostalgia del poeta por su tierra natal.","Ce poème exprime la profonde nostalgie du poète pour son pays natal."],["L7-3351","情结","qíngjié","N","complex (psychology)","complejo (psicología)","complexe (psychologie)","很多老人都有很深的故乡情结，晚年总想回老家住。","hěn duō lǎo rén dōu yǒu hěn shēn de gù xiāng qíng jié wǎn nián zǒng xiǎng huí lǎo jiā zhù","Many elderly people have a deep attachment to their hometown and want to live there in their later years.","Muchos ancianos sienten un profundo apego por su tierra natal y quieren volver a vivir allí en su vejez.","Beaucoup de personnes âgées sont profondément attachées à leur terre natale et veulent y retourner vivre sur leurs vieux jours."],["L7-3352","情侣","qínglǚ","N","couple; lovers","pareja; enamorados","couple; amoureux","公园的湖边坐着不少情侣，在一起看夕阳。","gōng yuán de hú biān zuò zhe bù shǎo qíng lǚ zài yì qǐ kàn xī yáng","Quite a few couples sat by the lake in the park, watching the sunset together.","Junto al lago del parque había varias parejas mirando juntas el atardecer.","Au bord du lac du parc, plusieurs couples regardaient ensemble le coucher du soleil."],["L7-3353","情人","qíngrén","N","lover; sweetheart","amante; novio","amant; chéri","情人之间难免会有矛盾，关键是要互相理解。","qíng rén zhī jiān nán miǎn huì yǒu máo dùn guān jiàn shì yào hù xiāng lǐ jiě","Conflicts between lovers are inevitable; the key is understanding each other.","Es inevitable que los enamorados tengan conflictos; lo importante es comprenderse mutuamente.","Il est inévitable que les amoureux aient des différends ; l'essentiel est de se comprendre."],["L7-3354","情谊","qíngyì","N","friendship","amistad","amitié","几十年过去了，两位老战友之间的情谊依然很深。","jǐ shí nián guò qù le liǎng wèi lǎo zhàn yǒu zhī jiān de qíng yì yī rán hěn shēn","Decades have passed, yet the bond between the two old comrades-in-arms remains deep.","Han pasado varias décadas, pero la amistad entre los dos viejos compañeros de armas sigue siendo muy profunda.","Des décennies ont passé, mais l'amitié entre les deux vieux compagnons d'armes reste très profonde."],["L7-3355","情愿","qíngyuàn","V/Adv","to be willing; would rather","estar dispuesto; preferir","être disposé à; préférer","只要孩子能健康快乐，我情愿自己辛苦一点。","zhǐ yào hái zi néng jiàn kāng kuài lè wǒ qíng yuàn zì jǐ xīn kǔ yì diǎn","As long as my child is healthy and happy, I'm willing to work a little harder myself.","Mientras mi hijo sea sano y feliz, prefiero sacrificarme yo un poco más.","Pourvu que mon enfant soit en bonne santé et heureux, je préfère me donner un peu plus de mal moi-même."],["L7-3356","请柬","qǐngjiǎn","N","invitation card","tarjeta de invitación","carton d'invitation","婚礼前一个月，他们就把请柬寄给了亲朋好友。","hūn lǐ qián yí ge yuè tā men jiù bǎ qǐng jiǎn jì gěi le qīn péng hǎo yǒu","A month before the wedding, they sent invitations to their friends and family.","Un mes antes de la boda, enviaron las invitaciones a sus familiares y amigos.","Un mois avant le mariage, ils ont envoyé les invitations à leurs proches."],["L7-3357","请帖","qǐngtiě","N","invitation card","tarjeta de invitación","carton d'invitation","他收到了一张老同学寄来的结婚请帖。","tā shōu dào le yì zhāng lǎo tóng xué jì lái de jié hūn qǐng tiě","He received a wedding invitation from an old classmate.","Recibió una invitación de boda de un antiguo compañero de clase.","Il a reçu un faire-part de mariage d'un ancien camarade de classe."],["L7-3358","庆典","qìngdiǎn","N","celebration","celebración","célébration","学校举行了盛大的庆典，庆祝建校一百周年。","xué xiào jǔ xíng le shèng dà de qìng diǎn qìng zhù jiàn xiào yì bǎi zhōu nián","The school held a grand celebration for its hundredth anniversary.","La escuela celebró una gran ceremonia por el centenario de su fundación.","L'école a organisé une grande cérémonie pour fêter le centenaire de sa fondation."],["L7-3359","庆贺","qìnghè","V","to celebrate; to congratulate","celebrar; felicitar","célébrer; féliciter","为了庆贺女儿考上大学，全家人去饭店吃了一顿。","wèi le qìng hè nǚ ér kǎo shàng dà xué quán jiā rén qù fàn diàn chī le yí dùn","To celebrate their daughter getting into university, the whole family went out to a restaurant.","Para celebrar que su hija entró a la universidad, toda la familia fue a comer a un restaurante.","Pour fêter l'entrée de leur fille à l'université, toute la famille est allée au restaurant."],["L7-3360","庆幸","qìngxìng","V","to rejoice; to be glad","alegrarse; congratularse","se féliciter; se réjouir","我很庆幸自己在最困难的时候遇到了他。","wǒ hěn qìng xìng zì jǐ zài zuì kùn nan de shí hou yù dào le tā","I'm very fortunate to have met him at the most difficult time of my life.","Me alegra mucho haberlo conocido en el momento más difícil.","Je m'estime très chanceux d'avoir rencontré cet homme au moment le plus difficile."],["L7-3361","丘陵","qiūlíng","N","hills","colinas","collines","这一带是丘陵地区，适合种茶和果树。","zhè yí dài shì qiū líng dì qū shì hé zhòng chá hé guǒ shù","This area is hilly country, well suited to growing tea and fruit trees.","Esta zona es de colinas y es ideal para cultivar té y árboles frutales.","Cette région est vallonnée et convient bien à la culture du thé et des arbres fruitiers."],["L7-3362","囚犯","qiúfàn","N","prisoner","preso","prisonnier","这部电影讲述了一个囚犯越狱的故事。","zhè bù diàn yǐng jiǎng shù le yí ge qiú fàn yuè yù de gù shi","This film tells the story of a prisoner's escape from jail.","Esta película cuenta la historia de un preso que se fuga de la cárcel.","Ce film raconte l'histoire d'un prisonnier qui s'évade de prison."],["L7-3363","求婚","qiúhūn","","to propose marriage","pedir matrimonio","demander en mariage","他单膝跪地，拿出戒指向女朋友求婚。","tā dān xī guì dì ná chū jiè zhi xiàng nǚ péng you qiú hūn","He knelt on one knee, took out a ring, and proposed to his girlfriend.","Se arrodilló sobre una rodilla, sacó un anillo y le propuso matrimonio a su novia.","Il mit un genou à terre, sortit une bague et demanda sa petite amie en mariage."],["L7-3364","求救","qiújiù","V","to call for help","pedir ayuda","appeler à l'aide","接到求救电话后，救援队连夜赶赴灾区。","jiē dào qiú jiù diàn huà hòu jiù yuán duì lián yè gǎn fù zāi qū","After receiving the call for help, the rescue team rushed to the disaster area overnight.","Tras recibir la llamada de auxilio, el equipo de rescate se dirigió a toda prisa a la zona del desastre durante la noche.","Après avoir reçu l'appel à l'aide, l'équipe de secours s'est précipitée dans la nuit vers la zone sinistrée."],["L7-3365","求学","qiúxué","V","to pursue studies","cursar estudios","poursuivre des études","他十六岁离开家乡，到大城市求学。","tā shí liù suì lí kāi jiā xiāng dào dà chéng shì qiú xué","At sixteen he left his hometown to study in a big city.","A los dieciséis años salió de su pueblo natal para estudiar en una gran ciudad.","À seize ans, il a quitté son village natal pour aller étudier dans une grande ville."],["L7-3366","求医","qiúyī","V","to seek medical help","buscar atención médica","consulter un médecin","为了治好父亲的病，他四处求医问药。","wèi le zhì hǎo fù qīn de bìng tā sì chù qiú yī wèn yào","To cure his father's illness, he sought out doctors and medicine everywhere.","Para curar la enfermedad de su padre, buscó médicos y medicinas por todas partes.","Pour guérir son père, il a consulté médecins et cherché des remèdes partout."],["L7-3367","求证","qiúzhèng","V","to seek confirmation","buscar confirmación","chercher confirmation","这条消息还需要向有关部门求证，暂时不要转发。","zhè tiáo xiāo xi hái xū yào xiàng yǒu guān bù mén qiú zhèng zàn shí bú yào zhuǎn fā","This report still needs to be verified with the relevant authorities, so don't share it for now.","Esta noticia aún debe confirmarse con las autoridades competentes, así que por ahora no la compartas.","Cette information doit encore être vérifiée auprès des services concernés, alors ne la partage pas pour le moment."],["L7-3368","求助","qiúzhù","V","to ask for help","pedir ayuda","demander de l'aide","面对别人的求助，他只是漠然地摇了摇头。","miàn duì bié rén de qiú zhù tā zhǐ shì mò rán de yáo le yáo tóu","Faced with someone's plea for help, he just shook his head indifferently.","Ante la petición de ayuda de alguien, él solo negó con la cabeza con indiferencia.","Face à la demande d'aide de quelqu'un, il s'est contenté de secouer la tête avec indifférence."],["L7-3369","曲线","qūxiàn","N","curve","curva","courbe","这张图上的曲线显示了近十年人口的变化。","zhè zhāng tú shàng de qū xiàn xiǎn shì le jìn shí nián rén kǒu de biàn huà","The curve on this chart shows population changes over the past ten years.","La curva de este gráfico muestra los cambios de la población en los últimos diez años.","La courbe de ce graphique montre l'évolution de la population au cours des dix dernières années."],["L7-3370","曲折","qūzhé","Adj","winding; complicated","sinuoso; complicado","sinueux; compliqué","这条山路很曲折，开车一定要小心。","zhè tiáo shān lù hěn qū zhé kāi chē yí dìng yào xiǎo xīn","This mountain road is very winding, so be careful driving.","Este camino de montaña tiene muchas curvas; hay que manejar con mucho cuidado.","Cette route de montagne est très sinueuse ; il faut conduire avec prudence."],["L7-3371","驱动","qūdòng","V","to drive; to propel","impulsar; accionar","entraîner; propulser","这种新型汽车完全由电力驱动。","zhè zhǒng xīn xíng qì chē wán quán yóu diàn lì qū dòng","This new type of car is powered entirely by electricity.","Este nuevo tipo de automóvil funciona totalmente con electricidad.","Ce nouveau type de voiture est entièrement propulsé par l'électricité."],["L7-3372","驱逐","qūzhú","V","to expel; to deport","expulsar; deportar","expulser; chasser","那名外交官因为从事间谍活动被驱逐出境。","nà míng wài jiāo guān yīn wèi cóng shì jiàn dié huó dòng bèi qū zhú chū jìng","The diplomat was expelled from the country for espionage.","Ese diplomático fue expulsado del país por realizar actividades de espionaje.","Ce diplomate a été expulsé du pays pour activités d'espionnage."],["L7-3373","屈服","qūfú","V","to yield; to succumb","ceder; sucumbir","céder; succomber","面对种种压力，她始终没有屈服。","miàn duì zhǒng zhǒng yā lì tā shǐ zhōng méi yǒu qū fú","In the face of all kinds of pressure, she never gave in.","Ante todo tipo de presiones, ella nunca cedió.","Face à toutes sortes de pressions, elle n'a jamais cédé."],["L7-3374","趋于","qūyú","V","to tend toward","tender a","tendre vers","经过治疗，他的病情已经趋于稳定。","jīng guò zhì liáo tā de bìng qíng yǐ jīng qū yú wěn dìng","After treatment, his condition has tended to stabilize.","Tras el tratamiento, su estado ya tiende a estabilizarse.","Après le traitement, son état tend désormais à se stabiliser."],["L7-3375","曲","qǔ","N","surname Qu; melody","apellido Qu; melodía","nom de famille Qu; mélodie","这首歌是他写的词，他妻子谱的曲。","zhè shǒu gē shì tā xiě de cí tā qī zi pǔ de qǔ","He wrote the lyrics to this song, and his wife composed the music.","La letra de esta canción la escribió él y la música la compuso su esposa.","Les paroles de cette chanson sont de lui, et la musique de sa femme."],["L7-3376","取代","qǔdài","V","to replace; to supersede","reemplazar; sustituir","remplacer; supplanter","在很多工厂里，机器已经取代了大部分人工。","zài hěn duō gōng chǎng lǐ jī qì yǐ jīng qǔ dài le dà bù fen rén gōng","In many factories, machines have replaced most manual labor.","En muchas fábricas, las máquinas ya han reemplazado a la mayor parte de la mano de obra.","Dans de nombreuses usines, les machines ont déjà remplacé la majeure partie de la main-d'œuvre."],["L7-3377","取缔","qǔdì","V","to ban; to crack down on","prohibir; reprimir","interdire; réprimer","政府决定取缔所有没有营业执照的小作坊。","zhèng fǔ jué dìng qǔ dì suǒ yǒu méi yǒu yíng yè zhí zhào de xiǎo zuō fang","The government decided to shut down all small workshops operating without a business license.","El gobierno decidió clausurar todos los pequeños talleres que no tengan licencia comercial.","Le gouvernement a décidé de fermer tous les petits ateliers dépourvus de licence commerciale."],["L7-3378","取而代之","qǔ'érdàizhī","","to take the place of","ocupar el lugar de","prendre la place de","老式电话亭越来越少，取而代之的是人手一部的手机。","lǎo shì diàn huà tíng yuè lái yuè shǎo qǔ ér dài zhī de shì rén shǒu yí bù de shǒu jī","Old phone booths are becoming rarer, replaced by the mobile phone everyone carries.","Las viejas cabinas telefónicas son cada vez menos y han sido sustituidas por el celular que cada persona lleva consigo.","Les vieilles cabines téléphoniques se font de plus en plus rares, remplacées par le portable que chacun a en poche."],["L7-3379","取经","qǔjīng","","to learn from others' experience","aprender de la experiencia ajena","s'inspirer de l'expérience d'autrui","这家农场的产品卖得很好，不少人专门来这里取经。","zhè jiā nóng chǎng de chǎn pǐn mài de hěn hǎo bù shǎo rén zhuān mén lái zhè lǐ qǔ jīng","This farm's products sell very well, and many people come here specially to learn from its experience.","Los productos de esta granja se venden muy bien y mucha gente viene expresamente a aprender de su experiencia.","Les produits de cette ferme se vendent très bien, et beaucoup de gens viennent exprès s'inspirer de son expérience."],["L7-3380","取决于","qǔjué yú","","to depend on","depender de","dépendre de","这项举措能否长期奏效，取决于后续监督是否到位。","zhè xiàng jǔ cuò néng fǒu cháng qī zòu xiào qǔ jué yú hòu xù jiān dū shì fǒu dào wèi","Whether this measure remains effective over time depends on whether follow-up oversight is adequate.","Que esta medida siga dando resultados a largo plazo depende de que la supervisión posterior sea adecuada.","Que cette mesure reste efficace à long terme dépend de la qualité du suivi et du contrôle qui en découleront."],["L7-3381","取暖","qǔnuǎn","V","to keep warm","calentarse","se réchauffer","天太冷了，他不停地搓着双手取暖。","tiān tài lěng le tā bù tíng de cuō zhe shuāng shǒu qǔ nuǎn","It was so cold that he kept rubbing his hands together to keep warm.","Hacía tanto frío que se frotaba las manos sin parar para entrar en calor.","Il faisait si froid qu'il se frottait les mains sans arrêt pour se réchauffer."],["L7-3382","取胜","qǔshèng","V","to win; to prevail","ganar; triunfar","gagner; l'emporter","我们队在最后一分钟进了一球，以二比一取胜。","wǒ men duì zài zuì hòu yì fēn zhōng jìn le yì qiú yǐ èr bǐ yì qǔ shèng","Our team scored a goal in the final minute and won two to one.","Nuestro equipo metió un gol en el último minuto y ganó dos a uno.","Notre équipe a marqué un but dans la dernière minute et l'a emporté deux à un."],["L7-3383","取笑","qǔxiào","V","to make fun of","burlarse de","se moquer de","别人说错话的时候，我们不应该取笑他。","bié rén shuō cuò huà de shí hou wǒ men bù yīng gāi qǔ xiào tā","When someone misspeaks, we shouldn't make fun of them.","Cuando alguien dice algo equivocado, no deberíamos burlarnos de él.","Quand quelqu'un se trompe en parlant, nous ne devrions pas nous moquer de lui."],["L7-3384","娶","qǔ","V","to marry (a woman)","casarse con (una mujer)","épouser (une femme)","他三十岁那年娶了一位同村的姑娘。","tā sān shí suì nà nián qǔ le yí wèi tóng cūn de gū niang","At thirty he married a girl from his village.","A los treinta años se casó con una muchacha de su mismo pueblo.","À trente ans, il a épousé une jeune fille de son village."],["L7-3385","去除","qùchú","V","to remove","quitar; eliminar","enlever; éliminer","这种清洁剂能有效去除衣服上的油渍。","zhè zhǒng qīng jié jì néng yǒu xiào qù chú yī fu shàng de yóu zì","This detergent effectively removes grease stains from clothes.","Este limpiador elimina eficazmente las manchas de grasa de la ropa.","Ce détachant élimine efficacement les taches de graisse sur les vêtements."],["L7-3386","去处","qùchù","N","place to go; destination","lugar adonde ir; destino","endroit où aller; destination","这个湖边公园是周末散步的好去处。","zhè ge hú biān gōng yuán shì zhōu mò sàn bù de hǎo qù chù","This lakeside park is a great place for a weekend stroll.","Este parque junto al lago es un buen lugar para pasear los fines de semana.","Ce parc au bord du lac est un endroit idéal pour se promener le week-end."],["L7-3387","去向","qùxiàng","N","whereabouts; direction","paradero; rumbo","direction prise; destination","那封重要的信件至今去向不明。","nà fēng zhòng yào de xìn jiàn zhì jīn qù xiàng bù míng","The whereabouts of that important letter are still unknown.","Hasta hoy se desconoce el paradero de aquella carta tan importante.","On ignore toujours ce qu'est devenue cette lettre importante."],["L7-3388","趣味","qùwèi","N","fun; interest; taste","gracia; interés; gusto","plaisir; intérêt; goût","他的业余生活充满了趣味。","tā de yè yú shēng huó chōng mǎn le qù wèi","His leisure life is full of fun.","Su tiempo libre está lleno de diversión.","Ses loisirs sont pleins d'agrément."],["L7-3389","圈套","quāntào","N","trap; snare","trampa; engaño","piège; traquenard","这些所谓的高回报投资，其实都是骗子设的圈套。","zhè xiē suǒ wèi de gāo huí bào tóu zī qí shí dōu shì piàn zi shè de quān tào","These so-called high-return investments are really traps set by swindlers.","Esas supuestas inversiones de alta rentabilidad son en realidad trampas de estafadores.","Ces prétendus placements à haut rendement sont en réalité des pièges tendus par des escrocs."],["L7-3390","圈子","quānzi","N","circle; social circle","círculo; círculo social","cercle; milieu","他的交际圈子很小，平时只和几个老朋友来往。","tā de jiāo jì quān zi hěn xiǎo píng shí zhǐ hé jǐ ge lǎo péng you lái wǎng","His social circle is small; he usually only keeps in touch with a few old friends.","Su círculo social es muy reducido; normalmente solo trata con unos pocos viejos amigos.","Son cercle social est très restreint ; d'ordinaire, il ne fréquente que quelques vieux amis."],["L7-3391","权衡","quánhéng","V","to weigh; to balance","sopesar; ponderar","peser; évaluer","做决定之前，要先权衡一下利害。","zuò jué dìng zhī qián yào xiān quán héng yí xià lì hài","Before making a decision, weigh the pros and cons.","Antes de tomar una decisión, hay que sopesar primero los pros y los contras.","Avant de prendre une décision, il faut d'abord peser le pour et le contre."],["L7-3392","权威","quánwēi","N","authority; authoritative","autoridad; autorizado","autorité; faisant autorité","他是这个领域的权威，他的意见很有分量。","tā shì zhè ge lǐng yù de quán wēi tā de yì jiàn hěn yǒu fèn liàng","He is an authority in this field, and his opinion carries a lot of weight.","Es una autoridad en este campo y su opinión tiene mucho peso.","C'est une autorité dans ce domaine, et son avis a beaucoup de poids."],["L7-3393","权益","quányì","N","rights and interests","derechos e intereses","droits et intérêts","消费者的合法权益应该得到保护。","xiāo fèi zhě de hé fǎ quán yì yīng gāi dé dào bǎo hù","The legitimate rights and interests of consumers should be protected.","Deben protegerse los derechos e intereses legítimos de los consumidores.","Les droits et intérêts légitimes des consommateurs doivent être protégés."],["L7-3394","全长","quáncháng","N","total length","longitud total","longueur totale","这条大河全长三千公里，大部分在我国境内。","zhè tiáo dà hé quán cháng sān qiān gōng lǐ dà bù fen zài wǒ guó jìng nèi","This great river is three thousand kilometers long, most of it within our country's borders.","Este gran río mide tres mil kilómetros de largo y la mayor parte está dentro de las fronteras de nuestro país.","Ce grand fleuve mesure trois mille kilomètres de long, et la plus grande partie se trouve sur le territoire de notre pays."],["L7-3395","全程","quánchéng","N","whole journey; entire course","trayecto completo; todo el recorrido","trajet complet; parcours entier","这场马拉松比赛他全程都没有停下来休息。","zhè chǎng mǎ lā sōng bǐ sài tā quán chéng dōu méi yǒu tíng xià lai xiū xi","He ran the entire marathon without stopping to rest.","En este maratón corrió todo el recorrido sin detenerse a descansar.","Il a couru tout le marathon sans s'arrêter pour se reposer."],["L7-3396","全方位","quánfāngwèi","N","all-round; comprehensive","integral; completo","global; complet","这家医院为病人提供全方位的护理服务。","zhè jiā yī yuàn wèi bìng rén tí gōng quán fāng wèi de hù lǐ fú wù","This hospital provides patients with comprehensive nursing care.","Este hospital ofrece a los pacientes servicios de atención integral.","Cet hôpital offre aux patients des soins infirmiers complets."],["L7-3397","全局","quánjú","N","overall situation","situación general","situation d'ensemble","作为领导，考虑问题要从全局出发。","zuò wéi lǐng dǎo kǎo lǜ wèn tí yào cóng quán jú chū fā","As a leader, you need to consider problems from the perspective of the whole.","Como líder, hay que analizar los problemas desde una visión de conjunto.","En tant que dirigeant, il faut aborder les problèmes dans une perspective d'ensemble."],["L7-3398","全力以赴","quánlìyǐfù","","to go all out","dar el máximo","se donner à fond","离比赛只剩一周了，大家都在全力以赴地训练。","lí bǐ sài zhǐ shèng yì zhōu le dà jiā dōu zài quán lì yǐ fù de xùn liàn","With only a week left before the competition, everyone is training all out.","Falta solo una semana para la competencia y todos entrenan con todas sus fuerzas.","Il ne reste qu'une semaine avant la compétition et tout le monde s'entraîne à fond."],["L7-3399","全能","quánnéng","Adj","all-round; omnipotent","polifacético; omnipotente","polyvalent; omnipotent","她是一位全能型运动员，跑步、游泳样样都行。","tā shì yí wèi quán néng xíng yùn dòng yuán pǎo bù yóu yǒng yàng yàng dōu xíng","She is an all-round athlete, good at everything from running to swimming.","Es una atleta completa: en todo, desde correr hasta nadar, se le da bien.","C'est une athlète polyvalente, qui excelle en tout, de la course à la natation."],["L7-3400","全文","quánwén","N","full text","texto completo","texte intégral","这篇讲话的全文已经在网上公布了。","zhè piān jiǎng huà de quán wén yǐ jīng zài wǎng shàng gōng bù le","The full text of the speech has been published online.","El texto completo de este discurso ya se publicó en internet.","Le texte intégral de ce discours a déjà été publié en ligne."],["L7-3401","全心全意","quánxīn-quányì","","wholeheartedly","de todo corazón","de tout cœur","这位老医生一辈子全心全意为病人服务。","zhè wèi lǎo yī shēng yí bèi zi quán xīn quán yì wèi bìng rén fú wù","This old doctor has served his patients wholeheartedly all his life.","Este anciano médico se dedicó en cuerpo y alma a sus pacientes toda su vida.","Ce vieux médecin a servi ses patients de tout son cœur toute sa vie."],["L7-3402","拳","quán","N/V","fist; boxing","puño; boxeo","poing; boxe","他气得一拳打在桌子上，杯子都震倒了。","tā qì de yì quán dǎ zài zhuō zi shàng bēi zi dōu zhèn dǎo le","He was so angry he slammed his fist on the table, knocking over the cups.","Estaba tan furioso que dio un puñetazo en la mesa y tiró los vasos.","Il était si en colère qu'il a donné un coup de poing sur la table et renversé les verres."],["L7-3403","拳头","quántóu","N","fist","puño","poing","这款手机是公司的拳头产品，销量一直遥遥领先。","zhè kuǎn shǒu jī shì gōng sī de quán tóu chǎn pǐn xiāo liàng yì zhí yáo yáo lǐng xiān","This phone is the company's flagship product, and its sales have always been far ahead.","Este teléfono es el producto estrella de la empresa y sus ventas siempre van muy a la cabeza.","Ce téléphone est le produit phare de l'entreprise, et ses ventes sont toujours largement en tête."],["L7-3404","劝告","quàngào","V/N","to advise; advice","aconsejar; consejo","conseiller; conseil","老人很顽固，谁的劝告都不听。","lǎo rén hěn wán gù shéi de quàn gào dōu bù tīng","The old man is very stubborn and won't listen to anyone's advice.","El anciano es muy terco y no escucha los consejos de nadie.","Le vieil homme est très têtu et n'écoute les conseils de personne."],["L7-3405","劝说","quànshuō","V","to persuade","persuadir","persuader","在朋友们的劝说下，他终于决定去医院检查。","zài péng you men de quàn shuō xià tā zhōng yú jué dìng qù yī yuàn jiǎn chá","Persuaded by his friends, he finally decided to go to the hospital for a checkup.","Convencido por sus amigos, por fin decidió ir al hospital a hacerse un chequeo.","Persuadé par ses amis, il s'est enfin décidé à aller à l'hôpital passer un examen."],["L7-3406","劝阻","quànzǔ","V","to dissuade","disuadir","dissuader","保安劝阻游客不要翻越栏杆拍照。","bǎo ān quàn zǔ yóu kè bú yào fān yuè lán gān pāi zhào","The security guard urged the tourists not to climb over the railing to take photos.","El guardia de seguridad pidió a los turistas que no saltaran la barandilla para tomarse fotos.","L'agent de sécurité a dissuadé les touristes d'enjamber la balustrade pour se prendre en photo."],["L7-3407","缺口","quēkǒu","N","gap; shortfall","brecha; déficit","brèche; déficit","大水把河堤冲开了一个缺口，村民们连夜抢修。","dà shuǐ bǎ hé dī chōng kāi le yí ge quē kǒu cūn mín men lián yè qiǎng xiū","The flood broke a gap in the riverbank, and villagers worked through the night to repair it.","La inundación abrió una brecha en el dique del río y los aldeanos trabajaron toda la noche para repararla.","La crue a ouvert une brèche dans la digue, et les villageois ont travaillé toute la nuit pour la réparer."],["L7-3408","缺失","quēshī","N/V","lack; deficiency","carencia; deficiencia","manque; déficience","这本旧书缺失了好几页，读起来很不方便。","zhè běn jiù shū quē shī le hǎo jǐ yè dú qǐ lái hěn bù fāng biàn","This old book is missing several pages, which makes it hard to read.","A este libro viejo le faltan varias páginas y es muy incómodo de leer.","Il manque plusieurs pages à ce vieux livre, ce qui le rend peu pratique à lire."],["L7-3409","缺席","quēxí","","to be absent","estar ausente","être absent","他因为生病缺席了今天的会议。","tā yīn wèi shēng bìng quē xí le jīn tiān de huì yì","He missed today's meeting because he was ill.","Faltó a la reunión de hoy porque estaba enfermo.","Il a été absent à la réunion d'aujourd'hui parce qu'il était malade."],["L7-3410","确切","quèqiè","Adj","exact; precise","exacto; preciso","exact; précis","飞机的确切起飞时间还没有通知。","fēi jī de què qiè qǐ fēi shí jiān hái méi yǒu tōng zhī","The exact departure time of the flight hasn't been announced yet.","Aún no se ha anunciado la hora exacta de despegue del avión.","L'heure exacte de décollage de l'avion n'a pas encore été annoncée."],["L7-3411","确信","quèxìn","V","to be convinced","estar convencido","être convaincu","我确信他说的都是实话。","wǒ què xìn tā shuō de dōu shì shí huà","I'm convinced that everything he said is true.","Estoy convencido de que todo lo que dijo es verdad.","Je suis convaincu que tout ce qu'il a dit est vrai."],["L7-3412","确凿","quèzáo","Adj","conclusive; irrefutable","concluyente; irrefutable","concluant; irréfutable","面对确凿的证据，他无话可说。","miàn duì què záo de zhèng jù tā wú huà kě shuō","Faced with conclusive evidence, he had nothing to say.","Ante pruebas irrefutables, no tuvo nada que decir.","Face à des preuves irréfutables, il n'avait plus rien à dire."],["L7-3413","确诊","quèzhěn","V","to confirm a diagnosis","confirmar un diagnóstico","confirmer un diagnostic","她没有把体检报告中的异常指标当成确诊结果，而是预约了进一步检查。","tā méi yǒu bǎ tǐ jiǎn bào gào zhōng de yì cháng zhǐ biāo dàng chéng què zhěn jié guǒ ér shì yù yuē le jìn yí bù jiǎn chá","She did not treat the abnormal findings in her checkup report as a confirmed diagnosis, but scheduled further tests.","Ella no tomó los valores anormales de su informe de chequeo como un diagnóstico confirmado, sino que pidió cita para hacerse más estudios.","Elle n'a pas pris les valeurs anormales de son bilan de santé pour un diagnostic confirmé, mais a pris rendez-vous pour des examens complémentaires."],["L7-3414","燃放","ránfàng","V","to set off (fireworks)","encender (petardos)","tirer (des feux d'artifice)","为了安全，市区里禁止燃放烟花爆竹。","wèi le ān quán shì qū lǐ jìn zhǐ rán fàng yān huā bào zhú","For safety reasons, setting off fireworks and firecrackers is banned in the city.","Por seguridad, está prohibido lanzar fuegos artificiales y petardos en el casco urbano.","Pour des raisons de sécurité, il est interdit de tirer des feux d'artifice et des pétards en ville."],["L7-3415","燃气","ránqì","N","gas fuel","gas combustible","gaz combustible","使用燃气以后，一定要记得关好阀门。","shǐ yòng rán qì yǐ hòu yí dìng yào jì de guān hǎo fá mén","After using the gas, be sure to turn off the valve.","Después de usar el gas, acuérdate de cerrar bien la válvula.","Après avoir utilisé le gaz, pensez à bien fermer la vanne."],["L7-3416","燃油","rányóu","N","fuel oil","combustible; gasóleo","carburant; fioul","燃油价格上涨以后，很多人改骑自行车上班了。","rán yóu jià gé shàng zhǎng yǐ hòu hěn duō rén gǎi qí zì xíng chē shàng bān le","After fuel prices rose, many people switched to cycling to work.","Después de que subió el precio del combustible, mucha gente empezó a ir al trabajo en bicicleta.","Depuis la hausse du prix des carburants, beaucoup de gens se rendent au travail à vélo."],["L7-3417","嚷","rǎng","V","to shout; to make a fuss","gritar; armar jaleo","crier; faire du bruit","你们小点声，别嚷了，孩子刚睡着。","nǐ men xiǎo diǎn shēng bié rǎng le hái zi gāng shuì zháo","Keep it down and stop shouting — the baby just fell asleep.","Bajen la voz y no griten, que el bebé acaba de dormirse.","Baissez d'un ton et arrêtez de crier, le bébé vient de s'endormir."],["L7-3418","让步","ràngbù","","to concede; concession","ceder; concesión","céder; concession","双方意见相反，越辩越激动，谁也不肯让步。","shuāng fāng yì jiàn xiāng fǎn yuè biàn yuè jī dòng shéi yě bù kěn ràng bù","The two sides held opposing views and grew more agitated as they argued, with neither willing to yield.","Las dos partes tenían opiniones opuestas y, cuanto más discutían, más se exaltaban, sin que ninguna quisiera ceder.","Les deux parties avaient des avis opposés et s'échauffaient de plus en plus en discutant, sans que personne ne veuille céder."],["L7-3419","饶","ráo","V","surname Rao; to spare","apellido Rao; perdonar","nom de famille Rao; épargner","这次就饶了你，下次可不能再犯了。","zhè cì jiù ráo le nǐ xià cì kě bù néng zài fàn le","I'll let you off this time, but don't do it again.","Por esta vez te perdono, pero que no se repita.","Je te pardonne pour cette fois, mais que ça ne se reproduise plus."],["L7-3420","饶恕","ráoshù","V","to forgive; to pardon","perdonar","pardonner","他犯下的错误不可饶恕。","tā fàn xià de cuò wù bù kě ráo shù","The mistake he made is unforgivable.","El error que cometió es imperdonable.","L'erreur qu'il a commise est impardonnable."],["L7-3421","扰乱","rǎoluàn","V","to disturb; to disrupt","perturbar; alterar","perturber; troubler","有人在网上散布谣言，扰乱了正常的社会秩序。","yǒu rén zài wǎng shàng sàn bù yáo yán rǎo luàn le zhèng cháng de shè huì zhì xù","Someone spread rumors online, disrupting normal social order.","Alguien difundió rumores en internet y alteró el orden social normal.","Quelqu'un a répandu des rumeurs sur Internet, troublant l'ordre public."],["L7-3422","绕行","ràoxíng","V","to detour","dar un rodeo","faire un détour","前方道路施工，请车辆绕行。","qián fāng dào lù shī gōng qǐng chē liàng rào xíng","Road construction ahead — vehicles please take a detour.","Hay obras en la carretera más adelante; los vehículos deben tomar un desvío.","Travaux sur la route plus loin : les véhicules sont priés de faire un détour."],["L7-3423","惹","rě","V","to provoke; to stir up","provocar; causar","provoquer; attirer","你别去惹他，他今天心情不好。","nǐ bié qù rě tā tā jīn tiān xīn qíng bù hǎo","Don't provoke him — he's in a bad mood today.","No te metas con él, hoy está de mal humor.","Ne le provoque pas, il est de mauvaise humeur aujourd'hui."],["L7-3424","热潮","rècháo","N","craze; upsurge","furor; auge","engouement; vague","近几年，全国掀起了一股露营的热潮。","jìn jǐ nián quán guó xiān qǐ le yì gǔ lù yíng de rè cháo","In recent years, a camping craze has swept the country.","En los últimos años, ha surgido en todo el país una verdadera fiebre por acampar.","Ces dernières années, un véritable engouement pour le camping a gagné tout le pays."],["L7-3425","热带","rèdài","N","tropics; tropical","trópico; tropical","tropiques; tropical","这支探险队在热带丛林里迷了路。","zhè zhī tàn xiǎn duì zài rè dài cóng lín lǐ mí le lù","The expedition team got lost in the tropical jungle.","Este equipo de exploración se perdió en la selva tropical.","Cette équipe d'exploration s'est perdue dans la jungle tropicale."],["L7-3426","热气","rèqì","N","steam; heat","vapor; calor","vapeur; chaleur","一打开锅盖，热气就扑到了脸上。","yì dǎ kāi guō gài rè qì jiù pū dào le liǎn shàng","As soon as I lifted the lid, the steam hit my face.","En cuanto abrí la tapa de la olla, el vapor me dio en la cara.","Dès que j'ai soulevé le couvercle de la casserole, la vapeur m'a sauté au visage."],["L7-3427","热气球","rèqìqiú","N","hot air balloon","globo aerostático","montgolfière","清晨，几只五颜六色的热气球慢慢升上了天空。","qīng chén jǐ zhī wǔ yán liù sè de rè qì qiú màn màn shēng shàng le tiān kōng","Early in the morning, several colorful hot-air balloons rose slowly into the sky.","Al amanecer, varios globos aerostáticos de colores subieron lentamente al cielo.","Au petit matin, plusieurs montgolfières multicolores se sont élevées lentement dans le ciel."],["L7-3428","热腾腾","rèténgténg","Adj","steaming hot","humeante","fumant","妈妈端上来一碗热腾腾的面条。","mā ma duān shàng lái yì wǎn rè téng téng de miàn tiáo","Mom brought out a steaming bowl of noodles.","Mamá trajo un plato de fideos humeantes.","Maman a apporté un bol de nouilles fumantes."],["L7-3429","热衷","rèzhōng","V","to be keen on","ser aficionado a","être passionné de","他热衷于收集各个国家的邮票。","tā rè zhōng yú shōu jí gè gè guó jiā de yóu piào","He is keen on collecting stamps from different countries.","Le apasiona coleccionar sellos postales de distintos países.","Il se passionne pour la collection de timbres de différents pays."],["L7-3430","人次","réncì","M","person-times; headcount","número de personas (visitas)","nombre de personnes (visites)","今年国庆假期，这个景区共接待游客五十万人次。","jīn nián guó qìng jià qī zhè ge jǐng qū gòng jiē dài yóu kè wǔ shí wàn rén cì","During this year's National Day holiday, the scenic area received a total of five hundred thousand visits.","Durante las vacaciones del Día Nacional de este año, esta zona turística recibió un total de quinientas mil visitas.","Pendant les vacances de la Fête nationale cette année, ce site touristique a reçu au total cinq cent mille visiteurs."],["L7-3431","人道","réndào","N/Adj","humane; humanitarian","humanitario; humano","humain; humanitaire","这样对待战俘是极不人道的。","zhè yàng duì dài zhàn fú shì jí bù rén dào de","Treating prisoners of war like this is extremely inhumane.","Tratar así a los prisioneros de guerra es sumamente inhumano.","Traiter ainsi les prisonniers de guerre est extrêmement inhumain."],["L7-3432","人格","réngé","N","personality; dignity","personalidad; dignidad","personnalité; dignité","每个人的人格都应该受到尊重。","měi ge rén de rén gé dōu yīng gāi shòu dào zūn zhòng","Everyone's dignity as a person should be respected.","La dignidad de cada persona debe ser respetada.","La dignité de chaque personne doit être respectée."],["L7-3433","人工智能","réngōng-zhìnéng","","artificial intelligence","inteligencia artificial","intelligence artificielle","近年来，人工智能技术飞速发展。","jìn nián lái rén gōng zhì néng jì shù fēi sù fā zhǎn","In recent years, artificial intelligence technology has developed at breakneck speed.","En los últimos años, la tecnología de inteligencia artificial se ha desarrollado a toda velocidad.","Ces dernières années, la technologie de l'intelligence artificielle s'est développée à une vitesse fulgurante."],["L7-3434","人均","rénjūn","V","per capita","per cápita","par habitant","这个地区的人均收入比十年前翻了一番。","zhè ge dì qū de rén jūn shōu rù bǐ shí nián qián fān le yì fān","The per capita income in this region has doubled compared with ten years ago.","El ingreso per cápita de esta región se duplicó con respecto a hace diez años.","Le revenu par habitant de cette région a doublé par rapport à il y a dix ans."],["L7-3435","人品","rénpǐn","N","character; moral quality","carácter; calidad moral","caractère; qualité morale","他这个人办事认真，人品也没说的。","tā zhè ge rén bàn shì rèn zhēn rén pǐn yě méi shuō de","He is conscientious in his work, and his character is beyond reproach.","Es una persona muy responsable en su trabajo y su carácter es intachable.","Il est consciencieux dans son travail et sa moralité est irréprochable."],["L7-3436","人气","rénqì","N","popularity","popularidad","popularité","这家火锅店人气很旺，晚上经常要等位。","zhè jiā huǒ guō diàn rén qì hěn wàng wǎn shang jīng cháng yào děng wèi","This hotpot restaurant is very popular, and there's often a wait for a table in the evening.","Este restaurante de hot pot es muy popular y por la noche a menudo hay que esperar mesa.","Ce restaurant de fondue chinoise est très populaire, et il faut souvent attendre une table le soir."],["L7-3437","人情","rénqíng","N","human feeling; favor","sentimiento humano; favor","sentiment humain; faveur","在农村，红白喜事都要随礼，人情往来很多。","zài nóng cūn hóng bái xǐ shì dōu yào suí lǐ rén qíng wǎng lái hěn duō","In the countryside, people are expected to give gifts at weddings and funerals, and such social exchanges are frequent.","En el campo, en las bodas y los funerales hay que dar un obsequio, y las obligaciones sociales son numerosas.","À la campagne, on doit offrir un cadeau aux mariages comme aux enterrements, et les échanges de politesses sont nombreux."],["L7-3438","人身","rénshēn","N","person; human body","persona; cuerpo humano","personne; corps humain","公交公司有责任保障乘客在车上的人身安全。","gōng jiāo gōng sī yǒu zé rèn bǎo zhàng chéng kè zài chē shàng de rén shēn ān quán","The bus company is responsible for ensuring passengers' personal safety while they are on the bus.","La empresa de autobuses tiene la responsabilidad de garantizar la seguridad personal de los pasajeros a bordo.","La compagnie de bus a la responsabilité de garantir la sécurité physique des passagers à bord."],["L7-3439","人事","rénshì","N","personnel; human affairs","personal; asuntos humanos","personnel; affaires humaines","公司最近人事变动很大，换了好几个部门经理。","gōng sī zuì jìn rén shì biàn dòng hěn dà huàn le hǎo jǐ ge bù mén jīng lǐ","The company has had major personnel changes recently, replacing several department managers.","La empresa ha tenido grandes cambios de personal últimamente y ha reemplazado a varios gerentes de departamento.","L'entreprise a connu récemment de grands changements de personnel, et plusieurs chefs de service ont été remplacés."],["L7-3440","人手","rénshǒu","N","manpower; staff","mano de obra; personal","main-d'œuvre; personnel","老式电话亭越来越少，取而代之的是人手一部的手机。","lǎo shì diàn huà tíng yuè lái yuè shǎo qǔ ér dài zhī de shì rén shǒu yí bù de shǒu jī","Old phone booths are becoming rarer, replaced by the mobile phone everyone carries.","Las viejas cabinas telefónicas son cada vez menos y han sido sustituidas por el celular que cada persona lleva consigo.","Les vieilles cabines téléphoniques se font de plus en plus rares, remplacées par le portable que chacun a en poche."],["L7-3441","人体","réntǐ","N","human body","cuerpo humano","corps humain","人体的大部分是由水组成的。","rén tǐ de dà bù fen shì yóu shuǐ zǔ chéng de","Most of the human body is made up of water.","La mayor parte del cuerpo humano está compuesta de agua.","La majeure partie du corps humain est composée d'eau."],["L7-3442","人为","rénwéi","Adj","man-made; artificial","artificial; provocado por el hombre","artificiel; d'origine humaine","调查表明，这场火灾是人为造成的。","diào chá biǎo míng zhè chǎng huǒ zāi shì rén wéi zào chéng de","The investigation showed that this fire was caused by human activity.","La investigación indica que este incendio fue provocado por el ser humano.","L'enquête montre que cet incendie est d'origine humaine."],["L7-3443","人文","rénwén","N","humanities; culture","humanidades; cultura","sciences humaines; culture","这座古城有着深厚的人文底蕴。","zhè zuò gǔ chéng yǒu zhe shēn hòu de rén wén dǐ yùn","This ancient city has a rich cultural heritage.","Esta antigua ciudad posee un profundo legado cultural.","Cette ville ancienne possède un riche patrimoine culturel."],["L7-3444","人行道","rénxíngdào","N","sidewalk","acera","trottoir","请走人行道，不要在马路中间行走。","qǐng zǒu rén xíng dào bú yào zài mǎ lù zhōng jiān xíng zǒu","Please use the sidewalk and don't walk in the middle of the road.","Por favor, camine por la acera y no por el medio de la calle.","Veuillez emprunter le trottoir et ne pas marcher au milieu de la chaussée."],["L7-3445","人性","rénxìng","N","human nature","naturaleza humana","nature humaine","这部小说深刻地揭示了人性的复杂。","zhè bù xiǎo shuō shēn kè de jiē shì le rén xìng de fù zá","This novel profoundly reveals the complexity of human nature.","Esta novela revela con profundidad la complejidad de la naturaleza humana.","Ce roman révèle avec profondeur la complexité de la nature humaine."],["L7-3446","人选","rénxuǎn","N","candidate; choice of person","candidato; elección de persona","candidat; choix de personne","新校长的人选目前还没有确定。","xīn xiào zhǎng de rén xuǎn mù qián hái méi yǒu què dìng","The choice of new principal has not yet been decided.","Todavía no se ha decidido quién será el nuevo director.","Le choix du nouveau directeur n'a pas encore été arrêté."],["L7-3447","人缘儿","rényuánr","N","popularity with others","simpatía entre la gente","popularité auprès des autres","她性格开朗，乐于助人，在单位里人缘儿特别好。","tā xìng gé kāi lǎng lè yú zhù rén zài dān wèi lǐ rén yuánr tè bié hǎo","She is cheerful and helpful, and very well liked at work.","Es alegre y servicial, y en el trabajo cae muy bien a todos.","Elle est enjouée et serviable, et elle est particulièrement appréciée au travail."],["L7-3448","人造","rénzào","Adj","man-made; artificial","artificial; sintético","artificiel; synthétique","这个公园里的湖是人造的，但看起来很自然。","zhè ge gōng yuán lǐ de hú shì rén zào de dàn kàn qǐ lái hěn zì rán","The lake in this park is man-made, but it looks very natural.","El lago de este parque es artificial, pero parece muy natural.","Le lac de ce parc est artificiel, mais il a l'air très naturel."],["L7-3449","人质","rénzhì","N","hostage","rehén","otage","歹徒挟持了一名人质，躲进了大楼。","dǎi tú xié chí le yì míng rén zhì duǒ jìn le dà lóu","The gangster seized a hostage and hid in the building.","El delincuente tomó a un rehén y se escondió en el edificio.","Le malfaiteur a pris un otage et s'est réfugié dans l'immeuble."],["L7-3450","仁慈","réncí","Adj","kind; benevolent","bondadoso; benévolo","bienveillant; charitable","老国王对百姓十分仁慈，很受人民爱戴。","lǎo guó wáng duì bǎi xìng shí fēn rén cí hěn shòu rén mín ài dài","The old king was very kind to his subjects and much loved by the people.","El viejo rey era muy bondadoso con su pueblo y era muy querido por la gente.","Le vieux roi était très bienveillant envers ses sujets et très aimé du peuple."],["L7-3451","忍饥挨饿","rěnjī-ái'è","","to go hungry","pasar hambre","souffrir de la faim","那几年粮食短缺，很多人家都忍饥挨饿。","nà jǐ nián liáng shi duǎn quē hěn duō rén jiā dōu rěn jī ái è","In those years food was scarce, and many families went hungry.","En aquellos años escaseaban los alimentos y muchas familias pasaron hambre.","À cette époque, la nourriture manquait et beaucoup de familles souffraient de la faim."],["L7-3452","忍耐","rěnnài","V","to endure; patience","aguantar; paciencia","endurer; patience","每个人的忍耐都有一定的限度。","měi ge rén de rěn nài dōu yǒu yí dìng de xiàn dù","Everyone's patience has a certain limit.","La paciencia de cada persona tiene un límite.","La patience de chacun a ses limites."],["L7-3453","忍心","rěnxīn","","to have the heart to","tener el valor de","avoir le cœur de","看着孩子哭得那么伤心，妈妈怎么忍心离开？","kàn zhe hái zi kū de nà me shāng xīn mā ma zěn me rěn xīn lí kāi","Seeing the child cry so sadly, how could the mother bear to leave?","Viendo al niño llorar con tanta tristeza, ¿cómo podría la madre irse?","Voyant l'enfant pleurer si tristement, comment sa mère aurait-elle le cœur de partir ?"],["L7-3454","认错","rèncuò","","to admit a mistake","admitir un error","reconnaître son erreur","他主动向老师认错，保证以后不再迟到。","tā zhǔ dòng xiàng lǎo shī rèn cuò bǎo zhèng yǐ hòu bú zài chí dào","He took the initiative to admit his mistake to the teacher and promised never to be late again.","Él reconoció su error ante el maestro por iniciativa propia y prometió no volver a llegar tarde.","Il a reconnu sa faute devant le professeur de lui-même et a promis de ne plus arriver en retard."],["L7-3455","认证","rènzhèng","V","to certify; to authenticate","certificar; autenticar","certifier; authentifier","这家工厂的产品已经通过了国际质量认证。","zhè jiā gōng chǎng de chǎn pǐn yǐ jīng tōng guò le guó jì zhì liàng rèn zhèng","This factory's products have passed international quality certification.","Los productos de esta fábrica ya obtuvieron la certificación internacional de calidad.","Les produits de cette usine ont déjà obtenu la certification internationale de qualité."],["L7-3456","认知","rènzhī","V","cognition; awareness","cognición; percepción","cognition; perception","阅读能促进儿童的认知发展。","yuè dú néng cù jìn ér tóng de rèn zhī fā zhǎn","Reading can promote children's cognitive development.","La lectura puede favorecer el desarrollo cognitivo de los niños.","La lecture peut favoriser le développement cognitif des enfants."],["L7-3457","任命","rènmìng","V","to appoint; appointment","nombrar; nombramiento","nommer; nomination","董事会任命她为公司的新总裁。","dǒng shì huì rèn mìng tā wéi gōng sī de xīn zǒng cái","The board appointed her as the company's new president.","La junta directiva nombró a ella como nueva presidenta de la empresa.","Le conseil d'administration l'a nommée nouvelle présidente de l'entreprise."],["L7-3458","任期","rènqī","N","term of office","mandato","mandat","这位市长任期内修建了好几座公园。","zhè wèi shì zhǎng rèn qī nèi xiū jiàn le hǎo jǐ zuò gōng yuán","This mayor built several parks during his term of office.","Durante su mandato, este alcalde construyó varios parques.","Pendant son mandat, ce maire a fait construire plusieurs parcs."],["L7-3459","任人宰割","rènrén-zǎigē","","to be at others' mercy","estar a merced de otros","être à la merci d'autrui","一个国家如果没有强大的国防，就只能任人宰割。","yí ge guó jiā rú guǒ méi yǒu qiáng dà de guó fáng jiù zhǐ néng rèn rén zǎi gē","A country without strong national defense can only be at the mercy of others.","Un país sin una defensa nacional fuerte solo puede quedar a merced de otros.","Un pays sans défense nationale solide est condamné à subir la loi des autres."],["L7-3460","任意","rènyì","Adv","arbitrary; at will","arbitrario; a voluntad","arbitraire; à volonté","图书馆的书可以任意借阅，但要按时归还。","tú shū guǎn de shū kě yǐ rèn yì jiè yuè dàn yào àn shí guī huán","Library books can be borrowed freely, but must be returned on time.","Los libros de la biblioteca se pueden tomar prestados libremente, pero hay que devolverlos a tiempo.","Les livres de la bibliothèque peuvent être empruntés librement, mais doivent être rendus à temps."],["L7-3461","任职","rènzhí","","to hold a post","ocupar un cargo","occuper un poste","他曾在一家大银行任职十多年。","tā céng zài yì jiā dà yín háng rèn zhí shí duō nián","He once held a position at a major bank for more than ten years.","Ocupó un cargo en un gran banco durante más de diez años.","Il a occupé un poste dans une grande banque pendant plus de dix ans."],["L7-3462","韧性","rènxìng","N","toughness; resilience","tenacidad; resiliencia","ténacité; résilience","竹子很有韧性，弯下去也不容易折断。","zhú zi hěn yǒu rèn xìng wān xià qù yě bù róng yì zhé duàn","Bamboo is very resilient; it bends without breaking easily.","El bambú es muy flexible: se dobla sin romperse fácilmente.","Le bambou est très résistant : il plie sans casser facilement."],["L7-3463","日程","rìchéng","N","schedule; itinerary","agenda; itinerario","programme; itinéraire","总经理这周的日程排得满满的，很难抽出时间。","zǒng jīng lǐ zhè zhōu de rì chéng pái de mǎn mǎn de hěn nán chōu chū shí jiān","The general manager's schedule is packed this week, so it's hard to find time.","La agenda del director general está repleta esta semana y es difícil encontrar un hueco.","L'emploi du temps du directeur général est complètement plein cette semaine, il est difficile de trouver un créneau."],["L7-3464","日复一日","rìfùyīrì","","day after day","día tras día","jour après jour","他日复一日地坚持练琴，终于考上了音乐学院。","tā rì fù yī rì de jiān chí liàn qín zhōng yú kǎo shàng le yīn yuè xué yuàn","Practicing the piano day after day, he finally got into the conservatory.","Practicó piano día tras día con constancia y por fin entró al conservatorio.","À force de s'exercer au piano jour après jour, il a fini par être admis au conservatoire."],["L7-3465","日后","rìhòu","N","in the future; later","en el futuro; más adelante","à l'avenir; plus tard","协议应明确违约责任，以免日后各执一词，难以裁定。","xié yì yīng míng què wéi yuē zé rèn yǐ miǎn rì hòu gè zhí yì cí nán yǐ cái dìng","The agreement should specify liability for a breach to avoid conflicting accounts that are difficult to adjudicate later.","El acuerdo debe precisar la responsabilidad por incumplimiento, para evitar que luego cada parte sostenga una versión distinta y sea difícil resolver.","L'accord doit préciser la responsabilité en cas de rupture, afin d'éviter que chaque partie ne s'en tienne plus tard à sa version et qu'il soit difficile de trancher."],["L7-3466","日前","rìqián","N","a few days ago","hace unos días","il y a quelques jours","日前，有关部门公布了新的交通管理办法。","rì qián yǒu guān bù mén gōng bù le xīn de jiāo tōng guǎn lǐ bàn fǎ","A few days ago, the relevant authorities announced new traffic management rules.","Hace unos días, las autoridades competentes dieron a conocer nuevas normas de gestión del tráfico.","Il y a quelques jours, les services compétents ont publié de nouvelles mesures de gestion de la circulation."],["L7-3467","日趋","rìqū","Adv","increasingly; day by day","cada vez más; día a día","de plus en plus; de jour en jour","随着人口老龄化，养老问题日趋突出。","suí zhe rén kǒu lǎo líng huà yǎng lǎo wèn tí rì qū tū chū","With the aging of the population, the issue of elderly care is becoming more prominent by the day.","Con el envejecimiento de la población, el problema del cuidado de los mayores se hace cada día más evidente.","Avec le vieillissement de la population, la question de la prise en charge des personnes âgées devient chaque jour plus pressante."],["L7-3468","日新月异","rìxīn-yuèyì","","changing rapidly","cambiar rápidamente","changer rapidement","这些年，家乡的面貌日新月异。","zhè xiē nián jiā xiāng de miàn mào rì xīn yuè yì","In recent years, my hometown has been changing rapidly.","En estos años, el aspecto de mi tierra natal cambia a pasos agigantados.","Ces dernières années, le visage de ma région natale change à toute vitesse."],["L7-3469","日益","rìyì","Adv","increasingly; day by day","cada vez más; día a día","de plus en plus; de jour en jour","随着经济的发展，人们的生活水平日益提高。","suí zhe jīng jì de fā zhǎn rén men de shēng huó shuǐ píng rì yì tí gāo","With economic development, people's living standards are improving day by day.","Con el desarrollo económico, el nivel de vida de la gente mejora cada día más.","Avec le développement économique, le niveau de vie des gens s'améliore de jour en jour."],["L7-3470","荣获","rónghuò","V","to be honored with","ser galardonado con","se voir décerner","这部纪录片荣获了本届电影节的最佳影片奖。","zhè bù jì lù piàn róng huò le běn jiè diàn yǐng jié de zuì jiā yǐng piàn jiǎng","This documentary won the best film award at this year's film festival.","Este documental obtuvo el premio a la mejor película del festival de cine de este año.","Ce documentaire a remporté le prix du meilleur film du festival de cette année."],["L7-3471","荣幸","róngxìng","Adj","honored","honrado","honoré","能和您一起工作，我感到非常荣幸。","néng hé nín yì qǐ gōng zuò wǒ gǎn dào fēi cháng róng xìng","It's a great honor for me to work with you.","Es un gran honor para mí poder trabajar con usted.","C'est un grand honneur pour moi de travailler avec vous."],["L7-3472","荣誉","róngyù","N","honor; glory","honor; gloria","honneur; gloire","这块奖牌是全队共同的荣誉。","zhè kuài jiǎng pái shì quán duì gòng tóng de róng yù","This medal is an honor shared by the whole team.","Esta medalla es un honor compartido por todo el equipo.","Cette médaille est un honneur que partage toute l'équipe."],["L7-3473","容光焕发","róngguāng-huànfā","","glowing; radiant","radiante; resplandeciente","rayonnant; resplendissant","度假回来以后，她整个人容光焕发。","dù jià huí lái yǐ hòu tā zhěng gè rén róng guāng huàn fā","After returning from vacation, she was absolutely glowing.","Después de volver de las vacaciones, ella se veía radiante.","Au retour de ses vacances, elle rayonnait."],["L7-3474","容量","róngliàng","N","capacity; volume","capacidad; volumen","capacité; volume","这个冰箱的容量很大，能放一周的食物。","zhè ge bīng xiāng de róng liàng hěn dà néng fàng yì zhōu de shí wù","This fridge has a large capacity and can hold a week's worth of food.","Este refrigerador tiene mucha capacidad y cabe comida para una semana.","Ce réfrigérateur a une grande capacité et peut contenir des provisions pour une semaine."],["L7-3475","容纳","róngnà","V","to hold; to accommodate","albergar; acoger","contenir; accueillir","这座体育馆可以容纳两万名观众。","zhè zuò tǐ yù guǎn kě yǐ róng nà liǎng wàn míng guān zhòng","This stadium can hold twenty thousand spectators.","Este estadio puede albergar a veinte mil espectadores.","Ce stade peut accueillir vingt mille spectateurs."],["L7-3476","容忍","róngrěn","V","to tolerate; to put up with","tolerar; soportar","tolérer; supporter","对于这种欺负弱小的行为，我们绝不能容忍。","duì yú zhè zhǒng qī fu ruò xiǎo de xíng wéi wǒ men jué bù néng róng rěn","We must never tolerate this kind of bullying of the weak.","Este tipo de abuso contra los débiles es algo que jamás podemos tolerar.","Nous ne pouvons jamais tolérer ce genre de comportement qui consiste à s'en prendre aux plus faibles."],["L7-3477","容许","róngxǔ","V","to allow; to permit","permitir; admitir","permettre; autoriser","这里的规定容许游客在室内拍照。","zhè lǐ de guī dìng róng xǔ yóu kè zài shì nèi pāi zhào","The rules here allow visitors to take photos indoors.","Según el reglamento de aquí, se permite a los visitantes tomar fotos en el interior.","Le règlement d'ici autorise les visiteurs à prendre des photos à l'intérieur."],["L7-3478","容颜","róngyán","N","facial appearance","rostro; semblante","visage; apparence","岁月改变了她的容颜，却没有改变她的笑容。","suì yuè gǎi biàn le tā de róng yán què méi yǒu gǎi biàn tā de xiào róng","The years have changed her looks, but not her smile.","Los años cambiaron su rostro, pero no su sonrisa.","Les années ont changé son visage, mais pas son sourire."],["L7-3479","溶解","róngjiě","V","to dissolve","disolver","dissoudre","把盐放进热水里，一会儿就溶解了。","bǎ yán fàng jìn rè shuǐ lǐ yí huìr jiù róng jiě le","Put salt in hot water and it dissolves in a moment.","Si echas sal en agua caliente, se disuelve enseguida.","Mets du sel dans de l'eau chaude et il se dissout en un instant."],["L7-3480","融","róng","V","to melt; to blend","derretir; fusionar","fondre; fusionner","死记硬背或许能应付一时的测验，却未必有助于融会贯通。","sǐ jì yìng bèi huò xǔ néng yìng fu yì shí de cè yàn què wèi bì yǒu zhù yú róng huì guàn tōng","Rote memorization may get someone through a test, but does not necessarily lead to an integrated understanding.","Memorizar de forma mecánica quizá sirva para salir del paso en una prueba, pero no necesariamente ayuda a comprender a fondo.","Apprendre par cœur peut permettre de s'en sortir lors d'un contrôle, mais n'aide pas forcément à bien assimiler."],["L7-3481","融化","rónghuà","V","to melt; to thaw","derretirse; deshelarse","fondre; dégeler","太阳出来以后，屋顶上的积雪很快就融化了。","tài yáng chū lái yǐ hòu wū dǐng shàng de jī xuě hěn kuài jiù róng huà le","After the sun came out, the snow on the roof quickly melted.","Después de que salió el sol, la nieve del tejado se derritió rápidamente.","Une fois le soleil sorti, la neige sur le toit a fondu rapidement."],["L7-3482","融洽","róngqià","Adj","harmonious","armonioso","harmonieux","我们宿舍的几个人关系很融洽，从来没吵过架。","wǒ men sù shè de jǐ ge rén guān xì hěn róng qià cóng lái méi chǎo guo jià","The people in our dorm get along very well and have never quarreled.","Los compañeros de nuestro dormitorio se llevan muy bien y nunca han discutido.","Les occupants de notre chambre s'entendent très bien et ne se sont jamais disputés."],["L7-3483","冗长","rǒngcháng","Adj","long-winded; tedious","prolijo; tedioso","long; verbeux","会议上的发言又冗长又空洞，很多人都听睡着了。","huì yì shàng de fā yán yòu rǒng cháng yòu kōng dòng hěn duō rén dōu tīng shuì zháo le","The speeches at the meeting were long-winded and empty, and many people fell asleep.","Los discursos de la reunión fueron largos y vacíos, y muchos se quedaron dormidos escuchándolos.","Les interventions pendant la réunion étaient longues et creuses, et beaucoup se sont endormis en les écoutant."],["L7-3484","柔和","róuhé","Adj","soft; gentle","suave; delicado","doux; tendre","傍晚的阳光很柔和，照在湖面上闪闪发光。","bàng wǎn de yáng guāng hěn róu hé zhào zài hú miàn shàng shǎn shǎn fā guāng","The evening sunlight is soft, glittering on the surface of the lake.","La luz del atardecer es suave y brilla sobre la superficie del lago.","La lumière du soir est douce et scintille sur la surface du lac."],["L7-3485","柔软","róuruǎn","Adj","soft","blando; suave","doux; moelleux","这条围巾摸起来又轻又柔软。","zhè tiáo wéi jīn mō qǐ lái yòu qīng yòu róu ruǎn","This scarf feels light and soft to the touch.","Esta bufanda es ligera y suave al tacto.","Cette écharpe est légère et douce au toucher."],["L7-3486","揉","róu","V","to knead; to rub","amasar; frotar","pétrir; frotter","她看了一整天电脑，不停地揉着发酸的眼睛。","tā kàn le yì zhěng tiān diàn nǎo bù tíng de róu zhe fā suān de yǎn jing","After looking at the computer all day, she kept rubbing her sore eyes.","Pasó todo el día frente a la computadora y no paraba de frotarse los ojos cansados.","Après avoir passé toute la journée devant l'ordinateur, elle n'arrêtait pas de se frotter les yeux douloureux."],["L7-3487","如果说","rúguǒ shuō","","if one were to say","si se dijera","si l'on disait","如果说父亲教会了我坚强，那么母亲就教会了我善良。","rú guǒ shuō fù qīn jiāo huì le wǒ jiān qiáng nà me mǔ qīn jiù jiāo huì le wǒ shàn liáng","If my father taught me to be strong, then my mother taught me to be kind.","Si mi padre me enseñó a ser fuerte, mi madre me enseñó a ser bondadoso.","Si mon père m'a appris à être fort, ma mère m'a appris à être bon."],["L7-3488","如实","rúshí","Adv","truthfully; as it is","fielmente; tal como es","fidèlement; tel quel","法官让证人如实陈述当晚看到的情况。","fǎ guān ràng zhèng rén rú shí chén shù dàng wǎn kàn dào de qíng kuàng","The judge asked the witness to give a truthful account of what they had seen that night.","El juez pidió al testigo que relatara con veracidad lo que había visto esa noche.","Le juge a demandé au témoin de relater fidèlement ce qu'il avait vu cette nuit-là."],["L7-3489","如意","rúyì","","as one wishes","a gusto; según el deseo","selon son désir","祝您新年快乐，万事如意！","zhù nín xīn nián kuài lè wàn shì rú yì","Wishing you a happy New Year and that everything goes as you wish!","¡Le deseo un feliz Año Nuevo y que todo le salga como desea!","Je vous souhaite une bonne année et que tout se passe selon vos vœux !"],["L7-3490","如愿以偿","rúyuànyǐcháng","","to have one's wish fulfilled","ver cumplido el deseo","voir son vœu exaucé","经过三年的努力，他终于如愿以偿地考上了研究生。","jīng guò sān nián de nǔ lì tā zhōng yú rú yuàn yǐ cháng de kǎo shàng le yán jiū shēng","After three years of effort, he finally achieved his wish of getting into graduate school.","Tras tres años de esfuerzo, por fin cumplió su deseo de entrar a un posgrado.","Après trois ans d'efforts, il a enfin réalisé son vœu d'être admis en master."],["L7-3491","如醉如痴","rúzuì-rúchī","","enraptured; infatuated","embelesado; ensimismado","ravi; fasciné","台下的观众听得如醉如痴，演出结束了还舍不得离开。","tái xià de guān zhòng tīng de rú zuì rú chī yǎn chū jié shù le hái shě bu de lí kāi","The audience listened spellbound and was reluctant to leave even after the performance ended.","El público escuchó embelesado y, aun después de terminada la función, no quería irse.","Le public écoutait, transporté, et ne voulait pas partir même une fois le spectacle terminé."],["L7-3492","儒家","Rújiā","N","Confucian school","escuela confuciana","école confucéenne","中庸是儒家思想中很重要的观念。","zhōng yōng shì rú jiā sī xiǎng zhōng hěn zhòng yào de guān niàn","The doctrine of the mean is a very important concept in Confucian thought.","El justo medio es un concepto muy importante en el pensamiento confuciano.","Le juste milieu est une notion très importante de la pensée confucéenne."],["L7-3493","儒学","rúxué","N","Confucianism","confucianismo","confucianisme","他在大学里专门研究儒学，写了好几本书。","tā zài dà xué lǐ zhuān mén yán jiū rú xué xiě le hǎo jǐ běn shū","He specializes in Confucian studies at the university and has written several books.","En la universidad se dedica a estudiar el confucianismo y ha escrito varios libros.","À l'université, il se consacre à l'étude du confucianisme et a écrit plusieurs livres."],["L7-3494","入场","rùchǎng","","to enter a venue","entrar al recinto","entrer dans la salle","演出七点开始，观众六点半就可以入场。","yǎn chū qī diǎn kāi shǐ guān zhòng liù diǎn bàn jiù kě yǐ rù chǎng","The performance begins at seven, and the audience can enter from half past six.","La función comienza a las siete y el público puede entrar desde las seis y media.","Le spectacle commence à sept heures, et le public peut entrer dès dix-huit heures trente."],["L7-3495","入场券","rùchǎngquàn","N","admission ticket","entrada","billet d'entrée","凭这张入场券，可以免费参观博物馆的所有展厅。","píng zhè zhāng rù chǎng quàn kě yǐ miǎn fèi cān guān bó wù guǎn de suǒ yǒu zhǎn tīng","With this admission ticket, you can visit all the museum's exhibition halls free of charge.","Con esta entrada se pueden visitar gratis todas las salas del museo.","Avec ce billet d'entrée, vous pouvez visiter gratuitement toutes les salles du musée."],["L7-3496","入境","rùjìng","","to enter a country","entrar en un país","entrer dans un pays","外国游客入境时需要出示护照和签证。","wài guó yóu kè rù jìng shí xū yào chū shì hù zhào hé qiān zhèng","Foreign tourists must show their passports and visas when entering the country.","Los turistas extranjeros deben presentar su pasaporte y su visa al ingresar al país.","Les touristes étrangers doivent présenter leur passeport et leur visa à l'entrée dans le pays."],["L7-3497","入侵","rùqīn","V","to invade","invadir","envahir","公司的电脑都安装了防火墙，防止黑客入侵。","gōng sī de diàn nǎo dōu ān zhuāng le fáng huǒ qiáng fáng zhǐ hēi kè rù qīn","All the company's computers have firewalls installed to prevent hacker attacks.","Todas las computadoras de la empresa tienen instalado un firewall para evitar intrusiones de hackers.","Tous les ordinateurs de l'entreprise sont équipés d'un pare-feu pour empêcher les intrusions de pirates."],["L7-3498","入手","rùshǒu","V","to start; to begin with","empezar; abordar","commencer; aborder","解决问题要从最关键的地方入手。","jiě jué wèn tí yào cóng zuì guān jiàn de dì fang rù shǒu","To solve a problem, you should start with the most crucial point.","Para resolver un problema hay que empezar por lo más fundamental.","Pour résoudre un problème, il faut commencer par le point le plus crucial."],["L7-3499","入选","rùxuǎn","V","to be selected","ser seleccionado","être sélectionné","她的作品入选了全国青年美术展。","tā de zuò pǐn rù xuǎn le quán guó qīng nián měi shù zhǎn","Her work was selected for the national youth art exhibition.","Su obra fue seleccionada para la exposición nacional de arte juvenil.","Son œuvre a été retenue pour l'exposition nationale d'art de la jeunesse."],["L7-3500","软弱","ruǎnruò","Adj","weak; feeble","débil; flojo","faible; mou","他性格有些软弱，遇到困难就想放弃。","tā xìng gé yǒu xiē ruǎn ruò yù dào kùn nan jiù xiǎng fàng qì","He's somewhat weak-willed and wants to give up when faced with difficulties.","Es de carácter algo débil y quiere rendirse en cuanto enfrenta dificultades.","Il a un caractère un peu faible et veut abandonner dès qu'il rencontre des difficultés."],["L7-3501","软实力","ruǎnshílì","N","soft power","poder blando","puissance douce","文化是一个国家软实力的重要组成部分。","wén huà shì yí ge guó jiā ruǎn shí lì de zhòng yào zǔ chéng bù fen","Culture is an important part of a country's soft power.","La cultura es una parte importante del poder blando de un país.","La culture est une composante importante du soft power d'un pays."],["L7-3502","瑞雪","ruìxuě","N","auspicious snow","nieve propicia","neige de bon augure","一场瑞雪过后，农民们都盼着明年有个好收成。","yì chǎng ruì xuě guò hòu nóng mín men dōu pàn zhe míng nián yǒu gè hǎo shōu chéng","After a timely snowfall, the farmers are all hoping for a good harvest next year.","Después de una buena nevada, los campesinos esperan una buena cosecha el año que viene.","Après une neige bienvenue, les paysans espèrent tous une bonne récolte l'an prochain."],["L7-3503","润","rùn","Adj/V","moist; to moisten","húmedo; humedecer","humide; humidifier","冬天空气干燥，喝点梨汤可以润润喉咙。","dōng tiān kōng qì gān zào hē diǎn lí tāng kě yǐ rùn rùn hóu lóng","The air is dry in winter, and a little pear soup can soothe your throat.","En invierno el aire es seco, y un poco de sopa de pera te calma la garganta.","En hiver, l'air est sec, et un peu de soupe de poire apaise la gorge."],["L7-3504","若干","ruògān","Pron","several; a number of","varios; cierto número de","plusieurs; un certain nombre de","公司就这个问题提出了若干改进建议。","gōng sī jiù zhè ge wèn tí tí chū le ruò gān gǎi jìn jiàn yì","The company put forward a number of suggestions for improvement on this issue.","La empresa presentó varias propuestas de mejora sobre este problema.","L'entreprise a présenté plusieurs propositions d'amélioration à ce sujet."],["L7-3505","弱点","ruòdiǎn","N","weakness","punto débil","point faible","每个人都有弱点，关键是要正视它。","měi ge rén dōu yǒu ruò diǎn guān jiàn shì yào zhèng shì tā","Everyone has weaknesses; the key is to face them squarely.","Todos tenemos puntos débiles; lo importante es afrontarlos.","Tout le monde a ses faiblesses ; l'essentiel est de les regarder en face."],["L7-3506","弱势","ruòshì","N","weak; disadvantaged","débil; desfavorecido","faible; défavorisé","社会应该给予弱势群体更多的关心和帮助。","shè huì yīng gāi jǐ yǔ ruò shì qún tǐ gèng duō de guān xīn hé bāng zhù","Society should give more care and help to vulnerable groups.","La sociedad debería brindar más atención y apoyo a los grupos vulnerables.","La société devrait accorder davantage d'attention et d'aide aux groupes vulnérables."],["L7-3507","撒","sā","V","to scatter; to let go","esparcir; soltar","répandre; lâcher","小孙子不小心把棋子撒了一地。","xiǎo sūn zi bù xiǎo xīn bǎ qí zǐ sǎ le yí dì","The little grandson accidentally scattered the chess pieces all over the floor.","Sin querer, el nietecito tiró todas las fichas de ajedrez al suelo.","Le petit-fils a accidentellement renversé tous les pions par terre."],["L7-3508","撒谎","sāhuǎng","","to lie","mentir","mentir","孩子撒谎的时候，父母要耐心地问清原因。","hái zi sā huǎng de shí hou fù mǔ yào nài xīn de wèn qīng yuán yīn","When a child lies, parents should patiently find out why.","Cuando un niño dice mentiras, los padres deben preguntarle con paciencia el motivo.","Quand un enfant ment, les parents doivent lui demander patiemment pourquoi."],["L7-3509","赛车","sàichē","N","racing car; car race","coche de carreras; carrera de coches","voiture de course; course automobile","他从小就喜欢赛车，梦想成为一名职业车手。","tā cóng xiǎo jiù xǐ huan sài chē mèng xiǎng chéng wéi yì míng zhí yè chē shǒu","He has loved car racing since childhood and dreams of becoming a professional driver.","Desde pequeño le gustan las carreras de autos y sueña con ser piloto profesional.","Depuis tout petit, il adore les courses automobiles et rêve de devenir pilote professionnel."],["L7-3510","赛跑","sàipǎo","V","to race; foot race","correr una carrera; carrera a pie","faire la course; course à pied","运动会上，他在一百米赛跑中得了第一名。","yùn dòng huì shàng tā zài yì bǎi mǐ sài pǎo zhōng dé le dì yī míng","At the sports meet, he won first place in the hundred-meter race.","En la competencia deportiva, quedó en primer lugar en los cien metros planos.","Aux jeux sportifs, il a remporté la première place au cent mètres."],["L7-3511","三番五次","sānfān-wǔcì","","repeatedly","una y otra vez","à maintes reprises","我三番五次提醒他按时吃药，他就是不听。","wǒ sān fān wǔ cì tí xǐng tā àn shí chī yào tā jiù shì bù tīng","I've reminded him again and again to take his medicine on time, but he just won't listen.","Le he recordado una y otra vez que se tome la medicina a tiempo, pero no me hace caso.","Je lui ai rappelé maintes fois de prendre ses médicaments à l'heure, mais il ne veut rien entendre."],["L7-3512","三角","sānjiǎo","N/Adj","triangle","triángulo","triangle","这块三角形的土地不太好利用。","zhè kuài sān jiǎo xíng de tǔ dì bú tài hǎo lì yòng","This triangular plot of land isn't easy to make use of.","Este terreno triangular no es fácil de aprovechar.","Ce terrain triangulaire n'est pas facile à exploiter."],["L7-3513","三维","sānwéi","Adj","three-dimensional","tridimensional","tridimensionnel","设计师用电脑做出了房子的三维模型。","shè jì shī yòng diàn nǎo zuò chū le fáng zi de sān wéi mó xíng","The designer created a three-dimensional model of the house on the computer.","El diseñador hizo con la computadora un modelo tridimensional de la casa.","Le concepteur a réalisé sur ordinateur une maquette en trois dimensions de la maison."],["L7-3514","散布","sànbù","V","to spread; to disseminate","difundir; esparcir","répandre; disséminer","有人在网上散布虚假消息，造成了恐慌。","yǒu rén zài wǎng shàng sàn bù xū jiǎ xiāo xi zào chéng le kǒng huāng","Someone spread false information online, causing panic.","Alguien difundió información falsa en internet y causó pánico.","Quelqu'un a diffusé de fausses informations sur Internet, provoquant la panique."],["L7-3515","散发","sànfā","V","to emit; to distribute","emitir; repartir","dégager; distribuer","院子里的桂花开了，散发出阵阵香气。","yuàn zi lǐ de guì huā kāi le sàn fā chū zhèn zhèn xiāng qì","The osmanthus in the courtyard is in bloom, giving off wafts of fragrance.","Los osmantos del patio florecieron y despiden oleadas de fragancia.","Les osmanthus de la cour sont en fleurs et répandent des bouffées de parfum."],["L7-3516","桑拿","sāngná","N","sauna","sauna","sauna","运动完以后，他喜欢去蒸个桑拿放松一下。","yùn dòng wán yǐ hòu tā xǐ huan qù zhēng gè sāng ná fàng sōng yí xià","After exercising, he likes to take a sauna to relax.","Después de hacer ejercicio, le gusta ir al sauna para relajarse.","Après le sport, il aime aller au sauna pour se détendre."],["L7-3517","嗓子","sǎngzi","N","throat; voice","garganta; voz","gorge; voix","他感冒咳嗽，嗓子里总是有痰。","tā gǎn mào ké sou sǎng zi lǐ zǒng shì yǒu tán","He has a cold and a cough, and there's always phlegm in his throat.","Está resfriado y con tos, y siempre tiene flema en la garganta.","Il est enrhumé, il tousse et a toujours des glaires dans la gorge."],["L7-3518","丧生","sàngshēng","","to lose one's life","perder la vida","perdre la vie","这次空难中，机上一百多人全部丧生。","zhè cì kōng nàn zhōng jī shàng yì bǎi duō rén quán bù sàng shēng","All of the more than one hundred people on board died in the plane crash.","En este accidente aéreo murieron las más de cien personas que iban a bordo.","Dans cet accident d'avion, les plus de cent personnes à bord ont toutes péri."],["L7-3519","骚乱","sāoluàn","V","riot; disturbance","disturbio; tumulto","émeute; troubles","比赛结束后，球场外发生了一场小规模骚乱。","bǐ sài jié shù hòu qiú chǎng wài fā shēng le yì chǎng xiǎo guī mó sāo luàn","After the match, a small-scale riot broke out outside the stadium.","Al terminar el partido, estalló un pequeño disturbio fuera del estadio.","À la fin du match, une émeute de petite ampleur a éclaté à l'extérieur du stade."],["L7-3520","骚扰","sāorǎo","V","to harass; to disturb","acosar; molestar","harceler; importuner","最近总有推销电话骚扰我，真让人心烦。","zuì jìn zǒng yǒu tuī xiāo diàn huà sāo rǎo wǒ zhēn ràng rén xīn fán","Lately I keep getting harassed by sales calls; it's really annoying.","Últimamente me acosan constantemente con llamadas de ventas; es realmente molesto.","Ces derniers temps, je suis sans cesse harcelé par des appels commerciaux ; c'est vraiment agaçant."],["L7-3521","扫除","sǎochú","V","to sweep away; to clean","barrer; limpiar","balayer; nettoyer","快过年了，家家户户都在进行大扫除。","kuài guò nián le jiā jiā hù hù dōu zài jìn xíng dà sǎo chú","The New Year is coming, and every household is doing a big cleanup.","Se acerca el Año Nuevo y todas las familias están haciendo la gran limpieza.","Le Nouvel An approche et chaque foyer fait son grand ménage."],["L7-3522","扫描","sǎomiáo","V","to scan","escanear","scanner","请把这份合同扫描一下，发到我的邮箱。","qǐng bǎ zhè fèn hé tóng sǎo miáo yí xià fā dào wǒ de yóu xiāng","Please scan this contract and send it to my email.","Por favor, escanea este contrato y envíalo a mi correo.","Veuillez scanner ce contrat et l'envoyer à mon adresse e-mail."],["L7-3523","扫墓","sǎomù","","to visit a grave","visitar una tumba","se recueillir sur une tombe","清明节期间，前往公墓扫墓的人特别多。","qīng míng jié qī jiān qián wǎng gōng mù sǎo mù de rén tè bié duō","During the Qingming Festival, a great many people go to cemeteries to sweep the graves.","Durante el Festival de Qingming, es muy grande la cantidad de personas que van al cementerio a limpiar las tumbas.","Pendant la fête de Qingming, énormément de gens se rendent au cimetière pour entretenir les tombes."],["L7-3524","扫兴","sǎoxìng","","to be disappointed; to spoil the fun","decepcionarse; aguar la fiesta","être déçu; gâcher le plaisir","本来计划去郊游，结果下起了大雨，真扫兴。","běn lái jì huà qù jiāo yóu jié guǒ xià qǐ le dà yǔ zhēn sǎo xìng","We had planned an outing, but then it poured — what a letdown.","Habíamos planeado una excursión, pero se puso a llover a cántaros; qué desilusión.","Nous avions prévu une sortie à la campagne, mais il s'est mis à pleuvoir à verse, quelle déception."],["L7-3525","嫂子","sǎozi","N","sister-in-law (elder brother's wife)","cuñada (esposa del hermano mayor)","belle-sœur (épouse du frère aîné)","哥哥结婚以后，嫂子对我们一家都很好。","gē ge jié hūn yǐ hòu sǎo zi duì wǒ men yì jiā dōu hěn hǎo","Since my older brother got married, my sister-in-law has been very kind to our whole family.","Desde que mi hermano se casó, mi cuñada ha sido muy buena con toda nuestra familia.","Depuis le mariage de mon frère, ma belle-sœur est très gentille avec toute notre famille."],["L7-3526","僧人","sēngrén","N","monk","monje","moine","山上的寺庙里住着几位僧人，每天清晨都要念经。","shān shàng de sì miào lǐ zhù zhe jǐ wèi sēng rén měi tiān qīng chén dōu yào niàn jīng","A few monks live in the temple on the mountain and chant scriptures every morning.","En el templo de la montaña viven algunos monjes que recitan las escrituras cada mañana al amanecer.","Dans le temple de la montagne vivent quelques moines qui récitent les sutras chaque matin à l'aube."],["L7-3527","杀害","shāhài","V","to murder","asesinar","assassiner","警方正在全力追捕杀害这名女子的凶手。","jǐng fāng zhèng zài quán lì zhuī bǔ shā hài zhè míng nǚ zǐ de xiōng shǒu","The police are making every effort to track down the person who murdered this woman.","La policía hace todo lo posible por capturar al asesino de esta mujer.","La police met tout en œuvre pour retrouver l'assassin de cette femme."],["L7-3528","杀手","shāshǒu","N","killer; hitman","asesino; sicario","tueur; tueur à gages","吸烟被称为健康的头号杀手。","xī yān bèi chēng wéi jiàn kāng de tóu hào shā shǒu","Smoking has been called the number one threat to health.","Fumar ha sido llamado el enemigo número uno de la salud.","Le tabagisme est considéré comme l'ennemi public numéro un de la santé."],["L7-3529","沙龙","shālóng","N","salon","salón","salon","这家书店每个月都会举办一次读书沙龙。","zhè jiā shū diàn měi ge yuè dōu huì jǔ bàn yí cì dú shū shā lóng","This bookstore holds a reading salon every month.","Esta librería organiza un salón de lectura todos los meses.","Cette librairie organise chaque mois un salon de lecture."],["L7-3530","沙滩","shātān","N","beach","playa","plage","孩子们在沙滩上堆了一座漂亮的沙堡。","hái zi men zài shā tān shàng duī le yí zuò piào liang de shā bǎo","The children built a beautiful sandcastle on the beach.","Los niños hicieron un hermoso castillo de arena en la playa.","Les enfants ont construit un joli château de sable sur la plage."],["L7-3531","纱","shā","N","yarn; gauze","hilo; gasa","fil; gaze","窗户上装了一层纱，蚊子就飞不进来了。","chuāng hu shàng zhuāng le yì céng shā wén zi jiù fēi bú jìn lái le","With a layer of gauze fitted over the window, mosquitoes can't fly in.","Con una malla en la ventana, los mosquitos ya no pueden entrar.","Avec une moustiquaire à la fenêtre, les moustiques ne peuvent plus entrer."],["L7-3532","刹车","shāchē","N","brake; to brake","freno; frenar","frein; freiner","汽车突然刹车时，乘客会因为惯性向前倾。","qì chē tū rán shā chē shí chéng kè huì yīn wèi guàn xìng xiàng qián qīng","When a car brakes suddenly, passengers lean forward because of inertia.","Cuando un auto frena de repente, los pasajeros se inclinan hacia adelante por la inercia.","Quand une voiture freine brusquement, les passagers se penchent vers l'avant à cause de l'inertie."],["L7-3533","砂糖","shātáng","N","granulated sugar","azúcar granulada","sucre en poudre","做蛋糕的时候，要先把鸡蛋和砂糖一起打匀。","zuò dàn gāo de shí hou yào xiān bǎ jī dàn hé shā táng yì qǐ dǎ yún","When making a cake, first beat the eggs and granulated sugar together.","Al hacer un pastel, primero hay que batir bien los huevos con el azúcar granulada.","Quand on fait un gâteau, il faut d'abord bien battre les œufs avec le sucre en poudre."],["L7-3534","鲨鱼","shāyú","N","shark","tiburón","requin","潜水的时候，我们远远地看到了一条鲨鱼。","qián shuǐ de shí hou wǒ men yuǎn yuǎn de kàn dào le yì tiáo shā yú","While diving, we saw a shark in the distance.","Mientras buceábamos, vimos un tiburón a lo lejos.","Pendant la plongée, nous avons aperçu un requin au loin."],["L7-3535","傻瓜","shǎguā","N","fool; idiot","tonto; idiota","idiot; imbécile","别把别人都当傻瓜，大家心里都清楚。","bié bǎ bié rén dōu dàng shǎ guā dà jiā xīn lǐ dōu qīng chu","Don't treat everyone else like fools — they all know what's going on.","No trates a los demás como tontos; todos saben perfectamente lo que pasa.","Ne prends pas les autres pour des imbéciles, tout le monde sait très bien ce qui se passe."],["L7-3536","筛","shāi","V","sieve; to sift","tamiz; cribar","tamis; tamiser","把面粉先筛一遍，做出来的蛋糕会更松软。","bǎ miàn fěn xiān shāi yí biàn zuò chū lái de dàn gāo huì gèng sōng ruǎn","Sift the flour first, and the cake will turn out fluffier.","Si primero tamizas la harina, el pastel quedará más esponjoso.","Tamise d'abord la farine et le gâteau sera plus moelleux."],["L7-3537","筛选","shāixuǎn","V","to screen; to filter","filtrar; seleccionar","filtrer; sélectionner","算法可以筛选信息，却不能替代使用者对信息真伪的判断。","suàn fǎ kě yǐ shāi xuǎn xìn xī què bù néng tì dài shǐ yòng zhě duì xìn xī zhēn wěi de pàn duàn","An algorithm can filter information, but it cannot replace the user's judgment about whether that information is genuine.","Un algoritmo puede filtrar información, pero no puede sustituir el juicio del usuario sobre si esa información es verdadera o falsa.","Un algorithme peut filtrer l'information, mais il ne peut pas remplacer le jugement de l'utilisateur sur sa véracité."],["L7-3538","晒太阳","shài tàiyáng","","to bask in the sun","tomar el sol","se faire dorer au soleil","一只老猫卧在门口晒太阳。","yì zhī lǎo māo wò zài mén kǒu shài tài yáng","An old cat is lying at the door basking in the sun.","Un gato viejo está echado en la puerta tomando el sol.","Un vieux chat est couché sur le seuil, à se prélasser au soleil."],["L7-3539","山川","shānchuān","N","mountains and rivers","montañas y ríos","montagnes et rivières","透过飞机的舷窗，我们看到了壮丽的山川。","tòu guò fēi jī de xián chuāng wǒ men kàn dào le zhuàng lì de shān chuān","Through the plane's window, we saw magnificent mountains and rivers.","A través de la ventanilla del avión vimos unas montañas y ríos majestuosos.","À travers le hublot de l'avion, nous avons vu de magnifiques montagnes et rivières."],["L7-3540","山顶","shāndǐng","N","mountaintop","cima de la montaña","sommet de la montagne","我们一鼓作气爬到了山顶。","wǒ men yì gǔ zuò qì pá dào le shān dǐng","We climbed to the top of the mountain in one go.","De un tirón subimos hasta la cima de la montaña.","D'une traite, nous avons grimpé jusqu'au sommet de la montagne."],["L7-3541","山冈","shāngāng","N","hillock","loma","colline","村子后面有一道山冈，上面种满了松树。","cūn zi hòu miàn yǒu yí dào shān gāng shàng miàn zhòng mǎn le sōng shù","Behind the village is a low hill covered with pine trees.","Detrás del pueblo hay una loma cubierta de pinos.","Derrière le village s'étend une colline plantée de pins."],["L7-3542","山岭","shānlǐng","N","mountain ridge","cordillera","chaîne de montagnes","连绵的山岭在云雾中若隐若现。","lián mián de shān lǐng zài yún wù zhōng ruò yǐn ruò xiàn","The rolling mountain ridges loom in and out of the mist.","Las montañas que se extienden sin fin aparecen y desaparecen entre las nubes y la niebla.","Les chaînes de montagnes qui se succèdent apparaissent et disparaissent dans les nuages et la brume."],["L7-3543","山路","shānlù","N","mountain road","camino de montaña","route de montagne","这条山路很曲折，开车一定要小心。","zhè tiáo shān lù hěn qū zhé kāi chē yí dìng yào xiǎo xīn","This mountain road is very winding, so be careful driving.","Este camino de montaña tiene muchas curvas; hay que manejar con mucho cuidado.","Cette route de montagne est très sinueuse ; il faut conduire avec prudence."],["L7-3544","山寨","shānzhài","N","knockoff; mountain stronghold","imitación; fortaleza de montaña","contrefaçon; repaire de montagne","小说里，一群好汉在山上建起了山寨。","xiǎo shuō lǐ yì qún hǎo hàn zài shān shàng jiàn qǐ le shān zhài","In the novel, a band of heroes built a stronghold in the mountains.","En la novela, un grupo de valientes construyó una fortaleza en la montaña.","Dans le roman, une bande de héros a bâti un repaire dans la montagne."],["L7-3545","删","shān","V","to delete","borrar","supprimer","这张照片拍得不好看，我已经把它删了。","zhè zhāng zhào piàn pāi de bù hǎo kàn wǒ yǐ jīng bǎ tā shān le","This photo didn't turn out well, so I've deleted it.","Esta foto no salió bien, así que ya la borré.","Cette photo n'est pas réussie, alors je l'ai déjà supprimée."],["L7-3546","删除","shānchú","V","to delete","eliminar; borrar","supprimer; effacer","数据一旦泄露，即使及时删除原始文件，也未必能挽回损失。","shù jù yí dàn xiè lòu jí shǐ jí shí shān chú yuán shǐ wén jiàn yě wèi bì néng wǎn huí sǔn shī","Once data has leaked, even promptly deleting the original files may not undo the damage.","Una vez que los datos se filtran, aunque se eliminen a tiempo los archivos originales, no necesariamente se puede reparar el daño.","Une fois les données divulguées, même en supprimant rapidement les fichiers d'origine, on ne peut pas forcément réparer les dégâts."],["L7-3547","煽动","shāndòng","V","to incite","incitar","inciter","这几个人因为在网上煽动闹事被拘留了。","zhè jǐ ge rén yīn wèi zài wǎng shàng shān dòng nào shì bèi jū liú le","These people were detained for inciting trouble online.","Estas personas fueron detenidas por incitar a disturbios en internet.","Ces personnes ont été placées en détention pour avoir incité à des troubles sur Internet."],["L7-3548","闪烁","shǎnshuò","V","to flicker; to twinkle","titilar; parpadear","scintiller; vaciller","夜空中的星星一闪一闪地闪烁着。","yè kōng zhōng de xīng xing yì shǎn yì shǎn de shǎn shuò zhe","The stars twinkle on and off in the night sky.","Las estrellas del cielo nocturno titilan una y otra vez.","Les étoiles dans le ciel nocturne scintillent sans cesse."],["L7-3549","善","shàn","Adj","good; kind; good at","bueno; amable; hábil","bon; bienveillant; doué","古代有的思想家认为，人的本性是善的。","gǔ dài yǒu de sī xiǎng jiā rèn wéi rén de běn xìng shì shàn de","Some ancient thinkers believed that human nature is good.","Algunos pensadores de la antigüedad opinaban que la naturaleza humana es buena.","Certains penseurs de l'Antiquité estimaient que la nature humaine est bonne."],["L7-3550","善意","shànyì","N","goodwill","buena voluntad","bonne volonté","他的批评是出于善意，你别往心里去。","tā de pī píng shì chū yú shàn yì nǐ bié wǎng xīn lǐ qù","His criticism was well-intentioned, so don't take it to heart.","Su crítica fue con buena intención, así que no te lo tomes a pecho.","Sa critique partait d'une bonne intention, ne la prends pas à cœur."],["L7-3551","擅长","shàncháng","V","to be good at","ser bueno en","être doué pour","他从小跟着爷爷学国画，最擅长画山水。","tā cóng xiǎo gēn zhe yé ye xué guó huà zuì shàn cháng huà shān shuǐ","He has studied traditional Chinese painting with his grandfather since childhood and is best at landscapes.","Desde pequeño aprendió pintura tradicional china con su abuelo y lo que mejor pinta son los paisajes.","Depuis l'enfance, il apprend la peinture traditionnelle chinoise avec son grand-père, et c'est dans le paysage qu'il excelle."],["L7-3552","擅自","shànzì","Adv","without permission","sin permiso","sans autorisation","合同中的条款一经双方签署，任何一方都不能擅自更改。","hé tóng zhōng de tiáo kuǎn yì jīng shuāng fāng qiān shǔ rèn hé yì fāng dōu bù néng shàn zì gēng gǎi","Once both parties sign the contract, neither may alter its terms without authorization.","Una vez que ambas partes firman las cláusulas del contrato, ninguna puede modificarlas por su cuenta.","Une fois les clauses du contrat signées par les deux parties, aucune d'elles ne peut les modifier de sa propre initiative."],["L7-3553","膳食","shànshí","N","meals; diet","comidas; dieta","repas; alimentation","多吃蔬菜可以补充膳食纤维。","duō chī shū cài kě yǐ bǔ chōng shàn shí xiān wéi","Eating more vegetables can help increase your dietary fiber intake.","Comer más verduras ayuda a aumentar la ingesta de fibra alimentaria.","Manger davantage de légumes permet d'augmenter son apport en fibres alimentaires."],["L7-3554","赡养","shànyǎng","V","to support (family members)","mantener (a familiares)","subvenir aux besoins de","子女有赡养父母的义务，这是法律规定的。","zǐ nǚ yǒu shàn yǎng fù mǔ de yì wù zhè shì fǎ lǜ guī dìng de","Children are obliged to support their parents; this is required by law.","Los hijos tienen la obligación de mantener a sus padres; así lo establece la ley.","Les enfants ont l'obligation de subvenir aux besoins de leurs parents ; c'est ce que prévoit la loi."],["L7-3555","伤残","shāngcán","V","disabled; handicapped","discapacitado; minusválido","handicapé; invalide","事故造成他下肢伤残，但他依然乐观地生活着。","shì gù zào chéng tā xià zhī shāng cán dàn tā yī rán lè guān de shēng huó zhe","The accident left him with a lower-limb disability, but he continues to live with optimism.","El accidente le dejó una discapacidad en las extremidades inferiores, pero sigue viviendo con optimismo.","L'accident lui a laissé un handicap aux membres inférieurs, mais il continue de vivre avec optimisme."],["L7-3556","伤感","shānggǎn","Adj","sad; sentimental","triste; sentimental","triste; sentimental","听到这首老歌，她不禁有些伤感。","tīng dào zhè shǒu lǎo gē tā bù jīn yǒu xiē shāng gǎn","Hearing this old song, she couldn't help feeling a little sad.","Al oír esta vieja canción, no pudo evitar sentirse un poco triste.","En entendant cette vieille chanson, elle n'a pu s'empêcher d'éprouver un peu de tristesse."],["L7-3557","伤痕","shānghén","N","scar; bruise","cicatriz; moretón","cicatrice; ecchymose","那场战争给这座城市留下了深深的伤痕。","nà chǎng zhàn zhēng gěi zhè zuò chéng shì liú xià le shēn shēn de shāng hén","That war left deep scars on this city.","Aquella guerra dejó profundas cicatrices en esta ciudad.","Cette guerre a laissé de profondes cicatrices dans cette ville."],["L7-3558","伤脑筋","shāng nǎojīn","","to be a headache","ser un quebradero de cabeza","donner du fil à retordre","孩子不爱吃饭，这件事让妈妈很伤脑筋。","hái zi bú ài chī fàn zhè jiàn shì ràng mā ma hěn shāng nǎo jīn","The child won't eat, and it's a real headache for his mother.","El niño no quiere comer, y eso le da muchos dolores de cabeza a su mamá.","L'enfant n'aime pas manger, et cela donne bien du souci à sa mère."],["L7-3559","伤势","shāngshì","N","extent of an injury","gravedad de la herida","gravité de la blessure","经过抢救，伤者的伤势已经稳定下来了。","jīng guò qiǎng jiù shāng zhě de shāng shì yǐ jīng wěn dìng xià lái le","After emergency treatment, the injured person's condition has stabilized.","Tras recibir atención de emergencia, el estado del herido se ha estabilizado.","Après les soins d'urgence, l'état du blessé s'est stabilisé."],["L7-3560","商贩","shāngfàn","N","vendor; peddler","vendedor; buhonero","marchand; colporteur","夜市上的商贩们大声地招呼着来往的行人。","yè shì shàng de shāng fàn men dà shēng de zhāo hu zhe lái wǎng de xíng rén","The vendors at the night market loudly hail the passers-by.","Los vendedores del mercado nocturno llaman a gritos a los transeúntes.","Les marchands du marché nocturne interpellent à voix haute les passants."],["L7-3561","商贾","shānggǔ","N","merchant","comerciante","marchand","这条古街在明清时期是商贾云集的地方。","zhè tiáo gǔ jiē zài míng qīng shí qī shì shāng gǔ yún jí de dì fang","During the Ming and Qing dynasties, this old street was where merchants gathered.","Durante las dinastías Ming y Qing, esta calle antigua era un lugar donde se reunían los comerciantes.","Sous les dynasties Ming et Qing, cette vieille rue était un lieu de rassemblement des marchands."],["L7-3562","商讨","shāngtǎo","V","to discuss; to deliberate","discutir; deliberar","discuter; délibérer","各方代表正在商讨如何解决水资源短缺的问题。","gè fāng dài biǎo zhèng zài shāng tǎo rú hé jiě jué shuǐ zī yuán duǎn quē de wèn tí","Representatives from all sides are discussing how to solve the water shortage.","Los representantes de todas las partes están discutiendo cómo resolver la escasez de recursos hídricos.","Les représentants de toutes les parties discutent des moyens de résoudre la pénurie d'eau."],["L7-3563","上报","shàngbào","V","to report to superiors","informar a los superiores","rendre compte à la hiérarchie","要是明天再交不上报告，我就完蛋了。","yào shi míng tiān zài jiāo bú shàng bào gào wǒ jiù wán dàn le","If I can't hand in the report tomorrow either, I'm done for.","Si mañana tampoco puedo entregar el informe, estoy acabado.","Si je ne rends pas le rapport demain non plus, je suis fichu."],["L7-3564","上场","shàngchǎng","","to go on stage; to take the field","salir a escena; saltar al campo","entrer en scène; entrer sur le terrain","比赛还剩十分钟时，教练派他上场了。","bǐ sài hái shèng shí fēn zhōng shí jiào liàn pài tā shàng chǎng le","With ten minutes left in the match, the coach sent him onto the field.","Cuando faltaban diez minutos para terminar el partido, el entrenador lo mandó a la cancha.","À dix minutes de la fin du match, l'entraîneur l'a envoyé sur le terrain."],["L7-3565","上方","shàngfāng","N","above; upper part","encima; parte superior","au-dessus; partie supérieure","法院大门上方挂着庄严的国徽。","fǎ yuàn dà mén shàng fāng guà zhe zhuāng yán de guó huī","The solemn national emblem hangs above the court's main entrance.","Sobre la puerta principal del tribunal cuelga el solemne escudo nacional.","Au-dessus de l'entrée principale du tribunal est accroché le solennel emblème national."],["L7-3566","上岗","shànggǎng","","to start work; to take up a post","incorporarse al puesto","prendre son poste","新员工要先培训一个月，考试合格后才能上岗。","xīn yuán gōng yào xiān péi xùn yí ge yuè kǎo shì hé gé hòu cái néng shàng gǎng","New employees must train for a month and pass an exam before they can start work.","Los nuevos empleados deben capacitarse durante un mes y aprobar un examen antes de empezar a trabajar.","Les nouveaux employés doivent suivre une formation d'un mois et réussir un examen avant de prendre leur poste."],["L7-3567","上火","shànghuǒ","","to get angry; to have excess heat","enfadarse; tener exceso de calor interno","s'énerver; avoir une chaleur interne","这几天吃了太多辣的，嘴上都起泡了，肯定是上火了。","zhè jǐ tiān chī le tài duō là de zuǐ shàng dōu qǐ pào le kěn dìng shì shàng huǒ le","I've eaten too much spicy food these past few days and have blisters on my lips — must be excess internal heat.","He comido demasiado picante estos días y tengo ampollas en la boca; seguro es exceso de calor interno.","J'ai trop mangé épicé ces derniers jours et j'ai des boutons de fièvre sur les lèvres : c'est sûrement un excès de chaleur interne."],["L7-3568","上空","shàngkōng","N","overhead; in the sky","en el cielo; sobre","dans le ciel; au-dessus","一架无人机在广场上空盘旋。","yí jià wú rén jī zài guǎng chǎng shàng kōng pán xuán","A drone circled in the sky above the square.","Un dron sobrevolaba en círculos la plaza.","Un drone tournoyait dans le ciel au-dessus de la place."],["L7-3569","上流","shàngliú","N","upper class","clase alta","classe supérieure","这部小说描写了上流社会的奢华生活。","zhè bù xiǎo shuō miáo xiě le shàng liú shè huì de shē huá shēng huó","This novel depicts the luxurious life of high society.","Esta novela describe la vida de lujo de la alta sociedad.","Ce roman décrit la vie fastueuse de la haute société."],["L7-3570","上期","shàng qī","","previous period","período anterior","période précédente","本期杂志的销量比上期增加了两成。","běn qī zá zhì de xiāo liàng bǐ shàng qī zēng jiā le liǎng chéng","Sales of this issue of the magazine were twenty percent higher than the previous one.","Las ventas de este número de la revista aumentaron un veinte por ciento con respecto al anterior.","Les ventes de ce numéro du magazine ont augmenté de vingt pour cent par rapport au précédent."],["L7-3571","上任","shàngrèn","","to take office; predecessor","asumir el cargo; predecesor","prendre ses fonctions; prédécesseur","新首相上任后很快组建了新内阁。","xīn shǒu xiàng shàng rèn hòu hěn kuài zǔ jiàn le xīn nèi gé","Soon after taking office, the new prime minister formed a new cabinet.","El nuevo primer ministro formó rápidamente un nuevo gabinete tras asumir el cargo.","Peu après son entrée en fonction, le nouveau Premier ministre a formé un nouveau cabinet."],["L7-3572","上述","shàngshù","Adj","above-mentioned","arriba mencionado","susmentionné","上述规定从下个月一号开始执行。","shàng shù guī dìng cóng xià ge yuè yī hào kāi shǐ zhí xíng","The above regulations take effect from the first of next month.","Las normas mencionadas entrarán en vigor el primero del mes que viene.","Les dispositions précitées seront appliquées à compter du premier du mois prochain."],["L7-3573","上司","shàngsi","N","boss; superior","jefe; superior","patron; supérieur","他和上司的关系不太好，正在考虑换工作。","tā hé shàng si de guān xì bú tài hǎo zhèng zài kǎo lǜ huàn gōng zuò","He doesn't get along well with his boss and is thinking about changing jobs.","No se lleva muy bien con su jefe y está pensando en cambiar de trabajo.","Il ne s'entend pas très bien avec son supérieur et envisage de changer d'emploi."],["L7-3574","上诉","shàngsù","V","to appeal (legal)","apelar; apelación","faire appel; appel","法院驳回了这项请求，但当事人仍可依法提出上诉。","fǎ yuàn bó huí le zhè xiàng qǐng qiú dàn dāng shì rén réng kě yī fǎ tí chū shàng sù","The court rejected the request, but the party concerned may still appeal in accordance with the law.","El tribunal rechazó esta solicitud, pero la parte interesada aún puede apelar conforme a la ley.","Le tribunal a rejeté cette demande, mais la partie concernée peut encore faire appel conformément à la loi."],["L7-3575","上调","shàngtiáo","V","to raise; to adjust upward","aumentar; ajustar al alza","relever; ajuster à la hausse","从下月起，本市的最低工资标准将上调。","cóng xià yuè qǐ běn shì de zuì dī gōng zī biāo zhǔn jiāng shàng tiáo","Starting next month, the city's minimum wage will be raised.","A partir del próximo mes, se aumentará el salario mínimo de esta ciudad.","À partir du mois prochain, le salaire minimum de la ville sera relevé."],["L7-3576","上头","shàngtou","N","to go to one's head; above","subirse a la cabeza; encima","monter à la tête; au-dessus","这种酒后劲很大，喝多了容易上头。","zhè zhǒng jiǔ hòu jìn hěn dà hē duō le róng yì shàng tóu","This liquor has a strong kick and easily goes to your head if you drink too much.","Este licor pega fuerte después y, si bebes demasiado, se te sube a la cabeza fácilmente.","Cet alcool a un effet puissant et monte facilement à la tête quand on en boit trop."],["L7-3577","上限","shàngxiàn","N","upper limit","límite superior","limite supérieure","这次比赛对参赛者的年龄设了上限。","zhè cì bǐ sài duì cān sài zhě de nián líng shè le shàng xiàn","This competition has set an upper age limit for participants.","En esta competencia se fijó un límite máximo de edad para los participantes.","Cette compétition a fixé une limite d'âge supérieure pour les participants."],["L7-3578","上旬","shàngxún","N","first ten days of a month","primeros diez días del mes","première décade du mois","考试安排在下个月上旬，大家要抓紧复习。","kǎo shì ān pái zài xià ge yuè shàng xún dà jiā yào zhuā jǐn fù xí","The exam is scheduled for early next month, so everyone should review diligently.","El examen está programado para principios del mes que viene, así que todos deben apurarse a repasar.","L'examen est prévu pour le début du mois prochain, alors tout le monde doit se hâter de réviser."],["L7-3579","上瘾","shàngyǐn","","to get addicted","volverse adicto","devenir accro","玩手机游戏很容易上瘾，一定要控制时间。","wán shǒu jī yóu xì hěn róng yì shàng yǐn yí dìng yào kòng zhì shí jiān","Mobile games are very addictive, so be sure to limit your time.","Los juegos del celular crean adicción fácilmente, así que hay que controlar el tiempo.","Les jeux sur téléphone rendent facilement accro, il faut absolument limiter le temps qu'on y passe."],["L7-3580","上映","shàngyìng","V","to screen (a film)","proyectar (una película)","projeter (un film)","这部电影下周五在全国各大影院上映。","zhè bù diàn yǐng xià zhōu wǔ zài quán guó gè dà yǐng yuàn shàng yìng","This film opens in cinemas nationwide next Friday.","Esta película se estrena el próximo viernes en los principales cines de todo el país.","Ce film sortira vendredi prochain dans les principales salles de cinéma du pays."],["L7-3581","上游","shàngyóu","N","upper reaches; upstream","curso alto; río arriba","cours supérieur; en amont","湖面上游着几只白色的天鹅。","hú miàn shàng yóu zhe jǐ zhī bái sè de tiān é","Several white swans were swimming on the lake.","En el lago nadaban varios cisnes blancos.","Quelques cygnes blancs nageaient sur le lac."],["L7-3582","尚","shàng","Adv/Conj","still; surname Shang","todavía; apellido Shang","encore; nom de famille Shang","调查结果只能说明两者相关，尚不足以证实其中存在因果关系。","diào chá jié guǒ zhǐ néng shuō míng liǎng zhě xiāng guān shàng bù zú yǐ zhèng shí qí zhōng cún zài yīn guǒ guān xì","The survey results show only a correlation and do not yet establish a causal relationship.","Los resultados de la encuesta solo muestran una correlación entre ambos y aún no bastan para demostrar una relación causal.","Les résultats de l'enquête montrent seulement une corrélation entre les deux et ne suffisent pas encore à établir un lien de causalité."],["L7-3583","尚未","shàngwèi","Adv","not yet","todavía no","pas encore","事故原因尚未查明，警方正在进一步调查。","shì gù yuán yīn shàng wèi chá míng jǐng fāng zhèng zài jìn yí bù diào chá","The cause of the accident has not yet been determined; police are investigating further.","Aún no se ha determinado la causa del accidente y la policía sigue investigando.","La cause de l'accident n'a pas encore été établie ; la police poursuit son enquête."],["L7-3584","捎","shāo","V","to take along; to bring to sb","llevar de paso; hacer llegar","transmettre; apporter en passant","你回老家的时候，帮我给爸妈捎点儿东西。","nǐ huí lǎo jiā de shí hou bāng wǒ gěi bà mā shāo diǎnr dōng xi","When you go back home, please take some things to my parents for me.","Cuando vuelvas a tu pueblo, llévales por favor algo a mis papás de mi parte.","Quand tu rentreras chez toi, peux-tu apporter quelque chose à mes parents de ma part ?"],["L7-3585","烧毁","shāohuǐ","V","to burn down","quemar; incendiar","brûler; incendier","这场大火烧毁了整条街，只有他家幸免。","zhè chǎng dà huǒ shāo huǐ le zhěng tiáo jiē zhǐ yǒu tā jiā xìng miǎn","The big fire destroyed the whole street; only his house was spared.","El gran incendio arrasó toda la calle; solo su casa se salvó.","Le grand incendie a détruit toute la rue ; seule sa maison a été épargnée."],["L7-3586","烧烤","shāokǎo","N","barbecue; to roast","barbacoa; asar","barbecue; griller","周末，我们几个朋友去河边搞了一次烧烤。","zhōu mò wǒ men jǐ ge péng you qù hé biān gǎo le yí cì shāo kǎo","At the weekend, a few of us friends had a barbecue by the river.","El fin de semana, unos amigos y yo hicimos una parrillada junto al río.","Ce week-end, quelques amis et moi avons fait un barbecue au bord de la rivière."],["L7-3587","稍后","shāohòu","Adv","later; in a moment","más tarde; en un momento","plus tard; dans un instant","开会的时候不方便接听电话，请稍后再打。","kāi huì de shí hou bù fāng biàn jiē tīng diàn huà qǐng shāo hòu zài dǎ","It's inconvenient to answer the phone during the meeting; please call back later.","Durante la reunión no es conveniente contestar llamadas; por favor, llame más tarde.","Il n'est pas commode de répondre au téléphone pendant la réunion ; veuillez rappeler plus tard."],["L7-3588","稍候","shāohòu","V","to wait a moment","esperar un momento","patienter un instant","请您稍候，经理马上就过来。","qǐng nín shāo hòu jīng lǐ mǎ shàng jiù guò lái","Please wait a moment; the manager will be right over.","Espere un momento, por favor; el gerente viene enseguida.","Veuillez patienter un instant, le directeur arrive tout de suite."],["L7-3589","稍稍","shāoshāo","Adv","slightly; a little","ligeramente; un poco","légèrement; un peu","天气一冷，铁轨会稍稍收缩。","tiān qì yì lěng tiě guǐ huì shāo shāo shōu suō","When the weather turns cold, the steel rails contract slightly.","Cuando el clima se enfría, los rieles de acero se contraen ligeramente.","Quand le temps se refroidit, les rails d'acier se contractent légèrement."],["L7-3590","少不了","shǎobuliǎo","V","cannot do without; bound to be","no poder faltar; ser inevitable","ne pas pouvoir se passer de; inévitable","搬家这么大的事，当然少不了朋友们的帮忙。","bān jiā zhè me dà de shì dāng rán shǎo bu liǎo péng you men de bāng máng","For something as big as moving house, of course you can't do without your friends' help.","Para algo tan grande como una mudanza, por supuesto no puede faltar la ayuda de los amigos.","Pour quelque chose d'aussi important qu'un déménagement, on ne peut évidemment pas se passer de l'aide des amis."],["L7-3591","少见","shǎojiàn","V/Adj","rare; seldom seen","raro; poco frecuente","rare; peu fréquent","这么大的雪在南方是很少见的。","zhè me dà de xuě zài nán fāng shì hěn shǎo jiàn de","Such heavy snow is rare in the south.","Una nevada tan fuerte es muy poco común en el sur.","Une neige aussi abondante est très rare dans le sud."],["L7-3592","少量","shǎoliàng","Adj","a small amount","poca cantidad","petite quantité","做这道菜只需要放少量的盐。","zuò zhè dào cài zhǐ xū yào fàng shǎo liàng de yán","This dish needs only a small amount of salt.","Para preparar este plato solo hace falta una pequeña cantidad de sal.","Pour préparer ce plat, il suffit d'un peu de sel."],["L7-3593","少有","shǎoyǒu","","rare; uncommon","raro; poco común","rare; peu commun","像他这样认真负责的年轻人现在是少有的。","xiàng tā zhè yàng rèn zhēn fù zé de nián qīng rén xiàn zài shì shǎo yǒu de","Young people as conscientious as he is are rare these days.","Jóvenes tan serios y responsables como él son poco comunes hoy en día.","Des jeunes aussi consciencieux que lui sont rares de nos jours."],["L7-3594","少林寺","Shàolín Sì","N","Shaolin Temple","templo Shaolin","temple Shaolin","少林寺以武术闻名，每年都有很多外国人来学功夫。","shào lín sì yǐ wǔ shù wén míng měi nián dōu yǒu hěn duō wài guó rén lái xué gōng fu","The Shaolin Temple is famous for martial arts, and many foreigners come every year to learn kung fu.","El templo Shaolin es famoso por las artes marciales y cada año vienen muchos extranjeros a aprender kung fu.","Le temple de Shaolin est célèbre pour les arts martiaux, et chaque année de nombreux étrangers viennent y apprendre le kung-fu."],["L7-3595","少女","shàonǚ","N","young girl","joven; muchacha","jeune fille","照片上的少女笑得很甜，那是奶奶年轻的时候。","zhào piàn shàng de shào nǚ xiào de hěn tián nà shi nǎi nai nián qīng de shí hou","The young girl in the photo has a sweet smile; that's Grandma when she was young.","La joven de la foto sonríe con dulzura; es mi abuela cuando era joven.","La jeune fille sur la photo a un sourire très doux ; c'est grand-mère quand elle était jeune."],["L7-3596","奢侈","shēchǐ","Adj","luxurious; extravagant","lujoso; derrochador","luxueux; extravagant","他的生活十分奢侈，一顿饭就要花好几千块。","tā de shēng huó shí fēn shē chǐ yí dùn fàn jiù yào huā hǎo jǐ qiān kuài","He lives extravagantly, spending thousands on a single meal.","Lleva una vida muy ostentosa: una sola comida le cuesta varios miles.","Il mène un train de vie très luxueux : un seul repas lui coûte plusieurs milliers."],["L7-3597","奢望","shēwàng","V/N","extravagant hope","esperanza desmedida","espoir démesuré","我不奢望能拿第一，只希望能发挥出正常水平。","wǒ bù shē wàng néng ná dì yī zhǐ xī wàng néng fā huī chū zhèng cháng shuǐ píng","I don't expect to come first; I just hope to perform at my normal level.","No pretendo ganar el primer lugar; solo espero rendir a mi nivel habitual.","Je n'ai pas la prétention de finir premier ; j'espère seulement être à mon niveau habituel."],["L7-3598","设","shè","V","to set up; to establish; suppose","establecer; instalar; suponer","établir; installer; supposer","这次比赛对参赛者的年龄设了上限。","zhè cì bǐ sài duì cān sài zhě de nián líng shè le shàng xiàn","This competition has set an upper age limit for participants.","En esta competencia se fijó un límite máximo de edad para los participantes.","Cette compétition a fixé une limite d'âge supérieure pour les participants."],["L7-3599","设定","shèdìng","V","to set; to configure","configurar; fijar","régler; configurer","你可以在手机上设定一个提醒，以免忘记吃药。","nǐ kě yǐ zài shǒu jī shàng shè dìng yí ge tí xǐng yǐ miǎn wàng jì chī yào","You can set a reminder on your phone so you don't forget to take your medicine.","Puedes programar un recordatorio en el celular para no olvidar tomar la medicina.","Tu peux programmer un rappel sur ton téléphone pour ne pas oublier de prendre tes médicaments."],["L7-3600","设法","shèfǎ","V","to try; to find a way","intentar; buscar la manera","essayer; chercher un moyen","我们一定会设法帮你找回丢失的行李。","wǒ men yí dìng huì shè fǎ bāng nǐ zhǎo huí diū shī de xíng li","We will certainly try to help you find your lost luggage.","Haremos todo lo posible por ayudarte a recuperar el equipaje perdido.","Nous ferons tout notre possible pour vous aider à retrouver vos bagages perdus."],["L7-3601","社会主义","shèhuì zhǔyì","","socialism","socialismo","socialisme","这本书介绍了社会主义思想的起源和发展。","zhè běn shū jiè shào le shè huì zhǔ yì sī xiǎng de qǐ yuán hé fā zhǎn","This book introduces the origins and development of socialist thought.","Este libro presenta el origen y el desarrollo del pensamiento socialista.","Ce livre présente les origines et le développement de la pensée socialiste."],["L7-3602","社交","shèjiāo","N","social interaction","interacción social","relations sociales","网络让年轻人的社交方式发生了很大变化。","wǎng luò ràng nián qīng rén de shè jiāo fāng shì fā shēng le hěn dà biàn huà","The internet has greatly changed the way young people socialize.","Internet ha cambiado mucho la forma en que socializan los jóvenes.","Internet a profondément changé la façon dont les jeunes socialisent."],["L7-3603","社论","shèlùn","N","editorial","editorial","éditorial","这家报纸今天发表了一篇关于环保的社论。","zhè jiā bào zhǐ jīn tiān fā biǎo le yì piān guān yú huán bǎo de shè lùn","This newspaper published an editorial on environmental protection today.","Hoy este periódico publicó un editorial sobre la protección del medio ambiente.","Ce journal a publié aujourd'hui un éditorial sur la protection de l'environnement."],["L7-3604","社团","shètuán","N","association; club","asociación; club","association; club","大学里有各种各样的社团，他参加了摄影社。","dà xué lǐ yǒu gè zhǒng gè yàng de shè tuán tā cān jiā le shè yǐng shè","There are all kinds of clubs at the university; he joined the photography club.","En la universidad hay todo tipo de clubes y él se unió al de fotografía.","À l'université, il y a toutes sortes d'associations, et il a rejoint le club photo."],["L7-3605","涉嫌","shèxián","V","to be suspected of","ser sospechoso de","être soupçonné de","这名男子涉嫌诈骗，已经被警方拘留。","zhè míng nán zǐ shè xián zhà piàn yǐ jīng bèi jǐng fāng jū liú","This man is suspected of fraud and has been detained by the police.","Este hombre es sospechoso de fraude y ya fue detenido por la policía.","Cet homme est soupçonné de fraude et a déjà été placé en garde à vue par la police."],["L7-3606","摄氏度","shèshìdù","M","degrees Celsius","grados Celsius","degrés Celsius","今天夜里最低气温只有零下十五摄氏度，出门要多穿点。","jīn tiān yè lǐ zuì dī qì wēn zhǐ yǒu líng xià shí wǔ shè shì dù chū mén yào duō chuān diǎn","Tonight's low is only minus fifteen degrees Celsius, so wrap up warm if you go out.","Esta noche la temperatura mínima será de solo quince grados bajo cero; abrígate bien si sales.","Cette nuit, la température minimale ne sera que de moins quinze degrés Celsius, couvrez-vous bien si vous sortez."],["L7-3607","谁知道","shéi zhīdào","","who knows; who would have thought","quién sabe; quién iba a pensar","qui sait; qui aurait pensé","我本来以为他会准时到，谁知道他睡过头了。","wǒ běn lái yǐ wéi tā huì zhǔn shí dào shéi zhī dào tā shuì guò tóu le","I thought he'd arrive on time — who'd have known he'd oversleep?","Pensé que llegaría puntual, pero resulta que se quedó dormido.","Je pensais qu'il arriverait à l'heure, mais il s'est rendormi, qui l'aurait cru."],["L7-3608","申办","shēnbàn","V","to apply for; to bid for","solicitar; presentar candidatura","demander; poser sa candidature","这座城市正在积极申办下一届亚运会。","zhè zuò chéng shì zhèng zài jī jí shēn bàn xià yí jiè yà yùn huì","This city is actively bidding to host the next Asian Games.","Esta ciudad se postula activamente para ser sede de los próximos Juegos Asiáticos.","Cette ville pose activement sa candidature pour accueillir les prochains Jeux asiatiques."],["L7-3609","申报","shēnbào","V","to declare; to report","declarar; informar","déclarer; signaler","入境时携带大量现金需要向海关申报。","rù jìng shí xié dài dà liàng xiàn jīn xū yào xiàng hǎi guān shēn bào","Carrying a large amount of cash when entering the country must be declared to customs.","Al ingresar al país, hay que declarar en la aduana si se lleva una gran cantidad de efectivo.","À l'entrée dans le pays, il faut déclarer à la douane toute grosse somme d'argent liquide transportée."],["L7-3610","申领","shēnlǐng","V","to apply for (a permit)","solicitar (un permiso)","demander (un permis)","符合条件的家庭可以申领每月的育儿补贴。","fú hé tiáo jiàn de jiā tíng kě yǐ shēn lǐng měi yuè de yù ér bǔ tiē","Eligible families can apply for a monthly childcare subsidy.","Las familias que cumplan los requisitos pueden solicitar el subsidio mensual para la crianza de los hijos.","Les familles remplissant les conditions peuvent demander l'allocation mensuelle pour la garde des enfants."],["L7-3611","伸手","shēnshǒu","","to reach out a hand","extender la mano","tendre la main","听见孩子哭，她本能地伸手把他抱了起来。","tīng jiàn hái zi kū tā běn néng de shēn shǒu bǎ tā bào le qǐ lái","On hearing the child cry, she instinctively reached out and picked him up.","Al oír llorar al niño, ella, por instinto, extendió la mano y lo levantó en brazos.","En entendant l'enfant pleurer, elle a tendu instinctivement la main et l'a pris dans ses bras."],["L7-3612","伸缩","shēnsuō","V","flexible; to extend and retract","flexible; extenderse y contraerse","flexible; s'étirer et se rétracter","这把雨伞的伞柄可以伸缩，放在包里很方便。","zhè bǎ yǔ sǎn de sǎn bǐng kě yǐ shēn suō fàng zài bāo lǐ hěn fāng biàn","This umbrella has a telescopic handle, so it's easy to carry in a bag.","El mango de este paraguas es telescópico y es muy cómodo de llevar en la mochila.","Le manche de ce parapluie est télescopique, ce qui le rend pratique à glisser dans un sac."],["L7-3613","伸张","shēnzhāng","V","to uphold; to promote","defender; promover","défendre; promouvoir","法律的作用就是伸张正义，保护无辜的人。","fǎ lǜ de zuò yòng jiù shì shēn zhāng zhèng yì bǎo hù wú gū de rén","The role of law is to uphold justice and protect the innocent.","La función de la ley es hacer justicia y proteger a los inocentes.","Le rôle de la loi est de rendre justice et de protéger les innocents."],["L7-3614","身不由己","shēnbùyóujǐ","","not in control of oneself","no poder evitarlo","ne pas être maître de soi","在那个年代，很多人都身不由己，无法决定自己的命运。","zài nà ge nián dài hěn duō rén dōu shēn bù yóu jǐ wú fǎ jué dìng zì jǐ de mìng yùn","In that era, many people were constrained by circumstances and could not determine their own destinies.","En aquella época, mucha gente no era dueña de sus actos y no podía decidir su propio destino.","À cette époque, beaucoup de gens n'étaient pas maîtres d'eux-mêmes et ne pouvaient pas décider de leur destin."],["L7-3615","身价","shēnjià","N","social status; worth","estatus social; valor","statut social; valeur","这位球员转会后，身价一下子涨了好几倍。","zhè wèi qiú yuán zhuǎn huì hòu shēn jià yí xià zi zhǎng le hǎo jǐ bèi","After the transfer, this player's market value rose several times over.","Tras su traspaso, el valor de mercado de este jugador se multiplicó varias veces de golpe.","Après son transfert, la valeur marchande de ce joueur a été multipliée d'un coup."],["L7-3616","身躯","shēnqū","N","body; stature","cuerpo; corpulencia","corps; stature","老人弯着瘦小的身躯，在田里慢慢地除草。","lǎo rén wān zhe shòu xiǎo de shēn qū zài tián lǐ màn màn de chú cǎo","Bending his thin, small frame, the old man slowly weeded the field.","El anciano, encorvando su cuerpo delgado y pequeño, desyerbaba lentamente el campo.","Le vieil homme, courbant son corps menu et frêle, désherbait lentement le champ."],["L7-3617","身心","shēnxīn","N","body and mind","cuerpo y mente","corps et esprit","经常到郊外走走，对身心健康都有好处。","jīng cháng dào jiāo wài zǒu zǒu duì shēn xīn jiàn kāng dōu yǒu hǎo chù","Going out to the countryside often is good for both physical and mental health.","Salir con frecuencia a las afueras es bueno para la salud física y mental.","Sortir souvent à la campagne est bon pour la santé physique et mentale."],["L7-3618","身影","shēnyǐng","N","figure; silhouette","silueta; figura","silhouette; figure","在人群中，我一眼就认出了妈妈的身影。","zài rén qún zhōng wǒ yì yǎn jiù rèn chū le mā ma de shēn yǐng","In the crowd, I recognized my mother's figure at a glance.","Entre la multitud, reconocí la silueta de mi madre al primer vistazo.","Dans la foule, j'ai reconnu la silhouette de ma mère au premier coup d'œil."],["L7-3619","身子","shēnzi","N","body; health","cuerpo; salud","corps; santé","他最近工作太累，身子越来越弱了。","tā zuì jìn gōng zuò tài lèi shēn zi yuè lái yuè ruò le","He has been working too hard lately, and his body is getting weaker and weaker.","Últimamente trabaja demasiado y su salud se debilita cada vez más.","Il travaille trop ces derniers temps et sa santé s'affaiblit de plus en plus."],["L7-3620","绅士","shēnshì","N","gentleman","caballero","gentleman","他总是主动帮女士开门，很有绅士风度。","tā zǒng shì zhǔ dòng bāng nǚ shì kāi mén hěn yǒu shēn shì fēng dù","He always opens the door for women — a real gentleman.","Siempre les abre la puerta a las señoras por iniciativa propia; es todo un caballero.","Il ouvre toujours spontanément la porte aux dames : c'est un vrai gentleman."],["L7-3621","深奥","shēn'ào","Adj","profound; abstruse","profundo; abstruso","profond; abstrus","这本哲学书太深奥了，我读了好几遍也没看懂。","zhè běn zhé xué shū tài shēn ào le wǒ dú le hǎo jǐ biàn yě méi kàn dǒng","This philosophy book is so abstruse that I've read it several times and still don't understand it.","Este libro de filosofía es tan profundo que lo leí varias veces y aun así no lo entendí.","Ce livre de philosophie est si abscons que je l'ai lu plusieurs fois sans le comprendre."],["L7-3622","深切","shēnqiè","Adj","deeply felt; sincere","profundo; sincero","profond; sincère","这位作家以诙谐的笔触描绘市井生活，字里行间却流露出深切的同情。","zhè wèi zuò jiā yǐ huī xié de bǐ chù miáo huì shì jǐng shēng huó zì lǐ háng jiān què liú lù chū shēn qiè de tóng qíng","The writer depicts everyday urban life with a humorous touch, while deep sympathy comes through between the lines.","La escritora retrata la vida cotidiana de la ciudad con un toque humorístico, pero entre líneas se percibe una profunda compasión.","L'écrivain dépeint la vie citadine avec une touche d'humour, mais une profonde compassion transparaît entre les lignes."],["L7-3623","深情","shēnqíng","N/Adj","deep affection","profundo cariño","affection profonde","他深情地望着远方，想起了故乡的亲人。","tā shēn qíng de wàng zhe yuǎn fāng xiǎng qǐ le gù xiāng de qīn rén","He gazed affectionately into the distance, thinking of his family back home.","Miraba a lo lejos con ternura, pensando en sus seres queridos de su tierra natal.","Il regardait au loin avec émotion, pensant aux siens restés au pays natal."],["L7-3624","深入人心","shēnrù-rénxīn","","to win people's hearts","calar hondo en la gente","gagner les cœurs","保护环境的观念已经深入人心。","bǎo hù huán jìng de guān niàn yǐ jīng shēn rù rén xīn","The idea of protecting the environment has taken deep root in people's minds.","La idea de proteger el medio ambiente ya ha calado hondo en la gente.","L'idée de protéger l'environnement est désormais bien ancrée dans les esprits."],["L7-3625","深受","shēnshòu","V","to be deeply affected by","recibir profundamente","être profondément marqué par","这部动画片深受孩子们的喜爱。","zhè bù dòng huà piàn shēn shòu hái zi men de xǐ ài","This cartoon is deeply loved by children.","Esta película animada es muy querida por los niños.","Ce dessin animé est très apprécié des enfants."],["L7-3626","深思","shēnsī","V","to ponder deeply","reflexionar profundamente","réfléchir profondément","老师的这番话值得我们每个人深思。","lǎo shī de zhè fān huà zhí dé wǒ men měi ge rén shēn sī","What the teacher said deserves deep reflection from every one of us.","Estas palabras del maestro merecen la reflexión profunda de todos nosotros.","Ces paroles du professeur méritent une profonde réflexion de la part de chacun de nous."],["L7-3627","深信","shēnxìn","V","to firmly believe","creer firmemente","croire fermement","我深信只要努力，总有一天会成功的。","wǒ shēn xìn zhǐ yào nǔ lì zǒng yǒu yì tiān huì chéng gōng de","I firmly believe that as long as I work hard, I'll succeed one day.","Estoy convencido de que, si me esfuerzo, algún día lo lograré.","Je suis profondément convaincu qu'à force d'efforts, je finirai par réussir un jour."],["L7-3628","深夜","shēnyè","N","late at night","altas horas de la noche","tard dans la nuit","为了完成报告，他一直工作直至深夜。","wèi le wán chéng bào gào tā yì zhí gōng zuò zhí zhì shēn yè","To finish the report, he kept working until late at night.","Para terminar el informe, siguió trabajando hasta entrada la noche.","Pour terminer le rapport, il a travaillé jusque tard dans la nuit."],["L7-3629","深远","shēnyuǎn","Adj","far-reaching; profound","de largo alcance; profundo","de grande portée; profond","儒家思想对中国社会产生了深远的影响。","rú jiā sī xiǎng duì zhōng guó shè huì chǎn shēng le shēn yuǎn de yǐng xiǎng","Confucian thought has had a profound influence on Chinese society.","El pensamiento confuciano ha ejercido una influencia profunda en la sociedad china.","La pensée confucéenne a exercé une influence profonde sur la société chinoise."],["L7-3630","神气","shénqì","N/Adj","vigorous; spirited; expression","enérgico; orgulloso; expresión","plein d'allure; fier; expression","他穿上新军装，显得特别神气。","tā chuān shàng xīn jūn zhuāng xiǎn de tè bié shén qì","In his new military uniform, he looks particularly smart and dashing.","Con su nuevo uniforme militar, se ve especialmente apuesto y orgulloso.","Dans son nouvel uniforme militaire, il a particulièrement fière allure."],["L7-3631","神圣","shénshèng","Adj","sacred; holy","sagrado; santo","sacré; saint","保卫祖国是每个公民神圣的职责。","bǎo wèi zǔ guó shì měi ge gōng mín shén shèng de zhí zé","Defending the motherland is the sacred duty of every citizen.","Defender la patria es el deber sagrado de todo ciudadano.","Défendre la patrie est le devoir sacré de tout citoyen."],["L7-3632","神态","shéntài","N","bearing; manner; look","porte; actitud; aspecto","allure; manière; air","她的表演没有刻意煽情，却凭借细腻的神态打动了观众。","tā de biǎo yǎn méi yǒu kè yì shān qíng què píng jiè xì nì de shén tài dǎ dòng le guān zhòng","Her performance avoided deliberate sentimentality, yet moved the audience through subtle expressions.","Su actuación no buscó deliberadamente el sentimentalismo, pero conmovió al público con la sutileza de sus gestos.","Son jeu ne cherchait pas délibérément à faire pleurer, mais il a ému le public par la subtilité de ses expressions."],["L7-3633","神仙","shénxiān","N","immortal; deity","inmortal; deidad","immortel; divinité","住在这样山清水秀的地方，日子过得像神仙一样。","zhù zài zhè yàng shān qīng shuǐ xiù de dì fang rì zi guò de xiàng shén xiān yí yàng","Life in such a scenic place amid hills and rivers is like that of an immortal.","Vivir en un lugar tan hermoso, de montañas y aguas cristalinas, es como vivir como un inmortal.","Vivre dans un endroit aussi pittoresque, entre montagnes et eaux claires, c'est mener une vie d'immortel."],["L7-3634","审","shěn","V","to examine; to try (in court)","examinar; juzgar","examiner; juger","这起案件将于下个月公开审判。","zhè qǐ àn jiàn jiāng yú xià ge yuè gōng kāi shěn pàn","This case will be tried publicly next month.","Este caso se juzgará públicamente el próximo mes.","Cette affaire sera jugée publiquement le mois prochain."],["L7-3635","审定","shěndìng","V","to review and approve","revisar y aprobar","examiner et approuver","这套新教材已经通过了专家的审定。","zhè tào xīn jiào cái yǐ jīng tōng guò le zhuān jiā de shěn dìng","This new set of textbooks has passed review by the experts.","Esta nueva serie de libros de texto ya fue aprobada por los expertos.","Cette nouvelle série de manuels a été validée par les experts."],["L7-3636","审核","shěnhé","V","to audit; to review","auditar; revisar","auditer; vérifier","您的申请材料正在审核中，请耐心等待。","nín de shēn qǐng cái liào zhèng zài shěn hé zhōng qǐng nài xīn děng dài","Your application materials are under review; please wait patiently.","Sus documentos de solicitud están en revisión; por favor espere con paciencia.","Votre dossier de demande est en cours d'examen, merci de patienter."],["L7-3637","审美","shěnměi","V","aesthetic appreciation","apreciación estética","appréciation esthétique","每个人的审美标准都不一样，没必要强求一致。","měi ge rén de shěn měi biāo zhǔn dōu bù yí yàng méi bì yào qiǎng qiú yí zhì","Everyone has different aesthetic standards; there's no need to force them to agree.","Cada persona tiene criterios estéticos distintos; no hace falta forzar a todos a coincidir.","Chacun a ses propres critères esthétiques ; il n'est pas nécessaire d'exiger l'unanimité."],["L7-3638","审判","shěnpàn","V","trial; to try","juicio; juzgar","procès; juger","这起案件将于下个月公开审判。","zhè qǐ àn jiàn jiāng yú xià ge yuè gōng kāi shěn pàn","This case will be tried publicly next month.","Este caso se juzgará públicamente el próximo mes.","Cette affaire sera jugée publiquement le mois prochain."],["L7-3639","审批","shěnpī","V","to review and approve","examinar y aprobar","examiner et approuver","政府为小企业松绑，简化了很多审批手续。","zhèng fǔ wèi xiǎo qǐ yè sōng bǎng jiǎn huà le hěn duō shěn pī shǒu xù","The government eased restrictions on small businesses, simplifying many approval procedures.","El gobierno flexibilizó las restricciones a las pequeñas empresas y simplificó muchos trámites de aprobación.","Le gouvernement a allégé les contraintes pesant sur les petites entreprises et simplifié de nombreuses procédures d'autorisation."],["L7-3640","审视","shěnshì","V","to examine closely","examinar de cerca","examiner de près","这轮产业转型既带来了新的机遇，也迫使企业重新审视劳动力的配置。","zhè lún chǎn yè zhuǎn xíng jì dài lái le xīn de jī yù yě pò shǐ qǐ yè chóng xīn shěn shì láo dòng lì de pèi zhì","This round of industrial transformation has created new opportunities while compelling companies to reconsider how they allocate their workforce.","Esta ola de transformación industrial ha traído nuevas oportunidades, pero también obliga a las empresas a replantearse la distribución de su fuerza laboral.","Cette vague de transformation industrielle a apporté de nouvelles opportunités, mais oblige aussi les entreprises à repenser la répartition de leur main-d'œuvre."],["L7-3641","肾","shèn","N","kidney","riñón","rein","医生说他的肾有点问题，要少吃咸的东西。","yī shēng shuō tā de shèn yǒu diǎn wèn tí yào shǎo chī xián de dōng xi","The doctor said there's a problem with his kidneys and he should eat less salty food.","El médico dijo que tiene un problema en los riñones y que debe comer menos cosas saladas.","Le médecin a dit qu'il avait un problème de reins et qu'il devait manger moins salé."],["L7-3642","甚至于","shènzhìyú","Adv","even; to the extent that","incluso; hasta el punto de","même; au point de","他太专注于研究，甚至于忘了自己的生日。","tā tài zhuān zhù yú yán jiū shèn zhì yú wàng le zì jǐ de shēng rì","He was so absorbed in his research that he even forgot his own birthday.","Estaba tan concentrado en su investigación que hasta se olvidó de su propio cumpleaños.","Il était tellement absorbé par ses recherches qu'il en a même oublié son propre anniversaire."],["L7-3643","渗","shèn","V","to seep; to ooze","filtrarse; rezumar","suinter; s'infiltrer","连着下了几天雨，雨水从屋顶渗了下来。","lián zhe xià le jǐ tiān yǔ yǔ shuǐ cóng wū dǐng shèn le xià lái","After several days of rain, water seeped down through the roof.","Después de varios días seguidos de lluvia, el agua se filtró por el techo.","Après plusieurs jours de pluie consécutifs, l'eau s'est infiltrée par le toit."],["L7-3644","渗透","shèntòu","V","to permeate; to penetrate","impregnar; penetrar","imprégner; pénétrer","环保意识已经渗透到人们生活的方方面面。","huán bǎo yì shí yǐ jīng shèn tòu dào rén men shēng huó de fāng fāng miàn miàn","Environmental awareness has permeated every aspect of people's lives.","La conciencia ambiental ya ha penetrado en todos los aspectos de la vida de la gente.","La conscience écologique a désormais pénétré tous les aspects de la vie quotidienne."],["L7-3645","慎重","shènzhòng","Adj","cautious; prudent","cauteloso; prudente","prudent; circonspect","换工作是一件大事，你要慎重考虑。","huàn gōng zuò shì yí jiàn dà shì nǐ yào shèn zhòng kǎo lǜ","Changing jobs is a big decision, so you should consider it carefully.","Cambiar de trabajo es algo importante; debes pensarlo con cuidado.","Changer de travail est une décision importante, il faut y réfléchir avec prudence."],["L7-3646","升温","shēngwēn","V","to heat up; to intensify","calentarse; intensificarse","se réchauffer; s'intensifier","最近几天天气迅速升温，已经有了夏天的感觉。","zuì jìn jǐ tiān tiān qì xùn sù shēng wēn yǐ jīng yǒu le xià tiān de gǎn jué","The weather has warmed up quickly over the past few days, and it already feels like summer.","En los últimos días la temperatura ha subido rápidamente y ya se siente como verano.","Ces derniers jours, la température a rapidement grimpé et on se croirait déjà en été."],["L7-3647","生机","shēngjī","N","vitality; life force","vitalidad; fuerza vital","vitalité; force vitale","这片原本贫瘠的土地，经过多年治理，终于恢复了生机。","zhè piàn yuán běn pín jí de tǔ dì jīng guò duō nián zhì lǐ zhōng yú huī fù le shēng jī","After years of restoration, this once-barren land has finally regained its vitality.","Esta tierra antes estéril, tras muchos años de recuperación, por fin recobró su vitalidad.","Cette terre autrefois aride a fini par retrouver sa vitalité après de nombreuses années de remise en état."],["L7-3648","生理","shēnglǐ","N","physiology","fisiología","physiologie","青春期的孩子会经历很多生理和心理上的变化。","qīng chūn qī de hái zi huì jīng lì hěn duō shēng lǐ hé xīn lǐ shàng de biàn huà","Adolescents go through many physical and psychological changes.","Los niños en la pubertad atraviesan muchos cambios físicos y psicológicos.","Les enfants à l'adolescence traversent de nombreux changements physiques et psychologiques."],["L7-3649","生命线","shēngmìngxiàn","N","lifeline","línea vital","bouée de sauvetage","这条公路是山区群众的生命线。","zhè tiáo gōng lù shì shān qū qún zhòng de shēng mìng xiàn","This road is a lifeline for the people of the mountain region.","Esta carretera es la línea vital de la gente de la zona montañosa.","Cette route est la bouée de sauvetage des habitants de la région montagneuse."],["L7-3650","生怕","shēngpà","V","for fear that","por miedo a que","de peur que","她生怕吵醒孩子，走路都是轻手轻脚的。","tā shēng pà chǎo xǐng hái zi zǒu lù dōu shì qīng shǒu qīng jiǎo de","Afraid of waking the baby, she tiptoed around.","Temiendo despertar al niño, caminaba con mucho sigilo.","Craignant de réveiller l'enfant, elle marchait à pas de loup."],["L7-3651","生平","shēngpíng","N","one's life; lifetime","vida; trayectoria","vie; parcours","纪念馆里展出了这位作家的生平事迹。","jì niàn guǎn lǐ zhǎn chū le zhè wèi zuò jiā de shēng píng shì jì","The memorial hall displays the life story of this writer.","En el museo conmemorativo se exhibe la vida y obra de este escritor.","Le mémorial expose la vie et les faits marquants de cet écrivain."],["L7-3652","生前","shēngqián","N","during one's lifetime","en vida","de son vivant","这些书都是爷爷生前最喜欢读的。","zhè xiē shū dōu shì yé ye shēng qián zuì xǐ huan dú de","These books were Grandpa's favorites during his lifetime.","Todos estos libros eran los que más le gustaba leer a mi abuelo en vida.","Tous ces livres étaient ceux que grand-père aimait le plus lire de son vivant."],["L7-3653","生死","shēngsǐ","N/Adj","life and death","vida o muerte","vie et mort","在生死关头，他毫不犹豫地救了战友。","zài shēng sǐ guān tóu tā háo bù yóu yù de jiù le zhàn yǒu","At the moment of life and death, he saved his comrade without the slightest hesitation.","En el momento crítico entre la vida y la muerte, salvó a su compañero sin dudarlo.","À l'instant décisif entre la vie et la mort, il a sauvé son camarade sans la moindre hésitation."],["L7-3654","生态","shēngtài","N","ecology","ecología","écologie","保护生物多样性，不能只关注少数珍稀物种，还要维护完整的生态系统。","bǎo hù shēng wù duō yàng xìng bù néng zhǐ guān zhù shǎo shù zhēn xī wù zhǒng hái yào wéi hù wán zhěng de shēng tài xì tǒng","Protecting biodiversity requires attention to more than a few rare species; it also requires preserving whole ecosystems.","Para proteger la biodiversidad no basta con prestar atención a unas pocas especies raras, sino que también hay que preservar los ecosistemas completos.","Pour protéger la biodiversité, il ne suffit pas de se préoccuper de quelques espèces rares : il faut aussi préserver des écosystèmes entiers."],["L7-3655","生物","shēngwù","N","living thing; biological","ser vivo; biológico","être vivant; biologique","农民们用生物方法消灭害虫，减少使用农药。","nóng mín men yòng shēng wù fāng fǎ xiāo miè hài chóng jiǎn shǎo shǐ yòng nóng yào","Farmers use biological methods to eliminate pests and reduce pesticide use.","Los agricultores usan métodos biológicos para eliminar las plagas y reducir el uso de pesticidas.","Les agriculteurs utilisent des méthodes biologiques pour éliminer les nuisibles et réduire l'emploi de pesticides."],["L7-3656","生效","shēngxiào","","to take effect","entrar en vigor","entrer en vigueur","新的劳动法将于明年一月一日起正式生效。","xīn de láo dòng fǎ jiāng yú míng nián yī yuè yī rì qǐ zhèng shì shēng xiào","The new labor law will formally take effect on January first next year.","La nueva ley laboral entrará oficialmente en vigor el primero de enero del próximo año.","Le nouveau code du travail entrera officiellement en vigueur le 1er janvier de l'an prochain."],["L7-3657","生涯","shēngyá","N","career; life","carrera; vida","carrière; vie","退役以后，他开始了自己的教练生涯。","tuì yì yǐ hòu tā kāi shǐ le zì jǐ de jiào liàn shēng yá","After retiring from competition, he began his coaching career.","Tras retirarse, comenzó su carrera como entrenador.","Après avoir pris sa retraite sportive, il a commencé sa carrière d'entraîneur."],["L7-3658","生硬","shēngyìng","Adj","stiff; blunt","rígido; brusco","raide; brusque","他的中文说得还有点生硬，但进步很快。","tā de zhōng wén shuō de hái yǒu diǎn shēng yìng dàn jìn bù hěn kuài","His Chinese still sounds a bit stiff, but he's improving quickly.","Su chino todavía suena un poco acartonado, pero progresa rápidamente.","Son chinois est encore un peu raide, mais il progresse vite."],["L7-3659","生育","shēngyù","V","to give birth; to bear children","dar a luz; tener hijos","donner naissance; avoir des enfants","随着生育率下降，人口老龄化问题越来越突出。","suí zhe shēng yù lǜ xià jiàng rén kǒu lǎo líng huà wèn tí yuè lái yuè tū chū","As the fertility rate falls, population aging is becoming an increasingly serious issue.","A medida que baja la tasa de natalidad, el envejecimiento de la población se vuelve un problema cada vez más evidente.","Avec la baisse du taux de natalité, le vieillissement de la population devient un problème de plus en plus manifeste."],["L7-3660","声称","shēngchēng","V","to claim; to assert","afirmar; declarar","prétendre; affirmer","这家公司声称他们的产品没有任何质量问题。","zhè jiā gōng sī shēng chēng tā men de chǎn pǐn méi yǒu rèn hé zhì liàng wèn tí","The company claims that its products have no quality problems whatsoever.","Esta empresa afirma que sus productos no tienen ningún problema de calidad.","Cette entreprise affirme que ses produits ne présentent aucun problème de qualité."],["L7-3661","声望","shēngwàng","N","prestige; reputation","prestigio; reputación","prestige; réputation","这位老中医在当地很有声望，很多人从外地赶来看病。","zhè wèi lǎo zhōng yī zài dāng dì hěn yǒu shēng wàng hěn duō rén cóng wài dì gǎn lái kàn bìng","This old doctor of traditional Chinese medicine enjoys great prestige locally, and many people travel from afar to see him.","Este viejo médico de medicina tradicional china tiene mucho prestigio en la zona y mucha gente viene de otros lugares a consultarlo.","Ce vieux médecin de médecine traditionnelle chinoise jouit d'une grande réputation dans la région, et beaucoup de gens viennent de loin pour le consulter."],["L7-3662","声誉","shēngyù","N","reputation; fame","reputación; fama","réputation; renommée","一次质量事故就可能毁掉一家企业多年的声誉。","yí cì zhì liàng shì gù jiù kě néng huǐ diào yì jiā qǐ yè duō nián de shēng yù","A single incident caused by poor quality can ruin the reputation a company has built over many years.","Un solo accidente por mala calidad puede arruinar la reputación que una empresa construyó durante años.","Un seul accident dû à un défaut de qualité peut ruiner la réputation qu'une entreprise a mis des années à bâtir."],["L7-3663","牲畜","shēngchù","N","livestock","ganado","bétail","大雪封山以后，牧民们最担心的是牲畜没有草吃。","dà xuě fēng shān yǐ hòu mù mín men zuì dān xīn de shì shēng chù méi yǒu cǎo chī","After heavy snow blocked access to the mountains, the herders' greatest worry was that their livestock had no grass to eat.","Cuando la fuerte nevada cerró la montaña, lo que más preocupaba a los pastores era que el ganado no tuviera pasto.","Quand la neige abondante a coupé l'accès à la montagne, ce qui inquiétait le plus les éleveurs, c'était que le bétail n'ait plus d'herbe à manger."],["L7-3664","绳子","shéngzi","N","rope; cord","cuerda; soga","corde","搬家前，他用绳子把箱子勒得紧紧的。","bān jiā qián tā yòng shéng zi bǎ xiāng zi lēi de jǐn jǐn de","Before moving, he tied the boxes up tightly with rope.","Antes de la mudanza, ató las cajas muy bien apretadas con una cuerda.","Avant le déménagement, il a ficelé les cartons bien serrés avec une corde."],["L7-3665","省略","shěnglüè","V","to omit; omission","omitir; omisión","omettre; omission","这一段内容跟主题关系不大，可以省略。","zhè yí duàn nèi róng gēn zhǔ tí guān xì bú dà kě yǐ shěng lüè","This passage has little to do with the topic and can be left out.","Este pasaje tiene poca relación con el tema y se puede omitir.","Ce passage a peu de rapport avec le sujet et peut être omis."],["L7-3666","省事","shěngshì","","to save trouble","ahorrarse molestias","s'éviter des ennuis","在网上交水电费很省事，不用再去银行排队了。","zài wǎng shàng jiāo shuǐ diàn fèi hěn shěng shì bú yòng zài qù yín háng pái duì le","Paying utility bills online saves a lot of trouble; there's no more queuing at the bank.","Pagar las cuentas de luz y agua por internet es muy cómodo; ya no hay que hacer fila en el banco.","Payer ses factures d'eau et d'électricité en ligne est très pratique : plus besoin de faire la queue à la banque."],["L7-3667","圣贤","shèngxián","N","sage; wise and holy man","sabio; santo","sage; saint homme","古代的圣贤留下了许多关于做人的道理。","gǔ dài de shèng xián liú xià le xǔ duō guān yú zuò rén de dào lǐ","The sages of ancient times left behind many lessons on how to conduct oneself.","Los sabios de la antigüedad nos dejaron muchas enseñanzas sobre cómo comportarse en la vida.","Les sages de l'Antiquité nous ont laissé de nombreux enseignements sur la façon de se conduire."],["L7-3668","胜出","shèngchū","V","to win; to come out on top","ganar; imponerse","l'emporter; sortir vainqueur","经过三轮比拼，她最终在比赛中胜出。","jīng guò sān lún bǐ pīn tā zuì zhōng zài bǐ sài zhōng shèng chū","After three rounds of competition, she finally came out on top.","Tras tres rondas de competencia, finalmente ella salió victoriosa.","Après trois manches de compétition, elle l'a finalement emporté."],["L7-3669","胜任","shèngrèn","V","to be competent","ser competente","être à la hauteur","他有十年的管理经验，完全能胜任这份工作。","tā yǒu shí nián de guǎn lǐ jīng yàn wán quán néng shèng rèn zhè fèn gōng zuò","He has ten years of management experience and is fully qualified for the job.","Tiene diez años de experiencia en gestión y está totalmente capacitado para este puesto.","Il a dix ans d'expérience en gestion et est tout à fait capable d'occuper ce poste."],["L7-3670","盛大","shèngdà","Adj","grand; magnificent","grandioso; magnífico","grandiose; magnifique","国庆节那天，广场上举行了盛大的游行。","guó qìng jié nà tiān guǎng chǎng shàng jǔ xíng le shèng dà de yóu xíng","On National Day, a grand parade was held in the square.","El día de la Fiesta Nacional se celebró un gran desfile en la plaza.","Le jour de la Fête nationale, un grand défilé a eu lieu sur la place."],["L7-3671","盛会","shènghuì","N","grand gathering","gran reunión","grand rassemblement","这届博览会是全球科技界的一次盛会。","zhè jiè bó lǎn huì shì quán qiú kē jì jiè de yí cì shèng huì","This expo is a grand gathering for the global technology community.","Esta feria es un gran encuentro para el mundo tecnológico mundial.","Cette exposition est un grand rendez-vous pour le monde de la technologie à l'échelle mondiale."],["L7-3672","盛开","shèngkāi","V","to be in full bloom","florecer plenamente","être en pleine floraison","这里四季鲜花盛开，是名副其实的花城。","zhè lǐ sì jì xiān huā shèng kāi shì míng fù qí shí de huā chéng","Flowers bloom here in all four seasons; it truly lives up to its name as a city of flowers.","Aquí florecen las flores en las cuatro estaciones; de verdad merece el nombre de ciudad de las flores.","Les fleurs s'épanouissent ici en toute saison ; c'est vraiment une ville des fleurs digne de ce nom."],["L7-3673","盛气凌人","shèngqì-língrén","","arrogant; overbearing","arrogante; prepotente","arrogant; autoritaire","他说话总是盛气凌人，同事们都不太喜欢他。","tā shuō huà zǒng shì shèng qì líng rén tóng shì men dōu bú tài xǐ huan tā","He always speaks in an overbearing manner, and his colleagues don't much like him.","Siempre habla con arrogancia y a sus compañeros no les cae muy bien.","Il parle toujours avec arrogance et ses collègues ne l'apprécient guère."],["L7-3674","剩余","shèngyú","V","remainder; surplus","resto; excedente","reste; surplus","他把剩余的时间都用来复习功课了。","tā bǎ shèng yú de shí jiān dōu yòng lái fù xí gōng kè le","He spent the remaining time reviewing his lessons.","Dedicó todo el tiempo que le quedaba a repasar sus lecciones.","Il a consacré tout le temps qui lui restait à réviser ses cours."],["L7-3675","尸体","shītǐ","N","corpse","cadáver","cadavre","警方在河边发现了一具尸体，正在调查死者身份。","jǐng fāng zài hé biān fā xiàn le yí jù shī tǐ zhèng zài diào chá sǐ zhě shēn fèn","Police found a body by the river and are investigating the identity of the deceased.","La policía halló un cadáver junto al río y está investigando la identidad de la víctima.","La police a découvert un cadavre au bord de la rivière et enquête sur l'identité de la victime."],["L7-3676","失传","shīchuán","V","to be lost (of skills)","perderse (de saberes)","se perdre (savoir-faire)","这种古老的手艺已经快要失传了。","zhè zhǒng gǔ lǎo de shǒu yì yǐ jīng kuài yào shī chuán le","This ancient craft is on the verge of being lost.","Este antiguo oficio artesanal está a punto de perderse.","Ce savoir-faire ancestral est sur le point de disparaître."],["L7-3677","失控","shīkòng","V","to lose control","perder el control","perdre le contrôle","汽车在冰面上突然失控，撞上了路边的护栏。","qì chē zài bīng miàn shàng tū rán shī kòng zhuàng shàng le lù biān de hù lán","The car suddenly went out of control on the ice and crashed into the roadside guardrail.","El auto perdió el control de repente sobre el hielo y chocó contra la barandilla de la carretera.","La voiture a soudain perdu le contrôle sur la glace et heurté la glissière de sécurité."],["L7-3678","失利","shīlì","","to suffer defeat","sufrir una derrota","subir une défaite","比赛失利以后，他一度很消沉。","bǐ sài shī lì yǐ hòu tā yí dù hěn xiāo chén","After losing the match, he was very depressed for a while.","Tras perder el partido, estuvo muy decaído durante un tiempo.","Après avoir perdu le match, il a été très abattu pendant un moment."],["L7-3679","失恋","shīliàn","","to be jilted; to break up","sufrir un desamor; romper","souffrir d'une peine de cœur; rompre","他失恋以后，整个人都瘦了一圈。","tā shī liàn yǐ hòu zhěng gè rén dōu shòu le yì quān","After his breakup, he lost a lot of weight.","Después de que lo dejó su pareja, adelgazó muchísimo.","Depuis sa rupture amoureuse, il a beaucoup maigri."],["L7-3680","失灵","shīlíng","V","to malfunction","dejar de funcionar","tomber en panne","电梯的按钮突然失灵了，我们被困了半个小时。","diàn tī de àn niǔ tū rán shī líng le wǒ men bèi kùn le bàn ge xiǎo shí","The elevator buttons suddenly stopped working, and we were stuck for half an hour.","Los botones del ascensor dejaron de funcionar de repente y nos quedamos atrapados media hora.","Les boutons de l'ascenseur sont soudain tombés en panne et nous sommes restés bloqués une demi-heure."],["L7-3681","失落","shīluò","V/Adj","to lose; to feel let down","perder; sentirse decepcionado","perdre; se sentir abattu","没能参加决赛，她心里感到很失落。","méi néng cān jiā jué sài tā xīn lǐ gǎn dào hěn shī luò","She felt very disappointed that she had been unable to take part in the final.","No poder participar en la final la dejó muy desanimada.","Elle s'est sentie très abattue de n'avoir pas pu participer à la finale."],["L7-3682","失眠","shīmián","","insomnia","insomnio","insomnie","他最近压力很大，经常失眠到凌晨。","tā zuì jìn yā lì hěn dà jīng cháng shī mián dào líng chén","He's been under a lot of pressure lately and often can't sleep until the early hours.","Últimamente está sometido a mucha presión y a menudo no puede dormir hasta la madrugada.","Il subit beaucoup de pression ces derniers temps et souffre souvent d'insomnie jusqu'au petit matin."],["L7-3683","失明","shīmíng","","to go blind","quedarse ciego","devenir aveugle","一场意外让他双目失明，但他没有放弃生活。","yì chǎng yì wài ràng tā shuāng mù shī míng dàn tā méi yǒu fàng qì shēng huó","An accident left him blind in both eyes, but he didn't give up on life.","Un accidente lo dejó ciego de ambos ojos, pero no renunció a la vida.","Un accident l'a rendu aveugle des deux yeux, mais il n'a pas renoncé à la vie."],["L7-3684","失效","shīxiào","","to become invalid","perder vigencia; fallar","devenir invalide; perdre son effet","这张优惠券已经过期失效了。","zhè zhāng yōu huì quàn yǐ jīng guò qī shī xiào le","This coupon has expired and is no longer valid.","Este cupón de descuento ya caducó y ya no es válido.","Ce bon de réduction est périmé et n'est plus valable."],["L7-3685","失业率","shīyèlǜ","N","unemployment rate","tasa de desempleo","taux de chômage","经济不景气，今年的失业率有所上升。","jīng jì bù jǐng qì jīn nián de shī yè lǜ yǒu suǒ shàng shēng","With the economy in a slump, the unemployment rate has risen somewhat this year.","Con la economía en recesión, la tasa de desempleo ha subido un poco este año.","L'économie étant en berne, le taux de chômage a un peu augmenté cette année."],["L7-3686","失踪","shīzōng","","to go missing","desaparecer","disparaître","直升机在海面上搜寻失踪的渔船。","zhí shēng jī zài hǎi miàn shàng sōu xún shī zōng de yú chuán","Helicopters searched the sea for the missing fishing boat.","Los helicópteros buscaban en el mar el barco pesquero desaparecido.","Des hélicoptères recherchaient en mer le bateau de pêche disparu."],["L7-3687","师范","shīfàn","N","teacher training","formación docente","formation des enseignants","她毕业于一所师范大学，后来回到家乡当了老师。","tā bì yè yú yì suǒ shī fàn dà xué hòu lái huí dào jiā xiāng dāng le lǎo shī","She graduated from a teachers' university and later returned home to teach.","Se graduó en una universidad pedagógica y después volvió a su pueblo natal para ser maestra.","Elle est diplômée d'une université de formation des enseignants et est ensuite retournée dans sa région natale pour enseigner."],["L7-3688","师长","shīzhǎng","N","teacher; division commander","maestro; comandante de división","enseignant; commandant de division","学生们在毕业典礼上向师长表达了感谢。","xué shēng men zài bì yè diǎn lǐ shàng xiàng shī zhǎng biǎo dá le gǎn xiè","At the graduation ceremony, the students expressed their gratitude to their teachers.","En la ceremonia de graduación, los estudiantes expresaron su agradecimiento a sus maestros.","Lors de la cérémonie de remise des diplômes, les étudiants ont exprimé leur gratitude à leurs professeurs."],["L7-3689","师资","shīzī","N","teaching staff","profesorado","corps enseignant","这所学校师资力量雄厚，很多老师都有博士学位。","zhè suǒ xué xiào shī zī lì liàng xióng hòu hěn duō lǎo shī dōu yǒu bó shì xué wèi","This school has a strong teaching staff, and many teachers hold doctorates.","Esta escuela cuenta con un sólido cuerpo docente y muchos profesores tienen doctorado.","Cette école dispose d'un corps enseignant solide, et beaucoup de professeurs sont titulaires d'un doctorat."],["L7-3690","狮子","shīzi","N","lion; Leo","león; Leo","lion; Lion","动物园里的狮子懒洋洋地躺在树荫下睡觉。","dòng wù yuán lǐ de shī zi lǎn yāng yāng de tǎng zài shù yīn xià shuì jiào","The lions at the zoo lay lazily asleep in the shade of the trees.","Los leones del zoológico dormían perezosamente a la sombra de los árboles.","Les lions du zoo dormaient paresseusement à l'ombre des arbres."],["L7-3691","施工","shīgōng","","construction work","obras; construcción","travaux; chantier","前方道路施工，请车辆绕行。","qián fāng dào lù shī gōng qǐng chē liàng rào xíng","Road construction ahead — vehicles please take a detour.","Hay obras en la carretera más adelante; los vehículos deben tomar un desvío.","Travaux sur la route plus loin : les véhicules sont priés de faire un détour."],["L7-3692","施加","shījiā","V","to exert (pressure)","ejercer (presión)","exercer (une pression)","父母不要给孩子施加太大的压力。","fù mǔ bú yào gěi hái zi shī jiā tài dà de yā lì","Parents shouldn't put too much pressure on their children.","Los padres no deben presionar demasiado a sus hijos.","Les parents ne devraient pas exercer trop de pression sur leurs enfants."],["L7-3693","施行","shīxíng","V","to implement; to take effect","aplicar; entrar en vigor","mettre en œuvre; entrer en vigueur","这部法律从公布之日起施行。","zhè bù fǎ lǜ cóng gōng bù zhī rì qǐ shī xíng","This law takes effect from the date of its promulgation.","Esta ley entra en vigor a partir de la fecha de su promulgación.","Cette loi est applicable à compter de la date de sa promulgation."],["L7-3694","施压","shīyā","V","to pressure","presionar","faire pression","对方不断施压，要求我们降低价格。","duì fāng bú duàn shī yā yāo qiú wǒ men jiàng dī jià gé","The other side keeps putting pressure on us to lower the price.","La otra parte sigue presionando para que bajemos el precio.","L'autre partie ne cesse de faire pression pour que nous baissions le prix."],["L7-3695","湿度","shīdù","N","humidity","humedad","humidité","气象站每天都要观测气温、湿度和风速的变化。","qì xiàng zhàn měi tiān dōu yào guān cè qì wēn shī dù hé fēng sù de biàn huà","The weather station observes changes in temperature, humidity, and wind speed every day.","La estación meteorológica observa todos los días los cambios de temperatura, humedad y velocidad del viento.","La station météorologique observe chaque jour l'évolution de la température, de l'humidité et de la vitesse du vent."],["L7-3696","湿润","shīrùn","Adj","moist; damp","húmedo","humide","这里气候温暖湿润，非常适合种植茶叶。","zhè lǐ qì hòu wēn nuǎn shī rùn fēi cháng shì hé zhòng zhí chá yè","The climate here is warm and humid, ideal for growing tea.","El clima aquí es cálido y húmedo, ideal para cultivar té.","Le climat ici est chaud et humide, idéal pour la culture du thé."],["L7-3697","十字路口","shízì lùkǒu","","crossroads","cruce","carrefour","在十字路口过马路时，一定要看清红绿灯。","zài shí zì lù kǒu guò mǎ lù shí yí dìng yào kàn qīng hóng lǜ dēng","When crossing at an intersection, be sure to check the traffic lights.","Al cruzar la calle en un cruce, hay que fijarse bien en el semáforo.","Quand on traverse la rue à un carrefour, il faut bien regarder les feux de circulation."],["L7-3698","时不时","shíbùshí","Adv","from time to time","de vez en cuando","de temps en temps","他时不时抬头看一眼墙上的钟，好像在等什么人。","tā shí bù shí tái tóu kàn yì yǎn qiáng shàng de zhōng hǎo xiàng zài děng shén me rén","Every now and then he glanced up at the clock on the wall, as if waiting for someone.","De vez en cuando levantaba la vista hacia el reloj de la pared, como si esperara a alguien.","De temps en temps, il levait les yeux vers l'horloge murale, comme s'il attendait quelqu'un."],["L7-3699","时段","shíduàn","N","time period; time slot","franja horaria","tranche horaire","晚上七点到九点是电视收视率最高的时段。","wǎn shang qī diǎn dào jiǔ diǎn shì diàn shì shōu shì lǜ zuì gāo de shí duàn","Seven to nine in the evening is the time slot with the highest TV ratings.","De siete a nueve de la noche es la franja horaria con mayor audiencia de televisión.","De dix-neuf à vingt et une heures, c'est la tranche horaire où l'audience de la télévision est la plus forte."],["L7-3700","时隔","shí gé","","after an interval of","tras un intervalo de","après un intervalle de","时隔多年，这位老演员依然风采不减。","shí gé duō nián zhè wèi lǎo yǎn yuán yī rán fēng cǎi bù jiǎn","After all these years, this veteran actor has lost none of his charisma.","Pasados tantos años, este veterano actor sigue conservando todo su encanto.","Des années plus tard, ce vieil acteur n'a rien perdu de son éclat."],["L7-3701","时好时坏","shíhǎo-shíhuài","","sometimes good, sometimes bad","a veces bien, a veces mal","tantôt bien, tantôt mal","爷爷的身体时好时坏，我们都很担心。","yé ye de shēn tǐ shí hǎo shí huài wǒ men dōu hěn dān xīn","Grandpa's health is up and down, and we're all very worried.","La salud del abuelo va y viene, y estamos muy preocupados.","La santé de grand-père est en dents de scie, et nous sommes tous très inquiets."],["L7-3702","时间表","shíjiānbiǎo","N","schedule; timetable","horario; calendario","emploi du temps; calendrier","开学前，学校会把每天的时间表发给学生。","kāi xué qián xué xiào huì bǎ měi tiān de shí jiān biǎo fā gěi xué shēng","Before term starts, the school gives students their daily timetable.","Antes de que empiecen las clases, la escuela les entrega a los alumnos el horario diario.","Avant la rentrée, l'école remet aux élèves leur emploi du temps quotidien."],["L7-3703","时空","shíkōng","N","time and space","espacio-tiempo","espace-temps","这部科幻电影讲的是一个人穿越时空的故事。","zhè bù kē huàn diàn yǐng jiǎng de shì yí ge rén chuān yuè shí kōng de gù shi","This science fiction film tells the story of a person who travels through time and space.","Esta película de ciencia ficción cuenta la historia de una persona que viaja a través del tiempo y el espacio.","Ce film de science-fiction raconte l'histoire d'une personne qui traverse le temps et l'espace."],["L7-3704","时髦","shímáo","Adj","fashionable; trendy","de moda; moderno","à la mode; branché","奶奶虽然七十多岁了，穿衣服却很时髦。","nǎi nai suī rán qī shí duō suì le chuān yī fú què hěn shí máo","Although Grandma is over seventy, she dresses very fashionably.","Aunque mi abuela tiene más de setenta años, se viste muy a la moda.","Bien que grand-mère ait plus de soixante-dix ans, elle s'habille de façon très tendance."],["L7-3705","时尚","shíshàng","Adj","fashion; trendy","moda; de moda","mode; à la mode","这辆汽车的外形设计很时尚。","zhè liàng qì chē de wài xíng shè jì hěn shí shàng","The exterior design of this car is very stylish.","El diseño exterior de este automóvil es muy moderno.","Le design extérieur de cette voiture est très branché."],["L7-3706","时速","shísù","N","speed per hour","velocidad por hora","vitesse horaire","这种高铁列车的最高时速可以达到三百五十公里。","zhè zhǒng gāo tiě liè chē de zuì gāo shí sù kě yǐ dá dào sān bǎi wǔ shí gōng lǐ","The top speed of this high-speed train can reach three hundred fifty kilometers per hour.","La velocidad máxima de este tren de alta velocidad puede alcanzar los trescientos cincuenta kilómetros por hora.","La vitesse maximale de ce train à grande vitesse peut atteindre trois cent cinquante kilomètres par heure."],["L7-3707","识别","shíbié","V","to identify; to recognize","identificar; reconocer","identifier; reconnaître","这种软件可以识别照片里的人脸。","zhè zhǒng ruǎn jiàn kě yǐ shí bié zhào piàn lǐ de rén liǎn","This software can recognize faces in photos.","Este software puede reconocer los rostros en las fotos.","Ce logiciel peut reconnaître les visages sur les photos."],["L7-3708","实地","shídì","Adv","on-site","sobre el terreno","sur place","这篇报道力求客观真实地反映事件经过。","zhè piān bào dào lì qiú kè guān zhēn shí de fǎn yìng shì jiàn jīng guò","This report strives to reflect what happened objectively and truthfully.","Este reportaje procura reflejar los hechos de forma objetiva y veraz.","Ce reportage s'efforce de rendre compte des faits de manière objective et fidèle."],["L7-3709","实话","shíhuà","N","truth","verdad","vérité","跟你说实话吧，我其实并不想去。","gēn nǐ shuō shí huà ba wǒ qí shí bìng bù xiǎng qù","To tell you the truth, I don't actually want to go.","Te lo digo con franqueza: en realidad no quiero ir.","Pour te dire la vérité, je n'ai en fait pas envie d'y aller."],["L7-3710","实话实说","shíhuà-shíshuō","","to tell it like it is","decir la verdad sin rodeos","dire les choses comme elles sont","有什么问题就实话实说，大家一起想办法。","yǒu shén me wèn tí jiù shí huà shí shuō dà jiā yì qǐ xiǎng bàn fǎ","If there's a problem, just say it straight, and we'll find a solution together.","Si hay algún problema, dilo con franqueza y entre todos buscaremos una solución.","S'il y a un problème, dites-le franchement et nous chercherons tous ensemble une solution."],["L7-3711","实况","shíkuàng","N","live; actual situation","en directo; situación real","en direct; situation réelle","这场足球比赛将进行电视实况转播。","zhè chǎng zú qiú bǐ sài jiāng jìn xíng diàn shì shí kuàng zhuǎn bō","This soccer match will be broadcast live on television.","Este partido de fútbol se transmitirá en vivo por televisión.","Ce match de football sera retransmis en direct à la télévision."],["L7-3712","实事求是","shíshì-qiúshì","","to be practical and realistic","ser realista","être réaliste","做研究要实事求是，不能为了结论去改数据。","zuò yán jiū yào shí shì qiú shì bù néng wèi le jié lùn qù gǎi shù jù","Research must be based on facts; you can't alter data to fit your conclusion.","La investigación debe basarse en los hechos; no se pueden alterar los datos para ajustarlos a la conclusión.","La recherche doit s'en tenir aux faits ; on ne peut pas modifier les données pour étayer une conclusion."],["L7-3713","实体","shítǐ","N","entity; substance","entidad; sustancia","entité; substance","这家网店最近在市中心开了一家实体店。","zhè jiā wǎng diàn zuì jìn zài shì zhōng xīn kāi le yì jiā shí tǐ diàn","This online store recently opened a physical shop in the city center.","Esta tienda en línea abrió recientemente una tienda física en el centro de la ciudad.","Cette boutique en ligne a récemment ouvert un magasin physique en centre-ville."],["L7-3714","实物","shíwù","N","real object; in kind","objeto real; en especie","objet réel; en nature","老师拿来实物给我们看，大家一下子就明白了。","lǎo shī ná lái shí wù gěi wǒ men kàn dà jiā yí xià zi jiù míng bai le","The teacher brought in the real thing to show us, and everyone understood at once.","La maestra trajo el objeto real para mostrárnoslo y todos lo entendieron enseguida.","La professeure a apporté l'objet réel pour nous le montrer, et tout le monde a compris aussitôt."],["L7-3715","实质","shízhì","N","substance; essence","esencia; sustancia","essence; substance","这两种说法看起来不同，实质上是一回事。","zhè liǎng zhǒng shuō fǎ kàn qǐ lái bù tóng shí zhì shàng shì yì huí shì","These two statements look different, but in essence they're the same thing.","Estas dos afirmaciones parecen distintas, pero en esencia son lo mismo.","Ces deux affirmations semblent différentes, mais au fond, c'est la même chose."],["L7-3716","食宿","shísù","N","room and board","alojamiento y comida","gîte et couvert","参加这次培训的学员，食宿都由公司安排。","cān jiā zhè cì péi xùn de xué yuán shí sù dōu yóu gōng sī ān pái","For participants in this training, room and board are arranged by the company.","Para los alumnos que participan en esta capacitación, el alojamiento y la comida corren por cuenta de la empresa.","Pour les stagiaires de cette formation, l'hébergement et les repas sont pris en charge par l'entreprise."],["L7-3717","食用","shíyòng","V","to eat; edible","consumir; comestible","consommer; comestible","这种蘑菇有毒，千万不能食用。","zhè zhǒng mó gu yǒu dú qiān wàn bù néng shí yòng","This mushroom is poisonous and must never be eaten.","Este hongo es venenoso; bajo ninguna circunstancia se debe comer.","Ce champignon est toxique ; il ne faut surtout pas le manger."],["L7-3718","史无前例","shǐwúqiánlì","","unprecedented in history","sin precedentes en la historia","sans précédent dans l'histoire","这次洪水的规模在当地是史无前例的。","zhè cì hóng shuǐ de guī mó zài dāng dì shì shǐ wú qián lì de","The scale of this flood is unprecedented in local history.","La magnitud de esta inundación no tiene precedentes en la zona.","L'ampleur de cette crue est sans précédent dans la région."],["L7-3719","使唤","shǐhuan","V","to order around; to handle","mandar; manejar","donner des ordres; manier","他是新来的员工，大家别总是使唤他干杂活。","tā shì xīn lái de yuán gōng dà jiā bié zǒng shì shǐ huan tā gàn zá huó","He's a new employee, so don't keep ordering him around to do odd jobs.","Es un empleado nuevo; no lo estén mandando todo el tiempo a hacer trabajitos varios.","C'est un nouvel employé, arrêtez de lui faire faire toutes les petites corvées."],["L7-3720","使命","shǐmìng","N","mission; calling","misión; vocación","mission; vocation","医生的使命就是救死扶伤。","yī shēng de shǐ mìng jiù shì jiù sǐ fú shāng","A doctor's mission is to heal the sick and save lives.","La misión de un médico es curar a los enfermos y salvar vidas.","La mission du médecin est de soigner les malades et de sauver des vies."],["L7-3721","使者","shǐzhě","N","envoy","enviado","émissaire","大熊猫被称为中国的友好使者。","dà xióng māo bèi chēng wéi zhōng guó de yǒu hǎo shǐ zhě","The giant panda is called China's envoy of friendship.","Al panda gigante se le llama el emisario de la amistad de China.","On appelle le panda géant l'ambassadeur de l'amitié de la Chine."],["L7-3722","士气","shìqì","N","morale","moral","moral","连胜三场以后，全队的士气非常高。","lián shèng sān chǎng yǐ hòu quán duì de shì qì fēi cháng gāo","After three straight wins, the whole team's morale is very high.","Tras ganar tres partidos seguidos, la moral de todo el equipo está muy alta.","Après trois victoires consécutives, le moral de toute l'équipe est au plus haut."],["L7-3723","示威","shìwēi","V","to demonstrate; demonstration","manifestarse; manifestación","manifester; manifestation","工人们在工厂门口示威，要求提高工资。","gōng rén men zài gōng chǎng mén kǒu shì wēi yāo qiú tí gāo gōng zī","The workers demonstrated at the factory gate, demanding higher wages.","Los obreros se manifestaron a la puerta de la fábrica exigiendo un aumento de sueldo.","Les ouvriers ont manifesté devant l'usine pour réclamer une augmentation de salaire."],["L7-3724","示意","shìyì","V","to signal; to hint","hacer señas; insinuar","faire signe; suggérer","导游用手势示意大家跟紧队伍。","dǎo yóu yòng shǒu shì shì yì dà jiā gēn jǐn duì wǔ","The tour guide gestured for everyone to stay close to the group.","El guía hizo gestos para indicarles a todos que no se separaran del grupo.","Le guide a fait signe à tout le monde de bien rester avec le groupe."],["L7-3725","世代","shìdài","N","generations; for generations","generaciones; durante generaciones","générations; de génération en génération","他们一家人世代以打鱼为业。","tā men yì jiā rén shì dài yǐ dǎ yú wéi yè","For generations their family has made a living by fishing.","Su familia se ha dedicado a la pesca durante generaciones.","Leur famille vit de la pêche depuis des générations."],["L7-3726","世故","shìgu","Adj","worldly-wise","mundano; experimentado","expérimenté; qui connaît la vie","他年纪不大，说话做事却显得很世故。","tā nián jì bú dà shuō huà zuò shì què xiǎn de hěn shì gu","He's not very old, but he speaks and acts in a very worldly way.","No es muy mayor, pero habla y actúa con mucha experiencia de la vida.","Il n'est pas très âgé, mais il parle et agit avec beaucoup de savoir-faire mondain."],["L7-3727","世界级","shìjiè jí","","world-class","de clase mundial","de classe mondiale","这座城市拥有好几座世界级的博物馆。","zhè zuò chéng shì yōng yǒu hǎo jǐ zuò shì jiè jí de bó wù guǎn","This city has several world-class museums.","Esta ciudad cuenta con varios museos de categoría mundial.","Cette ville possède plusieurs musées de rang mondial."],["L7-3728","世袭","shìxí","V","hereditary","hereditario","héréditaire","在古代，很多官职都是世袭的。","zài gǔ dài hěn duō guān zhí dōu shì shì xí de","In ancient times, many official positions were hereditary.","En la antigüedad, muchos cargos oficiales eran hereditarios.","Dans l'Antiquité, de nombreuses charges officielles étaient héréditaires."],["L7-3729","市场经济","shìchǎng jīngjì","","market economy","economía de mercado","économie de marché","在市场经济中，价格主要由供求关系决定。","zài shì chǎng jīng jì zhōng jià gé zhǔ yào yóu gōng qiú guān xì jué dìng","In a market economy, prices are mainly determined by supply and demand.","En una economía de mercado, los precios se determinan principalmente por la relación entre oferta y demanda.","Dans une économie de marché, les prix sont principalement déterminés par l'offre et la demande."],["L7-3730","势必","shìbì","Adv","bound to; certainly will","sin duda; forzosamente","forcément; nécessairement","如果不采取措施，环境污染势必越来越严重。","rú guǒ bù cǎi qǔ cuò shī huán jìng wū rǎn shì bì yuè lái yuè yán zhòng","If no measures are taken, environmental pollution is bound to get worse.","Si no se toman medidas, la contaminación ambiental se agravará sin remedio.","Si l'on ne prend pas de mesures, la pollution de l'environnement ne fera inévitablement qu'empirer."],["L7-3731","势不可当","shìbùkědāng","","irresistible","irresistible","irrésistible","新能源汽车发展势不可当，销量逐年增长。","xīn néng yuán qì chē fā zhǎn shì bù kě dāng xiāo liàng zhú nián zēng zhǎng","The development of new-energy vehicles is unstoppable, with sales rising year after year.","El desarrollo de los vehículos de nueva energía es imparable y sus ventas aumentan cada año.","Le développement des véhicules à énergies nouvelles est irrésistible, avec des ventes en hausse chaque année."],["L7-3732","势头","shìtou","N","momentum; trend","impulso; tendencia","élan; tendance","今年公司的发展势头很好，利润比去年翻了一番。","jīn nián gōng sī de fā zhǎn shì tóu hěn hǎo lì rùn bǐ qù nián fān le yì fān","The company has strong momentum this year, with profits doubling from last year.","Este año la empresa lleva muy buen ritmo y sus ganancias se duplicaron con respecto al año pasado.","Cette année, l'entreprise est sur une très bonne dynamique : ses bénéfices ont doublé par rapport à l'an dernier."],["L7-3733","事迹","shìjì","N","deeds; achievements","hazañas; logros","exploits; réalisations","纪念馆里展出了这位作家的生平事迹。","jì niàn guǎn lǐ zhǎn chū le zhè wèi zuò jiā de shēng píng shì jì","The memorial hall displays the life story of this writer.","En el museo conmemorativo se exhibe la vida y obra de este escritor.","Le mémorial expose la vie et les faits marquants de cet écrivain."],["L7-3734","事态","shìtài","N","situation; state of affairs","situación; estado de cosas","situation; état des choses","政府迅速采取措施，防止事态进一步扩大。","zhèng fǔ xùn sù cǎi qǔ cuò shī fáng zhǐ shì tài jìn yí bù kuò dà","The government quickly took measures to prevent the situation from escalating.","El gobierno tomó medidas rápidamente para evitar que la situación se agravara aún más.","Le gouvernement a rapidement pris des mesures pour empêcher que la situation ne s'aggrave."],["L7-3735","事务","shìwù","N","affairs; work","asuntos; trabajo","affaires; travail","她每天要处理大量的日常事务，非常忙碌。","tā měi tiān yào chǔ lǐ dà liàng de rì cháng shì wù fēi cháng máng lù","She handles a great deal of routine business every day and is very busy.","Todos los días atiende una gran cantidad de asuntos cotidianos y está muy ocupada.","Elle traite chaque jour une grande quantité de tâches courantes et est très occupée."],["L7-3736","事务所","shìwùsuǒ","N","office; firm","oficina; despacho","cabinet; bureau","他毕业后进了一家律师事务所工作。","tā bì yè hòu jìn le yì jiā lǜ shī shì wù suǒ gōng zuò","After graduating, he went to work at a law firm.","Después de graduarse, entró a trabajar en un bufete de abogados.","Après son diplôme, il est entré travailler dans un cabinet d'avocats."],["L7-3737","事项","shìxiàng","N","matter; item","asunto; punto","question; point","出国前，请仔细阅读注意事项。","chū guó qián qǐng zǐ xì yuè dú zhù yì shì xiàng","Before traveling abroad, please read the notes carefully.","Antes de viajar al extranjero, lea con atención las indicaciones.","Avant de partir à l'étranger, veuillez lire attentivement les consignes."],["L7-3738","事宜","shìyí","N","matters; arrangements","asuntos; gestiones","affaires; dispositions","双方正在商量下一步合作的有关事宜。","shuāng fāng zhèng zài shāng liang xià yí bù hé zuò de yǒu guān shì yí","The two sides are discussing matters related to the next stage of cooperation.","Ambas partes están discutiendo los asuntos relacionados con la siguiente etapa de cooperación.","Les deux parties discutent des questions relatives à la prochaine étape de la coopération."],["L7-3739","侍候","shìhòu","V","to wait upon; to serve","atender; servir","servir; s'occuper de","奶奶病了以后，一直是姑姑在身边侍候她。","nǎi nai bìng le yǐ hòu yì zhí shì gū gu zài shēn biān shì hòu tā","Since Grandma fell ill, my aunt has been by her side looking after her.","Desde que mi abuela enfermó, mi tía ha estado a su lado cuidándola.","Depuis que grand-mère est tombée malade, c'est ma tante qui est restée à son chevet pour s'occuper d'elle."],["L7-3740","试探","shìtan","V","to probe; to sound out","sondear; tantear","sonder; tâter","他想试探一下老板的态度，再决定要不要提加薪。","tā xiǎng shì tàn yí xià lǎo bǎn de tài dù zài jué dìng yào bu yào tí jiā xīn","He wanted to sound out the boss's attitude before deciding whether to ask for a raise.","Quería tantear la actitud del jefe antes de decidir si pedía un aumento.","Il voulait sonder l'attitude du patron avant de décider s'il demanderait une augmentation."],["L7-3741","试行","shìxíng","V","to try out","probar; poner a prueba","mettre à l'essai","这项新制度先在几个城市试行，效果好再推广。","zhè xiàng xīn zhì dù xiān zài jǐ ge chéng shì shì xíng xiào guǒ hǎo zài tuī guǎng","The new system will first be tried out in a few cities and expanded if it works well.","Este nuevo sistema se pondrá primero a prueba en algunas ciudades y, si da buenos resultados, se extenderá.","Ce nouveau système sera d'abord expérimenté dans quelques villes, puis étendu s'il donne de bons résultats."],["L7-3742","试用","shìyòng","V","to try out; to be on probation","probar; estar a prueba","essayer; être à l'essai","这款新软件可以免费试用一个月。","zhè kuǎn xīn ruǎn jiàn kě yǐ miǎn fèi shì yòng yí ge yuè","This new software can be tried free for one month.","Este nuevo software se puede probar gratis durante un mes.","Ce nouveau logiciel peut être essayé gratuitement pendant un mois."],["L7-3743","试用期","shìyòngqī","N","probation period","período de prueba","période d'essai","新员工的试用期一般是三个月。","xīn yuán gōng de shì yòng qī yì bān shì sān gè yuè","The probationary period for new employees is usually three months.","El período de prueba de los nuevos empleados suele ser de tres meses.","La période d'essai des nouveaux employés est généralement de trois mois."],["L7-3744","视察","shìchá","V","to inspect","inspeccionar","inspecter","市长今天到几所学校视察了教学情况。","shì zhǎng jīn tiān dào jǐ suǒ xué xiào shì chá le jiào xué qíng kuàng","The mayor visited several schools today to inspect teaching conditions.","Hoy el alcalde visitó varias escuelas para inspeccionar la situación de la enseñanza.","Le maire s'est rendu aujourd'hui dans plusieurs écoles pour inspecter les conditions d'enseignement."],["L7-3745","视角","shìjiǎo","N","perspective; viewpoint","perspectiva; punto de vista","perspective; point de vue","这部电影从一个孩子的视角讲述了那场战争。","zhè bù diàn yǐng cóng yí ge hái zi de shì jiǎo jiǎng shù le nà chǎng zhàn zhēng","This film tells the story of that war from a child's perspective.","Esta película narra aquella guerra desde la perspectiva de un niño.","Ce film raconte cette guerre du point de vue d'un enfant."],["L7-3746","视觉","shìjué","N","vision; visual","vista; visual","vue; visuel","这家餐厅不仅注重菜肴的味道，还讲究视觉效果。","zhè jiā cān tīng bù jǐn zhù zhòng cài yáo de wèi dào hái jiǎng jiu shì jué xiào guǒ","This restaurant pays attention not only to the taste of its dishes but also to their visual presentation.","Este restaurante no solo cuida el sabor de sus platos, sino también su presentación visual.","Ce restaurant ne se soucie pas seulement du goût de ses plats, mais aussi de leur effet visuel."],["L7-3747","视力","shìlì","N","eyesight","vista; visión","vue; acuité visuelle","长时间玩手机，孩子的视力下降得很快。","cháng shí jiān wán shǒu jī hái zi de shì lì xià jiàng de hěn kuài","Using phones for long periods causes children's eyesight to decline quickly.","Por usar el celular durante mucho tiempo, la vista de los niños se deteriora rápidamente.","À force d'utiliser le téléphone longtemps, la vue des enfants baisse rapidement."],["L7-3748","视线","shìxiàn","N","line of sight","línea de visión","ligne de mire","一辆大卡车挡住了我的视线，我看不清前面的路。","yí liàng dà kǎ chē dǎng zhù le wǒ de shì xiàn wǒ kàn bu qīng qián miàn de lù","A big truck blocked my view, so I couldn't see the road ahead clearly.","Un camión grande me tapaba la vista y no podía ver bien el camino de adelante.","Un gros camion me bouchait la vue et je ne voyais pas bien la route devant moi."],["L7-3749","视野","shìyě","N","field of vision; horizon","campo visual; horizonte","champ de vision; horizon","出国留学开阔了他的视野。","chū guó liú xué kāi kuò le tā de shì yě","Studying abroad broadened his horizons.","Estudiar en el extranjero amplió sus horizontes.","Ses études à l'étranger ont élargi ses horizons."],["L7-3750","柿子","shìzi","N","persimmon","caqui","kaki","秋天到了，院子里的柿子树挂满了红红的柿子。","qiū tiān dào le yuàn zi lǐ de shì zi shù guà mǎn le hóng hóng de shì zi","Autumn has come, and the persimmon tree in the yard is laden with red persimmons.","Llegó el otoño y el árbol de caquis del patio está cargado de caquis rojos.","L'automne est arrivé et le plaqueminier de la cour est chargé de kakis rouges."],["L7-3751","是非","shìfēi","N","right and wrong; disputes","bien y mal; disputas","bien et mal; querelles","孩子从小就要学会分辨是非。","hái zi cóng xiǎo jiù yào xué huì fēn biàn shì fēi","Children should learn to tell right from wrong from an early age.","Los niños deben aprender desde pequeños a distinguir el bien del mal.","Les enfants doivent apprendre dès le plus jeune âge à distinguer le bien du mal."],["L7-3752","适度","shìdù","Adj","moderate; appropriate","moderado; adecuado","modéré; approprié","适度的运动对身体有好处，但不要过量。","shì dù de yùn dòng duì shēn tǐ yǒu hǎo chù dàn bú yào guò liàng","Moderate exercise is good for the body, but don't overdo it.","El ejercicio moderado es bueno para el cuerpo, pero no hay que excederse.","Une activité physique modérée est bonne pour le corps, mais il ne faut pas en abuser."],["L7-3753","适量","shìliàng","Adj","appropriate amount","cantidad adecuada","quantité appropriée","做这道菜时，最后再加入适量的糖。","zuò zhè dào cài shí zuì hòu zài jiā rù shì liàng de táng","When making this dish, add an appropriate amount of sugar at the end.","Al preparar este plato, añade al final una cantidad adecuada de azúcar.","Pour ce plat, ajoutez à la fin la juste quantité de sucre."],["L7-3754","适时","shìshí","Adj","timely","oportuno","opportun","家长要适时地给孩子一些鼓励。","jiā zhǎng yào shì shí de gěi hái zi yì xiē gǔ lì","Parents should give their children encouragement at the right moments.","Los padres deben dar a sus hijos algo de ánimo en el momento oportuno.","Les parents doivent encourager leurs enfants au moment opportun."],["L7-3755","适宜","shìyí","Adj","suitable; appropriate","adecuado; apropiado","approprié; convenable","这里四季如春，非常适宜老年人居住。","zhè lǐ sì jì rú chūn fēi cháng shì yí lǎo nián rén jū zhù","It feels like spring here all year round, making it a very suitable place for older people to live.","Aquí es primavera todo el año, así que es muy adecuado para que vivan personas mayores.","Ici, c'est le printemps toute l'année, ce qui convient très bien aux personnes âgées."],["L7-3756","逝世","shìshì","V","to pass away","fallecer","décéder","这位著名作家昨天在北京逝世，享年九十岁。","zhè wèi zhù míng zuò jiā zuó tiān zài běi jīng shì shì xiǎng nián jiǔ shí suì","This famous writer passed away in Beijing yesterday at the age of ninety.","Este famoso escritor falleció ayer en Beijing a los noventa años.","Cet écrivain célèbre est décédé hier à Pékin à l'âge de quatre-vingt-dix ans."],["L7-3757","释放","shìfàng","V","to release; to free","liberar; poner en libertad","libérer; relâcher","被关押了三年以后，他终于被释放了。","bèi guān yā le sān nián yǐ hòu tā zhōng yú bèi shì fàng le","After three years in detention, he was finally released.","Después de tres años de reclusión, por fin lo pusieron en libertad.","Après trois ans de détention, il a enfin été libéré."],["L7-3758","嗜好","shìhào","N","hobby; habit; addiction","afición; hábito; vicio","passe-temps; habitude; penchant","他没有什么特别的嗜好，就是爱喝两口茶。","tā méi yǒu shén me tè bié de shì hào jiù shì ài hē liǎng kǒu chá","He has no particular hobbies; he just enjoys drinking a little tea.","No tiene ninguna afición especial; solo le gusta tomarse un poco de té.","Il n'a pas de passion particulière, il aime simplement boire un peu de thé."],["L7-3759","收复","shōufù","V","to recover; to recapture","recuperar; reconquistar","reprendre; reconquérir","经过激烈的战斗，军队终于收复了失地。","jīng guò jī liè de zhàn dòu jūn duì zhōng yú shōu fù le shī dì","After fierce fighting, the army finally recovered the lost territory.","Tras duros combates, el ejército por fin recuperó el territorio perdido.","Après de violents combats, l'armée a enfin repris les territoires perdus."],["L7-3760","收据","shōujù","N","receipt","recibo","reçu","交完房租以后，记得让房东给你开一张收据。","jiāo wán fáng zū yǐ hòu jì de ràng fáng dōng gěi nǐ kāi yì zhāng shōu jù","After paying the rent, remember to ask the landlord for a receipt.","Después de pagar el alquiler, acuérdate de pedirle un recibo al arrendador.","Après avoir payé le loyer, pense à demander un reçu au propriétaire."],["L7-3761","收敛","shōuliǎn","V","to restrain oneself; to converge","contenerse; converger","se retenir; converger","在长辈面前，他说话收敛了很多。","zài zhǎng bèi miàn qián tā shuō huà shōu liǎn le hěn duō","In front of his elders, he is much more restrained in what he says.","Delante de los mayores, se contiene mucho más al hablar.","Devant les aînés, il se retient beaucoup plus dans ses propos."],["L7-3762","收留","shōuliú","V","to take in; to shelter","acoger; dar cobijo","accueillir; héberger","好心的老人收留了这只无家可归的小猫。","hǎo xīn de lǎo rén shōu liú le zhè zhī wú jiā kě guī de xiǎo māo","The kind old man took in this homeless kitten.","El bondadoso anciano acogió a este gatito sin hogar.","Le vieil homme au grand cœur a recueilli ce chaton sans abri."],["L7-3763","收买","shōumǎi","V","to buy off; to bribe","sobornar; comprar","acheter; soudoyer","他想用钱收买证人，结果被警方发现了。","tā xiǎng yòng qián shōu mǎi zhèng rén jié guǒ bèi jǐng fāng fā xiàn le","He tried to buy off the witness with money but was found out by the police.","Quiso sobornar al testigo con dinero, pero la policía lo descubrió.","Il a voulu acheter le témoin avec de l'argent, mais la police l'a découvert."],["L7-3764","收视率","shōushìlǜ","N","TV ratings","índice de audiencia","taux d'audience","晚上七点到九点是电视收视率最高的时段。","wǎn shang qī diǎn dào jiǔ diǎn shì diàn shì shōu shì lǜ zuì gāo de shí duàn","Seven to nine in the evening is the time slot with the highest TV ratings.","De siete a nueve de la noche es la franja horaria con mayor audiencia de televisión.","De dix-neuf à vingt et une heures, c'est la tranche horaire où l'audience de la télévision est la plus forte."],["L7-3765","收缩","shōusuō","V","to shrink; to contract","contraer; encoger","se contracter; rétrécir","天气一冷，铁轨会稍稍收缩。","tiān qì yì lěng tiě guǐ huì shāo shāo shōu suō","When the weather turns cold, the steel rails contract slightly.","Cuando el clima se enfría, los rieles de acero se contraen ligeramente.","Quand le temps se refroidit, les rails d'acier se contractent légèrement."],["L7-3766","收支","shōuzhī","N","income and expenditure","ingresos y gastos","recettes et dépenses","每个月他都会仔细记录家里的收支情况。","měi ge yuè tā dōu huì zǐ xì jì lù jiā lǐ de shōu zhī qíng kuàng","Every month he carefully records the household income and expenses.","Cada mes anota con cuidado los ingresos y gastos del hogar.","Chaque mois, il note soigneusement les recettes et les dépenses du foyer."],["L7-3767","手臂","shǒubì","N","arm","brazo","bras","他伸出手臂，一把抓住了快要摔倒的孩子。","tā shēn chū shǒu bì yì bǎ zhuā zhù le kuài yào shuāi dǎo de hái zi","He reached out his arm and grabbed the child who was about to fall.","Extendió el brazo y agarró de un tirón al niño que estaba a punto de caerse.","Il a tendu le bras et a attrapé d'un geste l'enfant qui allait tomber."],["L7-3768","手册","shǒucè","N","handbook; manual","manual; guía","manuel; guide","新员工入职时都会领到一本员工手册。","xīn yuán gōng rù zhí shí dōu huì lǐng dào yì běn yuán gōng shǒu cè","New employees each receive an employee handbook when they join.","Cuando los nuevos empleados ingresan, reciben un manual del empleado.","À leur arrivée, les nouveaux employés reçoivent un guide du salarié."],["L7-3769","手动","shǒudòng","Adj","manual","manual","manuel","这辆旧车是手动挡的，开起来有点累。","zhè liàng jiù chē shì shǒu dòng dǎng de kāi qǐ lái yǒu diǎn lèi","This old car has a manual transmission, which makes it a bit tiring to drive.","Este auto viejo es de transmisión manual y cansa un poco manejarlo.","Cette vieille voiture est à boîte manuelle, et la conduire est un peu fatigant."],["L7-3770","手脚","shǒujiǎo","N","hands and feet; tricks","manos y pies; trampas","mains et pieds; manigances","天冷了，老人的手脚总是冰凉的。","tiān lěng le lǎo rén de shǒu jiǎo zǒng shì bīng liáng de","When the weather turns cold, the old man's hands and feet are always icy.","Con el frío, las manos y los pies del anciano siempre están helados.","Quand il fait froid, les mains et les pieds du vieil homme sont toujours glacés."],["L7-3771","手帕","shǒupà","N","handkerchief","pañuelo","mouchoir","她从包里拿出一块手帕，擦了擦额头上的汗。","tā cóng bāo lǐ ná chū yí kuài shǒu pà cā le cā é tóu shàng de hàn","She took a handkerchief from her bag and wiped the sweat from her forehead.","Sacó un pañuelo de su bolso y se secó el sudor de la frente.","Elle a sorti un mouchoir de son sac et s'est essuyé le front en sueur."],["L7-3772","手枪","shǒuqiāng","N","pistol","pistola","pistolet","那个歹徒手里拿着一支手枪。","nà ge dǎi tú shǒu lǐ ná zhe yì zhī shǒu qiāng","The gangster was holding a pistol in his hand.","Aquel malhechor tenía una pistola en la mano.","Ce malfrat tenait un pistolet à la main."],["L7-3773","手势","shǒushì","N","gesture","gesto","geste","导游用手势示意大家跟紧队伍。","dǎo yóu yòng shǒu shì shì yì dà jiā gēn jǐn duì wǔ","The tour guide gestured for everyone to stay close to the group.","El guía hizo gestos para indicarles a todos que no se separaran del grupo.","Le guide a fait signe à tout le monde de bien rester avec le groupe."],["L7-3774","手术室","shǒushùshì","N","operating room","quirófano","salle d'opération","手术室门口，家属们焦急地等待着。","shǒu shù shì mén kǒu jiā shǔ men jiāo jí de děng dài zhe","Outside the operating room, the family waited anxiously.","A la puerta del quirófano, los familiares esperaban con ansiedad.","À la porte du bloc opératoire, la famille attendait avec angoisse."],["L7-3775","手头","shǒutóu","N","on hand; finances","a mano; situación económica","sous la main; situation financière","我手头有点紧，能不能下个月再还你钱？","wǒ shǒu tóu yǒu diǎn jǐn néng bu néng xià ge yuè zài huán nǐ qián","I'm a bit short of money right now; can I pay you back next month?","Ando un poco corto de dinero; ¿puedo devolvértelo el mes que viene?","Je suis un peu à court en ce moment, puis-je te rembourser le mois prochain ?"],["L7-3776","手腕","shǒuwàn","N","wrist; skill; tactics","muñeca; habilidad; tácticas","poignet; habileté; manœuvres","她弹钢琴弹得太久，手腕有点疼。","tā tán gāng qín tán de tài jiǔ shǒu wàn yǒu diǎn téng","She played the piano for too long, and her wrist hurts a bit.","Tocó el piano durante demasiado tiempo y le duele un poco la muñeca.","Elle a joué trop longtemps du piano et son poignet lui fait un peu mal."],["L7-3777","手艺","shǒuyì","N","craftsmanship; handicraft","artesanía; oficio","savoir-faire; artisanat","他是这门传统手艺的第四代传人。","tā shì zhè mén chuán tǒng shǒu yì de dì sì dài chuán rén","He is the fourth-generation inheritor of this traditional craft.","Es la cuarta generación en heredar este oficio tradicional.","Il est le quatrième de sa lignée à perpétuer ce savoir-faire traditionnel."],["L7-3778","手掌","shǒuzhǎng","N","palm","palma de la mano","paume","他摊开手掌，里面是一颗小小的种子。","tā tān kāi shǒu zhǎng lǐ miàn shì yì kē xiǎo xiǎo de zhǒng zi","He opened his palm, and in it was a tiny seed.","Abrió la palma de la mano y dentro había una semillita.","Il ouvrit la paume de sa main, et dedans se trouvait une minuscule graine."],["L7-3779","守候","shǒuhòu","V","to wait for; to watch over","esperar; vigilar","attendre; veiller sur","医生在病床边守候了一整夜。","yī shēng zài bìng chuáng biān shǒu hòu le yì zhěng yè","The doctor kept watch at the bedside all night long.","El médico veló toda la noche junto a la cama del enfermo.","Le médecin a veillé toute la nuit au chevet du malade."],["L7-3780","守护","shǒuhù","V","to guard; to protect","proteger; custodiar","garder; protéger","这位老人在山上守护森林已经三十年了。","zhè wèi lǎo rén zài shān shàng shǒu hù sēn lín yǐ jīng sān shí nián le","This old man has been guarding the forest on the mountain for thirty years.","Este anciano lleva treinta años cuidando el bosque de la montaña.","Ce vieil homme garde la forêt de la montagne depuis trente ans."],["L7-3781","守株待兔","shǒuzhū-dàitù","","to wait for luck passively","esperar pasivamente la suerte","attendre la chance passivement","找工作要主动出击，不能守株待兔。","zhǎo gōng zuò yào zhǔ dòng chū jī bù néng shǒu zhū dài tù","When job hunting, you have to take the initiative instead of waiting for luck to come to you.","Para buscar trabajo hay que tomar la iniciativa y no quedarse esperando a que caiga del cielo.","Pour chercher du travail, il faut prendre les devants et ne pas attendre que la chance tombe du ciel."],["L7-3782","首创","shǒuchuàng","V","to pioneer; to originate","ser pionero en; crear por primera vez","être le premier à; inventer","这种教学方法是由一位乡村教师首创的。","zhè zhǒng jiào xué fāng fǎ shì yóu yí wèi xiāng cūn jiào shī shǒu chuàng de","This teaching method was pioneered by a village teacher.","Este método de enseñanza fue creado por primera vez por un maestro rural.","Cette méthode d'enseignement a été inventée par un instituteur de village."],["L7-3783","首府","shǒufǔ","N","capital (of a region)","capital (de una región)","capitale (d'une région)","呼和浩特是内蒙古自治区的首府。","hū hé hào tè shì nèi měng gǔ zì zhì qū de shǒu fǔ","Hohhot is the capital of the Inner Mongolia Autonomous Region.","Hohhot es la capital de la Región Autónoma de Mongolia Interior.","Hohhot est la capitale de la région autonome de Mongolie-Intérieure."],["L7-3784","首批","shǒupī","","first batch","primer lote","premier lot","首批救灾物资已经运到了受灾地区。","shǒu pī jiù zāi wù zī yǐ jīng yùn dào le shòu zāi dì qū","The first batch of relief supplies has arrived in the disaster area.","El primer lote de suministros de socorro ya llegó a la zona afectada.","Le premier lot de fournitures de secours est arrivé dans la zone sinistrée."],["L7-3785","首饰","shǒushì","N","jewelry","joyas","bijoux","她把妈妈留下的首饰小心地收在盒子里。","tā bǎ mā ma liú xià de shǒu shì xiǎo xīn de shōu zài hé zi lǐ","She carefully kept the jewelry her mother left her in a box.","Guardó con cuidado en una caja las joyas que le dejó su madre.","Elle a rangé avec soin dans une boîte les bijoux que sa mère lui avait laissés."],["L7-3786","首要","shǒuyào","Adj","most important; primary","más importante; principal","le plus important; primordial","当前的首要任务是保证每个人的安全。","dāng qián de shǒu yào rèn wu shì bǎo zhèng měi ge rén de ān quán","The top priority right now is to ensure everyone's safety.","La tarea prioritaria en este momento es garantizar la seguridad de todos.","La tâche prioritaire actuelle est d'assurer la sécurité de chacun."],["L7-3787","寿命","shòumìng","N","life span; lifetime","esperanza de vida; vida útil","durée de vie","这种灯泡的使用寿命比普通灯泡长很多。","zhè zhǒng dēng pào de shǐ yòng shòu mìng bǐ pǔ tōng dēng pào cháng hěn duō","This type of light bulb lasts much longer than ordinary bulbs.","La vida útil de este tipo de bombilla es mucho más larga que la de las bombillas comunes.","La durée de vie de ce type d'ampoule est bien supérieure à celle des ampoules ordinaires."],["L7-3788","受过","shòuguò","","to take the blame","cargar con la culpa","porter le blâme","这件事其实跟他无关，他是在替同事受过。","zhè jiàn shì qí shí gēn tā wú guān tā shì zài tì tóng shì shòu guò","This really had nothing to do with him; he was taking the blame for a colleague.","En realidad esto no tiene que ver con él; está cargando con la culpa de un compañero.","En réalité, cela n'a rien à voir avec lui : il porte le chapeau pour un collègue."],["L7-3789","受害","shòuhài","","to suffer harm; be victimized","sufrir daño; ser víctima","subir un préjudice; être victime","在这次洪水中，受害最严重的是沿河的几个村子。","zài zhè cì hóng shuǐ zhōng shòu hài zuì yán zhòng de shì yán hé de jǐ ge cūn zi","In this flood, the villages along the river suffered the worst damage.","En esta inundación, los más afectados fueron varios pueblos a lo largo del río.","Dans cette crue, les plus touchés ont été plusieurs villages le long de la rivière."],["L7-3790","受害人","shòuhàirén","N","victim","víctima","victime","警方提醒受害人保存好聊天记录，作为证据。","jǐng fāng tí xǐng shòu hài rén bǎo cún hǎo liáo tiān jì lù zuò wéi zhèng jù","The police reminded the victims to keep their chat records as evidence.","La policía recomendó a las víctimas conservar bien el historial de sus chats como prueba.","La police a recommandé aux victimes de bien conserver l'historique de leurs conversations comme preuve."],["L7-3791","受贿","shòuhuì","","to accept a bribe","aceptar un soborno","accepter un pot-de-vin","这名官员因受贿被判了十年。","zhè míng guān yuán yīn shòu huì bèi pàn le shí nián","The official was sentenced to ten years for taking bribes.","Ese funcionario fue condenado a diez años por aceptar sobornos.","Ce fonctionnaire a été condamné à dix ans de prison pour corruption."],["L7-3792","受惊","shòujīng","","startled; frightened","asustado; sobresaltado","effrayé; sursauté","一声巨响，马受惊了，拉着车狂奔起来。","yì shēng jù xiǎng mǎ shòu jīng le lā zhe chē kuáng bēn qǐ lái","At a loud bang, the horse took fright and bolted, dragging the cart behind it.","Se oyó un estruendo, el caballo se asustó y salió desbocado arrastrando el carro.","Au fracas d'une détonation, le cheval s'est affolé et s'est emballé en traînant la charrette."],["L7-3793","受苦","shòukǔ","","to suffer hardship","sufrir penalidades","souffrir; endurer des épreuves","父母不想让孩子跟着自己受苦，拼命地工作。","fù mǔ bù xiǎng ràng hái zi gēn zhe zì jǐ shòu kǔ pīn mìng de gōng zuò","Not wanting their children to suffer along with them, the parents worked desperately hard.","Los padres no querían que sus hijos sufrieran con ellos y trabajaban sin descanso.","Les parents ne voulaient pas que leurs enfants souffrent avec eux et travaillaient sans relâche."],["L7-3794","受理","shòulǐ","V","to accept and handle (a case)","admitir a trámite; tramitar","accepter de traiter (une affaire)","有关规定已经废除，办事人员不应再据此拒绝受理申请。","yǒu guān guī dìng yǐ jīng fèi chú bàn shì rén yuán bù yīng zài jù cǐ jù jué shòu lǐ shēn qǐng","The relevant rule has been abolished, so staff should no longer use it as grounds to reject applications.","La norma en cuestión ya fue derogada, por lo que el personal no debería seguir rechazando solicitudes con base en ella.","La disposition en question a été abrogée ; le personnel ne devrait donc plus s'en servir pour refuser d'instruire les demandes."],["L7-3795","受骗","shòupiàn","","to be cheated","ser engañado","être trompé","不少老年人在网上购买保健品时受骗了。","bù shǎo lǎo nián rén zài wǎng shàng gòu mǎi bǎo jiàn pǐn shí shòu piàn le","Quite a few elderly people were cheated when buying health supplements online.","Muchos ancianos fueron estafados al comprar suplementos de salud por internet.","Beaucoup de personnes âgées se sont fait escroquer en achetant des compléments de santé en ligne."],["L7-3796","受益","shòuyì","V","to benefit from","beneficiarse de","profiter de; bénéficier","这项政策让成千上万的农民受益。","zhè xiàng zhèng cè ràng chéng qiān shàng wàn de nóng mín shòu yì","This policy has benefited tens of thousands of farmers.","Esta política ha beneficiado a decenas de miles de campesinos.","Cette politique a profité à des dizaines de milliers de paysans."],["L7-3797","授权","shòuquán","V","to authorize","autorizar","autoriser","没有作者的授权，不能随便转载这篇文章。","méi yǒu zuò zhě de shòu quán bù néng suí biàn zhuǎn zǎi zhè piān wén zhāng","This article may not be reproduced without the author's authorization.","Sin la autorización del autor, no se puede reproducir libremente este artículo.","Sans l'autorisation de l'auteur, cet article ne peut pas être reproduit librement."],["L7-3798","授予","shòuyǔ","V","to award; to confer","otorgar; conceder","décerner; conférer","学校授予他荣誉博士学位。","xué xiào shòu yǔ tā róng yù bó shì xué wèi","The university conferred an honorary doctorate on him.","La universidad le otorgó el doctorado honoris causa.","L'université lui a décerné un doctorat honoris causa."],["L7-3799","售价","shòujià","N","selling price","precio de venta","prix de vente","这款新手机的售价比上一代高了不少。","zhè kuǎn xīn shǒu jī de shòu jià bǐ shàng yí dài gāo le bù shǎo","The price of this new phone is quite a bit higher than that of the previous model.","El precio de venta de este nuevo teléfono es bastante más alto que el de la generación anterior.","Le prix de vente de ce nouveau téléphone est nettement plus élevé que celui de la génération précédente."],["L7-3800","售票","shòupiào","V","to sell tickets","vender billetes","vendre des billets","火车站的售票窗口前排起了长队。","huǒ chē zhàn de shòu piào chuāng kǒu qián pái qǐ le cháng duì","A long queue formed in front of the ticket windows at the railway station.","Se formó una larga fila frente a las ventanillas de boletos de la estación de tren.","Une longue file s'est formée devant les guichets de la gare."],["L7-3801","书橱","shūchú","N","bookcase","librería; estantería","bibliothèque (meuble)","客厅的墙边摆着一个大书橱，里面装满了书。","kè tīng de qiáng biān bǎi zhe yí ge dà shū chú lǐ miàn zhuāng mǎn le shū","A big bookcase full of books stands against the living room wall.","Junto a la pared de la sala hay un gran librero lleno de libros.","Contre le mur du salon se trouve une grande bibliothèque remplie de livres."],["L7-3802","书籍","shūjí","N","books; literature","libros; obras","livres; ouvrages","图书馆每年都会购进大量新书籍。","tú shū guǎn měi nián dōu huì gòu jìn dà liàng xīn shū jí","The library buys in large numbers of new books every year.","La biblioteca adquiere cada año una gran cantidad de libros nuevos.","Chaque année, la bibliothèque acquiert un grand nombre de nouveaux livres."],["L7-3803","书记","shūjì","N","secretary (party); clerk","secretario (del partido); escribiente","secrétaire (du parti); greffier","村里的老书记带领大家修了一条新路。","cūn lǐ de lǎo shū jì dài lǐng dà jiā xiū le yì tiáo xīn lù","The village's old Party secretary led everyone in building a new road.","El viejo secretario del Partido de la aldea guió a todos para construir un camino nuevo.","Le vieux secrétaire du village a guidé tout le monde pour construire une nouvelle route."],["L7-3804","书面","shūmiàn","Adj","written; in writing","escrito; por escrito","écrit; par écrit","请假需要提交书面申请，口头说一声是不行的。","qǐng jià xū yào tí jiāo shū miàn shēn qǐng kǒu tóu shuō yì shēng shì bù xíng de","To take leave you must submit a written request; just saying so isn't enough.","Para pedir permiso hay que presentar una solicitud por escrito; decirlo de palabra no basta.","Pour demander un congé, il faut déposer une demande écrite ; le dire de vive voix ne suffit pas."],["L7-3805","书写","shūxiě","V","to write","escribir","écrire","这份说明书写得非常详尽。","zhè fèn shuō míng shū xiě de fēi cháng xiáng jìn","This manual is written in great detail.","Este manual de instrucciones está escrito con muchísimo detalle.","Ce mode d'emploi est rédigé de façon extrêmement détaillée."],["L7-3806","抒情","shūqíng","V","to express emotion; lyrical","expresar emociones; lírico","exprimer ses émotions; lyrique","这首抒情诗表达了诗人对故乡的思念。","zhè shǒu shū qíng shī biǎo dá le shī rén duì gù xiāng de sī niàn","This lyric poem expresses the poet's longing for his hometown.","Este poema lírico expresa la añoranza del poeta por su tierra natal.","Ce poème lyrique exprime la nostalgie du poète pour son pays natal."],["L7-3807","枢纽","shūniǔ","N","hub; pivot","eje; nudo (de transporte)","pivot; plaque tournante","这座城市是全国重要的交通枢纽。","zhè zuò chéng shì shì quán guó zhòng yào de jiāo tōng shū niǔ","This city is an important national transportation hub.","Esta ciudad es un importante centro de transporte del país.","Cette ville est un important nœud de transport du pays."],["L7-3808","梳","shū","V","comb; to comb","peine; peinar","peigne; peigner","她每天早上都要花十分钟把头发梳好。","tā měi tiān zǎo shang dōu yào huā shí fēn zhōng bǎ tóu fa shū hǎo","She spends ten minutes combing her hair every morning.","Todas las mañanas se toma diez minutos para peinarse.","Chaque matin, elle passe dix minutes à se coiffer."],["L7-3809","梳理","shūlǐ","V","to comb; to sort out","peinar; ordenar","peigner; démêler","新任主管上任后，先梳理了各部门的职责，再着手优化协作流程。","xīn rèn zhǔ guǎn shàng rèn hòu xiān shū lǐ le gè bù mén de zhí zé zài zhuó shǒu yōu huà xié zuò liú chéng","After taking office, the new manager first clarified each department's responsibilities and then began improving the workflow for collaboration.","Al asumir el cargo, el nuevo director primero puso en orden las responsabilidades de cada departamento y luego empezó a optimizar los procesos de colaboración.","Après sa prise de fonctions, le nouveau responsable a d'abord clarifié les responsabilités de chaque service, puis s'est attelé à optimiser les processus de collaboration."],["L7-3810","梳子","shūzi","N","comb","peine","peigne","这把木梳子是奶奶年轻时用过的。","zhè bǎ mù shū zi shì nǎi nai nián qīng shí yòng guo de","This wooden comb is one Grandma used when she was young.","Este peine de madera lo usó mi abuela cuando era joven.","Ce peigne en bois, grand-mère s'en servait quand elle était jeune."],["L7-3811","舒畅","shūchàng","Adj","comfortable; carefree","desahogado; a gusto","à l'aise; serein","走在海边，吹着海风，心情格外舒畅。","zǒu zài hǎi biān chuī zhe hǎi fēng xīn qíng gé wài shū chàng","Walking by the sea in the sea breeze, I felt especially carefree.","Caminar junto al mar con la brisa marina da una sensación de especial bienestar.","Marcher au bord de la mer dans la brise marine procure un bien-être tout particulier."],["L7-3812","疏导","shūdǎo","V","to channel; to clear obstructions","encauzar; desatascar","canaliser; désobstruer","节假日期间，交警在主要路口疏导交通。","jié jià rì qī jiān jiāo jǐng zài zhǔ yào lù kǒu shū dǎo jiāo tōng","During holidays, traffic police direct traffic at the main intersections.","Durante los días festivos, los policías de tránsito ordenan el tráfico en los cruces principales.","Pendant les jours fériés, la police de la circulation régule le trafic aux principaux carrefours."],["L7-3813","疏忽","shūhu","V","to neglect; negligence","descuidar; descuido","négliger; négligence","看守一时疏忽，竟把犯人跑了。","kān shǒu yì shí shū hu jìng bǎ fàn rén pǎo le","The guard was careless for a moment and actually let the prisoner escape.","El guardia se descuidó un momento y, increíblemente, dejó escapar al preso.","Le gardien s'est relâché un instant et a laissé le prisonnier s'enfuir."],["L7-3814","疏散","shūsàn","Adj/V","to evacuate; to disperse; scattered","evacuar; dispersar; disperso","évacuer; disperser; dispersé","火警响起后，大楼里的人员被迅速疏散。","huǒ jǐng xiǎng qǐ hòu dà lóu lǐ de rén yuán bèi xùn sù shū sàn","After the fire alarm went off, the people in the building were quickly evacuated.","Cuando sonó la alarma de incendios, las personas del edificio fueron evacuadas rápidamente.","Après le déclenchement de l'alarme incendie, les occupants de l'immeuble ont été rapidement évacués."],["L7-3815","疏通","shūtōng","V","to unblock; to clear; to facilitate","desatascar; despejar; facilitar","désobstruer; faciliter","工人们花了一上午才把堵塞的下水道疏通。","gōng rén men huā le yí shàng wǔ cái bǎ dǔ sè de xià shuǐ dào shū tōng","The workers spent the whole morning clearing the blocked drain.","Los obreros tardaron toda la mañana en destapar el desagüe obstruido.","Les ouvriers ont mis toute la matinée à déboucher l'égout obstrué."],["L7-3816","输家","shūjiā","N","loser","perdedor","perdant","这场官司没有赢家，双方都是输家。","zhè chǎng guān si méi yǒu yíng jiā shuāng fāng dōu shì shū jiā","There's no winner in this lawsuit; both sides are losers.","En este juicio no hay ganadores; ambas partes salen perdiendo.","Dans ce procès, il n'y a pas de gagnant : les deux parties sont perdantes."],["L7-3817","输送","shūsòng","V","to transport; to convey","transportar; conducir","transporter; acheminer","这条管道每天向城市输送大量天然气。","zhè tiáo guǎn dào měi tiān xiàng chéng shì shū sòng dà liàng tiān rán qì","This pipeline delivers large amounts of natural gas to the city every day.","Este gasoducto transporta cada día una gran cantidad de gas natural a la ciudad.","Ce pipeline achemine chaque jour de grandes quantités de gaz naturel vers la ville."],["L7-3818","输血","shūxuè","","to transfuse blood; to support","transfundir sangre; apoyar","transfuser du sang; soutenir","病人失血过多，医生决定马上给他输血。","bìng rén shī xuè guò duō yī shēng jué dìng mǎ shàng gěi tā shū xuè","The patient had lost too much blood, so the doctor decided to give him a transfusion immediately.","El paciente había perdido demasiada sangre y el médico decidió hacerle una transfusión de inmediato.","Le patient avait perdu trop de sang et le médecin a décidé de lui faire une transfusion immédiatement."],["L7-3819","输液","shūyè","","intravenous drip","gotero; infusión intravenosa","perfusion","他发高烧，在医院输液输了两天才好。","tā fā gāo shāo zài yī yuàn shū yè shū le liǎng tiān cái hǎo","He had a high fever and only recovered after two days on an IV drip at the hospital.","Tuvo fiebre alta y estuvo dos días con suero en el hospital hasta recuperarse.","Il a eu une forte fièvre et n'a guéri qu'après deux jours de perfusion à l'hôpital."],["L7-3820","赎","shú","V","to redeem; to ransom","redimir; rescatar","racheter; rançonner","他用全部积蓄把祖上的老房子赎了回来。","tā yòng quán bù jī xù bǎ zǔ shàng de lǎo fáng zi shú le huí lái","He used all his savings to buy back his ancestors' old house.","Con todos sus ahorros recuperó la vieja casa de sus antepasados.","Avec toutes ses économies, il a racheté la vieille maison de ses ancêtres."],["L7-3821","暑期","shǔqī","N","summer vacation","vacaciones de verano","vacances d'été","很多大学生利用暑期去公司实习。","hěn duō dà xué shēng lì yòng shǔ qī qù gōng sī shí xí","Many university students use the summer break to do internships at companies.","Muchos universitarios aprovechan las vacaciones de verano para hacer prácticas en empresas.","Beaucoup d'étudiants profitent des vacances d'été pour faire un stage en entreprise."],["L7-3822","属性","shǔxìng","N","attribute; property","atributo; propiedad","attribut; propriété","这两种材料的物理属性完全不同。","zhè liǎng zhǒng cái liào de wù lǐ shǔ xìng wán quán bù tóng","The physical properties of these two materials are completely different.","Las propiedades físicas de estos dos materiales son completamente distintas.","Les propriétés physiques de ces deux matériaux sont complètement différentes."],["L7-3823","曙光","shǔguāng","N","dawn; first light","amanecer; albor","aube; lueur du jour","新药研究成功，让患者看到了康复的曙光。","xīn yào yán jiū chéng gōng ràng huàn zhě kàn dào le kāng fù de shǔ guāng","The success of the new drug research gave patients a glimmer of hope for recovery.","El éxito de la investigación del nuevo medicamento les dio a los pacientes un rayo de esperanza de recuperación.","Le succès de la recherche sur ce nouveau médicament a fait entrevoir aux patients une lueur d'espoir de guérison."],["L7-3824","束缚","shùfù","V","to bind; to restrict; fetters","atar; restringir; ataduras","entraver; restreindre; entraves","他不想被传统观念束缚，决定按自己的想法生活。","tā bù xiǎng bèi chuán tǒng guān niàn shù fù jué dìng àn zì jǐ de xiǎng fǎ shēng huó","He didn't want to be bound by traditional ideas and decided to live his own way.","No quería quedar atado por las ideas tradicionales y decidió vivir según su propio criterio.","Il ne voulait pas être entravé par les idées traditionnelles et a décidé de vivre selon ses propres choix."],["L7-3825","树立","shùlì","V","to establish; to set up","establecer; erigir","établir; instaurer","父母要给孩子树立一个好榜样。","fù mǔ yào gěi hái zi shù lì yí ge hǎo bǎng yàng","Parents should set a good example for their children.","Los padres deben darles un buen ejemplo a sus hijos.","Les parents doivent donner le bon exemple à leurs enfants."],["L7-3826","树木","shùmù","N","trees","árboles","arbres","高大的树木遮着阳光，树下很凉快。","gāo dà de shù mù zhē zhe yáng guāng shù xià hěn liáng kuai","The tall trees block out the sunlight, so it's cool underneath.","Los árboles altos tapan el sol y bajo ellos hace fresco.","Les grands arbres font écran au soleil, et il fait frais en dessous."],["L7-3827","树梢","shùshāo","N","treetop","copa del árbol","cime d'un arbre","一轮明月慢慢升上了树梢。","yì lún míng yuè màn màn shēng shàng le shù shāo","A bright moon slowly rose above the treetops.","Una luna brillante subió lentamente por encima de las copas de los árboles.","Une lune claire s'éleva lentement au-dessus de la cime des arbres."],["L7-3828","树荫","shùyīn","N","shade of a tree","sombra de un árbol","ombre d'un arbre","夏天中午，几个老人坐在树荫下下棋。","xià tiān zhōng wǔ jǐ ge lǎo rén zuò zài shù yīn xià xià qí","At noon in summer, a few elderly people sit in the shade of a tree playing chess.","En el mediodía de verano, unos ancianos juegan al ajedrez a la sombra de un árbol.","À midi, en été, quelques personnes âgées jouent aux échecs à l'ombre d'un arbre."],["L7-3829","树枝","shùzhī","N","branch; twig","rama; ramita","branche; rameau","苹果熟了，把树枝都坠弯了。","píng guǒ shú le bǎ shù zhī dōu zhuì wān le","The apples are ripe and weigh the branches down.","Las manzanas están maduras y hacen doblarse las ramas.","Les pommes sont mûres et font ployer les branches."],["L7-3830","竖","shù","V/Adj","vertical; to erect","vertical; erigir","vertical; dresser","他向我竖起大拇指，夸我做得好。","tā xiàng wǒ shù qǐ dà mu zhǐ kuā wǒ zuò de hǎo","He gave me a thumbs-up and praised my work.","Me levantó el pulgar y me felicitó por lo bien que lo hice.","Il m'a fait un pouce levé et m'a félicité pour mon bon travail."],["L7-3831","数额","shù'é","N","amount; sum","cantidad; suma","montant; somme","这笔贷款的数额太大，银行需要进一步审核。","zhè bǐ dài kuǎn de shù é tài dà yín háng xū yào jìn yí bù shěn hé","The amount of this loan is too large, and the bank needs to review it further.","El monto de este préstamo es demasiado alto y el banco necesita revisarlo más a fondo.","Le montant de ce prêt est trop élevé et la banque doit l'examiner plus en détail."],["L7-3832","数据库","shùjùkù","N","database","base de datos","base de données","这个数据库收录了近百年来的天气资料。","zhè ge shù jù kù shōu lù le jìn bǎi nián lái de tiān qì zī liào","This database contains weather data covering nearly a hundred years.","Esta base de datos recoge datos meteorológicos de los últimos cien años.","Cette base de données rassemble des données météorologiques sur près d'un siècle."],["L7-3833","刷新","shuāxīn","V","to refresh; to renew","actualizar; renovar","actualiser; renouveler","她在这次比赛中刷新了全国纪录。","tā zài zhè cì bǐ sài zhōng shuā xīn le quán guó jì lù","She broke the national record in this competition.","En esta competencia ella batió el récord nacional.","Lors de cette compétition, elle a battu le record national."],["L7-3834","耍","shuǎ","V","to play; to wield (surname)","jugar; manejar","jouer; manier","街头艺人一边耍着几个球，一边和观众说笑。","jiē tóu yì rén yì biān shuǎ zhe jǐ ge qiú yì biān hé guān zhòng shuō xiào","The street performer juggled several balls while joking with the audience.","El artista callejero hacía malabares con varias pelotas mientras bromeaba con el público.","L'artiste de rue jonglait avec plusieurs balles tout en plaisantant avec le public."],["L7-3835","耍赖","shuǎlài","V","to act shamelessly; to renege","hacerse el sinvergüenza; echarse atrás","se défiler; ne pas tenir parole","说好输了的人请客，你可不能耍赖。","shuō hǎo shū le de rén qǐng kè nǐ kě bù néng shuǎ lài","We agreed that the loser would treat everyone, so don't try to back out of it.","Quedamos en que el que perdiera invitaba, así que no te hagas el tramposo.","On avait dit que le perdant invitait, alors ne triche pas."],["L7-3836","衰减","shuāijiǎn","V","to weaken; to attenuate","debilitar; atenuar","affaiblir; atténuer","随着距离的增加，信号会逐渐衰减。","suí zhe jù lí de zēng jiā xìn hào huì zhú jiàn shuāi jiǎn","As distance increases, the signal gradually weakens.","A medida que aumenta la distancia, la señal se va debilitando gradualmente.","À mesure que la distance augmente, le signal s'affaiblit progressivement."],["L7-3837","衰竭","shuāijié","V","organ failure; exhaustion","insuficiencia orgánica; agotamiento","défaillance d'organe; épuisement","病人因为心脏功能衰竭，被送进了重症病房。","bìng rén yīn wèi xīn zàng gōng néng shuāi jié bèi sòng jìn le zhòng zhèng bìng fáng","The patient was admitted to intensive care with heart failure.","El paciente fue ingresado en la unidad de cuidados intensivos por insuficiencia cardíaca.","Le patient a été admis en soins intensifs pour insuffisance cardiaque."],["L7-3838","衰老","shuāilǎo","Adj","to age; old and weak","envejecer; decrépito","vieillir; affaibli par l'âge","适当运动可以延缓身体的衰老。","shì dàng yùn dòng kě yǐ yán huǎn shēn tǐ de shuāi lǎo","Appropriate exercise can slow the aging of the body.","El ejercicio adecuado puede retrasar el envejecimiento del cuerpo.","Une activité physique adaptée peut retarder le vieillissement du corps."],["L7-3839","衰弱","shuāiruò","Adj","weak; feeble","débil; endeble","faible; chétif","大病一场以后，他的身体变得十分衰弱。","dà bìng yì chǎng yǐ hòu tā de shēn tǐ biàn de shí fēn shuāi ruò","After a serious illness, his body became very weak.","Después de una enfermedad grave, su cuerpo quedó muy debilitado.","Après une grave maladie, son corps est devenu très affaibli."],["L7-3840","衰退","shuāituì","V","to decline; decline","declinar; declive","décliner; déclin","受全球经济衰退的影响，很多工厂都减产了。","shòu quán qiú jīng jì shuāi tuì de yǐng xiǎng hěn duō gōng chǎng dōu jiǎn chǎn le","Affected by the global economic recession, many factories have cut production.","Por la recesión económica mundial, muchas fábricas redujeron su producción.","Sous l'effet de la récession économique mondiale, beaucoup d'usines ont réduit leur production."],["L7-3841","摔跤","shuāijiāo","","to trip and fall; to wrestle","tropezar y caer; luchar","trébucher; lutter (sport)","瞧你那狼狈样，路上是不是摔跤了？","qiáo nǐ nà láng bèi yàng lù shang shì bu shì shuāi jiāo le","Look at the state you're in; did you fall on the way?","Mira qué facha traes, ¿te caíste en el camino?","Regarde dans quel état tu es, tu es tombé en chemin ?"],["L7-3842","甩","shuǎi","V","to throw; to swing; to shake off","lanzar; agitar; deshacerse de","jeter; balancer; semer","小狗从河里爬上来，使劲甩了甩身上的水。","xiǎo gǒu cóng hé lǐ pá shàng lái shǐ jìn shuǎi le shuǎi shēn shang de shuǐ","The puppy climbed out of the river and shook the water off its body hard.","El perrito salió del río trepando y se sacudió con fuerza el agua del cuerpo.","Le chiot est remonté de la rivière et s'est vigoureusement secoué pour faire tomber l'eau de son pelage."],["L7-3843","率","shuài","V","to lead; to command; rash","dirigir; comandar; precipitado","mener; commander; irréfléchi","赛后，教练率全队向现场观众鞠躬致谢。","sài hòu jiào liàn shuài quán duì xiàng xiàn chǎng guān zhòng jū gōng zhì xiè","After the match, the coach led the whole team in bowing to the spectators in thanks.","Al terminar el partido, el entrenador encabezó al equipo para hacer una reverencia de agradecimiento al público presente.","Après le match, l'entraîneur a conduit toute l'équipe à s'incliner pour remercier les spectateurs présents."],["L7-3844","拴","shuān","V","to tie up","atar","attacher","他把自行车拴在路边的柱子上，就进了商店。","tā bǎ zì xíng chē shuān zài lù biān de zhù zi shàng jiù jìn le shāng diàn","He fastened his bicycle to a roadside post and went into the shop.","Amarró su bicicleta a un poste en la calle y entró a la tienda.","Il a attaché son vélo à un poteau au bord de la route et est entré dans le magasin."],["L7-3845","涮","shuàn","V","to rinse; to hotpot-dip; to fool","enjuagar; hacer hotpot; engañar","rincer; cuire au fondue chinoise; duper","把薄薄的羊肉片放进锅里涮一下就能吃了。","bǎ báo báo de yáng ròu piàn fàng jìn guō lǐ shuàn yí xià jiù néng chī le","Just dip the thin slices of mutton into the pot for a moment and they're ready to eat.","Echa las finas láminas de cordero en la olla un momento y ya se pueden comer.","Plongez quelques instants les fines tranches de mouton dans la marmite et elles sont prêtes à être mangées."],["L7-3846","双胞胎","shuāngbāotāi","N","twins","gemelos","jumeaux","这对双胞胎兄弟性格完全不一样。","zhè duì shuāng bāo tāi xiōng dì xìng gé wán quán bù yí yàng","These twin brothers have completely different personalities.","Estos hermanos gemelos tienen personalidades totalmente distintas.","Ces frères jumeaux ont des caractères complètement différents."],["L7-3847","双边","shuāngbiān","Adj","bilateral","bilateral","bilatéral","两国领导人就扩大双边贸易进行了会谈。","liǎng guó lǐng dǎo rén jiù kuò dà shuāng biān mào yì jìn xíng le huì tán","The leaders of the two countries held talks on expanding bilateral trade.","Los líderes de los dos países sostuvieron conversaciones sobre la ampliación del comercio bilateral.","Les dirigeants des deux pays se sont entretenus sur l'expansion des échanges commerciaux bilatéraux."],["L7-3848","双重","shuāngchóng","Adj","double","doble","double","这个年轻人背负着工作和学习的双重压力。","zhè ge nián qīng rén bēi fù zhe gōng zuò hé xué xí de shuāng chóng yā lì","This young man bears the double pressure of work and study.","Este joven carga con la doble presión del trabajo y los estudios.","Ce jeune homme subit la double pression du travail et des études."],["L7-3849","双向","shuāngxiàng","Adj","two-way; interactive","bidireccional; interactivo","bidirectionnel; interactif","这条马路明年要扩成双向六车道。","zhè tiáo mǎ lù míng nián yào kuò chéng shuāng xiàng liù chē dào","This road will be widened next year to six lanes in total, three in each direction.","El próximo año esta calle se ampliará a seis carriles, tres en cada sentido.","L'an prochain, cette route sera élargie à six voies, trois dans chaque sens."],["L7-3850","双赢","shuāngyíng","V","win-win; mutually beneficial","beneficio mutuo; ganar-ganar","gagnant-gagnant","这次合作对两家公司来说是双赢的。","zhè cì hé zuò duì liǎng jiā gōng sī lái shuō shì shuāng yíng de","This cooperation is a win-win for both companies.","Esta colaboración es beneficiosa para ambas empresas.","Cette coopération est gagnante pour les deux entreprises."],["L7-3851","霜","shuāng","N","frost; cream","escarcha; crema","givre; crème","早上起来，地上铺了一层白白的霜。","zǎo shang qǐ lái dì shang pū le yì céng bái bái de shuāng","When I got up in the morning, the ground was covered with a layer of white frost.","Al levantarme por la mañana, el suelo estaba cubierto por una capa de escarcha blanca.","Au lever, le sol était recouvert d'une couche de givre blanc."],["L7-3852","爽快","shuǎngkuai","Adj","refreshed; frank","despejado; franco","revigoré; franc","他办事很爽快，我刚开口他就答应帮忙了。","tā bàn shì hěn shuǎng kuai wǒ gāng kāi kǒu tā jiù dā ying bāng máng le","He's very straightforward — as soon as I asked, he agreed to help.","Es muy directo para resolver las cosas: apenas se lo pedí, aceptó ayudarme.","Il est très franc et rapide : à peine lui avais-je demandé qu'il a accepté de m'aider."],["L7-3853","水槽","shuǐcáo","N","sink","fregadero","évier","吃完饭，他把碗筷都放进了水槽里。","chī wán fàn tā bǎ wǎn kuài dōu fàng jìn le shuǐ cáo lǐ","After the meal, he put the bowls and chopsticks into the sink.","Al terminar de comer, puso los platos y los palillos en el fregadero.","Après le repas, il a mis les bols et les baguettes dans l'évier."],["L7-3854","水稻","shuǐdào","N","rice paddy; rice","arrozal; arroz","rizière; riz","这里的土壤很肥沃，适合种水稻。","zhè lǐ de tǔ rǎng hěn féi wò shì hé zhòng shuǐ dào","The soil here is very fertile and suitable for growing rice.","El suelo de aquí es muy fértil y propicio para cultivar arroz.","Le sol ici est très fertile et convient bien à la culture du riz."],["L7-3855","水管","shuǐguǎn","N","water pipe","tubería de agua","tuyau d'eau","天太冷了，院子里的水管都冻住了。","tiān tài lěng le yuàn zi lǐ de shuǐ guǎn dōu dòng zhù le","It's so cold that the water pipes in the yard have frozen.","Hace tanto frío que las tuberías de agua del patio se congelaron.","Il fait si froid que les canalisations d'eau de la cour ont gelé."],["L7-3856","水壶","shuǐhú","N","kettle; water bottle","hervidor; cantimplora","bouilloire; gourde","爬山的时候一定要带一个装满水的水壶。","pá shān de shí hou yí dìng yào dài yí ge zhuāng mǎn shuǐ de shuǐ hú","When climbing a mountain, be sure to bring a full water bottle.","Al subir a la montaña, no olvides llevar una cantimplora llena de agua.","Quand vous faites une randonnée en montagne, emportez toujours une gourde pleine d'eau."],["L7-3857","水货","shuǐhuò","N","smuggled goods","mercancía de contrabando","marchandises de contrebande","这些手机价格便宜得离谱，很可能是水货。","zhè xiē shǒu jī jià gé pián yi de lí pǔ hěn kě néng shì shuǐ huò","These phones are ridiculously cheap and are very likely gray-market goods.","Estos teléfonos son absurdamente baratos; lo más probable es que sean de contrabando.","Ces téléphones sont d'un prix ridiculement bas, et il s'agit très probablement de produits de contrebande."],["L7-3858","水晶","shuǐjīng","N","crystal","cristal","cristal","她戴着一条水晶项链，在灯光下闪闪发亮。","tā dài zhe yì tiáo shuǐ jīng xiàng liàn zài dēng guāng xià shǎn shǎn fā liàng","She wore a crystal necklace that sparkled under the lights.","Llevaba un collar de cristal que brillaba bajo las luces.","Elle portait un collier de cristal qui scintillait sous les lumières."],["L7-3859","水利","shuǐlì","N","water conservancy; irrigation","obras hidráulicas; riego","hydraulique; irrigation","这个地区修建了很多水利工程，解决了农田灌溉问题。","zhè ge dì qū xiū jiàn le hěn duō shuǐ lì gōng chéng jiě jué le nóng tián guàn gài wèn tí","Many water conservancy projects have been built in this area, solving the problem of irrigating farmland.","En esta región se construyeron muchas obras hidráulicas que resolvieron el problema del riego de las tierras de cultivo.","De nombreux ouvrages hydrauliques ont été construits dans cette région, résolvant le problème de l'irrigation des terres agricoles."],["L7-3860","水灵灵","shuǐlínglíng","Adj","lush and fresh-looking","lozano; fresco","frais et éclatant","早市上的青菜水灵灵的，一看就很新鲜。","zǎo shì shàng de qīng cài shuǐ líng líng de yí kàn jiù hěn xīn xiān","The greens at the morning market are juicy and fresh-looking.","Las verduras del mercado matinal están jugosas y se ve que son muy frescas.","Les légumes verts du marché du matin sont gorgés d'eau et ont l'air très frais."],["L7-3861","水龙头","shuǐlóngtóu","N","faucet; tap","grifo","robinet","洗完手记得把水龙头关紧，别浪费水。","xǐ wán shǒu jì de bǎ shuǐ lóng tóu guān jǐn bié làng fèi shuǐ","After washing your hands, remember to turn the tap off tightly so you don't waste water.","Después de lavarte las manos, acuérdate de cerrar bien el grifo para no desperdiciar agua.","Après t'être lavé les mains, pense à bien fermer le robinet pour ne pas gaspiller l'eau."],["L7-3862","水落石出","shuǐluò-shíchū","","the truth comes to light","la verdad sale a la luz","la vérité éclate au grand jour","这件事一定要查个水落石出，给大家一个交代。","zhè jiàn shì yí dìng yào chá gè shuǐ luò shí chū gěi dà jiā yí ge jiāo dài","This matter must be investigated until the truth comes out, so everyone gets an explanation.","Este asunto hay que investigarlo hasta que salga la verdad a la luz y darles una explicación a todos.","Cette affaire doit être élucidée jusqu'au bout pour que la vérité éclate et que chacun obtienne des explications."],["L7-3863","水面","shuǐmiàn","N","water surface","superficie del agua","surface de l'eau","河边的柳树把长长的枝条垂到了水面上。","hé biān de liǔ shù bǎ cháng cháng de zhī tiáo chuí dào le shuǐ miàn shàng","The willows by the river hang their long branches down to the surface of the water.","Los sauces de la orilla del río dejan caer sus largas ramas hasta la superficie del agua.","Les saules au bord de la rivière laissent pendre leurs longues branches jusqu'à la surface de l'eau."],["L7-3864","水手","shuǐshǒu","N","sailor","marinero","marin","老水手在海上航行了一辈子，见过各种各样的风浪。","lǎo shuǐ shǒu zài hǎi shàng háng xíng le yí bèi zi jiàn guo gè zhǒng gè yàng de fēng làng","The old sailor has sailed the seas all his life and has seen every kind of storm.","El viejo marinero ha navegado toda su vida y ha visto todo tipo de tormentas.","Le vieux marin a navigué toute sa vie et a connu toutes sortes de tempêtes."],["L7-3865","水温","shuǐwēn","N","water temperature","temperatura del agua","température de l'eau","给婴儿洗澡前，要先用手试一试水温。","gěi yīng ér xǐ zǎo qián yào xiān yòng shǒu shì yí shì shuǐ wēn","Before bathing a baby, test the water temperature with your hand first.","Antes de bañar a un bebé, primero hay que probar la temperatura del agua con la mano.","Avant de baigner un bébé, il faut d'abord tester la température de l'eau avec la main."],["L7-3866","水域","shuǐyù","N","waters; body of water","aguas; masa de agua","étendue d'eau; eaux","这片水域禁止游泳，因为水下暗流很多。","zhè piàn shuǐ yù jìn zhǐ yóu yǒng yīn wèi shuǐ xià àn liú hěn duō","Swimming is prohibited in these waters because of the many undercurrents.","Está prohibido nadar en estas aguas porque hay muchas corrientes subacuáticas.","La baignade est interdite dans ces eaux à cause des nombreux courants sous-marins."],["L7-3867","水源","shuǐyuán","N","water source","fuente de agua; manantial","source d'eau; point d'eau","工厂排放的污水污染了附近村庄的水源。","gōng chǎng pái fàng de wū shuǐ wū rǎn le fù jìn cūn zhuāng de shuǐ yuán","The wastewater discharged by the factory polluted the water supply of nearby villages.","Las aguas residuales vertidas por la fábrica contaminaron la fuente de agua de los pueblos cercanos.","Les eaux usées rejetées par l'usine ont pollué l'approvisionnement en eau des villages voisins."],["L7-3868","水涨船高","shuǐzhǎng-chuángāo","","to rise with the general tide","subir con la marea general","monter avec la marée générale","物价上涨，房租也跟着水涨船高。","wù jià shàng zhǎng fáng zū yě gēn zhe shuǐ zhǎng chuán gāo","As prices rise, rents go up along with them.","Sube el costo de la vida y el alquiler también aumenta en consecuencia.","Les prix augmentent et les loyers suivent le mouvement."],["L7-3869","水准","shuǐzhǔn","N","level; standard","nivel; estándar","niveau; standard","这位钢琴家的演奏水准非常高。","zhè wèi gāng qín jiā de yǎn zòu shuǐ zhǔn fēi cháng gāo","This pianist plays to a very high standard.","El nivel de interpretación de este pianista es altísimo.","Le niveau de jeu de ce pianiste est très élevé."],["L7-3870","税收","shuìshōu","N","taxation; tax revenue","recaudación de impuestos","recettes fiscales; fiscalité","政府通过税收来调控房价。","zhèng fǔ tōng guò shuì shōu lái tiáo kòng fáng jià","The government regulates housing prices through taxation.","El gobierno regula los precios de la vivienda mediante los impuestos.","Le gouvernement régule les prix de l'immobilier par la fiscalité."],["L7-3871","税务","shuìwù","N","tax affairs","asuntos tributarios","affaires fiscales","开公司以后，要按时到税务部门申报纳税。","kāi gōng sī yǐ hòu yào àn shí dào shuì wù bù mén shēn bào nà shuì","After starting a company, you must file tax returns with the tax authorities on time.","Después de abrir una empresa, hay que presentar a tiempo la declaración y el pago de impuestos ante la autoridad tributaria.","Après avoir créé une entreprise, il faut déclarer et payer ses impôts à temps auprès de l'administration fiscale."],["L7-3872","睡袋","shuìdài","N","sleeping bag","saco de dormir","sac de couchage","山上夜里很冷，一定要带一个厚睡袋。","shān shàng yè lǐ hěn lěng yí dìng yào dài yí ge hòu shuì dài","It's very cold on the mountain at night, so be sure to bring a thick sleeping bag.","En la montaña hace mucho frío por la noche, así que no olvides llevar un saco de dormir grueso.","Il fait très froid la nuit en montagne, pensez à emporter un sac de couchage bien épais."],["L7-3873","顺便","shùnbiàn","Adv","by the way; in passing","de paso; a propósito","au passage; en passant","我下班路过邮局，顺便把这封信寄了。","wǒ xià bān lù guò yóu jú shùn biàn bǎ zhè fēng xìn jì le","I passed the post office after work and mailed this letter while I was at it.","Pasé por la oficina de correos al salir del trabajo y de paso envié esta carta.","En sortant du travail, je suis passé devant la poste et j'en ai profité pour envoyer cette lettre."],["L7-3874","顺差","shùnchā","N","surplus (trade)","superávit","excédent (commercial)","这个国家今年的对外贸易继续保持顺差。","zhè ge guó jiā jīn nián de duì wài mào yì jì xù bǎo chí shùn chā","This country's foreign trade continued to show a surplus this year.","El comercio exterior de este país mantuvo este año un superávit.","Le commerce extérieur de ce pays a continué cette année à dégager un excédent."],["L7-3875","顺畅","shùnchàng","Adj","smooth; fluent","fluido; sin obstáculos","fluide; sans entrave","新路修好以后，这一带的交通顺畅多了。","xīn lù xiū hǎo yǐ hòu zhè yí dài de jiāo tōng shùn chàng duō le","After the new road was built, traffic in this area flowed much more smoothly.","Después de construirse el camino nuevo, el tráfico en esta zona fluye mucho mejor.","Depuis que la nouvelle route a été construite, la circulation dans ce secteur est bien plus fluide."],["L7-3876","顺从","shùncóng","V","obedient; to comply","obediente; acatar","docile; se soumettre","他从小就很顺从父母，从来不敢反对。","tā cóng xiǎo jiù hěn shùn cóng fù mǔ cóng lái bù gǎn fǎn duì","Since childhood he has always obeyed his parents and never dared to object.","Desde pequeño siempre ha obedecido a sus padres y nunca se ha atrevido a oponerse.","Depuis tout petit, il obéit toujours à ses parents et n'a jamais osé s'y opposer."],["L7-3877","顺理成章","shùnlǐ-chéngzhāng","","logical; natural","lógico; natural","logique; naturel","他工作出色，被提拔为经理也是顺理成章的事。","tā gōng zuò chū sè bèi tí bá wéi jīng lǐ yě shì shùn lǐ chéng zhāng de shì","He did outstanding work, so his promotion to manager was only natural.","Hacía un trabajo sobresaliente, así que su ascenso a gerente era lo más natural.","Il travaillait remarquablement bien, alors sa promotion au poste de directeur allait de soi."],["L7-3878","顺路","shùnlù","Adj/Adv","on the way; conveniently","de camino; de paso","en chemin; au passage","我下班顺路，可以开车送你回家。","wǒ xià bān shùn lù kě yǐ kāi chē sòng nǐ huí jiā","It's on my way home from work, so I can drive you home.","Me queda de camino al salir del trabajo, así que puedo llevarte a casa en auto.","Je rentre dans la même direction en sortant du travail, je peux te ramener en voiture."],["L7-3879","顺其自然","shùnqízìrán","","to let nature take its course","dejar que las cosas sigan su curso","laisser faire la nature","感情的事急不得，还是顺其自然吧。","gǎn qíng de shì jí bù dé hái shi shùn qí zì rán ba","Matters of the heart can't be rushed; just let things take their course.","Los asuntos del corazón no se pueden apresurar; mejor dejar que las cosas sigan su curso.","On ne peut pas brusquer les affaires de cœur ; laisse plutôt les choses suivre leur cours."],["L7-3880","顺势","shùnshì","Adv","to take advantage of the situation","aprovechar la ocasión","profiter de l'occasion","对方一松手，他顺势把球抢了过来。","duì fāng yì sōng shǒu tā shùn shì bǎ qiú qiǎng le guò lái","The moment his opponent loosened his grip, he took advantage and grabbed the ball.","Apenas su rival aflojó la mano, aprovechó para arrebatarle el balón.","À peine son adversaire a-t-il relâché sa prise qu'il en a profité pour lui prendre le ballon."],["L7-3881","顺手","shùnshǒu","Adj/Adv","conveniently; handy","de paso; a mano","au passage; pratique","出门的时候，他顺手把垃圾带下了楼。","chū mén de shí hou tā shùn shǒu bǎ lā jī dài xià le lóu","On his way out, he took the garbage downstairs while he was at it.","Al salir, aprovechó para bajar la basura.","En sortant, il en a profité pour descendre la poubelle."],["L7-3882","顺心","shùnxīn","","satisfied; content","satisfecho; contento","satisfait; content","最近工作上的事不太顺心，他整天闷闷不乐。","zuì jìn gōng zuò shàng de shì bú tài shùn xīn tā zhěng tiān mèn mèn bú lè","Things haven't been going well at work recently, and he's been gloomy all day.","Últimamente las cosas en el trabajo no le van bien y anda desanimado todo el día.","Ces derniers temps, les choses ne vont pas bien au travail et il est morose toute la journée."],["L7-3883","顺应","shùnyìng","V","to adapt to; to conform to","adaptarse a; ajustarse a","s'adapter à; se conformer à","企业必须顺应市场的变化，不断调整产品。","qǐ yè bì xū shùn yìng shì chǎng de biàn huà bú duàn tiáo zhěng chǎn pǐn","Businesses must adapt to market changes and keep adjusting their products.","Las empresas deben adaptarse a los cambios del mercado y ajustar constantemente sus productos.","Les entreprises doivent s'adapter aux évolutions du marché et ajuster constamment leurs produits."],["L7-3884","顺着","shùnzhe","","to follow; along","seguir; a lo largo de","suivre; le long de","他跑得满头大汗，汗水顺着脸往下淌。","tā pǎo de mǎn tóu dà hàn hàn shuǐ shùn zhe liǎn wǎng xià tǎng","He ran until he was drenched in sweat, which trickled down his face.","Corrió hasta quedar bañado en sudor, que le resbalaba por la cara.","Il a couru jusqu'à avoir le front ruisselant de sueur, qui lui coulait le long du visage."],["L7-3885","瞬间","shùnjiān","N","instant; moment","instante; momento","instant; moment","照相机记录下了孩子们欢笑的瞬间。","zhào xiàng jī jì lù xià le hái zi men huān xiào de shùn jiān","The camera captured a moment of the children laughing happily.","La cámara captó el instante en que los niños reían alegres.","L'appareil photo a saisi l'instant où les enfants riaient aux éclats."],["L7-3886","说白了","shuōbáile","","to put it bluntly","hablando claro","pour parler franchement","说白了，他就是不想承担这个责任。","shuō bái le tā jiù shì bù xiǎng chéng dān zhè ge zé rèn","To put it bluntly, he just doesn't want to take on this responsibility.","Dicho sin rodeos, simplemente no quiere asumir esta responsabilidad.","Pour dire les choses franchement, il ne veut tout simplement pas assumer cette responsabilité."],["L7-3887","说不上","shuōbushàng","V","can't say; not worth mentioning","no poder decir; no merecer mención","ne pas pouvoir dire; sans importance","我说不上为什么，就是不太喜欢这个地方。","wǒ shuō bu shàng wèi shén me jiù shì bú tài xǐ huan zhè ge dì fang","I can't say why, but I just don't really like this place.","No sé decir por qué, pero simplemente no me gusta mucho este lugar.","Je ne saurais pas dire pourquoi, mais cet endroit ne me plaît pas vraiment."],["L7-3888","说到底","shuōdàodǐ","","in the final analysis","a fin de cuentas","en fin de compte","钱再多也买不来健康，说到底，健康才是最重要的。","qián zài duō yě mǎi bù lái jiàn kāng shuō dào dǐ jiàn kāng cái shì zuì zhòng yào de","No amount of money can buy good health; when all is said and done, health is what matters most.","Por mucho dinero que se tenga, no se compra la salud; al fin y al cabo, lo más importante es la salud.","On a beau avoir beaucoup d'argent, on ne peut pas acheter la santé ; au bout du compte, la santé est ce qu'il y a de plus important."],["L7-3889","说道","shuōdao","V/N","to say; to state","decir; afirmar","dire; déclarer","爸爸放下报纸，笑着对孩子们说道，明天带大家去爬山。","bà ba fàng xià bào zhǐ xiào zhe duì hái zi men shuō dào míng tiān dài dà jiā qù pá shān","Dad put down the newspaper and told the children with a smile that he would take everyone hiking tomorrow.","Papá dejó el periódico y les dijo sonriendo a los niños que mañana los llevaría a todos a la montaña.","Papa a posé son journal et a dit en souriant aux enfants qu'il les emmènerait tous en randonnée demain."],["L7-3890","说干就干","shuō gàn jiù gàn","","to act without delay","ponerse manos a la obra","se mettre aussitôt à l'œuvre","他想开一家花店，说干就干，第二个月就开业了。","tā xiǎng kāi yì jiā huā diàn shuō gàn jiù gàn dì èr gè yuè jiù kāi yè le","He wanted to open a flower shop and wasted no time — it opened the very next month.","Quería abrir una florería y, dicho y hecho, al mes siguiente ya había inaugurado.","Il voulait ouvrir un fleuriste et, sitôt dit, sitôt fait, le magasin a ouvert dès le mois suivant."],["L7-3891","说谎","shuōhuǎng","","to lie","mentir","mentir","他是一个正直的人，从来不说谎。","tā shì yí ge zhèng zhí de rén cóng lái bù shuō huǎng","He is an upright person who never lies.","Es una persona íntegra que nunca dice mentiras.","C'est un homme droit qui ne ment jamais."],["L7-3892","说老实话","shuō lǎoshi huà","","to be honest","para ser sincero","pour être honnête","说老实话，我对这个计划没有什么信心。","shuō lǎo shi huà wǒ duì zhè ge jì huà méi yǒu shén me xìn xīn","To be honest, I don't have much confidence in this plan.","Para ser sincero, no tengo mucha confianza en este plan.","Pour être honnête, je n'ai pas beaucoup confiance en ce projet."],["L7-3893","说起来","shuō qǐlái","","speaking of; when it comes to","hablando de; en cuanto a","à propos de; quand on en parle","说起来容易，做起来可就难了。","shuō qǐ lái róng yì zuò qǐ lái kě jiù nán le","It's easy to talk about, but much harder to do.","Es fácil decirlo, pero hacerlo ya es otra cosa.","C'est facile à dire, mais bien plus difficile à faire."],["L7-3894","说情","shuōqíng","","to intercede for someone","interceder por alguien","intercéder pour quelqu'un","他犯了错，他父亲到处托人去说情。","tā fàn le cuò tā fù qīn dào chù tuō rén qù shuō qíng","He made a mistake, and his father went everywhere asking people to plead on his behalf.","Cometió un error y su padre fue por todas partes pidiéndole a la gente que intercediera por él.","Il a fait une faute, et son père est allé partout demander à des gens d'intercéder en sa faveur."],["L7-3895","说闲话","shuō xiánhuà","","to gossip","cotillear; chismorrear","bavarder; faire des commérages","别人爱说闲话就让他们说吧，你做好自己就行。","bié rén ài shuō xián huà jiù ràng tā men shuō ba nǐ zuò hǎo zì jǐ jiù xíng","If others love to gossip, let them; just focus on doing your own thing.","Si a los demás les gusta chismear, déjalos; tú solo ocúpate de hacer bien lo tuyo.","Si les autres aiment faire des commérages, laisse-les dire ; contente-toi de bien faire ce que tu as à faire."],["L7-3896","说真的","shuō zhēnde","","honestly; to tell the truth","de verdad; en serio","franchement; à vrai dire","说真的，你做的菜比饭店里的还好吃。","shuō zhēn de nǐ zuò de cài bǐ fàn diàn lǐ de hái hǎo chī","Honestly, your cooking is even better than the restaurant's.","En serio, lo que tú cocinas está más rico que lo del restaurante.","Franchement, ta cuisine est encore meilleure que celle du restaurant."],["L7-3897","硕果","shuòguǒ","N","great achievement","gran logro; fruto notable","grand succès; fruit remarquable","经过多年的研究，这个科研团队终于结出了硕果。","jīng guò duō nián de yán jiū zhè ge kē yán tuán duì zhōng yú jiē chū le shuò guǒ","After years of research, the scientific team finally achieved great results.","Tras muchos años de investigación, este equipo científico por fin cosechó grandes frutos.","Après des années de recherche, cette équipe scientifique a enfin récolté de beaux fruits."],["L7-3898","司法","sīfǎ","V","judicial; justice","judicial; justicia","judiciaire; justice","司法公正是社会公平的重要保障。","sī fǎ gōng zhèng shì shè huì gōng píng de zhòng yào bǎo zhàng","Judicial fairness is an important guarantee of social justice.","La justicia judicial es una garantía importante de la equidad social.","L'équité de la justice est une garantie importante de l'égalité sociale."],["L7-3899","司空见惯","sīkōng-jiànguàn","","common occurrence","cosa habitual","chose courante","屋里乱得一塌糊涂，他却从容不迫地收拾起来，仿佛这样的场面早已司空见惯。","wū lǐ luàn de yì tā hú tú tā què cóng róng bú pò de shōu shi qǐ lái fǎng fú zhè yàng de chǎng miàn zǎo yǐ sī kōng jiàn guàn","The room was in a terrible mess, but he began tidying it calmly, as though such a scene were already commonplace to him.","El cuarto estaba hecho un desastre, pero él empezó a ordenar con calma, como si ya estuviera acostumbrado a escenas así.","La pièce était dans un désordre épouvantable, mais il s'est mis à ranger calmement, comme si une telle scène lui était depuis longtemps familière."],["L7-3900","司令","sīlìng","N","commander","comandante","commandant","这位将军曾经是这支部队的司令。","zhè wèi jiāng jūn céng jīng shì zhè zhī bù duì de sī lìng","This general was once the commander of this army unit.","Este general fue en su día el comandante de esta unidad.","Ce général a jadis été le commandant de cette unité."],["L7-3901","丝","sī","N","silk; thread; trace","seda; hilo; pizca","soie; fil; trace","窗外吹进来一丝凉风，屋里顿时凉快了不少。","chuāng wài chuī jìn lái yì sī liáng fēng wū lǐ dùn shí liáng kuai le bù shǎo","A wisp of cool breeze blew in through the window, and the room immediately felt much cooler.","Entró por la ventana una leve brisa fresca y de pronto la habitación se refrescó bastante.","Un souffle d'air frais est entré par la fenêtre et la pièce s'est aussitôt bien rafraîchie."],["L7-3902","丝绸","sīchóu","N","silk cloth; silk","tela de seda; seda","soie; soierie","这条丝绸围巾摸起来又软又滑。","zhè tiáo sī chóu wéi jīn mō qǐ lái yòu ruǎn yòu huá","This silk scarf feels soft and smooth.","Esta bufanda de seda es suave y lisa al tacto.","Cette écharpe en soie est douce et lisse au toucher."],["L7-3903","丝毫","sīháo","Adj","slightest bit","ápice; mínimo","moindre; tant soit peu","面对困难，他没有丝毫畏惧。","miàn duì kùn nan tā méi yǒu sī háo wèi jù","In the face of difficulty, he showed no fear at all.","Ante las dificultades, no mostró el menor temor.","Face aux difficultés, il n'a montré aucune crainte."],["L7-3904","私房钱","sīfángqián","N","secret savings","ahorros secretos","cagnotte secrète","他偷偷攒了一笔私房钱，想给妻子买件礼物。","tā tōu tōu zǎn le yì bǐ sī fáng qián xiǎng gěi qī zi mǎi jiàn lǐ wù","He secretly saved up a stash of money to buy his wife a gift.","Ahorró a escondidas un dinero extra para comprarle un regalo a su esposa.","Il a mis de côté en cachette un petit pécule pour offrir un cadeau à sa femme."],["L7-3905","私家车","sījiāchē","N","private car","coche particular","voiture personnelle","节假日的时候，很多人开着私家车去郊外旅游。","jié jià rì de shí hou hěn duō rén kāi zhe sī jiā chē qù jiāo wài lǚ yóu","During holidays, many people drive their own cars to the countryside.","En los días festivos, mucha gente sale en su propio auto a hacer turismo en las afueras.","Pendant les jours fériés, beaucoup de gens partent en voiture personnelle faire du tourisme à la campagne."],["L7-3906","私立","sīlì","V/Adj","private (school, company)","privado","privé","他在一所私立医院做护士，工资比以前高了不少。","tā zài yì suǒ sī lì yī yuàn zuò hù shi gōng zī bǐ yǐ qián gāo le bù shǎo","He works as a nurse at a private hospital, earning quite a bit more than before.","Trabaja como enfermero en un hospital privado y gana bastante más que antes.","Il travaille comme infirmier dans un hôpital privé et gagne nettement plus qu'avant."],["L7-3907","私事","sīshì","N","personal matters","asuntos personales","affaires personnelles","上班时间最好不要处理私事。","shàng bān shí jiān zuì hǎo bú yào chǔ lǐ sī shì","It's best not to deal with personal matters during working hours.","Durante el horario de trabajo es mejor no ocuparse de asuntos personales.","Pendant les heures de travail, il vaut mieux ne pas s'occuper d'affaires personnelles."],["L7-3908","私下","sīxià","N/Adv","in private","en privado","en privé","这件事我们私下谈吧，别在会上说。","zhè jiàn shì wǒ men sī xià tán ba bié zài huì shàng shuō","Let's talk about this in private rather than at the meeting.","Hablemos de esto en privado, no en la reunión.","Parlons-en en privé, pas pendant la réunion."],["L7-3909","私营","sīyíng","Adj","privately-run","de gestión privada","privé; géré à titre privé","这家私营企业已经发展成了行业里的龙头。","zhè jiā sī yíng qǐ yè yǐ jīng fā zhǎn chéng le háng yè lǐ de lóng tóu","This private enterprise has grown into a leader in its industry.","Esta empresa privada se ha convertido en líder de su sector.","Cette entreprise privée est devenue le leader de son secteur."],["L7-3910","私有","sīyǒu","V","privately owned","de propiedad privada","privé; de propriété privée","这片树林是私有的，未经允许不能进去。","zhè piàn shù lín shì sī yǒu de wèi jīng yǔn xǔ bù néng jìn qù","This woodland is privately owned and may not be entered without permission.","Este bosque es propiedad privada y no se puede entrar sin permiso.","Ce bois est une propriété privée et on ne peut y entrer sans autorisation."],["L7-3911","私自","sīzì","Adv","secretly; without permission","en secreto; sin permiso","en cachette; sans autorisation","学生不得私自离开学校，有事必须先请假。","xué shēng bù dé sī zì lí kāi xué xiào yǒu shì bì xū xiān qǐng jià","Students may not leave the school without permission; if something comes up, they must ask for leave first.","Los estudiantes no pueden salir de la escuela por su cuenta; si tienen algo que hacer, primero deben pedir permiso.","Les élèves n'ont pas le droit de quitter l'école de leur propre chef ; en cas d'empêchement, ils doivent d'abord demander une autorisation d'absence."],["L7-3912","思路","sīlù","N","train of thought","línea de pensamiento","cheminement de pensée","听了老师的分析，我的思路一下子就清楚了。","tīng le lǎo shī de fēn xī wǒ de sī lù yí xià zi jiù qīng chu le","After hearing the teacher's analysis, my thinking suddenly became clear.","Después de escuchar el análisis del maestro, mis ideas se aclararon de golpe.","Après avoir écouté l'analyse du professeur, mes idées se sont soudain éclaircies."],["L7-3913","思念","sīniàn","V","to miss; to long for","añorar; echar de menos","avoir la nostalgie de; regretter","这首抒情诗表达了诗人对故乡的思念。","zhè shǒu shū qíng shī biǎo dá le shī rén duì gù xiāng de sī niàn","This lyric poem expresses the poet's longing for his hometown.","Este poema lírico expresa la añoranza del poeta por su tierra natal.","Ce poème lyrique exprime la nostalgie du poète pour son pays natal."],["L7-3914","思前想后","sīqián-xiǎnghòu","","to think over past and future","reflexionar sobre pasado y futuro","peser le pour et le contre","她思前想后，最后还是决定留在国内工作。","tā sī qián xiǎng hòu zuì hòu hái shi jué dìng liú zài guó nèi gōng zuò","After thinking it over from every angle, she finally decided to stay and work in her own country.","Después de darle muchas vueltas, al final decidió quedarse a trabajar en su país.","Après avoir longuement réfléchi, elle a finalement décidé de rester travailler dans son pays."],["L7-3915","思索","sīsuǒ","V","to ponder","reflexionar; meditar","réfléchir; méditer","这个问题他思索了很久，还是没有想出答案。","zhè ge wèn tí tā sī suǒ le hěn jiǔ hái shi méi yǒu xiǎng chū dá àn","He pondered this question for a long time but still couldn't come up with an answer.","Estuvo reflexionando mucho tiempo sobre este problema, pero aún no encontró la respuesta.","Il a longuement médité cette question sans pour autant trouver la réponse."],["L7-3916","撕","sī","V","to tear","rasgar; desgarrar","déchirer","他一生气，把信撕成了碎片。","tā yì shēng qì bǎ xìn sī chéng le suì piàn","In a fit of anger, he tore the letter to pieces.","Furioso, rompió la carta en pedazos.","Sous le coup de la colère, il a déchiré la lettre en morceaux."],["L7-3917","死心","sǐxīn","","to give up; to resign oneself","resignarse; desistir","y renoncer; se résigner","她已经拒绝他好几次了，他还是不死心。","tā yǐ jīng jù jué tā hǎo jǐ cì le tā hái shi bù sǐ xīn","She has turned him down several times, but he still won't give up.","Ella ya lo ha rechazado varias veces, pero él no se da por vencido.","Elle l'a déjà repoussé plusieurs fois, mais il ne perd pas espoir."],["L7-3918","死心塌地","sǐxīn-tādì","","dead set; unswerving","obstinado; inquebrantable","obstiné; inébranlable","这么多年，他一直死心塌地地跟着老板干。","zhè me duō nián tā yì zhí sǐ xīn tā dì de gēn zhe lǎo bǎn gàn","All these years, he has worked for his boss with unwavering loyalty.","Todos estos años le ha sido incondicionalmente fiel a su jefe.","Toutes ces années, il a servi son patron avec une loyauté inébranlable."],["L7-3919","四合院","sìhéyuàn","N","courtyard house (siheyuan)","casa con patio (siheyuan)","maison à cour carrée (siheyuan)","北京的老四合院越来越少了。","běi jīng de lǎo sì hé yuàn yuè lái yuè shǎo le","Old courtyard houses in Beijing are becoming fewer and fewer.","Cada vez quedan menos casas antiguas de patio interior en Beijing.","Les vieilles maisons à cour carrée de Pékin se font de plus en plus rares."],["L7-3920","四季","sìjì","N","four seasons","cuatro estaciones","quatre saisons","这里四季鲜花盛开，是名副其实的花城。","zhè lǐ sì jì xiān huā shèng kāi shì míng fù qí shí de huā chéng","Flowers bloom here in all four seasons; it truly lives up to its name as a city of flowers.","Aquí florecen las flores en las cuatro estaciones; de verdad merece el nombre de ciudad de las flores.","Les fleurs s'épanouissent ici en toute saison ; c'est vraiment une ville des fleurs digne de ce nom."],["L7-3921","四面八方","sìmiàn-bāfāng","","in all directions","por todas partes","de toutes parts","运动会开幕那天，观众从四面八方赶来。","yùn dòng huì kāi mù nà tiān guān zhòng cóng sì miàn bā fāng gǎn lái","On the opening day of the games, spectators came from all directions.","El día de la inauguración de los juegos deportivos, los espectadores llegaron de todas partes.","Le jour de l'ouverture des jeux sportifs, les spectateurs sont venus de partout."],["L7-3922","寺庙","sìmiào","N","temple; monastery","templo; monasterio","temple; monastère","山上的寺庙里住着十几个和尚。","shān shàng de sì miào lǐ zhù zhe shí jǐ ge hé shang","A dozen or so monks live in the temple on the mountain.","En el templo de la montaña viven una docena de monjes.","Une douzaine de moines vivent dans le temple de la montagne."],["L7-3923","似曾相识","sìcéng-xiāngshí","","déjà vu; seemingly familiar","déjà vu; aparentemente familiar","déjà-vu; air familier","走进这条小巷，我有一种似曾相识的感觉。","zǒu jìn zhè tiáo xiǎo xiàng wǒ yǒu yì zhǒng sì céng xiāng shí de gǎn jué","Walking into this lane, I had a feeling of déjà vu.","Al entrar en este callejón, tuve una sensación de déjà vu.","En m'engageant dans cette ruelle, j'ai eu une impression de déjà-vu."],["L7-3924","似是而非","sìshì-érfēi","","seemingly right but wrong","aparentemente cierto pero falso","spécieux; faussement vrai","网上有很多似是而非的健康知识，大家要小心辨别。","wǎng shàng yǒu hěn duō sì shì ér fēi de jiàn kāng zhī shi dà jiā yào xiǎo xīn biàn bié","There's a lot of plausible-sounding but wrong health advice online, so everyone should judge carefully.","En internet hay muchos consejos de salud que parecen ciertos pero no lo son, así que hay que distinguirlos con cuidado.","Il circule en ligne beaucoup de conseils de santé qui semblent justes mais ne le sont pas, il faut donc faire attention à les distinguer."],["L7-3925","伺机","sìjī","V","to wait for an opportunity","acechar la oportunidad","guetter l'occasion","小偷在人群中伺机下手，被便衣警察发现了。","xiǎo tōu zài rén qún zhōng sì jī xià shǒu bèi biàn yī jǐng chá fā xiàn le","The thief was waiting for a chance to strike in the crowd when he was spotted by a plainclothes officer.","El ladrón esperaba el momento de actuar entre la multitud, pero lo descubrió un policía de civil.","Le voleur guettait l'occasion de frapper dans la foule lorsqu'un policier en civil l'a repéré."],["L7-3926","饲料","sìliào","N","feed; fodder","pienso; forraje","aliments pour bétail; fourrage","最近饲料价格上涨，养猪的成本提高了。","zuì jìn sì liào jià gé shàng zhǎng yǎng zhū de chéng běn tí gāo le","Feed prices have risen recently, increasing the cost of raising pigs.","Últimamente subió el precio del pienso y aumentó el costo de criar cerdos.","Le prix de l'alimentation animale a augmenté récemment, ce qui a fait grimper le coût de l'élevage porcin."],["L7-3927","饲养","sìyǎng","V","to raise (animals)","criar (animales)","élever (des animaux)","这个农场饲养了几百头奶牛。","zhè ge nóng chǎng sì yǎng le jǐ bǎi tóu nǎi niú","This farm raises several hundred dairy cows.","Esta granja cría varios cientos de vacas lecheras.","Cette ferme élève plusieurs centaines de vaches laitières."],["L7-3928","松绑","sōngbǎng","","to untie; to ease restrictions","desatar; aflojar restricciones","délier; assouplir les restrictions","政府为小企业松绑，简化了很多审批手续。","zhèng fǔ wèi xiǎo qǐ yè sōng bǎng jiǎn huà le hěn duō shěn pī shǒu xù","The government eased restrictions on small businesses, simplifying many approval procedures.","El gobierno flexibilizó las restricciones a las pequeñas empresas y simplificó muchos trámites de aprobación.","Le gouvernement a allégé les contraintes pesant sur les petites entreprises et simplifié de nombreuses procédures d'autorisation."],["L7-3929","松弛","sōngchí","Adj","relaxed; slack","relajado; flojo","détendu; relâché","泡个热水澡能让紧张的肌肉松弛下来。","pào gè rè shuǐ zǎo néng ràng jǐn zhāng de jī ròu sōng chí xià lái","A hot bath can relax tense muscles.","Darse un baño de agua caliente ayuda a relajar los músculos tensos.","Prendre un bain chaud permet de détendre les muscles tendus."],["L7-3930","耸立","sǒnglì","V","to tower; to stand tall","alzarse; elevarse","se dresser; s'élever","市中心耸立着一座一百多层的摩天大楼。","shì zhōng xīn sǒng lì zhe yí zuò yì bǎi duō céng de mó tiān dà lóu","A skyscraper of over a hundred stories towers over the city center.","En el centro de la ciudad se alza un rascacielos de más de cien pisos.","Au centre-ville se dresse un gratte-ciel de plus de cent étages."],["L7-3931","送别","sòngbié","","to see off","despedir","faire ses adieux","大家都来火车站送别即将出国留学的小李。","dà jiā dōu lái huǒ chē zhàn sòng bié jí jiāng chū guó liú xué de xiǎo lǐ","Everyone came to the railway station to see off Xiao Li, who was about to go abroad to study.","Todos fueron a la estación de tren a despedir a Xiao Li, que estaba a punto de irse a estudiar al extranjero.","Tout le monde est venu à la gare dire au revoir à Xiao Li, sur le point de partir étudier à l'étranger."],["L7-3932","搜查","sōuchá","V","to search","registrar; inspeccionar","fouiller; perquisitionner","警察拿着搜查证，对嫌疑人的住处进行了搜查。","jǐng chá ná zhe sōu chá zhèng duì xián yí rén de zhù chù jìn xíng le sōu chá","With a search warrant, police searched the suspect's residence.","Con una orden de registro en mano, la policía registró el domicilio del sospechoso.","Munie d'un mandat de perquisition, la police a perquisitionné le domicile du suspect."],["L7-3933","搜集","sōují","V","to gather; to collect","recopilar; reunir","recueillir; rassembler","他花了好几年时间搜集民间故事。","tā huā le hǎo jǐ nián shí jiān sōu jí mín jiān gù shi","He spent several years collecting folk tales.","Pasó varios años recopilando cuentos populares.","Il a passé plusieurs années à collecter des contes populaires."],["L7-3934","搜救","sōujiù","V","search and rescue","búsqueda y rescate","recherche et sauvetage","地震发生后，搜救人员连夜赶到了灾区。","dì zhèn fā shēng hòu sōu jiù rén yuán lián yè gǎn dào le zāi qū","After the earthquake, search and rescue workers rushed overnight to the disaster area.","Tras el terremoto, los equipos de búsqueda y rescate llegaron de noche a la zona del desastre.","Après le séisme, les équipes de recherche et de sauvetage sont arrivées dans la zone sinistrée pendant la nuit."],["L7-3935","搜寻","sōuxún","V","to search for","buscar; rastrear","chercher; rechercher","直升机在海面上搜寻失踪的渔船。","zhí shēng jī zài hǎi miàn shàng sōu xún shī zōng de yú chuán","Helicopters searched the sea for the missing fishing boat.","Los helicópteros buscaban en el mar el barco pesquero desaparecido.","Des hélicoptères recherchaient en mer le bateau de pêche disparu."],["L7-3936","艘","sōu","M","classifier for ships","clasificador de barcos","classificateur de navires","港口里停着几艘大货轮，正在装货。","gǎng kǒu lǐ tíng zhe jǐ sōu dà huò lún zhèng zài zhuāng huò","Several large cargo ships are docked in the port, being loaded.","En el puerto hay varios grandes buques de carga que están siendo cargados.","Plusieurs gros cargos sont amarrés au port et sont en cours de chargement."],["L7-3937","苏醒","sūxǐng","V","to regain consciousness; to awaken","recobrar el conocimiento; despertar","reprendre connaissance; se réveiller","昏迷了三天以后，他终于苏醒过来了。","hūn mí le sān tiān yǐ hòu tā zhōng yú sū xǐng guò lái le","After three days in a coma, he finally regained consciousness.","Tras tres días en coma, por fin recobró el conocimiento.","Après trois jours de coma, il a enfin repris connaissance."],["L7-3938","酥","sū","Adj","crispy; flaky; limp","crujiente; quebradizo; flojo","croustillant; friable; mou","刚出炉的烧饼又香又酥，咬一口直掉渣。","gāng chū lú de shāo bing yòu xiāng yòu sū yǎo yì kǒu zhí diào zhā","Fresh from the oven, the flatbread is fragrant and flaky, shedding crumbs with every bite.","El shaobing recién salido del horno es aromático y crujiente, y suelta migas a cada mordida.","Le shaobing tout juste sorti du four est parfumé et croustillant, et laisse tomber des miettes à chaque bouchée."],["L7-3939","俗","sú","Adj","vulgar; popular; custom","vulgar; popular; costumbre","vulgaire; populaire; coutume","这件衣服颜色太艳了，看起来有点俗。","zhè jiàn yī fu yán sè tài yàn le kàn qǐ lái yǒu diǎn sú","This garment's colors are too loud; it looks a bit tacky.","El color de esta prenda es demasiado chillón y se ve algo de mal gusto.","Les couleurs de ce vêtement sont trop voyantes, ça fait un peu vulgaire."],["L7-3940","俗话","súhuà","N","common saying","dicho popular","dicton","他说话喜欢引用俗话，听起来又生动又有道理。","tā shuō huà xǐ huan yǐn yòng sú huà tīng qǐ lái yòu shēng dòng yòu yǒu dào lǐ","He likes to quote common sayings when he speaks, making his words lively and full of good sense.","Le gusta citar refranes al hablar, y suena tan vivo como sensato.","Il aime citer des dictons en parlant, ce qui rend ses propos à la fois vivants et pleins de bon sens."],["L7-3941","俗话说","súhuà shuō","","as the saying goes","como dice el refrán","comme dit le proverbe","俗话说，是金子总会发光的。","sú huà shuō shì jīn zi zǒng huì fā guāng de","As the saying goes, true gold will always shine.","Como dice el refrán, el oro siempre acaba brillando.","Comme dit le proverbe, l'or finit toujours par briller."],["L7-3942","俗语","súyǔ","N","proverb; colloquial speech","refrán; habla coloquial","proverbe; langage familier","这些俗语反映了老百姓的生活经验。","zhè xiē sú yǔ fǎn yìng le lǎo bǎi xìng de shēng huó jīng yàn","These proverbs reflect the life experience of ordinary people.","Estos refranes reflejan la experiencia de vida de la gente común.","Ces proverbes reflètent l'expérience de vie des gens ordinaires."],["L7-3943","诉苦","sùkǔ","","to complain; to grumble","quejarse; lamentarse","se plaindre; se lamenter","他一见到我就开始诉苦，说工作太累了。","tā yí jiàn dào wǒ jiù kāi shǐ sù kǔ shuō gōng zuò tài lèi le","As soon as he saw me, he started complaining that work was too tiring.","En cuanto me vio, empezó a quejarse de que el trabajo era demasiado agotador.","Dès qu'il m'a vu, il s'est mis à se plaindre que le travail était trop fatigant."],["L7-3944","诉说","sùshuō","V","to recount; to tell","relatar; contar","raconter; exposer","她独自抚养孩子多年，却很少向别人诉说生活的艰辛。","tā dú zì fǔ yǎng hái zi duō nián què hěn shǎo xiàng bié rén sù shuō shēng huó de jiān xīn","She raised her child alone for years, but seldom spoke to others about life's hardships.","Crió sola a su hijo durante muchos años, pero rara vez le contó a nadie las dificultades de la vida.","Elle a élevé seule son enfant pendant des années, mais elle parlait rarement à autrui des difficultés de sa vie."],["L7-3945","诉讼","sùsòng","V","lawsuit","litigio; pleito","procès; litige","这家公司因为侵犯专利被提起了诉讼。","zhè jiā gōng sī yīn wèi qīn fàn zhuān lì bèi tí qǐ le sù sòng","A lawsuit was brought against this company for patent infringement.","A esta empresa se le entabló una demanda por violar una patente.","Une action en justice a été intentée contre cette entreprise pour contrefaçon de brevet."],["L7-3946","素","sù","Adj/N","plain; white; vegetarian","sencillo; blanco; vegetariano","simple; blanc; végétarien","她平时穿得很素，很少穿颜色鲜艳的衣服。","tā píng shí chuān de hěn sù hěn shǎo chuān yán sè xiān yàn de yī fu","She usually dresses very plainly and rarely wears brightly colored clothes.","Normalmente se viste de forma sencilla y rara vez usa ropa de colores vivos.","Elle s'habille d'ordinaire très sobrement et porte rarement des vêtements aux couleurs vives."],["L7-3947","素不相识","sùbùxiāngshí","","to be total strangers","ser perfectos desconocidos","être de parfaits inconnus","一位素不相识的路人把我送到了医院。","yí wèi sù bù xiāng shí de lù rén bǎ wǒ sòng dào le yī yuàn","A passer-by I had never met took me to the hospital.","Un transeúnte al que no conocía de nada me llevó al hospital.","Un passant que je ne connaissais pas du tout m'a emmené à l'hôpital."],["L7-3948","素材","sùcái","N","source material","material de base","matériau de base","作家常常从日常生活中寻找写作的素材。","zuò jiā cháng cháng cóng rì cháng shēng huó zhōng xún zhǎo xiě zuò de sù cái","Writers often look for material for their writing in everyday life.","Los escritores suelen buscar material para escribir en la vida cotidiana.","Les écrivains cherchent souvent leur matière dans la vie quotidienne."],["L7-3949","素描","sùmiáo","N","sketch","boceto; dibujo","croquis; esquisse","学画画通常要从素描开始练起。","xué huà huà tōng cháng yào cóng sù miáo kāi shǐ liàn qǐ","Learning to paint usually starts with practicing sketching.","Aprender a pintar suele empezar practicando el dibujo a lápiz.","Apprendre à peindre commence généralement par des exercices de dessin."],["L7-3950","素食","sùshí","N","vegetarian food","comida vegetariana","alimentation végétarienne","她已经吃了五年素食，身体反而更好了。","tā yǐ jīng chī le wǔ nián sù shí shēn tǐ fǎn ér gèng hǎo le","She has been eating a vegetarian diet for five years, and her health is even better.","Lleva cinco años siendo vegetariana y su salud incluso ha mejorado.","Elle est végétarienne depuis cinq ans et sa santé s'en porte même mieux."],["L7-3951","素养","sùyǎng","N","accomplishment; cultivation","formación; cultura personal","culture; acquis personnel","教师不仅要有专业知识，还要有良好的文化素养。","jiào shī bù jǐn yào yǒu zhuān yè zhī shi hái yào yǒu liáng hǎo de wén huà sù yǎng","Teachers need not only professional knowledge but also a good level of cultural refinement.","Los docentes no solo necesitan conocimientos profesionales, sino también una buena formación cultural.","Les enseignants doivent avoir non seulement des connaissances professionnelles, mais aussi une bonne culture générale."],["L7-3952","塑造","sùzào","V","to shape; to portray","moldear; modelar; crear","façonner; modeler; créer","这部小说成功地塑造了一个善良勇敢的女性形象。","zhè bù xiǎo shuō chéng gōng de sù zào le yí ge shàn liáng yǒng gǎn de nǚ xìng xíng xiàng","This novel successfully creates the image of a kind and brave woman.","Esta novela logra crear con éxito la imagen de una mujer bondadosa y valiente.","Ce roman parvient à dépeindre avec succès un personnage féminin bon et courageux."],["L7-3953","蒜","suàn","N","garlic","ajo","ail","炒青菜的时候放一点蒜，味道会更香。","chǎo qīng cài de shí hou fàng yì diǎn suàn wèi dào huì gèng xiāng","Add a little garlic when stir-frying greens, and they'll taste even better.","Al saltear verduras, agrega un poco de ajo y tendrán más sabor.","Quand on fait sauter des légumes verts, ajouter un peu d'ail les rend encore plus savoureux."],["L7-3954","算计","suànjì","V","to calculate; to scheme","calcular; tramar","calculer; manigancer","他总是算计着怎么少花钱多办事。","tā zǒng shì suàn jì zhe zěn me shǎo huā qián duō bàn shì","He's always calculating how to get more done while spending less.","Siempre está calculando cómo gastar menos dinero y lograr más.","Il calcule toujours comment dépenser moins et faire plus."],["L7-3955","算盘","suànpán","N","abacus; scheme","ábaco; plan","boulier; calcul (intéressé)","爷爷年轻时是会计，算盘打得又快又准。","yé ye nián qīng shí shì kuài jì suàn pán dǎ de yòu kuài yòu zhǔn","Grandpa was an accountant when he was young and could use an abacus quickly and accurately.","De joven, mi abuelo era contador y manejaba el ábaco con rapidez y precisión.","Dans sa jeunesse, grand-père était comptable et maniait le boulier avec rapidité et précision."],["L7-3956","算账","suànzhàng","","to settle accounts; to do the books","ajustar cuentas; hacer la contabilidad","faire les comptes; régler ses comptes","月底了，店主正忙着算账。","yuè dǐ le diàn zhǔ zhèng máng zhe suàn zhàng","It's the end of the month, and the shop owner is busy doing the accounts.","Es fin de mes y el dueño de la tienda está ocupado haciendo las cuentas.","C'est la fin du mois et le commerçant est occupé à faire ses comptes."],["L7-3957","虽说","suīshuō","Conj","although; though","aunque; si bien","bien que; même si","虽说已经是春天了，早晚还是挺冷的。","suī shuō yǐ jīng shì chūn tiān le zǎo wǎn hái shi tǐng lěng de","Although it's already spring, mornings and evenings are still quite cold.","Aunque ya es primavera, por la mañana y por la noche todavía hace bastante frío.","Bien que ce soit déjà le printemps, il fait encore assez froid le matin et le soir."],["L7-3958","随处可见","suíchù kě jiàn","","visible everywhere","verse por todas partes","visible partout","在这座城市里，共享单车随处可见。","zài zhè zuò chéng shì lǐ gòng xiǎng dān chē suí chù kě jiàn","In this city, shared bikes can be seen everywhere.","En esta ciudad se ven bicicletas compartidas por todas partes.","Dans cette ville, on voit des vélos en libre-service partout."],["L7-3959","随大溜","suí dàliù","","to follow the crowd","seguir a la multitud","suivre le mouvement","选专业要考虑自己的兴趣，不能随大溜。","xuǎn zhuān yè yào kǎo lǜ zì jǐ de xìng qù bù néng suí dà liù","When choosing a major, you should consider your own interests rather than follow the crowd.","Al elegir carrera hay que tener en cuenta tus intereses y no dejarte llevar por la corriente.","Pour choisir sa filière, il faut tenir compte de ses propres goûts et ne pas suivre le troupeau."],["L7-3960","随机","suíjī","Adj","random; at random","aleatorio; al azar","aléatoire; au hasard","调查人员在街上随机采访了一百名市民。","diào chá rén yuán zài jiē shang suí jī cǎi fǎng le yì bǎi míng shì mín","The researchers randomly interviewed one hundred citizens on the street.","Los investigadores entrevistaron al azar a cien ciudadanos en la calle.","Les enquêteurs ont interrogé au hasard cent habitants dans la rue."],["L7-3961","随即","suíjí","Adv","immediately; right after","enseguida; acto seguido","aussitôt; peu après","他接到电话，随即开车赶往医院。","tā jiē dào diàn huà suí jí kāi chē gǎn wǎng yī yuàn","He got the call and immediately drove to the hospital.","Recibió la llamada e inmediatamente se fue en coche al hospital.","Il a reçu l'appel et s'est aussitôt rendu à l'hôpital en voiture."],["L7-3962","随身","suíshēn","Adj","to carry with one; personal","llevar consigo; personal","sur soi; personnel","出国旅行时，护照一定要随身携带。","chū guó lǚ xíng shí hù zhào yí dìng yào suí shēn xié dài","When traveling abroad, always keep your passport on you.","Al viajar al extranjero, siempre hay que llevar el pasaporte consigo.","Lorsque l'on voyage à l'étranger, il faut toujours garder son passeport sur soi."],["L7-3963","随时随地","suíshí-suídì","","anytime, anywhere","en cualquier momento y lugar","à tout moment et partout","有了手机，人们可以随时随地上网。","yǒu le shǒu jī rén men kě yǐ suí shí suí dì shàng wǎng","With mobile phones, people can go online anytime and anywhere.","Con el celular, la gente puede conectarse a internet en cualquier momento y lugar.","Avec un téléphone portable, on peut se connecter à Internet à tout moment et en tout lieu."],["L7-3964","随心所欲","suíxīnsuǒyù","","to do as one pleases","hacer lo que uno quiera","agir à sa guise","有了钱也不能随心所欲，还是要遵守规矩。","yǒu le qián yě bù néng suí xīn suǒ yù hái shi yào zūn shǒu guī ju","Even with money you can't do whatever you please; you still have to follow the rules.","Aunque se tenga dinero, no se puede hacer lo que a uno le dé la gana; hay que respetar las reglas.","Même avec de l'argent, on ne peut pas faire tout ce qu'on veut ; il faut respecter les règles."],["L7-3965","遂心","suìxīn","","to one's liking","a gusto de uno","à son gré","孩子考上了理想的大学，老两口总算遂心了。","hái zi kǎo shàng le lǐ xiǎng de dà xué lǎo liǎng kǒu zǒng suàn suì xīn le","Their child got into the university they had hoped for, and the elderly couple finally had their wish fulfilled.","Como su hijo entró a la universidad que quería, la pareja de ancianos por fin vio cumplido su deseo.","Leur enfant ayant été admis à l'université de ses rêves, le vieux couple a enfin vu son souhait exaucé."],["L7-3966","隧道","suìdào","N","tunnel","túnel","tunnel","修建这条穿山隧道是一项非常艰巨的任务。","xiū jiàn zhè tiáo chuān shān suì dào shì yí xiàng fēi cháng jiān jù de rèn wu","Building this tunnel through the mountain is an extremely arduous task.","Construir este túnel a través de la montaña es una tarea extremadamente ardua.","Construire ce tunnel à travers la montagne est une tâche extrêmement ardue."],["L7-3967","损","sǔn","V","to lose; to damage; to harm","perder; dañar; perjudicar","perdre; endommager; nuire","你说话别那么损，大家都是朋友。","nǐ shuō huà bié nà me sǔn dà jiā dōu shì péng you","Don't be so nasty when you talk; we're all friends here.","No hables con tanta malicia; todos somos amigos.","Ne parle pas avec autant de méchanceté, nous sommes tous amis."],["L7-3968","损坏","sǔnhuài","V","to damage","dañar; deteriorar","endommager; détériorer","快递公司把我的花瓶损坏了，答应全额赔偿。","kuài dì gōng sī bǎ wǒ de huā píng sǔn huài le dā ying quán é péi cháng","The courier company damaged my vase and agreed to compensate in full.","La empresa de mensajería rompió mi florero y accedió a indemnizarme por completo.","L'entreprise de messagerie a cassé mon vase et a accepté de me rembourser intégralement."],["L7-3969","损人利己","sǔnrén-lìjǐ","","to harm others for self-gain","perjudicar a otros por beneficio propio","nuire à autrui pour son profit","损人利己的事，我们绝对不能做。","sǔn rén lì jǐ de shì wǒ men jué duì bù néng zuò","We must never do anything that harms others to benefit ourselves.","Nunca debemos hacer algo que perjudique a otros para beneficiarnos nosotros.","Nous ne devons jamais faire quelque chose qui nuit aux autres pour en tirer profit."],["L7-3970","损伤","sǔnshāng","V","to injure; to damage","dañar; lesionar","blesser; endommager","长时间戴耳机听音乐，可能会损伤听力。","cháng shí jiān dài ěr jī tīng yīn yuè kě néng huì sǔn shāng tīng lì","Listening to music through headphones for long periods may damage your hearing.","Usar auriculares durante mucho tiempo para escuchar música puede dañar la audición.","Écouter de la musique avec un casque pendant de longues périodes peut endommager l'audition."],["L7-3971","缩","suō","V","to shrink; to contract; to withdraw","encoger; contraer; retirar","rétrécir; se contracter; se retirer","他在门口犹豫不决，几次伸手又缩了回来，最终才鼓起勇气敲门。","tā zài mén kǒu yóu yù bù jué jǐ cì shēn shǒu yòu suō le huí lái zuì zhōng cái gǔ qǐ yǒng qì qiāo mén","He hesitated at the doorway, reaching out and drawing back several times before finally summoning the courage to knock.","Dudó en la puerta, extendió la mano y la retiró varias veces, hasta que por fin reunió el valor para tocar.","Il a hésité devant la porte, tendant la main puis la retirant à plusieurs reprises, avant de trouver enfin le courage de frapper."],["L7-3972","缩水","suōshuǐ","","to shrink; to shrivel","encogerse; reducirse","rétrécir; diminuer","这件毛衣洗了一次就缩水了，小了一大圈。","zhè jiàn máo yī xǐ le yí cì jiù suō shuǐ le xiǎo le yí dà quān","This sweater shrank after one wash and is much smaller now.","Este suéter encogió en el primer lavado y quedó una talla mucho más pequeño.","Ce pull a rétréci dès le premier lavage et a perdu une bonne taille."],["L7-3973","缩影","suōyǐng","N","epitome; microcosm","microcosmos; epítome","microcosme; reflet fidèle","这个小村庄的变化是整个国家发展的缩影。","zhè ge xiǎo cūn zhuāng de biàn huà shì zhěng gè guó jiā fā zhǎn de suō yǐng","The changes in this small village are a microcosm of the whole country's development.","Los cambios de este pequeño pueblo son un reflejo del desarrollo de todo el país.","Les changements de ce petit village sont un microcosme du développement du pays tout entier."],["L7-3974","所属","suǒshǔ","Adj","affiliated; subordinate","afiliado; subordinado","rattaché; subordonné","这些设备都归所属部门管理。","zhè xiē shè bèi dōu guī suǒ shǔ bù mén guǎn lǐ","All this equipment is managed by the department it belongs to.","Todo este equipo está a cargo del departamento al que pertenece.","Tous ces équipements sont gérés par le service dont ils dépendent."],["L7-3975","所谓","suǒwèi","Adj","so-called","llamado; supuesto","soi-disant; dit","所谓幸福，就是和家人平平安安地在一起。","suǒ wèi xìng fú jiù shì hé jiā rén píng píng ān ān de zài yì qǐ","What is called happiness is simply being safe and sound with your family.","Eso que llaman felicidad es simplemente estar sano y salvo junto a la familia.","Ce qu'on appelle le bonheur, c'est simplement être auprès de sa famille, sains et saufs."],["L7-3976","所作所为","suǒzuò-suǒwéi","","one's conduct","los actos de uno; conducta","sa conduite; ses actes","他的所作所为让父母非常失望。","tā de suǒ zuò suǒ wéi ràng fù mǔ fēi cháng shī wàng","His conduct deeply disappointed his parents.","Su comportamiento decepcionó profundamente a sus padres.","Sa conduite a profondément déçu ses parents."],["L7-3977","索赔","suǒpéi","V","to claim compensation","reclamar una indemnización","réclamer des dommages-intérêts","航班延误了八个小时，乘客们纷纷向航空公司索赔。","háng bān yán wù le bā gè xiǎo shí chéng kè men fēn fēn xiàng háng kōng gōng sī suǒ péi","The flight was delayed eight hours, and passengers demanded compensation from the airline one after another.","El vuelo se retrasó ocho horas y los pasajeros reclamaron una indemnización a la aerolínea uno tras otro.","Le vol a eu huit heures de retard et les passagers ont tour à tour réclamé une indemnisation à la compagnie aérienne."],["L7-3978","索取","suǒqǔ","V","to demand; to ask for","exigir; pedir","exiger; demander","办理会员卡时，店员会向顾客索取姓名和电话号码。","bàn lǐ huì yuán kǎ shí diàn yuán huì xiàng gù kè suǒ qǔ xìng míng hé diàn huà hào mǎ","When issuing membership cards, the clerk asks customers for their names and phone numbers.","Al tramitar la tarjeta de membresía, el empleado les pide a los clientes su nombre y número de teléfono.","Lors de l'établissement d'une carte de membre, l'employé demande aux clients leur nom et leur numéro de téléphone."],["L7-3979","索性","suǒxìng","Adv","simply; might as well","más vale; sin más","autant; tout simplement","既然已经迟到这么久了，他索性不去了。","jì rán yǐ jīng chí dào zhè me jiǔ le tā suǒ xìng bú qù le","Since he was already so late, he simply decided not to go.","Como ya se había retrasado tanto, decidió mejor no ir.","Comme il était déjà tellement en retard, il a décidé de ne pas y aller du tout."],["L7-3980","锁定","suǒdìng","V","to lock; to lock onto","bloquear; fijar; cerrar con llave","verrouiller; cibler","警方已经锁定了嫌疑人的位置，准备实施抓捕。","jǐng fāng yǐ jīng suǒ dìng le xián yí rén de wèi zhì zhǔn bèi shí shī zhuā bǔ","The police have pinpointed the suspect's location and are preparing to make an arrest.","La policía ya localizó la ubicación del sospechoso y se prepara para detenerlo.","La police a déjà localisé le suspect et se prépare à procéder à son arrestation."],["L7-3981","他人","tārén","Pron","other people","otros; los demás","autrui; les autres","两名男子因当街殴打他人被警方拘留。","liǎng míng nán zǐ yīn dāng jiē ōu dǎ tā rén bèi jǐng fāng jū liú","Two men were detained by police for beating someone up in the street.","Dos hombres fueron detenidos por la policía por golpear a otra persona en plena calle.","Deux hommes ont été placés en garde à vue par la police pour avoir frappé quelqu'un en pleine rue."],["L7-3982","塌","tā","V","to collapse; to droop","derrumbarse; hundirse","s'effondrer; s'affaisser","连下了几天大雨，村口的老房子塌了一半。","lián xià le jǐ tiān dà yǔ cūn kǒu de lǎo fáng zi tā le yí bàn","After several days of heavy rain, half of the old house at the village entrance collapsed.","Tras varios días de lluvia intensa, la mitad de la casa vieja a la entrada del pueblo se derrumbó.","Après plusieurs jours de pluie battante, la moitié de la vieille maison à l'entrée du village s'est effondrée."],["L7-3983","踏上","tàshang","","to set foot on","pisar; poner pie en","poser le pied sur; s'engager sur","大学毕业后，他踏上了去西部支教的旅程。","dà xué bì yè hòu tā tà shàng le qù xī bù zhī jiào de lǚ chéng","After graduating from university, he set out on a journey to teach in the west.","Al graduarse de la universidad, emprendió el viaje para ir a enseñar al oeste del país.","Après l'université, il s'est lancé dans le voyage qui le menait enseigner dans l'ouest du pays."],["L7-3984","胎","tāi","N/M","fetus; litter; padding","feto; camada; relleno","fœtus; portée; rembourrage","这只母狗头一胎就生了五只小狗。","zhè zhī mǔ gǒu tóu yì tāi jiù shēng le wǔ zhī xiǎo gǒu","This dog gave birth to five puppies in her very first litter.","Esta perra tuvo cinco cachorros en su primera camada.","Cette chienne a mis bas cinq chiots dès sa première portée."],["L7-3985","胎儿","tāi'ér","N","fetus; unborn child","feto","fœtus","医生说胎儿发育得很好，让她放心。","yī shēng shuō tāi ér fā yù de hěn hǎo ràng tā fàng xīn","The doctor said the fetus was developing well and told her not to worry.","El médico dijo que el feto se está desarrollando muy bien y le pidió que se quedara tranquila.","Le médecin a dit que le fœtus se développait très bien et lui a demandé de ne pas s'inquiéter."],["L7-3986","台球","táiqiú","N","billiards","billar","billard","下班以后，他常和朋友去打台球。","xià bān yǐ hòu tā cháng hé péng you qù dǎ tái qiú","After work, he often goes to play billiards with his friends.","Después del trabajo, suele ir a jugar billar con sus amigos.","Après le travail, il va souvent jouer au billard avec ses amis."],["L7-3987","太极","tàijí","N","Taiji; Supreme Ultimate","taiji; el Gran Extremo","taiji; le Faîte suprême","公园里，一群老人正跟着音乐打太极。","gōng yuán lǐ yì qún lǎo rén zhèng gēn zhe yīn yuè dǎ tài jí","In the park, a group of elderly people are doing tai chi to music.","En el parque, un grupo de ancianos hace taichí al ritmo de la música.","Dans le parc, un groupe de personnes âgées pratique le tai-chi en musique."],["L7-3988","太极拳","tàijíquán","N","tai chi","tai chi","tai-chi","太极拳动作缓慢柔和，很适合老年人练习。","tài jí quán dòng zuò huǎn màn róu hé hěn shì hé lǎo nián rén liàn xí","Tai chi's movements are slow and gentle, making it ideal for older people.","Los movimientos del taichí son lentos y suaves, ideales para que los practiquen las personas mayores.","Les mouvements du tai-chi sont lents et doux, et conviennent très bien aux personnes âgées."],["L7-3989","太平","tàipíng","Adj","peaceful; place name","pacífico; topónimo","paisible; toponyme","老百姓最大的心愿就是天下太平。","lǎo bǎi xìng zuì dà de xīn yuàn jiù shì tiān xià tài píng","The ordinary people's greatest wish is peace throughout the land.","El mayor deseo de la gente común es que reine la paz en el mundo.","Le plus grand souhait du peuple est que la paix règne partout."],["L7-3990","泰斗","tàidǒu","N","leading authority","eminencia; autoridad máxima","sommité; autorité éminente","他是我国语言学界的泰斗，培养了很多学者。","tā shì wǒ guó yǔ yán xué jiè de tài dǒu péi yǎng le hěn duō xué zhě","He is a leading authority in our country's linguistics and has trained many scholars.","Es una eminencia de la lingüística de nuestro país y ha formado a muchos académicos.","C'est une sommité de la linguistique dans notre pays, et il a formé de nombreux chercheurs."],["L7-3991","贪","tān","V","greedy; to covet; corrupt","codiciar; ávido; corrupto","convoiter; avide; corrompu","做人不能太贪，否则会吃大亏。","zuò rén bù néng tài tān fǒu zé huì chī dà kuī","One shouldn't be too greedy, or one will suffer for it.","No se puede ser demasiado ambicioso, o uno acaba pagándolo caro.","On ne doit pas être trop cupide, sinon on en paie lourdement les conséquences."],["L7-3992","贪婪","tānlán","Adj","greedy; insatiable","codicioso; insaciable","cupide; insatiable","这个故事讽刺了商人贪婪的本性。","zhè ge gù shi fěng cì le shāng rén tān lán de běn xìng","This story satirizes the merchant's greedy nature.","Este cuento satiriza la codicia innata de los comerciantes.","Cette histoire tourne en dérision la cupidité naturelle des marchands."],["L7-3993","贪玩儿","tānwánr","V","to love playing too much","ser muy jugueton","ne penser qu'à jouer","这孩子太贪玩儿了，作业总是拖到最后才写。","zhè hái zi tài tān wánr le zuò yè zǒng shì tuō dào zuì hòu cái xiě","This child is too fond of play and always leaves his homework to the last minute.","Este niño es demasiado juguetón y siempre deja la tarea para el último momento.","Cet enfant ne pense qu'à jouer et remet toujours ses devoirs à la dernière minute."],["L7-3994","贪污","tānwū","V","to embezzle; corruption","malversar; corrupción","détourner des fonds; corruption","这位官员因为贪污公款被撤职了。","zhè wèi guān yuán yīn wèi tān wū gōng kuǎn bèi chè zhí le","The official was dismissed for embezzling public funds.","Ese funcionario fue destituido por malversar fondos públicos.","Ce fonctionnaire a été révoqué pour avoir détourné des fonds publics."],["L7-3995","摊","tān","V/N/M","to spread out; stall","extender; puesto (de venta)","étaler; étal","他把地图摊在桌子上，仔细研究路线。","tā bǎ dì tú tān zài zhuō zi shàng zǐ xì yán jiū lù xiàn","He spread the map out on the table and carefully studied the route.","Extendió el mapa sobre la mesa y estudió con atención la ruta.","Il a étalé la carte sur la table et étudié attentivement l'itinéraire."],["L7-3996","瘫","tān","V","paralyzed","paralizado","paralysé","跑完马拉松，他一下子瘫在了地上。","pǎo wán mǎ lā sōng tā yí xià zi tān zài le dì shang","After finishing the marathon, he collapsed onto the ground.","Al terminar el maratón, se desplomó de golpe en el suelo.","Après avoir fini le marathon, il s'est effondré par terre d'un coup."],["L7-3997","瘫痪","tānhuàn","V","paralysis; to be paralyzed","parálisis; paralizar","paralysie; paralyser","大雪导致城市交通一度瘫痪。","dà xuě dǎo zhì chéng shì jiāo tōng yí dù tān huàn","The heavy snow paralyzed the city's traffic for a time.","La fuerte nevada paralizó el tráfico de la ciudad por un tiempo.","Les fortes chutes de neige ont un temps paralysé la circulation dans la ville."],["L7-3998","坛","tán","N","platform; altar","tribuna; altar","tribune; autel","地窖里放着几坛自家酿的米酒。","dì jiào lǐ fàng zhe jǐ tán zì jiā niàng de mǐ jiǔ","There are several jars of home-brewed rice wine in the cellar.","En el sótano hay varias tinajas de vino de arroz hecho en casa.","Dans la cave se trouvent plusieurs jarres de vin de riz fait maison."],["L7-3999","谈不上","tán bu shàng","","out of the question","ni hablar; fuera de lugar","hors de question","我只是会弹几首简单的曲子，谈不上精通钢琴。","wǒ zhǐ shì huì tán jǐ shǒu jiǎn dān de qǔ zi tán bu shàng jīng tōng gāng qín","I can only play a few simple pieces; I can hardly claim to have mastered the piano.","Solo sé tocar unas cuantas piezas sencillas; no puedo decir que domine el piano.","Je ne sais jouer que quelques morceaux simples, je ne peux pas dire que je maîtrise le piano."],["L7-4000","谈到","tándào","","to mention; to talk about","mencionar; hablar de","évoquer; parler de","谈到自己的家乡，老人的眼里闪着光。","tán dào zì jǐ de jiā xiāng lǎo rén de yǎn lǐ shǎn zhe guāng","When he spoke of his hometown, the old man's eyes lit up.","Al hablar de su tierra natal, a los ojos del anciano les brillaba una luz.","Lorsqu'il parlait de son pays natal, les yeux du vieil homme brillaient."],["L7-4001","谈论","tánlùn","V","to discuss","hablar de; comentar","discuter de; commenter","大家都在谈论昨晚的那场足球比赛。","dà jiā dōu zài tán lùn zuó wǎn de nà chǎng zú qiú bǐ sài","Everyone is talking about last night's soccer match.","Todos están hablando del partido de fútbol de anoche.","Tout le monde parle du match de football d'hier soir."],["L7-4002","谈起","tánqǐ","","to mention; to bring up","mencionar; sacar a colación","évoquer; aborder","他很少谈起自己年轻时的经历。","tā hěn shǎo tán qǐ zì jǐ nián qīng shí de jīng lì","He rarely mentions what he went through when he was young.","Rara vez habla de lo que vivió en su juventud.","Il parle rarement de ce qu'il a vécu dans sa jeunesse."],["L7-4003","弹性","tánxìng","N","flexibility; elasticity","flexibilidad; elasticidad","flexibilité; élasticité","这种面料很有弹性，穿起来很舒服。","zhè zhǒng miàn liào hěn yǒu tán xìng chuān qǐ lái hěn shū fu","This fabric is very stretchy and comfortable to wear.","Esta tela es muy elástica y resulta muy cómoda de usar.","Ce tissu est très élastique et agréable à porter."],["L7-4004","痰","tán","N","phlegm","flema","glaire; crachat","他感冒咳嗽，嗓子里总是有痰。","tā gǎn mào ké sou sǎng zi lǐ zǒng shì yǒu tán","He has a cold and a cough, and there's always phlegm in his throat.","Está resfriado y con tos, y siempre tiene flema en la garganta.","Il est enrhumé, il tousse et a toujours des glaires dans la gorge."],["L7-4005","坦白","tǎnbái","Adj/V","honest; to confess","franco; confesar","franc; avouer","她很坦白，直接告诉我她还没有完成那份报告。","tā hěn tǎn bái zhí jiē gào su wǒ tā hái méi yǒu wán chéng nà fèn bào gào","She was forthcoming and told me directly that she had not yet finished the report.","Fue muy franca y me dijo directamente que aún no había terminado el informe.","Elle a été très franche et m'a dit directement qu'elle n'avait pas encore terminé ce rapport."],["L7-4006","坦诚","tǎnchéng","Adj","candid; frank","sincero; franco","sincère; franc","两人因误会产生了隔阂，直到一次坦诚的交谈才重新建立信任。","liǎng rén yīn wù huì chǎn shēng le gé hé zhí dào yí cì tǎn chéng de jiāo tán cái chóng xīn jiàn lì xìn rèn","A misunderstanding drove a wedge between them, and only a frank conversation restored their trust.","Un malentendido creó distancia entre los dos, y solo una conversación sincera restableció la confianza.","Un malentendu avait creusé un fossé entre eux, et il a fallu une conversation franche pour rétablir la confiance."],["L7-4007","坦克","tǎnkè","N","tank (military)","tanque","char d'assaut","博物馆的广场上陈列着一辆退役的坦克。","bó wù guǎn de guǎng chǎng shàng chén liè zhe yí liàng tuì yì de tǎn kè","A decommissioned tank is on display in the museum square.","En la plaza del museo hay un tanque retirado del servicio en exhibición.","Sur la place du musée est exposé un char d'assaut désaffecté."],["L7-4008","坦然","tǎnrán","Adj","calm; composed","sereno; tranquilo","serein; calme","面对别人的批评，他显得很坦然。","miàn duì bié rén de pī píng tā xiǎn de hěn tǎn rán","Faced with others' criticism, he appeared perfectly calm.","Ante las críticas de los demás, se mostró muy sereno.","Face aux critiques des autres, il est resté parfaitement serein."],["L7-4009","坦率","tǎnshuài","Adj","frank; blunt","franco; directo","franc; direct","她说话很坦率，有什么意见都当面说出来。","tā shuō huà hěn tǎn shuài yǒu shén me yì jiàn dōu dāng miàn shuō chū lái","She speaks very frankly and voices any opinion to your face.","Habla con mucha franqueza y dice cara a cara cualquier opinión que tenga.","Elle parle très franchement et dit en face toutes ses opinions."],["L7-4010","毯子","tǎnzi","N","blanket","manta","couverture","晚上有点凉，给孩子盖上一条毯子吧。","wǎn shang yǒu diǎn liáng gěi hái zi gài shàng yì tiáo tǎn zi ba","It's a bit chilly tonight, so cover the child with a blanket.","Esta noche hace un poco de fresco; tapa al niño con una manta.","Il fait un peu frais ce soir, couvre l'enfant avec une couverture."],["L7-4011","炭","tàn","N","charcoal; coal","carbón vegetal; carbón","charbon de bois; charbon","炉子里的炭快烧完了，再加几块吧。","lú zi lǐ de tàn kuài shāo wán le zài jiā jǐ kuài ba","The charcoal in the stove is almost burned out; add a few more pieces.","El carbón de la estufa está por acabarse; agrega unos trozos más.","Le charbon du poêle est presque entièrement consumé, remets-en quelques morceaux."],["L7-4012","探","tàn","V","to explore; to visit; to stretch forward","explorar; visitar; asomarse","explorer; rendre visite; se pencher","这条山路我们都没走过，先派两个人去探一探吧。","zhè tiáo shān lù wǒ men dōu méi zǒu guò xiān pài liǎng gè rén qù tàn yi tàn ba","None of us has taken this mountain path before, so let's send two people to scout it first.","Ninguno de nosotros ha recorrido este camino de montaña; mejor mandemos primero a dos personas a explorarlo.","Aucun de nous n'a jamais emprunté ce sentier de montagne, envoyons d'abord deux personnes le reconnaître."],["L7-4013","探测","tàncè","V","to probe; to survey","sondear; detectar","sonder; détecter","科学家利用卫星探测海洋的温度变化。","kē xué jiā lì yòng wèi xīng tàn cè hǎi yáng de wēn dù biàn huà","Scientists use satellites to detect changes in ocean temperature.","Los científicos usan satélites para detectar los cambios de temperatura del océano.","Les scientifiques utilisent des satellites pour détecter les variations de température des océans."],["L7-4014","探亲","tànqīn","","to visit one's family","visitar a la familia","rendre visite à sa famille","每年春节，他都要回老家探亲。","měi nián chūn jié tā dōu yào huí lǎo jiā tàn qīn","Every Spring Festival he goes back to his hometown to visit his family.","Cada Fiesta de la Primavera, vuelve a su pueblo natal para visitar a su familia.","Chaque année pour la fête du Printemps, il retourne dans son village natal rendre visite à sa famille."],["L7-4015","探求","tànqiú","V","to seek; to investigate","buscar; investigar","rechercher; enquêter","科学家们一直在探求生命起源的奥秘。","kē xué jiā men yì zhí zài tàn qiú shēng mìng qǐ yuán de ào mì","Scientists have long been seeking the secrets of the origin of life.","Los científicos llevan mucho tiempo buscando los secretos del origen de la vida.","Les scientifiques cherchent depuis longtemps à percer les mystères de l'origine de la vie."],["L7-4016","探望","tànwàng","V","to visit","visitar","rendre visite","周末，我们去医院探望了住院的老师。","zhōu mò wǒ men qù yī yuàn tàn wàng le zhù yuàn de lǎo shī","At the weekend, we went to the hospital to visit our teacher, who had been admitted.","El fin de semana fuimos al hospital a visitar a nuestra maestra, que estaba internada.","Le week-end, nous sommes allés à l'hôpital rendre visite à notre professeur hospitalisé."],["L7-4017","探险","tànxiǎn","","to explore; expedition","explorar; expedición","explorer; expédition","这支探险队在热带丛林里迷了路。","zhè zhī tàn xiǎn duì zài rè dài cóng lín lǐ mí le lù","The expedition team got lost in the tropical jungle.","Este equipo de exploración se perdió en la selva tropical.","Cette équipe d'exploration s'est perdue dans la jungle tropicale."],["L7-4018","碳","tàn","N","carbon","carbono","carbone","钻石和石墨看起来完全不同，但都是由碳组成的。","zuàn shí hé shí mò kàn qǐ lái wán quán bù tóng dàn dōu shì yóu tàn zǔ chéng de","Diamonds and graphite look completely different, but both are made of carbon.","El diamante y el grafito se ven completamente distintos, pero ambos están hechos de carbono.","Le diamant et le graphite ont l'air complètement différents, mais ils sont tous deux composés de carbone."],["L7-4019","汤圆","tāngyuán","N","sweet glutinous rice balls","bolas dulces de arroz glutinoso","boulettes de riz glutineux sucrées","元宵节晚上，一家人围坐在一起吃汤圆。","yuán xiāo jié wǎn shang yì jiā rén wéi zuò zài yì qǐ chī tāng yuán","On the night of the Lantern Festival, the family sits together eating sweet dumplings.","En la noche del Festival de los Faroles, la familia se sienta junta a comer tangyuan.","Le soir de la fête des Lanternes, la famille se réunit autour de la table pour manger des boulettes de riz glutineux."],["L7-4020","堂","táng","M","hall; classifier for classes","sala; clasificador de clases","salle; classificateur de cours","每年除夕，全家人都会欢聚一堂吃年夜饭。","měi nián chú xī quán jiā rén dōu huì huān jù yì táng chī nián yè fàn","Every New Year's Eve, the whole family gathers happily for the reunion dinner.","Cada Nochevieja, toda la familia se reúne alegremente para la cena de fin de año.","Chaque réveillon du Nouvel An, toute la famille se retrouve joyeusement pour le dîner de réveillon."],["L7-4021","糖果","tángguǒ","N","candy; sweets","caramelo; dulces","bonbon; confiserie","过年的时候，桌上摆满了瓜子和糖果。","guò nián de shí hou zhuō shàng bǎi mǎn le guā zǐ hé táng guǒ","At New Year, the table is covered with sunflower seeds and candy.","En Año Nuevo, la mesa se llena de semillas de girasol y dulces.","Pour le Nouvel An, la table est couverte de graines de tournesol et de bonbons."],["L7-4022","糖尿病","tángniàobìng","N","diabetes","diabetes","diabète","患糖尿病的人要严格控制饮食。","huàn táng niào bìng de rén yào yán gé kòng zhì yǐn shí","People with diabetes must strictly control their diet.","Las personas con diabetes deben controlar estrictamente su alimentación.","Les personnes atteintes de diabète doivent suivre un régime alimentaire strict."],["L7-4023","倘若","tǎngruò","Conj","if; in case","si; en caso de que","si; au cas où","倘若明天下雨，比赛就改在室内进行。","tǎng ruò míng tiān xià yǔ bǐ sài jiù gǎi zài shì nèi jìn xíng","If it rains tomorrow, the match will be moved indoors.","Si mañana llueve, el partido se jugará en un recinto cerrado.","S'il pleut demain, le match aura lieu en salle."],["L7-4024","淌","tǎng","V","to drip; to trickle","gotear; correr","goutter; ruisseler","他跑得满头大汗，汗水顺着脸往下淌。","tā pǎo de mǎn tóu dà hàn hàn shuǐ shùn zhe liǎn wǎng xià tǎng","He ran until he was drenched in sweat, which trickled down his face.","Corrió hasta quedar bañado en sudor, que le resbalaba por la cara.","Il a couru jusqu'à avoir le front ruisselant de sueur, qui lui coulait le long du visage."],["L7-4025","烫","tàng","V/Adj","to scald; to burn; to heat up","escaldar; quemar; calentar","ébouillanter; brûler; chauffer","汤太烫了，等凉一点再喝吧。","tāng tài tàng le děng liáng yì diǎn zài hē ba","The soup is too hot; wait until it cools a bit before drinking.","La sopa está demasiado caliente; espera a que se enfríe un poco para tomarla.","La soupe est trop chaude ; attends qu'elle refroidisse un peu avant de la boire."],["L7-4026","掏钱","tāo qián","","to pay; to fork out money","pagar; desembolsar","payer; débourser","这顿饭说好是我请客，怎么能让你掏钱呢？","zhè dùn fàn shuō hǎo shì wǒ qǐng kè zěn me néng ràng nǐ tāo qián ne","We agreed this meal was on me — how can I let you pay?","Quedamos en que esta comida la invitaba yo, ¿cómo voy a dejar que pagues tú?","Il était convenu que c'était moi qui invitais pour ce repas, comment pourrais-je te laisser payer ?"],["L7-4027","滔滔不绝","tāotāo-bùjué","","to talk non-stop","hablar sin parar","parler sans arrêt","一说起自己的旅行经历，他就滔滔不绝。","yì shuō qǐ zì jǐ de lǚ xíng jīng lì tā jiù tāo tāo bù jué","As soon as he starts talking about his travels, he goes on and on.","En cuanto empieza a hablar de sus viajes, no hay quien lo pare.","Dès qu'il se met à parler de ses voyages, il est intarissable."],["L7-4028","逃避","táobì","V","to escape; to evade","eludir; evadir","fuir; esquiver","有些人专门钻空子，逃避交税。","yǒu xiē rén zhuān mén zuān kòng zi táo bì jiāo shuì","Some people specialize in exploiting loopholes to avoid paying taxes.","Algunas personas se especializan en aprovechar las lagunas legales para evadir impuestos.","Certaines personnes se spécialisent dans l'exploitation des failles pour échapper à l'impôt."],["L7-4029","逃生","táoshēng","V","to flee for one's life","huir para salvar la vida","fuir pour sauver sa vie","消防演习教会了大家火灾时如何逃生。","xiāo fáng yǎn xí jiāo huì le dà jiā huǒ zāi shí rú hé táo shēng","The fire drill taught everyone how to escape in a fire.","El simulacro de incendio enseñó a todos cómo escapar en caso de incendio.","L'exercice d'évacuation incendie a appris à tout le monde comment s'échapper en cas de feu."],["L7-4030","逃亡","táowáng","V","to flee; fugitive","huir; fugitivo","fuir; fugitif","这个罪犯逃亡了十年，最后还是被抓住了。","zhè ge zuì fàn táo wáng le shí nián zuì hòu hái shi bèi zhuā zhù le","The criminal was on the run for ten years but was eventually caught.","Este criminal estuvo prófugo diez años, pero al final lo atraparon.","Ce criminel a été en cavale pendant dix ans, mais il a fini par être arrêté."],["L7-4031","陶瓷","táocí","N","ceramics; porcelain","cerámica; porcelana","céramique; porcelaine","这座小城生产的陶瓷远销世界各地。","zhè zuò xiǎo chéng shēng chǎn de táo cí yuǎn xiāo shì jiè gè dì","The ceramics produced in this small town are sold all over the world.","La cerámica que se produce en esta pequeña ciudad se exporta a todo el mundo.","La céramique produite dans cette petite ville est exportée dans le monde entier."],["L7-4032","陶冶","táoyě","V","to cultivate; to educate","formar; cultivar","former; cultiver","经常听音乐可以陶冶人的情操。","jīng cháng tīng yīn yuè kě yǐ táo yě rén de qíng cāo","Listening to music regularly can cultivate one's character.","Escuchar música con frecuencia ayuda a cultivar el carácter.","Écouter souvent de la musique permet de former le caractère."],["L7-4033","陶醉","táozuì","V","to be intoxicated; to revel in","embelesarse; deleitarse","s'enivrer; se délecter","美妙的音乐让在场的每一位观众都陶醉了。","měi miào de yīn yuè ràng zài chǎng de měi yí wèi guān zhòng dōu táo zuì le","The beautiful music enchanted every member of the audience.","La hermosa música cautivó a todos los espectadores presentes.","La musique magnifique a enchanté tous les spectateurs présents."],["L7-4034","淘","táo","V","to wash; to eliminate","lavar; eliminar","laver; éliminer","煮饭前，奶奶总要把米淘上两三遍。","zhǔ fàn qián nǎi nai zǒng yào bǎ mǐ táo shàng liǎng sān biàn","Before cooking rice, Grandma always rinses it two or three times.","Antes de cocinar el arroz, la abuela siempre lo enjuaga dos o tres veces.","Avant de faire cuire le riz, grand-mère le rince toujours deux ou trois fois."],["L7-4035","淘气","táoqì","","naughty; mischievous","travieso; revoltoso","espiègle; coquin","这个孩子很淘气，一会儿也坐不住。","zhè ge hái zi hěn táo qì yí huìr yě zuò bu zhù","This child is very mischievous and can't sit still for a moment.","Este niño es muy travieso y no puede quedarse quieto ni un momento.","Cet enfant est très espiègle et ne tient pas en place un instant."],["L7-4036","淘汰","táotài","V","to eliminate; to weed out","eliminar; descartar","éliminer; évincer","她在第一轮比赛中就被淘汰了。","tā zài dì yī lún bǐ sài zhōng jiù bèi táo tài le","She was eliminated in the very first round of the competition.","Fue eliminada en la primera ronda de la competencia.","Elle a été éliminée dès le premier tour de la compétition."],["L7-4037","讨","tǎo","V","to demand; to invite; to provoke","pedir; exigir; provocar","demander; solliciter; s'attirer","这孩子嘴很甜，很会讨大人的欢心。","zhè hái zi zuǐ hěn tián hěn huì tǎo dà ren de huān xīn","This child is a sweet talker and very good at winning adults' favor.","Este niño es muy zalamero y sabe ganarse muy bien el cariño de los mayores.","Cet enfant a la langue bien pendue et sait très bien se faire aimer des adultes."],["L7-4038","讨好","tǎohǎo","","to curry favor; to win approval","congraciarse; ganarse el favor","s'attirer les faveurs; flatter","他总是想方设法讨好领导，同事们都看不惯。","tā zǒng shì xiǎng fāng shè fǎ tǎo hǎo lǐng dǎo tóng shì men dōu kàn bu guàn","He is always trying every possible way to curry favor with his boss, which his colleagues can't stand.","Siempre busca la manera de congraciarse con los jefes, y a sus compañeros no les gusta nada.","Il cherche toujours un moyen de plaire à ses supérieurs, ce que ses collègues ne supportent pas."],["L7-4039","讨价还价","tǎojià-huánjià","","to haggle","regatear","marchander","在这个市场买东西，可以和老板讨价还价。","zài zhè ge shì chǎng mǎi dōng xi kě yǐ hé lǎo bǎn tǎo jià huán jià","When shopping in this market, you can haggle with the stall owners.","En este mercado puedes regatear con los dueños de los puestos.","Sur ce marché, on peut marchander avec les commerçants."],["L7-4040","讨人喜欢","tǎo rén xǐhuan","","endearing; likable","simpático; encantador","sympathique; charmant","这只小狗又聪明又乖，特别讨人喜欢。","zhè zhī xiǎo gǒu yòu cōng míng yòu guāi tè bié tǎo rén xǐ huan","This puppy is clever and well-behaved, and very endearing.","Este perrito es listo y obediente, y se hace querer muchísimo.","Ce petit chien est intelligent et sage, et on ne peut que l'adorer."],["L7-4041","特产","tèchǎn","N","local specialty","producto típico local","spécialité locale","来到这里，一定要尝尝当地的特产。","lái dào zhè lǐ yí dìng yào cháng cháng dāng dì de tè chǎn","When you come here, you must try the local specialties.","Ya que vienes aquí, tienes que probar las especialidades locales.","Puisque vous êtes ici, il faut absolument goûter les spécialités locales."],["L7-4042","特长","tècháng","N","strong point; special skill","punto fuerte; talento especial","point fort; talent particulier","填写简历时，可以写上自己的兴趣和特长。","tián xiě jiǎn lì shí kě yǐ xiě shàng zì jǐ de xìng qù hé tè cháng","When filling out your résumé, you can include your interests and special skills.","Al rellenar el currículum, puedes incluir tus intereses y habilidades especiales.","En remplissant votre CV, vous pouvez indiquer vos centres d'intérêt et vos talents particuliers."],["L7-4043","特例","tèlì","N","special case","caso especial","cas particulier","这次给他延期是特例，以后不能这样了。","zhè cì gěi tā yán qī shì tè lì yǐ hòu bù néng zhè yàng le","Giving him an extension this time is a special case; it can't happen again.","Darle una prórroga esta vez es un caso excepcional; no podrá volver a pasar.","Lui accorder un délai cette fois est une exception ; cela ne se reproduira pas."],["L7-4044","特权","tèquán","N","privilege","privilegio; prerrogativa","privilège; prérogative","在法律面前人人平等，任何人都没有特权。","zài fǎ lǜ miàn qián rén rén píng děng rèn hé rén dōu méi yǒu tè quán","All are equal before the law, and no one enjoys special privileges.","Todos somos iguales ante la ley y nadie tiene privilegios.","Tous sont égaux devant la loi et personne ne jouit de privilèges."],["L7-4045","特邀","tèyāo","V","to invite specially","invitar especialmente","inviter tout spécialement","本次晚会特邀了几位著名歌唱家参加演出。","běn cì wǎn huì tè yāo le jǐ wèi zhù míng gē chàng jiā cān jiā yǎn chū","Several famous singers have been specially invited to perform at this gala.","Para esta gala se invitó especialmente a varios cantantes famosos para que actuaran.","Plusieurs chanteurs célèbres ont été spécialement invités à se produire lors de cette soirée de gala."],["L7-4046","特制","tèzhì","V","specially made","hecho a medida; especial","fait sur mesure; spécial","这款蛋糕是用特制的模具做出来的。","zhè kuǎn dàn gāo shì yòng tè zhì de mú jù zuò chū lái de","This cake was made with a custom-made mold.","Este pastel se hizo con un molde hecho especialmente para ello.","Ce gâteau a été fait avec un moule fabriqué sur mesure."],["L7-4047","特质","tèzhì","N","characteristic; special quality","rasgo; cualidad especial","caractéristique; qualité propre","勇敢和坚强是这个角色最突出的特质。","yǒng gǎn hé jiān qiáng shì zhè ge jué sè zuì tū chū de tè zhì","Courage and resilience are this character's most prominent traits.","El valor y la fortaleza son los rasgos más destacados de este personaje.","Le courage et la force de caractère sont les traits les plus marquants de ce personnage."],["L7-4048","腾","téng","V","to soar; to make room","elevarse; dejar libre","s'élever; libérer","你能不能腾个地方，让我把箱子放下？","nǐ néng bu néng téng gè dì fang ràng wǒ bǎ xiāng zi fàng xià","Could you make some room so I can put my suitcase down?","¿Podrías hacerme un hueco para dejar la maleta?","Pourrais-tu me faire un peu de place pour que je pose ma valise ?"],["L7-4049","藤椅","téngyǐ","N","rattan chair","silla de ratán","chaise en rotin","爷爷喜欢坐在院子里的藤椅上看报纸。","yé ye xǐ huan zuò zài yuàn zi lǐ de téng yǐ shàng kàn bào zhǐ","Grandpa likes to sit in the rattan chair in the courtyard reading the newspaper.","Al abuelo le gusta sentarse en la silla de mimbre del patio a leer el periódico.","Grand-père aime s'asseoir dans le fauteuil en rotin de la cour pour lire le journal."],["L7-4050","剔除","tīchú","V","to remove; to discard","eliminar; descartar","éliminer; écarter","统计数据时，要先把错误的记录剔除掉。","tǒng jì shù jù shí yào xiān bǎ cuò wù de jì lù tī chú diào","When compiling statistics, first remove the erroneous records.","Al hacer las estadísticas, primero hay que eliminar los registros erróneos.","Pour établir des statistiques, il faut d'abord supprimer les enregistrements erronés."],["L7-4051","梯子","tīzi","N","ladder","escalera de mano","échelle","他搬来一把梯子，爬上去换灯泡。","tā bān lái yì bǎ tī zi pá shàng qù huàn dēng pào","He brought over a ladder and climbed up to change the light bulb.","Trajo una escalera y subió a cambiar la bombilla.","Il a apporté une échelle et est monté changer l'ampoule."],["L7-4052","提拔","tíbá","V","to promote","ascender","promouvoir","他立功以后，很快就被提拔了。","tā lì gōng yǐ hòu hěn kuài jiù bèi tí bá le","After he performed meritorious service, he was quickly promoted.","Después de lograr un mérito destacado, lo ascendieron rápidamente.","Après avoir rendu un service remarquable, il a été rapidement promu."],["L7-4053","提炼","tíliàn","V","to extract; to refine","extraer; refinar","extraire; raffiner","这篇报告从大量数据中提炼出了几个关键结论。","zhè piān bào gào cóng dà liàng shù jù zhōng tí liàn chū le jǐ ge guān jiàn jié lùn","This report distilled several key conclusions from a large amount of data.","Este informe extrajo varias conclusiones clave de una gran cantidad de datos.","Ce rapport a dégagé plusieurs conclusions essentielles d'une grande quantité de données."],["L7-4054","提名","tímíng","","to nominate","nominar","nommer; proposer comme candidat","她凭这部电影获得了最佳女主角的提名。","tā píng zhè bù diàn yǐng huò dé le zuì jiā nǚ zhǔ jué de tí míng","She received a nomination for Best Actress for this film.","Por esta película recibió una nominación a la mejor actriz.","Elle a été nommée meilleure actrice pour ce film."],["L7-4055","提速","tísù","","to speed up","acelerar","accélérer","这条铁路提速以后，两地之间只要两个小时。","zhè tiáo tiě lù tí sù yǐ hòu liǎng dì zhī jiān zhǐ yào liǎng gè xiǎo shí","With the increase in train speeds on this railway, the journey between the two places now takes only two hours.","Desde que se aumentó la velocidad de los trenes en esta línea, el trayecto entre las dos ciudades dura solo dos horas.","Depuis que les trains sont plus rapides sur cette ligne, le trajet entre les deux villes ne prend plus que deux heures."],["L7-4056","提心吊胆","tíxīn-diàodǎn","","to be on edge; to be scared","estar con el alma en un hilo","avoir la peur au ventre","孩子第一次一个人出远门，妈妈整天提心吊胆的。","hái zi dì yī cì yí ge rén chū yuǎn mén mā ma zhěng tiān tí xīn diào dǎn de","The first time the child traveled far alone, the mother was on edge all day.","Era la primera vez que el niño viajaba lejos solo, y su mamá estuvo con el alma en un hilo todo el día.","C'était la première fois que l'enfant partait seul loin de chez lui, et sa mère a été inquiète toute la journée."],["L7-4057","提议","tíyì","V/N","proposal; to propose","propuesta; proponer","proposition; proposer","他提议周末大家一起去郊外爬山。","tā tí yì zhōu mò dà jiā yì qǐ qù jiāo wài pá shān","He suggested that everyone go hiking in the countryside together on the weekend.","Propuso que el fin de semana todos fuéramos juntos a hacer senderismo en las afueras.","Il a proposé que tout le monde aille faire de la randonnée ensemble à la campagne ce week-end."],["L7-4058","提早","tízǎo","V","to bring forward; ahead of schedule","adelantar; con antelación","avancer; en avance","今天路上可能堵车，我们最好提早出发。","jīn tiān lù shang kě néng dǔ chē wǒ men zuì hǎo tí zǎo chū fā","There may be traffic jams today, so we'd better set out early.","Hoy puede haber tráfico en la carretera; mejor salgamos temprano.","Il risque d'y avoir des embouteillages aujourd'hui, mieux vaut partir tôt."],["L7-4059","体谅","tǐliàng","V","to empathize; to show understanding","comprender; ser comprensivo","faire preuve de compréhension","父母工作很辛苦，孩子应该多体谅他们。","fù mǔ gōng zuò hěn xīn kǔ hái zi yīng gāi duō tǐ liàng tā men","Parents work very hard, so children should be more understanding of them.","Los padres trabajan muy duro; los hijos deberían ser más comprensivos con ellos.","Les parents travaillent très dur, les enfants devraient se montrer plus compréhensifs envers eux."],["L7-4060","体面","tǐmiàn","N/Adj","dignity; respectable","dignidad; decoroso","dignité; honorable","他想找一份体面的工作，让家人放心。","tā xiǎng zhǎo yí fèn tǐ miàn de gōng zuò ràng jiā rén fàng xīn","He wants to find a respectable job so his family won't worry.","Quiere encontrar un trabajo digno para que su familia esté tranquila.","Il veut trouver un travail respectable pour rassurer sa famille."],["L7-4061","体能","tǐnéng","N","physical fitness; stamina","condición física; resistencia","condition physique; endurance","当消防员需要非常好的体能。","dāng xiāo fáng yuán xū yào fēi cháng hǎo de tǐ néng","Being a firefighter requires very good physical fitness.","Ser bombero requiere una muy buena condición física.","Pour être pompier, il faut une très bonne condition physique."],["L7-4062","体贴","tǐtiē","V","considerate","considerado; atento","attentionné; prévenant","她丈夫很体贴，每天下班都来接她。","tā zhàng fu hěn tǐ tiē měi tiān xià bān dōu lái jiē tā","Her husband is very considerate and picks her up from work every day.","Su esposo es muy atento y viene a recogerla todos los días al salir del trabajo.","Son mari est très attentionné et vient la chercher tous les jours à la sortie du travail."],["L7-4063","体温","tǐwēn","N","body temperature","temperatura corporal","température corporelle","孩子从昨晚开始发热，体温一直降不下来。","hái zi cóng zuó wǎn kāi shǐ fā rè tǐ wēn yì zhí jiàng bú xià lái","The child has had a fever since last night, and his temperature won't come down.","El niño tiene fiebre desde anoche y la temperatura no le baja.","L'enfant a de la fièvre depuis hier soir et sa température ne descend pas."],["L7-4064","体系","tǐxì","N","system","sistema","système","这所大学建立了完整的课程体系。","zhè suǒ dà xué jiàn lì le wán zhěng de kè chéng tǐ xì","This university has established a complete curriculum system.","Esta universidad ha establecido un sistema curricular completo.","Cette université a mis en place un système de cursus complet."],["L7-4065","体制","tǐzhì","N","system; institutional setup","sistema; régimen institucional","système; régime institutionnel","这个国家正在改革教育体制。","zhè ge guó jiā zhèng zài gǎi gé jiào yù tǐ zhì","This country is reforming its education system.","Este país está reformando su sistema educativo.","Ce pays est en train de réformer son système éducatif."],["L7-4066","体质","tǐzhì","N","physique; constitution","constitución física","constitution physique","他从小体质就弱，经常感冒。","tā cóng xiǎo tǐ zhì jiù ruò jīng cháng gǎn mào","He has had a weak constitution since childhood and often catches colds.","Desde pequeño es de constitución débil y se resfría con frecuencia.","Il est de constitution fragile depuis l'enfance et s'enrhume souvent."],["L7-4067","剃","tì","V","to shave","afeitar","raser","爸爸每天早上起床后都要剃胡子。","bà ba měi tiān zǎo shang qǐ chuáng hòu dōu yào tì hú zi","Dad shaves his beard every morning after getting up.","Papá se afeita la barba todas las mañanas al levantarse.","Papa se rase la barbe tous les matins en se levant."],["L7-4068","替换","tìhuàn","V","to replace; to substitute","reemplazar; sustituir","remplacer; substituer","这个零件坏了，需要用一个新的零件来替换。","zhè ge líng jiàn huài le xū yào yòng yí ge xīn de líng jiàn lái tì huàn","This part is broken and needs to be replaced with a new one.","Esta pieza está rota y hay que reemplazarla por una nueva.","Cette pièce est cassée et doit être remplacée par une neuve."],["L7-4069","替身","tìshēn","N","stand-in; scapegoat","doble; chivo expiatorio","doublure; bouc émissaire","电影里那些危险的动作都是替身完成的。","diàn yǐng lǐ nà xiē wēi xiǎn de dòng zuò dōu shì tì shēn wán chéng de","The dangerous stunts in the film were all done by a body double.","Las escenas peligrosas de la película las hizo un doble.","Les cascades dangereuses du film ont toutes été réalisées par une doublure."],["L7-4070","天长地久","tiāncháng-dìjiǔ","","everlasting; eternal","eterno; para siempre","éternel; pour toujours","他们在婚礼上许愿，希望爱情天长地久。","tā men zài hūn lǐ shàng xǔ yuàn xī wàng ài qíng tiān cháng dì jiǔ","At their wedding they made a wish that their love would last forever.","En su boda pidieron un deseo: que su amor durara para siempre.","Lors de leur mariage, ils ont fait le vœu que leur amour dure toujours."],["L7-4071","天地","tiāndì","N","world; sphere of activity","mundo; ámbito","monde; domaine d'action","站在草原上，眼前是一望无际的辽阔天地。","zhàn zài cǎo yuán shàng yǎn qián shì yí wàng wú jì de liáo kuò tiān dì","Standing on the grassland, you see a vast expanse stretching to the horizon.","De pie en la pradera, ante tus ojos se extiende un vasto horizonte sin fin.","Debout dans la prairie, on a devant les yeux un monde immense qui s'étend à perte de vue."],["L7-4072","天鹅","tiān'é","N","swan","cisne","cygne","湖面上游着几只白色的天鹅。","hú miàn shàng yóu zhe jǐ zhī bái sè de tiān é","Several white swans were swimming on the lake.","En el lago nadaban varios cisnes blancos.","Quelques cygnes blancs nageaient sur le lac."],["L7-4073","天分","tiānfèn","N","natural talent","talento natural","talent naturel","这孩子很有音乐天分，五岁就会弹钢琴了。","zhè hái zi hěn yǒu yīn yuè tiān fèn wǔ suì jiù huì tán gāng qín le","This child has a natural gift for music and could play the piano at five.","Este niño tiene talento natural para la música y a los cinco años ya tocaba el piano.","Cet enfant a un don naturel pour la musique et savait jouer du piano à cinq ans."],["L7-4074","天赋","tiānfù","V/N","gift; innate skill","don; talento innato","don; talent inné","每个人都有自己的天赋，只是表现在不同的方面。","měi ge rén dōu yǒu zì jǐ de tiān fù zhǐ shì biǎo xiàn zài bù tóng de fāng miàn","Everyone has their own innate talents; they just show up in different areas.","Todos tenemos nuestro propio don natural; solo que se manifiesta en áreas distintas.","Chacun a ses talents innés, ils se manifestent simplement dans des domaines différents."],["L7-4075","天经地义","tiānjīng-dìyì","","perfectly natural and right","de lo más natural y justo","tout à fait naturel et légitime","子女赡养年老的父母是天经地义的事情。","zǐ nǚ shàn yǎng nián lǎo de fù mǔ shì tiān jīng dì yì de shì qing","It is only right and proper for children to support their elderly parents.","Es lo más natural y justo que los hijos mantengan a sus padres ancianos.","Il est tout à fait naturel et légitime que les enfants subviennent aux besoins de leurs parents âgés."],["L7-4076","天平","tiānpíng","N","balance scales","balanza","balance","化学老师用天平称了一下这些药品的重量。","huà xué lǎo shī yòng tiān píng chēng le yí xià zhè xiē yào pǐn de zhòng liàng","The chemistry teacher weighed these chemicals on a balance.","El profesor de química pesó estos medicamentos en una balanza.","Le professeur de chimie a pesé ces produits sur une balance."],["L7-4077","天桥","tiānqiáo","N","Tianqiao (place); overpass","Tianqiao; pasarela","Tianqiao; passerelle","过马路请走天桥，不要横穿马路。","guò mǎ lù qǐng zǒu tiān qiáo bú yào héng chuān mǎ lù","Please use the pedestrian overpass to cross; don't cut across the road.","Para cruzar la calle, use el puente peatonal; no la cruce por en medio.","Pour traverser la route, empruntez la passerelle piétonne ; ne traversez pas en dehors des passages."],["L7-4078","天生","tiānshēng","Adj","innate; natural","innato; natural","inné; naturel","她天生一副好嗓子，唱歌特别好听。","tā tiān shēng yí fù hǎo sǎng zi chàng gē tè bié hǎo tīng","She was born with a fine voice and sings beautifully.","Nació con una buena voz y canta de maravilla.","Elle est née avec une belle voix et chante merveilleusement bien."],["L7-4079","天使","tiānshǐ","N","angel","ángel","ange","护士们常常被大家比作天使。","hù shi men cháng cháng bèi dà jiā bǐ zuò tiān shǐ","Nurses are often compared to angels.","A las enfermeras se les suele comparar con ángeles.","On compare souvent les infirmières à des anges."],["L7-4080","天线","tiānxiàn","N","antenna","antena","antenne","收音机的天线断了，信号很差。","shōu yīn jī de tiān xiàn duàn le xìn hào hěn chà","The radio's antenna is broken, so the signal is poor.","La antena de la radio se rompió y la señal es muy mala.","L'antenne de la radio est cassée, le signal est très mauvais."],["L7-4081","天性","tiānxìng","N","nature; innate tendency","naturaleza; carácter innato","nature; penchant inné","孩子爱玩是天性，不能总是让他们学习。","hái zi ài wán shì tiān xìng bù néng zǒng shì ràng tā men xué xí","Children love to play by nature; you can't make them study all the time.","A los niños les gusta jugar por naturaleza; no se les puede hacer estudiar todo el tiempo.","Les enfants aiment jouer, c'est dans leur nature ; on ne peut pas les faire étudier tout le temps."],["L7-4082","天主教","Tiānzhǔjiào","N","Catholicism","catolicismo","catholicisme","这座古老的教堂属于天主教。","zhè zuò gǔ lǎo de jiào táng shǔ yú tiān zhǔ jiào","This old church belongs to the Catholic Church.","Esta antigua iglesia pertenece a la Iglesia católica.","Cette vieille église est catholique."],["L7-4083","添加","tiānjiā","V","to add","añadir; agregar","ajouter","修复壁画时，工作人员尽量保留原貌，没有随意添加鲜艳的色彩。","xiū fù bì huà shí gōng zuò rén yuán jǐn liàng bǎo liú yuán mào méi yǒu suí yì tiān jiā xiān yàn de sè cǎi","When restoring the murals, the staff preserved their original appearance as far as possible rather than adding bright colors at will.","Al restaurar los murales, el personal procuró conservar su aspecto original y no añadió colores vivos a su antojo.","Lors de la restauration des fresques, l'équipe a veillé à préserver leur aspect d'origine et n'a pas ajouté de couleurs vives à sa guise."],["L7-4084","甜美","tiánměi","Adj","sweet; pleasant","dulce; agradable","doux; agréable","她的声音很甜美，很适合做主持人。","tā de shēng yīn hěn tián měi hěn shì hé zuò zhǔ chí rén","Her voice is sweet and very suitable for a host.","Su voz es muy dulce y le va muy bien para ser presentadora.","Sa voix est très douce et convient très bien à une présentatrice."],["L7-4085","甜蜜","tiánmì","Adj","sweet; happy","dulce; feliz","doux; heureux","回想起童年的生活，他心里感到很甜蜜。","huí xiǎng qǐ tóng nián de shēng huó tā xīn lǐ gǎn dào hěn tián mì","Recalling his childhood, he felt a warm glow of happiness.","Al recordar su vida de la infancia, sintió el corazón lleno de dulzura.","En repensant à sa vie d'enfant, il a ressenti une douce chaleur."],["L7-4086","甜头","tiántou","N","sweet reward; benefit","recompensa dulce; beneficio","avantage; bénéfice","尝到了做生意的甜头以后，他干脆辞职了。","cháng dào le zuò shēng yi de tián tou yǐ hòu tā gān cuì cí zhí le","After getting a taste of the benefits of doing business, he simply quit his job.","Después de probar las ventajas de hacer negocios, sin más renunció a su empleo.","Après avoir goûté aux avantages des affaires, il a tout simplement démissionné."],["L7-4087","填补","tiánbǔ","V","to fill a gap; to make up for","llenar un vacío; suplir","combler (une lacune)","这项研究填补了国内这个领域的空白。","zhè xiàng yán jiū tián bǔ le guó nèi zhè ge lǐng yù de kòng bái","This research filled a gap in this field in the country.","Esta investigación llenó un vacío en este campo dentro del país.","Cette recherche a comblé une lacune dans ce domaine à l'échelle nationale."],["L7-4088","填充","tiánchōng","V","to fill up; to stuff","rellenar; llenar","remplir; bourrer","枕头里填充的是荞麦皮，睡起来很舒服。","zhěn tou lǐ tián chōng de shì qiáo mài pí shuì qǐ lái hěn shū fu","The pillow is filled with buckwheat hulls and is very comfortable to sleep on.","La almohada está rellena de cascarilla de trigo sarraceno y es muy cómoda para dormir.","L'oreiller est rempli de balles de sarrasin, c'est très confortable pour dormir."],["L7-4089","填写","tiánxiě","V","to fill in (a form)","rellenar (un formulario)","remplir (un formulaire)","请在这张表格上填写您的姓名和电话。","qǐng zài zhè zhāng biǎo gé shàng tián xiě nín de xìng míng hé diàn huà","Please fill in your name and phone number on this form.","Por favor, escriba su nombre y teléfono en este formulario.","Veuillez inscrire votre nom et votre numéro de téléphone sur ce formulaire."],["L7-4090","舔","tiǎn","V","to lick","lamer","lécher","小狗跑过来舔了舔我的手。","xiǎo gǒu pǎo guò lái tiǎn le tiǎn wǒ de shǒu","The puppy ran over and licked my hand.","El perrito vino corriendo y me lamió la mano.","Le petit chien est accouru et m'a léché la main."],["L7-4091","挑剔","tiāoti","V","picky; fussy","quisquilloso; exigente","pointilleux; tatillon","他吃饭很挑剔，这也不吃那也不吃。","tā chī fàn hěn tiāo ti zhè yě bù chī nà yě bù chī","He is very picky about food and won't eat this or that.","Es muy quisquilloso con la comida: esto no lo come y aquello tampoco.","Il est très difficile pour la nourriture : il ne mange ni ceci ni cela."],["L7-4092","条款","tiáokuǎn","N","clause","cláusula","clause","双方代表正在拟定合作协议的具体条款。","shuāng fāng dài biǎo zhèng zài nǐ dìng hé zuò xié yì de jù tǐ tiáo kuǎn","Representatives of both sides are drafting the specific terms of the cooperation agreement.","Los representantes de ambas partes están redactando los términos concretos del acuerdo de cooperación.","Les représentants des deux parties sont en train de rédiger les clauses précises de l'accord de coopération."],["L7-4093","条例","tiáolì","N","regulations","reglamento; normas","règlement; ordonnance","新的交通管理条例下个月开始实施。","xīn de jiāo tōng guǎn lǐ tiáo lì xià ge yuè kāi shǐ shí shī","The new traffic management regulations take effect next month.","El nuevo reglamento de gestión del tránsito entrará en vigor el mes que viene.","Le nouveau règlement de gestion de la circulation entrera en vigueur le mois prochain."],["L7-4094","条约","tiáoyuē","N","treaty","tratado","traité","两个国家签订了和平条约。","liǎng gè guó jiā qiān dìng le hé píng tiáo yuē","The two countries signed a peace treaty.","Los dos países firmaron un tratado de paz.","Les deux pays ont signé un traité de paix."],["L7-4095","调侃","tiáokǎn","V","to tease; to mock","burlarse de; bromear","taquiner; se moquer","朋友们常常调侃他是个工作狂。","péng you men cháng cháng tiáo kǎn tā shì gè gōng zuò kuáng","His friends often tease him for being a workaholic.","Sus amigos suelen burlarse de él por ser un adicto al trabajo.","Ses amis le taquinent souvent en disant qu'il est un bourreau de travail."],["L7-4096","调控","tiáokòng","V","to regulate; to control","regular; controlar","réguler; contrôler","政府通过宏观调控来稳定物价。","zhèng fǔ tōng guò hóng guān tiáo kòng lái wěn dìng wù jià","The government stabilizes prices through macroeconomic regulation.","El gobierno estabiliza los precios mediante la regulación macroeconómica.","Le gouvernement stabilise les prix grâce à une régulation macroéconomique."],["L7-4097","调料","tiáoliào","N","seasoning; condiment","condimento; aderezo","condiment; assaisonnement","做这道菜需要准备好几种调料。","zuò zhè dào cài xū yào zhǔn bèi hǎo jǐ zhǒng tiáo liào","You need to prepare several kinds of seasoning to make this dish.","Para preparar este plato hay que tener listos varios condimentos.","Pour préparer ce plat, il faut avoir plusieurs sortes d'assaisonnements."],["L7-4098","调试","tiáoshì","V","to debug; to test and adjust","depurar; ajustar","déboguer; mettre au point","工程师正在调试新安装的机器。","gōng chéng shī zhèng zài tiáo shì xīn ān zhuāng de jī qì","The engineer is testing and adjusting the newly installed machine.","El ingeniero está probando y ajustando la máquina recién instalada.","L'ingénieur est en train de tester et de régler la machine qui vient d'être installée."],["L7-4099","挑起","tiǎoqǐ","","to provoke; to stir up","provocar; suscitar","provoquer; déclencher","有人故意在网上挑起争论。","yǒu rén gù yì zài wǎng shàng tiǎo qǐ zhēng lùn","Someone deliberately stirred up an argument online.","Alguien provocó deliberadamente una discusión en internet.","Quelqu'un a délibérément déclenché une polémique sur Internet."],["L7-4100","挑衅","tiǎoxìn","V","to provoke; provocation","provocar; provocación","provoquer; provocation","面对对方的挑衅，他始终保持冷静。","miàn duì duì fāng de tiǎo xìn tā shǐ zhōng bǎo chí lěng jìng","Faced with the other side's provocation, he always stayed calm.","Ante la provocación de la otra parte, siempre mantuvo la calma.","Face à la provocation de l'autre camp, il est toujours resté calme."],["L7-4101","跳槽","tiàocáo","","to change jobs","cambiar de trabajo","changer d'emploi","他工作不到一年就跳槽到了另一家公司。","tā gōng zuò bú dào yì nián jiù tiào cáo dào le lìng yì jiā gōng sī","He switched jobs to another company after working less than a year.","Cambió de trabajo a otra empresa sin haber cumplido siquiera un año.","Il a changé d'entreprise avant même d'avoir travaillé un an."],["L7-4102","跳动","tiàodòng","V","to throb; to pulse; to jump about","latir; palpitar; saltar","battre; palpiter; sautiller","壁炉里的火焰跳动着，屋子里暖洋洋的。","bì lú lǐ de huǒ yàn tiào dòng zhe wū zi lǐ nuǎn yáng yáng de","The flames danced in the fireplace, and the room was warm and cozy.","Las llamas danzaban en la chimenea y la habitación estaba calentita.","Les flammes dansaient dans la cheminée, et la pièce était délicieusement chaude."],["L7-4103","跳伞","tiàosǎn","","to parachute","saltar en paracaídas","sauter en parachute","他第一次跳伞的时候，紧张得腿都软了。","tā dì yī cì tiào sǎn de shí hou jǐn zhāng de tuǐ dōu ruǎn le","The first time he went skydiving, he was so nervous his legs went weak.","La primera vez que se lanzó en paracaídas, estaba tan nervioso que le temblaban las piernas.","La première fois qu'il a fait du parachute, il était si nerveux que les jambes lui ont flanché."],["L7-4104","跳跃","tiàoyuè","V","to jump; to leap","saltar; brincar","sauter; bondir","运动员在赛场上用力向前跳跃。","yùn dòng yuán zài sài chǎng shàng yòng lì xiàng qián tiào yuè","The athlete jumped forward forcefully on the field.","El atleta dio un fuerte salto hacia adelante en la pista.","L'athlète a bondi vers l'avant avec force sur le terrain."],["L7-4105","贴近","tiējìn","V/Adj","to snuggle close; intimate","acercarse; íntimo","se rapprocher; intime","这部电视剧贴近普通人的生活，所以很受欢迎。","zhè bù diàn shì jù tiē jìn pǔ tōng rén de shēng huó suǒ yǐ hěn shòu huān yíng","This TV series is close to ordinary people's lives, so it is very popular.","Esta serie de televisión refleja la vida de la gente común, por eso es muy popular.","Cette série télévisée est proche de la vie des gens ordinaires, c'est pourquoi elle est très populaire."],["L7-4106","贴切","tiēqiè","Adj","apt; fitting","apropiado; acertado","juste; approprié","评价一篇作文，既要看措辞是否贴切，也要看论证是否严谨。","píng jià yì piān zuò wén jì yào kàn cuò cí shì fǒu tiē qiè yě yào kàn lùn zhèng shì fǒu yán jǐn","Evaluating an essay requires attention both to apt wording and to rigorous reasoning.","Para evaluar una redacción hay que fijarse tanto en si las palabras son adecuadas como en si la argumentación es rigurosa.","Pour évaluer une rédaction, il faut regarder à la fois si les mots sont justes et si l'argumentation est rigoureuse."],["L7-4107","帖子","tiězi","N","forum post; invitation","publicación (foro); invitación","message (forum); invitation","他在论坛上发了一个帖子，很快就有人回复。","tā zài lùn tán shàng fā le yí ge tiě zi hěn kuài jiù yǒu rén huí fù","He posted on the forum, and someone replied very quickly.","Publicó un mensaje en el foro y enseguida alguien le respondió.","Il a posté un message sur le forum et quelqu'un a répondu très vite."],["L7-4108","听从","tīngcóng","V","to heed; to obey","hacer caso; obedecer","écouter; obéir","他听从了医生的建议，开始每天锻炼。","tā tīng cóng le yī shēng de jiàn yì kāi shǐ měi tiān duàn liàn","He followed the doctor's advice and started exercising every day.","Siguió el consejo del médico y empezó a hacer ejercicio todos los días.","Il a suivi le conseil du médecin et s'est mis à faire de l'exercice tous les jours."],["L7-4109","听话","tīnghuà","","obedient","obediente","obéissant","这个孩子很听话，从来不让父母操心。","zhè ge hái zi hěn tīng huà cóng lái bú ràng fù mǔ cāo xīn","This child is very obedient and never makes his parents worry.","Este niño es muy obediente y nunca da preocupaciones a sus padres.","Cet enfant est très obéissant et ne donne jamais de soucis à ses parents."],["L7-4110","停泊","tíngbó","V","to anchor; to moor","anclar; fondear","mouiller; ancrer","港口里停泊着许多大大小小的船。","gǎng kǒu lǐ tíng bó zhe xǔ duō dà dà xiǎo xiǎo de chuán","Many boats, large and small, are anchored in the harbor.","En el puerto están fondeados muchos barcos grandes y pequeños.","De nombreux bateaux, grands et petits, sont amarrés dans le port."],["L7-4111","停车位","tíngchēwèi","N","parking space","plaza de aparcamiento","place de parking","商场附近很难找到停车位。","shāng chǎng fù jìn hěn nán zhǎo dào tíng chē wèi","It's hard to find a parking space near the mall.","Es difícil encontrar estacionamiento cerca del centro comercial.","Il est difficile de trouver une place de parking près du centre commercial."],["L7-4112","停电","tíngdiàn","V","power outage","corte de electricidad","coupure de courant","停电了，我们只好点上蜡烛吃晚饭。","tíng diàn le wǒ men zhǐ hǎo diǎn shàng là zhú chī wǎn fàn","The power went out, so we had to light candles to eat dinner.","Se fue la luz, así que tuvimos que cenar a la luz de las velas.","Il y a eu une coupure de courant, nous avons dû allumer des bougies pour dîner."],["L7-4113","停顿","tíngdùn","V","to pause; to halt","detenerse; pausa","s'arrêter; pause","他讲到这里停顿了一下，然后接着说下去。","tā jiǎng dào zhè lǐ tíng dùn le yí xià rán hòu jiē zhe shuō xià qù","He paused at this point and then went on speaking.","Al llegar a este punto hizo una pausa y luego continuó hablando.","Arrivé là, il a marqué une pause, puis a poursuivi."],["L7-4114","停放","tíngfàng","V","to park; to leave (a vehicle)","aparcar; estacionar","garer; stationner","自行车请停放在指定的地方。","zì xíng chē qǐng tíng fàng zài zhǐ dìng de dì fang","Please park bicycles in the designated area.","Por favor, estacione las bicicletas en el lugar designado.","Veuillez garer les vélos à l'endroit prévu."],["L7-4115","停业","tíngyè","","to close down; to cease business","cerrar el negocio; cesar la actividad","cesser son activité; fermer","这家饭馆因为装修暂时停业一个月。","zhè jiā fàn guǎn yīn wèi zhuāng xiū zàn shí tíng yè yí ge yuè","This restaurant is temporarily closed for a month for renovation.","Este restaurante está cerrado temporalmente por un mes debido a una remodelación.","Ce restaurant est fermé temporairement pendant un mois pour travaux de rénovation."],["L7-4116","通畅","tōngchàng","Adj","unobstructed; fluent","despejado; fluido","dégagé; fluide","修好这条路以后，进城的交通通畅多了。","xiū hǎo zhè tiáo lù yǐ hòu jìn chéng de jiāo tōng tōng chàng duō le","After this road was repaired, traffic into the city became much smoother.","Después de arreglar esta carretera, el tráfico hacia la ciudad fluye mucho mejor.","Depuis la réparation de cette route, la circulation vers la ville est bien plus fluide."],["L7-4117","通车","tōngchē","","to open to traffic","abrir al tráfico","ouvrir à la circulation","这座大桥预计明年年底正式通车。","zhè zuò dà qiáo yù jì míng nián nián dǐ zhèng shì tōng chē","This bridge is expected to officially open to traffic at the end of next year.","Se prevé que este puente se abra oficialmente al tráfico a finales del año que viene.","Ce pont devrait être officiellement ouvert à la circulation à la fin de l'année prochaine."],["L7-4118","通风","tōngfēng","","ventilated; ventilation; to air out","ventilado; ventilación; ventilar","aéré; ventilation; aérer","房间里人太多了，打开窗户通风吧。","fáng jiān lǐ rén tài duō le dǎ kāi chuāng hu tōng fēng ba","There are too many people in the room; open the windows to air it out.","Hay demasiada gente en la habitación; abramos las ventanas para ventilar.","Il y a trop de monde dans la pièce, ouvrons les fenêtres pour aérer."],["L7-4119","通告","tōnggào","V/N","to announce; notice","anunciar; aviso","annoncer; avis","学校门口贴出了一张放假的通告。","xué xiào mén kǒu tiē chū le yì zhāng fàng jià de tōng gào","A notice about the holiday was posted at the school gate.","En la puerta de la escuela se colocó un aviso sobre las vacaciones.","Un avis concernant les vacances a été affiché à l'entrée de l'école."],["L7-4120","通缉","tōngjī","V","to put on the wanted list","emitir orden de búsqueda y captura","lancer un avis de recherche","警方正在全国通缉这名逃犯。","jǐng fāng zhèng zài quán guó tōng jī zhè míng táo fàn","The police are hunting this fugitive nationwide.","La policía busca a este fugitivo en todo el país.","La police a lancé un avis de recherche national contre ce fugitif."],["L7-4121","通顺","tōngshùn","Adj","smooth; coherent","fluido; coherente","fluide; cohérent","这篇作文写得很通顺，几乎没有错字。","zhè piān zuò wén xiě de hěn tōng shùn jī hū méi yǒu cuò zì","This composition reads smoothly and has almost no wrong characters.","Esta redacción está muy fluida y casi no tiene errores de caracteres.","Cette rédaction est très fluide et ne comporte presque aucune faute de caractères."],["L7-4122","通俗","tōngsú","Adj","popular; common","popular; vulgarizado","populaire; vulgarisé","医生用通俗的语言解释了手术的风险，使家属不再一味恐惧。","yī shēng yòng tōng sú de yǔ yán jiě shì le shǒu shù de fēng xiǎn shǐ jiā shǔ bú zài yí wèi kǒng jù","The doctor explained the risks of the operation in plain language, helping the family move beyond sheer fear.","El médico explicó los riesgos de la operación en un lenguaje sencillo, de modo que la familia dejó de limitarse a sentir miedo.","Le médecin a expliqué les risques de l'opération en termes simples, ce qui a permis à la famille de ne plus se laisser submerger par la peur."],["L7-4123","通通","tōngtōng","Adv","all; entirely","todo; por completo","tout; entièrement","这些旧书我通通送给图书馆了。","zhè xiē jiù shū wǒ tōng tōng sòng gěi tú shū guǎn le","I gave all these old books to the library.","Todos estos libros viejos se los regalé a la biblioteca.","J'ai donné tous ces vieux livres à la bibliothèque."],["L7-4124","通往","tōngwǎng","","to lead to","conducir a","mener à","这条小路一直通往山顶。","zhè tiáo xiǎo lù yì zhí tōng wǎng shān dǐng","This path leads all the way to the top of the mountain.","Este sendero lleva directamente hasta la cima de la montaña.","Ce petit chemin mène jusqu'au sommet de la montagne."],["L7-4125","通宵","tōngxiāo","N","all night","toda la noche","toute la nuit","为了准备考试，他昨天学了一个通宵。","wèi le zhǔn bèi kǎo shì tā zuó tiān xué le yí ge tōng xiāo","To prepare for the exam, he studied all night yesterday.","Para preparar el examen, ayer estudió toda la noche.","Pour préparer l'examen, il a étudié toute la nuit hier."],["L7-4126","通行证","tōngxíngzhèng","N","pass; permit","pase; salvoconducto","laissez-passer; permis","没有通行证的车辆不能进入这个园区。","méi yǒu tōng xíng zhèng de chē liàng bù néng jìn rù zhè ge yuán qū","Vehicles without a pass cannot enter this park.","Los vehículos sin pase no pueden entrar en este parque.","Les véhicules sans laissez-passer ne peuvent pas entrer dans ce parc."],["L7-4127","同伴","tóngbàn","N","companion","compañero","compagnon","登山的时候，他和同伴走散了。","dēng shān de shí hou tā hé tóng bàn zǒu sàn le","While climbing the mountain, he got separated from his companions.","Mientras subía la montaña, se separó de sus compañeros.","Pendant l'ascension de la montagne, il s'est perdu de vue avec ses compagnons."],["L7-4128","同步","tóngbù","V","synchronous; to synchronize","síncrono; sincronizar","synchrone; synchroniser","这场比赛在网上同步直播。","zhè chǎng bǐ sài zài wǎng shàng tóng bù zhí bō","This match is being broadcast live online at the same time.","Este partido se transmite en directo por internet de forma simultánea.","Ce match est retransmis en direct sur Internet en simultané."],["L7-4129","同等","tóngděng","Adj","equal; of the same level","igual; del mismo nivel","égal; de même niveau","男女员工应该享受同等的待遇。","nán nǚ yuán gōng yīng gāi xiǎng shòu tóng děng de dài yù","Male and female employees should enjoy equal treatment.","Los empleados y las empleadas deben recibir el mismo trato.","Les employés et les employées doivent bénéficier d'un traitement égal."],["L7-4130","同感","tónggǎn","N","same feeling","sentimiento compartido","même sentiment","你说这座城市生活压力大，我也很有同感。","nǐ shuō zhè zuò chéng shì shēng huó yā lì dà wǒ yě hěn yǒu tóng gǎn","You say the pressure of life in this city is high; I feel the same way.","Dices que la presión de vivir en esta ciudad es grande, y yo opino lo mismo.","Tu dis que la vie dans cette ville est stressante, je suis tout à fait d'accord."],["L7-4131","同伙","tónghuǒ","V/N","accomplice; partner","cómplice; compañero","complice; acolyte","小偷被抓住以后，很快供出了他的同伙。","xiǎo tōu bèi zhuā zhù yǐ hòu hěn kuài gòng chū le tā de tóng huǒ","After the thief was caught, he quickly gave up his accomplices.","Después de que atraparon al ladrón, enseguida delató a sus cómplices.","Une fois arrêté, le voleur a rapidement dénoncé ses complices."],["L7-4132","同类","tónglèi","Adj/N","similar; of the same kind","similar; del mismo tipo","semblable; de même nature","这款手机比同类产品便宜不少。","zhè kuǎn shǒu jī bǐ tóng lèi chǎn pǐn pián yi bù shǎo","This phone is quite a bit cheaper than similar products.","Este teléfono es bastante más barato que los productos similares.","Ce téléphone est nettement moins cher que les produits similaires."],["L7-4133","同盟","tóngméng","V/N","alliance","alianza","alliance","两国结成了同盟，共同对抗外来威胁。","liǎng guó jié chéng le tóng méng gòng tóng duì kàng wài lái wēi xié","The two countries formed an alliance to jointly resist external threats.","Los dos países formaron una alianza para resistir juntos las amenazas externas.","Les deux pays ont formé une alliance pour résister ensemble aux menaces extérieures."],["L7-4134","同年","tóngnián","N","same year","el mismo año","la même année","他大学毕业，同年就结了婚。","tā dà xué bì yè tóng nián jiù jié le hūn","He graduated from university and got married in the same year.","Se graduó de la universidad y ese mismo año se casó.","Il a obtenu son diplôme universitaire et s'est marié la même année."],["L7-4135","同人","tóngrén","N","colleague; fan-fiction","colega; fanfic","collègue; fanfiction","她业余时间喜欢写同人小说，在网上很有名。","tā yè yú shí jiān xǐ huan xiě tóng rén xiǎo shuō zài wǎng shàng hěn yǒu míng","She likes writing fan fiction in her spare time and is well known online.","En su tiempo libre le gusta escribir fanfics y es muy conocida en internet.","Elle aime écrire des fanfictions pendant son temps libre et est très connue en ligne."],["L7-4136","同志","tóngzhì","N","comrade; gay person","camarada; homosexual","camarade; homosexuel","老同志们退休以后，还经常回单位看看。","lǎo tóng zhì men tuì xiū yǐ hòu hái jīng cháng huí dān wèi kàn kan","After retiring, the veteran comrades often come back to visit the workplace.","Después de jubilarse, los veteranos suelen volver a visitar su antiguo lugar de trabajo.","Après leur retraite, les anciens reviennent souvent rendre visite à leur ancien lieu de travail."],["L7-4137","同舟共济","tóngzhōu-gòngjì","","to be in the same boat","estar todos en el mismo barco","être dans le même bateau","遇到困难时，全家人要同舟共济。","yù dào kùn nan shí quán jiā rén yào tóng zhōu gòng jì","When difficulties arise, the whole family should pull together.","Ante las dificultades, toda la familia debe remar en la misma dirección.","Face aux difficultés, toute la famille doit se serrer les coudes."],["L7-4138","铜","tóng","N","copper","cobre","cuivre","这口大钟是用铜铸造的。","zhè kǒu dà zhōng shì yòng tóng zhù zào de","This big bell was cast in bronze.","Esta gran campana está fundida en bronce.","Cette grosse cloche a été coulée en bronze."],["L7-4139","统筹","tǒngchóu","V","overall planning","planificación global","planification globale","这次活动由市政府统一统筹安排。","zhè cì huó dòng yóu shì zhèng fǔ tǒng yī tǒng chóu ān pái","This event is planned and arranged as a whole by the city government.","Este evento lo planifica y organiza de manera unificada el gobierno municipal.","Cet événement est planifié et organisé de façon centralisée par la municipalité."],["L7-4140","统统","tǒngtǒng","Adv","all; totally","todo; totalmente","tout; totalement","过期的食品统统扔掉吧。","guò qī de shí pǐn tǒng tǒng rēng diào ba","Throw away all the expired food.","Tira toda la comida caducada.","Jetez tous les aliments périmés."],["L7-4141","统治","tǒngzhì","V","to rule; to govern","gobernar; dominar","gouverner; dominer","这个王朝统治了这片土地三百年。","zhè ge wáng cháo tǒng zhì le zhè piàn tǔ dì sān bǎi nián","This dynasty ruled this land for three hundred years.","Esta dinastía gobernó estas tierras durante trescientos años.","Cette dynastie a régné sur ces terres pendant trois cents ans."],["L7-4142","捅","tǒng","V","to poke; to stab; to expose","pinchar; empujar; revelar","piquer; enfoncer; ébruiter","他用胳膊肘捅了捅我，让我别说话。","tā yòng gē bo zhǒu tǒng le tǒng wǒ ràng wǒ bié shuō huà","He nudged me with his elbow to tell me to stop talking.","Me dio un codazo para que me callara.","Il m'a donné un coup de coude pour que je me taise."],["L7-4143","桶","tǒng","N","bucket; barrel","cubo; barril","seau; baril","天还没亮，他就提着桶去井边打水了。","tiān hái méi liàng tā jiù tí zhe tǒng qù jǐng biān dǎ shuǐ le","Before dawn, he carried a bucket to the well to draw water.","Antes de que amaneciera, fue al pozo con un balde a sacar agua.","Avant même l'aube, il est allé au puits avec un seau pour puiser de l'eau."],["L7-4144","筒","tǒng","N","tube; cylinder","tubo; cilindro","tube; cylindre","他去体育用品店买了两筒羽毛球。","tā qù tǐ yù yòng pǐn diàn mǎi le liǎng tǒng yǔ máo qiú","He went to the sporting goods store and bought two tubes of shuttlecocks.","Fue a la tienda de artículos deportivos y compró dos tubos de volantes de bádminton.","Il est allé au magasin de sport et a acheté deux tubes de volants de badminton."],["L7-4145","痛","tòng","Adv","pain; deeply","dolor; profundamente","douleur; profondément","我的腰从昨天开始一直在痛。","wǒ de yāo cóng zuó tiān kāi shǐ yì zhí zài tòng","My lower back has been aching since yesterday.","Me duele la cintura desde ayer.","J'ai mal aux reins depuis hier."],["L7-4146","痛心","tòngxīn","Adj","grieved; pained","afligido; apenado","peiné; affligé","看到河水被污染成这样，大家都很痛心。","kàn dào hé shuǐ bèi wū rǎn chéng zhè yàng dà jiā dōu hěn tòng xīn","Everyone was deeply pained to see the river polluted like this.","Ver el río contaminado de esta manera nos dolió a todos.","Voir la rivière polluée à ce point a profondément attristé tout le monde."],["L7-4147","偷看","tōukàn","","to peek","mirar a escondidas","regarder en cachette","考试的时候不许偷看别人的答案。","kǎo shì de shí hou bù xǔ tōu kàn bié rén de dá àn","You are not allowed to peek at others' answers during the exam.","No se permite copiar las respuestas de otros durante el examen.","Il est interdit de regarder les réponses des autres pendant l'examen."],["L7-4148","偷窥","tōukuī","V","to peep; to spy","espiar; mirar a hurtadillas","épier; faire le voyeur","在别人家窗外偷窥是违法的行为。","zài bié rén jiā chuāng wài tōu kuī shì wéi fǎ de xíng wéi","Peeping through the window of someone else's home is illegal.","Espiar por la ventana de la casa de otra persona es ilegal.","Épier par la fenêtre chez les autres est illégal."],["L7-4149","偷懒","tōulǎn","","to slack off","holgazanear","paresser","老板一走，他就开始偷懒了。","lǎo bǎn yì zǒu tā jiù kāi shǐ tōu lǎn le","As soon as the boss left, he started slacking off.","En cuanto el jefe se fue, empezó a holgazanear.","Dès que le patron est parti, il s'est mis à tirer au flanc."],["L7-4150","头部","tóubù","N","head","cabeza","tête","他在事故中头部受伤，已经昏迷了两天。","tā zài shì gù zhōng tóu bù shòu shāng yǐ jīng hūn mí le liǎng tiān","He was injured in the head in the accident and has been unconscious for two days.","Se lesionó la cabeza en el accidente y lleva dos días inconsciente.","Il s'est blessé à la tête dans l'accident et est inconscient depuis deux jours."],["L7-4151","头顶","tóudǐng","N","top of the head","coronilla","sommet de la tête","一只鸟从我们头顶飞了过去。","yì zhī niǎo cóng wǒ men tóu dǐng fēi le guò qù","A bird flew over our heads.","Un pájaro voló sobre nuestras cabezas.","Un oiseau nous a survolés."],["L7-4152","头号","tóuhào","Adj","top; first-class","de primera; número uno","de premier ordre; numéro un","吸烟被称为健康的头号杀手。","xī yān bèi chēng wéi jiàn kāng de tóu hào shā shǒu","Smoking has been called the number one threat to health.","Fumar ha sido llamado el enemigo número uno de la salud.","Le tabagisme est considéré comme l'ennemi public numéro un de la santé."],["L7-4153","头条","tóutiáo","N","headline; Toutiao","titular; Toutiao","gros titre; Toutiao","这条新闻上了今天各大报纸的头条。","zhè tiáo xīn wén shàng le jīn tiān gè dà bào zhǐ de tóu tiáo","This news made the headlines of all the major newspapers today.","Esta noticia fue titular en los principales periódicos de hoy.","Cette nouvelle a fait la une de tous les grands journaux aujourd'hui."],["L7-4154","头头是道","tóutóu-shìdào","","clear and logical","claro y lógico","clair et logique","他讲起理财来头头是道，大家都听得很认真。","tā jiǎng qǐ lǐ cái lái tóu tóu shì dào dà jiā dōu tīng de hěn rèn zhēn","He talks about money management clearly and logically, and everyone listens attentively.","Cuando habla de finanzas personales lo hace con claridad y lógica, y todos lo escuchan con atención.","Quand il parle de gestion financière, il est clair et méthodique, et tout le monde l'écoute attentivement."],["L7-4155","头衔","tóuxián","N","title; rank","título; rango","titre; rang","他名片上印着好几个头衔。","tā míng piàn shàng yìn zhe hǎo jǐ ge tóu xián","His business card is printed with several titles.","En su tarjeta de presentación figuran varios cargos.","Sa carte de visite porte plusieurs titres."],["L7-4156","头晕","tóuyūn","V","dizzy","mareado","étourdi","她坐车坐久了就会头晕。","tā zuò chē zuò jiǔ le jiù huì tóu yūn","She gets dizzy if she rides in a car for a long time.","Si va mucho tiempo en coche, se marea.","Elle a le vertige quand elle reste longtemps en voiture."],["L7-4157","投奔","tóubèn","V","to seek refuge with","refugiarse con; acogerse a","se réfugier auprès de","他大学毕业后去北京投奔了他的叔叔。","tā dà xué bì yè hòu qù běi jīng tóu bèn le tā de shū shu","After graduating from university, he went to Beijing to seek support from his uncle.","Al graduarse de la universidad, se fue a Pekín a refugiarse con su tío.","Après ses études universitaires, il est allé à Pékin se placer sous la protection de son oncle."],["L7-4158","投稿","tóugǎo","","to submit a manuscript","enviar un artículo","soumettre un article","她经常给杂志投稿，已经发表了十几篇文章。","tā jīng cháng gěi zá zhì tóu gǎo yǐ jīng fā biǎo le shí jǐ piān wén zhāng","She often submits articles to magazines and has published more than a dozen.","Con frecuencia envía colaboraciones a revistas y ya ha publicado más de diez artículos.","Elle envoie souvent des articles à des magazines et en a déjà publié une dizaine."],["L7-4159","投机","tóujī","Adj/V","to speculate; congenial","especular; afín","spéculer; en phase","他们俩一见面就聊得很投机。","tā men liǎ yí jiàn miàn jiù liáo de hěn tóu jī","The two of them hit it off as soon as they met.","Esos dos congeniaron desde que se conocieron.","Ces deux-là se sont tout de suite bien entendus dès leur première rencontre."],["L7-4160","投射","tóushè","V","to cast; to project","proyectar; lanzar","projeter; lancer","阳光透过树叶，投射在地面上。","yáng guāng tòu guò shù yè tóu shè zài dì miàn shàng","Sunlight passed through the leaves and was cast onto the ground.","La luz del sol atraviesa las hojas de los árboles y se proyecta en el suelo.","La lumière du soleil traverse les feuilles et se projette sur le sol."],["L7-4161","投身","tóushēn","V","to throw oneself into","entregarse a","se lancer dans","他大学毕业后投身于环保事业。","tā dà xué bì yè hòu tóu shēn yú huán bǎo shì yè","After graduating from university, he devoted himself to environmental protection.","Después de graduarse de la universidad, se dedicó a la causa de la protección del medio ambiente.","Après l'université, il s'est consacré à la protection de l'environnement."],["L7-4162","投降","tóuxiáng","V","to surrender","rendirse","se rendre","敌人走投无路，只好投降了。","dí rén zǒu tóu wú lù zhǐ hǎo tóu xiáng le","The enemy had nowhere left to go and had to surrender.","Al enemigo no le quedó otra salida y tuvo que rendirse.","L'ennemi, acculé, n'a eu d'autre choix que de se rendre."],["L7-4163","透彻","tòuchè","Adj","thorough; incisive","profundo; certero","approfondi; pénétrant","老师把这个问题讲得非常透彻。","lǎo shī bǎ zhè ge wèn tí jiǎng de fēi cháng tòu chè","The teacher explained this problem very thoroughly.","El profesor explicó este problema de forma muy clara y completa.","Le professeur a expliqué ce problème de façon très approfondie."],["L7-4164","透过","tòuguò","V","through; by means of","a través de; mediante","à travers; au moyen de","阳光透过树叶，投射在地面上。","yáng guāng tòu guò shù yè tóu shè zài dì miàn shàng","Sunlight passed through the leaves and was cast onto the ground.","La luz del sol atraviesa las hojas de los árboles y se proyecta en el suelo.","La lumière du soleil traverse les feuilles et se projette sur le sol."],["L7-4165","透气","tòuqì","","to breathe; to ventilate","airear; ser transpirable","aérer; respirer","这种布料很透气，夏天穿很凉快。","zhè zhǒng bù liào hěn tòu qì xià tiān chuān hěn liáng kuai","This fabric breathes well and is cool to wear in summer.","Esta tela es muy transpirable y en verano resulta fresca.","Ce tissu respire très bien, on est au frais avec en été."],["L7-4166","透支","tòuzhī","V","to overdraw; to overspend","sobregirar; gastar en exceso","être à découvert; dépenser en excès","他这个月信用卡又透支了。","tā zhè ge yuè xìn yòng kǎ yòu tòu zhī le","He overdrew his credit card again this month.","Este mes volvió a sobregirar su tarjeta de crédito.","Ce mois-ci, il a encore dépassé le plafond de sa carte de crédit."],["L7-4167","凸","tū","Adj","convex; protruding","convexo; saliente","convexe; saillant","这面镜子中间是凸的，照出来的人特别小。","zhè miàn jìng zi zhōng jiān shì tū de zhào chū lái de rén tè bié xiǎo","This mirror bulges in the middle, so people reflected in it look very small.","Este espejo es convexo en el centro, así que las personas se ven muy pequeñas en él.","Ce miroir est bombé au milieu, les gens qui s'y reflètent paraissent donc très petits."],["L7-4168","凸显","tūxiǎn","V","to highlight; to stand out","resaltar; destacar","mettre en relief; faire ressortir","这项技术的普及降低了使用门槛，也使信息安全问题更加凸显。","zhè xiàng jì shù de pǔ jí jiàng dī le shǐ yòng mén kǎn yě shǐ xìn xī ān quán wèn tí gèng jiā tū xiǎn","The spread of this technology has lowered the barrier to use while making information security issues more prominent.","La difusión de esta tecnología ha reducido las barreras de uso, pero también ha hecho más evidentes los problemas de seguridad de la información.","La diffusion de cette technologie a abaissé le seuil d'utilisation, mais a aussi mis davantage en évidence les problèmes de sécurité de l'information."],["L7-4169","秃","tū","Adj","bald; blunt","calvo; romo","chauve; émoussé","他才三十岁，头顶就有点儿秃了。","tā cái sān shí suì tóu dǐng jiù yǒu diǎnr tū le","He is only thirty, but he's already a little bald on top.","Solo tiene treinta años y ya se le está quedando calva la coronilla.","Il n'a que trente ans et son crâne se dégarnit déjà un peu."],["L7-4170","突发","tūfā","V","to break out suddenly","surgir de repente","survenir brusquement","遇到突发情况，大家不要慌张。","yù dào tū fā qíng kuàng dà jiā bú yào huāng zhāng","When an emergency occurs, don't panic.","Ante una situación imprevista, que nadie se alarme.","En cas de situation imprévue, que personne ne panique."],["L7-4171","突击","tūjī","V","to assault; crash effort","asaltar; esfuerzo intensivo","donner l'assaut; effort intensif","警察在凌晨对这个地方发起了突击。","jǐng chá zài líng chén duì zhè ge dì fang fā qǐ le tū jī","The police launched a raid on the place in the early morning.","La policía realizó una redada en el lugar de madrugada.","La police a effectué une descente dans cet endroit au petit matin."],["L7-4172","突破口","tūpòkǒu","N","breakthrough point","punto de ruptura; brecha","point de percée; brèche","警方终于找到了这个案子的突破口。","jǐng fāng zhōng yú zhǎo dào le zhè ge àn zi de tū pò kǒu","The police finally found a way to make progress in the case.","La policía por fin encontró un punto de avance en este caso.","La police a enfin trouvé une piste pour faire avancer cette affaire."],["L7-4173","突如其来","tūrú-qílái","","suddenly; out of the blue","de repente; inesperadamente","soudain; à l'improviste","面对突如其来的火灾，消防员沉着地指挥大家撤离。","miàn duì tū rú qí lái de huǒ zāi xiāo fáng yuán chén zhuó de zhǐ huī dà jiā chè lí","Faced with the sudden fire, the firefighter calmly directed everyone to evacuate.","Ante el incendio repentino, el bombero dirigió con serenidad la evacuación de todos.","Face à l'incendie soudain, le pompier a dirigé calmement l'évacuation de tout le monde."],["L7-4174","图表","túbiǎo","N","chart; diagram","gráfico; diagrama","graphique; diagramme","用图表来说明这些数据更直观。","yòng tú biǎo lái shuō míng zhè xiē shù jù gèng zhí guān","Using charts to present these data is more intuitive.","Es más intuitivo explicar estos datos con gráficos.","Il est plus parlant d'illustrer ces données à l'aide de graphiques."],["L7-4175","图像","túxiàng","N","image; picture","imagen","image","这台电视的图像非常清晰。","zhè tái diàn shì de tú xiàng fēi cháng qīng xī","The picture on this television is very clear.","La imagen de este televisor es muy nítida.","L'image de ce téléviseur est très nette."],["L7-4176","图形","túxíng","N","figure; graphic","figura; gráfico","figure; graphique","孩子们用彩纸剪出了各种各样的图形。","hái zi men yòng cǎi zhǐ jiǎn chū le gè zhǒng gè yàng de tú xíng","The children cut all kinds of shapes out of colored paper.","Los niños recortaron figuras de todo tipo con papel de colores.","Les enfants ont découpé toutes sortes de formes dans du papier de couleur."],["L7-4177","图纸","túzhǐ","N","blueprint; drawing","plano; dibujo técnico","plan; dessin technique","工人们正在按照图纸施工。","gōng rén men zhèng zài àn zhào tú zhǐ shī gōng","The workers are building according to the blueprints.","Los obreros están construyendo según los planos.","Les ouvriers sont en train de construire d'après les plans."],["L7-4178","徒步","túbù","Adv","on foot","a pie","à pied","他们打算徒步穿越这片沙漠。","tā men dǎ suàn tú bù chuān yuè zhè piàn shā mò","They plan to cross this desert on foot.","Piensan cruzar este desierto a pie.","Ils comptent traverser ce désert à pied."],["L7-4179","涂","tú","V","to apply (paint); to smear","aplicar; untar","appliquer; enduire","她在脸上涂了一层防晒霜。","tā zài liǎn shàng tú le yì céng fáng shài shuāng","She applied a layer of sunscreen to her face.","Se aplicó una capa de protector solar en la cara.","Elle s'est appliqué une couche de crème solaire sur le visage."],["L7-4180","屠杀","túshā","V","to massacre","masacrar","massacrer","这座纪念馆记录了战争中敌人屠杀平民的历史。","zhè zuò jì niàn guǎn jì lù le zhàn zhēng zhōng dí rén tú shā píng mín de lì shǐ","This memorial hall records the history of the enemy massacring civilians during the war.","Este museo conmemorativo documenta la historia de la masacre de civiles por el enemigo durante la guerra.","Ce mémorial retrace l'histoire des massacres de civils commis par l'ennemi pendant la guerre."],["L7-4181","土匪","tǔfěi","N","bandit","bandido","bandit","从前这一带山里常有土匪出没。","cóng qián zhè yí dài shān lǐ cháng yǒu tǔ fěi chū mò","In the past, bandits often roamed the mountains around here.","Antiguamente, en las montañas de esta zona solían merodear bandidos.","Autrefois, des bandits rôdaient souvent dans les montagnes de la région."],["L7-4182","土壤","tǔrǎng","N","soil","suelo; tierra","sol; terre","这里的土壤很肥沃，适合种水稻。","zhè lǐ de tǔ rǎng hěn féi wò shì hé zhòng shuǐ dào","The soil here is very fertile and suitable for growing rice.","El suelo de aquí es muy fértil y propicio para cultivar arroz.","Le sol ici est très fertile et convient bien à la culture du riz."],["L7-4183","土生土长","tǔshēng-tǔzhǎng","","locally born and bred","nacido y criado en el lugar","du terroir; autochtone","他是土生土长的上海人，对这里非常熟悉。","tā shì tǔ shēng tǔ zhǎng de shàng hǎi rén duì zhè lǐ fēi cháng shú xī","He was born and raised in Shanghai and knows it very well.","Es shanghainés de pura cepa, nacido y criado allí, y conoce muy bien el lugar.","C'est un vrai Shanghaïen, né et élevé ici, et il connaît très bien l'endroit."],["L7-4184","团伙","tuánhuǒ","N","gang; accomplice","banda; cómplice","bande; complice","警方抓获了一个专门偷汽车的团伙。","jǐng fāng zhuā huò le yí ge zhuān mén tōu qì chē de tuán huǒ","The police caught a criminal gang that specialized in stealing cars.","La policía capturó a una banda especializada en robar autos.","La police a arrêté une bande spécialisée dans le vol de voitures."],["L7-4185","团聚","tuánjù","V","to reunite","reunirse","se retrouver; se réunir","每到春节前后，成千上万的人乘火车回家团聚。","měi dào chūn jié qián hòu chéng qiān shàng wàn de rén chéng huǒ chē huí jiā tuán jù","Around the Spring Festival every year, tens of thousands of people take the train home for family reunions.","Cada año, alrededor del Año Nuevo Chino, miles y miles de personas toman el tren para volver a casa y reunirse con sus familias.","Chaque année, autour de la fête du Printemps, des milliers de gens prennent le train pour rentrer chez eux retrouver leur famille."],["L7-4186","团员","tuányuán","N","member","miembro","membre","这个合唱团的团员大多是退休老人。","zhè ge hé chàng tuán de tuán yuán dà duō shì tuì xiū lǎo rén","Most of the members of this choir are retired seniors.","La mayoría de los miembros de este coro son personas mayores jubiladas.","La plupart des membres de cette chorale sont des retraités."],["L7-4187","团圆","tuányuán","V","to have a reunion","reunirse (la familia)","se réunir en famille","中秋节是一家人团圆的日子。","zhōng qiū jié shì yì jiā rén tuán yuán de rì zi","The Mid-Autumn Festival is a day for families to be together.","El Festival del Medio Otoño es el día en que la familia se reúne.","La fête de la Mi-automne est le jour où les familles se retrouvent."],["L7-4188","推测","tuīcè","V","to speculate; to conjecture","conjeturar; suponer","conjecturer; supposer","根据现场的情况，警察推测小偷是从窗户进来的。","gēn jù xiàn chǎng de qíng kuàng jǐng chá tuī cè xiǎo tōu shì cóng chuāng hu jìn lái de","Based on the scene, the police guessed that the thief came in through the window.","Según la situación en el lugar, la policía supuso que el ladrón había entrado por la ventana.","D'après l'état des lieux, la police a supposé que le voleur était entré par la fenêtre."],["L7-4189","推辞","tuīcí","V","to decline (politely)","declinar; rehusar","décliner; refuser poliment","朋友请他帮忙，他不好意思推辞。","péng you qǐng tā bāng máng tā bù hǎo yì si tuī cí","When his friend asked him for help, he was too embarrassed to decline.","Cuando su amigo le pidió ayuda, le dio pena negarse.","Quand son ami lui a demandé de l'aide, il n'a pas osé refuser."],["L7-4190","推断","tuīduàn","V","to infer; to deduce","inferir; deducir","inférer; déduire","面对相互矛盾的证据，研究者应当审慎推断，而非仓促下定论。","miàn duì xiāng hù máo dùn de zhèng jù yán jiū zhě yīng dāng shěn shèn tuī duàn ér fēi cāng cù xià dìng lùn","When faced with conflicting evidence, researchers should draw cautious inferences rather than rush to a definitive conclusion.","Ante pruebas contradictorias, los investigadores deben inferir con cautela en lugar de sacar conclusiones apresuradas.","Face à des preuves contradictoires, les chercheurs doivent raisonner avec prudence plutôt que de tirer des conclusions hâtives."],["L7-4191","推翻","tuīfān","","to overthrow","derrocar","renverser","新的证据推翻了原来的结论。","xīn de zhèng jù tuī fān le yuán lái de jié lùn","The new evidence overturned the original conclusion.","Las nuevas pruebas echaron por tierra la conclusión original.","Les nouvelles preuves ont renversé la conclusion initiale."],["L7-4192","推荐","tuījiàn","V","to recommend","recomendar","recommander","你能给我推荐几本适合初学者的书吗？","nǐ néng gěi wǒ tuī jiàn jǐ běn shì hé chū xué zhě de shū ma","Can you recommend a few books suitable for beginners?","¿Me puedes recomendar algunos libros adecuados para principiantes?","Peux-tu me recommander quelques livres adaptés aux débutants ?"],["L7-4193","推理","tuīlǐ","V","reasoning; to infer","razonamiento; inferir","raisonnement; déduire","孩子遇到难题时，老师没有直接给出答案，而是鼓励他举例说明自己的推理过程。","hái zi yù dào nán tí shí lǎo shī méi yǒu zhí jiē gěi chū dá àn ér shì gǔ lì tā jǔ lì shuō míng zì jǐ de tuī lǐ guò chéng","When the child met a difficult problem, the teacher did not give the answer directly but encouraged him to illustrate his reasoning with examples.","Cuando el niño se topó con un problema difícil, el maestro no le dio la respuesta directamente, sino que lo animó a explicar su razonamiento con ejemplos.","Quand l'enfant a rencontré un problème difficile, le professeur ne lui a pas donné directement la réponse, mais l'a encouragé à illustrer son raisonnement par des exemples."],["L7-4194","推敲","tuīqiāo","V","to ponder; to deliberate","sopesar; reflexionar","peser; réfléchir","这篇演讲稿他反复推敲了好几遍。","zhè piān yǎn jiǎng gǎo tā fǎn fù tuī qiāo le hǎo jǐ biàn","He went over this speech carefully several times.","Revisó este discurso minuciosamente varias veces.","Il a relu ce discours en le pesant avec soin à plusieurs reprises."],["L7-4195","推算","tuīsuàn","V","to calculate; to extrapolate","calcular; deducir","calculer; extrapoler","根据他的年龄推算，他应该是七十年代出生的。","gēn jù tā de nián líng tuī suàn tā yīng gāi shì qī shí nián dài chū shēng de","Reckoning from his age, he should have been born in the seventies.","Calculando por su edad, debió de nacer en los años setenta.","D'après son âge, il doit être né dans les années soixante-dix."],["L7-4196","推卸","tuīxiè","V","to shirk (responsibility)","eludir (responsabilidad)","se dérober; esquiver","我提出这个建议的本意，是减轻大家的负担，并非推卸责任。","wǒ tí chū zhè ge jiàn yì de běn yì shì jiǎn qīng dà jiā de fù dān bìng fēi tuī xiè zé rèn","My original intention in making this suggestion was to reduce everyone's burden, not to evade responsibility.","Mi intención original al hacer esta propuesta era aliviar la carga de todos, no eludir mi responsabilidad.","En faisant cette proposition, mon intention première était d'alléger la charge de tous, et non de me défausser de mes responsabilités."],["L7-4197","推选","tuīxuǎn","V","to elect","elegir","élire","大家推选他当我们班的班长。","dà jiā tuī xuǎn tā dāng wǒ men bān de bān zhǎng","Everyone chose him to be our class monitor.","Todos lo eligieron como delegado de nuestra clase.","Tout le monde l'a choisi comme délégué de notre classe."],["L7-4198","推移","tuīyí","V","to pass; to evolve (over time)","transcurrir; evolucionar","s'écouler; évoluer","随着时间的推移，她渐渐适应了新的环境。","suí zhe shí jiān de tuī yí tā jiàn jiàn shì yìng le xīn de huán jìng","As time went by, she gradually adapted to the new environment.","Con el paso del tiempo, ella se fue adaptando poco a poco al nuevo entorno.","Avec le temps, elle s'est peu à peu habituée à son nouvel environnement."],["L7-4199","颓废","tuífèi","Adj","decadent; dejected","decadente; abatido","décadent; abattu","失业以后，他变得很颓废，整天待在家里。","shī yè yǐ hòu tā biàn de hěn tuí fèi zhěng tiān dāi zài jiā lǐ","After losing his job, he became very dispirited and stayed home all day.","Tras perder el empleo, se volvió muy abatido y se pasaba todo el día en casa.","Après avoir perdu son emploi, il est devenu très abattu et reste chez lui toute la journée."],["L7-4200","退回","tuìhuí","V","to send back; to return","devolver; regresar","renvoyer; retourner","这封信因为地址不对被退回来了。","zhè fēng xìn yīn wèi dì zhǐ bú duì bèi tuì huí lái le","This letter was sent back because the address was wrong.","Esta carta fue devuelta porque la dirección era incorrecta.","Cette lettre a été renvoyée parce que l'adresse était erronée."],["L7-4201","退却","tuìquè","V","to retreat; to shrink back","retroceder; replegarse","reculer; battre en retraite","面对困难，我们不能退却。","miàn duì kùn nan wǒ men bù néng tuì què","In the face of difficulties, we cannot back down.","Ante las dificultades, no podemos retroceder.","Face aux difficultés, nous ne devons pas reculer."],["L7-4202","退让","tuìràng","V","to yield; to back down","ceder; echarse atrás","céder; reculer","在原则问题上，我们绝不能退让。","zài yuán zé wèn tí shàng wǒ men jué bù néng tuì ràng","On matters of principle, we must never give way.","En cuestiones de principios, jamás podemos ceder.","Sur les questions de principe, nous ne pouvons jamais céder."],["L7-4203","退缩","tuìsuō","V","to cower; to shrink back","encogerse; retroceder","se recroqueviller; reculer","遇到挫折时，他从来没有退缩过。","yù dào cuò zhé shí tā cóng lái méi yǒu tuì suō guo","He has never shrunk back when facing setbacks.","Cuando se ha topado con reveses, nunca se ha echado atrás.","Face aux revers, il n'a jamais reculé."],["L7-4204","退休金","tuìxiūjīn","N","pension","pensión de jubilación","pension de retraite","爷爷每个月都能领到一笔退休金。","yé ye měi ge yuè dōu néng lǐng dào yì bǐ tuì xiū jīn","Grandpa receives a pension every month.","El abuelo recibe una pensión de jubilación todos los meses.","Grand-père touche une pension de retraite chaque mois."],["L7-4205","退学","tuìxué","","to drop out of school","abandonar los estudios","abandonner l'école","他因为家里困难，不得不退学去打工。","tā yīn wèi jiā lǐ kùn nan bù dé bú tuì xué qù dǎ gōng","Because of difficulties at home, he had to drop out of school to work.","Por las dificultades de su familia, tuvo que dejar la escuela para ir a trabajar.","À cause des difficultés de sa famille, il a dû quitter l'école pour aller travailler."],["L7-4206","退役","tuìyì","","to retire; to be decommissioned","retirarse; dar de baja","prendre sa retraite; être retiré du service","这位著名的运动员宣布退役了。","zhè wèi zhù míng de yùn dòng yuán xuān bù tuì yì le","This famous athlete announced his retirement.","Este famoso deportista anunció su retiro.","Ce célèbre sportif a annoncé sa retraite sportive."],["L7-4207","屯","tún","N","to station; to store; village","acantonar; almacenar; aldea","stationner; stocker; village","村里人习惯在秋天屯些粮食过冬。","cūn lǐ rén xí guàn zài qiū tiān tún xiē liáng shi guò dōng","The villagers usually store up some grain in autumn for the winter.","La gente del pueblo acostumbra almacenar algo de grano en otoño para el invierno.","Au village, on a l'habitude de faire des réserves de grain en automne pour passer l'hiver."],["L7-4208","托付","tuōfù","V","to entrust","confiar; encomendar","confier","他出国前把家里的事都托付给了弟弟。","tā chū guó qián bǎ jiā lǐ de shì dōu tuō fù gěi le dì di","Before going abroad, he entrusted all the family affairs to his younger brother.","Antes de irse al extranjero, encomendó todos los asuntos de la casa a su hermano menor.","Avant de partir à l'étranger, il a confié toutes les affaires de la famille à son petit frère."],["L7-4209","拖累","tuōlěi","V","to burden; to implicate","ser una carga para; implicar","encombrer; impliquer","他不想因为自己的病拖累家人。","tā bù xiǎng yīn wèi zì jǐ de bìng tuō lěi jiā rén","He doesn't want his illness to be a burden on his family.","No quiere ser una carga para su familia por su enfermedad.","Il ne veut pas que sa maladie soit un fardeau pour sa famille."],["L7-4210","拖欠","tuōqiàn","V","to be in arrears","estar en mora; atrasarse en el pago","être en retard de paiement","这家公司被前员工控告拖欠工资。","zhè jiā gōng sī bèi qián yuán gōng kòng gào tuō qiàn gōng zī","Former employees have filed a complaint against the company over unpaid wages.","Esta empresa fue demandada por antiguos empleados por adeudar salarios.","Cette entreprise a été poursuivie par d'anciens employés pour retard de paiement des salaires."],["L7-4211","拖延","tuōyán","V","to delay; to procrastinate","retrasar; dilatar","retarder; procrastiner","这件事不能再拖延了，必须今天解决。","zhè jiàn shì bù néng zài tuō yán le bì xū jīn tiān jiě jué","This matter can't be put off any longer; it must be resolved today.","Este asunto ya no se puede aplazar más; hay que resolverlo hoy.","Cette affaire ne peut plus être repoussée, elle doit être réglée aujourd'hui."],["L7-4212","脱节","tuōjié","","to come apart; to be disconnected","desconectarse; desfasarse","se disjoindre; être déconnecté","学校教的知识和社会需要有些脱节。","xué xiào jiāo de zhī shi hé shè huì xū yào yǒu xiē tuō jié","What schools teach is somewhat out of step with society's needs.","Lo que se enseña en la escuela está algo desconectado de las necesidades de la sociedad.","Ce qu'on enseigne à l'école est un peu déconnecté des besoins de la société."],["L7-4213","脱口而出","tuōkǒu'érchū","","to blurt out","soltar sin pensar","lâcher sans réfléchir","他一紧张，那个秘密就脱口而出了。","tā yì jǐn zhāng nà ge mì mì jiù tuō kǒu ér chū le","When he became nervous, he blurted out the secret.","En cuanto se puso nervioso, se le escapó el secreto.","Dès qu'il a été nerveux, le secret lui a échappé."],["L7-4214","脱落","tuōluò","V","to fall off; to come off","desprenderse; caerse","tomber; se détacher","这面墙上的油漆已经开始脱落了。","zhè miàn qiáng shàng de yóu qī yǐ jīng kāi shǐ tuō luò le","The paint on this wall has started to peel off.","La pintura de esta pared ya empezó a descascararse.","La peinture de ce mur commence déjà à s'écailler."],["L7-4215","脱身","tuōshēn","","to get away; to free oneself","librarse; zafarse","se libérer; s'échapper","会议开个不停，他一直没办法脱身。","huì yì kāi gè bù tíng tā yì zhí méi bàn fǎ tuō shēn","The meeting went on and on, and he couldn't get away.","La reunión no terminaba nunca y no había forma de que pudiera escabullirse.","La réunion n'en finissait pas et il n'arrivait pas à s'éclipser."],["L7-4216","脱颖而出","tuōyǐng'érchū","","to stand out; to emerge","destacar; sobresalir","se distinguer; émerger","她在几百名选手中脱颖而出，获得了冠军。","tā zài jǐ bǎi míng xuǎn shǒu zhōng tuō yǐng ér chū huò dé le guàn jūn","She stood out among hundreds of contestants and won the championship.","Se destacó entre cientos de participantes y ganó el campeonato.","Elle s'est démarquée parmi des centaines de concurrents et a remporté le championnat."],["L7-4217","驮","tuó","V","to carry on the back","llevar a lomos","porter sur le dos","小毛驴驮着两袋粮食慢慢地往山上走。","xiǎo máo lǘ tuó zhe liǎng dài liáng shi màn màn de wǎng shān shàng zǒu","The little donkey slowly walked up the mountain carrying two sacks of grain.","El burrito subía lentamente la montaña cargando dos sacos de grano.","Le petit âne montait lentement la montagne, chargé de deux sacs de grain."],["L7-4218","妥","tuǒ","Adj","suitable; settled","adecuado; resuelto","convenable; réglé","这件事你看这样处理妥不妥？","zhè jiàn shì nǐ kàn zhè yàng chǔ lǐ tuǒ bu tuǒ","Do you think it's appropriate to handle this matter like this?","¿Te parece bien que se resuelva este asunto de esta manera?","Que penses-tu de régler cette affaire de cette façon ?"],["L7-4219","妥当","tuǒdàng","Adj","appropriate; ready","apropiado; listo","approprié; prêt","这件事我已经安排妥当了，你放心吧。","zhè jiàn shì wǒ yǐ jīng ān pái tuǒ dàng le nǐ fàng xīn ba","I've already made proper arrangements for this, so don't worry.","Ya dejé este asunto bien arreglado, quédate tranquilo.","J'ai déjà tout arrangé pour cette affaire, ne t'inquiète pas."],["L7-4220","妥善","tuǒshàn","Adj","appropriate; proper","adecuado; debido","approprié; adéquat","请妥善保存购物凭证，以便商品出现瑕疵时申请退换。","qǐng tuǒ shàn bǎo cún gòu wù píng zhèng yǐ biàn shāng pǐn chū xiàn xiá cī shí shēn qǐng tuì huàn","Please keep your proof of purchase so that you can request a return or exchange if the product has a defect.","Conserve bien su comprobante de compra para poder solicitar un cambio o devolución si el producto presenta algún defecto.","Veuillez conserver soigneusement votre justificatif d'achat afin de pouvoir demander un retour ou un échange en cas de défaut du produit."],["L7-4221","妥协","tuǒxié","V","to compromise","transigir; compromiso","transiger; compromis","经过几轮谈判，双方终于达成了妥协。","jīng guò jǐ lún tán pàn shuāng fāng zhōng yú dá chéng le tuǒ xié","After several rounds of negotiations, the two sides finally reached a compromise.","Tras varias rondas de negociación, ambas partes por fin llegaron a un acuerdo.","Après plusieurs rounds de négociations, les deux parties sont enfin parvenues à un compromis."],["L7-4222","拓宽","tuòkuān","V","to widen; to broaden","ensanchar; ampliar","élargir; agrandir","这条马路明年要拓宽成六车道。","zhè tiáo mǎ lù míng nián yào tuò kuān chéng liù chē dào","This road will be widened to six lanes next year.","El año que viene van a ensanchar esta calle a seis carriles.","L'année prochaine, cette route sera élargie à six voies."],["L7-4223","拓展","tuòzhǎn","V","to expand; to extend","expandir; ampliar","étendre; développer","公司正在积极拓展海外市场。","gōng sī zhèng zài jī jí tuò zhǎn hǎi wài shì chǎng","The company is actively expanding into overseas markets.","La empresa está expandiendo activamente su presencia en los mercados extranjeros.","L'entreprise développe activement ses activités sur les marchés étrangers."],["L7-4224","唾液","tuòyè","N","saliva","saliva","salive","唾液可以帮助我们消化食物。","tuò yè kě yǐ bāng zhù wǒ men xiāo huà shí wù","Saliva helps us digest food.","La saliva nos ayuda a digerir los alimentos.","La salive nous aide à digérer les aliments."],["L7-4225","挖掘","wājué","V","to excavate; to dig up","excavar; sacar a la luz","creuser; mettre au jour","考古学家在这里挖掘出了很多古代文物。","kǎo gǔ xué jiā zài zhè lǐ wā jué chū le hěn duō gǔ dài wén wù","Archaeologists have excavated many ancient relics here.","Los arqueólogos han desenterrado aquí muchas reliquias antiguas.","Les archéologues ont mis au jour ici de nombreux objets antiques."],["L7-4226","挖苦","wāku","V","to make sarcastic remarks","hacer comentarios sarcásticos","faire des remarques sarcastiques","他总爱挖苦别人，所以朋友不多。","tā zǒng ài wā ku bié rén suǒ yǐ péng you bù duō","He always likes to make sarcastic remarks about others, so he doesn't have many friends.","Siempre le gusta burlarse de los demás con sarcasmo, por eso tiene pocos amigos.","Il adore se moquer des autres avec sarcasme, c'est pourquoi il n'a pas beaucoup d'amis."],["L7-4227","瓦","wǎ","N","roof tile; watt","teja; vatio","tuile; watt","大风把屋顶上的瓦吹掉了几片。","dà fēng bǎ wū dǐng shàng de wǎ chuī diào le jǐ piàn","The strong wind blew several tiles off the roof.","El fuerte viento tiró algunas tejas del techo.","Le vent fort a fait tomber plusieurs tuiles du toit."],["L7-4228","歪","wāi","Adj","crooked; askew","torcido; ladeado","de travers; penché","你的领带系歪了，我帮你弄一下。","nǐ de lǐng dài xì wāi le wǒ bāng nǐ nòng yí xià","Your tie is crooked; let me fix it for you.","Tienes la corbata torcida, deja que te la arregle.","Ta cravate est de travers, laisse-moi te l'arranger."],["L7-4229","歪曲","wāiqū","V","to distort; to misrepresent","distorsionar; tergiversar","déformer; fausser","这篇报道歪曲了事实的真相。","zhè piān bào dào wāi qū le shì shí de zhēn xiàng","This report distorted the truth.","Este reportaje distorsionó la verdad de los hechos.","Ce reportage a déformé la vérité des faits."],["L7-4230","外表","wàibiǎo","N","appearance; exterior","apariencia; exterior","apparence; extérieur","找对象不光要看外表，更要看人品。","zhǎo duì xiàng bù guāng yào kàn wài biǎo gèng yào kàn rén pǐn","When looking for a partner, you should consider not just looks but even more their character.","Al buscar pareja, no solo hay que fijarse en el aspecto, sino sobre todo en el carácter.","Pour trouver un partenaire, il ne faut pas seulement regarder l'apparence, mais surtout le caractère."],["L7-4231","外公","wàigōng","N","maternal grandfather","abuelo materno","grand-père maternel","我小时候是外公带大的。","wǒ xiǎo shí hou shì wài gōng dài dà de","I was raised by my maternal grandfather when I was little.","De pequeño me crió mi abuelo materno.","Quand j'étais petit, j'ai été élevé par mon grand-père maternel."],["L7-4232","外行","wàiháng","Adj/N","layman; amateur","profano; aficionado","profane; amateur","我对装修完全是外行，还是请专家来吧。","wǒ duì zhuāng xiū wán quán shì wài háng hái shi qǐng zhuān jiā lái ba","I'm a complete layman when it comes to renovation, so let's hire an expert.","De remodelaciones no sé nada, mejor llamemos a un experto.","Je n'y connais rien en travaux de rénovation, mieux vaut faire appel à un expert."],["L7-4233","外号","wàihào","N","nickname","apodo","surnom","他个子很高，同学们给他起了个外号叫“长颈鹿”。","tā gè zi hěn gāo tóng xué men gěi tā qǐ le gè wài hào jiào cháng jǐng lù","He is very tall, so his classmates gave him the nickname \"Giraffe\".","Es muy alto, así que sus compañeros le pusieron el apodo de «jirafa».","Il est très grand, alors ses camarades l'ont surnommé « la girafe »."],["L7-4234","外籍","wàijí","N","foreign (nationality)","extranjero (de nacionalidad)","étranger (de nationalité)","这所学校请了好几位外籍老师。","zhè suǒ xué xiào qǐng le hǎo jǐ wèi wài jí lǎo shī","This school has hired several foreign teachers.","Esta escuela ha contratado a varios profesores extranjeros.","Cette école a embauché plusieurs professeurs étrangers."],["L7-4235","外贸","wàimào","N","foreign trade","comercio exterior","commerce extérieur","她大学毕业后进了一家外贸公司。","tā dà xué bì yè hòu jìn le yì jiā wài mào gōng sī","After graduating from university, she joined a foreign trade company.","Al graduarse de la universidad, entró a trabajar en una empresa de comercio exterior.","Après l'université, elle est entrée dans une entreprise de commerce extérieur."],["L7-4236","外貌","wàimào","N","appearance; looks","aspecto; apariencia","apparence; physionomie","这对双胞胎外貌很像，性格却完全不同。","zhè duì shuāng bāo tāi wài mào hěn xiàng xìng gé què wán quán bù tóng","These twins look very alike, but their personalities are completely different.","Estos gemelos se parecen mucho físicamente, pero tienen personalidades totalmente distintas.","Ces jumeaux se ressemblent beaucoup physiquement, mais ont des caractères complètement différents."],["L7-4237","外婆","wàipó","N","maternal grandmother","abuela materna","grand-mère maternelle","每年暑假我都去乡下看外婆。","měi nián shǔ jià wǒ dōu qù xiāng xia kàn wài pó","Every summer vacation I go to the countryside to see my maternal grandmother.","Todos los años, en las vacaciones de verano, voy al campo a ver a mi abuela materna.","Chaque année, pendant les vacances d'été, je vais à la campagne voir ma grand-mère maternelle."],["L7-4238","外企","wàiqǐ","N","foreign company","empresa extranjera","entreprise étrangère","他在一家外企工作，经常要出差。","tā zài yì jiā wài qǐ gōng zuò jīng cháng yào chū chāi","He works for a foreign company and often has to travel on business.","Trabaja en una empresa extranjera y con frecuencia tiene que viajar por trabajo.","Il travaille dans une entreprise étrangère et doit souvent partir en déplacement."],["L7-4239","外星人","wàixīngrén","N","alien; extraterrestrial","extraterrestre","extraterrestre","你相信宇宙中真的有外星人吗？","nǐ xiāng xìn yǔ zhòu zhōng zhēn de yǒu wài xīng rén ma","Do you believe there really are aliens in the universe?","¿Crees que realmente existen extraterrestres en el universo?","Crois-tu qu'il existe vraiment des extraterrestres dans l'univers ?"],["L7-4240","外形","wàixíng","N","shape; outward form","forma; apariencia externa","forme; aspect extérieur","这辆汽车的外形设计很时尚。","zhè liàng qì chē de wài xíng shè jì hěn shí shàng","The exterior design of this car is very stylish.","El diseño exterior de este automóvil es muy moderno.","Le design extérieur de cette voiture est très branché."],["L7-4241","外援","wàiyuán","N","foreign aid; foreign player","ayuda exterior; jugador extranjero","aide extérieure; joueur étranger","这支球队今年请了两名外援。","zhè zhī qiú duì jīn nián qǐng le liǎng míng wài yuán","This team has signed two foreign players this year.","Este equipo fichó este año a dos jugadores extranjeros.","Cette équipe a recruté deux joueurs étrangers cette année."],["L7-4242","丸","wán","N/M","pill; ball","píldora; bolita","pilule; boulette","这种中药每次吃两丸，一天吃三次。","zhè zhǒng zhōng yào měi cì chī liǎng wán yì tiān chī sān cì","Take two pills of this Chinese medicine each time, three times a day.","De esta medicina china se toman dos pastillas cada vez, tres veces al día.","Ce médicament chinois se prend à raison de deux pilules à la fois, trois fois par jour."],["L7-4243","完备","wánbèi","Adj","complete; flawless","completo; impecable","complet; irréprochable","这家医院的设备非常完备。","zhè jiā yī yuàn de shè bèi fēi cháng wán bèi","This hospital is very well equipped.","Este hospital cuenta con un equipamiento muy completo.","Cet hôpital est très bien équipé."],["L7-4244","完毕","wánbì","V","to finish; to complete","terminar; concluir","finir; achever","检查完毕以后，医生让他回家休息。","jiǎn chá wán bì yǐ hòu yī shēng ràng tā huí jiā xiū xi","After the examination was finished, the doctor told him to go home and rest.","Terminado el examen, el médico le dijo que se fuera a casa a descansar.","Une fois l'examen terminé, le médecin lui a dit de rentrer se reposer."],["L7-4245","完蛋","wándàn","","to be done for","estar acabado","être fichu","要是明天再交不上报告，我就完蛋了。","yào shi míng tiān zài jiāo bú shàng bào gào wǒ jiù wán dàn le","If I can't hand in the report tomorrow either, I'm done for.","Si mañana tampoco puedo entregar el informe, estoy acabado.","Si je ne rends pas le rapport demain non plus, je suis fichu."],["L7-4246","完好","wánhǎo","Adj","intact; in good condition","intacto; en buen estado","intact; en bon état","地震过后，这座老房子居然保存得很完好。","dì zhèn guò hòu zhè zuò lǎo fáng zi jū rán bǎo cún de hěn wán hǎo","After the earthquake, this old house was surprisingly well preserved and intact.","Después del terremoto, esta casa antigua se conservó sorprendentemente intacta.","Après le séisme, cette vieille maison s'est étonnamment bien conservée."],["L7-4247","玩耍","wánshuǎ","V","to play","jugar","jouer","放假了，孩子们在海边尽情地玩耍。","fàng jià le hái zi men zài hǎi biān jìn qíng de wán shuǎ","The holiday has begun, and the children are playing to their hearts' content by the sea.","Ya es vacaciones y los niños juegan a sus anchas junto al mar.","Les vacances ont commencé et les enfants jouent à cœur joie au bord de la mer."],["L7-4248","玩意儿","wányìr","N","thing; gadget; trick","cosa; chisme; truco","truc; machin; tour","这是什么新玩意儿？我从来没见过。","zhè shì shén me xīn wán yìr wǒ cóng lái méi jiàn guo","What is this new gadget? I've never seen it before.","¿Qué es este nuevo cacharro? Nunca lo había visto.","C'est quoi, ce nouveau machin ? Je n'en ai jamais vu."],["L7-4249","顽固","wángù","Adj","stubborn","terco; obstinado","têtu; obstiné","老人很顽固，谁的劝告都不听。","lǎo rén hěn wán gù shéi de quàn gào dōu bù tīng","The old man is very stubborn and won't listen to anyone's advice.","El anciano es muy terco y no escucha los consejos de nadie.","Le vieil homme est très têtu et n'écoute les conseils de personne."],["L7-4250","挽","wǎn","V","to pull; to roll up; to coil","tirar de; arremangar; enrollar","tirer; retrousser; enrouler","她挽着妈妈的胳膊在公园里散步。","tā wǎn zhe mā ma de gē bo zài gōng yuán lǐ sàn bù","She walked in the park arm in arm with her mother.","Paseaba por el parque del brazo de su mamá.","Elle se promenait dans le parc au bras de sa mère."],["L7-4251","挽回","wǎnhuí","V","to retrieve; to redeem","recuperar; enmendar","rattraper; redresser","事情发展到这个地步，已经很难挽回了。","shì qing fā zhǎn dào zhè ge dì bù yǐ jīng hěn nán wǎn huí le","Now that things have come to this point, it will be very hard to turn them around.","Ahora que las cosas han llegado a este punto, ya es muy difícil remediarlas.","Maintenant que les choses en sont arrivées là, il est devenu très difficile de les rattraper."],["L7-4252","挽救","wǎnjiù","V","to save; to rescue","salvar; rescatar","sauver; secourir","医生们尽了全力，终于挽救了他的生命。","yī shēng men jìn le quán lì zhōng yú wǎn jiù le tā de shēng mìng","The doctors did their utmost and finally saved his life.","Los médicos hicieron todo lo posible y por fin le salvaron la vida.","Les médecins ont tout fait et ont fini par lui sauver la vie."],["L7-4253","晚间","wǎnjiān","N","evening; night","tarde-noche; noche","soirée; nuit","晚间新闻每天九点开始播出。","wǎn jiān xīn wén měi tiān jiǔ diǎn kāi shǐ bō chū","The evening news starts at nine o'clock every day.","El noticiero de la noche empieza todos los días a las nueve.","Le journal du soir est diffusé tous les jours à vingt et une heures."],["L7-4254","晚年","wǎnnián","N","later years","últimos años de vida","dernières années","老人希望在家乡安度晚年。","lǎo rén xī wàng zài jiā xiāng ān dù wǎn nián","The old man hopes to spend his later years peacefully in his hometown.","El anciano espera pasar tranquilamente sus últimos años en su tierra natal.","Le vieil homme espère couler des jours paisibles dans sa ville natale pour ses vieux jours."],["L7-4255","晚期","wǎnqī","N","late stage; terminal","fase tardía; terminal","stade avancé; terminal","医生说他的病已经到了晚期。","yī shēng shuō tā de bìng yǐ jīng dào le wǎn qī","The doctor said his illness had already reached the late stage.","El médico dijo que su enfermedad ya había llegado a la fase terminal.","Le médecin a dit que sa maladie en était déjà au stade avancé."],["L7-4256","惋惜","wǎnxī","Adj","to regret; to feel it's a pity","lamentar; sentir pena","regretter; déplorer","他因为受伤错过了比赛，大家都很惋惜。","tā yīn wèi shòu shāng cuò guò le bǐ sài dà jiā dōu hěn wǎn xī","Everyone felt it was a great pity that he missed the competition because of an injury.","Todos lamentaron mucho que se perdiera la competencia por una lesión.","Tout le monde a regretté qu'il manque la compétition à cause d'une blessure."],["L7-4257","万分","wànfēn","Adv","extremely; very much","sumamente; muchísimo","extrêmement; infiniment","收到大家的礼物，她感动万分。","shōu dào dà jiā de lǐ wù tā gǎn dòng wàn fēn","She was extremely moved to receive everyone's gifts.","Al recibir los regalos de todos, se conmovió enormemente.","En recevant les cadeaux de tous, elle a été extrêmement émue."],["L7-4258","万古长青","wàngǔ-chángqīng","","to last forever","perdurar eternamente","rester éternellement vert","他们希望两国的友谊万古长青。","tā men xī wàng liǎng guó de yǒu yì wàn gǔ cháng qīng","They hope the friendship between the two countries will last forever.","Esperan que la amistad entre los dos países dure para siempre.","Ils espèrent que l'amitié entre les deux pays durera à jamais."],["L7-4259","万能","wànnéng","Adj","omnipotent; all-purpose","todopoderoso; multiuso","tout-puissant; universel","这种药并不是万能的，不能治疗所有疾病。","zhè zhǒng yào bìng bú shì wàn néng de bù néng zhì liáo suǒ yǒu jí bìng","This medicine is not a cure-all; it cannot treat every disease.","Esta medicina no es una panacea; no puede curar todas las enfermedades.","Ce médicament n'est pas miraculeux, il ne peut pas soigner toutes les maladies."],["L7-4260","万万","wànwàn","Adv","absolutely; by no means","en absoluto; de ningún modo","absolument; en aucun cas","这种话万万不能当着孩子的面说。","zhè zhǒng huà wàn wàn bù néng dāng zhe hái zi de miàn shuō","You absolutely must not say such things in front of the children.","Jamás se debe decir algo así delante de los niños.","On ne doit absolument pas dire de telles choses devant les enfants."],["L7-4261","万无一失","wànwú-yīshī","","foolproof; absolutely safe","infalible; completamente seguro","sans risque; infaillible","出发前他把行李又检查了一遍，确保万无一失。","chū fā qián tā bǎ xíng li yòu jiǎn chá le yí biàn què bǎo wàn wú yì shī","Before leaving, he checked his luggage once more to make sure nothing could go wrong.","Antes de salir, revisó el equipaje una vez más para asegurarse de que no fallara nada.","Avant de partir, il a vérifié ses bagages une fois de plus pour être sûr que rien ne cloche."],["L7-4262","汪洋","wāngyáng","Adj","vast expanse of water","vasta extensión de agua","vaste étendue d'eau","大雨下了三天，村子成了一片汪洋。","dà yǔ xià le sān tiān cūn zi chéng le yí piàn wāng yáng","After three days of heavy rain, the village became a vast expanse of water.","Después de tres días de lluvia torrencial, el pueblo quedó convertido en un mar de agua.","Après trois jours de pluie diluvienne, le village s'est transformé en une immense étendue d'eau."],["L7-4263","亡羊补牢","wángyáng-bǔláo","","better late than never; mend the pen","más vale tarde que nunca","mieux vaut tard que jamais","丢失部分文件后，他开始定期备份数据，也算是亡羊补牢。","diū shī bù fen wén jiàn hòu tā kāi shǐ dìng qī bèi fèn shù jù yě suàn shì wáng yáng bǔ láo","After losing some files, he started backing up his data regularly—a case of taking corrective action after a loss.","Tras perder algunos archivos, empezó a hacer copias de seguridad con regularidad; más vale tarde que nunca.","Après avoir perdu quelques fichiers, il a commencé à sauvegarder régulièrement ses données : mieux vaut tard que jamais."],["L7-4264","王国","wángguó","N","kingdom; realm","reino","royaume","这本童话讲的是一个神秘王国的故事。","zhè běn tóng huà jiǎng de shì yí ge shén mì wáng guó de gù shi","This fairy tale is about a mysterious kingdom.","Este cuento de hadas trata de un reino misterioso.","Ce conte de fées raconte l'histoire d'un royaume mystérieux."],["L7-4265","王牌","wángpái","N","trump card","carta de triunfo; baza","atout maître","他是我们队的王牌，每场比赛都能进球。","tā shì wǒ men duì de wáng pái měi chǎng bǐ sài dōu néng jìn qiú","He is our team's ace and scores in every game.","Es nuestro as del equipo y marca gol en todos los partidos.","C'est l'atout maître de notre équipe, il marque à chaque match."],["L7-4266","网点","wǎngdiǎn","N","sales outlet; network node","punto de venta; nodo de red","point de vente; nœud de réseau","这家银行在全市有一百多个网点。","zhè jiā yín háng zài quán shì yǒu yì bǎi duō ge wǎng diǎn","This bank has more than a hundred branches across the city.","Este banco tiene más de cien sucursales en toda la ciudad.","Cette banque compte plus d'une centaine d'agences dans toute la ville."],["L7-4267","网民","wǎngmín","N","netizen","internauta","internaute","这条新闻引起了很多网民的讨论。","zhè tiáo xīn wén yǐn qǐ le hěn duō wǎng mín de tǎo lùn","This news sparked discussion among many internet users.","Esta noticia generó debate entre muchos internautas.","Cette nouvelle a suscité des discussions parmi de nombreux internautes."],["L7-4268","往常","wǎngcháng","N","usual; customary","habitual; de siempre","habituel; d'ordinaire","他今天比往常起得早，六点就出门了。","tā jīn tiān bǐ wǎng cháng qǐ de zǎo liù diǎn jiù chū mén le","He got up earlier than usual today and left home at six.","Hoy se levantó más temprano que de costumbre y salió de casa a las seis.","Aujourd'hui, il s'est levé plus tôt que d'habitude et est parti à six heures."],["L7-4269","往返","wǎngfǎn","V","to go back and forth; round trip","ir y volver; viaje de ida y vuelta","faire l'aller-retour; aller-retour","从这里到机场往返要两个小时。","cóng zhè lǐ dào jī chǎng wǎng fǎn yào liǎng gè xiǎo shí","A round trip from here to the airport takes two hours.","Ir y volver de aquí al aeropuerto lleva dos horas.","L'aller-retour d'ici à l'aéroport prend deux heures."],["L7-4270","往日","wǎngrì","N","former days; the past","antaño; el pasado","autrefois; le passé","这条街已经没有了往日的热闹。","zhè tiáo jiē yǐ jīng méi yǒu le wǎng rì de rè nao","This street no longer has the bustle of former days.","Esta calle ya no tiene el bullicio de antaño.","Cette rue n'a plus l'animation d'autrefois."],["L7-4271","往事","wǎngshì","N","past events","sucesos del pasado","événements passés","回首往事，他觉得最对不起的是自己的父母。","huí shǒu wǎng shì tā jué de zuì duì bu qǐ de shì zì jǐ de fù mǔ","Looking back on the past, he feels he has let his parents down the most.","Al mirar atrás, siente que a quienes más ha fallado es a sus padres.","En repensant au passé, il estime que ce sont ses parents qu'il a le plus déçus."],["L7-4272","妄想","wàngxiǎng","V/N","to vainly hope; delusion","ilusionarse en vano; delirio","se faire des illusions; illusion","他妄想不劳动就发大财。","tā wàng xiǎng bù láo dòng jiù fā dà cái","He vainly hopes to get rich without working.","Tiene la ilusión de hacerse rico sin trabajar.","Il s'imagine pouvoir faire fortune sans travailler."],["L7-4273","忘不了","wàng bu liǎo","","cannot forget","no poder olvidar","ne pas pouvoir oublier","老师的恩情我一辈子也忘不了。","lǎo shī de ēn qíng wǒ yí bèi zi yě wàng bu liǎo","I will never forget my teacher's kindness as long as I live.","Nunca olvidaré en toda mi vida la bondad de mi maestro.","Je n'oublierai jamais de toute ma vie la bonté de mon professeur."],["L7-4274","忘掉","wàngdiào","","to forget","olvidar","oublier","不愉快的事就把它忘掉吧。","bù yú kuài de shì jiù bǎ tā wàng diào ba","Just forget the unpleasant things.","Olvidemos las cosas desagradables.","Oublions ce qui est désagréable."],["L7-4275","旺","wàng","Adj","prosperous; flourishing","próspero; pujante","prospère; florissant","这家饭馆的生意一直很旺。","zhè jiā fàn guǎn de shēng yi yì zhí hěn wàng","Business at this restaurant has always been booming.","El negocio de este restaurante siempre ha ido muy bien.","Ce restaurant a toujours très bien marché."],["L7-4276","旺季","wàngjì","N","peak season","temporada alta","haute saison","现在是旅游旺季，酒店都很难订。","xiàn zài shì lǚ yóu wàng jì jiǔ diàn dōu hěn nán dìng","It's the peak tourist season now, so hotels are hard to book.","Ahora es temporada alta de turismo y es difícil reservar hotel.","C'est la haute saison touristique, il est difficile de réserver un hôtel."],["L7-4277","旺盛","wàngshèng","Adj","vigorous; exuberant","vigoroso; exuberante","vigoureux; exubérant","年轻人精力旺盛，熬夜也不觉得累。","nián qīng rén jīng lì wàng shèng áo yè yě bù jué de lèi","Young people are full of energy and don't feel tired even when staying up late.","Los jóvenes rebosan de energía y no se cansan ni trasnochando.","Les jeunes débordent d'énergie et ne ressentent pas la fatigue même en veillant tard."],["L7-4278","望","wàng","V","to hope; to gaze; to visit","esperar; mirar a lo lejos; visitar","espérer; regarder au loin; rendre visite","老教授望着窗外，陷入了长久的沉思。","lǎo jiào shòu wàng zhe chuāng wài xiàn rù le cháng jiǔ de chén sī","The old professor gazed out of the window and fell into deep thought for a long time.","El viejo profesor miró por la ventana y se sumió en una larga reflexión.","Le vieux professeur a regardé par la fenêtre et s'est plongé dans une longue méditation."],["L7-4279","望远镜","wàngyuǎnjìng","N","telescope; binoculars","telescopio; prismáticos","télescope; jumelles","他用望远镜观察远处的小鸟。","tā yòng wàng yuǎn jìng guān chá yuǎn chù de xiǎo niǎo","He watched the birds in the distance through binoculars.","Observó con unos binoculares los pájaros a lo lejos.","Il observait avec des jumelles les oiseaux au loin."],["L7-4280","危及","wēijí","V","to endanger; to jeopardize","poner en peligro","mettre en danger; compromettre","长期过度开采地下水，可能导致地面沉降，甚至危及建筑安全。","cháng qī guò dù kāi cǎi dì xià shuǐ kě néng dǎo zhì dì miàn chén jiàng shèn zhì wēi jí jiàn zhù ān quán","Prolonged overextraction of groundwater may cause land subsidence and even endanger the safety of buildings.","La sobreexplotación prolongada de las aguas subterráneas puede provocar hundimientos del terreno e incluso poner en peligro la seguridad de los edificios.","La surexploitation prolongée des eaux souterraines peut provoquer un affaissement du sol et même menacer la sécurité des bâtiments."],["L7-4281","危急","wēijí","Adj","critical; urgent","crítico; urgente","critique; urgent","在危急时刻，他冲进火里救出了孩子。","zài wēi jí shí kè tā chōng jìn huǒ lǐ jiù chū le hái zi","At the critical moment, he rushed into the fire and saved the child.","En el momento crítico, se lanzó al fuego y rescató al niño.","Au moment critique, il s'est précipité dans le feu et a sauvé l'enfant."],["L7-4282","威风","wēifēng","N/Adj","might; impressive","poderío; imponente","prestige; imposant","他穿上警服，看起来非常威风。","tā chuān shàng jǐng fú kàn qǐ lái fēi cháng wēi fēng","In his police uniform, he looks very impressive.","Con el uniforme de policía puesto, se ve muy imponente.","En uniforme de policier, il a fière allure."],["L7-4283","威力","wēilì","N","might; formidable power","poder; fuerza formidable","puissance; force redoutable","这次台风的威力很大，吹倒了很多树。","zhè cì tái fēng de wēi lì hěn dà chuī dǎo le hěn duō shù","This typhoon was very powerful and blew down many trees.","Este tifón fue muy potente y derribó muchos árboles.","Ce typhon était très puissant et a abattu beaucoup d'arbres."],["L7-4284","威慑","wēishè","V","to deter; deterrence","disuadir; disuasión","dissuader; dissuasion","这项法律对犯罪分子起到了威慑作用。","zhè xiàng fǎ lǜ duì fàn zuì fèn zǐ qǐ dào le wēi shè zuò yòng","This law has had a deterrent effect on criminals.","Esta ley ha tenido un efecto disuasorio sobre los delincuentes.","Cette loi a eu un effet dissuasif sur les criminels."],["L7-4285","威信","wēixìn","N","prestige; Weixin (county)","prestigio; Weixin (condado)","prestige; Weixin (district)","这位老校长在学生中很有威信。","zhè wèi lǎo xiào zhǎng zài xué shēng zhōng hěn yǒu wēi xìn","This old principal has great prestige among the students.","Este anciano director goza de gran autoridad entre los estudiantes.","Ce vieux directeur jouit d'un grand prestige auprès des élèves."],["L7-4286","微不足道","wēibùzúdào","","negligible; insignificant","insignificante; despreciable","négligeable; insignifiant","这点儿小事微不足道，你别放在心上。","zhè diǎnr xiǎo shì wēi bù zú dào nǐ bié fàng zài xīn shàng","This little thing is trivial; don't take it to heart.","Esto es una nimiedad, no te lo tomes a pecho.","Ce n'est presque rien, ne t'en fais pas."],["L7-4287","微观","wēiguān","Adj","micro-; microscopic","micro; microscópico","micro; microscopique","这门课主要讲微观经济学的基本原理。","zhè mén kè zhǔ yào jiǎng wēi guān jīng jì xué de jī běn yuán lǐ","This course mainly covers the basic principles of microeconomics.","Este curso trata principalmente de los principios básicos de la microeconomía.","Ce cours porte principalement sur les principes de base de la microéconomie."],["L7-4288","微妙","wēimiào","Adj","subtle","sutil","subtil","他们俩的关系变得有些微妙。","tā men liǎ de guān xì biàn de yǒu xiē wēi miào","The relationship between the two of them has become somewhat delicate.","La relación entre esos dos se ha vuelto algo delicada.","La relation entre eux est devenue un peu délicate."],["L7-4289","微弱","wēiruò","Adj","weak; faint","débil; tenue","faible; ténu","黑暗中传来一个微弱的声音。","hēi àn zhōng chuán lái yí ge wēi ruò de shēng yīn","A faint sound came out of the darkness.","De la oscuridad llegó un sonido débil.","Un son faible est venu de l'obscurité."],["L7-4290","微型","wēixíng","Adj","miniature; micro-","miniatura; micro","miniature; micro","他买了一台微型相机，可以放进口袋里。","tā mǎi le yì tái wēi xíng xiàng jī kě yǐ fàng jìn kǒu dài lǐ","He bought a miniature camera that fits in his pocket.","Compró una cámara en miniatura que cabe en el bolsillo.","Il a acheté un appareil photo miniature qui tient dans la poche."],["L7-4291","为人","wéirén","V/N","to conduct oneself; character","comportarse; carácter","se comporter; caractère","他这个人为人正直，从不说假话。","tā zhè ge rén wéi rén zhèng zhí cóng bù shuō jiǎ huà","He is an upright person and never tells lies.","Es una persona íntegra que nunca dice mentiras.","C'est quelqu'un d'intègre qui ne ment jamais."],["L7-4292","违背","wéibèi","V","to violate; to go against","violar; ir contra","violer; aller à l'encontre de","我们不能违背自己的诺言。","wǒ men bù néng wéi bèi zì jǐ de nuò yán","We must not go back on our promises.","No debemos faltar a nuestra palabra.","Nous ne devons pas trahir nos promesses."],["L7-4293","违约","wéiyuē","","to breach a contract; to default","incumplir el contrato; impagar","rompre un contrat; faire défaut","协议应明确违约责任，以免日后各执一词，难以裁定。","xié yì yīng míng què wéi yuē zé rèn yǐ miǎn rì hòu gè zhí yì cí nán yǐ cái dìng","The agreement should specify liability for a breach to avoid conflicting accounts that are difficult to adjudicate later.","El acuerdo debe precisar la responsabilidad por incumplimiento, para evitar que luego cada parte sostenga una versión distinta y sea difícil resolver.","L'accord doit préciser la responsabilité en cas de rupture, afin d'éviter que chaque partie ne s'en tienne plus tard à sa version et qu'il soit difficile de trancher."],["L7-4294","违章","wéizhāng","","to break the rules","infringir las normas","enfreindre le règlement","他因为违章停车被罚了两百块钱。","tā yīn wèi wéi zhāng tíng chē bèi fá le liǎng bǎi kuài qián","He was fined two hundred yuan for illegal parking.","Le pusieron una multa de doscientos yuanes por estacionar en lugar prohibido.","Il a reçu une amende de deux cents yuans pour stationnement interdit."],["L7-4295","围墙","wéiqiáng","N","perimeter wall; fence","muro; cerca","mur d'enceinte; clôture","学校四周有一道高高的围墙。","xué xiào sì zhōu yǒu yí dào gāo gāo de wéi qiáng","There is a tall wall all around the school.","Alrededor de la escuela hay un muro alto.","Un haut mur entoure l'école."],["L7-4296","唯","wéi","Adv","only; alone","solo; únicamente","seulement; uniquement","全班同学都来了，唯他一个人没到。","quán bān tóng xué dōu lái le wéi tā yí ge rén méi dào","The whole class came; he was the only one who didn't show up.","Vino toda la clase; solo él no llegó.","Toute la classe est venue, lui seul n'est pas arrivé."],["L7-4297","唯独","wéidú","Adv","only; alone; all except","solo; único; salvo","seulement; sauf","大家都同意了这个计划，唯独他一直沉默不语。","dà jiā dōu tóng yì le zhè ge jì huà wéi dú tā yì zhí chén mò bù yǔ","Everyone agreed to the plan except him; he kept silent the whole time.","Todos estuvieron de acuerdo con el plan, excepto él, que permaneció callado todo el tiempo.","Tout le monde a approuvé le plan, sauf lui, qui est resté silencieux tout le temps."],["L7-4298","伪造","wěizào","V","to forge; to counterfeit","falsificar; fingir","falsifier; contrefaire","他因为伪造身份证被警察抓了。","tā yīn wèi wěi zào shēn fèn zhèng bèi jǐng chá zhuā le","He was arrested by the police for forging an ID card.","La policía lo detuvo por falsificar un documento de identidad.","Il a été arrêté par la police pour avoir falsifié une carte d'identité."],["L7-4299","伪装","wěizhuāng","V/N","to disguise; to pretend","disfrazar; fingir","déguiser; feindre","这只昆虫把自己伪装成一片树叶。","zhè zhī kūn chóng bǎ zì jǐ wěi zhuāng chéng yí piàn shù yè","This insect disguises itself as a leaf.","Este insecto se camufla como una hoja.","Cet insecte se camoufle en feuille."],["L7-4300","尾气","wěiqì","N","exhaust fumes","gases de escape","gaz d'échappement","汽车尾气是空气污染的罪魁祸首之一。","qì chē wěi qì shì kōng qì wū rǎn de zuì kuí huò shǒu zhī yī","Car exhaust is one of the main culprits of air pollution.","Los gases de escape de los autos son uno de los principales culpables de la contaminación del aire.","Les gaz d'échappement des voitures sont l'un des principaux responsables de la pollution de l'air."],["L7-4301","尾声","wěishēng","N","coda; epilogue","final; epílogo","épilogue; fin","这场音乐会已经接近尾声了。","zhè chǎng yīn yuè huì yǐ jīng jiē jìn wěi shēng le","This concert is already drawing to a close.","Este concierto ya está llegando a su final.","Ce concert touche déjà à sa fin."],["L7-4302","纬度","wěidù","N","latitude","latitud","latitude","这两个城市纬度差不多，气候却很不一样。","zhè liǎng gè chéng shì wěi dù chà bu duō qì hòu què hěn bù yí yàng","These two cities are at about the same latitude, but their climates are very different.","Estas dos ciudades tienen casi la misma latitud, pero sus climas son muy distintos.","Ces deux villes sont à peu près à la même latitude, mais leurs climats sont très différents."],["L7-4303","委屈","wěiqu","Adj/V","to feel wronged; to wrong","sentirse agraviado; agraviar","se sentir lésé; faire du tort","她受了委屈，一个人躲在房间里哭。","tā shòu le wěi qu yí ge rén duǒ zài fáng jiān lǐ kū","She was treated unfairly and hid in her room crying alone.","Se sintió agraviada y se escondió a llorar sola en su cuarto.","Se sentant lésée, elle s'est cachée dans sa chambre pour pleurer toute seule."],["L7-4304","委婉","wěiwǎn","Adj","tactful; euphemistic","diplomático; eufemístico","délicat; euphémique","她委婉地拒绝了对方的邀请。","tā wěi wǎn de jù jué le duì fāng de yāo qǐng","She tactfully declined the other person's invitation.","Rechazó con tacto la invitación de la otra persona.","Elle a décliné avec tact l'invitation de l'autre personne."],["L7-4305","委员","wěiyuán","N","committee member","miembro del comité","membre d'un comité","他被选为学生会的委员。","tā bèi xuǎn wéi xué shēng huì de wěi yuán","He was elected to the student union committee.","Fue elegido miembro del comité de estudiantes.","Il a été élu membre du bureau des étudiants."],["L7-4306","委员会","wěiyuánhuì","N","committee","comité","comité","这个问题要由委员会讨论决定。","zhè ge wèn tí yào yóu wěi yuán huì tǎo lùn jué dìng","This issue must be discussed and decided by the committee.","Este asunto lo debe discutir y decidir el comité.","Cette question doit être débattue et tranchée par le comité."],["L7-4307","萎缩","wěisuō","V","to wither; to atrophy","marchitarse; atrofiarse","se flétrir; s'atrophier","因为长期不运动，他腿上的肌肉开始萎缩了。","yīn wèi cháng qī bú yùn dòng tā tuǐ shàng de jī ròu kāi shǐ wěi suō le","Because he hadn't exercised for a long time, the muscles in his legs began to atrophy.","Como llevaba mucho tiempo sin hacer ejercicio, los músculos de sus piernas empezaron a atrofiarse.","Faute d'exercice depuis longtemps, les muscles de ses jambes ont commencé à s'atrophier."],["L7-4308","卫视","wèishì","N","satellite TV","televisión por satélite","télévision par satellite","这部电视剧正在好几家卫视同时播出。","zhè bù diàn shì jù zhèng zài hǎo jǐ jiā wèi shì tóng shí bō chū","This TV series is being broadcast on several satellite channels at the same time.","Esta serie se está transmitiendo al mismo tiempo en varios canales satelitales.","Cette série est diffusée simultanément sur plusieurs chaînes satellites."],["L7-4309","未","wèi","Adv","not yet; not","todavía no; no","pas encore; ne pas","他特地带着新作，前去拜见多年未见的老师。","tā tè dì dài zhe xīn zuò qián qù bài jiàn duō nián wèi jiàn de lǎo shī","He made a special visit to his teacher, whom he had not seen for years, bringing his latest work.","Fue expresamente a visitar a su maestro, a quien no veía desde hacía años, llevándole su nueva obra.","Il est allé tout exprès rendre visite à son maître, qu'il n'avait pas vu depuis des années, en apportant sa dernière œuvre."],["L7-4310","未成年人","wèichéngniánrén","N","minor (under 18)","menor de edad","mineur","商店不能向未成年人出售香烟。","shāng diàn bù néng xiàng wèi chéng nián rén chū shòu xiāng yān","Stores may not sell cigarettes to minors.","Las tiendas no pueden vender cigarrillos a menores de edad.","Les magasins ne peuvent pas vendre de cigarettes aux mineurs."],["L7-4311","未经","wèijīng","V","without having undergone","sin haber pasado por","sans être passé par","未经批准，不能在这里举行大型集会。","wèi jīng pī zhǔn bù néng zài zhè lǐ jǔ xíng dà xíng jí huì","Large gatherings may not be held here without approval.","No se pueden celebrar aquí grandes concentraciones sin autorización.","On ne peut pas organiser de grands rassemblements ici sans autorisation."],["L7-4312","未免","wèimiǎn","Adv","rather; really too","un tanto; demasiado","un peu trop; vraiment","你这样批评他，未免太严厉了吧。","nǐ zhè yàng pī píng tā wèi miǎn tài yán lì le ba","Criticizing him like this is rather too harsh, isn't it?","Criticarlo así es demasiado severo, ¿no crees?","Le critiquer ainsi, c'est tout de même un peu trop sévère, non ?"],["L7-4313","未知数","wèizhīshù","N","unknown quantity","incógnita","inconnue","这个项目能不能成功还是个未知数。","zhè ge xiàng mù néng bu néng chéng gōng hái shi gè wèi zhī shù","Whether this project can succeed is still an unknown.","Que este proyecto tenga éxito o no es todavía una incógnita.","Savoir si ce projet réussira reste une inconnue."],["L7-4314","位子","wèizi","N","seat; place","asiento; lugar","siège; place","电影院里已经没有空位子了。","diàn yǐng yuàn lǐ yǐ jīng méi yǒu kòng wèi zi le","There are no empty seats left in the cinema.","En el cine ya no quedan asientos libres.","Il n'y a plus de place libre au cinéma."],["L7-4315","味精","wèijīng","N","MSG; monosodium glutamate","glutamato monosódico","glutamate monosodique","做汤的时候我从来不放味精。","zuò tāng de shí hou wǒ cóng lái bú fàng wèi jīng","I never add MSG when making soup.","Cuando preparo sopa, nunca le pongo glutamato.","Quand je fais de la soupe, je n'y mets jamais de glutamate."],["L7-4316","畏惧","wèijù","V","to fear; to dread","temer; tener miedo","craindre; redouter","面对困难，他没有丝毫畏惧。","miàn duì kùn nan tā méi yǒu sī háo wèi jù","In the face of difficulty, he showed no fear at all.","Ante las dificultades, no mostró el menor temor.","Face aux difficultés, il n'a montré aucune crainte."],["L7-4317","畏缩","wèisuō","V","to cower; to flinch","encogerse; retroceder","reculer; se dérober","遇到挑战时，他从来没有畏缩过。","yù dào tiǎo zhàn shí tā cóng lái méi yǒu wèi suō guo","He has never flinched when facing a challenge.","Ante los desafíos, nunca se ha echado atrás.","Face aux défis, il n'a jamais reculé."],["L7-4318","胃口","wèikǒu","N","appetite","apetito","appétit","他胃口特别好，每次吃面都要吃大碗。","tā wèi kǒu tè bié hǎo měi cì chī miàn dōu yào chī dà wǎn","He has a big appetite and always orders a large bowl when he eats noodles.","Tiene muy buen apetito y siempre pide un tazón grande cuando come fideos.","Il a un très bon appétit et prend toujours un grand bol quand il mange des nouilles."],["L7-4319","喂养","wèiyǎng","V","to feed; to raise (animals)","alimentar; criar","nourrir; élever","这只小猫是她从小喂养大的。","zhè zhī xiǎo māo shì tā cóng xiǎo wèi yǎng dà de","She raised this cat from when it was a kitten.","Ella crio a esta gatita desde que era pequeña.","Elle a élevé ce chaton depuis sa naissance."],["L7-4320","慰劳","wèiláo","V","to comfort; to show appreciation","reconfortar; agasajar","réconforter; témoigner sa gratitude","春节前，公司领导去工厂慰劳一线工人。","chūn jié qián gōng sī lǐng dǎo qù gōng chǎng wèi láo yí xiàn gōng rén","Before the Spring Festival, company leaders went to the factory to show appreciation to the front-line workers.","Antes del Año Nuevo Chino, los directivos de la empresa fueron a la fábrica a agasajar a los obreros de primera línea.","Avant la fête du Printemps, les dirigeants de l'entreprise sont allés à l'usine témoigner leur reconnaissance aux ouvriers de terrain."],["L7-4321","温度计","wēndùjì","N","thermometer","termómetro","thermomètre","护士把温度计放在他的腋下。","hù shi bǎ wēn dù jì fàng zài tā de yè xià","The nurse put the thermometer under his arm.","La enfermera le puso el termómetro debajo del brazo.","L'infirmière lui a placé le thermomètre sous l'aisselle."],["L7-4322","温泉","wēnquán","N","hot spring; Wenquan (county)","aguas termales; Wenquan (condado)","source chaude; Wenquan (district)","冬天去山里的温泉泡一泡，特别舒服。","dōng tiān qù shān lǐ de wēn quán pào yi pào tè bié shū fu","In winter it's especially pleasant to go soak in a hot spring in the mountains.","En invierno, darse un baño en las aguas termales de la montaña es muy placentero.","En hiver, c'est particulièrement agréable d'aller se tremper dans une source chaude en montagne."],["L7-4323","温柔","wēnróu","Adj","gentle; tender","dulce; tierno","doux; tendre","她举止优雅，说话也很温柔。","tā jǔ zhǐ yōu yǎ shuō huà yě hěn wēn róu","She carries herself gracefully and speaks very gently.","Tiene modales elegantes y también habla con dulzura.","Elle a des manières élégantes et parle aussi avec beaucoup de douceur."],["L7-4324","温室","wēnshì","N","greenhouse","invernadero","serre","这些蔬菜是在温室里种出来的。","zhè xiē shū cài shì zài wēn shì lǐ zhòng chū lái de","These vegetables were grown in a greenhouse.","Estas verduras se cultivaron en un invernadero.","Ces légumes ont été cultivés en serre."],["L7-4325","温习","wēnxí","V","to review (a lesson)","repasar (una lección)","réviser (une leçon)","考试前，他把课文又温习了一遍。","kǎo shì qián tā bǎ kè wén yòu wēn xí le yí biàn","Before the exam, he reviewed the lessons once more.","Antes del examen, repasó una vez más los textos de la lección.","Avant l'examen, il a révisé encore une fois les textes du cours."],["L7-4326","温馨","wēnxīn","Adj","warm; cozy","cálido; acogedor","chaleureux; douillet","房间布置得很温馨，让人感觉像在家里一样。","fáng jiān bù zhì de hěn wēn xīn ràng rén gǎn jué xiàng zài jiā lǐ yí yàng","The room is decorated very warmly and makes you feel at home.","La habitación está decorada de forma muy acogedora y te hace sentir como en casa.","La pièce est décorée de façon très chaleureuse et on s'y sent comme chez soi."],["L7-4327","瘟疫","wēnyì","N","plague; epidemic","peste; epidemia","peste; épidémie","历史上，瘟疫曾经让很多人失去了生命。","lì shǐ shàng wēn yì céng jīng ràng hěn duō rén shī qù le shēng mìng","In history, plagues have taken many people's lives.","A lo largo de la historia, las epidemias han costado la vida a mucha gente.","Dans l'histoire, les épidémies ont coûté la vie à beaucoup de gens."],["L7-4328","文","wén","N","Wen (surname); writing; culture","Wen (apellido); escritura; cultura","Wen (nom); écrit; culture","这位作家的文写得很朴实，读起来很亲切。","zhè wèi zuò jiā de wén xiě de hěn pǔ shí dú qǐ lái hěn qīn qiè","This writer's prose is very plain and feels warm and familiar to read.","La prosa de este escritor es muy sencilla y resulta cercana al leerla.","Le style de cet écrivain est très simple et sa lecture est très chaleureuse."],["L7-4329","文具","wénjù","N","stationery","artículos de papelería","papeterie","开学前，妈妈给我买了一套新文具。","kāi xué qián mā ma gěi wǒ mǎi le yí tào xīn wén jù","Before school started, Mom bought me a new set of stationery.","Antes de empezar las clases, mi mamá me compró un juego nuevo de útiles escolares.","Avant la rentrée, maman m'a acheté un nouveau jeu de fournitures scolaires."],["L7-4330","文科","wénkē","N","liberal arts","humanidades; letras","lettres; sciences humaines","她对历史很感兴趣，所以选了文科。","tā duì lì shǐ hěn gǎn xìng qù suǒ yǐ xuǎn le wén kē","She is very interested in history, so she chose the liberal arts.","Le interesa mucho la historia, por eso eligió humanidades.","Elle s'intéresse beaucoup à l'histoire, c'est pourquoi elle a choisi la filière littéraire."],["L7-4331","文盲","wénmáng","N","illiterate person","analfabeto","analphabète","过去村里很多老人都是文盲，不识字。","guò qù cūn lǐ hěn duō lǎo rén dōu shì wén máng bù shí zì","In the past, many old people in the village were illiterate and couldn't read.","Antes, muchos ancianos del pueblo eran analfabetos y no sabían leer.","Autrefois, beaucoup de personnes âgées du village étaient analphabètes et ne savaient pas lire."],["L7-4332","文凭","wénpíng","N","diploma","diploma; título","diplôme","现在找工作，光有文凭是不够的。","xiàn zài zhǎo gōng zuò guāng yǒu wén píng shì bú gòu de","These days, having a diploma alone isn't enough to find a job.","Hoy en día, para encontrar trabajo no basta con tener un título.","Aujourd'hui, pour trouver un emploi, un diplôme ne suffit pas."],["L7-4333","文人","wénrén","N","scholar; man of letters","letrado; literato","lettré; homme de lettres","古代的文人喜欢在一起喝酒作诗。","gǔ dài de wén rén xǐ huan zài yì qǐ hē jiǔ zuò shī","Scholars in ancient times liked to drink and compose poems together.","En la antigüedad, a los letrados les gustaba reunirse a beber y componer poemas.","Dans l'Antiquité, les lettrés aimaient se réunir pour boire et composer des poèmes."],["L7-4334","文物","wénwù","N","cultural relic","reliquia cultural","vestige culturel","博物馆里展出了很多珍贵的文物。","bó wù guǎn lǐ zhǎn chū le hěn duō zhēn guì de wén wù","Many precious cultural relics are on display in the museum.","En el museo se exhiben muchas valiosas reliquias culturales.","Le musée expose de nombreux précieux objets du patrimoine culturel."],["L7-4335","文献","wénxiàn","N","document; literature","documento; bibliografía","document; documentation","写论文之前，要先查阅大量的文献。","xiě lùn wén zhī qián yào xiān chá yuè dà liàng de wén xiàn","Before writing a thesis, you need to consult a large amount of literature.","Antes de escribir una tesis, hay que consultar primero una gran cantidad de bibliografía.","Avant de rédiger un mémoire, il faut d'abord consulter une grande quantité de documents."],["L7-4336","文雅","wényǎ","Adj","elegant; refined","elegante; refinado","élégant; raffiné","他说话很文雅，一看就是读过很多书的人。","tā shuō huà hěn wén yǎ yí kàn jiù shì dú guo hěn duō shū de rén","He speaks very elegantly; you can tell he's someone who has read a lot.","Habla con mucha elegancia; se nota enseguida que es alguien que ha leído mucho.","Il s'exprime avec raffinement, on voit tout de suite que c'est quelqu'un qui a beaucoup lu."],["L7-4337","闻名","wénmíng","V","famous; well-known","famoso; célebre","célèbre; renommé","这座城市以美丽的湖景闻名。","zhè zuò chéng shì yǐ měi lì de hú jǐng wén míng","This city is famous for its beautiful lake views.","Esta ciudad es famosa por sus hermosas vistas del lago.","Cette ville est célèbre pour ses magnifiques paysages de lac."],["L7-4338","蚊帐","wénzhàng","N","mosquito net","mosquitero","moustiquaire","夏天睡觉的时候，奶奶总要挂上蚊帐。","xià tiān shuì jiào de shí hou nǎi nai zǒng yào guà shàng wén zhàng","When sleeping in summer, Grandma always hangs up a mosquito net.","Cuando duerme en verano, la abuela siempre cuelga el mosquitero.","En été, pour dormir, grand-mère installe toujours la moustiquaire."],["L7-4339","蚊子","wénzi","N","mosquito","mosquito","moustique","被蚊子咬了以后，胳膊上痒得很。","bèi wén zi yǎo le yǐ hòu gē bo shàng yǎng de hěn","After being bitten by mosquitoes, my arm itches terribly.","Después de que me picaron los mosquitos, el brazo me pica muchísimo.","Après avoir été piqué par des moustiques, j'ai le bras qui me démange terriblement."],["L7-4340","吻","wěn","N/V","kiss; to kiss","beso; besar","baiser; embrasser","妈妈轻轻地吻了一下孩子的额头。","mā ma qīng qīng de wěn le yí xià hái zi de é tóu","The mother gently kissed the child's forehead.","La madre besó suavemente la frente del niño.","La mère a doucement embrassé le front de l'enfant."],["L7-4341","吻合","wěnhé","Adj","to match; to fit","coincidir; encajar","concorder; correspondre","他说的情况和监控录像完全吻合。","tā shuō de qíng kuàng hé jiān kòng lù xiàng wán quán wěn hé","What he said matches the surveillance footage completely.","Lo que dijo coincide por completo con las grabaciones de las cámaras de vigilancia.","Ce qu'il a dit correspond parfaitement aux images de vidéosurveillance."],["L7-4342","紊乱","wěnluàn","Adj","disorder; chaotic","desorden; caótico","désordre; chaotique","长期熬夜会导致身体的生物钟紊乱。","cháng qī áo yè huì dǎo zhì shēn tǐ de shēng wù zhōng wěn luàn","Staying up late for a long time can throw the body's internal clock into disorder.","Trasnochar durante mucho tiempo desajusta el reloj biológico del cuerpo.","Veiller tard pendant longtemps dérègle l'horloge biologique du corps."],["L7-4343","稳固","wěngù","Adj/V","stable; to stabilize","estable; estabilizar","stable; consolider","这座桥的地基很稳固，可以用上百年。","zhè zuò qiáo de dì jī hěn wěn gù kě yǐ yòng shàng bǎi nián","This bridge's foundation is very solid and can last a hundred years.","Los cimientos de este puente son muy sólidos y puede durar cien años.","Les fondations de ce pont sont très solides et il peut durer cent ans."],["L7-4344","稳健","wěnjiàn","Adj","steady; sound","firme; sólido","ferme; solide","这家公司的发展一直很稳健。","zhè jiā gōng sī de fā zhǎn yì zhí hěn wěn jiàn","This company has always developed steadily.","Esta empresa siempre ha crecido de manera sólida.","Cette entreprise s'est toujours développée de façon stable."],["L7-4345","稳妥","wěntuǒ","Adj","safe; reliable","seguro; fiable","sûr; fiable","他办事一向稳妥，即便任务繁重，也能分清轻重缓急。","tā bàn shì yí xiàng wěn tuǒ jí biàn rèn wu fán zhòng yě néng fēn qīng qīng zhòng huǎn jí","He has always handled matters reliably and can set priorities even under a heavy workload.","Siempre ha resuelto los asuntos con seguridad y, aunque la tarea sea pesada, sabe distinguir lo urgente de lo importante.","Il a toujours géré les dossiers avec fiabilité et, même sous une lourde charge de travail, il sait hiérarchiser les priorités."],["L7-4346","稳重","wěnzhòng","Adj","steady; sedate","sereno; formal","posé; grave","他做事很稳重，领导很放心。","tā zuò shì hěn wěn zhòng lǐng dǎo hěn fàng xīn","He is very steady in how he does things, and his boss trusts him.","Es muy serio y responsable en lo que hace, y sus jefes confían en él.","Il est très posé dans son travail et ses supérieurs lui font confiance."],["L7-4347","问卷","wènjuàn","N","questionnaire","cuestionario","questionnaire","请大家花几分钟填一下这份问卷。","qǐng dà jiā huā jǐ fēn zhōng tián yí xià zhè fèn wèn juàn","Please take a few minutes to fill out this questionnaire.","Por favor, dediquen unos minutos a llenar este cuestionario.","Veuillez prendre quelques minutes pour remplir ce questionnaire."],["L7-4348","问世","wènshì","V","to be published; to appear","salir a la luz; publicarse","paraître; voir le jour","这本小说问世以后，马上引起了轰动。","zhè běn xiǎo shuō wèn shì yǐ hòu mǎ shàng yǐn qǐ le hōng dòng","As soon as this novel came out, it caused a sensation.","En cuanto salió esta novela, causó sensación de inmediato.","Dès sa parution, ce roman a fait sensation."],["L7-4349","窝","wō","N","nest; den; hollow","nido; guarida; hueco","nid; tanière; creux","燕子在我家屋檐下做了一个窝。","yàn zi zài wǒ jiā wū yán xià zuò le yí ge wō","Swallows built a nest under the eaves of our house.","Las golondrinas hicieron un nido bajo el alero de mi casa.","Des hirondelles ont fait un nid sous l'avant-toit de notre maison."],["L7-4350","卧","wò","V","to lie down; to crouch","acostarse; agazaparse","s'allonger; se tapir","一只老猫卧在门口晒太阳。","yì zhī lǎo māo wò zài mén kǒu shài tài yáng","An old cat is lying at the door basking in the sun.","Un gato viejo está echado en la puerta tomando el sol.","Un vieux chat est couché sur le seuil, à se prélasser au soleil."],["L7-4351","污秽","wūhuì","Adj/N","filthy; sordid","sucio; sórdido","sale; sordide","下水道里满是污秽的东西，气味很难闻。","xià shuǐ dào lǐ mǎn shì wū huì de dōng xi qì wèi hěn nán wén","The sewer is full of filthy things and smells terrible.","La alcantarilla está llena de porquería y huele muy mal.","Les égouts sont pleins d'immondices et sentent très mauvais."],["L7-4352","巫婆","wūpó","N","witch","bruja; hechicera","sorcière","童话里的巫婆骑着扫帚在天上飞。","tóng huà lǐ de wū pó qí zhe sào zhou zài tiān shàng fēi","The witch in the fairy tale flies through the sky on a broom.","En el cuento de hadas, la bruja vuela por el cielo montada en una escoba.","Dans le conte, la sorcière vole dans le ciel à cheval sur un balai."],["L7-4353","呜咽","wūyè","V","to sob; to whimper","sollozar; gimotear","sangloter; geindre","听到这个坏消息，她忍不住呜咽起来。","tīng dào zhè ge huài xiāo xi tā rěn bu zhù wū yè qǐ lái","Hearing the bad news, she couldn't help sobbing.","Al oír la mala noticia, no pudo evitar sollozar.","En apprenant la mauvaise nouvelle, elle n'a pas pu s'empêcher de sangloter."],["L7-4354","屋顶","wūdǐng","N","roof","tejado; techo","toit","大风把屋顶上的瓦吹掉了几片。","dà fēng bǎ wū dǐng shàng de wǎ chuī diào le jǐ piàn","The strong wind blew several tiles off the roof.","El fuerte viento tiró algunas tejas del techo.","Le vent fort a fait tomber plusieurs tuiles du toit."],["L7-4355","无比","wúbǐ","V","incomparable","incomparable","incomparable","站在山顶上，他心里感到无比激动。","zhàn zài shān dǐng shàng tā xīn lǐ gǎn dào wú bǐ jī dòng","Standing on the top of the mountain, he felt incomparably excited.","De pie en la cima de la montaña, sintió una emoción indescriptible.","Debout au sommet de la montagne, il ressentait une émotion indicible."],["L7-4356","无不","wúbù","Adv","without exception; all","sin excepción; todos","sans exception; tous","听了他的经历，在场的人无不感动。","tīng le tā de jīng lì zài chǎng de rén wú bù gǎn dòng","Everyone present was moved after hearing his story.","Al escuchar su historia, todos los presentes se conmovieron.","En écoutant son histoire, tous les présents ont été émus."],["L7-4357","无偿","wúcháng","Adj","free of charge","gratuito","gratuit","这位医生经常无偿为老人看病。","zhè wèi yī shēng jīng cháng wú cháng wèi lǎo rén kàn bìng","This doctor often treats elderly people free of charge.","Este médico atiende con frecuencia a personas mayores de forma gratuita.","Ce médecin soigne souvent gratuitement les personnes âgées."],["L7-4358","无敌","wúdí","V","invincible","invencible","invincible","这支球队今年在联赛中几乎是无敌的。","zhè zhī qiú duì jīn nián zài lián sài zhōng jī hū shì wú dí de","This team was almost unbeatable in the league this year.","Este equipo este año ha sido casi invencible en la liga.","Cette équipe a été presque invincible en championnat cette année."],["L7-4359","无恶不作","wú'è-bùzuò","","to commit every crime","cometer toda clase de fechorías","commettre toutes sortes de crimes","这伙强盗无恶不作，老百姓都恨透了他们。","zhè huǒ qiáng dào wú è bú zuò lǎo bǎi xìng dōu hèn tòu le tā men","This gang of robbers committed every kind of evil, and the common people hated them bitterly.","Esta banda de bandidos cometía toda clase de maldades, y la gente del pueblo los odiaba a muerte.","Cette bande de brigands commettait toutes sortes de méfaits et la population les haïssait profondément."],["L7-4360","无非","wúfēi","Adv","only; nothing but","solo; nada más que","seulement; rien d'autre que","他这么说，无非是想让你帮他一个忙。","tā zhè me shuō wú fēi shì xiǎng ràng nǐ bāng tā yí ge máng","He's saying this only because he wants you to do him a favor.","Si dice eso, es solo porque quiere que le hagas un favor.","S'il dit cela, ce n'est que parce qu'il veut que tu lui rendes un service."],["L7-4361","无辜","wúgū","Adj/N","innocent","inocente","innocent","法律的作用就是伸张正义，保护无辜的人。","fǎ lǜ de zuò yòng jiù shì shēn zhāng zhèng yì bǎo hù wú gū de rén","The role of law is to uphold justice and protect the innocent.","La función de la ley es hacer justicia y proteger a los inocentes.","Le rôle de la loi est de rendre justice et de protéger les innocents."],["L7-4362","无故","wúgù","Adv","without reason","sin motivo","sans raison","他无故缺席了三次会议，被领导批评了。","tā wú gù quē xí le sān cì huì yì bèi lǐng dǎo pī píng le","He was criticized by his boss for missing three meetings without reason.","Faltó sin motivo a tres reuniones y su jefe lo reprendió.","Il a été réprimandé par son supérieur pour avoir manqué trois réunions sans raison."],["L7-4363","无关紧要","wúguān-jǐnyào","","unimportant; irrelevant","irrelevante; sin importancia","sans importance","这些都是无关紧要的细节，不用太在意。","zhè xiē dōu shì wú guān jǐn yào de xì jié bú yòng tài zài yì","These are all unimportant details; don't worry too much about them.","Todos estos son detalles sin importancia; no hace falta darles demasiada atención.","Ce sont tous des détails sans importance, inutile de s'en soucier."],["L7-4364","无话可说","wúhuà-kěshuō","","to have nothing to say","no tener nada que decir","n'avoir rien à dire","面对确凿的证据，他无话可说。","miàn duì què záo de zhèng jù tā wú huà kě shuō","Faced with conclusive evidence, he had nothing to say.","Ante pruebas irrefutables, no tuvo nada que decir.","Face à des preuves irréfutables, il n'avait plus rien à dire."],["L7-4365","无济于事","wújìyúshì","","to no avail; futile","inútil; en vano","en vain; inutile","事情已经发生了，现在后悔也无济于事。","shì qing yǐ jīng fā shēng le xiàn zài hòu huǐ yě wú jì yú shì","It has already happened; regretting it now is of no use.","Lo hecho, hecho está; arrepentirse ahora no sirve de nada.","C'est déjà arrivé, regretter maintenant ne sert à rien."],["L7-4366","无家可归","wújiā-kěguī","","homeless","sin hogar","sans abri","这场洪水使上千人无家可归。","zhè chǎng hóng shuǐ shǐ shàng qiān rén wú jiā kě guī","This flood left more than a thousand people homeless.","Esta inundación dejó a más de mil personas sin hogar.","Cette inondation a laissé plus de mille personnes sans abri."],["L7-4367","无精打采","wújīng-dǎcǎi","","listless; in low spirits","decaído; desanimado","abattu; sans énergie","他昨晚没睡好，今天上课无精打采的。","tā zuó wǎn méi shuì hǎo jīn tiān shàng kè wú jīng dǎ cǎi de","He didn't sleep well last night and was listless in class today.","Anoche no durmió bien y hoy estuvo decaído en clase.","Il a mal dormi cette nuit et était sans énergie en cours aujourd'hui."],["L7-4368","无可奉告","wúkěfènggào","","no comment","sin comentarios","sans commentaire","记者问到这件事，发言人只说无可奉告。","jì zhě wèn dào zhè jiàn shì fā yán rén zhǐ shuō wú kě fèng gào","When reporters asked about the matter, the spokesperson only said \"no comment\".","Cuando los periodistas preguntaron sobre el asunto, el portavoz solo dijo «sin comentarios».","Quand les journalistes l'ont interrogé sur cette affaire, le porte-parole a simplement répondu « sans commentaire »."],["L7-4369","无可厚非","wúkěhòufēi","","not blameworthy; understandable","no censurable; comprensible","pas répréhensible; compréhensible","年轻人想多挣点儿钱，这无可厚非。","nián qīng rén xiǎng duō zhèng diǎnr qián zhè wú kě hòu fēi","Young people wanting to earn more money is understandable.","Que los jóvenes quieran ganar más dinero es comprensible.","Que les jeunes veuillent gagner plus d'argent n'a rien de blâmable."],["L7-4370","无可奈何","wúkěnàihé","","to have no alternative","no tener más remedio","ne pas avoir le choix","大雨下个不停，他们无可奈何，只好取消了比赛。","dà yǔ xià ge bù tíng tā men wú kě nài hé zhǐ hǎo qǔ xiāo le bǐ sài","The heavy rain kept falling; with no alternative, they had to cancel the match.","La lluvia fuerte no paraba y, sin más remedio, tuvieron que cancelar el partido.","La pluie battante ne s'arrêtait pas ; n'ayant pas le choix, ils ont dû annuler le match."],["L7-4371","无理","wúlǐ","V","unreasonable","irracional; sin razón","déraisonnable; injustifié","他提出的要求太无理了，我们不能答应。","tā tí chū de yāo qiú tài wú lǐ le wǒ men bù néng dā ying","His demands are too unreasonable; we can't agree to them.","Sus exigencias son demasiado irrazonables; no podemos aceptarlas.","Ses exigences sont déraisonnables, nous ne pouvons pas les accepter."],["L7-4372","无力","wúlì","V","powerless; weak","sin fuerzas; impotente","sans force; impuissant","病了一个星期，她觉得全身无力。","bìng le yí ge xīng qī tā jué de quán shēn wú lì","After being ill for a week, she felt weak all over.","Después de una semana enferma, se sentía sin fuerzas en todo el cuerpo.","Après une semaine de maladie, elle se sentait faible de partout."],["L7-4373","无论如何","wúlùn-rúhé","","in any case; no matter what","en cualquier caso; pase lo que pase","en tout cas; quoi qu'il arrive","无论如何，你明天都要按时到。","wú lùn rú hé nǐ míng tiān dōu yào àn shí dào","No matter what, you must arrive on time tomorrow.","Pase lo que pase, mañana tienes que llegar a tiempo.","Quoi qu'il arrive, tu dois arriver à l'heure demain."],["L7-4374","无能","wúnéng","Adj","incompetent; incapable","incompetente; incapaz","incompétent; incapable","遇到问题就推给别人，这是无能的表现。","yù dào wèn tí jiù tuī gěi bié rén zhè shì wú néng de biǎo xiàn","Pushing problems onto others is a sign of incompetence.","Echarles los problemas a los demás en cuanto surgen es señal de incompetencia.","Rejeter les problèmes sur les autres dès qu'ils se présentent est un signe d'incompétence."],["L7-4375","无能为力","wúnéngwéilì","","powerless; helpless","impotente; sin poder hacer nada","impuissant; démuni","对于这种病，现在的医学还无能为力。","duì yú zhè zhǒng bìng xiàn zài de yī xué hái wú néng wéi lì","Modern medicine is still powerless against this disease.","Ante esta enfermedad, la medicina actual todavía no puede hacer nada.","Face à cette maladie, la médecine actuelle reste impuissante."],["L7-4376","无情","wúqíng","Adj","ruthless; heartless","despiadado; cruel","impitoyable; sans cœur","时间是无情的，它不会为任何人停下来。","shí jiān shì wú qíng de tā bú huì wèi rèn hé rén tíng xià lai","Time is merciless; it won't stop for anyone.","El tiempo es implacable; no se detiene por nadie.","Le temps est impitoyable, il ne s'arrête pour personne."],["L7-4377","无情无义","wúqíng-wúyì","","cold and heartless","frío y desalmado","froid et sans scrupules","他对帮助过他的人无情无义，大家都看不起他。","tā duì bāng zhù guo tā de rén wú qíng wú yì dà jiā dōu kàn bu qǐ tā","He was cold and heartless toward those who had helped him, and everyone looks down on him.","Fue frío y desagradecido con quienes lo habían ayudado, y todos lo desprecian.","Il s'est montré froid et ingrat envers ceux qui l'avaient aidé, et tout le monde le méprise."],["L7-4378","无穷","wúqióng","V","endless; boundless","infinito; inagotable","infini; inépuisable","这道菜的味道让人回味无穷。","zhè dào cài de wèi dào ràng rén huí wèi wú qióng","The flavor of this dish leaves a lasting aftertaste.","El sabor de este plato deja un recuerdo que no se acaba.","Le goût de ce plat laisse un souvenir qu'on n'oublie pas."],["L7-4379","无私","wúsī","Adj","selfless; unselfish","desinteresado; altruista","désintéressé; altruiste","这首诗歌颂了母亲无私的爱。","zhè shǒu shī gē sòng le mǔ qīn wú sī de ài","This poem praises a mother's selfless love.","Este poema canta el amor desinteresado de una madre.","Ce poème célèbre l'amour désintéressé d'une mère."],["L7-4380","无所事事","wúsuǒshìshì","","to idle one's time away","no hacer nada; holgazanear","ne rien faire; flâner","他放假在家无所事事，整天玩手机。","tā fàng jià zài jiā wú suǒ shì shì zhěng tiān wán shǒu jī","On vacation he has nothing to do at home and plays on his phone all day.","En sus vacaciones se queda en casa sin hacer nada y se pasa el día con el celular.","En vacances, il reste à la maison à ne rien faire et passe sa journée sur son téléphone."],["L7-4381","无所作为","wúsuǒzuòwéi","","to achieve nothing","no lograr nada","ne rien accomplir","我们不能因为害怕失败就无所作为。","wǒ men bù néng yīn wèi hài pà shī bài jiù wú suǒ zuò wéi","We can't do nothing just because we're afraid of failure.","No podemos quedarnos de brazos cruzados solo por miedo al fracaso.","Nous ne pouvons pas rester sans rien faire par peur de l'échec."],["L7-4382","无条件","wútiáojiàn","V","unconditional","incondicional","inconditionnel","父母对孩子的爱是无条件的。","fù mǔ duì hái zi de ài shì wú tiáo jiàn de","Parents' love for their children is unconditional.","El amor de los padres por sus hijos es incondicional.","L'amour des parents pour leurs enfants est inconditionnel."],["L7-4383","无微不至","wúwēi-bùzhì","","meticulous; attentive in every way","esmerado; solícito en todo","minutieux; aux petits soins","她生病的时候，丈夫对她照顾得无微不至。","tā shēng bìng de shí hou zhàng fu duì tā zhào gù de wú wēi bú zhì","When she was ill, her husband took care of her in every possible way.","Cuando ella enfermó, su esposo la cuidó con el mayor esmero.","Quand elle était malade, son mari a pris soin d'elle avec une attention de tous les instants."],["L7-4384","无线","wúxiàn","Adj","wireless","inalámbrico","sans fil","咖啡馆里的无线网速度很快。","kā fēi guǎn lǐ de wú xiàn wǎng sù dù hěn kuài","The wireless internet in the café is very fast.","El wifi de la cafetería es muy rápido.","Le Wi-Fi du café est très rapide."],["L7-4385","无线电","wúxiàndiàn","N","radio; wireless","radio; inalámbrico","radio; sans fil","爷爷年轻时是部队里的无线电兵。","yé ye nián qīng shí shì bù duì lǐ de wú xiàn diàn bīng","When he was young, Grandpa was a radio operator in the army.","Cuando era joven, el abuelo fue radiotelegrafista en el ejército.","Dans sa jeunesse, grand-père était radio dans l'armée."],["L7-4386","无形","wúxíng","Adj","intangible; invisible","intangible; invisible","immatériel; invisible","父母的言行对孩子有无形的影响。","fù mǔ de yán xíng duì hái zi yǒu wú xíng de yǐng xiǎng","Parents' words and deeds have an invisible influence on their children.","Las palabras y los actos de los padres tienen una influencia invisible en los hijos.","Les paroles et les actes des parents exercent sur leurs enfants une influence invisible."],["L7-4387","无形中","wúxíngzhōng","Adv","imperceptibly; unconsciously","imperceptiblemente; sin darse cuenta","imperceptiblement; insensiblement","每天坚持读书，无形中他的眼界变宽了。","měi tiān jiān chí dú shū wú xíng zhōng tā de yǎn jiè biàn kuān le","By reading every day, his horizons broadened without his noticing.","Como lee todos los días, sin darse cuenta se le han ampliado los horizontes.","À force de lire chaque jour, son horizon s'est élargi sans qu'il s'en rende compte."],["L7-4388","无须","wúxū","Adv","need not","no hace falta; no es necesario","inutile de; pas besoin de","这点儿小伤无须去医院。","zhè diǎnr xiǎo shāng wú xū qù yī yuàn","This minor injury doesn't need a trip to the hospital.","Esta pequeña herida no necesita ir al hospital.","Cette petite blessure ne nécessite pas d'aller à l'hôpital."],["L7-4389","无意","wúyì","V/Adv","unintentional; to have no intention","sin querer; no tener intención","par inadvertance; ne pas avoir l'intention","我无意中听到了他们的谈话。","wǒ wú yì zhōng tīng dào le tā men de tán huà","I accidentally overheard their conversation.","Sin querer, escuché su conversación.","J'ai entendu leur conversation par hasard."],["L7-4390","无忧无虑","wúyōu-wúlǜ","","carefree","despreocupado","sans souci","孩子们在乡下度过了一个无忧无虑的暑假。","hái zi men zài xiāng xia dù guò le yí ge wú yōu wú lǜ de shǔ jià","The children spent a carefree summer vacation in the countryside.","Los niños pasaron unas vacaciones de verano sin preocupaciones en el campo.","Les enfants ont passé des vacances d'été insouciantes à la campagne."],["L7-4391","无缘","wúyuán","V/Adv","to have no chance; to lack affinity","no tener ocasión; no estar destinado","ne pas avoir l'occasion; sans affinité","因为受伤，他与这次奥运会无缘了。","yīn wèi shòu shāng tā yǔ zhè cì ào yùn huì wú yuán le","Because of his injury, he missed his chance at this Olympics.","Por su lesión, se quedó sin la oportunidad de participar en estos Juegos Olímpicos.","À cause de sa blessure, il a dû renoncer à ces Jeux olympiques."],["L7-4392","无知","wúzhī","Adj","ignorant; ignorance","ignorante; ignorancia","ignorant; ignorance","他的这番话暴露了他的无知。","tā de zhè fān huà bào lù le tā de wú zhī","His remarks revealed his ignorance.","Con estas palabras dejó al descubierto su ignorancia.","Ces propos ont révélé son ignorance."],["L7-4393","无足轻重","wúzú-qīngzhòng","","insignificant","insignificante","insignifiant","他在公司里只是个无足轻重的小职员。","tā zài gōng sī lǐ zhǐ shì gè wú zú qīng zhòng de xiǎo zhí yuán","He's just an insignificant junior clerk in the company.","En la empresa es solo un empleado menor sin importancia.","Dans l'entreprise, ce n'est qu'un petit employé sans importance."],["L7-4394","五花八门","wǔhuā-bāmén","","all kinds of; myriad","de todo tipo; variadísimo","de toutes sortes; très varié","超市里的零食五花八门，孩子们看得眼都花了。","chāo shì lǐ de líng shí wǔ huā bā mén hái zi men kàn de yǎn dōu huā le","The snacks in the supermarket come in every kind imaginable, and the children were dazzled.","Los snacks del supermercado son de todo tipo y los niños no sabían qué elegir.","Les en-cas du supermarché sont de toutes sortes et les enfants en avaient le tournis."],["L7-4395","五星级","wǔxīngjí","Adj","five-star","de cinco estrellas","cinq étoiles","他们在一家五星级酒店举行了婚礼。","tā men zài yì jiā wǔ xīng jí jiǔ diàn jǔ xíng le hūn lǐ","They held their wedding at a five-star hotel.","Celebraron su boda en un hotel de cinco estrellas.","Ils ont célébré leur mariage dans un hôtel cinq étoiles."],["L7-4396","武力","wǔlì","N","military force","fuerza militar","force armée","两国之间的矛盾不能靠武力解决。","liǎng guó zhī jiān de máo dùn bù néng kào wǔ lì jiě jué","The conflict between the two countries can't be resolved by force.","Los conflictos entre los dos países no se pueden resolver por la fuerza.","Les différends entre les deux pays ne peuvent pas se régler par la force."],["L7-4397","武装","wǔzhuāng","N/V","arms; to arm; armed forces","armamento; armar; fuerzas armadas","armement; armer; forces armées","这支队伍装备精良，武装到了牙齿。","zhè zhī duì wǔ zhuāng bèi jīng liáng wǔ zhuāng dào le yá chǐ","This unit is well equipped and armed to the teeth.","Esta unidad está muy bien equipada y armada hasta los dientes.","Cette unité est parfaitement équipée et armée jusqu'aux dents."],["L7-4398","侮辱","wǔrǔ","V","to insult; to humiliate","insultar; humillar","insulter; humilier","他觉得对方的话是对他的侮辱。","tā jué de duì fāng de huà shì duì tā de wǔ rǔ","He felt the other person's words were an insult to him.","Sintió que las palabras de la otra persona eran un insulto para él.","Il a ressenti les paroles de l'autre comme une insulte à son égard."],["L7-4399","捂","wǔ","V","to cover (with hand); to cover up","tapar; encubrir","couvrir; dissimuler","外面风太大，她用围巾捂着嘴。","wài miàn fēng tài dà tā yòng wéi jīn wǔ zhe zuǐ","The wind outside was too strong, so she covered her mouth with her scarf.","Afuera hacía demasiado viento y se tapó la boca con la bufanda.","Dehors, il y avait trop de vent, alors elle s'est couvert la bouche avec son écharpe."],["L7-4400","舞厅","wǔtīng","N","dance hall","sala de baile","salle de bal","退休以后，她每个周末都去舞厅跳舞。","tuì xiū yǐ hòu tā měi ge zhōu mò dōu qù wǔ tīng tiào wǔ","After retiring, she goes dancing at the dance hall every weekend.","Después de jubilarse, va a bailar al salón de baile todos los fines de semana.","Depuis sa retraite, elle va danser dans une salle de bal tous les week-ends."],["L7-4401","勿","wù","Adv","do not","no","ne pas","这里是施工现场，闲人勿进。","zhè lǐ shì shī gōng xiàn chǎng xián rén wù jìn","This is a construction site; no entry for unauthorized persons.","Esta es una obra en construcción; prohibido el paso a personas ajenas.","Ceci est un chantier : interdit au public."],["L7-4402","务必","wùbì","Adv","must; be sure to","sin falta; deber","impérativement; ne pas manquer de","导师反复叮嘱我们，引用他人的论述时务必注明出处。","dǎo shī fǎn fù dīng zhǔ wǒ men yǐn yòng tā rén de lùn shù shí wù bì zhù míng chū chù","Our supervisor repeatedly reminded us to identify the source whenever we cite someone else's arguments.","El tutor nos recordó una y otra vez que, al citar los argumentos de otros, hay que indicar siempre la fuente.","Notre directeur de recherche nous a répété qu'il faut toujours indiquer la source lorsqu'on cite les propos d'autrui."],["L7-4403","务实","wùshí","Adj","pragmatic","pragmático","pragmatique","新来的经理做事很务实，不喜欢说空话。","xīn lái de jīng lǐ zuò shì hěn wù shí bù xǐ huan shuō kōng huà","The new manager is very pragmatic and doesn't like empty talk.","El nuevo gerente es muy pragmático y no le gusta hablar por hablar.","Le nouveau directeur est très pragmatique et n'aime pas les paroles en l'air."],["L7-4404","物流","wùliú","N","logistics","logística","logistique","这家物流公司保证三天内送到。","zhè jiā wù liú gōng sī bǎo zhèng sān tiān nèi sòng dào","This logistics company guarantees delivery within three days.","Esta empresa de logística garantiza la entrega en un plazo de tres días.","Cette entreprise de logistique garantit la livraison sous trois jours."],["L7-4405","物体","wùtǐ","N","object; body","objeto; cuerpo","objet; corps","物体受热后一般会膨胀，遇冷则会收缩。","wù tǐ shòu rè hòu yì bān huì péng zhàng yù lěng zé huì shōu suō","Objects generally expand when heated and contract when cooled.","Por lo general, los objetos se dilatan con el calor y se contraen con el frío.","En général, les corps se dilatent sous l'effet de la chaleur et se contractent sous l'effet du froid."],["L7-4406","物证","wùzhèng","N","material evidence","prueba material","preuve matérielle","警察在现场找到了重要的物证。","jǐng chá zài xiàn chǎng zhǎo dào le zhòng yào de wù zhèng","The police found important physical evidence at the scene.","La policía encontró pruebas materiales importantes en el lugar de los hechos.","La police a trouvé d'importantes preuves matérielles sur les lieux."],["L7-4407","物资","wùzī","N","goods; supplies","materiales; suministros","marchandises; fournitures","救灾物资正在被运送到灾区。","jiù zāi wù zī zhèng zài bèi yùn sòng dào zāi qū","Relief supplies are being transported to the disaster area.","Se están enviando suministros de ayuda a la zona del desastre.","Les fournitures de secours sont acheminées vers la zone sinistrée."],["L7-4408","误差","wùchā","N","error; margin of error","error; margen de error","erreur; marge d'erreur","这台秤的误差不超过一克。","zhè tái chèng de wù chā bù chāo guò yí kè","This scale's margin of error is no more than one gram.","El margen de error de esta balanza no supera un gramo.","La marge d'erreur de cette balance ne dépasse pas un gramme."],["L7-4409","误导","wùdǎo","V","to mislead; misleading","engañar; confundir","induire en erreur; trompeur","这种广告很容易误导消费者。","zhè zhǒng guǎng gào hěn róng yì wù dǎo xiāo fèi zhě","This kind of advertisement can easily mislead consumers.","Este tipo de publicidad puede engañar fácilmente a los consumidores.","Ce genre de publicité peut facilement induire les consommateurs en erreur."],["L7-4410","误区","wùqū","N","misconception","idea errónea; error común","idée fausse","很多人有一个误区，以为不吃早饭能减肥。","hěn duō rén yǒu yí ge wù qū yǐ wéi bù chī zǎo fàn néng jiǎn féi","Many people have a misconception that skipping breakfast helps you lose weight.","Mucha gente tiene la idea equivocada de que saltarse el desayuno ayuda a adelgazar.","Beaucoup de gens se trompent en croyant que sauter le petit-déjeuner fait maigrir."],["L7-4411","雾","wù","N","fog; mist","niebla; bruma","brouillard; brume","摄影师在黎明前赶到湖畔，只为捕捉雾气散去的一瞬间。","shè yǐng shī zài lí míng qián gǎn dào hú pàn zhǐ wèi bǔ zhuō wù qì sàn qù de yí shùn jiān","The photographer reached the lakeside before dawn just to capture the moment when the mist lifted.","El fotógrafo llegó a la orilla del lago antes del amanecer solo para captar el instante en que se disipaba la niebla.","Le photographe est arrivé au bord du lac avant l'aube, juste pour saisir l'instant où la brume se dissipe."],["L7-4412","吸纳","xīnà","V","to absorb; to take in","absorber; acoger","absorber; accueillir","这个新工厂可以吸纳两千多人就业。","zhè ge xīn gōng chǎng kě yǐ xī nà liǎng qiān duō rén jiù yè","This new factory can provide jobs for more than two thousand people.","Esta nueva fábrica puede dar empleo a más de dos mil personas.","Cette nouvelle usine peut employer plus de deux mille personnes."],["L7-4413","吸取","xīqǔ","V","to absorb; to draw (a lesson)","absorber; extraer (una lección)","absorber; tirer (une leçon)","我们要从失败中吸取有用的经验。","wǒ men yào cóng shī bài zhōng xī qǔ yǒu yòng de jīng yàn","We should draw useful lessons from failure.","Debemos extraer experiencias útiles de los fracasos.","Nous devons tirer des enseignements utiles de nos échecs."],["L7-4414","昔日","xīrì","N","former days; past","antaño; en el pasado","autrefois; jadis","昔日的小渔村，如今已经变成了大城市。","xī rì de xiǎo yú cūn rú jīn yǐ jīng biàn chéng le dà chéng shì","The small fishing village of former days has now become a big city.","La pequeña aldea de pescadores de antaño es hoy una gran ciudad.","Le petit village de pêcheurs d'autrefois est devenu aujourd'hui une grande ville."],["L7-4415","息息相关","xīxī-xiāngguān","","closely linked","estrechamente ligado","étroitement lié","环境保护和每个人的生活息息相关。","huán jìng bǎo hù hé měi ge rén de shēng huó xī xī xiāng guān","Environmental protection is closely bound up with everyone's life.","La protección del medio ambiente está estrechamente ligada a la vida de cada persona.","La protection de l'environnement est étroitement liée à la vie de chacun."],["L7-4416","稀","xī","Adj","rare; sparse; watery","raro; escaso; aguado","rare; clairsemé; liquide","这种水果在北方很稀罕。","zhè zhǒng shuǐ guǒ zài běi fāng hěn xī han","This kind of fruit is a rarity in the north.","Esta fruta es muy rara en el norte.","Ce fruit est très rare dans le nord."],["L7-4417","稀罕","xīhan","Adj/V","rare; to treasure","raro; apreciar","rare; tenir à","这种水果在北方很稀罕。","zhè zhǒng shuǐ guǒ zài běi fāng hěn xī han","This kind of fruit is a rarity in the north.","Esta fruta es muy rara en el norte.","Ce fruit est très rare dans le nord."],["L7-4418","稀奇","xīqí","Adj","rare; strange","raro; extraño","rare; étrange","这种鸟在我们这里很少见，大家都觉得很稀奇。","zhè zhǒng niǎo zài wǒ men zhè lǐ hěn shǎo jiàn dà jiā dōu jué de hěn xī qí","This bird is rarely seen here, so everyone found it very curious.","Esta ave se ve poco por aquí, así que a todos les pareció muy curiosa.","Cet oiseau se voit rarement par ici, alors tout le monde l'a trouvé très curieux."],["L7-4419","稀少","xīshǎo","Adj","sparse; scarce","escaso; poco abundante","rare; clairsemé","这一带人口稀少，开车很久才能看到一个村子。","zhè yí dài rén kǒu xī shǎo kāi chē hěn jiǔ cái néng kàn dào yí ge cūn zi","This area is sparsely populated; you can drive a long time before seeing a village.","Esta zona está poco poblada; hay que conducir mucho rato para ver un pueblo.","Cette région est peu peuplée, il faut rouler longtemps pour voir un village."],["L7-4420","锡","xī","N","tin; to bestow","estaño; conceder","étain; octroyer","锡是一种很软的金属，常用来做焊料。","xī shì yì zhǒng hěn ruǎn de jīn shǔ cháng yòng lái zuò hàn liào","Tin is a very soft metal often used to make solder.","El estaño es un metal muy blando que se usa a menudo para hacer soldadura.","L'étain est un métal très mou qu'on utilise souvent pour fabriquer de la soudure."],["L7-4421","熙熙攘攘","xīxī-rǎngrǎng","Adj","bustling","bullicioso; concurrido","animé; bondé","节日里的商业街熙熙攘攘，到处都是人。","jié rì lǐ de shāng yè jiē xī xī rǎng rǎng dào chù dōu shì rén","During the holiday the shopping street was bustling, with people everywhere.","Durante las fiestas, la calle comercial estaba muy concurrida, llena de gente por todas partes.","Pendant les fêtes, la rue commerçante grouillait de monde, il y avait des gens partout."],["L7-4422","熄火","xīhuǒ","","to stall; to go out","apagarse; calarse","s'éteindre; caler","车开到半路突然熄火了。","chē kāi dào bàn lù tū rán xī huǒ le","The car suddenly stalled halfway.","El coche se detuvo de repente a medio camino.","La voiture a calé brusquement en chemin."],["L7-4423","膝盖","xīgài","N","knee","rodilla","genou","他的膝盖摔破了，一直在流血。","tā de xī gài shuāi pò le yì zhí zài liú xuè","He scraped his knee in a fall, and it kept bleeding.","Se cayó y se raspó la rodilla, y no deja de sangrar.","Il est tombé et s'est écorché le genou, qui n'arrête pas de saigner."],["L7-4424","嬉笑","xīxiào","V","to laugh and play","reír y juguetear","rire et jouer","孩子们在院子里追逐嬉笑。","hái zi men zài yuàn zi lǐ zhuī zhú xī xiào","The children chase each other and laugh in the yard.","Los niños se persiguen y ríen en el patio.","Les enfants se poursuivent en riant dans la cour."],["L7-4425","习俗","xísú","N","custom; tradition","costumbre; tradición","coutume; tradition","每个民族都有自己独特的习俗。","měi ge mín zú dōu yǒu zì jǐ dú tè de xí sú","Every ethnic group has its own unique customs.","Cada etnia tiene sus propias costumbres únicas.","Chaque ethnie a ses propres coutumes uniques."],["L7-4426","席","xí","N","mat; seat; Xi (surname)","estera; asiento; Xi (apellido)","natte; place; Xi (nom)","他结婚那天，婚宴一共摆了二十席。","tā jié hūn nà tiān hūn yàn yí gòng bǎi le èr shí xí","On his wedding day, the banquet had twenty tables in all.","El día de su boda, el banquete tuvo veinte mesas en total.","Le jour de son mariage, le banquet comptait vingt tables au total."],["L7-4427","席位","xíwèi","N","seat (in an assembly)","escaño; asiento","siège (d'assemblée)","这个党在议会中占了一半的席位。","zhè ge dǎng zài yì huì zhōng zhàn le yí bàn de xí wèi","This party holds half the seats in parliament.","Este partido ocupa la mitad de los escaños del parlamento.","Ce parti détient la moitié des sièges au parlement."],["L7-4428","袭击","xíjī","V","attack; raid","ataque; asaltar","attaque; assaillir","这个地区昨天遭到了台风的袭击。","zhè ge dì qū zuó tiān zāo dào le tái fēng de xí jī","This area was struck by a typhoon yesterday.","Esta zona fue azotada ayer por un tifón.","Cette région a été frappée hier par un typhon."],["L7-4429","媳妇","xífu","N","daughter-in-law; wife","nuera; esposa","belle-fille; épouse","她嫁到王家以后，是个人人夸的好媳妇。","tā jià dào wáng jiā yǐ hòu shì gè rén rén kuā de hǎo xí fù","After marrying into the Wang family, she became a daughter-in-law everyone praises.","Desde que se casó y entró en la familia Wang, es una nuera a la que todos elogian.","Depuis qu'elle est entrée dans la famille Wang par son mariage, elle est une belle-fille que tout le monde loue."],["L7-4430","洗涤剂","xǐdíjì","N","detergent","detergente","détergent","洗碗的时候不要用太多洗涤剂。","xǐ wǎn de shí hou bú yào yòng tài duō xǐ dí jì","Don't use too much detergent when washing dishes.","Al lavar los platos no uses demasiado detergente.","Ne mets pas trop de produit vaisselle quand tu fais la vaisselle."],["L7-4431","洗礼","xǐlǐ","N","baptism","bautismo","baptême","经过战争的洗礼，这座城市变得更加坚强。","jīng guò zhàn zhēng de xǐ lǐ zhè zuò chéng shì biàn de gèng jiā jiān qiáng","Having gone through the trial of war, this city became even stronger.","Tras pasar por la prueba de la guerra, esta ciudad se hizo aún más fuerte.","Après l'épreuve de la guerre, cette ville est devenue encore plus forte."],["L7-4432","喜出望外","xǐchūwàngwài","","overjoyed","rebosar de alegría","fou de joie","收到大学的录取通知书，他喜出望外。","shōu dào dà xué de lù qǔ tōng zhī shū tā xǐ chū wàng wài","He was overjoyed to receive the university admission letter.","Al recibir la carta de admisión de la universidad, se llenó de alegría inesperada.","En recevant sa lettre d'admission à l'université, il a été fou de joie."],["L7-4433","喜好","xǐhào","V/N","to like; preference","gustar; afición","aimer; goût","每个人的喜好都不一样，不能强求。","měi ge rén de xǐ hào dōu bù yí yàng bù néng qiǎng qiú","Everyone has different tastes, so you can't expect everyone to like the same things.","Los gustos de cada persona son diferentes y no se pueden imponer.","Les goûts de chacun sont différents, on ne peut pas les imposer."],["L7-4434","喜酒","xǐjiǔ","N","wedding banquet","banquete de bodas","banquet de mariage","下个月我要去喝表哥的喜酒。","xià ge yuè wǒ yào qù hē biǎo gē de xǐ jiǔ","Next month I'm going to my cousin's wedding banquet.","El mes que viene voy a la boda de mi primo.","Le mois prochain, je vais au repas de noces de mon cousin."],["L7-4435","喜怒哀乐","xǐ-nù-āi-lè","","joys and sorrows","alegrías y penas","joies et peines","他是个演员，很会表现人物的喜怒哀乐。","tā shì gè yǎn yuán hěn huì biǎo xiàn rén wù de xǐ nù āi lè","He is an actor who is very good at expressing a character's range of emotions.","Es un actor que sabe muy bien expresar toda la gama de emociones de un personaje.","C'est un acteur qui sait très bien exprimer toutes les émotions d'un personnage."],["L7-4436","喜庆","xǐqìng","Adj/N","festive; jubilation","festivo; regocijo","festif; liesse","春节期间，大街小巷都充满了喜庆的气氛。","chūn jié qī jiān dà jiē xiǎo xiàng dōu chōng mǎn le xǐ qìng de qì fēn","During the Spring Festival, the streets and lanes are full of a festive atmosphere.","Durante la Fiesta de la Primavera, todas las calles y callejones se llenan de un ambiente festivo.","Pendant la Fête du Printemps, toutes les rues et ruelles sont remplies d'une ambiance festive."],["L7-4437","喜事","xǐshì","N","happy event; wedding","feliz acontecimiento; boda","heureux événement; mariage","听说你家最近有喜事，恭喜恭喜！","tīng shuō nǐ jiā zuì jìn yǒu xǐ shì gōng xǐ gōng xǐ","I heard there was a happy occasion in your family recently. Congratulations!","Me enteré de que hay una buena noticia en tu familia. ¡Felicidades!","J'ai appris qu'il y a un heureux événement dans votre famille. Félicitations !"],["L7-4438","喜糖","xǐtáng","N","wedding candy","caramelos de boda","bonbons de mariage","同事结婚，给我们每人发了一包喜糖。","tóng shì jié hūn gěi wǒ men měi rén fā le yì bāo xǐ táng","A colleague got married and gave each of us a bag of wedding candy.","Una compañera de trabajo se casó y nos dio a cada uno una bolsita de dulces de boda.","Une collègue s'est mariée et nous a offert à chacun un sachet de bonbons de mariage."],["L7-4439","喜洋洋","xǐyángyáng","Adj","radiant with joy","radiante de alegría","rayonnant de joie","过年的时候，家家户户都喜洋洋的。","guò nián de shí hou jiā jiā hù hù dōu xǐ yáng yáng de","At New Year, every household is filled with joy.","En Año Nuevo, todas las casas están llenas de alegría.","À la nouvelle année, toutes les maisons sont remplies de joie."],["L7-4440","喜悦","xǐyuè","Adj","joyful; happy","alegre; gozoso","joyeux; heureux","看到孩子考上大学，父母心里充满了喜悦。","kàn dào hái zi kǎo shàng dà xué fù mǔ xīn lǐ chōng mǎn le xǐ yuè","Seeing their child admitted to university, the parents were filled with joy.","Al ver que su hijo entró a la universidad, los padres se llenaron de alegría.","En voyant leur enfant admis à l'université, les parents étaient remplis de joie."],["L7-4441","细腻","xìnì","Adj","delicate; refined","delicado; fino","délicat; raffiné","她的表演没有刻意煽情，却凭借细腻的神态打动了观众。","tā de biǎo yǎn méi yǒu kè yì shān qíng què píng jiè xì nì de shén tài dǎ dòng le guān zhòng","Her performance avoided deliberate sentimentality, yet moved the audience through subtle expressions.","Su actuación no buscó deliberadamente el sentimentalismo, pero conmovió al público con la sutileza de sus gestos.","Son jeu ne cherchait pas délibérément à faire pleurer, mais il a ému le public par la subtilité de ses expressions."],["L7-4442","细微","xìwēi","Adj","tiny; subtle","diminuto; sutil","infime; subtil","这两张照片只有一些细微的差别。","zhè liǎng zhāng zhào piàn zhǐ yǒu yì xiē xì wēi de chā bié","There are only a few slight differences between these two photos.","Estas dos fotos solo tienen algunas diferencias mínimas.","Ces deux photos ne présentent que de légères différences."],["L7-4443","细心","xìxīn","Adj","careful; attentive","cuidadoso; atento","soigneux; attentif","她很细心，连很小的错误都能发现。","tā hěn xì xīn lián hěn xiǎo de cuò wù dōu néng fā xiàn","She is very careful and can spot even tiny mistakes.","Es muy meticulosa y descubre hasta los errores más pequeños.","Elle est très minutieuse et repère même les plus petites erreurs."],["L7-4444","虾","xiā","N","shrimp; prawn","camarón; gamba","crevette","这家饭馆的虾做得特别好吃。","zhè jiā fàn guǎn de xiā zuò de tè bié hǎo chī","The shrimp at this restaurant are especially delicious.","Los camarones de este restaurante están especialmente deliciosos.","Les crevettes de ce restaurant sont particulièrement délicieuses."],["L7-4445","瞎","xiā","V/Adv","blind; blindly","ciego; a ciegas","aveugle; à l'aveuglette","孩子自己能处理好，你就别瞎操心了。","hái zi zì jǐ néng chǔ lǐ hǎo nǐ jiù bié xiā cāo xīn le","The child can handle it alone, so stop worrying needlessly.","El niño puede arreglárselas solo; no te preocupes por gusto.","L'enfant peut très bien s'en sortir seul, ne t'inquiète pas pour rien."],["L7-4446","侠义","xiáyì","Adj","chivalrous; chivalry","caballeroso; caballerosidad","chevaleresque; chevalerie","武侠小说里的英雄都很有侠义精神。","wǔ xiá xiǎo shuō lǐ de yīng xióng dōu hěn yǒu xiá yì jīng shén","The heroes in martial arts novels all have a chivalrous spirit.","Los héroes de las novelas de artes marciales tienen todos un gran espíritu caballeresco.","Les héros des romans de cape et d'épée ont tous un esprit chevaleresque."],["L7-4447","峡谷","xiágǔ","N","canyon; gorge","cañón; garganta","canyon; gorge","这条河从深深的峡谷中流过。","zhè tiáo hé cóng shēn shēn de xiá gǔ zhōng liú guò","This river flows through a deep canyon.","Este río corre por un profundo cañón.","Cette rivière coule à travers un profond canyon."],["L7-4448","狭隘","xiá'ài","Adj","narrow; narrow-minded","estrecho; de miras estrechas","étroit; borné","他的看法太狭隘了，只考虑自己的利益。","tā de kàn fǎ tài xiá ài le zhǐ kǎo lǜ zì jǐ de lì yì","His views are too narrow-minded; he only considers his own interests.","Su opinión es demasiado estrecha de miras; solo piensa en sus propios intereses.","Son point de vue est trop étroit, il ne pense qu'à son propre intérêt."],["L7-4449","狭小","xiáxiǎo","Adj","narrow; cramped","estrecho; reducido","étroit; exigu","他们一家五口住在一间狭小的房子里。","tā men yì jiā wǔ kǒu zhù zài yì jiān xiá xiǎo de fáng zi lǐ","Their family of five lives in a cramped little house.","Su familia de cinco vive en una casa diminuta.","Leur famille de cinq personnes vit dans une maison exiguë."],["L7-4450","狭窄","xiázhǎi","Adj","narrow","estrecho","étroit","这条胡同很狭窄，汽车开不进去。","zhè tiáo hú tòng hěn xiá zhǎi qì chē kāi bú jìn qù","This alley is very narrow, and cars can't get in.","Este callejón es muy angosto y los autos no pueden entrar.","Cette ruelle est très étroite, les voitures ne peuvent pas y entrer."],["L7-4451","下场","xiàchǎng","N","end result; to leave the stage","final; salir a escena","sort; quitter la scène","做坏事的人最后都不会有好下场。","zuò huài shì de rén zuì hòu dōu bú huì yǒu hǎo xià chǎng","People who do bad things never come to a good end.","Los que hacen cosas malas nunca acaban bien.","Ceux qui font le mal finissent toujours mal."],["L7-4452","下跌","xiàdiē","V","to fall; to plunge","caer; desplomarse","chuter; s'effondrer","股市连续下跌，很多股民损失惨重。","gǔ shì lián xù xià diē hěn duō gǔ mín sǔn shī cǎn zhòng","The stock market kept falling, and many retail investors suffered heavy losses.","La bolsa siguió cayendo y muchos inversionistas sufrieron grandes pérdidas.","La Bourse a continué de chuter, et de nombreux petits porteurs ont subi de lourdes pertes."],["L7-4453","下岗","xiàgǎng","","to be laid off; to go off duty","ser despedido; terminar el turno","être licencié; quitter son poste","他下岗以后，自己开了一家小饭馆。","tā xià gǎng yǐ hòu zì jǐ kāi le yì jiā xiǎo fàn guǎn","After being laid off, he opened a small restaurant himself.","Después de que lo despidieron, abrió un pequeño restaurante por su cuenta.","Après avoir été licencié, il a ouvert lui-même un petit restaurant."],["L7-4454","下功夫","xià gōngfu","","to put in effort","esforzarse; dedicar esfuerzo","faire des efforts","想学好一门外语，就得下功夫。","xiǎng xué hǎo yì mén wài yǔ jiù děi xià gōng fu","If you want to learn a foreign language well, you have to put in the effort.","Si quieres aprender bien un idioma extranjero, tienes que esforzarte.","Si l'on veut bien apprendre une langue étrangère, il faut y mettre du sien."],["L7-4455","下海","xiàhǎi","","to take the plunge into business","lanzarse a los negocios","se lancer dans les affaires","他辞去了公职，下海经商去了。","tā cí qù le gōng zhí xià hǎi jīng shāng qù le","He resigned from public office and went into business.","Renunció a su cargo público y se dedicó a los negocios.","Il a quitté la fonction publique pour se lancer dans les affaires."],["L7-4456","下级","xiàjí","N","subordinate; lower level","subordinado; nivel inferior","subordonné; échelon inférieur","领导应该多听听下级的意见。","lǐng dǎo yīng gāi duō tīng tīng xià jí de yì jiàn","Leaders should listen more to the opinions of their subordinates.","Los dirigentes deberían escuchar más las opiniones de sus subordinados.","Les dirigeants devraient écouter davantage l'avis de leurs subordonnés."],["L7-4457","下决心","xià juéxīn","","to resolve; to make up one's mind","decidirse; resolver","se résoudre; prendre la décision","他下决心今年一定要把烟戒掉。","tā xià jué xīn jīn nián yí dìng yào bǎ yān jiè diào","He made up his mind to quit smoking this year no matter what.","Se propuso firmemente dejar de fumar este año.","Il s'est juré d'arrêter de fumer cette année, coûte que coûte."],["L7-4458","下令","xiàlìng","","to order; to command","ordenar; mandar","ordonner; commander","将军下令部队立即撤退。","jiāng jūn xià lìng bù duì lì jí chè tuì","The general ordered the troops to retreat immediately.","El general ordenó a las tropas que se retiraran de inmediato.","Le général a ordonné aux troupes de se retirer immédiatement."],["L7-4459","下落","xiàluò","N","whereabouts; to fall","paradero; caer","sort; localisation; tomber","那个失踪的孩子至今还没有下落。","nà ge shī zōng de hái zi zhì jīn hái méi yǒu xià luò","There is still no word of the missing child's whereabouts.","Del niño desaparecido todavía no se sabe nada.","On est toujours sans nouvelles de l'enfant disparu."],["L7-4460","下期","xià qī","","next issue; next period","próximo número; próximo periodo","prochain numéro; prochaine période","这个故事的结局，我们下期再讲。","zhè ge gù shi de jié jú wǒ men xià qī zài jiǎng","We'll tell the ending of this story in the next issue.","El final de esta historia lo contaremos en la próxima entrega.","Nous raconterons la fin de cette histoire dans le prochain numéro."],["L7-4461","下棋","xiàqí","","to play chess","jugar al ajedrez","jouer aux échecs","别小看这个孩子，他下棋可厉害了。","bié xiǎo kàn zhè ge hái zi tā xià qí kě lì hai le","Don't underestimate this child; he's really good at chess.","No subestimes a este niño; juega muy bien al ajedrez.","Ne sous-estimez pas cet enfant, il est très fort aux échecs."],["L7-4462","下山","xiàshān","","to go down the mountain; to set","bajar de la montaña; ponerse","descendre de la montagne; se coucher","太阳快下山了，我们赶紧回家吧。","tài yáng kuài xià shān le wǒ men gǎn jǐn huí jiā ba","The sun is about to set; let's hurry home.","El sol está por ponerse; volvamos a casa rápido.","Le soleil va bientôt se coucher, rentrons vite à la maison."],["L7-4463","下手","xiàshǒu","","to start; to set about","empezar; poner manos a la obra","commencer; se mettre à l'œuvre","这道题太难了，我不知道从哪儿下手。","zhè dào tí tài nán le wǒ bù zhī dào cóng nǎr xià shǒu","This problem is too hard; I don't know where to start.","Este problema es muy difícil y no sé por dónde empezar.","Ce problème est trop difficile, je ne sais pas par où commencer."],["L7-4464","下属","xiàshǔ","N","subordinate; underling","subordinado; subalterno","subordonné; subalterne","他对待下属冷酷无情，大家都怕他。","tā duì dài xià shǔ lěng kù wú qíng dà jiā dōu pà tā","He is ruthless toward his subordinates, and everyone is afraid of him.","Es cruel y despiadado con sus subordinados, y todos le tienen miedo.","Il est dur et impitoyable avec ses subordonnés, et tout le monde le craint."],["L7-4465","下台","xiàtái","","to step down; to fall from power","dimitir; caer del poder","démissionner; tomber du pouvoir","演出结束后，演员们向观众鞠躬下台。","yǎn chū jié shù hòu yǎn yuán men xiàng guān zhòng jū gōng xià tái","After the performance, the actors bowed to the audience and left the stage.","Al terminar la función, los actores hicieron una reverencia al público y salieron del escenario.","À la fin du spectacle, les acteurs se sont inclinés devant le public avant de quitter la scène."],["L7-4466","下调","xiàtiáo","V","to adjust downward","rebajar; ajustar a la baja","réviser à la baisse","银行宣布下调贷款利率。","yín háng xuān bù xià tiáo dài kuǎn lì lǜ","The bank announced it would lower its loan interest rates.","El banco anunció una rebaja de las tasas de interés de los préstamos.","La banque a annoncé une baisse de ses taux d'intérêt sur les prêts."],["L7-4467","下乡","xiàxiāng","","to go to the countryside","ir al campo","aller à la campagne","大学生们暑假下乡为农民义务看病。","dà xué shēng men shǔ jià xià xiāng wèi nóng mín yì wù kàn bìng","During the summer vacation, university students went to the countryside to treat farmers for free.","En las vacaciones de verano, los universitarios fueron al campo a atender gratuitamente a los campesinos.","Pendant les vacances d'été, les étudiants sont allés à la campagne soigner gratuitement les paysans."],["L7-4468","下旬","xiàxún","N","last ten days of the month","tercera decena del mes","dernière décade du mois","这个月下旬我要去上海出差。","zhè ge yuè xià xún wǒ yào qù shàng hǎi chū chāi","I'm going on a business trip to Shanghai between the twenty-first and the end of this month.","A finales de este mes tengo que viajar a Shanghái por trabajo.","À la fin de ce mois, je dois me rendre à Shanghai pour affaires."],["L7-4469","下一代","xià yī dài","","next generation","próxima generación","la génération suivante","我们要为下一代留下一个干净的地球。","wǒ men yào wèi xià yí dài liú xià yí ge gān jìng de dì qiú","We must leave a clean Earth for the next generation.","Tenemos que dejarle un planeta limpio a la próxima generación.","Nous devons laisser une Terre propre à la prochaine génération."],["L7-4470","下意识","xiàyìshí","N/Adv","subconscious","subconsciente","subconscient","一阵急促的脚步声打破了寂静，他下意识地抬头望向走廊。","yí zhèn jí cù de jiǎo bù shēng dǎ pò le jì jìng tā xià yì shí de tái tóu wàng xiàng zǒu láng","A burst of hurried footsteps broke the silence, and he instinctively looked up toward the corridor.","Un ruido de pasos apresurados rompió el silencio y él levantó la vista instintivamente hacia el pasillo.","Un bruit de pas précipités rompit le silence, et il leva instinctivement les yeux vers le couloir."],["L7-4471","下游","xiàyóu","N","downstream; lower reaches","río abajo; curso bajo","en aval; cours inférieur","这条河的下游有很多工厂。","zhè tiáo hé de xià yóu yǒu hěn duō gōng chǎng","There are many factories along the lower reaches of this river.","En el curso bajo de este río hay muchas fábricas.","En aval de cette rivière, il y a beaucoup d'usines."],["L7-4472","下坠","xiàzhuì","V","to sink; to droop","caer; hundirse","tomber; s'affaisser","飞机突然开始下坠，乘客们都吓坏了。","fēi jī tū rán kāi shǐ xià zhuì chéng kè men dōu xià huài le","The plane suddenly began to drop, and the passengers were terrified.","El avión empezó a caer de repente y los pasajeros se asustaron muchísimo.","L'avion s'est soudain mis à chuter et les passagers ont été terrifiés."],["L7-4473","吓唬","xiàhu","V","to scare; to frighten","asustar; intimidar","effrayer; intimider","走就走，别拿辞职来吓唬老板。","zǒu jiù zǒu bié ná cí zhí lái xià hu lǎo bǎn","If you want to leave, leave; don't use quitting to scare the boss.","Si te quieres ir, vete; no amenaces al jefe con renunciar.","Si tu veux partir, pars ; ne menace pas le patron de démissionner."],["L7-4474","吓人","xiàrén","","scary; frightening","aterrador; espantoso","effrayant; terrifiant","昨晚的雷声真吓人，孩子一直躲在被子里。","zuó wǎn de léi shēng zhēn xià rén hái zi yì zhí duǒ zài bèi zi lǐ","Last night's thunder was really frightening; the child hid under the covers the whole time.","Los truenos de anoche daban mucho miedo; el niño se escondió bajo las cobijas todo el rato.","Le tonnerre d'hier soir était vraiment effrayant, l'enfant est resté caché sous les couvertures tout le temps."],["L7-4475","夏令营","xiàlìngyíng","N","summer camp","campamento de verano","colonie de vacances","今年暑假，儿子参加了一个英语夏令营。","jīn nián shǔ jià ér zi cān jiā le yí ge yīng yǔ xià lìng yíng","This summer, my son attended an English summer camp.","Este verano, mi hijo participó en un campamento de verano de inglés.","Cet été, mon fils a participé à un camp d'été d'anglais."],["L7-4476","仙鹤","xiānhè","N","red-crowned crane","grulla manchú","grue du Japon","画上有两只仙鹤站在松树下。","huà shàng yǒu liǎng zhī xiān hè zhàn zài sōng shù xià","In the painting, two cranes stand beneath a pine tree.","En la pintura hay dos grullas de pie bajo un pino.","Sur le tableau, deux grues se tiennent sous un pin."],["L7-4477","仙女","xiānnǚ","N","fairy; immortal maiden","hada; doncella inmortal","fée; immortelle","她穿着白色的长裙，像仙女一样漂亮。","tā chuān zhe bái sè de cháng qún xiàng xiān nǚ yí yàng piào liang","In her long white dress, she was as beautiful as a fairy.","Con su largo vestido blanco, estaba hermosa como un hada.","Dans sa longue robe blanche, elle était belle comme une fée."],["L7-4478","先例","xiānlì","N","precedent","precedente","précédent","这种做法在我们公司还没有先例。","zhè zhǒng zuò fǎ zài wǒ men gōng sī hái méi yǒu xiān lì","There is no precedent for this practice in our company.","Esta práctica no tiene precedentes en nuestra empresa.","Cette pratique n'a pas de précédent dans notre entreprise."],["L7-4479","先天","xiāntiān","N","innate; inborn","innato; congénito","inné; congénital","这孩子先天心脏不好，需要做手术。","zhè hái zi xiān tiān xīn zàng bù hǎo xū yào zuò shǒu shù","This child was born with a weak heart and needs an operation.","Este niño nació con un problema cardíaco y necesita una operación.","Cet enfant est né avec un cœur fragile et doit être opéré."],["L7-4480","纤维","xiānwéi","N","fiber","fibra","fibre","多吃蔬菜可以补充膳食纤维。","duō chī shū cài kě yǐ bǔ chōng shàn shí xiān wéi","Eating more vegetables can help increase your dietary fiber intake.","Comer más verduras ayuda a aumentar la ingesta de fibra alimentaria.","Manger davantage de légumes permet d'augmenter son apport en fibres alimentaires."],["L7-4481","掀","xiān","V","to lift; to rock","levantar; agitar","soulever; secouer","她轻轻掀了一下窗帘，往外看了看。","tā qīng qīng xiān le yí xià chuāng lián wǎng wài kàn le kàn","She gently lifted the curtain and looked outside.","Levantó suavemente la cortina y miró hacia afuera.","Elle a soulevé doucement le rideau et a regardé dehors."],["L7-4482","掀起","xiānqǐ","V","to lift; to stir up; to set off","levantar; desatar; provocar","soulever; déclencher; provoquer","近几年，全国掀起了一股露营的热潮。","jìn jǐ nián quán guó xiān qǐ le yì gǔ lù yíng de rè cháo","In recent years, a camping craze has swept the country.","En los últimos años, ha surgido en todo el país una verdadera fiebre por acampar.","Ces dernières années, un véritable engouement pour le camping a gagné tout le pays."],["L7-4483","鲜活","xiānhuó","Adj","vivid; fresh","vívido; fresco","vivant; frais","这本书里的人物写得很鲜活。","zhè běn shū lǐ de rén wù xiě de hěn xiān huó","The characters in this book are vividly written.","Los personajes de este libro están descritos con mucha vivacidad.","Les personnages de ce livre sont dépeints de façon très vivante."],["L7-4484","鲜美","xiānměi","Adj","delicious; tasty","delicioso; sabroso","délicieux; savoureux","这条鱼做成汤，味道特别鲜美。","zhè tiáo yú zuò chéng tāng wèi dào tè bié xiān měi","Made into soup, this fish tastes especially fresh and delicious.","Hecho en sopa, este pescado tiene un sabor fresco y delicioso.","En soupe, ce poisson a un goût particulièrement frais et délicieux."],["L7-4485","鲜血","xiānxuè","N","blood","sangre","sang","他的手被玻璃划破了，鲜血直流。","tā de shǒu bèi bō li huá pò le xiān xuè zhí liú","His hand was cut by glass and blood kept flowing.","Se cortó la mano con un vidrio y la sangre le corría sin parar.","Sa main a été coupée par du verre et le sang coulait à flots."],["L7-4486","弦","xián","N","string; bowstring; chord","cuerda; arco; cuerda (geom.)","corde; arc; corde (géom.)","吉他的一根弦断了，我得去换一根。","jí tā de yì gēn xián duàn le wǒ děi qù huàn yì gēn","One of the guitar's strings broke; I have to go replace it.","Se rompió una cuerda de la guitarra; tengo que ir a cambiarla.","Une corde de la guitare a cassé ; il faut que j'aille la remplacer."],["L7-4487","衔接","xiánjiē","V","to link up; to connect","enlazar; empalmar","assurer la jonction; relier","这两段文字衔接得不太自然。","zhè liǎng duàn wén zì xián jiē de bú tài zì rán","These two passages don't connect very naturally.","Estos dos pasajes no están muy bien enlazados.","Ces deux passages s'enchaînent de façon peu naturelle."],["L7-4488","嫌弃","xiánqì","V","to despise; to shun","despreciar; rehuir","dédaigner; fuir","他从来不嫌弃妻子做的饭不好吃。","tā cóng lái bù xián qì qī zi zuò de fàn bù hǎo chī","He never turns his nose up at his wife's cooking, even when it doesn't taste good.","Nunca le hace ascos a la comida de su esposa, aunque no esté buena.","Il ne fait jamais la fine bouche devant la cuisine de sa femme, même quand elle n'est pas bonne."],["L7-4489","嫌疑","xiányí","N","suspicion","sospecha","soupçon","警方已经排除了他的嫌疑。","jǐng fāng yǐ jīng pái chú le tā de xián yí","The police have already cleared him of suspicion.","La policía ya lo descartó como sospechoso.","La police l'a déjà mis hors de cause."],["L7-4490","显而易见","xiǎn'éryìjiàn","","obvious; clear at a glance","evidente; obvio","évident; manifeste","这个方法的好处是显而易见的。","zhè ge fāng fǎ de hǎo chù shì xiǎn ér yì jiàn de","The advantages of this method are obvious.","Las ventajas de este método son evidentes.","Les avantages de cette méthode sont évidents."],["L7-4491","显赫","xiǎnhè","Adj","illustrious; eminent","ilustre; destacado","illustre; éminent","他出生在一个显赫的家族。","tā chū shēng zài yí ge xiǎn hè de jiā zú","He was born into an illustrious family.","Nació en una familia ilustre.","Il est né dans une famille illustre."],["L7-4492","显示器","xiǎnshìqì","N","monitor; display","monitor; pantalla","écran; moniteur","这台电脑的显示器很大，看电影很舒服。","zhè tái diàn nǎo de xiǎn shì qì hěn dà kàn diàn yǐng hěn shū fu","This computer has a large monitor, which makes watching movies comfortable.","Este ordenador tiene un monitor grande y es muy agradable ver películas en él.","Cet ordinateur a un grand écran, c'est agréable pour regarder des films."],["L7-4493","显现","xiǎnxiàn","V","to appear; to emerge","aparecer; manifestarse","apparaître; se manifester","药吃了一个星期，效果才慢慢显现出来。","yào chī le yí ge xīng qī xiào guǒ cái màn màn xiǎn xiàn chū lái","After taking the medicine for a week, the effect gradually began to show.","Tras tomar la medicina durante una semana, el efecto empezó a notarse poco a poco.","Ce n'est qu'après une semaine de traitement que l'effet a commencé à se faire sentir."],["L7-4494","显眼","xiǎnyǎn","Adj","conspicuous; eye-catching","llamativo; visible","voyant; qui attire l'œil","她穿了一件红外套，在人群中特别显眼。","tā chuān le yí jiàn hóng wài tào zài rén qún zhōng tè bié xiǎn yǎn","She wore a red coat and stood out in the crowd.","Llevaba un abrigo rojo y destacaba muchísimo entre la multitud.","Elle portait un manteau rouge et se remarquait particulièrement dans la foule."],["L7-4495","现成","xiànchéng","Adj","ready-made; at hand","ya hecho; disponible","tout fait; disponible","冰箱里有现成的饭菜，热一下就能吃。","bīng xiāng lǐ yǒu xiàn chéng de fàn cài rè yí xià jiù néng chī","There's ready-made food in the fridge; just heat it up and eat.","En el refrigerador hay comida ya preparada; solo hay que calentarla.","Il y a des plats déjà prêts dans le frigo, il suffit de les réchauffer."],["L7-4496","现任","xiànrèn","V/Adj","current; incumbent; to hold a post","actual; titular; ocupar un cargo","actuel; en fonction; occuper un poste","他是这所学校的现任校长。","tā shì zhè suǒ xué xiào de xiàn rèn xiào zhǎng","He is the current principal of this school.","Es el actual director de esta escuela.","Il est l'actuel directeur de cette école."],["L7-4497","现行","xiànxíng","Adj","currently in force","vigente; en vigor","en vigueur; actuel","按照现行的规定，这样做是不允许的。","àn zhào xiàn xíng de guī dìng zhè yàng zuò shì bù yǔn xǔ de","According to current regulations, doing this is not allowed.","Según la normativa vigente, esto no está permitido.","Selon la réglementation en vigueur, ce n'est pas autorisé."],["L7-4498","限","xiàn","V","to limit; limit","limitar; límite","limiter; limite","这次调整旨在减少重复审批，而不是把所有权限都集中到一把手手中。","zhè cì tiáo zhěng zhǐ zài jiǎn shǎo chóng fù shěn pī ér bú shì bǎ suǒ yǒu quán xiàn dōu jí zhōng dào yì bǎ shǒu shǒu zhōng","This adjustment aims to reduce duplicate approvals, rather than concentrate all authority in the top leader's hands.","Este ajuste tiene como fin reducir las aprobaciones duplicadas, no concentrar toda la autoridad en manos del máximo responsable.","Cet ajustement vise à réduire les validations en double, et non à concentrer tous les pouvoirs entre les mains du premier responsable."],["L7-4499","限定","xiàndìng","V","to limit; to restrict to","limitar a; restringir","limiter à; restreindre","每位顾客限定购买两件。","měi wèi gù kè xiàn dìng gòu mǎi liǎng jiàn","Each customer is limited to buying two items.","Cada cliente puede comprar un máximo de dos artículos.","Chaque client est limité à l'achat de deux articles."],["L7-4500","限度","xiàndù","N","limit; bounds","límite","limite; borne","每个人的忍耐都有一定的限度。","měi ge rén de rěn nài dōu yǒu yí dìng de xiàn dù","Everyone's patience has a certain limit.","La paciencia de cada persona tiene un límite.","La patience de chacun a ses limites."],["L7-4501","限于","xiànyú","V","to be limited to","limitarse a","se limiter à","这次比赛的参加者限于本校学生。","zhè cì bǐ sài de cān jiā zhě xiàn yú běn xiào xué shēng","Participants in this competition are limited to students of this school.","Los participantes de esta competencia se limitan a los estudiantes de esta escuela.","Les participants à ce concours sont limités aux élèves de l'école."],["L7-4502","线条","xiàntiáo","N","line; contour","línea; trazo","ligne; contour","这幅画的线条简单，却很有表现力。","zhè fú huà de xiàn tiáo jiǎn dān què hěn yǒu biǎo xiàn lì","The lines of this painting are simple yet very expressive.","Las líneas de este cuadro son sencillas, pero muy expresivas.","Les lignes de ce tableau sont simples mais très expressives."],["L7-4503","宪法","xiànfǎ","N","constitution","constitución","constitution","宪法是一个国家的根本大法。","xiàn fǎ shì yí ge guó jiā de gēn běn dà fǎ","The constitution is the fundamental law of a country.","La constitución es la ley fundamental de un país.","La constitution est la loi fondamentale d'un pays."],["L7-4504","陷","xiàn","V","trap; to sink; to get stuck","trampa; hundirse; quedar atascado","piège; s'enfoncer; s'embourber","下过雨以后，他的鞋陷在泥里拔不出来了。","xià guo yǔ yǐ hòu tā de xié xiàn zài ní lǐ bá bù chū lái le","After the rain, his shoes got stuck in the mud and wouldn't come out.","Después de la lluvia, sus zapatos se hundieron en el barro y no podía sacarlos.","Après la pluie, ses chaussures se sont enfoncées dans la boue et il n'arrivait plus à les sortir."],["L7-4505","陷阱","xiànjǐng","N","pitfall; trap","trampa","piège","这个低价广告其实是个陷阱。","zhè ge dī jià guǎng gào qí shí shì gè xiàn jǐng","This low-price advertisement is actually a trap.","Este anuncio de precios bajos en realidad es una trampa.","Cette publicité à prix cassés est en réalité un piège."],["L7-4506","馅儿","xiànr","N","filling; stuffing","relleno","farce; garniture","妈妈包的饺子是白菜猪肉馅儿的。","mā ma bāo de jiǎo zi shì bái cài zhū ròu xiànr de","The dumplings Mom made have a cabbage and pork filling.","Los dumplings que hace mamá son de repollo y cerdo.","Les raviolis que maman prépare sont farcis au chou et au porc."],["L7-4507","羡慕","xiànmù","V","to envy; to admire","envidiar; admirar","envier; admirer","大家都很羡慕她有一个幸福的家庭。","dà jiā dōu hěn xiàn mù tā yǒu yí ge xìng fú de jiā tíng","Everyone envies her for having a happy family.","Todos envidian que tenga una familia tan feliz.","Tout le monde l'envie d'avoir une famille heureuse."],["L7-4508","献血","xiànxiě","V","to donate blood","donar sangre","donner son sang","地震以后，很多市民自发去献血。","dì zhèn yǐ hòu hěn duō shì mín zì fā qù xiàn xuè","After the earthquake, many citizens spontaneously went to donate blood.","Después del terremoto, muchos ciudadanos fueron por iniciativa propia a donar sangre.","Après le séisme, beaucoup de citoyens sont allés donner leur sang spontanément."],["L7-4509","腺","xiàn","N","gland","glándula","glande","人体里有很多种腺，它们能分泌不同的物质。","rén tǐ lǐ yǒu hěn duō zhǒng xiàn tā men néng fēn mì bù tóng de wù zhì","The human body has many kinds of glands that secrete different substances.","El cuerpo humano tiene muchos tipos de glándulas, que secretan distintas sustancias.","Le corps humain possède de nombreuses sortes de glandes, qui sécrètent des substances différentes."],["L7-4510","乡亲","xiāngqīn","N","fellow villager; folks","paisano; vecinos del pueblo","pays; gens du village","他回到老家，乡亲们都热情地欢迎他。","tā huí dào lǎo jiā xiāng qīn men dōu rè qíng de huān yíng tā","When he returned to his hometown, the local folks warmly welcomed him.","Cuando volvió a su pueblo natal, sus paisanos lo recibieron con calidez.","À son retour dans son village natal, les gens du pays l'ont chaleureusement accueilli."],["L7-4511","乡下","xiāngxia","N","countryside","campo; zona rural","campagne","每年暑假我都去乡下看外婆。","měi nián shǔ jià wǒ dōu qù xiāng xia kàn wài pó","Every summer vacation I go to the countryside to see my maternal grandmother.","Todos los años, en las vacaciones de verano, voy al campo a ver a mi abuela materna.","Chaque année, pendant les vacances d'été, je vais à la campagne voir ma grand-mère maternelle."],["L7-4512","相伴","xiāngbàn","V","to accompany","acompañar","accompagner","这只老狗已经和他相伴了十几年。","zhè zhī lǎo gǒu yǐ jīng hé tā xiāng bàn le shí jǐ nián","This old dog has kept him company for more than ten years.","Este viejo perro lo ha acompañado durante más de diez años.","Ce vieux chien l'accompagne depuis plus de dix ans."],["L7-4513","相比之下","xiāngbǐ zhī xià","","by comparison","en comparación","en comparaison","城里很热闹，相比之下，乡村安静多了。","chéng lǐ hěn rè nao xiāng bǐ zhī xià xiāng cūn ān jìng duō le","The city is very lively; by comparison, the countryside is much quieter.","La ciudad es muy animada; en comparación, el campo es mucho más tranquilo.","La ville est très animée ; en comparaison, la campagne est bien plus calme."],["L7-4514","相差","xiāngchà","V","to differ; difference","diferir; diferencia","différer; écart","这两个城市的气温相差十度。","zhè liǎng gè chéng shì de qì wēn xiāng chà shí dù","The temperatures of these two cities differ by ten degrees.","La temperatura de estas dos ciudades difiere en diez grados.","La température de ces deux villes diffère de dix degrés."],["L7-4515","相传","xiāngchuán","V","to be handed down; legend has it","transmitirse; según la leyenda","se transmettre; selon la légende","相传这座桥是一千年前修建的。","xiāng chuán zhè zuò qiáo shì yì qiān nián qián xiū jiàn de","According to legend, this bridge was built a thousand years ago.","Según la tradición, este puente se construyó hace mil años.","Selon la tradition, ce pont a été construit il y a mille ans."],["L7-4516","相当于","xiāngdāngyú","V","equivalent to","equivale a","équivaut à","在中国，一公斤相当于两斤。","zài zhōng guó yì gōng jīn xiāng dāng yú liǎng jīn","In China, one kilogram is equivalent to two jin.","En China, un kilogramo equivale a dos jin.","En Chine, un kilogramme équivaut à deux jin."],["L7-4517","相对","xiāngduì","V/Adj","relatively; opposite; relative","relativamente; opuesto; relativo","relativement; opposé; relatif","这里的房价相对便宜一些。","zhè lǐ de fáng jià xiāng duì pián yi yì xiē","Housing prices here are relatively cheaper.","Los precios de la vivienda aquí son relativamente más baratos.","Les prix de l'immobilier sont ici relativement plus bas."],["L7-4518","相对而言","xiāngduì-éryán","","relatively speaking","en términos relativos","relativement parlant","相对而言，坐火车比坐飞机更舒服。","xiāng duì ér yán zuò huǒ chē bǐ zuò fēi jī gèng shū fu","Relatively speaking, taking the train is more comfortable than flying.","En términos relativos, viajar en tren es más cómodo que en avión.","Relativement parlant, voyager en train est plus confortable qu'en avion."],["L7-4519","相辅相成","xiāngfǔ-xiāngchéng","","to complement each other","complementarse","se compléter mutuellement","学习和实践是相辅相成的。","xué xí hé shí jiàn shì xiāng fǔ xiāng chéng de","Study and practice complement each other.","El estudio y la práctica se complementan mutuamente.","L'étude et la pratique se complètent."],["L7-4520","相继","xiāngjì","Adv","in succession","sucesivamente","successivement","几位老教授相继退休了。","jǐ wèi lǎo jiào shòu xiāng jì tuì xiū le","Several old professors retired one after another.","Varios profesores veteranos se jubilaron uno tras otro.","Plusieurs vieux professeurs ont pris leur retraite les uns après les autres."],["L7-4521","相连","xiānglián","V","to be connected; to link","estar conectado; unir","relier; être relié","这两栋楼之间有一座天桥相连。","zhè liǎng dòng lóu zhī jiān yǒu yí zuò tiān qiáo xiāng lián","These two buildings are connected by a skybridge.","Estos dos edificios están conectados por una pasarela elevada.","Ces deux bâtiments sont reliés par une passerelle."],["L7-4522","相识","xiāngshí","V","to get acquainted; acquaintance","conocerse; conocido","faire connaissance; connaissance","我们是在一次旅行中相识的。","wǒ men shì zài yí cì lǚ xíng zhōng xiāng shí de","We got to know each other on a trip.","Nos conocimos en un viaje.","Nous nous sommes connus lors d'un voyage."],["L7-4523","相提并论","xiāngtí-bìnglùn","","to put on a par","comparar en pie de igualdad","mettre sur le même plan","这两件事性质完全不同，不能相提并论。","zhè liǎng jiàn shì xìng zhì wán quán bù tóng bù néng xiāng tí bìng lùn","These two matters are completely different in nature and can't be mentioned in the same breath.","Estos dos asuntos son de naturaleza completamente distinta y no se pueden comparar.","Ces deux affaires sont de nature totalement différente, on ne peut pas les mettre sur le même plan."],["L7-4524","相通","xiāngtōng","V","interlinked; communicating","comunicado; interconectado","communicant; relié","各国文化虽然不同，但人的感情是相通的。","gè guó wén huà suī rán bù tóng dàn rén de gǎn qíng shì xiāng tōng de","Although cultures differ from country to country, human feelings are shared.","Aunque las culturas de cada país son distintas, los sentimientos humanos son universales.","Même si les cultures diffèrent d'un pays à l'autre, les sentiments humains sont universels."],["L7-4525","相依为命","xiāngyī-wéimìng","","to depend on each other","depender el uno del otro","vivre l'un pour l'autre","父亲去世后，他和母亲相依为命。","fù qīn qù shì hòu tā hé mǔ qīn xiāng yī wéi mìng","After his father died, he and his mother relied on each other to get by.","Después de que murió su padre, él y su madre vivieron el uno para el otro.","Après la mort de son père, il a vécu seul avec sa mère, ils n'avaient que l'un l'autre."],["L7-4526","相遇","xiāngyù","V","to meet; to encounter","encontrarse; toparse con","se rencontrer; croiser","我们能在这里相遇，真是缘分。","wǒ men néng zài zhè lǐ xiāng yù zhēn shì yuán fèn","It's really fate that we met here.","Que nos hayamos encontrado aquí es realmente cosa del destino.","Que nous nous soyons rencontrés ici, c'est vraiment le destin."],["L7-4527","相约","xiāngyuē","V","to arrange to meet","quedar; acordar","convenir de se retrouver","我们相约明年夏天再来这里。","wǒ men xiāng yuē míng nián xià tiān zài lái zhè lǐ","We agreed to come back here next summer.","Quedamos en volver aquí el próximo verano.","Nous avons convenu de revenir ici l'été prochain."],["L7-4528","香料","xiāngliào","N","spice; fragrance","especia; fragancia","épice; parfum","这道菜里放了好几种香料。","zhè dào cài lǐ fàng le hǎo jǐ zhǒng xiāng liào","Several spices were added to this dish.","A este plato se le añadieron varias especias.","Plusieurs épices ont été ajoutées à ce plat."],["L7-4529","香水","xiāngshuǐ","N","perfume","perfume","parfum","她身上有一股淡淡的香水味。","tā shēn shang yǒu yì gǔ dàn dàn de xiāng shuǐ wèi","She has a faint scent of perfume.","Desprende un ligero aroma de perfume.","Elle dégage une légère odeur de parfum."],["L7-4530","香味","xiāngwèi","N","fragrance; aroma","aroma; fragancia","parfum; arôme","厨房里飘出了饭菜的香味。","chú fáng lǐ piāo chū le fàn cài de xiāng wèi","The aroma of food drifted out of the kitchen.","De la cocina salía el aroma de la comida.","L'odeur du repas s'échappait de la cuisine."],["L7-4531","香烟","xiāngyān","N","cigarette","cigarrillo","cigarette","为了健康，他终于戒掉了香烟。","wèi le jiàn kāng tā zhōng yú jiè diào le xiāng yān","For the sake of his health, he finally gave up cigarettes.","Por su salud, por fin dejó de fumar.","Pour sa santé, il a enfin arrêté de fumer."],["L7-4532","香油","xiāngyóu","N","sesame oil","aceite de sésamo","huile de sésame","拌凉菜的时候放几滴香油会更香。","bàn liáng cài de shí hou fàng jǐ dī xiāng yóu huì gèng xiāng","Adding a few drops of sesame oil makes cold dishes more fragrant.","Al aliñar ensaladas frías, unas gotas de aceite de sésamo les dan más aroma.","Quelques gouttes d'huile de sésame dans les plats froids les rendent plus parfumés."],["L7-4533","镶","xiāng","V","to inlay; to set","incrustar; engastar","incruster; sertir","她的戒指上镶着一颗小钻石。","tā de jiè zhi shàng xiāng zhe yì kē xiǎo zuàn shí","Her ring is set with a small diamond.","Su anillo lleva engastado un pequeño diamante.","Sa bague est sertie d'un petit diamant."],["L7-4534","镶嵌","xiāngqiàn","V","to inlay; to embed","incrustar; engastar","incruster; sertir","这扇古老的门上镶嵌着精美的宝石。","zhè shàn gǔ lǎo de mén shàng xiāng qiàn zhe jīng měi de bǎo shí","This ancient door is inlaid with exquisite gems.","Esta antigua puerta está incrustada con exquisitas piedras preciosas.","Cette ancienne porte est incrustée de magnifiques pierres précieuses."],["L7-4535","详尽","xiángjìn","Adj","detailed; exhaustive","detallado; exhaustivo","détaillé; exhaustif","这份说明书写得非常详尽。","zhè fèn shuō míng shū xiě de fēi cháng xiáng jìn","This manual is written in great detail.","Este manual de instrucciones está escrito con muchísimo detalle.","Ce mode d'emploi est rédigé de façon extrêmement détaillée."],["L7-4536","祥和","xiánghé","Adj","auspicious; peaceful","armonioso; sereno","paisible; serein","节日里，小镇上一片祥和的景象。","jié rì lǐ xiǎo zhèn shàng yí piàn xiáng hé de jǐng xiàng","During the festival, the small town was a peaceful and happy scene.","Durante la fiesta, el pequeño pueblo respiraba paz y alegría.","Pendant la fête, la petite ville offrait un spectacle de paix et de sérénité."],["L7-4537","享","xiǎng","V","to enjoy; to have use of","disfrutar; gozar de","jouir de; bénéficier de","辛苦了一辈子，老人终于可以享享福了。","xīn kǔ le yí bèi zi lǎo rén zhōng yú kě yǐ xiǎng xiǎng fú le","After a lifetime of hard work, the old man can finally enjoy some comfort.","Tras trabajar duro toda la vida, el anciano por fin puede disfrutar de una vida cómoda.","Après une vie de dur labeur, le vieil homme peut enfin profiter d'une vie tranquille."],["L7-4538","享有","xiǎngyǒu","V","to enjoy (rights)","gozar de (derechos)","jouir de (droits)","每个公民都享有受教育的权利。","měi ge gōng mín dōu xiǎng yǒu shòu jiào yù de quán lì","Every citizen enjoys the right to education.","Todo ciudadano goza del derecho a la educación.","Tout citoyen jouit du droit à l'éducation."],["L7-4539","响亮","xiǎngliàng","Adj","loud and clear","sonoro; claro","sonore; retentissant","孩子们响亮地回答了老师的问题。","hái zi men xiǎng liàng de huí dá le lǎo shī de wèn tí","The children answered the teacher's question loudly and clearly.","Los niños respondieron en voz alta y clara a la pregunta del maestro.","Les enfants ont répondu d'une voix claire et forte à la question du professeur."],["L7-4540","响起","xiǎngqǐ","","to ring out; to sound","resonar; sonar","retentir; résonner","火警响起后，大楼里的人员被迅速疏散。","huǒ jǐng xiǎng qǐ hòu dà lóu lǐ de rén yuán bèi xùn sù shū sàn","After the fire alarm went off, the people in the building were quickly evacuated.","Cuando sonó la alarma de incendios, las personas del edificio fueron evacuadas rápidamente.","Après le déclenchement de l'alarme incendie, les occupants de l'immeuble ont été rapidement évacués."],["L7-4541","响应","xiǎngyìng","V","to respond to","responder a; hacerse eco","répondre à; réagir à","大家积极响应学校的号召，参加植树活动。","dà jiā jī jí xiǎng yìng xué xiào de hào zhào cān jiā zhí shù huó dòng","Everyone actively responded to the school's call and took part in tree planting.","Todos respondieron con entusiasmo al llamado de la escuela y participaron en la plantación de árboles.","Tout le monde a répondu avec enthousiasme à l'appel de l'école et a participé à la plantation d'arbres."],["L7-4542","想方设法","xiǎngfāng-shèfǎ","","to try every possible means","hacer todo lo posible","tout mettre en œuvre","父母想方设法让孩子吃上有营养的饭菜。","fù mǔ xiǎng fāng shè fǎ ràng hái zi chī shàng yǒu yíng yǎng de fàn cài","The parents try every possible way to give their child nutritious meals.","Los padres hacen lo posible por darle a su hijo comidas nutritivas.","Les parents font tout leur possible pour que leur enfant mange des repas nutritifs."],["L7-4543","向来","xiànglái","Adv","always; all along","siempre; desde siempre","toujours; depuis toujours","他向来说话算话，从不失信。","tā xiàng lái shuō huà suàn huà cóng bù shī xìn","He has always kept his word and never broken a promise.","Siempre cumple lo que dice y nunca falta a su palabra.","Il tient toujours parole et n'a jamais manqué à ses engagements."],["L7-4544","向往","xiàngwǎng","V","to yearn for","anhelar","aspirer à; rêver de","她一直向往去西藏旅行。","tā yì zhí xiàng wǎng qù xī zàng lǚ xíng","She has always longed to travel to Tibet.","Siempre ha soñado con viajar al Tíbet.","Elle a toujours rêvé de voyager au Tibet."],["L7-4545","向着","xiàngzhe","V","towards; facing; to side with","hacia; de cara a; ponerse del lado de","vers; face à; prendre parti pour","小船向着对岸慢慢划去。","xiǎo chuán xiàng zhe duì àn màn màn huá qù","The little boat was slowly rowed toward the opposite bank.","El botecito avanzaba remando lentamente hacia la otra orilla.","La petite barque ramait lentement vers l'autre rive."],["L7-4546","项链","xiàngliàn","N","necklace","collar","collier","这条项链是妈妈送给她的生日礼物。","zhè tiáo xiàng liàn shì mā ma sòng gěi tā de shēng rì lǐ wù","This necklace was a birthday present from her mother.","Este collar fue el regalo de cumpleaños que le dio su mamá.","Ce collier est le cadeau d'anniversaire que sa mère lui a offert."],["L7-4547","像","xiàng","N","to resemble; such as","parecerse a; como","ressembler à; comme","他长得又高又壮，像个运动员。","tā zhǎng de yòu gāo yòu zhuàng xiàng gè yùn dòng yuán","He is tall and sturdy, like an athlete.","Es alto y fornido, como un deportista.","Il est grand et robuste, comme un athlète."],["L7-4548","像样","xiàngyàng","","presentable; decent","presentable; decente","présentable; convenable","他找了半天，也没找到一件像样的衣服。","tā zhǎo le bàn tiān yě méi zhǎo dào yí jiàn xiàng yàng de yī fu","He searched for a long time but couldn't find a decent piece of clothing.","Buscó un buen rato pero no encontró ni una prenda decente.","Il a cherché longtemps sans trouver un seul vêtement correct."],["L7-4549","橡胶","xiàngjiāo","N","rubber","caucho","caoutchouc","这种鞋底是用橡胶做的，很防滑。","zhè zhǒng xié dǐ shì yòng xiàng jiāo zuò de hěn fáng huá","These soles are made of rubber and are very slip-resistant.","Esta suela está hecha de caucho y es muy antideslizante.","Cette semelle est en caoutchouc et très antidérapante."],["L7-4550","橡皮","xiàngpí","N","eraser; rubber","goma de borrar; caucho","gomme; caoutchouc","我写错了字，借你的橡皮用一下。","wǒ xiě cuò le zì jiè nǐ de xiàng pí yòng yí xià","I wrote a character wrong; let me borrow your eraser.","Escribí mal un carácter; préstame tu goma de borrar un momento.","Je me suis trompé de caractère, prête-moi ta gomme un instant."],["L7-4551","削","xiāo","V","to peel; to pare","pelar; mondar","éplucher; tailler","妈妈给我削了一个苹果。","mā ma gěi wǒ xiāo le yí ge píng guǒ","Mom peeled an apple for me.","Mamá me peló una manzana.","Maman m'a épluché une pomme."],["L7-4552","消","xiāo","V","to disappear; to dissipate; to need","disiparse; consumir; necesitar","disparaître; dissiper; falloir","过了一个晚上，他的气还没消。","guò le yí ge wǎn shang tā de qì hái méi xiāo","After a whole night, his anger still hadn't subsided.","Pasó una noche entera y su enojo todavía no se le ha pasado.","Après une nuit entière, sa colère n'était toujours pas retombée."],["L7-4553","消沉","xiāochén","Adj","depressed; low-spirited","abatido; decaído","abattu; déprimé","比赛失利以后，他一度很消沉。","bǐ sài shī lì yǐ hòu tā yí dù hěn xiāo chén","After losing the match, he was very depressed for a while.","Tras perder el partido, estuvo muy decaído durante un tiempo.","Après avoir perdu le match, il a été très abattu pendant un moment."],["L7-4554","消遣","xiāoqiǎn","V","to while away time; pastime","pasar el rato; pasatiempo","se distraire; passe-temps","他周末喜欢钓鱼，当作一种消遣。","tā zhōu mò xǐ huan diào yú dàng zuò yì zhǒng xiāo qiǎn","On weekends he likes to go fishing as a pastime.","Los fines de semana le gusta pescar como pasatiempo.","Le week-end, il aime pêcher pour se distraire."],["L7-4555","萧条","xiāotiáo","Adj","bleak; depressed (economy)","desolado; en recesión","désolé; en récession","经济萧条的时候，很多工厂都倒闭了。","jīng jì xiāo tiáo de shí hou hěn duō gōng chǎng dōu dǎo bì le","During the economic depression, many factories went bankrupt.","Durante la depresión económica, muchas fábricas quebraron.","Pendant la dépression économique, beaucoup d'usines ont fait faillite."],["L7-4556","销","xiāo","V","to sell; to cancel; to spend","vender; cancelar; gastar","vendre; annuler; dépenser","这批茶叶主要销往欧洲。","zhè pī chá yè zhǔ yào xiāo wǎng ōu zhōu","This batch of tea is mainly sold to Europe.","Este lote de té se vende principalmente a Europa.","Ce lot de thé est principalement vendu en Europe."],["L7-4557","销毁","xiāohuǐ","V","to destroy; to dispose of","destruir; eliminar","détruire; anéantir","警方当众销毁了一批假药。","jǐng fāng dāng zhòng xiāo huǐ le yì pī jiǎ yào","The police publicly destroyed a batch of fake medicine.","La policía destruyó públicamente un lote de medicinas falsas.","La police a détruit publiquement un lot de faux médicaments."],["L7-4558","销量","xiāoliàng","N","sales volume","volumen de ventas","volume des ventes","本期杂志的销量比上期增加了两成。","běn qī zá zhì de xiāo liàng bǐ shàng qī zēng jiā le liǎng chéng","Sales of this issue of the magazine were twenty percent higher than the previous one.","Las ventas de este número de la revista aumentaron un veinte por ciento con respecto al anterior.","Les ventes de ce numéro du magazine ont augmenté de vingt pour cent par rapport au précédent."],["L7-4559","潇洒","xiāosǎ","Adj","elegant and free-spirited","desenvuelto; elegante","élégant et décontracté","他穿上西装，显得很潇洒。","tā chuān shàng xī zhuāng xiǎn de hěn xiāo sǎ","In a suit, he looks very dashing.","Con traje se ve muy elegante y desenvuelto.","En costume, il a beaucoup d'allure."],["L7-4560","小丑","xiǎochǒu","N","clown","payaso","clown","马戏团里的小丑逗得孩子们哈哈大笑。","mǎ xì tuán lǐ de xiǎo chǒu dòu de hái zi men hā hā dà xiào","The clown in the circus made the children roar with laughter.","El payaso del circo hizo que los niños se rieran a carcajadas.","Le clown du cirque a fait éclater de rire les enfants."],["L7-4561","小贩","xiǎofàn","N","street vendor; peddler","vendedor ambulante","colporteur; marchand ambulant","街上的小贩大声叫卖着水果。","jiē shang de xiǎo fàn dà shēng jiào mài zhe shuǐ guǒ","The street vendors were loudly hawking fruit.","Los vendedores ambulantes de la calle pregonaban fruta a gritos.","Les marchands ambulants de la rue criaient pour vendre leurs fruits."],["L7-4562","小看","xiǎokàn","V","to underestimate","subestimar","sous-estimer","别小看这个孩子，他下棋可厉害了。","bié xiǎo kàn zhè ge hái zi tā xià qí kě lì hai le","Don't underestimate this child; he's really good at chess.","No subestimes a este niño; juega muy bien al ajedrez.","Ne sous-estimez pas cet enfant, il est très fort aux échecs."],["L7-4563","小康","xiǎokāng","Adj","moderately prosperous","de bienestar moderado","d'aisance moyenne","这个村子的农民已经过上了小康生活。","zhè ge cūn zi de nóng mín yǐ jīng guò shàng le xiǎo kāng shēng huó","The farmers in this village now live a moderately well-off life.","Los campesinos de este pueblo ya viven con un nivel de vida moderadamente próspero.","Les paysans de ce village mènent déjà une vie aisée."],["L7-4564","小路","xiǎolù","N","path; lane","sendero; camino","sentier; chemin","这条小路一直通往山顶。","zhè tiáo xiǎo lù yì zhí tōng wǎng shān dǐng","This path leads all the way to the top of the mountain.","Este sendero lleva directamente hasta la cima de la montaña.","Ce petit chemin mène jusqu'au sommet de la montagne."],["L7-4565","小品","xiǎopǐn","N","sketch; skit; short piece","sketch; obra breve","sketch; petit texte","春节晚会上的小品让观众笑得前仰后合。","chūn jié wǎn huì shàng de xiǎo pǐn ràng guān zhòng xiào de qián yǎng hòu hé","The comedy sketch at the Spring Festival Gala made the audience double over with laughter.","El sketch cómico de la gala de Año Nuevo Chino hizo que el público se doblara de risa.","Le sketch du gala de la fête du Printemps a fait rire le public aux éclats."],["L7-4566","小气","xiǎoqi","Adj","stingy; petty","tacaño; mezquino","radin; mesquin","他小气得很，一分钱都舍不得花。","tā xiǎo qi de hěn yì fēn qián dōu shě bu de huā","He is extremely stingy and can't bear to spend a single cent.","Es muy tacaño; no se atreve a gastar ni un centavo.","Il est très radin, il ne supporte pas de dépenser un seul centime."],["L7-4567","小区","xiǎoqū","N","residential community; neighborhood","urbanización; barrio","quartier résidentiel; résidence","我们小区里有一个很大的花园。","wǒ men xiǎo qū lǐ yǒu yí ge hěn dà de huā yuán","There is a big garden in our residential community.","En nuestra urbanización hay un jardín muy grande.","Dans notre résidence, il y a un très grand jardin."],["L7-4568","小曲","xiǎoqǔ","N","folk song; ballad","canción popular; balada","chanson populaire; ballade","奶奶一边做饭一边哼着小曲。","nǎi nai yì biān zuò fàn yì biān hēng zhe xiǎo qǔ","Grandma hums a little tune while cooking.","La abuela tararea una cancioncita mientras cocina.","Grand-mère fredonne un petit air tout en faisant la cuisine."],["L7-4569","小人","xiǎorén","N","villain; humble person","persona mezquina; humilde servidor","homme vil; humble personne","他是个小人，当面一套，背后一套。","tā shì gè xiǎo rén dāng miàn yí tào bèi hòu yí tào","He is a petty person who says one thing to your face and another behind your back.","Es un hombre ruin: te dice una cosa en tu cara y hace otra a tus espaldas.","C'est un homme méprisable : il tient un discours en face et un autre dans votre dos."],["L7-4570","小提琴","xiǎotíqín","N","violin","violín","violon","她从五岁开始学小提琴。","tā cóng wǔ suì kāi shǐ xué xiǎo tí qín","She started learning the violin at the age of five.","Empezó a aprender violín a los cinco años.","Elle a commencé à apprendre le violon à cinq ans."],["L7-4571","小溪","xiǎoxī","N","brook; stream","arroyo","ruisseau","村子旁边有一条清澈的小溪。","cūn zi páng biān yǒu yì tiáo qīng chè de xiǎo xī","There's a clear brook beside the village.","Junto al pueblo corre un arroyo de aguas cristalinas.","À côté du village coule un ruisseau limpide."],["L7-4572","小心翼翼","xiǎoxīn-yìyì","","very carefully","con sumo cuidado","avec une extrême prudence","他小心翼翼地把花瓶放在桌子上。","tā xiǎo xīn yì yì de bǎ huā píng fàng zài zhuō zi shàng","He carefully placed the vase on the table.","Colocó el jarrón sobre la mesa con muchísimo cuidado.","Il a posé le vase sur la table avec mille précautions."],["L7-4573","小卒","xiǎozú","N","foot soldier; nobody; pawn","soldado raso; don nadie; peón","simple soldat; personne sans importance; pion","我在公司里只是个小卒，说话没人听。","wǒ zài gōng sī lǐ zhǐ shì gè xiǎo zú shuō huà méi rén tīng","I'm just a nobody in the company, and no one listens to me.","En la empresa solo soy un don nadie y nadie me escucha.","Dans l'entreprise, je ne suis qu'un simple pion et personne ne m'écoute."],["L7-4574","孝敬","xiàojìng","V","to show filial respect; to offer gifts","honrar a los mayores; obsequiar","témoigner du respect filial; offrir des présents","他每个月都寄钱回家孝敬父母。","tā měi ge yuè dōu jì qián huí jiā xiào jìng fù mǔ","He sends money home every month to look after his parents.","Todos los meses envía dinero a casa para sostener a sus padres.","Chaque mois, il envoie de l'argent à la maison pour subvenir aux besoins de ses parents."],["L7-4575","孝顺","xiàoshùn","V","filial; dutiful to parents","filial; respetuoso con los padres","filial; respectueux envers ses parents","儿女都这么孝顺，您真有福气。","ér nǚ dōu zhè me xiào shùn nín zhēn yǒu fú qi","Your children are all so devoted to you—you're truly blessed.","Sus hijos son todos tan filiales; usted sí que tiene suerte.","Vos enfants sont tous si dévoués ; vous avez vraiment de la chance."],["L7-4576","肖像","xiàoxiàng","N","portrait","retrato","portrait","墙上挂着一幅老人的肖像。","qiáng shàng guà zhe yì fú lǎo rén de xiào xiàng","A portrait of an old man hangs on the wall.","En la pared cuelga un retrato de un anciano.","Un portrait de vieil homme est accroché au mur."],["L7-4577","效仿","xiàofǎng","V","to imitate; to emulate","imitar; emular","imiter; suivre l'exemple de","别的学校纷纷效仿这种教学方法。","bié de xué xiào fēn fēn xiào fǎng zhè zhǒng jiào xué fāng fǎ","Other schools have one after another imitated this teaching method.","Otras escuelas han ido imitando este método de enseñanza.","D'autres écoles ont tour à tour imité cette méthode d'enseignement."],["L7-4578","效力","xiàolì","N","effectiveness; to serve","eficacia; servir","efficacité; servir","这份合同从签字之日起开始生效，具有法律效力。","zhè fèn hé tóng cóng qiān zì zhī rì qǐ kāi shǐ shēng xiào jù yǒu fǎ lǜ xiào lì","This contract takes effect from the date it is signed and is legally binding.","Este contrato entra en vigor desde el día de la firma y tiene validez legal.","Ce contrat prend effet à compter de la date de signature et a force de loi."],["L7-4579","效益","xiàoyì","N","benefit; efficiency","beneficio; rendimiento","rendement; bénéfice","这家工厂今年的经济效益很好。","zhè jiā gōng chǎng jīn nián de jīng jì xiào yì hěn hǎo","This factory's economic returns are very good this year.","Los beneficios económicos de esta fábrica este año son muy buenos.","Les résultats économiques de cette usine sont très bons cette année."],["L7-4580","效应","xiàoyìng","N","effect (phenomenon)","efecto (fenómeno)","effet (phénomène)","明星代言产生了很大的广告效应。","míng xīng dài yán chǎn shēng le hěn dà de guǎng gào xiào yìng","Celebrity endorsements have produced a big advertising effect.","Las celebridades que promocionan productos han generado un gran efecto publicitario.","Les parrainages de célébrités ont produit un grand effet publicitaire."],["L7-4581","协定","xiédìng","N/V","agreement; accord","acuerdo; convenio","accord; convention","两国签订了一项协定，加强贸易合作。","liǎng guó qiān dìng le yí xiàng xié dìng jiā qiáng mào yì hé zuò","The two countries signed an agreement to strengthen trade cooperation.","Los dos países firmaron un acuerdo para fortalecer la cooperación comercial.","Les deux pays ont signé un accord pour renforcer leur coopération commerciale."],["L7-4582","协同","xiétóng","V","to cooperate; in coordination","cooperar; en coordinación","coopérer; en coordination","这次救援行动由多个部门协同完成。","zhè cì jiù yuán xíng dòng yóu duō ge bù mén xié tóng wán chéng","This rescue operation was carried out jointly by several departments.","Esta operación de rescate se llevó a cabo de forma coordinada entre varios departamentos.","Cette opération de sauvetage a été menée conjointement par plusieurs services."],["L7-4583","协作","xiézuò","V","cooperation","cooperación","coopération","新任主管上任后，先梳理了各部门的职责，再着手优化协作流程。","xīn rèn zhǔ guǎn shàng rèn hòu xiān shū lǐ le gè bù mén de zhí zé zài zhuó shǒu yōu huà xié zuò liú chéng","After taking office, the new manager first clarified each department's responsibilities and then began improving the workflow for collaboration.","Al asumir el cargo, el nuevo director primero puso en orden las responsabilidades de cada departamento y luego empezó a optimizar los procesos de colaboración.","Après sa prise de fonctions, le nouveau responsable a d'abord clarifié les responsabilités de chaque service, puis s'est attelé à optimiser les processus de collaboration."],["L7-4584","邪","xié","Adj","evil; heterodox","maligno; heterodoxo","mauvais; hétérodoxe","这事真有点儿邪，怎么每次都是他赢？","zhè shì zhēn yǒu diǎnr xié zěn me měi cì dōu shì tā yíng","This is really a bit strange; how come he wins every time?","Esto es de verdad muy raro: ¿cómo es que siempre gana él?","C'est vraiment bizarre : comment se fait-il que ce soit toujours lui qui gagne ?"],["L7-4585","邪恶","xié'è","Adj","evil; wicked","malvado; perverso","mauvais; pervers","童话里的英雄最后战胜了邪恶的巫师。","tóng huà lǐ de yīng xióng zuì hòu zhàn shèng le xié è de wū shī","In the fairy tale, the hero finally defeated the evil wizard.","En el cuento de hadas, el héroe al final venció al malvado hechicero.","Dans le conte de fées, le héros finit par vaincre le sorcier maléfique."],["L7-4586","挟持","xiéchí","V","to seize; to hold hostage","secuestrar; retener","s'emparer de; prendre en otage","歹徒挟持了一名人质，躲进了大楼。","dǎi tú xié chí le yì míng rén zhì duǒ jìn le dà lóu","The gangster seized a hostage and hid in the building.","El delincuente tomó a un rehén y se escondió en el edificio.","Le malfaiteur a pris un otage et s'est réfugié dans l'immeuble."],["L7-4587","携带","xiédài","V","to carry; to bring along","llevar consigo","porter sur soi; emporter","乘坐飞机时不能携带打火机。","chéng zuò fēi jī shí bù néng xié dài dǎ huǒ jī","You can't carry lighters when taking a plane.","En el avión no se pueden llevar encendedores.","On ne peut pas emporter de briquet à bord d'un avion."],["L7-4588","携手","xiéshǒu","V","hand in hand; to join forces","de la mano; unir fuerzas","main dans la main; s'unir","两家公司携手开发了一款新产品。","liǎng jiā gōng sī xié shǒu kāi fā le yì kuǎn xīn chǎn pǐn","The two companies joined hands to develop a new product.","Las dos empresas unieron fuerzas para desarrollar un nuevo producto.","Les deux entreprises ont uni leurs efforts pour développer un nouveau produit."],["L7-4589","写照","xiězhào","V/N","portrayal","retrato; reflejo","portrait; reflet","这首诗是当时农民生活的真实写照。","zhè shǒu shī shì dāng shí nóng mín shēng huó de zhēn shí xiě zhào","This poem is a true portrayal of farmers' lives at the time.","Este poema es un fiel retrato de la vida de los campesinos de la época.","Ce poème est un fidèle tableau de la vie des paysans de l'époque."],["L7-4590","泄","xiè","V","to leak; to vent","filtrar; desahogar","fuir; laisser échapper","他把一肚子的怒气都泄在了孩子身上。","tā bǎ yí dù zi de nù qì dōu xiè zài le hái zi shēn shang","He vented all his pent-up anger on the child.","Descargó toda su rabia contenida en el niño.","Il a déchargé toute sa colère sur l'enfant."],["L7-4591","泄漏","xièlòu","V","to leak; to divulge","fugarse; filtrar","fuir; divulguer","工厂发生了煤气泄漏，附近居民被紧急转移。","gōng chǎng fā shēng le méi qì xiè lòu fù jìn jū mín bèi jǐn jí zhuǎn yí","A gas leak occurred at the factory, and nearby residents were urgently evacuated.","Hubo una fuga de gas en la fábrica y los vecinos de los alrededores fueron evacuados de urgencia.","Une fuite de gaz s'est produite à l'usine et les habitants des environs ont été évacués d'urgence."],["L7-4592","泄露","xièlòu","V","to leak; to divulge","filtrar; divulgar","divulguer; ébruiter","公司网站昨晚遭到黑客攻击，大量用户信息被泄露。","gōng sī wǎng zhàn zuó wǎn zāo dào hēi kè gōng jī dà liàng yòng hù xìn xī bèi xiè lòu","The company website was attacked by hackers last night, and a great deal of user information was leaked.","El sitio web de la empresa sufrió anoche un ataque de hackers y se filtró una gran cantidad de información de usuarios.","Le site Internet de l'entreprise a été attaqué par des pirates la nuit dernière et de nombreuses données d'utilisateurs ont fuité."],["L7-4593","泄密","xièmì","","to leak secrets","filtrar secretos","divulguer des secrets","公司规定员工不准泄密。","gōng sī guī dìng yuán gōng bù zhǔn xiè mì","Company rules forbid employees from leaking secrets.","El reglamento de la empresa prohíbe que los empleados divulguen secretos.","Le règlement de l'entreprise interdit aux employés de divulguer des secrets."],["L7-4594","泄气","xièqì","","to lose heart; to deflate","desanimarse; desinflarse","se décourager; se dégonfler","失败了一次就泄气，这可不行。","shī bài le yí cì jiù xiè qì zhè kě bù xíng","Losing heart after failing once just won't do.","Desanimarse por fracasar una sola vez no puede ser.","Se décourager après un seul échec, ça ne va pas."],["L7-4595","泻","xiè","V","to flow swiftly; diarrhea","fluir con rapidez; diarrea","s'écouler; diarrhée","月光从窗外泻进屋里，照在床上。","yuè guāng cóng chuāng wài xiè jìn wū lǐ zhào zài chuáng shàng","Moonlight poured into the room from outside the window and shone on the bed.","La luz de la luna entraba por la ventana y caía sobre la cama.","Le clair de lune entrait par la fenêtre et éclairait le lit."],["L7-4596","卸","xiè","V","to unload; to remove","descargar; quitar","décharger; retirer","工人们把货从卡车上卸了下来。","gōng rén men bǎ huò cóng kǎ chē shàng xiè le xià lái","The workers unloaded the goods from the truck.","Los obreros bajaron la mercancía del camión.","Les ouvriers ont déchargé la marchandise du camion."],["L7-4597","心爱","xīn'ài","Adj","beloved; treasured","querido; apreciado","bien-aimé; chéri","他不小心把心爱的手表弄丢了。","tā bù xiǎo xīn bǎ xīn ài de shǒu biǎo nòng diū le","He accidentally lost his beloved watch.","Sin querer, perdió su reloj favorito.","Il a perdu sans le vouloir sa montre préférée."],["L7-4598","心安理得","xīn'ān-lǐdé","","with a clear conscience","con la conciencia tranquila","en toute bonne conscience","他靠自己的努力挣钱，花得心安理得。","tā kào zì jǐ de nǔ lì zhèng qián huā de xīn ān lǐ dé","He earns his money through his own efforts, so he spends it with a clear conscience.","Gana el dinero con su propio esfuerzo, así que lo gasta con la conciencia tranquila.","Il gagne son argent par ses propres efforts, il le dépense donc la conscience tranquille."],["L7-4599","心病","xīnbìng","N","secret worry; sore point","preocupación secreta; punto débil","souci secret; point sensible","孩子的学习成绩成了她的一块心病。","hái zi de xué xí chéng jì chéng le tā de yí kuài xīn bìng","Her child's grades have become a constant worry for her.","Las notas de su hijo se han convertido en una preocupación constante para ella.","Les résultats scolaires de son enfant sont devenus pour elle un souci permanent."],["L7-4600","心肠","xīncháng","N","heart; disposition","corazón; carácter","cœur; disposition","这位老太太心肠很好，经常帮助邻居。","zhè wèi lǎo tài tai xīn cháng hěn hǎo jīng cháng bāng zhù lín jū","This old lady is very kind-hearted and often helps her neighbors.","Esta anciana tiene muy buen corazón y con frecuencia ayuda a sus vecinos.","Cette vieille dame a très bon cœur et aide souvent ses voisins."],["L7-4601","心得","xīndé","N","insight; takeaway","conclusión; reflexión personal","enseignement; réflexion personnelle","请大家写一篇读书心得交给我。","qǐng dà jiā xiě yì piān dú shū xīn dé jiāo gěi wǒ","Please each write a reflection on your reading and hand it in to me.","Por favor, escriban cada uno una reflexión sobre lo que han leído y entréguenmela.","Rédigez tous un compte rendu de vos impressions de lecture et remettez-le-moi."],["L7-4602","心慌","xīnhuāng","","flustered; to have palpitations","nervioso; palpitaciones","affolé; palpitations","一上台说话，他就心慌得厉害。","yí shàng tái shuō huà tā jiù xīn huāng de lì hai","As soon as he goes on stage to speak, he gets terribly flustered.","En cuanto sube al escenario a hablar, se pone terriblemente nervioso.","Dès qu'il monte sur scène pour parler, il est terriblement troublé."],["L7-4603","心急如焚","xīnjí-rúfén","","extremely anxious","arder de impaciencia","brûler d'impatience","孩子发高烧，父母心急如焚。","hái zi fā gāo shāo fù mǔ xīn jí rú fén","The child had a high fever, and the parents were burning with anxiety.","El niño tenía fiebre alta y sus padres estaban muertos de angustia.","L'enfant avait une forte fièvre et ses parents étaient rongés d'inquiétude."],["L7-4604","心里话","xīnlǐhuà","N","what's on one's mind; true feelings","lo que uno siente; confidencias","confidences; ce qu'on a sur le cœur","今天我想跟你说几句心里话。","jīn tiān wǒ xiǎng gēn nǐ shuō jǐ jù xīn lǐ huà","Today I want to tell you what's really on my mind.","Hoy quiero decirte unas palabras sinceras.","Aujourd'hui, je voudrais te dire quelques mots du fond du cœur."],["L7-4605","心灵手巧","xīnlíng-shǒuqiǎo","","clever and dexterous","hábil y mañoso","habile et adroit","她心灵手巧，做的手工都很漂亮。","tā xīn líng shǒu qiǎo zuò de shǒu gōng dōu hěn piào liang","She is clever and nimble with her hands, and everything she makes is beautiful.","Es muy habilidosa con las manos y todo lo que hace a mano es precioso.","Elle est ingénieuse et habile de ses mains, et tout ce qu'elle fabrique est magnifique."],["L7-4606","心目","xīnmù","N","mind; mental view","mente; ánimo","esprit; pensée","在孩子的心目中，爸爸是无所不能的。","zài hái zi de xīn mù zhōng bà ba shì wú suǒ bù néng de","In the child's mind, Dad can do anything.","Para el niño, papá es capaz de hacerlo todo.","Aux yeux de l'enfant, papa peut tout faire."],["L7-4607","心声","xīnshēng","N","inner voice; heartfelt wishes","voz interior; sentir íntimo","voix intérieure; vœux sincères","这首歌唱出了很多年轻人的心声。","zhè shǒu gē chàng chū le hěn duō nián qīng rén de xīn shēng","This song voices the feelings of many young people.","Esta canción expresa lo que sienten muchos jóvenes.","Cette chanson exprime les sentiments de beaucoup de jeunes."],["L7-4608","心事","xīnshì","N","worry; something on one's mind","preocupación","souci; préoccupation","她好像有什么心事，一整天都不说话。","tā hǎo xiàng yǒu shén me xīn shì yì zhěng tiān dōu bù shuō huà","She seems to have something on her mind and hasn't spoken all day.","Parece que algo la preocupa; no ha dicho palabra en todo el día.","Elle semble avoir quelque chose sur le cœur, elle n'a pas dit un mot de la journée."],["L7-4609","心思","xīnsi","N","thoughts; mood","pensamientos; ánimo","pensées; humeur","他的心思全在工作上，很少关心家里。","tā de xīn si quán zài gōng zuò shàng hěn shǎo guān xīn jiā lǐ","His mind is entirely on work, and he rarely pays attention to the family.","Solo piensa en el trabajo y casi no se ocupa de su familia.","Il a la tête entièrement au travail et s'occupe rarement de sa famille."],["L7-4610","心酸","xīnsuān","","to feel sad; heartsick","sentir pena; afligirse","avoir le cœur serré","听到老人的遭遇，大家都觉得很心酸。","tīng dào lǎo rén de zāo yù dà jiā dōu jué de hěn xīn suān","Hearing about the old man's misfortune, everyone felt very sad.","Al conocer la desgracia del anciano, todos sintieron mucha pena.","En apprenant le malheur du vieil homme, tout le monde a eu le cœur serré."],["L7-4611","心想事成","xīnxiǎng-shìchéng","","may all your wishes come true","que se cumplan tus deseos","que tous vos vœux se réalisent","祝你新年快乐，心想事成！","zhù nǐ xīn nián kuài lè xīn xiǎng shì chéng","Happy New Year, and may all your wishes come true!","¡Feliz Año Nuevo y que todos tus deseos se cumplan!","Bonne année, et que tous vos vœux se réalisent !"],["L7-4612","心胸","xīnxiōng","N","breadth of mind; ambition","amplitud de miras; aspiraciones","largeur d'esprit; ambition","他心胸宽广，从来不跟别人计较。","tā xīn xiōng kuān guǎng cóng lái bù gēn bié rén jì jiào","He is broad-minded and never quibbles with others.","Es de mente amplia y nunca se pone a discutir cada detalle con los demás.","Il a l'esprit large et ne chicane jamais avec les autres."],["L7-4613","心血","xīnxuè","N","painstaking effort","esfuerzo dedicado; desvelos","efforts acharnés; peine","这部作品是他十年心血的结晶。","zhè bù zuò pǐn shì tā shí nián xīn xuè de jié jīng","This work is the fruit of ten years of his painstaking effort.","Esta obra es el fruto de diez años de esfuerzo y dedicación suyos.","Cette œuvre est le fruit de dix ans de labeur de sa part."],["L7-4614","心眼儿","xīnyǎnr","N","mind; cleverness","mente; astucia","esprit; ruse","这个人心眼儿好，总是乐于帮助别人。","zhè ge rén xīn yǎnr hǎo zǒng shì lè yú bāng zhù bié rén","This person is kind at heart and always happy to help others.","Esta persona tiene buen corazón y siempre está dispuesta a ayudar a los demás.","Cette personne a bon cœur et aime toujours aider les autres."],["L7-4615","心意","xīnyì","N","kind intention; thoughtfulness","intención amable; detalle","intention aimable; attention","这是我的一点儿心意，请你收下。","zhè shì wǒ de yì diǎnr xīn yì qǐng nǐ shōu xià","This is a small token of my appreciation; please accept it.","Esto es un pequeño detalle de mi parte; por favor, acéptalo.","C'est un petit témoignage de mon affection, veuillez l'accepter."],["L7-4616","芯片","xīnpiàn","N","microchip","microchip","puce électronique","这款手机用的是最新的芯片。","zhè kuǎn shǒu jī yòng de shì zuì xīn de xīn piàn","This phone uses the latest chip.","Este teléfono usa el chip más reciente.","Ce téléphone utilise la toute dernière puce."],["L7-4617","辛勤","xīnqín","Adj","hardworking","trabajador; esforzado","travailleur; assidu","农民们辛勤劳动了一年，终于迎来了丰收。","nóng mín men xīn qín láo dòng le yì nián zhōng yú yíng lái le fēng shōu","After a year of hard work, the farmers finally had a good harvest.","Tras un año de arduo trabajo, los campesinos por fin tuvieron una buena cosecha.","Après une année de dur labeur, les paysans ont enfin eu une belle récolte."],["L7-4618","辛酸","xīnsuān","Adj","hardship; bitter","penurias; amargo","amertume; peines","他讲起自己创业的辛酸经历，忍不住流下了眼泪。","tā jiǎng qǐ zì jǐ chuàng yè de xīn suān jīng lì rěn bu zhù liú xià le yǎn lèi","Telling of the hardships of starting his business, he couldn't help shedding tears.","Al contar las penurias de cuando empezó su negocio, no pudo evitar derramar lágrimas.","En racontant les difficultés qu'il avait traversées pour monter son entreprise, il n'a pu retenir ses larmes."],["L7-4619","欣慰","xīnwèi","Adj","gratified; pleased","satisfecho; reconfortado","réconforté; satisfait","看到儿子长大成人，母亲感到很欣慰。","kàn dào ér zi zhǎng dà chéng rén mǔ qīn gǎn dào hěn xīn wèi","Seeing her son grow into a man, the mother felt very gratified.","Al ver a su hijo convertido en un adulto, la madre sintió un gran consuelo.","En voyant son fils devenir un homme, la mère a éprouvé un grand réconfort."],["L7-4620","欣喜","xīnxǐ","Adj","delighted; happy","alegre; contento","ravi; joyeux","收到录取通知，她欣喜地跳了起来。","shōu dào lù qǔ tōng zhī tā xīn xǐ de tiào le qǐ lái","When she received the acceptance letter, she jumped up with joy.","Al recibir la carta de admisión, saltó de alegría.","En recevant la lettre d'admission, elle a sauté de joie."],["L7-4621","欣欣向荣","xīnxīn-xiàngróng","","flourishing; thriving","próspero; floreciente","florissant; prospère","春天到了，田野里一片欣欣向荣的景象。","chūn tiān dào le tián yě lǐ yí piàn xīn xīn xiàng róng de jǐng xiàng","Spring has come, and the fields present a scene of flourishing growth.","Llegó la primavera y los campos presentan un panorama de plena vitalidad.","Le printemps est arrivé et les champs offrent un spectacle de pleine prospérité."],["L7-4622","新潮","xīncháo","N/Adj","fashionable; trendy","de moda; moderno","à la mode; branché","她的打扮很新潮，走在街上很引人注目。","tā de dǎ ban hěn xīn cháo zǒu zài jiē shang hěn yǐn rén zhù mù","Her style is very trendy and turns heads on the street.","Su estilo es muy moderno y llama la atención por la calle.","Son look est très tendance et fait tourner les têtes dans la rue."],["L7-4623","新陈代谢","xīnchén-dàixiè","","metabolism","metabolismo","métabolisme","年纪越大，人的新陈代谢就越慢。","nián jì yuè dà rén de xīn chén dài xiè jiù yuè màn","The older people get, the slower their metabolism becomes.","Cuanto mayor es la persona, más lento es su metabolismo.","Plus on vieillit, plus le métabolisme ralentit."],["L7-4624","新房","xīnfáng","N","new house; bridal chamber","casa nueva; cámara nupcial","maison neuve; chambre nuptiale","新房子的客厅又宽敞又明亮。","xīn fáng zi de kè tīng yòu kuān chang yòu míng liàng","The living room in the new house is spacious and bright.","La sala de la casa nueva es amplia y luminosa.","Le salon de la nouvelle maison est spacieux et lumineux."],["L7-4625","新款","xīnkuǎn","N","new model; new style","modelo nuevo; nuevo estilo","nouveau modèle; nouveau style","这家店上周到了几件新款大衣。","zhè jiā diàn shàng zhōu dào le jǐ jiàn xīn kuǎn dà yī","This store got in a few new-style coats last week.","La semana pasada llegaron a esta tienda algunos abrigos de la nueva temporada.","La semaine dernière, ce magasin a reçu quelques manteaux de la nouvelle collection."],["L7-4626","新奇","xīnqí","Adj","novel; exotic","novedoso; exótico","nouveau; exotique","第一次出国，他对什么都感到很新奇。","dì yī cì chū guó tā duì shén me dōu gǎn dào hěn xīn qí","On his first trip abroad, he found everything novel.","En su primer viaje al extranjero, todo le parecía nuevo y fascinante.","Pour son premier voyage à l'étranger, tout lui semblait nouveau et fascinant."],["L7-4627","新生","xīnshēng","Adj/N","newborn; new; rebirth","recién nacido; nuevo; renacimiento","nouveau-né; nouveau; renaissance","开学第一天，新生们都到礼堂集合。","kāi xué dì yī tiān xīn shēng men dōu dào lǐ táng jí hé","On the first day of school, the new students all gathered in the auditorium.","El primer día de clases, los alumnos de nuevo ingreso se reunieron en el auditorio.","Le premier jour de la rentrée, les nouveaux élèves se sont tous rassemblés dans l'auditorium."],["L7-4628","新式","xīnshì","Adj","new-style; modern","de nuevo estilo; moderno","de nouveau style; moderne","这种新式的洗衣机又省水又省电。","zhè zhǒng xīn shì de xǐ yī jī yòu shěng shuǐ yòu shěng diàn","This new type of washing machine saves both water and electricity.","Esta lavadora de nuevo tipo ahorra agua y electricidad.","Ce nouveau type de lave-linge économise l'eau et l'électricité."],["L7-4629","新手","xīnshǒu","N","novice; newcomer","novato; principiante","novice; débutant","他刚学会开车，还是个新手。","tā gāng xué huì kāi chē hái shi gè xīn shǒu","He has just learned to drive and is still a beginner.","Acaba de aprender a conducir y todavía es principiante.","Il vient d'apprendre à conduire et est encore débutant."],["L7-4630","新颖","xīnyǐng","Adj","novel and original","novedoso; original","nouveau; original","这个广告的创意很新颖。","zhè ge guǎng gào de chuàng yì hěn xīn yǐng","The idea behind this advertisement is very original.","La idea de este anuncio es muy original.","L'idée de cette publicité est très originale."],["L7-4631","信贷","xìndài","N","credit; loan","crédito; préstamo","crédit; prêt","银行加大了对小企业的信贷支持。","yín háng jiā dà le duì xiǎo qǐ yè de xìn dài zhī chí","The bank has increased its credit support for small businesses.","El banco ha aumentado el apoyo crediticio a las pequeñas empresas.","La banque a renforcé son soutien en crédit aux petites entreprises."],["L7-4632","信件","xìnjiàn","N","letter; mail","carta; correspondencia","lettre; courrier","那封重要的信件至今去向不明。","nà fēng zhòng yào de xìn jiàn zhì jīn qù xiàng bù míng","The whereabouts of that important letter are still unknown.","Hasta hoy se desconoce el paradero de aquella carta tan importante.","On ignore toujours ce qu'est devenue cette lettre importante."],["L7-4633","信赖","xìnlài","V","to trust; to rely on","confiar en; fiarse de","faire confiance; se fier à","他是一个值得信赖的朋友。","tā shì yí ge zhí dé xìn lài de péng you","He is a friend worth trusting.","Es un amigo digno de confianza.","C'est un ami digne de confiance."],["L7-4634","信誉","xìnyù","N","reputation; credibility","reputación; credibilidad","réputation; crédibilité","如果只顾眼前的暴利，企业最终可能失去多年积累的信誉。","rú guǒ zhǐ gù yǎn qián de bào lì qǐ yè zuì zhōng kě néng shī qù duō nián jī lěi de xìn yù","If a company pursues only immediate windfall profits, it may eventually lose the reputation built up over many years.","Si solo se piensa en las ganancias desorbitadas del momento, la empresa podría acabar perdiendo la credibilidad acumulada durante años.","Si l'entreprise ne songe qu'aux profits exorbitants à court terme, elle risque de perdre finalement la réputation bâtie pendant des années."],["L7-4635","兴奋剂","xīngfènjì","N","stimulant; doping","estimulante; dopaje","stimulant; dopage","这名运动员因为服用兴奋剂被取消了比赛资格。","zhè míng yùn dòng yuán yīn wèi fú yòng xīng fèn jì bèi qǔ xiāo le bǐ sài zī gé","This athlete was disqualified for taking performance-enhancing drugs.","Este deportista fue descalificado de la competencia por consumir dopaje.","Cet athlète a été disqualifié de la compétition pour avoir pris des produits dopants."],["L7-4636","兴建","xīngjiàn","V","to build; to construct","construir; edificar","construire; édifier","政府计划在这里兴建一座新机场。","zhèng fǔ jì huà zài zhè lǐ xīng jiàn yí zuò xīn jī chǎng","The government plans to build a new airport here.","El gobierno planea construir un nuevo aeropuerto aquí.","Le gouvernement prévoit de construire ici un nouvel aéroport."],["L7-4637","兴起","xīngqǐ","V","to rise; to spring up","surgir; emerger","surgir; apparaître","最近几年，城市里兴起了一股骑自行车的热潮。","zuì jìn jǐ nián chéng shì lǐ xīng qǐ le yì gǔ qí zì xíng chē de rè cháo","In recent years, a craze for cycling has sprung up in cities.","En los últimos años ha surgido en las ciudades una fiebre por andar en bicicleta.","Ces dernières années, un engouement pour le vélo est apparu dans les villes."],["L7-4638","星座","xīngzuò","N","constellation; zodiac sign","constelación; signo zodiacal","constellation; signe du zodiaque","晴朗的夜晚，可以在天上找到很多星座。","qíng lǎng de yè wǎn kě yǐ zài tiān shàng zhǎo dào hěn duō xīng zuò","On a clear night, you can find many constellations in the sky.","En una noche despejada se pueden encontrar muchas constelaciones en el cielo.","Par une nuit claire, on peut repérer de nombreuses constellations dans le ciel."],["L7-4639","猩猩","xīngxing","N","orangutan; gorilla","orangután; gorila","orang-outan; gorille","动物园里的猩猩会模仿游客的动作。","dòng wù yuán lǐ de xīng xing huì mó fǎng yóu kè de dòng zuò","The orangutans at the zoo imitate the visitors' movements.","Los orangutanes del zoológico imitan los movimientos de los visitantes.","Les orangs-outans du zoo imitent les gestes des visiteurs."],["L7-4640","腥","xīng","Adj","fishy (smell)","a pescado; fétido","de poisson; fade","这条鱼有点儿腥，多放点儿姜吧。","zhè tiáo yú yǒu diǎnr xīng duō fàng diǎnr jiāng ba","This fish smells a bit fishy; add some more ginger.","Este pescado huele un poco fuerte; ponle más jengibre.","Ce poisson sent un peu fort ; mets-y encore du gingembre."],["L7-4641","刑法","xíngfǎ","N","criminal law","derecho penal","droit pénal","他在大学里专门研究刑法。","tā zài dà xué lǐ zhuān mén yán jiū xíng fǎ","He specializes in criminal law at the university.","En la universidad se especializa en derecho penal.","À l'université, il est spécialisé en droit pénal."],["L7-4642","行使","xíngshǐ","V","to exercise (a right)","ejercer (un derecho)","exercer (un droit)","公民有权行使自己的选举权。","gōng mín yǒu quán xíng shǐ zì jǐ de xuǎn jǔ quán","Citizens have the right to exercise their right to vote.","Los ciudadanos tienen derecho a ejercer su derecho al voto.","Les citoyens ont le droit d'exercer leur droit de vote."],["L7-4643","行政","xíngzhèng","N","administration; administrative","administración; administrativo","administration; administratif","她在公司负责行政工作。","tā zài gōng sī fù zé xíng zhèng gōng zuò","She is in charge of administrative work at the company.","Se encarga de las tareas administrativas de la empresa.","Elle est chargée des tâches administratives dans l'entreprise."],["L7-4644","行走","xíngzǒu","V","to walk","caminar","marcher","他受伤以后，行走都很困难。","tā shòu shāng yǐ hòu xíng zǒu dōu hěn kùn nan","After his injury, even walking is difficult for him.","Desde que se lesionó, hasta caminar le resulta difícil.","Depuis sa blessure, même marcher lui est difficile."],["L7-4645","形形色色","xíngxíngsèsè","Adj","all kinds of","de todo tipo","de toutes sortes","街上的行人形形色色，有老有少。","jiē shang de xíng rén xíng xíng sè sè yǒu lǎo yǒu shào","The pedestrians on the street are of all kinds, old and young.","Los peatones de la calle son de todo tipo, viejos y jóvenes.","Les passants dans la rue sont très variés, des vieux comme des jeunes."],["L7-4646","形影不离","xíngyǐng-bùlí","","inseparable","inseparable","inséparable","这两个好朋友从小就形影不离。","zhè liǎng gè hǎo péng you cóng xiǎo jiù xíng yǐng bù lí","These two good friends have been inseparable since childhood.","Estos dos buenos amigos son inseparables desde la infancia.","Ces deux bons amis sont inséparables depuis l'enfance."],["L7-4647","醒来","xǐnglai","","to wake up","despertar","se réveiller","早上醒来的时候，外面已经下雪了。","zǎo shang xǐng lái de shí hou wài miàn yǐ jīng xià xuě le","When I woke up in the morning, it was already snowing outside.","Cuando me desperté por la mañana, ya estaba nevando afuera.","Quand je me suis réveillé ce matin, il neigeait déjà dehors."],["L7-4648","醒目","xǐngmù","Adj","eye-catching; striking","llamativo; destacado","frappant; bien visible","车站增设了醒目的标识，引导首次到访的旅客顺利换乘。","chē zhàn zēng shè le xǐng mù de biāo shí yǐn dǎo shǒu cì dào fǎng de lǚ kè shùn lì huàn chéng","The station added conspicuous signs to help first-time visitors transfer smoothly.","La estación instaló señalización llamativa para guiar a los viajeros que llegan por primera vez a hacer sus transbordos sin problemas.","La gare a installé une signalisation bien visible pour guider sans encombre les voyageurs qui viennent pour la première fois lors de leurs correspondances."],["L7-4649","醒悟","xǐngwù","V","to come to realize; to wake up","darse cuenta; abrir los ojos","prendre conscience; se réveiller à","直到失去了工作，他才醒悟过来。","zhí dào shī qù le gōng zuò tā cái xǐng wù guò lái","It wasn't until he lost his job that he came to his senses.","Hasta que perdió el trabajo, no abrió los ojos.","Ce n'est qu'après avoir perdu son travail qu'il a ouvert les yeux."],["L7-4650","兴高采烈","xìnggāo-cǎiliè","","in high spirits","muy animado; eufórico","tout joyeux; d'excellente humeur","孩子们兴高采烈地去公园春游了。","hái zi men xìng gāo cǎi liè de qù gōng yuán chūn yóu le","The children went on a spring outing to the park in high spirits.","Los niños se fueron muy contentos de excursión de primavera al parque.","Les enfants sont partis tout joyeux en sortie de printemps au parc."],["L7-4651","兴致","xìngzhì","N","interest; enthusiasm","entusiasmo; interés","entrain; intérêt","听说要去海边，大家的兴致都很高。","tīng shuō yào qù hǎi biān dà jiā de xìng zhì dōu hěn gāo","When they heard they were going to the beach, everyone was in high spirits.","Al enterarse de que iban a la playa, todos se entusiasmaron.","En apprenant qu'on allait à la mer, tout le monde était de très bonne humeur."],["L7-4652","幸存","xìngcún","V","to survive","sobrevivir","survivre","这次空难中只有两名乘客幸存。","zhè cì kōng nàn zhōng zhǐ yǒu liǎng míng chéng kè xìng cún","Only two passengers survived this air crash.","En este accidente aéreo solo sobrevivieron dos pasajeros.","Dans cet accident d'avion, seuls deux passagers ont survécu."],["L7-4653","幸好","xìnghǎo","Adv","fortunately","por suerte","heureusement","幸好我带了伞，不然就被雨淋湿了。","xìng hǎo wǒ dài le sǎn bù rán jiù bèi yǔ lín shī le","Luckily I brought an umbrella; otherwise I would have been soaked by the rain.","Por suerte traje paraguas; si no, me habría mojado con la lluvia.","Heureusement que j'ai apporté un parapluie, sinon j'aurais été trempé par la pluie."],["L7-4654","幸亏","xìngkuī","Adv","fortunately; luckily","afortunadamente; menos mal","heureusement; par chance","幸亏医生来得及时，孩子才脱离了危险。","xìng kuī yī shēng lái de jí shí hái zi cái tuō lí le wēi xiǎn","Fortunately the doctor arrived in time, and the child was out of danger.","Por suerte el médico llegó a tiempo y el niño salió de peligro.","Heureusement que le médecin est arrivé à temps, l'enfant est hors de danger."],["L7-4655","幸免","xìngmiǎn","V","to escape (misfortune)","librarse de; escapar de","échapper à","这场大火烧毁了整条街，只有他家幸免。","zhè chǎng dà huǒ shāo huǐ le zhěng tiáo jiē zhǐ yǒu tā jiā xìng miǎn","The big fire destroyed the whole street; only his house was spared.","El gran incendio arrasó toda la calle; solo su casa se salvó.","Le grand incendie a détruit toute la rue ; seule sa maison a été épargnée."],["L7-4656","性价比","xìngjiàbǐ","N","cost-effectiveness","relación calidad-precio","rapport qualité-prix","这款电脑性价比很高，很受学生欢迎。","zhè kuǎn diàn nǎo xìng jià bǐ hěn gāo hěn shòu xué shēng huān yíng","This computer offers great value for money and is very popular with students.","Esta computadora tiene una excelente relación calidad-precio y es muy popular entre los estudiantes.","Cet ordinateur a un excellent rapport qualité-prix et est très apprécié des étudiants."],["L7-4657","性命","xìngmìng","N","life","vida","vie","他冒着生命危险救人，差点儿丢了性命。","tā mào zhe shēng mìng wēi xiǎn jiù rén chà diǎnr diū le xìng mìng","He risked his life to save others and nearly lost his life.","Arriesgó la vida para salvar a otros y casi la pierde.","Il a risqué sa vie pour sauver des gens et a failli la perdre."],["L7-4658","性情","xìngqíng","N","temperament; disposition","carácter; temperamento","tempérament; caractère","她性情温和，很少跟人吵架。","tā xìng qíng wēn hé hěn shǎo gēn rén chǎo jià","She has a gentle temperament and seldom quarrels with anyone.","Tiene un carácter apacible y rara vez discute con nadie.","Elle a un tempérament doux et se dispute rarement avec les gens."],["L7-4659","姓氏","xìngshì","N","surname; family name","apellido","nom de famille","张、王、李是中国最常见的几个姓氏。","zhāng wáng lǐ shì zhōng guó zuì cháng jiàn de jǐ ge xìng shì","Zhang, Wang and Li are some of the most common surnames in China.","Zhang, Wang y Li son algunos de los apellidos más comunes de China.","Zhang, Wang et Li sont parmi les noms de famille les plus courants en Chine."],["L7-4660","凶残","xiōngcán","Adj","savage; cruel","feroz; cruel","féroce; cruel","这部纪录片展示了狼凶残的一面。","zhè bù jì lù piàn zhǎn shì le láng xiōng cán de yí miàn","This documentary shows the savage side of wolves.","Este documental muestra el lado feroz de los lobos.","Ce documentaire montre le côté féroce des loups."],["L7-4661","凶恶","xiōng'è","Adj","fierce; ferocious","feroz; temible","féroce; redoutable","那条狗看起来很凶恶，孩子们都不敢靠近。","nà tiáo gǒu kàn qǐ lái hěn xiōng è hái zi men dōu bù gǎn kào jìn","That dog looks very fierce, and the children don't dare go near it.","Ese perro parece muy feroz y los niños no se atreven a acercarse.","Ce chien a l'air très féroce, les enfants n'osent pas s'en approcher."],["L7-4662","凶狠","xiōnghěn","Adj","fierce; ruthless","feroz; despiadado","féroce; impitoyable","他凶狠地瞪了我一眼，什么也没说。","tā xiōng hěn de dèng le wǒ yì yǎn shén me yě méi shuō","He glared at me fiercely and said nothing.","Me lanzó una mirada feroz y no dijo nada.","Il m'a lancé un regard féroce sans dire un mot."],["L7-4663","凶猛","xiōngměng","Adj","fierce; violent","feroz; violento","féroce; violent","老虎是一种凶猛的动物。","lǎo hǔ shì yì zhǒng xiōng měng de dòng wù","The tiger is a ferocious animal.","El tigre es un animal feroz.","Le tigre est un animal féroce."],["L7-4664","汹涌","xiōngyǒng","V","to surge; turbulent","agitarse; bravo (mar)","déferler; tumultueux","暴风雨来临前，海面上的波浪越来越汹涌。","bào fēng yǔ lái lín qián hǎi miàn shàng de bō làng yuè lái yuè xiōng yǒng","Before the storm arrived, the waves on the sea grew more and more turbulent.","Antes de que llegara la tormenta, las olas del mar se iban haciendo cada vez más bravas.","Avant l'arrivée de la tempête, les vagues de la mer devenaient de plus en plus déchaînées."],["L7-4665","胸膛","xiōngtáng","N","chest","pecho","poitrine","他挺起胸膛，大步走上了领奖台。","tā tǐng qǐ xiōng táng dà bù zǒu shàng le lǐng jiǎng tái","He threw out his chest and strode onto the podium.","Sacó pecho y subió a grandes zancadas al podio.","Il a bombé le torse et est monté d'un pas décidé sur le podium."],["L7-4666","胸有成竹","xiōngyǒuchéngzhú","","to have a plan in mind","tener un plan claro","avoir un plan bien établi","他对这次考试胸有成竹，一点儿也不紧张。","tā duì zhè cì kǎo shì xiōng yǒu chéng zhú yì diǎnr yě bù jǐn zhāng","He has the exam all worked out and isn't nervous at all.","Tiene el examen totalmente controlado y no está nada nervioso.","Il est sûr de lui pour cet examen et n'est pas nerveux du tout."],["L7-4667","雄厚","xiónghòu","Adj","abundant; substantial","abundante; sólido","solide; abondant","这家公司资金雄厚，发展得很快。","zhè jiā gōng sī zī jīn xióng hòu fā zhǎn de hěn kuài","This company has abundant funds and is developing rapidly.","Esta empresa cuenta con abundantes fondos y crece muy rápido.","Cette entreprise dispose de capitaux importants et se développe très vite."],["L7-4668","休克","xiūkè","V","shock; to go into shock","shock; entrar en shock","choc; tomber en état de choc","病人因为失血过多陷入了休克。","bìng rén yīn wèi shī xuè guò duō xiàn rù le xiū kè","The patient went into shock from losing too much blood.","El paciente entró en shock por la gran pérdida de sangre.","Le patient est tombé en état de choc après avoir perdu trop de sang."],["L7-4669","休眠","xiūmián","V","dormant; to hibernate","latente; hibernar","en sommeil; hiberner","这座火山已经休眠了几百年。","zhè zuò huǒ shān yǐ jīng xiū mián le jǐ bǎi nián","This volcano has been dormant for several hundred years.","Este volcán lleva varios siglos inactivo.","Ce volcan est en sommeil depuis plusieurs siècles."],["L7-4670","休想","xiūxiǎng","V","don't imagine; no way","ni se te ocurra; ni soñarlo","n'imagine pas; pas question","你休想从我这里拿走一分钱。","nǐ xiū xiǎng cóng wǒ zhè lǐ ná zǒu yì fēn qián","Don't even think about taking a cent from me.","Ni se te ocurra llevarte de mí ni un centavo.","N'espère pas me prendre un seul centime."],["L7-4671","休养","xiūyǎng","V","to recuperate; to convalesce","recuperarse; convalecer","se rétablir; convalescence","手术以后，医生让他在家休养一个月。","shǒu shù yǐ hòu yī shēng ràng tā zài jiā xiū yǎng yí ge yuè","After the operation, the doctor told him to recuperate at home for a month.","Después de la operación, el médico le indicó que reposara en casa un mes.","Après l'opération, le médecin lui a demandé de se reposer à la maison pendant un mois."],["L7-4672","修补","xiūbǔ","V","to mend; to repair","remendar; reparar","raccommoder; réparer","爷爷正在修补一张破了的渔网。","yé ye zhèng zài xiū bǔ yì zhāng pò le de yú wǎng","Grandpa is mending a torn fishing net.","El abuelo está remendando una red de pesca rota.","Grand-père est en train de réparer un filet de pêche déchiré."],["L7-4673","修长","xiūcháng","Adj","slender; tall and thin","esbelto; alto y delgado","élancé; svelte","她身材修长，很适合当模特。","tā shēn cái xiū cháng hěn shì hé dāng mó tè","She is tall and slender and very suitable to be a model.","Es alta y esbelta, perfecta para ser modelo.","Elle est grande et élancée, tout à fait faite pour être mannequin."],["L7-4674","修订","xiūdìng","V","to revise","revisar","réviser","这本词典去年又修订了一次。","zhè běn cí diǎn qù nián yòu xiū dìng le yí cì","This dictionary was revised once again last year.","Este diccionario se revisó otra vez el año pasado.","Ce dictionnaire a de nouveau été révisé l'an dernier."],["L7-4675","修路","xiūlù","","to repair a road","reparar una carretera","réparer une route","为了修路，村里砍了好几棵老树。","wèi le xiū lù cūn lǐ kǎn le hǎo jǐ kē lǎo shù","To build the road, the village cut down several old trees.","Para construir la carretera, en el pueblo talaron varios árboles viejos.","Pour construire la route, le village a abattu plusieurs vieux arbres."],["L7-4676","修正","xiūzhèng","V","to revise; to amend","corregir; enmendar","corriger; amender","他根据大家的意见修正了自己的计划。","tā gēn jù dà jiā de yì jiàn xiū zhèng le zì jǐ de jì huà","He revised his plan based on everyone's suggestions.","Corrigió su plan según las opiniones de todos.","Il a modifié son plan en fonction des avis de chacun."],["L7-4677","羞愧","xiūkuì","Adj","ashamed","avergonzado","honteux","他为自己说过的谎话感到很羞愧。","tā wèi zì jǐ shuō guo de huǎng huà gǎn dào hěn xiū kuì","He felt deeply ashamed of the lies he had told.","Siente mucha vergüenza por las mentiras que dijo.","Il a très honte des mensonges qu'il a dits."],["L7-4678","秀丽","xiùlì","Adj","pretty; beautiful","hermoso; bello","joli; beau","这座小楼背山临水，四周风景十分秀丽。","zhè zuò xiǎo lóu bèi shān lín shuǐ sì zhōu fēng jǐng shí fēn xiù lì","This small building has mountains behind it and faces the water, with beautiful scenery all around.","Este pequeño edificio tiene una montaña detrás y el agua enfrente, y el paisaje a su alrededor es precioso.","Ce petit bâtiment est adossé à la montagne et donne sur l'eau, avec un paysage magnifique tout autour."],["L7-4679","秀美","xiùměi","Adj","elegant; graceful","elegante; grácil","élégant; gracieux","她写得一手秀美的毛笔字。","tā xiě de yì shǒu xiù měi de máo bǐ zì","She writes graceful calligraphy with a brush.","Escribe con pincel una caligrafía elegante y hermosa.","Elle a une belle et élégante calligraphie au pinceau."],["L7-4680","袖手旁观","xiùshǒu-pángguān","","to stand by and watch","cruzarse de brazos","rester les bras croisés","看到有人遇到困难，我们不能袖手旁观。","kàn dào yǒu rén yù dào kùn nan wǒ men bù néng xiù shǒu páng guān","When we see someone in trouble, we can't just stand by and watch.","Cuando vemos que alguien tiene dificultades, no podemos quedarnos de brazos cruzados.","Quand on voit quelqu'un en difficulté, on ne peut pas rester les bras croisés."],["L7-4681","绣","xiù","V","to embroider","bordar","broder","奶奶在枕头上绣了一朵红色的牡丹花。","nǎi nai zài zhěn tou shàng xiù le yì duǒ hóng sè de mǔ dan huā","Grandma embroidered a red peony on the pillow.","La abuela bordó una peonía roja en la almohada.","Grand-mère a brodé une pivoine rouge sur l'oreiller."],["L7-4682","锈","xiù","N/V","rust; to rust","óxido; oxidarse","rouille; rouiller","铁门好几年没刷漆，都锈了。","tiě mén hǎo jǐ nián méi shuā qī dōu xiù le","The iron gate hasn't been painted for years and has rusted.","La puerta de hierro lleva varios años sin repintarse y está oxidada.","Le portail en fer n'a pas été repeint depuis des années et il est rouillé."],["L7-4683","嗅觉","xiùjué","N","sense of smell","olfato","odorat","狗的嗅觉比人灵敏得多。","gǒu de xiù jué bǐ rén líng mǐn de duō","A dog's sense of smell is much keener than a person's.","El olfato de los perros es mucho más agudo que el de las personas.","L'odorat du chien est bien plus fin que celui de l'homme."],["L7-4684","须","xū","V","must; to have to","deber; ser preciso","devoir; falloir","进入实验室前，须先换上工作服。","jìn rù shí yàn shì qián xū xiān huàn shàng gōng zuò fú","Before entering the laboratory, you must first change into work clothes.","Antes de entrar al laboratorio, hay que ponerse primero la ropa de trabajo.","Avant d'entrer dans le laboratoire, il faut d'abord enfiler une tenue de travail."],["L7-4685","虚","xū","Adj/Adv","empty; weak; false","vacío; débil; falso","vide; faible; faux","他身体有点儿虚，走几步就出汗。","tā shēn tǐ yǒu diǎnr xū zǒu jǐ bù jiù chū hàn","He is a bit weak physically and sweats after walking a few steps.","Está algo débil físicamente y suda después de dar unos pasos.","Il est un peu faible et transpire après quelques pas."],["L7-4686","虚构","xūgòu","V","to make up; fictional","inventar; ficticio","inventer; fictif","这部小说里的故事完全是虚构的。","zhè bù xiǎo shuō lǐ de gù shi wán quán shì xū gòu de","The story in this novel is entirely fictional.","La historia de esta novela es totalmente ficticia.","L'histoire de ce roman est entièrement fictive."],["L7-4687","虚幻","xūhuàn","Adj","illusory; imaginary","ilusorio; imaginario","illusoire; imaginaire","海市蜃楼中的楼阁看似真实，其实只是虚幻的影像。","hǎi shì shèn lóu zhōng de lóu gé kàn sì zhēn shí qí shí zhǐ shì xū huàn de yǐng xiàng","The towers in the mirage look real, but they are merely illusory images.","Los edificios del espejismo parecen reales, pero solo son imágenes ilusorias.","Les édifices du mirage paraissent réels, mais ce ne sont que des images illusoires."],["L7-4688","虚假","xūjiǎ","Adj","false; sham","falso; fingido","faux; factice","有人在网上散布虚假消息，造成了恐慌。","yǒu rén zài wǎng shàng sàn bù xū jiǎ xiāo xi zào chéng le kǒng huāng","Someone spread false information online, causing panic.","Alguien difundió información falsa en internet y causó pánico.","Quelqu'un a diffusé de fausses informations sur Internet, provoquant la panique."],["L7-4689","虚拟","xūnǐ","V/Adj","virtual; to imagine","virtual; imaginar","virtuel; imaginer","在虚拟世界里，人们可以扮演各种角色。","zài xū nǐ shì jiè lǐ rén men kě yǐ bàn yǎn gè zhǒng jué sè","In the virtual world, people can play all kinds of roles.","En el mundo virtual, la gente puede interpretar todo tipo de papeles.","Dans le monde virtuel, on peut jouer toutes sortes de rôles."],["L7-4690","虚弱","xūruò","Adj","weak; frail","débil; enfermizo","faible; fragile","大病一场以后，她的身体非常虚弱。","dà bìng yì chǎng yǐ hòu tā de shēn tǐ fēi cháng xū ruò","After a serious illness, her body is very weak.","Después de una enfermedad grave, su cuerpo está muy débil.","Après une grave maladie, son corps est très affaibli."],["L7-4691","虚伪","xūwěi","Adj","hypocritical; false","hipócrita; falso","hypocrite; faux","他当面说好话，背后说坏话，真虚伪。","tā dāng miàn shuō hǎo huà bèi hòu shuō huài huà zhēn xū wěi","He says nice things to your face and bad things behind your back; how hypocritical.","Dice cosas buenas en tu cara y cosas malas a tus espaldas; qué hipócrita.","Il dit du bien en face et du mal dans le dos, quel hypocrite."],["L7-4692","需","xū","V","to need; to require","necesitar; requerir","avoir besoin de; exiger","办理签证需提前一个月预约，请大家留意时间。","bàn lǐ qiān zhèng xū tí qián yí ge yuè yù yuē qǐng dà jiā liú yì shí jiān","To apply for a visa, you must make an appointment a month in advance, so please keep this timing requirement in mind.","Para tramitar la visa hay que pedir cita con un mes de anticipación, así que presten atención a los plazos.","Pour demander un visa, il faut prendre rendez-vous un mois à l'avance ; veuillez donc faire attention aux délais."],["L7-4693","徐徐","xúxú","Adj","slowly; gently","lentamente; suavemente","lentement; doucement","火车徐徐地开出了车站。","huǒ chē xú xú de kāi chū le chē zhàn","The train slowly pulled out of the station.","El tren salió lentamente de la estación.","Le train est sorti lentement de la gare."],["L7-4694","许","xǔ","V/Adv","to allow; perhaps; Xu (surname)","permitir; quizá; Xu (apellido)","permettre; peut-être; Xu (nom)","爸爸只许我每天玩一个小时游戏。","bà ba zhǐ xǔ wǒ měi tiān wán yí ge xiǎo shí yóu xì","Dad only allows me to play games for an hour a day.","Papá solo me deja jugar videojuegos una hora al día.","Papa ne me laisse jouer aux jeux vidéo qu'une heure par jour."],["L7-4695","许可证","xǔkězhèng","N","license; permit","licencia; permiso","licence; permis","开饭馆必须先办好营业许可证。","kāi fàn guǎn bì xū xiān bàn hǎo yíng yè xǔ kě zhèng","To open a restaurant, you must first obtain a business license.","Para abrir un restaurante, primero hay que tramitar la licencia comercial.","Pour ouvrir un restaurant, il faut d'abord obtenir une licence d'exploitation."],["L7-4696","旭日","xùrì","N","rising sun","sol naciente","soleil levant","清晨，一轮旭日从海面上升起。","qīng chén yì lún xù rì cóng hǎi miàn shàng shēng qǐ","In the early morning, the rising sun came up over the sea.","Al amanecer, el sol naciente se elevó sobre el mar.","Au petit matin, un soleil levant a surgi au-dessus de la mer."],["L7-4697","序","xù","N","order; preface","orden; prefacio","ordre; préface","这本书的序是一位著名作家写的。","zhè běn shū de xù shì yí wèi zhù míng zuò jiā xiě de","The preface of this book was written by a famous author.","El prólogo de este libro lo escribió un famoso autor.","La préface de ce livre a été écrite par un écrivain célèbre."],["L7-4698","序幕","xùmù","N","prologue; prelude","prólogo; preludio","prologue; prélude","随着第一声锣响，演出拉开了序幕。","suí zhe dì yī shēng luó xiǎng yǎn chū lā kāi le xù mù","With the first beat of the gong, the performance began.","Con el primer golpe de gong, comenzó la función.","Au premier coup de gong, le spectacle a commencé."],["L7-4699","叙述","xùshù","V","to narrate; to recount","narrar; relatar","raconter; relater","请你把事情的经过详细地叙述一遍。","qǐng nǐ bǎ shì qing de jīng guò xiáng xì de xù shù yí biàn","Please describe in detail how the matter happened.","Por favor, relata con detalle cómo sucedió todo.","Veuillez raconter en détail comment les choses se sont passées."],["L7-4700","酗酒","xùjiǔ","V","to drink heavily","beber en exceso","s'adonner à la boisson","他因为长期酗酒，身体越来越差。","tā yīn wèi cháng qī xù jiǔ shēn tǐ yuè lái yuè chà","Because of long-term heavy drinking, his health has been getting worse and worse.","Por beber en exceso durante mucho tiempo, su salud empeora cada vez más.","À cause d'un alcoolisme de longue date, sa santé se dégrade de plus en plus."],["L7-4701","续","xù","V","to continue; to replenish","continuar; reponer","continuer; renouveler","合同快到期了，我们打算再续一年。","hé tóng kuài dào qī le wǒ men dǎ suàn zài xù yì nián","The contract is about to expire, and we plan to renew it for another year.","El contrato está por vencer y pensamos renovarlo por otro año.","Le contrat arrive bientôt à échéance et nous comptons le renouveler pour un an."],["L7-4702","絮叨","xùdao","Adj","long-winded; garrulous","prolijo; parlanchín","verbeux; bavard","妈妈总是絮叨个没完，让我多穿点儿衣服。","mā ma zǒng shì xù dao gè méi wán ràng wǒ duō chuān diǎnr yī fu","Mom keeps nagging on and on, telling me to wear more clothes.","Mamá no deja de dar la lata, diciéndome que me abrigue más.","Maman radote sans arrêt en me disant de mettre plus de vêtements."],["L7-4703","宣称","xuānchēng","V","to claim; to assert","afirmar; declarar","prétendre; affirmer","这家公司宣称新药能治好这种病。","zhè jiā gōng sī xuān chēng xīn yào néng zhì hǎo zhè zhǒng bìng","This company claims its new drug can cure this disease.","Esta empresa afirma que su nuevo medicamento puede curar esta enfermedad.","Cette entreprise affirme que son nouveau médicament peut guérir cette maladie."],["L7-4704","宣读","xuāndú","V","to read aloud","leer en voz alta","lire à haute voix","校长在毕业典礼上宣读了获奖名单。","xiào zhǎng zài bì yè diǎn lǐ shàng xuān dú le huò jiǎng míng dān","The principal read out the list of award winners at the graduation ceremony.","En la ceremonia de graduación, el director leyó la lista de premiados.","Lors de la cérémonie de remise des diplômes, le directeur a lu la liste des lauréats."],["L7-4705","宣告","xuāngào","V","to declare; to proclaim","declarar; proclamar","déclarer; proclamer","两人在婚礼上宣告正式成为夫妻。","liǎng rén zài hūn lǐ shàng xuān gào zhèng shì chéng wéi fū qī","At the wedding, the two declared that they were officially husband and wife.","En la boda, los dos declararon que ya eran oficialmente marido y mujer.","Lors du mariage, les deux ont déclaré être officiellement mari et femme."],["L7-4706","宣誓","xuānshì","","to swear an oath","prestar juramento","prêter serment","新入职的警察们举起右手宣誓。","xīn rù zhí de jǐng chá men jǔ qǐ yòu shǒu xuān shì","The newly hired police officers raised their right hands and took an oath.","Los policías recién incorporados levantaron la mano derecha y prestaron juramento.","Les nouveaux policiers ont levé la main droite et prêté serment."],["L7-4707","宣泄","xuānxiè","V","to vent; to unburden oneself","desahogarse; drenar","se défouler; évacuer","运动是宣泄压力的好办法。","yùn dòng shì xuān xiè yā lì de hǎo bàn fǎ","Exercise is a good way to release stress.","El ejercicio es una buena forma de liberar el estrés.","Le sport est un bon moyen d'évacuer le stress."],["L7-4708","宣言","xuānyán","N","declaration; manifesto","declaración; manifiesto","déclaration; manifeste","这份宣言表达了年轻人对未来的希望。","zhè fèn xuān yán biǎo dá le nián qīng rén duì wèi lái de xī wàng","This declaration expresses young people's hopes for the future.","Esta declaración expresa las esperanzas de los jóvenes para el futuro.","Cette déclaration exprime les espoirs des jeunes pour l'avenir."],["L7-4709","宣扬","xuānyáng","V","to publicize; to spread widely","divulgar; promocionar","divulguer; propager","他到处宣扬自己的成绩，让人很反感。","tā dào chù xuān yáng zì jǐ de chéng jì ràng rén hěn fǎn gǎn","He boasts about his achievements everywhere, which people find off-putting.","Presume de sus logros por todas partes, lo cual resulta muy desagradable.","Il vante partout ses réussites, ce qui agace beaucoup de gens."],["L7-4710","喧哗","xuānhuá","V/Adj","clamor; uproar","alboroto; bullicio","tumulte; vacarme","医院里请保持安静，不要大声喧哗。","yī yuàn lǐ qǐng bǎo chí ān jìng bú yào dà shēng xuān huá","Please keep quiet in the hospital and don't make a loud noise.","En el hospital, por favor guarden silencio y no hablen en voz alta.","À l'hôpital, veuillez rester silencieux et ne pas faire de bruit."],["L7-4711","喧闹","xuānnào","Adj","noisy; clamorous","ruidoso; bullicioso","bruyant; tapageur","天色渐暗，街上的灯火陆续亮起，白天喧闹的集市也慢慢安静下来。","tiān sè jiàn àn jiē shàng de dēng huǒ lù xù liàng qǐ bái tiān xuān nào de jí shì yě màn màn ān jìng xià lái","As dusk fell, the streetlights came on one after another, and the bustling daytime market gradually grew quiet.","Al oscurecer, las luces de la calle fueron encendiéndose una tras otra, y el mercado, bullicioso durante el día, se fue quedando en calma.","La nuit tombait, les lumières de la rue s'allumaient les unes après les autres et le marché animé de la journée retrouvait peu à peu le calme."],["L7-4712","玄","xuán","Adj","black; mysterious","negro; misterioso","noir; mystérieux","这个故事说得太玄了，我可不相信。","zhè ge gù shi shuō de tài xuán le wǒ kě bù xiāng xìn","This story is too far-fetched; I don't believe it.","Esta historia está muy exagerada; yo no la creo.","Cette histoire est trop tirée par les cheveux, je n'y crois pas."],["L7-4713","玄机","xuánjī","N","profound mystery; hidden meaning","misterio profundo; sentido oculto","mystère profond ; sens caché","这道题看起来简单，其实暗藏玄机。","zhè dào tí kàn qǐ lái jiǎn dān qí shí àn cáng xuán jī","This problem looks simple, but there's actually a hidden trick to it.","Este problema parece sencillo, pero en realidad esconde una trampa.","Ce problème semble simple, mais il cache en réalité un piège."],["L7-4714","悬挂","xuánguà","V","to hang; to suspend","colgar; suspender","suspendre ; accrocher","节日里，大街两旁悬挂着红灯笼。","jié rì lǐ dà jiē liǎng páng xuán guà zhe hóng dēng lóng","During the festival, red lanterns hang on both sides of the street.","Durante la fiesta, a ambos lados de la calle cuelgan faroles rojos.","Pendant la fête, des lanternes rouges sont suspendues des deux côtés de la rue."],["L7-4715","悬念","xuánniàn","N","suspense","suspense; intriga","suspense","这部电影的悬念一直保持到最后。","zhè bù diàn yǐng de xuán niàn yì zhí bǎo chí dào zuì hòu","The suspense in this film is kept up until the very end.","El suspenso de esta película se mantiene hasta el final.","Le suspense de ce film dure jusqu'à la fin."],["L7-4716","悬殊","xuánshū","Adj","vastly different; huge disparity","muy diferente; gran disparidad","très inégal ; énorme disparité","两支球队实力悬殊，比赛没什么悬念。","liǎng zhī qiú duì shí lì xuán shū bǐ sài méi shén me xuán niàn","The two teams are vastly different in strength, so there's little suspense in the match.","Los dos equipos tienen una diferencia de nivel enorme, así que el partido no tiene mucha emoción.","Les deux équipes ont un niveau très différent, le match n'a donc guère de suspense."],["L7-4717","悬崖","xuányá","N","cliff; precipice","acantilado; precipicio","falaise ; précipice","汽车差点儿从悬崖上掉下去。","qì chē chà diǎnr cóng xuán yá shàng diào xià qù","The car nearly fell off the cliff.","El coche estuvo a punto de caer por el acantilado.","La voiture a failli tomber du haut de la falaise."],["L7-4718","旋律","xuánlǜ","N","melody","melodía","mélodie","这首歌的旋律很忧郁，听了让人想哭。","zhè shǒu gē de xuán lǜ hěn yōu yù tīng le ràng rén xiǎng kū","This song's melody is so melancholy it makes you want to cry.","La melodía de esta canción es tan melancólica que dan ganas de llorar al oírla.","La mélodie de cette chanson est si mélancolique qu'elle donne envie de pleurer."],["L7-4719","旋涡","xuánwō","N","whirlpool; vortex","remolino; vórtice","tourbillon ; vortex","小船被卷进了旋涡，差点儿翻了。","xiǎo chuán bèi juǎn jìn le xuán wō chà diǎnr fān le","The little boat was sucked into a whirlpool and nearly capsized.","El botecito fue arrastrado a un remolino y casi se vuelca.","La petite barque a été aspirée dans un tourbillon et a failli chavirer."],["L7-4720","选民","xuǎnmín","N","voter; electorate","votante; electorado","électeur ; électorat","候选人在广场上向选民发表演讲。","hòu xuǎn rén zài guǎng chǎng shàng xiàng xuǎn mín fā biǎo yǎn jiǎng","The candidate gave a speech to voters in the square.","El candidato pronunció un discurso ante los votantes en la plaza.","Le candidat a prononcé un discours devant les électeurs sur la place."],["L7-4721","选项","xuǎnxiàng","N","option; choice","opción; alternativa","option ; choix","这道题有四个选项，只有一个是对的。","zhè dào tí yǒu sì gè xuǎn xiàng zhǐ yǒu yí ge shì duì de","This question has four options, and only one is correct.","Esta pregunta tiene cuatro opciones y solo una es correcta.","Cette question propose quatre options et une seule est correcte."],["L7-4722","选用","xuǎnyòng","V","to select and use","seleccionar y usar","sélectionner et utiliser","这家饭店只选用最新鲜的食材。","zhè jiā fàn diàn zhǐ xuǎn yòng zuì xīn xiān de shí cái","This restaurant only uses the freshest ingredients.","Este restaurante solo utiliza los ingredientes más frescos.","Ce restaurant n'utilise que les ingrédients les plus frais."],["L7-4723","炫耀","xuànyào","V","to show off; to flaunt","presumir; alardear","se vanter ; faire étalage de","他总是在朋友面前炫耀自己的新车。","tā zǒng shì zài péng you miàn qián xuàn yào zì jǐ de xīn chē","He is always showing off his new car in front of his friends.","Siempre presume de su coche nuevo delante de sus amigos.","Il se vante toujours de sa nouvelle voiture devant ses amis."],["L7-4724","削弱","xuēruò","V","to weaken","debilitar","affaiblir","长期熬夜会削弱身体的免疫力。","cháng qī áo yè huì xuē ruò shēn tǐ de miǎn yì lì","Staying up late for a long time weakens the body's immunity.","Trasnochar durante mucho tiempo debilita las defensas del cuerpo.","Veiller tard de façon prolongée affaiblit les défenses immunitaires de l'organisme."],["L7-4725","靴子","xuēzi","N","boots","botas","bottes","下雪天，她穿上了一双厚厚的靴子。","xià xuě tiān tā chuān shàng le yì shuāng hòu hòu de xuē zi","On the snowy day, she put on a pair of thick boots.","En el día nevado, se puso unas botas gruesas.","Un jour de neige, elle a enfilé une paire de grosses bottes."],["L7-4726","穴位","xuéwèi","N","acupuncture point","punto de acupuntura","point d'acupuncture","按摩这几个穴位可以缓解头痛。","àn mó zhè jǐ ge xué wèi kě yǐ huǎn jiě tóu tòng","Massaging these acupuncture points can relieve headaches.","Masajear estos puntos de acupuntura puede aliviar el dolor de cabeza.","Masser ces points d'acupuncture peut soulager les maux de tête."],["L7-4727","学历","xuélì","N","educational background","nivel de estudios","niveau d'études","这家公司用人只看能力，不看学历。","zhè jiā gōng sī yòng rén zhǐ kàn néng lì bú kàn xué lì","This company hires people based only on ability, not on academic credentials.","Esta empresa contrata a la gente solo por su capacidad, no por su formación académica.","Cette entreprise recrute uniquement en fonction des compétences, pas des diplômes."],["L7-4728","学士","xuéshì","N","bachelor's degree","licenciatura; grado universitario","licence ; diplôme universitaire","她去年拿到了经济学的学士学位。","tā qù nián ná dào le jīng jì xué de xué shì xué wèi","She received her bachelor's degree in economics last year.","El año pasado obtuvo la licenciatura en economía.","Elle a obtenu l'an dernier sa licence en économie."],["L7-4729","学说","xuéshuō","N","theory; doctrine","teoría; doctrina","théorie ; doctrine","这位哲学家的学说影响了好几代人。","zhè wèi zhé xué jiā de xué shuō yǐng xiǎng le hǎo jǐ dài rén","This philosopher's doctrine has influenced several generations.","La doctrina de este filósofo influyó en varias generaciones.","La doctrine de ce philosophe a influencé plusieurs générations."],["L7-4730","学堂","xuétáng","N","school (old term)","escuela (término antiguo)","école (terme ancien)","爷爷在城里的学堂读过几年书。","yé ye zài chéng lǐ de xué táng dú guo jǐ nián shū","Grandpa studied for a few years at a school in the city.","El abuelo estudió unos años en una escuela de la ciudad.","Grand-père a étudié quelques années dans une école de la ville."],["L7-4731","学业","xuéyè","N","studies; schoolwork","estudios; trabajo escolar","études ; travail scolaire","他因为生病，不得不暂时中断学业。","tā yīn wèi shēng bìng bù dé bú zàn shí zhōng duàn xué yè","Because of illness, he had to temporarily interrupt his studies.","Por enfermedad, tuvo que interrumpir temporalmente sus estudios.","À cause de sa maladie, il a dû interrompre temporairement ses études."],["L7-4732","学艺","xuéyì","V","to learn a skill or craft","aprender un oficio o arte","apprendre un art ou un métier","他十几岁就跟着师傅学艺。","tā shí jǐ suì jiù gēn zhe shī fu xué yì","He began learning the craft from a master in his teens.","Desde los quince años y pico aprendió el oficio con un maestro.","Dès l'adolescence, il a appris le métier auprès d'un maître."],["L7-4733","学子","xuézǐ","N","student; scholar","estudiante; erudito","étudiant ; lettré","每年高考，全国有上千万学子参加考试。","měi nián gāo kǎo quán guó yǒu shàng qiān wàn xué zǐ cān jiā kǎo shì","Every year, more than ten million students across the country take the college entrance exam.","Cada año, más de diez millones de estudiantes de todo el país presentan el examen de ingreso a la universidad.","Chaque année, plus de dix millions d'élèves passent le gaokao dans tout le pays."],["L7-4734","雪山","xuěshān","N","snow-capped mountain","montaña nevada","montagne enneigée","透过窗户，可以看到远处的雪山。","tòu guò chuāng hu kě yǐ kàn dào yuǎn chù de xuě shān","Through the window you can see the snowy mountains in the distance.","A través de la ventana se ven las montañas nevadas a lo lejos.","À travers la fenêtre, on aperçoit au loin les montagnes enneigées."],["L7-4735","雪上加霜","xuěshàng-jiāshuāng","","to make matters worse","empeorar las cosas","aggraver les choses","他刚丢了工作，又生了病，真是雪上加霜。","tā gāng diū le gōng zuò yòu shēng le bìng zhēn shì xuě shàng jiā shuāng","He just lost his job and then fell ill; it really never rains but it pours.","Acaba de perder el empleo y encima se enfermó; en verdad, las desgracias nunca vienen solas.","Il vient de perdre son travail et il est tombé malade en plus : décidément, un malheur n'arrive jamais seul."],["L7-4736","血脉","xuèmài","N","blood vessels; bloodline","vasos sanguíneos; linaje","vaisseaux sanguins ; lignée","这两个家族之间有血脉关系。","zhè liǎng gè jiā zú zhī jiān yǒu xuè mài guān xì","There is a blood relationship between these two families.","Entre estas dos familias existe un vínculo de sangre.","Il existe un lien de sang entre ces deux familles."],["L7-4737","血栓","xuèshuān","N","blood clot","coágulo de sangre","caillot sanguin","久坐不动容易导致腿部形成血栓。","jiǔ zuò bú dòng róng yì dǎo zhì tuǐ bù xíng chéng xuè shuān","Sitting still for a long time can easily lead to blood clots forming in the legs.","Permanecer sentado mucho tiempo puede provocar fácilmente coágulos en las piernas.","Rester assis longtemps peut facilement provoquer des caillots dans les jambes."],["L7-4738","血压","xuèyā","N","blood pressure","presión arterial","tension artérielle","爷爷每天早上都要量一次血压。","yé ye měi tiān zǎo shang dōu yào liáng yí cì xuè yā","Grandpa measures his blood pressure every morning.","El abuelo se mide la presión arterial todas las mañanas.","Grand-père prend sa tension artérielle tous les matins."],["L7-4739","血缘","xuèyuán","N","blood relationship","parentesco de sangre","lien de sang","他们虽然没有血缘关系，却亲如兄弟。","tā men suī rán méi yǒu xuè yuán guān xì què qīn rú xiōng dì","Although they are not related by blood, they are as close as brothers.","Aunque no son parientes de sangre, son tan unidos como hermanos.","Bien qu'ils n'aient aucun lien de sang, ils sont aussi proches que des frères."],["L7-4740","勋章","xūnzhāng","N","medal; decoration","medalla; condecoración","médaille ; décoration","这位老兵胸前挂满了勋章。","zhè wèi lǎo bīng xiōng qián guà mǎn le xūn zhāng","This veteran's chest is covered with medals.","Este veterano tiene el pecho cubierto de medallas.","Ce vieil ancien combattant a la poitrine couverte de médailles."],["L7-4741","熏","xūn","V","to smoke; to fumigate","ahumar; fumigar","fumer ; enfumer","厨房里的油烟把墙都熏黑了。","chú fáng lǐ de yóu yān bǎ qiáng dōu xūn hēi le","The cooking fumes in the kitchen have blackened the walls.","El humo de la cocina ha ennegrecido las paredes.","La fumée de cuisine a noirci les murs."],["L7-4742","熏陶","xūntáo","V","to influence gradually; to nurture","influir gradualmente; formar","imprégner ; façonner","在父母的熏陶下，她从小就爱上了音乐。","zài fù mǔ de xūn táo xià tā cóng xiǎo jiù ài shàng le yīn yuè","Under her parents' influence, she fell in love with music as a child.","Gracias a la influencia de sus padres, se enamoró de la música desde niña.","Sous l'influence de ses parents, elle est tombée amoureuse de la musique dès l'enfance."],["L7-4743","寻","xún","V","to look for; to seek","buscar","chercher","他走遍了全国，到处寻名医给母亲治病。","tā zǒu biàn le quán guó dào chù xún míng yī gěi mǔ qīn zhì bìng","He traveled all over the country seeking famous doctors to treat his mother.","Recorrió todo el país buscando a médicos famosos para curar a su madre.","Il a parcouru tout le pays à la recherche de médecins renommés pour soigner sa mère."],["L7-4744","寻常","xúncháng","Adj","ordinary; usual","ordinario; común","ordinaire ; habituel","今年夏天热得很不寻常，好多天都超过了四十度。","jīn nián xià tiān rè de hěn bù xún cháng hǎo duō tiān dōu chāo guò le sì shí dù","This summer has been unusually hot, with many days above forty degrees.","Este verano ha hecho un calor fuera de lo común, con muchos días por encima de los cuarenta grados.","Cet été est exceptionnellement chaud, avec de nombreux jours au-dessus de quarante degrés."],["L7-4745","寻觅","xúnmì","V","to look for; to seek","buscar; rastrear","chercher ; rechercher","他在旧书店里寻觅了很久，终于找到了这本书。","tā zài jiù shū diàn lǐ xún mì le hěn jiǔ zhōng yú zhǎo dào le zhè běn shū","He searched in the second-hand bookstore for a long time and finally found this book.","Buscó durante mucho tiempo en la librería de segunda mano y por fin encontró este libro.","Il a longuement cherché dans la librairie d'occasion et a fini par trouver ce livre."],["L7-4746","巡逻","xúnluó","V","to patrol","patrullar","patrouiller","警察腰间别着手枪，正在街上巡逻。","jǐng chá yāo jiān bié zhe shǒu qiāng zhèng zài jiē shang xún luó","With a pistol at his waist, the police officer was patrolling the street.","Con una pistola en la cintura, el policía patrullaba por la calle.","Un pistolet à la ceinture, le policier patrouillait dans la rue."],["L7-4747","循序渐进","xúnxù-jiànjìn","","to advance step by step","avanzar paso a paso","progresser pas à pas","受伤之后，他没有急于复出，而是在康复师指导下循序渐进地训练。","shòu shāng zhī hòu tā méi yǒu jí yú fù chū ér shì zài kāng fù shī zhǐ dǎo xià xún xù jiàn jìn de xùn liàn","After his injury, he did not rush to return, but trained gradually under a rehabilitation specialist's guidance.","Tras lesionarse, no tuvo prisa por volver, sino que entrenó de forma gradual bajo la guía de un fisioterapeuta.","Après sa blessure, il ne s'est pas pressé de reprendre la compétition, mais s'est entraîné progressivement sous la direction d'un rééducateur."],["L7-4748","训","xùn","V","to teach; to train; to admonish","enseñar; entrenar; reprender","enseigner ; former ; réprimander","孩子做错了事，被爸爸训了一顿。","hái zi zuò cuò liǎo shì bèi bà ba xùn le yí dùn","The child did something wrong and got a scolding from his father.","El niño hizo algo mal y su papá lo regañó.","L'enfant a fait une bêtise et s'est fait gronder par son père."],["L7-4749","驯","xùn","V","to tame","domesticar","apprivoiser","这匹野马很难驯，好几个人都被摔下来了。","zhè pǐ yě mǎ hěn nán xùn hǎo jǐ ge rén dōu bèi shuāi xià lái le","This wild horse is very hard to tame; several people have been thrown off.","Este caballo salvaje es muy difícil de domar; varias personas han salido disparadas al suelo.","Ce cheval sauvage est très difficile à dompter ; plusieurs personnes ont été désarçonnées."],["L7-4750","逊色","xùnsè","N/Adj","inferior; less impressive","inferior; menos destacado","inférieur ; moins brillant","这部续集比第一部逊色多了。","zhè bù xù jí bǐ dì yī bù xùn sè duō le","This sequel is much inferior to the first film.","Esta secuela es muy inferior a la primera película.","Cette suite est bien inférieure au premier film."],["L7-4751","丫头","yātou","N","girl; servant girl","muchacha; criada","fillette ; servante","邻居家的小丫头特别可爱，见人就笑。","lín jū jiā de xiǎo yā tou tè bié kě ài jiàn rén jiù xiào","The neighbor's little girl is especially cute and smiles at everyone.","La niñita de los vecinos es muy linda y le sonríe a todo el mundo.","La petite fille des voisins est adorable et sourit à tout le monde."],["L7-4752","压倒","yādǎo","","to overwhelm; to overpower","abrumar; dominar","écraser ; l'emporter sur","他的声音压倒了会场里所有的嘈杂声。","tā de shēng yīn yā dǎo le huì chǎng lǐ suǒ yǒu de cáo zá shēng","His voice drowned out all the noise in the hall.","Su voz ahogó todo el ruido de la sala.","Sa voix a couvert tout le vacarme de la salle."],["L7-4753","压缩","yāsuō","V","to compress","comprimir","comprimer","原材料价格持续攀升，压缩了中小厂家的利润空间。","yuán cái liào jià gé chí xù pān shēng yā suō le zhōng xiǎo chǎng jiā de lì rùn kōng jiān","The continuing rise in raw material prices has squeezed the profit margins of small and medium-sized manufacturers.","La subida constante del precio de las materias primas ha reducido el margen de ganancia de los fabricantes pequeños y medianos.","La hausse continue du prix des matières premières a réduit la marge bénéficiaire des petits et moyens fabricants."],["L7-4754","压抑","yāyì","V","to repress; oppressive","reprimir; opresivo","réprimer ; oppressant","她心里很压抑，想找个人好好聊聊。","tā xīn lǐ hěn yā yì xiǎng zhǎo gè rén hǎo hǎo liáo liáo","She feels emotionally stifled and wants to find someone to have a good talk with.","Se siente muy agobiada y quiere hablar con alguien.","Elle se sent très oppressée et voudrait en parler avec quelqu'un."],["L7-4755","压制","yāzhì","V","to suppress; to stifle","reprimir; sofocar","réprimer ; étouffer","老师不应该压制学生的不同意见。","lǎo shī bù yīng gāi yā zhì xué shēng de bù tóng yì jiàn","Teachers shouldn't suppress students' differing opinions.","Los maestros no deberían reprimir las opiniones discrepantes de los alumnos.","Les enseignants ne devraient pas étouffer les opinions divergentes des élèves."],["L7-4756","押","yā","V","to pawn; to detain; to escort","empeñar; detener; escoltar","mettre en gage ; détenir ; escorter","他把房子押给了银行，借了一笔钱。","tā bǎ fáng zi yā gěi le yín háng jiè le yì bǐ qián","He mortgaged his house to the bank and borrowed a sum of money.","Hipotecó su casa al banco y pidió prestada una suma de dinero.","Il a hypothéqué sa maison auprès de la banque et emprunté une somme d'argent."],["L7-4757","鸦雀无声","yāquè-wúshēng","","dead silence","silencio absoluto","silence complet","老师一走进教室，教室里立刻鸦雀无声。","lǎo shī yì zǒu jìn jiào shì jiào shì lǐ lì kè yā què wú shēng","As soon as the teacher walked into the classroom, it fell completely silent.","En cuanto la maestra entró al salón, se hizo un silencio total.","Dès que la maîtresse est entrée dans la classe, un silence complet s'est installé."],["L7-4758","牙齿","yáchǐ","N","tooth","diente","dent","每天早晚刷牙，可以保护牙齿。","měi tiān zǎo wǎn shuā yá kě yǐ bǎo hù yá chǐ","Brushing your teeth every morning and evening helps protect them.","Cepillarse los dientes por la mañana y por la noche ayuda a protegerlos.","Se brosser les dents matin et soir permet de les protéger."],["L7-4759","牙膏","yágāo","N","toothpaste","pasta de dientes","dentifrice","牙膏快用完了，记得再买一支。","yá gāo kuài yòng wán le jì de zài mǎi yì zhī","The toothpaste is almost used up; remember to buy another tube.","Ya casi se acaba la pasta de dientes; acuérdate de comprar otro tubo.","Le dentifrice est presque fini ; n'oublie pas d'en racheter un tube."],["L7-4760","芽","yá","N","bud; sprout","brote; yema","bourgeon ; pousse","种子泡了两天，已经发了芽。","zhǒng zi pào le liǎng tiān yǐ jīng fā le yá","After soaking for two days, the seeds have already sprouted.","Después de dos días en remojo, las semillas ya germinaron.","Après avoir trempé deux jours, les graines ont déjà germé."],["L7-4761","哑","yǎ","Adj","hoarse; mute","ronco; mudo","enroué ; muet","看完比赛，他的嗓子都喊哑了。","kàn wán bǐ sài tā de sǎng zi dōu hǎn yǎ le","After the match, he had shouted himself hoarse.","Después del partido, de tanto gritar se había quedado ronco.","Après le match, il avait tellement crié qu'il en était aphone."],["L7-4762","咽喉","yānhóu","N","throat","garganta","gorge","老师每天讲课，咽喉经常发炎。","lǎo shī měi tiān jiǎng kè yān hóu jīng cháng fā yán","The teacher lectures every day, and her throat often gets inflamed.","La maestra da clases todos los días y la garganta se le inflama con frecuencia.","La professeure fait cours tous les jours et a souvent la gorge enflammée."],["L7-4763","烟囱","yāncōng","N","chimney","chimenea","cheminée","工厂的烟囱里冒出了浓浓的黑烟。","gōng chǎng de yān cōng lǐ mào chū le nóng nóng de hēi yān","Thick black smoke poured out of the factory chimney.","De la chimenea de la fábrica salía un humo negro y espeso.","Une épaisse fumée noire s'échappait de la cheminée de l'usine."],["L7-4764","烟火","yānhuǒ","N","fireworks; smoke and fire","fuegos artificiales; humo y fuego","feux d'artifice ; fumée et feu","节日的夜空中绽放着五彩缤纷的烟火。","jié rì de yè kōng zhōng zhàn fàng zhe wǔ cǎi bīn fēn de yān huo","Colorful fireworks blossomed in the night sky during the festival.","En el cielo nocturno de la fiesta estallaban fuegos artificiales multicolores.","Dans le ciel nocturne de la fête, des feux d'artifice multicolores éclataient."],["L7-4765","淹","yān","V","to flood; to submerge; to drown","inundar; sumergir; ahogar","inonder ; submerger ; noyer","一场大雨过后，路边的庄稼都被淹了。","yì chǎng dà yǔ guò hòu lù biān de zhuāng jia dōu bèi yān le","After a heavy rain, the crops by the road were all flooded.","Después de un aguacero, los cultivos junto al camino quedaron inundados.","Après une forte pluie, les cultures au bord de la route ont toutes été inondées."],["L7-4766","延","yán","V","Yan (surname)","Yan (apellido)","Yan (nom de famille)","因为下雨，运动会往后延了一周。","yīn wèi xià yǔ yùn dòng huì wǎng hòu yán le yì zhōu","Because of rain, the sports meet was postponed by a week.","Por la lluvia, los juegos deportivos se aplazaron una semana.","À cause de la pluie, la compétition sportive a été reportée d'une semaine."],["L7-4767","延缓","yánhuǎn","V","to delay; to slow down","retrasar; ralentizar","retarder ; ralentir","适当运动可以延缓身体的衰老。","shì dàng yùn dòng kě yǐ yán huǎn shēn tǐ de shuāi lǎo","Appropriate exercise can slow the aging of the body.","El ejercicio adecuado puede retrasar el envejecimiento del cuerpo.","Une activité physique adaptée peut retarder le vieillissement du corps."],["L7-4768","延误","yánwù","V","to delay; to miss (an opportunity)","retrasar; perder (una oportunidad)","retarder ; manquer (une occasion)","航班延误了八个小时，乘客们纷纷向航空公司索赔。","háng bān yán wù le bā gè xiǎo shí chéng kè men fēn fēn xiàng háng kōng gōng sī suǒ péi","The flight was delayed eight hours, and passengers demanded compensation from the airline one after another.","El vuelo se retrasó ocho horas y los pasajeros reclamaron una indemnización a la aerolínea uno tras otro.","Le vol a eu huit heures de retard et les passagers ont tour à tour réclamé une indemnisation à la compagnie aérienne."],["L7-4769","严谨","yánjǐn","Adj","rigorous; meticulous","riguroso; meticuloso","rigoureux ; méticuleux","这位教授治学严谨，深受学生尊敬。","zhè wèi jiào shòu zhì xué yán jǐn shēn shòu xué shēng zūn jìng","This professor is rigorous in scholarship and deeply respected by students.","Este profesor es riguroso en su labor académica y sus alumnos lo respetan mucho.","Ce professeur est d'une grande rigueur scientifique et très respecté de ses étudiants."],["L7-4770","严禁","yánjìn","V","to strictly prohibit","prohibir estrictamente","interdire strictement","为了安全，加油站内严禁吸烟。","wèi le ān quán jiā yóu zhàn nèi yán jìn xī yān","For safety reasons, smoking is strictly prohibited at the gas station.","Por seguridad, está estrictamente prohibido fumar en la gasolinera.","Pour des raisons de sécurité, il est strictement interdit de fumer dans la station-service."],["L7-4771","严峻","yánjùn","Adj","grim; severe","severo; grave","sévère ; grave","连续暴雨让山村的救援工作面临严峻的挑战。","lián xù bào yǔ ràng shān cūn de jiù yuán gōng zuò miàn lín yán jùn de tiǎo zhàn","Days of heavy rain have posed severe challenges for rescue efforts in the mountain village.","Las lluvias torrenciales continuas plantean un reto muy serio para las labores de rescate en el pueblo de montaña.","Les pluies torrentielles continues posent un défi sévère aux opérations de secours dans le village de montagne."],["L7-4772","严密","yánmì","Adj/V","strict; tight","estricto; riguroso","strict ; rigoureux","这次考试组织得很严密，没有人作弊。","zhè cì kǎo shì zǔ zhī de hěn yán mì méi yǒu rén zuò bì","This exam was very tightly organized, and no one cheated.","Este examen estuvo muy bien organizado y nadie hizo trampa.","Cet examen a été très bien organisé et personne n'a triché."],["L7-4773","言辞","yáncí","N","words; wording","palabras; expresión","propos ; paroles","他的言辞很激烈，大家都吃了一惊。","tā de yán cí hěn jī liè dà jiā dōu chī le yì jīng","His words were very harsh, and everyone was taken aback.","Sus palabras fueron muy duras y todos se sorprendieron.","Ses paroles étaient très virulentes et tout le monde a été surpris."],["L7-4774","言论","yánlùn","N","remarks; opinions","declaraciones; opiniones","propos ; opinions","每个人都要对自己在网上的言论负责。","měi ge rén dōu yào duì zì jǐ zài wǎng shàng de yán lùn fù zé","Everyone must take responsibility for what they say online.","Cada quien debe responsabilizarse de lo que dice en internet.","Chacun doit assumer la responsabilité de ce qu'il dit sur internet."],["L7-4775","言行","yánxíng","N","words and deeds","palabras y acciones","paroles et actes","父母的言行会影响孩子的一生。","fù mǔ de yán xíng huì yǐng xiǎng hái zi de yì shēng","Parents' words and deeds can affect their children's whole lives.","Las palabras y los actos de los padres pueden marcar toda la vida de los hijos.","Les paroles et les actes des parents peuvent marquer toute la vie de leurs enfants."],["L7-4776","岩石","yánshí","N","rock","roca","roche","海边的岩石被海浪冲刷得很光滑。","hǎi biān de yán shí bèi hǎi làng chōng shuā de hěn guāng huá","The rocks by the sea have been worn smooth by the waves.","Las olas han dejado muy lisas las rocas de la orilla del mar.","Les rochers du bord de mer ont été polis par les vagues."],["L7-4777","炎热","yánrè","Adj","scorching hot","muy caluroso","torride","夏天这里非常炎热，最高气温超过四十度。","xià tiān zhè lǐ fēi cháng yán rè zuì gāo qì wēn chāo guò sì shí dù","It's extremely hot here in summer, with highs above forty degrees.","En verano aquí hace muchísimo calor, con máximas de más de cuarenta grados.","En été, il fait extrêmement chaud ici, avec des maximales de plus de quarante degrés."],["L7-4778","炎症","yánzhèng","N","inflammation","inflamación","inflammation","医生说他的伤口有炎症，需要吃消炎药。","yī shēng shuō tā de shāng kǒu yǒu yán zhèng xū yào chī xiāo yán yào","The doctor said his wound was inflamed and he needed to take anti-inflammatory medicine.","El médico dijo que su herida tenía una inflamación y que debía tomar antiinflamatorios.","Le médecin a dit que sa plaie était enflammée et qu'il devait prendre des anti-inflammatoires."],["L7-4779","沿岸","yán'àn","N","coastal area; along the coast","zona costera; litoral","zone côtière ; littoral","长江沿岸有很多美丽的城市。","cháng jiāng yán àn yǒu hěn duō měi lì de chéng shì","There are many beautiful cities along the Yangtze River.","A lo largo del río Yangtsé hay muchas ciudades hermosas.","Le long du Yangtsé, il y a beaucoup de belles villes."],["L7-4780","沿途","yántú","N/Adv","along the way","a lo largo del camino","le long du chemin","比起坐飞机，我更喜欢坐火车欣赏沿途的风景。","bǐ qǐ zuò fēi jī wǒ gèng xǐ huan zuò huǒ chē xīn shǎng yán tú de fēng jǐng","Compared with flying, I prefer taking the train to enjoy the scenery along the way.","Prefiero viajar en tren que en avión, para disfrutar del paisaje del camino.","Plutôt que de prendre l'avion, je préfère voyager en train pour admirer les paysages en chemin."],["L7-4781","沿线","yánxiàn","N","along the line; area along the line","a lo largo de la línea","le long de la ligne","这条高铁沿线有十几个车站。","zhè tiáo gāo tiě yán xiàn yǒu shí jǐ ge chē zhàn","There are more than ten stations along this high-speed railway.","A lo largo de esta línea de tren de alta velocidad hay más de diez estaciones.","Le long de cette ligne à grande vitesse, il y a une dizaine de gares."],["L7-4782","研讨","yántǎo","V","to discuss; to study","debatir; estudiar","discuter ; étudier","专家们正在研讨解决交通拥堵的办法。","zhuān jiā men zhèng zài yán tǎo jiě jué jiāo tōng yōng dǔ de bàn fǎ","The experts are discussing ways to solve traffic congestion.","Los expertos están estudiando formas de resolver los embotellamientos.","Les experts étudient des moyens de résoudre les embouteillages."],["L7-4783","阎王","Yánwang","N","King of Hell; tyrant","rey del infierno; tirano","roi des enfers ; tyran","老人们常说，阎王好见，小鬼难缠。","lǎo rén men cháng shuō yán wang hǎo jiàn xiǎo guǐ nán chán","The old folks often say the king of hell is easy to see, but his petty demons are hard to deal with.","Los ancianos suelen decir: es fácil ver al rey del infierno, pero difícil lidiar con sus diablillos.","Les anciens disent souvent : le roi des enfers est facile à voir, mais ses sbires sont difficiles à supporter."],["L7-4784","衍生","yǎnshēng","V","to derive; to give rise to","derivar; dar lugar a","dériver ; engendrer","这部动画片衍生出了很多玩具和图书。","zhè bù dòng huà piàn yǎn shēng chū le hěn duō wán jù hé tú shū","This cartoon has spawned many toys and books.","Esta serie de dibujos animados ha dado origen a muchos juguetes y libros.","Ce dessin animé a donné naissance à de nombreux jouets et livres."],["L7-4785","掩盖","yǎngài","V","to cover up; to conceal","encubrir; ocultar","dissimuler ; couvrir","包装再华丽，也不能掩盖商品本身的缺陷。","bāo zhuāng zài huá lì yě bù néng yǎn gài shāng pǐn běn shēn de quē xiàn","However elaborate the packaging, it cannot conceal the defects of the product itself.","Por muy lujoso que sea el empaque, no puede ocultar los defectos del producto en sí.","Aussi luxueux que soit l'emballage, il ne peut masquer les défauts du produit lui-même."],["L7-4786","掩护","yǎnhù","V","to shield; to cover","proteger; cubrir","couvrir ; protéger","在同伴的掩护下，他安全地撤了回来。","zài tóng bàn de yǎn hù xià tā ān quán de chè le huí lái","Under his companions' cover, he retreated safely.","Protegido por sus compañeros, logró retirarse a salvo.","Couvert par ses camarades, il s'est replié en sécurité."],["L7-4787","掩饰","yǎnshì","V","to cover up; to disguise","disimular; encubrir","dissimuler ; camoufler","不管他怎么掩饰，谎言终究会被揭穿。","bù guǎn tā zěn me yǎn shì huǎng yán zhōng jiū huì bèi jiē chuān","No matter how he covers it up, the lie will be exposed in the end.","Por más que intente disimularlo, la mentira acabará descubriéndose.","Quoi qu'il fasse pour le cacher, le mensonge finira par être découvert."],["L7-4788","眼红","yǎnhóng","Adj","envious; jealous","envidioso; celoso","jaloux ; envieux","看到邻居买了新车，他很眼红。","kàn dào lín jū mǎi le xīn chē tā hěn yǎn hóng","Seeing that his neighbor had bought a new car, he was very envious.","Al ver que el vecino se había comprado un coche nuevo, sintió mucha envidia.","En voyant que son voisin avait acheté une voiture neuve, il en a été très jaloux."],["L7-4789","眼界","yǎnjiè","N","horizons; scope of vision","horizontes; perspectiva","horizons ; champ de vision","出国留学让他开阔了眼界。","chū guó liú xué ràng tā kāi kuò le yǎn jiè","Studying abroad broadened his horizons.","Estudiar en el extranjero le amplió los horizontes.","Étudier à l'étranger lui a ouvert de nouveaux horizons."],["L7-4790","眼色","yǎnsè","N","meaningful glance; wink","mirada significativa; guiño","regard entendu ; clin d'œil","妈妈给我使了个眼色，让我别说话。","mā ma gěi wǒ shǐ le gè yǎn sè ràng wǒ bié shuō huà","Mom gave me a look, signaling me not to speak.","Mamá me hizo una seña con la mirada para que no hablara.","Maman m'a fait un signe des yeux pour que je me taise."],["L7-4791","眼神","yǎnshén","N","look in the eyes; glance","mirada; expresión de los ojos","regard ; expression des yeux","老师用眼神示意他坐下。","lǎo shī yòng yǎn shén shì yì tā zuò xia","The teacher signaled with a look for him to sit down.","La maestra le indicó con la mirada que se sentara.","La maîtresse lui a fait signe du regard de s'asseoir."],["L7-4792","眼下","yǎnxià","N","now; at present","ahora; actualmente","en ce moment ; actuellement","眼下最重要的是把身体养好。","yǎn xià zuì zhòng yào de shì bǎ shēn tǐ yǎng hǎo","The most important thing right now is to get your health back.","Lo más importante por ahora es recuperar la salud.","Le plus important pour le moment, c'est de bien soigner ta santé."],["L7-4793","演变","yǎnbiàn","V","to evolve; evolution","evolucionar; evolución","évoluer ; évolution","展览把不同时期的作品并列呈现，使风格的演变一目了然。","zhǎn lǎn bǎ bù tóng shí qī de zuò pǐn bìng liè chéng xiàn shǐ fēng gé de yǎn biàn yí mù liǎo rán","The exhibition presents works from different periods side by side, making the evolution of the style clear at a glance.","La exposición presenta obras de distintas épocas una al lado de la otra, de modo que la evolución del estilo se aprecia de un vistazo.","L'exposition présente côte à côte des œuvres de différentes époques, ce qui rend l'évolution du style évidente au premier coup d'œil."],["L7-4794","演播室","yǎnbōshì","N","broadcasting studio","estudio de transmisión","studio d'enregistrement","主持人正在演播室里录制节目。","zhǔ chí rén zhèng zài yǎn bō shì lǐ lù zhì jié mù","The host is recording a program in the studio.","El presentador está grabando un programa en el estudio.","L'animateur enregistre une émission en studio."],["L7-4795","演技","yǎnjì","N","acting skills","dotes de actuación","talent d'acteur","这位年轻演员的演技越来越成熟了。","zhè wèi nián qīng yǎn yuán de yǎn jì yuè lái yuè chéng shú le","This young actor's acting skills are becoming more and more mature.","La actuación de este joven actor es cada vez más madura.","Le jeu de ce jeune acteur gagne de plus en plus en maturité."],["L7-4796","演练","yǎnliàn","V","to drill; to practice","hacer un simulacro; practicar","s'exercer ; faire un exercice","学校每学期都组织一次消防演练。","xué xiào měi xué qī dōu zǔ zhī yí cì xiāo fáng yǎn liàn","The school organizes a fire drill every semester.","La escuela organiza un simulacro de incendio cada semestre.","L'école organise un exercice d'évacuation incendie chaque semestre."],["L7-4797","演示","yǎnshì","V","to demonstrate; demonstration","demostrar; demostración","démontrer ; démonstration","老师在课上演示了这个实验。","lǎo shī zài kè shàng yǎn shì le zhè ge shí yàn","The teacher demonstrated this experiment in class.","El maestro hizo una demostración de este experimento en clase.","Le professeur a fait la démonstration de cette expérience en classe."],["L7-4798","演说","yǎnshuō","V/N","speech; to give a speech","discurso; pronunciar un discurso","discours ; prononcer un discours","他在毕业典礼上发表了一篇精彩的演说。","tā zài bì yè diǎn lǐ shàng fā biǎo le yì piān jīng cǎi de yǎn shuō","He gave a brilliant speech at the graduation ceremony.","Pronunció un discurso brillante en la ceremonia de graduación.","Il a prononcé un discours brillant lors de la cérémonie de remise des diplômes."],["L7-4799","演习","yǎnxí","V","exercise; maneuver","ejercicio; maniobra","exercice ; manœuvre","军队在海上进行了一次联合演习。","jūn duì zài hǎi shàng jìn xíng le yí cì lián hé yǎn xí","The military carried out a joint exercise at sea.","Las fuerzas armadas realizaron un ejercicio conjunto en el mar.","L'armée a mené un exercice conjoint en mer."],["L7-4800","演戏","yǎnxì","","to act in a play; to pretend","actuar; fingir","jouer la comédie ; faire semblant","她从小就喜欢演戏，长大后当了演员。","tā cóng xiǎo jiù xǐ huan yǎn xì zhǎng dà hòu dāng le yǎn yuán","She loved acting from an early age and became an actress when she grew up.","Desde pequeña le gustaba actuar y de grande se hizo actriz.","Elle adorait jouer la comédie depuis l'enfance et est devenue actrice en grandissant."],["L7-4801","演艺圈","yǎnyìquān","N","show business","mundo del espectáculo","monde du spectacle","他进入演艺圈已经二十多年了。","tā jìn rù yǎn yì quān yǐ jīng èr shí duō nián le","He has been in show business for over twenty years.","Lleva más de veinte años en el mundo del espectáculo.","Cela fait plus de vingt ans qu'il évolue dans le monde du spectacle."],["L7-4802","演绎","yǎnyì","N/V","to deduce; to play out","deducir; desarrollar","déduire ; interpréter","这首老歌被她重新演绎以后，又火了起来。","zhè shǒu lǎo gē bèi tā chóng xīn yǎn yì yǐ hòu yòu huǒ le qǐ lái","After she reinterpreted this old song, it became popular again.","Después de que ella reinterpretó esta vieja canción, volvió a ponerse de moda.","Depuis qu'elle a réinterprété cette vieille chanson, elle est redevenue populaire."],["L7-4803","厌烦","yànfán","V","fed up; bored","harto; aburrido","ennuyé ; lassé","每天做同样的工作，他已经感到厌烦了。","měi tiān zuò tóng yàng de gōng zuò tā yǐ jīng gǎn dào yàn fán le","Doing the same work every day, he has grown tired of it.","Haciendo el mismo trabajo todos los días, ya está harto.","À faire le même travail tous les jours, il en a assez."],["L7-4804","厌倦","yànjuàn","V","weary of; tired of","cansado de; harto de","las de ; fatigué de","她厌倦了城市的生活，搬到了乡下。","tā yàn juàn le chéng shì de shēng huó bān dào le xiāng xia","She grew weary of city life and moved to the countryside.","Se cansó de la vida en la ciudad y se mudó al campo.","Lasse de la vie en ville, elle a déménagé à la campagne."],["L7-4805","咽","yàn","V","to swallow; throat","tragar; garganta","avaler ; gorge","药片太大了，他费了好大劲才咽了下去。","yào piàn tài dà le tā fèi le hǎo dà jìn cái yàn le xià qù","The pill was too big; it took him a lot of effort to swallow it.","La pastilla era demasiado grande y le costó mucho trabajo tragarla.","Le comprimé était trop gros ; il a eu beaucoup de mal à l'avaler."],["L7-4806","艳丽","yànlì","Adj","gorgeous; bright and beautiful","espléndido; vistoso","éclatant ; splendide","花园里开满了艳丽的花朵。","huā yuán lǐ kāi mǎn le yàn lì de huā duǒ","The garden is full of brightly colored flowers.","El jardín está lleno de flores de colores vistosos.","Le jardin est rempli de fleurs aux couleurs éclatantes."],["L7-4807","验","yàn","V","to test; to examine","comprobar; examinar","vérifier ; examiner","医生让他先去验一下血。","yī shēng ràng tā xiān qù yàn yí xià xuè","The doctor told him to go get a blood test first.","El médico le dijo que primero fuera a hacerse un análisis de sangre.","Le médecin lui a dit d'aller d'abord faire une prise de sang."],["L7-4808","验收","yànshōu","V","to inspect and accept","inspeccionar y aceptar","réceptionner ; contrôler","新房装修好以后，我们要仔细验收。","xīn fáng zhuāng xiū hǎo yǐ hòu wǒ men yào zǐ xì yàn shōu","After the new home's renovation is finished, we need to inspect it carefully.","Cuando terminen las remodelaciones de la casa nueva, tendremos que revisarla con cuidado antes de recibirla.","Une fois les travaux de la maison neuve terminés, nous devrons la réceptionner avec soin."],["L7-4809","验证","yànzhèng","V","to verify; to validate","verificar; validar","vérifier ; valider","科学家用实验验证了这个理论。","kē xué jiā yòng shí yàn yàn zhèng le zhè ge lǐ lùn","The scientists verified this theory through experiments.","Los científicos comprobaron esta teoría mediante experimentos.","Les scientifiques ont vérifié cette théorie par des expériences."],["L7-4810","焰火","yànhuǒ","N","fireworks","fuegos artificiales","feux d'artifice","国庆节晚上，天空中放起了美丽的焰火。","guó qìng jié wǎn shang tiān kōng zhōng fàng qǐ le měi lì de yàn huǒ","On the evening of National Day, beautiful fireworks were set off in the sky.","En la noche del Día Nacional se lanzaron hermosos fuegos artificiales al cielo.","Le soir de la fête nationale, de magnifiques feux d'artifice ont été tirés dans le ciel."],["L7-4811","燕子","yànzi","N","swallow","golondrina","hirondelle","燕子在我家屋檐下做了一个窝。","yàn zi zài wǒ jiā wū yán xià zuò le yí ge wō","Swallows built a nest under the eaves of our house.","Las golondrinas hicieron un nido bajo el alero de mi casa.","Des hirondelles ont fait un nid sous l'avant-toit de notre maison."],["L7-4812","秧歌","yāngge","N","yangge folk dance","yangge (danza folclórica)","yangge (danse folklorique)","每到过年，村里的人都要扭秧歌。","měi dào guò nián cūn lǐ de rén dōu yào niǔ yāng ge","Every New Year, the villagers dance the yangge.","Cada Año Nuevo, la gente del pueblo baila el yangge.","Chaque Nouvel An, les villageois dansent le yangge."],["L7-4813","扬","yáng","V","Yang (surname); to raise","Yang (apellido); levantar","Yang (nom de famille) ; lever","小船扬起白帆，慢慢驶离了港口。","xiǎo chuán yáng qǐ bái fān màn màn shǐ lí le gǎng kǒu","The little boat hoisted its white sail and slowly left the harbor.","El botecito izó su vela blanca y se alejó lentamente del puerto.","Le petit bateau a hissé sa voile blanche et quitté lentement le port."],["L7-4814","阳性","yángxìng","N","positive; masculine","positivo; masculino","positif ; masculin","检查结果是阳性，他需要住院治疗。","jiǎn chá jié guǒ shì yáng xìng tā xū yào zhù yuàn zhì liáo","The test result was positive, and he needs to be hospitalized.","El resultado del examen fue positivo y necesita ser hospitalizado.","Le résultat du test est positif et il doit être hospitalisé."],["L7-4815","杨树","yángshù","N","poplar","álamo","peuplier","路两边种满了高高的杨树。","lù liǎng biān zhòng mǎn le gāo gāo de yáng shù","Tall poplar trees line both sides of the road.","A ambos lados del camino hay altos álamos.","De grands peupliers bordent les deux côtés de la route."],["L7-4816","洋溢","yángyì","V","to brim with; to be full of","rebosar de; estar lleno de","déborder de ; être plein de","晚会上洋溢着欢乐的气氛。","wǎn huì shàng yáng yì zhe huān lè de qì fēn","The party was brimming with a joyful atmosphere.","La fiesta estaba llena de un ambiente alegre.","La soirée baignait dans une ambiance joyeuse."],["L7-4817","养活","yǎnghuo","V","to support; to raise (animals)","mantener; criar","faire vivre ; élever","他一个人打两份工，养活一家五口。","tā yí ge rén dǎ liǎng fèn gōng yǎng huo yì jiā wǔ kǒu","He works two jobs by himself to support a family of five.","Trabaja en dos empleos él solo para mantener a una familia de cinco.","Il cumule deux emplois à lui seul pour faire vivre une famille de cinq personnes."],["L7-4818","养老金","yǎnglǎojīn","N","pension","pensión","pension de retraite","退休以后，他每个月都能领到养老金。","tuì xiū yǐ hòu tā měi ge yuè dōu néng lǐng dào yǎng lǎo jīn","After retiring, he receives a pension every month.","Después de jubilarse, recibe una pensión todos los meses.","Depuis qu'il est à la retraite, il touche une pension chaque mois."],["L7-4819","养老院","yǎnglǎoyuàn","N","nursing home","residencia de ancianos","maison de retraite","她每个周末都去养老院做义工。","tā měi ge zhōu mò dōu qù yǎng lǎo yuàn zuò yì gōng","She volunteers at the nursing home every weekend.","Todos los fines de semana va como voluntaria a un asilo de ancianos.","Tous les week-ends, elle fait du bénévolat dans une maison de retraite."],["L7-4820","养生","yǎngshēng","V","to maintain good health","cuidar la salud","prendre soin de sa santé","现在越来越多的年轻人开始重视养生。","xiàn zài yuè lái yuè duō de nián qīng rén kāi shǐ zhòng shì yǎng shēng","More and more young people are starting to pay attention to keeping healthy.","Cada vez más jóvenes empiezan a darle importancia al cuidado de la salud.","De plus en plus de jeunes commencent à accorder de l'importance à leur hygiène de vie."],["L7-4821","养殖","yǎngzhí","V","to breed; to farm","criar; cultivar","élever ; cultiver","这个村子靠养殖鱼虾致富了。","zhè ge cūn zi kào yǎng zhí yú xiā zhì fù le","This village became prosperous by raising fish and shrimp.","Este pueblo prosperó criando peces y camarones.","Ce village a prospéré grâce à l'élevage de poissons et de crevettes."],["L7-4822","氧","yǎng","N","oxygen","oxígeno","oxygène","化学课上，老师说水是由氢和氧组成的。","huà xué kè shàng lǎo shī shuō shuǐ shì yóu qīng hé yǎng zǔ chéng de","In chemistry class, the teacher said water is made up of hydrogen and oxygen.","En la clase de química, el maestro dijo que el agua está compuesta de hidrógeno y oxígeno.","En cours de chimie, le professeur a dit que l'eau est composée d'hydrogène et d'oxygène."],["L7-4823","痒","yǎng","Adj","itchy; to itch","picar; con picazón","démanger ; qui démange","被蚊子咬了以后，胳膊上痒得很。","bèi wén zi yǎo le yǐ hòu gē bo shàng yǎng de hěn","After being bitten by mosquitoes, my arm itches terribly.","Después de que me picaron los mosquitos, el brazo me pica muchísimo.","Après avoir été piqué par des moustiques, j'ai le bras qui me démange terriblement."],["L7-4824","样本","yàngběn","N","sample; specimen","muestra; espécimen","échantillon ; spécimen","作者并未回避样本的局限，而是在结论中明确阐述了适用的范畴。","zuò zhě bìng wèi huí bì yàng běn de jú xiàn ér shì zài jié lùn zhōng míng què chǎn shù le shì yòng de fàn chóu","The author did not avoid the limitations of the sample, but clearly set out the scope of applicability in the conclusion.","El autor no eludió las limitaciones de la muestra, sino que expuso con claridad en las conclusiones el ámbito de aplicación.","L'auteur n'a pas éludé les limites de l'échantillon ; il a au contraire exposé clairement dans la conclusion le champ d'application."],["L7-4825","样品","yàngpǐn","N","sample","muestra","échantillon","请先给我们寄几件样品看看。","qǐng xiān gěi wǒ men jì jǐ jiàn yàng pǐn kàn kan","Please send us a few samples to look at first.","Por favor, envíenos primero algunas muestras para verlas.","Veuillez d'abord nous envoyer quelques échantillons à examiner."],["L7-4826","妖怪","yāoguài","N","monster; demon","monstruo; demonio","monstre ; démon","这本神话小说里有各种各样的妖怪。","zhè běn shén huà xiǎo shuō lǐ yǒu gè zhǒng gè yàng de yāo guài","There are all kinds of monsters in this mythological novel.","Esta novela de mitología tiene todo tipo de monstruos.","Ce roman mythologique est peuplé de toutes sortes de monstres."],["L7-4827","邀","yāo","V","to invite","invitar","inviter","我想邀几个朋友来家里吃饭。","wǒ xiǎng yāo jǐ ge péng you lái jiā lǐ chī fàn","I want to invite a few friends over for dinner.","Quiero invitar a unos amigos a comer a la casa.","Je voudrais inviter quelques amis à dîner à la maison."],["L7-4828","窑","yáo","N","kiln; oven","horno; alfarería","four ; fourneau","这种瓷器是在窑里烧出来的。","zhè zhǒng cí qì shì zài yáo lǐ shāo chū lái de","This kind of porcelain is fired in a kiln.","Esta clase de porcelana se cuece en el horno.","Cette sorte de porcelaine est cuite au four."],["L7-4829","谣言","yáoyán","N","rumor","rumor","rumeur","不要随便相信网上的谣言，更不要转发。","bú yào suí biàn xiāng xìn wǎng shàng de yáo yán gèng bú yào zhuǎn fā","Don't readily believe rumors online, let alone share them.","No te creas cualquier rumor de internet, y menos lo compartas.","Ne crois pas n'importe quelle rumeur sur internet, et encore moins ne la partage."],["L7-4830","摇摆","yáobǎi","V","to sway; to waver","balancearse; vacilar","se balancer ; vaciller","大风吹得小树来回摇摆。","dà fēng chuī de xiǎo shù lái huí yáo bǎi","The strong wind made the small trees sway back and forth.","El fuerte viento hacía balancear los arbolitos de un lado a otro.","Le vent fort faisait osciller les petits arbres d'un côté à l'autre."],["L7-4831","摇滚","yáogǔn","N","rock music","música rock","musique rock","他从小就喜欢听摇滚，还组过一个乐队。","tā cóng xiǎo jiù xǐ huan tīng yáo gǔn hái zǔ guo yí ge yuè duì","He has loved listening to rock music since childhood and even formed a band.","Desde niño le gusta escuchar rock e incluso formó una banda.","Il aime écouter du rock depuis l'enfance et a même monté un groupe."],["L7-4832","摇晃","yáohuàng","V","to shake; to sway","sacudir; mecerse","secouer ; se balancer","船在海浪中不停地摇晃，很多人都晕船了。","chuán zài hǎi làng zhōng bù tíng de yáo huàng hěn duō rén dōu yùn chuán le","The boat kept rocking in the waves, and many people got seasick.","El barco se mecía sin parar con las olas y mucha gente se mareó.","Le bateau tanguait sans cesse sur les vagues et beaucoup de gens ont eu le mal de mer."],["L7-4833","摇篮","yáolán","N","cradle","cuna","berceau","黄河流域被称为中华文明的摇篮。","huáng hé liú yù bèi chēng wéi zhōng huá wén míng de yáo lán","The Yellow River basin is called the cradle of Chinese civilization.","La cuenca del río Amarillo se considera la cuna de la civilización china.","Le bassin du fleuve Jaune est considéré comme le berceau de la civilisation chinoise."],["L7-4834","摇摇欲坠","yáoyáo-yùzhuì","","on the verge of collapse","a punto de derrumbarse","sur le point de s'effondrer","这座老房子已经摇摇欲坠，不能再住人了。","zhè zuò lǎo fáng zi yǐ jīng yáo yáo yù zhuì bù néng zài zhù rén le","This old house is on the verge of collapse and can no longer be lived in.","Esta vieja casa está a punto de derrumbarse y ya no se puede habitar.","Cette vieille maison menace de s'effondrer et n'est plus habitable."],["L7-4835","遥控","yáokòng","V","remote control","control remoto","télécommande","这辆玩具汽车可以用手机遥控。","zhè liàng wán jù qì chē kě yǐ yòng shǒu jī yáo kòng","This toy car can be remote-controlled with a phone.","Este carrito de juguete se puede controlar a distancia con el celular.","Cette voiture jouet peut être télécommandée avec un téléphone."],["L7-4836","遥远","yáoyuǎn","Adj","distant; remote","lejano; remoto","lointain","纵然路途遥远，他也每年回家看望父母。","zòng rán lù tú yáo yuǎn tā yě měi nián huí jiā kàn wàng fù mǔ","Even though the journey is long, he goes home to see his parents every year.","Aunque el camino es largo, él vuelve a casa todos los años a visitar a sus padres.","Même si le trajet est long, il rentre chaque année voir ses parents."],["L7-4837","药材","yàocái","N","medicinal herbs","ingredientes medicinales","matières médicinales","这个地区盛产各种药材，比如人参和枸杞。","zhè ge dì qū shèng chǎn gè zhǒng yào cái bǐ rú rén shēn hé gǒu qǐ","This region produces all kinds of medicinal herbs, such as ginseng and goji berries.","Esta región produce en abundancia todo tipo de hierbas medicinales, como el ginseng y las bayas de goji.","Cette région produit en abondance toutes sortes de plantes médicinales, comme le ginseng et les baies de goji."],["L7-4838","药方","yàofāng","N","prescription","receta médica","ordonnance","老中医给他开了一个药方。","lǎo zhōng yī gěi tā kāi le yí ge yào fāng","The old doctor of Chinese medicine wrote him a prescription.","El viejo médico de medicina china le recetó un remedio.","Le vieux médecin de médecine chinoise lui a prescrit une ordonnance."],["L7-4839","要不","yàobù","Conj","otherwise; or else","si no; de lo contrario","sinon ; autrement","快走吧，要不就赶不上火车了。","kuài zǒu ba yào bú jiù gǎn bú shàng huǒ chē le","Let's hurry, or else we'll miss the train.","Date prisa, si no, perderemos el tren.","Dépêchons-nous, sinon on va rater le train."],["L7-4840","要不是","yàobùshì","Conj","if it were not for","si no fuera por","n'eût été ; sans","要不是你提醒我，我早就忘了这件事。","yào bú shì nǐ tí xǐng wǒ wǒ zǎo jiù wàng le zhè jiàn shì","If you hadn't reminded me, I would have forgotten about it long ago.","Si no me lo hubieras recordado, ya me habría olvidado de esto hace mucho.","Si tu ne me l'avais pas rappelé, j'aurais oublié cela depuis longtemps."],["L7-4841","要点","yàodiǎn","N","main point; essentials","punto clave; esencial","point essentiel","请把这篇文章的要点总结一下。","qǐng bǎ zhè piān wén zhāng de yào diǎn zǒng jié yí xià","Please summarize the main points of this article.","Por favor, resume los puntos principales de este artículo.","Veuillez résumer les points essentiels de cet article."],["L7-4842","要害","yàohài","N","vital part; crucial point","punto vital; punto crucial","point vital ; point crucial","他的批评正好说中了问题的要害。","tā de pī píng zhèng hǎo shuō zhòng le wèn tí de yào hài","His criticism hit right at the crux of the problem.","Su crítica dio justo en el punto clave del problema.","Sa critique a touché précisément le point crucial du problème."],["L7-4843","要紧","yàojǐn","Adj","important; urgent","importante; urgente","important ; urgent","你的身体要紧，工作的事以后再说。","nǐ de shēn tǐ yào jǐn gōng zuò de shì yǐ hòu zài shuō","Your health comes first; we can talk about work later.","Tu salud es lo primero; del trabajo hablamos después.","Ta santé passe avant tout ; on parlera du travail plus tard."],["L7-4844","要领","yàolǐng","N","essentials; key points","esencia; puntos clave","essentiel ; points clés","学游泳要先掌握动作要领。","xué yóu yǒng yào xiān zhǎng wò dòng zuò yào lǐng","To learn to swim, you first need to master the essentials of the movements.","Para aprender a nadar, primero hay que dominar los puntos clave de los movimientos.","Pour apprendre à nager, il faut d'abord maîtriser les points clés des mouvements."],["L7-4845","要命","yàomìng","","extremely; terribly; to be deadly","muchísimo; terriblemente","extrêmement ; terriblement","今天热得要命，我一点儿也不想出门。","jīn tiān rè de yào mìng wǒ yì diǎnr yě bù xiǎng chū mén","It's terribly hot today, and I don't want to go out at all.","Hoy hace un calor horrible y no tengo ganas de salir para nada.","Il fait une chaleur terrible aujourd'hui et je n'ai pas du tout envie de sortir."],["L7-4846","要强","yàoqiáng","Adj","eager to excel; competitive","ambicioso; competitivo","ambitieux ; qui veut réussir","她是个要强的人，从来不愿意认输。","tā shì gè yào qiáng de rén cóng lái bú yuàn yì rèn shū","She is a determined person who never wants to admit defeat.","Es una persona orgullosa y decidida que nunca quiere admitir la derrota.","C'est une femme de caractère qui ne veut jamais s'avouer vaincue."],["L7-4847","钥匙","yàoshi","N","key","llave","clé","我真蠢，居然把钥匙锁在了车里。","wǒ zhēn chǔn jū rán bǎ yào shi suǒ zài le chē lǐ","How stupid of me—I actually locked the keys in the car.","Qué tonto soy, ¡cómo pude dejar las llaves encerradas dentro del auto!","Que je suis bête, j'ai vraiment enfermé les clés dans la voiture !"],["L7-4848","耀眼","yàoyǎn","Adj","dazzling","deslumbrante","éblouissant","中午的阳光太耀眼了，最好戴上墨镜。","zhōng wǔ de yáng guāng tài yào yǎn le zuì hǎo dài shàng mò jìng","The midday sunlight is too dazzling; you'd better wear sunglasses.","El sol del mediodía es deslumbrante; mejor ponte lentes de sol.","Le soleil de midi est éblouissant ; tu ferais mieux de mettre des lunettes de soleil."],["L7-4849","椰子","yēzi","N","coconut","coco","noix de coco","海南岛上到处都是椰子树。","hǎi nán dǎo shàng dào chù dōu shì yē zi shù","There are coconut trees everywhere on Hainan Island.","En la isla de Hainan hay cocoteros por todas partes.","Il y a des cocotiers partout sur l'île de Hainan."],["L7-4850","也就是说","yějiùshìshuō","","in other words","es decir; en otras palabras","autrement dit ; c'est-à-dire","他说下周没空，也就是说，会议得推迟了。","tā shuō xià zhōu méi kòng yě jiù shì shuō huì yì děi tuī chí le","He said he's busy next week; that is to say, the meeting has to be postponed.","Dijo que la próxima semana no tiene tiempo; es decir, la reunión tendrá que posponerse.","Il a dit qu'il n'est pas disponible la semaine prochaine ; autrement dit, la réunion devra être reportée."],["L7-4851","野餐","yěcān","V","picnic; to have a picnic","picnic; hacer un picnic","pique-nique ; pique-niquer","周末我们一家人去公园野餐。","zhōu mò wǒ men yì jiā rén qù gōng yuán yě cān","On the weekend our family went to the park for a picnic.","El fin de semana fuimos toda la familia a hacer un picnic al parque.","Ce week-end, toute la famille est allée pique-niquer au parc."],["L7-4852","野炊","yěchuī","V","to cook outdoors","cocinar al aire libre","cuisiner en plein air","同学们在河边野炊，玩得很开心。","tóng xué men zài hé biān yě chuī wán de hěn kāi xīn","The classmates had a cookout by the river and had a great time.","Los compañeros cocinaron al aire libre junto al río y se divirtieron mucho.","Les camarades ont cuisiné en plein air au bord de la rivière et se sont bien amusés."],["L7-4853","野蛮","yěmán","Adj","barbaric; uncivilized","bárbaro; incivilizado","barbare ; sauvage","在公共场所乱扔东西是很野蛮的行为。","zài gōng gòng chǎng suǒ luàn rēng dōng xi shì hěn yě mán de xíng wéi","Throwing things around in public places is very uncivilized behavior.","Tirar cosas en los lugares públicos es un comportamiento muy incivilizado.","Jeter des détritus dans les lieux publics est un comportement très barbare."],["L7-4854","野兽","yěshòu","N","wild animal; beast","animal salvaje; bestia","bête sauvage","从前这片森林里经常有野兽出没。","cóng qián zhè piàn sēn lín lǐ jīng cháng yǒu yě shòu chū mò","In the past, wild beasts often roamed this forest.","Antiguamente, en este bosque aparecían a menudo animales salvajes.","Autrefois, des bêtes sauvages rôdaient souvent dans cette forêt."],["L7-4855","野外","yěwài","N","countryside; outdoors","campo; exterior","campagne ; plein air","这次野外考察由王教授亲自带队。","zhè cì yě wài kǎo chá yóu wáng jiào shòu qīn zì dài duì","Professor Wang is personally leading this field survey.","Esta expedición de campo la dirige personalmente el profesor Wang.","Cette mission d'étude sur le terrain est menée en personne par le professeur Wang."],["L7-4856","野心","yěxīn","N","ambition","ambición","ambition","这个年轻人很有野心，想开一家自己的公司。","zhè ge nián qīng rén hěn yǒu yě xīn xiǎng kāi yì jiā zì jǐ de gōng sī","This young man is very ambitious and wants to start his own company.","Este joven es muy ambicioso y quiere abrir su propia empresa.","Ce jeune homme est très ambitieux et veut créer sa propre entreprise."],["L7-4857","野营","yěyíng","V","to camp","acampar","camper","暑假里，学校组织学生去山里野营。","shǔ jià lǐ xué xiào zǔ zhī xué shēng qù shān lǐ yě yíng","During the summer vacation, the school organized a camping trip in the mountains for students.","Durante las vacaciones de verano, la escuela organizó un campamento en las montañas para los alumnos.","Pendant les vacances d'été, l'école a organisé un camp en montagne pour les élèves."],["L7-4858","业","yè","Suffix","industry; business","industria; sector","industrie ; secteur","他们一家人世代以打鱼为业。","tā men yì jiā rén shì dài yǐ dǎ yú wéi yè","For generations their family has made a living by fishing.","Su familia se ha dedicado a la pesca durante generaciones.","Leur famille vit de la pêche depuis des générations."],["L7-4858#2","服务业","fúwùyè","N","service industry","sector servicios","secteur des services"],["L7-4859","业绩","yèjì","N","achievements; performance","logros; rendimiento","résultats ; performance","这家公司把员工的奖金和业绩直接挂钩。","zhè jiā gōng sī bǎ yuán gōng de jiǎng jīn hé yè jì zhí jiē guà gōu","This company links employee bonuses directly to performance.","Esta empresa vincula directamente las bonificaciones de los empleados con su rendimiento.","Cette entreprise lie directement les primes des employés à leurs résultats."],["L7-4860","夜班","yèbān","N","night shift","turno de noche","poste de nuit","医院的护士们每周轮流上夜班。","yī yuàn de hù shi men měi zhōu lún liú shàng yè bān","The hospital nurses take turns working the night shift every week.","Las enfermeras del hospital se turnan cada semana para el turno de noche.","Les infirmières de l'hôpital font la garde de nuit à tour de rôle chaque semaine."],["L7-4861","夜市","yèshì","N","night market","mercado nocturno","marché nocturne","晚上我们去夜市吃小吃吧。","wǎn shang wǒ men qù yè shì chī xiǎo chī ba","Let's go to the night market for snacks this evening.","Esta noche vamos al mercado nocturno a comer antojitos.","Ce soir, allons manger des petites choses au marché de nuit."],["L7-4862","夜晚","yèwǎn","N","night","noche","nuit","城市的夜晚灯火通明，非常热闹。","chéng shì de yè wǎn dēng huǒ tōng míng fēi cháng rè nao","At night the city is brightly lit and very lively.","De noche la ciudad está profusamente iluminada y muy animada.","La nuit, la ville est brillamment illuminée et très animée."],["L7-4863","夜校","yèxiào","N","night school","escuela nocturna","école du soir","他白天上班，晚上去夜校学英语。","tā bái tiān shàng bān wǎn shang qù yè xiào xué yīng yǔ","He works during the day and studies English at night school in the evening.","Trabaja de día y por la noche va a una escuela nocturna a estudiar inglés.","Il travaille la journée et étudie l'anglais le soir dans une école du soir."],["L7-4864","夜以继日","yèyǐjìrì","","day and night","día y noche","jour et nuit","工人们夜以继日地工作，终于按时完成了工程。","gōng rén men yè yǐ jì rì de gōng zuò zhōng yú àn shí wán chéng le gōng chéng","The workers worked day and night and finally finished the project on time.","Los obreros trabajaron día y noche y por fin terminaron la obra a tiempo.","Les ouvriers ont travaillé jour et nuit et ont fini par terminer le chantier à temps."],["L7-4865","夜总会","yèzǒnghuì","N","nightclub","club nocturno","boîte de nuit","这条街上有好几家夜总会。","zhè tiáo jiē shang yǒu hǎo jǐ jiā yè zǒng huì","There are several nightclubs on this street.","En esta calle hay varios clubes nocturnos.","Il y a plusieurs boîtes de nuit dans cette rue."],["L7-4866","液晶","yèjīng","N","liquid crystal","cristal líquido","cristaux liquides","这台液晶电视的画面非常清楚。","zhè tái yè jīng diàn shì de huà miàn fēi cháng qīng chu","The picture on this LCD television is very clear.","La imagen de este televisor LCD es muy nítida.","L'image de ce téléviseur LCD est très nette."],["L7-4867","液体","yètǐ","N","liquid","líquido","liquide","坐飞机时不能随身携带太多液体。","zuò fēi jī shí bù néng suí shēn xié dài tài duō yè tǐ","When flying, you can't carry too much liquid in your hand luggage.","Al viajar en avión no se puede llevar demasiado líquido en el equipaje de mano.","En avion, on ne peut pas emporter trop de liquides dans son bagage à main."],["L7-4868","一把手","yībǎshǒu","","the boss; head of an organization","el jefe; máximo responsable","le patron ; le premier responsable","这次调整旨在减少重复审批，而不是把所有权限都集中到一把手手中。","zhè cì tiáo zhěng zhǐ zài jiǎn shǎo chóng fù shěn pī ér bú shì bǎ suǒ yǒu quán xiàn dōu jí zhōng dào yì bǎ shǒu shǒu zhōng","This adjustment aims to reduce duplicate approvals, rather than concentrate all authority in the top leader's hands.","Este ajuste tiene como fin reducir las aprobaciones duplicadas, no concentrar toda la autoridad en manos del máximo responsable.","Cet ajustement vise à réduire les validations en double, et non à concentrer tous les pouvoirs entre les mains du premier responsable."],["L7-4869","一线","yīxiàn","N","front line","primera línea","première ligne","我们向奋战在一线的医护人员致敬。","wǒ men xiàng fèn zhàn zài yí xiàn de yī hù rén yuán zhì jìng","We pay tribute to the medical staff fighting on the front line.","Rendimos homenaje al personal médico que lucha en primera línea.","Nous rendons hommage au personnel soignant qui se bat en première ligne."],["L7-4870","一一","yīyī","Adv","one by one","uno por uno","un par un","老师把同学们的问题一一做了回答。","lǎo shī bǎ tóng xué men de wèn tí yī yī zuò le huí dá","The teacher answered the students' questions one by one.","El maestro respondió una por una las preguntas de los alumnos.","Le professeur a répondu une à une aux questions des élèves."],["L7-4871","伊斯兰教","Yīsīlánjiào","N","Islam","islam","islam","伊斯兰教是世界三大宗教之一。","yī sī lán jiào shì shì jiè sān dà zōng jiào zhī yī","Islam is one of the world's three major religions.","El islam es una de las tres grandes religiones del mundo.","L'islam est l'une des trois grandes religions du monde."],["L7-4872","衣食住行","yī-shí-zhù-xíng","","clothing, food, housing, transport","vestido, comida, vivienda y transporte","vêtement, nourriture, logement, transport","衣食住行是人们生活中最基本的需要。","yī shí zhù xíng shì rén men shēng huó zhōng zuì jī běn de xū yào","Food, clothing, housing and transportation are people's most basic needs.","Alimentación, vestido, vivienda y transporte son las necesidades más básicas de la vida.","Se nourrir, se vêtir, se loger et se déplacer sont les besoins les plus fondamentaux de la vie."],["L7-4873","医务","yīwù","N","medical affairs","asuntos médicos","affaires médicales","他在医院从事医务工作已经三十年了。","tā zài yī yuàn cóng shì yī wù gōng zuò yǐ jīng sān shí nián le","He has done medical work at the hospital for thirty years.","Lleva treinta años dedicado al trabajo médico en el hospital.","Il travaille dans le domaine médical à l'hôpital depuis trente ans."],["L7-4874","依","yī","V/Prep","to depend on; according to","depender de; según","dépendre de ; selon","依你看，这批货是继续等还是马上退掉？","yī nǐ kàn zhè pī huò shì jì xù děng hái shi mǎ shàng tuì diào","In your view, should we keep waiting for this shipment or cancel the order right away?","A tu parecer, ¿seguimos esperando este pedido o lo devolvemos de inmediato?","À ton avis, faut-il continuer à attendre cette marchandise ou la renvoyer tout de suite ?"],["L7-4875","依托","yītuō","V","to rely on; to depend on","apoyarse en; depender de","s'appuyer sur ; compter sur","这个小镇依托当地的温泉发展旅游业。","zhè ge xiǎo zhèn yī tuō dāng dì de wēn quán fā zhǎn lǚ yóu yè","This small town relies on its local hot springs to develop tourism.","Este pueblito se apoya en sus aguas termales locales para desarrollar el turismo.","Cette petite ville s'appuie sur ses sources thermales locales pour développer le tourisme."],["L7-4876","依依不舍","yīyī-bùshě","","reluctant to part","reacio a separarse","ne pas vouloir se quitter","毕业那天，同学们依依不舍地告别了。","bì yè nà tiān tóng xué men yī yī bù shě de gào bié le","On graduation day, the classmates said goodbye reluctantly.","El día de la graduación, los compañeros se despidieron con pena, sin querer separarse.","Le jour de la remise des diplômes, les camarades se sont dit au revoir à regret."],["L7-4877","一不小心","yī bù xiǎoxīn","","to be careless for a moment","descuidarse un momento","par inadvertance","他一不小心把杯子打碎了。","tā yí bù xiǎo xīn bǎ bēi zi dǎ suì le","He accidentally broke the cup.","Sin querer, rompió la taza.","Il a cassé la tasse par inadvertance."],["L7-4878","一刹那","yīchànà","N","an instant; a flash","un instante; un santiamén","un instant ; un éclair","就在那一刹那，他想起了一件重要的事。","jiù zài nà yí chà nà tā xiǎng qǐ le yí jiàn zhòng yào de shì","In that very instant, he remembered something important.","Justo en ese instante, recordó algo importante.","À cet instant précis, il s'est souvenu de quelque chose d'important."],["L7-4879","一大早","yīdàzǎo","N","first thing in the morning","a primera hora de la mañana","tôt le matin","他一大早就出门去赶火车了。","tā yí dà zǎo jiù chū mén qù gǎn huǒ chē le","He left home first thing in the morning to catch the train.","Salió de casa muy temprano para alcanzar el tren.","Il est parti de chez lui de bon matin pour prendre son train."],["L7-4880","一动不动","yīdòng-bùdòng","","motionless","inmóvil","immobile","小猫趴在窗台上一动不动。","xiǎo māo pā zài chuāng tái shàng yí dòng bú dòng","The kitten lay motionless on the windowsill.","El gatito estaba echado en el alféizar de la ventana sin moverse.","Le chaton était couché sur le rebord de la fenêtre, sans bouger."],["L7-4881","一度","yīdù","Adv","once; for a time","una vez; durante un tiempo","une fois ; un temps","大雪导致城市交通一度瘫痪。","dà xuě dǎo zhì chéng shì jiāo tōng yí dù tān huàn","The heavy snow paralyzed the city's traffic for a time.","La fuerte nevada paralizó el tráfico de la ciudad por un tiempo.","Les fortes chutes de neige ont un temps paralysé la circulation dans la ville."],["L7-4882","一概","yīgài","Adv","all; without exception","todos; sin excepción","tous ; sans exception","老城区的改造应兼顾居民日常所需，不能把有特色的街道一概改成相同的模样。","lǎo chéng qū de gǎi zào yīng jiān gù jū mín rì cháng suǒ xū bù néng bǎ yǒu tè sè de jiē dào yí gài gǎi chéng xiāng tóng de mú yàng","Renewal of the old town should take residents' everyday needs into account rather than give every distinctive street the same appearance.","La renovación del casco antiguo debe tener en cuenta las necesidades cotidianas de los residentes y no convertir todas las calles con carácter propio en un mismo modelo.","La rénovation du vieux quartier doit tenir compte des besoins quotidiens des habitants et ne pas donner la même apparence à toutes les rues qui ont leur caractère."],["L7-4883","一概而论","yīgài'érlùn","","to lump together","meter todo en el mismo saco","mettre tout dans le même panier","每个人的情况都不同，不能一概而论。","měi ge rén de qíng kuàng dōu bù tóng bù néng yí gài ér lùn","Everyone's situation is different, so you can't generalize.","La situación de cada persona es distinta, así que no se puede generalizar.","La situation de chacun est différente, on ne peut pas généraliser."],["L7-4884","一个劲儿","yīgejìnr","Adv","persistently; continuously","sin parar; con insistencia","sans arrêt ; avec insistance","孩子一个劲儿地哭，谁也劝不住。","hái zi yí ge jìnr de kū shéi yě quàn bu zhù","The child kept crying and no one could calm him down.","El niño no dejaba de llorar y nadie lograba calmarlo.","L'enfant n'arrêtait pas de pleurer et personne ne parvenait à le calmer."],["L7-4885","一晃","yīhuàng","V","in a flash; in an instant","en un abrir y cerrar de ojos","en un clin d'œil","一晃十年过去了，孩子们都长大了。","yì huǎng shí nián guò qù le hái zi men dōu zhǎng dà le","In the blink of an eye ten years have passed, and the children have all grown up.","En un abrir y cerrar de ojos pasaron diez años y los niños ya crecieron.","En un clin d'œil, dix ans ont passé et les enfants ont tous grandi."],["L7-4886","一技之长","yījìzhīcháng","","a special skill","una habilidad especial","une compétence particulière","学一门手艺，有一技之长就不怕找不到工作。","xué yì mén shǒu yì yǒu yí jì zhī cháng jiù bú pà zhǎo bu dào gōng zuò","Learn a trade; with a special skill, you needn't worry about finding work.","Aprende un oficio; si tienes una habilidad especial, no tendrás miedo de quedarte sin trabajo.","Apprends un métier ; avec un savoir-faire, tu n'auras pas peur de ne pas trouver de travail."],["L7-4887","一面","yīmiàn","N/Adv","one side; at the same time","un lado; al mismo tiempo","un côté ; en même temps","她一面听音乐，一面整理房间。","tā yí miàn tīng yīn yuè yí miàn zhěng lǐ fáng jiān","She tidied her room while listening to music.","Ella ordenaba su cuarto mientras escuchaba música.","Elle rangeait sa chambre tout en écoutant de la musique."],["L7-4888","一目了然","yīmù-liǎorán","","obvious at a glance","obvio a simple vista","clair au premier coup d'œil","展览把不同时期的作品并列呈现，使风格的演变一目了然。","zhǎn lǎn bǎ bù tóng shí qī de zuò pǐn bìng liè chéng xiàn shǐ fēng gé de yǎn biàn yí mù liǎo rán","The exhibition presents works from different periods side by side, making the evolution of the style clear at a glance.","La exposición presenta obras de distintas épocas una al lado de la otra, de modo que la evolución del estilo se aprecia de un vistazo.","L'exposition présente côte à côte des œuvres de différentes époques, ce qui rend l'évolution du style évidente au premier coup d'œil."],["L7-4889","一事无成","yīshì-wúchéng","","to achieve nothing","no lograr nada","ne rien accomplir","他这几年换了好几份工作，却一事无成。","tā zhè jǐ nián huàn le hǎo jǐ fèn gōng zuò què yí shì wú chéng","He has changed jobs several times in recent years but achieved nothing.","En estos años ha cambiado de empleo varias veces, pero no ha logrado nada.","Ces dernières années, il a changé plusieurs fois d'emploi sans rien accomplir."],["L7-4890","一瞬间","yīshùnjiān","N","a split second","un instante","un instant","摄影师在黎明前赶到湖畔，只为捕捉雾气散去的一瞬间。","shè yǐng shī zài lí míng qián gǎn dào hú pàn zhǐ wèi bǔ zhuō wù qì sàn qù de yí shùn jiān","The photographer reached the lakeside before dawn just to capture the moment when the mist lifted.","El fotógrafo llegó a la orilla del lago antes del amanecer solo para captar el instante en que se disipaba la niebla.","Le photographe est arrivé au bord du lac avant l'aube, juste pour saisir l'instant où la brume se dissipe."],["L7-4891","一味","yīwèi","Adv","blindly; persistently","ciegamente; obstinadamente","aveuglément ; obstinément","对孩子不能一味放纵，该管的时候一定要管。","duì hái zi bù néng yí wèi fàng zòng gāi guǎn de shí hou yí dìng yào guǎn","You can't just indulge children all the time; when discipline is needed, you must provide it.","No se puede consentir a los niños sin límites; cuando hay que corregirlos, hay que hacerlo.","On ne peut pas céder en tout aux enfants ; quand il faut les cadrer, il faut le faire."],["L7-4892","一系列","yīxìliè","Adj","a series of","una serie de","une série de","政府出台了一系列措施来扩大内需。","zhèng fǔ chū tái le yí xì liè cuò shī lái kuò dà nèi xū","The government introduced a series of measures to boost domestic demand.","El gobierno adoptó una serie de medidas para estimular la demanda interna.","Le gouvernement a adopté une série de mesures pour stimuler la demande intérieure."],["L7-4893","一阵","yīzhèn","","a burst; a spell","un rato; una racha","un moment ; une bouffée","半夜里，她被一阵电话铃声惊醒了。","bàn yè lǐ tā bèi yí zhèn diàn huà líng shēng jīng xǐng le","In the middle of the night, she was jolted awake by a ringing phone.","A medianoche, el timbre del teléfono la despertó sobresaltada.","Au milieu de la nuit, une sonnerie de téléphone l'a réveillée en sursaut."],["L7-4894","仪表","yíbiǎo","N","appearance; meter","aspecto; medidor","allure ; instrument de mesure","面试的时候，要注意自己的仪表。","miàn shì de shí hou yào zhù yì zì jǐ de yí biǎo","At a job interview, you should pay attention to your appearance.","En una entrevista de trabajo hay que cuidar la apariencia personal.","Lors d'un entretien d'embauche, il faut soigner sa tenue."],["L7-4895","怡然自得","yírán-zìdé","","happy and content","feliz y satisfecho","heureux et satisfait","老人坐在院子里喝茶，看起来怡然自得。","lǎo rén zuò zài yuàn zi lǐ hē chá kàn qǐ lái yí rán zì dé","The old man sat in the courtyard drinking tea, looking happy and content.","El anciano estaba sentado en el patio tomando té, con aire de total satisfacción.","Le vieil homme, assis dans la cour à boire du thé, avait l'air heureux et serein."],["L7-4896","姨","yí","N","maternal aunt","tía materna","tante maternelle","我姨在北京开了一家小书店。","wǒ yí zài běi jīng kāi le yì jiā xiǎo shū diàn","My aunt opened a small bookstore in Beijing.","Mi tía abrió una pequeña librería en Pekín.","Ma tante a ouvert une petite librairie à Pékin."],["L7-4897","移交","yíjiāo","V","to hand over; to transfer","entregar; transferir","remettre ; transférer","调查人员应当妥善保管证物，确保证据在移交过程中不被篡改。","diào chá rén yuán yīng dāng tuǒ shàn bǎo guǎn zhèng wù què bǎo zhèng jù zài yí jiāo guò chéng zhōng bú bèi cuàn gǎi","Investigators should safeguard the exhibits to ensure that evidence is not tampered with during transfer.","Los investigadores deben custodiar adecuadamente las pruebas para garantizar que no se alteren durante el traspaso.","Les enquêteurs doivent conserver correctement les pièces à conviction afin de garantir que les preuves ne soient pas falsifiées pendant leur transfert."],["L7-4898","移植","yízhí","V","to transplant","trasplantar","transplanter","医生成功地给病人移植了一颗肾脏。","yī shēng chéng gōng de gěi bìng rén yí zhí le yì kē shèn zàng","The doctors successfully transplanted a kidney into the patient.","Los médicos le trasplantaron con éxito un riñón al paciente.","Les médecins ont greffé avec succès un rein au patient."],["L7-4899","遗留","yíliú","V","to leave behind; to hand down","dejar; legar","laisser ; léguer","这些都是上一任经理遗留下来的问题。","zhè xiē dōu shì shàng yí rèn jīng lǐ yí liú xià lái de wèn tí","These are all problems left behind by the previous manager.","Todos estos son problemas que dejó el gerente anterior.","Ce sont tous des problèmes laissés par le directeur précédent."],["L7-4900","遗弃","yíqì","V","to abandon","abandonar","abandonner","这只小狗被主人遗弃在了路边。","zhè zhī xiǎo gǒu bèi zhǔ rén yí qì zài le lù biān","This puppy was abandoned by the roadside by its owner.","Su dueño abandonó a este perrito al borde del camino.","Ce chiot a été abandonné au bord de la route par son maître."],["L7-4901","遗体","yítǐ","N","remains of the deceased","restos mortales","dépouille","人们排着长队向老英雄的遗体告别。","rén men pái zhe cháng duì xiàng lǎo yīng xióng de yí tǐ gào bié","People lined up to bid farewell to the remains of the old hero.","La gente hizo una larga fila para despedirse de los restos del viejo héroe.","Les gens ont fait une longue queue pour dire adieu à la dépouille du vieux héros."],["L7-4902","遗忘","yíwàng","V","to forget","olvidar","oublier","这段历史不应该被遗忘。","zhè duàn lì shǐ bù yīng gāi bèi yí wàng","This period of history should not be forgotten.","Este período de la historia no debe olvidarse.","Cette période de l'histoire ne doit pas être oubliée."],["L7-4903","遗物","yíwù","N","relic; keepsake","reliquia; recuerdo del difunto","relique ; souvenir du défunt","这块手表是爷爷留下的遗物。","zhè kuài shǒu biǎo shì yé ye liú xià de yí wù","This watch is something Grandpa left behind when he died.","Este reloj es una reliquia que dejó mi abuelo.","Cette montre est un souvenir que grand-père nous a laissé."],["L7-4904","遗愿","yíyuàn","N","last wish","última voluntad","dernières volontés","按照老人的遗愿，家人把他的书捐给了图书馆。","àn zhào lǎo rén de yí yuàn jiā rén bǎ tā de shū juān gěi le tú shū guǎn","In accordance with the old man's last wishes, his family donated his books to the library.","Conforme a la última voluntad del anciano, su familia donó sus libros a la biblioteca.","Conformément aux dernières volontés du vieil homme, sa famille a fait don de ses livres à la bibliothèque."],["L7-4905","遗址","yízhǐ","N","ruins; historic site","ruinas; sitio histórico","ruines ; site historique","这里是一处有三千年历史的古城遗址。","zhè lǐ shì yí chù yǒu sān qiān nián lì shǐ de gǔ chéng yí zhǐ","This is the site of an ancient city with three thousand years of history.","Este es el sitio de una ciudad antigua con tres mil años de historia.","Voici le site d'une cité antique vieille de trois mille ans."],["L7-4906","遗嘱","yízhǔ","N","will; testament","testamento","testament","他在遗嘱里把房子留给了女儿。","tā zài yí zhǔ lǐ bǎ fáng zi liú gěi le nǚ ér","In his will he left the house to his daughter.","En su testamento le dejó la casa a su hija.","Dans son testament, il a légué la maison à sa fille."],["L7-4907","疑点","yídiǎn","N","doubtful point","punto dudoso","point douteux","这个案子还有很多疑点没有查清。","zhè ge àn zi hái yǒu hěn duō yí diǎn méi yǒu chá qīng","There are still many doubtful points in this case that haven't been cleared up.","Este caso todavía tiene muchos puntos dudosos sin aclarar.","Cette affaire comporte encore de nombreux points obscurs qui n'ont pas été élucidés."],["L7-4908","疑惑","yíhuò","V","doubt; to be puzzled","duda; estar perplejo","doute ; être perplexe","他疑惑地看着我，好像不明白我的意思。","tā yí huò de kàn zhe wǒ hǎo xiàng bù míng bai wǒ de yì si","He looked at me puzzled, as if he didn't understand what I meant.","Me miró desconcertado, como si no entendiera lo que quería decir.","Il m'a regardé d'un air perplexe, comme s'il ne comprenait pas ce que je voulais dire."],["L7-4909","疑虑","yílǜ","V","misgivings; doubt","reparos; dudas","doutes ; réticences","医生的解释打消了病人的疑虑。","yī shēng de jiě shì dǎ xiāo le bìng rén de yí lǜ","The doctor's explanation dispelled the patient's doubts.","La explicación del médico disipó las dudas del paciente.","L'explication du médecin a dissipé les doutes du patient."],["L7-4910","以","yǐ","Prep/Conj","by means of; with","mediante; con","au moyen de ; avec","这座城市以美丽的湖景闻名。","zhè zuò chéng shì yǐ měi lì de hú jǐng wén míng","This city is famous for its beautiful lake views.","Esta ciudad es famosa por sus hermosas vistas del lago.","Cette ville est célèbre pour ses magnifiques paysages de lac."],["L7-4911","以免","yǐmiǎn","Conj","so as to avoid","para evitar","afin d'éviter","炒菜时最好用木铲子，以免刮坏锅底。","chǎo cài shí zuì hǎo yòng mù chǎn zi yǐ miǎn guā huài guō dǐ","It's best to use a wooden spatula when stir-frying so you don't scratch the bottom of the pan.","Al saltear, es mejor usar una espátula de madera para no rayar el fondo del sartén.","Pour sauter les aliments, il vaut mieux utiliser une spatule en bois afin de ne pas rayer le fond de la poêle."],["L7-4912","以身作则","yǐshēn-zuòzé","","to set an example","dar ejemplo","donner l'exemple","父母要以身作则，给孩子做个好榜样。","fù mǔ yào yǐ shēn zuò zé gěi hái zi zuò gè hǎo bǎng yàng","Parents should lead by example and be good role models for their children.","Los padres deben predicar con el ejemplo y ser un buen modelo para sus hijos.","Les parents doivent donner l'exemple et être de bons modèles pour leurs enfants."],["L7-4913","以至于","yǐzhìyú","Conj","so much so that","hasta el punto de que","au point que","他看书看得太入迷，以至于忘了吃饭。","tā kàn shū kàn de tài rù mí yǐ zhì yú wàng le chī fàn","He was so absorbed in his book that he forgot to eat.","Estaba tan absorto leyendo que se olvidó de comer.","Il était si absorbé par sa lecture qu'il en a oublié de manger."],["L7-4914","以致","yǐzhì","Conj","so that; resulting in","de modo que; con el resultado de","de sorte que ; si bien que","他平时不注意休息，以致病倒了。","tā píng shí bú zhù yì xiū xi yǐ zhì bìng dǎo le","He usually didn't pay attention to rest, with the result that he fell ill.","Normalmente no cuidaba su descanso, y por eso terminó enfermándose.","Il ne faisait d'ordinaire pas attention à se reposer, si bien qu'il est tombé malade."],["L7-4915","矣","yǐ","Aux","(classical final particle)","(partícula final clásica)","(particule finale classique)","老人叹了口气说：事到如今，后悔已晚矣。","lǎo rén tàn le kǒu qì shuō shì dào rú jīn hòu huǐ yǐ wǎn yǐ","The old man sighed and said: at this point, it's too late for regrets.","El anciano suspiró y dijo: «A estas alturas, arrepentirse ya es tarde».","Le vieil homme soupira et dit : « À présent, il est trop tard pour les regrets. »"],["L7-4916","倚","yǐ","V","to lean on; to rely on","apoyarse en; depender de","s'appuyer sur ; compter sur","她倚在门口，看着外面的雨。","tā yǐ zài mén kǒu kàn zhe wài miàn de yǔ","She leaned against the doorway, watching the rain outside.","Estaba apoyada en la puerta, mirando la lluvia afuera.","Elle était appuyée contre l'embrasure de la porte et regardait la pluie dehors."],["L7-4917","一长一短","yī cháng yī duǎn","","talking endlessly","hablar sin parar","parler sans fin","她把旅途中的见闻一长一短地讲给我们听。","tā bǎ lǚ tú zhōng de jiàn wén yì cháng yì duǎn de jiǎng gěi wǒ men tīng","She gave us a long-winded account of what she had seen and heard on her trip.","Nos contó con todo detalle y sin prisa lo que había visto y oído durante su viaje.","Elle nous a raconté en long et en large tout ce qu'elle avait vu et entendu pendant son voyage."],["L7-4918","一成不变","yīchéng-bùbiàn","","unchanging; set in stone","inmutable","immuable","世界上没有一成不变的事物。","shì jiè shàng méi yǒu yì chéng bú biàn de shì wù","Nothing in the world stays the same forever.","En el mundo no hay nada que permanezca inmutable.","Rien au monde ne reste immuable."],["L7-4919","一筹莫展","yīchóu-mòzhǎn","","at one's wits' end","no saber qué hacer","ne savoir que faire","面对这么多困难，他一筹莫展。","miàn duì zhè me duō kùn nan tā yì chóu mò zhǎn","Faced with so many difficulties, he was at his wits' end.","Ante tantas dificultades, no sabía qué hacer.","Face à tant de difficultés, il ne savait plus quoi faire."],["L7-4920","一帆风顺","yīfān-fēngshùn","","smooth sailing","viento en popa","tout se passe bien","祝你这次出国旅行一帆风顺！","zhù nǐ zhè cì chū guó lǚ xíng yì fān fēng shùn","I wish you smooth sailing on your trip abroad!","¡Que tengas un buen viaje al extranjero, sin contratiempos!","Je te souhaite un très bon voyage à l'étranger, sans encombre !"],["L7-4921","一干二净","yīgān-èrjìng","","completely; thoroughly","por completo; totalmente","complètement ; entièrement","他把老师讲的内容忘得一干二净。","tā bǎ lǎo shī jiǎng de nèi róng wàng de yì gān èr jìng","He completely forgot what the teacher had taught.","Olvidó por completo lo que el maestro había explicado.","Il a complètement oublié ce que le professeur avait enseigné."],["L7-4922","一鼓作气","yīgǔ-zuòqì","","in one go; with one burst of energy","de un tirón; de una vez","d'une traite ; d'un seul élan","我们一鼓作气爬到了山顶。","wǒ men yì gǔ zuò qì pá dào le shān dǐng","We climbed to the top of the mountain in one go.","De un tirón subimos hasta la cima de la montaña.","D'une traite, nous avons grimpé jusqu'au sommet de la montagne."],["L7-4923","一锅粥","yīguōzhōu","N","a complete mess","un completo desorden","un vrai chaos","一听说老师不来了，教室里乱成了一锅粥。","yì tīng shuō lǎo shī bù lái le jiào shì lǐ luàn chéng le yì guō zhōu","As soon as they heard the teacher wasn't coming, the classroom fell into complete chaos.","En cuanto supieron que la maestra no vendría, el salón se volvió un completo caos.","Dès qu'ils ont appris que la maîtresse ne viendrait pas, la classe est devenue un vrai chaos."],["L7-4924","一回事","yīhuíshì","N","one and the same thing","lo mismo; una sola cosa","une seule et même chose","听了他的解释，我才明白是怎么一回事。","tīng le tā de jiě shì wǒ cái míng bai shì zěn me yì huí shì","Only after hearing his explanation did I understand what was going on.","Solo después de oír su explicación entendí lo que pasaba.","Ce n'est qu'après avoir entendu son explication que j'ai compris de quoi il s'agissait."],["L7-4925","一家人","yījiārén","N","the whole family","toda la familia","toute la famille","中秋节是一家人团圆的日子。","zhōng qiū jié shì yì jiā rén tuán yuán de rì zi","The Mid-Autumn Festival is a day for families to be together.","El Festival del Medio Otoño es el día en que la familia se reúne.","La fête de la Mi-automne est le jour où les familles se retrouvent."],["L7-4926","一经","yījīng","Adv","as soon as; once","en cuanto; una vez que","dès que ; une fois que","合同中的条款一经双方签署，任何一方都不能擅自更改。","hé tóng zhōng de tiáo kuǎn yì jīng shuāng fāng qiān shǔ rèn hé yì fāng dōu bù néng shàn zì gēng gǎi","Once both parties sign the contract, neither may alter its terms without authorization.","Una vez que ambas partes firman las cláusulas del contrato, ninguna puede modificarlas por su cuenta.","Une fois les clauses du contrat signées par les deux parties, aucune d'elles ne peut les modifier de sa propre initiative."],["L7-4927","一举","yījǔ","N/Adv","a move; at one stroke","de un solo golpe; una acción","d'un seul coup ; une action","他在这次比赛中一举拿下了三块金牌。","tā zài zhè cì bǐ sài zhōng yì jǔ ná xià le sān kuài jīn pái","In this competition he won three gold medals at one stroke.","En esta competencia se llevó tres medallas de oro de una sola vez.","Dans cette compétition, il a remporté trois médailles d'or d'un seul coup."],["L7-4928","一举一动","yījǔ-yīdòng","","every move","cada movimiento","chaque geste","孩子会模仿父母的一举一动。","hái zi huì mó fǎng fù mǔ de yì jǔ yí dòng","Children imitate their parents' every move.","Los niños imitan cada movimiento de sus padres.","Les enfants imitent le moindre geste de leurs parents."],["L7-4929","一卡通","yīkǎtōng","N","smart transit card","tarjeta inteligente de transporte","carte de transport à puce","有了这张一卡通，坐公交和地铁都很方便。","yǒu le zhè zhāng yì kǎ tōng zuò gōng jiāo hé dì tiě dōu hěn fāng biàn","With this all-in-one card, taking buses and the subway is very convenient.","Con esta tarjeta única, es muy cómodo viajar en autobús y en metro.","Avec cette carte unique, il est très pratique de prendre le bus et le métro."],["L7-4930","一揽子","yīlǎnzi","Adj","comprehensive; package","integral; paquete","global ; en bloc","政府推出了一揽子计划来帮助小企业。","zhèng fǔ tuī chū le yì lǎn zi jì huà lái bāng zhù xiǎo qǐ yè","The government launched a package of plans to help small businesses.","El gobierno lanzó un paquete de medidas para ayudar a las pequeñas empresas.","Le gouvernement a lancé un plan global pour aider les petites entreprises."],["L7-4931","一连","yīlián","Adv","in a row; in succession","seguido; consecutivamente","d'affilée ; consécutivement","一连下了三天雨，路上全是水。","yì lián xià le sān tiān yǔ lù shang quán shì shuǐ","It rained for three days straight, and the roads are covered with water.","Llovió tres días seguidos y las calles están llenas de agua.","Il a plu trois jours d'affilée et les routes sont couvertes d'eau."],["L7-4932","一连串","yīliánchuàn","Adj","a series of","una serie de","une série de","他一连串的问题把我问住了。","tā yì lián chuàn de wèn tí bǎ wǒ wèn zhù le","His string of questions left me speechless.","Su sarta de preguntas me dejó sin palabras.","Sa série de questions m'a laissé sans voix."],["L7-4933","一毛不拔","yīmáo-bùbá","","stingy","tacaño","radin","他这个人一毛不拔，从来不请客。","tā zhè ge rén yì máo bù bá cóng lái bù qǐng kè","He is a miser who never treats anyone.","Es un tacaño que nunca invita a nadie.","C'est un grippe-sou qui n'invite jamais personne."],["L7-4934","一年到头","yīnián-dàotóu","","all year round","todo el año","toute l'année","农民一年到头都在地里忙。","nóng mín yì nián dào tóu dōu zài dì lǐ máng","Farmers are busy in the fields all year round.","Los campesinos andan ocupados en el campo todo el año.","Les paysans sont occupés aux champs toute l'année."],["L7-4935","一旁","yīpáng","N","to the side; aside","a un lado; aparte","sur le côté ; à l'écart","妈妈在厨房做饭，孩子在一旁帮忙。","mā ma zài chú fáng zuò fàn hái zi zài yì páng bāng máng","Mom was cooking in the kitchen, and the child was helping at her side.","Mamá cocinaba en la cocina y el niño la ayudaba a su lado.","Maman faisait la cuisine et l'enfant l'aidait à ses côtés."],["L7-4936","一如既往","yīrú-jìwǎng","","as always; as before","como siempre","comme toujours","我们会一如既往地支持你。","wǒ men huì yì rú jì wǎng de zhī chí nǐ","We will continue to support you as always.","Te seguiremos apoyando como siempre.","Nous continuerons à te soutenir comme toujours."],["L7-4937","一声不吭","yīshēng-bùkēng","","to not say a word","no decir ni una palabra","ne pas dire un mot","挨了批评以后，他一声不吭地走了。","āi le pī píng yǐ hòu tā yì shēng bù kēng de zǒu le","After being criticized, he left without saying a word.","Después de que lo criticaron, se fue sin decir una palabra.","Après s'être fait critiquer, il est parti sans dire un mot."],["L7-4938","一手","yīshǒu","N/Adv","skill; single-handedly","habilidad; por sí solo","talent ; à soi seul","她写得一手秀美的毛笔字。","tā xiě de yì shǒu xiù měi de máo bǐ zì","She writes graceful calligraphy with a brush.","Escribe con pincel una caligrafía elegante y hermosa.","Elle a une belle et élégante calligraphie au pinceau."],["L7-4939","一塌糊涂","yītāhútú","","a complete mess","un completo desastre","un désastre complet","屋里乱得一塌糊涂，他却从容不迫地收拾起来，仿佛这样的场面早已司空见惯。","wū lǐ luàn de yì tā hú tú tā què cóng róng bú pò de shōu shi qǐ lái fǎng fú zhè yàng de chǎng miàn zǎo yǐ sī kōng jiàn guàn","The room was in a terrible mess, but he began tidying it calmly, as though such a scene were already commonplace to him.","El cuarto estaba hecho un desastre, pero él empezó a ordenar con calma, como si ya estuviera acostumbrado a escenas así.","La pièce était dans un désordre épouvantable, mais il s'est mis à ranger calmement, comme si une telle scène lui était depuis longtemps familière."],["L7-4940","一体","yītǐ","N","an integral whole; everybody","un todo; todos","un tout ; tout le monde","演出到最后，演员和观众仿佛成了一体。","yǎn chū dào zuì hòu yǎn yuán hé guān zhòng fǎng fú chéng le yì tǐ","By the end of the performance, the actors and audience seemed to have become one.","Al final de la función, los actores y el público parecían haberse vuelto uno solo.","À la fin du spectacle, les acteurs et le public semblaient ne faire plus qu'un."],["L7-4941","一天到晚","yītiān-dàowǎn","","all day long","todo el día","toute la journée","他一天到晚忙个不停，连吃饭的时间都没有。","tā yì tiān dào wǎn máng gè bù tíng lián chī fàn de shí jiān dōu méi yǒu","He is busy all day long and doesn't even have time to eat.","Anda ocupado todo el día sin parar, ni siquiera tiene tiempo de comer.","Il est occupé du matin au soir sans arrêt, il n'a même pas le temps de manger."],["L7-4942","一头","yītóu","Adv/N","a head; headlong","una cabeza; de cabeza","une tête ; tête baissée","她留着一头长长的黑发。","tā liú zhe yì tóu cháng cháng de hēi fà","She has a head of long black hair.","Tiene una larga cabellera negra.","Elle a de longs cheveux noirs."],["L7-4943","一无所有","yīwúsuǒyǒu","","to have nothing at all","no tener nada","ne rien posséder","他刚来城市的时候一无所有，现在已经买了房子。","tā gāng lái chéng shì de shí hou yì wú suǒ yǒu xiàn zài yǐ jīng mǎi le fáng zi","When he first came to the city he had nothing; now he has bought a house.","Cuando llegó a la ciudad no tenía nada; ahora ya compró una casa.","Quand il est arrivé en ville, il n'avait rien ; maintenant, il a déjà acheté une maison."],["L7-4944","一无所知","yīwúsuǒzhī","","to know nothing at all","no saber nada","ne rien savoir","我对这个行业一无所知，还要多向你学习。","wǒ duì zhè ge háng yè yì wú suǒ zhī hái yào duō xiàng nǐ xué xí","I know nothing about this industry and have a lot to learn from you.","No sé nada de este sector y tengo mucho que aprender de ti.","Je ne connais rien à ce secteur et j'ai beaucoup à apprendre de toi."],["L7-4945","一心","yīxīn","Adv","wholeheartedly","de todo corazón","de tout cœur","她一心为病人着想，从来不考虑自己。","tā yì xīn wèi bìng rén zhuó xiǎng cóng lái bù kǎo lǜ zì jǐ","She thinks wholeheartedly of her patients and never of herself.","Piensa solo en sus pacientes y nunca en sí misma.","Elle pense uniquement à ses patients et jamais à elle-même."],["L7-4946","一心一意","yīxīn-yīyì","","single-mindedly","con total dedicación","avec un seul but en tête","他一心一意地照顾生病的妻子。","tā yì xīn yí yì de zhào gù shēng bìng de qī zi","He devotedly looks after his sick wife.","Cuida con total dedicación a su esposa enferma.","Il s'occupe de sa femme malade avec un dévouement total."],["L7-4947","一言不发","yīyán-bùfā","","to not say a word","no decir palabra","ne pas dire un mot","会上他一言不发，不知道在想什么。","huì shàng tā yì yán bù fā bù zhī dào zài xiǎng shén me","He didn't say a word at the meeting; who knows what he was thinking.","En la reunión no dijo ni una palabra; quién sabe qué estaría pensando.","Pendant la réunion, il n'a pas dit un mot ; on ne sait pas à quoi il pensait."],["L7-4948","一言一行","yīyán-yīxíng","","every word and deed","cada palabra y acción","chaque parole et acte","老师的一言一行都会影响学生。","lǎo shī de yì yán yì xíng dōu huì yǐng xiǎng xué shēng","A teacher's every word and deed influences the students.","Cada palabra y cada acto de un maestro influyen en sus alumnos.","Chaque parole et chaque geste d'un enseignant influencent ses élèves."],["L7-4949","一眼","yīyǎn","","a glance","una mirada","un coup d'œil","他凶狠地瞪了我一眼，什么也没说。","tā xiōng hěn de dèng le wǒ yì yǎn shén me yě méi shuō","He glared at me fiercely and said nothing.","Me lanzó una mirada feroz y no dijo nada.","Il m'a lancé un regard féroce sans dire un mot."],["L7-4950","一应俱全","yīyīng-jùquán","","everything needed is available","con todo lo necesario","avoir tout le nécessaire","这家超市的商品一应俱全，什么都能买到。","zhè jiā chāo shì de shāng pǐn yì yīng jù quán shén me dōu néng mǎi dào","This supermarket has everything; you can buy anything there.","Este supermercado tiene de todo; se puede comprar cualquier cosa.","Ce supermarché propose tout ; on peut y acheter n'importe quoi."],["L7-4951","一早","yīzǎo","N","early in the morning","temprano por la mañana","tôt le matin","明天一早我们就出发去机场。","míng tiān yì zǎo wǒ men jiù chū fā qù jī chǎng","We'll leave for the airport early tomorrow morning.","Mañana a primera hora salimos hacia el aeropuerto.","Demain de bon matin, nous partons pour l'aéroport."],["L7-4952","义工","yìgōng","N","volunteer","voluntario","bénévole","她每个周末都去社区做义工。","tā měi ge zhōu mò dōu qù shè qū zuò yì gōng","She volunteers in the community every weekend.","Todos los fines de semana hace voluntariado en la comunidad.","Tous les week-ends, elle fait du bénévolat dans son quartier."],["L7-4953","议","yì","V","to discuss; to comment on","discutir; opinar","discuter ; commenter","这件事大家先议一议再决定。","zhè jiàn shì dà jiā xiān yì yi yì zài jué dìng","Let's discuss this matter first before deciding.","Primero discutamos este asunto entre todos y luego decidimos.","Discutons-en d'abord tous ensemble avant de décider."],["L7-4954","议程","yìchéng","N","agenda","orden del día","ordre du jour","今天会议的议程一共有三项。","jīn tiān huì yì de yì chéng yí gòng yǒu sān xiàng","Today's meeting agenda has three items in total.","El orden del día de la reunión de hoy tiene tres puntos en total.","L'ordre du jour de la réunion d'aujourd'hui comporte trois points au total."],["L7-4955","议会","yìhuì","N","parliament","parlamento","parlement","这个党在议会中占了一半的席位。","zhè ge dǎng zài yì huì zhōng zhàn le yí bàn de xí wèi","This party holds half the seats in parliament.","Este partido ocupa la mitad de los escaños del parlamento.","Ce parti détient la moitié des sièges au parlement."],["L7-4956","议员","yìyuán","N","legislator; parliamentarian","legislador; parlamentario","parlementaire ; député","这位议员在会上提出了一个新建议。","zhè wèi yì yuán zài huì shàng tí chū le yí ge xīn jiàn yì","This member of parliament put forward a new proposal at the meeting.","Este legislador presentó una nueva propuesta en la sesión.","Ce parlementaire a présenté une nouvelle proposition lors de la séance."],["L7-4957","屹立","yìlì","V","to stand tall","erguirse; alzarse","se dresser","这座古塔在山顶上屹立了一千多年。","zhè zuò gǔ tǎ zài shān dǐng shàng yì lì le yì qiān duō nián","This ancient pagoda has stood on the mountaintop for over a thousand years.","Esta antigua pagoda se alza en la cima de la montaña desde hace más de mil años.","Cette ancienne pagode se dresse au sommet de la montagne depuis plus de mille ans."],["L7-4958","亦","yì","Adv","also","también","aussi","他是我的老师，亦是我的朋友。","tā shì wǒ de lǎo shī yì shì wǒ de péng you","He is my teacher and also my friend.","Él es mi maestro y también mi amigo.","Il est mon professeur et aussi mon ami."],["L7-4959","异口同声","yìkǒu-tóngshēng","","to speak in unison","decir a coro","dire d'une seule voix","听到老师的问题，大家异口同声地回答没问题。","tīng dào lǎo shī de wèn tí dà jiā yì kǒu tóng shēng de huí dá méi wèn tí","Hearing the teacher's question, everyone answered in unison that there was no problem.","Al oír la pregunta de la maestra, todos respondieron a coro que no había problema.","En entendant la question de la maîtresse, tous ont répondu en chœur qu'il n'y avait pas de problème."],["L7-4960","异想天开","yìxiǎng-tiānkāi","","to indulge in fantasy","tener ideas descabelladas","avoir des idées farfelues","他想不花一分钱环游世界，真是异想天开。","tā xiǎng bù huā yì fēn qián huán yóu shì jiè zhēn shì yì xiǎng tiān kāi","He wants to travel around the world without spending a cent; what a fantasy.","Quiere dar la vuelta al mundo sin gastar un centavo; qué fantasía.","Il veut faire le tour du monde sans dépenser un sou ; quelle idée farfelue."],["L7-4961","异性","yìxìng","Adj/N","opposite sex","sexo opuesto","sexe opposé","青春期的孩子开始对异性产生兴趣。","qīng chūn qī de hái zi kāi shǐ duì yì xìng chǎn shēng xìng qù","Adolescents begin to take an interest in the opposite sex.","Los niños en la pubertad empiezan a sentir interés por el sexo opuesto.","Les enfants à la puberté commencent à s'intéresser au sexe opposé."],["L7-4962","异议","yìyì","N","objection; dissent","objeción; disenso","objection ; désaccord","如果大家没有异议，我们就按这个方案办。","rú guǒ dà jiā méi yǒu yì yì wǒ men jiù àn zhè ge fāng àn bàn","If no one has any objection, we'll go with this plan.","Si nadie tiene objeciones, haremos las cosas según este plan.","Si personne n'a d'objection, nous suivrons ce plan."],["L7-4963","抑扬顿挫","yìyáng-dùncuò","","cadence; rise and fall of tone","cadencia; entonación melodiosa","cadence ; modulation de la voix","他朗读课文时抑扬顿挫，非常好听。","tā lǎng dú kè wén shí yì yáng dùn cuò fēi cháng hǎo tīng","When he reads the text aloud, his voice rises and falls rhythmically and sounds wonderful.","Cuando lee el texto en voz alta, su entonación sube y baja con ritmo y suena muy bien.","Quand il lit le texte à voix haute, son intonation est pleine de nuances et très agréable à écouter."],["L7-4964","抑郁","yìyù","Adj","depressed; gloomy","deprimido; melancólico","déprimé ; sombre","失业以后，他的心情一直很抑郁。","shī yè yǐ hòu tā de xīn qíng yì zhí hěn yì yù","Since losing his job, he has been feeling very depressed.","Desde que perdió el empleo, ha estado muy deprimido.","Depuis qu'il a perdu son emploi, il est constamment déprimé."],["L7-4965","抑郁症","yìyùzhèng","N","depression","depresión","dépression","抑郁症是一种需要认真治疗的疾病。","yì yù zhèng shì yì zhǒng xū yào rèn zhēn zhì liáo de jí bìng","Depression is an illness that needs serious treatment.","La depresión es una enfermedad que requiere tratamiento serio.","La dépression est une maladie qui nécessite un traitement sérieux."],["L7-4966","抑制","yìzhì","V","to inhibit; to suppress","inhibir; reprimir","inhiber ; réprimer","这种药可以抑制细菌的生长。","zhè zhǒng yào kě yǐ yì zhì xì jūn de shēng zhǎng","This medicine can inhibit the growth of bacteria.","Este medicamento puede inhibir el crecimiento de las bacterias.","Ce médicament peut inhiber la croissance des bactéries."],["L7-4967","译","yì","V","to translate","traducir","traduire","他花了三年时间才译完这部长篇小说。","tā huā le sān nián shí jiān cái yì wán zhè bù cháng piān xiǎo shuō","It took him three years to finish translating this long novel.","Le llevó tres años terminar de traducir esta novela larga.","Il lui a fallu trois ans pour finir de traduire ce long roman."],["L7-4968","易拉罐","yìlāguàn","N","pull-tab can","lata con anilla","canette à languette","喝完的易拉罐请扔进回收箱里。","hē wán de yì lā guàn qǐng rēng jìn huí shōu xiāng lǐ","Please throw empty cans into the recycling bin.","Por favor, tire las latas vacías en el contenedor de reciclaje.","Veuillez jeter les canettes vides dans le bac de recyclage."],["L7-4969","疫苗","yìmiáo","N","vaccine","vacuna","vaccin","孩子出生以后要按时打疫苗。","hái zi chū shēng yǐ hòu yào àn shí dǎ yì miáo","After birth, children should get their vaccinations on schedule.","Después de nacer, los niños deben vacunarse a tiempo.","Après la naissance, les enfants doivent recevoir leurs vaccins à temps."],["L7-4970","益处","yìchù","N","benefit","beneficio","avantage","多读书对孩子有很多益处。","duō dú shū duì hái zi yǒu hěn duō yì chù","Reading more has many benefits for children.","Leer más trae muchos beneficios a los niños.","Lire davantage est très bénéfique pour les enfants."],["L7-4971","意料","yìliào","V","to expect; expectation","esperar; expectativa","prévoir ; attente","比赛的结果完全出乎大家的意料。","bǐ sài de jié guǒ wán quán chū hū dà jiā de yì liào","The result of the match was completely beyond everyone's expectations.","El resultado del partido superó por completo lo que todos esperaban.","Le résultat du match a dépassé toutes les attentes."],["L7-4972","意料之外","yìliào zhī wài","","unexpected","inesperado","inattendu","这次能拿到冠军，实在是意料之外的事。","zhè cì néng ná dào guàn jūn shí zài shì yì liào zhī wài de shì","Winning the championship this time was really unexpected.","Ganar el campeonato esta vez fue algo realmente inesperado.","Remporter le championnat cette fois-ci était vraiment inattendu."],["L7-4973","意图","yìtú","N","intention; to intend","intención; pretender","intention ; avoir l'intention de","我不明白他这么做的意图是什么。","wǒ bù míng bai tā zhè me zuò de yì tú shì shén me","I don't understand what his intention is in doing this.","No entiendo cuál es su intención al hacer esto.","Je ne comprends pas quelle est son intention en agissant ainsi."],["L7-4974","意向","yìxiàng","N","intention; inclination","intención; propósito","intention ; inclination","双方都表达了进一步合作的意向。","shuāng fāng dōu biǎo dá le jìn yí bù hé zuò de yì xiàng","Both sides expressed an intention to cooperate further.","Ambas partes manifestaron su intención de seguir cooperando.","Les deux parties ont exprimé leur intention de poursuivre la coopération."],["L7-4975","溢","yì","V","to overflow","desbordar","déborder","锅里的牛奶煮开了，溢得满灶台都是。","guō lǐ de niú nǎi zhǔ kāi le yì de mǎn zào tái dōu shì","The milk in the pot boiled over and spilled all over the stove.","La leche de la olla hirvió y se derramó por toda la estufa.","Le lait dans la casserole a bouilli et a débordé sur toute la cuisinière."],["L7-4976","毅力","yìlì","N","perseverance; willpower","perseverancia; fuerza de voluntad","persévérance ; volonté","学好一门外语需要很大的毅力。","xué hǎo yì mén wài yǔ xū yào hěn dà de yì lì","Learning a foreign language well takes a lot of perseverance.","Dominar bien un idioma extranjero requiere mucha perseverancia.","Bien maîtriser une langue étrangère demande beaucoup de persévérance."],["L7-4977","毅然","yìrán","Adv","resolutely; firmly","resueltamente; con firmeza","résolument ; fermement","为了照顾父母，他毅然辞去了城里的工作。","wèi le zhào gù fù mǔ tā yì rán cí qù le chéng lǐ de gōng zuò","To care for his parents, he resolutely quit his job in the city.","Para cuidar a sus padres, renunció sin dudar a su trabajo en la ciudad.","Pour s'occuper de ses parents, il a résolument quitté son travail en ville."],["L7-4978","因人而异","yīnrén'éryì","","to vary from person to person","variar según la persona","varier selon les personnes","适合的运动量因人而异。","shì hé de yùn dòng liàng yīn rén ér yì","The right amount of exercise varies from person to person.","La cantidad adecuada de ejercicio varía según la persona.","La quantité d'exercice qui convient varie d'une personne à l'autre."],["L7-4979","阴暗","yīn'àn","Adj","dim; gloomy","sombrío; oscuro","sombre ; obscur","这间地下室又阴暗又潮湿，不适合住人。","zhè jiān dì xià shì yòu yīn àn yòu cháo shī bú shì hé zhù rén","This basement is dark and damp and not fit to live in.","Este sótano es oscuro y húmedo, y no es apto para vivir.","Ce sous-sol est sombre et humide, impropre à l'habitation."],["L7-4980","阴性","yīnxìng","N","negative; feminine","negativo; femenino","négatif ; féminin","检查结果是阴性，医生让他放心。","jiǎn chá jié guǒ shì yīn xìng yī shēng ràng tā fàng xīn","The test result was negative, and the doctor told him not to worry.","El resultado del examen fue negativo y el médico le dijo que se quedara tranquilo.","Le résultat du test est négatif et le médecin lui a dit de ne pas s'inquiéter."],["L7-4981","音响","yīnxiǎng","N","sound system; audio","equipo de sonido; audio","chaîne hi-fi ; son","这套音响的效果非常好。","zhè tào yīn xiǎng de xiào guǒ fēi cháng hǎo","This sound system sounds excellent.","Este equipo de sonido suena buenísimo.","Ce système audio offre un excellent rendu sonore."],["L7-4982","殷勤","yīnqín","Adj","attentive; solicitous","atento; solícito","empressé ; attentionné","服务员殷勤地给我们倒茶。","fú wù yuán yīn qín de gěi wǒ men dào chá","The waiter attentively poured tea for us.","El mesero nos sirvió el té con mucha amabilidad.","Le serveur nous a versé le thé avec empressement."],["L7-4983","银幕","yínmù","N","movie screen","pantalla de cine","écran de cinéma","这部小说很快就要搬上银幕了。","zhè bù xiǎo shuō hěn kuài jiù yào bān shàng yín mù le","This novel will soon be adapted for the big screen.","Esta novela será llevada a la pantalla grande muy pronto.","Ce roman va bientôt être porté à l'écran."],["L7-4984","引发","yǐnfā","V","to trigger; to cause","desencadenar; provocar","déclencher ; provoquer","地震引发的海啸摧毁了沿岸的许多村庄。","dì zhèn yǐn fā de hǎi xiào cuī huǐ le yán àn de xǔ duō cūn zhuāng","The tsunami triggered by the earthquake destroyed many villages along the coast.","El tsunami provocado por el terremoto destruyó muchos pueblos de la costa.","Le tsunami déclenché par le séisme a détruit de nombreux villages côtiers."],["L7-4985","引经据典","yǐnjīng-jùdiǎn","","to quote the classics","citar los clásicos","citer les classiques","他讲课喜欢引经据典，学生们都很佩服。","tā jiǎng kè xǐ huan yǐn jīng jù diǎn xué shēng men dōu hěn pèi fú","He likes to quote the classics in his lectures, and the students admire him.","Le gusta citar a los clásicos en sus clases y los alumnos lo admiran.","Il aime citer les classiques dans ses cours, et ses élèves l'admirent."],["L7-4986","引领","yǐnlǐng","V","to lead; to await eagerly","guiar; esperar con ansia","guider ; attendre avec impatience","这家公司一直引领着手机行业的发展。","zhè jiā gōng sī yì zhí yǐn lǐng zhe shǒu jī háng yè de fā zhǎn","This company has always led the development of the mobile phone industry.","Esta empresa siempre ha liderado el desarrollo de la industria de los teléfonos móviles.","Cette entreprise a toujours été à l'avant-garde du secteur de la téléphonie mobile."],["L7-4987","引擎","yǐnqíng","N","engine","motor","moteur","汽车的引擎突然发出了奇怪的声音。","qì chē de yǐn qíng tū rán fā chū le qí guài de shēng yīn","The car's engine suddenly made a strange noise.","El motor del coche hizo de repente un ruido extraño.","Le moteur de la voiture a soudain émis un bruit étrange."],["L7-4988","引人入胜","yǐnrén-rùshèng","","fascinating; captivating","fascinante; cautivador","captivant ; fascinant","这本侦探小说情节引人入胜。","zhè běn zhēn tàn xiǎo shuō qíng jié yǐn rén rù shèng","The plot of this detective novel is gripping.","La trama de esta novela policíaca es cautivadora.","L'intrigue de ce roman policier est captivante."],["L7-4989","引人注目","yǐnrén-zhùmù","","eye-catching","llamativo","qui attire l'attention","她的打扮很新潮，走在街上很引人注目。","tā de dǎ ban hěn xīn cháo zǒu zài jiē shang hěn yǐn rén zhù mù","Her style is very trendy and turns heads on the street.","Su estilo es muy moderno y llama la atención por la calle.","Son look est très tendance et fait tourner les têtes dans la rue."],["L7-4990","引入","yǐnrù","V","to introduce; to bring in","introducir; incorporar","introduire ; faire entrer","这家工厂引入了先进的生产技术。","zhè jiā gōng chǎng yǐn rù le xiān jìn de shēng chǎn jì shù","This factory introduced advanced production technology.","Esta fábrica incorporó tecnología de producción avanzada.","Cette usine a adopté des techniques de production avancées."],["L7-4991","引用","yǐnyòng","V","to quote; to cite","citar; mencionar","citer","他说话喜欢引用俗话，听起来又生动又有道理。","tā shuō huà xǐ huan yǐn yòng sú huà tīng qǐ lái yòu shēng dòng yòu yǒu dào lǐ","He likes to quote common sayings when he speaks, making his words lively and full of good sense.","Le gusta citar refranes al hablar, y suena tan vivo como sensato.","Il aime citer des dictons en parlant, ce qui rend ses propos à la fois vivants et pleins de bon sens."],["L7-4992","引诱","yǐnyòu","V","to lure; to seduce","atraer; seducir","attirer ; séduire","不要被网上的高收入广告引诱。","bú yào bèi wǎng shàng de gāo shōu rù guǎng gào yǐn yòu","Don't be lured by online ads promising high earnings.","No te dejes seducir por los anuncios de internet que prometen altos ingresos.","Ne te laisse pas séduire par les publicités en ligne qui promettent de gros revenus."],["L7-4993","饮水","yǐn shuǐ","","drinking water","agua potable","eau potable","山区的饮水问题终于得到了解决。","shān qū de yǐn shuǐ wèn tí zhōng yú dé dào le jiě jué","The drinking water problem in the mountain area has finally been solved.","El problema del agua potable en la zona montañosa por fin se resolvió.","Le problème de l'eau potable dans la région montagneuse a enfin été résolu."],["L7-4994","饮用水","yǐnyòngshuǐ","N","drinking water","agua potable","eau potable","这里的饮用水检测合格，可以放心饮用。","zhè lǐ de yǐn yòng shuǐ jiǎn cè hé gé kě yǐ fàng xīn yǐn yòng","The drinking water here has passed safety tests and is safe to drink.","El agua potable de aquí pasó los controles de calidad y se puede beber sin preocupaciones.","L'eau potable d'ici a passé les contrôles et peut être bue en toute tranquillité."],["L7-4995","隐蔽","yǐnbì","V/Adj","to conceal; hidden","ocultar; oculto","dissimuler ; caché","小鸟把窝建在一个很隐蔽的地方。","xiǎo niǎo bǎ wō jiàn zài yí ge hěn yǐn bì de dì fang","The bird built its nest in a very hidden place.","El pajarito construyó su nido en un lugar muy escondido.","Le petit oiseau a construit son nid dans un endroit très caché."],["L7-4996","隐患","yǐnhuàn","N","hidden danger","peligro oculto","danger caché","这栋楼的电线已经老化，存在安全隐患。","zhè dòng lóu de diàn xiàn yǐ jīng lǎo huà cún zài ān quán yǐn huàn","The wiring in this building has aged and poses a safety hazard.","El cableado de este edificio está envejecido y representa un riesgo para la seguridad.","Les câbles électriques de cet immeuble sont vieillissants et présentent un risque pour la sécurité."],["L7-4997","隐瞒","yǐnmán","V","to conceal; to cover up","ocultar; encubrir","dissimuler ; cacher","他承认自己判断失误，却否认曾蓄意隐瞒关键事实。","tā chéng rèn zì jǐ pàn duàn shī wù què fǒu rèn céng xù yì yǐn mán guān jiàn shì shí","He admitted making an error of judgment but denied deliberately concealing key facts.","Reconoció haber cometido un error de juicio, pero negó haber ocultado deliberadamente datos clave.","Il a reconnu une erreur d'appréciation, mais a nié avoir délibérément dissimulé des faits essentiels."],["L7-4998","隐情","yǐnqíng","N","hidden circumstances; secret","circunstancias ocultas; secreto","secret ; raison cachée","他突然辞职，背后一定有什么隐情。","tā tū rán cí zhí bèi hòu yí dìng yǒu shén me yǐn qíng","He suddenly resigned; there must be something he's keeping secret.","Renunció de repente; detrás de eso debe de haber algún secreto.","Il a démissionné soudainement ; il doit y avoir une raison cachée là-derrière."],["L7-4999","隐身","yǐnshēn","V","to hide oneself; invisible","esconderse; invisible","se cacher ; invisible","这个软件可以让用户在线时隐身。","zhè ge ruǎn jiàn kě yǐ ràng yòng hù zài xiàn shí yǐn shēn","This software lets users appear offline while they are online.","Este programa permite a los usuarios aparecer desconectados mientras están en línea.","Ce logiciel permet aux utilisateurs d'apparaître hors ligne tout en étant connectés."],["L7-5000","隐形","yǐnxíng","Adj","invisible","invisible","invisible","这种飞机有隐形功能，雷达很难发现。","zhè zhǒng fēi jī yǒu yǐn xíng gōng néng léi dá hěn nán fā xiàn","This aircraft has stealth capabilities and is hard for radar to detect.","Este tipo de avión tiene capacidad furtiva y el radar apenas puede detectarlo.","Cet avion est furtif et le radar a du mal à le repérer."],["L7-5001","隐性","yǐnxìng","Adj","hidden; recessive","oculto; recesivo","caché ; récessif","有些疾病是隐性的，平时没有任何症状。","yǒu xiē jí bìng shì yǐn xìng de píng shí méi yǒu rèn hé zhèng zhuàng","Some diseases are latent and normally show no symptoms.","Algunas enfermedades son latentes y normalmente no presentan ningún síntoma.","Certaines maladies sont latentes et ne présentent normalement aucun symptôme."],["L7-5002","隐约","yǐnyuē","Adj","faint; indistinct","tenue; vago","vague ; indistinct","远处隐约传来一阵歌声。","yuǎn chù yǐn yuē chuán lái yí zhèn gē shēng","The faint sound of singing came from far away.","A lo lejos se oía vagamente un canto.","Au loin, on entendait vaguement un chant."],["L7-5003","瘾","yǐn","N","addiction; craving","adicción; antojo","dépendance ; envie irrésistible","他打游戏上了瘾，每天玩到半夜。","tā dǎ yóu xì shàng le yǐn měi tiān wán dào bàn yè","He got addicted to games and plays until midnight every day.","Se volvió adicto a los videojuegos y juega hasta la medianoche todos los días.","Il est devenu accro aux jeux vidéo et joue jusqu'à minuit tous les jours."],["L7-5004","印刷术","yìnshuāshù","N","printing","imprenta; técnica de impresión","imprimerie","印刷术是中国古代的四大发明之一。","yìn shuā shù shì zhōng guó gǔ dài de sì dà fā míng zhī yī","Printing is one of the four great inventions of ancient China.","La imprenta es uno de los cuatro grandes inventos de la antigua China.","L'imprimerie est l'une des quatre grandes inventions de la Chine ancienne."],["L7-5005","印章","yìnzhāng","N","seal; stamp","sello","cachet ; tampon","这份合同上盖着公司的印章。","zhè fèn hé tóng shàng gài zhe gōng sī de yìn zhāng","This contract bears the company seal.","Este contrato lleva el sello de la empresa.","Ce contrat porte le sceau de l'entreprise."],["L7-5006","印证","yìnzhèng","V/N","to corroborate; proof","corroborar; prueba","corroborer ; preuve","实验结果印证了他的猜想。","shí yàn jié guǒ yìn zhèng le tā de cāi xiǎng","The experimental results confirmed his hypothesis.","Los resultados del experimento confirmaron su conjetura.","Les résultats de l'expérience ont confirmé son hypothèse."],["L7-5007","应有尽有","yīngyǒu-jìnyǒu","","to have everything","tener de todo","avoir tout ce qu'on veut","这个商场里的商品应有尽有。","zhè ge shāng chǎng lǐ de shāng pǐn yīng yǒu jìn yǒu","This mall has everything you could want.","Este centro comercial tiene de todo.","Ce centre commercial a tout ce qu'on peut désirer."],["L7-5008","英镑","yīngbàng","N","pound sterling","libra esterlina","livre sterling","这件大衣在伦敦卖两百英镑。","zhè jiàn dà yī zài lún dūn mài liǎng bǎi yīng bàng","This coat sells for two hundred pounds in London.","Este abrigo se vende por doscientas libras en Londres.","Ce manteau se vend deux cents livres à Londres."],["L7-5009","英俊","yīngjùn","Adj","handsome","apuesto","beau","她的男朋友又高又英俊。","tā de nán péng you yòu gāo yòu yīng jùn","Her boyfriend is tall and handsome.","Su novio es alto y guapo.","Son petit ami est grand et beau."],["L7-5010","婴儿","yīng'ér","N","infant; baby","bebé; lactante","nourrisson ; bébé","婴儿每天要睡十几个小时。","yīng ér měi tiān yào shuì shí jǐ ge xiǎo shí","Babies sleep over ten hours a day.","Los bebés duermen más de diez horas al día.","Les bébés dorment plus de dix heures par jour."],["L7-5011","鹰","yīng","N","eagle; hawk","águila; halcón","aigle ; faucon","天上有一只鹰在慢慢地盘旋。","tiān shàng yǒu yì zhī yīng zài màn màn de pán xuán","An eagle is slowly circling in the sky.","En el cielo un águila da vueltas lentamente.","Dans le ciel, un aigle tourne lentement en cercles."],["L7-5012","迎","yíng","V","to welcome; to face","dar la bienvenida; enfrentar","accueillir ; affronter","他一出门，就迎着风往前走。","tā yì chū mén jiù yíng zhe fēng wǎng qián zǒu","As soon as he went out, he walked forward into the wind.","En cuanto salió, avanzó de frente contra el viento.","À peine sorti, il a avancé face au vent."],["L7-5013","迎合","yínghé","V","to cater to","complacer; adaptarse a","flatter ; chercher à plaire à","这家电视台为了迎合观众，播了很多娱乐节目。","zhè jiā diàn shì tái wèi le yíng hé guān zhòng bō le hěn duō yú lè jié mù","To cater to its audience, this TV station broadcast lots of entertainment programs.","Para agradar a la audiencia, esta cadena de televisión transmitió muchos programas de entretenimiento.","Pour plaire à son public, cette chaîne de télévision a diffusé beaucoup d'émissions de divertissement."],["L7-5014","荧光","yíngguāng","N","fluorescence","fluorescencia","fluorescence","这种笔写出来的字会发出荧光。","zhè zhǒng bǐ xiě chū lái de zì huì fā chū yíng guāng","Words written with this pen emit fluorescent light.","Lo que se escribe con este bolígrafo brilla con fluorescencia.","Ce que l'on écrit avec ce stylo est fluorescent."],["L7-5015","盈利","yínglì","V/N","profit; to make a profit","beneficio; obtener ganancias","profit ; faire des bénéfices","这家公司去年盈利了五百万元。","zhè jiā gōng sī qù nián yíng lì le wǔ bǎi wàn yuán","This company made a profit of five million yuan last year.","Esta empresa obtuvo el año pasado ganancias de cinco millones de yuanes.","Cette entreprise a réalisé l'an dernier un bénéfice de cinq millions de yuans."],["L7-5016","营救","yíngjiù","V","to rescue","rescatar","secourir","消防员连夜营救被困在山里的游客。","xiāo fáng yuán lián yè yíng jiù bèi kùn zài shān lǐ de yóu kè","Firefighters worked through the night to rescue the tourists trapped in the mountains.","Los bomberos trabajaron toda la noche para rescatar a los turistas atrapados en la montaña.","Les pompiers ont travaillé toute la nuit pour secourir les touristes bloqués en montagne."],["L7-5017","营造","yíngzào","V","to build; to create","construir; crear","construire ; créer","老师努力为学生营造一个轻松的学习环境。","lǎo shī nǔ lì wèi xué shēng yíng zào yí ge qīng sōng de xué xí huán jìng","The teacher works hard to create a relaxed learning environment for the students.","La maestra se esfuerza por crear un ambiente de estudio relajado para los alumnos.","L'enseignante s'efforce de créer un environnement d'apprentissage détendu pour ses élèves."],["L7-5018","赢家","yíngjiā","N","winner","ganador","gagnant","这场官司没有真正的赢家。","zhè chǎng guān si méi yǒu zhēn zhèng de yíng jiā","There is no real winner in this lawsuit.","En este pleito no hay un verdadero ganador.","Dans ce procès, il n'y a pas de véritable gagnant."],["L7-5019","影像","yǐngxiàng","N","image","imagen","image","医生仔细查看了病人肺部的影像。","yī shēng zǐ xì chá kàn le bìng rén fèi bù de yǐng xiàng","The doctor carefully examined the images of the patient's lungs.","El médico examinó con atención las imágenes de los pulmones del paciente.","Le médecin a examiné attentivement les images des poumons du patient."],["L7-5020","应酬","yìngchou","V/N","to socialize; social engagement","socializar; compromiso social","mondanités ; obligations sociales","他工作上的应酬很多，经常很晚才回家。","tā gōng zuò shàng de yìng chou hěn duō jīng cháng hěn wǎn cái huí jiā","He has many work-related social engagements and often comes home late.","Tiene muchos compromisos sociales por el trabajo y a menudo llega a casa muy tarde.","Il a beaucoup d'obligations mondaines liées à son travail et rentre souvent très tard."],["L7-5021","应付","yìngfu","V","to deal with; to cope","hacer frente a; arreglárselas","faire face à ; se débrouiller","死记硬背或许能应付一时的测验，却未必有助于融会贯通。","sǐ jì yìng bèi huò xǔ néng yìng fu yì shí de cè yàn què wèi bì yǒu zhù yú róng huì guàn tōng","Rote memorization may get someone through a test, but does not necessarily lead to an integrated understanding.","Memorizar de forma mecánica quizá sirva para salir del paso en una prueba, pero no necesariamente ayuda a comprender a fondo.","Apprendre par cœur peut permettre de s'en sortir lors d'un contrôle, mais n'aide pas forcément à bien assimiler."],["L7-5022","应聘","yìngpìn","V","to apply for a job","solicitar un empleo","postuler à un emploi","她去一家大公司应聘会计的职位。","tā qù yì jiā dà gōng sī yìng pìn kuài jì de zhí wèi","She applied for an accountant position at a large company.","Fue a postularse para un puesto de contadora en una gran empresa.","Elle est allée postuler à un poste de comptable dans une grande entreprise."],["L7-5023","应邀","yìngyāo","V","at someone's invitation","por invitación","sur invitation","他应邀参加了朋友的婚礼。","tā yìng yāo cān jiā le péng you de hūn lǐ","He attended his friend's wedding at his invitation.","Asistió a la boda de un amigo por invitación.","Il a assisté au mariage d'un ami sur son invitation."],["L7-5024","映","yìng","V","to reflect; to project","reflejar; proyectar","refléter ; projeter","月光映在湖面上，美极了。","yuè guāng yìng zài hú miàn shàng měi jí le","The moonlight reflected on the lake, and it was beautiful.","La luz de la luna se reflejaba en el lago; era preciosa.","Le clair de lune se reflétait sur le lac, c'était magnifique."],["L7-5025","硬币","yìngbì","N","coin","moneda","pièce de monnaie","他把口袋里的硬币都放进了存钱罐。","tā bǎ kǒu dài lǐ de yìng bì dōu fàng jìn le cún qián guàn","He put all the coins in his pocket into the piggy bank.","Metió todas las monedas que tenía en el bolsillo en la alcancía.","Il a mis toutes les pièces de sa poche dans la tirelire."],["L7-5026","硬朗","yìnglang","Adj","hale and hearty","robusto; saludable","robuste ; en bonne santé","爷爷八十多岁了，身体还很硬朗。","yé ye bā shí duō suì le shēn tǐ hái hěn yìng lang","Grandpa is over eighty, but he is still very hale and hearty.","El abuelo tiene más de ochenta años y todavía está muy fuerte y sano.","Grand-père a plus de quatre-vingts ans et il est encore vert."],["L7-5027","硬盘","yìngpán","N","hard disk","disco duro","disque dur","电脑的硬盘坏了，很多资料都丢了。","diàn nǎo de yìng pán huài le hěn duō zī liào dōu diū le","The computer's hard drive broke, and a lot of data was lost.","Se dañó el disco duro de la computadora y se perdieron muchos datos.","Le disque dur de l'ordinateur est tombé en panne et beaucoup de données ont été perdues."],["L7-5028","拥护","yōnghù","V","to support; to endorse","apoyar; respaldar","soutenir ; approuver","这项政策得到了老百姓的拥护。","zhè xiàng zhèng cè dé dào le lǎo bǎi xìng de yōng hù","This policy won the support of the people.","Esta política recibió el apoyo de la gente común.","Cette politique a reçu le soutien de la population."],["L7-5029","拥挤","yōngjǐ","V/Adj","crowded; to crowd","abarrotado; apiñarse","bondé ; se presser","上下班的时候，地铁总是非常拥挤。","shàng xià bān de shí hou dì tiě zǒng shì fēi cháng yōng jǐ","The subway is always very crowded during rush hour.","En las horas de entrada y salida del trabajo, el metro siempre está muy lleno.","Aux heures de pointe, le métro est toujours bondé."],["L7-5030","庸俗","yōngsú","Adj","vulgar; tacky","vulgar; ordinario","vulgaire ; commun","这部电视剧的内容太庸俗了。","zhè bù diàn shì jù de nèi róng tài yōng sú le","The content of this TV series is too vulgar.","El contenido de esta serie de televisión es demasiado vulgar.","Le contenu de cette série télévisée est beaucoup trop vulgaire."],["L7-5031","永不","yǒng bù","","never","nunca jamás","jamais","他发誓永不放弃自己的梦想。","tā fā shì yǒng bú fàng qì zì jǐ de mèng xiǎng","He vowed never to give up his dream.","Juró que nunca renunciaría a sus sueños.","Il a juré de ne jamais renoncer à ses rêves."],["L7-5032","永恒","yǒnghéng","Adj","eternal","eterno","éternel","母爱是文学作品中永恒的话题。","mǔ ài shì wén xué zuò pǐn zhōng yǒng héng de huà tí","Maternal love is an eternal theme in literature.","El amor materno es un tema eterno en la literatura.","L'amour maternel est un thème éternel de la littérature."],["L7-5033","永久","yǒngjiǔ","Adj","permanent; forever","permanente; para siempre","permanent ; pour toujours","这些文物将在博物馆里永久保存。","zhè xiē wén wù jiāng zài bó wù guǎn lǐ yǒng jiǔ bǎo cún","These relics will be permanently preserved in the museum.","Estas reliquias se conservarán para siempre en el museo.","Ces objets historiques seront conservés à perpétuité au musée."],["L7-5034","勇往直前","yǒngwǎng-zhíqián","","to advance bravely","avanzar con valentía","avancer vaillamment","不管遇到什么困难，我们都要勇往直前。","bù guǎn yù dào shén me kùn nan wǒ men dōu yào yǒng wǎng zhí qián","No matter what difficulties we meet, we must march bravely forward.","Sin importar las dificultades que enfrentemos, debemos avanzar con valentía.","Quelles que soient les difficultés rencontrées, nous devons avancer avec courage."],["L7-5035","勇于","yǒngyú","V","to dare to","atreverse a","oser","一个好领导要勇于承担责任。","yí ge hǎo lǐng dǎo yào yǒng yú chéng dān zé rèn","A good leader must dare to take responsibility.","Un buen líder debe atreverse a asumir responsabilidades.","Un bon dirigeant doit oser assumer ses responsabilités."],["L7-5036","涌","yǒng","V","to surge; to gush","brotar; surgir","jaillir ; affluer","商场一开门，人们就涌了进去。","shāng chǎng yì kāi mén rén men jiù yǒng le jìn qù","As soon as the mall opened, people surged in.","En cuanto abrió el centro comercial, la gente entró en tropel.","Dès l'ouverture du centre commercial, les gens s'y sont engouffrés."],["L7-5037","涌入","yǒngrù","V","to pour in; influx","afluir; entrada masiva","affluer ; afflux","山坡上的植被遭到破坏后，暴雨使大量泥沙涌入河道。","shān pō shàng de zhí bèi zāo dào pò huài hòu bào yǔ shǐ dà liàng ní shā yǒng rù hé dào","After the vegetation on the hillside was damaged, heavy rain washed large amounts of sediment into the river channel.","Tras dañarse la vegetación de la ladera, la lluvia torrencial arrastró grandes cantidades de lodo y arena hacia el cauce del río.","Après la dégradation de la végétation sur le versant, la pluie torrentielle a charrié de grandes quantités de limon et de sable dans le lit de la rivière."],["L7-5038","涌现","yǒngxiàn","V","to emerge in large numbers","surgir en masa","apparaître en masse","这几年，这个领域涌现出了很多年轻人才。","zhè jǐ nián zhè ge lǐng yù yǒng xiàn chū le hěn duō nián qīng rén cái","In recent years, many young talents have emerged in this field.","En estos años han surgido muchos jóvenes talentos en este campo.","Ces dernières années, beaucoup de jeunes talents ont émergé dans ce domaine."],["L7-5039","踊跃","yǒngyuè","V/Adj","eager; enthusiastic","entusiasta; ferviente","enthousiaste ; empressé","同学们踊跃报名参加运动会。","tóng xué men yǒng yuè bào míng cān jiā yùn dòng huì","The students eagerly signed up for the sports meet.","Los alumnos se inscribieron con entusiasmo para participar en los juegos deportivos.","Les élèves se sont inscrits avec enthousiasme pour participer à la compétition sportive."],["L7-5040","用餐","yòngcān","","to have a meal","comer; tomar una comida","prendre un repas","客人们正在餐厅里用餐。","kè rén men zhèng zài cān tīng lǐ yòng cān","The guests are dining in the restaurant.","Los invitados están comiendo en el restaurante.","Les invités sont en train de dîner au restaurant."],["L7-5041","用功","yònggōng","Adj","diligent; to study hard","aplicado; estudiar mucho","appliqué ; travailler dur","他学习很用功，每天都看书到很晚。","tā xué xí hěn yòng gōng měi tiān dōu kàn shū dào hěn wǎn","He studies very hard and reads until late every day.","Estudia con mucho empeño y lee hasta muy tarde todos los días.","Il étudie avec beaucoup d'application et lit tard tous les jours."],["L7-5042","用力","yònglì","","to exert oneself","esforzarse; hacer fuerza","faire un effort ; forcer","运动员在赛场上用力向前跳跃。","yùn dòng yuán zài sài chǎng shàng yòng lì xiàng qián tiào yuè","The athlete jumped forward forcefully on the field.","El atleta dio un fuerte salto hacia adelante en la pista.","L'athlète a bondi vers l'avant avec force sur le terrain."],["L7-5043","用人","yòngrén","","servant; to employ staff","sirviente; emplear personal","domestique ; employer du personnel","这家公司用人只看能力，不看学历。","zhè jiā gōng sī yòng rén zhǐ kàn néng lì bú kàn xué lì","This company hires people based only on ability, not on academic credentials.","Esta empresa contrata a la gente solo por su capacidad, no por su formación académica.","Cette entreprise recrute uniquement en fonction des compétences, pas des diplômes."],["L7-5044","用意","yòngyì","N","intention; purpose","intención; propósito","intention ; but","我明白你这么说的用意，你是为我好。","wǒ míng bai nǐ zhè me shuō de yòng yì nǐ shì wèi wǒ hǎo","I understand your intention in saying this; you mean well.","Entiendo lo que quieres decir con eso; lo haces por mi bien.","Je comprends ce que tu veux dire par là ; c'est pour mon bien."],["L7-5045","优","yōu","Adj","excellent; superior","excelente; superior","excellent ; supérieur","这学期他的数学成绩评了个优。","zhè xué qī tā de shù xué chéng jì píng le gè yōu","This semester his math grade was rated \"excellent\".","Este semestre sacó una calificación de sobresaliente en matemáticas.","Ce semestre, il a obtenu la mention « excellent » en mathématiques."],["L7-5046","优化","yōuhuà","V","to optimize","optimizar","optimiser","新任主管上任后，先梳理了各部门的职责，再着手优化协作流程。","xīn rèn zhǔ guǎn shàng rèn hòu xiān shū lǐ le gè bù mén de zhí zé zài zhuó shǒu yōu huà xié zuò liú chéng","After taking office, the new manager first clarified each department's responsibilities and then began improving the workflow for collaboration.","Al asumir el cargo, el nuevo director primero puso en orden las responsabilidades de cada departamento y luego empezó a optimizar los procesos de colaboración.","Après sa prise de fonctions, le nouveau responsable a d'abord clarifié les responsabilités de chaque service, puis s'est attelé à optimiser les processus de collaboration."],["L7-5047","优雅","yōuyǎ","Adj","elegant; graceful","elegante; grácil","élégant ; gracieux","她举止优雅，说话温和，很有气质。","tā jǔ zhǐ yōu yǎ shuō huà wēn hé hěn yǒu qì zhì","She carries herself gracefully, speaks gently and has real poise.","Tiene modales elegantes, habla con suavidad y mucha distinción.","Elle a des manières élégantes, parle avec douceur et beaucoup de classe."],["L7-5048","优异","yōuyì","Adj","outstanding; exceptional","sobresaliente; excepcional","remarquable ; exceptionnel","她以优异的成绩考上了大学。","tā yǐ yōu yì de chéng jì kǎo shàng le dà xué","She got into university with outstanding results.","Entró a la universidad con unas notas sobresalientes.","Elle est entrée à l'université avec d'excellents résultats."],["L7-5049","优越","yōuyuè","Adj","superior; advantageous","superior; ventajoso","supérieur ; avantageux","这里地理位置优越，交通非常方便。","zhè lǐ dì lǐ wèi zhi yōu yuè jiāo tōng fēi cháng fāng biàn","This place has a superior location, and transportation is very convenient.","Este lugar tiene una ubicación privilegiada y el transporte es muy cómodo.","L'emplacement de cet endroit est excellent et les transports y sont très pratiques."],["L7-5050","忧愁","yōuchóu","Adj","worried; sorrowful","preocupado; afligido","inquiet ; chagriné","奶奶脸上露出了忧愁的神情。","nǎi nai liǎn shàng lù chū le yōu chóu de shén qíng","A worried look appeared on Grandma's face.","En el rostro de la abuela apareció una expresión de preocupación.","Une expression soucieuse est apparue sur le visage de grand-mère."],["L7-5051","忧虑","yōulǜ","V","to worry; anxiety","preocuparse; ansiedad","s'inquiéter ; inquiétude","父母对孩子的未来很忧虑。","fù mǔ duì hái zi de wèi lái hěn yōu lǜ","The parents are very worried about their child's future.","Los padres están muy preocupados por el futuro de su hijo.","Les parents sont très inquiets pour l'avenir de leur enfant."],["L7-5052","忧郁","yōuyù","Adj","melancholy; depressed","melancólico; deprimido","mélancolique ; déprimé","这首歌的旋律很忧郁，听了让人想哭。","zhè shǒu gē de xuán lǜ hěn yōu yù tīng le ràng rén xiǎng kū","This song's melody is so melancholy it makes you want to cry.","La melodía de esta canción es tan melancólica que dan ganas de llorar al oírla.","La mélodie de cette chanson est si mélancolique qu'elle donne envie de pleurer."],["L7-5053","悠久","yōujiǔ","Adj","long-standing","de larga data; antiguo","ancien ; de longue date","中国有着悠久的历史和灿烂的文化。","zhōng guó yǒu zhe yōu jiǔ de lì shǐ hé càn làn de wén huà","China has a long history and a splendid culture.","China tiene una larga historia y una cultura esplendorosa.","La Chine possède une longue histoire et une culture brillante."],["L7-5054","悠闲","yōuxián","Adj","leisurely","tranquilo; relajado","tranquille ; paisible","退休以后，他过着悠闲的生活。","tuì xiū yǐ hòu tā guò zhe yōu xián de shēng huó","After retiring, he leads a leisurely life.","Después de jubilarse, lleva una vida tranquila y relajada.","Depuis sa retraite, il mène une vie paisible et sans hâte."],["L7-5055","尤为","yóuwéi","Adv","especially","especialmente","particulièrement","这个问题在农村尤为突出。","zhè ge wèn tí zài nóng cūn yóu wéi tū chū","This problem is especially prominent in rural areas.","Este problema es especialmente grave en las zonas rurales.","Ce problème est particulièrement marqué dans les campagnes."],["L7-5056","由此看来","yóucǐ-kànlái","","judging from this","a juzgar por esto","à en juger par là","他三次都没来，由此看来，他对这件事不感兴趣。","tā sān cì dōu méi lái yóu cǐ kàn lái tā duì zhè jiàn shì bù gǎn xìng qù","He failed to show up on all three occasions; judging from this, he is not interested in the matter.","No vino ninguna de las tres veces; por lo visto, este asunto no le interesa.","Il n'est venu aucune des trois fois ; on voit bien que cette affaire ne l'intéresse pas."],["L7-5057","由此可见","yóucǐ-kějiàn","","from this we can see","de esto se deduce","on peut en déduire que","他每天都练习，由此可见他是多么热爱音乐。","tā měi tiān dōu liàn xí yóu cǐ kě jiàn tā shì duō me rè ài yīn yuè","He practices every day, which shows how much he loves music.","Practica todos los días, lo que demuestra cuánto ama la música.","Il s'exerce tous les jours, ce qui montre à quel point il aime la musique."],["L7-5058","由来","yóulái","N","origin","origen","origine","你知道端午节的由来吗？","nǐ zhī dào duān wǔ jié de yóu lái ma","Do you know the origin of the Dragon Boat Festival?","¿Sabes cuál es el origen del Festival del Bote del Dragón?","Connais-tu l'origine de la fête des bateaux-dragons ?"],["L7-5059","由衷","yóuzhōng","V","heartfelt; sincere","sincero; de corazón","sincère ; du fond du cœur","我由衷地感谢大家的帮助。","wǒ yóu zhōng de gǎn xiè dà jiā de bāng zhù","I sincerely thank everyone for their help.","Les agradezco de todo corazón la ayuda a todos.","Je remercie sincèrement tout le monde pour son aide."],["L7-5060","邮编","yóubiān","N","postal code","código postal","code postal","寄信的时候别忘了写邮编。","jì xìn de shí hou bié wàng le xiě yóu biān","Don't forget to write the postal code when sending a letter.","Al enviar una carta, no olvides escribir el código postal.","En envoyant une lettre, n'oublie pas d'écrire le code postal."],["L7-5061","邮政","yóuzhèng","N","postal service","servicio postal","service postal","这个小镇上只有一家邮政所。","zhè ge xiǎo zhèn shàng zhǐ yǒu yì jiā yóu zhèng suǒ","There is only one post office in this small town.","En este pueblito solo hay una oficina de correos.","Il n'y a qu'un seul bureau de poste dans cette petite ville."],["L7-5062","犹如","yóurú","V","just like","igual que; como","tout comme","这里的春天犹如一幅美丽的画。","zhè lǐ de chūn tiān yóu rú yì fú měi lì de huà","Spring here is like a beautiful painting.","La primavera aquí es como un hermoso cuadro.","Le printemps ici ressemble à un beau tableau."],["L7-5063","犹豫不决","yóuyù-bùjué","","to hesitate; indecision","dudar; indecisión","hésiter ; indécision","买就买，别在这儿犹豫不决了。","mǎi jiù mǎi bié zài zhèr yóu yù bù jué le","If you're going to buy it, buy it; stop hesitating here.","Si vas a comprarlo, cómpralo; deja de dudar ahí parado.","Si tu veux l'acheter, achète-le ; arrête de tergiverser ici."],["L7-5064","油画","yóuhuà","N","oil painting","pintura al óleo","peinture à l'huile","客厅的墙上挂着一幅油画。","kè tīng de qiáng shàng guà zhe yì fú yóu huà","An oil painting hangs on the living room wall.","En la pared de la sala cuelga un óleo.","Un tableau à l'huile est accroché au mur du salon."],["L7-5065","游船","yóuchuán","N","pleasure boat","barco de recreo","bateau de plaisance","我们坐游船游览了整个西湖。","wǒ men zuò yóu chuán yóu lǎn le zhěng gè xī hú","We toured all of West Lake on a pleasure boat.","Recorrimos todo el Lago del Oeste en un barco de paseo.","Nous avons fait le tour du lac de l'Ouest à bord d'un bateau de plaisance."],["L7-5066","游览","yóulǎn","V","to go sightseeing; to tour","hacer turismo; recorrer","visiter ; faire du tourisme","我们坐游船游览了整个西湖。","wǒ men zuò yóu chuán yóu lǎn le zhěng gè xī hú","We toured all of West Lake on a pleasure boat.","Recorrimos todo el Lago del Oeste en un barco de paseo.","Nous avons fait le tour du lac de l'Ouest à bord d'un bateau de plaisance."],["L7-5067","友情","yǒuqíng","N","friendship","amistad","amitié","这段友情已经持续了二十多年。","zhè duàn yǒu qíng yǐ jīng chí xù le èr shí duō nián","This friendship has lasted for more than twenty years.","Esta amistad ha durado más de veinte años.","Cette amitié dure depuis plus de vingt ans."],["L7-5068","友人","yǒurén","N","friend","amigo","ami","他在国外结识了不少友人。","tā zài guó wài jié shí le bù shǎo yǒu rén","He made quite a few friends abroad.","En el extranjero conoció a bastantes amigos.","À l'étranger, il s'est fait pas mal d'amis."],["L7-5069","友善","yǒushàn","Adj","friendly","amistoso; amable","amical","这里的人对外地游客都很友善。","zhè lǐ de rén duì wài dì yóu kè dōu hěn yǒu shàn","The people here are very friendly to visitors from elsewhere.","La gente de aquí es muy amable con los turistas de otras partes.","Les gens d'ici sont très chaleureux avec les visiteurs venus d'ailleurs."],["L7-5070","有待","yǒudài","V","remains to be","queda por; pendiente de","reste à ; en attente de","这个问题还有待进一步研究。","zhè ge wèn tí hái yǒu dài jìn yí bù yán jiū","This question still awaits further study.","Este problema todavía necesita seguirse estudiando.","Cette question mérite encore d'être étudiée plus avant."],["L7-5071","有的放矢","yǒudì-fàngshǐ","","to aim at a target; to be targeted","apuntar a un objetivo","viser une cible","写文章要有的放矢，不能想到哪儿写到哪儿。","xiě wén zhāng yào yǒu dì fàng shǐ bù néng xiǎng dào nǎr xiě dào nǎr","When writing an article, you need a clear target; you can't just write whatever comes to mind.","Al escribir un artículo hay que tener un objetivo claro; no se puede escribir lo primero que se te ocurra.","Quand on écrit un article, il faut avoir un objectif précis ; on ne peut pas écrire tout ce qui passe par la tête."],["L7-5072","有机","yǒujī","Adj","organic","orgánico","organique","这家超市专门卖有机蔬菜。","zhè jiā chāo shì zhuān mén mài yǒu jī shū cài","This supermarket specializes in organic vegetables.","Este supermercado se especializa en vender verduras orgánicas.","Ce supermarché est spécialisé dans la vente de légumes bio."],["L7-5073","有口无心","yǒukǒu-wúxīn","","to speak harshly without malice","hablar con dureza sin mala intención","parler durement sans penser le mal","他说话有口无心，你别生气。","tā shuō huà yǒu kǒu wú xīn nǐ bié shēng qì","He speaks without thinking but means no harm, so don't be angry.","Habla sin pensar, pero no lo dice con mala intención; no te enojes.","Il parle sans réfléchir, mais sans méchanceté ; ne te fâche pas."],["L7-5074","有两下子","yǒu liǎngxiàzi","","to know one's stuff","tener buena mano","s'y connaître","这孩子画画还真有两下子。","zhè hái zi huà huà hái zhēn yǒu liǎng xià zi","This kid really knows a thing or two about drawing.","Este niño sí que sabe dibujar.","Ce gamin se débrouille vraiment bien en dessin."],["L7-5075","有声有色","yǒushēng-yǒusè","","vivid; lively","vívido; animado","vivant ; plein de vie","她把这个故事讲得有声有色。","tā bǎ zhè ge gù shi jiǎng de yǒu shēng yǒu sè","She told this story vividly.","Contó esta historia de manera muy viva y expresiva.","Elle a raconté cette histoire avec beaucoup de vivacité."],["L7-5076","有所","yǒusuǒ","V","somewhat; to some extent","en cierta medida","dans une certaine mesure","近年来，年轻人患病的比例有所上升。","jìn nián lái nián qīng rén huàn bìng de bǐ lì yǒu suǒ shàng shēng","In recent years, the proportion of young people falling ill has risen somewhat.","En los últimos años, la proporción de jóvenes que se enferman ha aumentado un poco.","Ces dernières années, la proportion de jeunes tombant malades a légèrement augmenté."],["L7-5077","有所不同","yǒusuǒ bù tóng","","to differ to some extent","diferir en cierta medida","différer en partie","南方和北方的饮食习惯有所不同。","nán fāng hé běi fāng de yǐn shí xí guàn yǒu suǒ bù tóng","The eating habits of the south and the north differ somewhat.","Los hábitos alimentarios del sur y del norte son algo distintos.","Les habitudes alimentaires du sud et du nord diffèrent quelque peu."],["L7-5078","有望","yǒuwàng","V","promising; hopeful","prometedor; con esperanza","prometteur ; plein d'espoir","这位年轻选手有望打破世界纪录。","zhè wèi nián qīng xuǎn shǒu yǒu wàng dǎ pò shì jiè jì lù","This young athlete has a good chance of breaking the world record.","Este joven deportista tiene posibilidades de romper el récord mundial.","Ce jeune athlète a de bonnes chances de battre le record du monde."],["L7-5079","有效期","yǒuxiàoqī","N","period of validity","periodo de validez","période de validité","这种食品必须在有效期内吃完。","zhè zhǒng shí pǐn bì xū zài yǒu xiào qī nèi chī wán","This food must be eaten before its expiration date.","Este alimento debe consumirse dentro de su fecha de caducidad.","Cet aliment doit être consommé avant sa date de péremption."],["L7-5080","有幸","yǒuxìng","Adj","fortunate; to have the honor","afortunado; tener el honor","avoir la chance de","我有幸参加了这次国际会议。","wǒ yǒu xìng cān jiā le zhè cì guó jì huì yì","I was fortunate enough to attend this international conference.","Tuve la suerte de participar en esta conferencia internacional.","J'ai eu la chance de participer à cette conférence internationale."],["L7-5081","有序","yǒuxù","Adj","orderly","ordenado","ordonné","地震以后，救援工作正在有序地进行。","dì zhèn yǐ hòu jiù yuán gōng zuò zhèng zài yǒu xù de jìn xíng","After the earthquake, rescue work is proceeding in an orderly way.","Tras el terremoto, las labores de rescate avanzan de manera ordenada.","Après le séisme, les opérations de secours se déroulent de façon ordonnée."],["L7-5082","有益","yǒuyì","Adj","beneficial","beneficioso","bénéfique","适量的运动对身体有益。","shì liàng de yùn dòng duì shēn tǐ yǒu yì","Moderate exercise is good for your health.","El ejercicio moderado es bueno para la salud.","Un exercice modéré est bon pour la santé."],["L7-5083","有意","yǒuyì","V/Adv","to intend; intentionally","tener intención; a propósito","avoir l'intention de ; exprès","我不是有意让你难过的。","wǒ bú shì yǒu yì ràng nǐ nán guò de","I didn't mean to upset you.","No lo hice con la intención de entristecerte.","Je ne voulais pas te faire de la peine."],["L7-5084","有朝一日","yǒuzhāo-yīrì","","one day","algún día","un jour","有朝一日，我一定要去看看大海。","yǒu zhāo yī rì wǒ yí dìng yào qù kàn kan dà hǎi","Some day I'm definitely going to go see the ocean.","Algún día voy a ir a ver el mar, sin falta.","Un jour, j'irai sûrement voir la mer."],["L7-5085","有助于","yǒuzhùyú","V","to help; to contribute to","ayudar a; contribuir a","aider à ; contribuer à","死记硬背或许能应付一时的测验，却未必有助于融会贯通。","sǐ jì yìng bèi huò xǔ néng yìng fu yì shí de cè yàn què wèi bì yǒu zhù yú róng huì guàn tōng","Rote memorization may get someone through a test, but does not necessarily lead to an integrated understanding.","Memorizar de forma mecánica quizá sirva para salir del paso en una prueba, pero no necesariamente ayuda a comprender a fondo.","Apprendre par cœur peut permettre de s'en sortir lors d'un contrôle, mais n'aide pas forcément à bien assimiler."],["L7-5086","幼稚","yòuzhì","Adj","childish; naive","infantil; ingenuo","enfantin ; puéril","他都三十岁了，说话还这么幼稚。","tā dōu sān shí suì le shuō huà hái zhè me yòu zhì","He's already thirty, yet he still talks so childishly.","Ya tiene treinta años y todavía habla de forma tan infantil.","Il a déjà trente ans et parle encore de façon si puérile."],["L7-5087","诱饵","yòu'ěr","N","bait","cebo","appât","钓鱼的时候，他用小虫子做诱饵。","diào yú de shí hou tā yòng xiǎo chóng zi zuò yòu ěr","When fishing, he uses small worms as bait.","Cuando pesca, usa gusanitos como carnada.","Quand il pêche, il utilise de petits vers comme appât."],["L7-5088","诱发","yòufā","V","to induce; to trigger","inducir; desencadenar","induire ; déclencher","同一种药物也可能诱发不同的反应，因此医护人员始终留意着患者的变化。","tóng yì zhǒng yào wù yě kě néng yòu fā bù tóng de fǎn yìng yīn cǐ yī hù rén yuán shǐ zhōng liú yì zhe huàn zhě de biàn huà","The same medication can trigger different reactions, so the medical staff kept watching for changes in the patients.","Un mismo medicamento también puede provocar reacciones distintas, por eso el personal sanitario vigilaba siempre los cambios de los pacientes.","Un même médicament peut aussi provoquer des réactions différentes ; le personnel soignant surveillait donc sans cesse l'évolution des patients."],["L7-5089","诱惑","yòuhuò","V/N","to tempt; temptation","tentar; tentación","tenter ; tentation","面对金钱的诱惑，他始终没有动心。","miàn duì jīn qián de yòu huò tā shǐ zhōng méi yǒu dòng xīn","Faced with the temptation of money, he was never moved.","Frente a la tentación del dinero, nunca se dejó seducir.","Face à la tentation de l'argent, il n'a jamais cédé."],["L7-5090","诱人","yòurén","Adj","tempting; attractive","tentador; atractivo","tentant ; séduisant","刚出炉的烤鸭香味很诱人。","gāng chū lú de kǎo yā xiāng wèi hěn yòu rén","The aroma of freshly roasted duck is very tempting.","El aroma del pato asado recién salido del horno es muy tentador.","L'arôme du canard laqué tout juste sorti du four est très alléchant."],["L7-5091","余","yú","V/Num","Yu (surname); remainder","Yu (apellido); resto","Yu (nom de famille) ; reste","这次活动吸引了两千余名观众。","zhè cì huó dòng xī yǐn le liǎng qiān yú míng guān zhòng","This event attracted more than two thousand spectators.","Este evento atrajo a más de dos mil espectadores.","Cet événement a attiré plus de deux mille spectateurs."],["L7-5092","余地","yúdì","N","leeway; room","margen; espacio","marge ; latitude","这件事还有商量的余地。","zhè jiàn shì hái yǒu shāng liang de yú dì","There is still room for discussion on this matter.","Todavía hay margen para negociar este asunto.","Il reste encore une marge de discussion sur cette question."],["L7-5093","余额","yú'é","N","balance; remainder","saldo; resto","solde ; reste","你的银行卡余额不足了。","nǐ de yín háng kǎ yú é bù zú le","Your bank card balance is insufficient.","El saldo de su tarjeta bancaria es insuficiente.","Le solde de votre carte bancaire est insuffisant."],["L7-5094","渔船","yúchuán","N","fishing boat","barco pesquero","bateau de pêche","台风来临前，渔船纷纷回港避风。","tái fēng lái lín qián yú chuán fēn fēn huí gǎng bì fēng","Before the typhoon arrived, fishing boats returned to port one after another to shelter from the wind.","Antes de la llegada del tifón, los barcos de pesca regresaron al puerto uno tras otro para resguardarse del viento.","Avant l'arrivée du typhon, les bateaux de pêche sont rentrés au port les uns après les autres pour s'abriter du vent."],["L7-5095","渔民","yúmín","N","fisherman","pescador","pêcheur","这个岛上的居民大多是渔民。","zhè ge dǎo shàng de jū mín dà duō shì yú mín","Most of the residents on this island are fishermen.","La mayoría de los habitantes de esta isla son pescadores.","La plupart des habitants de cette île sont pêcheurs."],["L7-5096","逾期","yúqī","","overdue; to be past deadline","vencido; pasarse del plazo","en retard ; dépasser le délai","图书逾期不还要交罚款。","tú shū yú qī bù hái yào jiāo fá kuǎn","You have to pay a fine if you return library books late.","Si no devuelves los libros a tiempo, tienes que pagar una multa.","Il faut payer une amende si l'on rend les livres en retard."],["L7-5097","愚蠢","yúchǔn","Adj","stupid; foolish","estúpido; tonto","stupide ; sot","这是我做过的最愚蠢的决定。","zhè shì wǒ zuò guo de zuì yú chǔn de jué dìng","This is the stupidest decision I've ever made.","Esta es la decisión más tonta que he tomado.","C'est la décision la plus stupide que j'aie jamais prise."],["L7-5098","愚公移山","yúgōng-yíshān","","persistence moves mountains","con perseverancia se mueven montañas","la persévérance déplace les montagnes","只要有愚公移山的精神，再难的事也能做成。","zhǐ yào yǒu yú gōng yí shān de jīng shén zài nán de shì yě néng zuò chéng","With the persistence of the Foolish Old Man who moved the mountains, even the hardest things can be done.","Con el espíritu del Viejo Tonto que removió las montañas, hasta lo más difícil se puede lograr.","Avec l'esprit du Vieux Sot qui déplaça les montagnes, même les choses les plus difficiles peuvent être accomplies."],["L7-5099","舆论","yúlùn","N","public opinion","opinión pública","opinion publique","消息一公布，舆论一片哗然。","xiāo xi yì gōng bù yú lùn yí piàn huá rán","As soon as the news was announced, there was a public uproar.","En cuanto se anunció la noticia, la opinión pública se escandalizó.","Dès l'annonce de la nouvelle, l'opinion publique s'est soulevée."],["L7-5100","与此同时","yǔcǐ-tóngshí","","meanwhile; at the same time","mientras tanto; al mismo tiempo","pendant ce temps ; en même temps","他在工作，与此同时还在读研究生。","tā zài gōng zuò yǔ cǐ tóng shí hái zài dú yán jiū shēng","He is working and pursuing postgraduate studies at the same time.","Trabaja y, al mismo tiempo, cursa un posgrado.","Il travaille et, en même temps, prépare un master."],["L7-5101","与否","yǔ fǒu","","whether or not","o no","ou non","成功与否，关键在于坚持。","chéng gōng yǔ fǒu guān jiàn zài yú jiān chí","Whether you succeed or not depends on perseverance.","Tener éxito o no depende de la constancia.","Réussir ou non dépend de la persévérance."],["L7-5102","与其","yǔqí","Conj","rather than","en vez de","plutôt que","与其在这里干等，我宁愿冒雨走回去。","yǔ qí zài zhè lǐ gān děng wǒ nìng yuàn mào yǔ zǒu huí qù","Rather than waiting here doing nothing, I'd rather walk back in the rain.","En vez de esperar aquí sin hacer nada, prefiero volver a pie bajo la lluvia.","Plutôt que d'attendre ici sans rien faire, je préfère rentrer à pied sous la pluie."],["L7-5103","与日俱增","yǔrì-jùzēng","","to grow day by day","crecer día a día","croître de jour en jour","他对中国文化的兴趣与日俱增。","tā duì zhōng guó wén huà de xìng qù yǔ rì jù zēng","His interest in Chinese culture grows day by day.","Su interés por la cultura china crece día a día.","Son intérêt pour la culture chinoise grandit de jour en jour."],["L7-5104","与时俱进","yǔshí-jùjìn","","to keep up with the times","estar al día con los tiempos","être de son temps","教育也要与时俱进，跟上时代的发展。","jiào yù yě yào yǔ shí jù jìn gēn shàng shí dài de fā zhǎn","Education must also keep up with the times.","La educación también debe ir con los tiempos y avanzar al ritmo del desarrollo de la época.","L'éducation doit elle aussi évoluer avec son temps et suivre le développement de l'époque."],["L7-5105","与众不同","yǔzhòng-bùtóng","","to stand out; unique","destacar; ser diferente","se démarquer ; être différent","她的穿衣风格与众不同。","tā de chuān yī fēng gé yǔ zhòng bù tóng","Her style of dress is out of the ordinary.","Su estilo de vestir es diferente al de los demás.","Son style vestimentaire sort de l'ordinaire."],["L7-5106","予以","yǔyǐ","V","to give; to apply","dar; aplicar","accorder ; appliquer","对表现突出的员工，公司将予以奖励。","duì biǎo xiàn tū chū de yuán gōng gōng sī jiāng yǔ yǐ jiǎng lì","The company will reward employees who perform outstandingly.","La empresa premiará a los empleados con un desempeño destacado.","L'entreprise récompensera les employés qui se distinguent par leurs performances."],["L7-5107","宇宙","yǔzhòu","N","universe; cosmos","universo; cosmos","univers ; cosmos","你相信宇宙中真的有外星人吗？","nǐ xiāng xìn yǔ zhòu zhōng zhēn de yǒu wài xīng rén ma","Do you believe there really are aliens in the universe?","¿Crees que realmente existen extraterrestres en el universo?","Crois-tu qu'il existe vraiment des extraterrestres dans l'univers ?"],["L7-5108","语气","yǔqì","N","tone; mood","tono; modo","ton ; mode","他说话的语气有点儿不耐烦。","tā shuō huà de yǔ qì yǒu diǎnr bú nài fán","His tone was a little impatient.","Su tono de voz sonaba un poco impaciente.","Son ton était un peu impatient."],["L7-5109","浴室","yùshì","N","bathroom","cuarto de baño","salle de bains","浴室的地板很滑，小心别摔倒。","yù shì de dì bǎn hěn huá xiǎo xīn bié shuāi dǎo","The bathroom floor is slippery; be careful not to fall.","El piso del baño está resbaloso; cuidado, no te vayas a caer.","Le sol de la salle de bains est glissant ; fais attention de ne pas tomber."],["L7-5110","预定","yùdìng","V","to schedule; to book","programar; reservar","prévoir ; réserver","会议预定在下周一上午九点开始。","huì yì yù dìng zài xià zhōu yí shàng wǔ jiǔ diǎn kāi shǐ","The meeting is scheduled to begin at nine next Monday morning.","La reunión está programada para comenzar el próximo lunes a las nueve de la mañana.","La réunion est prévue pour commencer lundi prochain à neuf heures du matin."],["L7-5111","预感","yùgǎn","V/N","premonition; to sense","presentimiento; presentir","pressentiment ; pressentir","我有一种预感，他今天不会来了。","wǒ yǒu yì zhǒng yù gǎn tā jīn tiān bú huì lái le","I have a feeling he won't come today.","Tengo el presentimiento de que hoy no va a venir.","J'ai le pressentiment qu'il ne viendra pas aujourd'hui."],["L7-5112","预告","yùgào","V/N","advance notice; to announce","aviso previo; anunciar","préavis ; annoncer","电视台预告了下周要播的节目。","diàn shì tái yù gào le xià zhōu yào bō de jié mù","The TV station announced the programs to be broadcast next week.","El canal de televisión anunció los programas que se emitirán la próxima semana.","La chaîne de télévision a annoncé les programmes de la semaine prochaine."],["L7-5113","预见","yùjiàn","V/N","to foresee; foresight","prever; previsión","prévoir ; prévision","没有人能预见未来会发生什么。","méi yǒu rén néng yù jiàn wèi lái huì fā shēng shén me","No one can foresee what will happen in the future.","Nadie puede prever lo que sucederá en el futuro.","Personne ne peut prévoir ce qui arrivera à l'avenir."],["L7-5114","预料","yùliào","V/N","to anticipate; expectation","prever; expectativa","prévoir ; attente","事情的发展完全出乎我们的预料。","shì qing de fā zhǎn wán quán chū hū wǒ men de yù liào","The way things developed was completely beyond our expectations.","El rumbo que tomaron los acontecimientos superó por completo nuestras previsiones.","L'évolution des choses a complètement dépassé nos prévisions."],["L7-5115","预赛","yùsài","V/N","preliminary round","ronda preliminar","épreuve préliminaire","他在预赛中表现很好，顺利进入了决赛。","tā zài yù sài zhōng biǎo xiàn hěn hǎo shùn lì jìn rù le jué sài","He performed well in the preliminaries and made it into the final.","Tuvo un buen desempeño en las eliminatorias y avanzó sin problemas a la final.","Il a bien joué lors des éliminatoires et s'est qualifié sans encombre pour la finale."],["L7-5116","预示","yùshì","V","to foreshadow; to indicate","presagiar; indicar","présager ; annoncer","天边的乌云预示着暴雨就要来了。","tiān biān de wū yún yù shì zhe bào yǔ jiù yào lái le","The dark clouds on the horizon indicate a storm is coming.","Las nubes negras en el horizonte anuncian que se viene un aguacero.","Les nuages noirs à l'horizon annoncent un orage violent."],["L7-5117","预售","yùshòu","V","to sell in advance","vender por adelantado","vendre en prévente","这部电影的票已经开始预售了。","zhè bù diàn yǐng de piào yǐ jīng kāi shǐ yù shòu le","Advance ticket sales for this film have already begun.","Ya comenzó la preventa de boletos de esta película.","La prévente des billets pour ce film a déjà commencé."],["L7-5118","预算","yùsuàn","N","budget","presupuesto","budget","这两种方案皆有道理，最后还要看预算。","zhè liǎng zhǒng fāng àn jiē yǒu dào lǐ zuì hòu hái yào kàn yù suàn","Both plans make sense; in the end it depends on the budget.","Ambos planes tienen sentido; al final habrá que ver el presupuesto.","Les deux plans se tiennent ; au final, tout dépendra du budget."],["L7-5119","预先","yùxiān","Adv","in advance","de antemano","à l'avance","去之前最好预先打个电话问一下。","qù zhī qián zuì hǎo yù xiān dǎ gè diàn huà wèn yí xià","It's best to call ahead and ask before you go.","Antes de ir, conviene llamar por teléfono para preguntar.","Avant d'y aller, il vaut mieux téléphoner pour se renseigner."],["L7-5120","预言","yùyán","V/N","to predict; prophecy","predecir; profecía","prédire ; prophétie","他的预言后来真的实现了。","tā de yù yán hòu lái zhēn de shí xiàn le","His prediction later actually came true.","Su predicción se cumplió más tarde de verdad.","Sa prédiction s'est réalisée par la suite."],["L7-5121","预兆","yùzhào","N/V","omen; sign","presagio; señal","présage ; signe avant-coureur","老人们认为喜鹊叫是好事的预兆。","lǎo rén men rèn wéi xǐ què jiào shì hǎo shì de yù zhào","The old folks think a magpie's call is an omen of good things.","Los ancianos creen que el canto de la urraca es presagio de buenas noticias.","Les anciens pensent que le chant de la pie est un présage de bonnes choses."],["L7-5122","欲望","yùwàng","N","desire; craving","deseo; ansia","désir ; envie","孩子对新事物有强烈的求知欲望。","hái zi duì xīn shì wù yǒu qiáng liè de qiú zhī yù wàng","Children have a strong desire to learn about new things.","Los niños sienten un fuerte deseo de aprender cosas nuevas.","Les enfants ont une forte soif d'apprendre de nouvelles choses."],["L7-5123","遇难","yùnàn","","to die in an accident","morir en un accidente","périr dans un accident","这次海难中有十几名乘客遇难。","zhè cì hǎi nàn zhōng yǒu shí jǐ míng chéng kè yù nàn","Ten-odd passengers died in this maritime disaster.","En este naufragio murieron una decena de pasajeros.","Une dizaine de passagers ont péri dans ce naufrage."],["L7-5124","遇上","yùshang","","to run into; to come across","toparse con; encontrarse","tomber sur ; rencontrer","回家的路上，我遇上了一位老同学。","huí jiā de lù shang wǒ yù shàng le yí wèi lǎo tóng xué","On my way home, I ran into an old classmate.","De camino a casa me encontré con un viejo compañero de clase.","En rentrant chez moi, j'ai croisé un ancien camarade de classe."],["L7-5125","遇险","yùxiǎn","","to meet with danger","correr peligro","se trouver en danger","一艘渔船在海上遇险，船员正在等待救援。","yì sōu yú chuán zài hǎi shàng yù xiǎn chuán yuán zhèng zài děng dài jiù yuán","A fishing boat ran into trouble at sea, and the crew are waiting for rescue.","Un barco pesquero se encuentra en peligro en el mar y la tripulación espera ser rescatada.","Un bateau de pêche est en détresse en mer et l'équipage attend les secours."],["L7-5126","寓言","yùyán","N","fable","fábula","fable","这本书里收集了很多有趣的寓言。","zhè běn shū lǐ shōu jí le hěn duō yǒu qù de yù yán","This book collects many interesting fables.","Este libro recopila muchas fábulas interesantes.","Ce livre rassemble beaucoup de fables intéressantes."],["L7-5127","寓意","yùyì","N","moral; implied meaning","moraleja; significado implícito","morale ; sens implicite","这幅画的寓意是家庭幸福。","zhè fú huà de yù yì shì jiā tíng xìng fú","The meaning behind this painting is family happiness.","El significado de este cuadro es la felicidad familiar.","Le sens de ce tableau est le bonheur familial."],["L7-5128","愈合","yùhé","V","to heal (wound)","cicatrizar","cicatriser","他的伤口已经慢慢愈合了。","tā de shāng kǒu yǐ jīng màn màn yù hé le","His wound has slowly healed.","Su herida ya sanó poco a poco.","Sa blessure s'est peu à peu cicatrisée."],["L7-5129","愈来愈","yù lái yù","","more and more","cada vez más","de plus en plus","雨愈来愈大了，我们找个地方躲一躲吧。","yǔ yù lái yù dà le wǒ men zhǎo gè dì fang duǒ yi duǒ ba","The rain is getting heavier and heavier; let's find somewhere to shelter.","Cada vez llueve más fuerte; busquemos dónde resguardarnos.","La pluie est de plus en plus forte ; trouvons un endroit où nous abriter."],["L7-5130","愈演愈烈","yùyǎn-yùliè","","to intensify; to get worse","intensificarse; agravarse","s'intensifier ; s'aggraver","两家公司之间的价格战愈演愈烈。","liǎng jiā gōng sī zhī jiān de jià gé zhàn yù yǎn yù liè","The price war between the two companies is getting more and more intense.","La guerra de precios entre las dos empresas se intensifica cada vez más.","La guerre des prix entre les deux entreprises s'intensifie de plus en plus."],["L7-5131","冤","yuān","N/Adj","injustice; wrong","injusticia; agravio","injustice ; tort","什么都没做就被罚了款，他觉得自己很冤。","shén me dōu méi zuò jiù bèi fá le kuǎn tā jué de zì jǐ hěn yuān","He was fined without having done anything, and he feels wronged.","Lo multaron sin haber hecho nada y siente que fue injusto.","Il s'est fait mettre une amende sans avoir rien fait et trouve cela injuste."],["L7-5132","冤枉","yuānwang","V/Adj","to wrong; to accuse falsely","acusar injustamente; agraviar","accuser à tort ; faire injustice à","我没拿你的钱，你别冤枉我。","wǒ méi ná nǐ de qián nǐ bié yuān wang wǒ","I didn't take your money; don't wrongly accuse me.","Yo no tomé tu dinero; no me acuses injustamente.","Je n'ai pas pris ton argent ; ne m'accuse pas à tort."],["L7-5133","渊源","yuānyuán","N","origin; source","origen; fuente","origine ; source","这两个家族之间有很深的渊源。","zhè liǎng gè jiā zú zhī jiān yǒu hěn shēn de yuān yuán","These two families have deep historical ties.","Estas dos familias tienen profundos vínculos históricos.","Ces deux familles ont des liens historiques profonds."],["L7-5134","元老","yuánlǎo","N","elder statesman; senior figure","veterano; figura destacada","doyen ; figure respectée","他是公司的元老，跟着老板干了三十年。","tā shì gōng sī de yuán lǎo gēn zhe lǎo bǎn gàn le sān shí nián","He is a veteran of the company and has worked with the boss for thirty years.","Es un veterano de la empresa y lleva treinta años trabajando con el jefe.","C'est un vétéran de l'entreprise et il travaille avec le patron depuis trente ans."],["L7-5135","元首","yuánshǒu","N","head of state","jefe de estado","chef d'État","两国元首在北京举行了会谈。","liǎng guó yuán shǒu zài běi jīng jǔ xíng le huì tán","The two heads of state held talks in Beijing.","Los jefes de Estado de los dos países sostuvieron conversaciones en Pekín.","Les chefs d'État des deux pays se sont entretenus à Pékin."],["L7-5136","元宵节","Yuánxiāo Jié","N","Lantern Festival","Festival de los Faroles","Fête des lanternes","元宵节晚上，人们出门看花灯、吃元宵。","yuán xiāo jié wǎn shang rén men chū mén kàn huā dēng chī yuán xiāo","On the evening of the Lantern Festival, people go out to see lanterns and eat sweet dumplings.","La noche del Festival de los Faroles, la gente sale a ver los faroles y a comer yuanxiao.","Le soir de la fête des Lanternes, les gens sortent admirer les lanternes et manger des yuanxiao."],["L7-5137","原本","yuánběn","Adv","originally; original","originalmente; original","à l'origine ; original","他们俩原本是好朋友，却因为一点小事成了仇人。","tā men liǎ yuán běn shì hǎo péng you què yīn wèi yì diǎn xiǎo shì chéng le chóu rén","The two of them used to be good friends, but they became enemies over a trivial matter.","Los dos eran buenos amigos, pero por una tontería se convirtieron en enemigos.","Ces deux-là étaient de bons amis, mais pour une broutille ils sont devenus ennemis."],["L7-5138","原材料","yuáncáiliào","N","raw materials","materias primas","matières premières","由于原材料涨价，公司今年出现了亏损。","yóu yú yuán cái liào zhǎng jià gōng sī jīn nián chū xiàn le kuī sǔn","Because raw material prices rose, the company posted a loss this year.","Debido al aumento del precio de las materias primas, la empresa tuvo pérdidas este año.","En raison de la hausse du prix des matières premières, l'entreprise a enregistré des pertes cette année."],["L7-5139","原创","yuánchuàng","V","original; to create originally","original; crear algo original","original ; créer","这首歌是他自己原创的。","zhè shǒu gē shì tā zì jǐ yuán chuàng de","This song is his own original composition.","Esta canción es una creación original suya.","Cette chanson est une création originale de lui."],["L7-5140","原地","yuándì","N","original place; on the spot","lugar original; en el sitio","sur place ; endroit d'origine","你在原地等我，我马上回来。","nǐ zài yuán dì děng wǒ wǒ mǎ shàng huí lái","Wait for me right here; I'll be right back.","Espérame aquí mismo; vuelvo enseguida.","Attends-moi sur place, je reviens tout de suite."],["L7-5141","原型","yuánxíng","N","prototype; archetype","prototipo; arquetipo","prototype ; archétype","这个故事的原型是作者的亲身经历。","zhè ge gù shi de yuán xíng shì zuò zhě de qīn shēn jīng lì","The author's own experiences are the real-life basis for this story.","El modelo de esta historia es una experiencia vivida por el propio autor.","Cette histoire s'inspire de l'expérience personnelle de l'auteur."],["L7-5142","原汁原味","yuánzhī-yuánwèi","","authentic; original flavor","auténtico; sabor original","authentique ; saveur d'origine","这家饭馆的川菜原汁原味，很地道。","zhè jiā fàn guǎn de chuān cài yuán zhī yuán wèi hěn dì dao","The Sichuan food at this restaurant is authentic and true to its roots.","La comida de Sichuan de este restaurante es auténtica, con el sabor original.","La cuisine sichuanaise de ce restaurant est authentique et fidèle à la tradition."],["L7-5143","原装","yuánzhuāng","Adj","genuine; original packaging","original; de fábrica","d'origine ; authentique","这款手机的原装配件都在盒子里。","zhè kuǎn shǒu jī de yuán zhuāng pèi jiàn dōu zài hé zi lǐ","All the original accessories for this phone are in the box.","Todos los accesorios originales de este celular están dentro de la caja.","Tous les accessoires d'origine de ce téléphone sont dans la boîte."],["L7-5144","圆形","yuánxíng","N","round shape; circle","forma redonda; círculo","forme ronde ; cercle","桌子是圆形的，可以坐十个人。","zhuō zi shì yuán xíng de kě yǐ zuò shí gè rén","The table is round and seats ten people.","La mesa es redonda y caben diez personas.","La table est ronde et peut accueillir dix personnes."],["L7-5145","缘分","yuánfèn","N","fate; destined affinity","destino; afinidad predestinada","destin ; affinité prédestinée","我们能在这里相遇，真是缘分。","wǒ men néng zài zhè lǐ xiāng yù zhēn shì yuán fèn","It's really fate that we met here.","Que nos hayamos encontrado aquí es realmente cosa del destino.","Que nous nous soyons rencontrés ici, c'est vraiment le destin."],["L7-5146","源泉","yuánquán","N","source; wellspring","fuente; manantial","source ; origine","生活是艺术创作的源泉。","shēng huó shì yì shù chuàng zuò de yuán quán","Life is the source of artistic creation.","La vida es la fuente de la creación artística.","La vie est la source de la création artistique."],["L7-5147","源头","yuántóu","N","source; origin","fuente; origen","source ; origine","这条大河的源头在雪山上。","zhè tiáo dà hé de yuán tóu zài xuě shān shàng","The source of this great river is in the snowy mountains.","El nacimiento de este gran río está en las montañas nevadas.","La source de ce grand fleuve se trouve dans les montagnes enneigées."],["L7-5148","源于","yuányú","","to originate from","originarse en; provenir de","provenir de ; tirer son origine de","这个节日源于一个古老的传说。","zhè ge jié rì yuán yú yí ge gǔ lǎo de chuán shuō","This festival originates from an ancient legend.","Esta fiesta tiene su origen en una antigua leyenda.","Cette fête tire son origine d'une ancienne légende."],["L7-5149","源源不断","yuányuán-bùduàn","","an endless stream","un flujo continuo","un flux continu","游客源源不断地来到这个小镇。","yóu kè yuán yuán bú duàn de lái dào zhè ge xiǎo zhèn","Tourists keep pouring into this small town.","Los turistas llegan sin cesar a este pueblito.","Les touristes affluent sans cesse dans cette petite ville."],["L7-5150","远程","yuǎnchéng","Adj","remote; long-distance","remoto; a larga distancia","à distance ; longue distance","这家医院为偏远乡村提供远程会诊，减少了患者长途奔波的负担。","zhè jiā yī yuàn wèi piān yuǎn xiāng cūn tí gōng yuǎn chéng huì zhěn jiǎn shǎo le huàn zhě cháng tú bēn bō de fù dān","This hospital offers remote consultations to isolated villages, reducing the burden of long journeys for patients.","Este hospital ofrece consultas a distancia a pueblos remotos, lo que alivia a los pacientes de largos desplazamientos.","Cet hôpital propose des téléconsultations aux villages isolés, ce qui évite aux patients de longs déplacements."],["L7-5151","远见","yuǎnjiàn","N","foresight; vision","visión de futuro; previsión","clairvoyance ; vision","他是一个很有远见的企业家。","tā shì yí ge hěn yǒu yuǎn jiàn de qǐ yè jiā","He is an entrepreneur with great foresight.","Es un empresario con mucha visión de futuro.","C'est un entrepreneur très clairvoyant."],["L7-5152","远近闻名","yuǎnjìn-wénmíng","","famous far and wide","famoso en todas partes","connu de partout","这家店的包子远近闻名。","zhè jiā diàn de bāo zi yuǎn jìn wén míng","This shop's steamed buns are famous far and wide.","Los baozi de esta tienda son famosos en todas partes.","Les brioches farcies de cette boutique sont connues de tous."],["L7-5153","怨恨","yuànhèn","V/N","to resent; resentment","guardar rencor; resentimiento","en vouloir à ; rancune","他心里一直怨恨父亲当年离开了家。","tā xīn lǐ yì zhí yuàn hèn fù qīn dāng nián lí kāi le jiā","He has always resented his father for leaving home years ago.","En el fondo siempre le ha guardado rencor a su padre por haber abandonado la casa aquel año.","Au fond de lui, il en a toujours voulu à son père d'avoir quitté la maison à l'époque."],["L7-5154","怨气","yuànqì","N","resentment; grievance","rencor; queja","ressentiment ; rancœur","他满肚子怨气，见谁都不高兴。","tā mǎn dù zi yuàn qì jiàn shéi dōu bù gāo xìng","He is full of resentment and unhappy with everyone he sees.","Está lleno de resentimiento y a todo el que ve le molesta.","Il est plein de rancœur et mécontent de tous ceux qu'il croise."],["L7-5155","怨言","yuànyán","N","complaint","queja","plainte","她工作很辛苦，却从来没有怨言。","tā gōng zuò hěn xīn kǔ què cóng lái méi yǒu yuàn yán","Her work is very hard, yet she never complains.","Su trabajo es muy duro, pero nunca se queja.","Son travail est très pénible, mais elle ne s'est jamais plainte."],["L7-5156","院士","yuànshì","N","academician","académico","académicien","这位老科学家是中国科学院的院士。","zhè wèi lǎo kē xué jiā shì zhōng guó kē xué yuàn de yuàn shì","This old scientist is an academician of the Chinese Academy of Sciences.","Este anciano científico es académico de la Academia China de Ciencias.","Ce vieux scientifique est académicien de l'Académie chinoise des sciences."],["L7-5157","曰","yuē","V","to say","decir","dire","孔子曰：三人行，必有我师。","kǒng zǐ yuē sān rén xíng bì yǒu wǒ shī","Confucius said: among any three people walking, there is one who can be my teacher.","Confucio dijo: «Si caminan tres personas, entre ellas siempre habrá un maestro para mí».","Confucius a dit : « Sur trois personnes qui marchent ensemble, il y en a toujours une qui peut être mon maître. »"],["L7-5158","约定俗成","yuēdìng-súchéng","","established by common usage","establecido por el uso común","consacré par l'usage","很多语言规则都是约定俗成的。","hěn duō yǔ yán guī zé dōu shì yuē dìng sú chéng de","Many language rules are established by common usage.","Muchas reglas del idioma se establecen por el uso común.","De nombreuses règles de langue sont établies par l'usage."],["L7-5159","月初","yuèchū","N","early in the month","principios de mes","début du mois","我们公司的工资每个月月初发。","wǒ men gōng sī de gōng zī měi ge yuè yuè chū fā","Our company pays wages at the beginning of every month.","En nuestra empresa los sueldos se pagan a principios de cada mes.","Dans notre entreprise, les salaires sont versés au début de chaque mois."],["L7-5160","月票","yuèpiào","N","monthly pass","abono mensual","abonnement mensuel","他每个月都买一张公交月票。","tā měi ge yuè dōu mǎi yì zhāng gōng jiāo yuè piào","He buys a monthly bus pass every month.","Cada mes compra un abono mensual de autobús.","Chaque mois, il achète un abonnement mensuel de bus."],["L7-5161","乐器","yuèqì","N","musical instrument","instrumento musical","instrument de musique","她从小学音乐，会演奏好几种乐器。","tā cóng xiǎo xué yīn yuè huì yǎn zòu hǎo jǐ zhǒng yuè qì","She has studied music since childhood and can play several instruments.","Estudia música desde niña y sabe tocar varios instrumentos.","Elle apprend la musique depuis l'enfance et sait jouer de plusieurs instruments."],["L7-5162","岳父","yuèfù","N","father-in-law (wife's father)","suegro (padre de la esposa)","beau-père (père de l'épouse)","他的岳父是一位退休的老教师。","tā de yuè fù shì yí wèi tuì xiū de lǎo jiào shī","His father-in-law is a retired teacher.","Su suegro es un viejo maestro jubilado.","Son beau-père est un vieil enseignant à la retraite."],["L7-5163","岳母","yuèmǔ","N","mother-in-law (wife's mother)","suegra (madre de la esposa)","belle-mère (mère de l'épouse)","岳母每次来都给我们带很多好吃的。","yuè mǔ měi cì lái dōu gěi wǒ men dài hěn duō hǎo chī de","Every time my mother-in-law comes, she brings us lots of tasty food.","Cada vez que viene mi suegra, nos trae muchas cosas ricas.","Chaque fois que ma belle-mère vient, elle nous apporte plein de bonnes choses."],["L7-5164","阅历","yuèlì","V/N","experience","experiencia","expérience","他年纪不大，但社会阅历很丰富。","tā nián jì bú dà dàn shè huì yuè lì hěn fēng fù","He isn't old, but he has a lot of life experience.","No es mayor, pero tiene mucha experiencia de la vida.","Il n'est pas vieux, mais il a beaucoup d'expérience de la vie."],["L7-5165","悦耳","yuè'ěr","Adj","pleasing to the ear","agradable al oído","mélodieux","树林里传来悦耳的鸟叫声。","shù lín lǐ chuán lái yuè ěr de niǎo jiào shēng","Sweet birdsong came from the woods.","Del bosque llegaba un agradable canto de pájaros.","Un doux chant d'oiseaux venait du bois."],["L7-5166","越发","yuèfā","Adv","even more; increasingly","aún más; cada vez más","d'autant plus ; de plus en plus","几年不见，她越发漂亮了。","jǐ nián bú jiàn tā yuè fā piào liang le","I haven't seen her for several years, and she's become even prettier.","Después de varios años sin verla, está aún más hermosa.","Après plusieurs années sans la voir, elle est encore plus belle."],["L7-5167","越过","yuèguò","","to cross over; to overcome","cruzar; superar","franchir ; surmonter","汽车越过了前面的卡车。","qì chē yuè guò le qián miàn de kǎ chē","The car overtook the truck in front.","El coche rebasó al camión de adelante.","La voiture a dépassé le camion qui était devant."],["L7-5168","晕倒","yūndǎo","","to faint","desmayarse","s'évanouir","她在太阳下站了太久，突然晕倒了。","tā zài tài yáng xià zhàn le tài jiǔ tū rán yūn dǎo le","She stood in the sun for too long and suddenly fainted.","Estuvo demasiado tiempo de pie bajo el sol y de pronto se desmayó.","Elle est restée trop longtemps debout au soleil et s'est soudain évanouie."],["L7-5169","陨石","yǔnshí","N","meteorite","meteorito","météorite","博物馆里展出了一块从天上掉下来的陨石。","bó wù guǎn lǐ zhǎn chū le yí kuài cóng tiān shàng diào xià lái de yǔn shí","A meteorite that fell from the sky is on display in the museum.","En el museo se exhibe un meteorito que cayó del cielo.","Le musée expose une météorite tombée du ciel."],["L7-5170","孕妇","yùnfù","N","pregnant woman","mujer embarazada","femme enceinte","公交车上，大家纷纷给孕妇让座。","gōng jiāo chē shàng dà jiā fēn fēn gěi yùn fù ràng zuò","On the bus, everyone offered their seats to the pregnant woman.","En el autobús, todos le cedieron el asiento a la mujer embarazada.","Dans le bus, tout le monde a cédé sa place à la femme enceinte."],["L7-5171","孕育","yùnyù","V","to be pregnant; to nurture","gestar; engendrar","porter ; faire naître","黄河孕育了古老的中华文明。","huáng hé yùn yù le gǔ lǎo de zhōng huá wén míng","The Yellow River gave birth to ancient Chinese civilization.","El río Amarillo dio origen a la antigua civilización china.","Le fleuve Jaune a donné naissance à l'ancienne civilisation chinoise."],["L7-5172","运河","yùnhé","N","canal","canal","canal","这条古老的运河已经有一千多年的历史了。","zhè tiáo gǔ lǎo de yùn hé yǐ jīng yǒu yì qiān duō nián de lì shǐ le","This ancient canal is over a thousand years old.","Este antiguo canal tiene más de mil años de historia.","Cet ancien canal a plus de mille ans d'histoire."],["L7-5173","运送","yùnsòng","V","to transport","transportar","transporter","救灾物资正在被运送到灾区。","jiù zāi wù zī zhèng zài bèi yùn sòng dào zāi qū","Relief supplies are being transported to the disaster area.","Se están enviando suministros de ayuda a la zona del desastre.","Les fournitures de secours sont acheminées vers la zone sinistrée."],["L7-5174","运营","yùnyíng","V","to operate; to run","operar; gestionar","exploiter ; gérer","这次调查中，超过半数的居民赞成延长公交运营时间。","zhè cì diào chá zhōng chāo guò bàn shù de jū mín zàn chéng yán cháng gōng jiāo yùn yíng shí jiān","In this survey, more than half of the residents supported extending bus service hours.","En esta encuesta, más de la mitad de los residentes estuvo a favor de ampliar el horario del transporte público.","Dans cette enquête, plus de la moitié des habitants étaient favorables à l'allongement des horaires des bus."],["L7-5175","运转","yùnzhuǎn","V","to operate; to run","funcionar; operar","fonctionner ; tourner","这台机器已经连续运转了十个小时。","zhè tái jī qì yǐ jīng lián xù yùn zhuǎn le shí gè xiǎo shí","This machine has been running continuously for ten hours.","Esta máquina lleva diez horas funcionando sin parar.","Cette machine fonctionne sans interruption depuis dix heures."],["L7-5176","酝酿","yùnniàng","V","to brew; to mull over","gestarse; madurar una idea","mijoter ; préparer","这个计划他已经酝酿了很久。","zhè ge jì huà tā yǐ jīng yùn niàng le hěn jiǔ","He has been mulling over this plan for a long time.","Lleva mucho tiempo madurando este plan.","Il mûrit ce projet depuis longtemps."],["L7-5177","韵味","yùnwèi","N","charm; lingering appeal","encanto; atractivo sutil","charme ; saveur","这首古诗读起来很有韵味。","zhè shǒu gǔ shī dú qǐ lái hěn yǒu yùn wèi","This ancient poem has a lovely lingering charm when read aloud.","Este antiguo poema tiene un encanto especial al leerlo.","Ce poème ancien a beaucoup de charme quand on le lit."],["L7-5178","蕴藏","yùncáng","V","to hold in store; to contain","albergar; contener","renfermer ; receler","这片土地下面蕴藏着丰富的石油。","zhè piàn tǔ dì xià miàn yùn cáng zhe fēng fù de shí yóu","Rich oil reserves lie beneath this land.","Bajo esta tierra se encuentran abundantes reservas de petróleo.","Ce sous-sol recèle d'abondantes réserves de pétrole."],["L7-5179","蕴涵","yùnhán","V","to contain; to imply","contener; implicar","contenir ; impliquer","这句简单的话里蕴涵着深刻的道理。","zhè jù jiǎn dān de huà lǐ yùn hán zhe shēn kè de dào lǐ","This simple sentence contains a profound truth.","Esta frase sencilla encierra una verdad profunda.","Cette phrase simple renferme une vérité profonde."],["L7-5180","杂技","zájì","N","acrobatics","acrobacia","acrobatie","孩子们看杂技表演看得目不转睛。","hái zi men kàn zá jì biǎo yǎn kàn de mù bù zhuǎn jīng","The children watched the acrobatic show without taking their eyes off it.","Los niños miraban el espectáculo acrobático sin pestañear.","Les enfants regardaient le spectacle d'acrobaties sans détourner les yeux."],["L7-5181","杂交","zájiāo","V","to crossbreed; hybridization","cruzar; hibridación","croiser ; hybridation","这种水稻是用杂交技术培育出来的。","zhè zhǒng shuǐ dào shì yòng zá jiāo jì shù péi yù chū lái de","This kind of rice was developed using hybridization technology.","Esta variedad de arroz se obtuvo mediante técnicas de hibridación.","Cette variété de riz a été obtenue grâce à des techniques d'hybridation."],["L7-5182","杂乱无章","záluàn-wúzhāng","","chaotic; messy","caótico; desordenado","chaotique ; en désordre","他的房间杂乱无章，东西扔得到处都是。","tā de fáng jiān zá luàn wú zhāng dōng xi rēng dé dào chù dōu shì","His room is a mess, with things thrown everywhere.","Su cuarto es un desorden y hay cosas tiradas por todas partes.","Sa chambre est en désordre, avec des affaires jetées partout."],["L7-5183","砸","zá","V","to smash; to bungle","romper; echar a perder","fracasser ; rater","一个足球飞过来，正好砸在了他头上。","yí ge zú qiú fēi guò lái zhèng hǎo zá zài le tā tóu shàng","A soccer ball flew over and hit him right on the head.","Un balón de fútbol vino volando y le dio justo en la cabeza.","Un ballon de football est arrivé et l'a frappé en pleine tête."],["L7-5184","栽","zāi","V","to plant","plantar","planter","爷爷在院子里栽了几棵枣树。","yé ye zài yuàn zi lǐ zāi le jǐ kē zǎo shù","Grandpa planted a few jujube trees in the yard.","El abuelo plantó unos jujubos en el patio.","Grand-père a planté quelques jujubiers dans la cour."],["L7-5185","栽培","zāipéi","V","to cultivate; to train","cultivar; formar","cultiver ; former","这种花很难栽培，需要特别的照顾。","zhè zhǒng huā hěn nán zāi péi xū yào tè bié de zhào gù","This flower is hard to cultivate and needs special care.","Esta flor es difícil de cultivar y necesita cuidados especiales.","Cette fleur est difficile à cultiver et demande des soins particuliers."],["L7-5186","宰","zǎi","V","to slaughter; to rip off","sacrificar; estafar","abattre ; arnaquer","这家饭馆专门宰外地游客。","zhè jiā fàn guǎn zhuān mén zǎi wài dì yóu kè","This restaurant specializes in ripping off out-of-town tourists.","Este restaurante se dedica a estafar a los turistas de fuera.","Ce restaurant est spécialisé dans l'arnaque des touristes venus d'ailleurs."],["L7-5187","再度","zàidù","Adv","once again","una vez más","à nouveau","这位老演员再度登上了舞台。","zhè wèi lǎo yǎn yuán zài dù dēng shàng le wǔ tái","This veteran actor took the stage once again.","Este veterano actor volvió a subir al escenario.","Ce vieil acteur est remonté sur scène."],["L7-5188","再现","zàixiàn","V","to reproduce; to recreate","reproducir; recrear","reproduire ; recréer","这部电影再现了一百年前的北京。","zhè bù diàn yǐng zài xiàn le yì bǎi nián qián de běi jīng","This film recreates Beijing as it was a hundred years ago.","Esta película recrea el Pekín de hace cien años.","Ce film fait revivre le Pékin d'il y a cent ans."],["L7-5189","在线","zàixiàn","V","online","en línea","en ligne","现在很多课程都可以在线学习。","xiàn zài hěn duō kè chéng dōu kě yǐ zài xiàn xué xí","Nowadays many courses can be studied online.","Hoy en día muchos cursos se pueden estudiar en línea.","Aujourd'hui, beaucoup de cours peuvent être suivis en ligne."],["L7-5190","在意","zàiyì","","to care about; to mind","importarle; preocuparse por","se soucier de ; prêter attention à","别人怎么说，他一点儿也不在意。","bié rén zěn me shuō tā yì diǎnr yě bú zài yì","He doesn't care at all what others say.","No le importa en lo más mínimo lo que digan los demás.","Il se moque complètement de ce que disent les autres."],["L7-5191","在职","zàizhí","V","in service; on the job","en activo; en el cargo","en poste ; en activité","他是一名在职研究生，白天上班，晚上上课。","tā shì yì míng zài zhí yán jiū shēng bái tiān shàng bān wǎn shang shàng kè","He is a part-time graduate student who works during the day and attends classes at night.","Es estudiante de posgrado y trabaja: de día trabaja y de noche va a clases.","Il fait un master en formation continue : il travaille le jour et suit des cours le soir."],["L7-5192","载体","zàitǐ","N","carrier; medium","portador; medio","support ; vecteur","语言是文化的重要载体。","yǔ yán shì wén huà de zhòng yào zài tǐ","Language is an important carrier of culture.","El idioma es un importante vehículo de la cultura.","La langue est un vecteur important de la culture."],["L7-5193","攒","zǎn","V","to save up; to accumulate","ahorrar; acumular","économiser ; accumuler","他攒了好几年钱，终于买了一辆小轿车。","tā zǎn le hǎo jǐ nián qián zhōng yú mǎi le yí liàng xiǎo jiào chē","He saved for several years and finally bought a car.","Ahorró dinero durante varios años y por fin se compró un auto.","Il a économisé pendant plusieurs années et a enfin acheté une voiture."],["L7-5194","暂","zàn","Adv","temporarily","temporalmente","temporairement","这件事暂不公开，请大家保密。","zhè jiàn shì zàn bù gōng kāi qǐng dà jiā bǎo mì","This matter won't be made public for now; please keep it confidential.","Este asunto no se hará público por ahora; les pido discreción.","Cette affaire ne sera pas rendue publique pour le moment ; merci de garder le secret."],["L7-5195","赞不绝口","zànbùjuékǒu","","to praise endlessly","elogiar sin cesar","ne pas tarir d'éloges","吃了妈妈做的菜，客人们赞不绝口。","chī le mā ma zuò de cài kè rén men zàn bù jué kǒu","After eating Mom's cooking, the guests couldn't stop praising it.","Después de probar la comida de mamá, los invitados no dejaban de elogiarla.","Après avoir goûté les plats de maman, les invités n'ont pas tari d'éloges."],["L7-5196","赞美","zànměi","V","to praise; to admire","elogiar; alabar","louer ; faire l'éloge de","诗人用优美的语言赞美家乡。","shī rén yòng yōu měi de yǔ yán zàn měi jiā xiāng","The poet praised his hometown in beautiful language.","El poeta elogió su tierra natal con un lenguaje hermoso.","Le poète a célébré sa terre natale dans un beau langage."],["L7-5197","赞叹","zàntàn","V","to marvel at","admirar; maravillarse","s'émerveiller de","看到这么壮观的瀑布，大家都发出了赞叹。","kàn dào zhè me zhuàng guān de pù bù dà jiā dōu fā chū le zàn tàn","Seeing such a magnificent waterfall, everyone exclaimed in admiration.","Al ver una cascada tan imponente, todos exclamaron admirados.","En voyant une cascade aussi spectaculaire, tout le monde s'est exclamé d'admiration."],["L7-5198","赞叹不已","zàntàn-bùyǐ","","to be full of admiration","estar lleno de admiración","être plein d'admiration","游客们对这里的美景赞叹不已。","yóu kè men duì zhè lǐ de měi jǐng zàn tàn bù yǐ","The tourists marveled endlessly at the beautiful scenery here.","Los turistas no dejaban de admirar el hermoso paisaje de este lugar.","Les touristes ne cessaient d'admirer le beau paysage de cet endroit."],["L7-5199","赞同","zàntóng","V","to approve; to agree with","aprobar; estar de acuerdo","approuver ; être d'accord","演讲结束时，台下的观众频频点头表示赞同。","yǎn jiǎng jié shù shí tái xià de guān zhòng pín pín diǎn tóu biǎo shì zàn tóng","At the end of the speech, the audience nodded repeatedly in agreement.","Al terminar el discurso, el público asintió repetidamente en señal de acuerdo.","À la fin du discours, le public a hoché la tête à plusieurs reprises en signe d'approbation."],["L7-5200","赞许","zànxǔ","V","to praise; to commend","elogiar; aprobar","louer ; approuver","老师向他投去了赞许的目光。","lǎo shī xiàng tā tóu qù le zàn xǔ de mù guāng","The teacher gave him an approving look.","La maestra le dirigió una mirada de aprobación.","La maîtresse lui a lancé un regard approbateur."],["L7-5201","赞扬","zànyáng","V","to praise; to commend","elogiar; alabar","louer ; féliciter","他勇敢救人的行为受到了大家的赞扬。","tā yǒng gǎn jiù rén de xíng wéi shòu dào le dà jiā de zàn yáng","His brave act of saving others won everyone's praise.","Su valiente acto de salvar a otros recibió el elogio de todos.","Son courageux sauvetage lui a valu les éloges de tous."],["L7-5202","葬","zàng","V","to bury","enterrar","enterrer","老人去世后葬在了家乡的山上。","lǎo rén qù shì hòu zàng zài le jiā xiāng de shān shàng","After the old man died, he was buried on a hill in his hometown.","Después de que murió el anciano, fue enterrado en el monte de su pueblo natal.","Après la mort du vieil homme, il a été enterré sur la colline de son village natal."],["L7-5203","葬礼","zànglǐ","N","funeral","funeral","funérailles","很多人参加了这位老教授的葬礼。","hěn duō rén cān jiā le zhè wèi lǎo jiào shòu de zàng lǐ","Many people attended the old professor's funeral.","Mucha gente asistió al funeral del viejo profesor.","Beaucoup de gens ont assisté aux funérailles du vieux professeur."],["L7-5204","遭殃","zāoyāng","","to suffer disaster","sufrir una desgracia","subir un malheur","上游的工厂污染了河水，下游的农民跟着遭殃。","shàng yóu de gōng chǎng wū rǎn le hé shuǐ xià yóu de nóng mín gēn zhe zāo yāng","The factory upstream polluted the river, and the farmers downstream suffered for it.","La fábrica río arriba contaminó el agua, y los campesinos río abajo salieron perjudicados.","L'usine en amont a pollué la rivière, et les paysans en aval en ont fait les frais."],["L7-5205","凿","záo","V","chisel; to dig","cincel; cavar","ciseau ; creuser","工人们在石头上凿了一个洞。","gōng rén men zài shí tou shàng záo le yí ge dòng","The workers chiseled a hole in the rock.","Los obreros abrieron un agujero en la roca con un cincel.","Les ouvriers ont percé un trou dans la pierre au burin."],["L7-5206","早年","zǎonián","N","early years; in the past","primeros años; antaño","jeunes années ; autrefois","这位老教授早年在国外留过学。","zhè wèi lǎo jiào shòu zǎo nián zài guó wài liú guo xué","This old professor studied abroad in his early years.","Este viejo profesor estudió en el extranjero en su juventud.","Ce vieux professeur a fait ses études à l'étranger dans sa jeunesse."],["L7-5207","早日","zǎorì","Adv/N","soon; at an early date","pronto; cuanto antes","bientôt ; au plus tôt","希望你早日回到我们身边。","xī wàng nǐ zǎo rì huí dào wǒ men shēn biān","I hope you come back to us soon.","Espero que regreses pronto con nosotros.","J'espère que tu seras bientôt de retour parmi nous."],["L7-5208","枣","zǎo","N","jujube; Chinese date","azufaifa; dátil chino","jujube ; datte chinoise","秋天到了，他把树上的枣打了下来。","qiū tiān dào le tā bǎ shù shàng de zǎo dǎ le xià lái","Autumn came, and he knocked the jujubes down from the tree.","Llegó el otoño y bajó los jujubes del árbol a golpes.","L'automne est venu et il a fait tomber les jujubes de l'arbre en les gaulant."],["L7-5209","造福","zàofú","V","to benefit (people)","beneficiar (a la gente)","faire le bien de ; profiter à","这项工程将造福千家万户。","zhè xiàng gōng chéng jiāng zào fú qiān jiā wàn hù","This project will benefit thousands of households.","Esta obra beneficiará a miles de familias.","Ce chantier profitera à des milliers de foyers."],["L7-5210","造假","zàojiǎ","V","to counterfeit; to fake","falsificar","contrefaire ; falsifier","这家公司因为财务造假被调查了。","zhè jiā gōng sī yīn wèi cái wù zào jiǎ bèi diào chá le","This company was investigated for falsifying its accounts.","Investigaron a esta empresa por falsificar sus cuentas.","Cette entreprise a fait l'objet d'une enquête pour falsification de ses comptes."],["L7-5211","造价","zàojià","N","construction cost","costo de construcción","coût de construction","这座大桥的造价超过了十亿元。","zhè zuò dà qiáo de zào jià chāo guò le shí yì yuán","The construction cost of this bridge exceeded one billion yuan.","El costo de construcción de este puente superó los mil millones de yuanes.","Le coût de construction de ce pont a dépassé le milliard de yuans."],["L7-5212","造就","zàojiù","V/N","to nurture; to bring up","formar; cultivar","former ; façonner","艰苦的环境造就了他坚强的性格。","jiān kǔ de huán jìng zào jiù le tā jiān qiáng de xìng gé","A harsh environment shaped his strong character.","Un entorno duro forjó su carácter fuerte.","Un environnement difficile a forgé son caractère solide."],["L7-5213","造纸术","zàozhǐshù","N","papermaking","fabricación de papel","fabrication du papier","造纸术是东汉时期的蔡伦改进的。","zào zhǐ shù shì dōng hàn shí qī de cài lún gǎi jìn de","Papermaking was improved by Cai Lun in the Eastern Han dynasty.","La fabricación del papel fue perfeccionada por Cai Lun en la dinastía Han Oriental.","La fabrication du papier a été perfectionnée par Cai Lun sous les Han orientaux."],["L7-5214","噪声","zàoshēng","N","noise","ruido","bruit","城市里的交通噪声影响了居民的休息。","chéng shì lǐ de jiāo tōng zào shēng yǐng xiǎng le jū mín de xiū xi","Traffic noise in the city disturbs the residents' rest.","El ruido del tráfico en la ciudad perturba el descanso de los vecinos.","Le bruit de la circulation en ville perturbe le repos des habitants."],["L7-5215","噪音","zàoyīn","N","noise","ruido","bruit","楼上装修的噪音吵得我没法工作。","lóu shàng zhuāng xiū de zào yīn chǎo de wǒ méi fǎ gōng zuò","The noise from the renovation upstairs makes it impossible for me to work.","El ruido de las obras del piso de arriba me impide trabajar.","Le bruit des travaux à l'étage au-dessus m'empêche de travailler."],["L7-5216","则","zé","Conj","then; but","entonces; pero","alors ; mais","物体受热后一般会膨胀，遇冷则会收缩。","wù tǐ shòu rè hòu yì bān huì péng zhàng yù lěng zé huì shōu suō","Objects generally expand when heated and contract when cooled.","Por lo general, los objetos se dilatan con el calor y se contraen con el frío.","En général, les corps se dilatent sous l'effet de la chaleur et se contractent sous l'effet du froid."],["L7-5218","责备","zébèi","V","to blame; to reproach","culpar; reprochar","blâmer ; reprocher","这件事不是你的错，别责备自己了。","zhè jiàn shì bú shì nǐ de cuò bié zé bèi zì jǐ le","This isn't your fault; stop blaming yourself.","Esto no es culpa tuya; deja de culparte.","Ce n'est pas ta faute ; cesse de te blâmer."],["L7-5219","责怪","zéguài","V","to blame; to rebuke","culpar; reprender","reprocher ; blâmer","妈妈没有责怪他，只是让他下次小心。","mā ma méi yǒu zé guài tā zhǐ shì ràng tā xià cì xiǎo xīn","Mom didn't blame him; she just told him to be careful next time.","Mamá no lo regañó; solo le dijo que tuviera cuidado la próxima vez.","Maman ne l'a pas réprimandé ; elle lui a seulement dit de faire attention la prochaine fois."],["L7-5220","贼","zéi","N","thief","ladrón","voleur","警察抓住了一个偷自行车的贼。","jǐng chá zhuā zhù le yí ge tōu zì xíng chē de zéi","The police caught a thief who stole bicycles.","La policía atrapó a un ladrón de bicicletas.","La police a arrêté un voleur de vélos."],["L7-5221","增收","zēngshōu","V","to increase revenue","aumentar los ingresos","augmenter les revenus","新技术帮助农民增收了不少。","xīn jì shù bāng zhù nóng mín zēng shōu le bù shǎo","The new technology has helped farmers increase their income considerably.","La nueva tecnología ha ayudado a los agricultores a aumentar bastante sus ingresos.","La nouvelle technologie a aidé les agriculteurs à augmenter sensiblement leurs revenus."],["L7-5222","增添","zēngtiān","V","to add; to increase","añadir; aumentar","ajouter ; accroître","节日的彩灯为城市增添了不少喜庆气氛。","jié rì de cǎi dēng wèi chéng shì zēng tiān le bù shǎo xǐ qìng qì fēn","The festive lights added a lot of joyful atmosphere to the city.","Las luces de colores de la fiesta le dieron a la ciudad un ambiente festivo.","Les lumières colorées de la fête ont apporté à la ville une belle atmosphère festive."],["L7-5223","扎根","zhāgēn","","to take root","echar raíces","prendre racine","他大学毕业后选择扎根农村，当了一名老师。","tā dà xué bì yè hòu xuǎn zé zhā gēn nóng cūn dāng le yì míng lǎo shī","After graduating from university, he chose to put down roots in the countryside and became a teacher.","Después de graduarse de la universidad, decidió echar raíces en el campo y se hizo maestro.","Après l'université, il a choisi de s'installer durablement à la campagne et est devenu instituteur."],["L7-5224","渣子","zhāzi","N","dregs; scraps","residuos; migajas","résidus ; miettes","面包渣子掉得满桌子都是。","miàn bāo zhā zi diào de mǎn zhuō zi dōu shì","Bread crumbs fell all over the table.","Las migas de pan cayeron por toda la mesa.","Des miettes de pain sont tombées partout sur la table."],["L7-5225","闸","zhá","N","sluice; gate; brake","esclusa; compuerta; freno","écluse ; vanne ; frein","雨季来了，水库打开了闸放水。","yǔ jì lái le shuǐ kù dǎ kāi le zhá fàng shuǐ","The rainy season came, and the reservoir opened its sluice gates to release water.","Llegó la temporada de lluvias y el embalse abrió las compuertas para soltar agua.","La saison des pluies est arrivée et le barrage a ouvert ses vannes pour libérer de l'eau."],["L7-5226","炸","zhá","V","to deep-fry","freír","frire","早上，妈妈在厨房里炸油条。","zǎo shang mā ma zài chú fáng lǐ zhá yóu tiáo","In the morning, Mom is deep-frying dough sticks in the kitchen.","Por la mañana, mamá fríe youtiao en la cocina.","Le matin, maman fait frire des youtiao dans la cuisine."],["L7-5227","眨眼","zhǎyǎn","","to blink; in a flash","parpadear; en un instante","cligner des yeux ; en un clin d'œil","一眨眼的工夫，孩子就跑得没影了。","yì zhǎ yǎn de gōng fu hái zi jiù pǎo de méi yǐng le","In the blink of an eye, the child had run off out of sight.","En un abrir y cerrar de ojos, el niño ya había salido corriendo y se perdió de vista.","En un clin d'œil, l'enfant avait couru et disparu."],["L7-5228","诈骗","zhàpiàn","V","to swindle; to defraud","estafar; defraudar","escroquer ; frauder","警察提醒大家小心电话诈骗。","jǐng chá tí xǐng dà jiā xiǎo xīn diàn huà zhà piàn","The police remind everyone to beware of phone scams.","La policía advierte a todos que tengan cuidado con las estafas telefónicas.","La police met chacun en garde contre les escroqueries par téléphone."],["L7-5229","榨","zhà","V","to press; to squeeze","exprimir; prensar","presser ; extraire","早餐时我习惯喝一杯鲜榨橙汁。","zǎo cān shí wǒ xí guàn hē yì bēi xiān zhà chéng zhī","At breakfast I usually drink a glass of freshly squeezed orange juice.","En el desayuno suelo tomar un vaso de jugo de naranja recién exprimido.","Au petit-déjeuner, j'ai l'habitude de boire un verre de jus d'orange pressé."],["L7-5230","窄","zhǎi","Adj","narrow","estrecho","étroit","这条路太窄了，两辆车没法并排走。","zhè tiáo lù tài zhǎi le liǎng liàng chē méi fǎ bìng pái zǒu","This road is too narrow for two cars to drive side by side.","Esta calle es demasiado estrecha y dos coches no pueden pasar uno al lado del otro.","Cette route est trop étroite pour que deux voitures roulent côte à côte."],["L7-5231","债务","zhàiwù","N","debt","deuda","dette","这家公司欠下了巨额债务。","zhè jiā gōng sī qiàn xià le jù é zhài wù","This company has run up huge debts.","Esta empresa ha contraído deudas enormes.","Cette entreprise a accumulé des dettes colossales."],["L7-5232","占卜","zhānbǔ","V","to divine; fortune-telling","adivinar; adivinación","prédire l'avenir ; divination","古人常用占卜来预测吉凶。","gǔ rén cháng yòng zhān bǔ lái yù cè jí xiōng","Ancient people often used divination to predict good or bad fortune.","Los antiguos solían recurrir a la adivinación para predecir la buena o la mala fortuna.","Les Anciens recouraient souvent à la divination pour prédire les bons ou les mauvais présages."],["L7-5233","沾","zhān","V","to be stained with; to touch","mancharse; tocar","se tacher ; toucher","下过雨后，他的鞋上沾了很多泥。","xià guo yǔ hòu tā de xié shàng zhān le hěn duō ní","After the rain, his shoes were covered in mud.","Después de la lluvia, sus zapatos quedaron llenos de barro.","Après la pluie, ses chaussures étaient couvertes de boue."],["L7-5234","沾光","zhānguāng","","to benefit from association","beneficiarse de alguien","profiter de l'aide de quelqu'un","他哥哥当了老板，他也跟着沾光。","tā gē ge dāng le lǎo bǎn tā yě gēn zhe zhān guāng","His elder brother became a boss, and he benefited from it too.","Su hermano mayor se hizo jefe y él también sale beneficiado.","Son frère aîné est devenu patron, et lui aussi en profite."],["L7-5235","粘","zhān","V","to stick; to paste","pegar; adherir","coller ; adhérer","我用胶水把撕破的书页粘好了。","wǒ yòng jiāo shuǐ bǎ sī pò de shū yè zhān hǎo le","I glued the torn pages back together.","Pegué con pegamento las páginas rotas del libro.","J'ai recollé avec de la colle les pages déchirées du livre."],["L7-5236","瞻仰","zhānyǎng","V","to pay respects to","rendir homenaje a","rendre hommage à","每年都有很多人来这里瞻仰英雄纪念碑。","měi nián dōu yǒu hěn duō rén lái zhè lǐ zhān yǎng yīng xióng jì niàn bēi","Every year many people come here to pay their respects at the heroes' monument.","Cada año mucha gente viene aquí a rendir homenaje al monumento a los héroes.","Chaque année, beaucoup de gens viennent ici se recueillir devant le monument aux héros."],["L7-5237","斩","zhǎn","V","to behead; to chop","decapitar; cortar","décapiter ; trancher","传说中，英雄一剑斩了那条恶龙。","chuán shuō zhōng yīng xióng yí jiàn zhǎn le nà tiáo è lóng","According to legend, the hero slew the evil dragon with one stroke of his sword.","Cuenta la leyenda que el héroe mató al malvado dragón de un solo espadazo.","Selon la légende, le héros a tué le méchant dragon d'un seul coup d'épée."],["L7-5238","斩草除根","zhǎncǎo-chúgēn","","to eradicate completely","erradicar de raíz","extirper jusqu'à la racine","警方继续追查诈骗团伙的幕后主使，力求斩草除根。","jǐng fāng jì xù zhuī chá zhà piàn tuán huǒ de mù hòu zhǔ shǐ lì qiú zhǎn cǎo chú gēn","The police continue to investigate the masterminds behind the fraud ring, aiming to wipe it out completely.","La policía sigue investigando a los cerebros de la banda de estafadores con el fin de erradicarla de raíz.","La police continue d'enquêter sur les cerveaux du réseau d'escrocs afin de l'éradiquer complètement."],["L7-5239","盏","zhǎn","M","(measure word for lamps)","(clasificador de lámparas)","(classificateur de lampes)","夜深了，桌上还点着一盏小灯。","yè shēn le zhuō shàng hái diǎn zhe yì zhǎn xiǎo dēng","It was late at night, and a small lamp was still lit on the table.","Era tarde en la noche y sobre la mesa aún había una lamparita encendida.","La nuit était avancée et une petite lampe brûlait encore sur la table."],["L7-5240","展出","zhǎnchū","V","to exhibit; to be on display","exhibir; estar expuesto","exposer ; être exposé","博物馆正在展出一批古代书画。","bó wù guǎn zhèng zài zhǎn chū yì pī gǔ dài shū huà","The museum is exhibiting a collection of ancient calligraphy and paintings.","El museo exhibe una colección de caligrafías y pinturas antiguas.","Le musée expose une série de calligraphies et de peintures anciennes."],["L7-5241","展览会","zhǎnlǎnhuì","N","exhibition","exposición","exposition","这次汽车展览会吸引了很多观众。","zhè cì qì chē zhǎn lǎn huì xī yǐn le hěn duō guān zhòng","This auto exhibition attracted many visitors.","Esta exposición del automóvil atrajo a mucho público.","Ce salon de l'automobile a attiré beaucoup de visiteurs."],["L7-5242","展望","zhǎnwàng","V","outlook; to look ahead","perspectiva; mirar hacia el futuro","perspective ; envisager l'avenir","新年到了，大家都在展望未来。","xīn nián dào le dà jiā dōu zài zhǎn wàng wèi lái","The New Year has arrived, and everyone is looking ahead to the future.","Llegó el Año Nuevo y todos miran hacia el futuro.","Le Nouvel An est arrivé et chacun se tourne vers l'avenir."],["L7-5243","崭新","zhǎnxīn","Adj","brand new","completamente nuevo","tout neuf","她穿了一身崭新的衣服去参加婚礼。","tā chuān le yì shēn zhǎn xīn de yī fu qù cān jiā hūn lǐ","She wore brand-new clothes to the wedding.","Fue a la boda con ropa completamente nueva.","Elle est allée au mariage dans une tenue flambant neuve."],["L7-5244","占用","zhànyòng","V","to occupy; to take up","ocupar","occuper","对不起，占用了您这么多时间。","duì bu qǐ zhàn yòng le nín zhè me duō shí jiān","Sorry for taking up so much of your time.","Disculpe, le he quitado tanto tiempo.","Excusez-moi de vous avoir pris tant de temps."],["L7-5245","站立","zhànlì","V","to stand","estar de pie","se tenir debout","他站立了好几个小时，腿都酸了。","tā zhàn lì le hǎo jǐ ge xiǎo shí tuǐ dōu suān le","He stood for several hours, and his legs were sore.","Estuvo de pie varias horas y le dolían las piernas.","Il est resté debout plusieurs heures et avait les jambes endolories."],["L7-5246","绽放","zhànfàng","V","to bloom","florecer","s'épanouir","春天到了，公园里的樱花竞相绽放。","chūn tiān dào le gōng yuán lǐ de yīng huā jìng xiāng zhàn fàng","Spring has arrived, and the cherry blossoms in the park are blooming as if competing with one another.","Llegó la primavera y los cerezos del parque florecen a porfía.","Le printemps est là et les cerisiers du parc fleurissent à qui mieux mieux."],["L7-5247","蘸","zhàn","V","to dip (in sauce, ink)","mojar; untar","tremper","吃饺子的时候，他喜欢蘸醋。","chī jiǎo zi de shí hou tā xǐ huan zhàn cù","When eating dumplings, he likes to dip them in vinegar.","Cuando come dumplings, le gusta mojarlos en vinagre.","Quand il mange des raviolis, il aime les tremper dans du vinaigre."],["L7-5248","张灯结彩","zhāngdēng-jiécǎi","","decorated with lanterns","adornado con farolillos","décoré de lanternes","春节前，家家户户都张灯结彩。","chūn jié qián jiā jiā hù hù dōu zhāng dēng jié cǎi","Before the Spring Festival, every household is decorated with lanterns and streamers.","Antes del Festival de Primavera, todas las casas se adornan con faroles y cintas.","Avant la fête du Printemps, toutes les maisons sont décorées de lanternes et de guirlandes."],["L7-5249","张贴","zhāngtiē","V","to post (a notice)","pegar (un aviso)","afficher","请不要在墙上随意张贴广告。","qǐng bú yào zài qiáng shàng suí yì zhāng tiē guǎng gào","Please don't post advertisements on the walls at will.","Por favor, no pegue anuncios en la pared a su antojo.","Veuillez ne pas coller de publicités sur les murs n'importe comment."],["L7-5250","张扬","zhāngyáng","V","Zhang Yang (director); to make public","Zhang Yang (director); divulgar","Zhang Yang (réalisateur) ; ébruiter","他不想让别人知道自己获奖的事，所以没有张扬。","tā bù xiǎng ràng bié rén zhī dào zì jǐ huò jiǎng de shì suǒ yǐ méi yǒu zhāng yáng","He didn't want others to know he had won an award, so he didn't make it public.","No quería que los demás supieran que había ganado un premio, así que no lo divulgó.","Il ne voulait pas que les autres sachent qu'il avait reçu un prix, alors il n'en a rien ébruité."],["L7-5251","长辈","zhǎngbèi","N","elders; older generation","mayores; generación anterior","aînés ; génération précédente","在长辈面前，他说话收敛了很多。","zài zhǎng bèi miàn qián tā shuō huà shōu liǎn le hěn duō","In front of his elders, he is much more restrained in what he says.","Delante de los mayores, se contiene mucho más al hablar.","Devant les aînés, il se retient beaucoup plus dans ses propos."],["L7-5252","长相","zhǎngxiàng","N","looks; appearance","aspecto; apariencia","apparence ; physique","这对兄弟长相差别很大。","zhè duì xiōng dì zhǎng xiàng chā bié hěn dà","These two brothers look very different.","Estos dos hermanos son muy diferentes físicamente.","Ces deux frères ne se ressemblent pas du tout."],["L7-5253","掌管","zhǎngguǎn","V","to be in charge of","estar a cargo de","diriger ; être en charge de","家里的钱一直由妈妈掌管。","jiā lǐ de qián yì zhí yóu mā ma zhǎng guǎn","Mom has always been in charge of the family's money.","El dinero de la casa siempre lo ha administrado mamá.","C'est toujours maman qui gère l'argent de la famille."],["L7-5254","帐篷","zhàngpeng","N","tent","tienda de campaña","tente","地震灾区急需帐篷、食品和药品。","dì zhèn zāi qū jí xū zhàng peng shí pǐn hé yào pǐn","The earthquake zone urgently needs tents, food, and medicine.","La zona del terremoto necesita con urgencia tiendas de campaña, alimentos y medicinas.","La zone sinistrée par le séisme a un besoin urgent de tentes, de nourriture et de médicaments."],["L7-5255","帐子","zhàngzi","N","mosquito net","mosquitero","moustiquaire","夏天睡觉前，奶奶总要放下帐子。","xià tiān shuì jiào qián nǎi nai zǒng yào fàng xià zhàng zi","In summer, Grandma always lowers the mosquito net before going to bed.","En verano, antes de dormir, la abuela siempre baja el mosquitero.","En été, avant de se coucher, grand-mère baisse toujours la moustiquaire."],["L7-5256","账单","zhàngdān","N","bill; invoice","cuenta; factura","facture ; addition","这个月的电话账单比上个月多了一百块。","zhè ge yuè de diàn huà zhàng dān bǐ shàng ge yuè duō le yì bǎi kuài","This month's phone bill is a hundred yuan more than last month's.","La factura del teléfono de este mes es cien yuanes más que la del mes pasado.","La facture de téléphone de ce mois est supérieure de cent yuans à celle du mois dernier."],["L7-5257","账号","zhànghào","N","account; username","cuenta; nombre de usuario","compte ; identifiant","请输入你的账号和密码。","qǐng shū rù nǐ de zhàng hào hé mì mǎ","Please enter your account name and password.","Por favor, ingresa tu cuenta y tu contraseña.","Veuillez saisir votre identifiant et votre mot de passe."],["L7-5258","胀","zhàng","V","to swell; bloated","hincharse; abotargado","gonfler ; ballonné","他吃了太多，肚子有点儿胀。","tā chī le tài duō dù zi yǒu diǎnr zhàng","He ate too much, and his stomach feels a bit bloated.","Comió demasiado y tiene el estómago un poco hinchado.","Il a trop mangé et a le ventre un peu ballonné."],["L7-5259","招标","zhāobiāo","","to invite bids","licitar; convocar licitación","lancer un appel d'offres","政府正在为这个工程公开招标。","zhèng fǔ zhèng zài wèi zhè ge gōng chéng gōng kāi zhāo biāo","The government is inviting public bids for this project.","El gobierno está abriendo una licitación pública para esta obra.","Le gouvernement lance un appel d'offres public pour ce chantier."],["L7-5260","招待","zhāodài","V","to entertain; to host","atender; recibir","recevoir ; accueillir","他热情地招待了远道而来的客人。","tā rè qíng de zhāo dài le yuǎn dào ér lái de kè rén","He warmly entertained the guests who had come from afar.","Atendió con calidez a los invitados que habían venido de lejos.","Il a chaleureusement reçu les invités venus de loin."],["L7-5261","招待会","zhāodàihuì","N","reception","recepción","réception","大使馆举行了一场新年招待会。","dà shǐ guǎn jǔ xíng le yì chǎng xīn nián zhāo dài huì","The embassy held a New Year reception.","La embajada ofreció una recepción de Año Nuevo.","L'ambassade a donné une réception pour le Nouvel An."],["L7-5262","招揽","zhāolǎn","V","to solicit; to attract (customers)","atraer (clientes)","attirer (des clients)","这家店打折是为了招揽顾客。","zhè jiā diàn dǎ zhé shì wèi le zhāo lǎn gù kè","This shop is offering discounts to attract customers.","Esta tienda hace descuentos para atraer clientes.","Cette boutique fait des soldes pour attirer les clients."],["L7-5263","招募","zhāomù","V","to recruit","reclutar","recruter","这次活动招募了一百名志愿者。","zhè cì huó dòng zhāo mù le yì bǎi míng zhì yuàn zhě","This event recruited a hundred volunteers.","Para este evento se reclutó a cien voluntarios.","Cet événement a recruté une centaine de bénévoles."],["L7-5264","招牌","zhāopai","N","shop sign; reputation","letrero; reputación","enseigne ; réputation","这家老店的招牌已经挂了一百多年了。","zhè jiā lǎo diàn de zhāo pai yǐ jīng guà le yì bǎi duō nián le","This old shop's signboard has been hanging for more than a hundred years.","El letrero de esta antigua tienda lleva colgado más de cien años.","L'enseigne de cette vieille boutique est accrochée depuis plus de cent ans."],["L7-5265","招收","zhāoshōu","V","to enroll; to recruit","admitir; reclutar","recruter ; admettre","这所大学今年招收了五千名新生。","zhè suǒ dà xué jīn nián zhāo shōu le wǔ qiān míng xīn shēng","This university admitted five thousand new students this year.","Esta universidad admitió este año a cinco mil estudiantes de nuevo ingreso.","Cette université a admis cinq mille nouveaux étudiants cette année."],["L7-5266","招数","zhāoshù","N","move; trick","jugada; truco","coup ; astuce","骗子的招数越来越多，大家要小心。","piàn zi de zhāo shù yuè lái yuè duō dà jiā yào xiǎo xīn","Swindlers have more and more tricks, so everyone should be careful.","Los estafadores tienen cada vez más trucos; hay que tener cuidado.","Les escrocs ont de plus en plus de ruses ; il faut être prudent."],["L7-5267","朝气蓬勃","zhāoqì-péngbó","","full of youthful vigor","lleno de vitalidad","plein d'énergie juvénile","校园里到处是朝气蓬勃的年轻人。","xiào yuán lǐ dào chù shì zhāo qì péng bó de nián qīng rén","The campus is full of young people brimming with energy.","El campus está lleno de jóvenes rebosantes de energía.","Le campus est plein de jeunes pleins d'entrain."],["L7-5268","朝三暮四","zhāosān-mùsì","","fickle; to keep changing one's mind","veleidoso; cambiar de opinión","inconstant ; changer d'avis sans cesse","他做事朝三暮四，没有一件能坚持下来。","tā zuò shì zhāo sān mù sì méi yǒu yí jiàn néng jiān chí xià lái","He keeps changing his mind and never sticks with anything.","Es muy inconstante en lo que hace y no ha terminado nada.","Il est girouette dans tout ce qu'il fait et n'a rien mené à terme."],["L7-5269","朝夕相处","zhāoxī-xiāngchǔ","","to spend every day together","pasar todos los días juntos","passer ses journées ensemble","同事们朝夕相处，彼此都很了解。","tóng shì men zhāo xī xiāng chǔ bǐ cǐ dōu hěn liǎo jiě","The colleagues spend every day together and know each other well.","Los colegas conviven todos los días y se conocen muy bien.","Les collègues se côtoient du matin au soir et se connaissent bien."],["L7-5270","着迷","zháomí","","to be fascinated","estar fascinado","être fasciné","孩子们对这个故事很着迷，一直听到最后。","hái zi men duì zhè ge gù shi hěn zháo mí yì zhí tīng dào zuì hòu","The children were fascinated by this story and listened to the very end.","Los niños quedaron fascinados con este cuento y lo escucharon hasta el final.","Les enfants étaient fascinés par cette histoire et l'ont écoutée jusqu'au bout."],["L7-5271","沼泽","zhǎozé","N","swamp; marsh","pantano; ciénaga","marais ; marécage","这片沼泽里生活着很多种鸟。","zhè piàn zhǎo zé lǐ shēng huó zhe hěn duō zhǒng niǎo","Many kinds of birds live in this marsh.","En este pantano viven muchas especies de aves.","De nombreuses espèces d'oiseaux vivent dans ce marais."],["L7-5272","召集","zhàojí","V","to convene; to summon","convocar; reunir","convoquer ; réunir","经理召集大家开了一个紧急会议。","jīng lǐ zhào jí dà jiā kāi le yí ge jǐn jí huì yì","The manager called everyone together for an emergency meeting.","El gerente reunió a todos para una reunión de emergencia.","Le directeur a rassemblé tout le monde pour une réunion d'urgence."],["L7-5273","兆头","zhàotou","N","omen; sign","presagio; señal","présage ; signe","老人们说，下雪是丰收的好兆头。","lǎo rén men shuō xià xuě shì fēng shōu de hǎo zhào tou","The old folks say that snow is a good omen for a bumper harvest.","Los ancianos dicen que la nieve es buen augurio de una abundante cosecha.","Les anciens disent que la neige est un bon présage de récolte abondante."],["L7-5274","照办","zhàobàn","","to do as instructed","hacer según lo indicado","faire comme demandé","你说怎么做，我就怎么照办。","nǐ shuō zěn me zuò wǒ jiù zěn me zhào bàn","I'll do whatever you say.","Haré lo que tú digas.","Je ferai comme tu me diras."],["L7-5275","照常","zhàocháng","V/Adv","as usual","como de costumbre","comme d'habitude","虽然下着大雨，商店还是照常营业。","suī rán xià zhe dà yǔ shāng diàn hái shi zhào cháng yíng yè","Although it was raining heavily, the shops were open as usual.","Aunque llovía a cántaros, las tiendas abrieron como de costumbre.","Bien qu'il pleuve à verse, les magasins ont ouvert comme d'habitude."],["L7-5276","照例","zhàolì","Adv","as usual; as a rule","como de costumbre; por regla","comme d'habitude ; en règle générale","每天晚饭后，爷爷照例要出去散步。","měi tiān wǎn fàn hòu yé ye zhào lì yào chū qù sàn bù","After dinner every day, Grandpa goes out for a walk as usual.","Después de la cena de cada día, el abuelo sale a caminar, como de costumbre.","Chaque jour après le dîner, grand-père sort se promener comme d'habitude."],["L7-5277","照料","zhàoliào","V","to take care of","cuidar","s'occuper de","她辞了工作，在家照料生病的母亲。","tā cí le gōng zuò zài jiā zhào liào shēng bìng de mǔ qīn","She quit her job to look after her sick mother at home.","Dejó su trabajo para cuidar en casa a su madre enferma.","Elle a quitté son emploi pour s'occuper à la maison de sa mère malade."],["L7-5278","照明","zhàomíng","V","lighting; to illuminate","iluminación; iluminar","éclairage ; éclairer","地下室的照明不太好，有点儿暗。","dì xià shì de zhào míng bú tài hǎo yǒu diǎnr àn","The lighting in the basement isn't very good; it's a bit dark.","La iluminación del sótano no es muy buena; está un poco oscuro.","L'éclairage du sous-sol n'est pas très bon ; il y fait un peu sombre."],["L7-5279","罩","zhào","V/N","cover; to cover","cubierta; cubrir","couvercle ; couvrir","妈妈用一个盖子把菜罩了起来，免得落灰。","mā ma yòng yí ge gài zi bǎ cài zhào le qǐ lái miǎn de luò huī","Mom covered the food with a lid to keep dust off.","Mamá cubrió la comida con una tapa para que no se llenara de polvo.","Maman a recouvert les plats d'un couvercle pour éviter la poussière."],["L7-5280","肇事","zhàoshì","V","to cause an accident","causar un accidente","causer un accident","肇事司机已经被警察抓到了。","zhào shì sī jī yǐ jīng bèi jǐng chá zhuā dào le","The driver who caused the accident has been caught by the police.","La policía ya atrapó al conductor que causó el accidente.","Le conducteur responsable de l'accident a été arrêté par la police."],["L7-5281","折腾","zhēteng","V","to toss and turn; to mess around","dar vueltas; hacer sufrir","se retourner ; tourmenter","他折腾了一个晚上，终于把电脑修好了。","tā zhē teng le yí ge wǎn shang zhōng yú bǎ diàn nǎo xiū hǎo le","He fiddled with it all night and finally fixed the computer.","Se pasó toda la noche trasteando y por fin logró arreglar la computadora.","Il a bricolé toute la nuit et a fini par réparer l'ordinateur."],["L7-5282","遮","zhē","V","to cover; to block","cubrir; tapar","couvrir ; cacher","高大的树木遮着阳光，树下很凉快。","gāo dà de shù mù zhē zhe yáng guāng shù xià hěn liáng kuai","The tall trees block out the sunlight, so it's cool underneath.","Los árboles altos tapan el sol y bajo ellos hace fresco.","Les grands arbres font écran au soleil, et il fait frais en dessous."],["L7-5283","遮盖","zhēgài","V","to cover; to hide","cubrir; ocultar","couvrir ; dissimuler","她用围巾遮盖住了脖子上的伤疤。","tā yòng wéi jīn zhē gài zhù le bó zi shàng de shāng bā","She covered the scar on her neck with a scarf.","Se cubrió con una bufanda la cicatriz del cuello.","Elle a caché avec une écharpe la cicatrice qu'elle avait au cou."],["L7-5284","折叠","zhédié","V","to fold; foldable","doblar; plegable","plier ; pliable","这把椅子可以折叠，不用的时候很省地方。","zhè bǎ yǐ zi kě yǐ zhé dié bú yòng de shí hou hěn shěng dì fang","This chair folds up and takes little space when not in use.","Esta silla es plegable y ocupa muy poco espacio cuando no se usa.","Cette chaise est pliable et prend peu de place quand on ne s'en sert pas."],["L7-5285","折合","zhéhé","V","to convert into; to amount to","equivaler a; convertir en","équivaloir à ; convertir en","一百美元折合人民币大约七百元。","yì bǎi měi yuán zhé hé rén mín bì dà yuē qī bǎi yuán","One hundred US dollars is equivalent to about seven hundred yuan.","Cien dólares estadounidenses equivalen a unos setecientos yuanes.","Cent dollars américains équivalent à environ sept cents yuans."],["L7-5286","折扣","zhékòu","N","discount","descuento","remise","这家店给老顾客的折扣很大。","zhè jiā diàn gěi lǎo gù kè de zhé kòu hěn dà","This shop gives regular customers big discounts.","Esta tienda hace grandes descuentos a los clientes habituales.","Cette boutique fait de gros rabais à ses clients fidèles."],["L7-5287","折磨","zhémó","V","to torment; to torture","atormentar; torturar","tourmenter ; torturer","这场病折磨了他好几年。","zhè chǎng bìng zhé mó le tā hǎo jǐ nián","This illness tormented him for several years.","Esta enfermedad lo atormentó durante varios años.","Cette maladie l'a tourmenté pendant plusieurs années."],["L7-5288","折射","zhéshè","V","to refract; refraction","refractar; refracción","réfracter ; réfraction","这部小说通过主人公的遭遇，折射出一个时代的动荡与变迁。","zhè bù xiǎo shuō tōng guò zhǔ rén gōng de zāo yù zhé shè chū yí ge shí dài de dòng dàng yǔ biàn qiān","Through its protagonist's experiences, this novel reflects the upheavals and changes of an era.","A través de las vivencias del protagonista, esta novela refleja las turbulencias y transformaciones de una época.","À travers le parcours de son héros, ce roman reflète les troubles et les mutations d'une époque."],["L7-5289","这会儿","zhèhuìr","Pron","right now; at this moment","ahora mismo; en este momento","en ce moment","这会儿他应该已经到家了。","zhè huìr tā yīng gāi yǐ jīng dào jiā le","He should be home by now.","A estas horas ya debe de haber llegado a casa.","À l'heure qu'il est, il devrait déjà être rentré."],["L7-5290","这样一来","zhèyàng-yīlái","","in that case; thus","así pues; de este modo","ainsi ; dans ce cas","这样一来，我们就能提前完成任务了。","zhè yàng yì lái wǒ men jiù néng tí qián wán chéng rèn wu le","That way, we can finish the task ahead of schedule.","De esta manera, podremos terminar la tarea antes de lo previsto.","Ainsi, nous pourrons terminer la tâche en avance."],["L7-5291","针锋相对","zhēnfēng-xiāngduì","","tit for tat; directly opposed","ojo por ojo; frontalmente opuesto","riposte du tac au tac ; en opposition frontale","面对冷嘲热讽，她没有针锋相对，而是平静地说明了自己的立场。","miàn duì lěng cháo rè fěng tā méi yǒu zhēn fēng xiāng duì ér shì píng jìng de shuō míng le zì jǐ de lì chǎng","Faced with sneers and sarcasm, she calmly explained her position instead of responding confrontationally.","Ante las burlas y la ironía, ella no respondió con confrontación, sino que explicó con calma su postura.","Face aux sarcasmes et aux railleries, elle n'a pas riposté du tac au tac, mais a expliqué calmement sa position."],["L7-5292","针灸","zhēnjiǔ","N","acupuncture and moxibustion","acupuntura y moxibustión","acupuncture et moxibustion","他的腰疼是靠针灸治好的。","tā de yāo téng shì kào zhēn jiǔ zhì hǎo de","His back pain was cured by acupuncture.","Su dolor de espalda se curó con acupuntura.","Son mal de dos a été guéri par l'acupuncture."],["L7-5293","侦察","zhēnchá","V","to scout; to investigate","reconocer; investigar","reconnaître ; enquêter","部队派人悄悄地去侦察敌人的阵地。","bù duì pài rén qiāo qiāo de qù zhēn chá dí rén de zhèn dì","The unit secretly sent people to scout the enemy position.","La tropa envió discretamente a algunos hombres a reconocer la posición del enemigo.","La troupe a envoyé discrètement des hommes reconnaître la position de l'ennemi."],["L7-5294","珍藏","zhēncáng","V/N","to treasure; prized collection","atesorar; colección valiosa","conserver précieusement ; collection précieuse","这些老照片他一直珍藏着。","zhè xiē lǎo zhào piàn tā yì zhí zhēn cáng zhe","He has always treasured these old photos.","Siempre ha conservado con cariño estas fotos antiguas.","Il a toujours précieusement conservé ces vieilles photos."],["L7-5295","珍视","zhēnshì","V","to cherish; to treasure","valorar; apreciar","chérir ; tenir à","我们要珍视来之不易的和平。","wǒ men yào zhēn shì lái zhī bú yì de hé píng","We must cherish the hard-won peace.","Debemos valorar la paz que tanto costó conseguir.","Nous devons chérir la paix si durement acquise."],["L7-5296","珍重","zhēnzhòng","V","to take care; precious","cuidarse; precioso","prendre soin de soi ; précieux","分别的时候，他们互相说了声“珍重”。","fēn bié de shí hou tā men hù xiāng shuō le shēng zhēn zhòng","When parting, they said \"take care\" to each other.","Al despedirse, se dijeron el uno al otro: «Cuídate».","En se quittant, ils se sont dit l'un à l'autre : « Prends soin de toi. »"],["L7-5297","真假","zhēnjiǎ","N","true or false; authenticity","verdadero o falso; autenticidad","vrai ou faux ; authenticité","专家用仪器鉴别这幅画的真假。","zhuān jiā yòng yí qì jiàn bié zhè fú huà de zhēn jiǎ","Experts used instruments to determine whether this painting is genuine.","Los expertos usaron instrumentos para determinar si este cuadro es auténtico o falso.","Les experts ont utilisé des instruments pour distinguer l'authenticité de ce tableau."],["L7-5298","真空","zhēnkōng","N","vacuum","vacío","vide","这些食品采用真空包装，可以保存很久。","zhè xiē shí pǐn cǎi yòng zhēn kōng bāo zhuāng kě yǐ bǎo cún hěn jiǔ","These foods are vacuum-packed and can be kept for a long time.","Estos alimentos están envasados al vacío y se pueden conservar mucho tiempo.","Ces aliments sont emballés sous vide et peuvent se conserver longtemps."],["L7-5299","真情","zhēnqíng","N","true feelings; the truth","sentimientos sinceros; la verdad","sentiments sincères ; vérité","这封信里流露出了他的真情。","zhè fēng xìn lǐ liú lù chū le tā de zhēn qíng","This letter reveals his true feelings.","Esta carta deja ver sus sentimientos sinceros.","Cette lettre laisse transparaître ses sentiments sincères."],["L7-5300","真是的","zhēnshide","","Honestly!; Really!","¡Vaya!; ¡Qué fastidio!","Franchement !","你看你，又把衣服弄脏了，真是的！","nǐ kàn nǐ yòu bǎ yī fu nòng zāng le zhēn shi de","Look at you, you've gotten your clothes dirty again, honestly!","¡Mira nada más, otra vez ensuciaste la ropa, de verdad!","Regarde-moi ça, tu as encore sali tes vêtements, franchement !"],["L7-5301","真心","zhēnxīn","N","sincere; heartfelt","sincero; de corazón","sincère ; de tout cœur","相信我，我是真心想帮助你的。","xiāng xìn wǒ wǒ shì zhēn xīn xiǎng bāng zhù nǐ de","Believe me, I sincerely want to help you.","Créeme, de verdad quiero ayudarte.","Crois-moi, je veux vraiment t'aider."],["L7-5302","真挚","zhēnzhì","Adj","sincere; heartfelt","sincero; cordial","sincère ; cordial","他们之间有着真挚的友谊。","tā men zhī jiān yǒu zhe zhēn zhì de yǒu yì","There is a sincere friendship between them.","Entre ellos hay una amistad sincera.","Une amitié sincère les unit."],["L7-5303","诊所","zhěnsuǒ","N","clinic","clínica","clinique","他在小区里开了一家牙科诊所。","tā zài xiǎo qū lǐ kāi le yì jiā yá kē zhěn suǒ","He opened a dental clinic in the neighborhood.","Abrió un consultorio dental en la colonia.","Il a ouvert un cabinet dentaire dans le quartier."],["L7-5304","枕头","zhěntou","N","pillow","almohada","oreiller","这个枕头太高了，我睡不惯。","zhè ge zhěn tou tài gāo le wǒ shuì bú guàn","This pillow is too high; I can't get used to sleeping on it.","Esta almohada es demasiado alta; no me acostumbro a dormir con ella.","Cet oreiller est trop haut ; je n'arrive pas à m'habituer à dormir dessus."],["L7-5305","阵容","zhènróng","N","lineup; formation","alineación; formación","composition ; formation","这部电影的阵容非常强大，有好几位明星。","zhè bù diàn yǐng de zhèn róng fēi cháng qiáng dà yǒu hǎo jǐ wèi míng xīng","This film has a very strong lineup, with several stars.","El reparto de esta película es muy potente, con varias estrellas.","Ce film a une distribution très impressionnante, avec plusieurs stars."],["L7-5306","阵营","zhènyíng","N","camp; faction","bando; facción","camp ; faction","两个阵营的球迷在场外吵了起来。","liǎng gè zhèn yíng de qiú mí zài chǎng wài chǎo le qǐ lái","Fans from the two camps started arguing outside the stadium.","Los aficionados de los dos bandos empezaron a discutir fuera del estadio.","Les supporters des deux camps se sont mis à se disputer à l'extérieur du stade."],["L7-5307","振奋","zhènfèn","Adj/V","to inspire; to rouse","animar; entusiasmar","stimuler ; galvaniser","这个好消息让全村人都很振奋。","zhè ge hǎo xiāo xi ràng quán cūn rén dōu hěn zhèn fèn","This good news greatly heartened the whole village.","Esta buena noticia animó mucho a todo el pueblo.","Cette bonne nouvelle a beaucoup stimulé tout le village."],["L7-5308","振兴","zhènxīng","V","to revitalize; to revive","revitalizar; reactivar","revitaliser ; relancer","政府出台了振兴乡村经济的政策。","zhèng fǔ chū tái le zhèn xīng xiāng cūn jīng jì de zhèng cè","The government introduced policies to revitalize the rural economy.","El gobierno promulgó políticas para revitalizar la economía rural.","Le gouvernement a adopté des politiques pour redynamiser l'économie rurale."],["L7-5309","振作","zhènzuò","Adj/V","to cheer up; to pull oneself together","animarse; recomponerse","se ressaisir ; reprendre courage","别难过了，振作起来，明年再考。","bié nán guò le zhèn zuò qǐ lái míng nián zài kǎo","Don't be sad; pull yourself together and take the exam again next year.","No estés triste, anímate y vuelve a presentar el examen el año que viene.","Ne sois pas triste, reprends-toi et repasse l'examen l'an prochain."],["L7-5310","震","zhèn","V","to shake; to jolt","sacudir; estremecer","secouer ; ébranler","他气得一拳打在桌子上，杯子都震倒了。","tā qì de yì quán dǎ zài zhuō zi shàng bēi zi dōu zhèn dǎo le","He was so angry he slammed his fist on the table, knocking over the cups.","Estaba tan furioso que dio un puñetazo en la mesa y tiró los vasos.","Il était si en colère qu'il a donné un coup de poing sur la table et renversé les verres."],["L7-5311","震动","zhèndòng","V","to vibrate; to shock","vibrar; conmocionar","vibrer ; choquer","地震的时候，整栋楼都在震动。","dì zhèn de shí hou zhěng dòng lóu dōu zài zhèn dòng","During the earthquake, the whole building was shaking.","Durante el terremoto, todo el edificio se sacudía.","Pendant le séisme, tout l'immeuble tremblait."],["L7-5312","震撼","zhènhàn","V","to shake; to stun","estremecer; impactar","ébranler ; bouleverser","这部纪录片的画面非常震撼。","zhè bù jì lù piàn de huà miàn fēi cháng zhèn hàn","The images in this documentary are very powerful.","Las imágenes de este documental son impresionantes.","Les images de ce documentaire sont saisissantes."],["L7-5313","镇定","zhèndìng","Adj/V","calm; composed","tranquilo; sereno","calme ; posé","旅途中遭遇变故时，保持镇定比一味抱怨更有助于找到出路。","lǚ tú zhōng zāo yù biàn gù shí bǎo chí zhèn dìng bǐ yí wèi bào yuàn gèng yǒu zhù yú zhǎo dào chū lù","When something unexpected happens during a journey, staying calm is more helpful in finding a way forward than merely complaining.","Cuando surge un imprevisto durante un viaje, mantener la calma ayuda más a encontrar una salida que limitarse a quejarse.","Quand un imprévu survient en voyage, garder son calme aide davantage à trouver une issue que de se plaindre sans cesse."],["L7-5314","争吵","zhēngchǎo","V","to quarrel","discutir; pelear","se disputer","邻居家又传来了争吵声。","lín jū jiā yòu chuán lái le zhēng chǎo shēng","The sound of quarreling came from the neighbors' house again.","De la casa de los vecinos volvieron a oírse discusiones.","Des bruits de dispute sont de nouveau venus de chez les voisins."],["L7-5315","争端","zhēngduān","N","dispute; conflict","disputa; conflicto","litige ; conflit","两国通过谈判解决了边界争端。","liǎng guó tōng guò tán pàn jiě jué le biān jiè zhēng duān","The two countries resolved their border dispute through negotiations.","Los dos países resolvieron la disputa fronteriza mediante negociaciones.","Les deux pays ont réglé leur différend frontalier par la négociation."],["L7-5316","争分夺秒","zhēngfēn-duómiǎo","","to race against time","correr contra el tiempo","lutter contre la montre","为了救人，医生们争分夺秒地进行手术。","wèi le jiù rén yī shēng men zhēng fēn duó miǎo de jìn xíng shǒu shù","To save the patient, the doctors raced against the clock to operate.","Para salvar al paciente, los médicos operaron luchando contra el reloj.","Pour sauver le patient, les médecins ont opéré en luttant contre la montre."],["L7-5317","争光","zhēngguāng","","to win honor","ganar honor","faire honneur","运动员们在比赛中为国争光。","yùn dòng yuán men zài bǐ sài zhōng wèi guó zhēng guāng","The athletes won glory for their country in the competition.","Los deportistas dieron gloria a su país en la competencia.","Les athlètes ont fait honneur à leur pays pendant la compétition."],["L7-5318","争气","zhēngqì","","to make one proud; to strive hard","esforzarse; dar la talla","se montrer à la hauteur","这孩子真争气，考上了最好的大学。","zhè hái zi zhēn zhēng qì kǎo shàng le zuì hǎo de dà xué","This child has really made his family proud by getting into the best university.","Este niño sí que da orgullo: entró a la mejor universidad.","Cet enfant fait vraiment honneur à sa famille : il est entré dans la meilleure université."],["L7-5319","争先恐后","zhēngxiān-kǒnghòu","","to scramble to be first","competir por ser el primero","se disputer la première place","下课铃一响，孩子们争先恐后地跑出了教室。","xià kè líng yì xiǎng hái zi men zhēng xiān kǒng hòu de pǎo chū le jiào shì","As soon as the bell rang, the children scrambled out of the classroom.","En cuanto sonó el timbre, los niños salieron del salón a la carrera, a ver quién llegaba primero.","Dès que la sonnerie a retenti, les enfants se sont précipités hors de la classe à qui mieux mieux."],["L7-5320","争执","zhēngzhí","V","to dispute; to argue","disputar; discutir","se quereller ; discuter","为了一点儿小事，两个人争执了半天。","wèi le yì diǎnr xiǎo shì liǎng gè rén zhēng zhí le bàn tiān","The two argued for a long time over a trifle.","Por una pequeñez, los dos discutieron un buen rato.","Pour une broutille, les deux ont discuté longuement."],["L7-5321","征","zhēng","V","expedition; to levy","expedición; recaudar","expédition ; lever","国家要征一部分土地修建机场。","guó jiā yào zhēng yí bù fen tǔ dì xiū jiàn jī chǎng","The state is going to requisition some land to build an airport.","El Estado va a expropiar parte de los terrenos para construir un aeropuerto.","L'État va réquisitionner une partie des terres pour construire un aéroport."],["L7-5322","征集","zhēngjí","V","to collect; to recruit","recopilar; reclutar","collecter ; recruter","博物馆正在向社会征集老照片。","bó wù guǎn zhèng zài xiàng shè huì zhēng jí lǎo zhào piàn","The museum is collecting old photos from the public.","El museo está recopilando fotografías antiguas entre el público.","Le musée collecte de vieilles photos auprès du public."],["L7-5323","征收","zhēngshōu","V","to levy (tax)","recaudar (impuestos)","prélever (des impôts)","政府决定对这类商品征收更高的税。","zhèng fǔ jué dìng duì zhè lèi shāng pǐn zhēng shōu gèng gāo de shuì","The government decided to levy higher taxes on this kind of goods.","El gobierno decidió imponer impuestos más altos a este tipo de productos.","Le gouvernement a décidé de prélever des taxes plus élevées sur ce type de marchandises."],["L7-5324","挣扎","zhēngzhá","V","to struggle","forcejear; luchar","se débattre","一只小鸟被网缠住了，正在拼命挣扎。","yì zhī xiǎo niǎo bèi wǎng chán zhù le zhèng zài pīn mìng zhēng zhá","A little bird got caught in a net and is struggling desperately.","Un pajarito quedó atrapado en una red y forcejea desesperadamente.","Un petit oiseau s'est pris dans un filet et se débat désespérément."],["L7-5325","症结","zhēngjié","N","crux; root of the problem","quid; raíz del problema","nœud du problème","找到问题的症结，才能对症下药。","zhǎo dào wèn tí de zhēng jié cái néng duì zhèng xià yào","Only by finding the crux of the problem can you prescribe the right remedy.","Solo encontrando el origen del problema se puede aplicar el remedio adecuado.","Ce n'est qu'en trouvant le nœud du problème qu'on peut y apporter le bon remède."],["L7-5326","睁","zhēng","V","to open (one's eyes)","abrir (los ojos)","ouvrir (les yeux)","他太困了，眼睛都睁不开了。","tā tài kùn le yǎn jing dōu zhēng bù kāi le","He was so sleepy he couldn't keep his eyes open.","Tenía tanto sueño que no podía mantener los ojos abiertos.","Il avait tellement sommeil qu'il n'arrivait plus à garder les yeux ouverts."],["L7-5327","蒸","zhēng","V","to steam","cocinar al vapor","cuire à la vapeur","妈妈在锅里蒸了一笼包子。","mā ma zài guō lǐ zhēng le yì lóng bāo zi","Mom steamed a basket of buns in the pot.","Mamá coció al vapor una vaporera de baozi en la olla.","Maman a fait cuire à la vapeur un panier de brioches dans la marmite."],["L7-5328","拯救","zhěngjiù","V","to save; to rescue","salvar; rescatar","sauver","这位医生拯救了无数病人的生命。","zhè wèi yī shēng zhěng jiù le wú shù bìng rén de shēng mìng","This doctor has saved countless patients' lives.","Este médico ha salvado la vida de innumerables pacientes.","Ce médecin a sauvé la vie d'innombrables patients."],["L7-5329","整合","zhěnghé","V","to integrate","integrar","intégrer","当地把零散的农产品整合起来销售，逐步形成了稳定的供应链。","dāng dì bǎ líng sǎn de nóng chǎn pǐn zhěng hé qǐ lái xiāo shòu zhú bù xíng chéng le wěn dìng de gōng yìng liàn","The area consolidated scattered supplies of farm produce for sale and gradually established a stable supply chain.","La localidad reunió los productos agrícolas dispersos para venderlos y fue formando poco a poco una cadena de suministro estable.","La localité a regroupé les produits agricoles dispersés pour les vendre et a progressivement mis en place une chaîne d'approvisionnement stable."],["L7-5330","整洁","zhěngjié","Adj","neat; tidy","ordenado; pulcro","net ; propre","参加面试时，穿着要整洁得体。","cān jiā miàn shì shí chuān zhuó yào zhěng jié dé tǐ","When going to a job interview, your attire should be neat and appropriate.","Al ir a una entrevista de trabajo, la ropa debe ser pulcra y apropiada.","Pour un entretien d'embauche, la tenue doit être soignée et convenable."],["L7-5331","整数","zhěngshù","N","integer; round number","número entero; cifra redonda","nombre entier ; chiffre rond","数学课上，老师说三点五不是整数。","shù xué kè shàng lǎo shī shuō sān diǎn wǔ bú shì zhěng shù","In math class, the teacher said three point five is not a whole number.","En la clase de matemáticas, el maestro dijo que tres coma cinco no es un número entero.","En cours de maths, le professeur a dit que trois virgule cinq n'est pas un nombre entier."],["L7-5332","正面","zhèngmiàn","N/Adj","front; positive","frente; positivo","face avant ; positif","照片的正面写着他的名字。","zhào piàn de zhèng miàn xiě zhe tā de míng zi","His name is written on the front of the photo.","En el anverso de la foto está escrito su nombre.","Son nom est écrit au recto de la photo."],["L7-5333","正能量","zhèngnéngliàng","N","positive energy","energía positiva","énergie positive","这部电影充满了正能量。","zhè bù diàn yǐng chōng mǎn le zhèng néng liàng","This film is full of positive energy.","Esta película está llena de energía positiva.","Ce film est plein d'énergie positive."],["L7-5334","正视","zhèngshì","V","to face squarely","afrontar","regarder en face","每个人都有弱点，关键是要正视它。","měi ge rén dōu yǒu ruò diǎn guān jiàn shì yào zhèng shì tā","Everyone has weaknesses; the key is to face them squarely.","Todos tenemos puntos débiles; lo importante es afrontarlos.","Tout le monde a ses faiblesses ; l'essentiel est de les regarder en face."],["L7-5335","正直","zhèngzhí","Adj","upright; honest","íntegro; honesto","droit ; honnête","他这个人为人正直，从不说假话。","tā zhè ge rén wéi rén zhèng zhí cóng bù shuō jiǎ huà","He is an upright person and never tells lies.","Es una persona íntegra que nunca dice mentiras.","C'est quelqu'un d'intègre qui ne ment jamais."],["L7-5336","正宗","zhèngzōng","N/Adj","authentic; genuine","auténtico; genuino","authentique ; véritable","这家饭馆的北京烤鸭很正宗。","zhè jiā fàn guǎn de běi jīng kǎo yā hěn zhèng zōng","The Peking duck at this restaurant is authentic.","El pato laqueado de Pekín de este restaurante es auténtico.","Le canard laqué de Pékin de ce restaurant est authentique."],["L7-5337","证人","zhèngrén","N","witness","testigo","témoin","法官请证人说出当时看到的情况。","fǎ guān qǐng zhèng rén shuō chū dāng shí kàn dào de qíng kuàng","The judge asked the witness to describe what he saw at the time.","El juez pidió al testigo que contara lo que vio en ese momento.","Le juge a demandé au témoin de dire ce qu'il avait vu à ce moment-là."],["L7-5338","郑重","zhèngzhòng","Adj","serious; solemn","serio; solemne","sérieux ; solennel","他郑重地向大家道了歉。","tā zhèng zhòng de xiàng dà jiā dào le qiàn","He solemnly apologized to everyone.","Pidió disculpas a todos con solemnidad.","Il a présenté solennellement ses excuses à tous."],["L7-5339","之","zhī","Pron","(possessive particle); it","(partícula posesiva); lo","(particule possessive) ; le","这部法律从公布之日起施行。","zhè bù fǎ lǜ cóng gōng bù zhī rì qǐ shī xíng","This law takes effect from the date of its promulgation.","Esta ley entra en vigor a partir de la fecha de su promulgación.","Cette loi est applicable à compter de la date de sa promulgation."],["L7-5341","之所以","zhīsuǒyǐ","Conj","the reason why","la razón por la que","la raison pour laquelle","他之所以成功，是因为他从不放弃。","tā zhī suǒ yǐ chéng gōng shì yīn wèi tā cóng bú fàng qì","The reason he succeeded is that he never gives up.","La razón por la que tuvo éxito es que nunca se rinde.","S'il a réussi, c'est parce qu'il n'abandonne jamais."],["L7-5342","支票","zhīpiào","N","check; cheque","cheque","chèque","现在很少有人用支票付款了。","xiàn zài hěn shǎo yǒu rén yòng zhī piào fù kuǎn le","Nowadays few people pay by check.","Hoy en día muy poca gente paga con cheque.","De nos jours, peu de gens paient par chèque."],["L7-5343","支柱","zhīzhù","N","pillar; mainstay","pilar; sostén","pilier ; soutien","旅游业是这个城市经济的支柱。","lǚ yóu yè shì zhè ge chéng shì jīng jì de zhī zhù","Tourism is the pillar of this city's economy.","El turismo es el pilar de la economía de esta ciudad.","Le tourisme est le pilier de l'économie de cette ville."],["L7-5344","汁","zhī","N","juice","jugo","jus","把柠檬切开，挤出一点儿汁来。","bǎ níng méng qiē kāi jǐ chū yì diǎnr zhī lái","Cut the lemon open and squeeze out a little juice.","Corta el limón y exprime un poco de jugo.","Coupe le citron et presse-en un peu de jus."],["L7-5345","芝麻","zhīma","N","sesame","sésamo","sésame","她在面包上撒了一些芝麻。","tā zài miàn bāo shàng sǎ le yì xiē zhī ma","She sprinkled some sesame seeds on the bread.","Espolvoreó un poco de ajonjolí sobre el pan.","Elle a saupoudré un peu de sésame sur le pain."],["L7-5346","芝士","zhīshì","N","cheese","queso","fromage","这个比萨上放了很多芝士。","zhè ge bǐ sà shàng fàng le hěn duō zhī shì","This pizza has lots of cheese on it.","Esta pizza lleva mucho queso.","Cette pizza est garnie de beaucoup de fromage."],["L7-5347","知己","zhījǐ","Adj/N","close friend; confidant","amigo íntimo; confidente","ami intime ; confident","人这一辈子，难得有一个知己。","rén zhè yí bèi zi nán dé yǒu yí ge zhī jǐ","In a lifetime, it is rare to have a true friend who understands you.","En esta vida es raro tener un amigo que de verdad te comprenda.","Dans une vie, il est rare d'avoir un véritable ami qui nous comprend."],["L7-5348","知觉","zhījué","N","perception; consciousness","percepción; conciencia","perception ; conscience","他在车祸中受了重伤，失去了知觉。","tā zài chē huò zhōng shòu le zhòng shāng shī qù le zhī jué","He was badly injured in the car accident and lost consciousness.","Resultó gravemente herido en el accidente de coche y perdió el conocimiento.","Il a été grièvement blessé dans l'accident de voiture et a perdu connaissance."],["L7-5349","知识分子","zhīshi fènzǐ","","intellectual","intelectual","intellectuel","他的父母都是知识分子。","tā de fù mǔ dōu shì zhī shi fèn zǐ","Both of his parents are intellectuals.","Sus padres son ambos intelectuales.","Ses parents sont tous deux des intellectuels."],["L7-5350","知足","zhīzú","Adj","content with what one has","conformarse; estar satisfecho","se contenter de ce qu'on a","她很知足，觉得现在的生活就很幸福。","tā hěn zhī zú jué de xiàn zài de shēng huó jiù hěn xìng fú","She is very content and feels her present life is happy.","Se conforma con lo que tiene y piensa que su vida actual es feliz.","Elle se contente de ce qu'elle a et trouve sa vie actuelle heureuse."],["L7-5351","肢体","zhītǐ","N","limbs; body","miembros; cuerpo","membres ; corps","演员用肢体动作表达人物的感情。","yǎn yuán yòng zhī tǐ dòng zuò biǎo dá rén wù de gǎn qíng","The actor expresses the character's feelings through body movements.","El actor expresa los sentimientos del personaje mediante movimientos corporales.","L'acteur exprime les sentiments du personnage par des gestes du corps."],["L7-5352","脂肪","zhīfáng","N","fat","grasa","graisse","多吃蔬菜，少吃脂肪高的食物。","duō chī shū cài shǎo chī zhī fáng gāo de shí wù","Eat more vegetables and less high-fat food.","Come más verduras y menos alimentos ricos en grasa.","Mange plus de légumes et moins d'aliments riches en graisses."],["L7-5353","执法","zhífǎ","V","to enforce the law","aplicar la ley","faire appliquer la loi","警察在工作中必须严格执法。","jǐng chá zài gōng zuò zhōng bì xū yán gé zhí fǎ","The police must strictly enforce the law in their work.","Los policías deben aplicar la ley con rigor en su trabajo.","Les policiers doivent faire appliquer strictement la loi dans l'exercice de leur travail."],["L7-5354","执意","zhíyì","Adv","to insist on; determined to","empeñarse en; insistir en","s'obstiner à ; tenir à","大家都劝他别去，可他执意要去。","dà jiā dōu quàn tā bié qù kě tā zhí yì yào qù","Everyone urged him not to go, but he insisted on going.","Todos le aconsejaron que no fuera, pero él se empeñó en ir.","Tout le monde lui a conseillé de ne pas y aller, mais il a tenu à y aller."],["L7-5355","执照","zhízhào","N","license; permit","licencia; permiso","licence ; permis","他学了三个月，终于拿到了开车的执照。","tā xué le sān gè yuè zhōng yú ná dào le kāi chē de zhí zhào","After three months of lessons, he finally got his driver's license.","Estudió durante tres meses y por fin obtuvo la licencia de conducir.","Après trois mois d'apprentissage, il a enfin obtenu son permis de conduire."],["L7-5356","执着","zhízhuó","Adj","persistent; attached to","tenaz; apegado","tenace ; attaché à","他对音乐的执着让人感动。","tā duì yīn yuè de zhí zhuó ràng rén gǎn dòng","His dedication to music is moving.","Su dedicación a la música conmueve.","Sa persévérance dans la musique est touchante."],["L7-5357","直奔","zhíbèn","V","to head straight for","ir directo a","aller droit vers","一下飞机，他就直奔医院去看母亲。","yí xià fēi jī tā jiù zhí bèn yī yuàn qù kàn mǔ qīn","As soon as he got off the plane, he went straight to the hospital to see his mother.","En cuanto bajó del avión, se fue directo al hospital a ver a su madre.","Dès qu'il est descendu de l'avion, il s'est rendu directement à l'hôpital voir sa mère."],["L7-5358","直达","zhídá","V","direct; to reach directly","directo; llegar directamente","direct ; aller directement","这趟火车直达上海，中途不停。","zhè tàng huǒ chē zhí dá shàng hǎi zhōng tú bù tíng","This train goes directly to Shanghai without stopping.","Este tren va directo a Shanghái, sin paradas intermedias.","Ce train est direct pour Shanghai, sans arrêt en route."],["L7-5359","直观","zhíguān","Adj","intuitive; direct observation","intuitivo; observación directa","intuitif ; observation directe","用图表来说明这些数据更直观。","yòng tú biǎo lái shuō míng zhè xiē shù jù gèng zhí guān","Using charts to present these data is more intuitive.","Es más intuitivo explicar estos datos con gráficos.","Il est plus parlant d'illustrer ces données à l'aide de graphiques."],["L7-5360","直径","zhíjìng","N","diameter","diámetro","diamètre","这个圆的直径是十厘米。","zhè ge yuán de zhí jìng shì shí lí mǐ","This circle's diameter is ten centimeters.","El diámetro de este círculo es de diez centímetros.","Le diamètre de ce cercle est de dix centimètres."],["L7-5361","直觉","zhíjué","N","intuition","intuición","intuition","我的直觉告诉我，他在说谎。","wǒ de zhí jué gào su wǒ tā zài shuō huǎng","My intuition tells me he is lying.","Mi intuición me dice que está mintiendo.","Mon intuition me dit qu'il ment."],["L7-5362","直视","zhíshì","V","to look straight at","mirar directamente","regarder droit dans les yeux","他不敢直视父亲的眼睛。","tā bù gǎn zhí shì fù qīn de yǎn jing","He didn't dare look his father in the eye.","No se atrevía a mirar a su padre a los ojos.","Il n'osait pas regarder son père dans les yeux."],["L7-5363","直至","zhízhì","V","until; up to","hasta","jusqu'à","为了完成报告，他一直工作直至深夜。","wèi le wán chéng bào gào tā yì zhí gōng zuò zhí zhì shēn yè","To finish the report, he kept working until late at night.","Para terminar el informe, siguió trabajando hasta entrada la noche.","Pour terminer le rapport, il a travaillé jusque tard dans la nuit."],["L7-5364","值钱","zhíqián","Adj","valuable","valioso","de valeur","这个旧花瓶其实很值钱。","zhè ge jiù huā píng qí shí hěn zhí qián","This old vase is actually very valuable.","Este viejo jarrón en realidad vale mucho.","Ce vieux vase a en fait beaucoup de valeur."],["L7-5365","职权","zhíquán","N","authority; powers","autoridad; competencias","autorité ; pouvoirs","古代有些官吏利用职权欺压百姓。","gǔ dài yǒu xiē guān lì lì yòng zhí quán qī yā bǎi xìng","In ancient times, some officials abused their power to oppress the common people.","En la antigüedad, algunos funcionarios abusaban de su autoridad para oprimir al pueblo.","Dans l'Antiquité, certains fonctionnaires abusaient de leur pouvoir pour opprimer le peuple."],["L7-5366","职业病","zhíyèbìng","N","occupational disease","enfermedad profesional","maladie professionnelle","颈椎病是很多上班族的职业病。","jǐng zhuī bìng shì hěn duō shàng bān zú de zhí yè bìng","Cervical spine problems are an occupational disease of many office workers.","Los problemas cervicales son una enfermedad profesional de muchos oficinistas.","Les problèmes de cervicales sont une maladie professionnelle de nombreux employés de bureau."],["L7-5367","职员","zhíyuán","N","office worker; staff member","empleado; oficinista","employé ; salarié","她是这家银行的普通职员。","tā shì zhè jiā yín háng de pǔ tōng zhí yuán","She is an ordinary employee at this bank.","Es una empleada común de este banco.","Elle est une simple employée de cette banque."],["L7-5368","止步","zhǐbù","","to halt; no entry","detenerse; prohibido el paso","s'arrêter ; interdit d'entrer","前方正在施工，请行人止步。","qián fāng zhèng zài shī gōng qǐng xíng rén zhǐ bù","Construction is underway ahead; pedestrians please stop.","Hay obras más adelante; peatones, deténganse, por favor.","Travaux en cours devant ; piétons, veuillez vous arrêter."],["L7-5369","止咳","zhǐ ké","","to relieve a cough","calmar la tos","calmer la toux","这种药可以止咳，还能退烧。","zhè zhǒng yào kě yǐ zhǐ ké hái néng tuì shāo","This medicine can stop coughs and also reduce fever.","Este medicamento calma la tos y además baja la fiebre.","Ce médicament calme la toux et fait aussi baisser la fièvre."],["L7-5370","止血","zhǐxuè","V","to stop bleeding","detener la hemorragia","arrêter le saignement","护士用纱布按住伤口，帮他止血。","hù shi yòng shā bù àn zhù shāng kǒu bāng tā zhǐ xuè","The nurse pressed gauze on the wound to help stop the bleeding.","La enfermera presionó la herida con una gasa para ayudarlo a detener la hemorragia.","L'infirmière a appuyé de la gaze sur la plaie pour l'aider à arrêter le saignement."],["L7-5371","旨在","zhǐzài","V","to aim to","tener como objetivo","viser à","这次调整旨在减少重复审批，而不是把所有权限都集中到一把手手中。","zhè cì tiáo zhěng zhǐ zài jiǎn shǎo chóng fù shěn pī ér bú shì bǎ suǒ yǒu quán xiàn dōu jí zhōng dào yì bǎ shǒu shǒu zhōng","This adjustment aims to reduce duplicate approvals, rather than concentrate all authority in the top leader's hands.","Este ajuste tiene como fin reducir las aprobaciones duplicadas, no concentrar toda la autoridad en manos del máximo responsable.","Cet ajustement vise à réduire les validations en double, et non à concentrer tous les pouvoirs entre les mains du premier responsable."],["L7-5372","指点","zhǐdiǎn","V","to point out; to give guidance","indicar; orientar","indiquer ; guider","多亏老师傅的指点，我很快就学会了。","duō kuī lǎo shī fu de zhǐ diǎn wǒ hěn kuài jiù xué huì le","Thanks to the experienced craftsman's guidance, I quickly learned how to do it.","Gracias a las indicaciones del maestro artesano, aprendí enseguida.","Grâce aux conseils du vieux maître, j'ai vite appris."],["L7-5373","指教","zhǐjiào","V","to give advice; guidance","aconsejar; orientar","conseiller ; guider","我刚来公司，请大家多多指教。","wǒ gāng lái gōng sī qǐng dà jiā duō duō zhǐ jiào","I'm new to the company, so I'd appreciate everyone's guidance.","Acabo de llegar a la empresa; les agradeceré que me orienten.","Je viens d'arriver dans l'entreprise, je compte sur vos conseils à tous."],["L7-5374","指令","zhǐlìng","N","instruction; command","instrucción; orden","instruction ; ordre","机器人按照指令完成了任务。","jī qì rén àn zhào zhǐ lìng wán chéng le rèn wu","The robot completed the task according to its instructions.","El robot cumplió la tarea según las instrucciones.","Le robot a accompli la tâche conformément aux instructions."],["L7-5375","指南","zhǐnán","N","guide; guidebook","guía; manual","guide ; manuel","出发前，他买了一本旅游指南。","chū fā qián tā mǎi le yì běn lǚ yóu zhǐ nán","Before setting off, he bought a travel guide.","Antes de salir, compró una guía de viaje.","Avant de partir, il a acheté un guide touristique."],["L7-5376","指南针","zhǐnánzhēn","N","compass","brújula","boussole","在森林里迷路的时候，指南针很有用。","zài sēn lín lǐ mí lù de shí hou zhǐ nán zhēn hěn yǒu yòng","A compass is very useful when you're lost in a forest.","Cuando te pierdes en el bosque, una brújula es muy útil.","Quand on est perdu dans la forêt, une boussole est très utile."],["L7-5377","指手画脚","zhǐshǒu-huàjiǎo","","to gesticulate; to meddle","gesticular; dar órdenes","gesticuler ; se mêler de tout","他指手画脚地讲述着昨晚比赛的精彩场面。","tā zhǐ shǒu huà jiǎo de jiǎng shù zhe zuó wǎn bǐ sài de jīng cǎi chǎng miàn","He gesticulates as he describes the highlights of last night's match.","Cuenta gesticulando los momentos emocionantes del partido de anoche.","Il raconte en gesticulant les moments forts du match d'hier soir."],["L7-5378","指望","zhǐwàng","V/N","to count on; hope","contar con; esperanza","compter sur ; espoir","这件事你别指望他了，他自己都忙不过来。","zhè jiàn shì nǐ bié zhǐ wàng tā le tā zì jǐ dōu máng bú guò lái","Don't count on him for this; he can't even keep up with his own work.","En esto no cuentes con él; ni siquiera da abasto con lo suyo.","Pour cette affaire, ne compte pas sur lui ; il n'arrive même pas à venir à bout de son propre travail."],["L7-5379","指向","zhǐxiàng","V/N","to point to; to aim at","apuntar a; dirigirse a","pointer vers ; viser","路口标志上的箭头指向火车站。","lù kǒu biāo zhì shàng de jiàn tóu zhǐ xiàng huǒ chē zhàn","The arrow on the sign at the intersection points toward the train station.","La flecha del letrero en la intersección apunta hacia la estación de tren.","La flèche du panneau au carrefour indique la gare."],["L7-5380","指引","zhǐyǐn","V","to guide; guidance","guiar; orientación","guider ; orientation","在老师的指引下，他找到了自己的方向。","zài lǎo shī de zhǐ yǐn xià tā zhǎo dào le zì jǐ de fāng xiàng","Under his teacher's guidance, he found his direction.","Guiado por su maestro, encontró su rumbo.","Guidé par son professeur, il a trouvé sa voie."],["L7-5381","至此","zhìcǐ","V","up to this point; so far","hasta aquí; hasta ahora","jusqu'ici ; à ce stade","至此，这个案子终于真相大白了。","zhì cǐ zhè ge àn zi zhōng yú zhēn xiàng dà bái le","At this point, the truth of the case finally came to light.","Con esto, la verdad de este caso quedó por fin esclarecida.","Dès lors, la vérité sur cette affaire a enfin éclaté."],["L7-5382","至关重要","zhìguān-zhòngyào","","crucial; vital","crucial; vital","crucial ; vital","睡眠对孩子的成长至关重要。","shuì mián duì hái zi de chéng zhǎng zhì guān zhòng yào","Sleep is vital to a child's growth.","El sueño es fundamental para el crecimiento de los niños.","Le sommeil est essentiel à la croissance des enfants."],["L7-5383","志气","zhìqì","N","ambition; backbone","ambición; coraje","ambition ; courage","这孩子很有志气，想当一名科学家。","zhè hái zi hěn yǒu zhì qì xiǎng dāng yì míng kē xué jiā","This child is very ambitious and wants to become a scientist.","Este niño tiene mucha ambición y quiere ser científico.","Cet enfant a de l'ambition et veut devenir scientifique."],["L7-5384","制","zhì","V","system; to control","sistema; controlar","système ; contrôler","美国和德国都是联邦制国家。","měi guó hé dé guó dōu shì lián bāng zhì guó jiā","The United States and Germany are both federal states.","Estados Unidos y Alemania son ambos Estados federales.","Les États-Unis et l'Allemagne sont tous deux des États fédéraux."],["L7-5385","制裁","zhìcái","V","to punish; sanctions","castigar; sanciones","punir ; sanctions","违反规定的公司将受到制裁。","wéi fǎn guī dìng de gōng sī jiāng shòu dào zhì cái","Companies that violate the rules will be sanctioned.","Las empresas que infrinjan las normas serán sancionadas.","Les entreprises qui enfreignent les règles seront sanctionnées."],["L7-5386","制服","zhìfú","N","to subdue; uniform","someter; uniforme","maîtriser ; uniforme","两名警察合力制服了持刀的歹徒。","liǎng míng jǐng chá hé lì zhì fú le chí dāo de dǎi tú","Two police officers worked together to subdue the knife-wielding assailant.","Dos policías unieron fuerzas para reducir al criminal armado con un cuchillo.","Deux policiers ont uni leurs forces pour maîtriser le malfaiteur armé d'un couteau."],["L7-5387","制品","zhìpǐn","N","products; goods","productos; artículos","produits ; articles","这家工厂专门生产塑料制品。","zhè jiā gōng chǎng zhuān mén shēng chǎn sù liào zhì pǐn","This factory specializes in plastic products.","Esta fábrica se dedica a producir artículos de plástico.","Cette usine est spécialisée dans la fabrication de produits en plastique."],["L7-5388","制止","zhìzhǐ","V","to stop; to curb","detener; frenar","arrêter ; freiner","看到有人乱扔垃圾，他立刻上前制止。","kàn dào yǒu rén luàn rēng lā jī tā lì kè shàng qián zhì zhǐ","Seeing someone littering, he immediately stepped forward to stop him.","Al ver que alguien tiraba basura, se acercó de inmediato para impedírselo.","En voyant quelqu'un jeter des déchets par terre, il s'est aussitôt avancé pour l'en empêcher."],["L7-5389","质地","zhìdì","N","texture; quality","textura; calidad","texture ; qualité","这种木材质地坚硬，很适合做家具。","zhè zhǒng mù cái zhì dì jiān yìng hěn shì hé zuò jiā jù","This wood is hard and well suited for making furniture.","Esta madera es dura y muy adecuada para hacer muebles.","Ce bois est dur et très bien adapté à la fabrication de meubles."],["L7-5390","质朴","zhìpǔ","Adj","simple; unaffected","sencillo; natural","simple ; naturel","这里的村民为人质朴，热情好客。","zhè lǐ de cūn mín wéi rén zhì pǔ rè qíng hào kè","The villagers here are simple and honest, warm and hospitable.","Los aldeanos de aquí son sencillos, cálidos y hospitalarios.","Les villageois d'ici sont simples, chaleureux et hospitaliers."],["L7-5391","质问","zhìwèn","V","to question; to demand an explanation","interpelar; pedir cuentas","interroger ; demander des comptes","面对记者的质问，他一句话也说不出来。","miàn duì jì zhě de zhì wèn tā yí jù huà yě shuō bu chū lái","Faced with the reporter's pointed questions, he couldn't say a word.","Ante las preguntas insistentes del reportero, no pudo decir ni una palabra.","Face aux questions pressantes du journaliste, il n'a pas pu dire un mot."],["L7-5392","质疑","zhìyí","V","to question; to doubt","cuestionar; poner en duda","remettre en question ; douter","商家承诺免费保修，却在维修时另收费用，这种做法理应受到质疑。","shāng jiā chéng nuò miǎn fèi bǎo xiū què zài wéi xiū shí lìng shōu fèi yòng zhè zhǒng zuò fǎ lǐ yīng shòu dào zhì yí","The seller promised free warranty repairs but charged extra during servicing; this practice deserves to be questioned.","El comerciante prometió una garantía gratuita, pero cobró un cargo adicional en la reparación; esta práctica merece ser cuestionada.","Le commerçant avait promis une garantie gratuite, mais a facturé des frais supplémentaires lors de la réparation ; cette pratique mérite d'être remise en question."],["L7-5393","治学","zhìxué","V","to pursue scholarship","dedicarse al estudio","se consacrer à l'étude","这位教授治学严谨，深受学生尊敬。","zhè wèi jiào shòu zhì xué yán jǐn shēn shòu xué shēng zūn jìng","This professor is rigorous in scholarship and deeply respected by students.","Este profesor es riguroso en su labor académica y sus alumnos lo respetan mucho.","Ce professeur est d'une grande rigueur scientifique et très respecté de ses étudiants."],["L7-5394","治愈","zhìyù","","to cure; heartwarming","curar; reconfortante","guérir ; réconfortant","经过三个月的治疗，他的病终于治愈了。","jīng guò sān gè yuè de zhì liáo tā de bìng zhōng yú zhì yù le","After three months of treatment, his illness was finally cured.","Después de tres meses de tratamiento, su enfermedad por fin se curó.","Après trois mois de traitement, sa maladie a enfin été guérie."],["L7-5395","致","zhì","V","fine; delicate; to send","delicado; fino; enviar","délicat ; fin ; adresser","校长写了一封信，致全体毕业生。","xiào zhǎng xiě le yì fēng xìn zhì quán tǐ bì yè shēng","The principal wrote a letter addressed to all the graduates.","El director escribió una carta dirigida a todos los graduados.","Le directeur a écrit une lettre adressée à tous les diplômés."],["L7-5396","致辞","zhìcí","","to give a speech","pronunciar unas palabras","prononcer un discours","校长在开学典礼上致辞。","xiào zhǎng zài kāi xué diǎn lǐ shàng zhì cí","The principal gave a speech at the opening ceremony.","El director pronunció unas palabras en la ceremonia de inicio de curso.","Le directeur a prononcé un discours lors de la cérémonie de rentrée."],["L7-5397","致富","zhìfù","V","to get rich","enriquecerse","s'enrichir","这个村子靠养殖鱼虾致富了。","zhè ge cūn zi kào yǎng zhí yú xiā zhì fù le","This village became prosperous by raising fish and shrimp.","Este pueblo prosperó criando peces y camarones.","Ce village a prospéré grâce à l'élevage de poissons et de crevettes."],["L7-5398","致敬","zhìjìng","V","to pay tribute; to salute","rendir homenaje; saludar","rendre hommage ; saluer","我们向奋战在一线的医护人员致敬。","wǒ men xiàng fèn zhàn zài yí xiàn de yī hù rén yuán zhì jìng","We pay tribute to the medical staff fighting on the front line.","Rendimos homenaje al personal médico que lucha en primera línea.","Nous rendons hommage au personnel soignant qui se bat en première ligne."],["L7-5399","致力于","zhìlì yú","","to devote oneself to","dedicarse a","se consacrer à","他一生致力于环境保护事业。","tā yì shēng zhì lì yú huán jìng bǎo hù shì yè","He devoted his whole life to environmental protection.","Dedicó toda su vida a la causa de la protección del medio ambiente.","Il a consacré toute sa vie à la protection de l'environnement."],["L7-5400","致命","zhìmìng","V","fatal; deadly","mortal; letal","mortel ; fatal","这场车祸对他造成了致命的伤害。","zhè chǎng chē huò duì tā zào chéng le zhì mìng de shāng hài","This car accident caused him fatal injuries.","Este accidente de tránsito le causó lesiones mortales.","Cet accident de la route lui a causé des blessures mortelles."],["L7-5401","致使","zhìshǐ","V/Conj","to cause; to result in","causar; provocar","causer ; entraîner","连续的暴雨致使河水上涨。","lián xù de bào yǔ zhì shǐ hé shuǐ shàng zhǎng","Continuous heavy rain caused the river to rise.","Las lluvias torrenciales continuas hicieron subir el nivel del río.","Les pluies torrentielles continues ont fait monter le niveau de la rivière."],["L7-5402","秩序","zhìxù","N","order","orden","ordre","地铁站里秩序很好，大家都排队上车。","dì tiě zhàn lǐ zhì xù hěn hǎo dà jiā dōu pái duì shàng chē","Order is good in the subway station; everyone lines up to board.","En la estación del metro hay mucho orden y todos hacen fila para subir.","Le métro est bien ordonné ; tout le monde fait la queue pour monter."],["L7-5403","窒息","zhìxī","V","to suffocate; to choke","asfixiar; sofocar","suffoquer ; étouffer","房间里的空气不流通，让人感到窒息。","fáng jiān lǐ de kōng qì bù liú tōng ràng rén gǎn dào zhì xī","The air in the room doesn't circulate, which makes you feel suffocated.","El aire de la habitación no circula y da sensación de asfixia.","L'air de la pièce ne circule pas et donne l'impression d'étouffer."],["L7-5404","智商","zhìshāng","N","IQ","coeficiente intelectual","QI","智商高不一定就能成功。","zhì shāng gāo bù yí dìng jiù néng chéng gōng","A high IQ doesn't necessarily guarantee success.","Tener un coeficiente intelectual alto no garantiza necesariamente el éxito.","Avoir un QI élevé ne garantit pas forcément la réussite."],["L7-5405","滞后","zhìhòu","V","to lag behind","rezagarse","prendre du retard","这个地区的经济发展有些滞后。","zhè ge dì qū de jīng jì fā zhǎn yǒu xiē zhì hòu","The economic development of this region lags somewhat behind.","El desarrollo económico de esta región va algo rezagado.","Le développement économique de cette région accuse un certain retard."],["L7-5406","滞留","zhìliú","V","to be stranded; to linger","quedar retenido; permanecer","rester bloqué ; s'attarder","列车因故障滞留途中，乘务员及时通报情况，并协助旅客调整行程。","liè chē yīn gù zhàng zhì liú tú zhōng chéng wù yuán jí shí tōng bào qíng kuàng bìng xié zhù lǚ kè tiáo zhěng xíng chéng","The train was held up en route by a fault, and the attendants promptly explained the situation and helped passengers revise their plans.","El tren quedó detenido en el trayecto por una avería; el personal informó a tiempo de la situación y ayudó a los pasajeros a reajustar su itinerario.","Le train est resté immobilisé en route à cause d'une panne ; le personnel a rapidement informé les voyageurs et les a aidés à modifier leur trajet."],["L7-5407","置","zhì","V","to place; to put","colocar; poner","placer ; mettre","工作了几年，他终于在城里置了一套房子。","gōng zuò le jǐ nián tā zhōng yú zài chéng lǐ zhì le yí tào fáng zi","After working for a few years, he finally bought a house in the city.","Después de trabajar unos años, por fin compró un apartamento en la ciudad.","Après quelques années de travail, il a enfin acheté un appartement en ville."],["L7-5408","中国画","zhōngguóhuà","N","Chinese painting","pintura china","peinture chinoise","她从小跟着爷爷学画中国画。","tā cóng xiǎo gēn zhe yé ye xué huà zhōng guó huà","She has studied Chinese painting with her grandfather since childhood.","Desde pequeña aprende pintura china con su abuelo.","Elle apprend la peinture chinoise avec son grand-père depuis l'enfance."],["L7-5409","中立","zhōnglì","V","neutral; neutrality","neutral; neutralidad","neutre ; neutralité","在这件事上，他一直保持中立。","zài zhè jiàn shì shàng tā yì zhí bǎo chí zhōng lì","He has stayed neutral on this matter.","En este asunto siempre ha mantenido la neutralidad.","Dans cette affaire, il est toujours resté neutre."],["L7-5410","中途","zhōngtú","N","midway; halfway","a mitad de camino","à mi-chemin","这趟火车直达上海，中途不停。","zhè tàng huǒ chē zhí dá shàng hǎi zhōng tú bù tíng","This train goes directly to Shanghai without stopping.","Este tren va directo a Shanghái, sin paradas intermedias.","Ce train est direct pour Shanghai, sans arrêt en route."],["L7-5411","中型","zhōngxíng","Adj","medium-sized","de tamaño mediano","de taille moyenne","这是一家中型企业，有三百多名员工。","zhè shì yì jiā zhōng xíng qǐ yè yǒu sān bǎi duō míng yuán gōng","This is a medium-sized enterprise with over three hundred employees.","Esta es una empresa mediana con más de trescientos empleados.","C'est une entreprise de taille moyenne qui compte plus de trois cents employés."],["L7-5412","中性","zhōngxìng","N/Adj","neutral","neutro","neutre","这件衣服是中性的款式，男女都能穿。","zhè jiàn yī fu shì zhōng xìng de kuǎn shì nán nǚ dōu néng chuān","This garment is a unisex style that both men and women can wear.","Esta prenda es de estilo unisex y la pueden usar tanto hombres como mujeres.","Ce vêtement est de style unisexe et peut être porté aussi bien par les hommes que par les femmes."],["L7-5413","中旬","zhōngxún","N","middle of the month","mediados de mes","milieu du mois","这个月中旬我们要去上海开会。","zhè ge yuè zhōng xún wǒ men yào qù shàng hǎi kāi huì","We're going to Shanghai for a meeting in the middle of this month.","A mediados de este mes iremos a Shanghái a una reunión.","À la mi-mois, nous irons à Shanghai pour une réunion."],["L7-5414","中庸","zhōngyōng","N/Adj","Doctrine of the Mean; moderate","Doctrina del Justo Medio; moderado","Juste Milieu ; modéré","中庸是儒家思想中很重要的观念。","zhōng yōng shì rú jiā sī xiǎng zhōng hěn zhòng yào de guān niàn","The doctrine of the mean is a very important concept in Confucian thought.","El justo medio es un concepto muy importante en el pensamiento confuciano.","Le juste milieu est une notion très importante de la pensée confucéenne."],["L7-5415","中止","zhōngzhǐ","V","to suspend; to discontinue","suspender; interrumpir","suspendre ; interrompre","因为下暴雨，比赛不得不中止。","yīn wèi xià bào yǔ bǐ sài bù dé bù zhōng zhǐ","Because of a rainstorm, the match had to be suspended.","Debido a la tormenta, el partido tuvo que suspenderse.","À cause d'un violent orage, le match a dû être interrompu."],["L7-5416","忠诚","zhōngchéng","Adj/N","loyal; loyalty","leal; lealtad","loyal ; loyauté","狗是对主人最忠诚的动物。","gǒu shì duì zhǔ rén zuì zhōng chéng de dòng wù","Dogs are the animals most loyal to their owners.","El perro es el animal más leal a su dueño.","Le chien est l'animal le plus fidèle à son maître."],["L7-5417","忠实","zhōngshí","Adj","faithful; loyal","fiel; leal","fidèle ; loyal","他是这个节目的忠实观众。","tā shì zhè ge jié mù de zhōng shí guān zhòng","He is a loyal viewer of this program.","Es un espectador fiel de este programa.","Il est un téléspectateur fidèle de cette émission."],["L7-5418","忠于","zhōngyú","V","to be loyal to","ser leal a","être fidèle à","每个人都应该忠于自己的祖国。","měi ge rén dōu yīng gāi zhōng yú zì jǐ de zǔ guó","Everyone should be loyal to their motherland.","Todos deben ser leales a su patria.","Chacun doit être fidèle à sa patrie."],["L7-5419","忠贞","zhōngzhēn","Adj","loyal and steadfast","leal y constante","loyal et constant","这对老夫妻几十年来一直对彼此很忠贞。","zhè duì lǎo fū qī jǐ shí nián lái yì zhí duì bǐ cǐ hěn zhōng zhēn","This elderly couple has remained faithful to each other for decades.","Esta pareja de ancianos se ha mantenido fiel el uno al otro durante décadas.","Ce vieux couple s'est toujours montré fidèle l'un envers l'autre depuis des décennies."],["L7-5420","终结","zhōngjié","V","to end; conclusion","terminar; conclusión","mettre fin à ; fin","这场比赛终结了他们的十连胜。","zhè chǎng bǐ sài zhōng jié le tā men de shí lián shèng","This match ended their ten-game winning streak.","Este partido puso fin a su racha de diez victorias consecutivas.","Ce match a mis fin à leur série de dix victoires consécutives."],["L7-5421","终究","zhōngjiū","Adv","after all; in the end","al fin y al cabo","après tout ; finalement","不管他怎么掩饰，谎言终究会被揭穿。","bù guǎn tā zěn me yǎn shì huǎng yán zhōng jiū huì bèi jiē chuān","No matter how he covers it up, the lie will be exposed in the end.","Por más que intente disimularlo, la mentira acabará descubriéndose.","Quoi qu'il fasse pour le cacher, le mensonge finira par être découvert."],["L7-5422","终生","zhōngshēng","N","lifelong; lifetime","de por vida; toda la vida","toute la vie ; à vie","这次经历让他终生难忘。","zhè cì jīng lì ràng tā zhōng shēng nán wàng","He will never forget this experience as long as he lives.","Esta experiencia la recordará toda la vida.","Cette expérience, il ne l'oubliera jamais de toute sa vie."],["L7-5423","衷心","zhōngxīn","Adj","heartfelt; sincere","sincero; cordial","sincère ; cordial","衷心祝愿你们生活幸福！","zhōng xīn zhù yuàn nǐ men shēng huó xìng fú","I sincerely wish you a happy life!","¡Les deseo de todo corazón una vida feliz!","Je vous souhaite de tout cœur une vie heureuse !"],["L7-5424","肿瘤","zhǒngliú","N","tumor","tumor","tumeur","手术很成功，医生把肿瘤全部切除了。","shǒu shù hěn chéng gōng yī shēng bǎ zhǒng liú quán bù qiē chú le","The operation was a success; the doctor removed the entire tumor.","La operación fue un éxito y el médico extirpó todo el tumor.","L'opération a été un succès et le médecin a retiré toute la tumeur."],["L7-5425","种族","zhǒngzú","N","race; ethnic group","raza; etnia","race ; ethnie","不同种族的人应该互相尊重。","bù tóng zhǒng zú de rén yīng gāi hù xiāng zūn zhòng","People of different races should respect one another.","Las personas de distintas razas deben respetarse mutuamente.","Les gens de races différentes doivent se respecter mutuellement."],["L7-5426","仲裁","zhòngcái","V","arbitration","arbitraje","arbitrage","双方无法达成一致，只好申请仲裁。","shuāng fāng wú fǎ dá chéng yí zhì zhǐ hǎo shēn qǐng zhòng cái","The two sides couldn't reach agreement and had to apply for arbitration.","Las dos partes no lograron llegar a un acuerdo y tuvieron que solicitar un arbitraje.","Les deux parties n'ont pas pu s'entendre et ont dû demander un arbitrage."],["L7-5427","众人","zhòngrén","N","everyone; the crowd","todos; la multitud","tout le monde ; la foule","他的发言引起了众人的注意。","tā de fā yán yǐn qǐ le zhòng rén de zhù yì","His speech caught everyone's attention.","Su intervención llamó la atención de todos.","Son intervention a attiré l'attention de tous."],["L7-5428","众所周知","zhòngsuǒzhōuzhī","","as everyone knows","como todos saben","comme chacun sait","众所周知，吸烟有害健康。","zhòng suǒ zhōu zhī xī yān yǒu hài jiàn kāng","As everyone knows, smoking is harmful to your health.","Como todos saben, fumar es perjudicial para la salud.","Comme chacun sait, fumer nuit à la santé."],["L7-5429","众志成城","zhòngzhì-chéngchéng","","united we stand","la unión hace la fuerza","l'union fait la force","面对洪水，全村人众志成城，保住了家园。","miàn duì hóng shuǐ quán cūn rén zhòng zhì chéng chéng bǎo zhù le jiā yuán","Facing the flood, the whole village united as one and saved their homes.","Ante la inundación, todo el pueblo se unió como un solo hombre y salvó sus hogares.","Face à la crue, tout le village s'est uni comme un seul homme et a sauvé ses maisons."],["L7-5430","重创","zhòngchuāng","V","to inflict heavy damage","infligir graves daños","infliger de lourdes pertes","这场台风给当地的农业造成了重创。","zhè chǎng tái fēng gěi dāng dì de nóng yè zào chéng le zhòng chuāng","This typhoon dealt a heavy blow to local agriculture.","Este tifón causó un duro golpe a la agricultura local.","Ce typhon a porté un coup dur à l'agriculture locale."],["L7-5431","重量级","zhòngliàngjí","Adj","heavyweight","peso pesado","poids lourd","这次会议请来了好几位重量级的专家。","zhè cì huì yì qǐng lái le hǎo jǐ wèi zhòng liàng jí de zhuān jiā","This conference has invited several heavyweight experts.","A esta conferencia se invitó a varios expertos de peso.","Cette conférence a invité plusieurs experts de renom."],["L7-5432","重任","zhòngrèn","N","heavy responsibility","gran responsabilidad","lourde responsabilité","年轻一代肩负着建设国家的重任。","nián qīng yí dài jiān fù zhe jiàn shè guó jiā de zhòng rèn","The younger generation shoulders the heavy responsibility of building the country.","La joven generación carga con la pesada responsabilidad de construir el país.","La jeune génération porte la lourde responsabilité de bâtir le pays."],["L7-5433","重伤","zhòngshāng","N","serious injury","herida grave","blessure grave","他在昨天的车祸中受了重伤。","tā zài zuó tiān de chē huò zhōng shòu le zhòng shāng","He was seriously injured in yesterday's car accident.","Resultó gravemente herido en el accidente de coche de ayer.","Il a été gravement blessé dans l'accident de voiture d'hier."],["L7-5434","重心","zhòngxīn","N","center of gravity; focus","centro de gravedad; foco","centre de gravité ; point central","最近他把工作的重心放在了市场开发上。","zuì jìn tā bǎ gōng zuò de zhòng xīn fàng zài le shì chǎng kāi fā shàng","Recently he has shifted the focus of his work to market development.","Últimamente ha puesto el centro de su trabajo en el desarrollo del mercado.","Récemment, il a fait de l'exploration du marché le centre de son travail."],["L7-5435","重型","zhòngxíng","Adj","heavy-duty; heavy","pesado; de gran tamaño","lourd ; de grande taille","这条路禁止重型卡车通行。","zhè tiáo lù jìn zhǐ zhòng xíng kǎ chē tōng xíng","Heavy trucks are not allowed on this road.","En esta carretera está prohibido el paso de camiones pesados.","La circulation des poids lourds est interdite sur cette route."],["L7-5436","重中之重","zhòngzhōngzhīzhòng","","top priority","la máxima prioridad","priorité absolue","安全生产是工厂的重中之重。","ān quán shēng chǎn shì gōng chǎng de zhòng zhōng zhī zhòng","Safe production is the top priority for the factory.","La producción segura es la máxima prioridad de la fábrica.","La sécurité de la production est la priorité absolue de l'usine."],["L7-5437","周边","zhōubiān","N","surrounding area; periphery","alrededores; periferia","alentours ; périphérie","这座核电站为周边几个城市提供电力。","zhè zuò hé diàn zhàn wèi zhōu biān jǐ ge chéng shì tí gōng diàn lì","This nuclear power plant supplies electricity to several surrounding cities.","Esta central nuclear suministra electricidad a varias ciudades de los alrededores.","Cette centrale nucléaire fournit de l'électricité à plusieurs villes environnantes."],["L7-5438","周到","zhōudào","Adj","thoughtful; thorough","atento; esmerado","attentionné ; minutieux","这家酒店的服务非常周到。","zhè jiā jiǔ diàn de fú wù fēi cháng zhōu dào","The service at this hotel is very attentive.","El servicio de este hotel es muy esmerado.","Le service de cet hôtel est très attentionné."],["L7-5439","周密","zhōumì","Adj","thorough; meticulous","minucioso; meticuloso","minutieux ; méticuleux","这次活动经过了周密的安排。","zhè cì huó dòng jīng guò le zhōu mì de ān pái","This event was carefully planned.","Este evento fue organizado con todo detalle.","Cet événement a été organisé dans les moindres détails."],["L7-5440","周旋","zhōuxuán","V","to deal with; to socialize","lidiar con; relacionarse","composer avec ; fréquenter","他在几家公司之间来回周旋。","tā zài jǐ jiā gōng sī zhī jiān lái huí zhōu xuán","He went back and forth dealing with several companies.","Anduvo de un lado a otro negociando entre varias empresas.","Il a fait des allées et venues pour mener ses tractations entre plusieurs entreprises."],["L7-5441","昼夜","zhòuyè","N","day and night","día y noche","jour et nuit","医院的急诊室昼夜开放。","yī yuàn de jí zhěn shì zhòu yè kāi fàng","The hospital's emergency room is open day and night.","Las urgencias del hospital están abiertas día y noche.","Les urgences de l'hôpital sont ouvertes jour et nuit."],["L7-5442","皱","zhòu","V/N","to wrinkle; wrinkled","arrugar; arrugado","froisser ; ridé","这件衬衫洗过以后皱得厉害。","zhè jiàn chèn shān xǐ guo yǐ hòu zhòu de lì hai","This shirt is badly wrinkled after washing.","Esta camisa se arruga mucho después de lavarla.","Cette chemise est très froissée après le lavage."],["L7-5443","骤然","zhòurán","Adv","suddenly","de repente","soudain","天气骤然变冷，很多人都感冒了。","tiān qì zhòu rán biàn lěng hěn duō rén dōu gǎn mào le","The weather turned suddenly cold, and many people caught colds.","El tiempo se enfrió de repente y mucha gente se resfrió.","Le temps s'est brusquement refroidi et beaucoup de gens ont attrapé un rhume."],["L7-5444","朱红","zhūhóng","Adj","vermilion","bermellón","vermillon","这座古老的寺庙有一扇朱红色的大门。","zhè zuò gǔ lǎo de sì miào yǒu yí shàn zhū hóng sè de dà mén","This ancient temple has a vermilion gate.","Este antiguo templo tiene un gran portón de color rojo bermellón.","Ce temple ancien a un grand portail vermillon."],["L7-5445","株","zhū","M","(measure word for plants)","(clasificador de plantas)","(classificateur de plantes)","奶奶家的院子里种着两株桃树。","nǎi nai jiā de yuàn zi lǐ zhòng zhe liǎng zhū táo shù","Two peach trees are planted in Grandma's yard.","En el patio de la casa de la abuela hay dos duraznos plantados.","Deux pêchers sont plantés dans la cour de chez grand-mère."],["L7-5446","诸多","zhūduō","Adj","many; a lot of","muchos; numerosos","nombreux ; beaucoup de","这个计划还存在诸多问题。","zhè ge jì huà hái cún zài zhū duō wèn tí","There are still many problems with this plan.","Este plan todavía tiene muchos problemas.","Ce projet pose encore de nombreux problèmes."],["L7-5447","诸如此类","zhūrú-cǐlèi","","and so on; things like this","y cosas así; etcétera","et ainsi de suite","比如迟到、早退，诸如此类的问题都要处理。","bǐ rú chí dào zǎo tuì zhū rú cǐ lèi de wèn tí dōu yào chǔ lǐ","Being late, leaving early, and problems like these all need to be dealt with.","Hay que atender problemas como llegar tarde, salir temprano y otros por el estilo.","Les retards, les départs anticipés et autres problèmes de ce genre doivent tous être traités."],["L7-5448","竹竿","zhúgān","N","bamboo pole","caña de bambú","perche de bambou","奶奶把洗好的衣服晾在竹竿上。","nǎi nai bǎ xǐ hǎo de yī fu liàng zài zhú gān shàng","Grandma hung the washed clothes on a bamboo pole.","La abuela tendió la ropa lavada en una vara de bambú.","Grand-mère a étendu le linge lavé sur une perche en bambou."],["L7-5449","逐年","zhúnián","Adv","year after year","año tras año","année après année","这个城市的人口逐年增加。","zhè ge chéng shì de rén kǒu zhú nián zēng jiā","The population of this city increases year by year.","La población de esta ciudad aumenta año tras año.","La population de cette ville augmente d'année en année."],["L7-5450","主","zhǔ","N","owner; master; host","dueño; amo; anfitrión","propriétaire ; maître ; hôte","他主动向老师认错，保证以后不再迟到。","tā zhǔ dòng xiàng lǎo shī rèn cuò bǎo zhèng yǐ hòu bú zài chí dào","He took the initiative to admit his mistake to the teacher and promised never to be late again.","Él reconoció su error ante el maestro por iniciativa propia y prometió no volver a llegar tarde.","Il a reconnu sa faute devant le professeur de lui-même et a promis de ne plus arriver en retard."],["L7-5451","主编","zhǔbiān","N/V","editor in chief","editor jefe","rédacteur en chef","她当这本杂志的主编已经十年了。","tā dāng zhè běn zá zhì de zhǔ biān yǐ jīng shí nián le","She has been the editor-in-chief of this magazine for ten years.","Hace diez años que es la directora de esta revista.","Elle est rédactrice en chef de ce magazine depuis dix ans."],["L7-5452","主妇","zhǔfù","N","housewife","ama de casa","femme au foyer","她结婚以后当了主妇，每天在家照顾孩子。","tā jié hūn yǐ hòu dāng le zhǔ fù měi tiān zài jiā zhào gù hái zi","After marrying she became a housewife and looks after the children at home every day.","Después de casarse se volvió ama de casa y cuida a los niños en casa todos los días.","Après son mariage, elle est devenue femme au foyer et s'occupe des enfants à la maison tous les jours."],["L7-5453","主力","zhǔlì","N","main force","fuerza principal","force principale","他是我们球队的主力队员。","tā shì wǒ men qiú duì de zhǔ lì duì yuán","He is a key player on our team.","Es un jugador clave de nuestro equipo.","C'est un joueur essentiel de notre équipe."],["L7-5454","主权","zhǔquán","N","sovereignty","soberanía","souveraineté","每个国家都有自己的主权。","měi ge guó jiā dōu yǒu zì jǐ de zhǔ quán","Every country has its own sovereignty.","Todo país tiene su propia soberanía.","Chaque pays a sa propre souveraineté."],["L7-5455","主人公","zhǔréngōng","N","protagonist; hero","protagonista; héroe","protagoniste ; héros","这部电影里，主人公差点儿被敌人枪毙。","zhè bù diàn yǐng lǐ zhǔ rén gōng chà diǎnr bèi dí rén qiāng bì","In this film, the hero is nearly executed by the enemy.","En esta película, el protagonista casi es fusilado por el enemigo.","Dans ce film, le héros est sur le point d'être fusillé par l'ennemi."],["L7-5456","主食","zhǔshí","N","staple food","alimento básico","aliment de base","南方人的主食是米饭，北方人更喜欢面食。","nán fāng rén de zhǔ shí shì mǐ fàn běi fāng rén gèng xǐ huan miàn shí","Southerners' staple food is rice, while northerners prefer wheat-based food.","El alimento básico de la gente del sur es el arroz, mientras que la del norte prefiere los fideos y otros productos de harina.","L'aliment de base des gens du Sud est le riz, tandis que ceux du Nord préfèrent les pâtes et autres produits à base de farine."],["L7-5457","主题歌","zhǔtígē","N","theme song","canción principal","chanson thème","这部电视剧的主题歌非常好听。","zhè bù diàn shì jù de zhǔ tí gē fēi cháng hǎo tīng","The theme song of this TV series is very nice.","El tema musical de esta serie de televisión es muy bonito.","Le générique de cette série télévisée est très agréable."],["L7-5458","主演","zhǔyǎn","V/N","to star in; lead actor","protagonizar; actor principal","jouer le rôle principal ; acteur principal","这部电影由一位著名演员主演。","zhè bù diàn yǐng yóu yí wèi zhù míng yǎn yuán zhǔ yǎn","This film stars a famous actor.","Esta película está protagonizada por un actor famoso.","Ce film a pour vedette un acteur célèbre."],["L7-5459","主页","zhǔyè","N","home page","página de inicio","page d'accueil","请访问我们的网站主页，了解更多信息。","qǐng fǎng wèn wǒ men de wǎng zhàn zhǔ yè liǎo jiě gèng duō xìn xī","Please visit our website's home page for more information.","Visita la página principal de nuestro sitio web para obtener más información.","Veuillez consulter la page d'accueil de notre site web pour en savoir plus."],["L7-5460","主义","zhǔyì","N","-ism; doctrine","-ismo; doctrina","-isme ; doctrine","他认为任何主义都不能代替独立思考。","tā rèn wéi rèn hé zhǔ yì dōu bù néng dài tì dú lì sī kǎo","He believes no ideology can replace independent thinking.","Considera que ninguna doctrina puede reemplazar el pensamiento independiente.","Il pense qu'aucune doctrine ne peut remplacer la pensée indépendante."],["L7-5461","主宰","zhǔzǎi","V/N","to dominate; to rule","dominar; gobernar","dominer ; diriger","我们要主宰自己的命运。","wǒ men yào zhǔ zǎi zì jǐ de mìng yùn","We should be masters of our own fate.","Debemos ser dueños de nuestro propio destino.","Nous devons être maîtres de notre destin."],["L7-5462","拄","zhǔ","V","to lean on (a stick)","apoyarse en (un bastón)","s'appuyer sur (une canne)","爷爷拄着拐杖慢慢地走过来。","yé ye zhǔ zhe guǎi zhàng màn màn de zǒu guò lái","Grandpa slowly walked over leaning on his cane.","El abuelo se acercó caminando despacio, apoyado en su bastón.","Grand-père s'est approché lentement, appuyé sur sa canne."],["L7-5463","嘱咐","zhǔfù","V","to urge; to instruct","encargar; recomendar","recommander ; charger de","出门前，妈妈嘱咐我路上小心。","chū mén qián mā ma zhǔ fù wǒ lù shang xiǎo xīn","Before I left, Mom told me to be careful on the way.","Antes de salir, mamá me recomendó tener cuidado en el camino.","Avant que je sorte, maman m'a recommandé de faire attention en chemin."],["L7-5464","瞩目","zhǔmù","V","to watch closely","observar con atención","suivre avec attention","这场比赛受到了全世界的瞩目。","zhè chǎng bǐ sài shòu dào le quán shì jiè de zhǔ mù","This match drew the attention of the whole world.","Este partido atrajo la atención del mundo entero.","Ce match a attiré l'attention du monde entier."],["L7-5465","助威","zhùwēi","","to cheer on","animar; alentar","encourager ; soutenir","球迷们在看台上为自己的球队助威。","qiú mí men zài kàn tái shàng wèi zì jǐ de qiú duì zhù wēi","The fans cheered for their team from the stands.","Los aficionados animaban a su equipo desde las gradas.","Les supporters encourageaient leur équipe depuis les tribunes."],["L7-5466","住处","zhùchù","N","residence; dwelling","residencia; vivienda","résidence ; logement","他在学校附近找了一个住处。","tā zài xué xiào fù jìn zhǎo le yí ge zhù chù","He found a place to live near the school.","Encontró un lugar donde vivir cerca de la escuela.","Il a trouvé un logement près de l'école."],["L7-5467","住户","zhùhù","N","household; resident","hogar; residente","ménage ; résident","这栋楼里一共住着六十多户住户。","zhè dòng lóu lǐ yí gòng zhù zhe liù shí duō hù zhù hù","More than sixty households live in this building.","En este edificio viven más de sesenta familias en total.","Plus de soixante foyers habitent dans cet immeuble au total."],["L7-5468","住宿","zhùsù","V","to stay; accommodation","alojarse; alojamiento","loger ; hébergement","这次旅行的住宿费用由公司负责。","zhè cì lǚ xíng de zhù sù fèi yòng yóu gōng sī fù zé","The company will cover the accommodation costs for this trip.","La empresa se hará cargo de los gastos de alojamiento de este viaje.","L'entreprise prend en charge les frais d'hébergement de ce voyage."],["L7-5469","住址","zhùzhǐ","N","address","dirección","adresse","请在表格上写清楚你的住址。","qǐng zài biǎo gé shàng xiě qīng chu nǐ de zhù zhǐ","Please write your address clearly on the form.","Por favor, escribe tu dirección con claridad en el formulario.","Veuillez écrire clairement votre adresse sur le formulaire."],["L7-5470","贮藏","zhùcáng","V","to store","almacenar","stocker","地窖里贮藏着很多过冬的白菜。","dì jiào lǐ zhù cáng zhe hěn duō guò dōng de bái cài","A lot of cabbage for the winter is stored in the cellar.","En el sótano de almacenamiento hay guardadas muchas coles para el invierno.","Beaucoup de choux pour l'hiver sont entreposés dans la cave."],["L7-5471","注","zhù","N/V","to pour; to concentrate","verter; concentrar","verser ; concentrer","出国前，请仔细阅读注意事项。","chū guó qián qǐng zǐ xì yuè dú zhù yì shì xiàng","Before traveling abroad, please read the notes carefully.","Antes de viajar al extranjero, lea con atención las indicaciones.","Avant de partir à l'étranger, veuillez lire attentivement les consignes."],["L7-5472","注定","zhùdìng","V","to be destined","estar destinado","être destiné","他们注定会成为一辈子的好朋友。","tā men zhù dìng huì chéng wéi yí bèi zi de hǎo péng you","They were destined to be lifelong friends.","Estaban destinados a ser buenos amigos de por vida.","Ils étaient destinés à être de bons amis pour la vie."],["L7-5473","注入","zhùrù","","to pour into","verter en; inyectar","verser dans ; injecter","新员工给公司注入了新的活力。","xīn yuán gōng gěi gōng sī zhù rù le xīn de huó lì","The new employees have injected new energy into the company.","Los nuevos empleados han inyectado nueva energía a la empresa.","Les nouveaux employés ont insufflé une énergie nouvelle à l'entreprise."],["L7-5474","铸造","zhùzào","V","to cast (metal)","fundir (metal)","couler (du métal)","这口大钟是用铜铸造的。","zhè kǒu dà zhōng shì yòng tóng zhù zào de","This big bell was cast in bronze.","Esta gran campana está fundida en bronce.","Cette grosse cloche a été coulée en bronze."],["L7-5475","筑","zhù","V","Guiyang (abbr.); to build","Guiyang (abrev.); construir","Guiyang (abr.) ; construire","古人用泥土和石头筑城墙。","gǔ rén yòng ní tǔ hé shí tou zhù chéng qiáng","People in ancient times built city walls with earth and stone.","En la antigüedad, la gente levantaba murallas con tierra y piedra.","Dans l'Antiquité, on construisait les remparts avec de la terre et des pierres."],["L7-5476","爪子","zhuǎzi","N","claw","garra","griffe","小猫伸出爪子抓我的手。","xiǎo māo shēn chū zhuǎ zi zhuā wǒ de shǒu","The kitten reached out its claws to scratch my hand.","El gatito sacó las garras y me arañó la mano.","Le chaton a sorti ses griffes pour me griffer la main."],["L7-5477","拽","zhuài","V","to pull; to drag","tirar; arrastrar","tirer ; traîner","孩子拽着妈妈的衣服不让她走。","hái zi zhuài zhe mā ma de yī fu bú ràng tā zǒu","The child tugged at his mother's clothes and wouldn't let her go.","El niño tiraba de la ropa de su mamá para que no se fuera.","L'enfant tirait sur les vêtements de sa mère pour l'empêcher de partir."],["L7-5478","专长","zhuāncháng","N","specialty; expertise","especialidad; pericia","spécialité ; expertise","每个人都有自己的专长。","měi ge rén dōu yǒu zì jǐ de zhuān cháng","Everyone has their own specialty.","Cada persona tiene su propia especialidad.","Chacun a sa propre spécialité."],["L7-5479","专程","zhuānchéng","Adv","specially; on purpose","expresamente; a propósito","spécialement ; exprès","他专程从上海赶来参加我们的婚礼。","tā zhuān chéng cóng shàng hǎi gǎn lái cān jiā wǒ men de hūn lǐ","He came all the way from Shanghai specially to attend our wedding.","Vino expresamente desde Shanghái para asistir a nuestra boda.","Il est venu exprès de Shanghai pour assister à notre mariage."],["L7-5480","专柜","zhuānguì","N","dedicated counter","mostrador especializado","comptoir spécialisé","这个牌子的化妆品在商场一楼有专柜。","zhè ge pái zi de huà zhuāng pǐn zài shāng chǎng yī lóu yǒu zhuān guì","This brand of cosmetics has a dedicated counter on the first floor of the mall.","Esta marca de cosméticos tiene un mostrador exclusivo en la planta baja del centro comercial.","Cette marque de cosmétiques a un comptoir dédié au rez-de-chaussée du centre commercial."],["L7-5481","专栏","zhuānlán","N","special column","columna especial","chronique","她在报纸上开了一个美食专栏。","tā zài bào zhǐ shàng kāi le yí ge měi shí zhuān lán","She started a food column in the newspaper.","Abrió una columna de gastronomía en el periódico.","Elle a lancé une chronique gastronomique dans le journal."],["L7-5482","专卖店","zhuānmàidiàn","N","specialty store","tienda especializada","magasin spécialisé","这条街上有很多品牌专卖店。","zhè tiáo jiē shang yǒu hěn duō pǐn pái zhuān mài diàn","There are many brand-name specialty stores on this street.","En esta calle hay muchas tiendas de marcas exclusivas.","Il y a beaucoup de boutiques de marques dans cette rue."],["L7-5483","专人","zhuānrén","N","person assigned to a task","persona designada","personne dédiée","这项工作有专人负责，你不用操心。","zhè xiàng gōng zuò yǒu zhuān rén fù zé nǐ bú yòng cāo xīn","A designated person is in charge of this work, so you needn't worry.","Hay una persona encargada de este trabajo, así que no tienes de qué preocuparte.","Une personne est chargée de ce travail, tu n'as donc pas à t'en faire."],["L7-5484","专职","zhuānzhí","N","full-time; dedicated","a tiempo completo; dedicado","à plein temps ; dédié","她是学校的专职心理老师。","tā shì xué xiào de zhuān zhí xīn lǐ lǎo shī","She is the school's full-time counselor.","Es la psicóloga escolar de tiempo completo de la escuela.","Elle est la psychologue scolaire à plein temps de l'école."],["L7-5485","专制","zhuānzhì","V","autocracy; despotic","autocracia; despótico","autocratie ; despotique","这个国家曾经经历过长期的专制统治。","zhè ge guó jiā céng jīng jīng lì guo cháng qī de zhuān zhì tǒng zhì","This country once went through a long period of autocratic rule.","Este país vivió durante mucho tiempo bajo un régimen autocrático.","Ce pays a connu pendant longtemps un régime autocratique."],["L7-5486","专注","zhuānzhù","Adj","focused; to concentrate","concentrado; concentrarse","concentré ; se concentrer","他做事非常专注，别人叫他也听不见。","tā zuò shì fēi cháng zhuān zhù bié rén jiào tā yě tīng bu jiàn","He is so focused when working that he doesn't hear people calling him.","Cuando trabaja se concentra tanto que no oye cuando lo llaman.","Quand il travaille, il est si concentré qu'il n'entend pas qu'on l'appelle."],["L7-5487","专著","zhuānzhù","N","monograph","monografía","monographie","这位教授出版了一本关于古代建筑的专著。","zhè wèi jiào shòu chū bǎn le yì běn guān yú gǔ dài jiàn zhù de zhuān zhù","This professor published a monograph on ancient architecture.","Este profesor publicó una monografía sobre arquitectura antigua.","Ce professeur a publié une monographie sur l'architecture ancienne."],["L7-5488","砖","zhuān","N","brick","ladrillo","brique","这面墙是用红砖砌成的。","zhè miàn qiáng shì yòng hóng zhuān qì chéng de","This wall is built of red bricks.","Este muro está construido con ladrillos rojos.","Ce mur est construit en briques rouges."],["L7-5489","转播","zhuǎnbō","V","to relay; to rebroadcast","retransmitir","retransmettre","电视台正在转播今晚的足球比赛。","diàn shì tái zhèng zài zhuǎn bō jīn wǎn de zú qiú bǐ sài","The TV station is broadcasting tonight's soccer match.","El canal de televisión está retransmitiendo el partido de fútbol de esta noche.","La chaîne de télévision retransmet le match de football de ce soir."],["L7-5490","转达","zhuǎndá","V","to pass on; to convey","transmitir; comunicar","transmettre ; communiquer","请你替我向你父母转达我的问候。","qǐng nǐ tì wǒ xiàng nǐ fù mǔ zhuǎn dá wǒ de wèn hòu","Please convey my regards to your parents for me.","Por favor, transmíteles mis saludos a tus padres de mi parte.","Transmets mes salutations à tes parents de ma part, s'il te plaît."],["L7-5491","转机","zhuǎnjī","N","turn for the better; to transfer flights","giro favorable; hacer escala","tournant favorable ; changer d'avion","经过医生的治疗，他的病情出现了转机。","jīng guò yī shēng de zhì liáo tā de bìng qíng chū xiàn le zhuǎn jī","After the doctor's treatment, his condition took a turn for the better.","Después del tratamiento médico, su enfermedad empezó a mejorar.","Après le traitement du médecin, son état s'est amélioré."],["L7-5492","转交","zhuǎnjiāo","V","to pass on to","hacer llegar a","remettre à","这封信请你帮我转交给王老师。","zhè fēng xìn qǐng nǐ bāng wǒ zhuǎn jiāo gěi wáng lǎo shī","Please pass this letter on to Teacher Wang for me.","Por favor, entrégale esta carta al profesor Wang de mi parte.","Peux-tu remettre cette lettre au professeur Wang de ma part ?"],["L7-5493","转型","zhuǎnxíng","V","to transform; to transition","transformarse; hacer la transición","se transformer ; effectuer une transition","这轮产业转型既带来了新的机遇，也迫使企业重新审视劳动力的配置。","zhè lún chǎn yè zhuǎn xíng jì dài lái le xīn de jī yù yě pò shǐ qǐ yè chóng xīn shěn shì láo dòng lì de pèi zhì","This round of industrial transformation has created new opportunities while compelling companies to reconsider how they allocate their workforce.","Esta ola de transformación industrial ha traído nuevas oportunidades, pero también obliga a las empresas a replantearse la distribución de su fuerza laboral.","Cette vague de transformation industrielle a apporté de nouvelles opportunités, mais oblige aussi les entreprises à repenser la répartition de leur main-d'œuvre."],["L7-5494","转学","zhuǎnxué","","to change schools","cambiar de escuela","changer d'école","因为搬家，他不得不转学。","yīn wèi bān jiā tā bù dé bù zhuǎn xué","Because his family moved, he had to change schools.","Por la mudanza, tuvo que cambiarse de escuela.","À cause du déménagement, il a dû changer d'école."],["L7-5495","转眼","zhuǎnyǎn","V","in the blink of an eye","en un abrir y cerrar de ojos","en un clin d'œil","时间过得真快，转眼孩子已经上大学了。","shí jiān guò de zhēn kuài zhuǎn yǎn hái zi yǐ jīng shàng dà xué le","Time flies; in the blink of an eye, the child is already in college.","El tiempo pasa volando; en un abrir y cerrar de ojos, el niño ya está en la universidad.","Le temps passe vite ; en un clin d'œil, l'enfant est déjà à l'université."],["L7-5496","转载","zhuǎnzǎi","V","to reprint; to repost","reproducir; republicar","reproduire ; republier","这篇文章被很多网站转载了。","zhè piān wén zhāng bèi hěn duō wǎng zhàn zhuǎn zǎi le","This article was reposted by many websites.","Este artículo fue republicado en muchos sitios web.","Cet article a été repris par de nombreux sites web."],["L7-5497","转折","zhuǎnzhé","V","turning point; twist","punto de inflexión; giro","tournant ; rebondissement","这次失败是他人生的一个转折。","zhè cì shī bài shì tā rén shēng de yí ge zhuǎn zhé","This failure was a turning point in his life.","Este fracaso marcó un punto de inflexión en su vida.","Cet échec a été un tournant dans sa vie."],["L7-5498","转折点","zhuǎnzhédiǎn","N","turning point","punto de inflexión","point de bascule","这场比赛成了他运动生涯的转折点。","zhè chǎng bǐ sài chéng le tā yùn dòng shēng yá de zhuǎn zhé diǎn","This match became the turning point of his sporting career.","Este partido se convirtió en el punto de inflexión de su carrera deportiva.","Ce match est devenu le tournant de sa carrière sportive."],["L7-5499","传","zhuàn","N","biography; tradition","biografía; tradición","biographie ; tradition","这是他家祖传的手艺，已经传了五代人了。","zhè shì tā jiā zǔ chuán de shǒu yì yǐ jīng chuán le wǔ dài rén le","This is his family's ancestral craft, passed down for five generations.","Este es un oficio que se hereda en su familia y que ya se ha transmitido durante cinco generaciones.","C'est un savoir-faire transmis dans sa famille, qui se perpétue depuis cinq générations."],["L7-5500","传记","zhuànjì","N","biography","biografía","biographie","我最近在读一本名人传记。","wǒ zuì jìn zài dú yì běn míng rén zhuàn jì","I've been reading a biography of a famous person recently.","Últimamente estoy leyendo la biografía de un personaje famoso.","Je lis en ce moment la biographie d'une personnalité célèbre."],["L7-5501","转悠","zhuànyou","V","to wander around","dar vueltas; deambular","flâner ; traîner","他在商场里转悠了半天，什么也没买。","tā zài shāng chǎng lǐ zhuàn you le bàn tiān shén me yě méi mǎi","He wandered around the mall for ages but didn't buy anything.","Estuvo dando vueltas por el centro comercial un buen rato y no compró nada.","Il a flâné longtemps dans le centre commercial sans rien acheter."],["L7-5502","撰写","zhuànxiě","V","to write; to compose","redactar; escribir","rédiger ; composer","他正在撰写一本关于中国历史的书。","tā zhèng zài zhuàn xiě yì běn guān yú zhōng guó lì shǐ de shū","He is writing a book about Chinese history.","Está escribiendo un libro sobre la historia de China.","Il est en train d'écrire un livre sur l'histoire de la Chine."],["L7-5503","庄稼","zhuāngjia","N","crops","cultivos","récoltes","今年雨水充足，庄稼长得很好。","jīn nián yǔ shuǐ chōng zú zhuāng jia zhǎng de hěn hǎo","There's been plenty of rain this year, and the crops are growing well.","Este año ha llovido bastante y los cultivos están creciendo muy bien.","Cette année, il a beaucoup plu et les récoltes poussent très bien."],["L7-5504","庄严","zhuāngyán","Adj","solemn; dignified","solemne; digno","solennel ; digne","法院大门上方挂着庄严的国徽。","fǎ yuàn dà mén shàng fāng guà zhe zhuāng yán de guó huī","The solemn national emblem hangs above the court's main entrance.","Sobre la puerta principal del tribunal cuelga el solemne escudo nacional.","Au-dessus de l'entrée principale du tribunal est accroché le solennel emblème national."],["L7-5505","庄园","zhuāngyuán","N","manor; estate","hacienda; finca","domaine ; manoir","这座古老的庄园现在成了博物馆。","zhè zuò gǔ lǎo de zhuāng yuán xiàn zài chéng le bó wù guǎn","This old manor has now become a museum.","Esta antigua hacienda ahora se ha convertido en museo.","Ce vieux domaine est devenu un musée."],["L7-5506","桩","zhuāng","N/M","stake; pile; (measure word)","estaca; pilote; (clasificador)","pieu ; pilier ; (classificateur)","这是一桩很难办的案子。","zhè shì yì zhuāng hěn nán bàn de àn zi","This is a very difficult case.","Este es un caso muy difícil de resolver.","C'est une affaire très difficile à traiter."],["L7-5507","装扮","zhuāngbàn","V","to dress up; to decorate","disfrazarse; adornar","se déguiser ; décorer","圣诞节前，商场被装扮得很漂亮。","shèng dàn jié qián shāng chǎng bèi zhuāng bàn de hěn piào liang","Before Christmas, the mall was beautifully decorated.","Antes de Navidad, el centro comercial fue decorado de forma muy bonita.","Avant Noël, le centre commercial a été joliment décoré."],["L7-5508","壮","zhuàng","Adj/V","strong; Zhuang (ethnic group)","fuerte; zhuang (etnia)","robuste ; Zhuang (ethnie)","他长得又高又壮，像个运动员。","tā zhǎng de yòu gāo yòu zhuàng xiàng gè yùn dòng yuán","He is tall and sturdy, like an athlete.","Es alto y fornido, como un deportista.","Il est grand et robuste, comme un athlète."],["L7-5509","壮大","zhuàngdà","V/Adj","to grow stronger; to expand","fortalecerse; ampliar","se renforcer ; s'agrandir","这家小公司这几年迅速壮大起来。","zhè jiā xiǎo gōng sī zhè jǐ nián xùn sù zhuàng dà qǐ lái","This small company has grown rapidly in recent years.","Esta pequeña empresa ha crecido rápidamente en los últimos años.","Cette petite entreprise s'est rapidement développée ces dernières années."],["L7-5510","壮胆","zhuàngdǎn","","to bolster one's courage","armarse de valor","se donner du courage","夜里一个人走路，他就唱歌给自己壮胆。","yè lǐ yí ge rén zǒu lù tā jiù chàng gē gěi zì jǐ zhuàng dǎn","When walking alone at night, he sings to give himself courage.","Cuando camina solo de noche, canta para darse valor.","Quand il marche seul la nuit, il chante pour se donner du courage."],["L7-5511","壮丽","zhuànglì","Adj","magnificent; majestic","magnífico; majestuoso","magnifique ; majestueux","站在山顶上，可以看到壮丽的日出。","zhàn zài shān dǐng shàng kě yǐ kàn dào zhuàng lì de rì chū","From the mountaintop, you can see a magnificent sunrise.","Desde la cima de la montaña se puede ver un magnífico amanecer.","Du sommet de la montagne, on peut voir un magnifique lever de soleil."],["L7-5512","壮实","zhuàngshi","Adj","sturdy; robust","robusto; fuerte","robuste ; solide","这孩子长得很壮实，很少生病。","zhè hái zi zhǎng de hěn zhuàng shi hěn shǎo shēng bìng","This child is sturdy and seldom gets sick.","Este niño es robusto y rara vez se enferma.","Cet enfant est robuste et tombe rarement malade."],["L7-5513","状元","zhuàngyuan","N","top scorer; champion","el mejor; campeón","premier ; champion","他是今年全省的高考状元。","tā shì jīn nián quán shěng de gāo kǎo zhuàng yuán","He is this year's top scorer on the college entrance exam in the whole province.","Este año obtuvo la mejor puntuación de toda la provincia en el examen de ingreso a la universidad.","Il est cette année le major de toute la province au concours d'entrée à l'université."],["L7-5514","撞击","zhuàngjī","V","to hit; to collide","golpear; chocar","heurter ; percuter","两辆车发生了剧烈的撞击。","liǎng liàng chē fā shēng le jù liè de zhuàng jī","The two cars collided violently.","Los dos autos chocaron con violencia.","Les deux voitures se sont violemment percutées."],["L7-5515","幢","zhuàng","M","(measure word for buildings)","(clasificador de edificios)","(classificateur de bâtiments)","这条街上新盖了几幢高楼。","zhè tiáo jiē shang xīn gài le jǐ zhuàng gāo lóu","Several tall buildings have been put up on this street.","En esta calle se han construido varios edificios altos nuevos.","Plusieurs nouveaux immeubles de grande hauteur ont été construits dans cette rue."],["L7-5516","追悼会","zhuīdàohuì","N","memorial service","ceremonia fúnebre","cérémonie commémorative","很多人参加了老校长的追悼会。","hěn duō rén cān jiā le lǎo xiào zhǎng de zhuī dào huì","Many people attended the memorial service for the old principal.","Mucha gente asistió al funeral en honor del antiguo director.","Beaucoup de gens ont assisté à la cérémonie d'hommage à l'ancien directeur."],["L7-5517","追赶","zhuīgǎn","V","to chase; to catch up","perseguir; alcanzar","poursuivre ; rattraper","他拼命追赶前面的选手。","tā pīn mìng zhuī gǎn qián miàn de xuǎn shǒu","He tried desperately to catch up with the runner ahead.","Persiguió con todas sus fuerzas al corredor que iba adelante.","Il a poursuivi de toutes ses forces le concurrent qui le précédait."],["L7-5518","追溯","zhuīsù","V","to trace back","remontar al origen","remonter à","这个村子的历史可以追溯到宋朝。","zhè ge cūn zi de lì shǐ kě yǐ zhuī sù dào sòng cháo","The history of this village can be traced back to the Song dynasty.","La historia de este pueblo se remonta a la dinastía Song.","L'histoire de ce village remonte à la dynastie Song."],["L7-5519","追随","zhuīsuí","V","to follow","seguir","suivre","他一直追随着老师的脚步。","tā yì zhí zhuī suí zhe lǎo shī de jiǎo bù","He has always followed in his teacher's footsteps.","Siempre ha seguido los pasos de su maestro.","Il a toujours suivi les traces de son maître."],["L7-5520","追尾","zhuīwěi","","to rear-end; to tailgate","chocar por detrás","emboutir par l'arrière","早上高速公路上发生了一起追尾事故。","zǎo shang gāo sù gōng lù shàng fā shēng le yì qǐ zhuī wěi shì gù","A rear-end collision happened on the highway this morning.","Esta mañana hubo un choque por alcance en la autopista.","Ce matin, il y a eu un accident par tamponnement sur l'autoroute."],["L7-5521","追问","zhuīwèn","V","to press with questions","interrogar a fondo","presser de questions","在警察的一再追问下，他终于说出了真相。","zài jǐng chá de yí zài zhuī wèn xià tā zhōng yú shuō chū le zhēn xiàng","Under the police's repeated questioning, he finally told the truth.","Ante las repetidas preguntas de la policía, por fin dijo la verdad.","Sous les questions répétées de la police, il a fini par dire la vérité."],["L7-5522","追逐","zhuīzhú","V","to chase; to pursue","perseguir; ir tras","poursuivre ; courir après","孩子们在院子里追逐嬉笑。","hái zi men zài yuàn zi lǐ zhuī zhú xī xiào","The children chase each other and laugh in the yard.","Los niños se persiguen y ríen en el patio.","Les enfants se poursuivent en riant dans la cour."],["L7-5523","追踪","zhuīzōng","V","to track; to trace","rastrear; seguir la pista","suivre la piste ; traquer","警方一直在追踪这名逃犯。","jǐng fāng yì zhí zài zhuī zōng zhè míng táo fàn","The police have been tracking this fugitive.","La policía ha estado siguiendo la pista de este fugitivo.","La police traque ce fugitif depuis un moment."],["L7-5524","坠","zhuì","V/N","to fall; to drop","caer; desplomarse","tomber ; chuter","苹果熟了，把树枝都坠弯了。","píng guǒ shú le bǎ shù zhī dōu zhuì wān le","The apples are ripe and weigh the branches down.","Las manzanas están maduras y hacen doblarse las ramas.","Les pommes sont mûres et font ployer les branches."],["L7-5525","准许","zhǔnxǔ","V","to permit; to allow","permitir; autorizar","permettre ; autoriser","没有老师的准许，学生不能离开教室。","méi yǒu lǎo shī de zhǔn xǔ xué shēng bù néng lí kāi jiào shì","Students may not leave the classroom without the teacher's permission.","Sin el permiso del profesor, los alumnos no pueden salir del salón.","Sans la permission du professeur, les élèves ne peuvent pas quitter la classe."],["L7-5526","准则","zhǔnzé","N","norm; criterion","norma; criterio","norme ; critère","诚实是做人的基本准则。","chéng shí shì zuò rén de jī běn zhǔn zé","Honesty is a basic principle of how to conduct oneself.","La honestidad es un principio básico de la conducta humana.","L'honnêteté est un principe fondamental de la conduite."],["L7-5527","拙劣","zhuōliè","Adj","clumsy; poor","torpe; deficiente","maladroit ; médiocre","这个骗子的手法很拙劣，很快就被人识破了。","zhè ge piàn zi de shǒu fǎ hěn zhuō liè hěn kuài jiù bèi rén shí pò le","This swindler's tricks were clumsy and were quickly seen through.","Las artimañas de este estafador eran tan torpes que pronto lo descubrieron.","Les ruses de cet escroc étaient grossières, et il a vite été démasqué."],["L7-5528","捉迷藏","zhuōmícáng","","to play hide-and-seek","jugar al escondite","jouer à cache-cache","孩子们在院子里玩捉迷藏。","hái zi men zài yuàn zi lǐ wán zhuō mí cáng","The children are playing hide-and-seek in the yard.","Los niños juegan a las escondidas en el patio.","Les enfants jouent à cache-cache dans la cour."],["L7-5529","灼热","zhuórè","Adj","scorching hot","abrasador","brûlant","中午的阳光灼热，晒得人睁不开眼。","zhōng wǔ de yáng guāng zhuó rè shài de rén zhēng bù kāi yǎn","The midday sun was scorching, so bright you couldn't open your eyes.","El sol del mediodía era abrasador y deslumbraba tanto que no se podían abrir los ojos.","Le soleil de midi était brûlant, au point qu'on ne pouvait pas garder les yeux ouverts."],["L7-5530","卓越","zhuóyuè","Adj","outstanding; excellent","sobresaliente; excelente","remarquable ; excellent","这位科学家为国家做出了卓越的贡献。","zhè wèi kē xué jiā wèi guó jiā zuò chū le zhuó yuè de gòng xiàn","This scientist made outstanding contributions to the country.","Este científico hizo contribuciones sobresalientes al país.","Ce scientifique a apporté des contributions remarquables au pays."],["L7-5531","酌情","zhuóqíng","V","to use discretion","a discreción","à sa discrétion","对于特殊情况，学校会酌情减免学费。","duì yú tè shū qíng kuàng xué xiào huì zhuó qíng jiǎn miǎn xué fèi","For special cases, the school will reduce or waive tuition as appropriate.","En casos especiales, la escuela reducirá o eximirá la matrícula según las circunstancias.","Dans les cas particuliers, l'école réduira ou supprimera les frais de scolarité selon les circonstances."],["L7-5532","着力","zhuólì","V","to put effort into","esforzarse en","s'efforcer de","政府将着力解决农民看病难的问题。","zhèng fǔ jiāng zhuó lì jiě jué nóng mín kàn bìng nán de wèn tí","The government will concentrate on solving the problem of farmers' difficulty in seeing a doctor.","El gobierno se concentrará en resolver el problema de la dificultad de los campesinos para recibir atención médica.","Le gouvernement s'attachera à résoudre le problème de l'accès aux soins des paysans."],["L7-5533","着落","zhuóluò","N","whereabouts; reliable source","paradero; fuente segura","sort ; source fiable","他找工作的事终于有了着落。","tā zhǎo gōng zuò de shì zhōng yú yǒu le zhuó luò","His job search has finally borne fruit.","Por fin su búsqueda de trabajo ha tenido resultado.","Sa recherche d'emploi a enfin abouti."],["L7-5534","着实","zhuóshí","Adv","truly; indeed","realmente; de veras","vraiment ; en effet","这个消息着实让人吃了一惊。","zhè ge xiāo xi zhuó shí ràng rén chī le yì jīng","This news was truly startling.","Esta noticia realmente nos sorprendió.","Cette nouvelle a vraiment été une surprise."],["L7-5535","着手","zhuóshǒu","V","to start; to set about","empezar; poner manos a la obra","commencer ; se mettre à","火车开动了，她站在站台上向我们挥着手。","huǒ chē kāi dòng le tā zhàn zài zhàn tái shàng xiàng wǒ men huī zhe shǒu","As the train pulled out, she stood on the platform waving to us.","El tren arrancó y ella, de pie en el andén, nos decía adiós con la mano.","Le train s'est mis en marche, et elle, sur le quai, nous faisait signe de la main."],["L7-5536","着想","zhuóxiǎng","V","to consider others' interests","pensar en (los demás)","penser à (autrui)","她做什么事都处处为别人着想。","tā zuò shén me shì dōu chù chù wèi bié rén zhuó xiǎng","Whatever she does, she always thinks of others.","Hagas lo que hagas, siempre piensa en los demás.","Quoi qu'elle fasse, elle pense toujours aux autres."],["L7-5537","着眼","zhuóyǎn","V","to focus on; to aim at","centrarse en; tener en mira","viser ; se concentrer sur","我们看问题要从大处着眼。","wǒ men kàn wèn tí yào cóng dà chù zhuó yǎn","We should consider problems with the big picture in mind.","Debemos analizar los problemas con una visión de conjunto.","Nous devons examiner les problèmes en ayant une vision d'ensemble."],["L7-5538","着眼于","zhuóyǎn yú","","to focus on","centrarse en","se concentrer sur","这家公司的发展着眼于长远利益。","zhè jiā gōng sī de fā zhǎn zhuó yǎn yú cháng yuǎn lì yì","This company's development focuses on long-term interests.","El desarrollo de esta empresa se centra en los intereses a largo plazo.","Le développement de cette entreprise vise les intérêts à long terme."],["L7-5539","着重","zhuózhòng","V","to emphasize","hacer hincapié en","mettre l'accent sur","老师着重讲解了这道题的解法。","lǎo shī zhuó zhòng jiǎng jiě le zhè dào tí de jiě fǎ","The teacher focused on explaining how to solve this problem.","La maestra hizo hincapié en explicar cómo se resuelve este problema.","Le professeur a surtout insisté sur la façon de résoudre ce problème."],["L7-5540","姿势","zīshì","N","posture; position","postura; posición","posture ; position","长时间保持一个姿势对身体不好。","cháng shí jiān bǎo chí yí ge zī shì duì shēn tǐ bù hǎo","Keeping the same posture for a long time is bad for your body.","Mantener la misma postura durante mucho tiempo es malo para el cuerpo.","Garder la même posture longtemps est mauvais pour le corps."],["L7-5541","姿态","zītài","N","attitude; posture","actitud; postura","attitude ; posture","面对批评，他表现出了谦虚的姿态。","miàn duì pī píng tā biǎo xiàn chū le qiān xū de zī tài","Faced with criticism, he showed a humble attitude.","Ante las críticas, mostró una actitud humilde.","Face aux critiques, il a fait preuve d'humilité."],["L7-5542","兹","zī","Pron","now; here; this","ahora; aquí; este","maintenant ; ici ; ce","兹定于下周一上午召开全体员工大会。","zī dìng yú xià zhōu yí shàng wǔ zhào kāi quán tǐ yuán gōng dà huì","It is hereby announced that a general staff meeting will be held next Monday morning.","Se informa que el próximo lunes por la mañana se celebrará una reunión general de todo el personal.","Il est porté à la connaissance de tous qu'une assemblée générale du personnel se tiendra lundi prochain dans la matinée."],["L7-5543","资本主义","zīběn zhǔyì","","capitalism","capitalismo","capitalisme","这本书分析了资本主义经济的发展历史。","zhè běn shū fēn xī le zī běn zhǔ yì jīng jì de fā zhǎn lì shǐ","This book analyzes the history of capitalist economic development.","Este libro analiza la historia del desarrollo de la economía capitalista.","Ce livre analyse l'histoire du développement de l'économie capitaliste."],["L7-5544","资历","zīlì","N","qualifications; seniority","cualificaciones; antigüedad","qualifications ; ancienneté","他资历很深，在公司工作了二十多年。","tā zī lì hěn shēn zài gōng sī gōng zuò le èr shí duō nián","He is very experienced and has worked at the company for over twenty years.","Tiene mucha experiencia y lleva más de veinte años trabajando en la empresa.","Il a beaucoup d'expérience et travaille dans l'entreprise depuis plus de vingt ans."],["L7-5545","资深","zīshēn","Adj","senior; veteran","veterano; con experiencia","chevronné ; expérimenté","她是一名资深记者，采访过很多名人。","tā shì yì míng zī shēn jì zhě cǎi fǎng guo hěn duō míng rén","She is a veteran journalist who has interviewed many celebrities.","Es una periodista veterana que ha entrevistado a muchas celebridades.","C'est une journaliste chevronnée qui a interviewé de nombreuses célébrités."],["L7-5546","资讯","zīxùn","N","information; news","información; noticias","information ; actualités","手机让我们可以随时获取各种资讯。","shǒu jī ràng wǒ men kě yǐ suí shí huò qǔ gè zhǒng zī xùn","Mobile phones let us get all kinds of information at any time.","El teléfono móvil nos permite obtener todo tipo de información en cualquier momento.","Le téléphone portable nous permet d'accéder à toutes sortes d'informations à tout moment."],["L7-5547","滋润","zīrùn","Adj/V","moist; to moisten","húmedo; humedecer","humide ; humidifier","一场春雨过后，干燥的土地得到了滋润。","yì chǎng chūn yǔ guò hòu gān zào de tǔ dì dé dào le zī rùn","After a spring rain, the dry land was moistened.","Después de una lluvia de primavera, la tierra seca quedó humedecida.","Après une pluie de printemps, la terre sèche s'est humidifiée."],["L7-5548","滋味","zīwèi","N","taste; flavor","sabor; gusto","goût ; saveur","离开家乡的滋味不好受。","lí kāi jiā xiāng de zī wèi bù hǎo shòu","Leaving your hometown is not a pleasant feeling.","No es nada agradable la sensación de dejar la tierra natal.","Quitter sa région natale est une sensation pénible."],["L7-5549","子弟","zǐdì","N","children; younger generation","hijos; jóvenes","enfants ; jeune génération","这所学校的学生大多是农民子弟。","zhè suǒ xué xiào de xué shēng dà duō shì nóng mín zǐ dì","Most of the students at this school are the children of farmers.","La mayoría de los estudiantes de esta escuela son hijos de campesinos.","La plupart des élèves de cette école sont des enfants d'agriculteurs."],["L7-5550","子孙","zǐsūn","N","descendants","descendientes","descendants","我们要为子孙后代保护好环境。","wǒ men yào wèi zǐ sūn hòu dài bǎo hù hǎo huán jìng","We must protect the environment for our descendants.","Debemos proteger bien el medio ambiente para nuestros descendientes.","Nous devons bien protéger l'environnement pour nos descendants."],["L7-5551","自卑","zìbēi","Adj","inferiority complex; to feel inferior","complejo de inferioridad; sentirse inferior","complexe d'infériorité ; se sentir inférieur","她因为个子矮，从小就很自卑。","tā yīn wèi gè zi ǎi cóng xiǎo jiù hěn zì bēi","Because she is short, she has felt inferior since childhood.","Como es de baja estatura, desde niña ha tenido complejo de inferioridad.","Comme elle est petite, elle souffre d'un complexe d'infériorité depuis l'enfance."],["L7-5552","自称","zìchēng","V","to claim to be; to call oneself","autoproclamarse; afirmar ser","se prétendre ; s'appeler","那个人自称是经理的朋友。","nà ge rén zì chēng shì jīng lǐ de péng you","That man claimed to be a friend of the manager.","Ese hombre dijo ser amigo del gerente.","Cet homme se disait ami du directeur."],["L7-5553","自发","zìfā","Adj","spontaneous","espontáneo","spontané","地震以后，很多市民自发去献血。","dì zhèn yǐ hòu hěn duō shì mín zì fā qù xiàn xuè","After the earthquake, many citizens spontaneously went to donate blood.","Después del terremoto, muchos ciudadanos fueron por iniciativa propia a donar sangre.","Après le séisme, beaucoup de citoyens sont allés donner leur sang spontanément."],["L7-5554","自费","zìfèi","V","at one's own expense","a cuenta propia","à ses frais","他没有申请奖学金，自费去国外留学。","tā méi yǒu shēn qǐng jiǎng xué jīn zì fèi qù guó wài liú xué","He didn't apply for a scholarship and went abroad to study at his own expense.","No solicitó una beca y se fue a estudiar al extranjero por su propia cuenta.","Il n'a pas demandé de bourse et est parti étudier à l'étranger à ses frais."],["L7-5555","自负","zìfù","Adj/V","conceited; to take responsibility","engreído; asumir la responsabilidad","prétentieux ; assumer la responsabilité","他太自负了，从来听不进别人的意见。","tā tài zì fù le cóng lái tīng bú jìn bié rén de yì jiàn","He is too conceited and never listens to others' opinions.","Es demasiado arrogante y nunca escucha las opiniones de los demás.","Il est trop vaniteux et n'écoute jamais l'avis des autres."],["L7-5556","自理","zìlǐ","V","to take care of oneself","valerse por sí mismo","subvenir à ses besoins","孩子逐渐长大，父母也需要学会放手，让他在尝试中培养自理能力和自信心。","hái zi zhú jiàn zhǎng dà fù mǔ yě xū yào xué huì fàng shǒu ràng tā zài cháng shì zhōng péi yǎng zì lǐ néng lì hé zì xìn xīn","As their child grows up, the parents also need to learn to let go and allow him to develop independence and confidence by trying things himself.","A medida que el niño crece, los padres también necesitan aprender a soltar y dejar que desarrolle su autonomía y su confianza intentando las cosas por sí mismo.","À mesure que l'enfant grandit, les parents doivent aussi apprendre à lâcher prise et à le laisser développer son autonomie et sa confiance en essayant par lui-même."],["L7-5557","自力更生","zìlì-gēngshēng","","self-reliance","autosuficiencia","compter sur ses propres forces","这个村子靠自力更生，修好了一条路。","zhè ge cūn zi kào zì lì gēng shēng xiū hǎo le yì tiáo lù","This village relied on its own efforts to build a road.","Este pueblo construyó un camino con sus propios esfuerzos.","Ce village a construit une route par ses propres moyens."],["L7-5558","自立","zìlì","V","independent; self-reliant","independiente; autosuficiente","indépendant ; autonome","孩子长大了，要学会自立。","hái zi zhǎng dà le yào xué huì zì lì","When children grow up, they need to learn to be independent.","Cuando los niños crecen, tienen que aprender a valerse por sí mismos.","Quand les enfants grandissent, ils doivent apprendre à devenir indépendants."],["L7-5559","自强不息","zìqiáng-bùxī","","to constantly strive to improve","superarse constantemente","s'améliorer sans cesse","他身体残疾，但自强不息，成了一名作家。","tā shēn tǐ cán jí dàn zì qiáng bù xī chéng le yì míng zuò jiā","He is disabled, but he never stopped striving and became a writer.","Tiene una discapacidad física, pero se superó sin descanso y se convirtió en escritor.","Il est handicapé, mais il n'a jamais cessé de se dépasser et est devenu écrivain."],["L7-5560","自然而然","zìrán'érrán","","naturally; automatically","naturalmente; de forma automática","naturellement ; automatiquement","两个人天天在一起，自然而然就成了朋友。","liǎng gè rén tiān tiān zài yì qǐ zì rán ér rán jiù chéng le péng you","Being together every day, the two naturally became friends.","Al estar juntos todos los días, los dos se hicieron amigos de forma natural.","À force d'être ensemble tous les jours, les deux sont naturellement devenus amis."],["L7-5561","自然界","zìránjiè","N","nature; natural world","naturaleza; mundo natural","nature ; monde naturel","自然界中有很多神奇的现象。","zì rán jiè zhōng yǒu hěn duō shén qí de xiàn xiàng","There are many amazing phenomena in the natural world.","En la naturaleza hay muchos fenómenos asombrosos.","Il existe de nombreux phénomènes étonnants dans la nature."],["L7-5562","自如","zìrú","Adj","with ease; freely","con soltura; libremente","avec aisance ; librement","练了一年，他已经能自如地使用筷子了。","liàn le yì nián tā yǐ jīng néng zì rú de shǐ yòng kuài zi le","After a year of practice, he can now use chopsticks with ease.","Después de un año de práctica, ya puede usar los palillos con soltura.","Après un an d'entraînement, il sait maintenant se servir des baguettes avec aisance."],["L7-5563","自始至终","zìshǐ-zhìzhōng","","from start to finish","de principio a fin","du début à la fin","他自始至终都没有说一句话。","tā zì shǐ zhì zhōng dōu méi yǒu shuō yí jù huà","He didn't say a single word from beginning to end.","No dijo ni una sola palabra de principio a fin.","Il n'a pas dit un seul mot du début à la fin."],["L7-5564","自私","zìsī","Adj","selfish","egoísta","égoïste","他太自私了，只关心自己的利益。","tā tài zì sī le zhǐ guān xīn zì jǐ de lì yì","He is too selfish and only cares about his own interests.","Es demasiado egoísta y solo se preocupa por sus propios intereses.","Il est trop égoïste et ne se soucie que de ses propres intérêts."],["L7-5565","自私自利","zìsī-zìlì","","selfish and self-serving","egoísta e interesado","égoïste et intéressé","自私自利的人很难交到真正的朋友。","zì sī zì lì de rén hěn nán jiāo dào zhēn zhèng de péng you","Selfish people find it hard to make true friends.","A las personas egoístas les cuesta tener verdaderos amigos.","Les gens égoïstes ont du mal à se faire de vrais amis."],["L7-5566","自卫","zìwèi","V","self-defense","autodefensa","légitime défense","她学习武术是为了自卫。","tā xué xí wǔ shù shì wèi le zì wèi","She studies martial arts for self-defense.","Ella estudia artes marciales para defenderse.","Elle étudie les arts martiaux pour se défendre."],["L7-5567","自相矛盾","zìxiāng-máodùn","","self-contradictory","contradecirse","se contredire","他说的话前后自相矛盾，让人无法相信。","tā shuō de huà qián hòu zì xiāng máo dùn ràng rén wú fǎ xiāng xìn","What he said contradicts itself, so it's impossible to believe.","Lo que dijo se contradice a sí mismo, así que es imposible creerle.","Ses propos se contredisent, il est donc impossible de le croire."],["L7-5568","自信心","zìxìnxīn","N","self-confidence","confianza en sí mismo","confiance en soi","经历了这次失败，他的自信心变得十分脆弱。","jīng lì le zhè cì shī bài tā de zì xìn xīn biàn de shí fēn cuì ruò","After this failure, his self-confidence became very fragile.","Después de este fracaso, su confianza en sí mismo se volvió muy frágil.","Après cet échec, sa confiance en lui est devenue très fragile."],["L7-5569","自行","zìxíng","Adv","by oneself; on one's own","por sí mismo; por cuenta propia","de soi-même ; par soi-même","这个问题请大家自行解决。","zhè ge wèn tí qǐng dà jiā zì xíng jiě jué","Please solve this problem by yourselves.","Por favor, resuelvan este problema por su cuenta.","Veuillez résoudre ce problème par vous-mêmes."],["L7-5570","自以为是","zìyǐwéishì","","self-righteous; opinionated","creerse infalible; arrogante","se croire infaillible ; présomptueux","他总是自以为是，从不承认自己的错误。","tā zǒng shì zì yǐ wéi shì cóng bù chéng rèn zì jǐ de cuò wù","He always thinks he's right and never admits his mistakes.","Siempre se cree que tiene la razón y nunca admite sus errores.","Il se croit toujours dans son droit et n'admet jamais ses erreurs."],["L7-5571","自由自在","zìyóu-zìzài","","free and carefree","libre y despreocupado","libre et insouciant","小鸟在天空中自由自在地飞翔。","xiǎo niǎo zài tiān kōng zhōng zì yóu zì zài de fēi xiáng","The birds fly freely in the sky.","Los pajaritos vuelan libremente por el cielo.","Les oiseaux volent librement dans le ciel."],["L7-5572","自责","zìzé","V","to blame oneself","culparse a sí mismo","se reprocher","这件事不是你的错，你不必自责。","zhè jiàn shì bú shì nǐ de cuò nǐ bú bì zì zé","This isn't your fault; you needn't blame yourself.","Esto no es culpa tuya, no tienes por qué culparte.","Ce n'est pas ta faute, tu n'as pas à t'en vouloir."],["L7-5573","自助","zìzhù","V","self-service","autoservicio","libre-service","这家酒店的早餐是自助的。","zhè jiā jiǔ diàn de zǎo cān shì zì zhù de","This hotel's breakfast is self-service.","El desayuno de este hotel es de autoservicio.","Le petit-déjeuner de cet hôtel est en libre-service."],["L7-5574","自尊","zìzūn","V","self-respect; pride","amor propio; orgullo","amour-propre ; fierté","批评孩子的时候要注意保护他的自尊。","pī píng hái zi de shí hou yào zhù yì bǎo hù tā de zì zūn","When criticizing children, take care to protect their self-respect.","Al regañar a los niños hay que cuidar de proteger su autoestima.","Quand on critique les enfants, il faut veiller à protéger leur amour-propre."],["L7-5575","自尊心","zìzūnxīn","N","self-esteem; pride","autoestima; orgullo","amour-propre ; fierté","他的自尊心很强，不愿意接受别人的帮助。","tā de zì zūn xīn hěn qiáng bú yuàn yì jiē shòu bié rén de bāng zhù","He is very proud and unwilling to accept others' help.","Es muy orgulloso y no quiere aceptar la ayuda de los demás.","Il est très fier et ne veut pas accepter l'aide des autres."],["L7-5576","字迹","zìjì","N","handwriting","caligrafía; letra","écriture","他的作业字迹工整，老师常拿来做示范。","tā de zuò yè zì jì gōng zhěng lǎo shī cháng ná lái zuò shì fàn","His homework is written so neatly that the teacher often uses it as an example.","Su tarea está escrita con letra tan prolija que la maestra suele usarla como ejemplo.","Ses devoirs sont écrits d'une écriture si soignée que le professeur s'en sert souvent comme exemple."],["L7-5577","字幕","zìmù","N","subtitles; caption","subtítulos; leyenda","sous-titres ; légende","这部外国电影有中文字幕。","zhè bù wài guó diàn yǐng yǒu zhōng wén zì mù","This foreign film has Chinese subtitles.","Esta película extranjera tiene subtítulos en chino.","Ce film étranger a des sous-titres en chinois."],["L7-5578","字体","zìtǐ","N","font; typeface","fuente; tipo de letra","police ; typographie","这本书用的字体太小了，看起来很累。","zhè běn shū yòng de zì tǐ tài xiǎo le kàn qǐ lái hěn lèi","The typeface in this book is too small and tiring to read.","La tipografía de este libro es demasiado pequeña y cansa la vista al leer.","La police de caractères de ce livre est trop petite et fatigue à la lecture."],["L7-5579","字眼","zìyǎn","N","wording; word","palabra; expresión","mot ; terme","写合同的时候，每一个字眼都要仔细推敲。","xiě hé tóng de shí hou měi yí ge zì yǎn dōu yào zǐ xì tuī qiāo","When writing a contract, every word must be carefully weighed.","Al redactar un contrato, hay que sopesar cuidadosamente cada palabra.","Quand on rédige un contrat, il faut peser soigneusement chaque mot."],["L7-5580","宗","zōng","M","Zong (surname); ancestor","Zong (apellido); antepasado","Zong (nom de famille) ; ancêtre","警方破获了一宗特大诈骗案。","jǐng fāng pò huò le yì zōng tè dà zhà piàn àn","The police cracked a major fraud case.","La policía resolvió un caso de fraude de enormes proporciones.","La police a élucidé une très grosse affaire de fraude."],["L7-5581","宗旨","zōngzhǐ","N","aim; purpose","propósito; objetivo","but ; objectif","我们公司的宗旨是顾客第一。","wǒ men gōng sī de zōng zhǐ shì gù kè dì yī","Our company's aim is to put customers first.","El propósito de nuestra empresa es poner al cliente primero.","La mission de notre entreprise est de placer le client en premier."],["L7-5582","综上所述","zōngshàng-suǒshù","","in summary","en resumen","en résumé","综上所述，这个方案是可行的。","zōng shàng suǒ shù zhè ge fāng àn shì kě xíng de","To sum up, this plan is feasible.","En resumen, este plan es viable.","En résumé, ce plan est réalisable."],["L7-5583","总的来说","zǒngde lái shuō","","generally speaking","en términos generales","en général","总的来说，这次旅行还是很愉快的。","zǒng de lái shuō zhè cì lǚ xíng hái shi hěn yú kuài de","Overall, this trip was quite enjoyable.","En general, este viaje fue bastante agradable.","Dans l'ensemble, ce voyage a été plutôt agréable."],["L7-5584","总额","zǒng'é","N","total amount","importe total","montant total","今年的销售总额超过了一亿元。","jīn nián de xiāo shòu zǒng é chāo guò le yí yì yuán","Total sales this year exceeded one hundred million yuan.","Las ventas totales de este año superaron los cien millones de yuanes.","Le total des ventes de cette année a dépassé cent millions de yuans."],["L7-5585","总而言之","zǒng'éryánzhī","","in short; in summary","en resumen; en pocas palabras","en un mot ; bref","总而言之，健康比什么都重要。","zǒng ér yán zhī jiàn kāng bǐ shén me dōu zhòng yào","In short, health is more important than anything.","En resumen, la salud es más importante que cualquier otra cosa.","En somme, la santé est plus importante que tout."],["L7-5586","总计","zǒngjì","V","total; to add up","total; sumar","total ; totaliser","这次活动总计花费了五万元。","zhè cì huó dòng zǒng jì huā fèi le wǔ wàn yuán","This event cost a total of fifty thousand yuan.","Esta actividad costó en total cincuenta mil yuanes.","Cette activité a coûté cinquante mille yuans au total."],["L7-5587","纵观","zòngguān","V","to survey; overview","examinar globalmente; panorama","passer en revue ; vue d'ensemble","纵观历史，每一次技术革命都改变了人们的生活。","zòng guān lì shǐ měi yí cì jì shù gé mìng dōu gǎi biàn le rén men de shēng huó","Looking across history, every technological revolution has changed people's lives.","Al mirar la historia, cada revolución tecnológica ha cambiado la vida de las personas.","Quand on observe l'histoire, chaque révolution technologique a changé la vie des gens."],["L7-5588","纵横交错","zònghéng-jiāocuò","","criss-crossed","entrecruzado","entrecroisé","城市里的道路纵横交错，外地人很容易迷路。","chéng shì lǐ de dào lù zòng héng jiāo cuò wài dì rén hěn róng yì mí lù","The city's roads crisscross, and outsiders get lost easily.","Las calles de la ciudad se entrecruzan, y los forasteros se pierden con facilidad.","Les routes de la ville s'entrecroisent et les étrangers à la ville s'y perdent facilement."],["L7-5589","纵然","zòngrán","Conj","even if","aunque; incluso si","même si","纵然困难再大，我们也不会放弃。","zòng rán kùn nan zài dà wǒ men yě bú huì fàng qì","No matter how great the difficulties are, we won't give up.","Por grandes que sean las dificultades, no nos rendiremos.","Même si les difficultés sont grandes, nous n'abandonnerons pas."],["L7-5590","纵容","zòngróng","V","to indulge; to condone","consentir; tolerar","laisser faire ; tolérer","父母不能纵容孩子的坏习惯。","fù mǔ bù néng zòng róng hái zi de huài xí guàn","Parents shouldn't indulge their children's bad habits.","Los padres no deben consentir los malos hábitos de sus hijos.","Les parents ne doivent pas tolérer les mauvaises habitudes de leurs enfants."],["L7-5591","纵深","zòngshēn","N","depth","profundidad","profondeur","这场改革正在向纵深方向发展。","zhè chǎng gǎi gé zhèng zài xiàng zòng shēn fāng xiàng fā zhǎn","This reform is developing in greater depth.","Esta reforma se está profundizando.","Cette réforme est en train de s'approfondir."],["L7-5592","粽子","zòngzi","N","zongzi; rice dumpling","zongzi; bolsa de arroz glutinoso","zongzi ; dumpling de riz gluant","端午节的时候，家家户户都包粽子。","duān wǔ jié de shí hou jiā jiā hù hù dōu bāo zòng zi","At the Dragon Boat Festival, every household makes zongzi.","En el Festival del Bote del Dragón, todas las familias preparan zongzi.","À la fête des bateaux-dragons, chaque famille prépare des zongzi."],["L7-5593","走过场","zǒu guòchǎng","","to go through the motions","cumplir con el trámite","faire les choses pour la forme","这次检查不能只是走过场。","zhè cì jiǎn chá bù néng zhǐ shì zǒu guò chǎng","This inspection can't just be going through the motions.","Esta inspección no puede ser un simple trámite.","Cette inspection ne peut pas être une simple formalité."],["L7-5594","走后门","zǒu hòumén","","to use connections","usar influencias; enchufe","passer par la petite porte","他靠走后门找到了这份工作。","tā kào zǒu hòu mén zhǎo dào le zhè fèn gōng zuò","He got this job through connections.","Consiguió este trabajo gracias a sus contactos.","Il a obtenu ce travail par piston."],["L7-5595","走近","zǒujìn","","to approach","acercarse","s'approcher","他慢慢走近那只受伤的小狗。","tā màn màn zǒu jìn nà zhī shòu shāng de xiǎo gǒu","He slowly approached the injured puppy.","Se acercó despacio al perrito herido.","Il s'est approché lentement du chiot blessé."],["L7-5596","走廊","zǒuláng","N","corridor; hallway","pasillo; corredor","couloir","医院的床位十分紧张，有些病人只能睡在走廊里。","yī yuàn de chuáng wèi shí fēn jǐn zhāng yǒu xiē bìng rén zhǐ néng shuì zài zǒu láng lǐ","Hospital beds are in very short supply, and some patients have to sleep in the corridor.","Las camas del hospital escasean mucho y algunos pacientes tienen que dormir en el pasillo.","Les lits d'hôpital manquent cruellement, et certains patients doivent dormir dans le couloir."],["L7-5597","走投无路","zǒutóu-wúlù","","to be at a dead end","estar sin salida","être dans une impasse","他走投无路，只好向朋友借钱。","tā zǒu tóu wú lù zhǐ hǎo xiàng péng you jiè qián","At the end of his rope, he had to borrow money from a friend.","Sin ninguna salida, no tuvo más remedio que pedirle dinero prestado a un amigo.","Acculé, il n'a eu d'autre choix que d'emprunter de l'argent à un ami."],["L7-5598","走弯路","zǒu wānlù","","to take a detour; to waste effort","dar rodeos; perder el tiempo","faire un détour ; perdre du temps","多听听前辈的建议，可以少走弯路。","duō tīng tīng qián bèi de jiàn yì kě yǐ shǎo zǒu wān lù","Listening to the advice of those more experienced can save you detours.","Escuchar más los consejos de los mayores con experiencia te permite evitar rodeos innecesarios.","Écouter davantage les conseils de ses aînés permet d'éviter bien des détours."],["L7-5599","奏效","zòuxiào","","to be effective","surtir efecto","faire effet","这项举措能否长期奏效，取决于后续监督是否到位。","zhè xiàng jǔ cuò néng fǒu cháng qī zòu xiào qǔ jué yú hòu xù jiān dū shì fǒu dào wèi","Whether this measure remains effective over time depends on whether follow-up oversight is adequate.","Que esta medida siga dando resultados a largo plazo depende de que la supervisión posterior sea adecuada.","Que cette mesure reste efficace à long terme dépend de la qualité du suivi et du contrôle qui en découleront."],["L7-5600","揍","zòu","V","to hit; to beat up","golpear; pegar","frapper ; rosser","那个小偷被抓住以后，差点儿被人揍了一顿。","nà ge xiǎo tōu bèi zhuā zhù yǐ hòu chà diǎnr bèi rén zòu le yí dùn","After the thief was caught, he was nearly beaten up.","Después de atrapar al ladrón, casi le dieron una paliza.","Après l'arrestation du voleur, il s'en est fallu de peu qu'il se fasse rouer de coups."],["L7-5601","租赁","zūlìn","V","to rent; to lease","alquilar; arrendar","louer","这家公司提供汽车租赁服务。","zhè jiā gōng sī tí gōng qì chē zū lìn fú wù","This company provides car rental services.","Esta empresa ofrece servicios de alquiler de automóviles.","Cette entreprise propose des services de location de voitures."],["L7-5602","足迹","zújì","N","footprint; track","huella; rastro","empreinte ; trace","雪地上留下了一串小动物的足迹。","xuě dì shàng liú xià le yí chuàn xiǎo dòng wù de zú jì","A trail of small animal tracks was left in the snow.","En la nieve quedó un rastro de huellas de animales pequeños.","Une série d'empreintes de petits animaux est restée dans la neige."],["L7-5603","足智多谋","zúzhì-duōmóu","","resourceful; full of schemes","ingenioso; astuto","plein de ressources","诸葛亮是一个足智多谋的人。","zhū gě liàng shì yí ge zú zhì duō móu de rén","Zhuge Liang was a resourceful and clever man.","Zhuge Liang era un hombre ingenioso y lleno de recursos.","Zhuge Liang était un homme plein de ressources et d'intelligence."],["L7-5604","阻挡","zǔdǎng","V","to block; to resist","bloquear; resistir","bloquer ; résister","什么也阻挡不了他追求梦想的脚步。","shén me yě zǔ dǎng bù liǎo tā zhuī qiú mèng xiǎng de jiǎo bù","Nothing can stop him from pursuing his dream.","Nada puede detenerlo en la búsqueda de su sueño.","Rien ne peut l'empêcher de poursuivre son rêve."],["L7-5605","阻拦","zǔlán","V","to stop; to obstruct","detener; obstruir","empêcher ; faire obstacle","妈妈想阻拦他，可他还是走了。","mā ma xiǎng zǔ lán tā kě tā hái shi zǒu le","Mom wanted to stop him, but he left anyway.","Su mamá quiso detenerlo, pero se fue de todos modos.","Sa mère a voulu le retenir, mais il est parti quand même."],["L7-5606","阻力","zǔlì","N","resistance; obstacle","resistencia; obstáculo","résistance ; obstacle","这项改革遇到了很大的阻力。","zhè xiàng gǎi gé yù dào le hěn dà de zǔ lì","This reform has met strong resistance.","Esta reforma ha encontrado una fuerte resistencia.","Cette réforme s'est heurtée à une forte résistance."],["L7-5607","阻挠","zǔnáo","V","to obstruct; to thwart","obstaculizar; frustrar","entraver ; faire obstacle","有人故意阻挠这项工程的进行。","yǒu rén gù yì zǔ náo zhè xiàng gōng chéng de jìn xíng","Someone is deliberately obstructing the progress of this project.","Alguien está obstaculizando deliberadamente el avance de este proyecto.","Quelqu'un entrave délibérément l'avancement de ce projet."],["L7-5608","组建","zǔjiàn","V","to set up; to form","formar; constituir","constituer ; former","学校组建了一支新的篮球队。","xué xiào zǔ jiàn le yì zhī xīn de lán qiú duì","The school formed a new basketball team.","La escuela formó un nuevo equipo de baloncesto.","L'école a constitué une nouvelle équipe de basket-ball."],["L7-5609","组装","zǔzhuāng","V","to assemble","ensamblar; montar","assembler ; monter","他自己动手组装了一台电脑。","tā zì jǐ dòng shǒu zǔ zhuāng le yì tái diàn nǎo","He assembled a computer by himself.","Armó una computadora él mismo.","Il a assemblé un ordinateur lui-même."],["L7-5610","祖传","zǔchuán","V","handed down from ancestors","heredado de los antepasados","transmis par les ancêtres","这家老店的酱料用的是祖传的秘方。","zhè jiā lǎo diàn de jiàng liào yòng de shì zǔ chuán de mì fāng","This old shop's sauce is made from a secret recipe handed down through the family.","Las salsas de este viejo local se hacen con una receta secreta heredada de la familia.","Les sauces de cette vieille boutique sont préparées selon une recette secrète transmise de génération en génération."],["L7-5611","祖籍","zǔjí","N","ancestral home","lugar de origen familiar","origine familiale","他出生在北京，祖籍是山东。","tā chū shēng zài běi jīng zǔ jí shì shān dōng","He was born in Beijing, but his ancestral home is Shandong.","Nació en Beijing, pero su familia es originaria de Shandong.","Il est né à Pékin, mais sa famille est originaire du Shandong."],["L7-5612","祖先","zǔxiān","N","ancestors","antepasados","ancêtres","清明节的时候，人们去祭拜祖先。","qīng míng jié de shí hou rén men qù jì bài zǔ xiān","At the Qingming Festival, people go to pay respects to their ancestors.","En el Festival de Qingming, la gente va a rendir homenaje a sus antepasados.","À la fête de Qingming, les gens vont se recueillir en l'honneur de leurs ancêtres."],["L7-5613","祖宗","zǔzong","N","ancestor; forebears","antepasado; ancestros","ancêtre ; aïeux","这些规矩都是老祖宗留下来的。","zhè xiē guī ju dōu shì lǎo zǔ zong liú xià lái de","These rules were all handed down by our forefathers.","Todas estas reglas nos las dejaron los antepasados.","Toutes ces règles nous ont été transmises par nos ancêtres."],["L7-5614","钻空子","zuān kòngzi","","to exploit a loophole","aprovechar una laguna","exploiter une faille","有些人专门钻空子，逃避交税。","yǒu xiē rén zhuān mén zuān kòng zi táo bì jiāo shuì","Some people specialize in exploiting loopholes to avoid paying taxes.","Algunas personas se especializan en aprovechar las lagunas legales para evadir impuestos.","Certaines personnes se spécialisent dans l'exploitation des failles pour échapper à l'impôt."],["L7-5615","钻研","zuānyán","V","to study intensively","estudiar a fondo","étudier à fond","他一直在钻研这门技术。","tā yì zhí zài zuān yán zhè mén jì shù","He has been delving deeply into this technology.","Lleva tiempo profundizando en esta técnica.","Il approfondit cette technique depuis longtemps."],["L7-5616","钻石","zuànshí","N","diamond","diamante","diamant","她的戒指上镶着一颗小钻石。","tā de jiè zhi shàng xiāng zhe yì kē xiǎo zuàn shí","Her ring is set with a small diamond.","Su anillo lleva engastado un pequeño diamante.","Sa bague est sertie d'un petit diamant."],["L7-5617","嘴唇","zuǐchún","N","lip","labio","lèvre","天气太干，她的嘴唇都裂了。","tiān qì tài gān tā de zuǐ chún dōu liè le","The weather is so dry that her lips are cracked.","El clima está tan seco que a ella se le agrietaron los labios.","Le temps est si sec qu'elle a les lèvres gercées."],["L7-5618","罪犯","zuìfàn","N","criminal","criminal","criminel","警察终于抓住了这个罪犯。","jǐng chá zhōng yú zhuā zhù le zhè ge zuì fàn","The police finally caught the criminal.","Por fin la policía atrapó al criminal.","La police a enfin arrêté le criminel."],["L7-5619","罪魁祸首","zuìkuí-huòshǒu","","main culprit","principal culpable","principal coupable","汽车尾气是空气污染的罪魁祸首之一。","qì chē wěi qì shì kōng qì wū rǎn de zuì kuí huò shǒu zhī yī","Car exhaust is one of the main culprits of air pollution.","Los gases de escape de los autos son uno de los principales culpables de la contaminación del aire.","Les gaz d'échappement des voitures sont l'un des principaux responsables de la pollution de l'air."],["L7-5620","尊贵","zūnguì","Adj","honorable; distinguished","honorable; distinguido","honorable ; distingué","酒店为每一位尊贵的客人准备了礼物。","jiǔ diàn wèi měi yí wèi zūn guì de kè rén zhǔn bèi le lǐ wù","The hotel prepared gifts for each of its distinguished guests.","El hotel preparó un regalo para cada uno de sus distinguidos huéspedes.","L'hôtel a préparé un cadeau pour chacun de ses hôtes de marque."],["L7-5621","尊严","zūnyán","N","dignity","dignidad","dignité","每个人都有自己的尊严。","měi ge rén dōu yǒu zì jǐ de zūn yán","Everyone has their own dignity.","Cada persona tiene su propia dignidad.","Chacun a sa propre dignité."],["L7-5622","遵循","zūnxún","V","to follow; to abide by","seguir; acatar","suivre ; se conformer à","临床研究需要严格遵循伦理规范，并充分尊重参与者的知情权。","lín chuáng yán jiū xū yào yán gé zūn xún lún lǐ guī fàn bìng chōng fèn zūn zhòng cān yù zhě de zhī qíng quán","Clinical research must strictly follow ethical standards and fully respect participants' right to be informed.","La investigación clínica debe seguir estrictamente las normas éticas y respetar plenamente el derecho de los participantes a estar informados.","La recherche clinique doit respecter strictement les normes éthiques et le droit des participants à être informés."],["L7-5623","遵照","zūnzhào","V","to comply with; to follow","ajustarse a; seguir","se conformer à ; suivre","我们会遵照您的要求去做。","wǒ men huì zūn zhào nín de yāo qiú qù zuò","We will act in accordance with your requirements.","Haremos lo que usted nos pida.","Nous ferons ce que vous demandez."],["L7-5624","琢磨","zuómo","V","to ponder; to think over","reflexionar; darle vueltas","réfléchir ; méditer","这个问题我琢磨了好几天，还是没想明白。","zhè ge wèn tí wǒ zuó mo le hǎo jǐ tiān hái shi méi xiǎng míng bai","I've been pondering this problem for days and still haven't figured it out.","Llevo varios días dándole vueltas a este problema y todavía no lo entiendo.","Je réfléchis à ce problème depuis plusieurs jours et je ne l'ai toujours pas compris."],["L7-5625","左顾右盼","zuǒgù-yòupàn","","to look around","mirar a todos lados","regarder de tous côtés","他站在路口左顾右盼，好像在等人。","tā zhàn zài lù kǒu zuǒ gù yòu pàn hǎo xiàng zài děng rén","He stood at the intersection looking around, as if waiting for someone.","Se quedó en la esquina mirando de un lado a otro, como si esperara a alguien.","Il se tenait au carrefour, regardant de tous côtés, comme s'il attendait quelqu'un."],["L7-5626","佐料","zuǒliào","N","condiments; seasoning","condimentos; aderezo","condiments ; assaisonnement","这道菜的佐料要提前准备好。","zhè dào cài de zuǒ liào yào tí qián zhǔn bèi hǎo","The seasonings for this dish need to be prepared in advance.","Los condimentos de este platillo hay que prepararlos con anticipación.","Les assaisonnements de ce plat doivent être préparés à l'avance."],["L7-5627","作弊","zuòbì","","to cheat","hacer trampa","tricher","考试作弊是不诚实的行为。","kǎo shì zuò bì shì bù chéng shí de xíng wéi","Cheating on exams is dishonest behavior.","Hacer trampa en los exámenes es una conducta deshonesta.","Tricher aux examens est un comportement malhonnête."],["L7-5628","作对","zuòduì","","to oppose; to be against","oponerse; ir en contra","s'opposer à ; faire obstacle à","他好像故意跟我作对，我说什么他都反对。","tā hǎo xiàng gù yì gēn wǒ zuò duì wǒ shuō shén me tā dōu fǎn duì","He seems to be deliberately working against me; he opposes whatever I say.","Parece que me lleva la contraria a propósito: se opone a todo lo que digo.","Il semble me chercher des noises exprès : il s'oppose à tout ce que je dis."],["L7-5629","作风","zuòfēng","N","style; way of working","estilo; manera de trabajar","style ; manière de faire","这位领导作风朴实，深受大家欢迎。","zhè wèi lǐng dǎo zuò fēng pǔ shí shēn shòu dà jiā huān yíng","This leader has a down-to-earth style and is very popular.","Este dirigente tiene un estilo sencillo y es muy querido por todos.","Ce dirigeant a un style simple et sans prétention et il est très apprécié de tous."],["L7-5630","作客","zuòkè","","to be a guest","ser invitado; visitar","être invité","他作客他乡多年，始终思念着故乡的亲人。","tā zuò kè tā xiāng duō nián shǐ zhōng sī niàn zhe gù xiāng de qīn rén","He has lived away from home for many years and has never stopped missing his family back home.","Lleva muchos años viviendo lejos de su tierra y nunca ha dejado de extrañar a su familia.","Il vit loin de chez lui depuis de nombreuses années et n'a jamais cessé de penser à sa famille restée au pays."],["L7-5631","作物","zuòwù","N","crop","cultivo","culture","这里种植的作物主要是小麦和玉米。","zhè lǐ zhòng zhí de zuò wù zhǔ yào shì xiǎo mài hé yù mǐ","The crops grown here are mainly wheat and corn.","Los cultivos que se siembran aquí son principalmente trigo y maíz.","Les cultures pratiquées ici sont principalement le blé et le maïs."],["L7-5632","坐落","zuòluò","V","to be located","estar situado","être situé","这座古老的寺庙坐落在半山腰上。","zhè zuò gǔ lǎo de sì miào zuò luò zài bàn shān yāo shàng","This ancient temple is located halfway up the mountain.","Este antiguo templo está situado a media montaña.","Cet ancien temple est situé à mi-pente de la montagne."],["L7-5633","座谈","zuòtán","V","to hold an informal discussion","celebrar un coloquio","tenir une discussion informelle","校长和新老师们一起座谈。","xiào zhǎng hé xīn lǎo shī men yì qǐ zuò tán","The principal held an informal discussion with the new teachers.","El director conversó de manera informal con los profesores nuevos.","Le directeur s'est entretenu de façon informelle avec les nouveaux professeurs."],["L7-5634","座右铭","zuòyòumíng","N","motto","lema","devise","他的座右铭是“永不放弃”。","tā de zuò yòu míng shì yǒng bú fàng qì","His motto is \"Never give up.\"","Su lema es «Nunca rendirse».","Sa devise est « Ne jamais abandonner »."],["L7-5635","做生意","zuò shēngyi","","to do business","hacer negocios","faire des affaires","他大学毕业后就开始做生意了。","tā dà xué bì yè hòu jiù kāi shǐ zuò shēng yi le","He started doing business right after graduating from university.","Empezó a dedicarse a los negocios justo después de graduarse de la universidad.","Il s'est lancé dans les affaires dès la fin de ses études universitaires."],["L7-5636","做证","zuòzhèng","","to testify","testificar","témoigner","他愿意出庭为朋友做证。","tā yuàn yì chū tíng wèi péng you zuò zhèng","He is willing to testify in court for his friend.","Está dispuesto a comparecer ante el tribunal para testificar a favor de su amigo.","Il est prêt à comparaître au tribunal pour témoigner en faveur de son ami."]];
